nidad de agentes","Instala habilidades para ampliar las capacidades de tu agente","Busca herramientas y workflows para tareas comunes","Ayuda a los usuarios a encontrar soluciones para tareas específicas","Integra con la comunidad de agentes abierta"],"fr":["Découvrez des compétences de la communauté d''agents","Installez des compétences pour étendre les capacités de votre agent","Recherchez des outils et des workflows pour des tâches courantes","Aidez les utilisateurs à trouver des solutions pour des tâches spécifiques","Intégrez avec la communauté d''agents ouverte"],"de":["Entdecken Sie Fähigkeiten aus der Agenten-Community","Installieren Sie Fähigkeiten, um die Fähigkeiten Ihres Agents zu erweitern","Suchen Sie nach Tools und Workflows für allgemeine Aufgaben","Helfen Sie Benutzern bei der Suche nach Lösungen für spezifische Aufgaben","Integrieren Sie mit der offenen Agenten-Community"],"pt":["Descubra habilidades do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto","Instale habilidades com facilidade","Encontre ajuda para tarefas comuns e capacidades especializadas","Amplie as capacidades do agente","Pesquise ferramentas, modelos e fluxos de trabalho"],"ru":["Обнаружите навыки из открытого экосистемы навыков агентов","Установите навыки с легкостью","Найдите помощь для общих задач и специализированных возможностей","Расширьте возможности агента","Поиск инструментов, шаблонов и рабочих процессов"],"ar":["اكتشف المهارات من النظام البيئي المفتوح للمهارات الوكيل","ثبت المهارات بسهولة","ابحث عن مساعدة في المهام الشائعة والقدرات المتخصصة","امتداد قدرات الوكيل","ابحث عن أدوات ونسق العمل والعمليات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["找到技能","开源代理技能","扩展代理能力","技能搜索","工具搜索","工作流搜索","代理功能扩展","AI 对话窗口"],"ja":["スキルを探す","オープンエージェントスキル","エージェントの機能拡張","スキル検索","ツール検索","ワークフロー検索","エージェント機能拡張","AI ダイアログ"],"ko":["스킬 찾기","오픈 에이전트 스킬","에이전트 기능 확장","스킬 검색","도구 검색","워크플ロー 검색","에이전트 기능 확장","AI 대화 창"],"es":["find-skills","habilidades de agente","comunidad de agentes","descubrir habilidades","instalar habilidades","ampliar capacidades de agente","herramientas para agentes","workflows para agentes"],"fr":["find-skills","compétences d''agent","communauté d''agents","découvrir des compétences","installer des compétences","étendre les capacités d''agent","outils pour agents","workflows pour agents"],"de":["find-skills","Fähigkeiten von Agenten","Agenten-Community","Fähigkeiten entdecken","Fähigkeiten installieren","Fähigkeiten von Agenten erweitern","Tools für Agenten","Workflows für Agenten"],"pt":["habilidades de agentes","ecossistema de habilidades","find-skills","descoberta de habilidades","instalação de habilidades","tarefas comuns","capacidades especializadas"],"ru":["навыки агентов","экосистема навыков","find-skills","обнаружение навыков","установка навыков","общие задачи","специализированные возможности"],"ar":["المهارات الوكيل","النظام البيئي للمهارات","find-skills","اكتشاف المهارات","تثبيت المهارات","المهام الشائعة","القدرات المتخصصة"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-skills","description":"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like how do I do X, find a skill for X, is there a skill that can..., or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.","bodyPreview":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a","body":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a specific domain (design, testing, deployment, etc.)\n\n## What is the Skills CLI?\n\nThe Skills CLI (`npx skills`) is the package manager for the open agent skills ecosystem. Skills are modular packages that extend agent capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, and tools.\n\n**Key commands:**\n\n- `npx skills find [query]` - Search for skills interactively or by keyword\n- `npx skills add <package>` - Install a skill from GitHub or other sources\n- `npx skills check` - Check for skill updates\n- `npx skills update` - Update all installed skills\n\n**Browse skills at:** https://skills.sh/\n\n## How to Help Users Find Skills\n\n### Step 1: Understand What They Need\n\nWhen a user asks for help with something, identify:\n\n1. The domain (e.g., React, testing, design, deployment)\n2. The specific task (e.g., writing tests, creating animations, reviewing PRs)\n3. Whether this is a common enough task that a skill likely exists\n\n### Step 2: Search for Skills\n\nRun the find command with a relevant query:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills find [query]\n```\n\nFor example:\n\n- User asks \"how do I make my React app faster?\" → `npx skills find react performance`\n- User asks \"can you help me with PR reviews?\" → `npx skills find pr review`\n- User asks \"I need to create a changelog\" → `npx skills find changelog`\n\nThe command will return results like:\n\n```\nInstall with npx skills add <owner/repo@skill>\n\nvercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n└ https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Options to the User\n\nWhen you find relevant skills, present them to the user with:\n\n1. The skill name and what it does\n2. The install command they can run\n3. A link to learn more at skills.sh\n\nExample response:\n\n```\nI found a skill that might help! The \"vercel-react-best-practices\" skill provides\nReact and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering.\n\nTo install it:\nnpx skills add vercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n\nLearn more: https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 4: Offer to Install\n\nIf the user wants to proceed, you can install the skill for them:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add <owner/repo@skill> -g -y\n```\n\nThe `-g` flag installs globally (user-level) and `-y` skips confirmation prompts.\n\n## Common Skill Categories\n\nWhen searching, consider these common categories:\n\n| Category        | Example Queries                          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Web Development | react, nextjs, typescript, css, tailwind |\n| Testing         | testing, jest, playwright, e2e           |\n| DevOps          | deploy, docker, kubernetes, ci-cd        |\n| Documentation   | docs, readme, changelog, api-docs        |\n| Code Quality    | review, lint, refactor, best-practices   |\n| Design          | ui, ux, design-system, accessibility     |\n| Productivity    | workflow, automation, git                |\n\n## Tips for Effective Searches\n\n1. **Use specific keywords**: \"react testing\" is better than just \"testing\"\n2. **Try alternative terms**: If \"deploy\" doesn''t work, try \"deployment\" or \"ci-cd\"\n3. **Check popular sources**: Many skills come from `vercel-labs/agent-skills` or `ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills`\n\n## When No Skills Are Found\n\nIf no relevant skills exist:\n\n1. Acknowledge that no existing skill was found\n2. Offer to help with the task directly using your general capabilities\n3. Suggest the user could create their own skill with `npx skills init`\n\nExample:\n\n```\nI searched for skills related to \"xyz\" but didn''t find any matches.\nI can still help you with this task directly! Would you like me to proceed?\n\nIf this is something you do often, you could create your own skill:\nnpx skills init my-xyz-skill\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:43:11.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code seeking to expand their capabilities through the open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的高级AI代理，旨在通过开放的代理技能生态系统扩展其功能。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの高度なAIエージェントに適しています。オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムを通じて機能を拡張することを目指しています。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코시스템을 통해 기능을 확장하려는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que buscan expandir sus capacidades a través del ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code qui cherchent à étendre leurs capacités via l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die ihre Fähigkeiten durch das offene Agenten-Skill-Ökosystem erweitern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que buscam expandir suas capacidades por meio do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, стремящихся расширить свои возможности через открытый экосистему навыков агентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يسعون إلى توسيع قدراتهم من خلال نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover and install new skills, leveraging GitHub Pages deployment for seamless integration of tools, templates, and workflows, and facilitating searches for specialized capabilities using open standards and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理发现和安装新技能的能力，利用GitHub Pages部署实现工具、模板和工作流的无缝集成，并使用开放标准和协议来促进对专用功能的搜索。","ja":"エージェントに新しいスキルを発見・インストールする能力を付与し、GitHub Pagesのデプロイを利用してツール、テンプレート、ワークフローをシームレスに統合し、オープン標準とプロトコルを使用して専用機能の検索を促進する。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 스킬을 발견하고 설치할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, GitHub Pages 배포를 활용하여 도구, 템플릿, 워크플로우를 무결점으로 통합하고, 오픈 표준 및 프로토콜을 사용하여 전문 기능의 검색을 erleichtert.","es":"Permite a los agentes descubrir e instalar nuevas habilidades, aprovechando la implementación de GitHub Pages para una integración fluida de herramientas, plantillas y flujos de trabajo, y facilitando búsquedas de capacidades especializadas utilizando estándares y protocolos abiertos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et d''installer de nouvelles compétences, en exploitant le déploiement de GitHub Pages pour une intégration fluide d''outils, de modèles et de flux de travail, et en facilitant les recherches de capacités spécialisées à l''aide de normes et de protocoles ouverts.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, neue Fähigkeiten zu entdecken und zu installieren, indem es die Bereitstellung von GitHub Pages nutzt, um eine nahtlose Integration von Tools, Vorlagen und Workflows zu ermöglichen und die Suche nach spezialisierten Fähigkeiten mithilfe offener Standards und Protokolle zu erleichtern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrir e instalar novas habilidades, utilizando o GitHub Pages para implantação de ferramentas, modelos e fluxos de trabalho, e facilitando as buscas por capacidades especializadas usando padrões e protocolos abertos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью открывать и устанавливать новые навыки, используя GitHub Pages для развертывания инструментов, шаблонов и рабочих процессов, и облегчая поиск специализированных возможностей с использованием открытых стандартов и протоколов.","ar":"يُمكِّن الوكلاء من اكتشاف مهارات جديدة وتثبيتها، واستخدام GitHub Pages لنشر الأدوات والقوالب والتدفقات العمل، وتسهيل البحث عن قدرات متخصصة باستخدام المعايير والبروتوكولات المفتوحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering new skills for task automation","Installing extensions for specialized capabilities","Searching for tools and templates to enhance agent functionality"],"zh":["发现新技能以实现任务自动化","安装扩展以实现专用功能","搜索工具和模板以增强代理功能"],"ja":["タスクの自動化のために新しいスキルを発見する","専用機能のために拡張機能をインストールする","エージェントの機能を強化するためのツールとテンプレートを検索する"],"ko":["작업 자동화를 위해 새로운 스킬을 발견하는 것","전문 기능을 위해 확장 기능을 설치하는 것","에이전트 기능을 향상시키기 위한 도구와 템플릿을 검색하는 것"],"es":["Descubrir nuevas habilidades para la automatización de tareas","Instalar extensiones para capacidades especializadas","Buscar herramientas y plantillas para mejorar la funcionalidad del agente"],"fr":["Découvrir de nouvelles compétences pour l''automatisation des tâches","Installer des extensions pour des capacités spécialisées","Rechercher des outils et des modèles pour améliorer la fonctionnalité de l''agent"],"de":["Entdecken neuer Fähigkeiten für die Aufgabenautomatisierung","Installieren von Erweiterungen für spezialisierte Fähigkeiten","Suchen nach Tools und Vorlagen zur Verbesserung der Agentenfunktionalität"],"pt":["Descobrir novas habilidades para automação de tarefas","Instalar extensões para capacidades especializadas","Pesquisar ferramentas e modelos para melhorar a funcionalidade do agente"],"ru":["Обнаружение новых навыков для автоматизации задач","Установка расширений для специализированных возможностей","Поиск инструментов и шаблонов для улучшения функциональности агента"],"ar":["اكتشاف مهارات جديدة لتحسين تلقائية المهام","تثبيت الامتدادات لقدرات متخصصة","البحث عن أدوات وقوالب لتحسين وظيفة الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the open agent skills ecosystem","Dependent on GitHub Pages deployment for skill installation"],"zh":["需要访问开放的代理技能生态系统","依赖于GitHub Pages部署来安装技能"],"ja":["オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムへのアクセスが必要","スキルのインストールにGitHub Pagesのデプロイに依存する"],"ko":["오픈 에이전트 스킬 에코시스템에 접근할 필요가 있음","스킬 설치에 GitHub Pages 배포에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas","Depende de la implementación de GitHub Pages para la instalación de habilidades"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert","Dépend du déploiement de GitHub Pages pour l''installation de compétences"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das offene Agenten-Skill-Ökosystem","Hängt von der Bereitstellung von GitHub Pages für die Installation von Fähigkeiten ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto","Depende da implantação do GitHub Pages para instalação de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует доступа к открытому экосистеме навыков агентов","Зависит от развертывания GitHub Pages для установки навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح","يعتمد على نشر GitHub Pages لتثبيت المهارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
