:"La compétence find-skills vous aide à découvrir et à installer des compétences depuis l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Die Fähigkeit find-skills hilft Ihnen, Fähigkeiten aus dem offenen Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem zu entdecken und zu installieren.","pt":"O find-skills é uma habilidade que ajuda a descobrir e instalar habilidades do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto. Use-o quando o usuário busca uma...","ru":"Find-skills - это навык, который помогает открыть и установить навыки из открытого экосистемы навыков агентов. Используйте его, когда пользователь ищет обычн...","ar":"find-skills هو مهارة يساعد في اكتشاف وتثبيت مهارات من نظام مهارات العميل المفتوح. استخدمه عندما يبحث المستخدم عن مهمة شائعة أو قدرة متخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills"],"ja":["find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills"],"ko":["find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills"],"es":["Descubre habilidades desde el ecosistema de agentes abiertas","Instala habilidades adicionales","Busca herramientas, plantillas y flujos de trabajo","Extiende las capacidades del agente","Encuentra habilidades para tareas comunes","Explora habilidades especializadas"],"fr":["Découvrez des compétences depuis l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert","Installez des compétences supplémentaires","Recherchez des outils, des modèles et des flux de travail","Étendez les capacités de l''agent","Trouvez des compétences pour des tâches courantes","Explorez des compétences spécialisées"],"de":["Entdecken Sie Fähigkeiten aus dem offenen Agenten-Fähigkeits-Ökosystem","Installieren Sie zusätzliche Fähigkeiten","Suchen Sie nach Tools, Vorlagen und Workflows","Erweitern Sie die Fähigkeiten des Agents","Finden Sie Fähigkeiten für allgemeine Aufgaben","Erkunden Sie spezialisierte Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Descobrir habilidades do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto","Instalar habilidades com facilidade","Melhorar as capacidades do agente","Buscar tarefas comuns e capacidades especializadas","Extender as funcionalidades do agente"],"ru":["Открывать навыки из открытого экосистемы навыков агентов","Устанавливать навыки с легкостью","Улучшать возможности агента","Искать обычные задачи и специализированные возможности","Расширять функциональность агента"],"ar":["اكتشاف مهارات من نظام مهارات العميل المفتوح","تثبيت المهارات بسهولة","تحسين إمكانيات العميل","البحث عن المهام الشائعة والقدرات المتخصصة","توسيع إمكانيات العميل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills"],"ja":["find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills"],"ko":["find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills","find-skills"],"es":["find-skills","habilidades de agentes","ecosistema de habilidades","instalación de habilidades","búsqueda de herramientas","extensión de capacidades"],"fr":["find-skills","compétences d''agents","écosystème de compétences","installation de compétences","recherche d''outils","extension de capacités"],"de":["find-skills","Fähigkeiten von Agenten","Fähigkeits-Ökosystem","Installation von Fähigkeiten","Suche nach Tools","Erweiterung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["find-skills","habilidades de agentes","ecossistema de habilidades","descobrir habilidades","instalar habilidades","melhorar capacidades do agente"],"ru":["find-skills","навыки агентов","экосистема навыков","открывать навыки","устанавливать навыки","улучшать возможности агента"],"ar":["find-skills","مهارات العميل","نظام مهارات مفتوح","اكتشاف مهارات","تثبيت مهارات","تحسين إمكانيات العميل"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-skills","description":"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like how do I do X, find a skill for X, is there a skill that can..., or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.","bodyPreview":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a","body":"# Find Skills\n\nThis skill helps you discover and install skills from the open agent skills ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n\n- Asks \"how do I do X\" where X might be a common task with an existing skill\n- Says \"find a skill for X\" or \"is there a skill for X\"\n- Asks \"can you do X\" where X is a specialized capability\n- Expresses interest in extending agent capabilities\n- Wants to search for tools, templates, or workflows\n- Mentions they wish they had help with a specific domain (design, testing, deployment, etc.)\n\n## What is the Skills CLI?\n\nThe Skills CLI (`npx skills`) is the package manager for the open agent skills ecosystem. Skills are modular packages that extend agent capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, and tools.\n\n**Key commands:**\n\n- `npx skills find [query]` - Search for skills interactively or by keyword\n- `npx skills add <package>` - Install a skill from GitHub or other sources\n- `npx skills check` - Check for skill updates\n- `npx skills update` - Update all installed skills\n\n**Browse skills at:** https://skills.sh/\n\n## How to Help Users Find Skills\n\n### Step 1: Understand What They Need\n\nWhen a user asks for help with something, identify:\n\n1. The domain (e.g., React, testing, design, deployment)\n2. The specific task (e.g., writing tests, creating animations, reviewing PRs)\n3. Whether this is a common enough task that a skill likely exists\n\n### Step 2: Search for Skills\n\nRun the find command with a relevant query:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills find [query]\n```\n\nFor example:\n\n- User asks \"how do I make my React app faster?\" → `npx skills find react performance`\n- User asks \"can you help me with PR reviews?\" → `npx skills find pr review`\n- User asks \"I need to create a changelog\" → `npx skills find changelog`\n\nThe command will return results like:\n\n```\nInstall with npx skills add <owner/repo@skill>\n\nvercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n└ https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Options to the User\n\nWhen you find relevant skills, present them to the user with:\n\n1. The skill name and what it does\n2. The install command they can run\n3. A link to learn more at skills.sh\n\nExample response:\n\n```\nI found a skill that might help! The \"vercel-react-best-practices\" skill provides\nReact and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering.\n\nTo install it:\nnpx skills add vercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices\n\nLearn more: https://skills.sh/vercel-labs/agent-skills/vercel-react-best-practices\n```\n\n### Step 4: Offer to Install\n\nIf the user wants to proceed, you can install the skill for them:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add <owner/repo@skill> -g -y\n```\n\nThe `-g` flag installs globally (user-level) and `-y` skips confirmation prompts.\n\n## Common Skill Categories\n\nWhen searching, consider these common categories:\n\n| Category        | Example Queries                          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Web Development | react, nextjs, typescript, css, tailwind |\n| Testing         | testing, jest, playwright, e2e           |\n| DevOps          | deploy, docker, kubernetes, ci-cd        |\n| Documentation   | docs, readme, changelog, api-docs        |\n| Code Quality    | review, lint, refactor, best-practices   |\n| Design          | ui, ux, design-system, accessibility     |\n| Productivity    | workflow, automation, git                |\n\n## Tips for Effective Searches\n\n1. **Use specific keywords**: \"react testing\" is better than just \"testing\"\n2. **Try alternative terms**: If \"deploy\" doesn''t work, try \"deployment\" or \"ci-cd\"\n3. **Check popular sources**: Many skills come from `vercel-labs/agent-skills` or `ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills`\n\n## When No Skills Are Found\n\nIf no relevant skills exist:\n\n1. Acknowledge that no existing skill was found\n2. Offer to help with the task directly using your general capabilities\n3. Suggest the user could create their own skill with `npx skills init`\n\nExample:\n\n```\nI searched for skills related to \"xyz\" but didn''t find any matches.\nI can still help you with this task directly! Would you like me to proceed?\n\nIf this is something you do often, you could create your own skill:\nnpx skills init my-xyz-skill\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:43:09.573Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Meta Agents seeking to expand their capabilities through the open agent skills ecosystem.","zh":"适合于寻求通过开放代理技能生态系统扩展其功能的Meta代理。","ja":"オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムを通じて機能を拡張しようとするMetaエージェントに適しています。","ko":"오픈 에이전트 스킬 생태계를 통해 기능을 확장하려는 메타 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para los agentes Meta que buscan ampliar sus capacidades a través del ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Meta cherchant à étendre leurs capacités via l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ideal für Meta-Agents, die ihre Fähigkeiten durch das offene Agenten-Skill-Ökosystem erweitern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Meta que buscam expandir suas capacidades por meio do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Meta, стремящихся расширить свои возможности через открытый экосистему навыков агентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء ميتا الذين يسعون إلى توسيع قدراتهم من خلال نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover and install new skills, leveraging natural language queries like ''find a skill for X'' or ''can you do X'', and facilitating the search for specialized tools, templates, or workflows through open agent skills ecosystem protocols.","zh":"赋予代理发现和安装新技能的能力，利用自然语言查询（如''为X找到一个技能''或''你能做X吗''），并通过开放代理技能生态系统协议促进对专用工具、模板或工作流的搜索。","ja":"エージェントが新しいスキルを発見してインストールすることを可能にし、自然言語クエリ（例：''Xのスキルを見つけて''または''Xはできるか''）を利用し、オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムのプロトコルを通じて専用ツール、テンプレート、またはワークフローの検索を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 스킬을 발견하고 설치할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 쿼리(예: ''X에 대한 스킬 찾기'' 또는 ''X를 할 수 있나요'')를 사용하고, 오픈 에이전트 스킬 생태계 프로토콜을 통해 전문 도구, 템플릿 또는 워크플로우를 검색하는 것을 촉진합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes descubrir e instalar nuevas habilidades, aprovechando consultas de lenguaje natural como ''encuentra una habilidad para X'' o ''puedes hacer X'', y facilita la búsqueda de herramientas especializadas, plantillas o flujos de trabajo a través de los protocolos del ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir et d''installer de nouvelles compétences, en exploitant des requêtes de langage naturel comme ''trouve une compétence pour X'' ou ''peux-tu faire X'', et en facilitant la recherche d''outils spécialisés, de modèles ou de flux de travail via les protocoles de l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, neue Fähigkeiten zu entdecken und zu installieren, indem es natürliche Sprachabfragen wie ''finde eine Fähigkeit für X'' oder ''kannst du X'', nutzt und die Suche nach spezialisierten Tools, Vorlagen oder Workflows über die Protokolle des offenen Agenten-Skill-Ökosystems erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrirem e instalarem novas habilidades, utilizando consultas de linguagem natural como ''encontre uma habilidade para X'' ou ''você pode fazer X'', e facilitando a busca por ferramentas especializadas, modelos ou fluxos de trabalho por meio de protocolos do ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и устанавливать новые навыки, используя запросы естественного языка типа ''найти навык для X'' или ''можете ли вы сделать X'', и облегчает поиск специализированных инструментов, шаблонов или рабочих процессов через протоколы открытой экосистемы навыков агентов.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من اكتشاف وتثبيت مهارات جديدة ، باستخدام استفسارات لغة طبيعية مثل ''ابحث عن مهارة ل X'' أو ''هل يمكنك القيام ب X'' ، وتسهيل البحث عن أدوات متخصصة أو قوالب أو سير عمل من خلال بروتوكولات نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح."},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering skills for uncommon tasks","Installing new agent capabilities on demand","Searching for tools and templates to enhance agent functionality"],"zh":["发现非常规任务的技能","按需安装新的代理功能","搜索工具和模板以增强代理功能"],"ja":["非凡なタスクのスキルを発見すること","新しいエージェント機能を需要に応じてインストールすること","エージェントの機能を強化するためのツールやテンプレートを検索すること"],"ko":["비정상적인 작업을 위한 스킬 발견","신규 에이전트 기능을 수요에 맞춰 설치","에이전트 기능을 강화하기 위한 도구 및 템플릿 검색"],"es":["Descubrir habilidades para tareas poco comunes","Instalar nuevas capacidades de agente a demanda","Buscar herramientas y plantillas para mejorar la funcionalidad del agente"],"fr":["Découvrir des compétences pour des tâches peu courantes","Installer de nouvelles capacités d''agent à la demande","Rechercher des outils et des modèles pour améliorer la fonctionnalité de l''agent"],"de":["Entdecken von Fähigkeiten für ungewöhnliche Aufgaben","Installation neuer Agentenfähigkeiten auf Abruf","Suchen nach Tools und Vorlagen zur Verbesserung der Agentenfunktionalität"],"pt":["Descobrir habilidades para tarefas incomuns","Instalar novas capacidades de agente sob demanda","Procurar ferramentas e modelos para melhorar a funcionalidade do agente"],"ru":["Обнаружение навыков для нетипичных задач","Установка новых возможностей агента по требованию","Поиск инструментов и шаблонов для улучшения функциональности агента"],"ar":["اكتشاف المهارات لأداء مهام غير عادية","تثبيت قدرات وكلاء جديدة حسب الطلب","البحث عن أدوات وقوالب لتحسين وظائف الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the open agent skills ecosystem","Dependent on user input for skill discovery"],"zh":["需要访问开放代理技能生态系统","依赖于用户输入来发现技能"],"ja":["オープンエージェントスキルエコシステムへのアクセスが必要","スキルの発見にユーザー入力を依存する"],"ko":["오픈 에이전트 스킬 생태계에 대한 액세스가 필요","스킬 발견에 사용자 입력을 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al ecosistema de habilidades de agentes abiertas","Depende de la entrada del usuario para el descubrimiento de habilidades"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''écosystème de compétences d''agents ouvert","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour la découverte de compétences"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das offene Agenten-Skill-Ökosystem","Hängt von der Benutzereingabe für die Fähigkeitsentdeckung ab"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao ecossistema de habilidades de agentes aberto","Dependente da entrada do usuário para descoberta de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует доступа к открытой экосистеме навыков агентов","Зависит от ввода пользователя для обнаружения навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام مهارات الوكيل المفتوح","يعتمد على إدخال المستخدم لاكتشاف المهارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
