ra agregar autenticación a aplicaciones TypeScript/JavaScript con Better Auth. Configuración de autenticación para proyectos nuevos o existentes","fr":"Guide pour ajouter l''authentification aux applications TypeScript/JavaScript avec Better Auth. Configuration de l''authentification pour les projets nouveaux ...","de":"Anleitung zum Hinzufügen von Authentifizierung zu TypeScript/JavaScript-Anwendungen mit Better Auth. Authentifizierungskonfiguration für neue oder bestehende...","pt":"O Create Auth Skill é uma central de habilidades de agente para adicionar autenticação às aplicações TypeScript/JavaScript","ru":"Create Auth Skill — это центральный хаб навыков агента для добавления аутентификации в приложения TypeScript/JavaScript","ar":"مهارة Create Auth هي مركز مركزي لمهارات الوكيل لإضافة المصادقة إلى تطبيقات TypeScript/JavaScript","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["Better Auth","TypeScript/JavaScript","Better Auth","API"],"ja":["Better Auth","TypeScript/JavaScript","Better Auth","API"],"ko":["Better Auth","TypeScript/JavaScript","Better Auth","API"],"es":["Configuración de autenticación para proyectos nuevos","Integración con bases de datos","Instalación de Better Auth","Creación de archivos de autenticación","Configuración de controladores de rutas"," Ejecución de migraciones y generación de código"],"fr":["Configuration de l''authentification pour les projets nouveaux","Intégration avec les bases de données","Installation de Better Auth","Création de fichiers d''authentification","Configuration des contrôleurs de routes"," Exécution des migrations et génération de code"],"de":["Authentifizierungskonfiguration für neue Projekte","Integration mit Datenbanken","Installation von Better Auth","Erstellung von Authentifizierungsdateien","Konfiguration von Routen-Controllern","Ausführung von Migrationen und Code-Generierung"],"pt":["Configuração de projeto novos","Escolha de framework e banco de dados","Instalação do Better Auth","Criação de arquivos de autenticação","Configuração de roteamento","Adição de recursos via plugins"],"ru":["Настройка новых проектов","Выбор фреймворка и базы данных","Установка Better Auth","Создание файлов аутентификации","Настройка маршрутизации","Добавление функций через плагины"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع جديدة","اختيار الإطار والقاعدة بيانات","تثبيت Better Auth","إنشاء ملفات المصادقة","تهيئة التوجيه","إضافة الميزات عبر البرامج المساعدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","API","Better Auth","auth"],"ja":["Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","API","Better Auth","auth"],"ko":["Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","API","Better Auth","auth"],"es":["autenticación","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","desarrollo de aplicaciones","seguridad","configuración de autenticación","proyectos nuevos","bases de datos"],"fr":["authentification","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","développement d''applications","sécurité","configuration de l''authentification","projets nouveaux","bases de données"],"de":["Authentifizierung","Better Auth","TypeScript","JavaScript","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Sicherheit","Authentifizierungskonfiguration","neue Projekte","Datenbanken"],"pt":["autenticação","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","desenvolvimento de aplicações","segurança","roteamento"],"ru":["аутентификация","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","Create Auth Skill","разработка приложений","безопасность","маршрутизация"],"ar":["المصادقة","TypeScript","JavaScript","Better Auth","مهارة Create Auth","تطوير التطبيقات","الأمان","التوجيه"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-auth-skill","description":"Skill for creating auth layers in TypeScript/JavaScript apps using Better Auth.","bodyPreview":"# Create Auth Skill\n\nGuide for adding authentication to TypeScript/JavaScript applications using Better Auth.\n\n**For code examples and syntax, see [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs).**\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this a new/empty project?\n├─ YES → New project setup\n│   1. Identify framework\n│   2. Choose database\n│   3. Install better-auth\n│   4. Create auth.ts + auth-client.ts\n│   5. Set up route handler\n│   6. Run CLI migrate/generate\n│   7. Add features via plugins\n│\n└─ N","body":"# Create Auth Skill\n\nGuide for adding authentication to TypeScript/JavaScript applications using Better Auth.\n\n**For code examples and syntax, see [better-auth.com/docs](https://better-auth.com/docs).**\n\n---\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this a new/empty project?\n├─ YES → New project setup\n│   1. Identify framework\n│   2. Choose database\n│   3. Install better-auth\n│   4. Create auth.ts + auth-client.ts\n│   5. Set up route handler\n│   6. Run CLI migrate/generate\n│   7. Add features via plugins\n│\n└─ NO → Does project have existing auth?\n    ├─ YES → Migration/enhancement\n    │   • Audit current auth for gaps\n    │   • Plan incremental migration\n    │   • See migration guides in docs\n    │\n    └─ NO → Add auth to existing project\n        1. Analyze project structure\n        2. Install better-auth\n        3. Create auth config\n        4. Add route handler\n        5. Run schema migrations\n        6. Integrate into existing pages\n```\n\n---\n\n## Installation\n\n**Core:** `npm install better-auth`\n\n**Scoped packages (as needed):**\n| Package | Use case |\n|---------|----------|\n| `@better-auth/passkey` | WebAuthn/Passkey auth |\n| `@better-auth/sso` | SAML/OIDC enterprise SSO |\n| `@better-auth/stripe` | Stripe payments |\n| `@better-auth/scim` | SCIM user provisioning |\n| `@better-auth/expo` | React Native/Expo |\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```env\nBETTER_AUTH_SECRET=<32+ chars, generate with: openssl rand -base64 32>\nBETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000\nDATABASE_URL=<your database connection string>\n```\n\nAdd OAuth secrets as needed: `GITHUB_CLIENT_ID`, `GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`, etc.\n\n---\n\n## Server Config (auth.ts)\n\n**Location:** `lib/auth.ts` or `src/lib/auth.ts`\n\n**Minimal config needs:**\n- `database` - Connection or adapter\n- `emailAndPassword: { enabled: true }` - For email/password auth\n\n**Standard config adds:**\n- `socialProviders` - OAuth providers (google, github, etc.)\n- `emailVerification.sendVerificationEmail` - Email verification handler\n- `emailAndPassword.sendResetPassword` - Password reset handler\n\n**Full config adds:**\n- `plugins` - Array of feature plugins\n- `session` - Expiry, cookie cache settings\n- `account.accountLinking` - Multi-provider linking\n- `rateLimit` - Rate limiting config\n\n**Export types:** `export type Session = typeof auth.$Infer.Session`\n\n---\n\n## Client Config (auth-client.ts)\n\n**Import by framework:**\n| Framework | Import |\n|-----------|--------|\n| React/Next.js | `better-auth/react` |\n| Vue | `better-auth/vue` |\n| Svelte | `better-auth/svelte` |\n| Solid | `better-auth/solid` |\n| Vanilla JS | `better-auth/client` |\n\n**Client plugins** go in `createAuthClient({ plugins: [...] })`.\n\n**Common exports:** `signIn`, `signUp`, `signOut`, `useSession`, `getSession`\n\n---\n\n## Route Handler Setup\n\n| Framework | File | Handler |\n|-----------|------|---------|\n| Next.js App Router | `app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts` | `toNextJsHandler(auth)` → export `{ GET, POST }` |\n| Next.js Pages | `pages/api/auth/[...all].ts` | `toNextJsHandler(auth)` → default export |\n| Express | Any file | `app.all(\"/api/auth/*\", toNodeHandler(auth))` |\n| SvelteKit | `src/hooks.server.ts` | `svelteKitHandler(auth)` |\n| SolidStart | Route file | `solidStartHandler(auth)` |\n| Hono | Route file | `auth.handler(c.req.raw)` |\n\n**Next.js Server Components:** Add `nextCookies()` plugin to auth config.\n\n---\n\n## Database Migrations\n\n| Adapter | Command |\n|---------|---------|\n| Built-in Kysely | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest migrate` (applies directly) |\n| Prisma | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate --output prisma/schema.prisma` then `npx prisma migrate dev` |\n| Drizzle | `npx @better-auth/cli@latest generate --output src/db/auth-schema.ts` then `npx drizzle-kit push` |\n\n**Re-run after adding plugins.**\n\n---\n\n## Database Adapters\n\n| Database | Setup |\n|----------|-------|\n| SQLite | Pass `better-sqlite3` or `bun:sqlite` instance directly |\n| PostgreSQL | Pass `pg.Pool` instance directly |\n| MySQL | Pass `mysql2` pool directly |\n| Prisma | `prismaAdapter(prisma, { provider: \"postgresql\" })` from `better-auth/adapters/prisma` |\n| Drizzle | `drizzleAdapter(db, { provider: \"pg\" })` from `better-auth/adapters/drizzle` |\n| MongoDB | `mongodbAdapter(db)` from `better-auth/adapters/mongodb` |\n\n---\n\n## Common Plugins\n\n| Plugin | Server Import | Client Import | Purpose |\n|--------|---------------|---------------|---------|\n| `twoFactor` | `better-auth/plugins` | `twoFactorClient` | 2FA with TOTP/OTP |\n| `organization` | `better-auth/plugins` | `organizationClient` | Teams/orgs |\n| `admin` | `better-auth/plugins` | `adminClient` | User management |\n| `bearer` | `better-auth/plugins` | - | API token auth |\n| `openAPI` | `better-auth/plugins` | - | API docs |\n| `passkey` | `@better-auth/passkey` | `passkeyClient` | WebAuthn |\n| `sso` | `@better-auth/sso` | - | Enterprise SSO |\n\n**Plugin pattern:** Server plugin + client plugin + run migrations.\n\n---\n\n## Auth UI Implementation\n\n**Sign in flow:**\n1. `signIn.email({ email, password })` or `signIn.social({ provider, callbackURL })`\n2. Handle `error` in response\n3. Redirect on success\n\n**Session check (client):** `useSession()` hook returns `{ data: session, isPending }`\n\n**Session check (server):** `auth.api.getSession({ headers: await headers() })`\n\n**Protected routes:** Check session, redirect to `/sign-in` if null.\n\n---\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n- [ ] `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` set (32+ chars)\n- [ ] `advanced.useSecureCookies: true` in production\n- [ ] `trustedOrigins` configured\n- [ ] Rate limits enabled\n- [ ] Email verification enabled\n- [ ] Password reset implemented\n- [ ] 2FA for sensitive apps\n- [ ] CSRF protection NOT disabled\n- [ ] `account.accountLinking` reviewed\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| \"Secret not set\" | Add `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` env var |\n| \"Invalid Origin\" | Add domain to `trustedOrigins` |\n| Cookies not setting | Check `baseURL` matches domain; enable secure cookies in prod |\n| OAuth callback errors | Verify redirect URIs in provider dashboard |\n| Type errors after adding plugin | Re-run CLI generate/migrate |\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Docs](https://better-auth.com/docs)\n- [Examples](https://github.com/better-auth/examples)\n- [Plugins](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/plugins)\n- [CLI](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/cli)\n- [Migration Guides](https://better-auth.com/docs/guides)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:09.324Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing robust authentication integration in TypeScript/JavaScript applications","zh":"非常适合需要在TypeScript/JavaScript应用程序中实现强大的身份验证集成的全栈代理","ja":"TypeScript/JavaScriptアプリケーションで強力な認証統合を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"TypeScript/JavaScript 애플리케이션에서 강력한 인증 통합을 필요로 하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan una integración de autenticación robusta en aplicaciones TypeScript/JavaScript","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui nécessitent une intégration d''authentification robuste dans les applications TypeScript/JavaScript","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine robuste Authentifizierungsintegration in TypeScript/JavaScript-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de integração de autenticação robusta em aplicações TypeScript/JavaScript","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходима надежная интеграция аутентификации в приложениях TypeScript/JavaScript","ar":"مثالي لعميلو تطبيق كامل يحتاجون إلى دمج مصادقة قوي في تطبيقات TypeScript/JavaScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely manage user identities using Better Auth, enabling seamless authentication workflows with features like route handlers, database integration, and plugin extensions via CLI migrate/generate commands","zh":"赋予代理安全管理用户身份的能力，使用Better Auth，通过路由处理程序、数据库集成和插件扩展等功能实现无缝的身份验证工作流，支持CLI migrate/generate命令","ja":"エージェントがBetter Authを使用してユーザーIDを安全に管理できるようにし、ルートハンドラー、データベース統合、プラグイン拡張などの機能を備えたシームレスな認証ワークフローを実現し、CLI migrate/generateコマンドをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 Better Auth를 사용하여 사용자 ID를 안전하게 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 路由 처리기, 데이터베이스 통합, 플러그인 확장 등의 기능을 통해 무결점 인증 워크플ロー 구현 및 CLI migrate/generate 명령어 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de forma segura las identidades de los usuarios mediante Better Auth, permitiendo flujos de trabajo de autenticación sin problemas con características como controladores de rutas, integración de base de datos y extensiones de plugins a través de comandos CLI migrate/generate","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière sécurisée les identités des utilisateurs à l''aide de Better Auth, permettant des flux de travail d''authentification sans problème avec des fonctionnalités comme les gestionnaires de routes, l''intégration de base de données et les extensions de plugins via des commandes CLI migrate/generate","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Benutzeridentitäten mithilfe von Better Auth sicher zu verwalten, wodurch eine nahtlose Authentifizierungs-Workflow mit Funktionen wie Routen-Handlern, Datenbankintegration und Plugin-Erweiterungen über CLI migrate/generate-Befehle ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar de forma segura as identidades dos usuários usando Better Auth, permitindo fluxos de trabalho de autenticação transparentes com recursos como manipuladores de rotas, integração de banco de dados e extensões de plug-in via comandos CLI migrate/generate","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасно управлять идентификаторами пользователей с помощью Better Auth, обеспечивая бесшовные рабочие процессы аутентификации с функциями, такими как обработчики маршрутов, интеграция с базой данных и расширения плагинов через команды CLI migrate/generate","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الهويات المستخدم بشكل آمن باستخدام Better Auth، وتمكين سير عمل المصادقة المتواصلة مع ميزات مثل معالجات الطرق، وتكامل قاعدة البيانات، وتوسيعات البرنامج المساعد عبر أوامر CLI migrate/generate"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure login systems","Authenticating API requests","Managing user sessions with auth.ts and auth-client.ts"],"zh":["实现安全的登录系统","验证API请求","使用auth.ts和auth-client.ts管理用户会话"],"ja":["セキュアなログインシステムの実装","APIリクエストの認証","auth.tsとauth-client.tsを使用したユーザーセッションの管理"],"ko":["보안 로그인 시스템 구현","API 요청 인증","auth.ts 및 auth-client.ts를 사용한 사용자 세션 관리"],"es":["Implementar sistemas de inicio de sesión seguros","Autenticar solicitudes de API","Administrar sesiones de usuario con auth.ts y auth-client.ts"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de connexion sécurisés","Authentifier les requêtes API","Gérer les sessions d''utilisateur avec auth.ts et auth-client.ts"],"de":["Sichere Anmeldesysteme implementieren","API-Anfragen authentifizieren","Benutzersitzungen mit auth.ts und auth-client.ts verwalten"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de login seguros","Autenticação de solicitações de API","Gerenciamento de sessões de usuário com auth.ts e auth-client.ts"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных систем входа","Аутентификация запросов API","Управление сессиями пользователей с auth.ts и auth-client.ts"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة تسجيل الدخول الآمنة","المصادقة على طلبات API","إدارة جلسات المستخدم مع auth.ts و auth-client.ts"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Better Auth installation","Limited to TypeScript/JavaScript applications","Needs database setup and configuration"],"zh":["需要Better Auth的安装","仅限TypeScript/JavaScript应用程序","需要数据库设置和配置"],"ja":["Better Authのインストールが必要","TypeScript/JavaScriptアプリケーションに限定","データベースの設定と構成が必要"],"ko":["Better Auth 설치 필요","TypeScript/JavaScript 애플리케이션으로 제한","데이터베이스 설정 및 구성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Better Auth","Limitado a aplicaciones TypeScript/JavaScript","Necesita configuración y setup de base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Better Auth","Limité aux applications TypeScript/JavaScript","Nécessite une configuration et un setup de base de données"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Better Auth","Begrenzt auf TypeScript/JavaScript-Anwendungen","Benötigt Datenbanksetup und -konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Better Auth","Limitado a aplicações TypeScript/JavaScript","Necessita de configuração e instalação de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требует установки Better Auth","Ограничен приложениями TypeScript/JavaScript","Требует настройки и установки базы данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Better Auth","محدود بتطبيقات TypeScript/JavaScript","يحتاج إلى إعداد وتثبيت قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-ff-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'kudegowo', 'Ejyke90/kudegowo', 'openspec-ff-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:01.532Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-ff-change","name":"openspec-ff-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change 技术可以快速生成项目文件，包括从用户请求中推导出更改名称或描述","ja":"openspec-ff-change 技術は、プロジェクトファイルを迅速に生成できます。ユーザーのリクエストから変更名または説明を導き出すことができます","ko":"openspec-ff-change 기술은 프로젝트 파일을 빠르게 생성할 수 있으며 사용자의 요청에서 변경 이름 또는 설명을 유추할 수 있습니다","es":"openspec-ff-change permite generar todo lo necesario para empezar la implementación en un solo paso, ahorrando tiempo y aumentando la productividad.","fr":"openspec-ff-change permet de générer tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour commencer l''implémentation en un seul étape, ce qui vous fait gagner du temps et augmenter la productivité.","de":"openspec-ff-change ermöglicht die Generierung aller notwendigen Elemente für die Implementierung in einem Schritt, wodurch Zeit gespart und die Produktivität gesteigert wird.","pt":"A ferramenta openspec-ff-change permite criar artefatos rapidamente, gerando tudo necessário para iniciar a implementação","ru":"Инструмент openspec-ff-change позволяет быстро создавать артефакты, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации","ar":"أداة openspec-ff-change تمكنك من إنشاء مكونات بسرعة، مولدة كل ما يلزم لبدء التنفيذ","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change 技术：快速生成项目文件","ja":"openspec-ff-change 技術：プロジェクトファイルを高速生成","ko":"openspec-ff-change 기술: 프로젝트 파일 빠른 생성","es":"openspec-ff-change: Creación Rápida de Artefactos","fr":"openspec-ff-change: Création Accélérée d''Artéfacts","de":"openspec-ff-change: Schneller Artefakt-Erstellung","pt":"Openspec-ff-change: Ferramenta de Criação de Artefatos","ru":"Openspec-ff-change: Инструмент быстрого создания артефактов","ar":"Openspec-ff-change: أداة إنشاء مكونات سريعة","en":"openspec-ff-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change 技术可以快速生成项目文件，包括从用户请求中推导出更改名称或描述","ja":"openspec-ff-change 技術は、プロジェクトファイルを迅速に生成できます。ユーザーのリクエストから変更名または説明を導き出すことができます","ko":"openspec-ff-change 기술은 프로젝트 파일을 빠르게 생성할 수 있으며 사용자의 요청에서 변경 이름 또는 설명을 유추할 수 있습니다","es":"openspec-ff-change permite generar todo lo necesario para empezar la implementación en un solo paso, ahorrando tiempo y aumentando la productividad.","fr":"openspec-ff-change permet de générer tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour commencer l''implémentation en un seul étape, ce qui vous fait gagner du temps et augm...","de":"openspec-ff-change ermöglicht die Generierung aller notwendigen Elemente für die Implementierung in einem Schritt, wodurch Zeit gespart und die Produktivität...","pt":"A ferramenta openspec-ff-change permite criar artefatos rapidamente, gerando tudo necessário para iniciar a implementação","ru":"Инструмент openspec-ff-change позволяет быстро создавать артефакты, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации","ar":"أداة openspec-ff-change تمكنك من إنشاء مكونات بسرعة، مولدة كل ما يلزم لبدء التنفيذ","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速生成项目文件","从用户请求中推导出更改名称或描述","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具询问用户需求","支持 kebab-case 更改名称","支持对用户描述的自然语言处理"],"ja":["プロジェクトファイルを迅速に生成","ユーザーのリクエストから変更名または説明を導き出す","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザーのニーズを問い合わせる","kebab-case の変更名をサポート","ユーザーの説明の自然言語処理をサポート"],"ko":["프로젝트 파일을 빠르게 생성","사용자의 요청에서 변경 이름 또는 설명을 유추","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자의 요구를 묻는","kebab-case 변경 이름 지원","사용자의 설명의 자연어 처리 지원"],"es":["Generación rápida de artefactos","Implementación en un solo paso","Ahorrro de tiempo y aumento de productividad","Soporte para kebab-case y descripciones","Integración con la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Génération accélérée d''artéfacts","Implémentation en un seul étape","Gain de temps et augmentation de la productivité","Prise en charge de kebab-case et de descriptions","Intégration avec l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Schnelle Generierung von Artefakten","Implementierung in einem Schritt","Zeitersparnis und Produktivitätssteigerung","Unterstützung für kebab-case und Beschreibungen","Integration mit dem Tool AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["Geração automática de artefatos","Criação rápida de projetos","Suporte a descrições de mudanças","Integração com a ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Geração de tudo necessário para iniciar a implementação"],"ru":["Автоматическая генерация артефактов","Быстрое создание проектов","Поддержка описаний изменений","Интеграция с инструментом AskUserQuestion","Генерация всего необходимого для начала реализации"],"ar":["توليد اوتوماتيكي للمكونات","إنشاء سريع للمشاريع","دعم وصف التغييرات","تكامل مع أداة AskUserQuestion","توليد كل ما يلزم لبدء التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-ff-change","快速生成项目文件","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case","自然语言处理","项目开发","软件开发","技术开发"],"ja":["openspec-ff-change","プロジェクトファイルを迅速に生成","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case","自然言語処理","プロジェクト開発","ソフトウェア開発","テクノロジー開発"],"ko":["openspec-ff-change","프로젝트 파일 빠르게 생성","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case","자연어 처리","프로젝트 개발","소프트웨어 개발","기술 개발"],"es":["openspec-ff-change","generación de artefactos","implementación rápida","productividad","kebab-case","descripciones","AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["openspec-ff-change","génération d''artéfacts","implémentation accélérée","productivité","kebab-case","descriptions","AskUserQuestion"],"de":["openspec-ff-change","Generierung von Artefakten","schnelle Implementierung","Produktivität","kebab-case","Beschreibungen","AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["ferramenta de criação de artefatos","geração automática de artefatos","criação rápida de projetos","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","openspec-ff-change"],"ru":["инструмент создания артефактов","автоматическая генерация артефактов","быстрое создание проектов","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","openspec-ff-change"],"ar":["أداة إنشاء مكونات","توليد اوتوماتيكي للمكونات","إنشاء سريع للمشاريع","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","openspec-ff-change"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:01.532Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Acceleration Agents that streamline project initialization and artifact generation.","zh":"非常适合开发加速代理，能够简化项目初始化和构件生成。","ja":"開発加速エージェントに最適で、プロジェクトの初期化とアーティファクトの生成を簡素化する。","ko":"개발 가속 에이전트에 적합하며 프로젝트 초기화와 아티팩트 생성을 간소화한다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aceleración de Desarrollo que optimizan la inicialización de proyectos y la generación de artefactos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Accélération de Développement qui rationalisent l''initialisation de projets et la génération d''artefacts.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsbeschleunigungsagenten, die die Projekteinrichtung und die Artefaktgenerierung rationalisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aceleração de Desenvolvimento que agilizam a inicialização do projeto e a geração de artefatos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ускорения разработки, которые оптимизируют инициализацию проекта и генерацию артефактов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تسريع التطوير الذي يسرع عملية 初始化 المشروع وتوليد الملفات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables rapid generation of complete implementation-ready artifacts from a single kebab-case change name or feature description. Automates the initial setup phase by producing all necessary starter files and configurations in one operation.","zh":"能够从单个 kabab-case 更改名称或功能描述快速生成完整的实现就绪的构件。通过产生所有必要的启动文件和配置，在一个操作中自动化初始设置阶段。","ja":"ケバブケースの変更名または機能の説明から、実装可能なアーティファクトを迅速に生成できる。初期設定段階を自動化し、1 回の操作で必要なすべてのスターター ファイルと構成を作成する。","ko":"케밥 케이스의 변경 이름 또는 기능 설명에서 완전한 구현 가능한 아티팩트를 신속하게 생성할 수 있다. 초기 설정 단계를 자동화하여 한 번의 작업으로 필요한 모든 스타터 파일과 구성 파일을 생성한다.","es":"Permite la generación rápida de artefactos completos y listos para la implementación a partir de un solo nombre de cambio o descripción de función en kebab-case. Automatiza la fase de configuración inicial produciendo todos los archivos y configuraciones de inicio necesarios en una sola operación.","fr":"Permet la génération rapide d''artefacts complets et prêts à l''implémentation à partir d''un seul nom de changement ou de description de fonctionnement en kebab-case. Automatise la phase de configuration initiale en produisant tous les fichiers et configurations de démarrage nécessaires en une seule opération.","de":"Ermöglicht die schnelle Generierung von vollständigen und implementierungsreifen Artefakten aus einem einzigen kebab-case-Namen oder Funktionsbeschreibung. Automatisiert die anfängliche Einrichtungsphase, indem alle notwendigen Starter-Dateien und Konfigurationen in einem einzigen Vorgang produziert werden.","pt":"Permite a geração rápida de artefatos completos e prontos para implementação a partir de um único nome de alteração ou descrição de recurso em kebab-case. Automatiza a fase de configuração inicial produzindo todos os arquivos e configurações necessários em uma única operação.","ru":"Позволяет быстро генерировать полные и готовые к реализации артефакты из одного имени изменения или описания функции в kebab-case. Автоматизирует начальную фазу настройки, производя все необходимые файлы и конфигурации в одной операции.","ar":"يسمح بالتوليد السريع للنواتج الجاهزة للتنفيذ بالكامل من اسم تغيير أو وصف ميزة وحيد في kebab-case. يؤتمة مرحلة الإعداد الأولية من خلال توليد جميع الملفات والإعدادات الضرورية في عملية واحدة"},"useCases":{"en":["Accelerating project kickoffs by generating initial codebase structure","Automating artifact creation for new feature implementations","Streamlining bug fix workflows with pre-configured debugging environments","Converting user requirements into immediate implementation-ready outputs"],"zh":["通过生成初始代码库结构加速项目启动","自动为新功能实现创建构件","使用预配置的调试环境简化错误修复工作流程","将用户需求转化为立即可实施的输出"],"ja":["プロジェクトのキックオフを加速するために、初期コードベース構造を生成する","新しい機能実装のためのアーティファクトを自動生成する","事前に構成されたデバッグ環境を使用してバグ修正のワークフローを簡素化する","ユーザーの要件をすぐに実装可能な出力に変換する"],"ko":["초기 코드베이스 구조를 생성하여 프로젝트 시작을 가속화한다","새로운 기능 구현을 위한 아티팩트를 자동으로 생성한다","사전 구성된 디버깅 환경을 사용하여 버그 수정 워크플로우를 간소화한다","사용자의 요구 사항을 즉시 구현 가능한 출력으로 변환한다"],"es":["Acelerar los lanzamientos de proyectos mediante la generación de la estructura inicial del código","Automatizar la creación de artefactos para nuevas implementaciones de funciones","Optimizar los flujos de trabajo de corrección de errores con entornos de depuración preconfigurados","Convertir los requisitos de los usuarios en resultados listos para la implementación inmediata"],"fr":["Accélérer les lancements de projets en générant la structure initiale du code","Automatiser la création d''artefacts pour de nouvelles implémentations de fonctions","Rationaliser les flux de travail de correction de bogues avec des environnements de débogage préconfigurés","Convertir les exigences des utilisateurs en résultats prêts à l''implémentation immédiate"],"de":["Beschleunigen des Projektkickoffs durch Generierung der initialen Codebasis-Struktur","Automatisieren der Artefakt-Erstellung für neue Funktionsimplementierungen","Optimieren der Fehlersuche-Workflows mit vorkonfigurierten Debugging-Umgebungen","Umwandeln der Benutzeranforderungen in sofort implementierbare Ausgaben"],"pt":["Acelerar a inicialização dos projetos gerando a estrutura inicial do código","Automatizar a criação de artefatos para novas implementações de recursos","Otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de correção de bugs com ambientes de depuração pré-configurados","Converter os requisitos do usuário em saídas prontas para implementação imediata"],"ru":["Ускорение запуска проектов путем генерации начальной структуры кода","Автоматизация создания артефактов для новых реализаций функций","Оптимизация потоков работ по исправлению ошибок с предварительно настроенными средами отладки","Преобразование требований пользователя в готовые к реализации выходные данные"],"ar":["تعزيز بداية المشاريع من خلال توليد هيكل الكود الأولي","تأتمة إنشاء الملفات للتحديثات الجديدة للميزات","جعل سير عمل إصلاح الأعطال أكثر كفاءة باستخدام بيئات تصحيح الأعطال مسبقًا","تحويل متطلبات المستخدم إلى مخرجات جاهزة للتنفيذ الفوري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear kebab-case input or detailed description","Depends on AskUserQuestion tool for clarification when input is ambiguous","Limited to initial artifact generation phase only"],"zh":["需要清晰的 kabab-case 输入或详细描述","当输入模糊时，依赖 AskUserQuestion 工具进行澄清","仅限于初始构件生成阶段"],"ja":["明確なケバブケースの入力または詳細な説明が必要","入力が曖昧な場合、AskUserQuestion ツールを使用して明確化する","初期アーティファクト生成段階のみに限定される"],"ko":["명확한 케밥 케이스의 입력 또는 자세한 설명이 필요하다","입력이 모호한 경우 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 명확화한다","초기 아티팩트 생성 단계에만 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere una entrada clara en kebab-case o una descripción detallada","Depende de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la aclaración cuando la entrada es ambigua","Limitado a la fase de generación de artefactos iniciales solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée claire en kebab-case ou une description détaillée","Dépend de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la clarification lorsque l''entrée est ambiguë","Limité à la phase de génération d''artefacts initiale uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Eingabe im kebab-case-Format oder eine detaillierte Beschreibung","Hängt von dem Tool AskUserQuestion für die Klarstellung ab, wenn die Eingabe mehrdeutig ist","Begrenzt auf die anfängliche Artefakt-Generierungsphase nur"],"pt":["Exige entrada clara em kebab-case ou descrição detalhada","Depende da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para esclarecimento quando a entrada é ambígua","Limitado à fase de geração de artefatos inicial apenas"],"ru":["Требует rõкой входной информации в kebab-case или подробного описания","Зависит от инструмента AskUserQuestion для уточнения при неоднозначном входе","Ограничен только начальной фазой генерации артефактов"],"ar":["يتطلب مدخلات واضحة في kebab-case أو وصف مفصل","يعتمد على أداة AskUserQuestion لتوضيح المدخلات الغامضة","محدود بالمرحلة الأولى من توليد الملفات فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-new-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'kudegowo', 'Ejyke90/kudegowo', 'openspec-new-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:04.156Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-new-change","name":"openspec-new-change","description":{"zh":"Openspec 新建变更功能使用实验性构件驱动方法开始新的变更，需要输入变更名称或描述。","ja":"Openspec の新しい変更機能は、実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチで新しい変更を開始します。変更名または説明の入力が必要です。","ko":"Openspec 새로운 변경 기능은 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법으로 새로운 변경을 시작합니다. 변경 이름 또는 설명의 입력이 필요합니다.","es":"El skill ''openspec-new-change'' permite iniciar un nuevo cambio utilizando la aproximación de artefactos experimentales, mejorando la eficiencia en el desarrollo.","fr":"Le skill ''openspec-new-change'' permet de démarrer un nouveau changement en utilisant l''approche expérimentale d''artéfacts, améliorant l''efficacité du développement.","de":"Das Skill ''openspec-new-change'' ermöglicht das Initiieren einer neuen Änderung mit dem experimentellen Artefakt-Ansatz, wodurch die Entwicklung effizienter wird.","pt":"A abordagem de artefato experimental permite criar mudanças eficazes. Inicie uma nova alteração com essa ferramenta inovadora.","ru":"Экспериментальный подход на основе артефактов позволяет создавать эффективные изменения. Начните новое изменение с этой инновационной инструментой.","ar":"النهج التجريبي القائم على المكونات يسمح بإنشاء تغييرات فعالة. ابدأ تغييرًا جديدًا بهذه الأداة المبتكرة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Openspec 新建变更 - 实验性构件驱动方法","ja":"Openspec 新しい変更 - 実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチ","ko":"Openspec 새로운 변경 - 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법","es":"Inicia un nuevo cambio con enfoque de artefactos experime...","fr":"Démarrez un nouveau changement avec l''approche expériment...","de":"Starten Sie eine neue Änderung mit dem experimentellen Ar...","pt":"Inicie uma Nova Alteração com Abordagem de Artefato Exper...","ru":"Начните новое изменение с помощью экспериментального подх...","ar":"ابدأ تغييرًا جديدًا باستخدام نهج تجريبي قائم على المكونات","en":"openspec-new-change"},"description":{"zh":"Openspec 新建变更功能使用实验性构件驱动方法开始新的变更，需要输入变更名称或描述。","ja":"Openspec の新しい変更機能は、実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチで新しい変更を開始します。変更名または説明の入力が必要です。","ko":"Openspec 새로운 변경 기능은 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법으로 새로운 변경을 시작합니다. 변경 이름 또는 설명의 입력이 필요합니다.","es":"El skill ''openspec-new-change'' permite iniciar un nuevo cambio utilizando la aproximación de artefactos experimentales, mejorando la eficiencia en el desarro...","fr":"Le skill ''openspec-new-change'' permet de démarrer un nouveau changement en utilisant l''approche expérimentale d''artéfacts, améliorant l''efficacité du dévelop...","de":"Das Skill ''openspec-new-change'' ermöglicht das Initiieren einer neuen Änderung mit dem experimentellen Artefakt-Ansatz, wodurch die Entwicklung effizienter w...","pt":"A abordagem de artefato experimental permite criar mudanças eficazes. Inicie uma nova alteração com essa ferramenta inovadora.","ru":"Экспериментальный подход на основе артефактов позволяет создавать эффективные изменения. Начните новое изменение с этой инновационной инструментой.","ar":"النهج التجريبي القائم على المكونات يسمح بإنشاء تغييرات فعالة. ابدأ تغييرًا جديدًا بهذه الأداة المبتكرة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实验性构件驱动方法","输入变更名称或描述","开始新的变更","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具","支持开-ended 输入"],"ja":["実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチ","変更名または説明の入力","新しい変更の開始","AskUserQuestion ツールの使用","オープンエンド入力のサポート"],"ko":["실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법","변경 이름 또는 설명의 입력","新的 변경의 시작","AskUserQuestion 툴의 사용","오픈엔드 입력의 지원"],"es":["Inicia un nuevo cambio con enfoque de artefactos experimentales","Pide al usuario que describa el cambio que desea realizar","Deriva un nombre en kebab-case a partir de la descripción del usuario","Utiliza la herramienta AskUserQuestion para obtener información","Mejora la eficiencia en el desarrollo con un enfoque experimental"],"fr":["Démarrez un nouveau changement avec l''approche expérimentale d''artéfacts","Demande à l''utilisateur de décrire le changement qu''il souhaite effectuer","Déduit un nom en kebab-case à partir de la description de l''utilisateur","Utilise l''outil AskUserQuestion pour obtenir des informations","Améliorez l''efficacité du développement avec une approche expérimentale"],"de":["Starten Sie eine neue Änderung mit dem experimentellen Artefakt-Ansatz","Fordern Sie den Benutzer auf, die Änderung zu beschreiben, die er durchführen möchte","Leiten Sie einen Namen im Kebab-Format aus der Benutzerbeschreibung ab","Verwenden Sie das Tool AskUserQuestion, um Informationen zu erhalten","Verbessern Sie die Entwicklungseffizienz mit einem experimentellen Ansatz"],"pt":["Crie mudanças eficazes com a abordagem de artefato experimental","Inicie uma nova alteração com facilidade","Derive um nome em kebab-case a partir da descrição do usuário","Utilize a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para obter informações do usuário","Aprenda a trabalhar com a abordagem de artefato experimental"],"ru":["Создавайте эффективные изменения с помощью экспериментального подхода на основе артефактов","Начинайте новое изменение с легкостью","Получайте имя в kebab-case из описания пользователя","Используйте инструмент AskUserQuestion для получения информации от пользователя","Узнайте, как работать с экспериментальным подходом на основе артефактов"],"ar":["انشئ تغييرات فعالة باستخدام نهج تجريبي قائم على المكونات","ابدأ تغييرًا جديدًا بسهولة","استخرج اسمًا في صيغة kebab-case من وصف المستخدم","استخدم أداة AskUserQuestion لاستلام معلومات من المستخدم","تعلم كيفية العمل مع نهج تجريبي قائم على المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Openspec","新建变更","实验性构件驱动方法","AskUserQuestion","开-ended 输入","变更管理"],"ja":["Openspec","新しい変更","実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチ","AskUserQuestion","オープンエンド入力","変更管理"],"ko":["Openspec","新的 변경","실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근법","AskUserQuestion","오픈엔드 입력","변경 관리"],"es":["desarrollo de software","enfoque experimental","artefactos","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","eficiencia en el desarrollo","nuevo cambio","skill de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement de logiciels","approche expérimentale","artéfacts","kebab-case","AskUserQuestion","efficacité du développement","nouveau changement","skill de développement"],"de":["Software-Entwicklung","experimenteller Ansatz","Artefakte","Kebab-Format","AskUserQuestion","Entwicklungseffizienz","neue Änderung","Entwicklungs-Skill"],"pt":["alteração experimental","abordagem de artefato experimental","mudanças eficazes","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case"],"ru":["экспериментальное изменение","экспериментальный подход на основе артефактов","эффективные изменения","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case"],"ar":["التغيير التجريبي","النهج التجريبي القائم على المكونات","التغييرات الفعالة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","AskUserQuestion","kebab-case"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:04.156Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Artifact-Driven Agents needing to initiate new changes with descriptive names and interactive user prompts.","zh":"适合于需要使用描述性名称和交互式用户提示来启动新变更的基于文物的代理。","ja":"新しい変更を開始するために記述的な名前と対話型のユーザープロンプトを必要とするアーティファクト駆動型エージェントに適しています。","ko":"새로운 변경을 시작하는 데에 설명적인 이름과 상호작용 사용자 프롬프트가 필요한 아티팩트 주도 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes impulsados por artefactos que necesitan iniciar nuevos cambios con nombres descriptivos y solicitudes de usuario interactivas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents à base d''artefacts ayant besoin d''initier de nouveaux changements avec des noms descriptifs et des invites de l''utilisateur interactives.","de":"Ideal für artefaktgesteuerte Agenten, die neue Änderungen mit beschreibenden Namen und interaktiven Benutzereingaben initiieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Dirigidos por Artefatos que precisam iniciar novas alterações com nomes descritivos e prompts de usuário interativos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, управляемых артефактами, которым необходимо инициировать новые изменения с описательными именами и интерактивными подсказками пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الموجه بالمنبع الذي يحتاج إلى启动 التغييرات الجديدة بأسماء وصفية وادخال مستخدم تفاعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to derive kebab-case names from user descriptions and utilize the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended input, facilitating an experimental artifact-driven approach with tools like AskUserQuestion and kebab-case naming conventions.","zh":"赋予代理从用户描述中推导出短横线命名法的名称，并利用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行开放式输入，从而促进使用 AskUserQuestion 和短横线命名法等工具的实验性基于文物的方法。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーの説明からケバブケースの名前を導出し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用してオープンエンド入力を活用できるようにし、AskUserQuestionやケバブケース命名規則などのツールを使用した実験的なアーティファクト駆動型アプローチを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자의 설명에서 케밥 케이스 이름을 유추하고 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 개방형 입력을 활용할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 AskUserQuestion 및 케밥 케이스 명명 규칙과 같은 도구를 사용하는 실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식을 촉진합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes derivar nombres en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuario y utilizar la herramienta AskUserQuestion para entradas abiertas, facilitando un enfoque experimental impulsado por artefactos con herramientas como AskUserQuestion y convenciones de nomenclatura en kebab-case.","fr":"Permet aux agents de dériver des noms en kebab-case à partir de descriptions utilisateur et d''utiliser l''outil AskUserQuestion pour des entrées ouvertes, facilitant une approche expérimentale à base d''artefacts avec des outils comme AskUserQuestion et des conventions de nommage en kebab-case.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, kebab-case-Namen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen abzuleiten und das Tool AskUserQuestion für offene Eingaben zu nutzen, wodurch ein experimenteller, artefaktgesteuerter Ansatz mit Tools wie AskUserQuestion und kebab-case-Namenskonventionen erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a derivar nomes em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário e a utilizar a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para entrada aberta, facilitando uma abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos com ferramentas como AskUserQuestion e convenções de nomenclatura em kebab-case.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью получать имена в формате kebab-case из описаний пользователя и использовать инструмент AskUserQuestion для открытого ввода, что облегчает экспериментальный подход, управляемый артефактами, с помощью инструментов, таких как AskUserQuestion и соглашения об именах в формате kebab-case.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على استخلاص أسماء الصيغة kebab-case من описات المستخدم واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion للإدخال المفتوح، وبالتالي تسهيل نهج تجريبي قائم على المنبع باستخدام أدوات مثل AskUserQuestion وتوافق تسمية الصيغة kebab-case."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new changes with user-provided descriptions","Deriving kebab-case names for changes","Prompting users for clarification on change requests"],"zh":["使用用户提供的描述来初始化新变化","为变化推导出短横线命名法的名称","提示用户对变化请求进行澄清"],"ja":["ユーザーが提供した説明を使用して新しい変更を初期化する","変更にケバブケースの名前を導出する","変更要求についてユーザーに明確化を求める"],"ko":["사용자 제공 설명으로 새로운 변화를 초기화","변화에 케밥 케이스 이름을 유추","변경 요청에 대한 사용자澄清 유도"],"es":["Inicializar nuevos cambios con descripciones proporcionadas por el usuario","Derivar nombres en kebab-case para los cambios","Solicitar a los usuarios aclaraciones sobre solicitudes de cambios"],"fr":["Initialiser de nouveaux changements avec des descriptions fournies par l''utilisateur","Dériver des noms en kebab-case pour les changements","Demander aux utilisateurs des éclaircissements sur les demandes de changement"],"de":["Neue Änderungen mit Benutzerbeschreibungen initialisieren","Kebab-case-Namen für Änderungen ableiten","Benutzer um Klarstellung bei Änderungsanfragen bitten"],"pt":["Inicializar novas alterações com descrições fornecidas pelo usuário","Derivar nomes em kebab-case para alterações","Solicitar esclarecimentos aos usuários sobre solicitações de alteração"],"ru":["Инициализация новых изменений с описаниями, предоставленными пользователем","Получение имен в формате kebab-case для изменений","Запрос разъяснений у пользователей по запросам на изменение"],"ar":["تحرير التغييرات الجديدة مع الوصف المقدم من قبل المستخدم","استخلاص أسماء الصيغة kebab-case للتغييرات","طلب توضيحات من المستخدمين بشأن طلبات التغيير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input or description","Dependent on AskUserQuestion tool functionality"],"zh":["需要用户输入或描述","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具的功能"],"ja":["ユーザー入力または説明が必要","AskUserQuestionツールの機能に依存する"],"ko":["사용자 입력 또는 설명이 필요","AskUserQuestion 도구의 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entrada o descripción del usuario","Dependiente de la funcionalidad de la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée ou une description de l''utilisateur","Dépend de la fonctionnalité de l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Benutzer-Eingabe oder -Beschreibung erforderlich","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des Tools AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["Requer entrada ou descrição do usuário","Depende da funcionalidade da ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Требует ввода или описания пользователя","Зависит от функциональности инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال أو وصف من المستخدم","يعتمد على وظائف أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('congwa/embedease-ai/auto-screenshot', 'community', 'congwa', 'embedease-ai', 'congwa/embedease-ai', 'auto-screenshot', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:26.620Z', NULL, '{"id":"congwa/embedease-ai/auto-screenshot","name":"auto-screenshot","description":{"zh":"自动截屏工具是一款开箱即用的AI智能客服系统，能够自动运行项目并对主要功能页面进行全屏截屏，保存到指定目录","ja":"自動スクリーンショットツールは、開箱即用的AI智能カスタマーサポートシステムであり、プロジェクトを自動的に実行して主要機能ページを全画面キャプチャし、指定されたディレクトリに保存します","ko":"자동 스크린샷 도구는 開箱即用的 AI智能 고객 지원 시스템으로, 프로젝트를 자동으로 실행하여 주요 기능 페이지를 전체 화면 캡처하여 지정된 디렉토리에 저장합니다","es":"La herramienta auto-screenshot es una solución para capturar automáticamente las pantallas de tu proyecto y guardarlas en un directorio","fr":"L''outil auto-screenshot est une solution pour capturer automatiquement les écrans de votre projet et les sauvegarder dans un répertoire","de":"Das Tool Auto-Screenshot ist eine Lösung, um die Bildschirme Ihres Projekts automatisch zu erfassen und in einem Verzeichnis zu speichern","pt":"O Auto Screenshot é uma ferramenta que captura automaticamente telas do seu projeto, salvando-as em um diretório de documentação.","ru":"Авто Скриншот - это инструмент, который автоматически делает снимки экрана вашего проекта, сохраняя их в директории документации.","ar":"اللقطة الآلية هي أداة تقوم بتقاط شاشات مشروعك تلقائيًا، وتحفظها في مجلد توثيق.","en":"一款开箱即用的 AI 智能客服系统，人工客服，客户转化"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"自动截屏工具 - AI 智能客服系统","ja":"自動スクリーンショットツール - AI智能カスタマーサポートシステム","ko":"자동 스크린샷 도구 - AI智能 고객 지원 시스템","es":"Auto-screenshot: Herramienta de captura automática de pan...","fr":"Auto-screenshot : Outil de capture d''écran automatique","de":"Auto-Screenshot: Werkzeug für automatische Bildschirmaufn...","pt":"Auto Screenshot: Ferramenta de Captura Automática","ru":"Авто Скриншот: Инструмент Автоматической Съёмки","ar":"اللقطة الآلية: أداة لالتقاط الشاشة تلقائيًا","en":"auto-screenshot"},"description":{"zh":"自动截屏工具是一款开箱即用的AI智能客服系统，能够自动运行项目并对主要功能页面进行全屏截屏，保存到指定目录","ja":"自動スクリーンショットツールは、開箱即用的AI智能カスタマーサポートシステムであり、プロジェクトを自動的に実行して主要機能ページを全画面キャプチャし、指定されたディレクトリに保存します","ko":"자동 스크린샷 도구는 開箱即用的 AI智能 고객 지원 시스템으로, 프로젝트를 자동으로 실행하여 주요 기능 페이지를 전체 화면 캡처하여 지정된 디렉토리에 저장합니다","es":"La herramienta auto-screenshot es una solución para capturar automáticamente las pantallas de tu proyecto y guardarlas en un directorio","fr":"L''outil auto-screenshot est une solution pour capturer automatiquement les écrans de votre projet et les sauvegarder dans un répertoire","de":"Das Tool Auto-Screenshot ist eine Lösung, um die Bildschirme Ihres Projekts automatisch zu erfassen und in einem Verzeichnis zu speichern","pt":"O Auto Screenshot é uma ferramenta que captura automaticamente telas do seu projeto, salvando-as em um diretório de documentação.","ru":"Авто Скриншот - это инструмент, который автоматически делает снимки экрана вашего проекта, сохраняя их в директории документации.","ar":"اللقطة الآلية هي أداة تقوم بتقاط شاشات مشروعك تلقائيًا، وتحفظها في مجلد توثيق.","en":"一款开箱即用的 AI 智能客服系统，人工客服，客户转化"},"definition":{"en":"一款开箱即用的 AI 智能客服系统，人工客服，客户转化"},"features":{"zh":["自动运行项目","全屏截屏","保存到指定目录","支持Playwright","支持多浏览器","易于使用"],"ja":["プロジェクトを自動的に実行","全画面キャプチャ","指定されたディレクトリに保存","Playwrightをサポート","多くのブラウザをサポート","使いやすい"],"ko":["프로젝트를 자동으로 실행","전체 화면 캡처","지정된 디렉토리에 저장","Playwright를 지원","다수의 브라우저를 지원","사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Captura automática de pantallas","Guardado de imágenes en un directorio","Compatibilidad con Playwright","Ejecución de scripts de captura","Soporte para múltiples navegadores"],"fr":["Capture automatique des écrans","Sauvegarde des images dans un répertoire","Compatibilité avec Playwright","Exécution de scripts de capture","Prise en charge de plusieurs navigateurs"],"de":["Automatische Erfassung von Bildschirmen","Speicherung von Bildern in einem Verzeichnis","Kompatibilität mit Playwright","Ausführung von Erfassungsskripten","Unterstützung für mehrere Browser"],"pt":["Captura automática de telas","Salva imagens em diretório de documentação","Requer Playwright para funcionar","Executa em ambiente de desenvolvimento","Suporta vários navegadores"],"ru":["Автоматическая съёмка экрана","Сохраняет изображения в директории документации","Требует Playwright для работы","Выполняется в среде разработки","Поддерживает несколько браузеров"],"ar":["التقاط الآلي للشاشة","تحفظ الصور في مجلد التوثيق","يتطلب Playwright للعمل","ينفذ في بيئة التطوير","يدعم عدة متصفحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动截屏","AI智能客服系统","自动化测试","文档生成","Playwright","自动化工具","开发效率","测试工具"],"ja":["自動スクリーンショット","AI智能カスタマーサポートシステム","自動テスト","ドキュメント生成","Playwright","自動化ツール","開発効率","テストツール"],"ko":["자동 스크린샷","AI智能 고객 지원 시스템","자동화 테스트","문서 생성","Playwright","자동화 도구","개발 효율성","테스트 도구"],"es":["auto-screenshot","captura automática de pantalla","playwright","desarrollo web","pruebas automatizadas","documentación de proyecto"],"fr":["auto-screenshot","capture automatique d''écran","playwright","développement web","tests automatisés","documentation de projet"],"de":["auto-screenshot","automatische Bildschirmaufnahme","playwright","webentwicklung","automatisierte tests","projektdokumentation"],"pt":["auto screenshot","captura automática de telas","documentação de projetos","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","playwright","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["авто скриншот","автоматическая съёмка экрана","документация проектов","инструмент разработки","playwright","веб-разработка"],"ar":["اللقطة الآلية","التقاط الشاشة تلقائيًا","توثيق المشاريع","أداة التطوير","playwright","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"congwa","repo":"embedease-ai","repoPath":"congwa/embedease-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"auto-screenshot","description":"自动截屏功能页面。当用户需要更新项目文档截图、生成功能演示图、或需要记录当前 UI 状态时触发。","bodyPreview":"# 自动截屏 Skill\n\n自动运行项目并对主要功能页面进行全屏截屏，保存到 `/docs/screenshots` 目录。\n\n## 前置条件\n\n1. **前端服务已启动**（`http://localhost:3000`）\n2. **安装 Playwright**（首次使用需安装）\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### 步骤 1：检查前端服务\n\n```bash\n# 如果前端服务未启动，先启动\ncd frontend && pnpm dev\n```\n\n### 步骤 2：安装依赖（首次使用，在 frontend 目录）\n\n```bash\ncd frontend\n\n# 安装 Playwright（如果尚未安装）\npnpm add -D playwright\n\n# 安装浏览器（首次使用）\nnpx playwright install chromium\n```\n\n### 步骤 3：运行截屏脚本（在 frontend 目录）\n\n```bash\ncd frontend\nnpx tsx scripts/screenshot.ts\n```\n\n## 截屏页面列表\n\n| 路径 | 文件名 | 描述 |\n|-----","body":"# 自动截屏 Skill\n\n自动运行项目并对主要功能页面进行全屏截屏，保存到 `/docs/screenshots` 目录。\n\n## 前置条件\n\n1. **前端服务已启动**（`http://localhost:3000`）\n2. **安装 Playwright**（首次使用需安装）\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### 步骤 1：检查前端服务\n\n```bash\n# 如果前端服务未启动，先启动\ncd frontend && pnpm dev\n```\n\n### 步骤 2：安装依赖（首次使用，在 frontend 目录）\n\n```bash\ncd frontend\n\n# 安装 Playwright（如果尚未安装）\npnpm add -D playwright\n\n# 安装浏览器（首次使用）\nnpx playwright install chromium\n```\n\n### 步骤 3：运行截屏脚本（在 frontend 目录）\n\n```bash\ncd frontend\nnpx tsx scripts/screenshot.ts\n```\n\n## 截屏页面列表\n\n| 路径 | 文件名 | 描述 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| `/` | landing-page.png | 产品落地页 |\n| `/chat` | chat-interface.png | 用户聊天界面 |\n| `/admin` | admin-dashboard.png | 管理后台仪表盘 |\n| `/admin/quick-setup` | quick-setup.png | 快速配置向导 |\n| `/admin/agents` | agent-list.png | Agent 列表 |\n| `/admin/single` | single-mode.png | 单 Agent 模式配置 |\n| `/admin/multi` | multi-mode.png | 编排模式配置 |\n| `/admin/settings` | settings.png | 系统设置 |\n| `/admin/settings/mode` | mode-settings.png | 模式设置 |\n| `/admin/skills` | skills-list.png | 技能列表 |\n| `/support` | support-workbench.png | 客服工作台 |\n\n## 输出文件\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── screenshots/\n│   ├── landing-page.png\n│   ├── chat-interface.png\n│   ├── admin-dashboard.png\n│   └── ...\n└── SCREENSHOTS.md          # 截图索引文件\n```\n\n## 配置选项\n\n可在 `scripts/screenshot.ts` 中修改：\n\n```typescript\nconst CONFIG = {\n  baseUrl: ''http://localhost:3000'',  // 服务地址\n  outputDir: ''./docs/screenshots'',    // 输出目录\n  viewport: { width: 1920, height: 1080 },  // 视口大小\n  timeout: 30000,  // 超时时间\n};\n```\n\n## 添加新页面\n\n在 `PAGES` 数组中添加：\n\n```typescript\n{ path: ''/admin/new-page'', name: ''new-page'', description: ''新页面描述'' },\n```\n\n## 注意事项\n\n1. **需要登录的页面**：脚本目前不处理登录状态，如需截取需要登录的页面，需要修改脚本添加登录逻辑\n2. **动态内容**：脚本会等待页面加载完成，但动态加载的数据可能显示为空\n3. **深色模式**：默认使用系统主题，如需指定可在脚本中添加主题切换逻辑\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:26.620Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing automated screenshot generation for documentation purposes.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化截图生成用于文档目的的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが自動化されたスクリーンショット生成を文書化目的で必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"문서화 목적으로 자동화된 스크린샷 생성이 필요한 프런트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan generación automática de capturas de pantalla para fines de documentación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une génération automatisée de captures d''écran à des fins de documentation.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine automatisierte Screenshot-Erstellung für Dokumentationszwecke benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de geração automática de capturas de tela para fins de documentação.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация скриншотов для целей документации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى إنتاج شاشة تلقائي للتوثيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate full-screen screenshot capture of web applications using Playwright and Chromium, saving images to a specified directory like `/docs/screenshots`.","zh":"赋予代理自动化全屏截图捕获网页应用程序的能力，使用Playwright和Chromium，并将图像保存到指定目录，如`/docs/screenshots`。","ja":"PlaywrightとChromiumを使用して、Webアプリケーションのフルスクリーンショットを自動的にキャプチャし、`/docs/screenshots`などの指定されたディレクトリに画像を保存するエージェントの能力を実現します。","ko":"Playwright와 Chromium을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션의 전체 화면 스크린샷을 자동으로 캡처하고 `/docs/screenshots`와 같은 지정된 디렉토리에 이미지를 저장하는 에이전트의 능력을賦予합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la captura de pantalla completa de aplicaciones web utilizando Playwright y Chromium, guardando las imágenes en un directorio especificado como `/docs/screenshots`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la capture d''écran complète des applications Web à l''aide de Playwright et Chromium, en sauvegardant les images dans un répertoire spécifié comme `/docs/screenshots`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Vollbild-Screenshot-Erfassung von Webanwendungen mithilfe von Playwright und Chromium zu automatisieren und die Bilder in einem bestimmten Verzeichnis wie `/docs/screenshots` zu speichern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a captura de tela cheia de aplicações web usando Playwright e Chromium, salvando imagens em um diretório especificado como `/docs/screenshots`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать захват полноэкранного скриншота веб-приложений с помощью Playwright и Chromium, сохраняя изображения в указанной директории, например `/docs/screenshots`.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من تلقين الوكيل لالتقاط شاشة كاملة من تطبيقات الويب باستخدام بلاي رايت وكروم، وحفظ الصور في دليل محدد مثل `/docs/screenshots`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating screenshot generation for new feature releases","Generating visual documentation for web application onboarding","Debugging responsive design issues across different screen sizes"],"zh":["自动化新功能发布的截图生成","生成网页应用程序入门的视觉文档","调试不同屏幕尺寸下的响应式设计问题"],"ja":["新機能リリースのスクリーンショット生成を自動化する","Webアプリケーションのオンボーディング用の視覚的なドキュメントを生成する","さまざまな画面サイズでのレスポンシブデザインの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["새로운 기능 릴리스를 위한 스크린샷 생성 자동화","웹 애플리케이션 온보딩을 위한 시각적 문서 생성","다양한 화면 크기에서 반응형 디자인 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de capturas de pantalla para nuevos lanzamientos de características","Generar documentación visual para la integración de aplicaciones web","Depurar problemas de diseño responsivo en diferentes tamaños de pantalla"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de captures d''écran pour les nouveaux lancements de fonctionnalités","Générer une documentation visuelle pour l''intégration d''applications Web","Déboguer les problèmes de conception réactive sur différents tailles d''écran"],"de":["Automatisieren der Screenshot-Erstellung für neue Feature-Veröffentlichungen","Erstellen einer visuellen Dokumentation für die Einrichtung von Webanwendungen","Beheben von Problemen mit responsivem Design auf verschiedenen Bildschirmgrößen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de capturas de tela para lançamentos de novos recursos","Gerar documentação visual para integração de aplicações web","Depurar problemas de design responsivo em diferentes tamanhos de tela"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию скриншотов для выпусков новых функций","Генерировать визуальную документацию для интеграции веб-приложений","Отлаживать проблемы с адаптивным дизайном на разных размерах экрана"],"ar":["التلقين لإنشاء شاشات لموارد جديدة","إنشاء توثيق مرئي لدمج تطبيقات الويب","تصحيح مشاكل تصميم متجاوب عبر أحجام شاشة مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright and Chromium installation","Frontend service must be running on `http://localhost:3000`","Limited to Chromium browser for screenshot capture"],"zh":["需要安装Playwright和Chromium","前端服务必须在`http://localhost:3000`上运行","仅限于Chromium浏览器进行截图捕获"],"ja":["PlaywrightとChromiumのインストールが必要","フロントエンドサービスは`http://localhost:3000`で実行されている必要がある","スクリーンショットのキャプチャはChromiumブラウザに限定される"],"ko":["Playwright와 Chromium 설치가 필요하다","프론트엔드 서비스는 `http://localhost:3000`에서 실행되어야 한다","스크린샷 캡처는 Chromium 브라우저로 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Playwright y Chromium","El servicio Frontend debe estar en ejecución en `http://localhost:3000`","Limitado al navegador Chromium para la captura de pantalla"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Playwright et Chromium","Le service Frontend doit être en cours d''exécution sur `http://localhost:3000`","Limité au navigateur Chromium pour la capture d''écran"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Playwright und Chromium","Der Frontend-Service muss auf `http://localhost:3000` ausgeführt werden","Begrenzt auf den Chromium-Browser für die Screenshot-Erfassung"],"pt":["Requer a instalação do Playwright e do Chromium","O serviço Frontend deve estar em execução em `http://localhost:3000`","Limitado ao navegador Chromium para captura de tela"],"ru":["Требует установки Playwright и Chromium","Сервис Фронтенд должен работать на `http://localhost:3000`","Ограничен браузером Chromium для захвата экрана"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بلاي رايت وكروم","يجب تشغيل خدمة واجهة المستخدم على `http://localhost:3000`","محدود بمتصفح كروم لالتقاط الشاشة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-verify-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'kudegowo', 'Ejyke90/kudegowo', 'openspec-verify-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:17.007Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-verify-change","name":"openspec-verify-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术验证用于确保实现匹配变更构件。开发者可以快速验证变更","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術検証は、実装が変更アーティファクトに一致することを確認するために使用されます。開発者は迅速に変更を検証できます","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술 검증은 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인하는 데 사용됩니다. 개발자는 빠르게 변경 사항을 검증할 수 있습니다","es":"Verifica que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio. Opcionalmente, especifica un nombre de cambio para verificar la coincidencia.","fr":"Vérifiez que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification. Spécifiez facultativement un nom de modification pour vérifier la correspondance.","de":"Überprüfen Sie, ob die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Optional können Sie einen Änderungsnamen angeben, um die Übereinstimmung zu überprüfen.","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde às alterações de artefatos, como specs, tarefas e design.","ru":"Openspec-verify-change — это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация изменению артефактов, таких как спецификации, задачи и дизайн.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة للتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع تغييرات القوالب، مثل المواصفات والمهام والتصميم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术验证","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術検証","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술 검증","es":"Verificar cambios con openspec-verify-change","fr":"Vérifier les modifications avec openspec-verify-change","de":"Änderungen mit openspec-verify-change überprüfen","pt":"Verificação de Alterações com openspec-verify-change","ru":"Проверка изменений с openspec-verify-change","ar":"التحقق من التغييرات مع openspec-verify-change","en":"openspec-verify-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-verify-change 技术验证用于确保实现匹配变更构件。开发者可以快速验证变更","ja":"openspec-verify-change 技術検証は、実装が変更アーティファクトに一致することを確認するために使用されます。開発者は迅速に変更を検証できます","ko":"openspec-verify-change 기술 검증은 구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인하는 데 사용됩니다. 개발자는 빠르게 변경 사항을 검증할 수 있습니다","es":"Verifica que la implementación coincida con los artefactos de cambio. Opcionalmente, especifica un nombre de cambio para verificar la coincidencia.","fr":"Vérifiez que la mise en œuvre correspond aux artefacts de modification. Spécifiez facultativement un nom de modification pour vérifier la correspondance.","de":"Überprüfen Sie, ob die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten übereinstimmt. Optional können Sie einen Änderungsnamen angeben, um die Übereinstimmung zu...","pt":"O openspec-verify-change é uma ferramenta que verifica se uma implementação corresponde às alterações de artefatos, como specs, tarefas e design.","ru":"Openspec-verify-change — это инструмент, который проверяет, соответствует ли реализация изменению артефактов, таких как спецификации, задачи и дизайн.","ar":"openspec-verify-change هو أداة للتحقق من تطابق التنفيذ مع تغييرات القوالب، مثل المواصفات والمهام والتصميم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证实现是否匹配变更构件","支持变更名称的选定","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具让用户选择变更","显示具有实现任务的变更","运行 openspec list --json 获取可用变更"],"ja":["実装が変更アーティファクトに一致することを確認","変更名の選択をサポート","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザーに選択を求める","実装タスクを含む変更を表示","openspec list --json を実行して利用可能な変更を取得"],"ko":["구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 확인","변경 이름 선택 지원","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자에게 선택을 요청","구현 작업을 포함하는 변경 사항 표시","openspec list --json 실행하여 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 가져옴"],"es":["Verificación de la implementación con los artefactos de cambio","Selección de cambios disponibles mediante la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Ejecución de comandos openspec para obtener cambios","Compatibilidad con selección de cambios por nombre","Soporte para inferir el nombre del cambio desde el contexto de la conversación"],"fr":["Vérification de la mise en œuvre avec les artefacts de modification","Sélection des modifications disponibles à l''aide de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Exécution de commandes openspec pour obtenir les modifications","Compatibilité avec la sélection de modifications par nom","Prise en charge de l''inférence du nom de la modification à partir du contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Überprüfung der Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten","Auswahl der verfügbaren Änderungen mithilfe der AskUserQuestion-Tool","Ausführung von openspec-Befehlen, um Änderungen zu erhalten","Kompatibilität mit der Auswahl von Änderungen nach Name","Unterstützung für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações de artefatos","Suporte a specs, tarefas e design","Opção para especificar o nome da alteração","Capacidade de inferir a alteração do contexto da conversa","Prompt para seleção de alterações disponíveis"],"ru":["Проверка изменений артефактов","Поддержка спецификаций, задач и дизайна","Возможность указать имя изменения","Способность вывести изменение из контекста разговора","Промпт для выбора доступных изменений"],"ar":["التحقق من تغييرات القوالب","دعم المواصفات والمهام والتصميم","خيار لتحديد اسم التغيير","القدرة على استنتاج التغيير من سياق المحادثة","توجيه لتحديد التغييرات المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-verify-change","技术验证","变更构件","实现匹配","AskUserQuestion","openspec list","开发者工具"],"ja":["openspec-verify-change","技術検証","変更アーティファクト","実装一致","AskUserQuestion","openspec list","開発者ツール"],"ko":["openspec-verify-change","기술 검증","변경 아티팩트","구현 일치","AskUserQuestion","openspec list","개발자 도구"],"es":["openspec-verify-change","verificar cambios","arteactos de cambio","implementación","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","AskUserQuestion","comandos openspec"],"fr":["openspec-verify-change","vérifier les modifications","artefacts de modification","mise en œuvre","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","AskUserQuestion","commandes openspec"],"de":["openspec-verify-change","änderungen überprüfen","änderungsartefakte","implementierung","software-entwicklung","entwicklungstools","AskUserQuestion","openspec-befehle"],"pt":["openspec-verify-change","verificação de alterações","arte-fatos","specs","tarefas","design","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["openspec-verify-change","проверка изменений","артефакты","спецификации","задачи","дизайн","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["openspec-verify-change","التحقق من التغييرات","القوالب","المواصفات","المهام","التصميم","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-verify-change","description":"Verify implementation matches change artifacts. Use when the user wants to validate that implementation is complete, correct, and coherent before archiving.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifa","body":"Verify that an implementation matches the change artifacts (specs, tasks, design).\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes. Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select.\n\n   Show changes that have implementation tasks (tasks artifact exists).\n   Include the schema used for each change if available.\n   Mark changes with incomplete tasks as \"(In Progress)\".\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check status to understand the schema**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to understand:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - Which artifacts exist for this change\n\n3. **Get the change directory and load artifacts**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions apply --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   This returns the change directory and context files. Read all available artifacts from `contextFiles`.\n\n4. **Initialize verification report structure**\n\n   Create a report structure with three dimensions:\n   - **Completeness**: Track tasks and spec coverage\n   - **Correctness**: Track requirement implementation and scenario coverage\n   - **Coherence**: Track design adherence and pattern consistency\n\n   Each dimension can have CRITICAL, WARNING, or SUGGESTION issues.\n\n5. **Verify Completeness**\n\n   **Task Completion**:\n   - If tasks.md exists in contextFiles, read it\n   - Parse checkboxes: `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - Count complete vs total tasks\n   - If incomplete tasks exist:\n     - Add CRITICAL issue for each incomplete task\n     - Recommendation: \"Complete task: <description>\" or \"Mark as done if already implemented\"\n\n   **Spec Coverage**:\n   - If delta specs exist in `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/`:\n     - Extract all requirements (marked with \"### Requirement:\")\n     - For each requirement:\n       - Search codebase for keywords related to the requirement\n       - Assess if implementation likely exists\n     - If requirements appear unimplemented:\n       - Add CRITICAL issue: \"Requirement not found: <requirement name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Implement requirement X: <description>\"\n\n6. **Verify Correctness**\n\n   **Requirement Implementation Mapping**:\n   - For each requirement from delta specs:\n     - Search codebase for implementation evidence\n     - If found, note file paths and line ranges\n     - Assess if implementation matches requirement intent\n     - If divergence detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Implementation may diverge from spec: <details>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Review <file>:<lines> against requirement X\"\n\n   **Scenario Coverage**:\n   - For each scenario in delta specs (marked with \"#### Scenario:\"):\n     - Check if conditions are handled in code\n     - Check if tests exist covering the scenario\n     - If scenario appears uncovered:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Scenario not covered: <scenario name>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Add test or implementation for scenario: <description>\"\n\n7. **Verify Coherence**\n\n   **Design Adherence**:\n   - If design.md exists in contextFiles:\n     - Extract key decisions (look for sections like \"Decision:\", \"Approach:\", \"Architecture:\")\n     - Verify implementation follows those decisions\n     - If contradiction detected:\n       - Add WARNING: \"Design decision not followed: <decision>\"\n       - Recommendation: \"Update implementation or revise design.md to match reality\"\n   - If no design.md: Skip design adherence check, note \"No design.md to verify against\"\n\n   **Code Pattern Consistency**:\n   - Review new code for consistency with project patterns\n   - Check file naming, directory structure, coding style\n   - If significant deviations found:\n     - Add SUGGESTION: \"Code pattern deviation: <details>\"\n     - Recommendation: \"Consider following project pattern: <example>\"\n\n8. **Generate Verification Report**\n\n   **Summary Scorecard**:\n   ```\n   ## Verification Report: <change-name>\n\n   ### Summary\n   | Dimension    | Status           |\n   |--------------|------------------|\n   | Completeness | X/Y tasks, N reqs|\n   | Correctness  | M/N reqs covered |\n   | Coherence    | Followed/Issues  |\n   ```\n\n   **Issues by Priority**:\n\n   1. **CRITICAL** (Must fix before archive):\n      - Incomplete tasks\n      - Missing requirement implementations\n      - Each with specific, actionable recommendation\n\n   2. **WARNING** (Should fix):\n      - Spec/design divergences\n      - Missing scenario coverage\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   3. **SUGGESTION** (Nice to fix):\n      - Pattern inconsistencies\n      - Minor improvements\n      - Each with specific recommendation\n\n   **Final Assessment**:\n   - If CRITICAL issues: \"X critical issue(s) found. Fix before archiving.\"\n   - If only warnings: \"No critical issues. Y warning(s) to consider. Ready for archive (with noted improvements).\"\n   - If all clear: \"All checks passed. Ready for archive.\"\n\n**Verification Heuristics**\n\n- **Completeness**: Focus on objective checklist items (checkboxes, requirements list)\n- **Correctness**: Use keyword search, file path analysis, reasonable inference - don''t require perfect certainty\n- **Coherence**: Look for glaring inconsistencies, don''t nitpick style\n- **False Positives**: When uncertain, prefer SUGGESTION over WARNING, WARNING over CRITICAL\n- **Actionability**: Every issue must have a specific recommendation with file/line references where applicable\n\n**Graceful Degradation**\n\n- If only tasks.md exists: verify task completion only, skip spec/design checks\n- If tasks + specs exist: verify completeness and correctness, skip design\n- If full artifacts: verify all three dimensions\n- Always note which checks were skipped and why\n\n**Output Format**\n\nUse clear markdown with:\n- Table for summary scorecard\n- Grouped lists for issues (CRITICAL/WARNING/SUGGESTION)\n- Code references in format: `file.ts:123`\n- Specific, actionable recommendations\n- No vague suggestions like \"consider reviewing\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:17.007Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring precise change verification and implementation validation.","zh":"适合需要精确变更验证和实现验证的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが正確な変更の検証と実装の検証を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 변경 검증 및 구현 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una verificación de cambios precisa y una validación de implementación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une vérification de modification précise et une validation d''implémentation.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine präzise Änderungsüberprüfung und eine Implementierungsvalidierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem verificação precisa de alterações e validação de implementação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих точной верификации изменений и валидации реализации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يتطلبون التحقق الدقيق للتغييرات والتحقق من التنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify implementation matches change artifacts using specs, tasks, and design, leveraging the openspec library and AskUserQuestion tool for seamless user interaction and change selection, including JSON output for robust data handling.","zh":"赋予代理验证实现是否与变更工件相匹配，使用规格、任务和设计，利用openspec库和AskUserQuestion工具实现无缝的用户交互和变更选择，包括JSON输出以实现强大的数据处理。","ja":"エージェントが実装が変更アーティファクトと一致することを検証できるようにし、仕様、タスク、設計を使用してopenspecライブラリとAskUserQuestionツールを利用し、シームレスなユーザーインタラクションと変更の選択を実現し、強力なデータ処理のためのJSON出力を含みます。","ko":"구현이 변경 아티팩트와 일치하는지 검증할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하고,规格、任务 및 디자인을 사용하여 openspec 라이브러리와 AskUserQuestion 툴을 활용하여 무결점한 사용자 상호 작용 및 변경 선택을 구현하며, 강력한 데이터 처리를 위한 JSON 출력을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar que la implementación coincide con los artefactos de cambio utilizando especificaciones, tareas y diseño, aprovechando la biblioteca openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para una interacción del usuario sin problemas y una selección de cambios, incluyendo una salida JSON para un manejo de datos robusto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier que l''implémentation correspond aux artefacts de modification en utilisant des spécifications, des tâches et une conception, en exploitant la bibliothèque openspec et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une interaction utilisateur transparente et une sélection de modifications, y compris une sortie JSON pour une gestion de données robuste.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Implementierung mit den Änderungsartefakten unter Verwendung von Spezifikationen, Aufgaben und Design abzugleichen, indem die openspec-Bibliothek und das AskUserQuestion-Tool für eine nahtlose Benutzerinteraktion und Änderungsauswahl genutzt werden, einschließlich JSON-Ausgabe für eine robuste Datenerfassung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar se a implementação corresponde aos artefatos de alteração usando especificações, tarefas e design, aproveitando a biblioteca openspec e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para interação do usuário sem interrupções e seleção de alterações, incluindo saída JSON para manipulação robusta de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить, соответствует ли реализация артефактам изменений, используя спецификации, задачи и дизайн, используя библиотеку openspec и инструмент AskUserQuestion для бесперебойного взаимодействия с пользователем и выбора изменений, включая вывод JSON для надежной обработки данных.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التحقق من是否 تتماشى التنفيذ مع مكونات التغيير باستخدام المواصفات والمهام والتصميم، واستخدام مكتبة openspec وأداة AskUserQuestion للتفاعل السلس مع المستخدم واختيار التغييرات، بما في ذلك الإخراج JSON لمعالجة البيانات القوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying implementation against change specifications","Validating design and task alignment with implementation","Automating change verification for iterative development cycles"],"zh":["验证实现是否与变更规范一致","验证设计和任务是否与实现一致","自动化变更验证用于迭代开发周期"],"ja":["実装が変更仕様と一致することを検証する","設計とタスクが実装と一致することを検証する","反復開発サイクルに使用するための変更検証の自動化"],"ko":["구현이 변경 사양과 일치하는지 검증","디자인과 태스크가 구현과 일치하는지 검증","반복 개발 주기에 사용하기 위한 변경 검증 자동화"],"es":["Verificar la implementación contra las especificaciones de cambio","Validar la alineación del diseño y las tareas con la implementación","Automatizar la verificación de cambios para ciclos de desarrollo iterativos"],"fr":["Vérifier l''implémentation par rapport aux spécifications de modification","Valider l''alignement de la conception et des tâches sur l''implémentation","Automatiser la vérification des modifications pour les cycles de développement itératifs"],"de":["Implementierung gegen Änderungsspezifikationen überprüfen","Übereinstimmung von Design und Aufgaben mit der Implementierung validieren","Änderungsüberprüfung für iterative Entwicklungszyklen automatisieren"],"pt":["Verificar a implementação contra especificações de alterações","Validar a conformidade do design e das tarefas com a implementação","Automatizar a verificação de alterações para ciclos de desenvolvimento iterativos"],"ru":["Проверка реализации против спецификаций изменений","Проверка соответствия дизайна и задач реализации","Автоматизация верификации изменений для итеративных циклов разработки"],"ar":["التحقق من التنفيذ مقابل مواصفات التغييرات","التحقق من مطابقة التصميم والمهام مع التنفيذ","التنفيذ الآلي للتحقق من التغييرات لأدوار التطوير المتكررة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec library installation","Needs access to change artifacts and implementation details","May prompt for user input if change name is ambiguous or omitted"],"zh":["需要安装openspec库","需要访问变更工件和实现细节","如果变更名称模糊或省略，可能会提示用户输入"],"ja":["openspecライブラリのインストールが必要","変更アーティファクトと実装の詳細へのアクセスが必要","変更名が曖昧または省略された場合、ユーザー入力を求めることがある"],"ko":["openspec 라이브러리 설치가 필요","변경 아티팩트 및 구현 세부사항에 대한 액세스가 필요","변경 이름이 모호하거나 생략된 경우 사용자 입력을 요청할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la biblioteca openspec","Necesita acceso a los artefactos de cambio y los detalles de implementación","Puede solicitar la entrada del usuario si el nombre del cambio es ambiguo u omitido"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la bibliothèque openspec","A besoin d''un accès aux artefacts de modification et aux détails d''implémentation","Peut demander une saisie utilisateur si le nom de la modification est ambigu ou omis"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der openspec-Bibliothek","Benötigt Zugriff auf Änderungsartefakte und Implementierungsdetails","Kann Benutzereingabe anfordern, wenn der Änderungsname mehrdeutig oder weggelassen ist"],"pt":["Requer instalação da biblioteca openspec","Necessita acesso a artefatos de alteração e detalhes de implementação","Pode solicitar entrada do usuário se o nome da alteração for ambíguo ou omitido"],"ru":["Требует установки библиотеки openspec","Требует доступа к артефактам изменений и деталям реализации","Может запросить ввод пользователя, если имя изменения неоднозначно или опущено"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبة openspec","يتطلب الوصول إلى مكونات التغيير و细یات التنفيذ","يمكن أن يطلب إدخال المستخدم إذا كان اسم التغيير غامضًا أو محذوفًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/ml_challenges/paypal-integration', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'ml_challenges', 'ollieb89/ml_challenges', 'paypal-integration', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:23.806Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/ml_challenges/paypal-integration","name":"paypal-integration","description":{"zh":"PayPal, Express Checkout, IPN, .","ja":"PayPal, Express Checkout, IPN, .","ko":"PayPal, Express Checkout, IPN, .","es":"La integración de PayPal permite a los desarrolladores ofrecer una experiencia de pago segura y fácil de usar. Aprende a implementarla en tu aplicación.","fr":"L''intégration de PayPal permet aux développeurs d''offrir une expérience de paiement sécurisée et facile à utiliser. Apprenez à l''implémenter dans votre application.","de":"Die PayPal-Integration ermöglicht es Entwicklern, eine sichere und benutzerfreundliche Zahlungserfahrung zu bieten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie in Ihre Anwendung integrieren können.","pt":"A integração do PayPal permite pagamento online seguro e fácil. Aprenda a implementar o checkout expresso e o faturamento recorrente.","ru":"Интеграция с PayPal позволяет обеспечить безопасные и простые онлайн-платежи. Узнайте, как реализовать экспресс-платежи и регулярный счет.","ar":"التكامل مع باي بال يسمح للدفع الآمن والسهل عبر الإنترنت. تعلم كيفية تنفيذ الدفع السريع والفواتير المتكررة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PayPal ","ja":"PayPal","ko":"PayPal ","es":"Integración de PayPal: Guía para Desarrolladores","fr":"Intégration PayPal : Guide pour Développeurs","de":"PayPal-Integration: Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"Integração PayPal: Guia de Pagamento Online","ru":"Интеграция PayPal: Руководство по онлайн-платежам","ar":"تكامل باي بال: دليل للدفع عبر الإنترنت","en":"paypal-integration"},"description":{"zh":"PayPal, Express Checkout, IPN, .","ja":"PayPal, Express Checkout, IPN, .","ko":"PayPal, Express Checkout, IPN, .","es":"La integración de PayPal permite a los desarrolladores ofrecer una experiencia de pago segura y fácil de usar. Aprende a implementarla en tu aplicación.","fr":"L''intégration de PayPal permet aux développeurs d''offrir une expérience de paiement sécurisée et facile à utiliser. Apprenez à l''implémenter dans votre appli...","de":"Die PayPal-Integration ermöglicht es Entwicklern, eine sichere und benutzerfreundliche Zahlungserfahrung zu bieten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie in Ihre Anwendu...","pt":"A integração do PayPal permite pagamento online seguro e fácil. Aprenda a implementar o checkout expresso e o faturamento recorrente.","ru":"Интеграция с PayPal позволяет обеспечить безопасные и простые онлайн-платежи. Узнайте, как реализовать экспресс-платежи и регулярный счет.","ar":"التكامل مع باي بال يسمح للدفع الآمن والسهل عبر الإنترنت. تعلم كيفية تنفيذ الدفع السريع والفواتير المتكررة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["PayPal","Express Checkout","IPN"," ","PayPal"],"ja":["PayPal","Express Checkout","IPN"," ","PayPal"],"ko":["PayPal","Express Checkout","IPN"," ","PayPal"],"es":["Pago express con PayPal Checkout","Implementación de flujos de pago recurrente","Procesamiento de reembolsos y disputas de pago","Manejo de webhooks de PayPal (IPN)","Soporte para pagos internacionales","Implementación de suscripciones de PayPal"],"fr":["Paiement express avec PayPal Checkout","Mise en œuvre de flux de paiement récurrent","Traitement des remboursements et des litiges de paiement","Gestion des webhooks de PayPal (IPN)","Prise en charge des paiements internationaux","Mise en œuvre des abonnements PayPal"],"de":["Express-Zahlung mit PayPal Checkout","Implementierung von wiederkehrenden Zahlungsflüssen","Verarbeitung von Rückerstattungen und Zahlungsstreitigkeiten","Verwaltung von PayPal-Webhooks (IPN)","Unterstützung für internationale Zahlungen","Implementierung von PayPal-Abonnements"],"pt":["Checkout Expresso","Faturamento Recorrente","Processamento de Reembolsos","Suporte a Pagamentos Internacionais","Implementação de Assinaturas","Tratamento de Webhooks (IPN)"],"ru":["Экспресс-платежи","Регулярный счет","Обработка возвратов","Поддержка международных платежей","Реализация подписок","Обработка вебхуков (IPN)"],"ar":["الدفع السريع","الفواتير المتكررة","معالجة الإرجاع","دعم المدفوعات الدولية","تنفيذ الاشتراكات","معالجة الويب هوك (IPN)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PayPal","Express Checkout","IPN"," ","PayPal","API"],"ja":["PayPal","Express Checkout","IPN"," ","PayPal","API"],"ko":["PayPal","Express Checkout","IPN"," ","PayPal","API"],"es":["integración de PayPal","paypal checkout","pago recurrente","reembolsos de paypal","webhooks de paypal","pagos internacionales","suscripciones de paypal","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pagos en línea"],"fr":["intégration de paypal","paypal checkout","paiement récurrent","remboursements paypal","webhooks paypal","paiements internationaux","abonnements paypal","développement d''applications","paiements en ligne"],"de":["paypal-integration","paypal checkout","wiederkehrende zahlung","paypal-rückerstattungen","paypal-webhooks","internationale zahlungen","paypal-abonnements","anwendungsentwicklung","online-zahlungen"],"pt":["integração paypal","pagamento online","checkout expresso","faturamento recorrente","processamento de reembolsos","suporte a pagamentos internacionais","assinaturas paypal","webhooks ipn"],"ru":["интеграция paypal","онлайн-платежи","экспресс-платежи","регулярный счет","обработка возвратов","поддержка международных платежей","подписки paypal","вебхуки ipn"],"ar":["تكامل باي بال","دفع عبر الإنترنت","الدفع السريع","الفواتير المتكررة","معالجة الإرجاع","دعم المدفوعات الدولية","الاشتراكات باي بال","الويب هوك ipn"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paypal-integration","description":"Integrate PayPal payment processing with support for express checkout, subscriptions, and refund management. Use when implementing PayPal payments, processing online transactions, or building e-commerce checkout flows.","bodyPreview":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Integrating PayPal as a payment option\n- Implementing express checkout flows\n- Setting up recurring billing with PayPal\n- Processing refunds and payment disputes\n- Handling PayPal webhooks (IPN)\n- Supporting international payments\n- Implementing PayPal subscriptions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Products\n**PayPal Checkout**\n-","body":"# PayPal Integration\n\nMaster PayPal payment integration including Express Checkout, IPN handling, recurring billing, and refund workflows.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Integrating PayPal as a payment option\n- Implementing express checkout flows\n- Setting up recurring billing with PayPal\n- Processing refunds and payment disputes\n- Handling PayPal webhooks (IPN)\n- Supporting international payments\n- Implementing PayPal subscriptions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Payment Products\n**PayPal Checkout**\n- One-time payments\n- Express checkout experience\n- Guest and PayPal account payments\n\n**PayPal Subscriptions**\n- Recurring billing\n- Subscription plans\n- Automatic renewals\n\n**PayPal Payouts**\n- Send money to multiple recipients\n- Marketplace and platform payments\n\n### 2. Integration Methods\n**Client-Side (JavaScript SDK)**\n- Smart Payment Buttons\n- Hosted payment flow\n- Minimal backend code\n\n**Server-Side (REST API)**\n- Full control over payment flow\n- Custom checkout UI\n- Advanced features\n\n### 3. IPN (Instant Payment Notification)\n- Webhook-like payment notifications\n- Asynchronous payment updates\n- Verification required\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend - PayPal Smart Buttons\n<div id=\"paypal-button-container\"></div>\n\n<script src=\"https://www.paypal.com/sdk/js?client-id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&currency=USD\"></script>\n<script>\n  paypal.Buttons({\n    createOrder: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.create({\n        purchase_units: [{\n          amount: {\n            value: ''25.00''\n          }\n        }]\n      });\n    },\n    onApprove: function(data, actions) {\n      return actions.order.capture().then(function(details) {\n        // Payment successful\n        console.log(''Transaction completed by '' + details.payer.name.given_name);\n\n        // Send to backend for verification\n        fetch(''/api/paypal/capture'', {\n          method: ''POST'',\n          headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n          body: JSON.stringify({orderID: data.orderID})\n        });\n      });\n    }\n  }).render(''#paypal-button-container'');\n</script>\n```\n\n```python\n# Backend - Verify and capture order\nfrom paypalrestsdk import Payment\nimport paypalrestsdk\n\npaypalrestsdk.configure({\n    \"mode\": \"sandbox\",  # or \"live\"\n    \"client_id\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_ID\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET\"\n})\n\ndef capture_paypal_order(order_id):\n    \"\"\"Capture a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n    payment = Payment.find(order_id)\n\n    if payment.execute({\"payer_id\": payment.payer.payer_info.payer_id}):\n        # Payment successful\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''success'',\n            ''transaction_id'': payment.id,\n            ''amount'': payment.transactions[0].amount.total\n        }\n    else:\n        # Payment failed\n        return {\n            ''status'': ''failed'',\n            ''error'': payment.error\n        }\n```\n\n## Express Checkout Implementation\n\n### Server-Side Order Creation\n```python\nimport requests\nimport json\n\nclass PayPalClient:\n    def __init__(self, client_id, client_secret, mode=''sandbox''):\n        self.client_id = client_id\n        self.client_secret = client_secret\n        self.base_url = ''https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com'' if mode == ''sandbox'' else ''https://api-m.paypal.com''\n        self.access_token = self.get_access_token()\n\n    def get_access_token(self):\n        \"\"\"Get OAuth access token.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v1/oauth2/token\"\n        headers = {\"Accept\": \"application/json\", \"Accept-Language\": \"en_US\"}\n\n        response = requests.post(\n            url,\n            headers=headers,\n            data={\"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\"},\n            auth=(self.client_id, self.client_secret)\n        )\n\n        return response.json()[''access_token'']\n\n    def create_order(self, amount, currency=''USD''):\n        \"\"\"Create a PayPal order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        payload = {\n            \"intent\": \"CAPTURE\",\n            \"purchase_units\": [{\n                \"amount\": {\n                    \"currency_code\": currency,\n                    \"value\": str(amount)\n                }\n            }]\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def capture_order(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Capture payment for an order.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}/capture\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.post(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n\n    def get_order_details(self, order_id):\n        \"\"\"Get order details.\"\"\"\n        url = f\"{self.base_url}/v2/checkout/orders/{order_id}\"\n        headers = {\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {self.access_token}\"\n        }\n\n        response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n        return response.json()\n```\n\n## IPN (Instant Payment Notification) Handling\n\n### IPN Verification and Processing\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask, request\nimport requests\nfrom urllib.parse import parse_qs\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\n\n@app.route(''/ipn'', methods=[''POST''])\ndef handle_ipn():\n    \"\"\"Handle PayPal IPN notifications.\"\"\"\n    # Get IPN message\n    ipn_data = request.form.to_dict()\n\n    # Verify IPN with PayPal\n    if not verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n        return ''IPN verification failed'', 400\n\n    # Process IPN based on transaction type\n    payment_status = ipn_data.get(''payment_status'')\n    txn_type = ipn_data.get(''txn_type'')\n\n    if payment_status == ''Completed'':\n        handle_payment_completed(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Refunded'':\n        handle_refund(ipn_data)\n    elif payment_status == ''Reversed'':\n        handle_chargeback(ipn_data)\n\n    return ''IPN processed'', 200\n\ndef verify_ipn(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Verify IPN message authenticity.\"\"\"\n    # Add ''cmd'' parameter\n    verify_data = ipn_data.copy()\n    verify_data[''cmd''] = ''_notify-validate''\n\n    # Send back to PayPal for verification\n    paypal_url = ''https://ipnpb.sandbox.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr''  # or production URL\n\n    response = requests.post(paypal_url, data=verify_data)\n\n    return response.text == ''VERIFIED''\n\ndef handle_payment_completed(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Process completed payment.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    payer_email = ipn_data.get(''payer_email'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n    item_name = ipn_data.get(''item_name'')\n\n    # Check if already processed (prevent duplicates)\n    if is_transaction_processed(txn_id):\n        return\n\n    # Update database\n    # Send confirmation email\n    # Fulfill order\n    print(f\"Payment completed: {txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_refund(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle refund.\"\"\"\n    parent_txn_id = ipn_data.get(''parent_txn_id'')\n    mc_gross = ipn_data.get(''mc_gross'')\n\n    # Process refund in your system\n    print(f\"Refund processed: {parent_txn_id}, Amount: ${mc_gross}\")\n\ndef handle_chargeback(ipn_data):\n    \"\"\"Handle payment reversal/chargeback.\"\"\"\n    txn_id = ipn_data.get(''txn_id'')\n    reason_code = ipn_data.get(''reason_code'')\n\n    # Handle chargeback\n    print(f\"Chargeback: {txn_id}, Reason: {reason_code}\")\n```\n\n## Subscription/Recurring Billing\n\n### Create Subscription Plan\n```python\ndef create_subscription_plan(name, amount, interval=''MONTH''):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription plan.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/plans\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"product_id\": \"PRODUCT_ID\",  # Create product first\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"billing_cycles\": [{\n            \"frequency\": {\n                \"interval_unit\": interval,\n                \"interval_count\": 1\n            },\n            \"tenure_type\": \"REGULAR\",\n            \"sequence\": 1,\n            \"total_cycles\": 0,  # Infinite\n            \"pricing_scheme\": {\n                \"fixed_price\": {\n                    \"value\": str(amount),\n                    \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n                }\n            }\n        }],\n        \"payment_preferences\": {\n            \"auto_bill_outstanding\": True,\n            \"setup_fee\": {\n                \"value\": \"0\",\n                \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n            },\n            \"setup_fee_failure_action\": \"CONTINUE\",\n            \"payment_failure_threshold\": 3\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef create_subscription(plan_id, subscriber_email):\n    \"\"\"Create a subscription for a customer.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v1/billing/subscriptions\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {\n        \"plan_id\": plan_id,\n        \"subscriber\": {\n            \"email_address\": subscriber_email\n        },\n        \"application_context\": {\n            \"return_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/success\",\n            \"cancel_url\": \"https://yourdomain.com/subscription/cancel\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    subscription = response.json()\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    for link in subscription.get(''links'', []):\n        if link[''rel''] == ''approve'':\n            return {\n                ''subscription_id'': subscription[''id''],\n                ''approval_url'': link[''href'']\n            }\n```\n\n## Refund Workflows\n\n```python\ndef create_refund(capture_id, amount=None, note=None):\n    \"\"\"Create a refund for a captured payment.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/captures/{capture_id}/refund\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    payload = {}\n    if amount:\n        payload[\"amount\"] = {\n            \"value\": str(amount),\n            \"currency_code\": \"USD\"\n        }\n\n    if note:\n        payload[\"note_to_payer\"] = note\n\n    response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload)\n    return response.json()\n\ndef get_refund_details(refund_id):\n    \"\"\"Get refund details.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_SECRET)\n\n    url = f\"{client.base_url}/v2/payments/refunds/{refund_id}\"\n    headers = {\n        \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {client.access_token}\"\n    }\n\n    response = requests.get(url, headers=headers)\n    return response.json()\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```python\nclass PayPalError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"Custom PayPal error.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\ndef handle_paypal_api_call(api_function):\n    \"\"\"Wrapper for PayPal API calls with error handling.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = api_function()\n        return result\n    except requests.exceptions.RequestException as e:\n        # Network error\n        raise PayPalError(f\"Network error: {str(e)}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        # Other errors\n        raise PayPalError(f\"PayPal API error: {str(e)}\")\n\n# Usage\ntry:\n    order = handle_paypal_api_call(lambda: client.create_order(25.00))\nexcept PayPalError as e:\n    # Handle error appropriately\n    log_error(e)\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```python\n# Use sandbox credentials\nSANDBOX_CLIENT_ID = \"...\"\nSANDBOX_SECRET = \"...\"\n\n# Test accounts\n# Create test buyer and seller accounts at developer.paypal.com\n\ndef test_payment_flow():\n    \"\"\"Test complete payment flow.\"\"\"\n    client = PayPalClient(SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID, SANDBOX_SECRET, mode=''sandbox'')\n\n    # Create order\n    order = client.create_order(10.00)\n    assert ''id'' in order\n\n    # Get approval URL\n    approval_url = next((link[''href''] for link in order[''links''] if link[''rel''] == ''approve''), None)\n    assert approval_url is not None\n\n    # After approval (manual step with test account)\n    # Capture order\n    # captured = client.capture_order(order[''id''])\n    # assert captured[''status''] == ''COMPLETED''\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/express-checkout.md**: Express Checkout implementation guide\n- **references/ipn-handling.md**: IPN verification and processing\n- **references/refund-workflows.md**: Refund handling patterns\n- **references/billing-agreements.md**: Recurring billing setup\n- **assets/paypal-client.py**: Production PayPal client\n- **assets/ipn-processor.py**: IPN webhook processor\n- **assets/recurring-billing.py**: Subscription management\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Verify IPN**: Never trust IPN without verification\n2. **Idempotent Processing**: Handle duplicate IPN notifications\n3. **Error Handling**: Implement robust error handling\n4. **Logging**: Log all transactions and errors\n5. **Test Thoroughly**: Use sandbox extensively\n6. **Webhook Backup**: Don''t rely solely on client-side callbacks\n7. **Currency Handling**: Always specify currency explicitly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Not Verifying IPN**: Accepting IPN without verification\n- **Duplicate Processing**: Not checking for duplicate transactions\n- **Wrong Environment**: Mixing sandbox and production URLs/credentials\n- **Missing Webhooks**: Not handling all payment states\n- **Hardcoded Values**: Not making configurable for different environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:23.806Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing seamless PayPal payment integration and Express Checkout capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝PayPal支付集成和Express Checkout功能的电子商务代理。","ja":"PayPalの決済のシームレスな統合とExpress Checkoutの機能を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適です。","ko":"무제한 PayPal 결제 통합 및 Express Checkout 기능이 필요한 전자상거래 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan una integración de pago de PayPal sin problemas y capacidades de pago Express.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une intégration de paiement PayPal transparente et de capacités de paiement Express.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine nahtlose PayPal-Zahlungsintegration und Express-Checkout-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que necessitam de integração de pagamento do PayPal sem interrupções e capacidades de Checkout Expresso.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с системой оплаты PayPal и возможности быстрого оформления заказа.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التجاريين الإلكترونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج دفع PayPal دون انقطاع وقدرات الدفع السريع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle recurring billing, refund workflows, and IPN handling using PayPal''s API, enabling support for international payments and subscriptions with protocols like IPN and Express Checkout.","zh":"赋予代理商使用PayPal的API处理循环计费、退款工作流和IPN处理的能力，支持国际支付和订阅，包括IPN和Express Checkout等协议。","ja":"PayPalのAPIを使用して、エージェントがリサイクル請求、返金ワークフロー、IPNハンドリングを行えるようにし、IPNやExpress Checkoutなどのプロトコルを使用した国際支払いやサブスクリプションをサポートします。","ko":"PayPal API를 사용하여 에이전트가 반복적인 청구, 환불 워크플ロー 및 IPN 처리를 수행할 수 있도록 하여 IPN 및 Express Checkout과 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 국제 결제 및 구독을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar facturas recurrentes, flujos de trabajo de reembolsos y manejo de IPN utilizando la API de PayPal, lo que permite el soporte para pagos y suscripciones internacionales con protocolos como IPN y Express Checkout.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les factures récurrentes, les flux de travail de remboursement et la gestion IPN à l''aide de l''API PayPal, permettant ainsi le support des paiements et des abonnements internationaux avec des protocoles tels que IPN et Express Checkout.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, wiederkehrende Abrechnungen, Erstattungsworkflows und IPN-Verarbeitung mithilfe der PayPal-API zu verwalten, wodurch die Unterstützung für internationale Zahlungen und Abonnements mit Protokollen wie IPN und Express Checkout ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com faturação recorrente, fluxos de trabalho de reembolso e manipulação de IPN usando a API do PayPal, permitindo o suporte a pagamentos internacionais e assinaturas com protocolos como IPN e Checkout Expresso.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обрабатывать регулярный счет, рабочие процессы возврата и обработку IPN с помощью API PayPal, обеспечивая поддержку международных платежей и подписок с использованием протоколов, таких как IPN и быстрое оформление заказа.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من التعامل مع الفواتير المتكررة وعمليات سير العمل لاسترداد الأموال ومعالجة IPN باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات PayPal، مما يسمح بدعم المدفوعات الدولية والاشتراكات ببروتوكولات مثل IPN والدفع السريع."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Express Checkout flows for streamlined payments","Automating recurring billing and subscription management with PayPal","Processing refunds and payment disputes through IPN handling"],"zh":["为流畅的支付实现Express Checkout流程","使用PayPal自动执行循环计费和订阅管理","通过IPN处理进行退款和支付纠纷处理"],"ja":["スムーズな決済のためにExpress Checkoutフローを実装する","PayPalを使用してリサイクル請求とサブスクリプション管理を自動化する","IPNハンドリングを通じて返金と決済紛争を処理する"],"ko":["스무스한 결제를 위한 Express Checkout 흐름 구현","PayPal을 사용한 반복적인 청구 및 구독 관리 자동화","IPN 처리를 통해 환불 및 결제 분쟁 처리"],"es":["Implementar flujos de pago Express para pagos simplificados","Automatizar la gestión de facturas recurrentes y suscripciones con PayPal","Procesar reembolsos y disputas de pago a través del manejo de IPN"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des flux de paiement Express pour des paiements simplifiés","Automatiser la gestion des factures récurrentes et des abonnements avec PayPal","Traiter les remboursements et les litiges de paiement via la gestion IPN"],"de":["Implementieren von Express-Checkout-Flows für vereinfachte Zahlungen","Automatisieren der Verwaltung von wiederkehrenden Abrechnungen und Abonnements mit PayPal","Verarbeiten von Erstattungen und Zahlungsstreitigkeiten über die IPN-Verarbeitung"],"pt":["Implementar fluxos de Checkout Expresso para pagamentos otimizados","Automatizar a gestão de faturação recorrente e assinatura com o PayPal","Processar reembolsos e disputas de pagamento por meio da manipulação de IPN"],"ru":["Реализация потоков быстрого оформления заказа для оптимизированных платежей","Автоматизация управления регулярным счетом и подпиской с помощью PayPal","Обработка возвратов и споров по платежам с помощью обработки IPN"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات الدفع السريع للمدفوعات المُستَخدَمة","توسيط إدارة الفواتير المتكررة والإشتراك باستخدام paypal","معالجة استرداد الأموال ونزاعات الدفع من خلال معالجة IPN"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a PayPal Business account","Needs setup for IPN and Express Checkout","Limited to PayPal payment services"],"zh":["需要PayPal商业账户","需要设置IPN和Express Checkout","仅限PayPal支付服务"],"ja":["PayPalビジネスアカウントが必要","IPNとExpress Checkoutの設定が必要","PayPal決済サービスのみに限定される"],"ko":["PayPal 비즈니스 계정이 필요합니다.","IPN 및 Express Checkout 설정이 필요합니다.","PayPal 결제 서비스만으로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de negocio de PayPal","Necesita configuración para IPN y Express Checkout","Limitado a los servicios de pago de PayPal"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte professionnel PayPal","Nécessite une configuration pour IPN et Express Checkout","Limité aux services de paiement PayPal"],"de":["Benötigt ein PayPal-Geschäftskonto","Benötigt eine Einrichtung für IPN und Express Checkout","Begrenzt auf PayPal-Zahlungsdienste"],"pt":["Exige uma conta de negócios do PayPal","Necessita de configuração para IPN e Checkout Expresso","Limitado aos serviços de pagamento do PayPal"],"ru":["Требует бизнес-аккаунта PayPal","Требует настройки для IPN и быстрого оформления заказа","Ограничен только сервисами оплаты PayPal"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب تجاري من paypal","يحتاج إلى إعداد ل IPN و الدفع السريع","محدود بخدمات دفع paypal فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('uxname/litefront/openspec-ff-change', 'community', 'uxname', 'litefront', 'uxname/litefront', 'openspec-ff-change', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:53.271Z', NULL, '{"id":"uxname/litefront/openspec-ff-change","name":"openspec-ff-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change是一个使用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法论的Vite + GraphQL + Typescript前端模板","ja":"openspec-ff-changeは、Feature-Sliced Designをプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法論として使用するVite + GraphQL + Typescriptフロントエンドボイラープレートです","ko":"openspec-ff-change는 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법론으로 Feature-Sliced Design를 사용하는 Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러플레이트입니다","es":"La plantilla de frontend openspec-ff-change utiliza Vite, GraphQL y Typescript con Feature-Sliced Design para una arquitectura de proyecto eficiente","fr":"Le modèle de frontend openspec-ff-change utilise Vite, GraphQL et Typescript avec Feature-Sliced Design pour une architecture de projet efficace","de":"Das Frontend-Boilerplate openspec-ff-change verwendet Vite, GraphQL und Typescript mit Feature-Sliced Design für eine effiziente Projektarchitektur","pt":"O openspec-ff-change é um boilerplate frontend que combina Vite, GraphQL e Typescript com a metodologia de arquitetura de projeto Feature-Sliced Design","ru":"Openspec-ff-change - это шаблон фронтенда, который объединяет Vite, GraphQL и Typescript с методологией проектирования Feature-Sliced Design","ar":"openspec-ff-change هو قالب frontend يجمع بين Vite و GraphQL و Typescript مع منهجية تصميم Feature-Sliced Design","en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 前端模板","ja":"openspec-ff-change：Vite + GraphQL + Typescript フロントエンドボイラ...","ko":"openspec-ff-change: Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러...","es":"Plantilla de frontend con Vite y GraphQL","fr":"Modèle de frontend avec Vite et GraphQL","de":"Frontend-Boilerplate mit Vite und GraphQL","pt":"Boilerplate Vite + GraphQL + Typescript com Feature-Slice...","ru":"Шаблон Vite + GraphQL + Typescript с Feature-Sliced Design","ar":"قالب Vite + GraphQL + Typescript مع Feature-Sliced Design","en":"openspec-ff-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change是一个使用Feature-Sliced Design作为项目架构方法论的Vite + GraphQL + Typescript前端模板","ja":"openspec-ff-changeは、Feature-Sliced Designをプロジェクトアーキテクチャ方法論として使用するVite + GraphQL + Typescriptフロントエンドボイラープレートです","ko":"openspec-ff-change는 프로젝트 아키텍처 방법론으로 Feature-Sliced Design를 사용하는 Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프론트엔드 보일러플레이트입니다","es":"La plantilla de frontend openspec-ff-change utiliza Vite, GraphQL y Typescript con Feature-Sliced Design para una arquitectura de proyecto eficiente","fr":"Le modèle de frontend openspec-ff-change utilise Vite, GraphQL et Typescript avec Feature-Sliced Design pour une architecture de projet efficace","de":"Das Frontend-Boilerplate openspec-ff-change verwendet Vite, GraphQL und Typescript mit Feature-Sliced Design für eine effiziente Projektarchitektur","pt":"O openspec-ff-change é um boilerplate frontend que combina Vite, GraphQL e Typescript com a metodologia de arquitetura de projeto Feature-Sliced Design","ru":"Openspec-ff-change - это шаблон фронтенда, который объединяет Vite, GraphQL и Typescript с методологией проектирования Feature-Sliced Design","ar":"openspec-ff-change هو قالب frontend يجمع بين Vite و GraphQL و Typescript مع منهجية تصميم Feature-Sliced Design","en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"definition":{"en":"A Vite + GraphQL + Typescript frontend boilerplate using Feature-Sliced Design as project architecture methodology"},"features":{"zh":["Vite支持","GraphQL集成","Typescript类型安全","Feature-Sliced Design架构","快速构建项目"],"ja":["Viteサポート","GraphQL統合","Typescriptタイプセーフティ","Feature-Sliced Designアーキテクチャ","プロジェクトの迅速な構築"],"ko":["Vite 지원","GraphQL 통합","Typescript 타입 안전","Feature-Sliced Design 아키텍처","프로젝트 빠른 구축"],"es":["Plantilla de frontend con Vite","Integración con GraphQL","Uso de Typescript","Arquitectura de proyecto con Feature-Sliced Design","Generación rápida de artefactos","Diseño de proyecto eficiente"],"fr":["Modèle de frontend avec Vite","Intégration avec GraphQL","Utilisation de Typescript","Architecture de projet avec Feature-Sliced Design","Génération rapide d''artefacts","Conception de projet efficace"],"de":["Frontend-Boilerplate mit Vite","Integration mit GraphQL","Verwendung von Typescript","Projektarchitektur mit Feature-Sliced Design","Schnelle Generierung von Artefakten","Effiziente Projektgestaltung"],"pt":["Boilerplate Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Metodologia de arquitetura de projeto Feature-Sliced Design","Geração rápida de artefatos","Suporte a Typescript","Integração com GraphQL"],"ru":["Шаблон Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","Методология проектирования Feature-Sliced Design","Быстрая генерация артефактов","Поддержка Typescript","Интеграция с GraphQL"],"ar":["قالب Vite + GraphQL + Typescript","منهجية تصميم Feature-Sliced Design","إنشاء سريع للنماذج","دعم Typescript","التكامل مع GraphQL"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","前端开发","快速构建","项目模板"],"ja":["Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","フロントエンド開発","迅速な構築","プロジェクトテンプレート"],"ko":["Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","프론트엔드 개발","빠른 구축","프로젝트 템플릿"],"es":["plantilla de frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","arquitectura de proyecto","desarrollo de frontend","herramientas de desarrollo","eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["modèle de frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","architecture de projet","développement de frontend","outils de développement","efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["Frontend-Boilerplate","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","Projektarchitektur","Frontend-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Effizienz in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["boilerplate frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","desenvolvimento frontend","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["шаблон фронтенда","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","разработка фронтенда","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["قالب frontend","Vite","GraphQL","Typescript","Feature-Sliced Design","تطوير frontend","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"litefront","repoPath":"uxname/litefront","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:53.271Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring rapid Vite + GraphQL + Typescript project setup and Feature-Sliced Design implementation.","zh":"适用于需要快速设置 Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 项目并实现 Feature-Sliced Design 的前端代理。","ja":"Vite + GraphQL + Typescript プロジェクトを迅速にセットアップし、Feature-Sliced Design を実装する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Vite + GraphQL + Typescript 프로젝트를 빠르게 설정하고 Feature-Sliced Design을 구현해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren una configuración rápida de proyectos Vite + GraphQL + Typescript y una implementación de diseño Feature-Sliced.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une configuration rapide de projets Vite + GraphQL + Typescript et une mise en œuvre de la conception Feature-Sliced.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine schnelle Einrichtung von Vite- + GraphQL- + Typescript-Projekten und eine Implementierung des Feature-Sliced-Designs erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que requerem configuração rápida de projetos Vite + GraphQL + Typescript e implementação de Design Dividido em Recursos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Фронтенд-агентов, требующих быстрой настройки проектов Vite + GraphQL + Typescript и реализации методологии дизайна, разбитого на функции.","ar":"مثالي لويب فرنت-أجنتس الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد سريع لمشاريع Vite + GraphQL + Typescript وتنفيذ تصميم مقطع الميزات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate entire project architectures in one go, utilizing Vite, GraphQL, and Typescript, while applying Feature-Sliced Design methodology for streamlined development, and handling user input through the AskUserQuestion tool for deriving kebab-case change names from descriptions.","zh":"能够让代理生成整个项目架构，同时利用 Vite、GraphQL 和 Typescript，并应用 Feature-Sliced Design 方法论以实现流畅的开发，并通过 AskUserQuestion 工具处理用户输入以从描述中推导出 kebab-case 更改名称。","ja":"Vite、GraphQL、Typescript を利用し、Feature-Sliced Design 方法論を適用してスムーズな開発を行い、AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザー入力から kebab-case の変更名を導出することで、エージェントが 1 回で全プロジェクト アーキテクチャを生成できるようにします。","ko":"Vite, GraphQL, Typescript를 활용하여 전체 프로젝트 아키텍처를 한 번에 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Feature-Sliced Design 방법론을 적용하여 개발을 간소화하고, AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자 입력으로부터 kebab-case 변경 이름을 도출하여 프로젝트 설정을 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar arquitecturas de proyecto completas de un solo golpe, utilizando Vite, GraphQL y Typescript, mientras se aplica la metodología de diseño Feature-Sliced para un desarrollo optimizado, y maneja la entrada del usuario a través de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para derivar nombres de cambios en kebab-case a partir de descripciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des architectures de projet complètes en une seule étape, en utilisant Vite, GraphQL et Typescript, tout en appliquant la méthodologie de conception Feature-Sliced pour un développement optimisé, et en gérant les entrées utilisateur via l''outil AskUserQuestion pour dériver des noms de changements en kebab-case à partir de descriptions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplette Projekarchitekturen in einem Schritt zu generieren, indem Vite, GraphQL und Typescript verwendet werden, während die Methodik des Feature-Sliced-Designs für ein optimiertes Entwicklung angewendet wird, und die Benutzereingabe über das Tool AskUserQuestion zur Ableitung von Änderungsnamen im Kebab-Format aus Beschreibungen handhabt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquiteturas de projetos inteiras de uma vez, utilizando Vite, GraphQL e Typescript, aplicando a metodologia de Design Dividido em Recursos para desenvolvimento otimizado, e lidando com a entrada do usuário por meio da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para derivar nomes de alterações em kebab-case a partir de descrições.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать всю архитектуру проекта за один раз, используя Vite, GraphQL и Typescript, применяя методологию дизайна, разбитого на функции, для оптимизированного развития, и обрабатывая пользовательский ввод через инструмент AskUserQuestion для получения имен изменений в kebab-case из описаний.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من توليد هياكل مشاريع كاملة في المرة الواحدة، باستخدام Vite و GraphQL و Typescript، وتنفيذ منهجية تصميم مقطع الميزات من أجل التطوير المتدفق، وتحديد مدخلات المستخدم من خلال أداة AskUserQuestion لاستخلاص أسماء التغييرات في صيغة kebab-case من الوصف."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend boilerplate creation with Vite and GraphQL","Generating project architectures using Feature-Sliced Design principles","Deriving kebab-case change names from user descriptions for streamlined project setup"],"zh":["使用 Vite 和 GraphQL 自动创建前端样板","使用 Feature-Sliced Design 原则生成项目架构","从用户描述中推导出 kebab-case 更改名称以实现流畅的项目设置"],"ja":["Vite と GraphQL を使用してフロントエンドのボイラープレートを自動生成する","Feature-Sliced Design の原則を使用してプロジェクト アーキテクチャを生成する","ユーザーからの説明から kebab-case の変更名を導出してプロジェクト設定をスムーズにする"],"ko":["Vite와 GraphQL을 사용하여 프론트엔드 보일러플레이트를 자동 생성하는 것","Feature-Sliced Design 원칙을 사용하여 프로젝트 아키텍처를 생성하는 것","사용자 설명에서 kebab-case 변경 이름을 유추하여 프로젝트 설정을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de plantillas frontend con Vite y GraphQL","Generación de arquitecturas de proyecto utilizando principios de diseño Feature-Sliced","Derivación de nombres de cambios en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuario para una configuración de proyecto optimizada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de modèles de frontend avec Vite et GraphQL","Génération d''architectures de projet en utilisant les principes de conception Feature-Sliced","Déduction de noms de changements en kebab-case à partir de descriptions utilisateur pour une configuration de projet optimisée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Frontend-Boilerplates mit Vite und GraphQL","Generierung von Projekarchitekturen unter Verwendung von Feature-Sliced-Design-Prinzipien","Ableitung von Änderungsnamen im Kebab-Format aus Benutzerbeschreibungen für eine optimierte Projektkonfiguration"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de código de inicialização do frontend com Vite e GraphQL","Gerar arquiteturas de projetos usando princípios de Design Dividido em Recursos","Derivar nomes de alterações em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário para configuração de projeto otimizada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание кода инициализации фронтенда с помощью Vite и GraphQL","Генерировать архитектуру проекта, используя принципы дизайна, разбитого на функции","Получать имена изменений в kebab-case из описаний пользователя для оптимизированной настройки проекта"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء رمز التمهيد الأمامي مع Vite و GraphQL","توليد هياكل المشاريع باستخدام مبادئ تصميم مقطع الميزات","استخلاص أسماء التغييرات في صيغة kebab-case من وصفات المستخدم من أجل إعداد مشروع متدفق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for change name or description","Dependent on AskUserQuestion tool for user interaction"],"zh":["需要用户输入更改名称或描述","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户交互"],"ja":["変更名または説明のユーザー入力が必要","ユーザーとのやり取りに AskUserQuestion ツールに依存する"],"ko":["변경 이름 또는 설명에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요함","사용자 상호작용에 AskUserQuestion 도구에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere entrada del usuario para el nombre o la descripción del cambio","Dependiente de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la interacción del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour le nom ou la description du changement","Dépend de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour l''interaction utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingabe für den Namen oder die Beschreibung der Änderung","Abhängig von dem Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerinteraktion"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para o nome ou descrição da alteração","Depende da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para interação do usuário"],"ru":["Требуется ввод пользователя для имени или описания изменения","Зависит от инструмента AskUserQuestion для взаимодействия с пользователем"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لاسم أو وصف التغيير","يعتمد على أداة AskUserQuestion للتفاعل مع المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
