:"tailwindcss"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS v4 是一个强大的 CSS 框架，提供了 utility-first、mobile-first 和组件提取等功能","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4 は強力な CSS フレームワークであり、Utility-First、Mobile-First、コンポーネント抽出などの機能を提供します","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4는 강력한 CSS 프레임워크로, Utility-First, Mobile-First, 컴포넌트 추출 등의 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Tailwind CSS v4 es un conjunto de herramientas de CSS que permite a los desarrolladores crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS v4 est un ensemble d''outils de CSS qui permet aux développeurs de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS v4 ist ein Satz von CSS-Tools, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O Tailwind CSS v4 é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento web que fornece classes de utilidade para criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas","ru":"Tailwind CSS v4 - это инструмент для веб-разработки, который предоставляет утилитарные классы для создания индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","ar":"Tailwind CSS v4 هو أداة تطوير الويب التي توفر فصولًا من المرافق لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم المخصصة","en":"款专为 Windsurf AI 开发环境打造的智能数据管理工具，提供 **AI 对话暂停反馈**、**智能存储清理** 和 **全面数据分析** 功能"},"definition":{"en":"款专为 Windsurf AI 开发环境打造的智能数据管理工具，提供 **AI 对话暂停反馈**、**智能存储清理** 和 **全面数据分析** 功能"},"features":{"zh":["Utility-First 配置方式","Mobile-First 设计","组件提取","响应式设计","CSS-first 配置方式"],"ja":["Utility-First 設定方式","Mobile-First デザイン","コンポーネント抽出","レスポンシブデザイン","CSS-first 設定方式"],"ko":["Utility-First 구성 방식","Mobile-First 디자인","컴포넌트 추출","반응형 디자인","CSS-first 구성 방식"],"es":["Enfoque de configuración basada en CSS","Diseño para móviles con modificadores responsivos","Extracción de componentes para patrones repetidos","Compatibilidad con versiones anteriores mediante tailwind.config.js"],"fr":["Approche de configuration basée sur le CSS","Conception pour les appareils mobiles avec des modificateurs responsifs","Extraction de composants pour les modèles répétitifs","Compatibilité avec les versions antérieures via tailwind.config.js"],"de":["CSS-basierte Konfigurationsansatz","Mobile-First-Design mit responsiven Modifikatoren","Komponentenextraktion für wiederkehrende Muster","Abwärtskompatibilität durch tailwind.config.js"],"pt":["Classes de utilidade para criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Abordagem de configuração CSS-first","Compatibilidade com v3 via tailwind.config.js","Desenvolvimento móvel primeiro com modificadores responsivos","Extração de componentes para padrões repetidos"],"ru":["Утилитарные классы для создания индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Подход к конфигурации CSS-first","Совместимость с v3 через tailwind.config.js","Разработка для мобильных устройств с modificadores responsivos","Извлечение компонентов для повторяющихся шаблонов"],"ar":["فصول المرافق لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم المخصصة","منهجية تكوين CSS-first","التوافق مع الإصدار 3 عبر tailwind.config.js","التطوير الموجه للهواتف المحمولة مع modificadores responsivos","استخراج المكونات للأنماط المتكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","CSS 框架","Utility-First","Mobile-First","组件提取","响应式设计","CSS-first"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","CSS フレームワーク","Utility-First","Mobile-First","コンポーネント抽出","レスポンシブデザイン","CSS-first"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","CSS 프레임워크","Utility-First","Mobile-First","컴포넌트 추출","반응형 디자인","CSS-first"],"es":["Tailwind CSS v4","desarrollo web","CSS","framework de CSS","diseño responsivo","compatibilidad con versiones anteriores"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS v4","développement web","CSS","framework de CSS","conception responsive","compatibilité avec les versions antérieures"],"de":["Tailwind CSS v4","Webentwicklung","CSS","CSS-Framework","responsive Design","Abwärtskompatibilität"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS v4","Desenvolvimento web","Classes de utilidade","CSS-first","Mobile-first","Componentes reutilizáveis","Tailwind config","CSS utility-first"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS v4","Веб-разработка","Утилитарные классы","CSS-first","Мобильная разработка","Компоненты с повторным использованием","Конфигурация Tailwind","CSS utility-first"],"ar":["Tailwind CSS v4","تطوير الويب","فصول المرافق","CSS-first","تطوير موجه للهواتف المحمولة","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تكوين Tailwind","CSS utility-first"]}},"owner":"congwa","repo":"wdm","repoPath":"congwa/wdm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss","description":"Tailwind CSS v4 utility-first styling patterns including responsive design, dark mode, and custom configuration. Use when styling with Tailwind, adding utility classes, configuring Tailwind, setting up dark mode, or customizing the theme.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS v4 Development Guidelines\n\nBest practices for using Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes effectively.\n\n**Note**: Tailwind CSS v4 (released January 2025) uses a CSS-first configuration approach. If you need v3 compatibility, tailwind.config.js is still supported.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Utility-First**: Use utility classes instead of custom CSS\n2. **Mobile-First**: Design for mobile, then scale up with responsive modifiers\n3. **Component Extraction**: Extract repeated patterns into co","body":"# Tailwind CSS v4 Development Guidelines\n\nBest practices for using Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes effectively.\n\n**Note**: Tailwind CSS v4 (released January 2025) uses a CSS-first configuration approach. If you need v3 compatibility, tailwind.config.js is still supported.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Utility-First**: Use utility classes instead of custom CSS\n2. **Mobile-First**: Design for mobile, then scale up with responsive modifiers\n3. **Component Extraction**: Extract repeated patterns into components\n4. **Consistent Spacing**: Use Tailwind''s spacing scale\n5. **Custom Configuration**: Extend the default theme for brand consistency\n\n## Basic Utilities\n\n### Layout\n\n```tsx\n// Flexbox\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n  <div className=\"flex-1\">Content</div>\n  <div className=\"flex-shrink-0\">Sidebar</div>\n</div>\n\n// Grid\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n  <div>1</div>\n  <div>2</div>\n  <div>3</div>\n</div>\n\n// Positioning\n<div className=\"relative\">\n  <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0\">Badge</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Spacing\n\n```tsx\n// Padding and Margin\n<div className=\"p-4 m-2\">           {/* padding: 1rem, margin: 0.5rem */}\n<div className=\"px-6 py-4\">        {/* padding-x: 1.5rem, padding-y: 1rem */}\n<div className=\"mt-8 mb-4\">        {/* margin-top: 2rem, margin-bottom: 1rem */}\n\n// Space between children\n<div className=\"space-y-4\">        {/* margin-bottom on all but last child */}\n  <div>Item 1</div>\n  <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Typography\n\n```tsx\n<h1 className=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Heading</h1>\n<p className=\"text-base font-normal text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">\n  Paragraph text with comfortable line height.\n</p>\n<span className=\"text-sm font-medium text-blue-600\">Label</span>\n```\n\n### Colors\n\n```tsx\n// Text colors\n<p className=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Text</p>\n\n// Background colors\n<div className=\"bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600\">Button</div>\n\n// Border colors\n<div className=\"border border-gray-300\">Box</div>\n```\n\n## Responsive Design\n\n### Breakpoints\n\n```tsx\n// Mobile-first responsive classes\n<div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3\">\n  {/* Full width on mobile, half on medium screens, third on large */}\n</div>\n\n<h1 className=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-6xl\">\n  {/* Responsive text sizes */}\n</h1>\n\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n  {/* Responsive grid */}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Container\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n  {/* Centered container with horizontal padding */}\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n  {/* Responsive container padding */}\n</div>\n```\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Button\n\n```tsx\n<button className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors\">\n  Click me\n</button>\n\n// Variants\n<button className=\"px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-50\">\n  Secondary\n</button>\n```\n\n### Card\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n  <img src=\"/image.jpg\" alt=\"\" className=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" />\n  <div className=\"p-6\">\n    <h2 className=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Card Title</h2>\n    <p className=\"text-gray-600\">Card content goes here.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Form Input\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"space-y-2\">\n  <label htmlFor=\"email\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">\n    Email\n  </label>\n  <input\n    type=\"email\"\n    id=\"email\"\n    className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent\"\n    placeholder=\"you@example.com\"\n  />\n  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">We''ll never share your email.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n## State Variants\n\n### Hover, Focus, Active\n\n```tsx\n<button className=\"bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 active:bg-blue-700 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\">\n  Interactive Button\n</button>\n\n<a href=\"#\" className=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\">\n  Link\n</a>\n```\n\n### Group Hover\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"group\">\n  <img src=\"/image.jpg\" className=\"group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity\" />\n  <p className=\"group-hover:text-blue-600\">Hover the container</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Disabled\n\n```tsx\n<button className=\"disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" disabled>\n  Disabled Button\n</button>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode\n\n```css\n/* Tailwind v4: Configure in app/globals.css */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  /* Or use class-based: .dark */\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// Usage (same as v3)\n<div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Title</h1>\n  <p className=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Description</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Custom Styles\n\n### Arbitrary Values\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"top-[117px]\">           {/* Custom top value */}\n<div className=\"bg-[#1da1f2]\">          {/* Custom color */}\n<div className=\"grid-cols-[200px_1fr]\"> {/* Custom grid template */}\n```\n\n### @apply Directive\n\n```css\n/* components/button.css */\n.btn-primary {\n  @apply px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-md;\n  @apply hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500;\n  @apply disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed;\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Tailwind v4: CSS-First Configuration\n\n```css\n/* app/globals.css */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@theme {\n  /* Custom colors */\n  --color-brand-50: #eff6ff;\n  --color-brand-100: #dbeafe;\n  --color-brand-900: #1e3a8a;\n\n  /* Custom spacing */\n  --spacing-128: 32rem;\n\n  /* Custom fonts */\n  --font-family-sans: ''Inter'', sans-serif;\n\n  /* Custom breakpoints */\n  --breakpoint-3xl: 1920px;\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind v3 Config (Still Supported)\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js (optional in v4)\nmodule.exports = {\n  content: [\n    ''./app/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}'',\n  ],\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        brand: {\n          50: ''#eff6ff'',\n          100: ''#dbeafe'',\n          900: ''#1e3a8a'',\n        }\n      },\n      spacing: {\n        ''128'': ''32rem'',\n      },\n      fontFamily: {\n        sans: [''Inter'', ''sans-serif''],\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    require(''@tailwindcss/forms''),\n    require(''@tailwindcss/typography''),\n  ],\n}\n```\n\n## Plugins\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/forms\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\nnpm install @tailwindcss/aspect-ratio\nnpm install @tailwindcss/container-queries\n```\n\n```tsx\n// @tailwindcss/forms\n<input type=\"text\" className=\"form-input rounded-md\" />\n\n// @tailwindcss/typography\n<article className=\"prose lg:prose-xl\">\n  <h1>Article Title</h1>\n  <p>Content...</p>\n</article>\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n### Automatic Content Detection\n\nTailwind v4 automatically detects and scans all template files - no `content` configuration needed.\n\n### Build Performance\n\nTailwind v4 delivers 3.5x faster full builds (~100ms) compared to v3 using modern CSS features like `@property` and `color-mix()`.\n\n**Browser Requirements**: Safari 16.4+, Chrome 111+, Firefox 128+\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Centered Content\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen\">\n  <div>Centered content</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Sticky Header\n\n```tsx\n<header className=\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b\">\n  <nav>Navigation</nav>\n</header>\n```\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n  {posts.map(post => (\n    <PostCard key={post.id} post={post} />\n  ))}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Truncate Text\n\n```tsx\n<p className=\"truncate\">This text will be truncated with ellipsis if too long</p>\n<p className=\"line-clamp-3\">This text will show max 3 lines with ellipsis</p>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Consistent Spacing**: Stick to Tailwind''s spacing scale\n2. **Responsive by Default**: Always consider mobile-first design\n3. **Extract Components**: Avoid repeating long class lists\n4. **Use Theme Colors**: Define custom colors in config, not arbitrary values\n5. **Leverage @apply Sparingly**: Prefer utility classes in JSX\n6. **Enable Dark Mode**: Plan for dark mode from the start\n7. **Use Plugins**: Leverage official plugins for common needs\n8. **Optimize Production**: Ensure purge is configured correctly\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor detailed information, see:\n- [Utility Patterns](resources/utility-patterns.md)\n- [Component Library](resources/component-library.md)\n- [Configuration Guide](resources/configuration.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:24.007Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS utility class management with Tailwind CSS v4","zh":"非常适合需要高效管理CSS实用程序类的前端代理，使用Tailwind CSS v4","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4を使用して効率的なCSSユーティリティクラス管理が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 효율적인 CSS 유틸리티 클래스 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan una gestión eficiente de clases de utilidad CSS con Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une gestion efficace des classes d''utilité CSS avec Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von CSS-Utility-Klassen mit Tailwind CSS v4 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento eficiente de classes de utilidade CSS com Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим эффективный менеджмент утилитных классов CSS с помощью Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة فئات tiện ích CSS فعالة مع Tailwind CSS v4"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize a CSS-first configuration approach, leveraging utility classes for responsive and mobile-first design, while also providing compatibility with tailwind.config.js for v3 support, and enabling features like AI 对话暂停反馈 and 智能存储清理","zh":"赋予代理采用CSS优先配置方法的能力，利用实用程序类实现响应式和移动优先设计，同时还提供与tailwind.config.js的兼容性以支持v3，并启用功能，如AI对话暂停反馈和智能存储清理","ja":"CSS優先の設定アプローチを使用して、ユーティリティクラスを活用し、レスポンシブでモバイルファーストのデザインを実現するとともに、tailwind.config.jsとの互換性を提供してv3をサポートし、AI会話の一時停止フィードバックやスマートストレージクリーンなどの機能を有効にする","ko":"CSS 우선 구성 방식을 사용하여 유틸리티 클래스를 활용하여 반응형 및 모바일 우선 디자인을 구현하면서 tailwind.config.js와의 호환성을 제공하여 v3를 지원하고 AI 대화 일시 중지 피드백 및 스마트 저장소 정리 등의 기능을 활성화하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar un enfoque de configuración CSS-first, aprovechando las clases de utilidad para diseños responsivos y de primera generación móvil, y también proporcionando compatibilidad con tailwind.config.js para soporte v3, y habilitando características como la retroalimentación de pausa de diálogo de IA y la limpieza de almacenamiento inteligente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser une approche de configuration CSS-first, en exploitant les classes d''utilité pour des conceptions responsives et mobile-first, tout en fournissant une compatibilité avec tailwind.config.js pour le support v3, et en activant des fonctionnalités comme la rétroaction de pause de dialogue d''IA et le nettoyage de stockage intelligent","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einen CSS-first-Konfigurationsansatz zu nutzen, indem Utility-Klassen für responsives und mobiles Design ausgenutzt werden, und bietet auch Kompatibilität mit tailwind.config.js für v3-Unterstützung, und ermöglicht Funktionen wie AI-Dialogpausen-Rückmeldungen und intelligente Speicherbereinigung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem uma abordagem de configuração CSS-first, aproveitando classes de utilidade para design responsivo e mobile-first, além de fornecer compatibilidade com tailwind.config.js para suporte à v3 e habilitar recursos como pausa de feedback de conversa de IA e limpeza de armazenamento inteligente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать подход к конфигурации CSS-first, используя утилитные классы для отзывчивого и мобильного дизайна, а также обеспечивает совместимость с tailwind.config.js для поддержки версии 3 и включает функции, такие как пауза обратной связи разговора ИИ и умная очистка хранилища","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استخدام نهج تكوين CSS-first ، واستخدام فئات الأدوات لتصميم استجابي وأول الوحدات النقالة ، بالإضافة إلى تقديم التوافق مع tailwind.config.js لدعم الإصدار 3 وتمكين الميزات مثل إيقاف ملاحظات محادثة الإصدار وتنظيف التخزين الذكي"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing utility-first CSS design principles","Generating responsive layouts with mobile-first approach","Extracting repeated patterns into components for efficient styling"],"zh":["实施实用优先的CSS设计原则","使用移动优先方法生成响应式布局","提取重复模式到组件以实现高效的样式"],"ja":["ユーティリティファーストのCSSデザイン原則を実装する","モバイルファーストアプローチを使用してレスポンシブレイアウトを生成する","繰り返しのパターンをコンポーネントに抽出して効率的なスタイリングを実現する"],"ko":["유틸리티 우선의 CSS 디자인 원칙을 구현","모바일 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 반응형 레이아웃을 생성","반복되는 패턴을 구성 요소로 추출하여 효율적인 스타일링을 구현"],"es":["Implementación de principios de diseño de CSS de primera utilidad","Generación de diseños responsivos con enfoque de primera generación móvil","Extracción de patrones repetidos en componentes para un estilo eficiente"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de principes de conception de CSS de première utilité","Génération de dispositions responsives avec une approche de première génération mobile","Extraction de modèles répétitifs en composants pour un style efficace"],"de":["Implementierung von Utility-First-CSS-Designprinzipien","Erzeugung von responsiven Layouts mit mobilem Ansatz","Extraktion von wiederkehrenden Mustern in Komponenten für effizientes Styling"],"pt":["Implementar princípios de design de CSS-first","Gerar layouts responsivos com abordagem mobile-first","Extrair padrões repetidos em componentes para estilização eficiente"],"ru":["Реализация принципов дизайна CSS-first","Генерация отзывчивых макетов с мобильной первой подход","Извлечение повторяющихся шаблонов в компоненты для эффективного стилизации"],"ar":["تنفيذ مبادئ تصميم CSS-first","генерация تخطيطات استجابة مع نهج أول الوحدات النقالة","استخراج أنماط متكررة في المكونات لتحسين الأسلوب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS v4 compatibility","Needs understanding of CSS-first configuration approach","Limited to CSS styling, not applicable for other styling languages"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS v4兼容性","需要理解CSS优先配置方法","仅限CSS样式，不适用于其他样式语言"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4の互換性が必要","CSS優先の設定方法の理解が必要","CSSスタイリングのみに限定され、他のスタイリング言語には適用不可"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4 호환성이 필요","CSS 우선 구성 방식의 이해가 필요","CSS 스타일링만 해당되며, 다른 스타일링 언어에는 적용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Tailwind CSS v4","Necesita comprensión del enfoque de configuración CSS-first","Limitado a la configuración de CSS, no aplicable a otros lenguajes de configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS v4","Nécessite une compréhension de l''approche de configuration CSS-first","Limité à la configuration CSS, non applicable à d''autres langages de configuration"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS v4","Benötigt Verständnis des CSS-first-Konfigurationsansatzes","Begrenzt auf CSS-Styling, nicht anwendbar auf andere Stil-Sprachen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com Tailwind CSS v4","Necessita de compreensão da abordagem de configuração CSS-first","Limitado ao estilo CSS, não se aplica a outras linguagens de estilo"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Tailwind CSS v4","Требует понимания подхода к конфигурации CSS-first","Ограничен стилем CSS, не применимо к другим языкам стилей"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Tailwind CSS v4","يحتاج إلى فهم نهج تكوين CSS-first","محدود بنمط CSS ، لا ينطبق على لغات الأسلوب الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/git-workflow', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'git-workflow', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:45:14.333Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/git-workflow","name":"git-workflow","description":{"zh":"Git 工作流是一个用于管理代码仓库的协议，包括分支管理、命名约定和提交消息格式","ja":"Git ワークフローは、コードリポジトリを管理するためのプロトコルであり、ブランチ管理、命名規則、コミットメッセージ形式を含みます","ko":"Git 작업 흐름은 코드 저장소를 관리하기 위한 프로토콜로, 분기 관리, 명명 규칙, 커밋 메시지 형식을 포함합니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es una serie de prácticas y convenciones para gestionar el código y colaborar en proyectos de desarrollo. Aprende a usar ramas, mensajes de commit y más","fr":"Le workflow Git est une série de pratiques et de conventions pour gérer le code et collaborer sur les projets de développement. Découvrez comment utiliser des branches, des messages de commit et plus","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist eine Reihe von Praktiken und Konventionen für die Verwaltung von Code und die Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Branches, Commit-Messages und mehr verwenden können","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho Git é um conjunto de práticas para gerenciar o código-fonte de forma eficaz. Isso inclui gerenciamento de branch e mensagens de commit.","ru":"Гит-Workflow - это набор практик для эффективного управления исходным кодом. Это включает в себя управление ветками и сообщения о коммитах.","ar":"تدفق العمل جيت هو مجموعة من الممارسات لإدارة الشيفرة المصدرية بفعالية. هذا يشمل إدارة الفرع ورسائل الالتزام.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git 工作流指南","ja":"Git ワークフロー ガイド","ko":"Git 작업 흐름 가이드","es":"Flujo de trabajo Git: Mejores prácticas para desarrolladores","fr":"Workflow Git : Meilleures pratiques pour les développeurs","de":"Git-Workflow: Best Practices für Entwickler","pt":"Fluxo de Trabalho Git: Melhores Práticas","ru":"Гит-Workflow: Лучшие Практики","ar":"تدفق العمل جيت: أفضل الممارسات","en":"git-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"Git 工作流是一个用于管理代码仓库的协议，包括分支管理、命名约定和提交消息格式","ja":"Git ワークフローは、コードリポジトリを管理するためのプロトコルであり、ブランチ管理、命名規則、コミットメッセージ形式を含みます","ko":"Git 작업 흐름은 코드 저장소를 관리하기 위한 프로토콜로, 분기 관리, 명명 규칙, 커밋 메시지 형식을 포함합니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo Git es una serie de prácticas y convenciones para gestionar el código y colaborar en proyectos de desarrollo. Aprende a usar ramas, mensa...","fr":"Le workflow Git est une série de pratiques et de conventions pour gérer le code et collaborer sur les projets de développement. Découvrez comment utiliser de...","de":"Der Git-Workflow ist eine Reihe von Praktiken und Konventionen für die Verwaltung von Code und die Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten. Erfahren Sie, wie...","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho Git é um conjunto de práticas para gerenciar o código-fonte de forma eficaz. Isso inclui gerenciamento de branch e mensagens de commit.","ru":"Гит-Workflow - это набор практик для эффективного управления исходным кодом. Это включает в себя управление ветками и сообщения о коммитах.","ar":"تدفق العمل جيت هو مجموعة من الممارسات لإدارة الشيفرة المصدرية بفعالية. هذا يشمل إدارة الفرع ورسائل الالتزام.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["分支管理","命名约定","提交消息格式","主分支保护","特性分支开发"],"ja":["ブランチ管理","命名規則","コミットメッセージ形式","メインブランチ保護","機能ブランチ開発"],"ko":["분기 관리","명명 규칙","커밋 메시지 형식","메인 분기 보호","기능 분기 개발"],"es":["Gestión de ramas","Convenciones de nombres de ramas","Formato de mensajes de commit","Uso de Pull Requests","Colaboración en proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Gestion des branches","Conventions de nommage des branches","Format des messages de commit","Utilisation des Pull Requests","Collaboration sur les projets de développement"],"de":["Verwaltung von Branches","Namenskonventionen für Branches","Format von Commit-Messages","Verwendung von Pull Requests","Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de branch","Mensagens de commit personalizadas","Criação de branches de recurso","Resolução de bugs","Refatoração de código","Integração contínua"],"ru":["Управление ветками","Пользовательские сообщения о коммитах","Создание фич-веток","Исправление ошибок","Рефакторинг кода","Непрерывная интеграция"],"ar":["إدارة الفرع","رسائل الالتزام المخصصة","إنشاء فروع الميزة","إصلاح الأعطال","إعادة هيكلة الشيفرة","التكامل المستمر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 工作流","分支管理","命名约定","提交消息格式","代码仓库管理","Git最佳实践"],"ja":["Git ワークフロー","ブランチ管理","命名規則","コミットメッセージ形式","コードリポジトリ管理","Git ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Git 작업 흐름","분기 관리","명명 규칙","커밋 메시지 형식","코드 저장소 관리","Git 최적화 방법"],"es":["flujo de trabajo Git","desarrollo de software","colaboración en proyectos","gestión de ramas","convenciones de nombres de ramas","formato de mensajes de commit"],"fr":["workflow Git","développement de logiciels","collaboration sur les projets","gestion des branches","conventions de nommage des branches","format des messages de commit"],"de":["Git-Workflow","Software-Entwicklung","Zusammenarbeit in Projekten","Verwaltung von Branches","Namenskonventionen für Branches","Format von Commit-Messages"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho git","gerenciamento de branch","mensagens de commit","desenvolvimento de software","controle de versão","integração contínua","git workflow","branch management","commit messages"],"ru":["Гит-Workflow","управление ветками","сообщения о коммитах","разработка программного обеспечения","контроль версий","непрерывная интеграция","git workflow","branch management","commit messages"],"ar":["تدفق العمل جيت","إدارة الفرع","رسائل الالتزام","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار","التكامل المستمر","git workflow","branch management","commit messages"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":"Git workflow and conventions for development. Use when creating branches, committing code, or creating PRs. Triggers on git, branch, commit, PR, pull request, merge, workflow.","bodyPreview":"# Git Usage Guidelines\n\n## Branch Management\n- **Main branch**: Typically `main`, `master`, or a custom branch (check project conventions)\n- **Workflow**: main branch → create feature branch → develop → PR back to main\n- **NEVER** work directly on the main branch → ALWAYS create feature branches\n\n## Branch Naming\n- Feature branches: `feat/description` or `feature/description`\n- Bug fixes: `fix/description`\n- Refactoring: `refactor/description`\n\n## Commit Message Format\nUse Conventional Commits f","body":"# Git Usage Guidelines\n\n## Branch Management\n- **Main branch**: Typically `main`, `master`, or a custom branch (check project conventions)\n- **Workflow**: main branch → create feature branch → develop → PR back to main\n- **NEVER** work directly on the main branch → ALWAYS create feature branches\n\n## Branch Naming\n- Feature branches: `feat/description` or `feature/description`\n- Bug fixes: `fix/description`\n- Refactoring: `refactor/description`\n\n## Commit Message Format\nUse Conventional Commits format:\n- `feat:` - New features\n- `fix:` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor:` - Code refactoring\n- `perf:` / `optimize:` - Performance improvements\n- `chore:` - Build, version, or non-code changes\n- `docs:` - Documentation only\n\n**Format**: `type: short description`\n- Use lowercase\n- Keep first line under 72 characters\n- Include issue number if applicable: `fix: resolve login bug OK-12345`\n\n**IMPORTANT - Claude Code commits**:\n- Do NOT include \"Generated with Claude Code\" link\n- Do NOT include \"Co-Authored-By: Claude\" signature\n- Commit message should be indistinguishable from human-written commits\n\n## PR Naming Convention\nFollow the same format as commit messages:\n- `feat: add dark mode support`\n- `fix: resolve authentication timeout issue`\n- `refactor: simplify payment processing logic`\n\n## Common Git Commands\n\n### Creating a Feature Branch\n```bash\ngit checkout main\ngit pull origin main\ngit checkout -b feat/my-new-feature\n```\n\n### Committing Changes\n\n**Option 1: Use /commit command (if available)**\n```bash\n/commit\n```\nThe `/commit` command automatically runs pre-commit checks and creates a well-formatted commit message.\n\n**Option 2: Manual commit with pre-checks**\n```bash\n# Stage your changes\ngit add .\n\n# Run pre-commit checks (MANDATORY)\nyarn lint:staged\nyarn tsc:staged\n\n# If checks pass, commit\ngit commit -m \"feat: add user profile page\"\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT**:\n- NEVER commit code that fails linting or TypeScript compilation\n- Pre-commit checks are mandatory\n\n### Pushing and Creating PR\n```bash\ngit push -u origin feat/my-new-feature\n# Then create PR via GitHub UI or gh CLI\n```\n\n### Rebasing on Latest Main\n```bash\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:14.333Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured collaborative coding practices with Git.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化协作编码实践并使用 Git 的开发代理。","ja":"Git を使用した構造化された共同コーディングの実践が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Git을 사용하여 구조화된 협업 코딩 실습이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan prácticas de codificación colaborativa estructuradas con Git.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de pratiques de codage collaboratif structurées avec Git.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die strukturierte kollaborative Codierpraktiken mit Git benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de práticas de codificação colaborativa estruturadas com Git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы структурированные практики совместного кодирования с Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى ممارسات برمجة تعاونية منظمّة مع Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex Git workflows using Conventional Commits, leveraging main and feature branches for seamless collaboration and version control, while adhering to strict branch naming conventions like ''feat/description'' and ''fix/description''.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂的 Git 工作流的能力，利用标准提交使用主分支和功能分支实现无缝的协作和版本控制，同时遵循严格的分支命名约定，如 ''feat/描述'' 和 ''fix/描述''。","ja":"エージェントが Conventional Commits を使用して主ブランチと機能ブランチを活用し、厳格なブランチ命名規約（例： ''feat/説明''、''fix/説明''）に従って複雑な Git ワークフローを管理する能力を提供します。","ko":"표준 커밋을 사용하여 주 분기와 기능 분기를 활용하여 복잡한 Git 워크플로를 관리하고 엄격한 분기 이름 규칙(''feat/설명'', ''fix/설명'' 등)을 준수하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo de Git complejos utilizando Commits Convencionales, aprovechando las ramas principales y de características para una colaboración y control de versiones sin problemas, y ajustándose a estrictas convenciones de nomenclatura de ramas como ''feat/descripción'' y ''fix/descripción''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des flux de travail Git complexes en utilisant des Commits Conventionnels, en exploitant les branches principales et de fonctionnalités pour une collaboration et un contrôle de version sans interruption, tout en respectant des conventions de dénomination de branches strictes comme ''feat/description'' et ''fix/description''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Git-Workflows mithilfe von Conventional Commits zu verwalten, indem sie die Haupt- und Feature-Branches für eine nahtlose Zusammenarbeit und Versionskontrolle nutzen und sich an strenge Branch-Benennungskonventionen wie ''feat/Beschreibung'' und ''fix/Beschreibung'' halten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de trabalho Git complexos usando Commits Convencionais, aproveitando as ramificações principais e de recursos para colaboração e controle de versão sem interrupção, enquanto adere a convenções estritas de nomenclatura de ramificações como ''feat/description'' e ''fix/description''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными рабочими процессами Git с помощью Конвенциональных Коммитов, используя основные и функциональные ветки для бесперебойного сотрудничества и контроля версий, а также соблюдая строгие конвенции именования веток, такие как ''feat/description'' и ''fix/description''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة تدفقات عمل Git المعقدة باستخدام الالتزامات التقليدية، واستخدام الفروع الرئيسية والفروع الميزة لتحقيق التعاون السلس والسيطرة على الإصدار، مع الالتزام بالقواعد الصارمة لتسمية الفروع مثل ''feat/description'' و ''fix/description''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating branch management with main and feature branches","Standardizing commit messages using Conventional Commits format","Streamlining pull request workflows for efficient code review"],"zh":["使用主分支和功能分支自动化分支管理","使用标准提交格式标准化提交消息","优化拉取请求工作流以实现高效的代码审查"],"ja":["メインブランチと機能ブランチを使用したブランチ管理の自動化","Conventional Commits 形式を使用したコミットメッセージの標準化","プルリクエストワークフローの最適化による効率的なコードレビュー"],"ko":["메인 분기와 기능 분기를 사용한 분기 관리 자동화","표준 커밋 형식을 사용한 커밋 메시지 표준화","풀 리퀘스트 워크플로우 최적화를 통한 효율적인 코드 리뷰"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de ramas con ramas principales y de características","Estandarización de mensajes de confirmación utilizando el formato Conventional Commits","Optimización de los flujos de trabajo de solicitudes de extracción para una revisión de código eficiente"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des branches avec les branches principales et de fonctionnalités","Standardisation des messages de validation en utilisant le format Conventional Commits","Optimisation des flux de travail de demandes d''extraction pour une révision de code efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung der Branch-Verwaltung mit Haupt- und Feature-Branches","Standardisierung von Commit-Nachrichten unter Verwendung des Conventional Commits-Formats","Optimierung der Pull-Request-Workflows für eine effiziente Code-Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automatizar a gestão de ramificações com ramificações principais e de recursos","Padronizar as mensagens de confirmação usando o formato de Commits Convencionais","Otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de solicitação de pull para revisão de código eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление ветками с основными и функциональными ветками","Стандартизировать сообщения коммитов с помощью формата Конвенциональных Коммитов","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы запросов на kéo для эффективного обзора кода"],"ar":["تحسين إدارة الفروع مع الفروع الرئيسية والفروع الميزة","تقييس رسائل الالتزام باستخدام تنسيق الالتزامات التقليدية","تبسيط سير عمل طلبات السحب للتحقق الفعّال من الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system","Adherence to specific branch naming and commit message formats"],"zh":["需要 Git 版本控制系统","需要遵循特定的分支命名和提交消息格式"],"ja":["Git バージョン管理システムの必要性","特定のブランチ命名とコミットメッセージ形式への準拠の必要性"],"ko":["Git 버전 관리 시스템 필요","특정 분기 이름 및 커밋 메시지 형식 준수 필요"],"es":["Requiere el sistema de control de versiones Git","Adhesión a formatos de nomenclatura de ramas y mensajes de confirmación específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite le système de contrôle de version Git","Adhésion à des formats de dénomination de branches et de messages de validation spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert das Git-Versionssystem","Einhaltung spezifischer Branch-Benennungs- und Commit-Nachrichten-Formate"],"pt":["Exige sistema de controle de versão Git","Adesão a formatos específicos de nomenclatura de ramificações e mensagens de confirmação"],"ru":["Требует системы контроля версий Git","Соблюдение конкретных форматов именования веток и сообщений коммитов"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدار Git","الامتثال لتنسيقات محددة لتسمية الفروع ورسائل الالتزام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
