ière-plan et les flux de travail automatisés","de":"Convex Cron Jobs ermöglicht die Planung wiederkehrender Funktionen für Hintergrundaufgaben und automatisierte Workflows","pt":"O Convex Cron Jobs permite agendar funções recorrentes para tarefas em segundo plano, limpeza e sincronização de dados.","ru":"Convex Cron Jobs позволяет планировать повторяющиеся функции для задач на фоне, очистки и синхронизации данных.","ar":"Convex Cron Jobs يسمح بجدولة الدوال المتكررة لمهام الخلفية وتنظيف البيانات وتحديثها.","en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"A centralised hub for agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["Convex","Cron Jobs","API","Convex","Cron Jobs"],"ja":["Convex","Cron ","API","Convex","Cron "],"ko":["Convex","Cron ","API","Convex","Cron "],"es":["Programación de tareas en segundo plano","Limpieza y sincronización de datos","Flujos de trabajo automatizados","Funciones programadas recurrentes","Integración con la documentación de Convex"],"fr":["Planification de tâches en arrière-plan","Nettoyage et synchronisation des données","Flux de travail automatisés","Fonctions planifiées récurrentes","Intégration avec la documentation Convex"],"de":["Zeitplanung für Hintergrundaufgaben","Bereinigung und Datensynchronisation","Automatisierte Workflows","Geplante Funktionen wiederkehrend","Integration mit der Convex-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Agendamento de funções recorrentes","Tarefas em segundo plano","Limpeza e sincronização de dados","Automatização de fluxos de trabalho","Integração com aplicações Convex"],"ru":["Планирование повторяющихся функций","Задачи на фоне","Очистка и синхронизация данных","Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Интеграция с приложениями Convex"],"ar":["جدولة الدوال المتكررة","مهام الخلفية","تنظيف وتحديث البيانات","تأتمة سير العمل","التكامل مع تطبيقات Convex"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex Cron Jobs","Convex","Cron Jobs","Convex API","Convex","Convex Cron Jobs"],"ja":["Convex Cron ","Convex","Cron ","Convex API","Convex","Convex Cron "],"ko":["Convex Cron ","Convex","Cron ","Convex API","Convex","Convex Cron "],"es":["Convex Cron Jobs","programación de tareas","tareas en segundo plano","limpieza de datos","sincronización de datos","flujos de trabajo automatizados"],"fr":["Convex Cron Jobs","planification de tâches","tâches en arrière-plan","nettoyage de données","synchronisation de données","flux de travail automatisés"],"de":["Convex Cron Jobs","Zeitplanung für Aufgaben","Hintergrundaufgaben","Bereinigung von Daten","Datensynchronisation","automatisierte Workflows"],"pt":["Convex Cron Jobs","Agendamento de tarefas","Tarefas em segundo plano","Limpeza de dados","Sincronização de dados","Automatização de fluxos de trabalho"],"ru":["Convex Cron Jobs","Планирование задач","Задачи на фоне","Очистка данных","Синхронизация данных","Автоматизация рабочих процессов"],"ar":["Convex Cron Jobs","جدولة المهام","مهام الخلفية","تنظيف البيانات","تحديث البيانات","تأتمة سير العمل"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Cron Jobs","description":"Scheduled function patterns for background tasks including interval scheduling, cron expressions, job monitoring, retry strategies, and best practices for long-running tasks","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","cron","scheduling","background-jobs","automation"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Cron Jobs\n\nSchedule recurring functions for background tasks, cleanup jobs, data syncing, and automated workflows in Convex applications.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling/cron-jobs\n- Scheduling Overview: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling\n- Scheduled Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling/scheduled-functions\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instr","body":"# Convex Cron Jobs\n\nSchedule recurring functions for background tasks, cleanup jobs, data syncing, and automated workflows in Convex applications.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling/cron-jobs\n- Scheduling Overview: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling\n- Scheduled Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling/scheduled-functions\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Cron Jobs Overview\n\nConvex cron jobs allow you to schedule functions to run at regular intervals or specific times. Key features:\n\n- Run functions on a fixed schedule\n- Support for interval-based and cron expression scheduling\n- Automatic retries on failure\n- Monitoring via the Convex dashboard\n\n### Basic Cron Setup\n\n```typescript\n// convex/crons.ts\nimport { cronJobs } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst crons = cronJobs();\n\n// Run every hour\ncrons.interval(\n  \"cleanup expired sessions\",\n  { hours: 1 },\n  internal.tasks.cleanupExpiredSessions,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Run every day at midnight UTC\ncrons.cron(\n  \"daily report\",\n  \"0 0 * * *\",\n  internal.reports.generateDailyReport,\n  {}\n);\n\nexport default crons;\n```\n\n### Interval-Based Scheduling\n\nUse `crons.interval` for simple recurring tasks:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/crons.ts\nimport { cronJobs } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst crons = cronJobs();\n\n// Every 5 minutes\ncrons.interval(\n  \"sync external data\",\n  { minutes: 5 },\n  internal.sync.fetchExternalData,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Every 2 hours\ncrons.interval(\n  \"cleanup temp files\",\n  { hours: 2 },\n  internal.files.cleanupTempFiles,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Every 30 seconds (minimum interval)\ncrons.interval(\n  \"health check\",\n  { seconds: 30 },\n  internal.monitoring.healthCheck,\n  {}\n);\n\nexport default crons;\n```\n\n### Cron Expression Scheduling\n\nUse `crons.cron` for precise scheduling with cron expressions:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/crons.ts\nimport { cronJobs } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst crons = cronJobs();\n\n// Every day at 9 AM UTC\ncrons.cron(\n  \"morning notifications\",\n  \"0 9 * * *\",\n  internal.notifications.sendMorningDigest,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Every Monday at 8 AM UTC\ncrons.cron(\n  \"weekly summary\",\n  \"0 8 * * 1\",\n  internal.reports.generateWeeklySummary,\n  {}\n);\n\n// First day of every month at midnight\ncrons.cron(\n  \"monthly billing\",\n  \"0 0 1 * *\",\n  internal.billing.processMonthlyBilling,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Every 15 minutes\ncrons.cron(\n  \"frequent sync\",\n  \"*/15 * * * *\",\n  internal.sync.syncData,\n  {}\n);\n\nexport default crons;\n```\n\n### Cron Expression Reference\n\n```\n┌───────────── minute (0-59)\n│ ┌───────────── hour (0-23)\n│ │ ┌───────────── day of month (1-31)\n│ │ │ ┌───────────── month (1-12)\n│ │ │ │ ┌───────────── day of week (0-6, Sunday=0)\n│ │ │ │ │\n* * * * *\n```\n\nCommon patterns:\n- `* * * * *` - Every minute\n- `0 * * * *` - Every hour\n- `0 0 * * *` - Every day at midnight\n- `0 0 * * 0` - Every Sunday at midnight\n- `0 0 1 * *` - First day of every month\n- `*/5 * * * *` - Every 5 minutes\n- `0 9-17 * * 1-5` - Every hour from 9 AM to 5 PM, Monday through Friday\n\n### Internal Functions for Crons\n\nCron jobs should call internal functions for security:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/tasks.ts\nimport { internalMutation, internalQuery } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Cleanup expired sessions\nexport const cleanupExpiredSessions = internalMutation({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.number(),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const oneHourAgo = Date.now() - 60 * 60 * 1000;\n    \n    const expiredSessions = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"sessions\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_lastActive\")\n      .filter((q) => q.lt(q.field(\"lastActive\"), oneHourAgo))\n      .collect();\n\n    for (const session of expiredSessions) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(session._id);\n    }\n\n    return expiredSessions.length;\n  },\n});\n\n// Process pending tasks\nexport const processPendingTasks = internalMutation({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const pendingTasks = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"tasks\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_status\", (q) => q.eq(\"status\", \"pending\"))\n      .take(100);\n\n    for (const task of pendingTasks) {\n      await ctx.db.patch(task._id, {\n        status: \"processing\",\n        startedAt: Date.now(),\n      });\n      \n      // Schedule the actual processing\n      await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.tasks.processTask, {\n        taskId: task._id,\n      });\n    }\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Cron Jobs with Arguments\n\nPass static arguments to cron jobs:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/crons.ts\nimport { cronJobs } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst crons = cronJobs();\n\n// Different cleanup intervals for different types\ncrons.interval(\n  \"cleanup temp files\",\n  { hours: 1 },\n  internal.cleanup.cleanupByType,\n  { fileType: \"temp\", maxAge: 3600000 }\n);\n\ncrons.interval(\n  \"cleanup cache files\",\n  { hours: 24 },\n  internal.cleanup.cleanupByType,\n  { fileType: \"cache\", maxAge: 86400000 }\n);\n\nexport default crons;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// convex/cleanup.ts\nimport { internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const cleanupByType = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    fileType: v.string(),\n    maxAge: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.number(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const cutoff = Date.now() - args.maxAge;\n    \n    const oldFiles = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"files\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_type_and_created\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"type\", args.fileType).lt(\"createdAt\", cutoff)\n      )\n      .collect();\n\n    for (const file of oldFiles) {\n      await ctx.storage.delete(file.storageId);\n      await ctx.db.delete(file._id);\n    }\n\n    return oldFiles.length;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Monitoring and Logging\n\nAdd logging to track cron job execution:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/tasks.ts\nimport { internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const cleanupWithLogging = internalMutation({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const startTime = Date.now();\n    let processedCount = 0;\n    let errorCount = 0;\n\n    try {\n      const expiredItems = await ctx.db\n        .query(\"items\")\n        .withIndex(\"by_expiresAt\")\n        .filter((q) => q.lt(q.field(\"expiresAt\"), Date.now()))\n        .collect();\n\n      for (const item of expiredItems) {\n        try {\n          await ctx.db.delete(item._id);\n          processedCount++;\n        } catch (error) {\n          errorCount++;\n          console.error(`Failed to delete item ${item._id}:`, error);\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Log job completion\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"cronLogs\", {\n        jobName: \"cleanup\",\n        startTime,\n        endTime: Date.now(),\n        duration: Date.now() - startTime,\n        processedCount,\n        errorCount,\n        status: errorCount === 0 ? \"success\" : \"partial\",\n      });\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Log job failure\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"cronLogs\", {\n        jobName: \"cleanup\",\n        startTime,\n        endTime: Date.now(),\n        duration: Date.now() - startTime,\n        processedCount,\n        errorCount,\n        status: \"failed\",\n        error: String(error),\n      });\n      throw error;\n    }\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Batching for Large Datasets\n\nHandle large datasets in batches to avoid timeouts:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/tasks.ts\nimport { internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst BATCH_SIZE = 100;\n\nexport const processBatch = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    cursor: v.optional(v.string()),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const result = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_status\", (q) => q.eq(\"status\", \"pending\"))\n      .paginate({ numItems: BATCH_SIZE, cursor: args.cursor ?? null });\n\n    for (const item of result.page) {\n      await ctx.db.patch(item._id, {\n        status: \"processed\",\n        processedAt: Date.now(),\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Schedule next batch if there are more items\n    if (!result.isDone) {\n      await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.tasks.processBatch, {\n        cursor: result.continueCursor,\n      });\n    }\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### External API Calls in Crons\n\nUse actions for external API calls:\n\n```typescript\n// convex/sync.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const syncExternalData = internalAction({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    // Fetch from external API\n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/data\", {\n      headers: {\n        Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.API_KEY}`,\n      },\n    });\n\n    if (!response.ok) {\n      throw new Error(`API request failed: ${response.status}`);\n    }\n\n    const data = await response.json();\n\n    // Store the data using a mutation\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.sync.storeExternalData, {\n      data,\n      syncedAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const storeExternalData = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    data: v.any(),\n    syncedAt: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"externalData\", {\n      data: args.data,\n      syncedAt: args.syncedAt,\n    });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// convex/crons.ts\nimport { cronJobs } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst crons = cronJobs();\n\ncrons.interval(\n  \"sync external data\",\n  { minutes: 15 },\n  internal.sync.syncExternalData,\n  {}\n);\n\nexport default crons;\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Schema for Cron Job Logging\n\n```typescript\n// convex/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  cronLogs: defineTable({\n    jobName: v.string(),\n    startTime: v.number(),\n    endTime: v.number(),\n    duration: v.number(),\n    processedCount: v.number(),\n    errorCount: v.number(),\n    status: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"success\"),\n      v.literal(\"partial\"),\n      v.literal(\"failed\")\n    ),\n    error: v.optional(v.string()),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_job\", [\"jobName\"])\n    .index(\"by_status\", [\"status\"])\n    .index(\"by_startTime\", [\"startTime\"]),\n\n  sessions: defineTable({\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    token: v.string(),\n    lastActive: v.number(),\n    expiresAt: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_user\", [\"userId\"])\n    .index(\"by_lastActive\", [\"lastActive\"])\n    .index(\"by_expiresAt\", [\"expiresAt\"]),\n\n  tasks: defineTable({\n    type: v.string(),\n    status: v.union(\n      v.literal(\"pending\"),\n      v.literal(\"processing\"),\n      v.literal(\"completed\"),\n      v.literal(\"failed\")\n    ),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n    startedAt: v.optional(v.number()),\n    completedAt: v.optional(v.number()),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_status\", [\"status\"])\n    .index(\"by_type_and_status\", [\"type\", \"status\"]),\n});\n```\n\n### Complete Cron Configuration Example\n\n```typescript\n// convex/crons.ts\nimport { cronJobs } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\nconst crons = cronJobs();\n\n// Cleanup jobs\ncrons.interval(\n  \"cleanup expired sessions\",\n  { hours: 1 },\n  internal.cleanup.expiredSessions,\n  {}\n);\n\ncrons.interval(\n  \"cleanup old logs\",\n  { hours: 24 },\n  internal.cleanup.oldLogs,\n  { maxAgeDays: 30 }\n);\n\n// Sync jobs\ncrons.interval(\n  \"sync user data\",\n  { minutes: 15 },\n  internal.sync.userData,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Report jobs\ncrons.cron(\n  \"daily analytics\",\n  \"0 1 * * *\",\n  internal.reports.dailyAnalytics,\n  {}\n);\n\ncrons.cron(\n  \"weekly summary\",\n  \"0 9 * * 1\",\n  internal.reports.weeklySummary,\n  {}\n);\n\n// Health checks\ncrons.interval(\n  \"service health check\",\n  { minutes: 5 },\n  internal.monitoring.healthCheck,\n  {}\n);\n\nexport default crons;\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Only use `crons.interval` or `crons.cron` methods, not deprecated helpers\n- Always call internal functions from cron jobs for security\n- Import `internal` from `_generated/api` even for functions in the same file\n- Add logging and monitoring for production cron jobs\n- Use batching for operations that process large datasets\n- Handle errors gracefully to prevent job failures\n- Use meaningful job names for dashboard visibility\n- Consider timezone when using cron expressions (Convex uses UTC)\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Using public functions** - Cron jobs should call internal functions only\n2. **Long-running mutations** - Break large operations into batches\n3. **Missing error handling** - Unhandled errors will fail the entire job\n4. **Forgetting timezone** - All cron expressions use UTC\n5. **Using deprecated helpers** - Avoid `crons.hourly`, `crons.daily`, etc.\n6. **Not logging execution** - Makes debugging production issues difficult\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Cron Jobs: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling/cron-jobs\n- Scheduling Overview: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling\n- Scheduled Functions: https://docs.convex.dev/scheduling/scheduled-functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:18.343Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring automated workflow management and scheduled task execution in Convex applications.","zh":"适用于需要自动化工作流管理和在 Convex 应用程序中调度任务执行的自主代理。","ja":"Convex アプリケーションでの自動化されたワークフロー管理とスケジュールされたタスクの実行が必要な自律エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Convex 애플리케이션에서 자동화된 워크플로 관리 및 예약된 태스크 실행이 필요한 자율 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes autónomos que requieren gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada y ejecución de tareas programadas en aplicaciones Convex.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents autonomes nécessitant une gestion de workflow automatisée et une exécution de tâches planifiées dans les applications Convex.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine automatisierte Workflow-Verwaltung und eine geplante Aufgabenausführung in Convex-Anwendungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requerem gestão automatizada de fluxos de trabalho e execução de tarefas agendadas em aplicações Convex.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, требующих автоматизированного управления рабочими процессами и выполнения запланированных задач в приложениях Convex.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة أوتوماتيكية لسير العمل وتنفيذ المهام المجدولة في تطبيقات Convex."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to schedule recurring functions for background tasks, cleanup jobs, and data syncing using Convex Cron Jobs, leveraging scheduled functions and the Convex scheduling overview for seamless automation, with support for broader context via the Convex LLMs documentation.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 Convex Cron Jobs 调度周期性函数的能力，用于后台任务、清理作业和数据同步，并利用调度函数和 Convex 调度概述实现无缝自动化，同时通过 Convex LLMs 文档支持更广泛的上下文。","ja":"Convex Cron Jobs を使用して周期的な関数をスケジュールし、バックグラウンド タスク、クリーンアップ ジョブ、データ同期を行い、スケジュールされた関数と Convex スケジューリングの概要を利用してシームレスな自動化を実現し、Convex LLMs ドキュメントを介してより広範なコンテキストをサポートします。","ko":"Convex Cron Jobs를 사용하여 주기적인 함수를 예약하고, 백그라운드 작업, 클리닝 작업 및 데이터 동기화를 수행하며, 예약된 함수와 Convex 예약 개요를 사용하여 무613 автомат화를 달성하며, Convex LLMs 문서를 통해 보다 광범위한 컨텍스트를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes programar funciones recurrentes para tareas en segundo plano, trabajos de limpieza y sincronización de datos utilizando Convex Cron Jobs, aprovechando las funciones programadas y la descripción general de programación de Convex para una automatización sin problemas, con soporte para un contexto más amplio a través de la documentación de Convex LLMs.","fr":"Permet aux agents de planifier des fonctions récurrentes pour des tâches en arrière-plan, des travaux de nettoyage et une synchronisation de données en utilisant Convex Cron Jobs, en exploitant les fonctions planifiées et la vue d''ensemble de la planification Convex pour une automation transparente, avec un support pour un contexte plus large via la documentation Convex LLMs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, wiederkehrende Funktionen für Hintergrundaufgaben, Bereinigungsjobs und Datenabgleich mit Convex Cron Jobs zu planen, indem es geplante Funktionen und die Convex-Planungsübersicht für eine nahtlose Automation nutzt, mit Unterstützung für einen breiteren Kontext über die Convex-LLMs-Dokumentation.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a agendar funções recorrentes para tarefas em segundo plano, trabalhos de limpeza e sincronização de dados utilizando os Convex Cron Jobs, aproveitando as funções agendadas e a visão geral de agendamento do Convex para uma automação perfeita, com suporte para um contexto mais amplo através da documentação dos LLMs da Convex.","ru":"Позволяет агентам планировать повторяющиеся функции для фоновых задач, заданий по очистке и синхронизации данных с использованием Convex Cron Jobs, используя запланированные функции и обзор планирования Convex для бесперебойной автоматизации, с поддержкой более широкого контекста через документацию Convex LLMs.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من جدولة الوظائف المتكررة للمهام الخلفية، وأعمال التنظيف، ومزامنة البيانات باستخدام Convex Cron Jobs، والاستفادة من الوظائف المجدولة ونظرة عامة على الجدولة في Convex لأتمتة سلسة، مع دعم سياق أوسع عبر وثائق Convex LLMs."},"useCases":{"en":["Scheduling automated workflows for data synchronization","Automating background tasks for efficient resource management","Debugging and optimizing scheduled functions for improved performance"],"zh":["用于数据同步的自动化工作流的调度","用于高效资源管理的后台任务的自动化","调试和优化调度函数以提高性能"],"ja":["データ同期のための自動化されたワークフローのスケジュール","効率的なリソース管理のためのバックグラウンド タスクの自動化","スケジュールされた関数のデバッグと最適化によるパフォーマンスの向上"],"ko":["데이터 동기화를 위한 자동화된 워크플로의 예약","효율적인 리소스 관리를 위한 백그라운드 작업의 자동화","예약된 함수의 디버깅 및 최적화를 통한 성능 향상"],"es":["Programación de flujos de trabajo automatizados para la sincronización de datos","Automatización de tareas en segundo plano para una gestión eficiente de recursos","Depuración y optimización de funciones programadas para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Planification de flux de travail automatisés pour la synchronisation des données","Automatisation de tâches en arrière-plan pour une gestion efficace des ressources","Débogage et optimisation de fonctions planifiées pour une meilleure performance"],"de":["Planung automatisierter Workflows für die Datenabgleich","Automatisierung von Hintergrundaufgaben für eine effiziente Ressourcenverwaltung","Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung geplanter Funktionen für eine verbesserte Leistung"],"pt":["Agendamento de fluxos de trabalho automatizados para sincronização de dados","Automatização de tarefas em segundo plano para uma gestão eficiente de recursos","Depuração e otimização de funções agendadas para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Планирование автоматизированных рабочих процессов для синхронизации данных","Автоматизация фоновых задач для эффективного управления ресурсами","Отладка и оптимизация запланированных функций для повышения производительности"],"ar":["جدولة مهام سير العمل الأوتوماتيكية لمزامنة البيانات","أتمتة المهام الخلفية للإدارة الفعالة للموارد","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين الوظائف المجدولة لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex application setup","Dependent on Convex scheduling and cron jobs documentation for implementation"],"zh":["需要 Convex 应用程序设置","依赖于 Convex 调度和 cron jobs 文档来实现"],"ja":["Convex アプリケーションの設定が必要","実装には Convex スケジューリングと cron jobs ドキュメントに依存"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","구현에는 Convex 예약 및 cron 작업 문서에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación Convex","Dependiente de la documentación de programación y trabajos cron de Convex para la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Convex","Dépend de la documentation de planification et de travaux cron Convex pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Convex-Anwendungseinrichtung","Abhängig von der Convex-Planungs- und Cron-Jobs-Dokumentation für die Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer configuração da aplicação Convex","Dependente da documentação de agendamento e cron jobs do Convex para implementação"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Convex","Зависит от документации по планированию и cron-заданиям Convex для реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Convex","يعتمد على وثائق الجدولة ومهام cron في Convex للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
