conventions","description":"Provides coding style rules for Python and PowerShell. Apply when writing, editing, reviewing, or debugging code.","bodyPreview":"# Coding Conventions\n\nThis skill contains language-specific coding convention files.\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [IMPLEMENT] - Apply coding style during implementation\n- [REFACTOR] - Apply coding style during refactoring\n\n**Phases**: IMPLEMENT, REFINE\n\n## Available Convention Files\n\n- `PYTHON-RULES.md` - Python coding conventions (formatting, imports, logging, etc.)\n- `JSON-RULES.md` - JSON coding conventions (field naming, 2-space indent, 2D table formatting)\n- `WORKFLOW-RULES.md","body":"# Coding Conventions\n\nThis skill contains language-specific coding convention files.\n\n## Verb Mapping\n\nThis skill implements:\n- [IMPLEMENT] - Apply coding style during implementation\n- [REFACTOR] - Apply coding style during refactoring\n\n**Phases**: IMPLEMENT, REFINE\n\n## Available Convention Files\n\n- `PYTHON-RULES.md` - Python coding conventions (formatting, imports, logging, etc.)\n- `JSON-RULES.md` - JSON coding conventions (field naming, 2-space indent, 2D table formatting)\n- `WORKFLOW-RULES.md` - Workflow document conventions (structure, formatting)\n- `AGENT-SKILL-RULES.md` - Agent skill folder structure and SKILL.md conventions\n\n## Tools\n\n- `reindent.py` - Convert Python file indentation to target spaces\n\n## Usage\n\nRead the appropriate convention file for the language you are working with.\n\n### reindent.py\n\nConvert Python indentation to target spaces. Auto-detects source indentation and skips files already at target. Excludes itself from processing.\n\n```powershell\n# Convert folder to 2-space indentation\npython reindent.py folder/ --to 2 --recursive\n\n# Dry-run (preview only)\npython reindent.py folder/ --to 2 --recursive --dry-run\n\n# Single file\npython reindent.py script.py --to 2\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:27.896Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing standardized coding style enforcement and SharePoint integration.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化编码风格强制和SharePoint集成的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントが標準化されたコードスタイルの適用とSharePointの統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 코딩 스타일 적용과 SharePoint 통합이 필요한 Python 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan aplicar un estilo de codificación estandarizado y la integración con SharePoint.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python qui ont besoin d''une mise en œuvre d''un style de codage standardisé et d''une intégration à SharePoint.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine standardisierte Codierungsstyle Durchsetzung und SharePoint-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de uma padronização de estilo de codificação e integração com o SharePoint.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Python, которым необходима стандартизация стиля кодирования и интеграция с SharePoint.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ نمط برمجي معياري وتكامل مع SharePoint."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply consistent Python coding conventions during implementation and refactoring, utilizing libraries like OpenAI Vector Stores and SharePoint APIs for seamless content crawling and indexing in JSON formats.","zh":"赋予代理应用一致的Python代码约定，在实现和重构期间使用类似OpenAI Vector Stores和SharePoint APIs的库，实现JSON格式的无缝内容爬取和索引。","ja":"エージェントに実装とリファクタリング中に一貫したPythonコード規約を適用する力を与え、OpenAI Vector StoresやSharePoint APIsなどのライブラリを使用してJSON形式のシームレスなコンテンツクロールとインデックス作成を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 구현과 리팩토링 중에 일관된 Python 코드 규약을 적용할 수 있는 힘을 주며, OpenAI Vector Stores와 SharePoint APIsなどの 라이브러리를 사용하여 JSON 형식의 無縫な 콘텐츠 크롤링과 색인을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar convenciones de codificación de Python coherentes durante la implementación y refactorización, utilizando bibliotecas como OpenAI Vector Stores y SharePoint APIs para un rastreo y indexación de contenido sin problemas en formatos JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des conventions de codage Python cohérentes pendant la mise en œuvre et la refactoring, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme OpenAI Vector Stores et SharePoint APIs pour un crawl et un indexage de contenu sans problème au format JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente Python-Codierkonventionen während der Implementierung und Refactoring anzuwenden, indem Bibliotheken wie OpenAI Vector Stores und SharePoint APIs für eine nahtlose Inhalts crawl und Indexierung im JSON-Format verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes apliquem convenções de codificação Python consistentes durante a implementação e refatoração, utilizando bibliotecas como OpenAI Vector Stores e APIs do SharePoint para rastreamento e indexação de conteúdo sem problemas em formatos JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять последовательные соглашения по кодированию Python во время реализации и рефакторинга, используя библиотеки như OpenAI Vector Stores и API SharePoint для беспрепятственного поиска и индексирования контента в форматах JSON.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتطبيق اتفاقيات برمجة بايثون الثابتة أثناء التنفيذ وإعادة هيكلة استخدام المكتبات مثل OpenAI Vector Stores وواجهات برمجة تطبيقات SharePoint للتحويل الخالي من العيوب والمفهرسة المحتوى في صيغ JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Python coding standards for Azure Web Apps","Refactoring existing codebases to conform to JSON-RULES.md and PYTHON-RULES.md","Automating SharePoint content crawling and indexing into OpenAI Vector Stores"],"zh":["为Azure Web Apps实施Python编码标准","重构现有的代码库以符合JSON-RULES.md和PYTHON-RULES.md","自动将SharePoint内容爬取和索引到OpenAI Vector Stores"],"ja":["Azure Web Apps用のPythonコード規約の実装","JSON-RULES.mdとPYTHON-RULES.mdに準拠するために既存のコードベースをリファクタリングする","SharePointのコンテンツをOpenAI Vector Storesにクロールしてインデックスを作成する自動化"],"ko":["Azure Web Apps를 위한 Python 코딩 표준 구현","JSON-RULES.md와 PYTHON-RULES.md에 준수하기 위해 기존 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것","SharePoint 콘텐츠를 OpenAI Vector Stores에 크롤링하고 색인을 생성하는 자동화"],"es":["Implementación de normas de codificación de Python para Azure Web Apps","Refactorización de bases de código existentes para que se ajusten a JSON-RULES.md y PYTHON-RULES.md","Automatización del rastreo y la indexación de contenido de SharePoint en OpenAI Vector Stores"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre des normes de codage Python pour Azure Web Apps","Refactoring de bases de code existantes pour se conformer à JSON-RULES.md et PYTHON-RULES.md","Automatisation du crawl et de l''indexation de contenu de SharePoint dans OpenAI Vector Stores"],"de":["Implementierung von Python-Codierstandards für Azure Web Apps","Refactoring bestehender Codebasen, um JSON-RULES.md und PYTHON-RULES.md zu entsprechen","Automatisierung des Inhalts-Crawling und -Indexierung von SharePoint in OpenAI Vector Stores"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões de codificação Python para Azure Web Apps","Reorganização de bases de código existentes para conformidade com JSON-RULES.md e PYTHON-RULES.md","Automatização da indexação e rastreamento de conteúdo do SharePoint para OpenAI Vector Stores"],"ru":["Реализация стандартов кодирования Python для Azure Web Apps","Переструктуризация существующих кодовых баз для соответствия JSON-RULES.md и PYTHON-RULES.md","Автоматизация индексирования и поиска контента SharePoint в OpenAI Vector Stores"],"ar":["تنفيذ معايير الترميز بايثون لمتاجر الويب في أزور","إعادة هيكلة قواعد التعليمات البرمجية الحالية لتوافقها مع JSON-RULES.md وPYTHON-RULES.md","أتمتة فهرسة ومسح المحتوى من SharePoint إلى OpenAI Vector Stores"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Web App setup","Limited to Python and JSON coding conventions","Dependent on OpenAI Vector Stores and SharePoint APIs"],"zh":["需要Azure Web App的设置","仅限Python和JSON代码约定","依赖于OpenAI Vector Stores和SharePoint APIs"],"ja":["Azure Web Appの設定が必要","PythonとJSONのコード規約のみ","OpenAI Vector StoresとSharePoint APIsに依存する"],"ko":["Azure Web App 설정이 필요합니다","Python과 JSON 코드 규약만 해당됩니다","OpenAI Vector Stores와 SharePoint APIs에 종속됩니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Azure Web App","Limitado a convenciones de codificación de Python y JSON","Dependiente de OpenAI Vector Stores y SharePoint APIs"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''Azure Web App","Limité aux conventions de codage Python et JSON","Dépendant de OpenAI Vector Stores et SharePoint APIs"],"de":["Benötigt Azure Web App-Setup","Begrenzt auf Python- und JSON-Codierkonventionen","Abhängig von OpenAI Vector Stores und SharePoint APIs"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Azure Web App","Limitado a convenções de codificação Python e JSON","Dependente de OpenAI Vector Stores e APIs do SharePoint"],"ru":["Требует настройки Azure Web App","Ограничен соглашениями по кодированию Python и JSON","Зависит от OpenAI Vector Stores и API SharePoint"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق الويب في أزور","محدود بالاتفاقيات البرمجية لبايثون و JSON","يعتمد على OpenAI Vector Stores وواجهات برمجة تطبيقات SharePoint"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yashness/yash-full-stack-personal/primitives', 'community', 'yashness', 'yash-full-stack-personal', 'yashness/yash-full-stack-personal', 'primitives', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:53.971Z', NULL, '{"id":"yashness/yash-full-stack-personal/primitives","name":"primitives","description":{"zh":" primitives","ja":" primitives","ko":" primitives","es":"Las primitivas de UI son componentes personalizables y sin estilo que siguen los patrones de Radix UI. Están diseñados para ser composables y fáciles de usar.","fr":"Les primitives UI sont des composants personnalisables et sans style qui suivent les modèles de Radix UI. Ils sont conçus pour être composables et faciles à utiliser.","de":"Die UI-Primitives sind anpassbare und ungestaltete Komponenten, die den Radix-UI-Mustern folgen. Sie sind dazu entwickelt, komposabel und einfach zu verwenden zu sein.","pt":"Os Primitives são componentes componíveis e sem estilos que seguem os padrões do Radix UI, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem interfaces de usuário personalizadas.","ru":"Примитивы - это составные и нестилизованные компоненты, следующие шаблонам Radix UI, позволяющие разработчикам создавать настраиваемые интерфейсы пользователя.","ar":"المركبات الأساسية هي مكونات قابلة للتركيب وبدون أنماط تتبع معايير Radix UI، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":" primitives","ja":" primitives","ko":" primitives","es":"Primitivas de UI: Componentes personalizables","fr":"Primitives UI: Composants personnalisables","de":"UI-Primitives: Anpassbare Komponenten","pt":"Primitives: Componentes Componíveis para UI","ru":"Примитивы: Компоненты для UI","ar":"المركبات الأساسية: مكونات واجهة المستخدم","en":"primitives"},"description":{"zh":" primitives","ja":" primitives","ko":" primitives","es":"Las primitivas de UI son componentes personalizables y sin estilo que siguen los patrones de Radix UI. Están diseñados para ser composables y fáciles de usar.","fr":"Les primitives UI sont des composants personnalisables et sans style qui suivent les modèles de Radix UI. Ils sont conçus pour être composables et faciles à ...","de":"Die UI-Primitives sind anpassbare und ungestaltete Komponenten, die den Radix-UI-Mustern folgen. Sie sind dazu entwickelt, komposabel und einfach zu verwende...","pt":"Os Primitives são componentes componíveis e sem estilos que seguem os padrões do Radix UI, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem interfaces de usuário pers...","ru":"Примитивы - это составные и нестилизованные компоненты, следующие шаблонам Radix UI, позволяющие разработчикам создавать настраиваемые интерфейсы пользователя.","ar":"المركبات الأساسية هي مكونات قابلة للتركيب وبدون أنماط تتبع معايير Radix UI، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":[" primitives","Radix UI","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","ActionBar"],"ja":[" primitives","Radix UI","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","ActionBar"],"ko":[" primitives","Radix UI","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","ActionBar"],"es":["Componentes personalizables","Sin estilo para una mayor flexibilidad","Sigue los patrones de Radix UI","Composables y fáciles de usar","Ideal para interfaces de usuario personalizadas"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables","Sans style pour une plus grande flexibilité","Suit les modèles de Radix UI","Composables et faciles à utiliser","Idéal pour les interfaces utilisateur personnalisées"],"de":["Anpassbare Komponenten","Ohne Stil für eine größere Flexibilität","Folgt den Radix-UI-Mustern","Komposabel und einfach zu verwenden","Ideal für benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Componentes componíveis","Sem estilos","Segue os padrões do Radix UI","Permite personalização de interfaces de usuário","Inclui componentes como ThreadPrimitive e ComposerPrimitive"],"ru":["Составные компоненты","Нестилизованные","Следуют шаблонам Radix UI","Позволяют настраивать интерфейсы пользователя","Включают компоненты seperti ThreadPrimitive и ComposerPrimitive"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة للتركيب","خالية من الأنماط","تتبع معايير Radix UI","تسمح بتحسين واجهات المستخدم","تتضمن مكونات مثل ThreadPrimitive و ComposerPrimitive"]},"keywords":{"zh":[" primitives","UI","Radix UI","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","ActionBar","UI"],"ja":[" primitives","UI","Radix UI","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","ActionBar","UI"],"ko":[" primitives","UI","Radix UI","ThreadPrimitive","ComposerPrimitive","MessagePrimitive","ActionBar","UI"],"es":["primitivas de ui","componentes personalizables","radix ui","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo de software","diseño de ui"],"fr":["primitives ui","composants personnalisables","radix ui","interfaces utilisateur","développement de logiciels","conception de ui"],"de":["ui-primitives","anpassbare komponenten","radix ui","benutzeroberflächen","software-entwicklung","ui-design"],"pt":["primitives","componentes componíveis","Radix UI","interface de usuário","desenvolvimento de software","componentes de UI"],"ru":["примитивы","составные компоненты","Radix UI","интерфейс пользователя","разработка программного обеспечения","компоненты интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["المركبات الأساسية","مكونات قابلة للتركيب","Radix UI","واجهة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","مكونات واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"yashness","repo":"yash-full-stack-personal","repoPath":"yashness/yash-full-stack-personal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"primitives","description":"Guide for assistant-ui UI primitives - ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, MessagePrimitive. Use when customizing chat UI components.","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# assistant-ui Primitives\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nComposable, unstyled components following Radix UI patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/thread.md](./references/thread.md) -- ThreadPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/composer.md](./references/composer.md) -- ComposerPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/message.md](./references/message.md) -- MessagePrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/action-bar.md](./references/acti","body":"# assistant-ui Primitives\n\n**Always consult [assistant-ui.com/llms.txt](https://assistant-ui.com/llms.txt) for latest API.**\n\nComposable, unstyled components following Radix UI patterns.\n\n## References\n\n- [./references/thread.md](./references/thread.md) -- ThreadPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/composer.md](./references/composer.md) -- ComposerPrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/message.md](./references/message.md) -- MessagePrimitive deep dive\n- [./references/action-bar.md](./references/action-bar.md) -- ActionBarPrimitive deep dive\n\n## Import\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  ThreadPrimitive,\n  ComposerPrimitive,\n  MessagePrimitive,\n  ActionBarPrimitive,\n  BranchPickerPrimitive,\n  AttachmentPrimitive,\n  ThreadListPrimitive,\n  ThreadListItemPrimitive,\n} from \"@assistant-ui/react\";\n```\n\n## Primitive Parts\n\n| Primitive | Key Parts |\n|-----------|-----------|\n| `ThreadPrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Viewport`, `.Messages`, `.Empty`, `.ScrollToBottom` |\n| `ComposerPrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Input`, `.Send`, `.Cancel`, `.Attachments` |\n| `MessagePrimitive` | `.Root`, `.Content`, `.Avatar`, `.If` |\n| `ActionBarPrimitive` | `.Copy`, `.Edit`, `.Reload`, `.Speak` |\n| `BranchPickerPrimitive` | `.Previous`, `.Next`, `.Number`, `.Count` |\n\n## Custom Thread Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction CustomThread() {\n  return (\n    <ThreadPrimitive.Root className=\"flex flex-col h-full\">\n      <ThreadPrimitive.Empty>\n        <div className=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center\">\n          Start a conversation\n        </div>\n      </ThreadPrimitive.Empty>\n\n      <ThreadPrimitive.Viewport className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4\">\n        <ThreadPrimitive.Messages components={{\n          UserMessage: CustomUserMessage,\n          AssistantMessage: CustomAssistantMessage,\n        }} />\n      </ThreadPrimitive.Viewport>\n\n      <ComposerPrimitive.Root className=\"border-t p-4 flex gap-2\">\n        <ComposerPrimitive.Input className=\"flex-1 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2\" />\n        <ComposerPrimitive.Send className=\"bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg\">\n          Send\n        </ComposerPrimitive.Send>\n      </ComposerPrimitive.Root>\n    </ThreadPrimitive.Root>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Conditional Rendering\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.If user>User only</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If assistant>Assistant only</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If running>Generating...</MessagePrimitive.If>\n<MessagePrimitive.If hasBranches>Has edit history</MessagePrimitive.If>\n\n<ComposerPrimitive.If submitting>\n  <ComposerPrimitive.Cancel>Stop</ComposerPrimitive.Cancel>\n</ComposerPrimitive.If>\n\n<ThreadPrimitive.If empty>No messages</ThreadPrimitive.If>\n```\n\n## Content Parts\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.Content components={{\n  Text: ({ part }) => <p>{part.text}</p>,\n  Image: ({ part }) => <img src={part.image} alt=\"\" />,\n  ToolCall: ({ part }) => <div>Tool: {part.toolName}</div>,\n  Reasoning: ({ part }) => <details><summary>Thinking</summary>{part.text}</details>,\n}} />\n```\n\n## Branch Picker\n\n```tsx\n<MessagePrimitive.If hasBranches>\n  <BranchPickerPrimitive.Root className=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n    <BranchPickerPrimitive.Previous>←</BranchPickerPrimitive.Previous>\n    <span><BranchPickerPrimitive.Number /> / <BranchPickerPrimitive.Count /></span>\n    <BranchPickerPrimitive.Next>→</BranchPickerPrimitive.Next>\n  </BranchPickerPrimitive.Root>\n</MessagePrimitive.If>\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n**Primitives not rendering**\n- Wrap in `AssistantRuntimeProvider`\n- Ensure parent primitive provides context\n\n**Styles not applying**\n- Primitives are unstyled by default\n- Add className or use `@assistant-ui/styles`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:53.971Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing customizable, unstyled UI components following Radix UI patterns.","zh":"非常适合需要可定制、无样式 UI 组件的前端代理，遵循 Radix UI 模式。","ja":"Radix UI パターンに従ったカスタマイズ可能でスタイルのない UI コンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI 패턴을 따르는 사용자 지정 가능하고 스타일이 없는 UI 컴포넌트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables y sin estilo, siguiendo los patrones de Radix UI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables et non stylisés, suivant les modèles de Radix UI.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die anpassbare, ungestylte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die den Radix-UI-Mustern folgen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de componentes de UI personalizáveis e sem estilos, seguindo os padrões da Radix UI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы настраиваемые, нестилизованные компоненты UI, следующие шаблонам Radix UI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للتعديل وغير المُصممة، تتبع أنماط Radix UI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compose UI elements using Radix UI primitives, enabling seamless integration with ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive, and MessagePrimitive components, while leveraging references from assistant-ui.com for the latest API.","zh":"赋予代理组合 UI 元素使用 Radix UI 原语的能力，实现与 ThreadPrimitive、ComposerPrimitive 和 MessagePrimitive 组件的无缝集成，同时利用 assistant-ui.com 的最新 API 参考。","ja":"Radix UI プリミティブを使用して UI 要素を組み合わせるエージェントの能力を提供し、ThreadPrimitive、ComposerPrimitive、MessagePrimitive コンポーネントとのシームレスな統合を実現し、同時に assistant-ui.com の最新 API リファレンスを利用します。","ko":"Radix UI 기본 요소를 사용하여 UI 요소를 구성하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive 및 MessagePrimitive 컴포넌트와의 무휴 통합을 가능하게 하며 동시에 assistant-ui.com의 최신 API 참조를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a componer elementos de interfaz de usuario utilizando primitivas de Radix UI, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con los componentes ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive y MessagePrimitive, mientras se aprovechan las referencias de assistant-ui.com para la última API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de composer des éléments d''interface utilisateur en utilisant les primitives de Radix UI, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec les composants ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive et MessagePrimitive, tout en exploitant les références de assistant-ui.com pour la dernière API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Benutzeroberflächenelemente mit Radix-UI-Primitiven zu komponieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit den Komponenten ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive und MessagePrimitive ermöglicht wird, während die Referenzen von assistant-ui.com für die neueste API genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compor elementos de UI usando primitivos da Radix UI, permitindo uma integração perfeita com os componentes ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive e MessagePrimitive, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita referências do assistant-ui.com para a última API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью составлять элементы UI с использованием примитивов Radix UI, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с компонентами ThreadPrimitive, ComposerPrimitive и MessagePrimitive, а также используя ссылки с assistant-ui.com для последней версии API.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تكوين عناصر واجهة المستخدم باستخدام البريميتيفات من Radix UI، ويتوافق بشكل متوافق مع مكونات ThreadPrimitive و ComposerPrimitive و MessagePrimitive، في الوقت نفسه يستفيد من المراجع من assistant-ui.com لأحدث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Composing reusable UI components for multi-agent interfaces","Customizing ThreadPrimitive for advanced conversation threading","Integrating ComposerPrimitive for enhanced message composition capabilities"],"zh":["为多代理接口组合可重用 UI 组件","自定义 ThreadPrimitive 以实现高级对话线程","集成 ComposerPrimitive 以增强消息组成能力"],"ja":["マルチエージェントインターフェイス用の再利用可能な UI コンポーネントを組み合わせる","ThreadPrimitive をカスタマイズして高度な会話スレッドを実現する","ComposerPrimitive を統合してメッセージ作成機能を強化する"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 인터페이스용 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구성","고급 대화 스레드를 实现하기 위한 ThreadPrimitive 사용자 지정","메시지 작성 능력增强을 위한 ComposerPrimitive 통합"],"es":["Componer componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables para interfaces de multiagente","Personalizar ThreadPrimitive para un enrutamiento de conversación avanzado","Integrar ComposerPrimitive para mejorar las capacidades de composición de mensajes"],"fr":["Composer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables pour les interfaces multi-agents","Personnaliser ThreadPrimitive pour un fil de conversation avancé","Intégrer ComposerPrimitive pour améliorer les capacités de composition de messages"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für Multiagenten-Schnittstellen komponieren","ThreadPrimitive anpassen, um erweiterte Konversationsverläufe zu ermöglichen","ComposerPrimitive integrieren, um die Nachrichtenkompositionsfähigkeiten zu verbessern"],"pt":["Compor componentes de UI reutilizáveis para interfaces de multi-agente","Personalizar ThreadPrimitive para encaminhamento de conversa avançado","Integrar ComposerPrimitive para capacidades de composição de mensagens aprimoradas"],"ru":["Составление многократно используемых компонентов UI для интерфейсов многого агента","Настройка ThreadPrimitive для расширенного потока разговора","Интеграция ComposerPrimitive для расширенных возможностей составления сообщений"],"ar":["تكوين مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمواجهات متعددة للوكيل","تخصيص ThreadPrimitive للتحويل المتقدم للمحادثة","دمج ComposerPrimitive لتعزيز قدرات تكوين الرسائل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the latest API at assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Specific to Radix UI patterns and primitives"],"zh":["需要咨询 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt 的最新 API","仅限 Radix UI 模式和原语"],"ja":["最新 API を確認するために assistant-ui.com/llms.txt を参照する必要がある","Radix UI パターンとプリミティブに限定される"],"ko":["최신 API를 확인하기 위해 assistant-ui.com/llms.txt를 참조해야 함","Radix UI 패턴 및 기본 요소에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la última API en assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Específico para los patrones y primitivas de Radix UI"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la dernière API sur assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Spécifique aux modèles et primitives de Radix UI"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der neuesten API unter assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Spezifisch für Radix-UI-Muster und -Primitiven"],"pt":["Exige consulta da última API em assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Específico para padrões e primitivos da Radix UI"],"ru":["Требует консультации последней версии API на assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","Конкретно для шаблонов и примитивов Radix UI"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة أحدث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات على assistant-ui.com/llms.txt","محدد لأنماط وبريميتيفات Radix UI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ollieb89/ml_challenges/monorepo-management', 'community', 'ollieb89', 'ml_challenges', 'ollieb89/ml_challenges', 'monorepo-management', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:44:21.476Z', NULL, '{"id":"ollieb89/ml_challenges/monorepo-management","name":"monorepo-management","description":{"zh":"Monorepo管理使您能够构建高效可扩展的代码仓库，实现代码共享、工具一致性和原子化变更","ja":"モノレポ管理により、効率的かつスケーラブルなコードリポジトリを構築してコードの共有、ツールの統一、原子的な変更を実現","ko":"모노레포 관리를 통해 효율적이고 확장 가능한 코드 저장소를 구축하고 코드 공유, 도구 일관성 및 원자적 변경을实现","es":"La gestión de monorepo permite crear proyectos escalables y eficientes con código compartido y herramientas consistentes","fr":"La gestion de monorepo permet de créer des projets scalables et efficaces avec du code partagé et des outils cohérents","de":"Die Monorepo-Verwaltung ermöglicht die Erstellung von skalierbaren und effizienten Projekten mit geteiltem Code und konsistenten Tools","pt":"O gerenciamento de monorepo permite a criação de repositórios eficientes e escaláveis para compartilhar código e melhorar a produtividade da equipe","ru":"Управление монорепо позволяет создавать эффективные и масштабируемые репозитории для обмена кодом и повышения производительности команды","ar":"إدارة مونوريبو تمكن من إنشاء مستودعات فعالة وقابلة للتوسيع لمشاركة الكود وتحسين إنتاجية الفريق","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Monorepo管理：构建高效可扩展的代码仓库","ja":"モノレポ管理：効率的かつスケーラブルなコードリポジトリを構築","ko":"모노레포 관리: 효율적이고 확장 가능한 코드 저장소 구축","es":"Gestión de Monorepo: Eficiencia y Escalabilidad","fr":"Gestion de Monorepo: Efficacité et Scalabilité","de":"Monorepo-Verwaltung: Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit","pt":"Gerenciamento de Monorepo: Otimização de Código","ru":"Управление Монорепо: Эффективное Кодирование","ar":"إدارة مونوريبو: تحسين الكود","en":"monorepo-management"},"description":{"zh":"Monorepo管理使您能够构建高效可扩展的代码仓库，实现代码共享、工具一致性和原子化变更","ja":"モノレポ管理により、効率的かつスケーラブルなコードリポジトリを構築してコードの共有、ツールの統一、原子的な変更を実現","ko":"모노레포 관리를 통해 효율적이고 확장 가능한 코드 저장소를 구축하고 코드 공유, 도구 일관성 및 원자적 변경을实现","es":"La gestión de monorepo permite crear proyectos escalables y eficientes con código compartido y herramientas consistentes","fr":"La gestion de monorepo permet de créer des projets scalables et efficaces avec du code partagé et des outils cohérents","de":"Die Monorepo-Verwaltung ermöglicht die Erstellung von skalierbaren und effizienten Projekten mit geteiltem Code und konsistenten Tools","pt":"O gerenciamento de monorepo permite a criação de repositórios eficientes e escaláveis para compartilhar código e melhorar a produtividade da equipe","ru":"Управление монорепо позволяет создавать эффективные и масштабируемые репозитории для обмена кодом и повышения производительности команды","ar":"إدارة مونوريبو تمكن من إنشاء مستودعات فعالة وقابلة للتوسيع لمشاركة الكود وتحسين إنتاجية الفريق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码共享","工具一致性","原子化变更","CI/CD集成","包版本管理","调试支持"],"ja":["コードの共有","ツールの統一","原子的な変更","CI/CDの統合","パッケージのバージョン管理","デバッグのサポート"],"ko":["코드 공유","도구 일관성","원자적 변경","CI/CD 통합","패키지 버전 관리","디버깅 지원"],"es":["Creación de monorepos escalables","Compartir código y herramientas","Cambios atómicos en múltiples paquetes","Optimización del rendimiento de compilación y prueba","Gestión de dependencias compartidas"],"fr":["Création de monorepos scalables","Partage de code et d''outils","Changements atomiques dans plusieurs packages","Optimisation des performances de compilation et de test","Gestion de dépendances partagées"],"de":["Erstellung von skalierbaren Monorepos","Teilen von Code und Tools","Atomare Änderungen in mehreren Paketen","Optimierung der Build- und Testleistung","Verwaltung von geteilten Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Criação de monorepos eficientes","Otimização de build e testes","Gerenciamento de dependências compartilhadas","Implantação de estratégias de compartilhamento de código","Configuração de CI/CD para monorepos","Depuração de problemas específicos de monorepo"],"ru":["Создание эффективных монорепо","Оптимизация сборки и тестирования","Управление общими зависимостями","Реализация стратегий обмена кодом","Настройка CI/CD для монорепо","Отладка проблем, специфичных для монорепо"],"ar":["إنشاء مونوريبوهات فعالة","تحسين البناء والاختبارات","إدارة التبعيات المشتركة","تنفيذ استراتيجيات مشاركة الكود","تكوين CI/CD لمونوريبوهات","تصحيح مشاكل محددة لمونوريبوهات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Monorepo","代码仓库","代码共享","工具一致性","原子化变更","CI/CD","包版本管理","调试"],"ja":["モノレポ","コードリポジトリ","コードの共有","ツールの統一","原子的な変更","CI/CD","パッケージのバージョン管理","デバッグ"],"ko":["모노레포","코드 저장소","코드 공유","도구 일관성","원자적 변경","CI/CD","패키지 버전 관리","디버깅"],"es":["monorepo","gestión de monorepo","desarrollo de software","code sharing","herramientas de desarrollo","escalabilidad","eficiencia"],"fr":["monorepo","gestion de monorepo","développement de logiciels","partage de code","outils de développement","scalabilité","efficacité"],"de":["monorepo","monorepo-verwaltung","softwareentwicklung","code-teilen","entwicklungstools","skalierbarkeit","effizienz"],"pt":["monorepo","gerenciamento de monorepo","otimização de código","compartilhamento de código","produtividade da equipe","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","ci/cd","devops"],"ru":["монорепо","управление монорепо","эффективное кодирование","обмен кодом","производительность команды","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","ci/cd","devops"],"ar":["مونوريبو","إدارة مونوريبو","تحسين الكود","مشاركة الكود","إنتاجية الفريق","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","ci/cd","devops"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"ml_challenges","repoPath":"ollieb89/ml_challenges","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monorepo-management","description":"Master monorepo management with Turborepo, Nx, and pnpm workspaces to build efficient, scalable multi-package repositories with optimized builds and dependency management. Use when setting up monorepos, optimizing builds, or managing shared dependencies.","bodyPreview":"# Monorepo Management\n\nBuild efficient, scalable monorepos that enable code sharing, consistent tooling, and atomic changes across multiple packages and applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new monorepo projects\n- Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo\n- Optimizing build and test performance\n- Managing shared dependencies\n- Implementing code sharing strategies\n- Setting up CI/CD for monorepos\n- Versioning and publishing packages\n- Debugging monorepo-specific issues\n\n## Core Conc","body":"# Monorepo Management\n\nBuild efficient, scalable monorepos that enable code sharing, consistent tooling, and atomic changes across multiple packages and applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new monorepo projects\n- Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo\n- Optimizing build and test performance\n- Managing shared dependencies\n- Implementing code sharing strategies\n- Setting up CI/CD for monorepos\n- Versioning and publishing packages\n- Debugging monorepo-specific issues\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Why Monorepos?\n\n**Advantages:**\n- Shared code and dependencies\n- Atomic commits across projects\n- Consistent tooling and standards\n- Easier refactoring\n- Simplified dependency management\n- Better code visibility\n\n**Challenges:**\n- Build performance at scale\n- CI/CD complexity\n- Access control\n- Large Git repository\n\n### 2. Monorepo Tools\n\n**Package Managers:**\n- pnpm workspaces (recommended)\n- npm workspaces\n- Yarn workspaces\n\n**Build Systems:**\n- Turborepo (recommended for most)\n- Nx (feature-rich, complex)\n- Lerna (older, maintenance mode)\n\n## Turborepo Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create new monorepo\nnpx create-turbo@latest my-monorepo\ncd my-monorepo\n\n# Structure:\n# apps/\n#   web/          - Next.js app\n#   docs/         - Documentation site\n# packages/\n#   ui/           - Shared UI components\n#   config/       - Shared configurations\n#   tsconfig/     - Shared TypeScript configs\n# turbo.json      - Turborepo configuration\n# package.json    - Root package.json\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```json\n// turbo.json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://turbo.build/schema.json\",\n  \"globalDependencies\": [\"**/.env.*local\"],\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\", \"!.next/cache/**\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"coverage/**\"]\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"outputs\": []\n    },\n    \"dev\": {\n      \"cache\": false,\n      \"persistent\": true\n    },\n    \"type-check\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": []\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```json\n// package.json (root)\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-monorepo\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"workspaces\": [\n    \"apps/*\",\n    \"packages/*\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"turbo run build\",\n    \"dev\": \"turbo run dev\",\n    \"test\": \"turbo run test\",\n    \"lint\": \"turbo run lint\",\n    \"format\": \"prettier --write \\\"**/*.{ts,tsx,md}\\\"\",\n    \"clean\": \"turbo run clean && rm -rf node_modules\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"turbo\": \"^1.10.0\",\n    \"prettier\": \"^3.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@8.0.0\"\n}\n```\n\n### Package Structure\n\n```json\n// packages/ui/package.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"@repo/ui\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"main\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"import\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\"\n    },\n    \"./button\": {\n      \"import\": \"./dist/button.js\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/button.d.ts\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsup src/index.ts --format esm,cjs --dts\",\n    \"dev\": \"tsup src/index.ts --format esm,cjs --dts --watch\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint src/\",\n    \"type-check\": \"tsc --noEmit\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@repo/tsconfig\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"tsup\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"^18.2.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## pnpm Workspaces\n\n### Setup\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''apps/*''\n  - ''packages/*''\n  - ''tools/*''\n```\n\n```json\n// .npmrc\n# Hoist shared dependencies\nshamefully-hoist=true\n\n# Strict peer dependencies\nauto-install-peers=true\nstrict-peer-dependencies=true\n\n# Performance\nstore-dir=~/.pnpm-store\n```\n\n### Dependency Management\n\n```bash\n# Install dependency in specific package\npnpm add react --filter @repo/ui\npnpm add -D typescript --filter @repo/ui\n\n# Install workspace dependency\npnpm add @repo/ui --filter web\n\n# Install in all packages\npnpm add -D eslint -w\n\n# Update all dependencies\npnpm update -r\n\n# Remove dependency\npnpm remove react --filter @repo/ui\n```\n\n### Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Run script in specific package\npnpm --filter web dev\npnpm --filter @repo/ui build\n\n# Run in all packages\npnpm -r build\npnpm -r test\n\n# Run in parallel\npnpm -r --parallel dev\n\n# Filter by pattern\npnpm --filter \"@repo/*\" build\npnpm --filter \"...web\" build  # Build web and dependencies\n```\n\n## Nx Monorepo\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create Nx monorepo\nnpx create-nx-workspace@latest my-org\n\n# Generate applications\nnx generate @nx/react:app my-app\nnx generate @nx/next:app my-next-app\n\n# Generate libraries\nnx generate @nx/react:lib ui-components\nnx generate @nx/js:lib utils\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```json\n// nx.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"nx/presets/npm.json\",\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"inputs\": [\"production\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\", \"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\"{projectRoot}/**/*\", \"sharedGlobals\"],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Running Tasks\n\n```bash\n# Run task for specific project\nnx build my-app\nnx test ui-components\nnx lint utils\n\n# Run for affected projects\nnx affected:build\nnx affected:test --base=main\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnx graph\n\n# Run in parallel\nnx run-many --target=build --all --parallel=3\n```\n\n## Shared Configurations\n\n### TypeScript Configuration\n\n```json\n// packages/tsconfig/base.json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n\n// packages/tsconfig/react.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"./base.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"]\n  }\n}\n\n// apps/web/tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"@repo/tsconfig/react.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n### ESLint Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// packages/config/eslint-preset.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [\n    ''eslint:recommended'',\n    ''plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended'',\n    ''plugin:react/recommended'',\n    ''plugin:react-hooks/recommended'',\n    ''prettier'',\n  ],\n  plugins: [''@typescript-eslint'', ''react'', ''react-hooks''],\n  parser: ''@typescript-eslint/parser'',\n  parserOptions: {\n    ecmaVersion: 2022,\n    sourceType: ''module'',\n    ecmaFeatures: {\n      jsx: true,\n    },\n  },\n  settings: {\n    react: {\n      version: ''detect'',\n    },\n  },\n  rules: {\n    ''@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars'': ''error'',\n    ''react/react-in-jsx-scope'': ''off'',\n  },\n};\n\n// apps/web/.eslintrc.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [''@repo/config/eslint-preset''],\n  rules: {\n    // App-specific rules\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Code Sharing Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Shared UI Components\n\n```typescript\n// packages/ui/src/button.tsx\nimport * as React from ''react'';\n\nexport interface ButtonProps {\n  variant?: ''primary'' | ''secondary'';\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n  onClick?: () => void;\n}\n\nexport function Button({ variant = ''primary'', children, onClick }: ButtonProps) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={`btn btn-${variant}`}\n      onClick={onClick}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n\n// packages/ui/src/index.ts\nexport { Button, type ButtonProps } from ''./button'';\nexport { Input, type InputProps } from ''./input'';\n\n// apps/web/src/app.tsx\nimport { Button } from ''@repo/ui'';\n\nexport function App() {\n  return <Button variant=\"primary\">Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Shared Utilities\n\n```typescript\n// packages/utils/src/string.ts\nexport function capitalize(str: string): string {\n  return str.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + str.slice(1);\n}\n\nexport function truncate(str: string, length: number): string {\n  return str.length > length ? str.slice(0, length) + ''...'' : str;\n}\n\n// packages/utils/src/index.ts\nexport * from ''./string'';\nexport * from ''./array'';\nexport * from ''./date'';\n\n// Usage in apps\nimport { capitalize, truncate } from ''@repo/utils'';\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Shared Types\n\n```typescript\n// packages/types/src/user.ts\nexport interface User {\n  id: string;\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n  role: ''admin'' | ''user'';\n}\n\nexport interface CreateUserInput {\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\n// Used in both frontend and backend\nimport type { User, CreateUserInput } from ''@repo/types'';\n```\n\n## Build Optimization\n\n### Turborepo Caching\n\n```json\n// turbo.json\n{\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      // Build depends on dependencies being built first\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n\n      // Cache these outputs\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\"],\n\n      // Cache based on these inputs (default: all files)\n      \"inputs\": [\"src/**/*.tsx\", \"src/**/*.ts\", \"package.json\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      // Run tests in parallel, don''t depend on build\n      \"cache\": true,\n      \"outputs\": [\"coverage/**\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Remote Caching\n\n```bash\n# Turborepo Remote Cache (Vercel)\nnpx turbo login\nnpx turbo link\n\n# Custom remote cache\n# turbo.json\n{\n  \"remoteCache\": {\n    \"signature\": true,\n    \"enabled\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## CI/CD for Monorepos\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0  # For Nx affected commands\n\n      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2\n        with:\n          version: 8\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3\n        with:\n          node-version: 18\n          cache: ''pnpm''\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: pnpm turbo run build\n\n      - name: Test\n        run: pnpm turbo run test\n\n      - name: Lint\n        run: pnpm turbo run lint\n\n      - name: Type check\n        run: pnpm turbo run type-check\n```\n\n### Deploy Affected Only\n\n```yaml\n# Deploy only changed apps\n- name: Deploy affected apps\n  run: |\n    if pnpm nx affected:apps --base=origin/main --head=HEAD | grep -q \"web\"; then\n      echo \"Deploying web app\"\n      pnpm --filter web deploy\n    fi\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Consistent Versioning**: Lock dependency versions across workspace\n2. **Shared Configs**: Centralize ESLint, TypeScript, Prettier configs\n3. **Dependency Graph**: Keep it acyclic, avoid circular dependencies\n4. **Cache Effectively**: Configure inputs/outputs correctly\n5. **Type Safety**: Share types between frontend/backend\n6. **Testing Strategy**: Unit tests in packages, E2E in apps\n7. **Documentation**: README in each package\n8. **Release Strategy**: Use changesets for versioning\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Circular Dependencies**: A depends on B, B depends on A\n- **Phantom Dependencies**: Using deps not in package.json\n- **Incorrect Cache Inputs**: Missing files in Turborepo inputs\n- **Over-Sharing**: Sharing code that should be separate\n- **Under-Sharing**: Duplicating code across packages\n- **Large Monorepos**: Without proper tooling, builds slow down\n\n## Publishing Packages\n\n```bash\n# Using Changesets\npnpm add -Dw @changesets/cli\npnpm changeset init\n\n# Create changeset\npnpm changeset\n\n# Version packages\npnpm changeset version\n\n# Publish\npnpm changeset publish\n```\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/release.yml\n- name: Create Release Pull Request or Publish\n  uses: changesets/action@v1\n  with:\n    publish: pnpm release\n  env:\n    GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n    NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/turborepo-guide.md**: Comprehensive Turborepo documentation\n- **references/nx-guide.md**: Nx monorepo patterns\n- **references/pnpm-workspaces.md**: pnpm workspace features\n- **assets/monorepo-checklist.md**: Setup checklist\n- **assets/migration-guide.md**: Multi-repo to monorepo migration\n- **scripts/dependency-graph.ts**: Visualize package dependencies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:44:21.476Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing efficient monorepo setup and management for scalable code sharing and atomic changes across packages and applications.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的单体仓库设置和管理的DevOps代理，实现可扩展的代码共享和跨包和应用程序的原子更改。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが効率的なモノリポ設定と管理を必要とする場合に最適です。パッケージとアプリケーション全体でコード共有と原子的な変更を実現します。","ko":"효율적인 모노리포 설정 및 관리가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 패키지 및 애플리케이션 간에 코드 공유 및 원자적 변경을 구현합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una configuración y administración de monorepo eficientes para el intercambio de código escalable y cambios atómicos en paquetes y aplicaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une configuration et d''une gestion de monorepo efficaces pour le partage de code évolutif et les modifications atomiques entre packages et applications.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine effiziente Monorepo-Konfiguration und -verwaltung für skalierbares Code-Teilen und atomare Änderungen in Paketen und Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de uma configuração e gerenciamento de monorepo eficientes para compartilhamento de código escalável e alterações atômicas em pacotes e aplicativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется эффективная настройка и управление монорепозиторием для масштабируемого обмена кодом и атомарных изменений в пакетах и приложениях.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد وادارة مونو ريبوزиторي كفؤ للتبادل الكودي القابل للتوسيع والتغييرات الذرية عبر الحزم والتطبيقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage shared dependencies, implement code sharing strategies, and set up CI/CD pipelines for monorepos, utilizing versioning and publishing protocols for optimized build and test performance.","zh":"赋予代理管理共享依赖项、实施代码共享策略和为单体仓库设置CI/CD管道的能力，利用版本控制和发布协议优化构建和测试性能。","ja":"エージェントが共有依存関係を管理し、コード共有戦略を実装し、モノリポのCI/CDパイプラインを設定することを可能にします。バージョニングとパブリッシングのプロトコルを使用してビルドとテストのパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 공유 의존성을 관리하고 코드 공유 전략을 구현하며 모노리포의 CI/CD 파이프라인을 설정할 수 있도록 합니다. 버저닝 및 퍼블리싱 프로토콜을 사용하여 빌드 및 테스트 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar dependencias compartidas, implementar estrategias de intercambio de código y configurar tuberías de CI/CD para monorepos, utilizando protocolos de versionado y publicación para un rendimiento de compilación y prueba optimizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les dépendances partagées, de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de partage de code et de configurer des pipelines de CI/CD pour les monorepos, en utilisant des protocoles de versionnage et de publication pour un rendement de construction et de test optimisé.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, gemeinsame Abhängigkeiten zu verwalten, Code-Teilungsstrategien umzusetzen und CI/CD-Pipelines für Monorepos einzurichten, indem Versionierungs- und Veröffentlichungsprotokolle für ein optimiertes Build- und Testverhalten verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar dependências compartilhadas, implementar estratégias de compartilhamento de código e configurar pipelines de CI/CD para monorepos, utilizando protocolos de versionamento e publicação para desempenho de compilação e teste otimizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять общими зависимостями, реализовывать стратегии обмена кодом и настраивать конвейеры CI/CD для монорепозиториев, используя протоколы версионирования и публикации для оптимизации производительности сборки и тестирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الاعتماديات المشتركة وتنفيذ استراتيجيات لمشاركة الكود وضبط خطوط أنابيب CI/CD ل monorepos، باستخدام بروتوكولات الإصدار والنشر لتحسين أداء بناء الاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating multi-repo projects to monorepo for streamlined development","Optimizing build and test performance in large-scale monorepo environments","Implementing atomic changes and versioning across multiple packages and applications"],"zh":["将多仓库项目迁移到单体仓库以实现流畅的开发","在大规模单体仓库环境中优化构建和测试性能","跨多个包和应用程序实现原子更改和版本控制"],"ja":["マルチリポジトリプロジェクトをモノリポに移行して開発をストリーミングする","大規模なモノリポ環境でのビルドとテストのパフォーマンスを最適化する","複数のパッケージとアプリケーション全体で原子的な変更とバージョニングを実現する"],"ko":["다중 저장소 프로젝트를 모노리포로 마이그레이션하여 개발을 스트리밍하는 것","대규모 모노리포 환경에서 빌드 및 테스트 성능을 최적화하는 것","여러 패키지 및 애플리케이션에서 원자적 변경 및 버저닝을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Migrar proyectos de multi-repo a monorepo para un desarrollo fluido","Optimizar el rendimiento de compilación y prueba en entornos de monorepo a gran escala","Implementar cambios atómicos y versionado en varios paquetes y aplicaciones"],"fr":["Migrer des projets multi-repo vers des monorepos pour un développement fluide","Optimiser les performances de construction et de test dans des environnements de monorepo à grande échelle","Mettre en œuvre des modifications atomiques et un versionnage sur plusieurs packages et applications"],"de":["Migrieren von Multi-Repo-Projekten zu Monorepos für eine flüssige Entwicklung","Optimieren des Build- und Testverhaltens in großen Monorepo-Umgebungen","Implementieren von atomaren Änderungen und Versionierung in mehreren Paketen und Anwendungen"],"pt":["Migrar projetos multi-repo para monorepo para desenvolvimento simplificado","Otimizar o desempenho de compilação e teste em ambientes de monorepo de grande escala","Implementar alterações atômicas e versionamento em vários pacotes e aplicativos"],"ru":["Переносить проекты с несколькими репозиториями в монорепозиторий для упрощенного развития","Оптимизировать производительность сборки и тестирования в средах монорепозитория крупного масштаба","Реализовывать атомарные изменения и версионирование в нескольких пакетах и приложениях"],"ar":["نقل مشاريع متعددة المستودعات إلى مونو ريبوزиторي من أجل تطوير مبسط","تحسين أداء بناء الاختبار في بيئات مونو ريبوزиторي ذات حجم كبير","تنفيذ التغييرات الذرية وتأشير الإصدار عبر حزم وتطبيقات متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive understanding of monorepo architecture and CI/CD pipelines","May necessitate adjustments for compatibility with diverse package managers and build tools"],"zh":["需要对单体仓库架构和CI/CD管道有全面的了解","可能需要对包管理器和构建工具的兼容性进行调整"],"ja":["モノリポアーキテクチャとCI/CDパイプラインを包括的に理解する必要がある","パッケージマネージャーとビルドツールの互換性に調整が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["모노리포 아키텍처 및 CI/CD 파이프라인에 대한 포괄적인 이해가 필요","패키지 매니저 및 빌드 도구의 호환성을 조정해야 할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión integral de la arquitectura de monorepo y las tuberías de CI/CD","Puede necesitar ajustes para ser compatible con diversos administradores de paquetes y herramientas de compilación"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension complète de l''architecture de monorepo et des pipelines de CI/CD","Peut nécessiter des ajustements pour être compatible avec des gestionnaires de packages et des outils de construction divers"],"de":["Erfordert ein umfassendes Verständnis der Monorepo-Architektur und der CI/CD-Pipelines","Kann Anpassungen für die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Paketmanagern und Build-Tools erfordern"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão abrangente da arquitetura de monorepo e pipelines de CI/CD","Pode necessitar de ajustes para compatibilidade com gerenciadores de pacotes e ferramentas de compilação diversificados"],"ru":["Требует всестороннего понимания архитектуры монорепозитория и конвейеров CI/CD","Может потребовать корректировок для совместимости с различными менеджерами пакетов и инструментами сборки"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا شاملاً لعمارة مونو ريبوزиторي وأنابيب CI/CD","قد يحتاج إلى تعديلات للتوافق مع مديري حزم وأدوات بناء متنوعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
