برمجة التطبيقات","اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة بشأن أنواع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","نماذج تسمية الموارد","طرق HTTP وأكواد الحالة","شجرة القرارات لــ REST و GraphQL و tRPC"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 设计模式","REST API","GraphQL API","tRPC API","API 设计原则","API 开发最佳实践"],"ja":["API デザイン パターン","REST API","GraphQL API","tRPC API","API 設計原則","API 開発ベスト プラクティス"],"ko":["API 디자인 패턴","REST API","GraphQL API","tRPC API","API 설계 원칙","API 개발 모범 사례"],"es":["patrones de API","diseño de API","API REST","API GraphQL","arquitectura de API","desarrollo de API","API efectivas","principios de diseño de API"],"fr":["modèles d''API","conception d''API","API REST","API GraphQL","architecture d''API","développement d''API","API efficaces","principes de conception d''API"],"de":["API-Muster","API-Entwurf","REST-API","GraphQL-API","API-Architektur","API-Entwicklung","effektive APIs","Designprinzipien für APIs"],"pt":["padrões de API","design de API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","desenvolvimento de API","princípios de design","tomada de decisão"],"ru":["шаблоны API","дизайн API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","разработка API","принципы дизайна","принятие решений"],"ar":["نماذج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","مبادئ تصميم","اتخاذ القرارات"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-patterns","description":"API design principles and decision-making. REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC selection, response formats, versioning, pagination.","bodyPreview":"# API Patterns\n\n> API design principles and decision-making for 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not copy fixed patterns.**\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `api-style.md` | REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC decision tree | Choosing API type |\n| `rest.md` | Resource naming, HTTP methods, status codes | Designing REST API |\n| `","body":"# API Patterns\n\n> API design principles and decision-making for 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not copy fixed patterns.**\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `api-style.md` | REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC decision tree | Choosing API type |\n| `rest.md` | Resource naming, HTTP methods, status codes | Designing REST API |\n| `response.md` | Envelope pattern, error format, pagination | Response structure |\n| `graphql.md` | Schema design, when to use, security | Considering GraphQL |\n| `trpc.md` | TypeScript monorepo, type safety | TS fullstack projects |\n| `versioning.md` | URI/Header/Query versioning | API evolution planning |\n| `auth.md` | JWT, OAuth, Passkey, API Keys | Auth pattern selection |\n| `rate-limiting.md` | Token bucket, sliding window | API protection |\n| `documentation.md` | OpenAPI/Swagger best practices | Documentation |\n| `security-testing.md` | OWASP API Top 10, auth/authz testing | Security audits |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Skills\n\n| Need | Skill |\n|------|-------|\n| API implementation | `@[skills/backend-development]` |\n| Data structure | `@[skills/database-design]` |\n| Security details | `@[skills/security-hardening]` |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Decision Checklist\n\nBefore designing an API:\n\n- [ ] **Asked user about API consumers?**\n- [ ] **Chosen API style for THIS context?** (REST/GraphQL/tRPC)\n- [ ] **Defined consistent response format?**\n- [ ] **Planned versioning strategy?**\n- [ ] **Considered authentication needs?**\n- [ ] **Planned rate limiting?**\n- [ ] **Documentation approach defined?**\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Anti-Patterns\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Default to REST for everything\n- Use verbs in REST endpoints (/getUsers)\n- Return inconsistent response formats\n- Expose internal errors to clients\n- Skip rate limiting\n\n**DO:**\n- Choose API style based on context\n- Ask about client requirements\n- Document thoroughly\n- Use appropriate status codes\n\n---\n\n## Script\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/api_validator.py` | API endpoint validation | `python scripts/api_validator.py <project_path>` |\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:32.874Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API-focused Agents needing informed decision-making on REST, GraphQL, and tRPC protocols.","zh":"适合需要在REST、GraphQL和tRPC协议上进行明智决策的API关注型Agent。","ja":"REST、GraphQL、tRPCプロトコルで情報に基づいた意思決定を必要とするAPI重点のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"REST, GraphQL 및 tRPC 프로토콜에서 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 필요로 하는 API 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en API que necesitan toma de decisiones informadas sobre los protocolos REST, GraphQL y tRPC.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''API nécessitant une prise de décision éclairée sur les protocoles REST, GraphQL et tRPC.","de":"Perfekt für API-fokussierte Agenten, die für die Protokolle REST, GraphQL und tRPC eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em API que necessitam de tomada de decisões informadas sobre os protocolos REST, GraphQL e tRPC.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на API, которым необходимы обоснованные решения по протоколам REST, GraphQL и tRPC.","ar":"مثالي لعميل برمجي يركز على واجهات برمجة التطبيقات التي تحتاج إلى اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة حول بروتوكولات REST وGraphQL وtRPC."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design robust APIs using decision trees, resource naming conventions, and HTTP methods, while considering status codes and API styles like REST, GraphQL, and tRPC.","zh":"赋予代理设计强大的API的能力，使用决策树、资源命名约定和HTTP方法，同时考虑状态代码和API风格，如REST、GraphQL和tRPC。","ja":"エージェントが、REST、GraphQL、tRPCなどのAPIスタイルやステータスコードを考慮しながら、意思決定ツリー、リソース命名規則、HTTPメソッドを使用して堅牢なAPIを設計できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 REST, GraphQL, tRPC 등의 API 스타일 및 상태 코드를 고려하면서 결정 트리, 리소스 명명 규칙 및 HTTP 메서드를 사용하여 강력한 API를 설계할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar API robustas utilizando árboles de decisión, convenciones de nomenclatura de recursos y métodos HTTP, considerando códigos de estado y estilos de API como REST, GraphQL y tRPC.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des API robustes en utilisant des arbres de décision, des conventions de nommage de ressources et des méthodes HTTP, en tenant compte des codes d''état et des styles d''API tels que REST, GraphQL et tRPC.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, robuste APIs zu entwerfen, indem sie Entscheidungsbäume, Ressourcennamenskonventionen und HTTP-Methoden verwenden, während sie Statuscodes und API-Stile wie REST, GraphQL und tRPC berücksichtigen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar APIs robustas usando árvores de decisão, convenções de nomeação de recursos e métodos HTTP, considerando códigos de status e estilos de API como REST, GraphQL e tRPC.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать надежные API с помощью деревьев решений, конвенций именования ресурсов и методов HTTP, учитывая коды состояния и стили API, такие как REST, GraphQL и tRPC.","ar":"يُمكن العميل البرمجي من تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات قوية باستخدام أشجار القرار وتوافق أسماء الموارد وأساليب HTTP، مع مراعاة رموز الحالة وأساليب واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مثل REST وGraphQL وtRPC."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable REST APIs","Selecting between GraphQL and tRPC for specific use cases","Implementing resource naming and HTTP method standards"],"zh":["设计可扩展的REST API","在特定用例中选择GraphQL和tRPC","实施资源命名和HTTP方法标准"],"ja":["拡張可能なREST APIを設計する","特定のユースケースでGraphQLとtRPCを選択する","リソース命名とHTTPメソッドの規格を実装する"],"ko":["확장 가능한 REST API 설계","특정 사용 사례에 대해 GraphQL 및 tRPC 선택","리소스 명명 및 HTTP 메서드 표준 구현"],"es":["Diseñar API REST escalables","Seleccionar entre GraphQL y tRPC para casos de uso específicos","Implementar normas de nomenclatura de recursos y métodos HTTP"],"fr":["Concevoir des API REST évolutives","Choisir entre GraphQL et tRPC pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques","Mettre en œuvre des normes de nommage de ressources et de méthodes HTTP"],"de":["Entwicklung von skalierbaren REST-APIs","Auswahl zwischen GraphQL und tRPC für bestimmte Anwendungsfälle","Implementierung von Ressourcennamens- und HTTP-Methodenstandards"],"pt":["Projeto de APIs REST escaláveis","Seleção entre GraphQL e tRPC para casos de uso específicos","Implementação de normas de nomeação de recursos e métodos HTTP"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых REST API","Выбор между GraphQL и tRPC для конкретных случаев использования","Реализация стандартов именования ресурсов и методов HTTP"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات REST القابلة للتنمية","اختيار بين GraphQL وtRPC ل_cases استخدام محددة","تنفيذ معايير أسماء الموارد وأساليب HTTP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of API design principles","Limited to REST, GraphQL, and tRPC protocols"],"zh":["需要理解API设计原则","仅限于REST、GraphQL和tRPC协议"],"ja":["API設計の原則を理解する必要がある","REST、GraphQL、tRPCプロトコルのみに限定される"],"ko":["API 설계 원리를 이해해야 함","REST, GraphQL 및 tRPC 프로토콜만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de diseño de API","Limitado a los protocolos REST, GraphQL y tRPC"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de conception d''API","Limité aux protocoles REST, GraphQL et tRPC"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis der API-Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf die Protokolle REST, GraphQL und tRPC"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de projeto de API","Limitado a protocolos REST, GraphQL e tRPC"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов проектирования API","Ограничен протоколами REST, GraphQL и tRPC"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","محدود ببروتوكولات REST وGraphQL وtRPC"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
