nd Plugins"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de servidores backend de alta performance","Suporte a TypeScript e Bun","Rotas e validação de dados","Autenticação e autorização","Integração com plugins e serviços externos"],"ru":["Разработка высокопроизводительных серверов Backend","Поддержка TypeScript и Bun","Маршрутизация и валидация данных","Аутентификация и авторизация","Интеграция с плагинами и внешними сервисами"],"ar":["إنشاء خوادم خلفية عالية الأداء","دعم جافاسكريبت وبيئة بان","التوجيه وتحقق البيانات","التحقق والتصريح","التكامل مع الإضافات والخدمات الخارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ElysiaJS","TypeScript后端服务器","高性能服务器","路由和验证","认证和授权","Bun运行时环境"],"ja":["ElysiaJS","TypeScriptバックエンドサーバー","高パフォーマンスサーバー","ルーティングとバリデーション","認証と認可","Bunランタイム環境"],"ko":["ElysiaJS","TypeScript 백엔드 서버","높은 성능 서버","라우팅과 유효성 검사","인증과 인가","Bun 런타임 환경"],"es":["ElysiaJS","TypeScript","servidores de backend","alta performance","seguridad","enrutamiento","validación","autenticación"],"fr":["ElysiaJS","TypeScript","serveurs de backend","haute performance","sécurité","routage","validation","authentification"],"de":["ElysiaJS","TypeScript","Backend-Server","Hochleistung","Sicherheit","Routing","Validierung","Authentifizierung"],"pt":["ElysiaJS","desenvolvimento backend","TypeScript","Bun","servidores backend","alta performance","segurança"],"ru":["ElysiaJS","разработка Backend","TypeScript","Bun","серверы Backend","высокая производительность","безопасность"],"ar":["إيليсия جافاسكريبت","تطوير الخادم الخلفي","جافاسكريبت","بيئة بان","خوادم خلفية","أداء عالي","أمن"]}},"owner":"yukikwi","repo":"elysia-boiler-plate","repoPath":"yukikwi/elysia-boiler-plate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"elysiajs","description":"Create backend with ElysiaJS, a type-safe, high-performance framework.","bodyPreview":"# ElysiaJS Development Skill\n\nAlways consult [elysiajs.com/llms.txt](https://elysiajs.com/llms.txt) for code examples and latest API.\n\n## Overview\n\nElysiaJS is a TypeScript framework for building Bun-first (but not limited to Bun) type-safe, high-performance backend servers. This skill provides comprehensive guidance for developing with Elysia, including routing, validation, authentication, plugins, integrations, and deployment.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nTrigger this skill when the user asks t","body":"# ElysiaJS Development Skill\n\nAlways consult [elysiajs.com/llms.txt](https://elysiajs.com/llms.txt) for code examples and latest API.\n\n## Overview\n\nElysiaJS is a TypeScript framework for building Bun-first (but not limited to Bun) type-safe, high-performance backend servers. This skill provides comprehensive guidance for developing with Elysia, including routing, validation, authentication, plugins, integrations, and deployment.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nTrigger this skill when the user asks to:\n- Create or modify ElysiaJS routes, handlers, or servers\n- Setup validation with TypeBox or other schema libraries (Zod, Valibot)\n- Implement authentication (JWT, session-based, macros, guards)\n- Add plugins (CORS, OpenAPI, Static files, JWT)\n- Integrate with external services (Drizzle ORM, Better Auth, Next.js, Eden Treaty)\n- Setup WebSocket endpoints for real-time features\n- Create unit tests for Elysia instances\n- Deploy Elysia servers to production\n\n## Quick Start\nQuick scaffold:\n```bash\nbun create elysia app\n```\n\n### Basic Server\n```typescript\nimport { Elysia, t, status } from ''elysia''\n\nconst app = new Elysia()\n  \t.get(''/'', () => ''Hello World'')\n   \t.post(''/user'', ({ body }) => body, {\n    \tbody: t.Object({\n      \t\tname: t.String(),\n        \tage: t.Number()\n     \t})\n    })\n    .get(''/id/:id'', ({ params: { id } }) => {\n   \t\tif(id > 1_000_000) return status(404, ''Not Found'')\n     \n     \treturn id\n    }, {\n    \tparams: t.Object({\n     \t\tid: t.Number({\n       \t\t\tminimum: 1\n       \t\t})\n     \t}),\n     \tresponse: {\n      \t\t200: t.Number(),\n        \t404: t.Literal(''Not Found'')\n      \t}\n    })\n    .listen(3000)\n```\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### HTTP Methods\n```typescript\nimport { Elysia } from ''elysia''\n\nnew Elysia()\n  .get(''/'', ''GET'')\n  .post(''/'', ''POST'')\n  .put(''/'', ''PUT'')\n  .patch(''/'', ''PATCH'')\n  .delete(''/'', ''DELETE'')\n  .options(''/'', ''OPTIONS'')\n  .head(''/'', ''HEAD'')\n```\n\n### Path Parameters\n```typescript\n.get(''/user/:id'', ({ params: { id } }) => id)\n.get(''/post/:id/:slug'', ({ params }) => params)\n```\n\n### Query Parameters\n```typescript\n.get(''/search'', ({ query }) => query.q)\n// GET /search?q=elysia → \"elysia\"\n```\n\n### Request Body\n```typescript\n.post(''/user'', ({ body }) => body)\n```\n\n### Headers\n```typescript\n.get(''/'', ({ headers }) => headers.authorization)\n```\n\n## TypeBox Validation\n\n### Basic Types\n```typescript\nimport { Elysia, t } from ''elysia''\n\n.post(''/user'', ({ body }) => body, {\n  body: t.Object({\n    name: t.String(),\n    age: t.Number(),\n    email: t.String({ format: ''email'' }),\n    website: t.Optional(t.String({ format: ''uri'' }))\n  })\n})\n```\n\n### Nested Objects\n```typescript\nbody: t.Object({\n  user: t.Object({\n    name: t.String(),\n    address: t.Object({\n      street: t.String(),\n      city: t.String()\n    })\n  })\n})\n```\n\n### Arrays\n```typescript\nbody: t.Object({\n  tags: t.Array(t.String()),\n  users: t.Array(t.Object({\n    id: t.String(),\n    name: t.String()\n  }))\n})\n```\n\n### File Upload\n```typescript\n.post(''/upload'', ({ body }) => body.file, {\n  body: t.Object({\n    file: t.File({\n      type: ''image'',              // image/* mime types\n      maxSize: ''5m''               // 5 megabytes\n    }),\n    files: t.Files({              // Multiple files\n      type: [''image/png'', ''image/jpeg'']\n    })\n  })\n})\n```\n\n### Response Validation\n```typescript\n.get(''/user/:id'', ({ params: { id } }) => ({\n  id,\n  name: ''John'',\n  email: ''john@example.com''\n}), {\n  params: t.Object({\n    id: t.Number()\n  }),\n  response: {\n    200: t.Object({\n      id: t.Number(),\n      name: t.String(),\n      email: t.String()\n    }),\n    404: t.String()\n  }\n})\n```\n\n## Standard Schema (Zod, Valibot, ArkType)\n\n### Zod\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod''\n\n.post(''/user'', ({ body }) => body, {\n  body: z.object({\n    name: z.string(),\n    age: z.number().min(0),\n    email: z.string().email()\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n.get(''/user/:id'', ({ params: { id }, status }) => {\n  const user = findUser(id)\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    return status(404, ''User not found'')\n  }\n  \n  return user\n})\n```\n\n## Guards (Apply to Multiple Routes)\n\n```typescript\n.guard({\n  params: t.Object({\n    id: t.Number()\n  })\n}, app => app\n  .get(''/user/:id'', ({ params: { id } }) => id)\n  .delete(''/user/:id'', ({ params: { id } }) => id)\n)\n```\n\n## Macro\n\n```typescript\n.macro({\n  hi: (word: string) => ({\n    beforeHandle() { console.log(word) }\n  })\n})\n.get(''/'', () => ''hi'', { hi: ''Elysia'' })\n```\n\n### Project Structure (Recommended)\nElysia takes an unopinionated approach but based on user request. But without any specific preference, we recommend a feature-based and domain driven folder structure where each feature has its own folder containing controllers, services, and models.\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── index.ts              # Main server entry\n├── modules/\n│   ├── auth/\n│   │   ├── index.ts      # Auth routes (Elysia instance)\n│   │   ├── service.ts    # Business logic\n│   │   └── model.ts      # TypeBox schemas/DTOs\n│   └── user/\n│       ├── index.ts\n│       ├── service.ts\n│       └── model.ts\n└── plugins/\n    └── custom.ts\n\npublic/                   # Static files (if using static plugin)\ntest/                     # Unit tests\n```\n\nEach file has its own responsibility as follows:\n- **Controller (index.ts)**: Handle HTTP routing, request validation, and cookie.\n- **Service (service.ts)**: Handle business logic, decoupled from Elysia controller if possible.\n- **Model (model.ts)**: Define the data structure and validation for the request and response.\n\n## Best Practice\nElysia is unopinionated on design pattern, but if not provided, we can relies on MVC pattern pair with feature based folder structure.\n\n- Controller:\n\t- Prefers Elysia as a controller for HTTP dependant controller\n\t- For non HTTP dependent, prefers service instead unless explicitly asked\n\t- Use `onError` to handle local custom errors\n\t- Register Model to Elysia instance via `Elysia.models({ ...models })` and prefix model by namespace `Elysia.prefix(''model'', ''Namespace.'')\n\t- Prefers Reference Model by name provided by Elysia instead of using an actual `Model.name`\n- Service:\n\t- Prefers class (or abstract class if possible)\n\t- Prefers interface/type derive from `Model`\n\t- Return `status` (`import { status } from ''elysia''`) for error\n\t- Prefers `return Error` instead of `throw Error`\n- Models:\n\t- Always export validation model and type of validation model\n\t- Custom Error should be in contains in Model\n\n## Elysia Key Concept\nElysia has a every important concepts/rules to understand before use.\n\n## Encapsulation - Isolates by Default\n\nLifecycles (hooks, middleware) **don''t leak** between instances unless scoped.\n\n**Scope levels:**\n- `local` (default) - current instance + descendants\n- `scoped` - parent + current + descendants  \n- `global` - all instances\n\n```ts\n.onBeforeHandle(() => {}) // only local instance\n.onBeforeHandle({ as: ''global'' }, () => {}) // exports to all\n```\n\n## Method Chaining - Required for Types\n\n**Must chain**. Each method returns new type reference.\n\n❌ Don''t:\n```ts\nconst app = new Elysia()\napp.state(''build'', 1) // loses type\napp.get(''/'', ({ store }) => store.build) // build doesn''t exists\n```\n\n✅ Do:\n```ts\nnew Elysia()\n  .state(''build'', 1)\n  .get(''/'', ({ store }) => store.build)\n```\n\n## Explicit Dependencies\n\nEach instance independent. **Declare what you use.**\n\n```ts\nconst auth = new Elysia()\n\t.decorate(''Auth'', Auth)\n\t.model(Auth.models)\n\nnew Elysia()\n  .get(''/'', ({ Auth }) => Auth.getProfile()) // Auth doesn''t exists\n\nnew Elysia()\n  .use(auth) // must declare\n  .get(''/'', ({ Auth }) => Auth.getProfile())\n```\n\n**Global scope when:**\n- No types added (cors, helmet)\n- Global lifecycle (logging, tracing)\n\n**Explicit when:**\n- Adds types (state, models)\n- Business logic (auth, db)\n\n## Deduplication\n\nPlugins re-execute unless named:\n\n```ts\nnew Elysia() // rerun on `.use`\nnew Elysia({ name: ''ip'' }) // runs once across all instances\n```\n\n## Order Matters\n\nEvents apply to routes **registered after** them.\n\n```ts\n.onBeforeHandle(() => console.log(''1''))\n.get(''/'', () => ''hi'') // has hook\n.onBeforeHandle(() => console.log(''2'')) // doesn''t affect ''/''\n```\n\n## Type Inference\n\n**Inline functions only** for accurate types.\n\nFor controllers, destructure in inline wrapper:\n\n```ts\n.post(''/'', ({ body }) => Controller.greet(body), {\n  body: t.Object({ name: t.String() })\n})\n```\n\nGet type from schema:\n```ts\ntype MyType = typeof MyType.static\n```\n\n## Reference Model\nModel can be reference by name, especially great for documenting an API\n```ts\nnew Elysia()\n\t.model({\n\t\tbook: t.Object({\n\t\t\tname: t.String()\n\t\t})\n\t})\n\t.post(''/'', ({ body }) => body.name, {\n\t\tbody: ''book''\n\t})\n```\n\nModel can be renamed by using `.prefix` / `.suffix`\n```ts\nnew Elysia()\n\t.model({\n\t\tbook: t.Object({\n\t\t\tname: t.String()\n\t\t})\n\t})\n\t.prefix(''model'', ''Namespace'')\n\t.post(''/'', ({ body }) => body.name, {\n\t\tbody: ''Namespace.Book''\n\t})\n```\n\nOnce `prefix`, model name will be capitalized by default.\n\n## Technical Terms\nThe following are technical terms that is use for Elysia:\n- `OpenAPI Type Gen` - function name `fromTypes` from `@elysiajs/openapi` for generating OpenAPI from types, see `plugins/openapi.md`\n- `Eden`, `Eden Treaty` - e2e type safe RPC client for share type from backend to frontend\n\n## Resources\nUse the following references as needed.\n\nIt''s recommended to checkout `route.md` for as it contains the most important foundation building blocks with examples.\n\n`plugin.md` and `validation.md` is important as well but can be check as needed.\n\n### references/\nDetailed documentation split by topic:\n- `bun-fullstack-dev-server.md` - Bun Fullstack Dev Server with HMR. React without bundler.\n- `cookie.md` - Detailed documentation on cookie\n- `deployment.md` - Production deployment guide / Docker\n- `eden.md` - e2e type safe RPC client for share type from backend to frontend\n- `guard.md` - Setting validation/lifecycle all at once\n- `macro.md` - Compose multiple schema/lifecycle as a reusable Elysia via key-value (recommended for complex setup, eg. authentication, authorization, Role-based Access Check)\n- `plugin.md` - Decouple part of Elysia into a standalone component\n- `route.md` - Elysia foundation building block: Routing, Handler and Context\n- `testing.md` - Unit tests with examples\n- `validation.md` - Setup input/output validation and list of all custom validation rules\n- `websocket.md` - Real-time features\n\n### plugins/ \nDetailed documentation, usage and configuration reference for official Elysia plugin:\n- `bearer.md` - Add bearer capability to Elysia (`@elysiajs/bearer`)\n- `cors.md` - Out of box configuration for CORS (`@elysiajs/cors`)\n- `cron.md` - Run cron job with access to Elysia context (`@elysiajs/cron`)\n- `graphql-apollo.md` - Integration GraphQL Apollo (`@elysiajs/graphql-apollo`)\n- `graphql-yoga.md` - Integration with GraphQL Yoga (`@elysiajs/graphql-yoga`)\n- `html.md` - HTML and JSX plugin setup and usage (`@elysiajs/html`)\n- `jwt.md` - JWT / JWK plugin (`@elysiajs/jwt`)\n- `openapi.md` - OpenAPI documentation and OpenAPI Type Gen / OpenAPI from types (`@elysiajs/openapi`)\n- `opentelemetry.md` - OpenTelemetry, instrumentation, and record span utilities (`@elysiajs/opentelemetry`)\n- `server-timing.md` - Server Timing metric for debug (`@elysiajs/server-timing`) \n- `static.md` - Serve static files/folders for Elysia Server (`@elysiajs/static`)\n\n### integrations/\nGuide to integrate Elysia with external library/runtime:\n- `ai-sdk.md` - Using Vercel AI SDK with Elysia\n- `astro.md` - Elysia in Astro API route\n- `better-auth.md` - Integrate Elysia with better-auth\n- `cloudflare-worker.md` - Elysia on Cloudflare Worker adapter\n- `deno.md` - Elysia on Deno\n- `drizzle.md` - Integrate Elysia with Drizzle ORM\n- `expo.md` - Elysia in Expo API route\n- `nextjs.md` - Elysia in Nextjs API route\n- `nodejs.md` - Run Elysia on Node.js\n- `nuxt.md` - Elysia on API route\n- `prisma.md` - Integrate Elysia with Prisma\n- `react-email.d` - Create and Send Email with React and Elysia\n- `sveltekit.md` - Run Elysia on Svelte Kit API route\n- `tanstack-start.md` - Run Elysia on Tanstack Start / React Query\n- `vercel.md` - Deploy Elysia to Vercel\n\n### examples/ (optional)\n- `basic.ts` - Basic Elysia example\n- `body-parser.ts` - Custom body parser example via `.onParse`\n- `complex.ts` - Comprehensive usage of Elysia server\n- `cookie.ts` - Setting cookie\n- `error.ts` - Error handling\n- `file.ts` - Returning local file from server\n- `guard.ts` - Setting mulitple validation schema and lifecycle\n- `map-response.ts` - Custom response mapper\n- `redirect.ts` - Redirect response\n- `rename.ts` - Rename context''s property \n- `schema.ts` - Setup validation\n- `state.ts` - Setup global state\n- `upload-file.ts` - File upload with validation\n- `websocket.ts` - Web Socket for realtime communication\n\n### patterns/ (optional)\n- `patterns/mvc.md` - Detail guideline for using Elysia with MVC patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:24.906Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript Agents needing high-performance backend server development with ElysiaJS","zh":"非常适合需要使用ElysiaJS进行高性能后端服务器开发的TypeScript代理","ja":"ElysiaJSを使用した高性能バックエンドサーバーの開発が必要なTypeScriptエージェントに最適","ko":"ElysiaJS를 사용하여 고성능 백엔드 서버 개발이 필요한 TypeScript 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de TypeScript que necesitan desarrollo de servidor backend de alto rendimiento con ElysiaJS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScript ayant besoin d''un développement de serveur backend haute performance avec ElysiaJS","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke Backend-Server-Entwicklung mit ElysiaJS benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes TypeScript que necessitam de desenvolvimento de servidor de backend de alto desempenho com ElysiaJS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов TypeScript, которым необходим высокопроизводительный сервер бэкэнда с ElysiaJS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل TypeScript التي تحتاج إلى تطوير خادم الخلفية بأداء عالي مع ElysiaJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build type-safe, high-performance backend servers with ElysiaJS, utilizing routing, validation, authentication, plugins, integrations, and deployment, all while leveraging the latest API from elysiajs.com/llms.txt","zh":"赋予代理构建类型安全、高性能的后端服务器的能力，使用ElysiaJS，利用路由、验证、身份验证、插件、集成和部署，同时利用elysiajs.com/llms.txt的最新API","ja":"ElysiaJSを使用して、ルーティング、バリデーション、認証、プラグイン、統合、デプロイなどの機能を利用し、elysiajs.com/llms.txtの最新APIを活用して、タイプセーフで高性能なバックエンドサーバーを構築するエージェントの能力を付与する","ko":"ElysiaJS를 사용하여 라우팅, 유효성 검사, 인증, 플러그인, 통합 및 배포를 활용하여 유형 안전 및 고성능 백엔드 서버를 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, elysiajs.com/llms.txt의 최신 API를 활용한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear servidores backend seguros y de alto rendimiento con ElysiaJS, utilizando enrutamiento, validación, autenticación, plugins, integraciones y despliegue, todo mientras aprovecha la última API de elysiajs.com/llms.txt","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des serveurs backend sécurisés et haute performance avec ElysiaJS, en utilisant le routage, la validation, l''authentification, les plugins, les intégrations et le déploiement, le tout en exploitant la dernière API de elysiajs.com/llms.txt","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sichere und hochleistungsstarke Backend-Server mit ElysiaJS zu erstellen, indem sie Routing, Validierung, Authentifizierung, Plugins, Integrationen und Bereitstellung verwenden, und zwar unter Ausnutzung der neuesten API von elysiajs.com/llms.txt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir servidores de backend seguros em termos de tipo, de alto desempenho com ElysiaJS, utilizando roteamento, validação, autenticação, plugins, integrações e implantação, aproveitando ao máximo a última API do elysiajs.com/llms.txt","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать серверы бэкэнда с безопасностью типов и высоким производительностью с помощью ElysiaJS, используя маршрутизацию, валидацию, аутентификацию, плагины, интеграции и развертывание, используя последний API с elysiajs.com/llms.txt","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء خوادم الخلفية آمنة وذات أداء عالي مع ElysiaJS، باستخدام التوجيه والتحقق من الصحة والتحقق من الهوية والإضافات والتكاملات والنشر، مع الاستفادة القصوى من أحدث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من elysiajs.com/llms.txt"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing complex Elysia applications with comprehensive guidance","Implementing routing and validation for backend servers","Integrating authentication and plugins for enhanced functionality"],"zh":["开发具有全面指导的复杂Elysia应用程序","为后端服务器实现路由和验证","集成身份验证和插件以增强功能"],"ja":["包括総合的なガイダンスを持つ複雑なElysiaアプリケーションの開発","バックエンドサーバーのルーティングとバリデーションの実装","認証とプラグインの統合による機能の強化"],"ko":["전체 지침이 포함된 복잡한 Elysia 애플리케이션 개발","백엔드 서버의 라우팅 및 유효성 검사 구현","인증 및 플러그인의 통합을 통한 기능 강화"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones Elysia complejas con orientación integral","Implementar enrutamiento y validación para servidores backend","Integrar autenticación y plugins para una funcionalidad mejorada"],"fr":["Développer des applications Elysia complexes avec un guide complet","Mettre en œuvre le routage et la validation pour les serveurs backend","Intégrer l''authentification et les plugins pour une fonctionnalité améliorée"],"de":["Komplexe Elysia-Anwendungen mit umfassender Anleitung entwickeln","Routing und Validierung für Backend-Server implementieren","Authentifizierung und Plugins für eine verbesserte Funktionalität integrieren"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações Elysia complexas com orientação abrangente","Implementar roteamento e validação para servidores de backend","Integrar autenticação e plugins para funcionalidade aprimorada"],"ru":["Разработка сложных приложений Elysia с комплексным руководством","Реализация маршрутизации и валидации для серверов бэкэнда","Интеграция аутентификации и плагинов для расширенной функциональности"],"ar":["تنمية تطبيقات Elysia المعقدة مع إرشادات شاملة","تنفيذ التوجيه والتحقق من الصحة لخادم الخلفية","دمج التحقق من الهوية والإضافات من أجل وظائف محسنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript knowledge","Limited to Bun-first and similar environments","Dependent on elysiajs.com/llms.txt for latest API and code examples"],"zh":["需要TypeScript知识","仅限于Bun-first和类似环境","依赖elysiajs.com/llms.txt的最新API和代码示例"],"ja":["TypeScriptの知識が必要","Bun-firstや同様の環境に限定される","elysiajs.com/llms.txtの最新APIとコード例に依存する"],"ko":["TypeScript 지식이 필요하다","Bun-first 및 유사한 환경으로 제한된다","elysiajs.com/llms.txt의 최신 API 및 코드 예제에 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript","Limitado a entornos Bun-first y similares","Dependiente de elysiajs.com/llms.txt para la última API y ejemplos de código"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript","Limité aux environnements Bun-first et similaires","Dépendant de elysiajs.com/llms.txt pour la dernière API et les exemples de code"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript-Kenntnisse","Begrenzt auf Bun-first- und ähnliche Umgebungen","Abhängig von elysiajs.com/llms.txt für die neueste API und Codebeispiele"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de TypeScript","Limitado a ambientes Bun-first e similares","Dependente de elysiajs.com/llms.txt para a última API e exemplos de código"],"ru":["Требует знания TypeScript","Ограничен средами Bun-first и аналогичными","Зависит от elysiajs.com/llms.txt для последней API и примеров кода"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة TypeScript","محدود بالبيئات Bun-first والمشابهة","يعتمد على elysiajs.com/llms.txt لأحدث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وأمثلة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pesitwizard/pesitwizard/pesit-expert', 'community', 'pesitwizard', 'pesitwizard', 'pesitwizard/pesitwizard', 'pesit-expert', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:45:49.526Z', NULL, '{"id":"pesitwizard/pesitwizard/pesit-expert","name":"pesit-expert","description":{"zh":"PeSIT 专家技能是解决 PeSIT 问题的综合指南，涵盖文档检查、单元测试和版本控制等方面","ja":"PeSIT エキスパートスキルは、PeSIT の問題解決のための包括的なガイドであり、文書化、ユニットテスト、バージョン管理などを網羅する","ko":"PeSIT 전문가 기술은 PeSIT 문제 해결을 위한 종합 가이드로 문서 확인, 유닛 테스트 및 버전 관리 등을 다룹니다","es":"La resolución de problemas PeSIT implica verificar la documentación, escribir pruebas unitarias y actualizar el registro de cambios. Aprende a hacerlo de manera efectiva.","fr":"La résolution de problèmes PeSIT implique la vérification de la documentation, l''écriture de tests unitaires et la mise à jour du journal des modifications. Découvrez comment le faire de manière efficace.","de":"Die Behebung von PeSIT-Problemen umfasst das Überprüfen der Dokumentation, das Schreiben von Einheitstests und das Aktualisieren des Änderungsprotokolls. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie es effektiv tun können.","pt":"O PeSIT Expert é uma habilidade que ajuda a resolver problemas específicos do PeSIT. Ele fornece um conjunto de etapas para solucionar problemas de forma eficiente.","ru":"Эксперт PeSIT - это навык, который помогает решать специфические проблемы PeSIT. Он предоставляет набор шагов для решения проблем эффективно.","ar":"خبير PeSIT هو مهارة تساعد على حل مشكلات محددة لبروتوكول PeSIT. يوفر مجموعة من الخطوات لحل المشكلات بفعالية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"PeSIT 专家技能：解决 PeSIT 问题的最佳实践","ja":"PeSIT エキスパートスキル：PeSIT の問題解決ベストプラクティス","ko":"PeSIT 전문가 기술: PeSIT 문제 해결 모범 사례","es":"Resolución de problemas PeSIT para desarrolladores","fr":"Résolution de problèmes PeSIT pour les développeurs","de":"PeSIT-Problembehebung für Entwickler","pt":"Resolução de Problemas PeSIT: Dicas e Práticas","ru":"Эксперт PeSIT: решение проблем и лучшие практики","ar":"خبير PeSIT: حل المشكلات وأفضل الممارسات","en":"pesit-expert"},"description":{"zh":"PeSIT 专家技能是解决 PeSIT 问题的综合指南，涵盖文档检查、单元测试和版本控制等方面","ja":"PeSIT エキスパートスキルは、PeSIT の問題解決のための包括的なガイドであり、文書化、ユニットテスト、バージョン管理などを網羅する","ko":"PeSIT 전문가 기술은 PeSIT 문제 해결을 위한 종합 가이드로 문서 확인, 유닛 테스트 및 버전 관리 등을 다룹니다","es":"La resolución de problemas PeSIT implica verificar la documentación, escribir pruebas unitarias y actualizar el registro de cambios. Aprende a hacerlo de man...","fr":"La résolution de problèmes PeSIT implique la vérification de la documentation, l''écriture de tests unitaires et la mise à jour du journal des modifications. ...","de":"Die Behebung von PeSIT-Problemen umfasst das Überprüfen der Dokumentation, das Schreiben von Einheitstests und das Aktualisieren des Änderungsprotokolls. Erf...","pt":"O PeSIT Expert é uma habilidade que ajuda a resolver problemas específicos do PeSIT. Ele fornece um conjunto de etapas para solucionar problemas de forma efi...","ru":"Эксперт PeSIT - это навык, который помогает решать специфические проблемы PeSIT. Он предоставляет набор шагов для решения проблем эффективно.","ar":"خبير PeSIT هو مهارة تساعد على حل مشكلات محددة لبروتوكول PeSIT. يوفر مجموعة من الخطوات لحل المشكلات بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["文档检查","单元测试","版本控制","GitHub 操作","问题解决","代码更新"],"ja":["文書化の確認","ユニットテスト","バージョン管理","GitHub 操作","問題解決","コードの更新"],"ko":["문서 확인","유닛 테스트","버전 관리","GitHub 작업","문제 해결","코드 업데이트"],"es":["Verificación de documentación","Escritura de pruebas unitarias","Actualización del registro de cambios","Actualización de dependencias","Creación de confirmaciones","Publicación en GitHub"],"fr":["Vérification de la documentation","Écriture de tests unitaires","Mise à jour du journal des modifications","Mise à jour des dépendances","Création de validations","Publication sur GitHub"],"de":["Überprüfung der Dokumentation","Schreiben von Einheitstests","Aktualisierung des Änderungsprotokolls","Aktualisierung von Abhängigkeiten","Erstellung von Commits","Veröffentlichung auf GitHub"],"pt":["Verificação da documentação","Escrita de testes unitários","Verificação da compilação","Atualização do changelog e da versão do módulo","Atualização das dependências","Criação de commits","Verificação das ações do GitHub","Criação de releases"],"ru":["Проверка документации","Написание юнит-тестов","Проверка компиляции","Обновление changelog и версии модуля","Обновление зависимостей","Создание коммитов","Проверка действий GitHub","Создание релизов"],"ar":["التحقق من الوثائق","كتابة الاختبارات الوحدوية","التحقق من الترجمة","تحديث سجل التغييرات وإصدار الوحدة","تحديث الإعتماديات","إنشاء التعهدات","التحقق من إجراءات جيثب","إنشاء الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PeSIT","问题解决","文档检查","单元测试","版本控制","GitHub","代码更新","开发最佳实践"],"ja":["PeSIT","問題解決","文書化の確認","ユニットテスト","バージョン管理","GitHub","コードの更新","開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["PeSIT","문제 해결","문서 확인","유닛 테스트","버전 관리","GitHub","코드 업데이트","개발 모범 사례"],"es":["resolución de problemas PeSIT","pruebas unitarias","documentación","registro de cambios","dependencias","confirmaciones","GitHub","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["résolution de problèmes PeSIT","tests unitaires","documentation","journal des modifications","dépendances","validations","GitHub","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Behebung von PeSIT-Problemen","Einheitstests","Dokumentation","Änderungsprotokoll","Abhängigkeiten","Commits","GitHub","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["PeSIT","resolução de problemas","desenvolvimento de software","testes unitários","compilação","changelog","versão do módulo","dependências","commits","GitHub"],"ru":["PeSIT","решение проблем","разработка программного обеспечения","юнит-тесты","компиляция","changelog","версия модуля","зависимости","коммиты","GitHub"],"ar":["PeSIT","حل المشكلات","تطوير البرمجيات","الاختبارات الوحدوية","الترجمة","سجل التغييرات","إصدار الوحدة","الإعتماديات","التعهدات","جيثب"]}},"owner":"pesitwizard","repo":"pesitwizard","repoPath":"pesitwizard/pesitwizard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pesit-expert","description":"Steps to perform to fix a PeSIT issue and release a new version","bodyPreview":"## PeSIT specific problem solving\n1. Check documentation\n2. Write unit tests that cover the issue and its resolution\n3. Check everything compiles\n4. Update changelog and pom version of impacted module\n5. Update dependency in all impacted modules\n6. Create commit once the issue is fixed and tests pass\n7. Check all GitHub Actions are up to date and pass\n8. Push to GitHub\n9. Create release","body":"## PeSIT specific problem solving\n1. Check documentation\n2. Write unit tests that cover the issue and its resolution\n3. Check everything compiles\n4. Update changelog and pom version of impacted module\n5. Update dependency in all impacted modules\n6. Create commit once the issue is fixed and tests pass\n7. Check all GitHub Actions are up to date and pass\n8. Push to GitHub\n9. Create release\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:49.526Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Java-based DevOps Agents handling PeSIT protocol implementations and Maven project maintenance.","zh":"适用于基于Java的DevOps代理，处理PeSIT协议实现和Maven项目维护。","ja":"JavaベースのDevOpsエージェントがPeSITプロトコル実装とMavenプロジェクトメンテナンスを処理する場合に不可欠です。","ko":"자바 기반 DevOps 에이전트가 PeSIT 프로토콜 구현 및 메이븐 프로젝트 유지 보수를 처리하는 경우 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de DevOps basados en Java que manejan implementaciones del protocolo PeSIT y mantenimiento de proyectos Maven.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents DevOps basés sur Java qui gèrent les implémentations du protocole PeSIT et la maintenance des projets Maven.","de":"Wesentlich für Java-basierte DevOps-Agents, die PeSIT-Protokoll-Implementierungen und Maven-Projekt-Wartung verwalten.","pt":"Essencial para agentes DevOps baseados em Java que lidam com implementações do protocolo PeSIT e manutenção de projetos Maven.","ru":"Необходим для агентов DevOps на основе Java, которые обрабатывают реализации протокола PeSIT и поддержку проектов Maven.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات DevOps المبنية على Java التي تتعامل مع تنفيذ بروتوكول PeSIT وصيانة مشاريع Maven."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive PeSIT protocol problem-solving through documentation checks, unit test creation, and Maven module dependency management. Automates GitHub release workflows including compilation verification, changelog updates, and CI/CD pipeline validation.","zh":"通过文档检查、单元测试创建和Maven模块依赖管理，实现全面性的PeSIT协议问题解决。自动化GitHub发布工作流，包括编译验证、更改日志更新和CI/CD管道验证。","ja":"文書チェック、ユニットテストの作成、Mavenモジュールの依存関係管理を通じて、包括的なPeSITプロトコルの問題解決を可能にします。 GitHubのリリースワークフローを自動化し、コンパイルの検証、変更ログの更新、CI/CDパイプラインの検証を含みます。","ko":"문서 검사, 단위 테스트 생성 및 메이븐 모듈 종속성 관리를 통해 종합적인 PeSIT 프로토콜 문제 해결을 가능하게 합니다. GitHub 릴리스 워크플ロー 자동화, 컴파일 검증, 변경 로그 업데이트 및 CI/CD 파이프라인 검증 포함.","es":"Permite una resolución integral de problemas del protocolo PeSIT a través de verificaciones de documentación, creación de pruebas unitarias y gestión de dependencias de módulos Maven. Automatiza flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento de GitHub, incluyendo verificación de compilación, actualizaciones de registros de cambios y validación de tuberías de CI/CD.","fr":"Permet une résolution complète des problèmes de protocole PeSIT via des vérifications de documentation, la création de tests unitaires et la gestion des dépendances de modules Maven. Automatise les flux de travail de publication GitHub, y compris la vérification de compilation, les mises à jour des journaux des modifications et la validation des pipelines CI/CD.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende Lösung von PeSIT-Protokollproblemen durch Dokumentationsprüfungen, Erstellung von Einheitstests und Maven-Modul-Abhängigkeitsverwaltung. Automatisiert GitHub-Veröffentlichungs-Workflows, einschließlich Kompilierungsverifizierung, Änderungsprotokoll-Aktualisierungen und CI/CD-Pipeline-Validierung.","pt":"Permite a resolução abrangente de problemas do protocolo PeSIT por meio de verificações de documentação, criação de testes unitários e gerenciamento de dependências de módulos Maven. Automatiza fluxos de trabalho de lançamento do GitHub, incluindo verificação de compilação, atualizações de changelog e validação de pipeline CI/CD.","ru":"Позволяет всесторонне решать проблемы протокола PeSIT посредством проверок документации, создания модульных тестов и управления зависимостями модулей Maven. Автоматизирует рабочие процессы выпуска GitHub, включая проверку компиляции, обновления журнала изменений и проверку конвейера CI/CD.","ar":"تمكن من حل مشاكل بروتوكول PeSIT الشامل من خلال فحص الوثائق وإنشاء اختبارات الوحدة وإدارة الإعتماديات الخاصة bằng موديول Maven. ي自动 خطوط سير عمل إصدار GitHub بما في ذلك التحقق من الترجمة والتحديثات السجل والتأكيد من خط أنابيب CI/CD."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing PeSIT-specific unit tests","Managing Maven module dependencies and versioning","Validating GitHub Actions workflows","Creating automated release cycles"],"zh":["编写PeSIT特定的单元测试","管理Maven模块依赖和版本","验证GitHub Actions工作流","创建自动化的发布周期"],"ja":["PeSIT特定のユニットテストの作成","Mavenモジュールの依存関係とバージョンの管理","GitHub Actionsワークフローの検証","自動化されたリリースサイクルの作成"],"ko":["PeSIT 특정 단위 테스트 작성","메이븐 모듈 종속성 및 버전 관리","GitHub Actions 워크플로우 검증","자동화된 릴리스 사이클 생성"],"es":["Escritura de pruebas unitarias específicas de PeSIT","Gestión de dependencias y versiones de módulos Maven","Validación de flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions","Creación de ciclos de lanzamiento automatizados"],"fr":["Écriture de tests unitaires spécifiques à PeSIT","Gestion des dépendances et des versions de modules Maven","Validation des flux de travail GitHub Actions","Création de cycles de publication automatisés"],"de":["Erstellung von PeSIT-spezifischen Einheitstests","Verwaltung von Maven-Modul-Abhängigkeiten und -Versionen","Validierung von GitHub-Actions-Workflows","Erstellung von automatisierten Release-Zyklen"],"pt":["Escrita de testes unitários específicos do PeSIT","Gerenciamento de dependências e versionamento de módulos Maven","Validação de fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions","Criação de ciclos de lançamento automatizados"],"ru":["Написание модульных тестов, специфичных для PeSIT","Управление зависимостями и версионностью модулей Maven","Проверка рабочих процессов GitHub Actions","Создание автоматических циклов выпуска"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدة محددة لبروتوكول PeSIT","إدارة الإعتماديات وإصدارات وحدات Maven","التحقق من سير عمل GitHub Actions","إنشاء دورات إصدار آلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Java/Maven project specific","Requires GitHub repository access","Assumes PeSIT protocol context"],"zh":["特定于Java/Maven项目","需要GitHub存储库访问","假设PeSIT协议上下文"],"ja":["Java/Mavenプロジェクトに特有の","GitHubリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","PeSITプロトコルのコンテキストを仮定"],"ko":["자바/메이븐 프로젝트에 특정","GitHub 리포지토리 액세스가 필요","PeSIT 프로토콜 컨텍스트를 가정"],"es":["Específico de proyectos Java/Maven","Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Supone contexto de protocolo PeSIT"],"fr":["Spécifique aux projets Java/Maven","Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Suppose un contexte de protocole PeSIT"],"de":["Spezifisch für Java/Maven-Projekte","Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Geht von PeSIT-Protokoll-Kontext aus"],"pt":["Específico para projetos Java/Maven","Exige acesso ao repositório GitHub","Pressupõe contexto do protocolo PeSIT"],"ru":["Конкретно для проектов Java/Maven","Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Предполагает контекст протокола PeSIT"],"ar":["محدد لمشاريع Java/Maven","يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","يفترض سياق بروتوكول PeSIT"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
