mandos.","fr":"Ce guide couvre les opérations essentielles de traitement de PDF à l''aide de bibliothèques Python et d''outils de ligne de commande.","de":"Diese Anleitung behandelt wesentliche PDF-Verarbeitungsvorgänge unter Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken und Kommandozeilen-Tools.","pt":"Este guia cobre operações essenciais de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Этот справочник охватывает основные операции обработки PDF с помощью библиотек Python и командной строки.","ar":"يدل هذا الدليل على عمليات معالجة ملفات PDF الأساسية باستخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر.","en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"definition":{"en":"築未科技 AI 對話窗口 - GitHub Pages 部署"},"features":{"zh":["使用Python库进行PDF阅读","提取PDF文本","填充PDF表单","使用命令行工具进行PDF处理","支持多种PDF操作"],"ja":["Pythonライブラリを使用したPDF読み取り","PDFテキストの抽出","PDFフォームの入力","コマンドラインツールを使用したPDF処理","多くのPDF操作をサポート"],"ko":["Python 라이브러리를 사용한 PDF 읽기","PDF 텍스트 추출","PDF 양식填充","명령줄 도구를 사용한 PDF 처리","다양한 PDF 운영을 지원"],"es":["Lectura de PDF","Escritura de PDF","Extracción de texto","Manipulación de páginas","Rellenado de formularios PDF"],"fr":["Lecture de PDF","Écriture de PDF","Extraction de texte","Manipulation de pages","Remplissage de formulaires PDF"],"de":["PDF-Lesevorgang","PDF-Schreibvorgang","Textextraktion","Seitenmanipulation","Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen"],"pt":["Leitura de arquivos PDF","Extração de texto de arquivos PDF","Criação de arquivos PDF","Edição de formulários PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python para processamento de PDF"],"ru":["Чтение файлов PDF","Извлечение текста из файлов PDF","Создание файлов PDF","Редактирование форм PDF","Использование библиотек Python для обработки PDF"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","إنشاء ملفات PDF","تعديل استمارات PDF","استخدام مكتبات Python لمعالجة ملفات PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF处理","Python库","命令行工具","PDF阅读","PDF提取","PDF填充","PDF操作"],"ja":["PDF処理","Pythonライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","PDF読み取り","PDF抽出","PDF入力","PDF操作"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","PDF 읽기","PDF 추출","PDF 양식填充","PDF 운영"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas pdf","herramientas pdf","manipulación de pdf","lectura de pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","bibliothèques pdf","outils pdf","manipulation de pdf","lecture de pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pdf-bibliotheken","pdf-tools","pdf-manipulation","pdf-lesen"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","bibliotecas python pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando pdf","extração de texto pdf","criação de pdf","edição de formulários pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","библиотеки python pdf","командная строка pdf","извлечение текста pdf","создание pdf","редактирование форм pdf"],"ar":["معالجة ملفات pdf","python pdf","مكتبات python pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر pdf","استخراج النص من pdf","إنشاء ملفات pdf","تعديل استمارات pdf"]}},"owner":"faint45","repo":"zhewei-ai-chat-01","repoPath":"faint45/zhewei-ai-chat-01","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to do anything with PDF files. This includes reading or extracting text/tables from PDFs, combining or merging multiple PDFs into one, splitting PDFs apart, rotating pages, adding watermarks, creating new PDFs, filling PDF forms, encrypting/decrypting PDFs, extracting images, and OCR on scanned PDFs to make them searchable. If the user mentions a .pdf file or asks to produce one, use this skill.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see REFERENCE.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read FORMS.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see REFERENCE.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read FORMS.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n#### Subscripts and Superscripts\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Never use Unicode subscript/superscript characters (₀₁₂₃₄₅₆₇₈₉, ⁰¹²³⁴⁵⁶⁷⁸⁹) in ReportLab PDFs. The built-in fonts do not include these glyphs, causing them to render as solid black boxes.\n\nInstead, use ReportLab''s XML markup tags in Paragraph objects:\n```python\nfrom reportlab.platypus import Paragraph\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\n\n# Subscripts: use <sub> tag\nchemical = Paragraph(\"H<sub>2</sub>O\", styles[''Normal''])\n\n# Superscripts: use <super> tag\nsquared = Paragraph(\"x<super>2</super> + y<super>2</super>\", styles[''Normal''])\n```\n\nFor canvas-drawn text (not Paragraph objects), manually adjust font the size and position rather than using Unicode subscripts/superscripts.\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see FORMS.md) | See FORMS.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see REFERENCE.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see REFERENCE.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in FORMS.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see REFERENCE.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:46:00.799Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 고급 PDF 처리 기능을 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités de traitement de PDF avancées en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen mit Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى معالجة متقدمة لملفات PDF باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text, read, and write PDF documents using pypdf, facilitating tasks like form filling and content analysis with Python.","zh":"赋予代理从PDF文档中提取文本、读取和写入PDF文档的能力，使用pypdf并利用Python进行任务，如表单填充和内容分析。","ja":"pypdfを使用して、PDF文書からテキストを抽出して読み書きする機能をエージェントに与え、Pythonを使用してフォームの自動入力やコンテンツ分析などのタスクを容易に行うことができます。","ko":"pypdf를 사용하여 PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 추출하고 PDF 문서를 읽고 쓰는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여 Python을 사용하여 양식 채우기 및 콘텐츠 분석 등의 작업을 쉽게 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer texto, leer y escribir documentos PDF utilizando pypdf, lo que facilita tareas como el llenado de formularios y el análisis de contenido con Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte, de lire et d''écrire des documents PDF en utilisant pypdf, ce qui facilite des tâches comme le remplissage de formulaires et l''analyse de contenu avec Python.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Text zu extrahieren, zu lesen und PDF-Dokumente mit pypdf zu schreiben, was Aufgaben wie das Ausfüllen von Formularen und die Inhaltsanalyse mit Python erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto, ler e gravar documentos PDF usando pypdf, facilitando tarefas como preenchimento de formulários e análise de conteúdo com Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст, читать и записывать документы PDF с помощью pypdf, что облегчает выполнение задач, таких как заполнение форм и анализ содержимого с помощью Python.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخراج النصوص، قراءة وكتابة مستندات PDF باستخدام pypdf، مما يسهل المهام مثل ملء الاستمارة وتحليل المحتوى باستخدام بايثون."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF documents","Automating PDF form filling","Reading and writing PDF files with Python"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取文本","自动化PDF表单填充","使用Python读写PDF文件"],"ja":["PDF文書からテキストを抽出","PDFフォームの自動入力","Pythonを使用してPDFファイルを読み書き"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 텍스트 추출","PDF 양식 자동 채우기","Python을 사용하여 PDF 파일 읽기/쓰기"],"es":["Extracción de texto de documentos PDF","Automatización del llenado de formularios PDF","Lectura y escritura de archivos PDF con Python"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de documents PDF","Automatisation du remplissage de formulaires PDF","Lecture et écriture de fichiers PDF avec Python"],"de":["Textextraktion aus PDF-Dokumenten","Automatisierung des Ausfüllens von PDF-Formularen","Lesen und Schreiben von PDF-Dateien mit Python"],"pt":["Extração de texto de documentos PDF","Automação do preenchimento de formulários PDF","Leitura e gravação de arquivos PDF com Python"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из документов PDF","Автоматизация заполнения форм PDF","Чтение и запись файлов PDF с помощью Python"],"ar":["استخراج النصوص من مستندات PDF","أتمتة ملء استمارات PDF","قراءة وكتابة ملفات PDF باستخدام بايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pypdf library","Python compatibility required","Limited to PDF format"],"zh":["需要pypdf库","需要Python兼容性","仅限PDF格式"],"ja":["pypdfライブラリが必要","Pythonの互換性が必要","PDF形式のみ"],"ko":["pypdf 라이브러리 필요","Python 호환성 필요","PDF 형식만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca pypdf","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python","Limitado al formato PDF"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque pypdf","Compatibilité Python requise","Limité au format PDF"],"de":["Benötigt die pypdf-Bibliothek","Python-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Begrenzt auf PDF-Format"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca pypdf","Compatibilidade com Python necessária","Limitado ao formato PDF"],"ru":["Требуется библиотека pypdf","Необходима совместимость с Python","Ограничен форматом PDF"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة pypdf","متطلبات متوافقة مع بايثون","محدود بتنسيق PDF"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
