 documento que captura información de posicionamiento y mensaje","fr":"Le contexte de marketing de produit aide à créer et à maintenir un document qui capture les informations de positionnement et de message","de":"Der Produktmarketing-Kontext hilft bei der Erstellung und Pflege eines Dokuments, das Positionierungs- und Nachrichteninformationen erfasst","pt":"O contexto de marketing de produto é um documento fundamental que captura informações de posicionamento e mensagens.","ru":"Контекст продуктового маркетинга - это основной документ, который捕ывает информацию о позиционировании и сообщениях.","ar":"سياق تسويق المنتج هو وثيقة أساسية تلتقط معلومات عن موقف ورسائل المنتج.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动创建产品营销文档","维护产品营销信息","提高营销效率","减少重复工作","支持多语言"],"ja":["製品マーケティングドキュメントの自動作成","製品マーケティング情報の維持","マーケティングの効率を向上","重複作業の削減","多言語対応"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 문서 자동 생성","제품 마케팅 정보 유지","마케팅 효율성 향상","重複 작업 감소","다중 언어 지원"],"es":["Crea un documento de contexto de marketing de producto","Almacena información de posicionamiento y mensaje","Evita la repetición de información","Sumariza la información capturada","Almacena el documento en .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"fr":["Créez un document de contexte de marketing de produit","Stockez les informations de positionnement et de message","Évitez les répétitions d''informations","Résumez les informations capturées","Stockez le document dans .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"de":["Erstellen Sie ein Dokument für den Produktmarketing-Kontext","Speichern Sie Positionierungs- und Nachrichteninformationen","Vermeiden Sie Informationswiederholungen","Fassen Sie die erfassten Informationen zusammen","Speichern Sie das Dokument in .claude/product-marketing-context.md"],"pt":["Criação de um documento de contexto de marketing de produto","Armazenamento em `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Leitura e resumo do conteúdo existente","Verificação de existência do documento","Captura de informações de posicionamento e mensagens"],"ru":["Создание документа контекста продуктового маркетинга","Хранение в `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Чтение и резюме существующего контента","Проверка существования документа","Захват информации о позиционировании и сообщениях"],"ar":["إنشاء وثيقة سياق تسويق المنتج","تخزين في `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","قراءة وملخص المحتوى الحالي","التحقق من وجود الوثيقة","التقاط معلومات عن موقف ورسائل المنتج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["产品营销背景","自动化文档创建","营销效率","文档维护","多语言支持","产品营销信息"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキスト","自動ドキュメント作成","マーケティングの効率","ドキュメントの維持","多言語対応","製品マーケティング情報"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트","자동화 문서 생성","마케팅 효율성","문서 유지","다중 언어 지원","제품 마케팅 정보"],"es":["contexto de marketing de producto","posicionamiento de producto","mensaje de marketing","documento de contexto","evitar la repetición de información","marketing de producto"],"fr":["contexte de marketing de produit","positionnement de produit","message de marketing","document de contexte","éviter les répétitions d''informations","marketing de produit"],"de":["Produktmarketing-Kontext","Produktpositionierung","Marketingnachricht","Kontextdokument","Informationswiederholungen vermeiden","Produktmarketing"],"pt":["contexto de marketing de produto","documento de marketing","posicionamento de produto","mensagens de marketing","equipe de marketing","eficiência de marketing"],"ru":["контекст продуктового маркетинга","документ маркетинга","позиционирование продукта","сообщения маркетинга","маркетинговая команда","эффективность маркетинга"],"ar":["سياق تسويق المنتج","وثيقة تسويق","موقف المنتج","رسائل التسويق","فريق التسويق","كفاءة التسويق"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-marketing-context","description":"When the user wants to create or update their product marketing context document. Also use when the user mentions product context, marketing context, set up context, positioning, or wants to avoid repeating foundational information across marketing tasks. Creates `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` that other marketing skills reference.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Product Marketing Context\n\nYou help users create and maintain a product marketing context document. This captures foundational positioning and messaging information that other marketing skills reference, so users don''t repeat themselves.\n\nThe document is stored at `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Check for Existing Context\n\nFirst, check if `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` already exists.\n\n**If it exists:**\n- Read it and summarize what''s captured\n- Ask whi","body":"# Product Marketing Context\n\nYou help users create and maintain a product marketing context document. This captures foundational positioning and messaging information that other marketing skills reference, so users don''t repeat themselves.\n\nThe document is stored at `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Check for Existing Context\n\nFirst, check if `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` already exists.\n\n**If it exists:**\n- Read it and summarize what''s captured\n- Ask which sections they want to update\n- Only gather info for those sections\n\n**If it doesn''t exist, offer two options:**\n\n1. **Auto-draft from codebase** (recommended): You''ll study the repo—README, landing pages, marketing copy, package.json, etc.—and draft a V1 of the context document. The user then reviews, corrects, and fills gaps. This is faster than starting from scratch.\n\n2. **Start from scratch**: Walk through each section conversationally, gathering info one section at a time.\n\nMost users prefer option 1. After presenting the draft, ask: \"What needs correcting? What''s missing?\"\n\n### Step 2: Gather Information\n\n**If auto-drafting:**\n1. Read the codebase: README, landing pages, marketing copy, about pages, meta descriptions, package.json, any existing docs\n2. Draft all sections based on what you find\n3. Present the draft and ask what needs correcting or is missing\n4. Iterate until the user is satisfied\n\n**If starting from scratch:**\nWalk through each section below conversationally, one at a time. Don''t dump all questions at once.\n\nFor each section:\n1. Briefly explain what you''re capturing\n2. Ask relevant questions\n3. Confirm accuracy\n4. Move to the next\n\n**Important:** Push for verbatim customer language. Exact phrases are more valuable than polished descriptions.\n\n---\n\n## Sections to Capture\n\n### 1. Product Overview\n- One-line description\n- What it does (2-3 sentences)\n- Product category (what \"shelf\" you sit on—how customers search for you)\n- Product type (SaaS, marketplace, e-commerce, service, etc.)\n- Business model and pricing\n\n### 2. Target Audience\n- Target company type (industry, size, stage)\n- Target decision-makers (roles, departments)\n- Primary use case (the main problem you solve)\n- Jobs to be done (2-3 things customers \"hire\" you for)\n- Specific use cases or scenarios\n\n### 3. Personas (B2B only)\nIf multiple stakeholders are involved in buying, capture for each:\n- User, Champion, Decision Maker, Financial Buyer, Technical Influencer\n- What each cares about, their challenge, and the value you promise them\n\n### 4. Problems & Pain Points\n- Core challenge customers face before finding you\n- Why current solutions fall short\n- What it costs them (time, money, opportunities)\n- Emotional tension (stress, fear, doubt)\n\n### 5. Competitive Landscape\n- **Direct competitors**: Same solution, same problem (e.g., Calendly vs SavvyCal)\n- **Secondary competitors**: Different solution, same problem (e.g., Calendly vs Superhuman scheduling)\n- **Indirect competitors**: Conflicting approach (e.g., Calendly vs personal assistant)\n- How each falls short for customers\n\n### 6. Differentiation\n- Key differentiators (capabilities alternatives lack)\n- How you solve it differently\n- Why that''s better (benefits)\n- Why customers choose you over alternatives\n\n### 7. Objections & Anti-Personas\n- Top 3 objections heard in sales and how to address them\n- Who is NOT a good fit (anti-persona)\n\n### 8. Switching Dynamics\nThe JTBD Four Forces:\n- **Push**: What frustrations drive them away from current solution\n- **Pull**: What attracts them to you\n- **Habit**: What keeps them stuck with current approach\n- **Anxiety**: What worries them about switching\n\n### 9. Customer Language\n- How customers describe the problem (verbatim)\n- How they describe your solution (verbatim)\n- Words/phrases to use\n- Words/phrases to avoid\n- Glossary of product-specific terms\n\n### 10. Brand Voice\n- Tone (professional, casual, playful, etc.)\n- Communication style (direct, conversational, technical)\n- Brand personality (3-5 adjectives)\n\n### 11. Proof Points\n- Key metrics or results to cite\n- Notable customers/logos\n- Testimonial snippets\n- Main value themes and supporting evidence\n\n### 12. Goals\n- Primary business goal\n- Key conversion action (what you want people to do)\n- Current metrics (if known)\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Create the Document\n\nAfter gathering information, create `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Product Marketing Context\n\n*Last updated: [date]*\n\n## Product Overview\n**One-liner:**\n**What it does:**\n**Product category:**\n**Product type:**\n**Business model:**\n\n## Target Audience\n**Target companies:**\n**Decision-makers:**\n**Primary use case:**\n**Jobs to be done:**\n-\n**Use cases:**\n-\n\n## Personas\n| Persona | Cares about | Challenge | Value we promise |\n|---------|-------------|-----------|------------------|\n| | | | |\n\n## Problems & Pain Points\n**Core problem:**\n**Why alternatives fall short:**\n-\n**What it costs them:**\n**Emotional tension:**\n\n## Competitive Landscape\n**Direct:** [Competitor] — falls short because...\n**Secondary:** [Approach] — falls short because...\n**Indirect:** [Alternative] — falls short because...\n\n## Differentiation\n**Key differentiators:**\n-\n**How we do it differently:**\n**Why that''s better:**\n**Why customers choose us:**\n\n## Objections\n| Objection | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| | |\n\n**Anti-persona:**\n\n## Switching Dynamics\n**Push:**\n**Pull:**\n**Habit:**\n**Anxiety:**\n\n## Customer Language\n**How they describe the problem:**\n- \"[verbatim]\"\n**How they describe us:**\n- \"[verbatim]\"\n**Words to use:**\n**Words to avoid:**\n**Glossary:**\n| Term | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| | |\n\n## Brand Voice\n**Tone:**\n**Style:**\n**Personality:**\n\n## Proof Points\n**Metrics:**\n**Customers:**\n**Testimonials:**\n> \"[quote]\" — [who]\n**Value themes:**\n| Theme | Proof |\n|-------|-------|\n| | |\n\n## Goals\n**Business goal:**\n**Conversion action:**\n**Current metrics:**\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Confirm and Save\n\n- Show the completed document\n- Ask if anything needs adjustment\n- Save to `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`\n- Tell them: \"Other marketing skills will now use this context automatically. Run `/product-marketing-context` anytime to update it.\"\n\n---\n\n## Tips\n\n- **Be specific**: Ask \"What''s the #1 frustration that brings them to you?\" not \"What problem do they solve?\"\n- **Capture exact words**: Customer language beats polished descriptions\n- **Ask for examples**: \"Can you give me an example?\" unlocks better answers\n- **Validate as you go**: Summarize each section and confirm before moving on\n- **Skip what doesn''t apply**: Not every product needs all sections (e.g., Personas for B2C)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:46:19.417Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing centralized product messaging management.","zh":"非常适合需要集中化产品信息管理的营销代理","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが集中管理された製品メッセージ管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"중앙 집중화된 제품 메시지 관리가 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan una gestión de mensajes de producto centralizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin d''une gestion centralisée des messages de produit.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine zentrale Produktmitteilungsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de gerenciamento de mensagens de produtos centralizadas.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходима централизованная система управления сообщениями о продуктах.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام التسويقية التي تحتاج إلى إدارة رسائل المنتجات المركزية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and maintain a unified product marketing context document, capturing foundational positioning and messaging information in a `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` file, ensuring consistency across marketing efforts.","zh":"赋予代理创建和维护统一的产品营销背景文档的能力，通过`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件捕捉基础定位和信息，确保跨营销工作的的一致性","ja":"エージェントが統一された製品マーケティングコンテキストドキュメントを作成および維持できるようにし、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルで基本的なポジショニングおよびメッセージ情報を取得し、マーケティング活動全体での一貫性を保証する","ko":"에이전트가統一された 제품 마케팅 배경 문서를 생성 및 유지할 수 있도록 하여 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일에서 기본적인 위치 및 메시지 정보를 캡처하여 마케팅 활동 전체에서 일관성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y mantener un documento de contexto de marketing de producto unificado, capturando información de posicionamiento y mensajería fundamental en un archivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, garantizando la consistencia en los esfuerzos de marketing.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de maintenir un document de contexte de marketing de produit unifié, capturant les informations de positionnement et de messagerie fondamentales dans un fichier `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, assurant la cohérence à travers les efforts de marketing.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein einheitliches Produktmarketing-Kontextdokument zu erstellen und zu pflegen, das grundlegende Positionierungs- und Messaging-Informationen in einer Datei `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` erfassen, um Konsistenz bei den Marketingbemühungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e manter um documento de contexto de marketing de produtos unificado, capturando informações de posicionamento e mensagens fundamentais em um arquivo `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, garantindo consistência em todos os esforços de marketing.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и поддерживать унифицированный документ контекста маркетинга продукта, фиксирующий основную информацию о позиционировании и сообщениях в файле `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, обеспечивая последовательность во всех маркетинговых усилиях.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء وتنظيف مستند سياق تسويقي موحد للمنتجات، وهو ما يحتوي على معلومات أساسية حول الموضع والرسائل في ملف `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`، وضمان الاتساق عبر جميع الجهود التسويقية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating product messaging updates","Generating consistent marketing materials","Debugging inconsistencies in product positioning"],"zh":["自动化产品信息更新","生成一致的营销材料","调试产品定位不一致"],"ja":["製品メッセージの更新を自動化する","一貫性のあるマーケティング資料を生成する","製品のポジショニングの不一致をデバッグする"],"ko":["제품 메시지 업데이트를 자동화","일관된 마케팅 자료를 생성","제품 위치의 불일치를 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de mensajes de producto","Generación de materiales de marketing coherentes","Depuración de inconsistencias en la posición del producto"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour des messages de produit","Génération de matériel de marketing cohérent","Débogage des incohérences dans le positionnement du produit"],"de":["Automatisierung von Produktmitteilungsaktualisierungen","Erzeugung konsistenter Marketingmaterialien","Fehlerbehebung bei Inkonsistenzen in der Produktpositionierung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de mensagens de produtos","Gerar materiais de marketing consistentes","Depurar inconsistências no posicionamento do produto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления сообщений о продуктах","Генерировать последовательные маркетинговые материалы","Отлаживать несоответствия в позиционировании продукта"],"ar":["تعزيز تحديثات رسائل المنتجات آليًا","إنتاج مواد تسويقية متسقة","تصحيح.Errors في موضع المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access to `.claude/` directory","Limited to Markdown file format (.md)"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问`.claude/`目录","仅限于Markdown文件格式(.md)"],"ja":[".claude/ディレクトリへのファイルシステムアクセスが必要","Markdownファイル形式(.md)のみに限られる"],"ko":["`.claude/` 디렉토리에 대한 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","마크다운 파일 형식(.md)만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos del directorio `.claude/`","Limitado al formato de archivo Markdown (.md)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers du répertoire `.claude/`","Limité au format de fichier Markdown (.md)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem des Verzeichnisses `.claude/`","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateiformat (.md)"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `.claude/`","Limitado ao formato de arquivo Markdown (.md)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `.claude/`","Ограничен форматом файла Markdown (.md)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `.claude/`","محدود بتنسيق ملف Markdown (.md)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
