Évaluation de l''état actuel","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique","Analyse des mots-clés et des thèmes prioritaires","Évaluation du trafic organique"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse des Kontexts der Website","Bewertung des aktuellen Zustands","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Organischen-Suche-Performance","Analyse von Schlüsselwörtern und priorisierten Themen","Bewertung des organischen Traffics"],"pt":["Análise de site para identificar problemas de SEO","Recomendações para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Análise de tráfego orgânico e palavras-chave","Relatórios personalizados para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Анализ сайта для выявления проблем SEO","Рекомендации для улучшения результатов поиска","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Анализ органического трафика и ключевых слов","Пользовательские отчеты для разработчиков"],"ar":["تحليل الموقع لتحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","توصيات لتحسين أداء محركات البحث العضوي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحليل حركة المرور العضوي والكلمات الرئيسية","تقارير مخصصة للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","开发者工具","网站性能优化","搜索引擎排名"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","開発者ツール","Web サイトパフォーマンス最適化","検索エンジンランキング"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","개발자 도구","웹사이트 성능 최적화","검색 엔진 순위"],"es":["análisis de SEO","mejora de SEO","rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica","problemas de SEO","palabras clave","temas prioritarios","tráfico orgánico","optimización de motores de búsqueda"],"fr":["audit de référencement","amélioration de SEO","performances de recherche organique","problèmes de SEO","mots-clés","thèmes prioritaires","trafic organique","optimisation des moteurs de recherche"],"de":["SEO-Audit","SEO-Optimierung","Organische-Suche-Performance","SEO-Probleme","Schlüsselwörter","priorisierte Themen","organischer Traffic","Suchmaschinen-Optimierung"],"pt":["auditoria de SEO","otimização para mecanismos de busca","desenvolvedores","melhorar desempenho de busca orgânica","análise de site","recomendações de SEO","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tráfego orgânico"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация для поисковых систем","разработчики","улучшение результатов поиска","анализ сайта","рекомендации SEO","инструменты разработки","органический трафик"],"ar":["تدقيق محركات البحث","تحسين محركات البحث","المطورون","تحسين أداء محركات البحث العضوي","تحليل الموقع","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث","أدوات التطوير","حركة المرور العضوي"]}},"owner":"afaraha8403","repo":"MCP-Scooter","repoPath":"afaraha8403/MCP-Scooter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent c","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:45:48.255Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Analysis Agents needing advanced site assessment and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级站点评估和优化功能的SEO分析代理。","ja":"SEO分析エージェントが高度なサイト評価および最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 사이트 평가 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 SEO 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de SEO que necesitan capacidades de evaluación y optimización de sitios avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de SEO ayant besoin de capacités d''évaluation et d''optimisation de sites avancées.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Site-Bewertungs- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de SEO que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de avaliação e otimização de sites.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа SEO, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оценки и оптимизации сайтов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل محركات البحث التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتقييم الموقع وإمكانيات تحسينه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations using site context analysis, keyword prioritization, and organic traffic evaluation, leveraging protocols like HTTP and file formats such as HTML and CSV.","zh":"使代理能够通过站点上下文分析、关键词优先级和有机流量评估等方式识别SEO问题，并提供可行的建议，利用HTTP等协议和HTML、CSV等文件格式。","ja":"サイトのコンテキスト分析、キーワードの優先順位付け、有機的なトラフィック評価などを利用して、SEOの問題を特定し、実行可能な推奨事項を提供することが代理者に可能になります。HTTPなどのプロトコルや、HTML、CSVなどのファイル形式を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 사이트 문맥 분석, 키워드 우선 순위 지정 및 유기적 트래픽 평가 등을 통해 SEO 문제를 식별하고 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. HTTP 및 HTML, CSV와 같은 파일 형식을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones de acción utilizando el análisis de contexto del sitio, la priorización de palabras clave y la evaluación del tráfico orgánico, aprovechando protocolos como HTTP y formatos de archivo como HTML y CSV.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations de action en utilisant l''analyse de contexte du site, la priorisation des mots clés et l''évaluation du trafic organique, en exploitant des protocoles tels que HTTP et des formats de fichiers tels que HTML et CSV.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen unter Verwendung der Kontextanalyse der Website, der Priorisierung von Schlüsselwörtern und der Bewertung des organischen Traffics bereitzustellen, indem Protokolle wie HTTP und Dateiformate wie HTML und CSV genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações práticas usando análise de contexto do site, priorização de palavras-chave e avaliação de tráfego orgânico, aproveitando protocolos como HTTP e formatos de arquivo como HTML e CSV.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации с использованием анализа контекста сайта, приоритизации ключевых слов и оценки органического трафика, используя протоколы như HTTP и форматы файлов такие как HTML и CSV.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام تحليل سياق الموقع وتحديد أولويات الكلمات الرئيسية وتقييم حركة المرور العضوية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وشكلات الملفات مثل HTML و CSV."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structures for SEO compliance","Analyzing organic traffic levels and keyword performance","Generating site optimization reports for business stakeholders"],"zh":["审计网站结构以确保SEO合规性","分析有机流量水平和关键词性能","为商业利益相关者生成站点优化报告"],"ja":["SEOコンプライアンスのためのウェブサイト構造の監査","有機的なトラフィックレベルとキーワード性能の分析","ビジネスステークホルダー向けのサイト最適化レポートの生成"],"ko":["SEO 규정 준수 위한 웹사이트 구조 감사","유기적 트래픽 수준 및 키워드 성능 분석","비즈니스 이해 관계자를 위한 사이트 최적화 보고서 생성"],"es":["Auditoría de estructuras de sitios web para cumplimiento de SEO","Análisis de niveles de tráfico orgánico y rendimiento de palabras clave","Generación de informes de optimización de sitios para partes interesadas empresariales"],"fr":["Audit des structures de sites web pour la conformité SEO","Analyse des niveaux de trafic organique et de la performance des mots clés","Génération de rapports d''optimisation de sites pour les parties prenantes commerciales"],"de":["Prüfung der Website-Strukturen auf SEO-Konformität","Analyse der organischen Traffik-Ebenen und der Schlüsselwortleistung","Erstellung von Site-Optimierungsberichten für Geschäftsbeteiligte"],"pt":["Auditoria de estruturas de sites para conformidade com SEO","Análise de níveis de tráfego orgânico e desempenho de palavras-chave","Geração de relatórios de otimização de sites para partes interessadas empresariais"],"ru":["Аудит структуры сайтов для соответствия требованиям SEO","Анализ уровней органического трафика и производительности ключевых слов","Генерация отчетов об оптимизации сайтов для бизнес- заинтересованных сторон"],"ar":["فحص هياكل المواقع لتوافقها مع معايير محركات البحث","تحليل مستويات حركة المرور العضوية وأداء الكلمات الرئيسية","генерация تقارير لتحسين موقع على شبكة الإنترنت للمستفيدين من الأعمال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires site access and credentials","Limited to HTTP and HTML-based websites"],"zh":["需要站点访问和凭证","仅限HTTP和HTML基于的网站"],"ja":["サイトへのアクセスと資格情報が必要","HTTPおよびHTMLベースのウェブサイトのみ"],"ko":["사이트 액세스 및 자격 증명이 필요함","HTTP 및 HTML 기반 웹사이트만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sitio y credenciales","Limitado a sitios basados en HTTP y HTML"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au site et des informations d''identification","Limité aux sites basés sur HTTP et HTML"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Website und Anmeldeinformationen","Begrenzt auf HTTP- und HTML-basierte Websites"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao site e credenciais","Limitado a sites baseados em HTTP e HTML"],"ru":["Требует доступа к сайту и учетных данных","Ограничен сайтами на основе HTTP и HTML"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الموقع والتصريحات","محدود بالمواقع التي تعتمد على HTTP و HTML"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri/understanding-tauri-process-model', 'community', 'TheerasakPing', 'video-downloader-tauri', 'TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri', 'understanding-tauri-process-model', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z', '2026-02-18T12:46:24.420Z', NULL, '{"id":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri/understanding-tauri-process-model","name":"understanding-tauri-process-model","description":{"zh":"Tauri 的多进程模型类似于 Electron 和现代 Web 浏览器，理解这一模型对于构建安全、高性能的 Tauri 应用至关重要","ja":"Tauri のマルチプロセス モデルは Electron や现代 Web ブラウザと類似しており、このモデルを理解することは、安全で高性能な Tauri アプリを構築する上で非常に重要","ko":"Tauri의 멀티 프로세스 모델은 Electron 및 현대 웹 브라우저와 유사하며, 이 모델을 이해하는 것은 보안 및 성능이 뛰어난 Tauri 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 매우 중요","es":"El modelo de proceso Tauri es una arquitectura de multiproceso similar a Electron y los navegadores web modernos. Entender este modelo es esencial para desarrollar aplicaciones Tauri seguras y de alto rendimiento","fr":"Le modèle de processus Tauri est une architecture de multiprocesso similaire à Electron et aux navigateurs web modernes. Comprendre ce modèle est essentiel pour développer des applications Tauri sécurisées et hautes performances","de":"Das Tauri-Prozess-Modell ist eine Mehrprozessarchitektur, ähnlich wie Electron und moderne Webbrowser. Das Verständnis dieses Modells ist für die Entwicklung sicherer und leistungsstarker Tauri-Anwendungen unerlässlich","pt":"O Tauri implements uma arquitetura multi-processo similar ao Electron e aos navegadores web modernos. Entender esse modelo é essencial para construir aplicações Tauri seguras e performáticas.","ru":"Tauri реализует много-процессную архитектуру, аналогичную Electron и современным веб-браузерам. Понимание этой модели имеет важное значение для создания безопасных и производительных приложений Tauri.","ar":"يُ実ّن Tauri هندسة معمارية متعددة العمليات مشابهة لـ Electron و المتصفحات الويب الحديثة. فهم هذا النموذج ضروري لإنشاء تطبيقات Tauri آمنة وذكية","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tauri 进程模型解析","ja":"Tauri プロセス モデル理解","ko":"Tauri 프로세스 모델 분석","es":"Modelo de Proceso Tauri: Desarrollo de Aplicaciones","fr":"Modèle de Processus Tauri: Développement d''Applications","de":"Tauri-Prozess-Modell: Entwicklung von Anwendungen","pt":"Modelo de Processo Tauri: Entendendo a Arquitetura","ru":"Модель процесса Tauri: понимание архитектуры","ar":"نموذج عملية توري: فهم الهندسة المعمارية","en":"understanding-tauri-process-model"},"description":{"zh":"Tauri 的多进程模型类似于 Electron 和现代 Web 浏览器，理解这一模型对于构建安全、高性能的 Tauri 应用至关重要","ja":"Tauri のマルチプロセス モデルは Electron や现代 Web ブラウザと類似しており、このモデルを理解することは、安全で高性能な Tauri アプリを構築する上で非常に重要","ko":"Tauri의 멀티 프로세스 모델은 Electron 및 현대 웹 브라우저와 유사하며, 이 모델을 이해하는 것은 보안 및 성능이 뛰어난 Tauri 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 매우 중요","es":"El modelo de proceso Tauri es una arquitectura de multiproceso similar a Electron y los navegadores web modernos. Entender este modelo es esencial para desar...","fr":"Le modèle de processus Tauri est une architecture de multiprocesso similaire à Electron et aux navigateurs web modernes. Comprendre ce modèle est essentiel p...","de":"Das Tauri-Prozess-Modell ist eine Mehrprozessarchitektur, ähnlich wie Electron und moderne Webbrowser. Das Verständnis dieses Modells ist für die Entwicklung...","pt":"O Tauri implements uma arquitetura multi-processo similar ao Electron e aos navegadores web modernos. Entender esse modelo é essencial para construir aplicaç...","ru":"Tauri реализует много-процессную архитектуру, аналогичную Electron и современным веб-браузерам. Понимание этой модели имеет важное значение для создания безо...","ar":"يُ実ّن Tauri هندسة معمارية متعددة العمليات مشابهة لـ Electron و المتصفحات الويب الحديثة. فهم هذا النموذج ضروري لإنشاء تطبيقات Tauri آمنة وذكية","en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"definition":{"en":"🎬 Video downloader app - Built with Tauri + React + Rust"},"features":{"zh":["多进程架构","安全性","高性能"," Electron 和现代 Web 浏览器兼容","React 和 Rust 集成"],"ja":["マルチプロセス アーキテクチャ","セキュリティ","高性能","Electron および现代 Web ブラウザとの互換性","React および Rust の統合"],"ko":["멀티 프로세스 아키텍처","보안성","성능","Electron 및 현대 웹 브라우저와의 호환성","React 및 Rust 통합"],"es":["Arquitectura de multiproceso","Seguridad y rendimiento mejorados","Compatibilidad con React y Rust","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio","Flexibilidad y personalización"],"fr":["Architecture de multiprocesso","Sécurité et performances améliorées","Compatibilité avec React et Rust","Développement d''applications de bureau","Flexibilité et personnalisation"],"de":["Mehrprozessarchitektur","Erhöhte Sicherheit und Leistung","Kompatibilität mit React und Rust","Entwicklung von Desktop-Anwendungen","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit"],"pt":["Arquitetura multi-processo","Segurança e desempenho melhorados","Compatibilidade com React e Rust","Criação de aplicações desktop","Integração com o navegador web"],"ru":["Много-процессная архитектура","Повышенная безопасность и производительность","Совместимость с React и Rust","Создание настольных приложений","Интеграция с веб-браузером"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية متعددة العمليات","أمان وتقديم محسّن","توافق مع React و Rust","إنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب","تكامل مع متصفح الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tauri","进程模型","多进程架构","安全性","高性能","Electron","React","Rust"],"ja":["Tauri","プロセス モデル","マルチプロセス アーキテクチャ","セキュリティ","高性能","Electron","React","Rust"],"ko":["Tauri","프로세스 모델","멀티 프로세스 아키텍처","보안성","성능","Electron","React","Rust"],"es":["Tauri","modelo de proceso","desarrollo de aplicaciones","React","Rust","seguridad","rendimiento","aplicaciones de escritorio"],"fr":["Tauri","modèle de processus","développement d''applications","React","Rust","sécurité","performances","applications de bureau"],"de":["Tauri","Prozess-Modell","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","React","Rust","Sicherheit","Leistung","Desktop-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Tauri","modelo de processo","arquitetura multi-processo","segurança","desempenho","React","Rust","aplicações desktop"],"ru":["Tauri","модель процесса","много-процессная архитектура","безопасность","производительность","React","Rust","настольные приложения"],"ar":["توري","نموذج عملية","هندسة معمارية متعددة العمليات","أمان","تقديم","React","Rust","تطبيقات سطح المكتب"]}},"owner":"TheerasakPing","repo":"video-downloader-tauri","repoPath":"TheerasakPing/video-downloader-tauri","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"understanding-tauri-process-model","description":"Explains the Tauri process model architecture including the Core process, WebView process, inter-process communication, multiwindow handling, and process isolation security patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Tauri Process Model\n\nTauri implements a multi-process architecture similar to Electron and modern web browsers. Understanding this model is essential for building secure, performant Tauri applications.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                        TAURI APPLICATION                          |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|","body":"# Tauri Process Model\n\nTauri implements a multi-process architecture similar to Electron and modern web browsers. Understanding this model is essential for building secure, performant Tauri applications.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                        TAURI APPLICATION                          |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                   |\n|  +-----------------------------+                                  |\n|  |       CORE PROCESS          |                                  |\n|  |         (Rust)              |                                  |\n|  |                             |                                  |\n|  |  +----------------------+   |                                  |\n|  |  | Window Manager       |   |                                  |\n|  |  +----------------------+   |                                  |\n|  |  | System Tray          |   |                                  |\n|  |  +----------------------+   |                                  |\n|  |  | Global State         |   |                                  |\n|  |  +----------------------+   |                                  |\n|  |  | IPC Router           |   |                                  |\n|  |  +----------------------+   |                                  |\n|  |  | OS Abstractions      |   |                                  |\n|  +-------------+---------------+                                  |\n|                |                                                  |\n|                | IPC (Inter-Process Communication)                |\n|                |                                                  |\n|     +----------+----------+----------+                            |\n|     |          |          |          |                            |\n|     v          v          v          v                            |\n|  +------+  +------+  +------+  +------+                           |\n|  |WebView|  |WebView|  |WebView|  |WebView|                       |\n|  |  #1   |  |  #2   |  |  #3   |  |  #N   |                       |\n|  +------+  +------+  +------+  +------+                           |\n|  | HTML |  | HTML |  | HTML |  | HTML |                           |\n|  | CSS  |  | CSS  |  | CSS  |  | CSS  |                           |\n|  | JS   |  | JS   |  | JS   |  | JS   |                           |\n|  +------+  +------+  +------+  +------+                           |\n|                                                                   |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n## The Core Process\n\nThe Core process is the application''s entry point and central hub. It runs Rust code and has exclusive access to operating system capabilities.\n\n### Responsibilities\n\n| Responsibility | Description |\n|----------------|-------------|\n| Window Management | Creates and orchestrates application windows |\n| System Integration | Manages system tray menus and notifications |\n| IPC Routing | Handles all inter-process communication |\n| Global State | Manages application-wide settings and database connections |\n| OS Abstractions | Provides cross-platform APIs |\n\n### Why Rust for the Core Process\n\nRust powers the Core process for its memory-safety guarantees. The ownership system prevents:\n\n- Null pointer dereferences\n- Buffer overflows\n- Data races\n- Use-after-free bugs\n\nThis is critical because the Core process has full system access.\n\n```\n+------------------------------------------+\n|            CORE PROCESS                   |\n|                                          |\n|  Memory Safety via Rust Ownership:       |\n|  - No null pointers                      |\n|  - No buffer overflows                   |\n|  - No data races                         |\n|  - No use-after-free                     |\n|                                          |\n|  Full OS Access:                         |\n|  - File system                           |\n|  - Network                               |\n|  - System APIs                           |\n|  - Hardware interfaces                   |\n+------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n## The WebView Process\n\nWebView processes render the user interface using the operating system''s native WebView library.\n\n### Platform-Specific WebViews\n\n```\n+------------------+------------------+------------------+\n|     WINDOWS      |      MACOS       |      LINUX       |\n+------------------+------------------+------------------+\n|                  |                  |                  |\n|  Microsoft Edge  |    WKWebView     |    webkitgtk     |\n|    WebView2      |                  |                  |\n|                  |                  |                  |\n|  Chromium-based  |  Safari engine   |  WebKit engine   |\n|                  |                  |                  |\n+------------------+------------------+------------------+\n         |                  |                  |\n         +------------------+------------------+\n                           |\n                    Dynamic Linking\n                    (Not bundled)\n                           |\n                    Smaller executables\n```\n\n### Key Characteristics\n\n1. **Dynamic Linking**: WebView libraries are linked at runtime, not bundled\n2. **Web Technologies**: Execute HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\n3. **Framework Support**: Works with React, Vue, Svelte, Solid, etc.\n4. **Isolation**: Each WebView runs in its own process space\n\n## Process Communication (IPC)\n\nAll communication between processes flows through the Core process.\n\n```\n+----------------+                              +----------------+\n|   WebView A    |                              |   WebView B    |\n|                |                              |                |\n|  invoke()  ----+---->+----------------+<------+---- invoke()   |\n|                |     |  CORE PROCESS  |       |                |\n|  <---- listen  |<----+                +------>|  listen ---->  |\n|                |     |  - Validates   |       |                |\n+----------------+     |  - Routes      |       +----------------+\n                       |  - Filters     |\n                       |  - Transforms  |\n                       +----------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n                       +----------------+\n                       |   OS / System  |\n                       |   Resources    |\n                       +----------------+\n```\n\n### IPC Flow\n\n1. WebView calls `invoke()` with a command name and payload\n2. Core process receives the message\n3. Core process validates and processes the request\n4. Core process may interact with OS resources\n5. Core process sends response back to WebView\n\n### Example: Basic IPC\n\n**Frontend (JavaScript)**\n```javascript\nimport { invoke } from ''@tauri-apps/api/core'';\n\n// Call a Rust command\nconst result = await invoke(''greet'', { name: ''World'' });\n```\n\n**Backend (Rust)**\n```rust\n#[tauri::command]\nfn greet(name: &str) -> String {\n    format!(\"Hello, {}!\", name)\n}\n```\n\n## Multiwindow Handling\n\nA single Core process manages multiple WebView processes.\n\n```\n                    +-------------------+\n                    |   CORE PROCESS    |\n                    |                   |\n                    |  Shared State:    |\n                    |  - User session   |\n                    |  - App config     |\n                    |  - DB connection  |\n                    +-------------------+\n                           /|\\\n                          / | \\\n                         /  |  \\\n                        /   |   \\\n                       /    |    \\\n                      v     v     v\n               +------+ +------+ +------+\n               |Main  | |Settings| |About|\n               |Window| |Window | |Window|\n               +------+ +------+ +------+\n```\n\n### Window Management Patterns\n\n**Creating Windows**\n```rust\nuse tauri::Manager;\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn open_settings(app: tauri::AppHandle) {\n    tauri::WebviewWindowBuilder::new(\n        &app,\n        \"settings\",\n        tauri::WebviewUrl::App(\"settings.html\".into())\n    )\n    .title(\"Settings\")\n    .build()\n    .unwrap();\n}\n```\n\n**Cross-Window Communication**\n```rust\nuse tauri::Manager;\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn broadcast_update(app: tauri::AppHandle, data: String) {\n    // Emit to all windows\n    app.emit(\"data-updated\", data).unwrap();\n}\n```\n\n**Window-Specific Events**\n```rust\nuse tauri::Manager;\n\n#[tauri::command]\nfn notify_window(app: tauri::AppHandle, window_label: String, data: String) {\n    if let Some(window) = app.get_webview_window(&window_label) {\n        window.emit(\"notification\", data).unwrap();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Process Isolation and Security\n\n### The Principle of Least Privilege\n\n> \"If you have a gardener coming over to trim your hedge, you give them the key to your garden. You would not give them the keys to your house.\"\n\n```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                     SECURITY BOUNDARIES                           |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                   |\n|  +---------------------------+   +---------------------------+    |\n|  |      CORE PROCESS         |   |     WEBVIEW PROCESS       |    |\n|  |      (Trusted Zone)       |   |    (Untrusted Zone)       |    |\n|  +---------------------------+   +---------------------------+    |\n|  |                           |   |                           |    |\n|  |  - File system access     |   |  - Render UI only         |    |\n|  |  - Database connections   |   |  - User input handling    |    |\n|  |  - Network requests       |   |  - Display data           |    |\n|  |  - Crypto operations      |   |  - Call allowed commands  |    |\n|  |  - Secrets management     |   |                           |    |\n|  |  - Business logic         |   |  NO DIRECT ACCESS TO:     |    |\n|  |                           |   |  - File system            |    |\n|  |                           |   |  - Network (direct)       |    |\n|  |                           |   |  - System APIs            |    |\n|  +---------------------------+   +---------------------------+    |\n|                                                                   |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n### Security Benefits of Process Isolation\n\n| Benefit | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Crash Containment | Failures in one process don''t crash the entire app |\n| State Recovery | Invalid processes can be restarted independently |\n| Attack Surface Reduction | Compromised WebView has limited capabilities |\n| Resource Protection | Sensitive data stays in Core process |\n\n### Security Best Practices\n\n**In the Frontend (WebView)**\n\n1. Sanitize all user input\n2. Never handle secrets\n3. Defer business logic to Core process\n4. Implement Content Security Policy (CSP)\n\n**In the Backend (Core Process)**\n\n1. Validate all IPC inputs\n2. Use the capability system to restrict commands\n3. Apply principle of least privilege to each window\n\n### Capability-Based Security\n\nTauri uses a capability system to control what each window can access.\n\n```\n+------------------+     +------------------+     +------------------+\n|   Main Window    |     | Settings Window  |     |  Viewer Window   |\n+------------------+     +------------------+     +------------------+\n| Capabilities:    |     | Capabilities:    |     | Capabilities:    |\n| - read_file      |     | - read_config    |     | - read_file      |\n| - write_file     |     | - write_config   |     | (read only)      |\n| - network        |     |                  |     |                  |\n| - notifications  |     |                  |     |                  |\n+------------------+     +------------------+     +------------------+\n```\n\n**Example: Capability Configuration**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"identifier\": \"main-capability\",\n  \"description\": \"Capability for the main window\",\n  \"windows\": [\"main\"],\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"core:default\",\n    \"fs:read-files\",\n    \"fs:write-files\",\n    \"http:default\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Process Lifecycle\n\n```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                      APPLICATION LIFECYCLE                        |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                   |\n|  1. App Launch                                                    |\n|     +------------------+                                          |\n|     | Core Process     |  <-- Starts first                        |\n|     | Initializes      |                                          |\n|     +------------------+                                          |\n|              |                                                    |\n|              v                                                    |\n|  2. Window Creation                                               |\n|     +------------------+                                          |\n|     | WebView Process  |  <-- Core creates WebViews               |\n|     | Spawned          |                                          |\n|     +------------------+                                          |\n|              |                                                    |\n|              v                                                    |\n|  3. Running                                                       |\n|     +--------+    IPC    +----------+                             |\n|     | Core   |<--------->| WebViews |                             |\n|     +--------+           +----------+                             |\n|              |                                                    |\n|              v                                                    |\n|  4. Shutdown                                                      |\n|     +------------------+                                          |\n|     | WebViews close   |  <-- WebViews terminate first            |\n|     | Core cleans up   |  <-- Core process exits last             |\n|     +------------------+                                          |\n|                                                                   |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n## Summary\n\n| Aspect | Core Process | WebView Process |\n|--------|--------------|-----------------|\n| Language | Rust | JavaScript/TypeScript |\n| Quantity | One per app | One or more per app |\n| OS Access | Full | None (via IPC only) |\n| Role | Backend, orchestration | UI rendering |\n| Security | Trusted | Untrusted |\n| Crash Impact | App terminates | Window closes |\n\nThe Tauri process model provides a secure foundation for building desktop applications by maintaining strict separation between the trusted Core process and the potentially vulnerable WebView processes. All sensitive operations should be implemented in the Core process, with the WebView serving only as a presentation layer.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:46:24.420Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Process Architecture Agents needing to build secure and performant Tauri applications with React and Rust","zh":"非常适合需要构建安全且高性能的 Tauri 应用程序的多进程架构代理，使用 React 和 Rust","ja":"マルチプロセスアーキテクチャエージェントが React と Rust を使用して安全で高性能な Tauri アプリケーションを構築するのに最適","ko":"React와 Rust를 사용하여 안전하고 고성능의 Tauri 애플리케이션을 구축해야 하는 멀티 프로세스 아키텍처 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de arquitectura de multi-proceso que necesitan crear aplicaciones Tauri seguras y de alto rendimiento con React y Rust","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''architecture multi-processus ayant besoin de créer des applications Tauri sécurisées et performantes avec React et Rust","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Prozess-Architektur-Agenten, die sichere und leistungsstarke Tauri-Anwendungen mit React und Rust erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquitetura Multi-Processo que precisam criar aplicações Tauri seguras e performáticas com React e Rust","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов архитектуры с несколькими процессами, которым необходимо создавать безопасные и производительные приложения Tauri с использованием React и Rust","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعدد العمليات الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء تطبيقات Tauri آمنة وقابلة للتنفيذ مع React و Rust"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to architect scalable Tauri applications using a multi-process model similar to Electron and modern web browsers, leveraging React for frontend and Rust for backend, ensuring secure and performant execution of video downloader apps","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的 Tauri 应用程序的能力，使用类似 Electron 和现代 web 浏览器的多进程模型，利用 React 进行前端开发，利用 Rust 进行后端开发，确保安全且高性能的视频下载应用程序执行","ja":"エージェントが Electron やモダンな Web ブラウザと同様のマルチプロセスモデルを使用してスケーラブルな Tauri アプリケーションを設計できるようにし、フロントエンドには React、バックエンドには Rust を使用して、セキュアで高性能なビデオダウンローダーアプリケーションの実行を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 Electron이나 최신 웹 브라우저와 유사한 멀티 프로세스 모델을 사용하여 확장 가능한 Tauri 애플리케이션을设计할 수 있도록 하며, 프론트엔드에는 React, 백엔드에는 Rust를 사용하여 보안이 뛰어난 고성능의 비디오 다운로드 애플리케이션 실행을 보장한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a arquitectar aplicaciones Tauri escalables utilizando un modelo de multi-proceso similar a Electron y los navegadores web modernos, aprovechando React para la interfaz de usuario y Rust para el backend, asegurando una ejecución segura y de alto rendimiento de aplicaciones de descarga de video","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des applications Tauri escalables en utilisant un modèle multi-processus similaire à Electron et aux navigateurs web modernes, en exploitant React pour le frontend et Rust pour le backend, garantissant une exécution sécurisée et performante des applications de téléchargement de vidéos","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Tauri-Anwendungen zu entwerfen, die skalierbar sind und ein Multi-Prozess-Modell ähnlich wie Electron und moderne Webbrowser verwenden, indem sie React für die Benutzeroberfläche und Rust für das Backend nutzen, um eine sichere und leistungsstarke Ausführung von Videodownloader-Apps zu gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquitetarem aplicações Tauri escaláveis usando um modelo de vários processos semelhante ao Electron e aos navegadores da web modernos, aproveitando o React para o frontend e o Rust para o backend, garantindo a execução segura e performática de aplicações de download de vídeo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать масштабируемые приложения Tauri, используя модель с несколькими процессами, аналогичную Electron и современным веб-браузерам, используя React для frontend и Rust для backend, обеспечивая безопасное и производительное выполнение приложений для скачивания видео","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم تطبيقات Tauri قابلة للتوسع باستخدام نموذج متعدد العمليات مشابه لElectron والمتصفحات الحديثة، واستخدام React للواجهة الأمامية وRust للواجهة الخلفية، مما يضمن تنفيذ تطبيقات تنزيل الفيديو بشكل آمن وسريع"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-process architectures for Tauri apps","Building secure video downloader applications with Tauri and React","Optimizing performance in Tauri applications using Rust"],"zh":["为 Tauri 应用程序设计多进程架构","使用 Tauri 和 React 构建安全的视频下载应用程序","使用 Rust 优化 Tauri 应用程序的性能"],"ja":["Tauri アプリケーションのマルチプロセスアーキテクチャを設計する","Tauri と React を使用してセキュアなビデオダウンローダーアプリケーションを構築する","Rust を使用して Tauri アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["Tauri 애플리케이션을 위한 멀티 프로세스 아키텍처 설계","Tauri와 React를 사용하여 보안이 뛰어난 비디오 다운로드 애플리케이션 구축","Rust를 사용하여 Tauri 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de multi-proceso para aplicaciones Tauri","Crear aplicaciones de descarga de video seguras con Tauri y React","Optimizar el rendimiento en aplicaciones Tauri utilizando Rust"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures multi-processus pour les applications Tauri","Créer des applications de téléchargement de vidéos sécurisées avec Tauri et React","Optimiser les performances dans les applications Tauri en utilisant Rust"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Prozess-Architekturen für Tauri-Anwendungen","Erstellen von sicheren Videodownloader-Anwendungen mit Tauri und React","Optimieren der Leistung in Tauri-Anwendungen mit Rust"],"pt":["Projeto de arquiteturas multi-processo para aplicações Tauri","Construção de aplicações de download de vídeo seguras com Tauri e React","Otimização do desempenho em aplicações Tauri usando Rust"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектур с несколькими процессами для приложений Tauri","Создание безопасных приложений для скачивания видео с использованием Tauri и React","Оптимизация производительности в приложениях Tauri с помощью Rust"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة متعددة العمليات لتطبيقات Tauri","بناء تطبيقات آمنة لتنزيل الفيديو باستخدام Tauri و React","تحسين الأداء في تطبيقات Tauri باستخدام Rust"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Tauri''s architecture","Limited to Tauri applications","Dependent on React and Rust for development"],"zh":["需要了解 Tauri 的架构","仅限于 Tauri 应用程序","依赖于 React 和 Rust 进行开发"],"ja":["Tauri のアーキテクチャを理解する必要がある","Tauri アプリケーションに限定される","開発には React と Rust に依存する"],"ko":["Tauri의 아키텍처를 이해해야 한다","Tauri 애플리케이션에만 제한된다","개발에는 React와 Rust에 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura de Tauri","Limitado a aplicaciones Tauri","Dependiente de React y Rust para el desarrollo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture de Tauri","Limité aux applications Tauri","Dépendant de React et Rust pour le développement"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für die Tauri-Architektur","Begrenzt auf Tauri-Anwendungen","Abhängig von React und Rust für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da arquitetura do Tauri","Limitado a aplicações Tauri","Dependente do React e Rust para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Требует понимания архитектуры Tauri","Ограничен приложениями Tauri","Зависит от React и Rust для разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم هندسة Tauri","محدود بتطبيقات Tauri","يعتمد على React و Rust للتنمية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
