X","Técnicas para mejorar la usabilidad","Diseño de flujos de usuario","Análisis de experiencia del usuario","Mejora de la accesibilidad","Creación de interfaces intuitivas"],"fr":["Principes de conception UX","Techniques pour améliorer l''ergonomie","Conception de flux utilisateur","Analyse de l''expérience utilisateur","Amélioration de l''accessibilité","Création d''interfaces intuitives"],"de":["Prinzipien des UX-Designs","Techniken zur Verbesserung der Usability","Erstellung von Benutzerflüssen","Analyse der Benutzererfahrung","Verbesserung der Zugänglichkeit","Erstellung benutzerfreundlicher Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Princípios de UX design","Criação de fluxos de usuário","Melhoria da usabilidade","Análise de UX","Redução de pontos de fricção","Otimização de jornadas de usuário"],"ru":["Принципы UX-дизайна","Создание пользовательских потоков","Улучшение удобства использования","Анализ UX","Снижение точек трения","Оптимизация пользовательских путей"],"ar":["مبادئ تصميم واجهة المستخدم","إنشاء تدفقات المستخدم","تحسين سهولة الاستخدام","تحليل تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تقليل نقاط الاحتكاك","تحسين تجارب المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UX设计","用户体验","用户中心","界面设计","用户流程","可用性"],"ja":["UXデザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","ユーザーセンター","インターフェイス設計","ユーザーフロー","可用性"],"ko":["UX 디자인","사용자 경험","사용자 중심","인터페이스 디자인","사용자 흐름","사용성"],"es":["diseño UX","principios de diseño UX","usabilidad","experiencia del usuario","interfaces intuitivas","accesibilidad","diseño de flujos de usuario","análisis de experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["conception UX","principes de conception UX","ergonomie","expérience utilisateur","interfaces intuitives","accessibilité","conception de flux utilisateur","analyse de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["UX-Design","Prinzipien des UX-Designs","Usability","Benutzererfahrung","benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen","Zugänglichkeit","Erstellung von Benutzerflüssen","Analyse der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["ux design","desenvolvimento de interfaces","usabilidade","experiência do usuário","princípios de UX","design de produto","análise de UX","otimização de jornadas de usuário"],"ru":["ux-дизайн","разработка интерфейсов","удобство использования","пользовательский опыт","принципы UX","дизайн продукта","анализ UX","оптимизация пользовательских путей"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تطوير واجهات","سهولة الاستخدام","تجارب المستخدم","مبادئ تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تصميم المنتج","تحليل تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تحسين تجارب المستخدم"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ux-design","description":"User experience design principles. Use when designing user flows, improving usability, conducting UX reviews, and optimizing user journeys.","bodyPreview":"# UX Design Skill\n\nUser experience principles for creating intuitive, user-centered interfaces.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing user flows\n- Improving usability\n- Conducting UX audits\n- Reducing friction points\n- Enhancing user journeys\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 UX Principles\n\n## Nielsen''s 10 Usability Heuristics\n\n1. **Visibility of system status**\n   - Show loading indicators\n   - Confirm actions completed\n   - Display progress for long operations\n\n2. **Match between system and real world**\n   - Use f","body":"# UX Design Skill\n\nUser experience principles for creating intuitive, user-centered interfaces.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing user flows\n- Improving usability\n- Conducting UX audits\n- Reducing friction points\n- Enhancing user journeys\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 UX Principles\n\n## Nielsen''s 10 Usability Heuristics\n\n1. **Visibility of system status**\n   - Show loading indicators\n   - Confirm actions completed\n   - Display progress for long operations\n\n2. **Match between system and real world**\n   - Use familiar language\n   - Follow real-world conventions\n   - Avoid technical jargon\n\n3. **User control and freedom**\n   - Provide undo/redo\n   - Allow cancel actions\n   - Easy navigation back\n\n4. **Consistency and standards**\n   - Follow platform conventions\n   - Consistent button styles\n   - Predictable behavior\n\n5. **Error prevention**\n   - Validate before submit\n   - Confirmation for destructive actions\n   - Smart defaults\n\n6. **Recognition rather than recall**\n   - Show options visibly\n   - Provide context and hints\n   - Recent items/history\n\n7. **Flexibility and efficiency**\n   - Keyboard shortcuts\n   - Customizable workflows\n   - Expert shortcuts\n\n8. **Aesthetic and minimalist design**\n   - Remove unnecessary elements\n   - Focus on essential content\n   - White space usage\n\n9. **Help users recognize and recover from errors**\n   - Clear error messages\n   - Suggest solutions\n   - Don''t blame the user\n\n10. **Help and documentation**\n    - Easy to search\n    - Context-sensitive help\n    - Task-oriented\n\n---\n\n# 🔄 User Flow Design\n\n## Flow Structure\n\n```\nEntry Point → Task Steps → Confirmation → Success State\n     ↓\nError Handling → Recovery Path\n```\n\n## Sign Up Flow Example\n\n```\nLanding Page\n    ↓\nEmail Input → Validation\n    ↓\nPassword Create → Strength Check\n    ↓\nProfile Setup (Optional) → Skip Option\n    ↓\nWelcome / Onboarding\n    ↓\nMain Dashboard\n```\n\n## Reduce Steps\n\n```\n❌ Bad: 5+ step registration\n   Email → Password → Name → Phone → Address → Verify\n\n✅ Good: Progressive disclosure\n   Email + Password → Verify → (Collect more later)\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📝 Forms UX\n\n## Best Practices\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Good: Clear labels, inline validation\n<form>\n  <label htmlFor=\"email\">Email address</label>\n  <input \n    id=\"email\" \n    type=\"email\"\n    placeholder=\"you@example.com\"\n    aria-describedby=\"email-error\"\n  />\n  {error && <span id=\"email-error\" className=\"text-red-500\">{error}</span>}\n</form>\n```\n\n## Form Guidelines\n\n| Do | Don''t |\n|----|-------|\n| Use single column | Multiple columns on mobile |\n| Show password toggle | Force complex requirements |\n| Inline validation | Validate only on submit |\n| Smart defaults | Make user choose everything |\n| Save progress | Lose data on navigation |\n| Show required fields | Hide what''s optional |\n\n## Error Messages\n\n```\n❌ Bad: \"Invalid input\"\n✅ Good: \"Please enter a valid email address (e.g., name@example.com)\"\n\n❌ Bad: \"Error 500\"\n✅ Good: \"Unable to save. Please try again or contact support.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n# ⚡ Reduce Friction\n\n## Friction Points\n\n| Friction | Solution |\n|----------|----------|\n| Too many clicks | Reduce steps, shortcuts |\n| Waiting | Skeleton loading, optimistic UI |\n| Confusion | Clear labels, tooltips |\n| Errors | Validation, auto-correct |\n| Decision fatigue | Smart defaults, recommendations |\n\n## Optimistic UI\n\n```tsx\n// Show success immediately, rollback if fails\nfunction handleLike() {\n  setLiked(true);  // Instant feedback\n  \n  api.like(postId).catch(() => {\n    setLiked(false);  // Rollback on error\n    toast.error(''Failed to like'');\n  });\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📱 Mobile UX\n\n## Touch Targets\n\n- Minimum: 44x44px\n- Comfortable: 48x48px\n- Spacing between targets: 8px+\n\n## Thumb Zone\n\n```\n┌────────────────────┐\n│   Hard to reach    │  ← Move important actions down\n│                    │\n│  Natural reach     │  ← Primary navigation here\n│                    │\n│  Easy access       │  ← Main CTAs, bottom nav\n└────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Mobile Patterns\n\n- Bottom navigation (5 items max)\n- Pull to refresh\n- Swipe actions\n- Floating action button\n- Modal sheets from bottom\n\n---\n\n# 🔔 Feedback & States\n\n## Every Action Needs Feedback\n\n```\nClick button    → Visual press state\nSubmit form     → Loading indicator\nSuccess         → Confirmation message\nError           → Clear error + solution\nEmpty state     → Helpful guidance\n```\n\n## State Hierarchy\n\n```\n1. Empty    → \"No items yet. Create your first...\"\n2. Loading  → Skeleton or spinner\n3. Error    → Error message + retry\n4. Partial  → Show what''s available\n5. Success  → Full content\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🧭 Navigation\n\n## Navigation Types\n\n| Type | Use Case |\n|------|----------|\n| Top nav | Marketing sites, simple apps |\n| Side nav | Dashboards, complex apps |\n| Bottom nav | Mobile apps (5 items max) |\n| Breadcrumbs | Deep hierarchies |\n| Tabs | Related content sections |\n\n## Navigation Guidelines\n\n- Current location always visible\n- Back button works as expected\n- Consistent across app\n- Maximum 7±2 items per level\n- Search for large sites\n\n---\n\n# ♿ Accessibility (a11y)\n\n## Quick Checklist\n\n- [ ] Keyboard navigation works\n- [ ] Focus states visible\n- [ ] Color contrast 4.5:1+\n- [ ] Alt text on images\n- [ ] Form labels linked\n- [ ] Error messages announced\n- [ ] Touch targets 44px+\n- [ ] No motion for vestibular issues\n\n---\n\n# 📚 UX Resources\n\n- [Nielsen Norman Group](https://www.nngroup.com/)\n- [Laws of UX](https://lawsofux.com/)\n- [ibelick/ui-skills](https://github.com/ibelick/ui-skills)\n- [nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill](https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:47:50.209Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Interface Agents requiring intuitive user experience design principles to enhance usability and user journeys.","zh":"适用于需要直观用户体验设计原则来增强可用性和用户旅程的接口代理。","ja":"インターフェースエージェントが直感的なユーザーエクスペリエンス設計原則を使用して使いやすさとユーザージャーニーを向上させるのに適しています。","ko":"사용자 경험 디자인 원칙을 사용하여 사용 편의성과 사용자 여정을 향상시키는 인터페이스 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Interfaz que requieren principios de diseño de experiencia de usuario intuitiva para mejorar la usabilidad y los recorridos de usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Interface nécessitant des principes de conception d''expérience utilisateur intuitifs pour améliorer l''utilisabilité et les parcours utilisateur.","de":"Ideal für Interface-Agents, die intuitive Benutzererfahrung-Designprinzipien erfordern, um die Benutzerfreundlichkeit und Benutzerreisen zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Interface que requerem princípios de design de experiência do usuário intuitivos para melhorar a usabilidade e as jornadas do usuário.","ru":"Идеально для Интерфейсных Агентов, требующих интуитивных принципов проектирования пользовательского опыта для улучшения удобства использования и пользовательских путей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الذي يتطلب مبادئ التصميم التجربة للمستخدم بال直猶ة لتحسين سهولة الاستخدام والمسارات المستخدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply Nielsen''s 10 Usability Heuristics, ensuring visibility of system status, match between system and real world, and reducing friction points through intelligent load balancing and Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time token streaming.","zh":"赋予代理应用尼尔森的10种可用性启发法，确保系统状态的可见性、系统与现实世界之间的匹配，并通过智能负载平衡和服务器发送事件（SSE）实现实时令牌流，减少摩擦点。","ja":"エージェントにニールセンの10の使いやすさのヒューリスティックを適用させることで、システムの状態の可視性、システムと現実世界の間のマッチングを保ち、インテリジェントな負荷分散とサーバーセントイベント（SSE）によるリアルタイムトークンストリーミングを通じて摩擦点を減らします。","ko":"에이전트가 니엘슨의 10가지 사용성启发법을 적용할 수 있도록 해서 시스템 상태의 가시성, 시스템과 실제 세계 간의 일치, 지능형 부하 분산 및 서버-발송 이벤트(SSE)를 통한 실시간 토큰 스트리밍을 통해 마찰 점을 줄입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las 10 Heurísticas de Usabilidad de Nielsen, garantizando la visibilidad del estado del sistema, la coincidencia entre el sistema y el mundo real, y reduciendo los puntos de fricción a través de un equilibrio de carga inteligente y Eventos enviados por el servidor (SSE) para la transmisión de tokens en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les 10 Heuristiques d''utilisabilité de Nielsen, garantissant la visibilité de l''état du système, la correspondance entre le système et le monde réel, et réduisant les points de friction grâce à un équilibrage de charge intelligent et des Événements envoyés par le serveur (SSE) pour le streaming de jetons en temps réel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Nielsens 10 Benutzerfreundlichkeitsheuristiken anzuwenden, um die Sichtbarkeit des Systemstatus, die Übereinstimmung zwischen System und realer Welt sicherzustellen und Reibungspunkte durch intelligente Lastverteilung und Server-gesendete Ereignisse (SSE) für Echtzeit-Token-Streaming zu reduzieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as 10 Heurísticas de Usabilidade de Nielsen, garantindo a visibilidade do status do sistema, a correspondência entre o sistema e o mundo real, e reduzindo os pontos de fricção por meio de balanceamento de carga inteligente e Eventos Enviados pelo Servidor (SSE) para transmissão de token em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять 10 эвристик удобства использования Нильсена, обеспечивая видимость статуса системы, соответствие между системой и реальным миром, и снижая точки трения посредством интеллектуального балансирования нагрузки и Событий, отправляемых сервером (SSE), для потоковой передачи токенов в реальном времени.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تطبيق 10 قواعد आसانية الاستخدام لنيلسن، مما يضمن رؤية حالة النظام، والتوافق بين النظام والعالم الحقيقي، وتقليل نقاط الاحتكاك من خلال التوزع الذكي للتحميل وأحداث الخادم (SSE) لنقل الرموز في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing user flows with streamlined request routing","Improving usability through UX audits and heuristic evaluations","Enhancing user journeys with loading indicators and progress displays for long operations"],"zh":["设计流畅的用户流程和请求路由","通过用户体验审计和启发法评估来改进可用性","增强用户旅程，使用加载指示器和进度显示来处理长时间操作"],"ja":["ストリームライン化されたリクエストルーティングでユーザーフローを設計する","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの監査とヒューリスティック評価を通じて使いやすさを改善する","ロードインジケーターと長時間の操作の進度表示を使用してユーザージャーニーを強化する"],"ko":["스트림 라인화된 요청 라우팅으로 사용자 흐름을 설계한다","사용자 경험 감사 및启发法 평가를 통해 사용 편의성을 개선한다","로딩 표시기 및 긴 작업 진행 표시를 사용하여 사용자 여정을 강화한다"],"es":["Diseñar flujos de usuario con enrutamiento de solicitudes optimizado","Mejorar la usabilidad a través de auditorías de UX y evaluaciones heurísticas","Mejorar los recorridos de usuario con indicadores de carga y visualizaciones de progreso para operaciones largas"],"fr":["Concevoir des flux d''utilisateurs avec un routage de requêtes optimisé","Améliorer l''utilisabilité grâce à des audits UX et des évaluations heuristiques","Améliorer les parcours utilisateur avec des indicateurs de chargement et des affichages de progression pour les opérations longues"],"de":["Benutzerflüsse mit optimiertem Anforderungsrouting entwerfen","Benutzerfreundlichkeit durch UX-Audits und heuristische Bewertungen verbessern","Benutzerreisen mit Ladeanzeigern und Fortschrittsanzeigern für lange Operationen verbessern"],"pt":["Projetar fluxos de usuário com roteamento de solicitação simplificado","Melhorar a usabilidade por meio de auditorias de UX e avaliações heurísticas","Aumentar as jornadas do usuário com indicadores de carregamento e exibições de progresso para operações longas"],"ru":["Проектирование потоков пользователей с упрощенным маршрутизацией запросов","Улучшение удобства использования посредством аудитов UX и эвристических оценок","Улучшение пользовательских путей с помощью индикаторов загрузки и отображений прогресса для длинных операций"],"ar":["تصميم تدفقات المستخدم مع توجيه الطلبات المبسطة","تحسين سهولة الاستخدام من خلال عمليات فحص واجهة المستخدم وتقييمات قواعدية","تحسين مسارات المستخدم مع مؤشرات التحميل وعرض التقدم لعملية طويلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of user experience principles","Dependent on LLM backend compatibility for seamless request routing"],"zh":["需要理解用户体验原则","依赖于LLM后端兼容性以实现无缝的请求路由"],"ja":["ユーザーエクスペリエンスの原則を理解する必要がある","シームレスなリクエストルーティングを実現するためにLLMバックエンドの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["사용자 경험 원칙을 이해해야 한다","무결점 요청 라우팅을 달성하기 위해 LLM 백엔드 호환성을 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de experiencia de usuario","Depende de la compatibilidad del backend de LLM para un enrutamiento de solicitudes sin problemas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes d''expérience utilisateur","Dépend de la compatibilité du backend LLM pour un routage de requêtes sans problème"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für Benutzererfahrungsprinzipien","Hängt von der Kompatibilität des LLM-Backends für ein reibungsloses Anforderungsrouting ab"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de experiência do usuário","Depende da compatibilidade do backend LLM para roteamento de solicitação sem problemas"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов пользовательского опыта","Зависит от совместимости бэкэнда LLM для бесперебойного маршрутизации запросов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ تجربة المستخدم","يعتمد على توافق الخلفية LLM من أجل توجيه الطلبات دون مشاكل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
