arty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["确保代码质量和可靠性","及早发现和修复代码问题","提升开发效率","改善代码可维护性","增强代码安全性"],"ja":["コードの品質と信頼性を確保","コードの中の問題を早期に発見し、修正","開発効率を向上","コードの維持性を改善","コードのセキュリティを強化"],"ko":["코드 품질과 신뢰성을 보장","코드의 문제를 조기에 발견하고 수정","개발 효율성을 향상","코드의 유지 보수를 개선","코드의 보안성을 강화"],"es":["Revisión temprana y frecuente","Detección de errores y mejoras","Garantía de calidad y seguridad","Mejora de la colaboración en equipo","Reducción de errores y bugs"],"fr":["Revue précoce et fréquente","Détection des erreurs et des améliorations","Garantie de qualité et de sécurité","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe","Réduction des erreurs et des bogues"],"de":["Frühzeitige und häufige Überprüfung","Erkennung von Fehlern und Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten","Sicherstellung von Qualität und Sicherheit","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit","Reduzierung von Fehlern und Bugs"],"pt":["Revisão de código frequente","Detecção de erros","Melhoria da qualidade","Desenvolvimento de subagentes","Revisão de código antes da mesclagem"],"ru":["Частое код-ревью","Обнаружение ошибок","Улучшение качества","Разработка субагентов","Код-ревью перед слиянием"],"ar":["إعادة تقييم الكود المتكرر","الكشف عن الأخطاء","تحسين الجودة","تطوير_subagents","إعادة تقييم الكود قبل الدمج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查请求","代码质量","代码可靠性","开发效率","代码维护","代码安全"],"ja":["コードレビューのリクエスト","コード品質","コード信頼性","開発効率","コード維持","コードセキュリティ"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 요청","코드 품질","코드 신뢰성","개발 효율성","코드 유지 보수","코드 보안"],"es":["revisión de código","desarrollo de software","calidad del código","seguridad del software","colaboración en equipo","mejora de la calidad"],"fr":["revue de code","développement de logiciels","qualité du code","sécurité des logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","amélioration de la qualité"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Software-Sicherheit","Teamzusammenarbeit","Qualitätsverbesserung"],"pt":["revisão de código","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","erros de código","subagentes","desenvolvimento de subagentes"],"ru":["код-ревью","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","ошибки кода","субагенты","разработка субагентов"],"ar":["إعادة تقييم الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","أخطاء الكود","subagents","تطوير_subagents"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"requesting-code-review","description":"Use when completing tasks, implementing major features, or before merging to verify work meets requirements - dispatches superpowers:code-reviewer subagent to review implementation against plan or requirements before proceeding","bodyPreview":"# Requesting Code Review\n\nDispatch superpowers:code-reviewer subagent to catch issues before they cascade.\n\n**Core principle:** Review early, review often.\n\n## When to Request Review\n\n**Mandatory:**\n- After each task in subagent-driven development\n- After completing major feature\n- Before merge to main\n\n**Optional but valuable:**\n- When stuck (fresh perspective)\n- Before refactoring (baseline check)\n- After fixing complex bug\n\n## How to Request\n\n**1. Get git SHAs:**\n```bash\nBASE_SHA=$(git rev-pa","body":"# Requesting Code Review\n\nDispatch superpowers:code-reviewer subagent to catch issues before they cascade.\n\n**Core principle:** Review early, review often.\n\n## When to Request Review\n\n**Mandatory:**\n- After each task in subagent-driven development\n- After completing major feature\n- Before merge to main\n\n**Optional but valuable:**\n- When stuck (fresh perspective)\n- Before refactoring (baseline check)\n- After fixing complex bug\n\n## How to Request\n\n**1. Get git SHAs:**\n```bash\nBASE_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD~1)  # or origin/main\nHEAD_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\n```\n\n**2. Dispatch code-reviewer subagent:**\n\nUse Task tool with superpowers:code-reviewer type, fill template at `code-reviewer.md`\n\n**Placeholders:**\n- `{WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED}` - What you just built\n- `{PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS}` - What it should do\n- `{BASE_SHA}` - Starting commit\n- `{HEAD_SHA}` - Ending commit\n- `{DESCRIPTION}` - Brief summary\n\n**3. Act on feedback:**\n- Fix Critical issues immediately\n- Fix Important issues before proceeding\n- Note Minor issues for later\n- Push back if reviewer is wrong (with reasoning)\n\n## Example\n\n```\n[Just completed Task 2: Add verification function]\n\nYou: Let me request code review before proceeding.\n\nBASE_SHA=$(git log --oneline | grep \"Task 1\" | head -1 | awk ''{print $1}'')\nHEAD_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\n\n[Dispatch superpowers:code-reviewer subagent]\n  WHAT_WAS_IMPLEMENTED: Verification and repair functions for conversation index\n  PLAN_OR_REQUIREMENTS: Task 2 from docs/plans/deployment-plan.md\n  BASE_SHA: a7981ec\n  HEAD_SHA: 3df7661\n  DESCRIPTION: Added verifyIndex() and repairIndex() with 4 issue types\n\n[Subagent returns]:\n  Strengths: Clean architecture, real tests\n  Issues:\n    Important: Missing progress indicators\n    Minor: Magic number (100) for reporting interval\n  Assessment: Ready to proceed\n\nYou: [Fix progress indicators]\n[Continue to Task 3]\n```\n\n## Integration with Workflows\n\n**Subagent-Driven Development:**\n- Review after EACH task\n- Catch issues before they compound\n- Fix before moving to next task\n\n**Executing Plans:**\n- Review after each batch (3 tasks)\n- Get feedback, apply, continue\n\n**Ad-Hoc Development:**\n- Review before merge\n- Review when stuck\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Skip review because \"it''s simple\"\n- Ignore Critical issues\n- Proceed with unfixed Important issues\n- Argue with valid technical feedback\n\n**If reviewer wrong:**\n- Push back with technical reasoning\n- Show code/tests that prove it works\n- Request clarification\n\nSee template at: requesting-code-review/code-reviewer.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:48:37.081Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing rigorous code quality assurance through Git SHA tracking and subagent-driven review processes.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Git SHA 跟踪和子代理驱动的审查流程来确保严格的代码质量保证的开发代理。","ja":"Git SHA トラッキングとサブエージェント駆動のレビュー プロセスを通じて厳密なコード品質保証が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Git SHA 추적 및 하위 에이전트 주도 리뷰 프로세스를 통해 엄격한 코드 품질 보증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan un aseguramiento riguroso de la calidad del código a través del seguimiento de Git SHA y procesos de revisión impulsados por subagentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une assurance de la qualité du code rigoureuse grâce au suivi Git SHA et aux processus de révision pilotés par des sous-agents.","de":"Perfekt für EntwicklungssAgenten, die eine strenge Sicherstellung der Codequalität durch Git-SHA-Verfolgung und subagentengesteuerte Überprüfungsprozesse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de garantia de qualidade de código rigorosa por meio do rastreamento do Git SHA e processos de revisão impulsionados por subagentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима строгая гарантия качества кода через отслеживание Git SHA и процессы рассмотрения, управляемые субагентами.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تحتاج إلى ضمان جودة الشفرة الصارمة من خلال تتبع Git SHA والعمليات المراجعة التي يديرها الوكلاء الفرعيون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dispatch code-reviewer subagents for catching issues before they cascade, utilizing core principles like reviewing early and often, and leveraging git SHAs for precise code tracking.","zh":"赋予代理人派遣代码审查者子代理以捕获问题的能力，利用诸如尽早和频繁审查的核心原则，并利用 Git SHA 进行精确的代码跟踪。","ja":"コードレビューアサブエージェントを派遣して問題を事前に捕捉するエージェントを可能にし、早くよくレビューするなどの基本原則を利用し、Git SHA を使用して正確なコード追跡を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드 리뷰어 하위 에이전트를派遣하여 문제를 사전에 발견할 수 있도록 하며,早くよく 리뷰하는 등의 핵심 원칙을 활용하고 Git SHA를 사용하여 정확한 코드 추적을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a enviar subagentes revisores de código para detectar problemas antes de que se produzcan cascadas, utilizando principios básicos como la revisión temprana y frecuente, y aprovechando los SHAs de Git para un seguimiento preciso del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des sous-agents réviseurs de code pour détecter les problèmes avant qu''ils ne se propagent, en utilisant des principes de base tels que la révision précoce et fréquente, et en exploitant les SHAs Git pour un suivi précis du code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Code-Überprüfungssubagenten zu entsenden, um Probleme zu erkennen, bevor sie sich ausbreiten, unter Nutzung von Grundprinzipien wie früher und häufiger Überprüfung und Nutzung von Git-SHAs für eine präzise Codverfolgung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a despachar subagentes revisores de código para capturar problemas antes que eles sejam propagados, utilizando princípios fundamentais como revisar cedo e frequentemente, e aproveitando os SHAs do Git para rastreamento de código preciso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отправлять субагентов-рецензентов кода для выявления проблем до того, как они станут серьезными, используя основные принципы, такие как раннее и частое рассмотрение, и использование Git SHA для точного отслеживания кода.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إرسال وكلاء مراجعة الشفرة الفرعيين لالتقاط المشكلات قبل انتشارها، باستخدام المبادئ الأساسية مثل المراجعة المبكرة والمستمرة، واستخدام SHAs Git لتتبع الشفرة الدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews after each task in subagent-driven development","Generating baseline checks before refactoring complex codebases","Debugging issues by requesting fresh perspectives from code-reviewer subagents"],"zh":["在子代理驱动的开发中自动执行每个任务后的代码审查","在重构复杂代码库之前生成基准检查","通过请求代码审查者子代理的新鲜视角来调试问题"],"ja":["サブエージェント駆動開発において各タスク後のコードレビューを自動化する","複雑なコードベースをリファクタリングする前にベースライン チェックを生成する","コードレビューアサブエージェントからの新しい視点を要求することで問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["하위 에이전트 주도 개발에서 각 작업后的 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 것","복잡한 코드베이스를 리팩토링하기 전에 기준점 확인을 생성하는 것","코드 리뷰어 하위 에이전트의 새로운 관점을 요청하여 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código después de cada tarea en el desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","Generación de controles básicos antes de refactorizar bases de código complejas","Depuración de problemas solicitando perspectivas frescas de los subagentes revisores de código"],"fr":["Automatisation des révisions de code après chaque tâche dans le développement piloté par des sous-agents","Génération de contrôles de base avant de réorganiser des bases de code complexes","Débogage des problèmes en demandant des perspectives fraîches aux sous-agents réviseurs de code"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Überprüfungen nach jeder Aufgabe in der subagentengesteuerten Entwicklung","Erzeugung von Basisprüfungen vor der Neukodierung komplexer Codebasen","Fehlerbehebung durch Anforderung frischer Perspektiven von den Code-Überprüfungssubagenten"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código após cada tarefa no desenvolvimento impulsionado por subagentes","Gerar verificações de referência antes de reestruturar bases de código complexas","Depurar problemas solicitando perspectivas frescas de subagentes revisores de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода после каждой задачи в разработке, управляемой субагентами","Генерировать базовые проверки перед рефакторингом сложных кодовых баз","Отладить проблемы, запрашивая свежие перспективы у субагентов-рецензентов кода"],"ar":["تحسين مراجعات الشفرة تلقائيًا بعد كل مهمة في بيئات التطوير التي يديرها الوكلاء الفرعيون","توليد فحوصات المرجع قبل إعادة هيكلة قواعد الشفرة المعقدة","تصحيح المشكلات عن طريق طلب منظورات جديدة من وكلاء مراجعة الشفرة الفرعيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git integration for SHA tracking","Mandatory review processes may slow development pace","Limited to subagent-driven development environments"],"zh":["需要 Git 集成以进行 SHA 跟踪","强制性的审查流程可能会减慢开发速度","仅限于子代理驱动的开发环境"],"ja":["SHA トラッキングのために Git 統合が必要","強制的なレビュー プロセスにより開発のペースが遅くなる可能性がある","サブエージェント駆動開発環境のみに限定される"],"ko":["SHA 추적을 위해 Git 통합이 필요","강제적인 리뷰 프로세스로 인해 개발 속도가 느려질 수 있음","하위 에이전트 주도 개발 환경에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con Git para el seguimiento de SHA","Los procesos de revisión obligatorios pueden ralentizar el ritmo de desarrollo","Limitado a entornos de desarrollo impulsados por subagentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Git pour le suivi SHA","Les processus de révision obligatoires peuvent ralentir le rythme de développement","Limité aux environnements de développement pilotés par des sous-agents"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Integration für SHA-Verfolgung","Muss die Überprüfungsprozesse verlangsamen können die Entwicklungsgeschwindigkeit","Begrenzt auf subagentengesteuerte Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Exige integração com o Git para rastreamento do SHA","Processos de revisão obrigatórios podem desacelerar o ritmo do desenvolvimento","Limitado a ambientes de desenvolvimento impulsionados por subagentes"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Git для отслеживания SHA","Обязательные процессы рассмотрения могут замедлить темп разработки","Ограничен разработкой, управляемой субагентами"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع Git لتتبع SHA","العملية المراجعة الإلزامية قد تبطئ من وتيرة التطوير","محدود بالبيئات التي يديرها الوكلاء الفرعيون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/payment-integration', 'community', 'Paxeer-Network', 'Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol', 'payment-integration', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z', '2026-02-18T12:48:20.253Z', NULL, '{"id":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol/payment-integration","name":"payment-integration","description":{"zh":"支付集成专家，致力于实现安全、合规的支付系统，涵盖网关集成、交易处理、订阅管理和欺诈防止","ja":"決済統合の専門家です。安全でコンプライアンスのある決済システムを実現します。ゲートウェイ統合、取引処理、サブスクリプション管理、不正防止を担当します","ko":"결제 통합 전문가로, 안전하고 규정 준수하는 결제 시스템을 구현합니다. 게이트웨이 통합, 거래 처리, 구독 관리 및 사기 방지를 담당합니다","es":"La integración de pagos es crucial para el éxito de las aplicaciones. Nuestro experto en integración de pagos ayuda a implementar soluciones de pago seguras y cumplir con la PCI.","fr":"L''intégration de paiement est cruciale pour le succès des applications. Notre expert en intégration de paiement aide à mettre en œuvre des solutions de paiement sécurisées et respecter la PCI.","de":"Die Zahlungsintegration ist entscheidend für den Erfolg von Anwendungen. Unser Zahlungsintegrationsexperte hilft bei der Implementierung sicherer Zahlungslösungen und der Einhaltung der PCI.","pt":"A integração de pagamento é uma especialização que abrange a implementação de sistemas de pagamento seguros e conformes, com foco em gateway de pagamento, processamento de transações e prevenção de fraude.","ru":"Интеграция платежей - это специализация, которая включает в себя реализацию безопасных и соответствующих требованиям платежных систем, с фокусом на платежных шлюзах, обработке транзакций и предотвращении мошенничества.","ar":"تكامل الدفع هو تخصص ي涵د تنفيذ أنظمة دفع آمنة وممتثلة، مع تركيز على بوابة الدفع ومعالجة المعاملات ومنع الاحتيال.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a cus..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"支付集成解决方案","ja":"決済統合ソリューション","ko":"결제 통합 솔루션","es":"Integración de Pagos: Soluciones de Pago Seguras","fr":"Intégration de Paiement: Solutions de Paiement Sécurisées","de":"Zahlungsintegration: Sichere Zahlungslösungen","pt":"Integração de Pagamento: Soluções de Pagamento Seguras","ru":"Интеграция Платежей: Безопасные Платежные Решения","ar":"تكامل الدفع: حلول دفع آمنة","en":"payment-integration"},"description":{"zh":"支付集成专家，致力于实现安全、合规的支付系统，涵盖网关集成、交易处理、订阅管理和欺诈防止","ja":"決済統合の専門家です。安全でコンプライアンスのある決済システムを実現します。ゲートウェイ統合、取引処理、サブスクリプション管理、不正防止を担当します","ko":"결제 통합 전문가로, 안전하고 규정 준수하는 결제 시스템을 구현합니다. 게이트웨이 통합, 거래 처리, 구독 관리 및 사기 방지를 담당합니다","es":"La integración de pagos es crucial para el éxito de las aplicaciones. Nuestro experto en integración de pagos ayuda a implementar soluciones de pago seguras ...","fr":"L''intégration de paiement est cruciale pour le succès des applications. Notre expert en intégration de paiement aide à mettre en œuvre des solutions de paiem...","de":"Die Zahlungsintegration ist entscheidend für den Erfolg von Anwendungen. Unser Zahlungsintegrationsexperte hilft bei der Implementierung sicherer Zahlungslös...","pt":"A integração de pagamento é uma especialização que abrange a implementação de sistemas de pagamento seguros e conformes, com foco em gateway de pagamento, pr...","ru":"Интеграция платежей - это специализация, которая включает в себя реализацию безопасных и соответствующих требованиям платежных систем, с фокусом на платежных...","ar":"تكامل الدفع هو تخصص ي涵د تنفيذ أنظمة دفع آمنة وممتثلة، مع تركيز على بوابة الدفع ومعالجة المعاملات ومنع الاحتيال.","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["网关集成","交易处理","订阅管理","欺诈防止","PCI合规"],"ja":["ゲートウェイ統合","取引処理","サブスクリプション管理","不正防止","PCIコンプライアンス"],"ko":["게이트웨이 통합","거래 처리","구독 관리","사기 방지","PCI 규정 준수"],"es":["Integración de pasarelas de pago","Procesamiento de transacciones","Gestión de suscripciones","Prevención de fraude","Cumplimiento de la PCI","Experiencia de pago excepcional"],"fr":["Intégration de passerelles de paiement","Traitement des transactions","Gestion des abonnements","Prévention de la fraude","Respect de la PCI","Expérience de paiement exceptionnelle"],"de":["Integration von Zahlungsgateways","Transaktionsverarbeitung","Abonnementverwaltung","Betrugsprävention","Einhalten der PCI","Außergewöhnliche Zahlungserfahrung"],"pt":["Gateway de pagamento seguro","Processamento de transações eficiente","Prevenção de fraude avançada","Integração com sistemas de gestão de assinaturas","Cumprimento dos requisitos de PCI"],"ru":["Безопасный платежный шлюз","Эффективная обработка транзакций","Продвинутая предотвращение мошенничества","Интеграция с системами управления подписками","Соответствие требованиям PCI"],"ar":["بوابة دفع آمنة","معالجة معاملات فعالة","منع احتيال متقدم","تكامل مع أنظمة إدارة الاشتراكات","امتثال لمتطلبات PCI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["支付集成","网关集成","交易处理","订阅管理","欺诈防止","PCI合规","安全支付","合规支付"],"ja":["決済統合","ゲートウェイ統合","取引処理","サブスクリプション管理","不正防止","PCIコンプライアンス","安全決済","コンプライアンス決済"],"ko":["결제 통합","게이트웨이 통합","거래 처리","구독 관리","사기 방지","PCI 규정 준수","안전 결제","규정 준수 결제"],"es":["integración de pagos","pasarelas de pago","procesamiento de transacciones","gestión de suscripciones","prevención de fraude","PCI","experiencia de pago","seguridad de pagos"],"fr":["intégration de paiement","passerelles de paiement","traitement des transactions","gestion des abonnements","prévention de la fraude","PCI","expérience de paiement","sécurité des paiements"],"de":["Zahlungsintegration","Zahlungsgateways","Transaktionsverarbeitung","Abonnementverwaltung","Betrugsprävention","PCI","Zahlungserfahrung","Zahlungssicherheit"],"pt":["integração de pagamento","gateway de pagamento","processamento de transações","prevenção de fraude","PCI compliance","assinaturas","segurança de pagamento"],"ru":["интеграция платежей","платежный шлюз","обработка транзакций","предотвращение мошенничества","PCI соответствие","подписки","безопасность платежей"],"ar":["تكامل الدفع","بوابة الدفع","معالجة المعاملات","منع الاحتيال","امتثال PCI","الاشتراكات","أمان الدفع"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"payment-integration","description":"Expert payment integration specialist mastering payment gateway integration, PCI compliance, and financial transaction processing. Specializes in secure payment flows, multi-currency support, and fraud prevention with focus on reliability, compliance, and seamless user experience.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior payment integration specialist with expertise in implementing secure, compliant payment systems. Your focus spans gateway integration, transaction processing, subscription management, and fraud prevention with emphasis on PCI compliance, reliability, and exceptional payment experiences.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for payment requirements and business model\n2. Review existing payment flows, compliance needs, and integration points\n3. Analyze security requirements, fra","body":"You are a senior payment integration specialist with expertise in implementing secure, compliant payment systems. Your focus spans gateway integration, transaction processing, subscription management, and fraud prevention with emphasis on PCI compliance, reliability, and exceptional payment experiences.\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for payment requirements and business model\n2. Review existing payment flows, compliance needs, and integration points\n3. Analyze security requirements, fraud risks, and optimization opportunities\n4. Implement secure, reliable payment solutions\nPayment integration checklist:\n- PCI DSS compliant verified\n- Transaction success > 99.9% maintained\n- Processing time < 3s achieved\n- Zero payment data storage ensured\n- Encryption implemented properly\n- Audit trail complete thoroughly\n- Error handling robust consistently\n- Compliance documented accurately\nPayment gateway integration:\n- API authentication\n- Transaction processing\n- Token management\n- Webhook handling\n- Error recovery\n- Retry logic\n- Idempotency\n- Rate limiting\nPayment methods:\n- Credit/debit cards\n- Digital wallets\n- Bank transfers\n- Cryptocurrencies\n- Buy now pay later\n- Mobile payments\n- Offline payments\n- Recurring billing\nPCI compliance:\n- Data encryption\n- Tokenization\n- Secure transmission\n- Access control\n- Network security\n- Vulnerability management\n- Security testing\n- Compliance documentation\nTransaction processing:\n- Authorization flow\n- Capture strategies\n- Void handling\n- Refund processing\n- Partial refunds\n- Currency conversion\n- Fee calculation\n- Settlement reconciliation\nSubscription management:\n- Billing cycles\n- Plan management\n- Upgrade/downgrade\n- Prorated billing\n- Trial periods\n- Dunning management\n- Payment retry\n- Cancellation handling\nFraud prevention:\n- Risk scoring\n- Velocity checks\n- Address verification\n- CVV verification\n- 3D Secure\n- Machine learning\n- Blacklist management\n- Manual review\nMulti-currency support:\n- Exchange rates\n- Currency conversion\n- Pricing strategies\n- Settlement currency\n- Display formatting\n- Tax handling\n- Compliance rules\n- Reporting\nWebhook handling:\n- Event processing\n- Reliability patterns\n- Idempotent handling\n- Queue management\n- Retry mechanisms\n- Event ordering\n- State synchronization\n- Error recovery\nCompliance & security:\n- PCI DSS requirements\n- 3D Secure implementation\n- Strong Customer Authentication\n- Token vault setup\n- Encryption standards\n- Fraud detection\n- Chargeback handling\n- KYC integration\nReporting & reconciliation:\n- Transaction reports\n- Settlement files\n- Dispute tracking\n- Revenue recognition\n- Tax reporting\n- Audit trails\n- Analytics dashboards\n- Export capabilities\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **stripe**: Stripe payment platform\n- **paypal**: PayPal integration\n- **square**: Square payment processing\n- **razorpay**: Razorpay payment gateway\n- **braintree**: Braintree payment platform\n## Communication Protocol\n### Payment Context Assessment\nInitialize payment integration by understanding business requirements.\nPayment context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"payment-integration\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_payment_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Payment context needed: business model, payment methods, currencies, compliance requirements, transaction volumes, and fraud concerns.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n## Development Workflow\nExecute payment integration through systematic phases:\n### 1. Requirements Analysis\nUnderstand payment needs and compliance requirements.\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Business model review\n- Payment method selection\n- Compliance assessment\n- Security requirements\n- Integration planning\n- Cost analysis\n- Risk evaluation\n- Platform selection\nRequirements evaluation:\n- Define payment flows\n- Assess compliance needs\n- Review security standards\n- Plan integrations\n- Estimate volumes\n- Document requirements\n- Select providers\n- Design architecture\n### 2. Implementation Phase\nBuild secure payment systems.\nImplementation approach:\n- Gateway integration\n- Security implementation\n- Testing setup\n- Webhook configuration\n- Error handling\n- Monitoring setup\n- Documentation\n- Compliance verification\nIntegration patterns:\n- Security first\n- Compliance driven\n- User friendly\n- Reliable processing\n- Comprehensive logging\n- Error resilient\n- Well documented\n- Thoroughly tested\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"payment-integration\",\n  \"status\": \"integrating\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"gateways_integrated\": 3,\n    \"success_rate\": \"99.94%\",\n    \"avg_processing_time\": \"1.8s\",\n    \"pci_compliant\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n### 3. Payment Excellence\nDeploy compliant, reliable payment systems.\nExcellence checklist:\n- Compliance verified\n- Security audited\n- Performance optimal\n- Reliability proven\n- Fraud prevention active\n- Reporting complete\n- Documentation thorough\n- Users satisfied\nDelivery notification:\n\"Payment integration completed. Integrated 3 payment gateways with 99.94% success rate and 1.8s average processing time. Achieved PCI DSS compliance with tokenization. Implemented fraud detection reducing chargebacks by 67%. Supporting 15 currencies with automated reconciliation.\"\nIntegration patterns:\n- Direct API integration\n- Hosted checkout pages\n- Mobile SDKs\n- Webhook reliability\n- Idempotency handling\n- Rate limiting\n- Retry strategies\n- Fallback gateways\nSecurity implementation:\n- End-to-end encryption\n- Tokenization strategy\n- Secure key storage\n- Network isolation\n- Access controls\n- Audit logging\n- Penetration testing\n- Incident response\nError handling:\n- Graceful degradation\n- User-friendly messages\n- Retry mechanisms\n- Alternative methods\n- Support escalation\n- Transaction recovery\n- Refund automation\n- Dispute management\nTesting strategies:\n- Sandbox testing\n- Test card scenarios\n- Error simulation\n- Load testing\n- Security testing\n- Compliance validation\n- Integration testing\n- User acceptance\nOptimization techniques:\n- Gateway routing\n- Cost optimization\n- Success rate improvement\n- Latency reduction\n- Currency optimization\n- Fee minimization\n- Conversion optimization\n- Checkout simplification\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with security-auditor on compliance\n- Support backend-developer on API integration\n- Work with frontend-developer on checkout UI\n- Guide fintech-engineer on financial flows\n- Help devops-engineer on deployment\n- Assist qa-expert on testing strategies\n- Partner with risk-manager on fraud prevention\n- Coordinate with legal-advisor on regulations\nAlways prioritize security, compliance, and reliability while building payment systems that process transactions seamlessly and maintain user trust."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:48:20.253Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing secure payment processing and PCI compliance expertise.","zh":"适用于需要安全支付处理和PCI合规专长的金融代理","ja":"金融エージェントが安全な決済処理とPCIコンプライアンスの専門知識を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"안전한 결제 처리 및 PCI 규정 준수 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 금융 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes financieros que necesitan un procesamiento de pagos seguro y experiencia en cumplimiento de PCI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents financiers ayant besoin d''un traitement de paiement sécurisé et d''une expertise en matière de conformité PCI.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzagenten, die ein sicheres Zahlungsverarbeitungssystem und PCI-Konformitätsexpertise benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Financeiros que necessitam de processamento de pagamentos seguro e especialização em conformidade PCI.","ru":"Идеально для финансовых агентов, которым необходимы безопасная обработка платежей и экспертиза в области соблюдения требований PCI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الماليين الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة مدفوعات آمنة وخبير في الامتثال لمتطلبات PCI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate payment gateways, process transactions, and prevent fraud using secure protocols, with emphasis on reliability and exceptional payment experiences, leveraging expertise in PCI compliance and subscription management.","zh":"赋予代理商集成支付网关、处理交易、防止欺诈的能力，使用安全协议，强调可靠性和异常支付体验，利用PCI合规和订阅管理的专长","ja":"エージェントに決済ゲートウェイの統合、取引の処理、詐欺防止の機能を提供し、安全なプロトコルを使用し、信頼性と優れた決済体験に重点を置き、PCIコンプライアンスとサブスクリプション管理の専門知識を活用する","ko":"에이전트가 결제 게이트웨이를 통합하고 거래를 처리하고 사기를 방지할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 보안 프로토콜을 사용하고, 신뢰성과 우수한 결제 경험을 강조하며, PCI 규정 준수 및 구독 관리 전문 지식을 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar pasarelas de pago, procesar transacciones y prevenir el fraude utilizando protocolos seguros, con énfasis en la confiabilidad y experiencias de pago excepcionales, aprovechando la experiencia en cumplimiento de PCI y gestión de suscripciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer des passerelles de paiement, de traiter les transactions et de prévenir la fraude en utilisant des protocoles sécurisés, en mettant l''accent sur la fiabilité et les expériences de paiement exceptionnelles, en tirant parti de l''expertise en matière de conformité PCI et de gestion d''abonnements.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Zahlungs-Gateways zu integrieren, Transaktionen zu verarbeiten und Betrug mithilfe sicherer Protokolle zu verhindern, wobei der Schwerpunkt auf Zuverlässigkeit und außergewöhnlichen Zahlungserlebnissen liegt und die Expertise in PCI-Konformität und Abonnementsverwaltung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar gateways de pagamento, processar transações e prevenir fraudes usando protocolos seguros, com ênfase na confiabilidade e experiências de pagamento excepcionais, aproveitando a especialização em conformidade PCI e gerenciamento de assinaturas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать шлюзы оплаты, обрабатывать транзакции и предотвращать мошенничество с использованием безопасных протоколов, с акцентом на надежности и исключительном опыте платежей, используя экспертизу в области соблюдения требований PCI и управления подписками.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من دمج بوابات الدفع ومعالجة المعاملات ومنع الاحتيال باستخدام بروتوكولات آمنة، مع التركيز على الموثوقية والتجارب الدفعية الاستثنائية، واستخدام الخبرة في الامتثال لمتطلبات PCI وإدارة الاشتراكات."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating payment gateways for crypto and fiat transactions","Implementing fraud prevention measures for secure payment processing","Managing subscriptions and transaction processing for RWA assets"],"zh":["为加密货币和法定货币交易集成支付网关","实施防止欺诈的措施以确保安全的支付处理","管理RWA资产的订阅和交易处理"],"ja":["暗号資産と法定通貨の取引のための決済ゲートウェイの統合","安全な決済処理のための詐欺防止対策の実装","RWA資産のサブスクリプションと取引処理の管理"],"ko":["암호화폐 및 법정화폐 거래를 위한 결제 게이트웨이 통합","안전한 결제 처리를 위한 사기 예방 조치 구현","RWA 자산의 구독 및 거래 처리 관리"],"es":["Integrar pasarelas de pago para transacciones de criptomonedas y fiduciarias","Implementar medidas de prevención de fraude para un procesamiento de pagos seguro","Gestionar suscripciones y procesamiento de transacciones para activos RWA"],"fr":["Intégrer des passerelles de paiement pour les transactions de crypto et de fiat","Mettre en œuvre des mesures de prévention de la fraude pour un traitement de paiement sécurisé","Gérer les abonnements et le traitement des transactions pour les actifs RWA"],"de":["Zahlungs-Gateways für Krypto- und Fiat-Transaktionen integrieren","Maßnahmen zur Betrugsprävention für sichere Zahlungsverarbeitung implementieren","Abonnements und Transaktionsverarbeitung für RWA-Vermögenswerte verwalten"],"pt":["Integrar gateways de pagamento para transações de criptomoedas e fiduciárias","Implementar medidas de prevenção de fraudes para processamento de pagamentos seguro","Gerenciar assinaturas e processamento de transações para ativos RWA"],"ru":["Интегрировать шлюзы оплаты для транзакций с криптовалютами и фиатными валютами","Реализовать меры предотвращения мошенничества для безопасной обработки платежей","Управлять подписками и обработкой транзакций для активов RWA"],"ar":["دمج بوابات الدفع للمعاملات النقديّة والرقميّة","تنفيذ إجراءات منع الغش لضمان معالجة دفع آمنة","إدارة الاشتراكات ومعالجة المعاملات لأصول RWA"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PCI compliance knowledge","Limited to payment processing for supported assets (crypto, stocks, indexes)"],"zh":["需要PCI合规知识","仅限于支持资产（加密货币、股票、指数）的支付处理"],"ja":["PCIコンプライアンスの知識が必要","サポートされている資産（暗号資産、株式、指数）のみの決済処理に限定"],"ko":["PCI 규정 준수 지식이 필요합니다","지원되는 자산(암호화폐, 주식, 지수)만의 결제 처리에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de cumplimiento de PCI","Limitado al procesamiento de pagos para activos admitidos (criptomonedas, acciones, índices)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de conformité PCI","Limité au traitement des paiements pour les actifs pris en charge (crypto, actions, indices)"],"de":["Benötigt PCI-Konformitätswissen","Begrenzt auf Zahlungsverarbeitung für unterstützte Vermögenswerte (Krypto, Aktien, Indizes)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de conformidade PCI","Limitado a processamento de pagamentos para ativos suportados (criptomoedas, ações, índices)"],"ru":["Требует знаний о соблюдении требований PCI","Ограничен обработкой платежей для поддерживаемых активов (криптовалют, акций, индексов)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالامتثال لمتطلبات PCI","محدود بمعالجة الدفعات لأصول مدعومة (العملات الرقميّة والأسهم والمؤشرات)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
