ko":["합성 영속퓨처즈 프로토콜","RWA 자산 지원","암호화폐 거래","최대 1000배 레버리지","사용자 정의 오라클","가상 AMM"],"es":["Tipos de artefactos de planificación","Creación de Epics, Specs, Stories, Tasks, Research y Decisiones","Definición de objetivos y tareas del proyecto","Aplicación de artefactos en el proceso de planificación","Uso de un enfoque técnico para la planificación de proyectos"],"fr":["Types d''artefacts de planification","Création d''Epics, Specs, Stories, Tasks, Research et Decision","Définition des objectifs et des tâches du projet","Application des artefacts dans le processus de planification","Utilisation d''une approche technique pour la planification de projet"],"de":["Arten von Planungsartefakten","Erstellung von Epics, Specs, Stories, Tasks, Research und Entscheidungen","Definition der Ziele und Aufgaben des Projekts","Anwendung von Artefakten im Planungsprozess","Verwendung eines technischen Ansatzes für die Projektplanung"],"pt":["Tipos de artefatos: Epic, Spec, Story, Task, Research e Decision","Product Requirements Document (PRD)","Gestão de stakeholders","Definição de objetivos","Planejamento de recursos","Acompanhamento de progresso"],"ru":["Типы артефактов: Epic, Spec, Story, Task, Research и Decision","Документ требования к продукту (PRD)","Управление заинтересованными сторонами","Определение целей","Планирование ресурсов","Отслеживание прогресса"],"ar":["أنواع الملفات: Epic و Spec و Story و Task و Research و Decision","وثيقة متطلبات المنتج (PRD)","إدارة أصحاب المصلحة","تحديد الأهداف","تخطيط الموارد","متابعة التقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目规划","合成永续期货协议","RWA资产","加密货币","杠杆交易","自定义oracle","虚拟AMM","TWAP平滑"],"ja":["プロジェクト計画","シンセティックパーマネントフューチャーズプロトコル","RWAアセット","暗号通貨","レバレッジ取引","カスタムオラクル","バーチャルAMM","TWAP平滑化"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획","합성 영속퓨처즈 프로토콜","RWA 자산","암호화폐","레버리지 거래","사용자 정의 오라클","가상 AMM","TWAP 평활"],"es":["planificación de proyectos","artefactos de planificación","epics","specs","stories","tasks","research","decisiones","enfoque técnico"],"fr":["planification de projet","artefacts de planification","epics","specs","stories","tasks","research","decision","approche technique"],"de":["projektplanung","planungsartefakte","epics","specs","stories","tasks","research","entscheidungen","technischer ansatz"],"pt":["planejamento de projetos","artefatos","Epic","Spec","Story","Task","Research","Decision","PRD","gestão de stakeholders"],"ru":["планирование проектов","артефакты","Epic","Spec","Story","Task","Research","Decision","PRD","управление заинтересованными сторонами"],"ar":["تخطيط المشاريع","الملفات","Epic","Spec","Story","Task","Research","Decision","PRD","إدارة أصحاب المصلحة"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-planning","description":"Use to know about Planning Artifacts used in project management.","bodyPreview":"## What are [Planning Artifact] Types?\n\nThroughout the project-planning instructions you will see often refernces to types in the form of [Epic], [Spec], [Story], [Task], [Research], and [Decision].\n\nThis is to reinforce to you the reader or agent that these are distinct artifact types with specific roles.\n\n- [PRD]: Product Requirements Document, A high-level statement of what the product should achieve. They capture the needs and expectations of stakeholders. A [PRD] informs managers in the cre","body":"## What are [Planning Artifact] Types?\n\nThroughout the project-planning instructions you will see often refernces to types in the form of [Epic], [Spec], [Story], [Task], [Research], and [Decision].\n\nThis is to reinforce to you the reader or agent that these are distinct artifact types with specific roles.\n\n- [PRD]: Product Requirements Document, A high-level statement of what the product should achieve. They capture the needs and expectations of stakeholders. A [PRD] informs managers in the creation of one or more [Epic].\n- [Epic]: A large body of work that is described by Stories. An [Epic] is always accompanied by a [Spec], they have a 1:1 relationship.\n- [Spec]: A detailed description of the project''s requirements and objectives. It leads to creation of one or more [Story].\n- [Research]: Information gathering and analysis conducted to inform project decisions. Primary phase: Planning/Initiation (during PRD/Epic/Spec creation). Secondary phase: ad-hoc during Execution when implementation raises unknowns. [Research] informs [Spec], [Decision], and project direction. Linked to [PRD], [Epic], [Spec], [Decision], [Story], or [Task].\n- [Decision]: A conclusion reached after evaluating options, often based on [Research]. [Decision] can influence [Spec] and project direction. Created during Initiation/Planning (for strategic decisions) or during Execution (for implementation decisions). Status must be \"Decided\" or \"Unresolved\". All [Decision] artifacts with status \"Unresolved\" MUST be linked to the [Retrospective] during the Closing phase.\n- [Story]: A scenario or use case, manageable piece of work derived from an [Epic]. [Story] always contain \"user stories\". [Story] are always implemented by [Task].\n- [Task]: A specific piece of work that needs to be completed as part of a [Story]. They are always linked to both a [Story] and an [Epic]. They can also be linked to other [Task] in interesting ways (e.g., blocking, dependent on, related to).\n- [Retrospective]: A reflective artifact created at the end of an epic or project phase to capture lessons learned, successes, and areas for improvement. It summarizes insights from the team and stakeholders to inform future projects. Each [Retrospective] is linked to its corresponding [Epic] and any unresolved [Decision] artifacts.\n\n## Workflow Phases\n\nProjects flow through five distinct phases. Understanding where artifacts belong is critical for agents executing this skill.\n\n**Agents make tactical decisions autonomously** (which artifact to create, when to move statuses, validating content) **but escalate strategic decisions to Q** (scope changes, timeline shifts, technical refactoring, resource constraints).\n\n### Phase Overview\n\n1. **Planning** — Create artifacts defining the work (PRD → Epic → Spec → Stories → Tasks)\n   - → **See: skill_reference(`references/workflow/planning-phase.md`)** for detailed artifact creation sequence and validation gates\n\n2. **Execution** — Move work to completion through status transitions\n   - → **See: skill_reference(`references/workflow/execution-phase.md`)** for execution guidance\n\n3. **Closing** — Archive completed work and formally close Epic/Project\n   - → **See: skill_reference(`references/workflow/closing-phase.md`)** for closing procedures\n\n4. **Retrospective** — Capture learnings (can follow Epic or Project completion)\n   - → **See: skill_reference(`references/workflow/retrospective-phase.md`)** for retrospective guidance\n\n### Escalation Matrix\n\nPause and escalate to Q when encountering:\n- **Scope changes** — Feature additions/removals mid-Epic or mid-Planning\n- **Timeline shifts** — Projected delivery date moves >1 week\n- **Technical refactoring** — Discovered design changes during work\n- **Resource constraints** — Task/Story complexity exceeds capacity\n\n→ **See: skill_reference(`references/workflow/overview.md`)** for complete escalation matrix, artifact relationship diagram, and agent decision model.\n\n## Estimation \n\nWhen estimation is required, read the resources: \n\n- → **See: skill_reference(`references/estimation.md`)** for detailed estimation techniques and best practices.\n\n## Relationships\n\nArtifacts maintain clear relationships to ensure traceability and context throughout the project lifecycle.\n\n- → **See: skill_reference(`references/relationships.md`)** for detailed relationship types and usage guidelines for all artifact types (PRD, Epic, Research, Story, Task, Retrospective, Decision).\n\n## Artifact Status Transitions\n\nEach artifact type has valid status progressions that guide state management throughout the project lifecycle.\n\n- → **See: skill_reference(`references/status-flow.md`** for detailed status flow diagrams and descriptions for all artifact types (PRD, Epic, Research, Story, Task, Retrospective, Decision).\n\n## Artifact Schemas and Content Structure\n\nAll artifacts follow consistent schema patterns for organization and linking. \nEach artifact type has specific frontmatter requirements and content sections.\n\n→ Use the linked skill resources for detailed schema definitions, artifact content structure, and link type definitions for all artifact types (PRD, Epic, Research, Story, Task, Retrospective, Decision).\n\n**See below for specific artifact schemas:**\n\n- → **PRD** skill_reference(`schema/01-artifact-prd.md`)\n- → **Epic** skill_reference(`schema/02-artifact-epic.md`)\n- → **Spec** skill_reference(`schema/03-artifact-spec.md`)\n- → **Research** skill_reference(`schema/04-artifact-research.md`)\n- → **Decision** skill_reference(`schema/05-artifact-decision.md`)\n- → **Story** skill_reference(`schema/06-artifact-story.md`)\n- → **Task** skill_reference(`schema/07-artifact-task.md`)\n- → **Retrospective** skill_reference(`schema/08-artifact-retrospective.md`)\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:47:57.722Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring structured project management and artifact organization, such as Epics, Specs, Stories, Tasks, Research, and Decisions.","zh":"适合需要结构化项目管理和文档组织的商业策略代理，例如史诗、规格、故事、任务、研究和决策。","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクト管理と成果物の整理が必要なビジネス戦略エージェントに適しています。たとえば、エピック、仕様、ストーリー、タスク、研究、決定などです。","ko":"구조화 된 프로젝트 관리와 아티팩트 조직이 필요한 비즈니스 전략 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어 에픽, 사양, 이야기, 작업, 연구, 결정 등이 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de estrategia empresarial que requieren una gestión de proyectos estructurada y organización de artefactos, como Épicos, Especificaciones, Historias, Tareas, Investigación y Decisiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de stratégie commerciale nécessitant une gestion de projet structurée et une organisation d''artefacts, tels que les Épopées, les Spécifications, les Histoires, les Tâches, la Recherche et les Décisions.","de":"Ideal für Geschäftsstrategieagenten, die eine strukturierte Projektmanagement und Artefaktorganisation benötigen, wie Epics, Spezifikationen, Stories, Aufgaben, Forschung und Entscheidungen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Estratégia de Negócios que requerem gestão de projetos estruturada e organização de artefatos, como Épicos, Especificações, Histórias, Tarefas, Pesquisas e Decisões.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-стратегии, требующих структурированного управления проектами и организации артефактов, таких как Эпические, Спецификации, Истории, Задачи, Исследования и Решения.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء استراتيجية الأعمال الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مشروع منظمة وهيكلة للملفات، مثل الملحمة، والمواصفات، والقصص، والمهام، والبحوث، والقرارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage detailed project plans, leveraging Product Requirements Documents (PRD) to capture stakeholder needs and expectations, while organizing tasks and decisions through distinct artifact types like [Epic], [Spec], [Story], [Task], [Research], and [Decision].","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理详细的项目计划的能力，利用产品需求文档（PRD）来捕获利益相关者的需求和期望，同时通过不同的成果物类型（如史诗、规格、故事、任务、研究和决策）来组织任务和决策。","ja":"エージェントに詳細なプロジェクト計画を作成して管理する能力を与え、ステークホルダーのニーズと期待を把握するために製品要件文書（PRD）を活用し、タスクと決定をエピック、仕様、ストーリー、タスク、研究、決定などの異なる成果物の種類を通じて整理する。","ko":"에이전트가 상세한 프로젝트 계획을 생성하고 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 이해 관계자의 요구와 기대치를 포착하기 위해 제품 요구 사항 문서 (PRD)를 활용하며, 작업과 결정을 에픽, 사양, 이야기, 작업, 연구, 결정 등의 다양한 아티팩트 유형을 통해 조직합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar planes de proyecto detallados, aprovechando los Documentos de Requisitos de Producto (PRD) para capturar las necesidades y expectativas de las partes interesadas, mientras organiza tareas y decisiones a través de tipos de artefactos distintos como [Épico], [Especificación], [Historia], [Tarea], [Investigación] y [Decisión].","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des plans de projet détaillés, en exploitant les Documents de Spécifications de Produit (PRD) pour capter les besoins et les attentes des parties prenantes, tout en organisant les tâches et les décisions à travers des types d''artefacts distincts comme [Épopée], [Spécification], [Histoire], [Tâche], [Recherche] et [Décision].","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, detaillierte Projektpläne zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie Produktanforderungsdokumente (PRD) nutzen, um die Bedürfnisse und Erwartungen der Stakeholder zu erfassen, während sie Aufgaben und Entscheidungen durch unterschiedliche Artefakttypen wie [Epos], [Spezifikation], [Geschichte], [Aufgabe], [Forschung] und [Entscheidung] organisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar planos de projeto detalhados, utilizando Documentos de Requisitos de Produto (PRD) para capturar as necessidades e expectativas das partes interessadas, ao mesmo tempo em que organiza tarefas e decisões por meio de tipos de artefatos distintos como [Épico], [Especificação], [História], [Tarefa], [Pesquisa] e [Decisão].","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять подробными планами проектов, используя Документы требований продукта (PRD) для фиксации потребностей и ожиданий заинтересованных сторон, а также организовывать задачи и решения посредством различных типов артефактов, таких как [Эпик], [Спецификация], [История], [Задача], [Исследование] и [Решение].","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتنظيم خطط مشروع مفصلة، باستخدام وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD) لتحديد احتياجات ومتطلبات أصحاب المصلحة، وفي الوقت نفسه تنظيم المهام والقرارات من خلال أنواع الملفات المتميزة مثل [الملحمة]، [المواصفات]، [القصص]، [المهام]، [البحث] و [القرار]."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating project timelines and milestones","Organizing and prioritizing tasks based on Epics and Specs","Creating and managing Product Requirements Documents (PRD) for stakeholder alignment"],"zh":["生成项目时间表和里程碑","根据史诗和规格组织和优先级任务","创建和管理产品需求文档（PRD）以实现利益相关者的一致性"],"ja":["プロジェクトのタイムラインとマイルストーンを生成する","エピックと仕様に基づいてタスクを整理して優先順位を付ける","ステークホルダーの整合性を実現するために製品要件文書（PRD）を作成して管理する"],"ko":["프로젝트 타임라인과 里程碑 생성","에픽과 사양을 기반으로 작업을 조직하고 우선순위 지정","이해관계자의 일관성을 달성하기 위해 제품 요구사항 문서 (PRD) 생성 및 관리"],"es":["Generar líneas de tiempo de proyectos y hitos","Organizar y priorizar tareas en función de Épicos y Especificaciones","Crear y gestionar Documentos de Requisitos de Producto (PRD) para la alineación de las partes interesadas"],"fr":["Générer des chronologies de projet et des jalons","Organiser et prioriser les tâches en fonction des Épopées et des Spécifications","Créer et gérer des Documents de Spécifications de Produit (PRD) pour l''alignement des parties prenantes"],"de":["Projektzeitpläne und Meilensteine generieren","Aufgaben organisieren und priorisieren basierend auf Epics und Spezifikationen","Produktanforderungsdokumente (PRD) erstellen und verwalten, um die Ausrichtung der Stakeholder zu gewährleisten"],"pt":["Geração de cronogramas e marcos de projeto","Organização e priorização de tarefas com base em Épicos e Especificações","Criação e gerenciamento de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto (PRD) para alinhamento com as partes interessadas"],"ru":["Генерация графиков и вех проекта","Организация и расстановка приоритетов задач на основе Эпиков и Спецификаций","Создание и управление Документами требований продукта (PRD) для согласования с заинтересованными сторонами"],"ar":["توليد جداول زمنية وأحداث للمشروع","تنظيم وتحديد أولويات المهام بناءً على الملحمة والمواصفات","إنشاء وتنظيم وثائق متطلبات المنتج (PRD) لتحقيق الانسجام مع أصحاب المصلحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of project planning terminology and concepts","Limited to project planning and management, not a general-purpose skill"],"zh":["需要了解项目规划的术语和概念","仅限于项目规划和管理，不是通用技能"],"ja":["プロジェクト計画の用語と概念の理解が必要","プロジェクト計画と管理に限定され、汎用的なスキルではない"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획의 용어와 개념을 이해해야 함","프로젝트 계획 및 관리에만 국한되며, 범용적인 스킬이 아님"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la terminología y los conceptos de planificación de proyectos","Limitado a la planificación y gestión de proyectos, no es una habilidad de propósito general"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la terminologie et des concepts de planification de projet","Limité à la planification et à la gestion de projet, ce n''est pas une compétence générale"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der Projektplanungsterminologie und -konzepte","Begrenzt auf Projektplanung und -management, keine allgemeine Fähigkeit"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da terminologia e conceitos de planejamento de projetos","Limitado ao planejamento e gerenciamento de projetos, não é uma habilidade de propósito geral"],"ru":["Требует понимания терминологии и концепций планирования проектов","Ограничен планированием и управлением проектами, не является универсальной навыком"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم المصطلحات والمفاهيم المتعلقة بالتخطيط للمشاريع","محدود بالتخطيط وإدارة المشاريع، وليس مهارة عامة الغرض"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
