:"합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜 예시","es":"Protocolo de futuros sintéticos con activos RWA y apalanc...","fr":"Protocole de futures synthétiques avec actifs RWA et effe...","de":"Synthetisches Futures-Protokoll mit RWA-Vermögenswerten u...","pt":"Exemplos de Commits Convencionais","ru":"Примеры Конвенционных Коммитов","ar":"أمثلة على الالتزامات التقليدية","en":"examples"},"description":{"zh":"合成永续协议支持实物资产、加密货币、股票和指数的交易，最高可达1000倍杠杆，通过自定义的预言机、虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑定价","ja":"シンセティック・パーペチュアル・フューチャーズ・プロトコルは、実物資産、暗号資産、株式、指数を取引可能で、最高1000倍のレバレッジを提供し、カスタム・オラクル、仮想AMM、TWAPスムージングによる価格設定を行う","ko":"합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜은 실물 자산, 암호화 자산, 주식, 지수를 거래할 수 있으며, 최고 1000배 레버리지 제공 및 커스텀 오라클, 가상 AMM, TWAP 스무딩을 통한 가격 결정","es":"Un protocolo de futuros sintéticos que admite activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices con apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","fr":"Un protocole de futures synthétiques prenant en charge les actifs RWA, les crypto-monnaies, les actions et les indices avec un effet de levier allant jusqu''à...","de":"Ein synthetisches Futures-Protokoll, das RWA-Vermögenswerte, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes mit bis zu 1000x Hebelwirkung unterstützt","pt":"Exemplos de commits convencionais para desenvolvedores, incluindo novos recursos, correções de bugs e atualizações de documentação","ru":"Примеры конвенционных коммитов для разработчиков, включая новые функции, исправления ошибок и обновления документации","ar":"أمثلة على الالتزامات التقليدية للمطورين، بما في ذلك الميزات الجديدة وتصحيح الأخطاء وتحديث الوثائق","en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collater..."},"definition":{"en":"A synthetic perpetual futures protocol supporting RWA assets, crypto, stocks, and indexes. Traders open leveraged long/short positions (up to 1000x) collateralized by stablecoins held in per-user on-chain vaults. A central liquidity vault acts as counterparty to all trades. Pricing combines a custom oracle, a Virtual AMM , and TWAP smoothing."},"features":{"zh":["支持实物资产、加密货币、股票和指数的交易","最高可达1000倍杠杆","自定义的预言机、虚拟AMM和TWAP平滑定价","每用户的链上金库","集中式流动性金库作为所有交易的对手方"],"ja":["実物資産、暗号資産、株式、指数を取引可能","最高1000倍のレバレッジを提供","カスタム・オラクル、仮想AMM、TWAPスムージングによる価格設定","ユーザーごとのオンチェーン・ヴォールト","集中式流動性ヴォールトがすべての取引の対価となる"],"ko":["실물 자산, 암호화 자산, 주식, 지수를 거래할 수 있음","최고 1000배 레버리지 제공","커스텀 오라클, 가상 AMM, TWAP 스무딩을 통한 가격 결정","사용자별 온체인 보관소","집중식 유동성 보관소가 모든 거래의 대응자"],"es":["Soporte para activos RWA, criptomonedas, acciones y índices","Apalancamiento de hasta 1000x","Bóveda de liquidez centralizada","Precios que combinan un oráculo personalizado, un AMM virtual y suavizado TWAP"],"fr":["Prise en charge des actifs RWA, des crypto-monnaies, des actions et des indices","Effet de levier allant jusqu''à 1000x","Chambre de liquide centrale","Prix qui combinent un oracle personnalisé, un AMM virtuel et un lissage TWAP"],"de":["Unterstützung für RWA-Vermögenswerte, Kryptowährungen, Aktien und Indizes","Hebelwirkung von bis zu 1000x","Zentrale Liquiditätsbörse","Preise, die einen benutzerdefinierten Oracle, ein virtuelles AMM und ein TWAP-Glättung kombinieren"],"pt":["Novos recursos com exemplos de código","Correções de bugs com explicações detalhadas","Atualizações de documentação com exemplos práticos","Exemplos de commits com escopo para melhor organização","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas para desenvolvedores globais","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares"],"ru":["Новые функции с примерами кода","Исправления ошибок с подробными объяснениями","Обновления документации с практическими примерами","Примеры коммитов с областью действия для лучшей организации","Поддержка нескольких языков для глобальных разработчиков","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки"],"ar":["ميزات جديدة مع أمثلة من الشفرة","تصحيح الأخطاء مع объясارات مفصلة","تحديثات الوثائق مع أمثلة praktische","أمثلة على الالتزامات مع نطاق لتحسين التنظيم","دعم اللغات المتعددة للمطورين العالميين","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشهيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["合成永续协议","加密货币交易","股票交易","指数交易","去中心化交易","高杠杆交易"],"ja":["シンセティック・パーペチュアル・フューチャーズ・プロトコル","暗号資産取引","株式取引","指数取引","分散型取引","高レバレッジ取引"],"ko":["합성 영속적 선물 프로토콜","암호화 자산 거래","주식 거래","지수 거래","분산형 거래","고레버리지 거래"],"es":["protocolo de futuros sintéticos","activos RWA","apalancamiento","criptomonedas","acciones","índices","bóveda de liquidez","oráculo personalizado"],"fr":["protocole de futures synthétiques","actifs RWA","effet de levier","crypto-monnaies","actions","indices","chambre de liquide","oracle personnalisé"],"de":["synthetisches Futures-Protokoll","RWA-Vermögenswerte","Hebelwirkung","Kryptowährungen","Aktien","Indizes","Liquiditätsbörse","benutzerdefinierter Oracle"],"pt":["commits convencionais","desenvolvimento de software","organização de código","clareza de código","documentação de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","idiomas de programação","desenvolvedores globais"],"ru":["конвенционные коммиты","разработка программного обеспечения","организация кода","ясность кода","документация кода","инструменты разработки","языки программирования","глобальные разработчики"],"ar":["الالتزامات التقليدية","تطوير البرمجيات","تنظيم الشفرة","وضوح الشفرة","وثائق الشفرة","أدوات التطوير","لغات البرمجة","مطورون عالميون"]}},"owner":"Paxeer-Network","repo":"Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","repoPath":"Paxeer-Network/Sidiora-Perpetual-Protocol","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"examples","description":"Real-world examples of Conventional Commits for different scenarios and commit types.","bodyPreview":"# Conventional Commits Examples\n\n## Simple Examples\n\n### New Feature (Simple)\n```\nfeat: add dark mode toggle to settings\n```\n\n### Bug Fix (Simple)\n```\nfix: correct spelling of CHANGELOG\n```\n\n### Documentation Update\n```\ndocs: update installation instructions in README\n```\n\n### Breaking Change (Simple)\n```\nfeat!: drop support for Node 6\n```\n\n## Examples with Scope\n\n### New Feature with Scope\n```\nfeat(lang): add Polish language support\n```\n\n### Bug Fix with Scope\n```\nfix(parser): handle edge case","body":"# Conventional Commits Examples\n\n## Simple Examples\n\n### New Feature (Simple)\n```\nfeat: add dark mode toggle to settings\n```\n\n### Bug Fix (Simple)\n```\nfix: correct spelling of CHANGELOG\n```\n\n### Documentation Update\n```\ndocs: update installation instructions in README\n```\n\n### Breaking Change (Simple)\n```\nfeat!: drop support for Node 6\n```\n\n## Examples with Scope\n\n### New Feature with Scope\n```\nfeat(lang): add Polish language support\n```\n\n### Bug Fix with Scope\n```\nfix(parser): handle edge case with empty arrays\n```\n\n### API Change with Scope\n```\nfeat(api): add new user authentication endpoint\n```\n\n### Style Changes with Scope\n```\nstyle(ui): fix button styling on mobile devices\n```\n\n## Examples with Body\n\n### Feature with Detailed Body\n```\nfeat: allow provided config object to extend other configs\n\nThis commit enables configuration objects to extend other config files,\nimproving code reusability and reducing duplication across projects.\n\nThe implementation uses a new `extends` key in the config file that can\nreference other configuration files by path or package name.\n\nCloses #42\n```\n\n### Bug Fix with Body and Context\n```\nfix: prevent racing of requests\n\nIntroduce a request id and a reference to latest request. Dismiss\nincoming responses other than from latest request.\n\nRemove timeouts which were used to mitigate the racing issue but are\nobsolete now.\n\nReviewed-by: Z\nRefs: #123\n```\n\n## Examples with Breaking Changes\n\n### Breaking Change with `!` Notation\n```\nfeat(api)!: send an email to the customer when a product is shipped\n```\n\n### Breaking Change with Footer\n```\nchore!: drop support for Node 6\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: use JavaScript features not available in Node 6.\n```\n\n### Breaking Change with Both `!` and Footer\n```\nfeat(auth)!: change authentication flow\n\nThis commit modifies the authentication flow to use OAuth2 instead of\nsession-based authentication. Existing API clients will need to update\ntheir authentication mechanism.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: authentication now requires OAuth2 tokens instead of session cookies\n```\n\n## Examples with Multiple Footers\n\n### Complex Commit with Multiple Footers\n```\nfix: prevent racing of requests\n\nIntroduce a request id and a reference to latest request. Dismiss\nincoming responses other than from latest request.\n\nRemove timeouts which were used to mitigate the racing issue but are\nobsolete now.\n\nReviewed-by: Z\nRefs: #123\nCloses: #456\n```\n\n## Commit Type Examples\n\n### Feature Examples\n```\nfeat(ui): add theme customization panel\nfeat(api): implement user profile API endpoints\nfeat(docs): add API documentation with examples\nfeat(perf): optimize database query performance\n```\n\n### Fix Examples\n```\nfix(auth): resolve login page refresh issue\nfix(parser): handle null values in array parsing\nfix(ui): correct button alignment on mobile\nfix(api): return correct status code for 404 errors\n```\n\n### Documentation Examples\n```\ndocs: update CONTRIBUTING.md with new guidelines\ndocs(api): document new authentication endpoints\ndocs: add deployment instructions for Docker\n```\n\n### Refactor Examples\n```\nrefactor(core): simplify request processing logic\nrefactor(utils): consolidate duplicate functions\nrefactor(db): reorganize database query builders\n```\n\n### Test Examples\n```\ntest: add comprehensive coverage for auth module\ntest(parser): add test cases for edge cases\ntest: improve test isolation and reliability\n```\n\n### Chore Examples\n```\nchore: upgrade dependencies to latest versions\nchore(build): update webpack configuration\nchore: configure pre-commit hooks\n```\n\n### CI Examples\n```\nci: add GitHub Actions workflow for tests\nci: configure automatic deployment to staging\nci(coverage): add code coverage reporting\n```\n\n### Style Examples\n```\nstyle: fix indentation in authentication module\nstyle(utils): apply formatting rules to all files\nstyle: remove trailing whitespace\n```\n\n### Performance Examples\n```\nperf: optimize image loading with lazy loading\nperf(api): reduce database query time by 40%\nperf: implement result caching for expensive operations\n```\n\n## Scenario-Based Examples\n\n### Implementing a Complete Feature\n```\nfeat(payment): add Stripe payment integration\n\nIntegrate Stripe payment processing into the checkout flow. This allows\ncustomers to pay for orders using various payment methods supported by\nStripe.\n\nChanges:\n- Add Stripe API client initialization\n- Implement payment form component\n- Add payment processing endpoint\n- Store payment tokens securely\n- Add error handling for payment failures\n\nTesting:\n- Unit tests for payment processing logic\n- Integration tests for checkout flow\n- Manual testing with Stripe test account\n\nRelated Issues: closes #789, relates to #790\n```\n\n### Fixing a Critical Bug\n```\nfix(auth): prevent session hijacking vulnerability\n\nThe session token was not being properly validated on each request,\nallowing attackers to reuse expired tokens. This commit adds proper\ntoken validation and expiration checking.\n\nSecurity Impact: High - potential for unauthorized access\nAffected Versions: all versions before v2.1.0\n\nTesting:\n- Security audit passed\n- All auth tests passing\n- Manual testing with token expiration scenarios\n\nReviewed-by: security@company.com\nRefs: #999\n```\n\n### Breaking Change with Migration Path\n```\nfeat!: migrate to new configuration format\n\nConfiguration format has changed from XML to YAML for better readability\nand easier maintenance. Old XML configurations will not be supported\nafter v3.0.0.\n\nMigration Path:\n1. Use provided migration tool: `migrate-config --xml-to-yaml config.xml`\n2. Update application initialization code\n3. Test thoroughly before deploying to production\n\nFor more details, see MIGRATION.md\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: XML configuration format no longer supported, use YAML instead\nDeprecated: old ConfigParser class, use new YAMLConfigParser\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### ❌ Wrong - Vague Description\n```\nfix: bug\nfeat: improvements\n```\n\n### ✅ Correct - Specific Description\n```\nfix: resolve null pointer exception in user lookup\nfeat: add email notification for order status changes\n```\n\n### ❌ Wrong - Missing Type\n```\nallow users to toggle dark mode\n```\n\n### ✅ Correct - With Type\n```\nfeat: allow users to toggle dark mode\n```\n\n### ❌ Wrong - Not Imperative Mood\n```\nfeat: added dark mode support\nfix: fixed the login issue\n```\n\n### ✅ Correct - Imperative Mood\n```\nfeat: add dark mode support\nfix: resolve login issue\n```\n\n### ❌ Wrong - Uppercase Description\n```\nfeat: Add Dark Mode Support\nfix: Resolve Login Issue\n```\n\n### ✅ Correct - Lowercase Description\n```\nfeat: add dark mode support\nfix: resolve login issue\n```\n\n## Tips for Writing Good Commits\n\n1. **Be Specific**: Describe what changed, not what you did\n2. **Use Imperative Mood**: \"add\" not \"added\"\n3. **Keep Description Short**: 50 characters or less is ideal\n4. **Use Body for Details**: Explain why and provide context\n5. **Reference Issues**: Link to related issues in footers\n6. **One Logical Change**: Keep commits focused and atomic\n7. **Review Before Committing**: Check your diff before creating the commit\n\n---\n\n**License**: [Creative Commons - CC BY 3.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)\n\nSource: [Conventional Commits v1.0.0](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:48:49.010Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Commit Message Agents needing standardized formatting conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化格式约定的提交消息代理。","ja":"標準化されたフォーマット規約を必要とするコミットメッセージエージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 형식 규칙이 필요한 커밋 메시지 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Mensajes de Confirmación que necesitan convenciones de formato estandarizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Message de Commit ayant besoin de conventions de formatage standardisées.","de":"Perfekt für Commit-Nachrichten-Agents, die standardisierte Formatierungskonventionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mensagem de Commit que precisam de convenções de formatação padronizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов сообщений Commit, требующих стандартизированных конвенций форматирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء رسائل Commit الذين يحتاجون إلى اتفاقيات تنسيق موحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate conventional commit messages using specific formats like ''feat'' for new features, ''fix'' for bug fixes, and ''docs'' for documentation updates, all following a consistent protocol.","zh":"赋予代理生成使用特定格式（如新功能使用''feat''、bug 修复使用''fix''、文档更新使用''docs''）的标准化提交消息的能力，所有消息都遵循一致的协议。","ja":"エージェントに、特定のフォーマット（例：新機能の場合は''feat''、バグ修正の場合は''fix''、ドキュメントの更新の場合は''docs''）を使用した標準化されたコミットメッセージを生成する能力を付与し、すべてのメッセージが一貫したプロトコルに従う。","ko":"새로운 기능은 ''feat'', 버그 수정은 ''fix'', 문서 업데이트는 ''docs''와 같은 특정 형식을 사용하여 표준화된 커밋 메시지를 생성하는 에이전트의 기능을 강화하며, 모든 메시지는 일관된 프로토콜을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar mensajes de confirmación convencionales utilizando formatos específicos como ''feat'' para nuevas características, ''fix'' para correcciones de errores y ''docs'' para actualizaciones de documentación, todos siguiendo un protocolo coherente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des messages de commit conventionnels en utilisant des formats spécifiques comme ''feat'' pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités, ''fix'' pour les corrections de bogues et ''docs'' pour les mises à jour de la documentation, le tout suivant un protocole cohérent.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, konventionelle Commit-Nachrichten zu generieren, die spezifische Formate wie ''feat'' für neue Funktionen, ''fix'' für Fehlerkorrekturen und ''docs'' für Dokumentationsaktualisierungen verwenden, alle folgen einem konsistenten Protokoll.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar mensagens de commit convencionais usando formatos específicos como ''feat'' para recursos novos, ''fix'' para correções de bugs e ''docs'' para atualizações de documentação, todos seguindo um protocolo consistente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать конвенциональные сообщения commit с использованием конкретных форматов, таких как ''feat'' для новых функций, ''fix'' для исправления ошибок и ''docs'' для обновлений документации, все в соответствии с единым протоколом.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 رسائل Commit تقليدية باستخدام تنسيقات محددة مثل ''feat'' لميزات جديدة و ''fix'' لتصحيح الأخطاء و ''docs'' لتحديثات الوثائق، جميعها تتبع بروتوكولًا موحدًا."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit logs","Automating changelog generation","Validating commit message formats"],"zh":["标准化提交日志","自动化变更日志生成","验证提交消息格式"],"ja":["コミットログの標準化","変更ログの自動生成","コミットメッセージ形式の検証"],"ko":["커밋 로그 표준화","변경 로그 자동 생성","커밋 메시지 형식 검증"],"es":["Estandarización de registros de confirmación","Generación automática de registros de cambios","Validación de formatos de mensajes de confirmación"],"fr":["Standardisation des journaux de commit","Génération automatique du journal des modifications","Validation des formats de messages de commit"],"de":["Standardisierung von Commit-Protokollen","Automatisierte Erstellung von Änderungsprotokollen","Validierung von Commit-Nachrichtenformaten"],"pt":["Padronização de registros de commit","Geração automática de changelog","Validação de formatos de mensagens de commit"],"ru":["Стандартизация журналов commit","Автоматическая генерация changelog","Проверка форматов сообщений commit"],"ar":["توحيد سجلات Commit","توليد سجل التغييرات تلقائيًا","تحقق من صحة تنسيقات رسائل Commit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to conventional commit message protocol","Limited to specific commit types (e.g., feat, fix, docs)"],"zh":["需要遵守标准化的提交消息协议","仅限于特定的提交类型（例如：feat、fix、docs）"],"ja":["標準化されたコミットメッセージプロトコルに従う必要がある","特定のコミットタイプ（例：feat、fix、docs）のみに限定される"],"ko":["표준화된 커밋 메시지 프로토콜을遵守해야 함","특정 커밋 유형(예: feat, fix, docs)만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere adherencia al protocolo de mensaje de confirmación convencional","Limitado a tipos de confirmación específicos (por ejemplo, feat, fix, docs)"],"fr":["Requiert l''adhésion au protocole de message de commit conventionnel","Limité à des types de commit spécifiques (par exemple, feat, fix, docs)"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des konventionellen Commit-Nachrichten-Protokolls","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Commit-Typen (z. B. feat, fix, docs)"],"pt":["Exige adesão ao protocolo de mensagem de commit convencional","Limitado a tipos de commit específicos (por exemplo, feat, fix, docs)"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конвенционального протокола сообщений commit","Ограничен конкретными типами commit (например, feat, fix, docs)"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام ببروتوكول رسائل Commit التقليدية","محدود بنوع معين من Commit (على سبيل المثال feat و fix و docs)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
