开发"],"ja":["プラン書き込み","タスク分解","検証基準","開発効率","タスク管理","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["계획 작성","태스크 분해","검증 기준","개발 효율성","태스크 관리","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["planificación de tareas","desglose de trabajo","tareas claras","criterios de verificación","productividad","eficiencia","gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software","metodologías ágiles"],"fr":["rédaction de plans","décomposition de travail","tâches claires","critères de vérification","productivité","efficacité","gestion de projets","développement de logiciels","méthodologies agiles"],"de":["Aufgabenplanung","Arbeitsaufteilung","klare Aufgaben","Überprüfungskriterien","Produktivität","Effizienz","Projektmanagement","Softwareentwicklung","Agile Methoden"],"pt":["planejamento de tarefas","gestão de projetos","tarefas claras","verificação de tarefas","ordem lógica","dependências","trabalho paralelo","resultados verificáveis"],"ru":["планирование задач","управление проектами","ясные задачи","проверка задач","логический порядок","зависимости","параллельная работа","проверяемые результаты"],"ar":["كتابة الخطة","إدارة المشاريع","مهام واضحة","التحقق من المهام","الترتيب المنطقي","الإعتماديات","العمل المتوازي","نتائج قابلة للتحقق"]}},"owner":"ollieb89","repo":"orchestrator","repoPath":"ollieb89/orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-writing","description":"Structured task planning with clear breakdowns, dependencies, and verification criteria. Use when implementing features, refactoring, or any multi-step work.","bodyPreview":"# Plan Writing\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a framework for breaking down work into clear, actionable tasks with verification criteria.\n\n## Task Breakdown Principles\n\n### 1. Small, Focused Tasks\n- Each task should take 2-5 minutes\n- One clear outcome per task\n- Independently verifiable\n\n### 2. Clear Verification\n- How do you know it''s done?\n- What can you check/test?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### 3. Logical Ordering\n- Dependencies identified\n- Parallel work w","body":"# Plan Writing\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a framework for breaking down work into clear, actionable tasks with verification criteria.\n\n## Task Breakdown Principles\n\n### 1. Small, Focused Tasks\n- Each task should take 2-5 minutes\n- One clear outcome per task\n- Independently verifiable\n\n### 2. Clear Verification\n- How do you know it''s done?\n- What can you check/test?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### 3. Logical Ordering\n- Dependencies identified\n- Parallel work where possible\n- Critical path highlighted\n- **Phase X: Verification is always LAST**\n\n### 4. Dynamic Naming in Project Root\n- Plan files are saved as `{task-slug}.md` in the PROJECT ROOT\n- Name derived from task (e.g., \"add auth\" → `auth-feature.md`)\n- **NEVER** inside `.claude/`, `docs/`, or temp folders\n\n## Planning Principles (NOT Templates!)\n\n> 🔴 **NO fixed templates. Each plan is UNIQUE to the task.**\n\n### Principle 1: Keep It SHORT\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| 50 tasks with sub-sub-tasks | 5-10 clear tasks max |\n| Every micro-step listed | Only actionable items |\n| Verbose descriptions | One-line per task |\n\n> **Rule:** If plan is longer than 1 page, it''s too long. Simplify.\n\n---\n\n### Principle 2: Be SPECIFIC, Not Generic\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| \"Set up project\" | \"Run `npx create-next-app`\" |\n| \"Add authentication\" | \"Install next-auth, create `/api/auth/[...nextauth].ts`\" |\n| \"Style the UI\" | \"Add Tailwind classes to `Header.tsx`\" |\n\n> **Rule:** Each task should have a clear, verifiable outcome.\n\n---\n\n### Principle 3: Dynamic Content Based on Project Type\n\n**For NEW PROJECT:**\n- What tech stack? (decide first)\n- What''s the MVP? (minimal features)\n- What''s the file structure?\n\n**For FEATURE ADDITION:**\n- Which files are affected?\n- What dependencies needed?\n- How to verify it works?\n\n**For BUG FIX:**\n- What''s the root cause?\n- What file/line to change?\n- How to test the fix?\n\n---\n\n### Principle 4: Scripts Are Project-Specific\n\n> 🔴 **DO NOT copy-paste script commands. Choose based on project type.**\n\n| Project Type | Relevant Scripts |\n|--------------|------------------|\n| Frontend/React | `ux_audit.py`, `accessibility_checker.py` |\n| Backend/API | `api_validator.py`, `security_scan.py` |\n| Mobile | `mobile_audit.py` |\n| Database | `schema_validator.py` |\n| Full-stack | Mix of above based on what you touched |\n\n**Wrong:** Adding all scripts to every plan\n**Right:** Only scripts relevant to THIS task\n\n---\n\n### Principle 5: Verification is Simple\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| \"Verify the component works correctly\" | \"Run `npm run dev`, click button, see toast\" |\n| \"Test the API\" | \"curl localhost:3000/api/users returns 200\" |\n| \"Check styles\" | \"Open browser, verify dark mode toggle works\" |\n\n---\n\n## Plan Structure (Flexible, Not Fixed!)\n\n```\n# [Task Name]\n\n## Goal\nOne sentence: What are we building/fixing?\n\n## Tasks\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n- [ ] Task 3: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n\n## Done When\n- [ ] [Main success criteria]\n```\n\n> **That''s it.** No phases, no sub-sections unless truly needed.\n> Keep it minimal. Add complexity only when required.\n\n## Notes\n[Any important considerations]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices (Quick Reference)\n\n1. **Start with goal** - What are we building/fixing?\n2. **Max 10 tasks** - If more, break into multiple plans\n3. **Each task verifiable** - Clear \"done\" criteria\n4. **Project-specific** - No copy-paste templates\n5. **Update as you go** - Mark `[x]` when complete\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New project from scratch\n- Adding a feature\n- Fixing a bug (if complex)\n- Refactoring multiple files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:49:28.186Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents requiring structured workflow planning with clear verification criteria.","zh":"适用于需要结构化工作流规划和明确验证标准的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが構造化されたワークフロー計画と明確な検証基準を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"명확한 검증 기준이 있는 구조화된 워크플로 계획을 요구하는 태스크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que requieren una planificación de flujo de trabajo estructurada con criterios de verificación claros.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant une planification de workflow structurée avec des critères de vérification clairs.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die eine strukturierte Workflow-Planung mit klaren Überprüfungskriterien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestão de Tarefas que requerem planeamento de fluxo de trabalho estruturado com critérios de verificação claros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих структурированного планирования рабочих процессов с четкими критериями проверки.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة المهام الذين يتطلبون تخطيطًا منظمًا لسير العمل مع معايير تحقق واضحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to break down work into small, focused tasks with independently verifiable outcomes, utilizing logical ordering and dependency identification to streamline workflow processes.","zh":"赋予代理将工作分解为小型、集中的任务，具有独立可验证的结果，利用逻辑顺序和依赖关系识别来简化工作流程。","ja":"エージェントが仕事を小さく焦点を当てたタスクに分解し、独立して検証可能な結果を持ち、論理的な順序付けと依存関係の識別を利用してワークフロー プロセスを最適化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 작업을 작은 집중된 태스크로 분해하여 독립적으로 검증 가능한 결과를 가지게 하며, 논리적인 순서와 의존성 식별을 통해 워크플로우 프로세스를 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dividir el trabajo en tareas pequeñas y enfocadas con resultados verificables de forma independiente, utilizando un orden lógico y la identificación de dependencias para optimizar los procesos de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diviser le travail en tâches petites et ciblées avec des résultats vérifiables de manière indépendante, en utilisant un ordre logique et l''identification des dépendances pour rationaliser les processus de workflow.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Arbeit in kleine, fokussierte Aufgaben mit unabhängig überprüfbaren Ergebnissen aufzuteilen, indem sie logische Reihenfolge und Abhängigkeitsidentifizierung nutzen, um Workflow-Prozesse zu optimieren.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a dividir o trabalho em tarefas pequenas e focadas com resultados independentemente verificáveis, utilizando ordenação lógica e identificação de dependências para otimizar os processos de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разбивать работу на небольшие, сфокусированные задачи с независимо проверяемыми результатами, используя логическое упорядочивание и определение зависимостей для оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تقسيم العمل إلى مهام صغيرة ومركزة ذات نتائج يمكن التحقق منها بشكل مستقل، باستخدام الترتيب المنطقي وتحديد التبعيات لتبسيط عمليات سير العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task breakdown for complex projects","Generating verification criteria for actionable tasks","Creating logical workflows with parallel work capabilities"],"zh":["自动分解复杂项目的任务","生成可执行任务的验证标准","创建具有并行工作能力的逻辑工作流"],"ja":["複雑なプロジェクトのタスクを自動分解する","実行可能なタスクの検証基準を生成する","並列作業可能な論理的なワークフローを作成する"],"ko":["복잡한 프로젝트의 태스크를 자동 분해하는 것","실행 가능한 태스크에 대한 검증 기준을 생성하는 것","병렬 작업이 가능한 논리적인 워크플로우를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la descomposición de tareas para proyectos complejos","Generación de criterios de verificación para tareas realizables","Creación de flujos de trabajo lógicos con capacidades de trabajo paralelo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la décomposition des tâches pour les projets complexes","Génération de critères de vérification pour les tâches réalisables","Création de flux de travail logiques avec des capacités de travail parallèle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenzerlegung für komplexe Projekte","Erzeugung von Überprüfungskriterien für handhabbare Aufgaben","Erstellung logischer Workflows mit paralleler Arbeitsfähigkeit"],"pt":["Automatização da divisão de tarefas para projetos complexos","Geração de critérios de verificação para tarefas acionáveis","Criação de fluxos de trabalho lógicos com capacidades de trabalho paralelo"],"ru":["Автоматизация разбивки задач для сложных проектов","Генерация критериев проверки для действенных задач","Создание логических рабочих процессов с возможностью параллельной работы"],"ar":["أتمتة تقسيم المهام للمشاريع المعقدة","إنشاء معايير التحقق للمهام القابلة للتنفيذ","إنشاء مسارات عمل منطقية مع قدرات العمل المتوازي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Tasks must be independently verifiable","Requires clear outcome definition per task","Optimized for tasks taking 2-5 minutes to complete"],"zh":["任务必须是独立可验证的","需要每个任务明确的结果定义","优化用于完成时间为2-5分钟的任务"],"ja":["タスクは独立して検証可能である必要がある","各タスクごとに明確な結果定義が必要","2〜5分で完了するタスクに最適化"],"ko":["태스크는 독립적으로 검증 가능해야 함","각 태스크에 대해 명확한 결과 정의가 필요함","2〜5분 내에 완료되는 태스크에 최적화됨"],"es":["Las tareas deben ser verificables de forma independiente","Requiere una definición clara de resultado por tarea","Optimizado para tareas que tardan 2-5 minutos en completarse"],"fr":["Les tâches doivent être vérifiables de manière indépendante","Nécessite une définition claire du résultat par tâche","Optimisé pour les tâches qui prennent 2-5 minutes pour être complétées"],"de":["Aufgaben müssen unabhängig überprüfbar sein","Benötigt eine klare Ergebnisdefinition pro Aufgabe","Optimiert für Aufgaben, die 2-5 Minuten dauern, um abgeschlossen zu werden"],"pt":["As tarefas devem ser independentemente verificáveis","Requer uma definição clara de resultado por tarefa","Otimizado para tarefas que levam de 2 a 5 minutos para serem concluídas"],"ru":["Задачи должны быть независимо проверяемыми","Требует четкого определения результата для каждой задачи","Оптимизированы для задач, выполнение которых занимает 2-5 минут"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهام قابلة للتحقق بشكل مستقل","يتطلب تعريفًا واضحًا للنتيجة لكل مهمة","مُحسّن للمهام التي تستغرق من 2 إلى 