avanzado","Almacenamiento inteligente","Compatibilidad con GitHub y Gitee","Soporte para rutas de acceso relativas","Zero dependencias externas"],"fr":["Analyse de données avancée","Stockage intelligent","Compatibilité avec GitHub et Gitee","Prise en charge des chemins d''accès relatifs","Zéro dépendances externes"],"de":["Erweiterte Datenanalyse","Intelligenter Speicher","Kompatibilität mit GitHub und Gitee","Unterstützung für relative Pfade","Keine externen Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Referências de imagem relativa","Análise de dados","Otimização de armazenamento","Compatibilidade com GitHub e Gitee"],"ru":["Относительные ссылки на изображения","Анализ данных","Оптимизация хранилища","Совместимость с GitHub и Gitee"],"ar":["مراجع صورية نسبية","تحليل البيانات","تحسين التخزين","التوافق مع GitHub و Gitee"]},"keywords":{"zh":["README图片规范","Windsurf AI","智能数据管理","AI对话暂停反馈","智能存储清理","数据分析","相对路径","GitHub","Gitee"],"ja":["README画像規約","Windsurf AI","スマートデータ管理","AI対話暂停フィードバック","スマートストレージクリーンナップ","データ分析","相対パス","GitHub","Gitee"],"ko":["README 이미지 규격","Windsurf AI","스마트 데이터 관리","AI 대화暂停 피드백","스마트 스토리지 청소","데이터 분석","상대 경로","GitHub","Gitee"],"es":["gestión de datos","análisis de datos","almacenamiento inteligente","Windsurf AI","GitHub","Gitee","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","optimización de datos"],"fr":["gestion de données","analyse de données","stockage intelligent","Windsurf AI","GitHub","Gitee","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","optimisation de données"],"de":["Datenverwaltung","Datenanalyse","intelligenter Speicher","Windsurf AI","GitHub","Gitee","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","Datenoptimierung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de imagens","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de armazenamento","análise de dados","GitHub","Gitee","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["управление изображениями","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация хранилища","анализ данных","GitHub","Gitee","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["إدارة الصور","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين التخزين","تحليل البيانات","GitHub","Gitee","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"congwa","repo":"wdm","repoPath":"congwa/wdm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readme-images","description":"Handle README.md image references for GitHub and Gitee platforms. Use when writing or converting README.md files that contain images, ensuring correct image paths for each platform. GitHub READMEs use Qiniu cloud URLs (via qiniu-upload skill), Gitee READMEs use local relative image paths.","bodyPreview":"# Readme Images\n\nREADME.md 中的图片引用规范。\n\n## 核心规则\n\n**所有图片统一使用相对路径**，GitHub 和 Gitee 共用同一份 README，无需区分平台、无需转换。\n\n```markdown\n![功能截图](./docs/screenshots/feature.avif)\n![架构图](./images/architecture.png)\n```\n\n## 工作原理\n\n- **GitHub**：自动解析为 `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/user/repo/branch/path`\n- **Gitee**：自动解析为 `https://gitee.com/user/repo/raw/branch/path`\n\n两个平台都官方支持相对路径，零外部依赖，最稳定。\n\n## 图片目录规范\n\n```\nproject/\n├── README.md\n├── docs/\n│   └── screenshots/       # 推荐：功能截图\n│       ├── feature.avif\n│       └── dem","body":"# Readme Images\n\nREADME.md 中的图片引用规范。\n\n## 核心规则\n\n**所有图片统一使用相对路径**，GitHub 和 Gitee 共用同一份 README，无需区分平台、无需转换。\n\n```markdown\n![功能截图](./docs/screenshots/feature.avif)\n![架构图](./images/architecture.png)\n```\n\n## 工作原理\n\n- **GitHub**：自动解析为 `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/user/repo/branch/path`\n- **Gitee**：自动解析为 `https://gitee.com/user/repo/raw/branch/path`\n\n两个平台都官方支持相对路径，零外部依赖，最稳定。\n\n## 图片目录规范\n\n```\nproject/\n├── README.md\n├── docs/\n│   └── screenshots/       # 推荐：功能截图\n│       ├── feature.avif\n│       └── demo.webp\n└── images/                # 备选：通用图片\n    └── logo.png\n```\n\n## 必须遵守\n\n1. **图片文件必须提交到仓库** — 两个平台都需要文件存在\n2. **使用相对路径** — 以 `./` 开头或直接写相对路径\n3. **不使用绝对 URL** — 不用 CDN、不用 raw.githubusercontent.com、不用七牛云\n4. **图片需压缩** — 遵循 `image-compress` skill 规则，确保图片 < 100KB\n5. **推荐格式** — avif > webp > png > jpg\n\n## 禁止的写法\n\n```markdown\n<!-- ❌ 七牛云 URL -->\n![图片](http://qiniu.biomed168.com/pic/screenshot.png)\n\n<!-- ❌ GitHub Raw URL -->\n![图片](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/user/repo/main/images/pic.png)\n\n<!-- ❌ jsdelivr CDN -->\n![图片](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/user/repo@main/images/pic.png)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:48:45.609Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Agents needing standardized image referencing in Markdown files.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Markdown 文件中标准化图像引用的文档代理。","ja":"マークダウンファイルで画像参照を標準化する必要があるドキュメント エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Markdown 파일에서 이미지 참조를 표준화해야 하는 문서 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de documentación que necesitan referencias de imágenes estandarizadas en archivos Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de documentation ayant besoin de références d''images standardisées dans les fichiers Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsagenten, die standardisierte Bildverweise in Markdown-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Documentação que necessitam de referências de imagem padronizadas em arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов документации, требующих стандартизированных ссылок на изображения в файлах Markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى مرجع صور معياري في ملفات Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage images in README files using relative paths, supporting both GitHub and Gitee platforms with automatic URL resolution for .avif and .png files.","zh":"赋予代理管理 README 文件中的图像的能力，使用相对路径，支持 GitHub 和 Gitee 平台，对 .avif 和 .png 文件进行自动 URL 解析。","ja":"エージェントが README ファイル内の画像を相対パスで管理できるようにし、GitHub と Gitee プラットフォームをサポートし、.avif と .png ファイルの自動 URL 解決を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 README 파일 내의 이미지를 상대 경로로 관리할 수 있도록 하며 GitHub 및 Gitee 플랫폼을 지원하며 .avif 및 .png 파일에 대한 자동 URL解析을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar imágenes en archivos README utilizando rutas relativas, con soporte para las plataformas GitHub y Gitee, y resolución automática de URL para archivos .avif y .png.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des images dans les fichiers README en utilisant des chemins relatifs, en prenant en charge les plates-formes GitHub et Gitee, avec une résolution automatique d''URL pour les fichiers .avif et .png.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Bilder in README-Dateien mithilfe relativer Pfade zu verwalten, und unterstützt sowohl die GitHub- als auch die Gitee-Plattform mit automatischer URL-Auflösung für .avif- und .png-Dateien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar imagens em arquivos README usando caminhos relativos, suportando tanto as plataformas GitHub e Gitee com resolução de URL automática para arquivos .avif e .png.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять изображениями в файлах README с использованием относительных путей, поддерживая обе платформы GitHub и Gitee с автоматическим разрешением URL для файлов .avif и .png.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة الصور في ملفات README باستخدام مسارات相対ية، ودعم منصات GitHub و Gitee مع حل URL تلقائي لملفات .avif و .png."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing image references in cross-platform README files","Automating image path resolution for GitHub and Gitee","Organizing project screenshots and architecture diagrams in a unified directory structure"],"zh":["标准化跨平台 README 文件中的图像引用","自动化 GitHub 和 Gitee 的图像路径解析","统一目录结构中组织项目屏幕截图和体系结构图"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの README ファイル内の画像参照を標準化する","GitHub と Gitee の画像パス解決を自動化する","統一されたディレクトリ構造でプロジェクトのスクリーンショットとアーキテクチャ図を整理する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 README 파일 내의 이미지 참조를 표준화한다","GitHub 및 Gitee의 이미지 경로를 자동으로 해결한다","统一된 디렉토리 구조에서 프로젝트의 스크린샷과 아키텍처 다이어그램을 조직한다"],"es":["Estandarizar referencias de imágenes en archivos README multiplataforma","Automatizar la resolución de rutas de imágenes para GitHub y Gitee","Organizar capturas de pantalla del proyecto y diagramas de arquitectura en una estructura de directorios unificada"],"fr":["Standardiser les références d''images dans les fichiers README multiplateforme","Automatiser la résolution des chemins d''images pour GitHub et Gitee","Organiser les captures d''écran de projet et les diagrammes d''architecture dans une structure de répertoire unifiée"],"de":["Standardisieren von Bildverweisen in cross-plattformen-README-Dateien","Automatisieren der Bildpfadauflösung für GitHub und Gitee","Organisieren von Projektscreenshots und Architekturdiagrammen in einer einheitlichen Verzeichnisstruktur"],"pt":["Padronizar referências de imagem em arquivos README de plataforma cruzada","Automatizar a resolução do caminho de imagem para GitHub e Gitee","Organizar capturas de tela do projeto e diagramas de arquitetura em uma estrutura de diretório unificada"],"ru":["Стандартизировать ссылки на изображения в файлах README для разных платформ","Автоматизировать разрешение пути к изображению для GitHub и Gitee","Организовать скриншоты проекта и диаграммы архитектуры в единой структуре директорий"],"ar":["توحيد مرجع الصور في ملفات README متعددة المنصات","تحسين مسار الصورة تلقائيًا لمنصات GitHub و Gitee","تنظيم لقطات الشاشة والمخططات المعمارية للمشروع في هيكل دليل موحد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific directory structure and naming conventions","Limited to GitHub and Gitee platforms for automatic URL resolution"],"zh":["需要遵守特定的目录结构和命名约定","仅限 GitHub 和 Gitee 平台的自动 URL 解析"],"ja":["特定のディレクトリ構造と命名規則に従う必要がある","自動 URL 解決は GitHub と Gitee プラットフォームに限定される"],"ko":["특정 디렉토리 구조와命名 규칙을 따라야 한다","자동 URL 해결은 GitHub 및 Gitee 플랫폼에만 적용된다"],"es":["Requiere adherencia a una estructura de directorios y convenciones de nomenclatura específicas","Limitado a las plataformas GitHub y Gitee para la resolución automática de URL"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à une structure de répertoire et des conventions de nommage spécifiques","Limité aux plates-formes GitHub et Gitee pour la résolution automatique d''URL"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur und Benennungskonventionen","Begrenzt auf die GitHub- und Gitee-Plattformen für die automatische URL-Auflösung"],"pt":["Exige aderência a uma estrutura de diretório específica e convenções de nomenclatura","Limitado às plataformas GitHub e Gitee para resolução de URL automática"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения определенной структуры директорий и соглашений о наименовании","Ограничен платформами GitHub и Gitee для автоматического разрешения URL"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع هيكل دليل معين وتوافق命ي","محدود بمنصات GitHub و Gitee لحل URL تلقائي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools/edird-phase-planning', 'community', 'karstenheld3', 'OpenAI-BackendTools', 'karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools', 'edird-phase-planning', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z', '2026-02-18T12:49:36.085Z', NULL, '{"id":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools/edird-phase-planning","name":"edird-phase-planning","description":{"zh":"EDIRD 阶段规划工具是一套用于测试、操作和维护 OpenAI 后端的工具集合，用于创建高级计划以实现目标","ja":"EDIRD フェーズプランニングツールは、OpenAI バックエンドのテスト、操作、維持を支援するツールの集合です","ko":"EDIRD 단계 계획 도구는 OpenAI 백엔드의 테스트, 운영, 유지 보수를 지원하는 도구 모음으로 목표를 달성하기 위한 고급 계획을 생성","pt":"O planejamento de fase EDIRD é uma coleção de ferramentas para testar, operar e manter backends de OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","ru":"Планирование фазы EDIRD - это коллекция инструментов для тестирования, эксплуатации и обслуживания бэкендов OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","ar":"تخطيط مرحلة EDIRD هو مجموعة من الأدوات لاختبار وتشغيل وصيانة الخوادم الخلفية لشركة OpenAI و AzureOpenAI","en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"EDIRD 阶段规划工具","ja":"EDIRD フェーズプランニングツール","ko":"EDIRD 단계 계획 도구","pt":"Planejamento de Fase EDIRD para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Планирование фазы EDIRD для разработчиков","ar":"تخطيط مرحلة EDIRD للمطورين","en":"edird-phase-planning"},"description":{"zh":"EDIRD 阶段规划工具是一套用于测试、操作和维护 OpenAI 后端的工具集合，用于创建高级计划以实现目标","ja":"EDIRD フェーズプランニングツールは、OpenAI バックエンドのテスト、操作、維持を支援するツールの集合です","ko":"EDIRD 단계 계획 도구는 OpenAI 백엔드의 테스트, 운영, 유지 보수를 지원하는 도구 모음으로 목표를 달성하기 위한 고급 계획을 생성","pt":"O planejamento de fase EDIRD é uma coleção de ferramentas para testar, operar e manter backends de OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","ru":"Планирование фазы EDIRD - это коллекция инструментов для тестирования, эксплуатации и обслуживания бэкендов OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","ar":"تخطيط مرحلة EDIRD هو مجموعة من الأدوات لاختبار وتشغيل وصيانة الخوادم الخلفية لشركة OpenAI و AzureOpenAI","en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of tools to test, operate and maintain OpenAI backends (OpenAI and AzureOpenAI)"},"features":{"zh":["支持创建高级计划","用于测试、操作和维护 OpenAI 后端","支持长期代理运行","提供快速参考指南"],"ja":["ハイレベルプランの作成をサポート","OpenAI バックエンドのテスト、操作、維持をサポート","長期エージェントランをサポート","クイックリファレンスガイドを提供"],"ko":["고급 계획 생성 지원","OpenAI 백엔드의 테스트, 운영, 유지 보수 지원","장기 에이전트 실행 지원","빠른 참조 가이드 제공"],"pt":["Criação de planos de alto nível para alcançar metas","Planejamento para execuções de longa duração para recursos, correções ou pesquisas","Ferramentas para testar e operar backends de OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","Otimização de workflows de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplas fases: EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE e DELIVER"],"ru":["Создание высокоуровневых планов для достижения целей","Планирование для длительных запусков для функций, исправлений или исследований","Инструменты для тестирования и эксплуатации бэкендов OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","Оптимизация рабочих процессов разработки","Поддержка нескольких фаз: EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE и DELIVER"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط عالية المستوى لتحقيق الأهداف","تخطيط لتشغيل طويل الأمد لميزات أو إصلاحات أو أبحاث","أدوات لاختبار وتشغيل الخوادم الخلفية لشركة OpenAI و AzureOpenAI","تحسين سير عمل التطوير","دعم مراحل متعددة: EXPLORE و DESIGN و IMPLEMENT و REFINE و DELIVER"]},"keywords":{"zh":["EDIRD 阶段规划工具","OpenAI 后端开发","测试和操作","维护和管理","长期代理运行","快速参考指南"],"ja":["EDIRD フェーズプランニングツール","OpenAI バックエンド開発","テストと操作","維持と管理","長期エージェントラン","クイックリファレンスガイド"],"ko":["EDIRD 단계 계획 도구","OpenAI 백엔드 개발","테스트 및 운영","유지 보수 및 관리","장기 에이전트 실행","빠른 참조 가이드"],"pt":["planejamento de fase EDIRD","desenvolvimento com OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","otimização de workflows","backends de OpenAI","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["планирование фазы EDIRD","разработка с OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","оптимизация рабочих процессов","бэкенды OpenAI","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تخطيط مرحلة EDIRD","التطوير باستخدام OpenAI","AzureOpenAI","تحسين سير عمل التطوير","خوادم خلفية لشركة OpenAI","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"edird-phase-planning","description":"Apply when doing planning for long-running tasks in sessions on top level","bodyPreview":"# EDIRD Phase Planning\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- `/build` or `/solve` workflows\n- [PLAN] - creating high-level plans to achieve goals\n- Planning for long agentic runs for features, fixes, or research\n\n**NOT for document writing** - Use dedicated workflows instead:\n- `/write-spec` for SPEC documents\n- `/write-impl-plan` for IMPL documents\n- `/write-test-plan` for TEST documents\n- `/write-tasks-plan` for TASKS documents\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Phases:** EXPLORE → DESIGN → IMPLEMENT → REFINE → DELIVER","body":"# EDIRD Phase Planning\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- `/build` or `/solve` workflows\n- [PLAN] - creating high-level plans to achieve goals\n- Planning for long agentic runs for features, fixes, or research\n\n**NOT for document writing** - Use dedicated workflows instead:\n- `/write-spec` for SPEC documents\n- `/write-impl-plan` for IMPL documents\n- `/write-test-plan` for TEST documents\n- `/write-tasks-plan` for TASKS documents\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Phases:** EXPLORE → DESIGN → IMPLEMENT → REFINE → DELIVER\n\n**Workflow types:** BUILD (code output) | SOLVE (knowledge/decision output)\n\n**Assessment:** COMPLEXITY-LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH | PROBLEM-TYPE (RESEARCH/ANALYSIS/EVALUATION/WRITING/DECISION)\n\n## Phase Gates\n\n### EXPLORE → DESIGN\n\n- [ ] Problem or goal clearly understood\n- [ ] Workflow type determined (BUILD or SOLVE)\n- [ ] Assessment complete (BUILD: COMPLEXITY | SOLVE: PROBLEM-TYPE)\n- [ ] Scope boundaries defined\n- [ ] No blocking unknowns requiring [ACTOR] input\n\n### DESIGN → IMPLEMENT\n\n- [ ] Approach documented (outline, spec, or plan)\n- [ ] Risky parts proven via POC (if COMPLEXITY-MEDIUM or higher)\n- [ ] No open questions requiring [ACTOR] decision\n- [ ] For BUILD: SPEC, IMPL, TEST documents created\n- [ ] For BUILD: TASKS document created via [PARTITION]\n- [ ] For SOLVE: Structure/criteria validated\n\n### IMPLEMENT → REFINE\n\n- [ ] Core work complete (code written / document drafted)\n- [ ] For BUILD: Tests pass\n- [ ] For BUILD: No TODO/FIXME left unaddressed\n- [ ] For SOLVE: All sections drafted\n- [ ] Progress committed/saved\n\n### REFINE → DELIVER\n\n- [ ] Self-review complete\n- [ ] Verification against spec/rules passed\n- [ ] For BUILD COMPLEXITY-MEDIUM+: Critique and reconcile complete\n- [ ] For SOLVE: Claims verified, arguments strengthened\n- [ ] All found issues fixed\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n### BUILD (COMPLEXITY-HIGH)\n\n```\n[EXPLORE] → [RESEARCH] → [ANALYZE] → [ASSESS] → [SCOPE] → Gate\n[DESIGN]  → [PLAN] → [WRITE-SPEC] → [WRITE-IMPL-PLAN] → [PROVE] → [PARTITION] → Gate\n[IMPLEMENT] → [IMPLEMENT] → [TEST] → [FIX] → [COMMIT] → Gate (loop until green)\n[REFINE] → [REVIEW] → [VERIFY] → [CRITIQUE] → [RECONCILE] → Gate\n[DELIVER] → [VALIDATE] → [MERGE] → [CLOSE] → [ARCHIVE]\n```\n\n### SOLVE (EVALUATION)\n\n```\n[EXPLORE] → [RESEARCH] → [ANALYZE] → [ASSESS] → EVALUATION → Gate\n[DESIGN]  → [FRAME] → [OUTLINE] criteria → [DEFINE] framework → Gate\n[IMPLEMENT] → [RESEARCH] options → [EVALUATE] → [SYNTHESIZE] → Gate\n[REFINE] → [CRITIQUE] → [VERIFY] claims → [IMPROVE] → Gate\n[DELIVER] → [CONCLUDE] → [RECOMMEND] → [VALIDATE] → [ARCHIVE]\n```\n\n**Note:** COMPLEXITY-LOW skips [PROVE], [CRITIQUE], [RECONCILE].\n\n## Phase Plan Requirements\n\nPlans created via [PLAN] must define:\n- **Objectives** - What success looks like\n- **Strategy** - How to achieve objectives\n- **Deliverables** - Concrete outputs with checkboxes\n- **Transitions** - When to move to next phase\n\n**Planning Horizon:**\n```\n[EXPLORE]   ← Plan now\n[DESIGN]    ← Plan now\n[IMPLEMENT] ← TBD (after DESIGN gate)\n[REFINE]    ← TBD (after IMPLEMENT gate)\n[DELIVER]   ← Plan now (shipping tasks from NOTES)\n```\n\n## How to Plan Well\n\n### Goal Decomposition\n\n1. **Start with outcome** - What does \"done\" look like?\n2. **Identify dependencies** - What must complete before what?\n3. **Find parallel opportunities** - What can run concurrently?\n4. **Size steps for testability** - Each step should be verifiable\n\n### Scope Calibration\n\n- **Too big**: Step takes >30min AWT or touches >3 files → decompose further\n- **Too small**: Step takes <2min AWT → combine with adjacent step\n- **Right size**: Verifiable outcome, clear done criteria, single responsibility\n\n### Dependency Mapping\n\nAsk for each step:\n- What inputs do I need? (determines predecessors)\n- What outputs do I produce? (determines successors)\n- Can this run while something else runs? (candidate for Concurrent block)\n\n### Common Planning Mistakes\n\n- **Vague objectives**: \"Make it work\" → Define specific success criteria\n- **Missing dependencies**: Steps that assume prior work → Explicit `← Px-Sy`\n- **Over-sequencing**: All steps linear when some could parallelize\n- **Under-estimating**: No AWT in Strategy → Add time budget\n- **Skipping verification**: No test step after implement → Add [TEST] or [VERIFY]\n\n## Next Action Logic\n\n1. **Check phase gate** → Pass? → Next phase, first verb\n2. **Gate fails?** → Execute verb that addresses unchecked item\n3. **Verb outcome:** -OK → next verb | -FAIL → handle | -SKIP → next verb\n4. **No more verbs?** → Re-evaluate gate\n5. **[DELIVER] done?** → [CLOSE] and [ARCHIVE] if session-based\n\n**Common failure handlers:**\n- -FAIL on [RESEARCH], [ASSESS], [PLAN] → [CONSULT] or more [RESEARCH]\n- -FAIL on [TEST], [VERIFY] → [FIX] → retry\n\n## Effort Allocation\n\n### Time Units\n\n- **AWT** (Agentic Work Time) - Agent processing time, excludes user wait\n- **HHW** (Human-Hour Work) - Human equivalent effort for task sizing\n\n### Phase Budgets by Complexity\n\n| Phase | LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH |\n|-------|-----|--------|------|\n| EXPLORE | 5min | 15min | 30min |\n| DESIGN | 5min | 30min | 60min |\n| IMPLEMENT | varies | varies | varies |\n| REFINE | 5min | 15min | 30min |\n| DELIVER | 2min | 5min | 10min |\n\nValues are AWT guidelines, not hard limits.\n\n### Diminishing Returns\n\n- Phase takes 2x budget without gate progress → [CONSULT]\n- Same step retried 3x without improvement → [CONSULT]\n- Research yields no new information after 3 sources → move on\n\n### Retry Limits\n\n- **COMPLEXITY-LOW**: Infinite retries (until user stops)\n- **COMPLEXITY-MEDIUM/HIGH**: Max 5 attempts per phase, then [CONSULT]\n\n## Mandatory Gate Output\n\nBefore proceeding to next phase, output:\n\n```markdown\n## Gate: [CURRENT_PHASE] → [NEXT_PHASE]\n\n**Complexity**: [LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH] | **Artifacts**: [list created docs]\n\n- [x] Item - Evidence: [specific evidence]\n- [ ] Item - BLOCKED: [what''s missing]\n\n**Gate status**: PASS | FAIL\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:49:36.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring structured planning for OpenAI backend operations","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要为 OpenAI 后端操作进行结构化规划","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの OpenAI バックエンド操作の構造化計画を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています","ko":"OpenAI 백엔드 작업을 위한 구조화된 계획을 요구하는 AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren una planificación estructurada para las operaciones de backend de OpenAI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une planification structurée pour les opérations de backend OpenAI","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine strukturierte Planung für OpenAI-Backend-Operationen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem planejamento estruturado para operações de backend da OpenAI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих структурированного планирования для операций бэкэнда OpenAI","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب التخطيط المنظم لعمليات الخلفية لشركة OpenAI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-level plans using the EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE, and DELIVER phases, streamlining OpenAI backend testing, operation, and maintenance via `/build` or `/solve` workflows and PLAN protocols","zh":"使得代理能够使用 EXPLORE、DESIGN、IMPLEMENT、REFINE 和 DELIVER 阶段创建高级计划，从而通过 `/build` 或 `/solve` 工作流和 PLAN 协议简化 OpenAI 后端测试、操作和维护","ja":"EXPLORE、DESIGN、IMPLEMENT、REFINE、DELIVER フェーズを使用して、高レベルなプランを作成できるようにエージェントをエンパワーメントし、 `/build` または `/solve` ワークフローおよび PLAN プロトコルを介して OpenAI バックエンドのテスト、操作、およびメンテナンスを合理化する","ko":"EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE 및 DELIVER 단계를 사용하여 고급 계획을 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하여 `/build` 또는 `/solve` 워크플로 및 PLAN 프로토콜을 통해 OpenAI 백엔드 테스트, 운영 및 유지 보수를 간소화합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear planes de alto nivel utilizando las fases de EXPLORAR, DISEÑAR, IMPLEMENTAR, PERFECCIONAR y ENTREGAR, lo que simplifica las pruebas, operaciones y mantenimiento de backend de OpenAI a través de flujos de trabajo `/build` o `/solve` y protocolos de PLAN","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans de haut niveau en utilisant les phases d''EXPLORER, CONCEVOIR, METTRE EN ŒUVRE, AFFINER et LIVRER, ce qui simplifie les tests, les opérations et la maintenance de backend OpenAI via les flux de travail `/build` ou `/solve` et les protocoles de PLAN","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, hochrangige Pläne unter Verwendung der Phasen EXPLORIEREN, ENTWERFEN, IMPLEMENTIEREN, VERFEINERN und LIEFERN zu erstellen, wodurch die Tests, Betrieb und Wartung von OpenAI-Backend über `/build`- oder `/solve`-Workflows und PLAN-Protokolle vereinfacht werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem planos de alto nível usando as fases EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE e DELIVER, simplificando os testes, operação e manutenção do backend da OpenAI por meio de fluxos de trabalho `/build` ou `/solve` e protocolos de PLANO","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать высокоуровневые планы, используя фазы EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE и DELIVER, упрощая тестирование, эксплуатацию и обслуживание бэкэнда OpenAI посредством рабочих процессов `/build` или `/solve` и протоколов PLANE","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء خطط من المستوى الأعلى باستخدام مراحل استكشاف وتصميم وتنفيذ وتصفية وتسليم، مبسطاً اختبارات وعمليات الصيانة للخلفية من خلال سير عمل `/build` أو `/solve` وبروتوكولات التخطيط"},"useCases":{"en":["Planning long agentic runs for feature development","Creating high-level plans to achieve research goals","Maintaining OpenAI and AzureOpenAI backends through phased planning"],"zh":["规划长期代理运行以进行功能开发","创建高级计划以实现研究目标","通过分阶段规划维护 OpenAI 和 AzureOpenAI 后端"],"ja":["機能開発のための長期エージェント実行の計画","研究目標を達成するための高レベルなプランの作成","段階的な計画を通じて OpenAI と AzureOpenAI バックエンドのメンテナンス"],"ko":["기능 개발을 위한 장기 에이전트 실행 계획","연구 목표 달성을 위한 고급 계획 생성","阶段적 계획을 통한 OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 백엔드 유지 보수"],"es":["Planificación de ejecuciones de agentes a largo plazo para el desarrollo de funciones","Creación de planes de alto nivel para lograr objetivos de investigación","Mantenimiento de backends de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI a través de la planificación por fases"],"fr":["Planification d''exécutions d''agents à long terme pour le développement de fonctions","Création de plans de haut niveau pour atteindre les objectifs de recherche","Maintenance des backends OpenAI et AzureOpenAI via la planification par phases"],"de":["Planung von Agentenausführungen über einen langen Zeitraum für die Funktionsentwicklung","Erstellung von hochrangigen Plänen, um Forschungsziele zu erreichen","Wartung von OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Backends durch phasenweise Planung"],"pt":["Planejamento de execuções de agentes de longo prazo para desenvolvimento de recursos","Criação de planos de alto nível para alcançar objetivos de pesquisa","Manutenção de backends da OpenAI e AzureOpenAI por meio de planejamento por fases"],"ru":["Планирование длительных запусков агентов для разработки функций","Создание высокоуровневых планов для достижения исследовательских целей","Обслуживание бэкэндов OpenAI и AzureOpenAI посредством фазового планирования"],"ar":["تخطيط عمليات وكلاء طويلة الأمد لتطوير الميزات","إنشاء خطط من المستوى الأعلى لتحقيق أهداف البحث","صيانة الخلفيات من OpenAI و AzureOpenAI من خلال التخطيط بالمراحل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Not intended for document writing, use dedicated workflows instead","Requires OpenAI backend access","Specific to OpenAI and AzureOpenAI services"],"zh":["不适用于文档编写，请使用专用工作流程","需要 OpenAI 后端访问","仅适用于 OpenAI 和 AzureOpenAI 服务"],"ja":["ドキュメントの作成には使用しないでください。専用のワークフローを使用してください","OpenAI バックエンドへのアクセスが必要","OpenAI と AzureOpenAI サービス専用"],"ko":["문서 작성에는 사용하지 마십시오. 전용 워크플로를 사용하십시오","OpenAI 백엔드 액세스가 필요합니다","OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 서비스 전용"],"es":["No está destinado a la escritura de documentos, use flujos de trabajo dedicados en su lugar","Requiere acceso al backend de OpenAI","Específico para los servicios de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI"],"fr":["N''est pas destiné à l''écriture de documents, utilisez des flux de travail dédiés à la place","Requiert l''accès au backend OpenAI","Spécifique aux services OpenAI et AzureOpenAI"],"de":["Nicht für das Schreiben von Dokumenten gedacht, verwenden Sie stattdessen dedizierte Workflows","Benötigt Zugriff auf OpenAI-Backend","Spezifisch für OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Dienste"],"pt":["Não destinado à escrita de documentos, use fluxos de trabalho dedicados instead","Exige acesso ao backend da OpenAI","Específico para serviços da OpenAI e AzureOpenAI"],"ru":["Не предназначен для написания документов, используйте вместо этого выделенные рабочие процессы","Требует доступа к бэкэнду OpenAI","Специфичен для сервисов OpenAI и AzureOpenAI"],"ar":["غير مخصص لكتابة الوثائق، استخدم بدلاً من ذلك سير العمل المخصصة","يتطلب الوصول إلى الخلفية من OpenAI","محدد لخدمات OpenAI و AzureOpenAI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('stackconsult/RE-Engine/reengine-claude-code', 'community', 'stackconsult', 'RE-Engine', 'stackconsult/RE-Engine', 'reengine-claude-code', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z', '2026-02-18T12:50:01.825Z', NULL, '{"id":"stackconsult/RE-Engine/reengine-claude-code","name":"reengine-claude-code","description":{"zh":"RE Engine Claude Code集成用于简化开发任务，利用Claude Code和Ollama模型","ja":"REエンジンのClaude Code統合は、開発タスクを簡素化するために使用され、Claude CodeとOllamaモデルを利用","ko":"RE 엔진 Claude Code 통합은 개발 작업을 간소화하기 위해 사용되며 Claude Code와 Ollama 모델을 활용","es":"La integración de RE Engine Claude Code permite aprovechar Claude Code con modelos Ollama para tareas de desarrollo de RE-Engine.","fr":"L''intégration de RE Engine Claude Code permet d''utiliser Claude Code avec des modèles Ollama pour les tâches de développement RE-Engine.","de":"Die Integration von RE Engine Claude Code ermöglicht die Nutzung von Claude Code mit Ollama-Modellen für RE-Engine-Entwicklungsaufgaben.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"RE Engine Claude Code集成","ja":"REエンジン Claude Code統合","ko":"RE 엔진 Claude Code 통합","es":"Integración de RE Engine Claude Code","fr":"Intégration de RE Engine Claude Code","de":"RE Engine Claude Code Integration","en":"reengine-claude-code"},"description":{"zh":"RE Engine Claude Code集成用于简化开发任务，利用Claude Code和Ollama模型","ja":"REエンジンのClaude Code統合は、開発タスクを簡素化するために使用され、Claude CodeとOllamaモデルを利用","ko":"RE 엔진 Claude Code 통합은 개발 작업을 간소화하기 위해 사용되며 Claude Code와 Ollama 모델을 활용","es":"La integración de RE Engine Claude Code permite aprovechar Claude Code con modelos Ollama para tareas de desarrollo de RE-Engine.","fr":"L''intégration de RE Engine Claude Code permet d''utiliser Claude Code avec des modèles Ollama pour les tâches de développement RE-Engine.","de":"Die Integration von RE Engine Claude Code ermöglicht die Nutzung von Claude Code mit Ollama-Modellen für RE-Engine-Entwicklungsaufgaben.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持qwen3-coder、glm-4.7:cloud、gpt-oss:20b模型","Anthropic兼容性环境变量设置","Claude Code安装和配置","适用于RE-Engine开发任务","支持TypeScript/Node.js工作","支持MCP服务器开发"],"ja":["qwen3-coder、glm-4.7:cloud、gpt-oss:20bモデルをサポート","Anthropic互換性環境変数の設定","Claude Codeのインストールと設定","RE-Engine開発タスクに適している","TypeScript/Node.jsの作業をサポート","MCPサーバーの開発をサポート"],"ko":["qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud, gpt-oss:20b 모델 지원","Anthropic 호환성 환경 변수 설정","Claude Code 설치 및 구성","RE-Engine 개발 작업에 적합","TypeScript/Node.js 작업 지원","MCP 서버 개발 지원"],"es":["Integración con modelos Ollama","Compatibilidad con Anthropic","Entorno de desarrollo configurado","Soporte para tareas de codificación","Optimizado para MCP y TypeScript/Node.js"],"fr":["Intégration avec des modèles Ollama","Compatibilité avec Anthropic","Environnement de développement configuré","Prise en charge des tâches de codage","Optimisé pour MCP et TypeScript/Node.js"],"de":["Integration mit Ollama-Modellen","Kompatibilität mit Anthropic","Entwicklungsumgebung konfiguriert","Unterstützung für Codieraufgaben","Optimiert für MCP und TypeScript/Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RE Engine","Claude Code","Ollama模型","开发工具","qwen3-coder","glm-4.7:cloud","gpt-oss:20b","Anthropic","TypeScript","Node.js"],"ja":["REエンジン","Claude Code","Ollamaモデル","開発ツール","qwen3-coder","glm-4.7:cloud","gpt-oss:20b","Anthropic","TypeScript","Node.js"],"ko":["RE 엔진","Claude Code","Ollama 모델","개발 도구","qwen3-coder","glm-4.7:cloud","gpt-oss:20b","Anthropic","TypeScript","Node.js"],"es":["RE Engine","Claude Code","Ollama","desarrollo de software","integración de modelos","Anthropic","MCP","TypeScript","Node.js"],"fr":["RE Engine","Claude Code","Ollama","développement de logiciels","intégration de modèles","Anthropic","MCP","TypeScript","Node.js"],"de":["RE Engine","Claude Code","Ollama","Softwareentwicklung","Modellintegration","Anthropic","MCP","TypeScript","Node.js"]}},"owner":"stackconsult","repo":"RE-Engine","repoPath":"stackconsult/RE-Engine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reengine-claude-code","description":"Use Claude Code with Ollama for enhanced RE-Engine development and operations","bodyPreview":"# RE Engine Claude Code Integration\n\n## When to use\nUse this skill when you need to leverage Claude Code with Ollama models for RE-Engine development tasks.\n\n## Environment Setup\n- Ollama running with qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud, gpt-oss:20b models\n- Anthropic compatibility environment variables set\n- Claude Code installed and configured\n\n## Model Specializations\n- **qwen3-coder**: Best for coding tasks, MCP server development, TypeScript/Node.js work\n- **glm-4.7:cloud**: Best for message generat","body":"# RE Engine Claude Code Integration\n\n## When to use\nUse this skill when you need to leverage Claude Code with Ollama models for RE-Engine development tasks.\n\n## Environment Setup\n- Ollama running with qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud, gpt-oss:20b models\n- Anthropic compatibility environment variables set\n- Claude Code installed and configured\n\n## Model Specializations\n- **qwen3-coder**: Best for coding tasks, MCP server development, TypeScript/Node.js work\n- **glm-4.7:cloud**: Best for message generation, reasoning about outreach strategies\n- **gpt-oss:20b**: Best for operations, debugging, and general maintenance\n\n## Procedure\n1) Ensure Ollama service is running: `brew services list | grep ollama`\n2) Set environment: `export ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=ollama ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=\"\"`\n3) Choose appropriate model for task:\n   - Development: `claude --model qwen3-coder`\n   - Messaging: `claude --model glm-4.7:cloud` \n   - Operations: `claude --model gpt-oss:20b`\n4) Run Claude Code in RE-Engine directory\n5) Leverage enhanced context window (64k) for complex codebase analysis\n\n## Integration Points\n- MCP Server development: Use qwen3-coder for complex tool implementations\n- Message template optimization: Use glm-4.7:cloud for personalization strategies\n- Production debugging: Use gpt-oss:20b for operational issues\n- Code refactoring: Use qwen3-coder with full codebase context\n\n## Mandatory checks\n- Never expose API keys or secrets in Claude Code sessions\n- Ensure approval-first policies are maintained in all generated code\n- Test all code changes in development environment before production\n- Update documentation when adding new Claude Code workflows\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:50:01.825Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Development Agents requiring seamless integration with Ollama models and Claude Code for RE-Engine development tasks.","zh":"适合需要与 Ollama 模型和 Claude Code 无缝集成的高级开发代理，用于 RE-Engine 开发任务。","ja":"Ollama モデルおよび Claude Code とシームレスに統合する必要がある高度な開発エージェントに適しています。RE-Engine 開発タスク用です。","ko":"Ollama 모델 및 Claude Code와의無縫統合이 필요한 고급 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다. RE-Engine 개발 작업을 위해 설계되었습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo avanzados que requieren una integración sin problemas con los modelos Ollama y Claude Code para tareas de desarrollo de RE-Engine.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement avancés nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les modèles Ollama et Claude Code pour les tâches de développement de RE-Engine.","de":"Ideal für Advanced Development Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Ollama-Modellen und Claude Code für RE-Engine-Entwicklungsaufgaben erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Avançado que exigem integração perfeita com modelos Ollama e Claude Code para tarefas de desenvolvimento do RE-Engine.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов разработки, требующих бесшовной интеграции с моделями Ollama и Claude Code для задач разработки RE-Engine.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير المتقدم الذي يتطلب تكاملًا دون إنهيارات مع نماذج Ollama و Claude Code لمهام تطوير RE-Engine."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Claude Code with specialized models like qwen3-coder for coding tasks and glm-4.7:cloud for message generation, utilizing Anthropic compatibility environment variables and TypeScript/Node.js work.","zh":"赋予代理使用 Claude Code 和专用模型（如 qwen3-coder 用于编码任务和 glm-4.7:cloud 用于消息生成）利用 Anthropic 兼容性环境变量和 TypeScript/Node.js 工作的能力。","ja":"Claude Code と専用モデル（qwen3-coder を使用したコーディング タスクと glm-4.7:cloud を使用したメッセージ生成など）を使用し、Anthropic 互換性環境変数と TypeScript/Node.js を使用した作業をエージェントに可能にする。","ko":"에이전트가 Claude Code 및 전용 모델(qwen3-coder를 사용한 코딩 작업과 glm-4.7:cloud를 사용한 메시지 생성 등)을 활용하여 Anthropic 호환성 환경 변수 및 TypeScript/Node.js 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar Claude Code con modelos especializados como qwen3-coder para tareas de codificación y glm-4.7:cloud para la generación de mensajes, utilizando variables de entorno de compatibilidad Anthropic y trabajo de TypeScript/Node.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter Claude Code avec des modèles spécialisés comme qwen3-coder pour les tâches de codage et glm-4.7:cloud pour la génération de messages, en utilisant des variables d''environnement de compatibilité Anthropic et un travail de TypeScript/Node.js.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Claude Code mit speziellen Modellen wie qwen3-coder für Codieraufgaben und glm-4.7:cloud für die Nachrichtengenerierung zu nutzen, unter Verwendung von Anthropic-Kompatibilitäts-Umgebungsvariablen und TypeScript/Node.js-Arbeit.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o Claude Code com modelos especializados, como o qwen3-coder para tarefas de codificação e o glm-4.7:cloud para geração de mensagens, utilizando variáveis de ambiente de compatibilidade Anthropic e trabalho TypeScript/Node.js.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать Claude Code с особыми моделями, такими как qwen3-coder для задач кодирования и glm-4.7:cloud для генерации сообщений, используя переменные среды совместимости Anthropic и работу TypeScript/Node.js.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستفادة من Claude Code مع نماذج متخصصة مثل qwen3-coder لأعمال الترميز و glm-4.7:cloud لإنشاء الرسائل، باستخدام متغيرات بيئة التوافق من Anthropic وعمل TypeScript/Node.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing MCP server applications with qwen3-coder","Generating messages with glm-4.7:cloud for RE-Engine projects","Integrating Claude Code with Ollama models for advanced development tasks"],"zh":["使用 qwen3-coder 开发 MCP 服务器应用程序","使用 glm-4.7:cloud 为 RE-Engine 项目生成消息","将 Claude Code 与 Ollama 模型集成以执行高级开发任务"],"ja":["qwen3-coder を使用した MCP サーバー アプリケーションの開発","glm-4.7:cloud を使用した RE-Engine プロジェクトのメッセージ生成","Claude Code と Ollama モデルを統合して高度な開発タスクを実行"],"ko":["qwen3-coder를 사용한 MCP 서버 응용 프로그램 개발","glm-4.7:cloud를 사용한 RE-Engine 프로젝트 메시지 생성","Claude Code와 Ollama 모델을 통합하여 고급 개발 작업 수행"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones de servidor MCP con qwen3-coder","Generar mensajes con glm-4.7:cloud para proyectos de RE-Engine","Integrar Claude Code con modelos Ollama para tareas de desarrollo avanzadas"],"fr":["Développer des applications de serveur MCP avec qwen3-coder","Générer des messages avec glm-4.7:cloud pour les projets de RE-Engine","Intégrer Claude Code avec des modèles Ollama pour des tâches de développement avancées"],"de":["Entwicklung von MCP-Serveranwendungen mit qwen3-coder","Generierung von Nachrichten mit glm-4.7:cloud für RE-Engine-Projekte","Integration von Claude Code mit Ollama-Modellen für fortschrittliche Entwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações de servidor MCP com qwen3-coder","Gerar mensagens com glm-4.7:cloud para projetos RE-Engine","Integrar Claude Code com modelos Ollama para tarefas de desenvolvimento avançado"],"ru":["Разработка приложений сервера MCP с qwen3-coder","Генерация сообщений с помощью glm-4.7:cloud для проектов RE-Engine","Интеграция Claude Code с моделями Ollama для задач продвинутой разработки"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات خادم MCP باستخدام qwen3-coder","إنشاء رسائل باستخدام glm-4.7:cloud لمشاريع RE-Engine","دمج Claude Code مع نماذج Ollama لأعمال التطوير المتقدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ollama running with qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud, and gpt-oss:20b models","Needs Anthropic compatibility environment variables set","Claude Code installation and configuration required"],"zh":["需要 Ollama 与 qwen3-coder、glm-4.7:cloud 和 gpt-oss:20b 模型一起运行","需要设置 Anthropic 兼容性环境变量","需要 Claude Code 的安装和配置"],"ja":["Ollama が qwen3-coder、glm-4.7:cloud、gpt-oss:20b モデルと一緒に実行される必要がある","Anthropic 互換性環境変数を設定する必要がある","Claude Code のインストールと設定が必要"],"ko":["Ollama가 qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud 및 gpt-oss:20b 모델과 함께 실행되어야 함","Anthropic 호환성 환경 변수를 설정해야 함","Claude Code 설치 및 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere que Ollama se ejecute con los modelos qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud y gpt-oss:20b","Necesita variables de entorno de compatibilidad Anthropic establecidas","Se requiere instalación y configuración de Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite que Ollama s''exécute avec les modèles qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud et gpt-oss:20b","Nécessite des variables d''environnement de compatibilité Anthropic définies","Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Claude Code"],"de":["Erfordert, dass Ollama mit den Modellen qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud und gpt-oss:20b ausgeführt wird","Benötigt Anthropic-Kompatibilitäts-Umgebungsvariablen","Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Claude Code"],"pt":["Exige Ollama em execução com os modelos qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud e gpt-oss:20b","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente de compatibilidade Anthropic configuradas","Requer instalação e configuração do Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует Ollama с запущенными моделями qwen3-coder, glm-4.7:cloud и gpt-oss:20b","Требует настроенных переменных среды совместимости Anthropic","Требует установки и конфигурации Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل Ollama مع نماذج qwen3-coder و glm-4.7:cloud و gpt-oss:20b","يحتاج إلى تكوين متغيرات بيئة التوافق من Anthropic","يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
