ón de elementos","Autenticación","Herramientas de prueba","Flujos de trabajo comunes y avanzados","Capturas de pantalla de página completa"],"fr":["Sélection d''éléments","Authentification","Outils de test","Workflows courants et avancés","Captures d''écran de page complète"],"de":["Elementauswahl","Authentifizierung","Testtools","Gemeinsame und erweiterte Workflows","Vollbildschirmfotos"],"pt":["Ferramentas para testar backends OpenAI","Automação de tarefas","Testes de unidade e integração","Suporte à configuração e autenticação","Ferramentas para captura de tela e manipulação de elementos"],"ru":["Инструменты для тестирования backend OpenAI","Автоматизация задач","Юнит-тестирование и интеграционное тестирование","Поддержка конфигурации и аутентификации","Инструменты для захвата экрана и манипуляции элементами"],"ar":["أدوات لاختبار الخوادم الخلفية OpenAI","تأتمتة المهام","اختبارات الوحدة والتكامل","دعم التكوين والتحقق","أدوات لالتقاط الشاشة وتصرف العناصر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright MCP","OpenAI后端","测试工具","维护工具","配置管理","工作流管理"],"ja":["Playwright MCP","OpenAIバックエンド","テストツール","メンテナンスタール","コンフィギュレーション管理","ワークフローマネージメント"],"ko":["Playwright MCP","OpenAI 백엔드","테스트 도구","유지 보수 도구","구성 관리","워크플로우 관리"],"es":["Playwright MCP","pruebas de backend","OpenAI","Azure OpenAI","automatización de pruebas","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Playwright MCP","tests de backend","OpenAI","Azure OpenAI","automatisation de tests","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Playwright MCP","Backend-Tests","OpenAI","Azure OpenAI","Testautomatisierung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Playwright MCP","testes de backend","OpenAI","automação de tarefas","testes de unidade","configuração","autenticação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Playwright MCP","тестирование бэкенда","OpenAI","автоматизация задач","юнит-тестирование","конфигурация","аутентификация","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Playwright MCP","اختبار الخوادم الخلفية","OpenAI","تأتمتة المهام","اختبارات الوحدة","التكوين","التحقق","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"OpenAI-BackendTools","repoPath":"karstenheld3/OpenAI-BackendTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ms-playwright-mcp","description":"Apply when automating browser interactions, web scraping, or UI testing with AI agents","bodyPreview":"# Playwright MCP Guide\n\nRules and usage for Microsoft Playwright MCP server.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Configuration](#configuration)\n- [Available Tools](#available-tools)\n\n**Workflows**\n- [Common Workflows](#common-workflows)\n- [Advanced Workflows](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md) - Cookie popups, scrolling, expanding items, full page screenshots\n\n**Reference**\n- [Element Selection](#element-selection)\n- [Authentication](PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.","body":"# Playwright MCP Guide\n\nRules and usage for Microsoft Playwright MCP server.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Configuration](#configuration)\n- [Available Tools](#available-tools)\n\n**Workflows**\n- [Common Workflows](#common-workflows)\n- [Advanced Workflows](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md) - Cookie popups, scrolling, expanding items, full page screenshots\n\n**Reference**\n- [Element Selection](#element-selection)\n- [Authentication](PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.md) - Persistent profiles, storage state, extension mode\n- [Troubleshooting](PLAYWRIGHT_TROUBLESHOOTING.md) - Common issues, flaky tests\n- [Setup](SETUP.md) - Installation\n\n## Intent Lookup\n\n**User wants to...**\n- **Research a topic / read articles** → Navigate, dismiss cookie popup, scroll for lazy content, screenshot\n- **Find a product / compare prices** → Navigate, search, extract data with `browser_evaluate`\n- **Fill out a form / submit application** → Use `browser_fill` for fields, `browser_click` for submit\n- **Download file / attachment** → First find links with [Section 5](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md#5-find-and-extract-links), then click to download\n- **Log into a site** → Fill credentials, submit; use [PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.md](PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.md) to stay logged in\n- **Do a bank transfer / pay bills** → Requires persistent profile for auth; use `browser_snapshot` before each action\n- **Check email / download attachments** → Navigate to webmail, expand messages, click attachment links\n- **Archive a webpage** → See [PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md) for full page screenshot workflow\n- **Interact with dynamic content** → Scroll to load lazy content, expand collapsed sections, then proceed\n\n**UI testing...**\n- **Verify page loads correctly** → Navigate, `browser_snapshot`, check expected elements present\n- **Test form validation** → Submit empty/invalid data, check error messages appear\n- **Test navigation flow** → Click through menus, verify correct pages load\n- **Test responsive layout** → Resize browser, screenshot at different widths\n- **Test button states** → Hover, click, verify visual/functional changes\n- **Test modal dialogs** → Trigger modal, interact, close, verify dismissed\n- **Test error states** → Force errors (bad URL, timeout), verify error handling\n- **Test accessibility** → Use `browser_snapshot` (accessibility tree), check refs have labels\n- **Compare before/after** → Screenshot before change, screenshot after, compare\n- **Test login/logout** → Full auth flow, verify session state\n\n**Technical tasks...**\n- **Handle cookie popup** → [PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md#1-close-cookie-popups](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md#1-close-cookie-popups)\n- **Run custom JavaScript** → `browser_evaluate(expression: \"...\")`\n- **Debug failures** → [PLAYWRIGHT_TROUBLESHOOTING.md](PLAYWRIGHT_TROUBLESHOOTING.md)\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use accessibility tree (not screenshots) for element selection\n- Reference elements via `ref=e5` format from `browser_snapshot`\n- Always call `browser_snapshot` before clicking to get current refs\n- Use `browser_close` when done to free resources\n- For logged-in sessions: Use persistent user profile or storage state\n\n## Configuration\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp\n**Package**: `@playwright/mcp`\n\n**Basic (isolated session):**\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"playwright\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"@playwright/mcp@latest\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Persistent profile (remembers logins):**\n```json\n{\n  \"args\": [\"@playwright/mcp@latest\", \"--user-data-dir\", \"[USER_PROFILE_PATH]/.ms-playwright-mcp-profile\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Headless:** Add `\"--headless\"` to args.\n\n**Timeouts:** Add `\"--timeout-action\", \"10000\", \"--timeout-navigation\", \"120000\"` for slow pages.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n### Navigation\n- **browser_navigate** - `browser_navigate(url: \"https://example.com\")`\n\n### Element Interaction\n- **browser_snapshot** - Get accessibility tree with element refs\n- **browser_click** - `browser_click(element: \"Button\", ref: \"e12\")`\n- **browser_type** - `browser_type(element: \"Input\", ref: \"e8\", text: \"query\")`\n- **browser_fill** - `browser_fill(element: \"Email\", ref: \"e3\", value: \"user@example.com\")`\n- **browser_select** - `browser_select(element: \"Country\", ref: \"e15\", values: [\"USA\"])`\n- **browser_hover** - `browser_hover(element: \"Menu\", ref: \"e5\")`\n- **browser_drag** - Drag and drop between elements\n- **browser_press_key** - `browser_press_key(key: \"Enter\")` or `browser_press_key(key: \"Control+A\")`\n\n### Inspection\n- **browser_screenshot** - `browser_screenshot()` or `browser_screenshot(fullPage: true)`\n- **browser_console_messages** - Get console logs\n- **browser_evaluate** - `browser_evaluate(expression: \"document.title\")`\n\n### Timing\n- **browser_wait_for** - `browser_wait_for(time: 2)` wait seconds, or `browser_wait_for(text: \"Loading\")` wait for text\n\n### Session\n- **browser_close** - Close browser and free resources\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Navigate and Click\n```\n1. browser_navigate(url: \"https://example.com\")\n2. browser_snapshot()\n3. browser_click(element: \"Login button\", ref: \"e12\")\n```\n\n### Fill Form\n```\n1. browser_snapshot()\n2. browser_fill(element: \"Username\", ref: \"e3\", value: \"user@example.com\")\n3. browser_fill(element: \"Password\", ref: \"e5\", value: \"password123\")\n4. browser_click(element: \"Submit\", ref: \"e8\")\n```\n\n### Wait for Content\nAfter navigation or click, call `browser_snapshot()` to verify page loaded and get updated refs.\n\n### Full Page Screenshot\n```\nbrowser_screenshot(fullPage: true)\n```\n\nFor cookie popups, lazy-load scrolling, and expanding collapsed items, see [PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md).\n\n## Element Selection\n\n### Using Refs from Snapshot\n\n1. Call `browser_snapshot()` to get current page structure\n2. Find element in returned accessibility tree\n3. Use the `ref` value in subsequent commands\n\n**Example snapshot output:**\n```\n- banner [ref=e3]:\n    - link \"Home\" [ref=e5] [cursor=pointer]\n    - navigation [ref=e12]:\n        - link \"Docs\" [ref=e13]\n```\n\n### Selector Priority\n\nWhen refs unavailable, use stable selectors:\n1. `[data-testid=\"submit\"]` - Best\n2. `getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Save'' })` - Semantic\n3. `getByText(''Sign in'')` - User-facing\n4. `input[name=\"email\"]` - HTML attributes\n5. Avoid: `.btn-primary`, `#submit` - Classes/IDs change\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+ with npx in PATH\n- Chrome/Chromium for headed mode\n\nSee [SETUP.md](SETUP.md) for installation details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:48:52.719Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring automated testing and maintenance of OpenAI backends, such as those built with Microsoft Playwright MCP","zh":"适用于需要自动化测试和维护 OpenAI 后端的 AI 代理，例如使用 Microsoft Playwright MCP 构建的代理","ja":"OpenAI バックエンドの自動テストとメンテナンスを必要とする AI エージェントに適しています。たとえば、Microsoft Playwright MCP を使用して構築されたエージェント","ko":"OpenAI 백엔드의 자동화된 테스트 및 유지 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어 Microsoft Playwright MCP로 구축된 에이전트","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren pruebas y mantenimiento automatizados de backends de OpenAI, como aquellos construidos con Microsoft Playwright MCP","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des tests et une maintenance automatisés des backends OpenAI, tels que ceux construits avec Microsoft Playwright MCP","de":"Ideal für AI-Agents, die automatisierte Tests und Wartung von OpenAI-Backends erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die mit Microsoft Playwright MCP erstellt wurden","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem testes e manutenção automatizados de backends da OpenAI, como aqueles construídos com Microsoft Playwright MCP","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих автоматизированного тестирования и обслуживания бэкендов OpenAI, таких как те, которые построены с помощью Microsoft Playwright MCP","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يتطلب اختبارات و صيانة ذاتية للخلفيات مفتوحة المصدر، مثل تلك التي بنيت مع مايكروسوفت بلاي رايت إم سي بي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate workflows using Playwright MCP, facilitating advanced browser automation, element selection, and authentication protocols like those described in the Playwright MCP Guide, enabling seamless interaction with OpenAI and AzureOpenAI services","zh":"赋予代理使用 Playwright MCP 自动化工作流的能力，促进高级浏览器自动化、元素选择和身份验证协议，如 Playwright MCP 指南中所述，实现无缝地与 OpenAI 和 AzureOpenAI 服务交互","ja":"Playwright MCP を使用してワークフローを自動化するエージェントの能力を高め、Playwright MCP ガイドに記載されているように、高度なブラウザ自動化、要素の選択、認証プロトコルを促進し、OpenAI と AzureOpenAI サービスとのシームレスな相互作用を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright MCP를 사용하여 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하여 고급 브라우저 자동화, 요소 선택 및 Playwright MCP 가이드에 설명된 바와 같이 인증 프로토콜을促進하며 OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 서비스와의 무결점 상호 작용을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo utilizando Playwright MCP, facilitando la automatización avanzada del navegador, la selección de elementos y los protocolos de autenticación como los descritos en la Guía de Playwright MCP, lo que permite una interacción sin problemas con los servicios OpenAI y AzureOpenAI","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en place des flux de travail automatisés en utilisant Playwright MCP, facilitant l''automatisation avancée du navigateur, la sélection d''éléments et les protocoles d''authentification tels que ceux décrits dans le Guide de Playwright MCP, permettant une interaction transparente avec les services OpenAI et AzureOpenAI","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Workflows mit Playwright MCP zu automatisieren, wodurch eine erweiterte Automatisierung des Browsers, die Auswahl von Elementen und Authentifizierungsprotokolle wie in der Playwright MCP-Anleitung beschrieben ermöglicht wird, was eine nahtlose Interaktion mit OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Diensten ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho usando Playwright MCP, facilitando a automação avançada do navegador, seleção de elementos e protocolos de autenticação, como aqueles descritos no Guia do Playwright MCP, permitindo interação sem problemas com os serviços da OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы с помощью Playwright MCP, облегчая продвинутую автоматизацию браузера, выбор элементов и протоколы аутентификации, такие как описанные в Руководстве по Playwright MCP, обеспечивая беспрепятственное взаимодействие с сервисами OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير سير عمل آلي باستخدام بلاي رايت إم سي بي، و تسهيل آليّة متقدّمة للمتصفّح واختيار العناصر وبروتوكولات المصادقة، مثل تلك الموضحة في دليل بلاي رايت إم سي بي، وتمكين التفاعل دون عائق مع خدمات مفتوحة المصدر وأزور مفتوحة المصدر"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating OpenAI backend testing with Playwright MCP tools","Debugging browser interactions using Playwright MCP''s element selection and authentication features","Maintaining AzureOpenAI services with advanced workflows and cookie popup handling"],"zh":["使用 Playwright MCP 工具自动化 OpenAI 后端测试","使用 Playwright MCP 的元素选择和身份验证功能调试浏览器交互","使用高级工作流和 cookie 弹出处理维护 AzureOpenAI 服务"],"ja":["Playwright MCP ツールを使用して OpenAI バックエンドのテストを自動化する","Playwright MCP の要素の選択と認証機能を使用してブラウザの相互作用をデバッグする","高度なワークフローと Cookie ポップアップの処理を使用して AzureOpenAI サービスを維持する"],"ko":["Playwright MCP 도구를 사용하여 OpenAI 백엔드 테스트 자동화","Playwright MCP의 요소 선택 및 인증 기능을 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용 디버깅","고급 워크플로 및 쿠키 팝업 처리를 사용하여 AzureOpenAI 서비스 유지 보수"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de backend de OpenAI con herramientas de Playwright MCP","Depurar interacciones del navegador utilizando las características de selección de elementos y autenticación de Playwright MCP","Mantener servicios de AzureOpenAI con flujos de trabajo avanzados y manipulación de ventanas emergentes de cookies"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de backend OpenAI avec les outils Playwright MCP","Déboguer les interactions du navigateur en utilisant les fonctionnalités de sélection d''éléments et d''authentification de Playwright MCP","Maintenir les services AzureOpenAI avec des flux de travail avancés et une gestion des fenêtres contextuelles de cookies"],"de":["Automatisieren von OpenAI-Backend-Tests mit Playwright-MCP-Tools","Fehlerbehebung von Browser-Interaktionen unter Verwendung der Element-Auswahl- und Authentifizierungs-Features von Playwright MCP","Wartung von AzureOpenAI-Diensten mit erweiterten Workflows und Cookie-Popup-Handling"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de backend da OpenAI com ferramentas do Playwright MCP","Depurar interações do navegador usando recursos de seleção de elementos e autenticação do Playwright MCP","Manter serviços da AzureOpenAI com fluxos de trabalho avançados e tratamento de pop-ups de cookies"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование бэкенда OpenAI с помощью инструментов Playwright MCP","Отлаживать взаимодействия браузера, используя функции выбора элементов и аутентификации Playwright MCP","Обслуживать сервисы AzureOpenAI с помощью продвинутых рабочих процессов и обработки всплывающих окон cookie"],"ar":["تحقيق آليّة اختبارات الخلفية مفتوحة المصدر باستخدام أدوات بلاي رايت إم سي بي","تصحيح أخطاء التفاعل مع المتصفّح باستخدام ميزات اختيار العناصر والمصادقة في بلاي رايت إم سي بي","صيانة خدمات أزور مفتوحة المصدر بسير عمل متقدم ومعالجة نوافذ منبثقة للكوكيز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Microsoft Playwright MCP server setup","Limited to OpenAI and AzureOpenAI backends","Dependent on Playwright MCP''s available tools and configuration"],"zh":["需要 Microsoft Playwright MCP 服务器设置","仅限 OpenAI 和 AzureOpenAI 后端","依赖于 Playwright MCP 的可用工具和配置"],"ja":["Microsoft Playwright MCP サーバーの設定が必要","OpenAI と AzureOpenAI のバックエンドのみに限定","Playwright MCP の利用可能なツールと構成に依存"],"ko":["Microsoft Playwright MCP 서버 설정 필요","OpenAI 및 AzureOpenAI 백엔드에만 제한","Playwright MCP의 사용 가능한 도구 및 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del servidor Microsoft Playwright MCP","Limitado a backends de OpenAI y AzureOpenAI","Dependiente de las herramientas y la configuración disponibles de Playwright MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du serveur Microsoft Playwright MCP","Limité aux backends OpenAI et AzureOpenAI","Dépendant des outils et de la configuration disponibles de Playwright MCP"],"de":["Erfordert Microsoft Playwright MCP-Server-Setup","Begrenzt auf OpenAI- und AzureOpenAI-Backends","Abhängig von den verfügbaren Tools und der Konfiguration von Playwright MCP"],"pt":["Exige configuração do servidor Microsoft Playwright MCP","Limitado a backends da OpenAI e AzureOpenAI","Dependente das ferramentas e configuração disponíveis do Playwright MCP"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера Microsoft Playwright MCP","Ограничен бэкендами OpenAI и AzureOpenAI","Зависит от доступных инструментов и конфигурации Playwright MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم مايكروسوفت بلاي رايت إم سي بي","محدود بالخلفيات مفتوحة المصدر وأزور مفتوحة المصدر","يعتمد على الأدوات وإعدادات بلاي رايت إم سي بي المتاحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
