ных для seo","шаблоны для seo","данные для seo","избежание штрафов за тонкий контент","увеличение видимости в поисковых системах"],"ar":["تحسين برنامج سيو","إنشاء صفحات محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث","قوالب لتحسين محركات البحث","بيانات لتحسين محركات البحث","تجنب العقوبات لضعف المحتوى","زيادة وضوح الصورة في محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"programmatic-seo","description":"When the user wants to create SEO-driven pages at scale using templates and data. Also use when the user mentions programmatic SEO, template pages, pages at scale, directory pages, location pages, [keyword] + [city] pages, comparison pages, integration pages, or building many pages for SEO. For auditing existing SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strate","body":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strategy, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context**\n   - What''s the product/service?\n   - Who is the target audience?\n   - What''s the conversion goal for these pages?\n\n2. **Opportunity Assessment**\n   - What search patterns exist?\n   - How many potential pages?\n   - What''s the search volume distribution?\n\n3. **Competitive Landscape**\n   - Who ranks for these terms now?\n   - What do their pages look like?\n   - Can you realistically compete?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Unique Value Per Page\n- Every page must provide value specific to that page\n- Not just swapped variables in a template\n- Maximize unique content—the more differentiated, the better\n\n### 2. Proprietary Data Wins\nHierarchy of data defensibility:\n1. Proprietary (you created it)\n2. Product-derived (from your users)\n3. User-generated (your community)\n4. Licensed (exclusive access)\n5. Public (anyone can use—weakest)\n\n### 3. Clean URL Structure\n**Always use subfolders, not subdomains**:\n- Good: `yoursite.com/templates/resume/`\n- Bad: `templates.yoursite.com/resume/`\n\n### 4. Genuine Search Intent Match\nPages must actually answer what people are searching for.\n\n### 5. Quality Over Quantity\nBetter to have 100 great pages than 10,000 thin ones.\n\n### 6. Avoid Google Penalties\n- No doorway pages\n- No keyword stuffing\n- No duplicate content\n- Genuine utility for users\n\n---\n\n## The 12 Playbooks (Overview)\n\n| Playbook | Pattern | Example |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| Templates | \"[Type] template\" | \"resume template\" |\n| Curation | \"best [category]\" | \"best website builders\" |\n| Conversions | \"[X] to [Y]\" | \"$10 USD to GBP\" |\n| Comparisons | \"[X] vs [Y]\" | \"webflow vs wordpress\" |\n| Examples | \"[type] examples\" | \"landing page examples\" |\n| Locations | \"[service] in [location]\" | \"dentists in austin\" |\n| Personas | \"[product] for [audience]\" | \"crm for real estate\" |\n| Integrations | \"[product A] [product B] integration\" | \"slack asana integration\" |\n| Glossary | \"what is [term]\" | \"what is pSEO\" |\n| Translations | Content in multiple languages | Localized content |\n| Directory | \"[category] tools\" | \"ai copywriting tools\" |\n| Profiles | \"[entity name]\" | \"stripe ceo\" |\n\n**For detailed playbook implementation**: See [references/playbooks.md](references/playbooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Choosing Your Playbook\n\n| If you have... | Consider... |\n|----------------|-------------|\n| Proprietary data | Directories, Profiles |\n| Product with integrations | Integrations |\n| Design/creative product | Templates, Examples |\n| Multi-segment audience | Personas |\n| Local presence | Locations |\n| Tool or utility product | Conversions |\n| Content/expertise | Glossary, Curation |\n| Competitor landscape | Comparisons |\n\nYou can layer multiple playbooks (e.g., \"Best coworking spaces in San Diego\").\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Framework\n\n### 1. Keyword Pattern Research\n\n**Identify the pattern:**\n- What''s the repeating structure?\n- What are the variables?\n- How many unique combinations exist?\n\n**Validate demand:**\n- Aggregate search volume\n- Volume distribution (head vs. long tail)\n- Trend direction\n\n### 2. Data Requirements\n\n**Identify data sources:**\n- What data populates each page?\n- Is it first-party, scraped, licensed, public?\n- How is it updated?\n\n### 3. Template Design\n\n**Page structure:**\n- Header with target keyword\n- Unique intro (not just variables swapped)\n- Data-driven sections\n- Related pages / internal links\n- CTAs appropriate to intent\n\n**Ensuring uniqueness:**\n- Each page needs unique value\n- Conditional content based on data\n- Original insights/analysis per page\n\n### 4. Internal Linking Architecture\n\n**Hub and spoke model:**\n- Hub: Main category page\n- Spokes: Individual programmatic pages\n- Cross-links between related spokes\n\n**Avoid orphan pages:**\n- Every page reachable from main site\n- XML sitemap for all pages\n- Breadcrumbs with structured data\n\n### 5. Indexation Strategy\n\n- Prioritize high-volume patterns\n- Noindex very thin variations\n- Manage crawl budget thoughtfully\n- Separate sitemaps by page type\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checks\n\n### Pre-Launch Checklist\n\n**Content quality:**\n- [ ] Each page provides unique value\n- [ ] Answers search intent\n- [ ] Readable and useful\n\n**Technical SEO:**\n- [ ] Unique titles and meta descriptions\n- [ ] Proper heading structure\n- [ ] Schema markup implemented\n- [ ] Page speed acceptable\n\n**Internal linking:**\n- [ ] Connected to site architecture\n- [ ] Related pages linked\n- [ ] No orphan pages\n\n**Indexation:**\n- [ ] In XML sitemap\n- [ ] Crawlable\n- [ ] No conflicting noindex\n\n### Post-Launch Monitoring\n\nTrack: Indexation rate, Rankings, Traffic, Engagement, Conversion\n\nWatch for: Thin content warnings, Ranking drops, Manual actions, Crawl errors\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- **Thin content**: Just swapping city names in identical content\n- **Keyword cannibalization**: Multiple pages targeting same keyword\n- **Over-generation**: Creating pages with no search demand\n- **Poor data quality**: Outdated or incorrect information\n- **Ignoring UX**: Pages exist for Google, not users\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Strategy Document\n- Opportunity analysis\n- Implementation plan\n- Content guidelines\n\n### Page Template\n- URL structure\n- Title/meta templates\n- Content outline\n- Schema markup\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What keyword patterns are you targeting?\n2. What data do you have (or can acquire)?\n3. How many pages are you planning?\n4. What does your site authority look like?\n5. Who currently ranks for these terms?\n6. What''s your technical stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For auditing programmatic pages after launch\n- **schema-markup**: For adding structured data\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison page frameworks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:50:38.463Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Generation Agents needing advanced programmatic SEO capabilities for building SEO-optimized pages at scale.","zh":"非常适合需要高级程序化SEO功能的内容生成代理，以大规模构建SEO优化页面。","ja":"コンテンツ生成エージェントが大規模にSEO最適化されたページを構築するために、高度なプログラムによるSEO機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"대규모로 SEO 최적화된 페이지를 구축하기 위해 고급 프로그래밍 방식의 SEO 기능이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Contenido que necesitan capacidades de SEO programático avanzadas para crear páginas optimizadas para SEO a gran escala.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Contenu ayant besoin de capacités de SEO programmation avancées pour créer des pages optimisées pour le SEO à grande échelle.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellungsagenten, die erweiterte programmatische SEO-Funktionen für die Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten im großen Maßstab benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que precisam de capacidades de SEO programático avançadas para construir páginas otimizadas para SEO em escala.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации контента, которым требуются расширенные программные возможности SEO для создания страниц, оптимизированных для SEO, в большом масштабе.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لبرمجة تحسين محركات البحث لإنشاء صفحات محسنة لمحركات البحث على نطاق واسع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties using templates and data, leveraging product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and optimizing for SEO with scalable page generation.","zh":"赋予代理创建排名、提供价值、避免薄内容惩罚的页面能力，使用来自`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`等文件的模板和数据，并利用产品营销背景，通过可扩展的页面生成进行SEO优化。","ja":"エージェントがランク付け、価値提供、薄内容ペナルティを回避するページを作成できるようにし、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルからのテンプレートとデータを使用し、製品マーケティングのコンテキストを活用し、拡張可能なページ生成でSEOを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 랭크에 포함되고 가치를 제공하며 얇은 콘텐츠 페널티를 피하는 페이지를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일에서 템플릿과 데이터를 사용하고 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 확장 가능한 페이지 생성으로 SEO를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear páginas que se clasifiquen, brinden valor y eviten penalizaciones por contenido delgado utilizando plantillas y datos, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y optimizando para SEO con generación de páginas escalables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages qui se classent, apportent de la valeur et évitent les pénalités de contenu mince en utilisant des modèles et des données, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits de fichiers comme `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en optimisant pour le SEO avec une génération de pages scalable.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Seiten zu erstellen, die sich einordnen, Wert bieten und Strafen für dünnen Inhalt vermeiden, indem sie Vorlagen und Daten verwenden, den Marketing-Kontext von Produkten aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen und für SEO mit skalierbarer Seitenenerstellung optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar páginas que são classificadas, fornecem valor e evitam penalidades de conteúdo fino usando modelos e dados, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e otimizando para SEO com geração de páginas escalável.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать страницы, которые занимают позиции, предоставляют ценность и избегают штрафов за тонкий контент, используя шаблоны и данные, используя контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и оптимизируя для SEO с масштабируемой генерацией страниц.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء صفحات تحتل مراتب وتقدم قيمة وتتجنب عقوبات المحتوى الرفيع باستخدام القوالب والبيانات والاستفادة من سياق تسويق المنتج من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وضبط جودة تحسين محركات البحث مع إنشاء صفحات قابلة للتوسيع."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data","Avoiding thin content penalties with high-value content creation","Designing programmatic SEO strategies with product marketing context"],"zh":["使用模板和数据在大规模生成SEO优化页面","通过高价值内容创建避免薄内容惩罚","使用产品营销背景设计程序化SEO策略"],"ja":["テンプレートとデータを使用して大規模にSEO最適化されたページを生成する","高価値コンテンツの作成によって薄内容ペナルティを回避する","製品マーケティングのコンテキストを使用してプログラムによるSEO戦略を設計する"],"ko":["템플릿과 데이터를 사용하여 대규모로 SEO 최적화된 페이지를 생성","고가치 콘텐츠 생성을 통해 얇은 콘텐츠 페널티를 피함","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 사용하여 프로그래밍 방식의 SEO 전략을 설계"],"es":["Generación de páginas optimizadas para SEO a gran escala utilizando plantillas y datos","Evitar penalizaciones por contenido delgado con la creación de contenido de alto valor","Diseñar estrategias de SEO programático con contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Génération de pages optimisées pour le SEO à grande échelle en utilisant des modèles et des données","Éviter les pénalités de contenu mince avec la création de contenu à haute valeur","Concevoir des stratégies de SEO programmation avec le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten im großen Maßstab unter Verwendung von Vorlagen und Daten","Vermeidung von Strafen für dünnen Inhalt durch die Erstellung von hochwertigem Inhalt","Entwicklung von programmatischen SEO-Strategien mit Produktmarketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Gerar páginas otimizadas para SEO em escala usando modelos e dados","Evitar penalidades de conteúdo fino com criação de conteúdo de alto valor","Projetar estratégias de SEO programático com contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Генерировать страницы, оптимизированные для SEO, в большом масштабе, используя шаблоны и данные","Избегать штрафов за тонкий контент с созданием контента высокого качества","Разрабатывать программные стратегии SEO с контекстом маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات محسنة لمحركات البحث على نطاق واسع باستخدام النماذج والبيانات","تجنب عقوبات المحتوى الرفيع مع إنشاء محتوى ذي قيمة عالية","تصميم استراتيجيات برمجة تحسين محركات البحث مع سياق تسويق المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Needs understanding of SEO principles and page ranking factors"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件，如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","需要了解SEO原则和页面排名因素"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキストファイル（`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`など）へのアクセスが必要","SEOの原則とページのランク付け要因を理解する必要がある"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일(`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 등)에 대한 액세스가 필요","SEO 원칙과 페이지 랭크 요인을 이해해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Necesita comprensión de los principios de SEO y factores de clasificación de páginas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits comme `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Nécessite une compréhension des principes de SEO et des facteurs de classement de pages"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Dateien des Marketing-Kontexts von Produkten wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Benötigt Verständnis von SEO-Grundsätzen und Seitenrangfaktoren"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Necessita de compreensão dos princípios de SEO e fatores de classificação de páginas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта, таким как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","Требует понимания принципов SEO и факторов ранжирования страниц"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`","يحتاج إلى فهم مبادئ تحسين محركات البحث وعوامل تصنيف الصفحات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CElyousfi/PalntsScanner/ralph', 'community', 'CElyousfi', 'PalntsScanner', 'CElyousfi/PalntsScanner', 'ralph', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z', '2026-02-18T12:50:59.485Z', NULL, '{"id":"CElyousfi/PalntsScanner/ralph","name":"ralph","description":{"zh":"Ralph 是一个自动化代理系统，执行用户故事和 PRD 转换。它支持将 PRD 转换为 json 格式，并使用脚本运行","ja":"Ralph は自動エージェントシステムで、ユーザーストーリーと PRD 変換を実行します。PRD を json 形式に変換し、スクリプトで実行します","ko":"Ralph는 자동 에이전트 시스템으로 사용자 스토리와 PRD 변환을 실행합니다. PRD를 json 형식으로 변환하고 스크립트로 실행합니다","es":"Ralph es un agente autónomo que ejecuta historias de usuario desde un archivo prd.json. Aprende a convertir PRDs y a ejecutar Ralph con facilidad","fr":"Ralph est un agent autonome qui exécute des histoires utilisateur à partir d''un fichier prd.json. Découvrez comment convertir des PRDs et exécuter Ralph simplement","de":"Ralph ist ein autonomes Agentensystem, das Benutzerstories aus einer prd.json-Datei ausführt. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie PRDs konvertieren und Ralph einfach ausführen","pt":"Ralph é um agente autônomo que executa histórias de usuário a partir de um arquivo prd.json. Ele suporta a conversão de PRDs e a execução do agente.","ru":"Ralph - автономный агент, который выполняет пользовательские истории из файла prd.json. Он поддерживает конвертацию PRD и запуск агента.","ar":"رالف هو نظام وكيل مستقل ينفذ قصص المستخدم من ملف prd.json. يدعم تحويل PRDs و تشغيل الوكيل.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ralph 自动化代理系统","ja":"Ralph 自動エージェントシステム","ko":"Ralph 자동 에이전트 시스템","es":"Ralph: Sistema de Agente Autónomo para Ejecutar Historias...","fr":"Ralph: Système d''Agent Autonome pour Exécuter des Histoir...","de":"Ralph: Autonomes Agentensystem zur Ausführung von Benutze...","pt":"Ralph: Sistema Autônomo de Agentes","ru":"Ralph: Автономная система агентов","ar":"رالف: نظام وكيل مستقل","en":"ralph"},"description":{"zh":"Ralph 是一个自动化代理系统，执行用户故事和 PRD 转换。它支持将 PRD 转换为 json 格式，并使用脚本运行","ja":"Ralph は自動エージェントシステムで、ユーザーストーリーと PRD 変換を実行します。PRD を json 形式に変換し、スクリプトで実行します","ko":"Ralph는 자동 에이전트 시스템으로 사용자 스토리와 PRD 변환을 실행합니다. PRD를 json 형식으로 변환하고 스크립트로 실행합니다","es":"Ralph es un agente autónomo que ejecuta historias de usuario desde un archivo prd.json. Aprende a convertir PRDs y a ejecutar Ralph con facilidad","fr":"Ralph est un agent autonome qui exécute des histoires utilisateur à partir d''un fichier prd.json. Découvrez comment convertir des PRDs et exécuter Ralph simp...","de":"Ralph ist ein autonomes Agentensystem, das Benutzerstories aus einer prd.json-Datei ausführt. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie PRDs konvertieren und Ralph einfach ausfü...","pt":"Ralph é um agente autônomo que executa histórias de usuário a partir de um arquivo prd.json. Ele suporta a conversão de PRDs e a execução do agente.","ru":"Ralph - автономный агент, который выполняет пользовательские истории из файла prd.json. Он поддерживает конвертацию PRD и запуск агента.","ar":"رالف هو نظام وكيل مستقل ينفذ قصص المستخدم من ملف prd.json. يدعم تحويل PRDs و تشغيل الوكيل.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化代理系统","PRD 转换为 json 格式","使用脚本运行","支持多种工具","可自定义设置"],"ja":["自動エージェントシステム","PRD を json 形式に変換","スクリプトで実行","複数のツールをサポート","カスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["자동 에이전트 시스템","PRD를 json 형식으로 변환","스크립트로 실행","다양한 도구 지원","사용자 정의 가능"],"es":["Ejecuta historias de usuario desde un archivo prd.json","Convierte PRDs al formato prd.json","Se ejecuta mediante el script ./scripts/ralph.sh","Permite personalizar la configuración con opciones de línea de comandos","Soporta herramientas como amp y Claude Code"],"fr":["Exécute des histoires utilisateur à partir d''un fichier prd.json","Convertis des PRDs au format prd.json","S''exécute via le script ./scripts/ralph.sh","Permet de personnaliser la configuration avec des options de ligne de commande","Prend en charge des outils tels que amp et Claude Code"],"de":["Führt Benutzerstories aus einer prd.json-Datei aus","Konvertiert PRDs in das prd.json-Format","Wird über das Skript ./scripts/ralph.sh ausgeführt","Ermöglicht die Anpassung der Konfiguration mit Befehlszeilenoptionen","Unterstützt Tools wie amp und Claude Code"],"pt":["Conversão de PRDs para o formato prd.json","Execução do agente Ralph usando o script ./scripts/ralph.sh","Suporte a ferramentas como amp e Claude Code","Configuração personalizada com opções de linha de comando","Execução de histórias de usuário de forma autônoma"],"ru":["Конвертация PRD в формат prd.json","Запуск агента Ralph с помощью скрипта ./scripts/ralph.sh","Поддержка инструментов, таких как amp и Claude Code","Пользовательская настройка с помощью опций командной строки","Выполнение пользовательских историй в автономном режиме"],"ar":["تحويل PRDs إلى تنسيق prd.json","تشغيل نظام الوكيل رالف باستخدام سكريبت ./scripts/ralph.sh","دعم أدوات مثل amp و Claude Code","تخصيص الإعدادات باستخدام خيارات سطر الأوامر","تشغيل قصص المستخدم بطريقة مستقل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ralph","自动化代理系统","PRD 转换","json 格式","脚本运行","自动化测试","DevOps"],"ja":["Ralph","自動エージェントシステム","PRD 変換","json 形式","スクリプト実行","自動テスト","DevOps"],"ko":["Ralph","자동 에이전트 시스템","PRD 변환","json 형식","스크립트 실행","자동화 테스트","DevOps"],"es":["agente autónomo","historias de usuario","prd.json","conversión de PRDs","ejecución de scripts","personalización de configuración","herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de software","automatización de pruebas"],"fr":["agent autonome","histoires utilisateur","prd.json","conversion de PRDs","exécution de scripts","personnalisation de configuration","outils de développement","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tests"],"de":["autonomes Agentensystem","Benutzerstories","prd.json","Konvertierung von PRDs","Ausführung von Skripten","Anpassung der Konfiguration","Entwicklungstools","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Tests"],"pt":["Ralph","sistema autônomo de agentes","conversão de PRDs","execução de histórias de usuário","prd.json","automação de processos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Ralph","автономная система агентов","конвертация PRD","выполнение пользовательских историй","prd.json","автоматизация процессов","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["رالف","نظام وكيل مستقل","تحويل PRDs","تشغيل قصص المستخدم","prd.json","توسيق العمليات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"CElyousfi","repo":"PalntsScanner","repoPath":"CElyousfi/PalntsScanner","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph","description":"Convert PRDs to prd.json format and run the Ralph autonomous agent system. Use when converting PRDs to Ralph format OR running Ralph to execute user stories. Triggers on: convert this prd, turn this into ralph format, create prd.json, ralph json, run ralph, start ralph, execute ralph.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph - Autonomous Agent System\n\nRalph is an autonomous agent that executes user stories from a `prd.json` file. This skill covers both:\n1. **Converting PRDs** to the prd.json format Ralph requires\n2. **Running Ralph** using the `./scripts/ralph.sh` script\n\n---\n\n## Running Ralph\n\nExecute Ralph using the script at `./scripts/ralph.sh`:\n\n```bash\n# Run with default settings (amp tool, 10 iterations)\n./scripts/ralph.sh\n\n# Run with Claude Code instead of amp\n./scripts/ralph.sh --tool claude\n\n# Run","body":"# Ralph - Autonomous Agent System\n\nRalph is an autonomous agent that executes user stories from a `prd.json` file. This skill covers both:\n1. **Converting PRDs** to the prd.json format Ralph requires\n2. **Running Ralph** using the `./scripts/ralph.sh` script\n\n---\n\n## Running Ralph\n\nExecute Ralph using the script at `./scripts/ralph.sh`:\n\n```bash\n# Run with default settings (amp tool, 10 iterations)\n./scripts/ralph.sh\n\n# Run with Claude Code instead of amp\n./scripts/ralph.sh --tool claude\n\n# Run with custom max iterations\n./scripts/ralph.sh 20\n\n# Combine options\n./scripts/ralph.sh --tool claude 15\n```\n\n**Options:**\n- `--tool amp|claude` - Choose which AI tool to use (default: amp)\n- `[max_iterations]` - Maximum iteration count (default: 10)\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Reads `prd.json` from the script directory\n2. Spawns a fresh AI instance per iteration (no memory between iterations)\n3. Each iteration works on the next incomplete user story\n4. Archives previous runs when branch name changes\n5. Exits when all stories pass or max iterations reached\n\n---\n\n## PRD Conversion\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Criterion 1\",\n        \"Criterion 2\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Story Size: The Number One Rule\n\n**Each story must be completable in ONE Ralph iteration (one context window).**\n\nRalph spawns a fresh Amp instance per iteration with no memory of previous work. If a story is too big, the LLM runs out of context before finishing and produces broken code.\n\n### Right-sized stories:\n- Add a database column and migration\n- Add a UI component to an existing page\n- Update a server action with new logic\n- Add a filter dropdown to a list\n\n### Too big (split these):\n- \"Build the entire dashboard\" - Split into: schema, queries, UI components, filters\n- \"Add authentication\" - Split into: schema, middleware, login UI, session handling\n- \"Refactor the API\" - Split into one story per endpoint or pattern\n\n**Rule of thumb:** If you cannot describe the change in 2-3 sentences, it is too big.\n\n---\n\n## Story Ordering: Dependencies First\n\nStories execute in priority order. Earlier stories must not depend on later ones.\n\n**Correct order:**\n1. Schema/database changes (migrations)\n2. Server actions / backend logic\n3. UI components that use the backend\n4. Dashboard/summary views that aggregate data\n\n**Wrong order:**\n1. UI component (depends on schema that does not exist yet)\n2. Schema change\n\n---\n\n## Acceptance Criteria: Must Be Verifiable\n\nEach criterion must be something Ralph can CHECK, not something vague.\n\n### Good criteria (verifiable):\n- \"Add `status` column to tasks table with default ''pending''\"\n- \"Filter dropdown has options: All, Active, Completed\"\n- \"Clicking delete shows confirmation dialog\"\n- \"Typecheck passes\"\n- \"Tests pass\"\n\n### Bad criteria (vague):\n- \"Works correctly\"\n- \"User can do X easily\"\n- \"Good UX\"\n- \"Handles edge cases\"\n\n### Always include as final criterion:\n```\n\"Typecheck passes\"\n```\n\nFor stories with testable logic, also include:\n```\n\"Tests pass\"\n```\n\n### For stories that change UI, also include:\n```\n\"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n```\n\nFrontend stories are NOT complete until visually verified. Ralph will use the dev-browser skill to navigate to the page, interact with the UI, and confirm changes work.\n\n---\n\n## Conversion Rules\n\n1. **Each user story becomes one JSON entry**\n2. **IDs**: Sequential (US-001, US-002, etc.)\n3. **Priority**: Based on dependency order, then document order\n4. **All stories**: `passes: false` and empty `notes`\n5. **branchName**: Derive from feature name, kebab-case, prefixed with `ralph/`\n6. **Always add**: \"Typecheck passes\" to every story''s acceptance criteria\n\n---\n\n## Splitting Large PRDs\n\nIf a PRD has big features, split them:\n\n**Original:**\n> \"Add user notification system\"\n\n**Split into:**\n1. US-001: Add notifications table to database\n2. US-002: Create notification service for sending notifications\n3. US-003: Add notification bell icon to header\n4. US-004: Create notification dropdown panel\n5. US-005: Add mark-as-read functionality\n6. US-006: Add notification preferences page\n\nEach is one focused change that can be completed and verified independently.\n\n---\n\n## Example\n\n**Input PRD:**\n```markdown\n# Task Status Feature\n\nAdd ability to mark tasks with different statuses.\n\n## Requirements\n- Toggle between pending/in-progress/done on task list\n- Filter list by status\n- Show status badge on each task\n- Persist status in database\n```\n\n**Output prd.json:**\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"TaskApp\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/task-status\",\n  \"description\": \"Task Status Feature - Track task progress with status indicators\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status field to tasks table\",\n      \"description\": \"As a developer, I need to store task status in the database.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Add status column: ''pending'' | ''in_progress'' | ''done'' (default ''pending'')\",\n        \"Generate and run migration successfully\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Display status badge on task cards\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to see task status at a glance.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each task card shows colored status badge\",\n        \"Badge colors: gray=pending, blue=in_progress, green=done\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status toggle to task list rows\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to change task status directly from the list.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each row has status dropdown or toggle\",\n        \"Changing status saves immediately\",\n        \"UI updates without page refresh\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Filter tasks by status\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to filter the list to see only certain statuses.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Filter dropdown: All | Pending | In Progress | Done\",\n        \"Filter persists in URL params\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 4,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Archiving Previous Runs\n\n**Before writing a new prd.json, check if there is an existing one from a different feature:**\n\n1. Read the current `prd.json` if it exists\n2. Check if `branchName` differs from the new feature''s branch name\n3. If different AND `progress.txt` has content beyond the header:\n   - Create archive folder: `archive/YYYY-MM-DD-feature-name/`\n   - Copy current `prd.json` and `progress.txt` to archive\n   - Reset `progress.txt` with fresh header\n\n**The `./scripts/ralph.sh` script handles this automatically** when you run it, but if you are manually updating prd.json between runs, archive first.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Before Saving\n\nBefore writing prd.json, verify:\n\n- [ ] **Previous run archived** (if prd.json exists with different branchName, archive it first)\n- [ ] Each story is completable in one iteration (small enough)\n- [ ] Stories are ordered by dependency (schema to backend to UI)\n- [ ] Every story has \"Typecheck passes\" as criterion\n- [ ] UI stories have \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as criterion\n- [ ] Acceptance criteria are verifiable (not vague)\n- [ ] No story depends on a later story"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:50:59.485Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring automated execution of user stories from PRD files","zh":"适用于需要从 PRD 文件自动执行用户故事的自主代理","ja":"PRD ファイルからのユーザーストーリーの自動実行を必要とする自律エージェントに最適","ko":"PRD 파일에서 사용자 스토리를 자동으로 실행해야 하는 자율 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren ejecución automática de historias de usuario desde archivos PRD","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant l''exécution automatisée d''histoires d''utilisateurs à partir de fichiers PRD","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine automatisierte Ausführung von Benutzerstories aus PRD-Dateien erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem execução automatizada de histórias de usuário a partir de arquivos PRD","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, требующих автоматизированного выполнения историй пользователей из файлов PRD","ar":"مثالي لعميل tự động يتطلب تنفيذ تلقائي لقصص المستخدم من ملفات PRD"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute user stories using the prd.json format, leveraging tools like amp and Claude Code, and utilizing scripts like ./scripts/ralph.sh for seamless execution, supporting up to 10 iterations and customizable tool selection","zh":"赋予代理使用 prd.json 格式执行用户故事的能力，利用诸如 amp 和 Claude Code 之类的工具，并使用诸如 ./scripts/ralph.sh 之类的脚本实现无缝执行，支持最多 10 次迭代和可自定义的工具选择","ja":"エージェントに、prd.json 形式を使用してユーザーストーリーを実行する能力を付与し、amp や Claude Code などのツールを利用し、./scripts/ralph.sh などのスクリプトを使用してシームレスな実行を実現し、最大 10 回のイテレーションとカスタマイズ可能なツールの選択をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 prd.json 형식을 사용하여 사용자 스토리를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, amp 및 Claude Code와 같은 도구를 활용하고, ./scripts/ralph.sh와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 무缝한 실행을 지원하며, 최대 10회 반복 및 사용자 지정 가능한 도구 선택을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar historias de usuario utilizando el formato prd.json, aprovechando herramientas como amp y Claude Code, y utilizando scripts como ./scripts/ralph.sh para una ejecución sin problemas, admitiendo hasta 10 iteraciones y una selección de herramientas personalizable","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des histoires d''utilisateurs en utilisant le format prd.json, en exploitant des outils comme amp et Claude Code, et en utilisant des scripts comme ./scripts/ralph.sh pour une exécution sans rupture, prenant en charge jusqu''à 10 itérations et une sélection d''outils personnalisable","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzerstories mithilfe des prd.json-Formats auszuführen, indem es Tools wie amp und Claude Code nutzt und Skripte wie ./scripts/ralph.sh für eine nahtlose Ausführung verwendet, mit Unterstützung für bis zu 10 Iterationen und einer anpassbaren Werkzeugauswahl","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar histórias de usuário usando o formato prd.json, aproveitando ferramentas como amp e Claude Code, e utilizando scripts como ./scripts/ralph.sh para execução sem interrupções, suportando até 10 iterações e seleção personalizada de ferramentas","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выполнять истории пользователей с использованием формата prd.json, используя инструменты seperti amp и Claude Code, и использует скрипты như ./scripts/ralph.sh для бесперебойного выполнения, поддерживая до 10 итераций и настраиваемый выбор инструментов","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تشغيل قصص المستخدم باستخدام تنسيق prd.json ، واستخدام أدوات مثل amp و Claude Code ، واستخدام سكريبتات مثل ./scripts/ralph.sh للتشغيل السلس ، ودعم ما يصل إلى 10 تكرارات واختيار أدوات مخصص"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating user story execution from PRD files","Converting PRDs to prd.json format for compatibility","Running Ralph with custom tool selections, such as Claude Code"],"zh":["从 PRD 文件自动执行用户故事","将 PRD 转换为 prd.json 格式以实现兼容性","使用自定义工具选择（如 Claude Code）运行 Ralph"],"ja":["PRD ファイルからのユーザーストーリーの自動実行","PRD を prd.json 形式に変換して互換性を確保","カスタムツールの選択（例：Claude Code）を使用して Ralph を実行"],"ko":["PRD 파일에서 사용자 스토리를 자동으로 실행","PRD를 prd.json 형식으로 변환하여 호환성을 보장","사용자 지정 도구 선택(Claude Code 등)을 사용하여 Ralph 실행"],"es":["Automatización de la ejecución de historias de usuario desde archivos PRD","Conversión de PRD a formato prd.json para la compatibilidad","Ejecución de Ralph con selecciones de herramientas personalizadas, como Claude Code"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exécution d''histoires d''utilisateurs à partir de fichiers PRD","Conversion de PRD au format prd.json pour la compatibilité","Exécution de Ralph avec des sélections d''outils personnalisées, comme Claude Code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ausführung von Benutzerstories aus PRD-Dateien","Konvertierung von PRD in das prd.json-Format für die Kompatibilität","Ausführung von Ralph mit benutzerdefinierten Werkzeugauswahlen, wie Claude Code"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução de histórias de usuário a partir de arquivos PRD","Converter PRDs para o formato prd.json para compatibilidade","Executar Ralph com seleções de ferramentas personalizadas, como Claude Code"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение историй пользователей из файлов PRD","Преобразовывать PRD в формат prd.json для совместимости","Выполнять Ralph с настраиваемым выбором инструментов, таких как Claude Code"],"ar":["أتمتة تشغيل قصص المستخدم من ملفات PRD","تحويل PRD إلى تنسيق prd.json للتوافق","تشغيل رالف مع اختيار أدوات مخصص ، مثل Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires prd.json file format","Dependent on ./scripts/ralph.sh script for execution","Limited to 10 iterations by default"],"zh":["需要 prd.json 文件格式","依赖于 ./scripts/ralph.sh 脚本进行执行","默认情况下最多支持 10 次迭代"],"ja":["prd.json ファイル形式が必要","./scripts/ralph.sh スクリプトに依存して実行","デフォルトで最大 10 回のイテレーションに制限"],"ko":["prd.json 파일 형식 필요","./scripts/ralph.sh 스크립트에 의존하여 실행","기본적으로 최대 10회 반복 제한"],"es":["Requiere el formato de archivo prd.json","Dependiente del script ./scripts/ralph.sh para la ejecución","Limitado a 10 iteraciones por defecto"],"fr":["Nécessite le format de fichier prd.json","Dépendant du script ./scripts/ralph.sh pour l''exécution","Limité à 10 itérations par défaut"],"de":["Erfordert das Dateiformat prd.json","Abhängig vom Skript ./scripts/ralph.sh für die Ausführung","Standardmäßig auf 10 Iterationen beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer o formato de arquivo prd.json","Depende do script ./scripts/ralph.sh para execução","Limitado a 10 iterações por padrão"],"ru":["Требует формата файла prd.json","Зависит от скрипта ./scripts/ralph.sh для выполнения","Ограничен 10 итерациями по умолчанию"],"ar":["يتطلب تنسيق الملف prd.json","يعتمد على سكريبت ./scripts/ralph.sh للتشغيل","محدود بـ 10 تكرارات افتراضيًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
