nt UI pour applications SaaS modernes","de":"UI-Entwicklungskit für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen","pt":"Kit de Desenvolvimento UI para Aplicativos SaaS Modernos","ru":"Набор инструментов для разработки UI для современных прил...","ar":"حزمة تطوير واجهة المستخدم لتقدم تطبيقات السحابة","en":"openspec-ff-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change是一种UI开发工具包，用于快速生成现代SaaS应用程序所需的代码","ja":"openspec-ff-changeは、モダンSaaSアプリケーションのUI開発を迅速に実行するためのツールキットです","ko":"openspec-ff-change는 현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션을 위한 UI 개발 도구입니다","es":"HAI3 es un kit de desarrollo UI para aplicaciones SaaS modernas que permite generar todo lo necesario para empezar a implementar en un solo paso","fr":"HAI3 est un kit de développement UI pour applications SaaS modernes qui permet de générer tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer à implémenter en une seul...","de":"HAI3 ist ein UI-Entwicklungskit für moderne SaaS-Anwendungen, der es ermöglicht, alles Notwendige für die Implementierung in einem Schritt zu generieren","pt":"O kit de desenvolvimento UI openspec-ff-change permite criar artefatos necessários para iniciar a implementação em um só go. Basta fornecer um nome de altera...","ru":"Набор инструментов для разработки UI openspec-ff-change позволяет создавать все необходимые артефакты для начала реализации за один шаг. Достаточно предостав...","ar":"حزمة تطوير واجهة المستخدم openspec-ff-change تمكنك من إنشاء الملفات المطلوبة لبدء التنفيذ في خطوة واحدة. ي suffices تقديم اسم التغيير أو وصف ما تريد بناءه","en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"definition":{"en":"HAI3 - UI development kit for modern SaaS applications"},"features":{"zh":["快速生成SaaS应用程序所需的代码","简化开发流程","支持现代SaaS应用程序开发","自动化代码生成","提高开发效率"],"ja":["モダンSaaSアプリケーションを迅速に開発","開発プロセスを自動化","UI開発を迅速に実行","コード生成をサポート","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션을 빠르게 개발","개발 프로세스를 자동화","UI 개발을 빠르게 수행","코드 생성을 지원","개발 효율을 향상"],"es":["Generación de artefactos en un solo paso","Desarrollo de aplicaciones SaaS modernas","Kit de desarrollo UI personalizable","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Génération d''artefacts en une seule étape","Développement d''applications SaaS modernes","Kit de développement UI personnalisable","Intégration avec des outils de développement existants","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Generierung von Artefakten in einem Schritt","Entwicklung moderner SaaS-Anwendungen","Anpassbares UI-Entwicklungskit","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Criação rápida de artefatos","Kit de desenvolvimento UI para aplicativos SaaS","Suporte à criação de alterações em kebab-case","Ferramenta de perguntas ao usuário para clarificar requisitos","Geração de todos os arquivos necessários para iniciar a implementação"],"ru":["Быстрое создание артефактов","Набор инструментов для разработки UI для приложений SaaS","Поддержка создания изменений в kebab-case","Инструмент вопросов пользователю для уточнения требований","Генерация всех необходимых файлов для начала реализации"],"ar":["إنشاء سريع للملفات","حزمة تطوير واجهة المستخدم لتقدم تطبيقات السحابة","دعم إنشاء التغييرات في kebab-case","أداة أسئلة المستخدم لتوضيح المتطلبات","إنشاء جميع الملفات المطلوبة لبدء التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS应用程序开发","UI开发工具","代码生成","自动化开发","现代SaaS应用程序","快速开发","开发效率"],"ja":["SaaSアプリケーション開発","UI開発ツール","コード生成","自動化開発","モダンSaaSアプリケーション","迅速開発","開発効率"],"ko":["SaaS 애플리케이션 개발","UI 개발 도구","코드 생성","자동화 개발","현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션","빠른 개발","개발 효율"],"es":["desarrollo UI","aplicaciones SaaS","kit de desarrollo","generación de artefactos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","SaaS modernas","UI personalizable"],"fr":["développement UI","applications SaaS","kit de développement","génération d''artefacts","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","SaaS modernes","UI personnalisable"],"de":["UI-Entwicklung","SaaS-Anwendungen","Entwicklungskit","Generierung von Artefakten","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","moderne SaaS","anpassbares UI"],"pt":["desenvolvimento UI","aplicativos SaaS","kit de desenvolvimento","criação de artefatos","kebab-case","ferramenta de perguntas ao usuário","desenvolvimento rápido","implementação de aplicativos"],"ru":["разработка UI","приложения SaaS","набор инструментов","создание артефактов","kebab-case","инструмент вопросов пользователю","быстрое развитие","реализация приложений"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم","تطبيقات السحابة","حزمة تطوير","إنشاء الملفات","kebab-case","أداة أسئلة المستخدم","تطوير سريع","تنفيذ التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"HAI3org","repo":"HAI3","repoPath":"HAI3org/HAI3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:51:24.153Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI Development Agents needing rapid SaaS application prototyping and implementation","zh":"非常适合需要快速进行SaaS应用程序原型设计和实施的UI开发智能体","ja":"SaaSアプリケーションの迅速なプロトタイピングと実装を必要とするUI開発エージェントに最適","ko":"SaaS 애플리케이션의 빠른 프로토타이핑과 구현이 필요한 UI 개발 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de UI que necesitan prototipado e implementación rápida de aplicaciones SaaS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''UI nécessitant un prototypage et une mise en œuvre rapides d''applications SaaS","de":"Perfekt für UI-Entwicklungsagenten, die ein schnelles Prototyping und eine Implementierung von SaaS-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de UI que necessitam de prototipagem e implementação rápida de aplicações SaaS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки UI, которым необходима быстрая прототипизация и реализация приложений SaaS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء تطوير واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى إعداد وتنفيذ سريع لتطبيقات SaaS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation using kebab-case change names or descriptions, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for open-ended user input and deriving kebab-case change names from descriptions","zh":"使智能体能够通过使用kebab-case变更名称或描述来快速推进工件创建，一次性生成开始实施所需的所有内容，利用AskUserQuestion工具获取开放式用户输入并从描述中派生出kebab-case变更名称","ja":"kebab-caseの変更名または説明を使用して成果物の作成を迅速化し、一気通貫で実装開始に必要なすべてを生成することでエージェントを支援。オープンエンドのユーザー入力にはAskUserQuestionツールを活用し、説明からkebab-caseの変更名を導出","ko":"kebab-case 변경 이름 또는 설명을 사용하여 아티팩트 생성 과정을 빠르게 진행하고, 한 번에 구현 시작에 필요한 모든 것을 생성하여 에이전트를 강화합니다. 개방형 사용자 입력에는 AskUserQuestion 도구를 활용하며 설명에서 kebab-case 변경 이름을 도출합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a avanzar rápidamente en la creación de artefactos utilizando nombres o descripciones en kebab-case, generando todo lo necesario para iniciar la implementación de una sola vez, aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la entrada de usuario de preguntas abiertas y derivando nombres de cambios en kebab-case de las descripciones","fr":"Permet aux agents de passer rapidement à la création d''artefacts en utilisant des noms ou des descriptions en kebab-case, en générant tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer la mise en œuvre en une seule fois, en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour une saisie utilisateur de questions ouvertes et en dérivant des noms de changements en kebab-case à partir des descriptions","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Erstellung von Artefakten mithilfe von kebab-case-Namen oder -beschreibungen zu beschleunigen, indem alles Notwendige für die Implementierung in einem Schritt generiert wird, unter Ausnutzung des AskUserQuestion-Tools für offene Benutzereingaben und unter Ableitung von kebab-case-Änderungsnamen aus Beschreibungen","pt":"Permite que os agentes avancem rapidamente na criação de artefatos usando nomes ou descrições em kebab-case, gerando tudo o que é necessário para iniciar a implementação de uma vez, utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para entrada de usuário aberta e derivando nomes de alteração em kebab-case a partir de descrições","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро создавать артефакты, используя имена или описания в формате kebab-case, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации за один раз, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для открытого ввода пользователя и получая имена изменений в формате kebab-case из описаний","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التقدّم بسرعة في إنشاء الملفات القائمة باستخدام أسماء أو описات بالشكل kebab-case، وتوليد كل ما هو ضروري لبدء التنفيذ في المرة الأولى، مستخدما أداة AskUserQuestion لإدخال المستخدم المفتوح واستخلاص أسماء التغييرات بالشكل kebab-case من الأوصاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SaaS application setup with generated artifacts","Generating kebab-case change names from user descriptions","Streamlining UI development with one-go implementation"],"zh":["使用生成的工件自动化SaaS应用程序设置","根据用户描述生成kebab-case变更名称","通过一次性实施简化UI开发"],"ja":["生成された成果物を用いたSaaSアプリケーション設定の自動化","ユーザーの説明からkebab-case変更名を生成","一気通貫の実装によるUI開発の効率化"],"ko":["생성된 아티팩트로 SaaS 애플리케이션 설정 자동화","사용자 설명에서 kebab-case 변경 이름 생성","한 번에 구현으로 UI 개발 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración de aplicaciones SaaS con artefactos generados","Generación de nombres de cambios en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuarios","Optimización del desarrollo de UI con implementación en un solo paso"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration des applications SaaS avec des artefacts générés","Génération de noms de changements en kebab-case à partir de descriptions d''utilisateurs","Optimisation du développement d''UI avec une mise en œuvre en une seule étape"],"de":["Automatisierung der SaaS-Anwendungssetup mit generierten Artefakten","Generierung von kebab-case-Änderungsnamen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen","Optimierung der UI-Entwicklung mit einer Implementierung in einem Schritt"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração de aplicações SaaS com artefatos gerados","Gerar nomes de alteração em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário","Otimizar o desenvolvimento de UI com implementação em uma única etapa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку приложений SaaS с помощью сгенерированных артефактов","Генерировать имена изменений в формате kebab-case из описаний пользователя","Оптимизировать разработку UI с реализацией за один раз"],"ar":["تأتمتة إعداد تطبيقات SaaS مع الملفات المولدة","توليد أسماء التغييرات بالشكل kebab-case من описات المستخدم","تسهيل تطوير واجهة المستخدم بتنفيذ في خطوة واحدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for change name or description","Limited to modern SaaS applications"],"zh":["需要用户输入变更名称或描述","仅限于现代SaaS应用程序"],"ja":["変更名または説明のユーザー入力が必要","現代のSaaSアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["변경 이름 또는 설명에 대한 사용자 입력 필요","현대적인 SaaS 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para el nombre o la descripción del cambio","Limitado a aplicaciones SaaS modernas"],"fr":["Nécessite une saisie utilisateur pour le nom ou la description du changement","Limité aux applications SaaS modernes"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für den Änderungsnamen oder die -beschreibung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf moderne SaaS-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário para nome ou descrição da alteração","Limitado a aplicações SaaS modernas"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для имени или описания изменения","Ограничен современными приложениями SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لاسم أو وصف التغيير","محدود بتطبيقات SaaS الحديثة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
