Otimização de Colocação","ru":"Слаббед Тест Матрица: Оптимизация Размещения","ar":"مصفوفة اختبار Slabbed: تحسين الوضع","en":"slabbed-test-matrix-and-repro-world"},"description":{"zh":"Slabbed 技术提供了一种创建一致的测试矩阵和简单的 Repro World 构建计划的方法，确保游戏的稳定性和可靠性","ja":"Slabbed 技術は、一貫したテストマトリックスとシンプルな Repro World ビルド計画を作成する方法を提供し、ゲームの安定性と信頼性を確保します","ko":"Slabbed 기술은 일관된 테스트 매트릭스와 간단한 Repro World 빌드 계획을 생성하여 게임의 안정성과 신뢰성을 제공합니다","es":"Slabbed es una habilidad que permite crear una matriz de pruebas y un plan de construcción de un mundo de reproducción para validar su funcionamiento en supe...","fr":"Slabbed est une compétence qui permet de créer une matrice de tests et un plan de construction d''un monde de reproduction pour valider son fonctionnement sur...","de":"Slabbed ist eine Fähigkeit, die es ermöglicht, eine Testmatrix und einen Bauplan für eine Repro-Welt zu erstellen, um deren Funktionieren auf Slab-Oberfläche...","pt":"A matriz de teste Slabbed é uma ferramenta para validar a colocação de blocos em slabs, garantindo a estabilidade e a precisão.","ru":"Матрица тестирования Slabbed - это инструмент для проверки размещения блоков на слэбах, обеспечивающий стабильность и точность.","ar":"مصفوفة اختبار Slabbed هي أداة لتحقيق وضع الكتل على 슬اب، مما يضمن الاستقرار والدقة.","en":"Put things on slabs!"},"definition":{"en":"Put things on slabs!"},"features":{"zh":["创建一致的测试矩阵","简单的 Repro World 构建计划","验证游戏的稳定性和可靠性","确保游戏的视觉效果正确","支持 Slabbed placement 和 block 更新"],"ja":["一貫したテストマトリックスを作成","シンプルな Repro World ビルド計画","ゲームの安定性と信頼性を検証","ゲームの視覚効果を正確に保つ","Slabbed placement と block 更新をサポート"],"ko":["일관된 테스트 매트릭스를 생성","간단한 Repro World 빌드 계획","게임의 안정성과 신뢰성을 검증","게임의 시각 효과를 정확하게 유지","Slabbed placement와 block 업데이트 지원"],"es":["Crea una matriz de pruebas para validar el funcionamiento de Slabbed","Permite crear un plan de construcción de un mundo de reproducción","Valida el funcionamiento en superficies de slab","No requiere cambios en el código de mixin","No se centra en la optimización del rendimiento","Se centra en el comportamiento de soporte de slab"],"fr":["Crée une matrice de tests pour valider le fonctionnement de Slabbed","Permet de créer un plan de construction d''un monde de reproduction","Valide le fonctionnement sur les surfaces de slab","N''exige pas de modifications du code de mixin","Ne se concentre pas sur l''optimisation des performances","Se concentre sur le comportement de support de slab"],"de":["Erstellt eine Testmatrix, um das Funktionieren von Slabbed zu überprüfen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung eines Bauplans für eine Repro-Welt","Überprüft das Funktionieren auf Slab-Oberflächen","Erfordert keine Änderungen am Mixin-Code","Konzentriert sich nicht auf die Leistungsoptimierung","Konzentriert sich auf das Verhalten des Slab-Supports"],"pt":["Criação de matriz de teste consistente","Validação de colocação de blocos em slabs","Garantia de estabilidade e precisão","Suporte à versão 1.21.11 do Minecraft","Integração com o Fabric dev"],"ru":["Создание последовательной матрицы тестирования","Проверка размещения блоков на слэбах","Обеспечение стабильности и точности","Поддержка версии 1.21.11 Minecraft","Интеграция с Fabric dev"],"ar":["إنشاء مصفوفة اختبار متسقة","تحقيق وضع الكتل على سلاب","ضمان الاستقرار والدقة","دعم الإصدار 1.21.11 من ماين كرافت","التكامل مع Fabric dev"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slabbed 技术","测试矩阵","Repro World","游戏稳定性","游戏可靠性","Slabbed placement","block 更新"],"ja":["Slabbed 技術","テストマトリックス","Repro World","ゲームの安定性","ゲームの信頼性","Slabbed placement","block 更新"],"ko":["Slabbed 기술","테스트 매트릭스","Repro World","게임 안정성","게임 신뢰성","Slabbed placement","block 업데이트"],"es":["Slabbed","matriz de pruebas","mundo de reproducción","validación de funcionamiento","superficies de slab","desarrollo de juegos","pruebas de software","optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Slabbed","matrice de tests","monde de reproduction","validation de fonctionnement","surfaces de slab","développement de jeux","tests de logiciel","optimisation des performances"],"de":["Slabbed","Testmatrix","Repro-Welt","Funktionsüberprüfung","Slab-Oberflächen","Spieleentwicklung","Softwaretests","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["matriz de teste Slabbed","colocação de blocos em slabs","estabilidade de projeto","Minecraft 1.21.11","Fabric dev","teste de colocação","validação de projeto"],"ru":["матрица тестирования Slabbed","размещение блоков на слэбах","стабильность проекта","Minecraft 1.21.11","Fabric dev","тестирование размещения","проверка проекта"],"ar":["مصفوفة اختبار Slabbed","وضع الكتل على سلاب","استقرار المشروع","ماين كرافت 1.21.11","Fabric dev","اختبار وضع","تحقق المشروع"]}},"owner":"joolbits","repo":"slabbed","repoPath":"joolbits/slabbed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slabbed-test-matrix-and-repro-world","description":"Define and run the strict test matrix and reproducible world layout for validating slab support.","bodyPreview":"# Slabbed — Test Matrix + Repro World (Strict)\n\n## Goal\nCreate a consistent, repeatable way to validate Slabbed:\n- placement works on slab tops\n- blocks do not pop off after updates\n- visuals are correct (strict)\n\nThis skill produces a concrete test matrix and a simple “repro world” build plan.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No mixin code changes required\n- No performance optimization here\n- No broad QA; focus on slab-support behaviors\n\n## Assumptions\n- MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run is working\n- Rule: treat the **","body":"# Slabbed — Test Matrix + Repro World (Strict)\n\n## Goal\nCreate a consistent, repeatable way to validate Slabbed:\n- placement works on slab tops\n- blocks do not pop off after updates\n- visuals are correct (strict)\n\nThis skill produces a concrete test matrix and a simple “repro world” build plan.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No mixin code changes required\n- No performance optimization here\n- No broad QA; focus on slab-support behaviors\n\n## Assumptions\n- MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run is working\n- Rule: treat the **top face** of slabs as ground (bottom slab top and top slab top)\n\n## A) Standard Repro World Setup\n\n### 1) World settings\n- Create new singleplayer world: `Slabbed QA` \n- Creative mode\n- Cheats: ON\n- Flat world preset (superflat) preferred for clarity\n- Time: set day and lock if desired\n\n### 2) Build the Repro Platform (coords-based)\nAt spawn, build a labeled platform with 3 lanes:\n\nLane 1: **Full blocks** baseline  \nLane 2: **Bottom slabs** (target behavior)  \nLane 3: **Top slabs** (target behavior)\n\nEach lane should be 3 blocks wide and at least 30 blocks long.\n\n### 3) Segment markers\nEvery 5 blocks, place a sign label:\n- `T1 Torch` \n- `T2 Redstone Dust` \n- `T3 Repeater/Comparator` \n- `T4 Rails` \n- `T5 Pressure Plates` \n- `T6 Carpet` \n- `T7 Plants (optional)` \n- `T8 Misc (as needed)` \n\n## B) Test Matrix (Strict)\n\nFor each test item, run in each lane (full / bottom slab / top slab) and record PASS/FAIL.\n\n### Common pass criteria (all)\n- Places without forcing weird aim hacks\n- Renders at the correct height (flush to slab top surface)\n- Does not instantly break\n- Survives a neighbor update and chunk reload\n\n### Evidence capture\nFor every FAIL:\n- Screenshot showing placement + block state context\n- Save the exact reproduction steps in a note\nFor every PASS (first time per category):\n- One screenshot\n\n## C) Update/Stress Actions (run after placement)\n\nAfter placing each item, run these update triggers:\n\n1) **Neighbor update**\n- Place and break a block adjacent (side)\n- Place and break a block beneath (where applicable)\n\n2) **Chunk unload/reload**\n- Fly 200 blocks away, return\n\n3) **Fluid interaction** (if relevant)\n- Place water adjacent (if item normally interacts)\n\n4) **Redstone tick** (redstone category)\n- Power it and observe updates (lever on adjacent full block is acceptable for test)\n\n5) **Piston test** (if relevant)\n- Push a neighboring full block to cause updates (don’t require the slabbed item itself to be pushable)\n\n## D) Output format (required)\n\nProduce a test report in this exact structure:\n\n- Build/commit under test: `<hash or local>` \n- World: `Slabbed QA` \n- Results:\n  - Torch: Full / BottomSlab / TopSlab\n  - Dust: ...\n  - Repeater: ...\n  - Comparator: ...\n  - Rails: ...\n  - Pressure plates: ...\n  - Carpet: ...\n- Notable failures (each):\n  - What broke\n  - Exact placement context\n  - Which update trigger caused it\n  - Screenshot filenames/paths\n- Next debug targets:\n  - 1–3 suspected methods/classes\n\n## E) Stop conditions\nIf any category fails on slabs:\n- Do not expand scope\n- Pivot immediately to diagnosis using `slabbed-mixin-target-discovery` \n\n## Pass criteria for “Alpha Ready”\n- Torch, Dust, Repeater/Comparator, Rails, Pressure Plates, Carpet:\n  - PASS on bottom slabs and top slabs\n  - Survive neighbor updates + chunk reload\n  - Visual height is correct (strict)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:51:10.606Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Agents needing to validate slab placement and behavior in a controlled environment.","zh":"非常适合需要在受控环境中验证台阶放置和行为的Minecraft代理。","ja":"統制された環境内でスラブの配置と挙動を検証する必要があるMinecraftエージェントに最適です。","ko":"통제된 환경에서 슬래브 배치와 동작을 검증해야 하는 Minecraft 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Minecraft que necesitan validar la colocación y el comportamiento de losas en un entorno controlado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Minecraft ayant besoin de valider le placement et le comportement des dalles dans un environnement contrôlé.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Agenten, die die Platzierung und das Verhalten von Platten in einer kontrollierten Umgebung überprüfen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Minecraft que precisam validar a colocação e o comportamento de lajes em um ambiente controlado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Minecraft, которым необходимо проверить размещение и поведение плит в контролируемой среде.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ماينكرافت الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق من وضع و سلوك البلاط في بيئة خاضعة للرقابة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create a consistent and repeatable test matrix for validating slabbed behaviors, including placement, block persistence, and visual correctness, all within a reproducible world build plan using MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run.","zh":"使代理能够创建一个一致且可重复的测试矩阵，用于验证台阶行为，包括放置、方块持久性和视觉正确性，所有这些都在使用MC 1.21.11 Fabric开发版本的可重现世界构建计划中完成。","ja":"MC 1.21.11 Fabric開発版を使用した再現可能なワールド構築計画内で、配置、ブロックの永続性、視覚的正確性を含むスラブ化された挙動を検証するための、一貫性と再現性のあるテストマトリックスをエージェントが作成できるようにします。","ko":"MC 1.21.11 Fabric 개발 버전을 사용한 재현 가능한 월드 빌드 계획 내에서 배치, 블록 지속성, 시각적 정확성을 포함한 슬래브 동작을 검증하기 위해 일관되고 반복 가능한 테스트 매트릭스를 에이전트가 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear una matriz de prueba consistente y reproducible para validar comportamientos con losas, incluyendo la colocación, la persistencia de bloques y la corrección visual, todo dentro de un plan de construcción de mundo reproducible utilizando MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une matrice de test cohérente et reproductible pour valider les comportements avec dalles, y compris le placement, la persistance des blocs et la correction visuelle, le tout dans un plan de construction de monde reproductible utilisant MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine konsistente und wiederholbare Testmatrix für das Validieren von Verhaltensweisen mit Platten zu erstellen, einschließlich Platzierung, Blockpersistenz und visueller Korrektheit, alles innerhalb eines reproduzierbaren Weltbauplans unter Verwendung von MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem uma matriz de teste consistente e repetível para validar comportamentos com lajes, incluindo colocação, persistência de blocos e correção visual, tudo dentro de um plano de construção de mundo reprodutível usando MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать последовательную и повторяющуюся матрицу тестирования для проверки поведения плит, включая размещение, сохранение блоков и визуальную правильность, все в рамках воспроизводимого плана построения мира с использованием MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run.","ar":"يسمح للعميل إنشاء مصفوفة اختبار متسقة و قابلة للتكرار للتحقق من سلوكيات البلاط، بما في ذلك وضع و استمرار الكتلة و الصحة البصرية، و كل ذلك داخل خطة بناء عالم قابلة للتكرار باستخدام تشغيل تطبيق MC 1.21.11 Fabric."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating slab placement on slab tops","Testing block persistence after updates","Verifying visual correctness in a strict environment"],"zh":["验证台阶顶部的台阶放置","测试更新后的方块持久性","在严格环境中验证视觉正确性"],"ja":["スラブ上面へのスラブ配置の検証","更新後のブロック永続性のテスト","厳格な環境下での視覚的正確性の検証"],"ko":["슬래브 상단에 슬래브 배치 검증","업데이트 후 블록 지속성 테스트","엄격한 환경에서 시각적 정확성 검증"],"es":["Validar la colocación de losas en la parte superior de las losas","Probar la persistencia de bloques después de actualizaciones","Verificar la corrección visual en un entorno estricto"],"fr":["Valider le placement de dalles sur le dessus des dalles","Tester la persistance des blocs après des mises à jour","Vérifier la correction visuelle dans un environnement strict"],"de":["Überprüfen der Platzierung von Platten auf der Oberseite von Platten","Testen der Blockpersistenz nach Updates","Überprüfen der visuellen Korrektheit in einem strengen Umfeld"],"pt":["Validar a colocação de lajes em cima de lajes","Testar a persistência de blocos após atualizações","Verificar a correção visual em um ambiente estrito"],"ru":["Проверить размещение плит на верху плит","Тестировать сохранение блоков после обновлений","Проверить визуальную правильность в строгой среде"],"ar":["التحقق من وضع البلاط على أعلى البلاط","اختبار استمرار الكتلة بعد التحديثات","التحقق من الصحة البصرية في بيئة صارمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run","No mixin code changes are supported","No performance optimization is included"],"zh":["需要MC 1.21.11 Fabric开发版本","不支持mixin代码更改","不包含性能优化"],"ja":["MC 1.21.11 Fabric開発版が必要","Mixinコードの変更はサポートされていない","パフォーマンス最適化は含まれていない"],"ko":["MC 1.21.11 Fabric 개발 버전 필요","믹스인 코드 변경은 지원되지 않음","성능 최적화는 포함되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run","No se admiten cambios de código de mixin","No se incluye optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run","Aucun changement de code de mixin n''est pris en charge","Aucune optimisation des performances n''est incluse"],"de":["Benötigt MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run","Änderungen an Mixin-Code werden nicht unterstützt","Enthält keine Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Requer MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run","Não são suportadas alterações de código mixin","Não está incluída otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Требуется MC 1.21.11 Fabric dev run","Не поддерживаются изменения кода mixin","Не включена оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل تطبيق MC 1.21.11 Fabric","لا يدعم تغييرات كود mixin","لا يتم تضمين تحسين الأداء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
