phQL y Prisma.io con openspec-ff-change","fr":"Générer un backend GraphQL et Prisma.io avec openspec-ff-...","de":"Erstellen Sie ein GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend mit open...","pt":"Crie um Backend Node.js com GraphQL e Prisma.io","ru":"Создайте Backend на Node.js с GraphQL и Prisma.io","ar":"أنشئ خلفية Node.js مع GraphQL و Prisma.io","en":"openspec-ff-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-ff-change是一个轻量级的GraphQL和Prisma.io Node.js后端，用于快速生成项目","ja":"openspec-ff-changeは軽量級のGraphQLとPrisma.io Node.jsバックエンドで、プロジェクトを迅速に生成するために使用されます","ko":"openspec-ff-change는 경량급 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io Node.js 백엔드로 프로젝트를 빠르게 생성하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"openspec-ff-change es un backend ligero de GraphQL y Prisma.io para node.js que te permite generar todo lo necesario para empezar a implementar en un solo paso.","fr":"openspec-ff-change est un backend léger GraphQL et Prisma.io pour node.js qui vous permet de générer tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour commencer à mettre en...","de":"openspec-ff-change ist ein leichtiges GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend für node.js, das es Ihnen ermöglicht, alles Notwendige für die Implementierung in einem ...","pt":"O openspec-ff-change é um skill que permite criar um backend Node.js leve com GraphQL e Prisma.io. Ele gera tudo o que é necessário para começar a implementa...","ru":"Openspec-ff-change - это навык, который позволяет создать легкий бэкэнд Node.js с GraphQL и Prisma.io. Он генерирует все необходимое для начала реализации за...","ar":"openspec-ff-change هو مهارة يسمح بإنشاء خلفية Node.js خفيفة مع GraphQL و Prisma.io. يتم توليد كل ما هو ضروري لبدء التنفيذ في المرة الأولى.","en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight GraphQL & Prisma.io node.js backend"},"features":{"zh":["轻量级GraphQL和Prisma.io Node.js后端","快速生成项目","支持kebab-case和描述性输入","使用AskUserQuestion工具询问用户输入","从描述中推导kebab-case名称"],"ja":["軽量級のGraphQLとPrisma.io Node.jsバックエンド","プロジェクトを迅速に生成","kebab-caseと記述的入力をサポート","AskUserQuestionツールを使用してユーザー入力を問い合わせる","記述からkebab-case名称を導き出す"],"ko":["경량급 GraphQL 및 Prisma.io Node.js 백엔드","프로젝트를 빠르게 생성","kebab-case 및 서술형 입력 지원","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자 입력을問い合わせる","서술에서 kebab-case 이름을 유추"],"es":["Generación rápida de artefactos","Backend ligero de GraphQL y Prisma.io","Compatibilidad con node.js","Implementación sencilla","Flexibilidad en la creación de artefactos"],"fr":["Génération rapide d''artefacts","Backend léger GraphQL et Prisma.io","Compatibilité avec node.js","Mise en œuvre simple","Flexibilité dans la création d''artefacts"],"de":["Schnelle Generierung von Artefakten","Leichtes GraphQL- und Prisma.io-Backend","Kompatibilität mit node.js","Einfache Implementierung","Flexibilität bei der Erstellung von Artefakten"],"pt":["Geração de backend Node.js","Integração com GraphQL","Suporte a Prisma.io","Criação rápida de artefatos","Desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Генерация бэкэнда Node.js","Интеграция с GraphQL","Поддержка Prisma.io","Быстрое создание артефактов","Разработка масштабируемых приложений"],"ar":["توليد خلفية Node.js","التكامل مع GraphQL","دعم Prisma.io","إنشاء سريع للنماذج","تطوير تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GraphQL","Prisma.io","Node.js后端","轻量级后端","快速生成项目","kebab-case","描述性输入","AskUserQuestion"],"ja":["GraphQL","Prisma.io","Node.jsバックエンド","軽量級バックエンド","プロジェクトを迅速に生成","kebab-case","記述的入力","AskUserQuestion"],"ko":["GraphQL","Prisma.io","Node.js 백엔드","경량급 백엔드","프로젝트를 빠르게 생성","kebab-case","서술형 입력","AskUserQuestion"],"es":["GraphQL","Prisma.io","node.js","backend","generación de artefactos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","tecnologías de backend"],"fr":["GraphQL","Prisma.io","node.js","backend","génération d''artefacts","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","technologies de backend"],"de":["GraphQL","Prisma.io","node.js","Backend","Generierung von Artefakten","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Backend-Technologien"],"pt":["Node.js","GraphQL","Prisma.io","Backend","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Artefatos","Escalabilidade"],"ru":["Node.js","GraphQL","Prisma.io","Бэкэнд","Разработка приложений","Артефакты","Масштабируемость"],"ar":["Node.js","GraphQL","Prisma.io","خلفية","تطوير التطبيقات","النماذج","التوسيع"]}},"owner":"uxname","repo":"liteend","repoPath":"uxname/liteend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:51:41.638Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing rapid backend development with GraphQL and Prisma.io","zh":"非常适合需要使用 GraphQL 和 Prisma.io 进行快速后端开发的全栈代理","ja":"GraphQL と Prisma.io を使用した迅速なバックエンド開発が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"GraphQL 및 Prisma.io를 사용하여 빠른 백엔드 개발이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan un desarrollo de backend rápido con GraphQL y Prisma.io","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un développement de backend rapide avec GraphQL et Prisma.io","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine schnelle Backend-Entwicklung mit GraphQL und Prisma.io benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de desenvolvimento de backend rápido com GraphQL e Prisma.io","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым необходим быстрый бэкенд-разработка с GraphQL и Prisma.io","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير الخلفية السريع مع GraphQL و Prisma.io"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation, generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, utilizing node.js, GraphQL, and Prisma.io for efficient backend development","zh":"赋予代理人快速创建项目所需的所有内容，利用 node.js、GraphQL 和 Prisma.io 实现高效的后端开发","ja":"エージェントがアーティファクトの作成を迅速化し、node.js、GraphQL、Prisma.io を使用して効率的なバックエンド開発を実現できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 아티팩트 생성을 빠르게 진행하여 node.js, GraphQL 및 Prisma.io를 사용하여 효율적인 백엔드 개발을 시작할 수 있게 해줍니다","es":"Permite a los agentes avanzar rápidamente en la creación de artefactos, generando todo lo necesario para comenzar la implementación de una sola vez, utilizando node.js, GraphQL y Prisma.io para un desarrollo de backend eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''accélérer la création d''artefacts, en générant tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer la mise en œuvre en une seule fois, en utilisant node.js, GraphQL et Prisma.io pour un développement de backend efficace","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Erstellung von Artefakten zu beschleunigen, indem sie alles Notwendige für die Implementierung in einem Schritt generieren, wobei node.js, GraphQL und Prisma.io für eine effiziente Backend-Entwicklung verwendet werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes avancem rapidamente na criação de artefatos, gerando tudo o que é necessário para iniciar a implementação de uma vez, utilizando node.js, GraphQL e Prisma.io para desenvolvimento de backend eficiente","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро проходить процесс создания артефактов, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации за один раз, используя node.js, GraphQL и Prisma.io для эффективного бэкенд-разраб