`\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:51:38.446Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing rapid artifact creation and implementation planning.","zh":"非常适合需要快速创建和实施规划的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが迅速に成果物を作成し、実装計画を立てる必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"신속한 아티팩트 생성 및 구현 계획이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una creación y planificación de artefactos rápidos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une création et de planification d''artefacts rapides.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine schnelle Erstellung und Implementierungsplanung von Artefakten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de criação rápida de artefatos e planejamento de implementação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется быстрое создание артефактов и планирование реализации.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تطوير العميل التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء سريع للنماذج و تخطيط التنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation by generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, utilizing natural language processing to derive kebab-case change names from user descriptions and leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for clarifying input.","zh":"通过利用自然语言处理从用户描述中推导出短横线命名法的更改名称，并利用 AskUserQuestion 工具来澄清输入，从而使代理能够加速创建成果物，并一次性生成开始实施所需的一切。","ja":"自然言語処理を利用してユーザーの説明からケバブケースの変更名を導出し、AskUserQuestionツールを使用して入力を明確化することで、エージェントが成果物の作成をスキップし、実装を開始するために必要なすべてを一括で生成できるようにします。","ko":"자연어 처리를 이용하여 사용자 설명에서 케밥 케이스 변경 이름을 도출하고 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 입력을 명확히 함으로써 에이전트가 아티팩트 생성을 가속화하고 구현을 시작하는 데 필요한 모든 것을 한 번에 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a avanzar rápidamente en la creación de artefactos al generar todo lo necesario para iniciar la implementación de una sola vez, utilizando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural para derivar nombres de cambios en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuario y aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para aclarar la entrada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire un bond en avant dans la création d''artefacts en générant tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer l''implémentation en une seule fois, en utilisant le traitement automatique du langage pour dériver des noms de changements en kebab-case à partir de descriptions d''utilisateur et en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour clarifier l''entrée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Erstellung von Artefakten durch die Generierung aller benötigten Elemente für die Implementierung in einem Schritt zu beschleunigen, indem es die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache nutzt, um kebab-case-Änderungsnamen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen abzuleiten und das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Klarstellung der Eingabe einsetzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avançar rapidamente na criação de artefatos, gerando tudo o que é necessário para iniciar a implementação de uma só vez, utilizando o processamento de linguagem natural para derivar nomes de alterações em kebab-case a partir de descrições do usuário e aproveitando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para esclarecer as entradas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью быстро создавать артефакты, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации за один раз, используя обработку естественного языка для получения имен изменений в формате kebab-case из описаний пользователя и используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для уточнения ввода.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على الإسراع في إنشاء النماذج من خلال توليد كل ما هو مطلوب لبدء التنفيذ في المرة الأولى، مستخدماً معالجة اللغة الطبيعية لاستخراج أسماء التغييرات الشبيهة بالكباب من وصف العميل واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لتوضيح المدخلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating implementation plans from user requests","Deriving kebab-case change names for consistent naming conventions","Automating the initial setup for new development projects"],"zh":["从用户请求生成实施计划","为一致的命名约定推导出短横线命名法的更改名称","自动设置新的开发项目的初始设置"],"ja":["ユーザーのリクエストから実装計画を生成する","一貫した命名規則のためにケバブケースの変更名を導出する","新しい開発プロジェクトの初期設定を自動化する"],"ko":["사용자 요청에서 구현 계획을 생성하는 것","일관된命名 규칙을 위해 케밥 케이스 변경 이름을 도출하는 것","새로운 개발 프로젝트의 초기 설정을 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Generación de planes de implementación a partir de solicitudes de usuario","Derivación de nombres de cambios en kebab-case para convenciones de nomenclatura coherentes","Automatización de la configuración inicial para nuevos proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Génération de plans d''implémentation à partir de demandes d''utilisateur","Déivation de noms de changements en kebab-case pour des conventions de nommage cohérentes","Automatisation de la configuration initiale pour de nouveaux projets de développement"],"de":["Erstellung von Implementierungsplänen aus Benutzeranfragen","Ableitung von Änderungsnamen im kebab-case für konsistente Benennungskonventionen","Automatisierung der Initialkonfiguration für neue Entwicklungsprojekte"],"pt":["Geração de planos de implementação a partir de solicitações do usuário","Derivação de nomes de alterações em kebab-case para convenções de nomenclatura consistentes","Automatização da configuração inicial para novos projetos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Генерация планов реализации на основе запросов пользователя","Получение имен изменений в формате kebab-case для единообразных соглашений об именах","Автоматизация начальной настройки для новых проектов разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط التنفيذ من طلبات العميل","استخراج أسماء التغييرات الشبيهة بالكباب لاتفاقيات التسمية الثابتة","تأتمة إعدادات البدء ل مشاريع التطوير الجديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input or description of the change","Dependent on the quality of user-provided descriptions for accurate kebab-case derivation"],"zh":["需要用户输入或对更改的描述","取决于用户提供的描述的质量以进行准确的短横线命名法推导"],"ja":["ユーザーの入力または変更の説明が必要","ユーザーが提供する説明の品質に依存してケバブケースの導出を正確に行う"],"ko":["사용자 입력 또는 변경 설명이 필요함","사용자가 제공한 설명의 품질에 따라 케밥 케이스 도출의 정확도에 영향을 받음"],"es":["Requiere la entrada o descripción del cambio por parte del usuario","Depende de la calidad de las descripciones proporcionadas por el usuario para una derivación precisa de kebab-case"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée ou une description du changement fournie par l''utilisateur","Dépend de la qualité des descriptions fournies par l''utilisateur pour une dérivation précise de kebab-case"],"de":["Benötigt die Eingabe oder Beschreibung der Änderung durch den Benutzer","Hängt von der Qualität der vom Benutzer bereitgestellten Beschreibungen für eine genaue Ableitung von kebab-case ab"],"pt":["Requer entrada ou descrição do usuário da alteração","Depende da qualidade das descrições fornecidas pelo usuário para derivação precisa de kebab-case"],"ru":["Требует ввода или описания изменения пользователем","Зависит от качества описаний, предоставленных пользователем, для точного получения имен изменений в формате kebab-case"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال أو وصف التغيير من قبل العميل","يعتمد على جودة الوصف المقدم من قبل العميل لاستخراج دقيق لأسماء التغييرات الشبيهة بالكباب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
