ndo tiempo y esfuerzo en el proceso de implementación","Compatibilidad con solicitudes de cambio en kebab-case","Integración con la herramienta AskUserQuestion para solicitudes de cambio"],"fr":["Génération automatique de tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour la mise en œuvre","Utilisation de la description de l''utilisateur pour dériver un nom de changement","Gain de temps et d''efforts dans le processus de mise en œuvre","Compatibilité avec les demandes de changement en kebab-case","Intégration avec l''outil AskUserQuestion pour les demandes de changement"],"de":["Automatische Generierung aller notwendigen Elemente für die Implementierung","Verwendung der Beschreibung des Benutzers, um einen Änderungsnamen abzuleiten","Zeit- und Aufwandseinsparung im Implementierungsprozess","Kompatibilität mit Änderungsanfragen im kebab-Case","Integration mit dem Tool AskUserQuestion für Änderungsanfragen"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos em massa","Inicia a implementação em uma etapa","Economia de tempo e esforço","Suporte a descrição de mudanças","Uso da ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Быстрое создание артефактов","Начало реализации в один этап","Экономия времени и сил","Поддержка описания изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["إنشاء الملفات بسرعة","بدء التنفيذ في مرحلة واحدة","توفير الوقت والجهد","دعم وصف التغييرات","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-ff-change","快速生成变更内容","开发效率","变更实现","AskUserQuestion"],"ja":["openspec-ff-change","変更コンテンツの迅速生成","開発効率","変更実現","AskUserQuestion"],"ko":["openspec-ff-change","변경 컨텐츠 빠른 생성","개발 효율","변경 구현","AskUserQuestion"],"es":["openspec-ff-change","implementación rápida","generación automática","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad","eficiencia"],"fr":["openspec-ff-change","mise en œuvre rapide","génération automatique","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","productivité","efficacité"],"de":["openspec-ff-change","schnellimplementierung","automatische generierung","softwareentwicklung","entwicklungstools","produktivität","effizienz"],"pt":["openspec-ff-change","criação de artefatos","iniciação de implementação","economia de tempo","descrição de mudanças","ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["openspec-ff-change","быстрое создание артефактов","начало реализации","экономия времени","описание изменений","инструмент AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["openspec-ff-change","إنشاء الملفات بسرعة","بدء التنفيذ","توفير الوقت","وصف التغييرات","أداة AskUserQuestion"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"ai-assisted-engineering","repoPath":"gAmUssA/ai-assisted-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-ff-change","description":"Fast-forward through OpenSpec artifact creation. Use when the user wants to quickly create all artifacts needed for implementation without stepping through each one individually.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-c","body":"Fast-forward through artifact creation - generate everything needed to start implementation in one go.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/`.\n\n3. **Get the artifact build order**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n   Parse the JSON to get:\n   - `applyRequires`: array of artifact IDs needed before implementation (e.g., `[\"tasks\"]`)\n   - `artifacts`: list of all artifacts with their status and dependencies\n\n4. **Create artifacts in sequence until apply-ready**\n\n   Use the **TodoWrite tool** to track progress through the artifacts.\n\n   Loop through artifacts in dependency order (artifacts with no pending dependencies first):\n\n   a. **For each artifact that is `ready` (dependencies satisfied)**:\n      - Get instructions:\n        ```bash\n        openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n        ```\n      - The instructions JSON includes:\n        - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n        - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n        - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance for this artifact type\n        - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n        - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n      - Read any completed dependency files for context\n      - Create the artifact file using `template` as the structure\n      - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints - but do NOT copy them into the file\n      - Show brief progress: \"✓ Created <artifact-id>\"\n\n   b. **Continue until all `applyRequires` artifacts are complete**\n      - After creating each artifact, re-run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Check if every artifact ID in `applyRequires` has `status: \"done\"` in the artifacts array\n      - Stop when all `applyRequires` artifacts are done\n\n   c. **If an artifact requires user input** (unclear context):\n      - Use **AskUserQuestion tool** to clarify\n      - Then continue with creation\n\n5. **Show final status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing all artifacts, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- List of artifacts created with brief descriptions\n- What''s ready: \"All artifacts created! Ready for implementation.\"\n- Prompt: \"Run `/opsx:apply` or ask me to implement to start working on the tasks.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\n- Follow the `instruction` field from `openspec instructions` for each artifact type\n- The schema defines what each artifact should contain - follow it\n- Read dependency artifacts for context before creating new ones\n- Use `template` as the structure for your output file - fill in its sections\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Create ALL artifacts needed for implementation (as defined by schema''s `apply.requires`)\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- If context is critically unclear, ask the user - but prefer making reasonable decisions to keep momentum\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Verify each artifact file exists after writing before proceeding to next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:51:47.161Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Agile Development Agents requiring rapid artifact creation and implementation planning.","zh":"适合需要快速创建和实施规划的敏捷开发代理的理想选择。","ja":"迅速な成果物の作成と実装計画を必要とするアジャイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"신속한 아티팩트 생성 및 구현 계획이 필요한 애자일 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo ágil que requieren la creación rápida de artefactos y planificación de implementación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement agile nécessitant une création rapide d''artefacts et une planification d''implémentation.","de":"Ideal für Agile-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine schnelle Erstellung von Artefakten und Implementierungsplanung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Ágil que exigem criação rápida de artefatos e planejamento de implementação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Agile-разработки, требующих быстрого создания артефактов и планирования реализации.","ar":"مثالية لعميل التطوير الرشيق الذي يتطلب إنشاء سريع للنماذج وتنفيذ الخطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fast-forward through artifact creation by generating everything needed to start implementation in one go, utilizing kebab-case change names and descriptions to derive project specifications, and leveraging the AskUserQuestion tool for clarifying user requests.","zh":"通过生成所有必要的内容来启动实施，利用短横线命名法的更改名称和描述来推导项目规格，并利用 AskUserQuestion 工具来阐明用户请求，从而使代理能够快速推进成果物的创建。","ja":"実装の開始に必要なすべてを一括生成し、ケバブケースの変更名と説明からプロジェクト仕様を導出し、AskUserQuestionツールを利用してユーザーのリクエストを明確化することで、エージェントが成果物の作成を迅速に進めることができる。","ko":"실施을 시작하는 데 필요한 모든 것을 일괄 생성하고, 케밥 케이스의 변경 이름 및 설명에서 프로젝트 사양을 도출하며, AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자의 요청을 명확히 함으로써 에이전트가 아티팩트의 생성을 신속하게 진행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes avanzar rápidamente en la creación de artefactos generando todo lo necesario para iniciar la implementación de una sola vez, utilizando nombres y descripciones en kebab-case para derivar especificaciones de proyecto, y aprovechando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para aclarar solicitudes de usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire un saut en avant dans la création d''artefacts en générant tout ce qui est nécessaire pour commencer l''implémentation en une seule fois, en utilisant des noms et des descriptions en kebab-case pour dériver des spécifications de projet, et en exploitant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour clarifier les demandes des utilisateurs.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Erstellung von Artefakten durch die Generierung aller erforderlichen Elemente für den Start der Implementierung in einem Schritt zu beschleunigen, indem sie kebab-case-Änderungsnamen und -beschreibungen verwenden, um Projektspezifikationen abzuleiten, und die AskUserQuestion-Tool für die Klärung von Benutzeranfragen nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes avancem rapidamente na criação de artefatos, gerando tudo o que é necessário para iniciar a implementação de uma vez, utilizando nomes e descrições em kebab-case para derivar especificações do projeto e utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para esclarecer solicitações do usuário.","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро создавать артефакты, генерируя все необходимое для начала реализации за один раз, используя имена и описания в kebab-case для получения спецификаций проекта и используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для уточнения запросов пользователя.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التنقل بسرعة خلال إنشاء النماذج من خلال توليد كل ما هو مطلوب لبدء التنفيذ في المرة الأولى، واستخدام أسماء ووصف الحالة kebab-case لاستخراج مواصفات المشروع، وتحقيق أداة AskUserQuestion لتوضيح طلبات المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating project specifications from user descriptions","Automating artifact creation for new features","Streamlining implementation planning with comprehensive project outlines"],"zh":["从用户描述中生成项目规格","为新功能自动创建成果物","使用综合项目大纲简化实施规划"],"ja":["ユーザーの説明からプロジェクト仕様を生成する","新しい機能の自動成果物の作成","包括的なプロジェクトアウトラインを使用した実装計画の合理化"],"ko":["사용자 설명에서 프로젝트 사양을 생성하는 것","새로운 기능을 위한 자동 아티팩트 생성","포괄적인 프로젝트 개요를 사용한 구현 계획의 간소화"],"es":["Generación de especificaciones de proyecto a partir de descripciones de usuario","Automatización de la creación de artefactos para nuevas características","Optimización de la planificación de implementación con esquemas de proyecto integrales"],"fr":["Génération de spécifications de projet à partir de descriptions d''utilisateur","Automatisation de la création d''artefacts pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Optimisation de la planification d''implémentation avec des plans de projet complets"],"de":["Erstellung von Projektspezifikationen aus Benutzerbeschreibungen","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Artefakten für neue Funktionen","Optimierung der Implementierungsplanung mit umfassenden Projektkonturen"],"pt":["Geração de especificações do projeto a partir de descrições do usuário","Automatização da criação de artefatos para recursos novos","Otimização do planejamento de implementação com esboços abrangentes do projeto"],"ru":["Генерация спецификаций проекта из описаний пользователя","Автоматизация создания артефактов для новых функций","Оптимизация планирования реализации с помощью всесторонних контуров проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات المشروع من وصف المستخدم","تأتمة إنشاء النماذج للسمات الجديدة","تبسيط تخطيط التنفيذ مع الخطوط العريضة الشاملة للمشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear user input or description of the change","Dependent on the AskUserQuestion tool for user clarification"],"zh":["需要清晰的用户输入或对更改的描述","依赖于 AskUserQuestion 工具来进行用户澄清"],"ja":["明確なユーザー入力または変更の説明が必要","ユーザーの明確化に AskUserQuestion ツールに依存する"],"ko":["명확한 사용자 입력 또는 변경 설명이 필요","사용자 요청의澄清을 위해 AskUserQuestion 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de usuario clara o una descripción del cambio","Depende de la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la aclaración de solicitudes de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée d''utilisateur claire ou une description du changement","Dépend de l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la clarification des demandes des utilisateurs"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Benutzereingabe oder eine Beschreibung der Änderung","Hängt von der AskUserQuestion-Tool für die Klärung von Benutzeranfragen ab"],"pt":["Exige entrada clara do usuário ou descrição da alteração","Depende da ferramenta AskUserQuestion para esclarecimento do usuário"],"ru":["Требует ясного ввода пользователя или описания изменения","Зависит от инструмента AskUserQuestion для уточнения пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال واضح من المستخدم أو وصف للتغيير","يعتمد على أداة AskUserQuestion لتوضيح المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
