a estilização","Abordagem de configuração CSS-first","Compatibilidade com v3","Desenvolvimento móvel primeiro","Extração de componentes"],"ru":["Утилитарные классы для стилизации","Подход к конфигурации CSS-first","Совместимость с v3","Мобильная разработка в первую очередь","Экстракция компонентов"],"ar":["فئات الأدوات لتحسين الشكل","منهجية تكوين CSS-first","التوافق مع v3","التطوير المتنقل أولاً","استخراج المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS v4","CSS 框架","实用工具类","响应式设计","移动优先","组件提取"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4","CSS フレームワーク","ユーティリティクラス","レスポンシブデザイン","モバイルファースト","コンポーネント抽出"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4","CSS 프레임워크","유틸리티 클래스","반응형 설계","모바일 우선","컴포넌트 추출"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo web","diseño de interfaz de usuario","framework de CSS","utilidad primero","diseño para móviles"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement web","conception d''interface utilisateur","framework CSS","approche d''utilité première","conception pour mobiles"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächendesign","CSS-Framework","Utility-First-Ansatz","Mobile-First-Design"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento web","CSS","Utilidade de classes","Mobile-first","Componentes reutilizáveis","Configuração CSS-first","Compatibilidade v3"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS","Веб-разработка","CSS","Утилитарные классы","Мобильная разработка","Переиспользуемые компоненты","Конфигурация CSS-first","Совместимость v3"],"ar":["Tailwind CSS","تطوير الويب","CSS","فئات الأدوات","التطوير المتنقل","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تكوين CSS-first","التوافق v3"]}},"owner":"congwa","repo":"embedease-ai","repoPath":"congwa/embedease-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss","description":"Tailwind CSS v4 utility-first styling patterns including responsive design, dark mode, and custom configuration. Use when styling with Tailwind, adding utility classes, configuring Tailwind, setting up dark mode, or customizing the theme.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS v4 Development Guidelines\n\nBest practices for using Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes effectively.\n\n**Note**: Tailwind CSS v4 (released January 2025) uses a CSS-first configuration approach. If you need v3 compatibility, tailwind.config.js is still supported.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Utility-First**: Use utility classes instead of custom CSS\n2. **Mobile-First**: Design for mobile, then scale up with responsive modifiers\n3. **Component Extraction**: Extract repeated patterns into co","body":"# Tailwind CSS v4 Development Guidelines\n\nBest practices for using Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes effectively.\n\n**Note**: Tailwind CSS v4 (released January 2025) uses a CSS-first configuration approach. If you need v3 compatibility, tailwind.config.js is still supported.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Utility-First**: Use utility classes instead of custom CSS\n2. **Mobile-First**: Design for mobile, then scale up with responsive modifiers\n3. **Component Extraction**: Extract repeated patterns into components\n4. **Consistent Spacing**: Use Tailwind''s spacing scale\n5. **Custom Configuration**: Extend the default theme for brand consistency\n\n## Basic Utilities\n\n### Layout\n\n```tsx\n// Flexbox\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n  <div className=\"flex-1\">Content</div>\n  <div className=\"flex-shrink-0\">Sidebar</div>\n</div>\n\n// Grid\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n  <div>1</div>\n  <div>2</div>\n  <div>3</div>\n</div>\n\n// Positioning\n<div className=\"relative\">\n  <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0\">Badge</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Spacing\n\n```tsx\n// Padding and Margin\n<div className=\"p-4 m-2\">           {/* padding: 1rem, margin: 0.5rem */}\n<div className=\"px-6 py-4\">        {/* padding-x: 1.5rem, padding-y: 1rem */}\n<div className=\"mt-8 mb-4\">        {/* margin-top: 2rem, margin-bottom: 1rem */}\n\n// Space between children\n<div className=\"space-y-4\">        {/* margin-bottom on all but last child */}\n  <div>Item 1</div>\n  <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Typography\n\n```tsx\n<h1 className=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Heading</h1>\n<p className=\"text-base font-normal text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">\n  Paragraph text with comfortable line height.\n</p>\n<span className=\"text-sm font-medium text-blue-600\">Label</span>\n```\n\n### Colors\n\n```tsx\n// Text colors\n<p className=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Text</p>\n\n// Background colors\n<div className=\"bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600\">Button</div>\n\n// Border colors\n<div className=\"border border-gray-300\">Box</div>\n```\n\n## Responsive Design\n\n### Breakpoints\n\n```tsx\n// Mobile-first responsive classes\n<div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3\">\n  {/* Full width on mobile, half on medium screens, third on large */}\n</div>\n\n<h1 className=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-6xl\">\n  {/* Responsive text sizes */}\n</h1>\n\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n  {/* Responsive grid */}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Container\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n  {/* Centered container with horizontal padding */}\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n  {/* Responsive container padding */}\n</div>\n```\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Button\n\n```tsx\n<button className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors\">\n  Click me\n</button>\n\n// Variants\n<button className=\"px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-50\">\n  Secondary\n</button>\n```\n\n### Card\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden\">\n  <img src=\"/image.jpg\" alt=\"\" className=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" />\n  <div className=\"p-6\">\n    <h2 className=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Card Title</h2>\n    <p className=\"text-gray-600\">Card content goes here.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Form Input\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"space-y-2\">\n  <label htmlFor=\"email\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">\n    Email\n  </label>\n  <input\n    type=\"email\"\n    id=\"email\"\n    className=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent\"\n    placeholder=\"you@example.com\"\n  />\n  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">We''ll never share your email.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n## State Variants\n\n### Hover, Focus, Active\n\n```tsx\n<button className=\"bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 active:bg-blue-700 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\">\n  Interactive Button\n</button>\n\n<a href=\"#\" className=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 hover:underline\">\n  Link\n</a>\n```\n\n### Group Hover\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"group\">\n  <img src=\"/image.jpg\" className=\"group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity\" />\n  <p className=\"group-hover:text-blue-600\">Hover the container</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Disabled\n\n```tsx\n<button className=\"disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" disabled>\n  Disabled Button\n</button>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode\n\n```css\n/* Tailwind v4: Configure in app/globals.css */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  /* Or use class-based: .dark */\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// Usage (same as v3)\n<div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Title</h1>\n  <p className=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Description</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Custom Styles\n\n### Arbitrary Values\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"top-[117px]\">           {/* Custom top value */}\n<div className=\"bg-[#1da1f2]\">          {/* Custom color */}\n<div className=\"grid-cols-[200px_1fr]\"> {/* Custom grid template */}\n```\n\n### @apply Directive\n\n```css\n/* components/button.css */\n.btn-primary {\n  @apply px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium rounded-md;\n  @apply hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500;\n  @apply disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed;\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Tailwind v4: CSS-First Configuration\n\n```css\n/* app/globals.css */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@theme {\n  /* Custom colors */\n  --color-brand-50: #eff6ff;\n  --color-brand-100: #dbeafe;\n  --color-brand-900: #1e3a8a;\n\n  /* Custom spacing */\n  --spacing-128: 32rem;\n\n  /* Custom fonts */\n  --font-family-sans: ''Inter'', sans-serif;\n\n  /* Custom breakpoints */\n  --breakpoint-3xl: 1920px;\n}\n```\n\n### Tailwind v3 Config (Still Supported)\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js (optional in v4)\nmodule.exports = {\n  content: [\n    ''./app/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}'',\n    ''./components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}'',\n  ],\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        brand: {\n          50: ''#eff6ff'',\n          100: ''#dbeafe'',\n          900: ''#1e3a8a'',\n        }\n      },\n      spacing: {\n        ''128'': ''32rem'',\n      },\n      fontFamily: {\n        sans: [''Inter'', ''sans-serif''],\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    require(''@tailwindcss/forms''),\n    require(''@tailwindcss/typography''),\n  ],\n}\n```\n\n## Plugins\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/forms\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\nnpm install @tailwindcss/aspect-ratio\nnpm install @tailwindcss/container-queries\n```\n\n```tsx\n// @tailwindcss/forms\n<input type=\"text\" className=\"form-input rounded-md\" />\n\n// @tailwindcss/typography\n<article className=\"prose lg:prose-xl\">\n  <h1>Article Title</h1>\n  <p>Content...</p>\n</article>\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n### Automatic Content Detection\n\nTailwind v4 automatically detects and scans all template files - no `content` configuration needed.\n\n### Build Performance\n\nTailwind v4 delivers 3.5x faster full builds (~100ms) compared to v3 using modern CSS features like `@property` and `color-mix()`.\n\n**Browser Requirements**: Safari 16.4+, Chrome 111+, Firefox 128+\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Centered Content\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen\">\n  <div>Centered content</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Sticky Header\n\n```tsx\n<header className=\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b\">\n  <nav>Navigation</nav>\n</header>\n```\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n  {posts.map(post => (\n    <PostCard key={post.id} post={post} />\n  ))}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Truncate Text\n\n```tsx\n<p className=\"truncate\">This text will be truncated with ellipsis if too long</p>\n<p className=\"line-clamp-3\">This text will show max 3 lines with ellipsis</p>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Consistent Spacing**: Stick to Tailwind''s spacing scale\n2. **Responsive by Default**: Always consider mobile-first design\n3. **Extract Components**: Avoid repeating long class lists\n4. **Use Theme Colors**: Define custom colors in config, not arbitrary values\n5. **Leverage @apply Sparingly**: Prefer utility classes in JSX\n6. **Enable Dark Mode**: Plan for dark mode from the start\n7. **Use Plugins**: Leverage official plugins for common needs\n8. **Optimize Production**: Ensure purge is configured correctly\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor detailed information, see:\n- [Utility Patterns](resources/utility-patterns.md)\n- [Component Library](resources/component-library.md)\n- [Configuration Guide](resources/configuration.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:51:43.163Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS utility classes and responsive design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效CSS实用程序类和响应式设计功能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが効率的なCSSユーティリティクラスとレスポンシブデザインの機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 효율적인 CSS 유틸리티 클래스와 반응형 디자인 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan clases de utilidad CSS eficientes y capacidades de diseño responsivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de classes d''utilité CSS efficaces et de capacités de conception responsives.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die effiziente CSS-Utility-Klassen und responsive Designfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS utility classes and responsive design capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS utility classes and responsive design capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS utility classes and responsive design capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes for mobile-first design, leveraging CSS-first configuration approaches and responsive modifiers, while ensuring compatibility with v3 configurations through tailwind.config.js.","zh":"赋予代理利用Tailwind CSS v4实用程序类进行移动优先设计的能力，利用CSS优先配置方法和响应式修饰符，同时通过tailwind.config.js确保与v3配置的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントがTailwind CSS v4ユーティリティクラスを使用してモバイルファーストデザインを実現する能力を付与し、CSSファースト構成アプローチとレスポンシブ修飾子を利用し、tailwind.config.jsを介してv3構成との互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS v4 유틸리티 클래스를 사용하여 모바일 우선 디자인을 구현할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, CSS 우선 구성 방법과 반응형 수정자를 활용하며, tailwind.config.js를 통해 v3 구성との 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar las clases de utilidad Tailwind CSS v4 para diseño de primera generación móvil, aprovechando los enfoques de configuración CSS y los modificadores responsivos, mientras se garantiza la compatibilidad con configuraciones v3 a través de tailwind.config.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les classes d''utilité Tailwind CSS v4 pour la conception mobile en premier, en exploitant les approches de configuration CSS et les modificateurs responsives, tout en assurant la compatibilité avec les configurations v3 via tailwind.config.js.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Tailwind CSS v4-Utility-Klassen für mobiles Design zu nutzen, indem sie CSS-erste Konfigurationsansätze und responsive Modifikatoren nutzen und gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit v3-Konfigurationen über tailwind.config.js sicherstellen.","pt":"Empowers agents to utilize Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes for mobile-first design, leveraging CSS-first configuration approaches and responsive modifiers, while ensuring compatibility with v3 configurations through tailwind.config.js.","ru":"Empowers agents to utilize Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes for mobile-first design, leveraging CSS-first configuration approaches and responsive modifiers, while ensuring compatibility with v3 configurations through tailwind.config.js.","ar":"Empowers agents to utilize Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes for mobile-first design, leveraging CSS-first configuration approaches and responsive modifiers, while ensuring compatibility with v3 configurations through tailwind.config.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive user interfaces with utility-first approach","Generating consistent CSS styles across multiple web applications","Optimizing mobile-first design patterns with scalable responsive modifiers"],"zh":["使用实用程序优先方法设计响应式用户界面","在多个Web应用程序中生成一致的CSS样式","使用可扩展的响应式修饰符优化移动优先设计模式"],"ja":["ユーティリティファーストアプローチを使用してレスポンシブなユーザーインターフェイスを設計する","複数のWebアプリケーション全体で一貫したCSSスタイルを生成する","拡張可能なレスポンシブ修飾子を使用してモバイルファーストデザインパターンを最適化する"],"ko":["유틸리티 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 반응형 사용자 인터페이스를 설계하는 것","여러 웹 애플리케이션에서 일관된 CSS 스타일을 생성하는 것","확장 가능한 반응형 수정자를 사용하여 모바일 우선 디자인 패턴을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de usuario responsivas con enfoque de utilidad primera","Generar estilos CSS consistentes en varias aplicaciones web","Optimizar patrones de diseño de primera generación móvil con modificadores responsivos escalables"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces utilisateur responsives avec une approche d''utilité première","Générer des styles CSS cohérents dans plusieurs applications web","Optimiser les modèles de conception de première génération mobile avec des modificateurs responsives escalables"],"de":["Entwerfen von responsiven Benutzeroberflächen mit utility-first-Ansatz","Erzeugen von konsistenten CSS-Stilen über mehrere Webanwendungen hinweg","Optimieren von mobiles-erst-Designmustern mit skalierbaren responsiven Modifikatoren"],"pt":["Designing responsive user interfaces with utility-first approach","Generating consistent CSS styles across multiple web applications","Optimizing mobile-first design patterns with scalable responsive modifiers"],"ru":["Designing responsive user interfaces with utility-first approach","Generating consistent CSS styles across multiple web applications","Optimizing mobile-first design patterns with scalable responsive modifiers"],"ar":["Designing responsive user interfaces with utility-first approach","Generating consistent CSS styles across multiple web applications","Optimizing mobile-first design patterns with scalable responsive modifiers"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of CSS and utility-first design principles","Limited to Tailwind CSS v4 and its compatible configurations"],"zh":["需要CSS和实用程序优先设计原则的知识","仅限于Tailwind CSS v4及其兼容配置"],"ja":["CSSとユーティリティファーストデザインの原則の知識が必要","Tailwind CSS v4とその互換性のある構成のみに限定される"],"ko":["CSS와 유틸리티 우선 디자인 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요","Tailwind CSS v4와 그와 호환되는 구성만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de CSS y principios de diseño de utilidad primera","Limitado a Tailwind CSS v4 y sus configuraciones compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de CSS et des principes de conception d''utilité première","Limité à Tailwind CSS v4 et ses configurations compatibles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von CSS und utility-first-Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Tailwind CSS v4 und seine kompatiblen Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Requires knowledge of CSS and utility-first design principles","Limited to Tailwind CSS v4 and its compatible configurations"],"ru":["Requires knowledge of CSS and utility-first design principles","Limited to Tailwind CSS v4 and its compatible configurations"],"ar":[