リ","要素選択と認証","ワークフロー管理"],"ko":["SharePoint 사이트의 콘텐츠 크롤링","OpenAI Vector Stores 지원","Azure Web앱","요소 선택 및 인증","작업 흐름 관리"],"es":["Crawlear contenido de sitios de SharePoint","Integración con OpenAI Vector Stores","Desarrollado con Azure Web App en Python","Selección de elementos personalizable","Autenticación avanzada","Flujos de trabajo comunes y avanzados"],"fr":["Crawler le contenu des sites SharePoint","Intégration avec OpenAI Vector Stores","Développé avec Azure Web App en Python","Sélection d''éléments personnalisable","Authentification avancée","Flux de travail communs et avancés"],"de":["Inhalte von SharePoint-Sites crawlen","Integration mit OpenAI Vector Stores","Entwickelt mit Azure Web App in Python","Anpassbare Elementauswahl","Erweiterte Authentifizierung","Allgemeine und erweiterte Arbeitsabläufe"],"pt":["Crawl de conteúdo de sites SharePoint","Integração com OpenAI Vector Stores","Configuração personalizada","Ferramentas de autenticação e seleção de elementos","Suporte a workflows avançados"],"ru":["Краулинг контента сайтов SharePoint","Интеграция с OpenAI Vector Stores","Настройка конфигурации","Инструменты аутентификации и выбора элементов","Поддержка продвинутых рабочих процессов"],"ar":["استخراج المحتوى من مواقع SharePoint","التكامل مع متاجر OpenAI Vector","ضبط التكوين","أدوات التحقق والاختيار","دعم سير العمل المتقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web 应用","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","爬取","元素选择","认证"],"ja":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web アプリ","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","クロール","要素選択","認証"],"ko":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web앱","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","크롤링","요소 선택","인증"],"es":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","crawlear contenido","desarrollo web","Python","autenticación avanzada"],"fr":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","crawler le contenu","développement web","Python","authentification avancée"],"de":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web App","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","Inhalte crawlen","Webentwicklung","Python","erweiterte Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Playwright MCP","Azure Web App","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","Crawl de conteúdo","Autenticação","Seleção de elementos"],"ru":["Playwright MCP","Веб-приложение Azure","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","Краулинг контента","Аутентификация","Выбор элементов"],"ar":["Playwright MCP","تطبيق ويب على Azure","Python","SharePoint","متاجر OpenAI Vector","استخراج المحتوى","التحقق","اختيار العناصر"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ms-playwright-mcp","description":"Apply when automating browser interactions, web scraping, or UI testing with AI agents","bodyPreview":"# Playwright MCP Guide\n\nRules and usage for Microsoft Playwright MCP server.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Configuration](#configuration)\n- [Available Tools](#available-tools)\n\n**Workflows**\n- [Common Workflows](#common-workflows)\n- [Advanced Workflows](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md) - Cookie popups, scrolling, expanding items, full page screenshots\n\n**Reference**\n- [Element Selection](#element-selection)\n- [Authentication](PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.","body":"# Playwright MCP Guide\n\nRules and usage for Microsoft Playwright MCP server.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n**Core**\n- [MUST-NOT-FORGET](#must-not-forget)\n- [Configuration](#configuration)\n- [Available Tools](#available-tools)\n\n**Workflows**\n- [Common Workflows](#common-workflows)\n- [Advanced Workflows](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md) - Cookie popups, scrolling, expanding items, full page screenshots\n\n**Reference**\n- [Element Selection](#element-selection)\n- [Authentication](PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.md) - Persistent profiles, storage state, extension mode\n- [Troubleshooting](PLAYWRIGHT_TROUBLESHOOTING.md) - Common issues, flaky tests\n- [Setup](SETUP.md) - Installation\n\n## Intent Lookup\n\n**User wants to...**\n- **Research a topic / read articles** → Navigate, dismiss cookie popup, scroll for lazy content, screenshot\n- **Find a product / compare prices** → Navigate, search, extract data with `browser_evaluate`\n- **Fill out a form / submit application** → Use `browser_fill` for fields, `browser_click` for submit\n- **Download file / attachment** → First find links with [Section 5](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md#5-find-and-extract-links), then click to download\n- **Log into a site** → Fill credentials, submit; use [PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.md](PLAYWRIGHT_AUTHENTICATION.md) to stay logged in\n- **Do a bank transfer / pay bills** → Requires persistent profile for auth; use `browser_snapshot` before each action\n- **Check email / download attachments** → Navigate to webmail, expand messages, click attachment links\n- **Archive a webpage** → See [PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md) for full page screenshot workflow\n- **Interact with dynamic content** → Scroll to load lazy content, expand collapsed sections, then proceed\n\n**UI testing...**\n- **Verify page loads correctly** → Navigate, `browser_snapshot`, check expected elements present\n- **Test form validation** → Submit empty/invalid data, check error messages appear\n- **Test navigation flow** → Click through menus, verify correct pages load\n- **Test responsive layout** → Resize browser, screenshot at different widths\n- **Test button states** → Hover, click, verify visual/functional changes\n- **Test modal dialogs** → Trigger modal, interact, close, verify dismissed\n- **Test error states** → Force errors (bad URL, timeout), verify error handling\n- **Test accessibility** → Use `browser_snapshot` (accessibility tree), check refs have labels\n- **Compare before/after** → Screenshot before change, screenshot after, compare\n- **Test login/logout** → Full auth flow, verify session state\n\n**Technical tasks...**\n- **Handle cookie popup** → [PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md#1-close-cookie-popups](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md#1-close-cookie-popups)\n- **Run custom JavaScript** → `browser_evaluate(expression: \"...\")`\n- **Debug failures** → [PLAYWRIGHT_TROUBLESHOOTING.md](PLAYWRIGHT_TROUBLESHOOTING.md)\n\n## MUST-NOT-FORGET\n\n- Use accessibility tree (not screenshots) for element selection\n- Reference elements via `ref=e5` format from `browser_snapshot`\n- Always call `browser_snapshot` before clicking to get current refs\n- Use `browser_close` when done to free resources\n- For logged-in sessions: Use persistent user profile or storage state\n- Always use `type: \"jpeg\"` for screenshots (default is png, which produces unnecessarily large files)\n\n## Configuration\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp\n**Package**: `@playwright/mcp`\n\n**Basic (isolated session):**\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"playwright\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"@playwright/mcp@latest\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Persistent profile (remembers logins):**\n```json\n{\n  \"args\": [\"@playwright/mcp@latest\", \"--user-data-dir\", \"[USER_PROFILE_PATH]/.ms-playwright-mcp-profile\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Headless:** Add `\"--headless\"` to args.\n\n**Timeouts:** Add `\"--timeout-action\", \"10000\", \"--timeout-navigation\", \"120000\"` for slow pages.\n\n## Available Tools\n\n### Navigation\n- **browser_navigate** - `browser_navigate(url: \"https://example.com\")`\n\n### Element Interaction\n- **browser_snapshot** - Get accessibility tree with element refs\n- **browser_click** - `browser_click(element: \"Button\", ref: \"e12\")`\n- **browser_type** - `browser_type(element: \"Input\", ref: \"e8\", text: \"query\")`\n- **browser_fill** - `browser_fill(element: \"Email\", ref: \"e3\", value: \"user@example.com\")`\n- **browser_select** - `browser_select(element: \"Country\", ref: \"e15\", values: [\"USA\"])`\n- **browser_hover** - `browser_hover(element: \"Menu\", ref: \"e5\")`\n- **browser_drag** - Drag and drop between elements\n- **browser_press_key** - `browser_press_key(key: \"Enter\")` or `browser_press_key(key: \"Control+A\")`\n\n### Inspection\n- **browser_screenshot** - `browser_screenshot(type: \"jpeg\")` or `browser_screenshot(fullPage: true, type: \"jpeg\")`\n- **browser_console_messages** - Get console logs\n- **browser_evaluate** - `browser_evaluate(expression: \"document.title\")`\n\n### Timing\n- **browser_wait_for** - `browser_wait_for(time: 2)` wait seconds, or `browser_wait_for(text: \"Loading\")` wait for text\n\n### Session\n- **browser_close** - Close browser and free resources\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Navigate and Click\n```\n1. browser_navigate(url: \"https://example.com\")\n2. browser_snapshot()\n3. browser_click(element: \"Login button\", ref: \"e12\")\n```\n\n### Fill Form\n```\n1. browser_snapshot()\n2. browser_fill(element: \"Username\", ref: \"e3\", value: \"user@example.com\")\n3. browser_fill(element: \"Password\", ref: \"e5\", value: \"password123\")\n4. browser_click(element: \"Submit\", ref: \"e8\")\n```\n\n### Wait for Content\nAfter navigation or click, call `browser_snapshot()` to verify page loaded and get updated refs.\n\n### Full Page Screenshot\n```\nbrowser_screenshot(fullPage: true, type: \"jpeg\")\n```\n\nFor cookie popups, lazy-load scrolling, and expanding collapsed items, see [PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md](PLAYWRIGHT_ADVANCED_WORKFLOWS.md).\n\n## Element Selection\n\n### Using Refs from Snapshot\n\n1. Call `browser_snapshot()` to get current page structure\n2. Find element in returned accessibility tree\n3. Use the `ref` value in subsequent commands\n\n**Example snapshot output:**\n```\n- banner [ref=e3]:\n    - link \"Home\" [ref=e5] [cursor=pointer]\n    - navigation [ref=e12]:\n        - link \"Docs\" [ref=e13]\n```\n\n### Selector Priority\n\nWhen refs unavailable, use stable selectors:\n1. `[data-testid=\"submit\"]` - Best\n2. `getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Save'' })` - Semantic\n3. `getByText(''Sign in'')` - User-facing\n4. `input[name=\"email\"]` - HTML attributes\n5. Avoid: `.btn-primary`, `#submit` - Classes/IDs change\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+ with npx in PATH\n- Chrome/Chromium for headed mode\n\nSee [SETUP.md](SETUP.md) for installation details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:52:51.744Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Enterprise Data Ingestion Agents needing automated SharePoint content extraction.","zh":"适用于需要自动化SharePoint内容提取的企业数据摄取Agent的理想选择。","ja":"SharePointコンテンツの自動抽出が必要なエンタープライズデータインジェストエージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 SharePoint 컨텐츠 추출이 필요한 엔터프라이즈 데이터 수집 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Ingestión de Datos Empresariales que necesitan extracción automática de contenido de SharePoint.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''ingestion de données d''entreprise nécessitant une extraction automatisée de contenu SharePoint.","de":"Ideal für Enterprise-Daten-Import-Agents, die eine automatisierte SharePoint-Inhaltsextraktion benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Ingestão de Dados Empresariais que necessitam de extração automática de conteúdo do SharePoint.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инжеста данных предприятия, требующих автоматизированного извлечения контента SharePoint.","ar":"مثالي لعمال استيعاب البيانات التجارية الذين يحتاجون إلى استخراج المحتوى التلقائي لبرنامج SharePoint."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated crawling of SharePoint sites directly into OpenAI Vector Stores using Playwright''s browser automation capabilities. Provides robust authentication handling, cookie management, and advanced workflows for complex enterprise content extraction scenarios.","zh":"能够直接使用Playwright的浏览器自动化功能将SharePoint站点自动爬取到OpenAI矢量存储中。提供强大的身份验证处理、Cookie管理和复杂企业内容提取场景的高级工作流。","ja":"Playwrightのブラウザ自動化機能を使用して、SharePointサイトをOpenAIベクトルストアに直接自動クロールできる。強力な認証処理、Cookie管理、および複雑なエンタープライズコンテンツ抽出シナリオの高度なワークフローを提供。","ko":"Playwright의 브라우저 자동화 기능을 사용하여 SharePoint 사이트를 OpenAI 벡터 저장소에 직접 자동 크롤링할 수 있습니다. 강력한 인증 처리, 쿠키 관리 및 복잡한 엔터프라이즈 컨텐츠 추출 시나리오를 위한 고급 워크플로를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la exploración automática de sitios de SharePoint directamente en las Tiendas de Vectores de OpenAI utilizando las capacidades de automatización del navegador de Playwright. Proporciona un manejo de autenticación robusto, gestión de cookies y flujos de trabajo avanzados para escenarios de extracción de contenido empresarial complejos.","fr":"Permet la crawling automatisée de sites SharePoint directement dans les Magasins de vecteurs OpenAI en utilisant les capacités d''automatisation de navigateur de Playwright. Fournit une gestion d''authentification robuste, une gestion de cookies et des flux de travail avancés pour des scénarios d''extraction de contenu d''entreprise complexes.","de":"Ermöglicht das automatische Crawling von SharePoint-Seiten direkt in die OpenAI-Vektor-Speicher mithilfe der Browser-Automatisierungsfunktionen von Playwright. Bietet robuste Authentifizierungsverwaltung, Cookie-Verwaltung und erweiterte Workflows für komplexe Unternehmensinhalts-Extraktionsszenarien.","pt":"Permite a raspagem automática de sites do SharePoint diretamente para lojas de vetores OpenAI usando as capacidades de automação de navegador do Playwright. Fornece tratamento de autenticação robusto, gerenciamento de cookies e fluxos de trabalho avançados para cenários complexos de extração de conteúdo empresarial.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически выполнять поиск сайтов SharePoint напрямую в хранилища векторов OpenAI, используя возможности автоматизации браузера Playwright. Предоставляет надежную обработку аутентификации, управление файлами cookie и расширенные рабочие процессы для сложных сценариев извлечения контента предприятия.","ar":"تمكن من التنقل التلقائي لمواقع برنامج SharePoint مباشرة إلى مخازن المتجهات مفتوحة الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام إمكانيات تحكم متصفح لعب المسرح. توفر معالجة مصادقة قوية وإدارة ملفات تعريف الارتباط وعمليات عمل متقدمة لسيناريوهات استخراج المحتوى التجاري المعقدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Crawling SharePoint document libraries for RAG implementation","Automating authentication flows for enterprise content access","Generating full-page screenshots for content verification","Extracting structured data from dynamic SharePoint web applications"],"zh":["爬取SharePoint文档库以实现RAG实现","自动化企业内容访问的身份验证流程","生成全页截图以用于内容验证","从动态SharePoint Web应用程序中提取结构化数据"],"ja":["RAG実装のためにSharePointドキュメントライブラリをクロールする","エンタープライズコンテンツアクセスの認証フローを自動化する","コンテンツの検証のためにフルページスクリーンショットを生成する","動的SharePoint Webアプリケーションから構造化データを抽出する"],"ko":["RAG 구현을 위해 SharePoint 문서 라이브러리를 크롤링합니다.","엔터프라이즈 컨텐츠 액세スの 인증 흐름을 자동화합니다.","컨텐츠 검증을 위해 전체 페이지 스크린샷을 생성합니다.","동적 SharePoint 웹 애플리케이션에서 구조화된 데이터를 추출합니다."],"es":["Exploración de bibliotecas de documentos de SharePoint para la implementación de RAG","Automatización de flujos de autenticación para el acceso a contenido empresarial","Generación de capturas de pantalla de página completa para la verificación de contenido","Extracción de datos estructurados de aplicaciones web dinámicas de SharePoint"],"fr":["Crawling de bibliothèques de documents SharePoint pour la mise en œuvre de RAG","Automatisation des flux d''authentification pour l''accès au contenu d''entreprise","Génération de captures d''écran de page complète pour la vérification du contenu","Extraction de données structurées d''applications web dynamiques SharePoint"],"de":["Crawling von SharePoint-Dokumentbibliotheken für die Implementierung von RAG","Automatisierung von Authentifizierungsflüssen für den Zugriff auf Unternehmensinhalte","Erzeugung von Vollbildschirmfotos für die Inhaltsverifizierung","Extraktion von strukturierten Daten aus dynamischen SharePoint-Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Rastrear bibliotecas de documentos do SharePoint para implementação de RAG","Automatizar fluxos de autenticação para acesso a conteúdo empresarial","Gerar capturas de tela de página completa para verificação de conteúdo","Extrair dado