实现高效的阶段规划","支持 EXPLORE、DESIGN、IMPLEMENT、REFINE 和 DELIVER 阶段","提供快速参考指南","支持 `/build` 和 `/solve` 工作流"],"ja":["SharePoint サイトのコンテンツを OpenAI Vector Stores にクロールする","Python を使用して効率的なフェーズプランニングを実現する","EXPLORE、DESIGN、IMPLEMENT、REFINE、DELIVER フェーズをサポートする","クイックリファレンスガイドを提供する"," `/build` と `/solve` ワークフローをサポートする"],"ko":["SharePoint 사이트의 콘텐츠를 OpenAI Vector Stores 로 크롤링하는 기능","Python 을 사용하여 효율적인 단계 계획을 구현하는 기능","EXPLORE、DESIGN、IMPLEMENT、REFINE 및 DELIVER 단계를 지원하는 기능","快速 참고 가이드를 제공하는 기능"," `/build` 및 `/solve` 워크플로우를 지원하는 기능"],"es":["Crawl de contenido de sitios de SharePoint","Integración con OpenAI Vector Stores","Planificación de fases para alcanzar objetivos","Creación de planes de alto nivel","Soporte para flujos de trabajo de construcción y resolución"],"fr":["Crawl de contenu des sites SharePoint","Intégration avec les magasins de vecteurs OpenAI","Planification de phases pour atteindre des objectifs","Création de plans de haut niveau","Prise en charge des flux de travail de construction et de résolution"],"de":["Crawlen von Inhalten von SharePoint-Sites","Integration mit OpenAI-Vektor-Speichern","Phasenplanung zur Erreichung von Zielen","Erstellung von Plänen auf hohem Niveau","Unterstützung von Arbeitsabläufen für Bau und Auflösung"],"pt":["Crawler de SharePoint","Armazenamento em lojas de vetores OpenAI","Planejamento de alto nível","Fases de EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE e DELIVER","Integração com workflows de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Инструмент для爬ления сайтов SharePoint","Хранение в магазинах векторов OpenAI","Высокоуровневое планирование","Фазы EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENT, REFINE и DELIVER","Интеграция с рабочими процессами разработки"],"ar":["أداة爬ل لمواقع SharePoint","تخزين في متاجر متجهات OpenAI","تخطيط высок المستوى","مراحل الاستكشاف والتصميم والتنفيذ والتحسين والتسليم","التكامل مع سير عمل التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["EDIRD 阶段规划","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","SharePoint 站点","Python","阶段规划","EXPLORE 阶段","DESIGN 阶段","IMPLEMENT 阶段","REFINE 阶段","DELIVER 阶段"],"ja":["EDIRD フェーズプランニング","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","SharePoint サイト","Python","フェーズプランニング","EXPLORE フェーズ","DESIGN フェーズ","IMPLEMENT フェーズ","REFINE フェーズ","DELIVER フェーズ"],"ko":["EDIRD 단계 계획","Azure Web App","OpenAI Vector Stores","SharePoint 사이트","Python","단계 계획","EXPLORE 단계","DESIGN 단계","IMPLEMENT 단계","REFINE 단계","DELIVER 단계"],"es":["planificación de fase EDIRD","Azure Web App","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI Vector Stores","crawling","planificación de proyectos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["planification de phase EDIRD","Application Web Azure","Python","SharePoint","Magasins de vecteurs OpenAI","crawling","planification de projets","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Phasenplanung von EDIRD","Azure-Web-App","Python","SharePoint","OpenAI-Vektor-Speicher","Crawling","Projektplanung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["planejamento de fase EDIRD","crawler de SharePoint","lojas de vetores OpenAI","desenvolvimento de software","planejamento de projeto","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["планирование фазы EDIRD","инструмент для爬ления сайтов SharePoint","магазины векторов OpenAI","разработка программного обеспечения","планирование проекта","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تخطيط مرحلة EDIRD","أداة爬ل لمواقع SharePoint","متاجر متجهات OpenAI","تطوير البرمجيات","تخطيط المشروع","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"karstenheld3","repo":"SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","repoPath":"karstenheld3/SharePoint-GPT-Middleware","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"edird-phase-planning","description":"Apply when doing planning for long-running tasks in sessions on top level","bodyPreview":"# EDIRD Phase Planning\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- `/build` or `/solve` workflows\n- [PLAN] - creating high-level plans to achieve goals\n- Planning for long agentic runs for features, fixes, or research\n\n**NOT for document writing** - Use dedicated workflows instead:\n- `/write-spec` for SPEC documents\n- `/write-impl-plan` for IMPL documents\n- `/write-test-plan` for TEST documents\n- `/write-tasks-plan` for TASKS documents\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Phases:** EXPLORE → DESIGN → IMPLEMENT → REFINE → DELIVER","body":"# EDIRD Phase Planning\n\n## When to Invoke\n\n- `/build` or `/solve` workflows\n- [PLAN] - creating high-level plans to achieve goals\n- Planning for long agentic runs for features, fixes, or research\n\n**NOT for document writing** - Use dedicated workflows instead:\n- `/write-spec` for SPEC documents\n- `/write-impl-plan` for IMPL documents\n- `/write-test-plan` for TEST documents\n- `/write-tasks-plan` for TASKS documents\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Phases:** EXPLORE → DESIGN → IMPLEMENT → REFINE → DELIVER\n\n**Workflow types:** BUILD (code output) | SOLVE (knowledge/decision output)\n\n**Assessment:** COMPLEXITY-LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH | PROBLEM-TYPE (RESEARCH/ANALYSIS/EVALUATION/WRITING/DECISION)\n\n## Phase Gates\n\n### EXPLORE → DESIGN\n\n- [ ] Problem or goal clearly understood\n- [ ] Workflow type determined (BUILD or SOLVE)\n- [ ] Assessment complete (BUILD: COMPLEXITY | SOLVE: PROBLEM-TYPE)\n- [ ] Scope boundaries defined\n- [ ] No blocking unknowns requiring [ACTOR] input\n\n### DESIGN → IMPLEMENT\n\n- [ ] Approach documented (outline, spec, or plan)\n- [ ] Risky parts proven via POC (if COMPLEXITY-MEDIUM or higher)\n- [ ] No open questions requiring [ACTOR] decision\n- [ ] For BUILD: SPEC, IMPL, TEST documents created\n- [ ] For BUILD: TASKS document created via [PARTITION]\n- [ ] For SOLVE: Structure/criteria validated\n\n### IMPLEMENT → REFINE\n\n- [ ] Core work complete (code written / document drafted)\n- [ ] For BUILD: Tests pass\n- [ ] For BUILD: No TODO/FIXME left unaddressed\n- [ ] For SOLVE: All sections drafted\n- [ ] Progress committed/saved\n\n### REFINE → DELIVER\n\n- [ ] Self-review complete\n- [ ] Verification against spec/rules passed\n- [ ] For BUILD COMPLEXITY-MEDIUM+: Critique and reconcile complete\n- [ ] For SOLVE: Claims verified, arguments strengthened\n- [ ] All found issues fixed\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n### BUILD (COMPLEXITY-HIGH)\n\n```\n[EXPLORE] → [RESEARCH] → [ANALYZE] → [ASSESS] → [SCOPE] → Gate\n[DESIGN]  → [PLAN] → [WRITE-SPEC] → [WRITE-IMPL-PLAN] → [PROVE] → [PARTITION] → Gate\n[IMPLEMENT] → [IMPLEMENT] → [TEST] → [FIX] → [COMMIT] → Gate (loop until green)\n[REFINE] → [REVIEW] → [VERIFY] → [CRITIQUE] → [RECONCILE] → Gate\n[DELIVER] → [VALIDATE] → [MERGE] → [CLOSE] → [ARCHIVE]\n```\n\n### SOLVE (EVALUATION)\n\n```\n[EXPLORE] → [RESEARCH] → [ANALYZE] → [ASSESS] → EVALUATION → Gate\n[DESIGN]  → [FRAME] → [OUTLINE] criteria → [DEFINE] framework → Gate\n[IMPLEMENT] → [RESEARCH] options → [EVALUATE] → [SYNTHESIZE] → Gate\n[REFINE] → [CRITIQUE] → [VERIFY] claims → [IMPROVE] → Gate\n[DELIVER] → [CONCLUDE] → [RECOMMEND] → [VALIDATE] → [ARCHIVE]\n```\n\n**Note:** COMPLEXITY-LOW skips [PROVE], [CRITIQUE], [RECONCILE].\n\n## Phase Plan Requirements\n\nPlans created via [PLAN] must define:\n- **Objectives** - What success looks like\n- **Strategy** - How to achieve objectives\n- **Deliverables** - Concrete outputs with checkboxes\n- **Transitions** - When to move to next phase\n\n**Planning Horizon:**\n```\n[EXPLORE]   ← Plan now\n[DESIGN]    ← Plan now\n[IMPLEMENT] ← TBD (after DESIGN gate)\n[REFINE]    ← TBD (after IMPLEMENT gate)\n[DELIVER]   ← Plan now (shipping tasks from NOTES)\n```\n\n## How to Plan Well\n\n### Goal Decomposition\n\n1. **Start with outcome** - What does \"done\" look like?\n2. **Identify dependencies** - What must complete before what?\n3. **Find parallel opportunities** - What can run concurrently?\n4. **Size steps for testability** - Each step should be verifiable\n\n### Scope Calibration\n\n- **Too big**: Step takes >30min AWT or touches >3 files → decompose further\n- **Too small**: Step takes <2min AWT → combine with adjacent step\n- **Right size**: Verifiable outcome, clear done criteria, single responsibility\n\n### Dependency Mapping\n\nAsk for each step:\n- What inputs do I need? (determines predecessors)\n- What outputs do I produce? (determines successors)\n- Can this run while something else runs? (candidate for Concurrent block)\n\n### Common Planning Mistakes\n\n- **Vague objectives**: \"Make it work\" → Define specific success criteria\n- **Missing dependencies**: Steps that assume prior work → Explicit `← Px-Sy`\n- **Over-sequencing**: All steps linear when some could parallelize\n- **Under-estimating**: No AWT in Strategy → Add time budget\n- **Skipping verification**: No test step after implement → Add [TEST] or [VERIFY]\n\n## Next Action Logic\n\n1. **Check phase gate** → Pass? → Next phase, first verb\n2. **Gate fails?** → Execute verb that addresses unchecked item\n3. **Verb outcome:** -OK → next verb | -FAIL → handle | -SKIP → next verb\n4. **No more verbs?** → Re-evaluate gate\n5. **[DELIVER] done?** → [CLOSE] and [ARCHIVE] if session-based\n\n**Common failure handlers:**\n- -FAIL on [RESEARCH], [ASSESS], [PLAN] → [CONSULT] or more [RESEARCH]\n- -FAIL on [TEST], [VERIFY] → [FIX] → retry\n\n## Effort Allocation\n\n### Time Units\n\n- **AWT** (Agentic Work Time) - Agent processing time, excludes user wait\n- **HHW** (Human-Hour Work) - Human equivalent effort for task sizing\n\n### Phase Budgets by Complexity\n\n| Phase | LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH |\n|-------|-----|--------|------|\n| EXPLORE | 5min | 15min | 30min |\n| DESIGN | 5min | 30min | 60min |\n| IMPLEMENT | varies | varies | varies |\n| REFINE | 5min | 15min | 30min |\n| DELIVER | 2min | 5min | 10min |\n\nValues are AWT guidelines, not hard limits.\n\n### Diminishing Returns\n\n- Phase takes 2x budget without gate progress → [CONSULT]\n- Same step retried 3x without improvement → [CONSULT]\n- Research yields no new information after 3 sources → move on\n\n### Retry Limits\n\n- **COMPLEXITY-LOW**: Infinite retries (until user stops)\n- **COMPLEXITY-MEDIUM/HIGH**: Max 5 attempts per phase, then [CONSULT]\n\n## Mandatory Gate Output\n\nBefore proceeding to next phase, output:\n\n```markdown\n## Gate: [CURRENT_PHASE] → [NEXT_PHASE]\n\n**Complexity**: [LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH] | **Artifacts**: [list created docs]\n\n- [x] Item - Evidence: [specific evidence]\n- [ ] Item - BLOCKED: [what''s missing]\n\n**Gate status**: PASS | FAIL\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:53:03.285Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Azure-focused AI Agents needing advanced SharePoint content crawling and OpenAI Vector Store integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 SharePoint 内容爬取和 OpenAI Vector Store 集成的 Azure 专注 AI 代理。","ja":"Azure に焦点を当てた AI エージェントが、SharePoint コンテンツのクロールと OpenAI Vector Store の統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Azure에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 고급 SharePoint 콘텐츠 크롤링 및 OpenAI Vector Store 통합을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA con enfoque en Azure que necesitan un rastreo avanzado de contenido de SharePoint y una integración con OpenAI Vector Store.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur Azure nécessitant un crawl de contenu SharePoint avancé et une intégration avec OpenAI Vector Store.","de":"Perfekt für Azure-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte SharePoint-Inhaltsdurchsuchung und eine OpenAI-Vektor-Speicher-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados no Azure que necessitam de crawl de conteúdo avançado do SharePoint e integração com o OpenAI Vector Store.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Azure, которым необходим продвинутый поиск содержимого SharePoint и интеграция с хранилищем векторов OpenAI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي ذوي التركيز على أزور الذين يحتاجون إلى زحف محتوى متقدم من شير بوينت وتكامل مع مخزن المتجهات من أوبن أيه آي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to crawl SharePoint sites and integrate content into OpenAI Vector Stores using Python, enabling efficient data retrieval and analysis for high-level planning phases like EXPLORE, DESIGN, and IMPLEMENT.","zh":"赋予代理在 Python 中爬取 SharePoint 站点并将内容集成到 OpenAI Vector Stores 中的能力，从而实现高级规划阶段（如 EXPLORE、DESIGN 和 IMPLEMENT）中的数据检索和分析。","ja":"エージェントが Python で SharePoint サイトをクロールし、コンテンツを OpenAI Vector Stores に統合する能力を付与し、EXPLORE、DESIGN、IMPLEMENT などの高レベルな計画段階でのデータの取得と分析を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Python에서 SharePoint 사이트를 크롤링하고 콘텐츠를 OpenAI Vector Stores에 통합하여 EXPLORE, DESIGN, IMPLEMENTなどの 고급 계획 단계에서 데이터 검색 및 분석을 효율적으로 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a rastrear sitios de SharePoint e integrar contenido en tiendas de vectores de OpenAI utilizando Python, lo que permite una recuperación y análisis de datos eficientes para fases de planificación de alto nivel como EXPLORE, DESIGN e IMPLEMENT.","fr":"Permet aux agents de crawler des sites SharePoint et d''intégrer du contenu dans les magasins de vecteurs OpenAI à l''aide de Python, ce qui permet une récupération et une analyse de données efficaces pour les phases de planification de haut niveau comme EXPLORE, DESIGN et IMPLEMENT.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, SharePoint-Seiten zu durchsuchen und Inhalte in OpenAI-Vektor-Speicher mithilfe von Python zu integrieren, was eine effiziente Datenrückgewinnung und -analyse für Hochstufungsplanungsphasen wie EXPLORE, DESIGN und IMPLEMENT ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a crawl de sites do SharePoint e integrar o conteúdo em lojas de vetores OpenAI usando Python, permitindo a recuperação e análise de dados eficientes para fases de planejamento de alto nível como EXPLORE, DESIGN e IMPLEMENT.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ползать по сайтам SharePoint и интегрировать содержимое в хранилища векторов OpenAI с помощью Python, обеспечивая эффективное получение и анализ данных для высокоуровневых фаз планирования, таких как EXPLORE, DESIGN и IMPLEMENT.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بالزحف إلى مواقع شير بوينت وتكامل المحتوى في مخازن المتجهات أوبن أيه آي باستخدام بايثون، مما يتيح استرجاع البيانات وتحليلها بكفاءة لفаз التخطيط العالي المستوى مثل استكشاف وتصميم وتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SharePoint content ingestion for knowledge graph construction","Generating high-level plans for long agentic runs using OpenAI Vector Stores","Refining plans through iterative content analysis and vector store updates"],"zh":["自动化 SharePoint 内容摄取以构建知识图","使用 OpenAI Vector Stores 生成长期代理运行的高级计划","通过迭代内容分析和向量存储更新来细化计划"],"ja":["ナレッジ グラフの構築のための SharePoint コンテンツのインジェストを自動化する","OpenAI Vector Stores を使用して長期のエージェント実行のための高レベルの計画を生成する","イテレーティブなコンテンツ分析とベクトル ストアの更新を通じて計画を洗練する"],"ko":["지식 그래프 구성을 위한 SharePoint 콘텐츠 摄取 자동화","OpenAI Vector Stores를 사용하여 장기 에이전트 실행을 위한 고급 계획 생성","반복적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 벡터 저장소 업데이트를 통해 계획을 세부화"],"es":["Automatización de la ingesta de contenido de SharePoint para la construcción de gráficos de conocimiento","Generación de planes de alto nivel para ejecuciones de agentes largas utilizando tiendas de vectores de OpenAI","Perfeccionamiento de planes a través de análisis de contenido iterativo y actualizaciones de la tienda de vectores"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''ingestion de contenu SharePoint pour la construction de graphiques de connaissances","Génération de plans de haut niveau pour des exécutions d''agents longues à l''aide de magasins de vecteurs OpenAI","Affinement de plans grâce à l''analyse de contenu itérative et à la mise à jour du magasin de vecteurs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Inhaltsaufnahme von SharePoint für den Aufbau von Wissensgraphen","Erstellung von Hochstufungsplänen für lange Agentenläufe unter Verwendung von OpenAI-Vektor-Speichern","Verfeinerung von Plänen durch iterative Inhaltsanalyse und Vektor-Speicher-Aktualisierungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a ingestão de conteúdo do SharePoint para a construção de grafos de conhecimento","Gerar planos de alto nível para execuções de agentes de longo prazo usando lojas de vetores OpenAI","Aperfeiçoar planos por meio de análise de conteúdo iterativa e atualizações de loja de vetores"],"ru":["Автоматизировать прием содержимого SharePoint для построения графов знаний","Генерировать высокоуровневые планы для длительных запусков агентов с помощью хранилищ векторов OpenAI","Уточнять планы посредством итеративного анализа содержимого и обновлений хранилища векторов"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لاستيعاب محتوى شير بوينت لبناء رسوم بيانية للمعرفة","توليد خطط عالية المستوى لتشغيل الوكلاء لمدة طويلة باستخدام مخازن المتجهات أوبن أيه آي","تحسين الخطط من خلال تحليل المحتوى التكراري وتحديثات مخزن المتجهات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure Web App setup","Limited to Python environment","Not intended for document writing tasks"],"zh":["需要 Azure Web 应用程序设置","仅限 Python 环境","不适用于文档编写任务"],"ja":["Azure Web アプリの設定が必要","Python 環境のみ","ドキュメントの作成タスクには使用しないでください"],"ko":["Azure Web 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","Python 환경만 해당","문서 작성 작업에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Azure Web App","Limitado al entorno de Python","No está destinado a tareas de escritura de documentos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Web Azure","Limité à l''environnement Python","N''est pas destiné aux tâches d''écriture de documents"],"de":["Erfordert Azure-Web-App-Setup","Begrenzt auf Python-Umgebung","Nicht für Dokumentschreibaufgaben vorgesehen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Azure Web App","Limitado ao ambiente Python","Não destinado a tarefas de escrita de documentos"],"ru":["Требует настройки веб-приложения Azure","Ограничен средой Python","Не предназначен для задач написания документов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق ويب أزور","محدود بالبيئة بايثون","لا يُقصد لمهام كتابة الوثائق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
