para impulsionar a conversão","Dicas para melhorar a escrita de marketing","Análise de caso de sucesso em copywriting","Ferramentas para otimizar o copywriting"],"ru":["Техники написания для конверсии","Создание rõкого и привлекательного маркетингового контента","Стратегии для стимулирования конверсии","Советы для улучшения маркетингового письма","Анализ кейса успешного копирайтинга","Инструменты для оптимизации копирайтинга"],"ar":["تقنيات الكتابة للتحويل","إنشاء محتوى تسويقي واضح وجذاب","استراتيجيات لزيادة التحويل","نصائح لتحسين كتابة التسويق","تحليل حالة نجاح في كتابة المحتوى","أدوات لتحسين كتابة المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技术文案写作","转化率优化","营销文案","页面目的","产品营销背景","驱动用户行动"],"ja":["コンベージョンコピー","コンバージョン率最適化","マーケティングコピー","ページ目的","製品マーケティング背景","ユーザー行動を促す"],"ko":["컨버전스 카피라이팅","컨버전스율 최적화","마케팅 카피","페이지 목적","제품 마케팅 배경","사용자 행동 유도"],"es":["copywriting para desarrolladores","técnicas de copywriting","marketing de contenido","optimización de copy","análisis de audiencia","llamadas a la acción"],"fr":["copywriting pour les développeurs","techniques de copywriting","marketing de contenu","optimisation de copy","analyse de l''audience","appels à l''action"],"de":["Copywriting für Entwickler","Copywriting-Techniken","Inhaltsmarketing","Copy-Optimierung","Zielgruppenanalyse","Calls-to-Action"],"pt":["copywriting","redação para conversão","conteúdo de marketing","escrita de marketing","técnicas de copywriting","estratégias de marketing","otimização de copywriting","ferramentas de copywriting","curso de copywriting","treinamento de copywriting"],"ru":["копирайтинг","написание для конверсии","маркетинговый контент","маркетинговое письмо","техники копирайтинга","стратегии маркетинга","оптимизация копирайтинга","инструменты копирайтинга","курс копирайтинга","тренинг копирайтинга"],"ar":["كتابة المحتوى","كتابة للتحويل","محتوى تسويقي","كتابة تسويقي","تقنيات كتابة المحتوى","استراتيجيات تسويقية","تحسين كتابة المحتوى","أدوات كتابة المحتوى","دورة كتابة المحتوى","تدريب كتابة المحتوى"]}},"owner":"eKoh951","repo":"hytale-gg","repoPath":"eKoh951/hytale-gg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":"When the user wants to write, rewrite, or improve marketing copy for any page — including homepage, landing pages, pricing pages, feature pages, about pages, or product pages. Also use when the user says write copy for, improve this copy, rewrite this page, marketing copy, headline help, or CTA copy. For email copy, see email-sequence. For popup copy, see popup-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page? (homepage, landing page, pricing,","body":"# Copywriting\n\nYou are an expert conversion copywriter. Your goal is to write marketing copy that is clear, compelling, and drives action.\n\n## Before Writing\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Page Purpose\n- What type of page? (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- What is the ONE primary action you want visitors to take?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What problem are they trying to solve?\n- What objections or hesitations do they have?\n- What language do they use to describe their problem?\n\n### 3. Product/Offer\n- What are you selling or offering?\n- What makes it different from alternatives?\n- What''s the key transformation or outcome?\n- Any proof points (numbers, testimonials, case studies)?\n\n### 4. Context\n- Where is traffic coming from? (ads, organic, email)\n- What do visitors already know before arriving?\n\n---\n\n## Copywriting Principles\n\n### Clarity Over Cleverness\nIf you have to choose between clear and creative, choose clear.\n\n### Benefits Over Features\nFeatures: What it does. Benefits: What that means for the customer.\n\n### Specificity Over Vagueness\n- Vague: \"Save time on your workflow\"\n- Specific: \"Cut your weekly reporting from 4 hours to 15 minutes\"\n\n### Customer Language Over Company Language\nUse words your customers use. Mirror voice-of-customer from reviews, interviews, support tickets.\n\n### One Idea Per Section\nEach section should advance one argument. Build a logical flow down the page.\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\n### Core Principles\n\n1. **Simple over complex** — \"Use\" not \"utilize,\" \"help\" not \"facilitate\"\n2. **Specific over vague** — Avoid \"streamline,\" \"optimize,\" \"innovative\"\n3. **Active over passive** — \"We generate reports\" not \"Reports are generated\"\n4. **Confident over qualified** — Remove \"almost,\" \"very,\" \"really\"\n5. **Show over tell** — Describe the outcome instead of using adverbs\n6. **Honest over sensational** — Never fabricate statistics or testimonials\n\n### Quick Quality Check\n\n- Jargon that could confuse outsiders?\n- Sentences trying to do too much?\n- Passive voice constructions?\n- Exclamation points? (remove them)\n- Marketing buzzwords without substance?\n\nFor thorough line-by-line review, use the **copy-editing** skill after your draft.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Direct\nGet to the point. Don''t bury the value in qualifications.\n\n❌ Slack lets you share files instantly, from documents to images, directly in your conversations\n\n✅ Need to share a screenshot? Send as many documents, images, and audio files as your heart desires.\n\n### Use Rhetorical Questions\nQuestions engage readers and make them think about their own situation.\n- \"Hate returning stuff to Amazon?\"\n- \"Tired of chasing approvals?\"\n\n### Use Analogies When Helpful\nAnalogies make abstract concepts concrete and memorable.\n\n### Pepper in Humor (When Appropriate)\nPuns and wit make copy memorable—but only if it fits the brand and doesn''t undermine clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold\n\n**Headline**\n- Your single most important message\n- Communicate core value proposition\n- Specific > generic\n\n**Example formulas:**\n- \"{Achieve outcome} without {pain point}\"\n- \"The {category} for {audience}\"\n- \"Never {unpleasant event} again\"\n- \"{Question highlighting main pain point}\"\n\n**For comprehensive headline formulas**: See [references/copy-frameworks.md](references/copy-frameworks.md)\n\n**For natural transition phrases**: See [references/natural-transitions.md](references/natural-transitions.md)\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Expands on headline\n- Adds specificity\n- 1-2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented button text\n- Communicate what they get: \"Start Free Trial\" > \"Sign Up\"\n\n### Core Sections\n\n| Section | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Social Proof | Build credibility (logos, stats, testimonials) |\n| Problem/Pain | Show you understand their situation |\n| Solution/Benefits | Connect to outcomes (3-5 key benefits) |\n| How It Works | Reduce perceived complexity (3-4 steps) |\n| Objection Handling | FAQ, comparisons, guarantees |\n| Final CTA | Recap value, repeat CTA, risk reversal |\n\n**For detailed section types and page templates**: See [references/copy-frameworks.md](references/copy-frameworks.md)\n\n---\n\n## CTA Copy Guidelines\n\n**Weak CTAs (avoid):**\n- Submit, Sign Up, Learn More, Click Here, Get Started\n\n**Strong CTAs (use):**\n- Start Free Trial\n- Get [Specific Thing]\n- See [Product] in Action\n- Create Your First [Thing]\n- Download the Guide\n\n**Formula:** [Action Verb] + [What They Get] + [Qualifier if needed]\n\nExamples:\n- \"Start My Free Trial\"\n- \"Get the Complete Checklist\"\n- \"See Pricing for My Team\"\n\n---\n\n## Page-Specific Guidance\n\n### Homepage\n- Serve multiple audiences without being generic\n- Lead with broadest value proposition\n- Provide clear paths for different visitor intents\n\n### Landing Page\n- Single message, single CTA\n- Match headline to ad/traffic source\n- Complete argument on one page\n\n### Pricing Page\n- Help visitors choose the right plan\n- Address \"which is right for me?\" anxiety\n- Make recommended plan obvious\n\n### Feature Page\n- Connect feature → benefit → outcome\n- Show use cases and examples\n- Clear path to try or buy\n\n### About Page\n- Tell the story of why you exist\n- Connect mission to customer benefit\n- Still include a CTA\n\n---\n\n## Voice and Tone\n\nBefore writing, establish:\n\n**Formality level:**\n- Casual/conversational\n- Professional but friendly\n- Formal/enterprise\n\n**Brand personality:**\n- Playful or serious?\n- Bold or understated?\n- Technical or accessible?\n\nMaintain consistency, but adjust intensity:\n- Headlines can be bolder\n- Body copy should be clearer\n- CTAs should be action-oriented\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section:\n- Headline, Subheadline, CTA\n- Section headers and body copy\n- Secondary CTAs\n\n### Annotations\nFor key elements, explain:\n- Why you made this choice\n- What principle it applies\n\n### Alternatives\nFor headlines and CTAs, provide 2-3 options:\n- Option A: [copy] — [rationale]\n- Option B: [copy] — [rationale]\n\n### Meta Content (if relevant)\n- Page title (for SEO)\n- Meta description\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copy-editing**: For polishing existing copy (use after your draft)\n- **page-cro**: If page structure/strategy needs work, not just copy\n- **email-sequence**: For email copywriting\n- **popup-cro**: For popup and modal copy\n- **ab-test-setup**: To test copy variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:53:36.512Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing persuasive marketing content creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要具有说服性营销内容创建能力的语言代理。","ja":"説得力のあるマーケティングコンテンツ作成能力が必要な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"설득력 있는 마케팅 콘텐츠 생성 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de creación de contenido de marketing persuasivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langue ayant besoin de capacités de création de contenu de marketing persuasif.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die überzeugende Marketing-Inhalte erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades de criação de conteúdo de marketing persuasivo.","ru":"Идеально для языковых агентов, которым необходимы возможности создания убедительного маркетингового контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إنشاء محتوى تسويقي مقنع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling marketing copy using product marketing context, driving conversions with clear and actionable language, and leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed content creation.","zh":"赋予代理人使用产品营销背景制作引人入胜的营销文案的能力，使用清晰和可行的语言驱动转化，并利用类似 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的文件进行信息丰富的内容创建。","ja":"製品マーケティングのコンテキストを使用して説得力のあるマーケティングコピーを作成する機能をエージェントに与え、明確で実行可能な言語を使用してコンバージョンを推進し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のようなファイルを利用して情報に基づいたコンテンツを作成します。","ko":"제품 마케팅 맥락을 사용하여 설득력 있는 마케팅 사본을 작성할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 명확하고 실행 가능한 언어를 사용하여 전환을 유도하고, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 정보에 기반한 콘텐츠를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear copias de marketing convincentes utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, impulsando las conversiones con un lenguaje claro y accionable, y aprovechando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para una creación de contenido informada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des copies de marketing convaincantes en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, en stimulant les conversions avec un langage clair et opérationnel, et en exploitant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour une création de contenu éclairée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Marketing-Kopien zu erstellen, indem sie den Produkt-Marketing-Kontext nutzen, Umwandlungen mit klarer und handlungsorientierter Sprache vorantreiben und Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für eine informierte Inhaltsbildung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar cópias de marketing convincentes usando o contexto de marketing de produtos, impulsionando conversões com linguagem clara e ação, e utilizando arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para criação de conteúdo informada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать убедительный маркетинговый текст, используя контекст продукта, стимулируя конверсии с помощью ясного и действенного языка, и используя файлы, такие как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, для информированного создания контента.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من创ación копي تسويقي مقنع باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج، و驱动 التحويلات مع لغة واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ، واستخدام الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لإنشاء محتوى محدث."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating landing page content","Writing persuasive homepage headlines","Creating pricing page descriptions that drive sales"],"zh":["生成着陆页内容","撰写说服性首页标题","创建能够促进销售的定价页描述"],"ja":["ランディングページのコンテンツを生成する","説得力のあるホームページのタイトルを書く","販売を促進する価格ページの説明を作成する"],"ko":["랜딩 페이지 콘텐츠 생성","설득력 있는 홈페이지 제목 작성","판매를 유도하는 가격 페이지 설명 생성"],"es":["Generar contenido de página de aterrizaje","Escribir títulos de página de inicio persuasivos","Crear descripciones de página de precios que impulsan las ventas"],"fr":["Générer du contenu de page d''atterrissage","Écrire des titres de page d''accueil persuasifs","Créer des descriptions de page de tarification qui stimulent les ventes"],"de":["Erstellen von Inhalten für die Landeseite","Schreiben von überzeugenden Startseitentiteln","Erstellen von Beschreibungen der Preisseite, die den Verkauf vorantreiben"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo de página de destino","Escrita de títulos de página inicial persuasivos","Criação de descrições de página de preços que impulsionam as vendas"],"ru":["Генерация контента для целевой страницы","Написание убедительных заголовков для главной страницы","Создание описаний страницы цен, которые стимулируют продажи"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى صفحة الوجهة","كتابة عناوين الصفحة الرئيسية المقنعة","إنشاء описания صفحة الأسعار التي تدفع المبيعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context information","Limited to text-based content creation"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景信息","仅限于基于文本的内容创建"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキスト情報が必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ作成のみ"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 맥락 정보가 필요","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere información de contexto de marketing de productos","Limitado a la creación de contenido basado en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations de contexte de marketing de produits","Limité à la création de contenu basé sur du texte"],"de":["Benötigt Produkt-Marketing-Kontextinformationen","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von textbasiertem Inhalt"],"pt":["Requer informações de contexto de marketing de produtos","Limitado à criação de conteúdo baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует информации о контексте продукта","Ограничен созданием контента на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب معلومات حول سياق تسويق المنتج","محدود بإنشاء المحتوى القائم على النص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('coleam00/obsidian-voice-agent/agent-browser', 'community', 'coleam00', 'obsidian-voice-agent', 'coleam00/obsidian-voice-agent', 'agent-browser', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z', '2026-02-18T12:53:29.503Z', NULL, '{"id":"coleam00/obsidian-voice-agent/agent-browser","name":"agent-browser","description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一种浏览器自动化工具，支持打开网页、截图、点击元素、填充表单等功能","ja":"agent-browserはブラウザ自動化ツールで、ページを開く、スクリーンショットを撮る、要素をクリックする、フォームを埋めるなどができます","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 페이지 열기, 스크린샷, 요소 클릭, 폼 채우기 등이 가능합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite navegar, capturar elementos y realizar acciones.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet de naviguer, capturer des éléments et effectuer des actions.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht das Navigieren, Erfassen von Elementen und Ausführen von Aktionen.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta para automatizar tarefas de navegação. Abra páginas, capture elementos e execute ações.","ru":"Agent-browser — это инструмент для автоматизации задач навигации. Открывайте страницы, захватывайте элементы и выполняйте действия.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة لتلقيم مهام الملاحة. افتح الصفحات، اقطع العناصر وتنفيذ الإجراءات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"agent-browser自动化浏览器","ja":"agent-browserブラウザ自動化","ko":"agent-browser 브라우저 자동화","es":"Automatización de navegador con agent-browser","fr":"Automation de navigateur avec agent-browser","de":"Browser-Automatisierung mit agent-browser","pt":"Automatize Navegação com agent-browser","ru":"Автоматизируйте навигацию с agent-browser","ar":"أتمتة الملاحة مع agent-browser","en":"agent-browser"},"description":{"zh":"agent-browser是一种浏览器自动化工具，支持打开网页、截图、点击元素、填充表单等功能","ja":"agent-browserはブラウザ自動化ツールで、ページを開く、スクリーンショットを撮る、要素をクリックする、フォームを埋めるなどができます","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 페이지 열기, 스크린샷, 요소 클릭, 폼 채우기 등이 가능합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite navegar, capturar elementos y realizar acciones.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet de naviguer, capturer des éléments et effectuer des actions.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht das Navigieren, Erfassen von Elementen und Ausführen von Aktionen.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta para automatizar tarefas de navegação. Abra páginas, capture elementos e execute ações.","ru":"Agent-browser — это инструмент для автоматизации задач навигации. Открывайте страницы, захватывайте элементы и выполняйте действия.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة لتلقيم مهام الملاحة. افتح الصفحات، اقطع العناصر وتنفيذ الإجراءات.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["打开网页","截图","点击元素","填充表单","关闭浏览器"],"ja":["ページを開く","スクリーンショットを撮る","要素をクリックする","フォームを埋める","ブラウザを閉じる"],"ko":["페이지 열기","스크린샷","요소 클릭","폼 채우기","브라우저 닫기"],"es":["Navegación a URLs personalizadas","Captura de elementos interactivos","Simulación de clics y acciones","Relleno de formularios","Cierre del navegador"],"fr":["Navigation vers des URL personnalisées","Capture d''éléments interactifs","Simulation de clics et d''actions","Remplissage de formulaires","Fermeture du navigateur"],"de":["Navigation zu benutzerdefinierten URLs","Erfassung von interaktiven Elementen","Simulierung von Klicks und Aktionen","Ausfüllen von Formularen","Schließen des Browsers"],"pt":["Abra páginas com facilidade","Capture elementos interativos","Execute ações em elementos","Feche o navegador quando necessário","Obtenha referências para elementos","Interaja com elementos de forma programática"],"ru":["Открывайте страницы с легкостью","Захватывайте интерактивные элементы","Выполняйте действия над элементами","Закрывайте браузер когда необходимо","Получайте ссылки на элементы","Взаимодействуйте с элементами программно"],"ar":["افتح الصفحات بسهولة","اقطع العناصر التفاعلية","نفذ إجراءات على العناصر","أغلق المتصفح عند الحاجة","احصل على مراجع للعناصر","تفاعل مع العناصر ببرمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","agent-browser","自动化测试","网页自动化","开发工具","自动化脚本"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","自動テスト","ページ自動化","開発ツール","自動化スクリプト"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","자동화 테스트","페이지 자동화","개발 도구","자동화 스크립트"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","navegación web","captura de elementos","simulación de acciones","relleno de formularios","desarrollo web","herramientas de automatización"],"fr":["automation de navigateur","agent-browser","navigation web","capture d''éléments","simulation d''actions","remplissage de formulaires","développement web","outils d''automation"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","agent-browser","Web-Navigation","Erfassung von Elementen","Simulierung von Aktionen","Ausfüllen von Formularen","Web-Entwicklung","Automatisierungstools"],"pt":["automação de navegação","agent-browser","navegação programática","captura de elementos","execução de ações","fechamento de navegador","referências de elementos","interação programática"],"ru":["автоматизация навигации","agent-browser","программная навигация","захват элементов","выполнение действий","закрытие браузера","ссылки на элементы","программное взаимодействие"],"ar":["تلقيم الملاحة","agent-browser","ملاحة برمجية","التقط العناصر","تنفيذ الإجراءات","إغلاق المتصفح","مراجع للعناصر","التفاعل البرمجي"]}},"owner":"coleam00","repo":"obsidian-voice-agent","repoPath":"coleam00/obsidian-voice-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\r\n\r\n## Quick start\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\r\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\r\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\r\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Core workflow\r\n\r\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\r\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\r\n\r\n## Quick start\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\r\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\r\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\r\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Core workflow\r\n\r\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\r\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\r\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\r\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\r\n\r\n## Commands\r\n\r\n### Navigation\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser open <url>      # Navigate to URL\r\nagent-browser back            # Go back\r\nagent-browser forward         # Go forward\r\nagent-browser reload          # Reload page\r\nagent-browser close           # Close browser\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Snapshot (page analysis)\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser snapshot            # Full accessibility tree\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i         # Interactive elements only (recommended)\r\nagent-browser snapshot -c         # Compact output\r\nagent-browser snapshot -d 3       # Limit depth to 3\r\nagent-browser snapshot -s \"#main\" # Scope to CSS selector\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Interactions (use @refs from snapshot)\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser click @e1           # Click\r\nagent-browser dblclick @e1        # Double-click\r\nagent-browser focus @e1           # Focus element\r\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"     # Clear and type\r\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"     # Type without clearing\r\nagent-browser press Enter         # Press key\r\nagent-browser press Control+a     # Key combination\r\nagent-browser keydown Shift       # Hold key down\r\nagent-browser keyup Shift         # Release key\r\nagent-browser hover @e1           # Hover\r\nagent-browser check @e1           # Check checkbox\r\nagent-browser uncheck @e1         # Uncheck checkbox\r\nagent-browser select @e1 \"value\"  # Select dropdown\r\nagent-browser scroll down 500     # Scroll page\r\nagent-browser scrollintoview @e1  # Scroll element into view\r\nagent-browser drag @e1 @e2        # Drag and drop\r\nagent-browser upload @e1 file.pdf # Upload files\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Get information\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser get text @e1        # Get element text\r\nagent-browser get html @e1        # Get innerHTML\r\nagent-browser get value @e1       # Get input value\r\nagent-browser get attr @e1 href   # Get attribute\r\nagent-browser get title           # Get page title\r\nagent-browser get url             # Get current URL\r\nagent-browser get count \".item\"   # Count matching elements\r\nagent-browser get box @e1         # Get bounding box\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Check state\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser is visible @e1      # Check if visible\r\nagent-browser is enabled @e1      # Check if enabled\r\nagent-browser is checked @e1      # Check if checked\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Screenshots & PDF\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser screenshot          # Screenshot to stdout\r\nagent-browser screenshot path.png # Save to file\r\nagent-browser screenshot --full   # Full page\r\nagent-browser pdf output.pdf      # Save as PDF\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Video recording\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser record start ./demo.webm    # Start recording (uses current URL + state)\r\nagent-browser click @e1                   # Perform actions\r\nagent-browser record stop                 # Stop and save video\r\nagent-browser record restart ./take2.webm # Stop current + start new recording\r\n```\r\nRecording creates a fresh context but preserves cookies/storage from your session. If no URL is provided, it automatically returns to your current page. For smooth demos, explore first, then start recording.\r\n\r\n### Wait\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser wait @e1                     # Wait for element\r\nagent-browser wait 2000                    # Wait milliseconds\r\nagent-browser wait --text \"Success\"        # Wait for text\r\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"    # Wait for URL pattern\r\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle      # Wait for network idle\r\nagent-browser wait --fn \"window.ready\"     # Wait for JS condition\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Mouse control\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser mouse move 100 200      # Move mouse\r\nagent-browser mouse down left         # Press button\r\nagent-browser mouse up left           # Release button\r\nagent-browser mouse wheel 100         # Scroll wheel\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Semantic locators (alternative to refs)\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\r\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\r\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\r\nagent-browser find first \".item\" click\r\nagent-browser find nth 2 \"a\" text\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Browser settings\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser set viewport 1920 1080      # Set viewport size\r\nagent-browser set device \"iPhone 14\"      # Emulate device\r\nagent-browser set geo 37.7749 -122.4194   # Set geolocation\r\nagent-browser set offline on              # Toggle offline mode\r\nagent-browser set headers ''{\"X-Key\":\"v\"}'' # Extra HTTP headers\r\nagent-browser set credentials user pass   # HTTP basic auth\r\nagent-browser set media dark              # Emulate color scheme\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Cookies & Storage\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser cookies                     # Get all cookies\r\nagent-browser cookies set name value      # Set cookie\r\nagent-browser cookies clear               # Clear cookies\r\nagent-browser storage local               # Get all localStorage\r\nagent-browser storage local key           # Get specific key\r\nagent-browser storage local set k v       # Set value\r\nagent-browser storage local clear         # Clear all\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Network\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser network route <url>              # Intercept requests\r\nagent-browser network route <url> --abort      # Block requests\r\nagent-browser network route <url> --body ''{}''  # Mock response\r\nagent-browser network unroute [url]            # Remove routes\r\nagent-browser network requests                 # View tracked requests\r\nagent-browser network requests --filter api    # Filter requests\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Tabs & Windows\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser tab                 # List tabs\r\nagent-browser tab new [url]       # New tab\r\nagent-browser tab 2               # Switch to tab\r\nagent-browser tab close           # Close tab\r\nagent-browser window new          # New window\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Frames\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser frame \"#iframe\"     # Switch to iframe\r\nagent-browser frame main          # Back to main frame\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Dialogs\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser dialog accept [text]  # Accept dialog\r\nagent-browser dialog dismiss        # Dismiss dialog\r\n```\r\n\r\n### JavaScript\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser eval \"document.title\"   # Run JavaScript\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Example: Form submission\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i\r\n# Output shows: textbox \"Email\" [ref=e1], textbox \"Password\" [ref=e2], button \"Submit\" [ref=e3]\r\n\r\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\r\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\r\nagent-browser click @e3\r\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Example: Authentication with saved state\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Login once\r\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i\r\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"username\"\r\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password\"\r\nagent-browser click @e3\r\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\r\nagent-browser state save auth.json\r\n\r\n# Later sessions: load saved state\r\nagent-browser state load auth.json\r\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Sessions (parallel browsers)\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser --session test1 open site-a.com\r\nagent-browser --session test2 open site-b.com\r\nagent-browser session list\r\n```\r\n\r\n## JSON output (for parsing)\r\n\r\nAdd `--json` for machine-readable output:\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\r\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Debugging\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nagent-browser open example.com --headed              # Show browser window\r\nagent-browser console                                # View console messages\r\nagent-browser errors                                 # View page errors\r\nagent-browser record start ./debug.webm   # Record from current page\r\nagent-browser record stop                            # Save recording\r\nagent-browser open example.com --headed  # Show browser window\r\nagent-browser --cdp 9222 snapshot        # Connect via CDP\r\nagent-browser console                    # View console messages\r\nagent-browser console --clear            # Clear console\r\nagent-browser errors                     # View page errors\r\nagent-browser errors --clear             # Clear errors\r\nagent-browser highlight @e1              # Highlight element\r\nagent-browser trace start                # Start recording trace\r\nagent-browser trace stop trace.zip       # Stop and save trace\r\n```"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:53:29.503Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Automation Agents needing direct browser interaction and element manipulation.","zh":"非常适合需要直接浏览器交互和元素操作的Web自动化代理。","ja":"Web自動化エージェントが直接のブラウザのやりとりと要素操作を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"직접 브라우저 상호 작용 및 요소 조작이 필요한 웹 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización Web que necesitan interacción directa con el navegador y manipulación de elementos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automation Web nécessitant une interaction directe avec le navigateur et une manipulation d''éléments.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine direkte Browserinteraktion und Elementmanipulation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação Web que precisam de interação direta com o navegador e manipulação de elementos.","ru":"Идеально для веб-агентов, автоматизации, требующих прямого взаимодействия с браузером и манипуляций с элементами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز التلقائي على الويب الذي يحتاج إلى تفاعل مباشر مع المتصفح وتنفيذ عناصر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct browser control through CLI commands, providing element reference tracking (@e1, @e2) for precise interaction. Automates navigation, clicking, form filling, and snapshot analysis with interactive element identification.","zh":"通过CLI命令实现直接浏览器控制，提供元素引用跟踪(@e1, @e2)以实现精确交互。自动化导航、点击、表单填充和快照分析，具有交互元素识别功能。","ja":"CLIコマンドを介して直接のブラウザ制御を可能にし、正確な操作のための要素参照追跡 (@e1, @e2) を提供します。ナビゲーション、クリック、フォーム入力、スナップショット分析を自動化し、インタラクティブな要素識別を実行します。","ko":"CLI 명령을 통해 직접 브라우저 제어를 가능하게 하며, 정밀한 상호 작용을 위한 요소 참조 추적(@e1, @e2)을 제공합니다. 네비게이션, 클릭, 양식 填充, 스냅샷 분석을 자동화하고 상호 작용 요소 식별을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita el control directo del navegador a través de comandos de la interfaz de línea de comandos, proporcionando un seguimiento de referencia de elementos (@e1, @e2) para una interacción precisa. Automatiza la navegación, el clic, el llenado de formularios y el análisis de instantáneas con identificación de elementos interactivos.","fr":"Permet le contrôle direct du navigateur via des commandes de l''interface de ligne de commande, fournissant un suivi de référence d''éléments (@e1, @e2) pour une interaction précise. Automatise la navigation, le clic, le remplissage de formulaires et l''analyse d''instantanés avec identification d''éléments interactifs.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Steuerung des Browsers über Befehlszeilenkommandos, wodurch eine präzise Interaktion durch Elementreferenzverfolgung (@e1, @e2) ermöglicht wird. Automatisiert die Navigation, das Klicken, das Ausfüllen von Formularen und die Momentaufnahmenanalyse mit interaktiver Elementidentifizierung.","pt":"Permite o controle direto do navegador por meio de comandos CLI, fornecendo rastreamento de referência de elementos (@e1, @e2) para interação precisa. Automatiza a navegação, cliques, preenchimento de formulários e análise de instantâneos com identificação de elementos interativos.","ru":"Позволяет直接 контролировать браузер с помощью команд CLI, обеспечивая отслеживание ссылок на элементы (@e1, @e2) для точного взаимодействия. Автоматизирует навигацию, клики, заполнение форм и анализ снимков с идентификацией интерактивных элементов.","ar":"يمكّن التحكم المباشر في المتصفح من خلال أوامر CLI ، مع توفير تتبع مرجع العناصر (@e1، @e2) للتفاعل الدقيق. يؤتمة الملاحة والنقرات وملىء الاستمارات وتحليل اللقطة مع تحديد العناصر التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web form submissions","Scraping interactive web content","Testing web application flows","Performing browser-based user interactions"],"zh":["自动化网页表单提交","抓取交互式网页内容","测试网页应用程序流程","执行基于浏览器的用户交互"],"ja":["Webフォームの提出を自動化する","インタラクティブなWebコンテンツをスクラップする","Webアプリケーションのフローをテストする","ブラウザベースのユーザーインタラクションを実行する"],"ko":["웹 폼 제출 자동화","상호 작용형 웹 콘텐츠 스크레이핑","웹 애플리케이션 흐름 테스트","브라우저 기반 사용자 상호 작용 수행"],"es":["Automatización de envíos de formularios web","Extracción de contenido web interactivo","Pruebas de flujos de aplicaciones web","Realización de interacciones de usuario basadas en el navegador"],"fr":["Automatisation de soumissions de formulaires web","Extraction de contenu web interactif","Tests de flux d''applications web","Réalisations d''interactions utilisateur basées sur le navigateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webformulareinreichungen","Extraktion interaktiver Webinhalte","Testen von Webanwendungsflüssen","Durchführung von browserbasierten Benutzerinteraktionen"],"pt":["Automação de envio de formulários web","Coleta de conteúdo web interativo","Teste de fluxos de aplicativos web","Realização de interações do usuário baseadas em navegador"],"ru":["Автоматизация отправки веб-форм","Сбор интерактивного веб-контента","Тестирование потоков веб-приложений","Выполнение взаимодействий пользователя на основе браузера"],"ar":["تأتمة إرسال استمارات الويب","جمع المحتوى التفاعلي للويب","اختبار تدفقات تطبيقات الويب","إجراء تفاعلات المستخدم المعتمدة على المتصفح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires browser instance management","Dependent on element reference system","CLI command structure only"],"zh":["需要浏览器实例管理","依赖于元素引用系统","仅CLI命令结构"],"ja":["ブラウザインスタンスの管理が必要","要素参照システムに依存する","CLIコマンド構造のみ"],"ko":["브라우저 인스턴스 관리 필요","요소 참조 시스템에 의존","CLI 명령 구조만"],"es":["Requiere gestión de instancias de navegador","Dependiente del sistema de referencia de elementos","Estructura de comandos de la interfaz de línea de comandos solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une gestion d''instances de navigateur","Dépendant du système de référence d''éléments","Structure de commande de l''interface de ligne de commande uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt eine Instanzverwaltung des Browsers","Abhängig vom Elementreferenzsystem","Nur Befehlszeilenkommandostruktur"],"pt":["Requer gerenciamento de instâncias de navegador","Dependente do sistema de referência de elementos","Estrutura de comando CLI apenas"],"ru":["Требует управления экземплярами браузера","Зависит от системы ссылок на элементы","Только структура команды CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب إدارة مثيلات المتصفح","يعتمد على نظام مرجع العناصر","هياكل أمر CLI فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-bulk-archive-change', 'community', 'Ejyke90', 'kudegowo', 'Ejyke90/kudegowo', 'openspec-bulk-archive-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z', '2026-02-18T12:53:04.409Z', NULL, '{"id":"Ejyke90/kudegowo/openspec-bulk-archive-change","name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-bulk-archive-change允许您批量归档完成的更改，并智能地处理规格冲突。该技能检查代码库以确定实际实现的内容","ja":"openspec-bulk-archive-changeは、完了した変更を一括アーカイブし、仕様の衝突を賢く処理することを可能にします。このスキルは、実際に実装されている内容を判断するためにコードベースを確認します","ko":"openspec-bulk-archive-change는 완료된 변경을 일괄 아카이브하고, 사양 충돌을 스마트하게 처리할 수 있습니다. 이 기능은 실제로 구현된 내용을判断하기 위해 코드베이스를 확인합니다","es":"El skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permite archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación, manejando conflictos de especificaciones de forma inteligente","fr":"Le skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permet d''archiver plusieurs modifications terminées en une seule opération, gérant les conflits de spécifications de manière intelligente","de":"Der Skill openspec-bulk-archive-change ermöglicht das Archivieren mehrerer abgeschlossener Änderungen in einem einzigen Vorgang, wobei Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent gehandhabt werden","pt":"A habilidade openspec-bulk-archive-change permite arquivar várias alterações concluídas em uma única operação, lidando com conflitos de especificações de forma inteligente.","ru":"Навык openspec-bulk-archive-change позволяет архивировать несколько завершенных изменений в одной операции, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций интеллектуально.","ar":"تسمح مهارة openspec-bulk-archive-change بأرشفة عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة، وتتعامل مع تضادات مواصفات بطريقة ذكية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec批量归档更改","ja":"openspec一括アーカイブ変更","ko":"openspec 일괄 아카이브 변경","es":"Archivar cambios en masa con openspec-bulk-archive-change","fr":"Archiver les modifications en masse avec openspec-bulk-ar...","de":"Massenarchivierung von Änderungen mit openspec-bulk-archi...","pt":"Arquivamento em massa de alterações com openspec","ru":"Массовое архивирование изменений с openspec","ar":"أرشفة الكتلة للتغييرات مع openspec","en":"openspec-bulk-archive-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-bulk-archive-change允许您批量归档完成的更改，并智能地处理规格冲突。该技能检查代码库以确定实际实现的内容","ja":"openspec-bulk-archive-changeは、完了した変更を一括アーカイブし、仕様の衝突を賢く処理することを可能にします。このスキルは、実際に実装されている内容を判断するためにコードベースを確認します","ko":"openspec-bulk-archive-change는 완료된 변경을 일괄 아카이브하고, 사양 충돌을 스마트하게 처리할 수 있습니다. 이 기능은 실제로 구현된 내용을判断하기 위해 코드베이스를 확인합니다","es":"El skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permite archivar múltiples cambios completados en una sola operación, manejando conflictos de especificaciones de forma...","fr":"Le skill openspec-bulk-archive-change permet d''archiver plusieurs modifications terminées en une seule opération, gérant les conflits de spécifications de ma...","de":"Der Skill openspec-bulk-archive-change ermöglicht das Archivieren mehrerer abgeschlossener Änderungen in einem einzigen Vorgang, wobei Spezifikationskonflikt...","pt":"A habilidade openspec-bulk-archive-change permite arquivar várias alterações concluídas em uma única operação, lidando com conflitos de especificações de for...","ru":"Навык openspec-bulk-archive-change позволяет архивировать несколько завершенных изменений в одной операции, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций интеллектуально.","ar":"تسمح مهارة openspec-bulk-archive-change بأرشفة عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة، وتتعامل مع تضادات مواصفات بطريقة ذكية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["批量归档完成的更改","智能处理规格冲突","检查代码库以确定实际实现的内容","使用AskUserQuestion工具进行多选","支持JSON输出"],"ja":["完了した変更を一括アーカイブ","仕様の衝突を賢く処理","コードベースを確認して実際に実装されている内容を判断","AskUserQuestionツールを使用した多選","JSON出力のサポート"],"ko":["완료된 변경을 일괄 아카이브","사양 충돌을 스마트하게 처리","코드베이스를 확인하여 실제로 구현된 내용을 판단","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용한 다중 선택","JSON 출력 지원"],"es":["Archivado en masa de cambios completados","Manejo inteligente de conflictos de especificaciones","Selección de cambios mediante herramienta de preguntas al usuario","Compatibilidad con comando openspec list --json","Optimización del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Archivage en masse des modifications terminées","Gestion intelligente des conflits de spécifications","Sélection des modifications via outil de questions à l''utilisateur","Compatibilité avec la commande openspec list --json","Optimisation du flux de travail"],"de":["Massenarchivierung abgeschlossener Änderungen","Intelligentes Handling von Spezifikationskonflikten","Auswahl von Änderungen mittels Benutzerfrage-Tool","Kompatibilität mit dem Befehl openspec list --json","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs"],"pt":["Arquivamento em massa de alterações","Lida com conflitos de especificações de forma inteligente","Não requer entrada de dados","Prompt para seleção de alterações","Verifica o código para determinar o que está implementado"],"ru":["Массовое архивирование изменений","Обрабатывает конфликты спецификаций интеллектуально","Не требует входных данных","Предлагает выбор изменений","Проверяет код, чтобы определить, что реализовано"],"ar":["أرشفة الكتلة للتغييرات","تتعامل مع تضادات مواصفات بطريقة ذكية","لا تتطلب إدخال البيانات","تستفسر عن اختيار التغييرات","تتحقق من الكود لتحديد ما تم تنفيذه"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec","批量归档","规格冲突","代码库","AskUserQuestion","JSON输出"],"ja":["openspec","一括アーカイブ","仕様の衝突","コードベース","AskUserQuestion","JSON出力"],"ko":["openspec","일괄 아카이브","사양 충돌","코드베이스","AskUserQuestion","JSON 출력"],"es":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivado en masa","manejo de conflictos","optimización del flujo de trabajo","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","archivage en masse","gestion de conflits","optimisation du flux de travail","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches","outils de développement"],"de":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","Massenarchivierung","Spezifikationskonflikt-Handling","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","arquivamento em massa","alterações concluídas","conflitos de especificações","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","массовое архивирование","завершенные изменения","конфликты спецификаций","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["openspec-bulk-archive-change","أرشفة الكتلة","تغييرات مكتملة","تضادات مواصفات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Ejyke90","repo":"kudegowo","repoPath":"Ejyke90/kudegowo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":"Archive multiple completed changes at once. Use when archiving several parallel changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select t","body":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select to let user choose changes:\n   - Show each change with its schema\n   - Include an option for \"All changes\"\n   - Allow any number of selections (1+ works, 2+ is the typical use case)\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT auto-select. Always let the user choose.\n\n3. **Batch validation - gather status for all selected changes**\n\n   For each selected change, collect:\n\n   a. **Artifact status** - Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n      - Parse `schemaName` and `artifacts` list\n      - Note which artifacts are `done` vs other states\n\n   b. **Task completion** - Read `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n      - Count `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n      - If no tasks file exists, note as \"No tasks\"\n\n   c. **Delta specs** - Check `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/` directory\n      - List which capability specs exist\n      - For each, extract requirement names (lines matching `### Requirement: <name>`)\n\n4. **Detect spec conflicts**\n\n   Build a map of `capability -> [changes that touch it]`:\n\n   ```\n   auth -> [change-a, change-b]  <- CONFLICT (2+ changes)\n   api  -> [change-c]            <- OK (only 1 change)\n   ```\n\n   A conflict exists when 2+ selected changes have delta specs for the same capability.\n\n5. **Resolve conflicts agentically**\n\n   **For each conflict**, investigate the codebase:\n\n   a. **Read the delta specs** from each conflicting change to understand what each claims to add/modify\n\n   b. **Search the codebase** for implementation evidence:\n      - Look for code implementing requirements from each delta spec\n      - Check for related files, functions, or tests\n\n   c. **Determine resolution**:\n      - If only one change is actually implemented -> sync that one''s specs\n      - If both implemented -> apply in chronological order (older first, newer overwrites)\n      - If neither implemented -> skip spec sync, warn user\n\n   d. **Record resolution** for each conflict:\n      - Which change''s specs to apply\n      - In what order (if both)\n      - Rationale (what was found in codebase)\n\n6. **Show consolidated status table**\n\n   Display a table summarizing all changes:\n\n   ```\n   | Change               | Artifacts | Tasks | Specs   | Conflicts | Status |\n   |---------------------|-----------|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n   | schema-management   | Done      | 5/5   | 2 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | project-config      | Done      | 3/3   | 1 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | add-oauth           | Done      | 4/4   | 1 delta | auth (!)  | Ready* |\n   | add-verify-skill    | 1 left    | 2/5   | None    | None      | Warn   |\n   ```\n\n   For conflicts, show the resolution:\n   ```\n   * Conflict resolution:\n     - auth spec: Will apply add-oauth then add-jwt (both implemented, chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   For incomplete changes, show warnings:\n   ```\n   Warnings:\n   - add-verify-skill: 1 incomplete artifact, 3 incomplete tasks\n   ```\n\n7. **Confirm batch operation**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with a single confirmation:\n\n   - \"Archive N changes?\" with options based on status\n   - Options might include:\n     - \"Archive all N changes\"\n     - \"Archive only N ready changes (skip incomplete)\"\n     - \"Cancel\"\n\n   If there are incomplete changes, make clear they''ll be archived with warnings.\n\n8. **Execute archive for each confirmed change**\n\n   Process changes in the determined order (respecting conflict resolution):\n\n   a. **Sync specs** if delta specs exist:\n      - Use the openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven intelligent merge)\n      - For conflicts, apply in resolved order\n      - Track if sync was done\n\n   b. **Perform the archive**:\n      ```bash\n      mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n      mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n      ```\n\n   c. **Track outcome** for each change:\n      - Success: archived successfully\n      - Failed: error during archive (record error)\n      - Skipped: user chose not to archive (if applicable)\n\n9. **Display summary**\n\n   Show final results:\n\n   ```\n   ## Bulk Archive Complete\n\n   Archived 3 changes:\n   - schema-management-cli -> archive/2026-01-19-schema-management-cli/\n   - project-config -> archive/2026-01-19-project-config/\n   - add-oauth -> archive/2026-01-19-add-oauth/\n\n   Skipped 1 change:\n   - add-verify-skill (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\n   Spec sync summary:\n   - 4 delta specs synced to main specs\n   - 1 conflict resolved (auth: applied both in chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   If any failures:\n   ```\n   Failed 1 change:\n   - some-change: Archive directory already exists\n   ```\n\n**Conflict Resolution Examples**\n\nExample 1: Only one implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/auth/spec.md touched by [add-oauth, add-jwt]\n\nChecking add-oauth:\n- Delta adds \"OAuth Provider Integration\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/auth/oauth.ts implementing OAuth flow\n\nChecking add-jwt:\n- Delta adds \"JWT Token Handling\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... no JWT implementation found\n\nResolution: Only add-oauth is implemented. Will sync add-oauth specs only.\n```\n\nExample 2: Both implemented\n```\nConflict: specs/api/spec.md touched by [add-rest-api, add-graphql]\n\nChecking add-rest-api (created 2026-01-10):\n- Delta adds \"REST Endpoints\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/rest.ts\n\nChecking add-graphql (created 2026-01-15):\n- Delta adds \"GraphQL Schema\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/graphql.ts\n\nResolution: Both implemented. Will apply add-rest-api specs first,\nthen add-graphql specs (chronological order, newer takes precedence).\n```\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n- <change-2> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-2>/\n\nSpec sync summary:\n- N delta specs synced to main specs\n- No conflicts (or: M conflicts resolved)\n```\n\n**Output On Partial Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete (partial)\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n\nSkipped M changes:\n- <change-2> (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\nFailed K changes:\n- <change-3>: Archive directory already exists\n```\n\n**Output When No Changes**\n\n```\n## No Changes to Archive\n\nNo active changes found. Use `/opsx:new` to create a new change.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Allow any number of changes (1+ is fine, 2+ is the typical use case)\n- Always prompt for selection, never auto-select\n- Detect spec conflicts early and resolve by checking codebase\n- When both changes are implemented, apply specs in chronological order\n- Skip spec sync only when implementation is missing (warn user)\n- Show clear per-change status before confirming\n- Use single confirmation for entire batch\n- Track and report all outcomes (success/skip/fail)\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive\n- Archive directory target uses current date: YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n- If archive target exists, fail that change but continue with others\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:53:04.409Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Management Agents requiring efficient bulk archiving of completed changes with intelligent spec conflict resolution.","zh":"适用于需要高效批量存档已完成更改并具有智能规格冲突解决的代码管理代理的理想选择。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが効率的に完了した変更のバルクアーカイブを実行し、スマートな仕様のコンフリクト解決を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 관리 에이전트가 완료된 변경 사항의 효율적인 대량 아카이빙 및 지능형 사양 충돌 해결을 요구하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Código que requieren un archivo en bulk eficiente de cambios completados con resolución inteligente de conflictos de especificaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Gestion de Code nécessitant un archivage en bulk efficace des modifications terminées avec une résolution intelligente des conflits de spécifications.","de":"Ideal für Code-Management-Agents, die ein effizientes Bulk-Archivieren abgeschlossener Änderungen mit intelligenter Spezifikationskonfliktlösung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que exigem arquivamento em massa eficiente de alterações concluídas com resolução inteligente de conflitos de especificação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, требующих эффективного массового архивирования завершенных изменений с интеллектуальной решением конфликтов спецификаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشيفرة الذي يتطلب أرشفة كتلة فعالة للتغييرات المكتملة مع حل صراع المواصفات الذكي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts by checking the codebase and determining what''s actually implemented, utilizing the `openspec list --json` command and multi-select prompts via the AskUserQuestion tool.","zh":"赋予代理批量存档更改的能力，通过检查代码库并确定实际实施的内容来处理规格冲突，利用 `openspec list --json` 命令和 AskUserQuestion 工具的多选提示。","ja":"エージェントに変更をバッチアーカイブする機能を与え、コードベースを確認して実際に実装されているものを決定することで仕様のコンフリクトを解決し、`openspec list --json` コマンドと AskUserQuestion ツールのマルチセレクトプロンプトを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 변경 사항을 일괄 아카이빙할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고 코드베이스를 확인하여 실제로 구현된 내용을 결정함으로써 사양 충돌을 해결하며, `openspec list --json` 명령과 AskUserQuestion 도구의 다중 선택 프롬프트를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a archivar por lotes los cambios, manejando conflictos de especificaciones comprobando la base de código y determinando qué es lo que realmente se implementa, utilizando el comando `openspec list --json` y las solicitudes de selección múltiple a través de la herramienta AskUserQuestion.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''archiver par lots les modifications, en gérant les conflits de spécifications en vérifiant la base de code et en déterminant ce qui est réellement implémenté, en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` et les invites de sélection multiple via l''outil AskUserQuestion.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Änderungen in Batches zu archivieren, indem Spezifikationskonflikte durch Überprüfung der Codebasis und Bestimmung dessen, was tatsächlich implementiert wurde, gehandhabt werden, unter Verwendung des Befehls `openspec list --json` und mehrfacher Auswahlhinweise über das Tool AskUserQuestion.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a arquivar em lote as alterações, lidando com conflitos de especificação verificando a base de código e determinando o que é realmente implementado, utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` e prompts de multi-seleção via a ferramenta AskUserQuestion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью пакетного архивирования изменений, обрабатывая конфликты спецификаций путем проверки кодовой базы и определения того, что фактически реализовано, используя команду `openspec list --json` и многоселекторные запросы через инструмент AskUserQuestion.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أرشفة التغييرات بشكل مجمّع، وتحديد صراعات المواصفات عن طريق التحقق من قاعدة الشفرة وتحديد ما تم تنفيذه بالفعل، باستخدام الأمر `openspec list --json` والاستفسارات متعددة التحديد عبر أداة AskUserQuestion."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating bulk archiving of completed changes","Resolving spec conflicts intelligently across multiple changes","Streamlining codebase management by archiving inactive changes in bulk"],"zh":["自动执行已完成更改的批量存档","跨多个更改智能解决规格冲突","通过批量存档非活动更改来简化代码库管理"],"ja":["完了した変更のバルクアーカイブの自動化","複数の変更に対する仕様のコンフリクトの智能解決","非アクティブな変更をバルクでアーカイブすることでコードベースの管理をストリームライン化"],"ko":["완료된 변경 사항의 대량 아카이빙 자동화","다중 변경 사항에 대한 사양 충돌의 지능형 해결","비활성 변경 사항을 일괄 아카이빙하여 코드베이스 관리를 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar el archivo en bulk de cambios completados","Resolver conflictos de especificaciones de forma inteligente en varias modificaciones","Optimizar la gestión de la base de código archivando cambios inactivos en bulk"],"fr":["Automatiser l''archivage en bulk des modifications terminées","Résoudre de manière intelligente les conflits de spécifications sur plusieurs modifications","Optimiser la gestion de la base de code en archivant les modifications inactives en bulk"],"de":["Automatisieren des Bulk-Archivierens abgeschlossener Änderungen","Intelligente Auflösung von Spezifikationskonflikten über mehrere Änderungen","Optimieren der Codebasisverwaltung durch Bulk-Archivieren inaktiver Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar o arquivamento em massa de alterações concluídas","Resolver conflitos de especificação de forma inteligente em várias alterações","Otimizar a gestão da base de código arquivando alterações inativas em massa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать массовое архивирование завершенных изменений","Интеллектуально решать конфликты спецификаций в нескольких изменениях","Оптимизировать управление кодовой базой, архивируя неактивные изменения пакетно"],"ar":["أتمتة أرشفة التغييرات المكتملة بشكل مجمّع","حل صراعات المواصفات بذكاء عبر عدة تغييرات","تحسين إدارة قاعدة الشفرة من خلال أرشفة التغييرات غير النشطة بشكل مجمّع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `openspec` command-line tool","Needs access to the codebase for conflict resolution","No active changes exist, the process will be stopped"],"zh":["需要 `openspec` 命令行工具","需要访问代码库以解决冲突","如果没有活动变化，过程将被停止"],"ja":["`openspec` コマンドラインツールが必要","コンフリクトを解決するためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要","アクティブな変更がない場合、プロセスは停止される"],"ko":["`openspec` 명령줄 도구가 필요","충돌을 해결하기 위해 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","활성 변경 사항이 없으면 프로세스가 중지됨"],"es":["Requiere la herramienta de línea de comandos `openspec`","Necesita acceso a la base de código para la resolución de conflictos","No existen cambios activos, el proceso se detendrá"],"fr":["Nécessite l''outil de ligne de commande `openspec`","Besoin d''accès à la base de code pour la résolution des conflits","Aucun changement actif n''existe, le processus s''arrêtera"],"de":["Benötigt das Kommandozeilen-Tool `openspec`","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis für die Konfliktlösung","Es gibt keine aktiven Änderungen, der Vorgang wird gestoppt"],"pt":["Requer a ferramenta de linha de comando `openspec`","Necessita acesso à base de código para resolução de conflitos","Se não existirem alterações ativas, o processo será interrompido"],"ru":["Требует командной строки `openspec`","Требует доступа к кодовой базе для решения конфликтов","Если не существует активных изменений, процесс будет остановлен"],"ar":["يتطلب أداة سطر الأوامر `openspec`","يحتاج الوصول الى قاعدة الشفرة لحل الصراعات","إذا لم تكن هناك تغييرات نشطة،將 يتم إيقاف العملية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Siddharth-Khattar/holmes/motion', 'community', 'Siddharth-Khattar', 'holmes', 'Siddharth-Khattar/holmes', 'motion', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z', '2026-02-18T12:54:28.095Z', NULL, '{"id":"Siddharth-Khattar/holmes/motion","name":"motion","description":{"zh":"Motion Vue 是一个为 Vue 3 和 Nuxt 提供硬件加速动画的库，支持简单的声明式动画和手势交互","ja":"Motion Vue は Vue 3 と Nuxt 用のハードウェア アクセラレーション アニメーション ライブラリで、シンプルな宣言的アニメーションとジェスチャー ベースのインタラクションをサポートしています","ko":"모션 뷰는 Vue 3와 Nuxt를 위한 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션 라이브러리로서, 간단한 선언적 애니메이션과 제스처 기반 상호작용을 지원합니다","pt":"Motion Vue é uma biblioteca de animação para Vue 3 e Nuxt, oferecendo animações aceleradas por hardware e tamanho de bundle mínimo.","ru":"Motion Vue — библиотека анимации для Vue 3 и Nuxt, предлагающая hardware-ускоренные анимации и минимальный размер пакета.","ar":"موشن فيو هي مكتبة للرسوم المتحركة لفيو 3 ونيكست، توفر الرسوم المتحركة المُسرعة بالأجهزة وحجم حزمة صغير.","en":"Project implementation of the legal and investigation project for Gemini 3 Hackathon 2026"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Motion Vue动画库","ja":"Motion Vue アニメーションライブラリ","ko":"모션 뷰 애니메이션 라이브러리","pt":"Motion Vue: Biblioteca de Animação para Vue 3","ru":"Motion Vue: Библиотека анимации для Vue 3","ar":"موشن فيو: مكتبة للرسوم المتحركة لفيو 3","en":"motion"},"description":{"zh":"Motion Vue 是一个为 Vue 3 和 Nuxt 提供硬件加速动画的库，支持简单的声明式动画和手势交互","ja":"Motion Vue は Vue 3 と Nuxt 用のハードウェア アクセラレーション アニメーション ライブラリで、シンプルな宣言的アニメーションとジェスチャー ベースのインタラクションをサポートしています","ko":"모션 뷰는 Vue 3와 Nuxt를 위한 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션 라이브러리로서, 간단한 선언적 애니메이션과 제스처 기반 상호작용을 지원합니다","pt":"Motion Vue é uma biblioteca de animação para Vue 3 e Nuxt, oferecendo animações aceleradas por hardware e tamanho de bundle mínimo.","ru":"Motion Vue — библиотека анимации для Vue 3 и Nuxt, предлагающая hardware-ускоренные анимации и минимальный размер пакета.","ar":"موشن فيو هي مكتبة للرسوم المتحركة لفيو 3 ونيكست، توفر الرسوم المتحركة المُسرعة بالأجهزة وحجم حزمة صغير.","en":"Project implementation of the legal and investigation project for Gemini 3 Hackathon 2026"},"definition":{"en":"Project implementation of the legal and investigation project for Gemini 3 Hackathon 2026"},"features":{"zh":["硬件加速动画","小巧的包体积","简单的声明式动画","手势交互","支持 Vue 3 和 Nuxt"],"ja":["ハードウェア アクセラレーション アニメーション","小さなパッケージサイズ","シンプルな宣言的アニメーション","ジェスチャー ベースのインタラクション","Vue 3 と Nuxt のサポート"],"ko":["하드웨어 가속 애니메이션","작은 패키지 크기","간단한 선언적 애니메이션","제스처 기반 상호작용","Vue 3와 Nuxt 지원"],"pt":["Animações declarativas simples","Interações baseadas em gestos","Aceleração por hardware","Tamanho de bundle mínimo","Compatibilidade com Vue 3 e Nuxt"],"ru":["Простые декларативные анимации","Взаимодействия на основе жестов","Hardware-ускорение","Минимальный размер пакета","Совместимость с Vue 3 и Nuxt"],"ar":["الرسوم المتحركة الاقتراعية البسيطة","التفاعلات التي تعتمد على الإشارات","التسريع بالأجهزة","حجم الحزمة الأصغر","التوافق مع فيو 3 ونيكست"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Motion Vue","Vue 3 动画","Nuxt 动画","硬件加速动画","声明式动画","手势交互"],"ja":["Motion Vue","Vue 3 アニメーション","Nuxt アニメーション","ハードウェア アクセラレーション アニメーション","宣言的アニメーション","ジェスチャー ベースのインタラクション"],"ko":["모션 뷰","Vue 3 애니메이션","Nuxt 애니메이션","하드웨어 가속 애니메이션","선언적 애니메이션","제스처 기반 상호작용"],"pt":["Motion Vue","Biblioteca de animação","Vue 3","Nuxt","Animações declarativas","Interações baseadas em gestos","Aceleração por hardware","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Motion Vue","Библиотека анимации","Vue 3","Nuxt","Декларативные анимации","Взаимодействия на основе жестов","Hardware-ускорение","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["موشن فيو","مكتبة للرسوم المتحركة","فيو 3","نيكست","الرسوم المتحركة الاقتراعية","التفاعلات التي تعتمد على الإشارات","التسريع بالأجهزة","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"Siddharth-Khattar","repo":"holmes","repoPath":"Siddharth-Khattar/holmes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"motion","description":"Use when adding animations with Motion Vue (motion-v) - provides motion component API, gesture animations, scroll-linked effects, layout transitions, and composables for Vue 3/Nuxt","bodyPreview":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, ta","body":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, tap, drag)\n- Scroll-linked animations\n- Layout animations and shared element transitions\n- Spring physics animations\n\n**Consider alternatives:**\n\n- **GSAP** - Complex timelines, SVG morphing, scroll-triggered sequences\n- **@vueuse/motion** - Simpler API, less features, smaller bundle\n- **CSS animations** - Simple transitions without JS\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Vue 3\npnpm add motion-v\n\n# Nuxt 3\npnpm add motion-v @vueuse/nuxt\n```\n\n```ts\n// nuxt.config.ts - Nuxt 3 setup\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''motion-v/nuxt''],\n})\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Working on...                | Load file                 |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Motion component, gestures   | references/components.md  |\n| useMotionValue, useScroll    | references/composables.md |\n| Animation examples, patterns | references/examples.md    |\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Load one file at a time based on context:**\n\n- Component animations → [references/components.md](references/components.md)\n- Composables, motion values → [references/composables.md](references/composables.md)\n- Examples, inspiration → [references/examples.md](references/examples.md)\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Motion Component\n\nRender any HTML/SVG element with animation capabilities:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { Motion } from ''motion-v''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <Motion.div\n    :initial=\"{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }\"\n    :animate=\"{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }\"\n    :exit=\"{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }\"\n    :transition=\"{ duration: 0.3 }\"\n  >\n    Animated content\n  </Motion.div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### Gesture Animations\n\n```vue\n<Motion.button\n  :whileHover=\"{ scale: 1.05 }\"\n  :whilePress=\"{ scale: 0.95 }\"\n  :transition=\"{ type: ''spring'', stiffness: 400 }\"\n>\n  Click me\n</Motion.button>\n```\n\n### Scroll Animations\n\n```vue\n<Motion.div\n  :initial=\"{ opacity: 0 }\"\n  :whileInView=\"{ opacity: 1 }\"\n  :viewport=\"{ once: true, margin: ''-100px'' }\"\n>\n  Appears on scroll\n</Motion.div>\n```\n\n## Available Guidance\n\n**[references/components.md](references/components.md)** - Motion component variants, animation props, gesture props, layout animations, transition configuration\n\n**[references/composables.md](references/composables.md)** - useMotionValue, useSpring, useTransform, useScroll, useInView, animate()\n\n**[references/examples.md](references/examples.md)** - External resources, component libraries, animation patterns and inspiration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:54:28.095Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations for Vue 3 and Nuxt applications.","zh":"非常适合需要为Vue 3和Nuxt应用程序提供生产就绪的硬件加速动画的前端代理。","ja":"Vue 3およびNuxtアプリケーション向けに生産準備完了のハードウェアアクセラレーションアニメーションを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Vue 3 및 Nuxt 애플리케이션을 위한 생산 준비가 완료된 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan animaciones con aceleración de hardware listas para producción para aplicaciones Vue 3 y Nuxt.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''animations prêtes pour la production avec accélération matérielle pour les applications Vue 3 et Nuxt.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die produktionsreife, hardwarebeschleunigte Animationen für Vue 3- und Nuxt-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de animações prontas para produção, aceleradas por hardware, para aplicações Vue 3 e Nuxt.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются готовые к производству, аппаратно ускоренные анимации для приложений Vue 3 и Nuxt.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى رسوم متحركة جاهزة للانتاج، ومسارة بدقة الأجهزة، للتطبيقات Vue 3 و Nuxt."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create simple declarative animations, such as fade, slide, and scale, and gesture-based interactions like hover and tap using Motion Vue''s library, with minimal bundle size and support for Vue 3 and Nuxt.","zh":"赋予代理创建简单的声明式动画，例如渐隐、滑动和缩放，并使用Motion Vue库的基于手势的交互，例如悬停和点击，具有最小的包大小和对Vue 3和Nuxt的支持。","ja":"エージェントがMotion Vueライブラリを使用して、フェード、スライド、スケールなどのシンプルな宣言的なアニメーション、およびホバーとタップのようなジェスチャーベースのインタラクションを作成できるようにし、最小のバンドルサイズとVue 3およびNuxtのサポートを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Motion Vue 라이브러리를 사용하여 페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 간단한 선언적 애니메이션과 호버, 탭 같은 제스처 기반 상호 작용을 만들 수 있도록 하며, 최소한의 번들 크기와 Vue 3 및 Nuxt 지원을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones declarativas simples, como desvanecimiento, deslizamiento y escala, y interacciones basadas en gestos como hover y tap utilizando la biblioteca Motion Vue, con un tamaño de paquete mínimo y soporte para Vue 3 y Nuxt.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations déclaratives simples, telles que le fondu, le défilement et la mise à l''échelle, et des interactions basées sur les gestes comme le survol et le tap en utilisant la bibliothèque Motion Vue, avec une taille de bundle minimale et un support pour Vue 3 et Nuxt.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einfache deklarative Animationen wie Fade, Slide und Skalierung sowie gestenbasierte Interaktionen wie Hover und Tap mit der Motion-Vue-Bibliothek zu erstellen, mit minimalem Bundle-Größe und Unterstützung für Vue 3 und Nuxt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem animações declarativas simples, como fade, slide e scale, e interações baseadas em gestos, como hover e tap, usando a biblioteca Motion Vue, com tamanho de bundle mínimo e suporte a Vue 3 e Nuxt.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать простые декларативные анимации, такие как fade, slide и scale, и жестовые взаимодействия, такие как hover и tap, с использованием библиотеки Motion Vue, с минимальным размером пакета и поддержкой Vue 3 и Nuxt.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء رسوم متحركة إعلانية بسيطة، مثل تلاشي، انزلاق، وتكبير، وتفاعلات تعتمد على الإيماءات، مثل الحوفر وتاب، باستخدام مكتبة موشن فيو، مع الحفاظ على حجم الحزمة الأدنى ودعم فيو 3 ونكست."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing progressive animations for web applications","Creating gesture-based interactions for enhanced user experience","Optimizing animation performance with hardware-accelerated rendering"],"zh":["为Web应用程序实现渐进式动画","为增强用户体验创建基于手势的交互","使用硬件加速渲染优化动画性能"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション向けのプログレッシブアニメーションの実装","強化されたユーザーエクスペリエンスのためのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションの作成","ハードウェアアクセラレーションレンダリングを使用したアニメーションパフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 점진적 애니메이션 구현","향상된 사용자 경험을 위한 제스처 기반 상호 작용 만들기","하드웨어 가속 렌더링을 사용한 애니메이션 성능 최적화"],"es":["Implementar animaciones progresivas para aplicaciones web","Crear interacciones basadas en gestos para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","Optimizar el rendimiento de las animaciones con representación con aceleración de hardware"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des animations progressives pour les applications Web","Créer des interactions basées sur les gestes pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Optimiser les performances des animations avec un rendu accéléré par le matériel"],"de":["Implementierung von progressiven Animationen für Webanwendungen","Erstellen von gestenbasierten Interaktionen für eine verbesserte Benutzeroberfläche","Optimierung der Animationsleistung mit hardwarebeschleunigter Darstellung"],"pt":["Implementar animações progressivas para aplicações web","Criar interações baseadas em gestos para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada","Otimizar o desempenho da animação com renderização acelerada por hardware"],"ru":["Реализация прогрессивных анимаций для веб-приложений","Создание жестовых взаимодействий для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Оптимизация производительности анимации с аппаратным ускорением"],"ar":["تنفيذ الرسوم المتحركة التطورية لتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء التفاعلات المعتمدة على الإيماءات لتجربة مستخدم محسنة","تحسين أداء الرسوم المتحركة مع التصيير المسرع بالأجهزة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue 3 or Nuxt for integration","Limited to animation capabilities, not a full-fledged UI framework"],"zh":["需要Vue 3或Nuxt进行集成","仅限动画能力，不是完整的UI框架"],"ja":["統合にはVue 3またはNuxtが必要","アニメーション機能のみ、完全なUIフレームワークではありません"],"ko":["통합을 위해 Vue 3 또는 Nuxt가 필요","애니메이션 기능만, 완전한 UI 프레임워크가 아님"],"es":["Requiere Vue 3 o Nuxt para la integración","Limitado a capacidades de animación, no un framework de UI completo"],"fr":["Nécessite Vue 3 ou Nuxt pour l''intégration","Limité aux capacités d''animation, et non à un framework UI complet"],"de":["Benötigt Vue 3 oder Nuxt für die Integration","Begrenzt auf Animationsfunktionen, kein umfassendes UI-Framework"],"pt":["Requer Vue 3 ou Nuxt para integração","Limitado às capacidades de animação, não é um framework de UI completo"],"ru":["Требуется Vue 3 или Nuxt для интеграции","Ограничен возможностями анимации, не является полноценным фреймворком UI"],"ar":["يتطلب فيو 3 أو نكست للتكامل","محدود بالقدرات المتحركة، وليس إطار عمل واجهة المستخدم كامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
