tigravity IDE","Kompatibilität mit IDEs wie GitHub Copilot und Cursor","Kompatibilität mit CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Entwicklung von immersiven Erfahrungen mit VR/AR","Auswahl von Plattformen für VR und AR"],"pt":["Plataformas de VR como Quest e PCVR","Plataformas de AR como ARKit e ARCore","Princípios de conforto para experiências imersivas","Desenvolvimento de experiências em WebXR","Integração com IDEs e CLIs"],"ru":["Платформы VR, такие как Quest и PCVR","Платформы AR, такие как ARKit и ARCore","Принципы комфорта для погружающих опытов","Разработка опытов в WebXR","Интеграция с IDE и CLI"],"ar":["منصات VR مثل Quest و PCVR","منصات AR مثل ARKit و ARCore","مبادئ الراحة لتجارب الغمر","تطوير تجارب في WebXR","التكامل مع IDE و CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["VR开发","AR开发","沉浸式体验","平台选择","舒适性原则","Quest","PCVR","PSVR","WebXR","ARKit","ARCore","HoloLens"],"ja":["VR開発","AR開発","没入感の高い体験","プラットフォームの選択","快適性の原則","Quest","PCVR","PSVR","WebXR","ARKit","ARCore","HoloLens"],"ko":["VR 개발","AR 개발","몰입형 경험","플랫폼 선택","편안한 사용자 경험","Quest","PCVR","PSVR","WebXR","ARKit","ARCore","HoloLens"],"es":["desarrollo vr ar","herramientas vr ar","realidad virtual","realidad aumentada","experiencias inmersivas","vr ar para desarrolladores"],"fr":["développement vr ar","outils vr ar","réalité virtuelle","réalité augmentée","expériences immersives","vr ar pour les développeurs"],"de":["entwicklung vr ar","tools vr ar","virtuelle realität","erweiterte realität","immersive erfahrungen","vr ar für entwickler"],"pt":["desenvolvimento VR","desenvolvimento AR","experiências imersivas","plataformas de VR","plataformas de AR","WebXR","IDE","CLI"],"ru":["разработка VR","разработка AR","погружающие опыты","платформы VR","платформы AR","WebXR","IDE","CLI"],"ar":["تطوير VR","تطوير AR","تجارب غمرية","منصات VR","منصات AR","WebXR","IDE","CLI"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vr-ar","description":"VR/AR development principles. Comfort, interaction, performance requirements.","bodyPreview":"# VR/AR Development\n\n> Immersive experience principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Selection\n\n### VR Platforms\n\n| Platform | Use Case |\n|----------|----------|\n| **Quest** | Standalone, wireless |\n| **PCVR** | High fidelity |\n| **PSVR** | Console market |\n| **WebXR** | Browser-based |\n\n### AR Platforms\n\n| Platform | Use Case |\n|----------|----------|\n| **ARKit** | iOS devices |\n| **ARCore** | Android devices |\n| **WebXR** | Browser AR |\n| **HoloLens** | Enterprise |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Comfort Principles\n\n###","body":"# VR/AR Development\n\n> Immersive experience principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Selection\n\n### VR Platforms\n\n| Platform | Use Case |\n|----------|----------|\n| **Quest** | Standalone, wireless |\n| **PCVR** | High fidelity |\n| **PSVR** | Console market |\n| **WebXR** | Browser-based |\n\n### AR Platforms\n\n| Platform | Use Case |\n|----------|----------|\n| **ARKit** | iOS devices |\n| **ARCore** | Android devices |\n| **WebXR** | Browser AR |\n| **HoloLens** | Enterprise |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Comfort Principles\n\n### Motion Sickness Prevention\n\n| Cause | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| **Locomotion** | Teleport, snap turn |\n| **Low FPS** | Maintain 90 FPS |\n| **Camera shake** | Avoid or minimize |\n| **Rapid acceleration** | Gradual movement |\n\n### Comfort Settings\n\n- Vignette during movement\n- Snap vs smooth turning\n- Seated vs standing modes\n- Height calibration\n\n---\n\n## 3. Performance Requirements\n\n### Target Metrics\n\n| Platform | FPS | Resolution |\n|----------|-----|------------|\n| Quest 2 | 72-90 | 1832x1920 |\n| Quest 3 | 90-120 | 2064x2208 |\n| PCVR | 90 | 2160x2160+ |\n| PSVR2 | 90-120 | 2000x2040 |\n\n### Frame Budget\n\n- VR requires consistent frame times\n- Single dropped frame = visible judder\n- 90 FPS = 11.11ms budget\n\n---\n\n## 4. Interaction Principles\n\n### Controller Interaction\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Point + click** | UI, distant objects |\n| **Grab** | Manipulation |\n| **Gesture** | Magic, special actions |\n| **Physical** | Throwing, swinging |\n\n### Hand Tracking\n\n- More immersive but less precise\n- Good for: social, casual\n- Challenging for: action, precision\n\n---\n\n## 5. Spatial Design\n\n### World Scale\n\n- 1 unit = 1 meter (critical)\n- Objects must feel right size\n- Test with real measurements\n\n### Depth Cues\n\n| Cue | Importance |\n|-----|------------|\n| Stereo | Primary depth |\n| Motion parallax | Secondary |\n| Shadows | Grounding |\n| Occlusion | Layering |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Move camera without player | Player controls camera |\n| Drop below 90 FPS | Maintain frame rate |\n| Use tiny UI text | Large, readable text |\n| Ignore arm length | Scale to player reach |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Comfort is not optional. Sick players don''t play.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:54:11.149Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents focused on immersive experience development, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, needing advanced VR/AR platform integration.","zh":"适合专注于沉浸式体验开发的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，需要高级的VR/AR平台集成。","ja":"イミューシブ体験の開発に重点を置くAIエージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeに適しています。これらは、VR/ARプラットフォームの高度な統合を必要とします。","ko":" 몰입형 경험 개발에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트 (예: Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code)에게 적합하며, 고급 VR/AR 플랫폼 통합이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en el desarrollo de experiencias inmersivas, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, que necesitan una integración avanzada de plataformas de RV/RA.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA axés sur le développement d''expériences immersives, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, nécessitant une intégration avancée de plates-formes de RV/RA.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die auf die Entwicklung von immersiven Erfahrungen ausgerichtet sind, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, die eine erweiterte VR/AR-Plattformintegration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados no desenvolvimento de experiências imersivas, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, que necessitam de integração avançada de plataformas de RV/RA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на разработку иммерсивных trải nghiệm, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, требующих продвинутой интеграции платформ виртуальной и дополненной реальности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يركزون على تطوير الخبرات الغامرة، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، وهم بحاجة إلى دمج متقدم لمنصات الواقع الافتراضي/الواقع المعزز."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop cross-platform immersive experiences using WebXR, ARKit, and ARCore, enabling seamless interactions across Quest, PCVR, PSVR, and HoloLens devices, and facilitating the conversion of configurations from Antigravity IDE to compatible formats for GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and other CLIs.","zh":"赋予代理开发跨平台的沉浸式体验的能力，使用WebXR、ARKit和ARCore，实现Quest、PCVR、PSVR和HoloLens设备之间的无缝交互，并促进从Antigravity IDE到GitHub Copilot、Cursor和其他CLI的兼容格式的配置转换。","ja":"WebXR、ARKit、ARCoreを使用して、エージェントがクロスプラットフォームのイミューシブ体験を開発できるようにし、Quest、PCVR、PSVR、HoloLensデバイス間のシームレスな相互作用を可能にし、Antigravity IDEからGitHub Copilot、Cursor、その他のCLIへの設定の変換を促進します。","ko":"WebXR, ARKit 및 ARCore를 사용하여 에이전트가 크로스 플랫폼의 몰입형 경험을 개발할 수 있도록 하며, Quest, PCVR, PSVR 및 HoloLens 장치 간의 무결점 상호 작용을 가능하게 하고, Antigravity IDE에서 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 및 기타 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 구성의 변환을 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar experiencias inmersivas multiplataforma utilizando WebXR, ARKit y ARCore, lo que permite interacciones sin problemas en dispositivos Quest, PCVR, PSVR y HoloLens, y facilita la conversión de configuraciones desde Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles para GitHub Copilot, Cursor y otros CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des expériences immersives multiplateformes en utilisant WebXR, ARKit et ARCore, ce qui permet des interactions sans problème sur les appareils Quest, PCVR, PSVR et HoloLens, et facilite la conversion des configurations depuis Antigravity IDE vers des formats compatibles pour GitHub Copilot, Cursor et d''autres CLI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, cross-plattform-Immersions-Erfahrungen mit WebXR, ARKit und ARCore zu entwickeln, wodurch eine nahtlose Interaktion über Geräte wie Quest, PCVR, PSVR und HoloLens ermöglicht wird und die Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate für GitHub Copilot, Cursor und andere CLI erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver experiências imersivas cross-plataforma usando WebXR, ARKit e ARCore, permitindo interações sem interrupção em dispositivos Quest, PCVR, PSVR e HoloLens, e facilitando a conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com o GitHub Copilot, Cursor e outros CLIs.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки иммерсивных trải nghiệm, независимых от платформы, с использованием WebXR, ARKit и ARCore, что обеспечивает бесперебойное взаимодействие на устройствах Quest, PCVR, PSVR и HoloLens, и облегчает преобразование настроек из Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с GitHub Copilot, Cursor и другими интерфейсами командной строки.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير خبرات غامرة متعددة المنصات باستخدام WebXR و ARKit و ARCore، مما يسمح بالتفاعلات دون انقطاع عبر أجهزة Quest و PCVR و PSVR و HoloLens، ويتيسر تحويل الإعدادات من Antigravity IDE إلى صيغ متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot و Cursor وأدوات سطر الأوامر الأخرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing standalone wireless VR experiences for Quest","Creating high-fidelity PCVR applications","Designing browser-based AR experiences with WebXR"],"zh":["为Quest开发独立的无线VR体验","创建高保真度的PCVR应用程序","使用WebXR设计基于浏览器的AR体验"],"ja":["Quest用のスタンドアロン無線VR体験の開発","高品質のPCVRアプリケーションの作成","WebXRを使用したブラウザベースのAR体験の設計"],"ko":["Quest용 독립형 무선 VR 경험 개발","고품질 PCVR 애플리케이션 생성","WebXR를 사용한 브라우저 기반 AR 경험 설계"],"es":["Desarrollar experiencias de RV inalámbricas autónomas para Quest","Crear aplicaciones de PCVR de alta fidelidad","Diseñar experiencias de RA basadas en navegador con WebXR"],"fr":["Développer des expériences de RV sans fil autonomes pour Quest","Créer des applications de PCVR haute fidélité","Concevoir des expériences de RA basées sur le navigateur avec WebXR"],"de":["Entwicklung von eigenständigen drahtlosen VR-Erfahrungen für Quest","Erstellung von PCVR-Anwendungen mit hoher Fidelität","Entwurf von browserbasierten AR-Erfahrungen mit WebXR"],"pt":["Desenvolver experiências de RV sem fio autônomas para Quest","Criar aplicações de PCVR de alta fidelidade","Projetar experiências de RA baseadas em navegador com WebXR"],"ru":["Разработка автономных беспроводных trải nghiệm виртуальной реальности для Quest","Создание высококачественных приложений PCVR","Разработка trải nghiệm дополненной реальности на основе браузера с WebXR"],"ar":["تطوير خبرات الواقع الافتراضي اللاسلكي المستقلة لجهاز Quest","إنشاء تطبيقات الواقع الافتراضي على الكمبيوتر الشخصي عالية الجودة","تصميم خبرات الواقع المعزز المبنية على المتصفح باستخدام WebXR"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of VR/AR development principles","Limited to specific platforms like Quest, PCVR, PSVR, and HoloLens"],"zh":["需要VR/AR开发原则的知识","仅限于特定平台，如Quest、PCVR、PSVR和HoloLens"],"ja":["VR/AR開発原則の知識が必要","特定のプラットフォーム（Quest、PCVR、PSVR、HoloLensなど）に限定される"],"ko":["VR/AR 개발 원칙에 대한 지식 필요","특정 플랫폼(Quest, PCVR, PSVR, HoloLens 등)으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de desarrollo de RV/RA","Limitado a plataformas específicas como Quest, PCVR, PSVR y HoloLens"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de principes de développement de RV/RA","Limité à des plates-formes spécifiques comme Quest, PCVR, PSVR et HoloLens"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von VR/AR-Entwicklungsprinzipien","Begrenzt auf spezifische Plattformen wie Quest, PCVR, PSVR und HoloLens"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos princípios de desenvolvimento de RV/RA","Limitado a plataformas específicas como Quest, PCVR, PSVR e HoloLens"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов разработки виртуальной и дополненной реальности","Ограничен конкретными платформами, такими как Quest, PCVR, PSVR и HoloLens"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمبادئ تطوير الواقع الافتراضي/الواقع المعزز","محدود بالمنصات المحددة مثل Quest و PCVR و PSVR و HoloLens"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
