licativos","ru":"Flutter Тестер: Инструмент для тестирования приложений","ar":"Flutter Tester: أداة اختبار لتطبيقات","en":"flutter-tester"},"description":{"zh":"本技能提供了编写一致、可靠、易维护的 Flutter 应用测试的综合指导。遵循测试模式、模拟策略和架构指南，确保测试隔离、可重复、涵盖成功和错误场景","ja":"このスキルは、一貫性、信頼性、メンテナンス性を保った Flutter アプリのテストを書くための包括的なガイダンスを提供します。テストパターン、モッキング戦略、建築ガイドラインに従って、テストが分離、繰り返し可能、成功およびエラーのシナリオをカバーするようにします","ko":"이 스킬은 일관성, 신뢰성, 유지보수성이 뛰어난 Flutter 애플리케이션 테스트 작성에 대한 포괄적인 가이드를 제공합니다. 테스트 패턴, 모의 전략, 아키텍처 가이드를 따르하여 테스트가 분리, 반복 가능, 성공 및 오류 시나리오를 모두 커버하도록 합니다","es":"Este skill proporciona orientación para escribir pruebas consistentes y confiables para aplicaciones Flutter. Aprende a seguir patrones de prueba y estrategi...","fr":"Ce skill fournit des conseils pour écrire des tests cohérents et fiables pour les applications Flutter. Apprenez à suivre des modèles de test et des stratégi...","de":"Dieses Skill bietet Anleitung zum Schreiben konsistenter und zuverlässiger Tests für Flutter-Anwendungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Testmuster und Mocking-Strate...","pt":"O Flutter Tester fornece orientação abrangente para escrever testes para aplicativos Flutter","ru":"Flutter Тестер предоставляет всестороннее руководство по написанию тестов для приложений Flutter","ar":"يوفّر Flutter Tester إرشادات شاملة لكتابة اختبارات لتطبيقات Flutter","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["一致的测试模式","可靠的模拟策略","易维护的架构指南","支持 Riverpod、Mockito 和 flutter_test"],"ja":["一貫性のあるテストパターン","信頼性の高いモッキング戦略","メンテナンス性の高い建築ガイドライン","Riverpod、Mockito、flutter_test をサポート"],"ko":["일관적인 테스트 패턴","신뢰할 수 있는 모의 전략","유지보수성이 높은 아키텍처 가이드","Riverpod, Mockito, flutter_test 지원"],"es":["Guía para escribir pruebas unitarias","Estrategias de mocking para pruebas","Patrones de prueba para aplicaciones Flutter","Integración con Riverpod y Mockito","Pruebas de éxito y error","Pruebas aisladas y repetibles"],"fr":["Guide pour écrire des tests unitaires","Stratégies de mocking pour les tests","Modèles de test pour les applications Flutter","Intégration avec Riverpod et Mockito","Tests de succès et d''erreur","Tests isolés et répétables"],"de":["Anleitung zum Schreiben von Einheitstests","Mocking-Strategien für Tests","Testmuster für Flutter-Anwendungen","Integration mit Riverpod und Mockito","Tests für Erfolg und Fehler","Isolierte und wiederholbare Tests"],"pt":["Orientação para testes unitários","Estratégias de mock para testes","Diretrizes arquiteturais para testes","Integração com pacotes como Riverpod e Mockito","Suporte a testes de sucesso e erro"],"ru":["Руководство по написанию unit-тестов","Стратегии мокирования для тестов","Архитектурные рекомендации для тестов","Интеграция с пакетами như Riverpod и Mockito","Поддержка тестов успеха и ошибки"],"ar":["إرشادات للاختبارات الوحدوية","استراتيجيات المحاكاة للاختبارات","إرشادات هندسية للاختبارات","التكامل مع حزم مثل Riverpod وMockito","دعم اختبارات النجاح والخطأ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter 测试","一致的测试","可靠的模拟","易维护的架构","Riverpod","Mockito","flutter_test"],"ja":["Flutter テスト","一貫性のあるテスト","信頼性の高いモッキング","メンテナンス性の高い建築","Riverpod","Mockito","flutter_test"],"ko":["Flutter 테스트","일관적인 테스트","신뢰할 수 있는 모의","유지보수성이 높은 아키텍처","Riverpod","Mockito","flutter_test"],"es":["pruebas de Flutter","tester de Flutter","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","pruebas unitarias","mocking","Riverpod","Mockito","pruebas de éxito y error"],"fr":["tests Flutter","testeur Flutter","développement d''applications mobiles","tests unitaires","mocking","Riverpod","Mockito","tests de succès et d''erreur"],"de":["Flutter-Tests","Flutter-Tester","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Einheitstests","Mocking","Riverpod","Mockito","Tests für Erfolg und Fehler"],"pt":["Flutter Tester","Testes de unidade","Mockito","Riverpod","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter","Testes de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Flutter Тестер","Unit-тесты","Mockito","Riverpod","Разработка приложений Flutter","Тестирование мобильных приложений"],"ar":["Flutter Tester","اختبارات الوحدوية","Mockito","Riverpod","تطوير تطبيقات Flutter","اختبار تطبيقات المحمول"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-tester","description":"A comprehensive Flutter testing skill for creating, writing, and analyzing tests in any Flutter project. Provides guidance on test structure, mocking patterns, Riverpod testing, widget testing, and industry best practices for reliable, maintainable tests.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Tester\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for writing consistent, reliable, and maintainable tests for Flutter applications. Follow the testing patterns, mocking strategies, and architectural guidelines to ensure tests are isolated, repeatable, and cover both success and error scenarios. This skill works with any Flutter project using common packages like Riverpod, Mockito, and flutter_test.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Creating new unit tes","body":"# Flutter Tester\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for writing consistent, reliable, and maintainable tests for Flutter applications. Follow the testing patterns, mocking strategies, and architectural guidelines to ensure tests are isolated, repeatable, and cover both success and error scenarios. This skill works with any Flutter project using common packages like Riverpod, Mockito, and flutter_test.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Creating new unit tests for repositories, providers, DAOs, or services\n- Writing widget tests for UI components and views\n- Setting up mocks and test dependencies with Mockito and Riverpod\n- Implementing Given-When-Then test structure\n- Testing state management with Riverpod providers\n- Writing integration tests for multi-layer workflows\n- Debugging or fixing existing tests\n- Ensuring proper test coverage across data, domain, and presentation layers\n\n## Core Testing Principles\n\n### 1. Clean Architecture Testing\n\nTest each layer in **isolation**:\n\n- **Data Layer** → DAOs, APIs, Repositories\n- **Domain Layer** → Models (Freezed), Entities\n- **Presentation Layer** → Providers (Riverpod), Views, Controllers\n\n### 2. Given-When-Then Structure\n\nAlways structure tests using Given-When-Then pattern:\n\n```dart\ntest(''Given valid data, When operation executes, Then returns expected result'', () async {\n  // Arrange (Given)\n  when(mockDAO.getData()).thenAnswer((_) async => testData);\n\n  // Act (When)\n  final result = await repository.fetchData();\n\n  // Assert (Then)\n  expect(result, equals(testData));\n  verify(mockDAO.getData()).called(1);\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Test Organization\n\n- Group related tests using `group()` blocks\n- Use `setUp()` for common initialization\n- Use `tearDown()` for cleanup (reset GetIt, dispose resources)\n- Use `setUpAll()` for one-time expensive setup\n\n## Testing Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Layer Under Test\n\nDetermine which architectural layer you''re testing:\n\n- **Repository tests** → Mock DAOs and APIs\n- **Provider tests** → Mock services and repositories\n- **Widget tests** → Mock providers and services\n- **DAO tests** → Use FakeDatabase\n\n### Step 2: Set Up Dependencies and Mocks\n\n#### Generate Mocks with Mockito\n\n```dart\n@GenerateMocks([ILogger, ICarouselRepository, INotificationDAO])\nvoid main() {\n  // Test code\n}\n```\n\n**Important**: Never mock providers directly. Override their dependencies instead.\n\n#### Register with GetIt\n\n```dart\nsetUp(() {\n  mockLogger = MockILogger();\n  mockRepository = MockICarouselRepository();\n  GetIt.I.registerSingleton<ILogger>(mockLogger);\n  GetIt.I.registerSingleton<ICarouselRepository>(mockRepository);\n});\n\ntearDown(() => GetIt.I.reset());\n```\n\n#### SharedPreferences Setup\n\n```dart\nsetUpAll(() async {\n  SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues({''key1'': ''value1''});\n  SharedPrefManager.instance = await SharedPreferences.getInstance();\n});\n```\n\n### Step 3: Write Tests Following Layer Patterns\n\nRefer to the `references/layer_testing_patterns.md` file for detailed examples of:\n\n- Repository testing patterns\n- Provider testing patterns with Riverpod\n- DAO testing patterns with FakeDatabase\n- Widget testing patterns with keys and screen size setup\n\n### Step 4: Test Error Scenarios\n\nAlways test both success and failure paths:\n\n```dart\ntest(''Given service throws exception, When called, Then logs error and returns fallback'', () async {\n  // Arrange\n  final exception = Exception(''Network error'');\n  when(mockService.fetchData()).thenThrow(exception);\n\n  // Act\n  final result = await repository.getData();\n\n  // Assert\n  expect(result, isEmpty); // Or appropriate fallback\n  verify(mockLogger.writeExceptionLog(''RepositoryName'', ''getData'', exception, any)).called(1);\n});\n```\n\n## Widget Testing Essentials\n\n### Always Set Screen Size\n\n```dart\ntestWidgets(''Test description'', (tester) async {\n  tester.view.physicalSize = const Size(1000, 1000);\n  tester.view.devicePixelRatio = 1.0;\n\n  // Your test code\n});\n```\n\n### Always Use Keys for Widget Finding\n\n**In source code:**\n\n```dart\nElevatedButton(\n  key: const Key(''saveButton''),\n  onPressed: () {},\n  child: const Text(''Save''),\n);\n```\n\n**In test:**\n\n```dart\nawait tester.tap(find.byKey(const Key(''saveButton'')));\nawait tester.pumpAndSettle();\n```\n\nIf a key doesn''t exist in the source widget, **add it** before writing the test.\n\n### Loading → Content Transitions\n\n```dart\nwhen(mockService.fetchData()).thenAnswer((_) async => data);\n\nawait tester.pumpWidget(createTestWidget());\nexpect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsOneWidget);\n\nawait tester.pumpAndSettle();\nexpect(find.byType(DataWidget), findsOneWidget);\n```\n\n### Platform-Specific Testing\n\n```dart\ntestWidgets(''iOS specific behavior'', (tester) async {\n  debugDefaultTargetPlatformOverride = TargetPlatform.iOS;\n\n  await tester.pumpWidget(createTestWidget());\n\n  expect(find.byType(CupertinoButton), findsOneWidget);\n\n  debugDefaultTargetPlatformOverride = null;\n});\n```\n\n## Riverpod Testing\n\n### Create Container with Overrides\n\n```dart\nfinal container = createContainer(overrides: [\n  repoProvider.overrideWith((ref) => mockRepo),\n]);\n```\n\nUse the `createContainer()` helper from `test/riverpod_container.dart` which auto-disposes on tearDown.\n\n### Test Provider State\n\n```dart\ntest(''Given valid data, When state updates, Then reflects new value'', () async {\n  final notifier = container.read(provider.notifier);\n\n  notifier.updateState(newValue);\n\n  expect(container.read(provider).value!.property, newValue);\n});\n```\n\n### Test Initial State\n\n```dart\ntest(''Given empty data, When building initial state, Then returns default state'', () async {\n  when(mockService.fetchData()).thenAnswer((_) async => []);\n\n  final container = createContainer();\n  final state = await container.read(provider.notifier).future;\n\n  expect(state.data, isEmpty);\n  expect(state.isLoading, false);\n});\n```\n\n## Stubbing Patterns\n\n### Success Scenarios\n\n```dart\nwhen(mockRepo.fetchFromDb()).thenAnswer((_) async => mockData);\nwhen(mockApi.updateData(any, any, any)).thenAnswer((_) async => true);\n```\n\n### Failure Scenarios\n\n```dart\nwhen(mockRepo.fetchFromDb()).thenThrow(Exception(''DB error''));\nwhen(mockApi.updateData(any, any, any)).thenAnswer((_) async => false);\n```\n\n### Using Completers for Async Control\n\n```dart\nfinal completer = Completer<RegistrationModel>();\n\nwhen(mockRepo.fetchData(any, any)).thenAnswer((_) => completer.future);\n\nawait tester.tap(find.text(''Save''));\nawait tester.pump();\n\nexpect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsOneWidget);\n\ncompleter.complete(const RegistrationModel(status: ''success''));\nawait tester.pump();\n\nexpect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsNothing);\n```\n\n## Fakes vs Mocks\n\n### When to Use Fakes\n\nUse fake implementations for consistent dummy behavior:\n\n```dart\nclass FakeLogger extends ILogger {\n  @override\n  void writeInfoLog(String className, String method, String message) {}\n\n  @override\n  void writeErrorLog(String className, String method, dynamic error, StackTrace? stack, [String? msg]) {}\n}\n```\n\nRegister in test setup:\n\n```dart\nGetIt.I.registerSingleton<ILogger>(FakeLogger.i);\n```\n\n### When to Use Mocks\n\nUse mocks when you need to verify method calls or setup specific behaviors:\n\n```dart\nwhen(mockLogger.writeErrorLog(any, any, any, any)).thenReturn(null);\nverify(mockLogger.writeErrorLog(''ClassName'', ''methodName'', exception, any)).called(1);\n```\n\n## Database Testing with FakeDatabase\n\n```dart\nlate MenuDAO menuDAO;\nlate Database db;\nlate IDatabase mockDatabase;\n\nsetUp(() async {\n  await FakePathProviderPlatform.initialize();\n  PathProviderPlatform.instance = FakePathProviderPlatform();\n\n  mockDatabase = FakeDatabase();\n  db = await mockDatabase.database;\n\n  menuDAO = MenuDAO(\n    dbManager: mockDatabase,\n    logger: mockLogger,\n  );\n});\n\ntearDown() async {\n  await menuDAO.deleteTable();\n  if (GetIt.I.isRegistered<IDatabase>()) {\n    await GetIt.I<IDatabase>().close();\n  }\n  await GetIt.I.reset();\n  await FakePathProviderPlatform.cleanup();\n}\n```\n\n## Test Checklist\n\nBefore submitting tests, ensure:\n\n**Setup & Mocking:**\n\n- [ ] Dependencies mocked (not providers)\n- [ ] SharedPreferences mocked if used\n- [ ] GetIt reset in tearDown\n- [ ] Streams closed in tearDown\n- [ ] Controllers disposed in tearDown\n\n**Widget Tests:**\n\n- [ ] **Keys added & used in widget tests**\n- [ ] Screen size set (physicalSize + devicePixelRatio)\n- [ ] Platform overrides reset (debugDefaultTargetPlatformOverride = null)\n- [ ] Navigation tested if applicable\n- [ ] Dialogs/overlays tested if shown\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n\n- [ ] Success & failure paths covered\n- [ ] Edge cases tested (null, empty, max values)\n- [ ] Loading states tested\n- [ ] Error states tested\n- [ ] Async handled correctly (await, Completer)\n\n**Code Quality:**\n\n- [ ] Given-When-Then naming used\n- [ ] verify() or verifyNever() used where appropriate\n- [ ] No hardcoded delays (use pump/pumpAndSettle)\n- [ ] Tests are isolated (no dependencies between tests)\n- [ ] Tests are deterministic (same result every time)\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Verification Patterns\n\n```dart\n// Single call\nverify(mockService.method()).called(1);\n\n// Multiple calls\nverify(mockService.method()).called(3);\n\n// Never called\nverifyNever(mockService.method());\n\n// Ordered calls\nverifyInOrder([\n  mockService.method1(),\n  mockService.method2(),\n]);\n```\n\n### Testing Global State\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:your_app/path/to/global_variables.dart'' as global_variables;\n\nsetUp(() {\n  global_variables.someGlobalVariable = initialValue;\n});\n\ntearDown(() {\n  global_variables.someGlobalVariable = initialValue; // Reset to default\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Dispose/Cleanup\n\n```dart\ntestWidgets(''Given provider disposed, When container disposed, Then unsubscribes and cleans up'', () async {\n  final container = createContainer();\n  final notifier = container.read(provider.notifier);\n  await notifier.future;\n\n  container.dispose();\n\n  verify(mockService.unsubscribe(any, any)).called(1);\n  verify(mockService.dispose(any)).called(1);\n});\n```\n\n## Running Tests\n\n### Run All Tests\n\n```bash\nflutter test --coverage\n# Or if using FVM:\nfvm flutter test --coverage\n```\n\n### Run Specific Test File\n\n```bash\nflutter test test/path/to/your_test.dart\n# Or if using FVM:\nfvm flutter test test/path/to/your_test.dart\n```\n\n### Run Specific Test by Name\n\n```bash\nflutter test --plain-name \"Given valid data\"\n# Or if using FVM:\nfvm flutter test --plain-name \"Given valid data\"\n```\n\n### Generate Coverage Report\n\n```bash\nflutter test --coverage\ngenhtml coverage/lcov.info -o coverage/html\n# Or if using FVM:\nfvm flutter test --coverage\ngenhtml coverage/lcov.info -o coverage/html\n```\n\n## Test Helpers and Utilities\n\n### Creating a Test Widget Wrapper\n\n```dart\nWidget createTestWidget(Widget child) {\n  return MaterialApp(\n    home: Scaffold(\n      body: child,\n    ),\n  );\n}\n\n// With Riverpod\nWidget createTestWidgetWithProviders(Widget child, List<Override> overrides) {\n  return ProviderScope(\n    overrides: overrides,\n    child: MaterialApp(\n      home: Scaffold(\n        body: child,\n      ),\n    ),\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Reusable Riverpod Container Helper\n\n```dart\nProviderContainer createContainer({List<Override> overrides = const []}) {\n  final container = ProviderContainer(overrides: overrides);\n  addTearDown(container.dispose);\n  return container;\n}\n```\n\n### Finding Widgets by Type and Text\n\n```dart\n// Find by type\nexpect(find.byType(CircularProgressIndicator), findsOneWidget);\n\n// Find by text\nexpect(find.text(''Hello''), findsOneWidget);\n\n// Find by key\nexpect(find.byKey(const Key(''myKey'')), findsOneWidget);\n\n// Find descendant\nexpect(\n  find.descendant(\n    of: find.byType(Container),\n    matching: find.text(''Child''),\n  ),\n  findsOneWidget,\n);\n\n// Find ancestor\nexpect(\n  find.ancestor(\n    of: find.text(''Child''),\n    matching: find.byType(Container),\n  ),\n  findsOneWidget,\n);\n```\n\n### Matchers for Better Assertions\n\n```dart\n// Common matchers\nexpect(value, equals(expected));\nexpect(value, isNotNull);\nexpect(value, isNull);\nexpect(list, isEmpty);\nexpect(list, isNotEmpty);\nexpect(list, hasLength(3));\nexpect(list, contains(''item''));\nexpect(list, containsAll([''a'', ''b'']));\nexpect(value, greaterThan(5));\nexpect(value, lessThan(10));\nexpect(value, inRange(1, 10));\n\n// Custom matchers\nexpect(find.byType(Widget), findsOneWidget);\nexpect(find.byType(Widget), findsNothing);\nexpect(find.byType(Widget), findsWidgets);\nexpect(find.byType(Widget), findsNWidgets(3));\n```\n\n## Additional Testing Patterns\n\n### Testing with GetIt Dependency Injection\n\n```dart\nsetUp(() {\n  GetIt.I.registerSingleton<ApiService>(mockApiService);\n  GetIt.I.registerLazySingleton<UserRepository>(() => UserRepository());\n});\n\ntearDown(() {\n  GetIt.I.reset(); // Always reset GetIt between tests\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Stream-Based Code\n\n```dart\ntest(''Given stream emits values, When listening, Then receives all values'', () async {\n  // Arrange\n  final streamController = StreamController<int>();\n  final values = <int>[];\n\n  // Act\n  streamController.stream.listen(values.add);\n  streamController.add(1);\n  streamController.add(2);\n  streamController.add(3);\n  await streamController.close();\n\n  // Wait for stream to complete\n  await Future.delayed(Duration.zero);\n\n  // Assert\n  expect(values, equals([1, 2, 3]));\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Timer-Based Code\n\n```dart\ntestWidgets(''Given timer completes, When countdown finishes, Then shows message'', (tester) async {\n  await tester.pumpWidget(MyTimerWidget());\n\n  // Fast-forward time\n  await tester.pump(const Duration(seconds: 5));\n\n  expect(find.text(''Time is up!''), findsOneWidget);\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Scrollable Widgets\n\n```dart\ntestWidgets(''Given long list, When scrolling, Then finds bottom item'', (tester) async {\n  await tester.pumpWidget(MyLongListWidget());\n\n  // Scroll until item is visible\n  await tester.scrollUntilVisible(\n    find.text(''Item 99''),\n    500.0,\n  );\n\n  expect(find.text(''Item 99''), findsOneWidget);\n});\n```\n\n## Resources\n\nThis skill includes reference files with detailed patterns and examples:\n\n### references/\n\n- `layer_testing_patterns.md` - Comprehensive examples for testing repositories, providers, DAOs, and services\n- `widget_testing_guide.md` - Detailed widget testing patterns with keys, screen size, and user interactions\n- `riverpod_testing_guide.md` - Advanced Riverpod provider testing patterns and state management testing\n\nRefer to these references when you need specific implementation examples or encounter complex testing scenarios.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:56:09.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing comprehensive Flutter testing capabilities with Riverpod, Mockito, and flutter_test.","zh":"非常适合需要全面Flutter测试能力的移动开发代理，包括Riverpod、Mockito和flutter_test。","ja":"Riverpod、Mockito、flutter_testを使用した包括的なFlutterテスト機能を必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Riverpod, Mockito, flutter_test를 사용한 포괄적인 Flutter 테스트 기능이 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo móvil que necesitan capacidades de prueba de Flutter integrales con Riverpod, Mockito y flutter_test.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile nécessitant des capacités de test Flutter complètes avec Riverpod, Mockito et flutter_test.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Development Agents, die umfassende Flutter-Testfunktionen mit Riverpod, Mockito und flutter_test benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento móvel que necessitam de capacidades de teste abrangentes do Flutter com Riverpod, Mockito e flutter_test.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности тестирования Flutter с помощью Riverpod, Mockito и flutter_test.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة تطوير الهاتف المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات اختبار شاملة لFlutter مع Riverpod و Mockito و flutter_test."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write consistent, reliable, and maintainable tests for Flutter applications, covering both success and error scenarios with isolated and repeatable testing patterns, utilizing Riverpod for state management and Mockito for mocking dependencies.","zh":"赋予代理编写一致、可靠且可维护的Flutter应用程序测试的能力，涵盖成功和错误场景，并使用Riverpod进行状态管理和Mockito进行依赖模拟，采用隔离和可重复的测试模式。","ja":"エージェントが一貫性のある、信頼性の高い、かつ保守可能なFlutterアプリケーションのテストを書くことを可能にします。Riverpodを使用した状態管理とMockitoを使用した依存関係のモッキングにより、成功シナリオとエラーシナリオの両方をカバーし、隔離されたリピータブルなテストパターンを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 일관성 있고 신뢰할 수 있으며 유지 보수할 수 있는 Flutter 애플리케이션 테스트를 작성할 수 있도록 합니다. Riverpod를 사용한 상태 관리와 Mockito를 사용한 의존성 모의를 통해 성공 시나리오와 오류 시나리오 모두를 커버하고 분리 및 반복 가능한 테스트 패턴을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir pruebas consistentes, confiables y mantenibles para aplicaciones Flutter, cubriendo tanto escenarios de éxito como de error con patrones de prueba aislados y repetibles, utilizando Riverpod para la gestión de estado y Mockito para simular dependencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests cohérents, fiables et maintainables pour les applications Flutter, couvrant à la fois les scénarios de réussite et d''erreur avec des modèles de test isolés et répétables, en utilisant Riverpod pour la gestion d''état et Mockito pour simuler les dépendances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konsistente, zuverlässige und wartbare Tests für Flutter-Anwendungen zu schreiben, die sowohl Erfolgs- als auch Fehler-Szenarien mit isolierten und wiederholbaren Testmustern abdecken, wobei Riverpod für die Zustandsverwaltung und Mockito für das Mocken von Abhängigkeiten verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes consistentes, confiáveis e mantidos para aplicações Flutter, cobrindo tanto cenários de sucesso quanto de erro com padrões de teste isolados e repetíveis, utilizando Riverpod para gerenciamento de estado e Mockito para simular dependências.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать последовательные, надежные и поддерживаемые тесты для приложений Flutter, охватывая как успешные, так и ошибочные сценарии с помощью изолированных и повторяющихся шаблонов тестирования, используя Riverpod для управления состоянием и Mockito для имитации зависимостей.","ar":"يمكن للعميلة كتابة اختبارات متسقة وآمنة وقابلة للصيانة لتطبيقات Flutter، وتغطية كل من السيناريوهات الناجحة والخاطئة باستخدام أنماط اختبار معزولة وقابلة للتكرار، وذلك باستخدام Riverpod لإدارة الحالة و Mockito لمحاكاة الاعتماديات."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new unit tests for Flutter applications","Implementing mocking strategies with Mockito for complex dependencies","Architecting test suites with flutter_test for comprehensive coverage"],"zh":["为Flutter应用程序创建新的单元测试","使用Mockito为复杂依赖实现模拟策略","使用flutter_test架构测试套件以实现全面覆盖"],"ja":["Flutterアプリケーションの新しいユニットテストを作成する","Mockitoを使用して複雑な依存関係のモッキング戦略を実装する","flutter_testを使用して包括的なカバレッジのためのテストスイートをアーキテクチャする"],"ko":["Flutter 애플리케이션에 대한 새로운 유닛 테스트 생성","Mockito를 사용하여 복잡한 의존성에 대한 모의 전략 구현","flutter_test를 사용하여 포괄적인 커버리지에 대한 테스트 스위트 아키텍처"],"es":["Crear nuevas pruebas unitarias para aplicaciones Flutter","Implementar estrategias de simulación con Mockito para dependencias complejas","Diseñar suites de pruebas con flutter_test para una cobertura integral"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles tests unitaires pour les applications Flutter","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de simulation avec Mockito pour les dépendances complexes","Concevoir des suites de tests avec flutter_test pour une couverture complète"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Unit-Tests für Flutter-Anwendungen","Implementieren von Mocking-Strategien mit Mockito für komplexe Abhängigkeiten","Architektur von Test-Suiten mit flutter_test für umfassende Abdeckung"],"pt":["Criar novos testes unitários para aplicações Flutter","Implementar estratégias de simulação com Mockito para dependências complexas","Arquitetar conjuntos de testes com flutter_test para cobertura abrangente"],"ru":["Создание новых юнит-тестов для приложений Flutter","Реализация стратегий имитации с помощью Mockito для сложных зависимостей","Проектирование наборов тестов с помощью flutter_test для всестороннего покрытия"],"ar":["إنشاء اختبارات وحدة جديدة لتطبيقات Flutter","تنفيذ استراتيجيات محاكاة باستخدام Mockito للاعتماديات المعقدة","تصميم مجموعات اختبار باستخدام flutter_test لتغطية شاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Flutter project setup","Limited to Flutter applications using Riverpod, Mockito, and flutter_test"],"zh":["需要Flutter项目设置","仅限使用Riverpod、Mockito和flutter_test的Flutter应用程序"],"ja":["Flutterプロジェクトのセットアップが必要","Riverpod、Mockito、flutter_testを使用するFlutterアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Flutter 프로젝트 설정이 필요","Riverpod, Mockito, flutter_test를 사용하는 Flutter 애플리케이션에 한정"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto Flutter","Limitado a aplicaciones Flutter que utilizan Riverpod, Mockito y flutter_test"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Flutter","Limité aux applications Flutter utilisant Riverpod, Mockito et flutter_test"],"de":["Benötigt Flutter-Projekt-Setup","Begrenzt auf Flutter-Anwendungen, die Riverpod, Mockito und flutter_test verwenden"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Flutter","Limitado a aplicações Flutter que usam Riverpod, Mockito e flutter_test"],"ru":["Требуется настройка проекта Flutter","Ограничен для приложений Flutter, которые используют Riverpod, Mockito и flutter_test"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Flutter","محدود لتطبيقات Flutter التي تستخدم Riverpod و Mockito و flutter_test"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/payment-integration', 'community', 'yashvinthan', 'DuskSpendr', 'yashvinthan/DuskSpendr', 'payment-integration', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z', '2026-02-18T12:56:09.088Z', NULL, '{"id":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/payment-integration","name":"payment-integration","description":{"zh":"支付集成专家，专注于安全、合规的支付系统，涵盖网关集成、交易处理、订阅管理和欺诈防止","ja":"決済統合の専門家、安全でコンプライアンスのある決済システムに重点を置く、ゲートウェイ統合、取引処理、サブスクリプション管理、不正防止を含む","ko":"결제 통합 전문가, 안전하고 규정 준수하는 결제 시스템에 중점을 둠, 게이트웨이 통합, 거래 처리, 구독 관리 및 사기 방지를 포함","es":"La integración de pagos seguros implica implementar sistemas de pago confiables y cumplir con la PCI. Esto incluye la integración de pasarelas de pago, el procesamiento de transacciones y la prevención de fraudes.","fr":"L''intégration de paiement sécurisé consiste à mettre en œuvre des systèmes de paiement fiables et à respecter la PCI. Cela inclut l''intégration de passerelles de paiement, le traitement des transactions et la prévention des fraudes.","de":"Die sichere Zahlungsintegration beinhaltet die Implementierung zuverlässiger Zahlungssysteme und die Einhaltung der PCI. Dazu gehören die Integration von Zahlungsgateways, die Transaktionsverarbeitung und die Betrugsprävention.","pt":"Implemente sistemas de pagamento seguros e confiáveis com especialista em pagamento. Aprenda sobre gateway de pagamento, processamento de transações e prevenção de fraude","ru":"Реализуйте безопасные и надежные системы платежей с помощью специалиста по платежам. Узнайте о шлюзах платежей, обработке транзакций и предотвращении мошенничества","ar":"نفذ أنظمة دفع آمنة وموثوقة مع chuyên家 الدفع. تعلم عن بوابات الدفع ومعالجة المعاملات وتحديد الاحتيال","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"支付集成解决方案","ja":"決済統合ソリューション","ko":"결제 통합 솔루션","es":"Integración de Pagos Seguros","fr":"Intégration de Paiement Sécurisé","de":"Sichere Zahl