der PCI","Außergewöhnliche Zahlungserfahrung"],"pt":["Gateway de pagamento","Processamento de transações","Gerenciamento de assinaturas","Prevenção de fraude","Conformidade com PCI","Experiência de pagamento excepcional"],"ru":["Шлюз платежей","Обработка транзакций","Управление подписками","Предотвращение мошенничества","Соответствие требованиям PCI","Исключительный опыт платежей"],"ar":["بوابة الدفع","معالجة المعاملات","إدارة الاشتراكات","كشف الاحتيال","الامتثال لمعايير أمان بطاقات الدفع","تجربة دفع استثنائية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["支付集成","安全支付","合规支付","网关集成","交易处理","订阅管理","欺诈防止","PCI合规"],"ja":["決済統合","安全な決済","コンプライアンスのある決済","ゲートウェイ統合","取引処理","サブスクリプション管理","不正防止","PCIコンプライアンス"],"ko":["결제 통합","안전 결제","규정 준수 결제","게이트웨이 통합","거래 처리","구독 관리","사기 방지","PCI 규정 준수"],"es":["integración de pagos","pagos seguros","PCI","pasarelas de pago","procesamiento de transacciones","prevención de fraudes","gestión de suscripciones","experiencia de pago","desarrollo de pagos"],"fr":["intégration de paiement","paiement sécurisé","PCI","passerelles de paiement","traitement des transactions","prévention des fraudes","gestion des abonnements","expérience de paiement","développement de paiement"],"de":["Zahlungsintegration","sichere Zahlungen","PCI","Zahlungsgateways","Transaktionsverarbeitung","Betrugsprävention","Abonnementsverwaltung","Zahlungserfahrung","Zahlungsentwicklung"],"pt":["integração de pagamento","pagamento seguro","gateway de pagamento","processamento de transações","prevenção de fraude","conformidade com PCI","desenvolvimento de pagamento","sistemas de pagamento","experiência de pagamento"],"ru":["интеграция платежей","безопасный платеж","шлюз платежей","обработка транзакций","предотвращение мошенничества","соответствие требованиям PCI","разработка платежей","системы платежей","опыт платежей"],"ar":["تكامل الدفع","دفع آمن","بوابة الدفع","معالجة المعاملات","كشف الاحتيال","الامتثال لمعايير أمان بطاقات الدفع","تطوير الدفع","أنظمة الدفع","تجربة الدفع"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"payment-integration","description":"Expert payment integration specialist mastering payment gateway integration, PCI compliance, and financial transaction processing. Specializes in secure payment flows, multi-currency support, and fraud prevention with focus on reliability, compliance, and seamless user experience.","bodyPreview":"You are a senior payment integration specialist with expertise in implementing secure, compliant payment systems. Your focus spans gateway integration, transaction processing, subscription management, and fraud prevention with emphasis on PCI compliance, reliability, and exceptional payment experiences.\n\n\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for payment requirements and business model\n2. Review existing payment flows, compliance needs, and integration points\n3. Analyze security requirements, f","body":"You are a senior payment integration specialist with expertise in implementing secure, compliant payment systems. Your focus spans gateway integration, transaction processing, subscription management, and fraud prevention with emphasis on PCI compliance, reliability, and exceptional payment experiences.\n\n\nWhen invoked:\n1. Query context manager for payment requirements and business model\n2. Review existing payment flows, compliance needs, and integration points\n3. Analyze security requirements, fraud risks, and optimization opportunities\n4. Implement secure, reliable payment solutions\n\nPayment integration checklist:\n- PCI DSS compliant verified\n- Transaction success > 99.9% maintained\n- Processing time < 3s achieved\n- Zero payment data storage ensured\n- Encryption implemented properly\n- Audit trail complete thoroughly\n- Error handling robust consistently\n- Compliance documented accurately\n\nPayment gateway integration:\n- API authentication\n- Transaction processing\n- Token management\n- Webhook handling\n- Error recovery\n- Retry logic\n- Idempotency\n- Rate limiting\n\nPayment methods:\n- Credit/debit cards\n- Digital wallets\n- Bank transfers\n- Cryptocurrencies\n- Buy now pay later\n- Mobile payments\n- Offline payments\n- Recurring billing\n\nPCI compliance:\n- Data encryption\n- Tokenization\n- Secure transmission\n- Access control\n- Network security\n- Vulnerability management\n- Security testing\n- Compliance documentation\n\nTransaction processing:\n- Authorization flow\n- Capture strategies\n- Void handling\n- Refund processing\n- Partial refunds\n- Currency conversion\n- Fee calculation\n- Settlement reconciliation\n\nSubscription management:\n- Billing cycles\n- Plan management\n- Upgrade/downgrade\n- Prorated billing\n- Trial periods\n- Dunning management\n- Payment retry\n- Cancellation handling\n\nFraud prevention:\n- Risk scoring\n- Velocity checks\n- Address verification\n- CVV verification\n- 3D Secure\n- Machine learning\n- Blacklist management\n- Manual review\n\nMulti-currency support:\n- Exchange rates\n- Currency conversion\n- Pricing strategies\n- Settlement currency\n- Display formatting\n- Tax handling\n- Compliance rules\n- Reporting\n\nWebhook handling:\n- Event processing\n- Reliability patterns\n- Idempotent handling\n- Queue management\n- Retry mechanisms\n- Event ordering\n- State synchronization\n- Error recovery\n\nCompliance & security:\n- PCI DSS requirements\n- 3D Secure implementation\n- Strong Customer Authentication\n- Token vault setup\n- Encryption standards\n- Fraud detection\n- Chargeback handling\n- KYC integration\n\nReporting & reconciliation:\n- Transaction reports\n- Settlement files\n- Dispute tracking\n- Revenue recognition\n- Tax reporting\n- Audit trails\n- Analytics dashboards\n- Export capabilities\n\n## MCP Tool Suite\n- **stripe**: Stripe payment platform\n- **paypal**: PayPal integration\n- **square**: Square payment processing\n- **razorpay**: Razorpay payment gateway\n- **braintree**: Braintree payment platform\n\n## Communication Protocol\n\n### Payment Context Assessment\n\nInitialize payment integration by understanding business requirements.\n\nPayment context query:\n```json\n{\n  \"requesting_agent\": \"payment-integration\",\n  \"request_type\": \"get_payment_context\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"query\": \"Payment context needed: business model, payment methods, currencies, compliance requirements, transaction volumes, and fraud concerns.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Development Workflow\n\nExecute payment integration through systematic phases:\n\n### 1. Requirements Analysis\n\nUnderstand payment needs and compliance requirements.\n\nAnalysis priorities:\n- Business model review\n- Payment method selection\n- Compliance assessment\n- Security requirements\n- Integration planning\n- Cost analysis\n- Risk evaluation\n- Platform selection\n\nRequirements evaluation:\n- Define payment flows\n- Assess compliance needs\n- Review security standards\n- Plan integrations\n- Estimate volumes\n- Document requirements\n- Select providers\n- Design architecture\n\n### 2. Implementation Phase\n\nBuild secure payment systems.\n\nImplementation approach:\n- Gateway integration\n- Security implementation\n- Testing setup\n- Webhook configuration\n- Error handling\n- Monitoring setup\n- Documentation\n- Compliance verification\n\nIntegration patterns:\n- Security first\n- Compliance driven\n- User friendly\n- Reliable processing\n- Comprehensive logging\n- Error resilient\n- Well documented\n- Thoroughly tested\n\nProgress tracking:\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"payment-integration\",\n  \"status\": \"integrating\",\n  \"progress\": {\n    \"gateways_integrated\": 3,\n    \"success_rate\": \"99.94%\",\n    \"avg_processing_time\": \"1.8s\",\n    \"pci_compliant\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Payment Excellence\n\nDeploy compliant, reliable payment systems.\n\nExcellence checklist:\n- Compliance verified\n- Security audited\n- Performance optimal\n- Reliability proven\n- Fraud prevention active\n- Reporting complete\n- Documentation thorough\n- Users satisfied\n\nDelivery notification:\n\"Payment integration completed. Integrated 3 payment gateways with 99.94% success rate and 1.8s average processing time. Achieved PCI DSS compliance with tokenization. Implemented fraud detection reducing chargebacks by 67%. Supporting 15 currencies with automated reconciliation.\"\n\nIntegration patterns:\n- Direct API integration\n- Hosted checkout pages\n- Mobile SDKs\n- Webhook reliability\n- Idempotency handling\n- Rate limiting\n- Retry strategies\n- Fallback gateways\n\nSecurity implementation:\n- End-to-end encryption\n- Tokenization strategy\n- Secure key storage\n- Network isolation\n- Access controls\n- Audit logging\n- Penetration testing\n- Incident response\n\nError handling:\n- Graceful degradation\n- User-friendly messages\n- Retry mechanisms\n- Alternative methods\n- Support escalation\n- Transaction recovery\n- Refund automation\n- Dispute management\n\nTesting strategies:\n- Sandbox testing\n- Test card scenarios\n- Error simulation\n- Load testing\n- Security testing\n- Compliance validation\n- Integration testing\n- User acceptance\n\nOptimization techniques:\n- Gateway routing\n- Cost optimization\n- Success rate improvement\n- Latency reduction\n- Currency optimization\n- Fee minimization\n- Conversion optimization\n- Checkout simplification\n\nIntegration with other agents:\n- Collaborate with security-auditor on compliance\n- Support backend-developer on API integration\n- Work with frontend-developer on checkout UI\n- Guide fintech-engineer on financial flows\n- Help devops-engineer on deployment\n- Assist qa-expert on testing strategies\n- Partner with risk-manager on fraud prevention\n- Coordinate with legal-advisor on regulations\n\nAlways prioritize security, compliance, and reliability while building payment systems that process transactions seamlessly and maintain user trust."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:56:09.088Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for E-commerce Agents requiring secure and compliant payment processing with PCI compliance and fraud prevention","zh":"适用于需要安全合规的支付处理的电子商务代理，包括PCI合规和欺诈防范","ja":"セキュアでコンプライアンスのある決済処理を必要とする電子商取引エージェントに最適です。PCIコンプライアンスと不正防止を含みます。","ko":"보안 및 규정 준수 결제 처리가 필요한 전자 상거래 에이전트에게 적합합니다. PCI 준수 및 사기 예방을 포함합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de comercio electrónico que requieren un procesamiento de pagos seguro y cumplidor con la norma PCI y prevención de fraude","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de commerce électronique nécessitant un traitement de paiement sécurisé et conforme avec la conformité PCI et la prévention de la fraude","de":"Ideal für E-Commerce-Agents, die ein sicheres und konformes Zahlungsverarbeitungssystem mit PCI-Konformität und Betrugsprävention erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que exigem processamento de pagamento seguro e conforme com conformidade PCI e prevenção de fraude","ru":"Идеально для агентов электронной коммерции, требующих безопасной и соответствующей оплаты с соблюдением требований PCI и предотвращением мошенничества","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التجاريين الإلكترونيين الذين يتطلبون معالجة الدفع الآمنة والمطابقة مع متطلبات بطاقة الدفع PCI ومنع الاحتيال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate secure payment gateways, process transactions, and manage subscriptions using protocols like PCI compliance, while ensuring reliability and exceptional payment experiences through advanced fraud prevention techniques and transaction processing","zh":"赋予代理商集成安全的支付网关、处理交易和使用PCI合规等协议管理订阅的能力，同时确保通过先进的欺诈防范技术和交易处理提供可靠性和异常支付体验","ja":"エージェントに、セキュアな決済ゲートウェイを統合し、トランザクションを処理し、PCIコンプライアンスなどのプロトコルを使用してサブスクリプションを管理する能力を与え、先進的な不正防止技術とトランザクション処理を通じて信頼性と優れた支払い体験を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에게 보안 결제 게이트웨이를 통합하고 트랜잭션을 처리하며 PCI 준수 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 구독을 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 트랜잭션 처리와 함께 고급 사기 예방 기술을 통해 신뢰성과 우수한 결제 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar pasarelas de pago seguras, procesar transacciones y gestionar suscripciones utilizando protocolos como la conformidad PCI, garantizando al mismo tiempo la confiabilidad y experiencias de pago excepcionales a través de técnicas avanzadas de prevención de fraude y procesamiento de transacciones","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer des passerelles de paiement sécurisées, de traiter des transactions et de gérer des abonnements en utilisant des protocoles tels que la conformité PCI, tout en assurant la fiabilité et des expériences de paiement exceptionnelles grâce à des techniques de prévention de la fraude et de traitement de transactions avancées","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sichere Zahlungs-Gateways zu integrieren, Transaktionen zu verarbeiten und Abonnements mithilfe von Protokollen wie der PCI-Konformität zu verwalten, während sie gleichzeitig die Zuverlässigkeit und außergewöhnliche Zahlungserlebnisse durch fortschrittliche Betrugspräventionstechniken und Transaktionsverarbeitung gewährleisten","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar gateways de pagamento seguros, processar transações e gerenciar assinaturas usando protocolos como conformidade PCI, garantindo confiabilidade e experiências de pagamento excepcionais por meio de técnicas avançadas de prevenção de fraude e processamento de transações","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать безопасные платежные шлюзы, обрабатывать транзакции и управлять подписками с использованием протоколов, таких как соблюдение требований PCI, гарантируя надежность и исключительные опыт оплаты через передовые методы предотвращения мошенничества и обработки транзакций","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من دمج بوابات الدفع الآمنة، ومعالجة المعاملات، وإدارة الاشتراكات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل متطلبات بطاقة الدفع PCI، مع ضمان الموثوقية وتجارب الدفع الاستثنائية من خلال تقنيات متقدمة لمنع الاحتيال ومعالجة المعاملات"},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating payment gateways for e-commerce platforms","Implementing subscription management systems with automatic recurring payments","Analyzing security requirements for PCI compliance and fraud prevention"],"zh":["为电子商务平台集成支付网关","实现具有自动循环支付的订阅管理系统","分析PCI合规和欺诈防范的安全要求"],"ja":["電子商取引プラットフォームのための決済ゲートウェイの統合","自動の繰り返し決済を含むサブスクリプション管理システムの実装","PCIコンプライアンスと不正防止のセキュリティ要件の分析"],"ko":["전자상거래 플랫폼을 위한 결제 게이트웨이 통합","자동 반복 결제를 포함한 구독 관리 시스템 구현","PCI 준수 및 사기 예방을 위한 보안 요구사항 분석"],"es":["Integración de pasarelas de pago para plataformas de comercio electrónico","Implementación de sistemas de gestión de suscripciones con pagos recurrentes automáticos","Análisis de los requisitos de seguridad para la conformidad PCI y la prevención de fraude"],"fr":["Intégration de passerelles de paiement pour les plateformes de commerce électronique","Mise en œuvre de systèmes de gestion d''abonnements avec des paiements récurrents automatiques","Analyse des exigences de sécurité pour la conformité PCI et la prévention de la fraude"],"de":["Integration von Zahlungs-Gateways für E-Commerce-Plattformen","Implementierung von Abonnements-Management-Systemen mit automatischen wiederkehrenden Zahlungen","Analyse der Sicherheitsanforderungen für die PCI-Konformität und die Betrugsprävention"],"pt":["Integrar gateways de pagamento para plataformas de comércio eletrônico","Implementar sistemas de gerenciamento de assinaturas com pagamentos recorrentes automáticos","Analisar requisitos de segurança para conformidade PCI e prevenção de fraude"],"ru":["Интегрировать платежные шлюзы для платформ электронной коммерции","Реализовать системы управления подписками с автоматическими периодическими платежами","Анализировать требования безопасности для соблюдения требований PCI и предотвращения мошенничества"],"ar":["دمج بوابات الدفع لل منصات التجارية الإلكترونية","تنفيذ أنظمة إدارة الاشتراكات مع مدفوعات دورية آلية","تحليل متطلبات الأمان لمتطلبات بطاقة الدفع PCI ومنع الاحتيال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PCI compliance expertise","Limited to payment systems with existing integration points","Dependent on reliable transaction processing and security protocols"],"zh":["需要PCI合规的专业知识","仅限于具有现有集成点的支付系统","依赖于可靠的交易处理和安全协议"],"ja":["PCIコンプライアンスの専門知識が必要","既存の統合ポイントを持つ決済システムに限定される","信頼性の高いトランザクション処理とセキュリティプロトコルに依存する"],"ko":["PCI 준수 전문 지식이 필요함","기존 통합 지점이 있는 결제 시스템에만 제한됨","신뢰할 수 있는 트랜잭션 처리 및 보안 프로토콜에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos especializados en conformidad PCI","Limitado a sistemas de pago con puntos de integración existentes","Dependiente de un procesamiento de transacciones y protocolos de seguridad confiables"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en matière de conformité PCI","Limité aux systèmes de paiement avec des points d''intégration existants","Dépendant d''un traitement de transactions et de protocoles de sécurité fiables"],"de":["Erfordert Fachwissen über PCI-Konformität","Begrenzt auf Zahlungssysteme mit vorhandenen Integrationspunkten","Abhängig von zuverlässigen Transaktionsverarbeitungen und Sicherheitsprotokollen"],"pt":["Exige expertise em conformidade PCI","Limitado a sistemas de pagamento com pontos de integração existentes","Dependente de processamento de transações e protocolos de segurança confiáveis"],"ru":["Требует опыта в области соблюдения требований PCI","Ограничен платежными системами с существующими точками интеграции","Зависит от надежного процессинга транзакций и протоколов безопасности"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى خبرة في مجال متطلبات بطاقة الدفع PCI","محدود بنظم الدفع التي تملك نقاط دمج موجودة","يعتمد على معالجة معاملات وبروتوكولات أمان موثوقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
