ription":{"zh":"Moai Lang Flutter 是一个跨平台开发工具，支持最新的 Dart 和 Flutter 版本，提供现代化的开发模式和强大的功能","ja":"Moai Lang Flutter は、最新の Dart と Flutter バージョンをサポートするクロスプラットフォーム開発ツールです","ko":"Moai Lang Flutter 는 최신의 Dart 와 Flutter 버전을 지원하는 크로스 플랫폼 개발 도구입니다","es":"El kit de desarrollo de Flutter con Dart 3.5+ y patrones modernos permite crear aplicaciones cross-platform con facilidad.","fr":"Le kit de développement Flutter avec Dart 3.5+ et modèles modernes permet de créer des applications cross-platform avec facilité.","de":"Das Flutter-Entwicklungskit mit Dart 3.5+ und modernen Mustern ermöglicht die einfache Erstellung von Cross-Platform-Anwendungen.","pt":"Moai-Lang-Flutter é uma habilidade para desenvolvedores que desejam criar aplicativos cross-platform com Dart 3.5 e Flutter 3.24","ru":"Moai-Lang-Flutter - это навык для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать кроссплатформенные приложения с Dart 3.5 и Flutter 3.24","ar":"Moai-Lang-Flutter هي مهارة لالمطورين الذين يرغبون في إنشاء تطبيقات متعددة المنصات مع Dart 3.5 و Flutter 3.24","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Dart 3.5 支持","Flutter 3.24 支持","现代化开发模式","Riverpod 状态管理","go_router 声明式导航"],"ja":["Dart 3.5 サポート","Flutter 3.24 サポート","モダンな開発パターン","Riverpod 状態管理","go_router 宣言的ナビゲーション"],"ko":["Dart 3.5 지원","Flutter 3.24 지원","최신 개발 패턴","Riverpod 상태 관리","go_router 선언적 내비게이션"],"es":["Dart 3.5 con patrones, registros y clases selladas","Flutter 3.24 con árbol de widgets y diseños adaptativos","Gestión de estado con Riverpod y generación de código","Navegación declarativa con go_router y enlace profundo","Canales de plataforma para iOS y Android"],"fr":["Dart 3.5 avec modèles, enregistrements et classes scellées","Flutter 3.24 avec arbre de widgets et conceptions adaptatives","Gestion d''état avec Riverpod et génération de code","Navigation déclarative avec go_router et lien profond","Canaux de plateforme pour iOS et Android"],"de":["Dart 3.5 mit Mustern, Registrierungen und abgeschlossenen Klassen","Flutter 3.24 mit Widget-Baum und adaptiven Designs","Statusverwaltung mit Riverpod und Codegenerierung","Deklarative Navigation mit go_router und Tiefverknüpfung","Plattformkanäle für iOS und Android"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos cross-platform com Dart 3.5 e Flutter 3.24","Padrões modernos de desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Gerenciamento de estado com Riverpod","Navegação declarativa com go_router","Canais de plataforma para integração nativa"],"ru":["Разработка кроссплатформенных приложений с Dart 3.5 и Flutter 3.24","Современные шаблоны разработки приложений","Управление состоянием с Riverpod","Декларативная навигация с go_router","Платформенные каналы для родной интеграции"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات متعددة المنصات مع Dart 3.5 و Flutter 3.24","أنماط تطوير تطبيقات حديثة","إدارة الحالة مع Riverpod","تنقل إعلاني مع go_router","قنوات منصة للدمج الأصلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Moai Lang Flutter","跨平台开发","Dart 3.5","Flutter 3.24","Riverpod","go_router"],"ja":["Moai Lang Flutter","クロスプラットフォーム開発","Dart 3.5","Flutter 3.24","Riverpod","go_router"],"ko":["Moai Lang Flutter","크로스 플랫폼 개발","Dart 3.5","Flutter 3.24","Riverpod","go_router"],"es":["desarrollo de Flutter","Dart 3.5","patrones de diseño","gestión de estado","navegación declarativa","aplicaciones cross-platform"," Riverpod","go_router"],"fr":["développement Flutter","Dart 3.5","modèles de conception","gestion d''état","navigation déclarative","applications cross-platform","Riverpod","go_router"],"de":["Flutter-Entwicklung","Dart 3.5","Entwurfsmuster","Statusverwaltung","deklarative Navigation","Cross-Platform-Anwendungen","Riverpod","go_router"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Dart 3.5","Flutter 3.24","aplicativos cross-platform","Riverpod","go_router","canais de plataforma"],"ru":["разработка приложений","Dart 3.5","Flutter 3.24","кроссплатформенные приложения","Riverpod","go_router","платформенные каналы"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات","Dart 3.5","Flutter 3.24","تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","Riverpod","go_router","قنوات المنصة"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moai-lang-flutter","description":">","version":"1.1.0","tags":"flutter, dart, riverpod, cross-platform, mobile, desktop","bodyPreview":"## Quick Reference (30 seconds)\n\nFlutter/Dart Development Expert - Dart 3.5+, Flutter 3.24+ with modern patterns.\n\nAuto-Triggers: Flutter projects (`.dart` files, `pubspec.yaml`), cross-platform apps, widget development\n\nCore Capabilities:\n\n- Dart 3.5: Patterns, records, sealed classes, extension types\n- Flutter 3.24: Widget tree, Material 3, adaptive layouts\n- Riverpod: State management with code generation\n- go_router: Declarative navigation and deep linking\n- Platform Channels: Native iOS/And","body":"## Quick Reference (30 seconds)\n\nFlutter/Dart Development Expert - Dart 3.5+, Flutter 3.24+ with modern patterns.\n\nAuto-Triggers: Flutter projects (`.dart` files, `pubspec.yaml`), cross-platform apps, widget development\n\nCore Capabilities:\n\n- Dart 3.5: Patterns, records, sealed classes, extension types\n- Flutter 3.24: Widget tree, Material 3, adaptive layouts\n- Riverpod: State management with code generation\n- go_router: Declarative navigation and deep linking\n- Platform Channels: Native iOS/Android integration\n- Testing: flutter_test, widget_test, integration_test\n\n## Implementation Guide (5 minutes)\n\n### Dart 3.5 Language Features\n\nPattern Matching with Sealed Classes: Define a sealed class Result with generic type parameter T. Create subclasses Success containing data field and Failure containing error string. Use switch expressions with pattern matching on the sealed type. Patterns use colon syntax to extract named fields. Add guard clauses with when keyword for conditional matching based on field values.\n\nRecords and Destructuring: Define type aliases for records using parentheses with named fields. Create functions returning multiple values as record tuples with positional elements. Use destructuring syntax with parentheses on the left side of assignment. In for loops, destructure named record fields directly using colon syntax.\n\nExtension Types: Define extension types with the type keyword, wrapping a base type in parentheses. Add factory constructors for validation logic. Define getters for computed properties on the underlying value.\n\n### Riverpod State Management\n\nProvider Definitions: Import riverpod_annotation and add part directive for generated file. Use @riverpod annotation on functions to create simple providers. Return repository instances reading other providers with ref.read. Create async providers by returning Future types. For stateful providers, create classes extending the generated underscore class, override build method for initial state, and add methods that modify state using AsyncValue.guard.\n\nWidget Integration: Create ConsumerWidget subclasses. In build method, receive WidgetRef as second parameter. Use ref.watch to observe provider values. Handle AsyncValue with when method providing data, loading, and error callbacks. Use ref.invalidate to refresh data. Use ref.listen in StatefulWidget for side effects like showing snackbars.\n\nStatefulWidget with Riverpod: Extend ConsumerStatefulWidget and ConsumerState. Initialize TextEditingController in initState and dispose in dispose. Use ref.listen in build for side effects. Check isLoading state to disable buttons during async operations. Access notifier methods with ref.read and the notifier getter.\n\n### go_router Navigation\n\nRouter Configuration: Create GoRouter instance with initialLocation. Define routes array with GoRoute objects containing path, name, and builder. Nest child routes in routes array. Use ShellRoute for persistent navigation shells. Create pageBuilder using NoTransitionPage for tab navigation. Implement redirect callback checking authentication state and returning redirect path or null to allow navigation. Define errorBuilder for error handling.\n\nNavigation methods: Use context.go for declarative navigation with path. Use context.canPop to check before context.pop.\n\n### Platform Channels\n\nDart Implementation: Define class with MethodChannel and EventChannel constants using channel name strings. Create async methods that invoke methods on the channel with invokeMethod, catching PlatformException. For streaming data, call receiveBroadcastStream on EventChannel and map events to typed objects. Set up method call handler with setMethodCallHandler to receive calls from native code.\n\n### Widget Patterns\n\nAdaptive Layouts: Create StatelessWidget with required parameters for child, destinations, selectedIndex, and onDestinationSelected callback. In build, get width using MediaQuery.sizeOf. Use conditional returns based on width breakpoints. Under 600 pixels, return Scaffold with NavigationBar in bottomNavigationBar. Under 840 pixels, return Scaffold with Row containing NavigationRail and expanded child. Above 840 pixels, return Scaffold with Row containing NavigationDrawer and expanded child.\n\n### Testing\n\nWidget Test Example: In test main function, create ProviderContainer with overrides for mock providers. Use tester.pumpWidget with UncontrolledProviderScope wrapping MaterialApp with the widget under test. Assert initial loading state with find.byType. Call tester.pumpAndSettle to wait for async operations. Assert final state with find.text.\n\nFor comprehensive testing patterns, see [examples.md](examples.md).\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\nFor comprehensive coverage including:\n\n- Clean Architecture with Riverpod\n- Isolates for compute-heavy operations\n- Custom render objects and painting\n- FFI and platform-specific plugins\n- Performance optimization and profiling\n\nSee: [reference.md](reference.md) and [examples.md](examples.md)\n\n## Context7 Library Mappings\n\nFlutter/Dart Core:\n\n- `/flutter/flutter` - Flutter framework\n- `/dart-lang/sdk` - Dart SDK\n\nState Management:\n\n- `/rrousselGit/riverpod` - Riverpod state management\n- `/felangel/bloc` - BLoC pattern\n\nNavigation and Storage:\n\n- `/flutter/packages` - go_router and official packages\n- `/cfug/dio` - HTTP client\n- `/isar/isar` - NoSQL database\n\n## Works Well With\n\n- `moai-lang-swift` - iOS native integration for platform channels\n- `moai-lang-kotlin` - Android native integration for platform channels\n- `moai-domain-backend` - API integration and backend communication\n- `moai-quality-security` - Mobile security best practices\n- `moai-essentials-debug` - Flutter debugging and DevTools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:56:17.444Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents requiring modern Flutter development with Dart 3.5+ and advanced state management using Riverpod.","zh":"适用于需要使用Dart 3.5+和Riverpod进行现代化Flutter开发的跨平台代理，特别是那些需要先进状态管理的代理。","ja":"Dart 3.5+とRiverpodを使用したモダンなFlutter開発を必要とするクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Dart 3.5+와 Riverpod를 사용하여 현대적인 Flutter 개발이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que requieren desarrollo moderno de Flutter con Dart 3.5+ y gestión de estado avanzada utilizando Riverpod.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de plateforme croisée nécessitant un développement Flutter moderne avec Dart 3.5+ et une gestion d''état avancée à l''aide de Riverpod.","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agenten, die moderne Flutter-Entwicklung mit Dart 3.5+ und erweiterte Statusverwaltung mit Riverpod erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que exigem desenvolvimento moderno do Flutter com Dart 3.5+ e gerenciamento de estado avançado usando Riverpod.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов с поддержкой нескольких платформ, требующих современного развития Flutter с Dart 3.5+ и продвинутого управления состоянием с помощью Riverpod.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة المنصات الذين يتطلبون تطويرًا حديثًا ل Flutter مع Dart 3.5+ وإدارة حالة متقدمة باستخدام Riverpod."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop adaptive cross-platform apps with Flutter 3.24, leveraging Material 3 and declarative navigation via go_router, while utilizing Platform Channels for native iOS and Android interactions.","zh":"赋予代理开发适应性跨平台应用的能力，利用Flutter 3.24、Material 3和go_router进行声明性导航，同时利用Platform Channels进行原生iOS和Android交互。","ja":"エージェントに、Flutter 3.24、Material 3、go_routerを使用した宣言的ナビゲーション、およびPlatform Channelsを使用したネイティブiOSおよびAndroidとのやり取りにより、適応性のあるクロスプラットフォームアプリを開発する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 Flutter 3.24, Material 3 및 go_router를 사용하여 선언적 탐색을 수행하고 Platform Channels를 사용하여 네이티브 iOS 및 Android와 상호 작용하는 적응형 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para desarrollar aplicaciones cruzadas adaptativas con Flutter 3.24, aprovechando Material 3 y navegación declarativa a través de go_router, al mismo tiempo que utiliza canales de plataforma para interacciones nativas de iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications croisées adaptatives avec Flutter 3.24, en exploitant Material 3 et la navigation déclarative via go_router, tout en utilisant les canaux de plateforme pour les interactions natives iOS et Android.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, adaptive Cross-Platform-Apps mit Flutter 3.24 zu entwickeln, indem Material 3 und deklarative Navigation über go_router genutzt werden, während gleichzeitig Platform Channels für native iOS- und Android-Interaktionen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicativos cross-platform adaptáveis com Flutter 3.24, aproveitando Material 3 e navegação declarativa via go_router, enquanto utilizam Canais de Plataforma para interações nativas do iOS e do Android.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать адаптивные кроссплатформенные приложения с помощью Flutter 3.24, используя Material 3 и декларативную навигацию через go_router, а также использует каналы платформы для взаимодействия с родными приложениями iOS и Android.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات متعددة المنصات قابلة للتكيف مع Flutter 3.24، مستفيدة من Material 3 والتنقل الإعلاني عبر go_router، في حين يستخدم قنوات المنصة للتفاعلات الأصلية مع نظام iOS والاندرود."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing responsive widget trees for mobile and web applications","Implementing state management with Riverpod and code generation","Creating adaptive layouts with Material 3 for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["为移动和Web应用程序开发响应式小部件树","使用Riverpod和代码生成实现状态管理","使用Material 3创建适应性布局以增强用户体验"],"ja":["モバイルおよびWebアプリケーションのためのレスポンシブウィジェットツリーの開発","Riverpodとコード生成を使用した状態管理の実装","Material 3を使用した適応性レイアウトの作成によるユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上"],"ko":["모바일 및 웹 애플리케이션을 위한 반응형 위젯 트리의 개발","Riverpod와 코드 생성을 사용한 상태 관리의 구현","Material 3를 사용한 적응형 레이아웃의 생성으로 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Desarrollar árboles de widgets responsivos para aplicaciones móviles y web","Implementar gestión de estado con Riverpod y generación de código","Crear diseños adaptables con Material 3 para una experiencia de usuario mejorada"],"fr":["Développer des arbres de widgets réactifs pour les applications mobiles et web","Mettre en œuvre la gestion d''état avec Riverpod et la génération de code","Créer des dispositions adaptatives avec Material 3 pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée"],"de":["Entwickeln responsiver Widget-Bäume für mobile und Web-Anwendungen","Implementieren von Statusverwaltung mit Riverpod und Codegenerierung","Erstellen adaptiver Layouts mit Material 3 für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Desenvolver árvores de widgets responsivas para aplicações móveis e web","Implementar gerenciamento de estado com Riverpod e geração de código","Criar layouts adaptáveis com Material 3 para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada"],"ru":["Разработка адаптивных деревьев виджетов для мобильных и веб-приложений","Реализация управления состоянием с помощью Riverpod и генерации кода","Создание адаптивных компоновок с помощью Material 3 для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تطوير شجرات Widgets المستجيبة للتطبيقات المتنقلة والويب","تنفيذ إدارة الحالة مع Riverpod وتوليد الكود","إنشاء تخطيطات قابلة للتكيف مع Material 3 لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dart 3.5+ and Flutter 3.24+","Limited to cross-platform development with Flutter"],"zh":["需要Dart 3.5+和Flutter 3.24+","仅限于使用Flutter的跨平台开发"],"ja":["Dart 3.5+とFlutter 3.24+が必要","Flutterを使用したクロスプラットフォーム開発のみに限定される"],"ko":["Dart 3.5+와 Flutter 3.24+가 필요","Flutter를 사용한 크로스 플랫폼 개발에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere Dart 3.5+ y Flutter 3.24+","Limitado al desarrollo de plataforma cruzada con Flutter"],"fr":["Nécessite Dart 3.5+ et Flutter 3.24+","Limité au développement de plateforme croisée avec Flutter"],"de":["Benötigt Dart 3.5+ und Flutter 3.24+","Begrenzt auf Cross-Platform-Entwicklung mit Flutter"],"pt":["Exige Dart 3.5+ e Flutter 3.24+","Limitado ao desenvolvimento cross-platform com Flutter"],"ru":["Требует Dart 3.5+ и Flutter 3.24+","Ограничен разработкой кроссплатформенных приложений с помощью Flutter"],"ar":["يتطلب Dart 3.5+ و Flutter 3.24+","محدود بالتطوير متعددة المنصات مع Flutter"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
