a fetching","Révision de code pour les problèmes de performances","Refactoring de code existant"],"de":["57 Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für eine automatisierte Refactoring","Leitfaden für das Schreiben neuer React-Komponenten","Implementierung von Data Fetching","Überprüfung von Code auf Leistungsprobleme","Refactoring von bestehendem Code"],"pt":["57 regras para otimizar o desempenho","8 categorias para refatoração e geração de código","Guia para implementação de busca de dados","Otimização de bundles para melhor desempenho","Melhorias de desempenho para aplicativos React e Next.js","Refatoração de código existente para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для рефакторинга и генерации кода","Руководство по реализации запроса данных","Оптимизация пакетов для лучшей производительности","Улучшения производительности для приложений React и Next.js","Рефакторинг существующего кода для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات للتحويل البرمجي وتوليد الكود","دليل لتنفيذ استعلام البيانات","تحسين الحزم لتحسين الأداء","تحسينات الأداء للتطبيقات React و Next.js","إعادة هيكلة الكود الحالي لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动化代码重构","自动化代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動コードリファクタリング","自動コード生成"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 코드 리팩토링","자동 코드 생성"],"es":["react best practices","vercel react","optimización de rendimiento","next.js","desarrollo de aplicaciones","mejores prácticas de desarrollo","react performance optimization","vercel development"],"fr":["bonnes pratiques react","vercel react","optimisation des performances","next.js","développement d''applications","bonnes pratiques de développement","react performance optimization","vercel développement"],"de":["react best practices","vercel react","leistungsoptimierung","next.js","anwendungsentwicklung","entwicklungsbest practices","react leistungsoptimierung","vercel entwicklung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Otimização de bundles","Refatoração de código","Busca de dados"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Оптимизация пакетов","Рефакторинг кода","Запрос данных"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل ممارسات","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تطوير الويب","تحسين الحزم","إعادة هيكلة الكود","استعلام البيانات"]}},"owner":"premj01","repo":"-EduGen-BuildAndGrow-Hackthonn","repoPath":"premj01/-EduGen-BuildAndGrow-Hackthonn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:57:19.789Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents focused on React and Next.js development needing comprehensive performance optimization guides","zh":"非常适合专注于 React 和 Next.js 开发的前端代理，需要全面的性能优化指南","ja":"React と Next.js 開発に焦点を当てたフロントエンド エージェントに最適で、包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドが必要","ko":"React와 Next.js 개발에 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 포괄적인 성능 최적화 가이드가 필요","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend centrados en el desarrollo de React y Next.js que necesitan guías de optimización de rendimiento completas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend axés sur le développement React et Next.js nécessitant des guides d''optimisation de performances complets","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung von React und Next.js konzentrieren und umfassende Leistungsoptimierungsleitfäden benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend focados no desenvolvimento de React e Next.js que necessitam de guias abrangentes de otimização de desempenho","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, ориентированных на разработку React и Next.js, которым необходимы всесторонние рекомендации по оптимизации производительности","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية المتخصصة في تطوير React و Next.js الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة لتحسين الأداء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, while optimizing data fetching and bundling","zh":"赋予代理自动重构和代码生成的能力，适用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，使用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别，按影响力优先，同时优化数据获取和打包","ja":"エージェントに React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、8 つのカテゴリにわたる 57 のルールを使用し、影響度に基づいて優先順位付けを行い、データ取得とバンドルを最適化","ko":"에이전트에 React 컴포넌트와 Next.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 8개의 카테고리에 걸친 57개의 규칙을 사용하여 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 지정하며, 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, al mismo tiempo que se optimiza la recuperación de datos y la agrupación","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactorisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, tout en optimisant la récupération de données et le regroupement","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, priorisiert nach Auswirkung, während gleichzeitig die Datenabfrage und die Bündelung optimiert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js usando 57 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza a coleta e o agrupamento de dados","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по степени воздействия, а также оптимизировать получение и пакетирование данных","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تلقيم إعادة هيكلة وإنشاء رمز للمكونات React وصفحات Next.js باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير، مع تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتقسيمها"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Generating optimized code for server-side data fetching in Next.js","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Reviewing code for performance issues and implementing fixes","Optimizing bundling for faster application loading"],"zh":["自动为新 React 组件进行性能优化","为 Next.js 服务器端数据获取生成优化代码","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能","检查代码以查找性能问题并实施修复","优化打包以实现更快的应用程序加载"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンス最適化の自動化","Next.js サーバーサイドデータ取得の最適化コードの生成","既存の React と Next.js コードのリファクタリングによるパフォーマンスの向上","コードのパフォーマンス問題の特定と修正の実施","バンドルの最適化によるアプリケーションの迅速なロード"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트의 성능 최적화를 자동화","Next.js 서버측 데이터 가져오기에 대한 최적화 코드 생성","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드의 리팩토링을 통한 성능 향상","코드의 성능 문제를 식별하고 수정을 구현","번들의 최적화를 통한 애플리케이션의 빠른 로딩"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React","Generar código optimizado para la recuperación de datos del lado del servidor en Next.js","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Revisar el código en busca de problemas de rendimiento y implementar soluciones","Optimizar la agrupación para una carga de aplicaciones más rápida"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Générer du code optimisé pour la récupération de données côté serveur dans Next.js","Refactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Examiner le code pour les problèmes de performances et mettre en œuvre des solutions","Optimiser le regroupement pour un chargement d''applications plus rapide"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für die serverseitige Datenabfrage in Next.js","Refactoring des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung","Überprüfen des Codes auf Leistungsprobleme und Implementieren von Lösungen","Optimieren der Bündelung für ein schnelleres Laden von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Gerar código otimizado para coleta de dados no lado do servidor em Next.js","Refatorar código existente de React e Next.js para melhor desempenho","Revisar código para problemas de desempenho e implementar soluções","Otimizar o agrupamento para carregamento de aplicativos mais rápido"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для получения данных на стороне сервера в Next.js","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Проверять код на наличие проблем с производительностью и реализовывать исправления","Оптимизировать пакетирование для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["تلقيم تحسين الأداء التلقائي للمكونات الجديدة React","إنشاء رمز محسّن لاسترجاع البيانات على جانب الخادم في Next.js","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء","مراجعة الرمز لتحديد مشاكل الأداء وتنفيذ الإصلاحات","تحسين التقسيم لتحميل التطبيقات بسرعة أكبر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to React and Next.js applications","Dependent on Vercel''s guidelines and updates"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 的知识","仅限 React 和 Next.js 应用程序","依赖于 Vercel 的指南和更新"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","React と Next.js アプリケーションに限定","Vercel のガイドラインと更新に依存"],"ko":["React와 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션에 한정","Vercel의 가이드라인 및 업데이트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones de React y Next.js","Dependiente de las directrices y actualizaciones de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité aux applications React et Next.js","Dépendant des directives et des mises à jour de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen","Abhängig von den Richtlinien und Updates von Vercel"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações React e Next.js","Depende das diretrizes e atualizações da Vercel"],"ru":["Требует знаний React и Next.js","Ограничен приложениями React и Next.js","Зависит от рекомендаций и обновлений Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات React و Next.js","يعتمد على إرشادات Vercel وتنقيحاتها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
