nes de enrutador de aplicaciones de Next.js para una arquitectura de aplicación moderna y escalable","fr":"Modèles de routeur d''applications Next.js pour une architecture d''application moderne et évolutiva","de":"Next.js App-Router-Muster für eine moderne und skalierbare Anwendungsarchitektur","pt":"Padrões de roteamento de aplicativos Next.js para desenvolvimento full-stack moderno com Server Components e App Router.","ru":"Шаблоны маршрутизации приложений Next.js для современного полноэкранного разработки с Server Components и App Router.","ar":"أنماط توجيه التطبيقات Next.js من أجل تطوير كامل الحزمة مع مكونات الخادم وتوجيه التطبيق.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 Next.js 14+ 应用路由器架构","服务器组件和流媒体支持","并行和拦截路由设置","数据获取和缓存优化","构建全栈功能 dengan 服务器操作"],"ja":["Next.js 14+ アプリルーターアーキテクチャのサポート","サーバーコンポーネントとストリーミングのサポート","並行とインターセプト ルーティングの設定","データ取得とキャッシュの最適化","フルスタック機能の構築 with サーバーアクション"],"ko":["Next.js 14+ 애플리케이션 라우터 아키텍처 지원","서버 컴포넌트 및 스트리밍 지원","병렬 및 인터셉트 라우팅 설정","데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱 최적화","풀스택 기능 구축 with 서버 액션"],"es":["Arquitectura de enrutador de aplicaciones de Next.js 14+","Implementación de componentes de servidor y transmisión","Configuración de rutas paralelas e interceptadas","Optimización de la recuperación y almacenamiento en caché de datos","Creación de características de pila completa con acciones de servidor"],"fr":["Architecture de routeur d''applications Next.js 14+","Mise en œuvre de composants de serveur et de transmission","Configuration de routes parallèles et interceptées","Optimisation de la récupération et du stockage en cache de données","Création de fonctionnalités de pile complète avec des actions de serveur"],"de":["Next.js App-Router-Architektur 14+","Implementierung von Serverkomponenten und Streaming","Einrichtung von parallelen und abgefangenen Routen","Optimierung von Datenabruf und Caching","Erstellung von Full-Stack-Funktionen mit Server-Aktionen"],"pt":["Roteamento de aplicativos com App Router","Implementação de Server Components e streaming","Configuração de rotas paralelas e interceptação","Otimização de busca de dados e cache","Construção de recursos full-stack com Server Actions"],"ru":["Маршрутизация приложений с App Router","Реализация Server Components и потоковой передачи","Настройка параллельных и перехватывающих маршрутов","Оптимизация поиска данных и кэширования","Создание полноэкранных функций с Server Actions"],"ar":["توجيه التطبيقات مع توجيه التطبيق","تنفيذ مكونات الخادم والبث","تكوين مسارات موازية واعتراض","تحسين البحث عن البيانات والแคش","بناء الميزات الكاملة مع إجراءات الخادم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","应用路由器","服务器组件","流媒体","并行路由","数据获取","缓存优化","全栈开发"],"ja":["Next.js","アプリルーター","サーバーコンポーネント","ストリーミング","並行ルーティング","データ取得","キャッシュ最適化","フルスタック開発"],"ko":["Next.js","애플리케이션 라우터","서버 컴포넌트","스트리밍","병렬 라우팅","데이터 가져오기","캐싱 최적화","풀스택 개발"],"es":["Next.js","enrutador de aplicaciones","arquitectura de aplicación","componentes de servidor","transmisión","rutas paralelas","optimización de datos","acciones de servidor"],"fr":["Next.js","routeur d''applications","architecture d''application","composants de serveur","transmission","routes parallèles","optimisation de données","actions de serveur"],"de":["Next.js","App-Router","Anwendungsarchitektur","Serverkomponenten","Streaming","parallele Routen","Datenoptimierung","Server-Aktionen"],"pt":["Next.js","App Router","Server Components","desenvolvimento full-stack","roteamento de aplicativos","React","Server Actions"],"ru":["Next.js","App Router","Server Components","полноэкранная разработка","маршрутизация приложений","React","Server Actions"],"ar":["Next.js","توجيه التطبيق","مكونات الخادم","تطوير كامل الحزمة","توجيه التطبيقات","React","إجراءات الخادم"]}},"owner":"multideskio","repo":"vinha_admin_center","repoPath":"multideskio/vinha_admin_center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-app-router-patterns","description":"Master Next.js 14+ App Router with Server Components, streaming, parallel routes, and advanced data fetching. Use when building Next.js applications, implementing SSR/SSG, or optimizing React Server Components.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js App Router Patterns\n\nComprehensive patterns for Next.js 14+ App Router architecture, Server Components, and modern full-stack React development.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building new Next.js applications with App Router\n- Migrating from Pages Router to App Router\n- Implementing Server Components and streaming\n- Setting up parallel and intercepting routes\n- Optimizing data fetching and caching\n- Building full-stack features with Server Actions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Rendering Mo","body":"# Next.js App Router Patterns\n\nComprehensive patterns for Next.js 14+ App Router architecture, Server Components, and modern full-stack React development.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building new Next.js applications with App Router\n- Migrating from Pages Router to App Router\n- Implementing Server Components and streaming\n- Setting up parallel and intercepting routes\n- Optimizing data fetching and caching\n- Building full-stack features with Server Actions\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Rendering Modes\n\n| Mode                  | Where        | When to Use                               |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Server Components** | Server only  | Data fetching, heavy computation, secrets |\n| **Client Components** | Browser      | Interactivity, hooks, browser APIs        |\n| **Static**            | Build time   | Content that rarely changes               |\n| **Dynamic**           | Request time | Personalized or real-time data            |\n| **Streaming**         | Progressive  | Large pages, slow data sources            |\n\n### 2. File Conventions\n\n```\napp/\n├── layout.tsx       # Shared UI wrapper\n├── page.tsx         # Route UI\n├── loading.tsx      # Loading UI (Suspense)\n├── error.tsx        # Error boundary\n├── not-found.tsx    # 404 UI\n├── route.ts         # API endpoint\n├── template.tsx     # Re-mounted layout\n├── default.tsx      # Parallel route fallback\n└── opengraph-image.tsx  # OG image generation\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\n// app/layout.tsx\nimport { Inter } from ''next/font/google''\nimport { Providers } from ''./providers''\n\nconst inter = Inter({ subsets: [''latin''] })\n\nexport const metadata = {\n  title: { default: ''My App'', template: ''%s | My App'' },\n  description: ''Built with Next.js App Router'',\n}\n\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\" suppressHydrationWarning>\n      <body className={inter.className}>\n        <Providers>{children}</Providers>\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n\n// app/page.tsx - Server Component by default\nasync function getProducts() {\n  const res = await fetch(''https://api.example.com/products'', {\n    next: { revalidate: 3600 }, // ISR: revalidate every hour\n  })\n  return res.json()\n}\n\nexport default async function HomePage() {\n  const products = await getProducts()\n\n  return (\n    <main>\n      <h1>Products</h1>\n      <ProductGrid products={products} />\n    </main>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Server Components with Data Fetching\n\n```typescript\n// app/products/page.tsx\nimport { Suspense } from ''react''\nimport { ProductList, ProductListSkeleton } from ''@/components/products''\nimport { FilterSidebar } from ''@/components/filters''\n\ninterface SearchParams {\n  category?: string\n  sort?: ''price'' | ''name'' | ''date''\n  page?: string\n}\n\nexport default async function ProductsPage({\n  searchParams,\n}: {\n  searchParams: Promise<SearchParams>\n}) {\n  const params = await searchParams\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex gap-8\">\n      <FilterSidebar />\n      <Suspense\n        key={JSON.stringify(params)}\n        fallback={<ProductListSkeleton />}\n      >\n        <ProductList\n          category={params.category}\n          sort={params.sort}\n          page={Number(params.page) || 1}\n        />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// components/products/ProductList.tsx - Server Component\nasync function getProducts(filters: ProductFilters) {\n  const res = await fetch(\n    `${process.env.API_URL}/products?${new URLSearchParams(filters)}`,\n    { next: { tags: [''products''] } }\n  )\n  if (!res.ok) throw new Error(''Failed to fetch products'')\n  return res.json()\n}\n\nexport async function ProductList({ category, sort, page }: ProductFilters) {\n  const { products, totalPages } = await getProducts({ category, sort, page })\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n        {products.map((product) => (\n          <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />\n        ))}\n      </div>\n      <Pagination currentPage={page} totalPages={totalPages} />\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Client Components with ''use client''\n\n```typescript\n// components/products/AddToCartButton.tsx\n''use client''\n\nimport { useState, useTransition } from ''react''\nimport { addToCart } from ''@/app/actions/cart''\n\nexport function AddToCartButton({ productId }: { productId: string }) {\n  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition()\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null)\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    setError(null)\n    startTransition(async () => {\n      const result = await addToCart(productId)\n      if (result.error) {\n        setError(result.error)\n      }\n    })\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button\n        onClick={handleClick}\n        disabled={isPending}\n        className=\"btn-primary\"\n      >\n        {isPending ? ''Adding...'' : ''Add to Cart''}\n      </button>\n      {error && <p className=\"text-red-500 text-sm\">{error}</p>}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Server Actions\n\n```typescript\n// app/actions/cart.ts\n''use server''\n\nimport { revalidateTag } from ''next/cache''\nimport { cookies } from ''next/headers''\nimport { redirect } from ''next/navigation''\n\nexport async function addToCart(productId: string) {\n  const cookieStore = await cookies()\n  const sessionId = cookieStore.get(''session'')?.value\n\n  if (!sessionId) {\n    redirect(''/login'')\n  }\n\n  try {\n    await db.cart.upsert({\n      where: { sessionId_productId: { sessionId, productId } },\n      update: { quantity: { increment: 1 } },\n      create: { sessionId, productId, quantity: 1 },\n    })\n\n    revalidateTag(''cart'')\n    return { success: true }\n  } catch (error) {\n    return { error: ''Failed to add item to cart'' }\n  }\n}\n\nexport async function checkout(formData: FormData) {\n  const address = formData.get(''address'') as string\n  const payment = formData.get(''payment'') as string\n\n  // Validate\n  if (!address || !payment) {\n    return { error: ''Missing required fields'' }\n  }\n\n  // Process order\n  const order = await processOrder({ address, payment })\n\n  // Redirect to confirmation\n  redirect(`/orders/${order.id}/confirmation`)\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Parallel Routes\n\n```typescript\n// app/dashboard/layout.tsx\nexport default function DashboardLayout({\n  children,\n  analytics,\n  team,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  analytics: React.ReactNode\n  team: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"dashboard-grid\">\n      <main>{children}</main>\n      <aside className=\"analytics-panel\">{analytics}</aside>\n      <aside className=\"team-panel\">{team}</aside>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// app/dashboard/@analytics/page.tsx\nexport default async function AnalyticsSlot() {\n  const stats = await getAnalytics()\n  return <AnalyticsChart data={stats} />\n}\n\n// app/dashboard/@analytics/loading.tsx\nexport default function AnalyticsLoading() {\n  return <ChartSkeleton />\n}\n\n// app/dashboard/@team/page.tsx\nexport default async function TeamSlot() {\n  const members = await getTeamMembers()\n  return <TeamList members={members} />\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: Intercepting Routes (Modal Pattern)\n\n```typescript\n// File structure for photo modal\n// app/\n// ├── @modal/\n// │   ├── (.)photos/[id]/page.tsx  # Intercept\n// │   └── default.tsx\n// ├── photos/\n// │   └── [id]/page.tsx            # Full page\n// └── layout.tsx\n\n// app/@modal/(.)photos/[id]/page.tsx\nimport { Modal } from ''@/components/Modal''\nimport { PhotoDetail } from ''@/components/PhotoDetail''\n\nexport default async function PhotoModal({\n  params,\n}: {\n  params: Promise<{ id: string }>\n}) {\n  const { id } = await params\n  const photo = await getPhoto(id)\n\n  return (\n    <Modal>\n      <PhotoDetail photo={photo} />\n    </Modal>\n  )\n}\n\n// app/photos/[id]/page.tsx - Full page version\nexport default async function PhotoPage({\n  params,\n}: {\n  params: Promise<{ id: string }>\n}) {\n  const { id } = await params\n  const photo = await getPhoto(id)\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"photo-page\">\n      <PhotoDetail photo={photo} />\n      <RelatedPhotos photoId={id} />\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// app/layout.tsx\nexport default function RootLayout({\n  children,\n  modal,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  modal: React.ReactNode\n}) {\n  return (\n    <html>\n      <body>\n        {children}\n        {modal}\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Streaming with Suspense\n\n```typescript\n// app/product/[id]/page.tsx\nimport { Suspense } from ''react''\n\nexport default async function ProductPage({\n  params,\n}: {\n  params: Promise<{ id: string }>\n}) {\n  const { id } = await params\n\n  // This data loads first (blocking)\n  const product = await getProduct(id)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {/* Immediate render */}\n      <ProductHeader product={product} />\n\n      {/* Stream in reviews */}\n      <Suspense fallback={<ReviewsSkeleton />}>\n        <Reviews productId={id} />\n      </Suspense>\n\n      {/* Stream in recommendations */}\n      <Suspense fallback={<RecommendationsSkeleton />}>\n        <Recommendations productId={id} />\n      </Suspense>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// These components fetch their own data\nasync function Reviews({ productId }: { productId: string }) {\n  const reviews = await getReviews(productId) // Slow API\n  return <ReviewList reviews={reviews} />\n}\n\nasync function Recommendations({ productId }: { productId: string }) {\n  const products = await getRecommendations(productId) // ML-based, slow\n  return <ProductCarousel products={products} />\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 7: Route Handlers (API Routes)\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/products/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from ''next/server''\n\nexport async function GET(request: NextRequest) {\n  const searchParams = request.nextUrl.searchParams\n  const category = searchParams.get(''category'')\n\n  const products = await db.product.findMany({\n    where: category ? { category } : undefined,\n    take: 20,\n  })\n\n  return NextResponse.json(products)\n}\n\nexport async function POST(request: NextRequest) {\n  const body = await request.json()\n\n  const product = await db.product.create({\n    data: body,\n  })\n\n  return NextResponse.json(product, { status: 201 })\n}\n\n// app/api/products/[id]/route.ts\nexport async function GET(request: NextRequest, { params }: { params: Promise<{ id: string }> }) {\n  const { id } = await params\n  const product = await db.product.findUnique({ where: { id } })\n\n  if (!product) {\n    return NextResponse.json({ error: ''Product not found'' }, { status: 404 })\n  }\n\n  return NextResponse.json(product)\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 8: Metadata and SEO\n\n```typescript\n// app/products/[slug]/page.tsx\nimport { Metadata } from ''next''\nimport { notFound } from ''next/navigation''\n\ntype Props = {\n  params: Promise<{ slug: string }>\n}\n\nexport async function generateMetadata({ params }: Props): Promise<Metadata> {\n  const { slug } = await params\n  const product = await getProduct(slug)\n\n  if (!product) return {}\n\n  return {\n    title: product.name,\n    description: product.description,\n    openGraph: {\n      title: product.name,\n      description: product.description,\n      images: [{ url: product.image, width: 1200, height: 630 }],\n    },\n    twitter: {\n      card: ''summary_large_image'',\n      title: product.name,\n      description: product.description,\n      images: [product.image],\n    },\n  }\n}\n\nexport async function generateStaticParams() {\n  const products = await db.product.findMany({ select: { slug: true } })\n  return products.map((p) => ({ slug: p.slug }))\n}\n\nexport default async function ProductPage({ params }: Props) {\n  const { slug } = await params\n  const product = await getProduct(slug)\n\n  if (!product) notFound()\n\n  return <ProductDetail product={product} />\n}\n```\n\n## Caching Strategies\n\n### Data Cache\n\n```typescript\n// No cache (always fresh)\nfetch(url, { cache: ''no-store'' })\n\n// Cache forever (static)\nfetch(url, { cache: ''force-cache'' })\n\n// ISR - revalidate after 60 seconds\nfetch(url, { next: { revalidate: 60 } })\n\n// Tag-based invalidation\nfetch(url, { next: { tags: [''products''] } })\n\n// Invalidate via Server Action\n;(''use server'')\nimport { revalidateTag, revalidatePath } from ''next/cache''\n\nexport async function updateProduct(id: string, data: ProductData) {\n  await db.product.update({ where: { id }, data })\n  revalidateTag(''products'')\n  revalidatePath(''/products'')\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with Server Components** - Add ''use client'' only when needed\n- **Colocate data fetching** - Fetch data where it''s used\n- **Use Suspense boundaries** - Enable streaming for slow data\n- **Leverage parallel routes** - Independent loading states\n- **Use Server Actions** - For mutations with progressive enhancement\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t pass serializable data** - Server → Client boundary limitations\n- **Don''t use hooks in Server Components** - No useState, useEffect\n- **Don''t fetch in Client Components** - Use Server Components or React Query\n- **Don''t over-nest layouts** - Each layout adds to the component tree\n- **Don''t ignore loading states** - Always provide loading.tsx or Suspense\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Next.js App Router Documentation](https://nextjs.org/docs/app)\n- [Server Components RFC](https://github.com/reactjs/rfcs/blob/main/text/0188-server-components.md)\n- [Vercel Templates](https://vercel.com/templates/next.js)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:57:19.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack React Agents requiring advanced Next.js App Router architecture and Server Components integration.","zh":"适合需要高级 Next.js 应用路由器架构和服务器组件集成的全栈 React 代理。","ja":"Next.jsアプリルーターアーキテクチャとサーバーコンポーネント統合を必要とするフルスタックReactエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Next.js 애플리케이션 라우터 아키텍처 및 서버 구성 요소 통합이 필요한 풀스택 React 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack React que requieren una arquitectura avanzada de App Router de Next.js y una integración de Componentes del Servidor.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Full-Stack React nécessitant une architecture avancée de App Router Next.js et une intégration de Composants du Serveur.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-React-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche App-Router-Architektur und eine Integration von Server-Komponenten von Next.js erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes React de Pilha Completa que exigem arquitetura avançada de Roteador de Aplicativos Next.js e integração de Componentes de Servidor.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов React, требующих продвинутой архитектуры маршрутизатора приложений Next.js и интеграции серверных компонентов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ريكت كامل النطاق الذي يتطلب بنية متقدمة لروتر تطبيق نكست.جس ودمج مكونات الخادم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build modern full-stack React applications with Next.js 14+ App Router, leveraging Server Components, streaming, and parallel routing, while optimizing data fetching and caching with Server Actions.","zh":"赋予代理构建现代全栈 React 应用程序的能力，使用 Next.js 14+ 应用路由器，利用服务器组件、流媒体和并行路由，同时使用服务器操作优化数据获取和缓存。","ja":"Next.js 14+アプリルータを使用して、サーバーコンポーネント、ストリーミング、並列ルーティングを活用し、サーバーアクションを使用してデータ取得とキャッシュを最適化して、モダンなフルスタックReactアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"Next.js 14+ 애플리케이션 라우터를 사용하여 서버 구성 요소, 스트리밍 및 병렬 라우팅을 활용하고 서버 동작을 사용하여 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 최적화하여 현대적인 풀스택 React 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones full-stack React modernas con Next.js 14+ App Router, aprovechando los Componentes del Servidor, la transmisión y la ruta paralela, mientras se optimiza la recuperación y el almacenamiento en caché de datos con Acciones del Servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications full-stack React modernes avec Next.js 14+ App Router, en exploitant les Composants du Serveur, le streaming et la routage parallèle, tout en optimisant la récupération et la mise en cache des données avec des Actions de Serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, moderne Full-Stack-React-Anwendungen mit Next.js 14+ App Router zu erstellen, indem Server-Komponenten, Streaming und parallele Routing genutzt werden, während die Datenerfassung und -zwischenspeicherung mit Server-Aktionen optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações React de pilha completa modernas com Next.js 14+ Roteador de Aplicativos, aproveitando Componentes de Servidor, transmissão e roteamento paralelo, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza a busca e o cache de dados com Ações de Servidor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать современные полнофункциональные приложения React с помощью Next.js 14+ маршрутизатора приложений, используя серверные компоненты, потоковую передачу и параллельный маршрутизацию, а также оптимизируя получение и кэширование данных с помощью серверных действий.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من بناء تطبيقات ريكت حديثة ذات نطاق كامل باستخدام نكست.جس 14+ روتر التطبيق، مستفيداً من مكونات الخادم و البث و التسرب المتوازن، في نفس الوقت الذي يتم فيه تحسين استرجاع البيانات و الذاكرة المؤقتة مع إجراءات الخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating legacy Pages Router applications to App Router","Implementing server-side rendering with Server Components","Optimizing data fetching and caching for improved application performance","Setting up parallel and intercepting routes for complex application workflows"],"zh":["将传统页面路由器应用程序迁移到应用路由器","使用服务器组件实现服务器端渲染","优化数据获取和缓存以提高应用程序性能","设置并行和拦截路由以用于复杂的应用程序工作流"],"ja":["レガシーページルーターアプリケーションをアプリルータに移行する","サーバーコンポーネントを使用してサーバーサイドレンダリングを実装する","データ取得とキャッシュを最適化してアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させる","複雑なアプリケーションワークフロー用に並列およびインターセプトルートを設定する"],"ko":["레거시 페이지 라우터 애플리케이션을 애플리케이션 라우터로 마이그레이션","서버 구성 요소를 사용하여 서버 측 렌더링을 구현","데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 최적화하여 애플리케이션 성능을 향상","복잡한 애플리케이션 워크플ロー에 대한 병렬 및 인터셉트 라우팅을 설정"],"es":["Migrar aplicaciones legacy de Pages Router a App Router","Implementar renderizado del lado del servidor con Componentes del Servidor","Optimizar la recuperación y el almacenamiento en caché de datos para mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación","Configurar rutas paralelas e interceptantes para flujos de trabajo de aplicaciones complejas"],"fr":["Migrer des applications legacy de Pages Router vers App Router","Mettre en œuvre le rendu côté serveur avec des Composants du Serveur","Optimiser la récupération et la mise en cache des données pour améliorer les performances de l''application","Configurer des routes parallèles et d''interception pour des flux de travail d''applications complexes"],"de":["Legacy-Anwendungen von Pages Router auf App Router migrieren","Serverseitiges Rendering mit Server-Komponenten implementieren","Datenerfassung und -zwischenspeicherung optimieren, um die Anwendungsleistung zu verbessern","Parallele und abfangende Routen für komplexe Anwendungsworkflows einrichten"],"pt":["Migrar aplicações legadas do Roteador de Páginas para o Roteador de Aplicativos","Implementar renderização no lado do servidor com Componentes de Servidor","Otimizar a busca e o cache de dados para melhorar o desempenho da aplicação","Configurar rotas paralelas e interceptadoras para fluxos de trabalho de aplicação complexos"],"ru":["Мигрировать устаревшие приложения маршрутизатора страниц на маршрутизатор приложений","Реализовать серверную визуализацию с помощью серверных компонентов","Оптимизировать получение и кэширование данных для улучшения производительности приложения","Настроить параллельные и перехватывающие маршруты для сложных рабочих процессов приложения"],"ar":["نقل تطبيقات الروتر القديمة إلى روتر التطبيقات","تنفيذ العرض الجانبي للخادم مع مكونات الخادم","تحسين استرجاع البيانات والذاكرة المؤقتة لتحسين أداء التطبيق","إعداد مسارات موازية و مسارات اعتراضية لتدفقات عمل التطبيقات المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js 14+","Limited to React-based applications","Needs Server Components and App Router architecture understanding"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 14+","仅限 React 基础应用程序","需要服务器组件和应用路由器架构理解"],"ja":["Next.js 14+ が必要","Reactベースのアプリケーションに限定される","サーバーコンポーネントとアプリルーターアーキテクチャの理解が必要"],"ko":["Next.js 14+가 필요","React 기반의 애플리케이션에만 제한","서버 구성 요소 및 애플리케이션 라우터 아키텍처에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Next.js 14+","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React","Necesita comprensión de la arquitectura de Componentes del Servidor y App Router"],"fr":["Nécessite Next.js 14+","Limité aux applications basées sur React","Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture de Composants du Serveur et d''App Router"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js 14+","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen","Benötigt Kenntnisse der Server-Komponenten- und App-Router-Architektur"],"pt":["Exige Next.js 14+","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React","Necessita de compreensão da arquitetura de Componentes de Servidor e Roteador de Aplicativos"],"ru":["Требует Next.js 14+","Ограничен для приложений на основе React","Требует понимания архитектуры серверных компонентов и маршрутизатора приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب نكست.جس 14+","محدود للتطبيقات التي تعتمد على ريكت","يحتاج إلى فهم بنية مكونات الخادم وروتر التطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/ui-styling', 'community', 'yashvinthan', 'DuskSpendr', 'yashvinthan/DuskSpendr', 'ui-styling', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z', '2026-02-18T12:57:25.077Z', NULL, '{"id":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/ui-styling","name":"ui-styling","description":{"zh":"UI ","ja":"UI","ko":"UI ","es":"La habilidad de estilo de UI es una habilidad integral para crear interfaces de usuario hermosas y accesibles, que combina componentes de shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS","fr":"La compétence de style d''UI est une compétence complète pour créer des interfaces utilisateur accessibles et élégantes, qui combine les composants de shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS","de":"Die UI-Styling-Fähigkeit ist eine umfassende Fähigkeit zur Erstellung von zugänglichen und schönen Benutzeroberflächen, die shadcn/ui-Komponenten und Tailwind CSS kombiniert","pt":"A habilidade de estilização de UI é uma habilidade abrangente para criar interfaces de usuário bonitas e acessíveis, combinando componentes shadcn/ui, estilização de utilitário Tailwind CSS e sistemas de design visual baseados em canvas.","ru":"Навык стилизации UI - это комплексный навык для создания красивых и доступных интерфейсов пользователя, сочетающий компоненты shadcn/ui, утилитарную стилизацию Tailwind CSS и системы визуального дизайна на основе холста.","ar":"مهارة تخصيص واجهة المستخدم هي مهارة شاملة لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم جميلة وقابلة للوصول، معاً مع مكونات shadcn/ui وأسلوب التصميم المرئي القائم على الcanvas","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI ","ja":"UI","ko":"UI ","es":"Habilidad de Estilo de UI: Creación de Interfaces de Usua...","fr":"Compétence de Style d''UI: Création d''Interfaces Utilisate...","de":"UI-Styling-Fähigkeit: Erstellung von Zugänglichen Benutze...","pt":"Estilização de UI: Crie Interfaces Bonitas e Acessíveis","ru":"Стилизация UI: Создавайте Красивые и Доступные Интерфейсы","ar":"تخصيص واجهة المستخدم: أنشئ واجهات مستخدم جميلة وقابلة للوصول","en":"ui-styling"},"description":{"zh":"UI ","ja":"UI","ko":"UI ","es":"La habilidad de estilo de UI es una habilidad integral para crear interfaces de usuario hermosas y accesibles, que combina componentes de shadcn/ui y Tailwin...","fr":"La compétence de style d''UI est une compétence complète pour créer des interfaces utilisateur accessibles et élégantes, qui combine les composants de shadcn/...","de":"Die UI-Styling-Fähigkeit ist eine umfassende Fähigkeit zur Erstellung von zugänglichen und schönen Benutzeroberflächen, die shadcn/ui-Komponenten und Tailwin...","pt":"A habilidade de estilização de UI é uma habilidade abrangente para criar interfaces de usuário bonitas e acessíveis, combinando componentes shadcn/ui, estili...","ru":"Навык стилизации UI - это комплексный навык для создания красивых и доступных интерфейсов пользователя, сочетающий компоненты shadcn/ui, утилитарную стилизац...","ar":"مهارة تخصيص واجهة المستخدم هي مهارة شاملة لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم جميلة وقابلة للوصول، معاً مع مكونات shadcn/ui وأسلوب التصميم المرئي القائم على الcanvas","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["shadcn/ui","Tailwind CSS","React","Next.js","Vite","Remix"],"ja":["shadcn/ui","Tailwind CSS","React","Next.js","Vite","Remix"],"ko":["shadcn/ui","Tailwind CSS","React","Next.js","Vite","Remix"],"es":["Componentes de shadcn/ui","Estilo de utilidad de Tailwind CSS","Diseño visual basado en canvas","Accesibilidad en diálogos y formularios","Compatibilidad con frameworks de React como Next.js y Vite"],"fr":["Composants de shadcn/ui","Style de utility de Tailwind CSS","Conception visuelle basée sur le canvas","Accessibilité dans les dialogues et les formulaires","Compatibilité avec les frameworks React tels que Next.js et Vite"],"de":["shadcn/ui-Komponenten","Tailwind CSS-Utility-Styling","Canvas-basiertes visuelles Design","Barrierefreie Dialoge und Formulare","Kompatibilität mit React-Frameworks wie Next.js und Vite"],"pt":["Combinação de componentes shadcn/ui","Estilização de utilitário Tailwind CSS","Sistemas de design visual baseados em canvas","Acessibilidade em interfaces de usuário","Integração com frameworks React-based","Implementação de componentes acessíveis"],"ru":["Сочетание компонентов shadcn/ui","Утилитарная стилизация Tailwind CSS","Системы визуального дизайна на основе холста","Доступность в интерфейсах пользователя","Интеграция с фреймворками на основе React","Реализация доступных компонентов"],"ar":["مixin مكونات shadcn/ui","تصميم مرئي قائم على الcanvas","نظام تصميم مرئي قائم على الcanvas","الوصول إلى واجهات المستخدم","التكامل مع الإطارات المستندة إلى React","تنفيذ مكونات قابلة للوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI","React","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","UI","UI"],"ja":["UI","React","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","UI","UI"],"ko":["UI","React","Next.js","Vite","Remix","Tailwind CSS","shadcn/ui","UI","UI"],"es":["estilo de ui","diseño de interfaz de usuario","accesibilidad web","tailwind css","shadcn/ui","react","next.js","vite"],"fr":["style d''ui","conception d''interface utilisateur","accessibilité web","tailwind css","shadcn/ui","react","next.js","vite"],"de":["ui-styling","benutzeroberflächendesign","web-accessibilität","tailwind css","shadcn/ui","react","next.js","vite"],"pt":["estilização de UI","interfaces de usuário","acessibilidade","shadcn/ui","Tailwind CSS","design visual","React","frameworks","componentes acessíveis"],"ru":["стилизация UI","интерфейсы пользователя","доступность","shadcn/ui","Tailwind CSS","визуальный дизайн","React","фреймворки","доступные компоненты"],"ar":["تخصيص واجهة المستخدم","واجهات المستخدم","الوصول","shadcn/ui","Tailwind CSS","التصميم المرئي","React","الإطارات","مكونات قابلة للوصول"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.514Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-styling","description":"Create beautiful, accessible user interfaces with shadcn/ui components (built on Radix UI + Tailwind), Tailwind CSS utility-first styling, and canvas-based visual designs. Use when building user interfaces, implementing design systems, creating responsive layouts, adding accessible components (dialogs, dropdowns, forms, tables), customizing themes and colors, implementing dark mode, generating visual designs and posters, or establishing consistent styling patterns across applications.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# UI Styling Skill\n\nComprehensive skill for creating beautiful, accessible user interfaces combining shadcn/ui components, Tailwind CSS utility styling, and canvas-based visual design systems.\n\n## Reference\n\n- shadcn/ui: https://ui.shadcn.com/llms.txt\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com/docs\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse when:\n- Building UI with React-based frameworks (Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro)\n- Implementing accessible components (dialogs, forms, tables, navigation)\n- Styling with util","body":"# UI Styling Skill\n\nComprehensive skill for creating beautiful, accessible user interfaces combining shadcn/ui components, Tailwind CSS utility styling, and canvas-based visual design systems.\n\n## Reference\n\n- shadcn/ui: https://ui.shadcn.com/llms.txt\n- Tailwind CSS: https://tailwindcss.com/docs\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse when:\n- Building UI with React-based frameworks (Next.js, Vite, Remix, Astro)\n- Implementing accessible components (dialogs, forms, tables, navigation)\n- Styling with utility-first CSS approach\n- Creating responsive, mobile-first layouts\n- Implementing dark mode and theme customization\n- Building design systems with consistent tokens\n- Generating visual designs, posters, or brand materials\n- Rapid prototyping with immediate visual feedback\n- Adding complex UI patterns (data tables, charts, command palettes)\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Component Layer: shadcn/ui\n- Pre-built accessible components via Radix UI primitives\n- Copy-paste distribution model (components live in your codebase)\n- TypeScript-first with full type safety\n- Composable primitives for complex UIs\n- CLI-based installation and management\n\n### Styling Layer: Tailwind CSS\n- Utility-first CSS framework\n- Build-time processing with zero runtime overhead\n- Mobile-first responsive design\n- Consistent design tokens (colors, spacing, typography)\n- Automatic dead code elimination\n\n### Visual Design Layer: Canvas\n- Museum-quality visual compositions\n- Philosophy-driven design approach\n- Sophisticated visual communication\n- Minimal text, maximum visual impact\n- Systematic patterns and refined aesthetics\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Component + Styling Setup\n\n**Install shadcn/ui with Tailwind:**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nCLI prompts for framework, TypeScript, paths, and theme preferences. This configures both shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS.\n\n**Add components:**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button card dialog form\n```\n\n**Use components with utility styling:**\n```tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Card, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardContent } from \"@/components/ui/card\"\n\nexport function Dashboard() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n      <Card className=\"hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n        <CardHeader>\n          <CardTitle className=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Analytics</CardTitle>\n        </CardHeader>\n        <CardContent className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p className=\"text-muted-foreground\">View your metrics</p>\n          <Button variant=\"default\" className=\"w-full\">\n            View Details\n          </Button>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Alternative: Tailwind-Only Setup\n\n**Vite projects:**\n```bash\nnpm install -D tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite\n```\n\n```javascript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport tailwindcss from ''@tailwindcss/vite''\nexport default { plugins: [tailwindcss()] }\n```\n\n```css\n/* src/index.css */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n```\n\n## Component Library Guide\n\n**Comprehensive component catalog with usage patterns, installation, and composition examples.**\n\nSee: `references/shadcn-components.md`\n\nCovers:\n- Form & input components (Button, Input, Select, Checkbox, Date Picker, Form validation)\n- Layout & navigation (Card, Tabs, Accordion, Navigation Menu)\n- Overlays & dialogs (Dialog, Drawer, Popover, Toast, Command)\n- Feedback & status (Alert, Progress, Skeleton)\n- Display components (Table, Data Table, Avatar, Badge)\n\n## Theme & Customization\n\n**Theme configuration, CSS variables, dark mode implementation, and component customization.**\n\nSee: `references/shadcn-theming.md`\n\nCovers:\n- Dark mode setup with next-themes\n- CSS variable system\n- Color customization and palettes\n- Component variant customization\n- Theme toggle implementation\n\n## Accessibility Patterns\n\n**ARIA patterns, keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and accessible component usage.**\n\nSee: `references/shadcn-accessibility.md`\n\nCovers:\n- Radix UI accessibility features\n- Keyboard navigation patterns\n- Focus management\n- Screen reader announcements\n- Form validation accessibility\n\n## Tailwind Utilities\n\n**Core utility classes for layout, spacing, typography, colors, borders, and shadows.**\n\nSee: `references/tailwind-utilities.md`\n\nCovers:\n- Layout utilities (Flexbox, Grid, positioning)\n- Spacing system (padding, margin, gap)\n- Typography (font sizes, weights, alignment, line height)\n- Colors and backgrounds\n- Borders and shadows\n- Arbitrary values for custom styling\n\n## Responsive Design\n\n**Mobile-first breakpoints, responsive utilities, and adaptive layouts.**\n\nSee: `references/tailwind-responsive.md`\n\nCovers:\n- Mobile-first approach\n- Breakpoint system (sm, md, lg, xl, 2xl)\n- Responsive utility patterns\n- Container queries\n- Max-width queries\n- Custom breakpoints\n\n## Tailwind Customization\n\n**Config file structure, custom utilities, plugins, and theme extensions.**\n\nSee: `references/tailwind-customization.md`\n\nCovers:\n- @theme directive for custom tokens\n- Custom colors and fonts\n- Spacing and breakpoint extensions\n- Custom utility creation\n- Custom variants\n- Layer organization (@layer base, components, utilities)\n- Apply directive for component extraction\n\n## Visual Design System\n\n**Canvas-based design philosophy, visual communication principles, and sophisticated compositions.**\n\nSee: `references/canvas-design-system.md`\n\nCovers:\n- Design philosophy approach\n- Visual communication over text\n- Systematic patterns and composition\n- Color, form, and spatial design\n- Minimal text integration\n- Museum-quality execution\n- Multi-page design systems\n\n## Utility Scripts\n\n**Python automation for component installation and configuration generation.**\n\n### shadcn_add.py\nAdd shadcn/ui components with dependency handling:\n```bash\npython scripts/shadcn_add.py button card dialog\n```\n\n### tailwind_config_gen.py\nGenerate tailwind.config.js with custom theme:\n```bash\npython scripts/tailwind_config_gen.py --colors brand:blue --fonts display:Inter\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Component Composition**: Build complex UIs from simple, composable primitives\n2. **Utility-First Styling**: Use Tailwind classes directly; extract components only for true repetition\n3. **Mobile-First Responsive**: Start with mobile styles, layer responsive variants\n4. **Accessibility-First**: Leverage Radix UI primitives, add focus states, use semantic HTML\n5. **Design Tokens**: Use consistent spacing scale, color palettes, typography system\n6. **Dark Mode Consistency**: Apply dark variants to all themed elements\n7. **Performance**: Leverage automatic CSS purging, avoid dynamic class names\n8. **TypeScript**: Use full type safety for better DX\n9. **Visual Hierarchy**: Let composition guide attention, use spacing and color intentionally\n10. **Expert Craftsmanship**: Every detail matters - treat UI as a craft\n\n## Reference Navigation\n\n**Component Library**\n- `references/shadcn-components.md` - Complete component catalog\n- `references/shadcn-theming.md` - Theming and customization\n- `references/shadcn-accessibility.md` - Accessibility patterns\n\n**Styling System**\n- `references/tailwind-utilities.md` - Core utility classes\n- `references/tailwind-responsive.md` - Responsive design\n- `references/tailwind-customization.md` - Configuration and extensions\n\n**Visual Design**\n- `references/canvas-design-system.md` - Design philosophy and canvas workflows\n\n**Automation**\n- `scripts/shadcn_add.py` - Component installation\n- `scripts/tailwind_config_gen.py` - Config generation\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Form with validation:**\n```tsx\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\nimport { zodResolver } from \"@hookform/resolvers/zod\"\nimport * as z from \"zod\"\nimport { Form, FormField, FormItem, FormLabel, FormControl, FormMessage } from \"@/components/ui/form\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\n\nconst schema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  password: z.string().min(8)\n})\n\nexport function LoginForm() {\n  const form = useForm({\n    resolver: zodResolver(schema),\n    defaultValues: { email: \"\", password: \"\" }\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <Form {...form}>\n      <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(console.log)} className=\"space-y-6\">\n        <FormField control={form.control} name=\"email\" render={({ field }) => (\n          <FormItem>\n            <FormLabel>Email</FormLabel>\n            <FormControl>\n              <Input type=\"email\" {...field} />\n            </FormControl>\n            <FormMessage />\n          </FormItem>\n        )} />\n        <Button type=\"submit\" className=\"w-full\">Sign In</Button>\n      </form>\n    </Form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Responsive layout with dark mode:**\n```tsx\n<div className=\"min-h-screen bg-white dark:bg-gray-900\">\n  <div className=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <Card className=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700\">\n        <CardContent className=\"p-6\">\n          <h3 className=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n            Content\n          </h3>\n        </CardContent>\n      </Card>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- shadcn/ui Docs: https://ui.shadcn.com\n- Tailwind CSS Docs: https://tailwindcss.com\n- Radix UI: https://radix-ui.com\n- Tailwind UI: https://tailwindui.com\n- Headless UI: https://headlessui.com\n- v0 (AI UI Generator): https://v0.dev\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:57:25.077Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI component styling with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 shadcn/ui 和 Tailwind CSS 进行高级 UI 组件样式设计的前端代理。","ja":"shadcn/ui と Tailwind CSS を使用した高度な UI コンポーネントのスタイリングが必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"shadcn/ui와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 고급 UI 컴포넌트 스타일링이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan estilos avanzados de componentes de interfaz de usuario con shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un style avancé de composants d''interface utilisateur avec shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Stile für Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit shadcn/ui und Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de estilização avançada de componentes de interface do usuário com shadcn/ui e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая стилизация компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью shadcn/ui и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق متقدم لمكونات واجهة المستخدم مع shadcn/ui و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create accessible and beautiful user interfaces using shadcn/ui components, Tailwind CSS utility styling, and canvas-based visual design systems, enabling seamless integration with React-based frameworks like Next.js, Vite, Remix, and Astro.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用 shadcn/ui 组件、Tailwind CSS 实用程序样式和基于画布的视觉设计系统的无障碍和美丽的用户界面能力，从而可以与 Next.js、Vite、Remix 和 Astro 等基于 React 的框架实现无缝集成。","ja":"shadcn/ui コンポーネント、Tailwind CSS ユーティリティスタイリング、キャンバスベースのビジュアルデザインシステムを使用して、無障碍で美しいユーザーインターフェイスを作成するエージェントを可能にし、Next.js、Vite、Remix、Astro などの React ベースのフレームワークとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui 컴포넌트, Tailwind CSS 유틸리티 스타일 및 캔버스 기반 시각적 디자인 시스템을 사용하여 접근성과 아름다운 사용자 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Next.js, Vite, Remix 및 Astro와 같은 React 기반 프레임워크와의 무작위 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario accesibles y hermosas utilizando componentes shadcn/ui, estilos de utilidad de Tailwind CSS y sistemas de diseño visual basados en canvas, lo que permite una integración perfecta con frameworks basados en React como Next.js, Vite, Remix y Astro.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur accessibles et belles en utilisant des composants shadcn/ui, des styles d''utilité de Tailwind CSS et des systèmes de conception visuelle basés sur le canvas, permettant une intégration transparente avec des frameworks basés sur React tels que Next.js, Vite, Remix et Astro.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, zugängliche und schöne Benutzeroberflächen mit shadcn/ui-Komponenten, Tailwind-CSS-Utility-Styling und canvas-basierten visuellen Designsystemen zu erstellen, was eine nahtlose Integration mit React-basierten Frameworks wie Next.js, Vite, Remix und Astro ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem interfaces de usuário acessíveis e bonitas usando componentes shadcn/ui, estilização de utilitários Tailwind CSS e sistemas de design visual baseados em canvas, permitindo integração perfeita com frameworks baseados em React, como Next.js, Vite, Remix e Astro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать доступные и красивые пользовательские интерфейсы, используя компоненты shadcn/ui, стилизацию утилит Tailwind CSS и системы визуальной разработки на основе canvas, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с фреймворками на основе React, такими как Next.js, Vite, Remix и Astro.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات مستخدم متوافقة وجميلة باستخدام مكونات shadcn/ui وأسلوب تنسيقユーティリティ Tailwind CSS ونظم التصميم البصري القائمة على Canvas، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع الإطارات القائمة على React مثل Next.js و Vite و Remix و Astro."},"useCases":{"en":["Styling React-based applications with Tailwind CSS utility classes","Implementing accessible UI components such as dialogs, forms, and navigation","Customizing canvas-based visual design systems for unique user interfaces"],"zh":["使用 Tailwind CSS 实用程序类样式 React 基于应用程序","实现无障碍的 UI 组件，例如对话框、表单和导航","为独特的用户界面自定义基于画布的视觉设计系统"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS ユーティリティクラスを使用した React ベースのアプリケーションのスタイリング","対話型ダイアログ、フォーム、ナビゲーションなどのアクセシブルな UI コンポーネントの実装","ユニークなユーザー インターフェイスのためのキャンバスベースのビジュアル デザイン システムのカスタマイズ"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 유틸리티 클래스를 사용하여 React 기반 애플리케이션 스타일링","대화상자, 양식 및 탐색과 같은 접근 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구현","고유한 사용자 인터페이스에 대한 캔버스 기반 시각적 디자인 시스템 사용자 정의"],"es":["Estilismo de aplicaciones basadas en React con clases de utilidad de Tailwind CSS","Implementación de componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles como diálogos, formularios y navegación","Personalización de sistemas de diseño visual basados en canvas para interfaces de usuario únicas"],"fr":["Mise en page d''applications basées sur React avec des classes d''utilité de Tailwind CSS","Mise en œuvre de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles tels que des dialogues, des formulaires et une navigation","Personnalisation de systèmes de conception visuelle basés sur le canvas pour des interfaces utilisateur uniques"],"de":["Styling von React-basierten Anwendungen mit Tailwind-CSS-Utility-Klassen","Implementierung von zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten wie Dialogen, Formularen und Navigation","Anpassung von canvas-basierten visuellen Designsystemen für einzigartige Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Estilização de aplicações baseadas em React com classes de utilitários Tailwind CSS","Implementação de componentes de interface do usuário acessíveis, como diálogos, formulários e navegação","Personalização de sistemas de design visual baseados em canvas para interfaces de usuário únicas"],"ru":["Стилизация приложений на основе React с помощью классов утилит Tailwind CSS","Реализация доступных компонентов пользовательского интерфейса, таких как диалоги, формы и навигация","Настройка систем визуальной разработки на основе canvas для уникальных пользовательских интерфейсов"],"ar":["تنسيق تطبيقات قائمة على React باستخدام فئاتユーティリティ Tailwind CSS","تنفيذ مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة، مثل الحوارات والاستمارات والتنقل","تخصيص أنظمة التصميم البصري القائمة على Canvas لواجهات المستخدم الفريدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React-based frameworks","Limited to shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS ecosystems"],"zh":["需要 React 基于框架的知识","仅限 shadcn/ui 和 Tailwind CSS 生态系统"],"ja":["React ベースのフレームワークの知識が必要","shadcn/ui と Tailwind CSS のエコシステムに限定"],"ko":["React 기반 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","shadcn/ui 및 Tailwind CSS 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de frameworks basados en React","Limitado a los ecosistemas shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en frameworks basés sur React","Limité aux écosystèmes shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React-basierten Frameworks","Begrenzt auf die shadcn/ui- und Tailwind-CSS-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de frameworks baseados em React","Limitado aos ecossistemas shadcn/ui e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворков на основе React","Ограничен экосистемами shadcn/ui и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالإطارات القائمة على React","محدود بنطاقات shadcn/ui و Tailwind CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
