quiere autenticación"],"fr":["Déploiement instantané de projets","Détection automatique du framework","Téléchargement du projet sur le service de déploiement","Génération d''une URL de prévisualisation et d''une URL de réclamation","Nécessite keine authentification"],"de":["Instantane Bereitstellung von Projekten","Automatische Framework-Erkennung","Hochladen des Projekts auf den Bereitstellungsdienst","Erzeugung einer Vorschau-URL und einer Anspruchs-URL","Keine Authentifizierung erforderlich"],"pt":["Implantação instantânea","Sem necessidade de autenticação","Detecção automática de framework","Upload para serviço de implantação","Retorna URL de visualização e URL de reivindicação"],"ru":["Мгновенный деплой","Нет необходимости аутентификации","Автоматическое обнаружение фреймворка","Загрузка на службу развертывания","Возвращает URL-превью и URL-претензии"],"ar":["التحديث الفوري","لا حاجة للمصادقة","اكتشاف الإطار التلقائي","تحميل إلى خدمة النشر","يعيد URL المعاينة و URL المطالبة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel 部署","即时部署","自动检测框架","上传部署","无需认证","tarball 包装","预览 URL","认领 URL"],"ja":["Vercel デプロイ","即時デプロイ","自動フレームワーク検出","アップロードデプロイ","認証不要","tarball 包装","プレビュー URL","クレーム URL"],"ko":["Vercel 배포","즉시 배포","자동 프레임워크 감지","업로드 배포","인증 필요없음","tarball 패키징","미리보기 URL","클레임 URL"],"es":["despliegue de Vercel","despliegue instantáneo","proyectos web","framework","servicio de despliegue","URL de vista previa","URL de reclamo","autenticación"],"fr":["déploiement Vercel","déploiement instantané","projets web","framework","service de déploiement","URL de prévisualisation","URL de réclamation","authentification"],"de":["Vercel-Bereitstellung","instantane Bereitstellung","Webprojekte","Framework","Bereitstellungsdienst","Vorschau-URL","Anspruchs-URL","Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Vercel Deploy","implantação instantânea","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","serviços de hospedagem","frameworks de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Vercel Deploy","мгновенный деплой","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","хостинговые услуги","фреймворки разработки"],"ar":["Vercel Deploy","التحديث الفوري","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","خدمات الاستضافة","إطارات التطوير"]}},"owner":"LeeCuongg","repo":"stock-flow-qt-food","repoPath":"LeeCuongg/stock-flow-qt-food","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-deploy","description":"Deploy applications and websites to Vercel. Use this skill when the user requests deployment actions such as Deploy my app, Deploy this to production, Create a preview deployment, Deploy and give me the link, or Push this live. No authentication required - returns preview URL and claimable deployment link.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel Deploy\n\nDeploy any project to Vercel instantly. No authentication required.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Packages your project into a tarball (excludes `node_modules` and `.git`)\n2. Auto-detects framework from `package.json`\n3. Uploads to deployment service\n4. Returns **Preview URL** (live site) and **Claim URL** (transfer to your Vercel account)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nbash /mnt/skills/user/vercel-deploy/scripts/deploy.sh [path]\n```\n\n**Arguments:**\n- `path` - Directory to deploy, or a `.tgz` file (","body":"# Vercel Deploy\n\nDeploy any project to Vercel instantly. No authentication required.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. Packages your project into a tarball (excludes `node_modules` and `.git`)\n2. Auto-detects framework from `package.json`\n3. Uploads to deployment service\n4. Returns **Preview URL** (live site) and **Claim URL** (transfer to your Vercel account)\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nbash /mnt/skills/user/vercel-deploy/scripts/deploy.sh [path]\n```\n\n**Arguments:**\n- `path` - Directory to deploy, or a `.tgz` file (defaults to current directory)\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```bash\n# Deploy current directory\nbash /mnt/skills/user/vercel-deploy/scripts/deploy.sh\n\n# Deploy specific project\nbash /mnt/skills/user/vercel-deploy/scripts/deploy.sh /path/to/project\n\n# Deploy existing tarball\nbash /mnt/skills/user/vercel-deploy/scripts/deploy.sh /path/to/project.tgz\n```\n\n## Output\n\n```\nPreparing deployment...\nDetected framework: nextjs\nCreating deployment package...\nDeploying...\n✓ Deployment successful!\n\nPreview URL: https://skill-deploy-abc123.vercel.app\nClaim URL:   https://vercel.com/claim-deployment?code=...\n```\n\nThe script also outputs JSON to stdout for programmatic use:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"previewUrl\": \"https://skill-deploy-abc123.vercel.app\",\n  \"claimUrl\": \"https://vercel.com/claim-deployment?code=...\",\n  \"deploymentId\": \"dpl_...\",\n  \"projectId\": \"prj_...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Framework Detection\n\nThe script auto-detects frameworks from `package.json`. Supported frameworks include:\n\n- **React**: Next.js, Gatsby, Create React App, Remix, React Router\n- **Vue**: Nuxt, Vitepress, Vuepress, Gridsome\n- **Svelte**: SvelteKit, Svelte, Sapper\n- **Other Frontend**: Astro, Solid Start, Angular, Ember, Preact, Docusaurus\n- **Backend**: Express, Hono, Fastify, NestJS, Elysia, h3, Nitro\n- **Build Tools**: Vite, Parcel\n- **And more**: Blitz, Hydrogen, RedwoodJS, Storybook, Sanity, etc.\n\nFor static HTML projects (no `package.json`), framework is set to `null`.\n\n## Static HTML Projects\n\nFor projects without a `package.json`:\n- If there''s a single `.html` file not named `index.html`, it gets renamed automatically\n- This ensures the page is served at the root URL (`/`)\n\n## Present Results to User\n\nAlways show both URLs:\n\n```\n✓ Deployment successful!\n\nPreview URL: https://skill-deploy-abc123.vercel.app\nClaim URL:   https://vercel.com/claim-deployment?code=...\n\nView your site at the Preview URL.\nTo transfer this deployment to your Vercel account, visit the Claim URL.\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Network Egress Error\n\nIf deployment fails due to network restrictions (common on claude.ai), tell the user:\n\n```\nDeployment failed due to network restrictions. To fix this:\n\n1. Go to https://claude.ai/settings/capabilities\n2. Add *.vercel.com to the allowed domains\n3. Try deploying again\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:58:25.803Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full Stack Agents requiring instant web deployment and preview capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要即时 Web 部署和预览功能的全栈代理。","ja":"インスタント Web デプロイとプレビュー機能を必要とするフルスタック エージェントに最適です。","ko":"즉시 웹 배포 및 미리보기 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Full Stack que requieren implementación y capacidad de vista previa web instantánea.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full Stack nécessitant un déploiement Web instantané et des fonctionnalités d''aperçu.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine sofortige Webbereitstellung und Vorschau-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que requerem implantação e visualização instantâneas na web.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, требующих мгновенного развертывания и возможности предварительного просмотра веб-приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذي يتطلب نشر ويب وتحديثات معاينة فورية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to instantly deploy projects to Vercel, auto-detecting frameworks from package.json and uploading tarballs, while providing Preview URLs and Claim URLs for seamless transfer to Vercel accounts, all without requiring authentication.","zh":"赋予代理人瞬间将项目部署到 Vercel 的能力，自动从 package.json 中检测框架并上传 tarball，同时提供预览 URL 和认领 URL，以便无缝转移到 Vercel 账户，无需身份验证。","ja":"エージェントにプロジェクトを Vercel に瞬時にデプロイする機能を付与し、package.json からフレームワークを自動で検出して tarball をアップロードし、プレビュー URL とクレーム URL を提供して、Vercel アカウントへのシームレスな移行を可能にしますが、認証は必要ありません。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트를 Vercel에 즉시 배포할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 package.json에서 프레임워크를 자동으로 감지하고 tarball을 업로드하며 미리보기 URL과 클레임 URL을 제공하여 Vercel 계정으로의 無縫な 전환을 가능하게 하며, 인증은 필요하지 않습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar proyectos de forma instantánea en Vercel, detectando automáticamente los frameworks desde package.json y subiendo tarballs, mientras proporciona URLs de vista previa y URLs de reclamación para una transferencia sin problemas a cuentas de Vercel, todo sin requerir autenticación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer instantanément des projets sur Vercel, en détectant automatiquement les frameworks à partir de package.json et en téléchargeant des tarballs, tout en fournissant des URL de prévisualisation et des URL de réclamation pour un transfert sans problème vers des comptes Vercel, le tout sans nécessiter d''authentification.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projekte sofort auf Vercel zu deployen, Frameworks automatisch aus package.json zu erkennen und Tarballs hochzuladen, während es Vorschau-URLs und Anspruchs-URLs für einen nahtlosen Transfer zu Vercel-Konten bereitstellt, alles ohne Authentifizierung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem projetos instantaneamente no Vercel, detectando frameworks automaticamente a partir do package.json e fazendo upload de tarballs, enquanto fornece URLs de pré-visualização e URLs de reivindicação para transferência sem interrupções para contas do Vercel, tudo sem exigir autenticação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью мгновенно развертывать проекты в Vercel, автоматически обнаруживая фреймворки из package.json и загружая tarballs, а также предоставляя URL-адреса предварительного просмотра и URL-адреса для бесшовной передачи в учетные записи Vercel, все без необходимости аутентификации.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء نشر المشاريع على الفور على Vercel ، وتكتشف الإطارات تلقائيا من package.json ورفع tarballs ، في حين تقدم روابط معاينة ومعرفات لنقل بدون انقطاع إلى حسابات Vercel ، كل ذلك بدون الحاجة إلى مصادقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying web applications to Vercel for live preview","Automating framework detection for streamlined deployment","Uploading projects as tarballs for efficient transfer"],"zh":["将 Web 应用程序部署到 Vercel 以进行实时预览","自动检测框架以实现流畅的部署","以 tarball 的形式上传项目以实现高效的传输"],"ja":["Vercel に Web アプリケーションをデプロイしてライブ プレビューを実行する","フレームワークを自動で検出してデプロイをスムーズにする","プロジェクトを tarball としてアップロードして転送を効率化する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 Vercel에 배포하여 실시간 미리보기를 수행하는 것","프레임워크를 자동으로 감지하여 배포를 원활하게 하는 것","프로젝트를 tarball로 업로드하여 전송을 효율적으로 하는 것"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones web en Vercel para vista previa en vivo","Automatizar la detección de frameworks para un despliegue optimizado","Subir proyectos como tarballs para una transferencia eficiente"],"fr":["Déployer des applications Web sur Vercel pour une prévisualisation en direct","Automatiser la détection de frameworks pour un déploiement simplifié","Télécharger des projets sous forme de tarballs pour un transfert efficace"],"de":["Bereitstellen von Webanwendungen auf Vercel für Live-Vorschau","Automatisierung der Framework-Erkennung für einen optimierten Einsatz","Hochladen von Projekten als Tarballs für einen effizienten Transfer"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações web no Vercel para visualização ao vivo","Automação da detecção de estruturas para implantação simplificada","Upload de projetos como tarballs para transferência eficiente"],"ru":["Развертывание веб-приложений в Vercel для живого просмотра","Автоматизация обнаружения фреймворков для упрощенного развертывания","Загрузка проектов в виде tarballs для эффективной передачи"],"ar":["نشر التطبيقات الويب على Vercel للمعاينة الحية","تأتمة الكشف عن الإطارات لنشر بسط","تحميل المشاريع كـ tarballs لنقل فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Excludes node_modules and .git from deployment tarball","Requires package.json for framework auto-detection","Deploys to Vercel only"],"zh":["排除 node_modules 和 .git 从部署 tarball 中","需要 package.json 来进行框架自动检测","仅部署到 Vercel"],"ja":["デプロイ tarball から node_modules と .git を除外する","フレームワークの自動検出には package.json が必要","Vercel へのみデプロイする"],"ko":["배포 tarball에서 node_modules와 .git을 제외하는 것","프레임워크 자동 감지를 위해 package.json이 필요함","Vercel에만 배포함"],"es":["Excluye node_modules y .git del tarball de implementación","Requiere package.json para la detección automática de frameworks","Solo se implementa en Vercel"],"fr":["Exclut node_modules et .git du tarball de déploiement","Nécessite package.json pour la détection automatique des frameworks","Ne déploie que sur Vercel"],"de":["Schließt node_modules und .git aus dem Bereitstellungstarball aus","Benötigt package.json für die automatische Framework-Erkennung","Deployt nur auf Vercel"],"pt":["Exclui node_modules e .git do tarball de implantação","Exige package.json para detecção automática de estruturas","Implanta apenas no Vercel"],"ru":["Исключает node_modules и .git из tarball развертывания","Требует package.json для автоматического обнаружения фреймворков","Развертывает только в Vercel"],"ar":["استبعاد node_modules و .git من tarball النشر","يتطلب package.json للكشف التلقائي عن الإطارات","ينشر فقط في Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/xlsx', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'xlsx', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z', '2026-02-18T12:58:49.361Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/xlsx","name":"xlsx","description":{"zh":"xlsx 格式需要零公式错误和保留现有模板，开发金融模型时需要遵循特定的颜色编码和格式","ja":"xlsx 形式では、零の式エラーと既存のテンプレートの保存が必要です。金融モデルを開発するときは、特定の色付けと形式を遵守する必要があります","ko":"xlsx 형식에서는 공식 오류가 없고 기존 템플릿을 유지해야 하며, 금융 모델을 개발할 때는 특정 색상 코드와 형식을 준수해야 함","es":"La generación de archivos xlsx requiere cero errores de fórmula y la preservación de formatos existentes. Aprende a crear modelos financieros precisos.","fr":"La création de fichiers xlsx nécessite zéro erreur de formule et la préservation des formats existants. Apprenez à créer des modèles financiers précis.","de":"Die Erstellung von xlsx-Dateien erfordert null Formel-fehler und die Erhaltung bestehender Formate. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie genaue Finanzmodelle erstellen.","pt":"Criar arquivos xlsx perfeitos requires atenção ao detalhe e conhecimento técnico. Nossas diretrizes ajudam a evitar erros de fórmula e preservar modelos existentes","ru":"Создание идеальных файлов xlsx требует внимания к деталям и технических знаний. Наши рекомендации помогают избежать ошибок формул и сохранить существующие шаблоны","ar":"إنشاء ملفات xlsx مثالية يتطلب اهتمام بال细节 والمعرفة الفنية. إرشاداتنا تساعد على تجنب أخطاء الصيغ والحفاظ على القوالب الحالية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"xlsx 技术规范","ja":"xlsx 技術仕様","ko":"xlsx 기술 사양","es":"Generación de archivos xlsx sin errores de fórmula","fr":"Génération de fichiers xlsx sans erreurs de formule","de":"Erstellung von xlsx-Dateien ohne Formel-fehler","pt":"Criar Arquivos xlsx Perfeitos","ru":"Создание идеальных файлов xlsx","ar":"إنشاء ملفات xlsx مثالية","en":"xlsx"},"description":{"zh":"xlsx 格式需要零公式错误和保留现有模板，开发金融模型时需要遵循特定的颜色编码和格式","ja":"xlsx 形式では、零の式エラーと既存のテンプレートの保存が必要です。金融モデルを開発するときは、特定の色付けと形式を遵守する必要があります","ko":"xlsx 형식에서는 공식 오류가 없고 기존 템플릿을 유지해야 하며, 금융 모델을 개발할 때는 특정 색상 코드와 형식을 준수해야 함","es":"La generación de archivos xlsx requiere cero errores de fórmula y la preservación de formatos existentes. Aprende a crear modelos financieros precisos.","fr":"La création de fichiers xlsx nécessite zéro erreur de formule et la préservation des formats existants. Apprenez à créer des modèles financiers précis.","de":"Die Erstellung von xlsx-Dateien erfordert null Formel-fehler und die Erhaltung bestehender Formate. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie genaue Finanzmodelle erstellen.","pt":"Criar arquivos xlsx perfeitos requires atenção ao detalhe e conhecimento técnico. Nossas diretrizes ajudam a evitar erros de fórmula e preservar modelos exis...","ru":"Создание идеальных файлов xlsx требует внимания к деталям и технических знаний. Наши рекомендации помогают избежать ошибок формул и сохранить существующие ша...","ar":"إنشاء ملفات xlsx مثالية يتطلب اهتمام بال细节 والمعرفة الفنية. إرشاداتنا تساعد على تجنب أخطاء الصيغ والحفاظ على القوالب الحالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["零公式错误","保留现有模板","金融模型颜色编码","特定格式要求","Excel 文件开发"],"ja":["零の式エラー","既存のテンプレートの保存","金融モデルの色付け","特定の形式要件","Excel ファイル開発"],"ko":["공식 오류 없음","기존 템플릿 유지","금융 모델 색상 코드","특정 형식 요구 사항","Excel 파일 개발"],"es":["Cero errores de fórmula","Preservación de formatos existentes","Modelos financieros precisos","Color coding para claridad","Compatibilidad con formatos de archivo xlsx","Mejores prácticas para la creación de modelos financieros"],"fr":["Zéro erreur de formule","Préservation des formats existants","Modèles financiers précis","Codage de couleur pour la clarté","Compatibilité avec les formats de fichier xlsx","Meilleures pratiques pour la création de modèles financiers"],"de":["Null Formel-fehler","Erhaltung bestehender Formate","Genaue Finanzmodelle","Farbcodierung für Klarheit","Kompatibilität mit xlsx-Dateiformaten","Beste Praktiken für die Erstellung von Finanzmodellen"],"pt":["Evite erros de fórmula","Preserve modelos existentes","Estude e reproduza formatos e estilos existentes","Nunca imponha formatação padrão em arquivos com padrões estabelecidos","Existing template conventions sempre têm prioridade"],"ru":["Избегайте ошибок формул","Сохраните существующие шаблоны","Изучите и воспроизведите существующие форматы и стили","Никогда не навязывайте стандартную форматировку файлам со установленными паттернами","Существующие шаблоны всегда имеют приоритет"],"ar":["تجنب أخطاء الصيغ","احفظ القوالب الحالية","درس واعكس الصيغ والأسلوب الحالي","لا تفرض تنسيقًا قياسيًا على الملفات ذات الأنماط المحددة","القوالب الحالية دائمًا ما يتم إعطاؤها الأولوية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["xlsx","Excel 文件","零公式错误","金融模型","颜色编码","特定格式","开发规范"],"ja":["xlsx","Excel ファイル","零の式エラー","金融モデル","色付け","特定の形式","開発仕様"],"ko":["xlsx","Excel 파일","공식 오류 없음","금융 모델","색상 코드","특정 형식","개발 사양"],"es":["xlsx","errores de fórmula","modelos financieros","formatos de archivo","precisión","color coding","mejores prácticas","creación de modelos financieros","compatibilidad con xlsx"],"fr":["xlsx","erreurs de formule","modèles financiers","formats de fichier","précision","codage de couleur","meilleures pratiques","création de modèles financiers","compatibilité avec xlsx"],"de":["xlsx","Formel-fehler","Finanzmodelle","Dateiformate","Präzision","Farbcodierung","beste Praktiken","Erstellung von Finanzmodellen","Kompatibilität mit xlsx"],"pt":["arquivos xlsx","erros de fórmula","modelos existentes","formatos de planilha","criação de arquivos xlsx","otimização de arquivos xlsx"],"ru":["файлы xlsx","ошибки формул","существующие шаблоны","форматы электронных таблиц","создание файлов xlsx","оптимизация файлов xlsx"],"ar":["ملفات xlsx","أخطاء الصيغ","القوالب الحالية","صيغ الجداول الإلكترونية","إنشاء ملفات xlsx","تحسين ملفات xlsx"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xlsx","description":"Comprehensive spreadsheet creation, editing, and analysis with support for formulas, formatting, data analysis, and visualization. When Claude needs to work with spreadsheets (.xlsx, .xlsm, .csv, .tsv, etc) for: (1) Creating new spreadsheets with formulas and formatting, (2) Reading or analyzing data, (3) Modify existing spreadsheets while preserving formulas, (4) Data analysis and visualization in spreadsheets, or (5) Recalculating formulas","bodyPreview":"# Requirements for Outputs\n\n## All Excel files\n\n### Zero Formula Errors\n- Every Excel model MUST be delivered with ZERO formula errors (#REF!, #DIV/0!, #VALUE!, #N/A, #NAME?)\n\n### Preserve Existing Templates (when updating templates)\n- Study and EXACTLY match existing format, style, and conventions when modifying files\n- Never impose standardized formatting on files with established patterns\n- Existing template conventions ALWAYS override these guidelines\n\n## Financial models\n\n### Color Coding S","body":"# Requirements for Outputs\n\n## All Excel files\n\n### Zero Formula Errors\n- Every Excel model MUST be delivered with ZERO formula errors (#REF!, #DIV/0!, #VALUE!, #N/A, #NAME?)\n\n### Preserve Existing Templates (when updating templates)\n- Study and EXACTLY match existing format, style, and conventions when modifying files\n- Never impose standardized formatting on files with established patterns\n- Existing template conventions ALWAYS override these guidelines\n\n## Financial models\n\n### Color Coding Standards\nUnless otherwise stated by the user or existing template\n\n#### Industry-Standard Color Conventions\n- **Blue text (RGB: 0,0,255)**: Hardcoded inputs, and numbers users will change for scenarios\n- **Black text (RGB: 0,0,0)**: ALL formulas and calculations\n- **Green text (RGB: 0,128,0)**: Links pulling from other worksheets within same workbook\n- **Red text (RGB: 255,0,0)**: External links to other files\n- **Yellow background (RGB: 255,255,0)**: Key assumptions needing attention or cells that need to be updated\n\n### Number Formatting Standards\n\n#### Required Format Rules\n- **Years**: Format as text strings (e.g., \"2024\" not \"2,024\")\n- **Currency**: Use $#,##0 format; ALWAYS specify units in headers (\"Revenue ($mm)\")\n- **Zeros**: Use number formatting to make all zeros \"-\", including percentages (e.g., \"$#,##0;($#,##0);-\")\n- **Percentages**: Default to 0.0% format (one decimal)\n- **Multiples**: Format as 0.0x for valuation multiples (EV/EBITDA, P/E)\n- **Negative numbers**: Use parentheses (123) not minus -123\n\n### Formula Construction Rules\n\n#### Assumptions Placement\n- Place ALL assumptions (growth rates, margins, multiples, etc.) in separate assumption cells\n- Use cell references instead of hardcoded values in formulas\n- Example: Use =B5*(1+$B$6) instead of =B5*1.05\n\n#### Formula Error Prevention\n- Verify all cell references are correct\n- Check for off-by-one errors in ranges\n- Ensure consistent formulas across all projection periods\n- Test with edge cases (zero values, negative numbers)\n- Verify no unintended circular references\n\n#### Documentation Requirements for Hardcodes\n- Comment or in cells beside (if end of table). Format: \"Source: [System/Document], [Date], [Specific Reference], [URL if applicable]\"\n- Examples:\n  - \"Source: Company 10-K, FY2024, Page 45, Revenue Note, [SEC EDGAR URL]\"\n  - \"Source: Company 10-Q, Q2 2025, Exhibit 99.1, [SEC EDGAR URL]\"\n  - \"Source: Bloomberg Terminal, 8/15/2025, AAPL US Equity\"\n  - \"Source: FactSet, 8/20/2025, Consensus Estimates Screen\"\n\n# XLSX creation, editing, and analysis\n\n## Overview\n\nA user may ask you to create, edit, or analyze the contents of an .xlsx file. You have different tools and workflows available for different tasks.\n\n## Important Requirements\n\n**LibreOffice Required for Formula Recalculation**: You can assume LibreOffice is installed for recalculating formula values using the `recalc.py` script. The script automatically configures LibreOffice on first run\n\n## Reading and analyzing data\n\n### Data analysis with pandas\nFor data analysis, visualization, and basic operations, use **pandas** which provides powerful data manipulation capabilities:\n\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Read Excel\ndf = pd.read_excel(''file.xlsx'')  # Default: first sheet\nall_sheets = pd.read_excel(''file.xlsx'', sheet_name=None)  # All sheets as dict\n\n# Analyze\ndf.head()      # Preview data\ndf.info()      # Column info\ndf.describe()  # Statistics\n\n# Write Excel\ndf.to_excel(''output.xlsx'', index=False)\n```\n\n## Excel File Workflows\n\n## CRITICAL: Use Formulas, Not Hardcoded Values\n\n**Always use Excel formulas instead of calculating values in Python and hardcoding them.** This ensures the spreadsheet remains dynamic and updateable.\n\n### ❌ WRONG - Hardcoding Calculated Values\n```python\n# Bad: Calculating in Python and hardcoding result\ntotal = df[''Sales''].sum()\nsheet[''B10''] = total  # Hardcodes 5000\n\n# Bad: Computing growth rate in Python\ngrowth = (df.iloc[-1][''Revenue''] - df.iloc[0][''Revenue'']) / df.iloc[0][''Revenue'']\nsheet[''C5''] = growth  # Hardcodes 0.15\n\n# Bad: Python calculation for average\navg = sum(values) / len(values)\nsheet[''D20''] = avg  # Hardcodes 42.5\n```\n\n### ✅ CORRECT - Using Excel Formulas\n```python\n# Good: Let Excel calculate the sum\nsheet[''B10''] = ''=SUM(B2:B9)''\n\n# Good: Growth rate as Excel formula\nsheet[''C5''] = ''=(C4-C2)/C2''\n\n# Good: Average using Excel function\nsheet[''D20''] = ''=AVERAGE(D2:D19)''\n```\n\nThis applies to ALL calculations - totals, percentages, ratios, differences, etc. The spreadsheet should be able to recalculate when source data changes.\n\n## Common Workflow\n1. **Choose tool**: pandas for data, openpyxl for formulas/formatting\n2. **Create/Load**: Create new workbook or load existing file\n3. **Modify**: Add/edit data, formulas, and formatting\n4. **Save**: Write to file\n5. **Recalculate formulas (MANDATORY IF USING FORMULAS)**: Use the recalc.py script\n   ```bash\n   python recalc.py output.xlsx\n   ```\n6. **Verify and fix any errors**: \n   - The script returns JSON with error details\n   - If `status` is `errors_found`, check `error_summary` for specific error types and locations\n   - Fix the identified errors and recalculate again\n   - Common errors to fix:\n     - `#REF!`: Invalid cell references\n     - `#DIV/0!`: Division by zero\n     - `#VALUE!`: Wrong data type in formula\n     - `#NAME?`: Unrecognized formula name\n\n### Creating new Excel files\n\n```python\n# Using openpyxl for formulas and formatting\nfrom openpyxl import Workbook\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment\n\nwb = Workbook()\nsheet = wb.active\n\n# Add data\nsheet[''A1''] = ''Hello''\nsheet[''B1''] = ''World''\nsheet.append([''Row'', ''of'', ''data''])\n\n# Add formula\nsheet[''B2''] = ''=SUM(A1:A10)''\n\n# Formatting\nsheet[''A1''].font = Font(bold=True, color=''FF0000'')\nsheet[''A1''].fill = PatternFill(''solid'', start_color=''FFFF00'')\nsheet[''A1''].alignment = Alignment(horizontal=''center'')\n\n# Column width\nsheet.column_dimensions[''A''].width = 20\n\nwb.save(''output.xlsx'')\n```\n\n### Editing existing Excel files\n\n```python\n# Using openpyxl to preserve formulas and formatting\nfrom openpyxl import load_workbook\n\n# Load existing file\nwb = load_workbook(''existing.xlsx'')\nsheet = wb.active  # or wb[''SheetName''] for specific sheet\n\n# Working with multiple sheets\nfor sheet_name in wb.sheetnames:\n    sheet = wb[sheet_name]\n    print(f\"Sheet: {sheet_name}\")\n\n# Modify cells\nsheet[''A1''] = ''New Value''\nsheet.insert_rows(2)  # Insert row at position 2\nsheet.delete_cols(3)  # Delete column 3\n\n# Add new sheet\nnew_sheet = wb.create_sheet(''NewSheet'')\nnew_sheet[''A1''] = ''Data''\n\nwb.save(''modified.xlsx'')\n```\n\n## Recalculating formulas\n\nExcel files created or modified by openpyxl contain formulas as strings but not calculated values. Use the provided `recalc.py` script to recalculate formulas:\n\n```bash\npython recalc.py <excel_file> [timeout_seconds]\n```\n\nExample:\n```bash\npython recalc.py output.xlsx 30\n```\n\nThe script:\n- Automatically sets up LibreOffice macro on first run\n- Recalculates all formulas in all sheets\n- Scans ALL cells for Excel errors (#REF!, #DIV/0!, etc.)\n- Returns JSON with detailed error locations and counts\n- Works on both Linux and macOS\n\n## Formula Verification Checklist\n\nQuick checks to ensure formulas work correctly:\n\n### Essential Verification\n- [ ] **Test 2-3 sample references**: Verify they pull correct values before building full model\n- [ ] **Column mapping**: Confirm Excel columns match (e.g., column 64 = BL, not BK)\n- [ ] **Row offset**: Remember Excel rows are 1-indexed (DataFrame row 5 = Excel row 6)\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n- [ ] **NaN handling**: Check for null values with `pd.notna()`\n- [ ] **Far-right columns**: FY data often in columns 50+ \n- [ ] **Multiple matches**: Search all occurrences, not just first\n- [ ] **Division by zero**: Check denominators before using `/` in formulas (#DIV/0!)\n- [ ] **Wrong references**: Verify all cell references point to intended cells (#REF!)\n- [ ] **Cross-sheet references**: Use correct format (Sheet1!A1) for linking sheets\n\n### Formula Testing Strategy\n- [ ] **Start small**: Test formulas on 2-3 cells before applying broadly\n- [ ] **Verify dependencies**: Check all cells referenced in formulas exist\n- [ ] **Test edge cases**: Include zero, negative, and very large values\n\n### Interpreting recalc.py Output\nThe script returns JSON with error details:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",           // or \"errors_found\"\n  \"total_errors\": 0,              // Total error count\n  \"total_formulas\": 42,           // Number of formulas in file\n  \"error_summary\": {              // Only present if errors found\n    \"#REF!\": {\n      \"count\": 2,\n      \"locations\": [\"Sheet1!B5\", \"Sheet1!C10\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Library Selection\n- **pandas**: Best for data analysis, bulk operations, and simple data export\n- **openpyxl**: Best for complex formatting, formulas, and Excel-specific features\n\n### Working with openpyxl\n- Cell indices are 1-based (row=1, column=1 refers to cell A1)\n- Use `data_only=True` to read calculated values: `load_workbook(''file.xlsx'', data_only=True)`\n- **Warning**: If opened with `data_only=True` and saved, formulas are replaced with values and permanently lost\n- For large files: Use `read_only=True` for reading or `write_only=True` for writing\n- Formulas are preserved but not evaluated - use recalc.py to update values\n\n### Working with pandas\n- Specify data types to avoid inference issues: `pd.read_excel(''file.xlsx'', dtype={''id'': str})`\n- For large files, read specific columns: `pd.read_excel(''file.xlsx'', usecols=[''A'', ''C'', ''E''])`\n- Handle dates properly: `pd.read_excel(''file.xlsx'', parse_dates=[''date_column''])`\n\n## Code Style Guidelines\n**IMPORTANT**: When generating Python code for Excel operations:\n- Write minimal, concise Python code without unnecessary comments\n- Avoid verbose variable names and redundant operations\n- Avoid unnecessary print statements\n\n**For Excel files themselves**:\n- Add comments to cells with complex formulas or important assumptions\n- Document data sources for hardcoded values\n- Include notes for key calculations and model sections"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:58:49.361Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing precise Excel file manipulation and formula error handling.","zh":"非常适合需要精确操作Excel文件和处理公式错误的数据分析智能体。","ja":"Excelファイルの精密な操作と数式エラーの処理を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 Excel 파일 조작과 수식 오류 처리가 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan una manipulación precisa de archivos de Excel y un control de errores de fórmulas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données ayant besoin d''une manipulation précise de fichiers Excel et d''une gestion d''erreurs de formules.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine präzise Excel-Dateimanipulation und Formel-Fehlerbehandlung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam de manipulação precisa de arquivos do Excel e tratamento de erros de fórmulas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуется точная манипуляция файлами Excel и обработка ошибок формул.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل البيانات الذي يحتاج إلى التعامل الدقيق مع ملفات إكسل ومعالجة أخطاء الصيغ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and modify Excel files with zero formula errors, preserving existing templates and conventions, and utilizing color coding standards for financial models, all while maintaining compatibility with .xlsx file formats.","zh":"使智能体能够创建和修改Excel文件，实现零公式错误，保留现有模板和约定，并利用财务模型的颜色编码标准，同时保持与.xlsx文件格式的兼容性。","ja":"既存のテンプレートと規約を維持し、財務モデルのカラーコーディング標準を利用しながら、数式エラーをゼロにしてExcelファイルを作成および変更し、.xlsxファイル形式との互換性を維持する機能をエージェントに提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 기존 템플릿과 규칙을 보존하고 재무 모델에 대한 색상 코딩 표준을 활용하며 .xlsx 파일 형식과의 호환성을 유지하면서 수식 오류 없이 Excel 파일을 생성하고 수정할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y modificar archivos de Excel con cero errores de fórmulas, preservando plantillas y convenciones existentes, y utilizando estándares de codificación de colores para modelos financieros, todo mientras se mantiene la compatibilidad con los formatos de archivo .xlsx.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de modifier des fichiers Excel avec zéro erreur de formules, en préservant les modèles et les conventions existants, et en utilisant des normes de codage de couleurs pour les modèles financiers, le tout en maintenant la compatibilité avec les formats de fichiers .xlsx.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Excel-Dateien mit null Formelfehlern zu erstellen und zu ändern, indem bestehende Vorlagen und Konventionen erhalten bleiben und Farbcodierungsstandards für Finanzmodelle verwendet werden, während die Kompatibilität mit .xlsx-Dateiformaten erhalten bleibt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e modificar arquivos do Excel sem erros de fórmulas, preservando modelos e convenções existentes, e utilizando padrões de codificação de cores para modelos financeiros, mantendo a compatibilidade com formatos de arquivo .xlsx.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и изменять файлы Excel без ошибок формул, сохраняя существующие шаблоны и соглашения, и используя стандарты цветового кодирования для финансовых моделей, сохраняя совместимость с форматами файлов .xlsx.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء وتعديل ملفات إكسل بدون أخطاء في الصيغ، مع الحفاظ على القوالب والتقاليد الموجودة، واستخدام معايير الترميز اللوني لنماذج مالية، مع الحفاظ على التوافق مع تنسيقات الملفات .xlsx."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Excel template updates with exact format matching","Debugging formula errors in financial models","Generating .xlsx files with precise color coding for financial data visualization"],"zh":["通过精确格式匹配自动化Excel模板更新","调试财务模型中的公式错误","为财务数据可视化生成具有精确颜色编码的.xlsx文件"],"ja":["正確なフォーマットマッチングによるExcelテンプレート更新の自動化","財務モデルにおける数式エラーのデバッグ","財務データ可視化のための精密なカラーコーディングを施した.xlsxファイルの生成"],"ko":["정확한 형식 일치로 Excel 템플릿 업데이트 자동화","재무 모델에서 수식 오류 디버깅","재무 데이터 시각화를 위한 정밀한 색상 코딩이 적용된 .xlsx 파일 생성"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de plantillas de Excel con coincidencia de formato exacta","Depurar errores de fórmulas en modelos financieros","Generar archivos .xlsx con codificación de colores precisa para la visualización de datos financieros"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de modèles Excel avec une correspondance de format exacte","Déboguer les erreurs de formules dans les modèles financiers","Générer des fichiers .xlsx avec un codage de couleurs précis pour la visualisation de données financières"],"de":["Automatisieren von Excel-Vorlagen-Updates mit exakter Formatübereinstimmung","Fehlerbehebung in Formeln von Finanzmodellen","Erstellen von .xlsx-Dateien mit präziser Farbcodierung für die Visualisierung von Finanzdaten"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de modelos do Excel com correspondência de formato exata","Depurar erros de fórmulas em modelos financeiros","Gerar arquivos .xlsx com codificação de cores precisa para visualização de dados financeiros"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления шаблонов Excel с точным совпадением формата","Отлаживать ошибки формул в финансовых моделях","Генерировать файлы .xlsx с точным цветовым кодированием для визуализации финансовых данных"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في تحديث قوالب إكسل مع تطابق دقيق في التنسيق","تصحيح أخطاء الصيغ في نماذج مالية","إنشاء ملفات .xlsx مع ترميز لوني دقيق لتصوير بيانات مالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires exact matching of existing template formats and styles","Limited to .xlsx file format","Must adhere to established color coding conventions for financial models"],"zh":["需要与现有模板格式和样式精确匹配","仅限于.xlsx文件格式","必须遵守财务模型既定的颜色编码约定"],"ja":["既存のテンプレートフォーマットとスタイルとの正確なマッチングが必要",".xlsxファイル形式に限定","財務モデルで確立されたカラーコーディング規約に従う必要がある"],"ko":["기존 템플릿 형식 및 스타일과의 정확한 일치 필요",".xlsx 파일 형식으로 제한됨","재무 모델에 대해 확립된 색상 코딩 규칙을 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una coincidencia exacta de formatos y estilos de plantilla existentes","Limitado al formato de archivo .xlsx","Debe cumplir con las convenciones de codificación de colores establecidas para modelos financieros"],"fr":["Nécessite une correspondance exacte des formats et des styles de modèles existants","Limité au format de fichier .xlsx","Doit respecter les conventions de codage de couleurs établies pour les modèles financiers"],"de":["Erfordert eine exakte Übereinstimmung der bestehenden Vorlagenformate und -stile","Begrenzt auf das .xlsx-Dateiformat","Muss den etablierten Farbcodierungs-Konventionen für Finanzmodelle entsprechen"],"pt":["Exige correspondência exata de formatos e estilos de modelos existentes","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .xlsx","Deve seguir as convenções de codificação de cores estabelecidas para modelos financeiros"],"ru":["Требует точного совпадения существующих форматов и стилей шаблонов","Ограничен форматом файла .xlsx","Должен следовать установленным соглашениям цветового кодирования для финансовых моделей"],"ar":["يتطلب تطابقاً دقيقاً لتنسيقات وأساليب القوالب الموجودة","محدود بتنسيق الملف .xlsx","يجب اتباع معايير الترميز اللوني المعمول بها لنماذج مالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
