},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Creación de campañas de anuncios pagados","Optimización de campañas para una adquisición de clientes eficiente","Escalado de campañas para llegar a más clientes","Análisis de resultados para mejorar el rendimiento","Integración con plataformas de publicidad en línea","Seguimiento y ajuste de campañas en tiempo real"],"fr":["Création de campagnes d''annonces payantes","Optimisation de campagnes pour une acquisition de clients efficace","Développement de campagnes pour atteindre plus de clients","Analyse des résultats pour améliorer les performances","Intégration avec les plateformes de publicité en ligne","Suivi et ajustement de campagnes en temps réel"],"de":["Erstellung von bezahlten Anzeigenkampagnen","Optimierung von Kampagnen für eine effiziente Kundengewinnung","Skalierung von Kampagnen, um mehr Kunden zu erreichen","Analyse der Ergebnisse, um die Leistung zu verbessern","Integration mit Online-Werbeplattformen","Verfolgung und Anpassung von Kampagnen in Echtzeit"],"pt":["Criação de campanhas publicitárias","Otimização de anúncios para dispositivos móveis","Aumento da eficiência da aquisição de clientes","Análise de desempenho de campanhas","Otimização de orçamento publicitário","Integração com plataformas de marketing"],"ru":["Создание рекламных кампаний","Оптимизация рекламы для мобильных устройств","Повышение эффективности привлечения клиентов","Анализ производительности кампаний","Оптимизация рекламного бюджета","Интеграция с маркетинговыми платформами"],"ar":["إنشاء حملات إعلانية","تحسين الإعلانات للجهاز المحمول","زيادة كفاءة جذب العملاء","تحليل أداء الحملات","تحسين ميزانية الإعلان","التكامل مع منصات التسويق"]},"keywords":{"es":["anuncios pagados","marketing de rendimiento","adquisición de clientes","optimización de campañas","publicidad en línea","plataformas de publicidad","análisis de resultados","escalado de campañas","seguimiento de campañas"],"fr":["annonces payantes","marketing de performance","acquisition de clients","optimisation de campagnes","publicité en ligne","plateformes de publicité","analyse des résultats","développement de campagnes","suivi de campagnes"],"de":["bezahlte Anzeigen","Performance-Marketing","Kundengewinnung","Optimierung von Kampagnen","Online-Werbung","Werbplattformen","Ergebnisanalyse","Skalierung von Kampagnen","Kampagnenverfolgung"],"pt":["anúncios pagos","otimização de campanhas publicitárias","aquisição de clientes","marketing digital","publicidade online","campanhas de marketing","análise de desempenho","orçamento publicitário","integração com plataformas de marketing"],"ru":["платная реклама","оптимизация рекламных кампаний","привлечение клиентов","цифровой маркетинг","онлайн-реклама","маркетинговые кампании","анализ производительности","рекламный бюджет","интеграция с маркетинговыми платформами"],"ar":["إعلانات مدفوعة","تحسين حملات الإعلان","جذب العملاء","تسويق رقمي","إعلان عبر الإنترنت","حملات التسويق","تحليل الأداء","ميزانية الإعلان","التكامل مع منصات التسويق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paid-ads","description":"When the user wants help with paid advertising campaigns on Google Ads, Meta (Facebook/Instagram), LinkedIn, Twitter/X, or other ad platforms. Also use when the user mentions PPC, paid media, ad copy, ad creative, ROAS, CPA, ad campaign, retargeting, or audience targeting. This skill covers campaign strategy, ad creation, audience targeting, and optimization.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):","body":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Campaign Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Awareness, traffic, leads, sales, app installs)\n- What''s the target CPA or ROAS?\n- What''s the monthly/weekly budget?\n- Any constraints? (Brand guidelines, compliance, geographic)\n\n### 2. Product & Offer\n- What are you promoting? (Product, free trial, lead magnet, demo)\n- What''s the landing page URL?\n- What makes this offer compelling?\n\n### 3. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What problem does your product solve for them?\n- What are they searching for or interested in?\n- Do you have existing customer data for lookalikes?\n\n### 4. Current State\n- Have you run ads before? What worked/didn''t?\n- Do you have existing pixel/conversion data?\n- What''s your current funnel conversion rate?\n\n---\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Use When |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Google Ads** | High-intent search traffic | People actively search for your solution |\n| **Meta** | Demand generation, visual products | Creating demand, strong creative assets |\n| **LinkedIn** | B2B, decision-makers | Job title/company targeting matters, higher price points |\n| **Twitter/X** | Tech audiences, thought leadership | Audience is active on X, timely content |\n| **TikTok** | Younger demographics, viral creative | Audience skews 18-34, video capacity |\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Structure Best Practices\n\n### Account Organization\n\n```\nAccount\n├── Campaign 1: [Objective] - [Audience/Product]\n│   ├── Ad Set 1: [Targeting variation]\n│   │   ├── Ad 1: [Creative variation A]\n│   │   ├── Ad 2: [Creative variation B]\n│   │   └── Ad 3: [Creative variation C]\n│   └── Ad Set 2: [Targeting variation]\n└── Campaign 2...\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n```\n[Platform]_[Objective]_[Audience]_[Offer]_[Date]\n\nExamples:\nMETA_Conv_Lookalike-Customers_FreeTrial_2024Q1\nGOOG_Search_Brand_Demo_Ongoing\nLI_LeadGen_CMOs-SaaS_Whitepaper_Mar24\n```\n\n### Budget Allocation\n\n**Testing phase (first 2-4 weeks):**\n- 70% to proven/safe campaigns\n- 30% to testing new audiences/creative\n\n**Scaling phase:**\n- Consolidate budget into winning combinations\n- Increase budgets 20-30% at a time\n- Wait 3-5 days between increases for algorithm learning\n\n---\n\n## Ad Copy Frameworks\n\n### Key Formulas\n\n**Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS):**\n> [Problem] → [Agitate the pain] → [Introduce solution] → [CTA]\n\n**Before-After-Bridge (BAB):**\n> [Current painful state] → [Desired future state] → [Your product as bridge]\n\n**Social Proof Lead:**\n> [Impressive stat or testimonial] → [What you do] → [CTA]\n\n**For detailed templates and headline formulas**: See [references/ad-copy-templates.md](references/ad-copy-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Audience Targeting Overview\n\n### Platform Strengths\n\n| Platform | Key Targeting | Best Signals |\n|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| Google | Keywords, search intent | What they''re searching |\n| Meta | Interests, behaviors, lookalikes | Engagement patterns |\n| LinkedIn | Job titles, companies, industries | Professional identity |\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Lookalikes**: Base on best customers (by LTV), not all customers\n- **Retargeting**: Segment by funnel stage (visitors vs. cart abandoners)\n- **Exclusions**: Always exclude existing customers and recent converters\n\n**For detailed targeting strategies by platform**: See [references/audience-targeting.md](references/audience-targeting.md)\n\n---\n\n## Creative Best Practices\n\n### Image Ads\n- Clear product screenshots showing UI\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Stats and numbers as focal point\n- Human faces (real, not stock)\n- Bold, readable text overlay (keep under 20%)\n\n### Video Ads Structure (15-30 sec)\n1. Hook (0-3 sec): Pattern interrupt, question, or bold statement\n2. Problem (3-8 sec): Relatable pain point\n3. Solution (8-20 sec): Show product/benefit\n4. CTA (20-30 sec): Clear next step\n\n**Production tips:**\n- Captions always (85% watch without sound)\n- Vertical for Stories/Reels, square for feed\n- Native feel outperforms polished\n- First 3 seconds determine if they watch\n\n### Creative Testing Hierarchy\n1. Concept/angle (biggest impact)\n2. Hook/headline\n3. Visual style\n4. Body copy\n5. CTA\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Optimization\n\n### Key Metrics by Objective\n\n| Objective | Primary Metrics |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| Awareness | CPM, Reach, Video view rate |\n| Consideration | CTR, CPC, Time on site |\n| Conversion | CPA, ROAS, Conversion rate |\n\n### Optimization Levers\n\n**If CPA is too high:**\n1. Check landing page (is the problem post-click?)\n2. Tighten audience targeting\n3. Test new creative angles\n4. Improve ad relevance/quality score\n5. Adjust bid strategy\n\n**If CTR is low:**\n- Creative isn''t resonating → test new hooks/angles\n- Audience mismatch → refine targeting\n- Ad fatigue → refresh creative\n\n**If CPM is high:**\n- Audience too narrow → expand targeting\n- High competition → try different placements\n- Low relevance score → improve creative fit\n\n### Bid Strategy Progression\n1. Start with manual or cost caps\n2. Gather conversion data (50+ conversions)\n3. Switch to automated with targets based on historical data\n4. Monitor and adjust targets based on results\n\n---\n\n## Retargeting Strategies\n\n### Funnel-Based Approach\n\n| Funnel Stage | Audience | Message | Goal |\n|--------------|----------|---------|------|\n| Top | Blog readers, video viewers | Educational, social proof | Move to consideration |\n| Middle | Pricing/feature page visitors | Case studies, demos | Move to decision |\n| Bottom | Cart abandoners, trial users | Urgency, objection handling | Convert |\n\n### Retargeting Windows\n\n| Stage | Window | Frequency Cap |\n|-------|--------|---------------|\n| Hot (cart/trial) | 1-7 days | Higher OK |\n| Warm (key pages) | 7-30 days | 3-5x/week |\n| Cold (any visit) | 30-90 days | 1-2x/week |\n\n### Exclusions to Set Up\n- Existing customers (unless upsell)\n- Recent converters (7-14 day window)\n- Bounced visitors (<10 sec)\n- Irrelevant pages (careers, support)\n\n---\n\n## Reporting & Analysis\n\n### Weekly Review\n- Spend vs. budget pacing\n- CPA/ROAS vs. targets\n- Top and bottom performing ads\n- Audience performance breakdown\n- Frequency check (fatigue risk)\n- Landing page conversion rate\n\n### Attribution Considerations\n- Platform attribution is inflated\n- Use UTM parameters consistently\n- Compare platform data to GA4\n- Look at blended CAC, not just platform CPA\n\n---\n\n## Platform Setup\n\nBefore launching campaigns, ensure proper tracking and account setup.\n\n**For complete setup checklists by platform**: See [references/platform-setup-checklists.md](references/platform-setup-checklists.md)\n\n### Universal Pre-Launch Checklist\n- [ ] Conversion tracking tested with real conversion\n- [ ] Landing page loads fast (<3 sec)\n- [ ] Landing page mobile-friendly\n- [ ] UTM parameters working\n- [ ] Budget set correctly\n- [ ] Targeting matches intended audience\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### Strategy\n- Launching without conversion tracking\n- Too many campaigns (fragmenting budget)\n- Not giving algorithms enough learning time\n- Optimizing for wrong metric\n\n### Targeting\n- Audiences too narrow or too broad\n- Not excluding existing customers\n- Overlapping audiences competing\n\n### Creative\n- Only one ad per ad set\n- Not refreshing creative (fatigue)\n- Mismatch between ad and landing page\n\n### Budget\n- Spreading too thin across campaigns\n- Making big budget changes (disrupts learning)\n- Stopping campaigns during learning phase\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What platform(s) are you currently running or want to start with?\n2. What''s your monthly ad budget?\n3. What does a successful conversion look like (and what''s it worth)?\n4. Do you have existing creative assets or need to create them?\n5. What landing page will ads point to?\n6. Do you have pixel/conversion tracking set up?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key advertising platforms:\n\n| Platform | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|----------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **Google Ads** | Search intent, high-intent traffic | ✓ | [google-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/google-ads.md) |\n| **Meta Ads** | Demand gen, visual products, B2C | - | [meta-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/meta-ads.md) |\n| **LinkedIn Ads** | B2B, job title targeting | - | [linkedin-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/linkedin-ads.md) |\n| **TikTok Ads** | Younger demographics, video | - | [tiktok-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/tiktok-ads.md) |\n\nFor tracking, see also: [ga4.md](../../tools/integrations/ga4.md), [segment.md](../../tools/integrations/segment.md)\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For landing page copy that converts ad traffic\n- **analytics-tracking**: For proper conversion tracking setup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For landing page testing to improve ROAS\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing post-click conversion rates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:59:33.010Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced paid advertising campaign optimization and customer acquisition strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要高级付费广告活动优化和客户获取策略的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度な有料広告キャンペーンの最適化と顧客の獲得戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 유료 광고 캠페인 최적화 및 고객 확보 전략이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan una optimización avanzada de campañas publicitarias pagas y estrategias de adquisición de clientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin d''une optimisation avancée des campagnes publicitaires payantes et de stratégies d''acquisition de clients.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen und Kundenakquise-Strategien benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de otimização avançada de campanhas de publicidade paga e estratégias de aquisição de clientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым требуется продвинутая оптимизация платных рекламных кампаний и стратегии привлечения клиентов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لحملات الإعلان المدفوع واستراتيجيات اكتساب العملاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns using ad platform accounts, driving efficient customer acquisition through direct access to campaign performance data and product marketing context.","zh":"赋予代理商使用广告平台账户创建、优化和扩大有料广告活动的能力，通过直接访问活动性能数据和产品营销背景，实现高效的客户获取。","ja":"広告プラットフォームアカウントを使用して、代理店が有料広告キャンペーンを作成、最適化、拡大できるようにし、キャンペーンのパフォーマンスデータと製品マーケティングのコンテキストに直接アクセスすることで、効率的な顧客獲得を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 광고 플랫폼 계정을 사용하여 유료 광고 캠페인을 생성, 최적화 및 확장할 수 있도록 하여 캠페인 성능 데이터 및 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트에 직접 액세스하여 효율적인 고객 확보를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear, optimizar y ampliar campañas publicitarias pagas utilizando cuentas de plataformas de publicidad, lo que impulsa una adquisición de clientes eficiente a través del acceso directo a datos de rendimiento de campaña y contexto de marketing de productos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''optimiser et de développer des campagnes publicitaires payantes en utilisant des comptes de plateformes de publicité, ce qui favorise une acquisition de clients efficace grâce à un accès direct aux données de performance de campagne et au contexte de marketing de produits.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen zu erstellen, zu optimieren und zu skalieren, indem sie Werbeplattform-Konten nutzen, was eine effiziente Kundenakquise durch direkten Zugriff auf Kampagnenleistungsdaten und Produktmarketing-Kontext ermöglicht.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a criar, otimizar e dimensionar campanhas de publicidade paga usando contas de plataformas de anúncios, impulsionando a aquisição eficiente de clientes através do acesso direto aos dados de desempenho da campanha e ao contexto de marketing do produto.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, оптимизировать и масштабировать платные рекламные кампании с использованием аккаунтов рекламных платформ, обеспечивая эффективное привлечение клиентов за счет прямого доступа к данным о производительности кампании и контексту маркетинга продукта.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحسين وتوسيع نطاق حملات الإعلان المدفوع باستخدام حسابات منصات الإعلان، مما يؤدي إلى اكتساب العملاء بكفاءة من خلال الوصول المباشر إلى بيانات أداء الحملة وسياق تسويق المنتج."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating targeted ad campaigns","Optimizing ad spend for efficient customer acquisition","Analyzing campaign performance data"],"zh":["创建有针对性的广告活动","优化广告支出以实现高效的客户获取","分析活动性能数据"],"ja":["ターゲットを絞った広告キャンペーンの作成","効率的な顧客の獲得のための広告支出の最適化","キャンペーンのパフォーマンスデータの分析"],"ko":["대상별 광고 캠페인 생성","효율적인 고객 확보를 위한 광고 비용 최적화","캠페인 성능 데이터 분석"],"es":["Creación de campañas publicitarias dirigidas","Optimización del gasto publicitario para una adquisición de clientes eficiente","Análisis de datos de rendimiento de campaña"],"fr":["Création de campagnes publicitaires ciblées","Optimisation des dépenses publicitaires pour une acquisition de clients efficace","Analyse des données de performance de campagne"],"de":["Erstellung von gezielten Werbekampagnen","Optimierung der Werbeausgaben für eine effiziente Kundenakquise","Analyse von Kampagnenleistungsdaten"],"pt":["Criação de campanhas publicitárias segmentadas","Otimização do gasto em publicidade para aquisição eficiente de clientes","Análise de dados de desempenho da campanha"],"ru":["Создание целевых рекламных кампаний","Оптимизация рекламных расходов для эффективного привлечения клиентов","Анализ данных о производительности кампании"],"ar":["إنشاء حملات إعلانية مستهدفة","تحسين الإنفاق الإعلاني لاكتساب العملاء بكفاءة","تحليل بيانات أداء الحملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ad platform accounts","Needs product marketing context for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要访问广告平台账户","需要产品营销背景以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["広告プラットフォームアカウントへのアクセスが必要","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するには製品マーケティングのコンテキストが必要"],"ko":["광고 플랫폼 계정에 대한 액세스가 필요","최적의 성능을 달성하려면 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad","Necesita contexto de marketing de productos para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux comptes de plateformes de publicité","Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten","Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a contas de plataformas de anúncios","Necessita de contexto de marketing do produto para um desempenho ideal"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к аккаунтам рекламных платформ","Для оптимальной производительности необходим контекст маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حسابات منصات الإعلان","يحتاج إلى سياق تسويق المنتج لأداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/form-cro', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'form-cro', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z', '2026-02-18T12:59:46.888Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/form-cro","name":"form-cro","description":{"zh":"Form CRO是指通过优化表单设计和内容来提高表单完成率和数据质量。","ja":"Form CROは、フォームのデザインとコンテンツを最適化して、フォームの完成率とデータの品質を向上させることです。","ko":"폼 CRO는 폼 설계와 콘텐츠를 최적화하여 폼 완성률과 데이터 품질을 향상시키는 것을 의미합니다.","es":"Maximiza las tasas de finalización de formularios y captura datos clave con técnicas de optimización de formularios CRO","fr":"Maximisez les taux de finalisation de formulaires et captez des données clés avec des techniques d''optimisation de formulaires CRO","de":"Maximieren Sie die Formular-Abschlussraten und erfassen Sie wichtige Daten mit Techniken zur Formular-Optimierung CRO","pt":"Otimização de formulários para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a maximizar as taxas de conclusão de formulários e capturar dados importantes.","ru":"Оптимизация форм для разработчиков. Узнайте, как максимизировать показатели завершения форм и собирать важные данные","ar":"تحسين الاستمارات لملقني التطبيقات. تعلم كيفية تعزيز معدلات إكمال الاستمارات وجمع البيانات المهمة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Form CRO 优化专家","ja":"フォームCRO最適化エキスパート","ko":"폼 CRO 최적화 전문가","es":"Optimización de Formularios CRO","fr":"Optimisation de Formulaires CRO","de":"Formular-Optimierung CRO","pt":"Otimização de Formulários para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Оптимизация форм для разработчиков","ar":"تحسين الاستمارات لملقني التطبيقات","en":"form-cro"},"description":{"zh":"Form CRO是指通过优化表单设计和内容来提高表单完成率和数据质量。","ja":"Form CROは、フォームのデザインとコンテンツを最適化して、フォームの完成率とデータの品質を向上させることです。","ko":"폼 CRO는 폼 설계와 콘텐츠를 최적화하여 폼 완성률과 데이터 품질을 향상시키는 것을 의미합니다.","es":"Maximiza las tasas de finalización de formularios y captura datos clave con técnicas de optimización de formularios CRO","fr":"Maximisez les taux de finalisation de formulaires et captez des données clés avec des techniques d''optimisation de formulaires CRO","de":"Maximieren Sie die Formular-Abschlussraten und erfassen Sie wichtige Daten mit Techniken zur Formular-Optimierung CRO","pt":"Otimização de formulários para desenvolvedores. Aprenda a maximizar as taxas de conclusão de formulários e capturar dados importantes.","ru":"Оптимизация форм для разработчиков. Узнайте, как максимизировать показатели завершения форм и собирать важные данные","ar":"تحسين الاستمارات لملقني التطبيقات. تعلم كيفية تعزيز معدلات إكمال الاستمارات وجمع البيانات المهمة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提高表单完成率","捕获重要数据","优化表单设计","提高数据质量","个性化表单内容"],"ja":["フォームの完成率を向上","重要なデータのキャプチャ","フォームデザインの最適化","データ品質の向上","フォームコンテンツのパーソナライズ"],"ko":["폼 완성률 향상","중요한 데이터 캡처","폼 디자인 최적화","데이터 품질 향상","폼 콘텐츠 개인화"],"es":["Identificación del tipo de formulario","Análisis de la experiencia del usuario","Optimización de campos y etiquetas","Mejora de la accesibilidad","Pruebas A/B y análisis de resultados"],"fr":["Identification du type de formulaire","Analyse de l''expérience utilisateur","Optimisation des champs et des étiquettes","Amélioration de l''accessibilité","Tests A/B et analyse des résultats"],"de":["Identifizierung des Formulartyps","Analyse der Benutzeroberfläche","Optimierung von Feldern und Beschriftungen","Verbesserung der Zugänglichkeit","A/B-Tests und Ergebnisanalyse"],"pt":["Otimização de formulários para lead capture","Melhoria da taxa de conclusão de formulários","Captação de dados importantes","Análise de desempenho de formulários","Otimização de formulários para dispositivos móveis"],"ru":["Оптимизация форм для сбора лидов","Повышение показателей завершения форм","Сбор важных данных","Анализ производительности форм","Оптимизация форм для мобильных устройств"],"ar":["تحسين الاستمارات لجمع القادة","تحسين نسبة إكمال الاستمارات","جمع البيانات المهمة","تحليل أداء الاستمارات","تحسين الاستمارات للأجهزة المحمولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Form CRO","表单优化","表单完成率","数据质量","用户体验","转化率优化","营销自动化"],"ja":["Form CRO","フォーム最適化","フォームの完成率","データ品質","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","コンバージョンレート最適化","マーケティングオートメーション"],"ko":["폼 CRO","폼 최적화","폼 완성률","데이터 품질","사용자 경험","전환률 최적화","마케팅 자동화"],"es":["optimización de formularios","CRO","formularios web","experiencia del usuario","accesibilidad","pruebas A/B","análisis de resultados"],"fr":["optimisation de formulaires","CRO","formulaires web","expérience utilisateur","accessibilité","tests A/B","analyse des résultats"],"de":["Formular-Optimierung","CRO","Webformulare","Benutzeroberfläche","Zugänglichkeit","A/B-Tests","Ergebnisanalyse"],"pt":["otimização de formulários","form cro","desenvolvedores","taxa de conclusão de formulários","captação de leads","análise de desempenho de formulários"],"ru":["оптимизация форм","форм cro","разработчики","показатели завершения форм","сбор лидов","анализ производительности форм"],"ar":["تحسين الاستمارات","استمارات cro","ملقني التطبيقات","نسبة إكمال الاستمارات","جمع القادة","تحليل أداء الاستمارات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"form-cro","description":"When the user wants to optimize any form that is NOT signup/registration — including lead capture forms, contact forms, demo request forms, application forms, survey forms, or checkout forms. Also use when the user mentions form optimization, lead form conversions, form friction, form fields, form completion rate, or contact form. For signup/registration forms, see signup-flow-cro. For popups containing forms, see popup-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Form CRO\n\nYou are an expert in form optimization. Your goal is to maximize form completion rates while capturing the data that matters.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Form Type**\n   - Lead capture (gated content, newsletter)\n   - Co","body":"# Form CRO\n\nYou are an expert in form optimization. Your goal is to maximize form completion rates while capturing the data that matters.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, identify:\n\n1. **Form Type**\n   - Lead capture (gated content, newsletter)\n   - Contact form\n   - Demo/sales request\n   - Application form\n   - Survey/feedback\n   - Checkout form\n   - Quote request\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - How many fields?\n   - What''s the current completion rate?\n   - Mobile vs. desktop split?\n   - Where do users abandon?\n\n3. **Business Context**\n   - What happens with form submissions?\n   - Which fields are actually used in follow-up?\n   - Are there compliance/legal requirements?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Every Field Has a Cost\nEach field reduces completion rate. Rule of thumb:\n- 3 fields: Baseline\n- 4-6 fields: 10-25% reduction\n- 7+ fields: 25-50%+ reduction\n\nFor each field, ask:\n- Is this absolutely necessary before we can help them?\n- Can we get this information another way?\n- Can we ask this later?\n\n### 2. Value Must Exceed Effort\n- Clear value proposition above form\n- Make what they get obvious\n- Reduce perceived effort (field count, labels)\n\n### 3. Reduce Cognitive Load\n- One question per field\n- Clear, conversational labels\n- Logical grouping and order\n- Smart defaults where possible\n\n---\n\n## Field-by-Field Optimization\n\n### Email Field\n- Single field, no confirmation\n- Inline validation\n- Typo detection (did you mean gmail.com?)\n- Proper mobile keyboard\n\n### Name Fields\n- Single \"Name\" vs. First/Last — test this\n- Single field reduces friction\n- Split needed only if personalization requires it\n\n### Phone Number\n- Make optional if possible\n- If required, explain why\n- Auto-format as they type\n- Country code handling\n\n### Company/Organization\n- Auto-suggest for faster entry\n- Enrichment after submission (Clearbit, etc.)\n- Consider inferring from email domain\n\n### Job Title/Role\n- Dropdown if categories matter\n- Free text if wide variation\n- Consider making optional\n\n### Message/Comments (Free Text)\n- Make optional\n- Reasonable character guidance\n- Expand on focus\n\n### Dropdown Selects\n- \"Select one...\" placeholder\n- Searchable if many options\n- Consider radio buttons if < 5 options\n- \"Other\" option with text field\n\n### Checkboxes (Multi-select)\n- Clear, parallel labels\n- Reasonable number of options\n- Consider \"Select all that apply\" instruction\n\n---\n\n## Form Layout Optimization\n\n### Field Order\n1. Start with easiest fields (name, email)\n2. Build commitment before asking more\n3. Sensitive fields last (phone, company size)\n4. Logical grouping if many fields\n\n### Labels and Placeholders\n- Labels: Always visible (not just placeholder)\n- Placeholders: Examples, not labels\n- Help text: Only when genuinely helpful\n\n**Good:**\n```\nEmail\n[name@company.com]\n```\n\n**Bad:**\n```\n[Enter your email address]  ← Disappears on focus\n```\n\n### Visual Design\n- Sufficient spacing between fields\n- Clear visual hierarchy\n- CTA button stands out\n- Mobile-friendly tap targets (44px+)\n\n### Single Column vs. Multi-Column\n- Single column: Higher completion, mobile-friendly\n- Multi-column: Only for short related fields (First/Last name)\n- When in doubt, single column\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Step Forms\n\n### When to Use Multi-Step\n- More than 5-6 fields\n- Logically distinct sections\n- Conditional paths based on answers\n- Complex forms (applications, quotes)\n\n### Multi-Step Best Practices\n- Progress indicator (step X of Y)\n- Start with easy, end with sensitive\n- One topic per step\n- Allow back navigation\n- Save progress (don''t lose data on refresh)\n- Clear indication of required vs. optional\n\n### Progressive Commitment Pattern\n1. Low-friction start (just email)\n2. More detail (name, company)\n3. Qualifying questions\n4. Contact preferences\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Inline Validation\n- Validate as they move to next field\n- Don''t validate too aggressively while typing\n- Clear visual indicators (green check, red border)\n\n### Error Messages\n- Specific to the problem\n- Suggest how to fix\n- Positioned near the field\n- Don''t clear their input\n\n**Good:** \"Please enter a valid email address (e.g., name@company.com)\"\n**Bad:** \"Invalid input\"\n\n### On Submit\n- Focus on first error field\n- Summarize errors if multiple\n- Preserve all entered data\n- Don''t clear form on error\n\n---\n\n## Submit Button Optimization\n\n### Button Copy\nWeak: \"Submit\" | \"Send\"\nStrong: \"[Action] + [What they get]\"\n\nExamples:\n- \"Get My Free Quote\"\n- \"Download the Guide\"\n- \"Request Demo\"\n- \"Send Message\"\n- \"Start Free Trial\"\n\n### Button Placement\n- Immediately after last field\n- Left-aligned with fields\n- Sufficient size and contrast\n- Mobile: Sticky or clearly visible\n\n### Post-Submit States\n- Loading state (disable button, show spinner)\n- Success confirmation (clear next steps)\n- Error handling (clear message, focus on issue)\n\n---\n\n## Trust and Friction Reduction\n\n### Near the Form\n- Privacy statement: \"We''ll never share your info\"\n- Security badges if collecting sensitive data\n- Testimonial or social proof\n- Expected response time\n\n### Reducing Perceived Effort\n- \"Takes 30 seconds\"\n- Field count indicator\n- Remove visual clutter\n- Generous white space\n\n### Addressing Objections\n- \"No spam, unsubscribe anytime\"\n- \"We won''t share your number\"\n- \"No credit card required\"\n\n---\n\n## Form Types: Specific Guidance\n\n### Lead Capture (Gated Content)\n- Minimum viable fields (often just email)\n- Clear value proposition for what they get\n- Consider asking enrichment questions post-download\n- Test email-only vs. email + name\n\n### Contact Form\n- Essential: Email/Name + Message\n- Phone optional\n- Set response time expectations\n- Offer alternatives (chat, phone)\n\n### Demo Request\n- Name, Email, Company required\n- Phone: Optional with \"preferred contact\" choice\n- Use case/goal question helps personalize\n- Calendar embed can increase show rate\n\n### Quote/Estimate Request\n- Multi-step often works well\n- Start with easy questions\n- Technical details later\n- Save progress for complex forms\n\n### Survey Forms\n- Progress bar essential\n- One question per screen for engagement\n- Skip logic for relevance\n- Consider incentive for completion\n\n---\n\n## Mobile Optimization\n\n- Larger touch targets (44px minimum height)\n- Appropriate keyboard types (email, tel, number)\n- Autofill support\n- Single column only\n- Sticky submit button\n- Minimal typing (dropdowns, buttons)\n\n---\n\n## Measurement\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Form start rate**: Page views → Started form\n- **Completion rate**: Started → Submitted\n- **Field drop-off**: Which fields lose people\n- **Error rate**: By field\n- **Time to complete**: Total and by field\n- **Mobile vs. desktop**: Completion by device\n\n### What to Track\n- Form views\n- First field focus\n- Each field completion\n- Errors by field\n- Submit attempts\n- Successful submissions\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Form Audit\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: Estimated effect on conversions\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: High/Medium/Low\n\n### Recommended Form Design\n- **Required fields**: Justified list\n- **Optional fields**: With rationale\n- **Field order**: Recommended sequence\n- **Copy**: Labels, placeholders, button\n- **Error messages**: For each field\n- **Layout**: Visual guidance\n\n### Test Hypotheses\nIdeas to A/B test with expected outcomes\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Ideas\n\n### Form Structure Experiments\n\n**Layout & Flow**\n- Single-step form vs. multi-step with progress bar\n- 1-column vs. 2-column field layout\n- Form embedded on page vs. separate page\n- Vertical vs. horizontal field alignment\n- Form above fold vs. after content\n\n**Field Optimization**\n- Reduce to minimum viable fields\n- Add or remove phone number field\n- Add or remove company/organization field\n- Test required vs. optional field balance\n- Use field enrichment to auto-fill known data\n- Hide fields for returning/known visitors\n\n**Smart Forms**\n- Add real-time validation for emails and phone numbers\n- Progressive profiling (ask more over time)\n- Conditional fields based on earlier answers\n- Auto-suggest for company names\n\n---\n\n### Copy & Design Experiments\n\n**Labels & Microcopy**\n- Test field label clarity and length\n- Placeholder text optimization\n- Help text: show vs. hide vs. on-hover\n- Error message tone (friendly vs. direct)\n\n**CTAs & Buttons**\n- Button text variations (\"Submit\" vs. \"Get My Quote\" vs. specific action)\n- Button color and size testing\n- Button placement relative to fields\n\n**Trust Elements**\n- Add privacy assurance near form\n- Show trust badges next to submit\n- Add testimonial near form\n- Display expected response time\n\n---\n\n### Form Type-Specific Experiments\n\n**Demo Request Forms**\n- Test with/without phone number requirement\n- Add \"preferred contact method\" choice\n- Include \"What''s your biggest challenge?\" question\n- Test calendar embed vs. form submission\n\n**Lead Capture Forms**\n- Email-only vs. email + name\n- Test value proposition messaging above form\n- Gated vs. ungated content strategies\n- Post-submission enrichment questions\n\n**Contact Forms**\n- Add department/topic routing dropdown\n- Test with/without message field requirement\n- Show alternative contact methods (chat, phone)\n- Expected response time messaging\n\n---\n\n### Mobile & UX Experiments\n\n- Larger touch targets for mobile\n- Test appropriate keyboard types by field\n- Sticky submit button on mobile\n- Auto-focus first field on page load\n- Test form container styling (card vs. minimal)\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current form completion rate?\n2. Do you have field-level analytics?\n3. What happens with the data after submission?\n4. Which fields are actually used in follow-up?\n5. Are there compliance/legal requirements?\n6. What''s the mobile vs. desktop split?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **signup-flow-cro**: For account creation forms\n- **popup-cro**: For forms inside popups/modals\n- **page-cro**: For the page containing the form\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing form changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T12:59:46.888Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversion Optimization Agents specializing in user experience and data capture.","zh":"适合专注于用户体验和数据采集的转化率优化代理","ja":"ユーザーエクスペリエンスとデータキャプチャーに特化したコンバージョン最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"사용자 경험과 데이터 수집에 전문적인 전환 최적화 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de conversión especializados en experiencia del usuario y captura de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de conversion spécialisés dans l''expérience utilisateur et la capture de données.","de":"Perfekt für Conversion-Optimierungsagenten, die sich auf Benutzererfahrung und Datenerfassung spezialisiert haben.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Conversão especializados em experiência do usuário e captura de dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации конверсии, специализирующихся на пользовательском опыте и сборе данных.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحسّنين لتحويل المستخدمين الذين يختصون في تجربة المستخدم وجمع البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Maximizes form completion rates by analyzing form type, assessing lead capture or contact structures, and leveraging product marketing context from `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` files. Enables data-driven optimization recommendations based on specific form purposes and existing marketing frameworks.","zh":"通过分析表单类型、评估潜在客户捕获或联系结构，并利用`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`文件中的产品营销背景，最大限度地提高表单完成率。根据具体表单目的和现有的营销框架，实现数据驱动的优化建议","ja":"フォームの種類を分析し、リードキャプチャまたはコンタクト構造を評価し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`ファイルからの製品マーケティングコンテキストを活用して、フォームの完了率を最大化します。特定のフォームの目的と既存のマーケティングフレームワークに基づいたデータドリブンの最適化推奨を可能にします","ko":"폼 유형을 분석하고 리드 캡처 또는 연락처 구조를 평가하며 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 파일의 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하여 폼 완료율을 최대화합니다. 특정 폼 목적과 기존 마케팅 프레임워크에 기반한 데이터 驱动 최적화 추천을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Maximiza las tasas de finalización de formularios analizando el tipo de formulario, evaluando las estructuras de captura de leads o contactos y aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de los archivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`. Permite recomendaciones de optimización basadas en datos según propósitos de formulario específicos y marcos de marketing existentes.","fr":"Maximise les taux d''achèvement des formulaires en analysant le type de formulaire, en évaluant les structures de capture de leads ou de contacts et en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits à partir des fichiers `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`. Permet des recommandations d''optimisation basées sur les données en fonction d''objectifs de formulaire spécifiques et de cadres de marketing existants.","de":"Maximiert die Formularabschlussraten, indem es den Formulartyp analysiert, die Lead-Capture- oder Kontaktstrukturen bewertet und den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus Dateien `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzt. Ermöglicht datengetriebene Optimierungsempfehlungen basierend auf spezifischen Formularzwecken und bestehenden Marketing-Frameworks.","pt":"Maximiza as taxas de conclusão de formulários analisando o tipo de formulário, avaliando as estruturas de captura de leads ou contato e utilizando o contexto de marketing de produto de arquivos `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`. Permite recomendações de otimização baseadas em dados com base em propósitos de formulários específicos e estruturas de marketing existentes.","ru":"Максимально увеличивает показатели завершения форм, анализируя тип формы, оценивая структуры сбора лидов или контактов и используя контекст маркетинга продукта из файлов `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`. Позволяет давать рекомендации по оптимизации на основе данных, исходя из конкретных целей форм и существующих маркетинговых рамок.","ar":"يضمن أقصى حد من معدلات إكمال الاستمارات من خلال تحليل نوع الاستمارة وتقييم هياكل جمع بيانات الاتصال أو الارتباط واستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج من ملفات `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`. تمكن من تقديم توصيات تحسين مدعومة بالبيانات بناءً على أغراض استمارة محددة وإطارات التسويق الحالية."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing lead capture forms for gated content","Improving newsletter sign-up conversion rates","Assessing contact form effectiveness against marketing context"],"zh":["优化受限内容的潜在客户捕获表单","提高新闻通讯注册转化率","评估联系表单在营销背景下的有效性"],"ja":["ゲートキープコンテンツのリードキャプチャフォームを最適化","ニュースレターサインアップのコンバージョン率を向上させる","マーケティングコンテキストに対するコンタクトフォームの有効性を評価"],"ko":["게이트된 콘텐츠의 리드 캡처 폼 최적화","뉴스레터 가입 전환률 향상","마케팅 컨텍스트에 대한 연락처 폼의 효과성 평가"],"es":["Optimización de formularios de captura de leads para contenido restringido","Mejora de las tasas de conversión de registro de boletines","Evaluación de la eficacia de los formularios de contacto en relación con el contexto de marketing"],"fr":["Optimisation des formulaires de capture de leads pour le contenu verrouillé","Amélioration des taux de conversion d''inscription à la newsletter","Évaluation de l''efficacité des formulaires de contact par rapport au contexte de marketing"],"de":["Optimierung von Lead-Capture-Formularen für geschützten Inhalt","Verbesserung der Umwandlungsrate von Newsletter-Anmeldungen","Bewertung der Effektivität von Kontaktformularen im Vergleich zum Marketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Otimizar formulários de captura de leads para conteúdo bloqueado","Melhorar as taxas de conversão de assinatura de newsletters","Avaliar a eficácia dos formulários de contato contra o contexto de marketing"],"ru":["Оптимизация форм сбора лидов для контента с ограниченным доступом","Улучшение показателей конверсии при подписке на новости","Оценка эффективности форм контактов в сравнении с маркетинговым контекстом"],"ar":["تحسين استمارات جمع بيانات الاتصال للمحتوى المحظور","تحسين معدلات تحويل الاشتراك في النشرات الإخبارية","تقييم فعالية استمارات الاتصال ضد سياق التسويق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file for full optimization","Limited to form-based conversion optimization scenarios"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景文件才能实现完全优化","仅限于基于表单的转化率优化场景"],"ja":["完全な最適化を実現するには製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルが必要","フォームベースのコンバージョン最適化シナリオのみに限定"],"ko":["완전한 최적화를 위해 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일이 필요","폼 기반 전환 최적화 시나리오에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de contexto de marketing de productos para una optimización completa","Limitado a escenarios de optimización de conversión basados en formularios"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte de marketing de produits pour une optimisation complète","Limité à des scénarios d''optimisation de conversion basés sur des formulaires"],"de":["Benötigt eine Produktmarketing-Kontext-Datei für eine vollständige Optimierung","Begrenzt auf formularbasierte Konversions-Optimierungsszenarien"],"pt":["Exige arquivo de contexto de marketing de produto para otimização completa","Limitado a cenários de otimização de conversão baseados em formulários"],"ru":["Требует файла контекста маркетинга продукта для полной оптимизации","Ограничен сценариями оптимизации конверсии на основе форм"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف سياق تسويق المنتج لتحسين کامل","محدود بمواقف تحسين التحويل القائمة على الاستمارات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ryolambert/kiro-wiz/kiro-directory-layout', 'community', 'ryolambert', 'kiro-wiz', 'ryolambert/kiro-wiz', 'kiro-directory-layout', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z', '2026-02-18T13:00:04.152Z', NULL, '{"id":"ryolambert/kiro-wiz/kiro-directory-layout","name":"kiro-directory-layout","description":{"zh":"Kiro 目录布局是一种用于管理开发环境的结构化目录系统","ja":"Kiro ディレクトリレイアウトは、開発環境を管理するための構造化ディレクトリシステムです","ko":"Kiro 디렉토리 레이아웃은 개발 환경을 관리하기 위한 구조화된 디렉토리 시스템입니다","es":"La estructura de directorio Kiro es un sistema de organización para proyectos de desarrollo, que incluye carpetas para agentes, configuraciones y sesiones.","fr":"La structure de répertoire Kiro est un système d''organisation pour les projets de développement, qui comprend des dossiers pour les agents, les configurations et les sessions.","de":"Die Verzeichnisstruktur von Kiro ist ein Organisationsystem für Entwicklungsprojekte, das Ordner für Agenten, Konfigurationen und Sitzungen enthält.","pt":"O layout de diretório Kiro é uma estrutura de organização para seus projetos, incluindo configurações globais e locais, modelos de prompt e conversas salvas.","ru":"Макет директории Kiro - это структура организации для ваших проектов, включая глобальные и локальные настройки, шаблоны промптов и сохраненные разговоры.","ar":"مخطط دليل كيرو هو هيكل تنظيمي لمشاريعك، بما في ذلك الإعدادات العامه والمحلية وقوالب الاستدعاء والمحادثات المحفوظة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kiro 目录布局 - 开发者指南","ja":"Kiro ディレクトリレイアウト - デベロッパーガイド","ko":"Kiro 디렉토리 레이아웃 - 개발자 가이드","es":"Estructura de Directorio Kiro: Guía Técnica","fr":"Structure de Répertoire Kiro: Guide Technique","de":"Kiro-Verzeichnisstruktur: Technische Anleitung","pt":"Layout de Diretório Kiro: Organize Seus Projetos","ru":"Киро Директория Макет: Организуйте Свої Проекти","ar":"مخطط دليل كيرو: نظم مشاريعك","en":"kiro-directory-layout"},"description":{"zh":"Kiro 目录布局是一种用于管理开发环境的结构化目录系统","ja":"Kiro ディレクトリレイアウトは、開発環境を管理するための構造化ディレクトリシステムです","ko":"Kiro 디렉토리 레이아웃은 개발 환경을 관리하기 위한 구조화된 디렉토리 시스템입니다","es":"La estructura de directorio Kiro es un sistema de organización para proyectos de desarrollo, que incluye carpetas para agentes, configuraciones y sesiones.","fr":"La structure de répertoire Kiro est un système d''organisation pour les projets de développement, qui comprend des dossiers pour les agents, les configuration...","de":"Die Verzeichnisstruktur von Kiro ist ein Organisationsystem für Entwicklungsprojekte, das Ordner für Agenten, Konfigurationen und Sitzungen enthält.","pt":"O layout de diretório Kiro é uma estrutura de organização para seus projetos, incluindo configurações globais e locais, modelos de prompt e conversas salvas.","ru":"Макет директории Kiro - это структура организации для ваших проектов, включая глобальные и локальные настройки, шаблоны промптов и сохраненные разговоры.","ar":"مخطط دليل كيرو هو هيكل تنظيمي لمشاريعك، بما في ذلك الإعدادات العامه والمحلية وقوالب الاستدعاء والمحادثات المحفوظة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["全局和本地配置文件支持","自定义工具项目支持","会话保存和恢复功能","MCP 服务器配置支持","提示模板支持"],"ja":["グローバルとローカルの構成ファイルのサポート","カスタムツールプロジェクトのサポート","セッションの保存と復元機能","MCPサーバーの構成サポート","プロンプテンプレートのサポート"],"ko":["전역 및 로컬 구성 파일 지원","사용자 정의 도구 프로젝트 지원","세션 저장 및 복원 기능","MCP 서버 구성 지원","프롬프트 템플릿 지원"],"es":["Organización de proyectos de desarrollo","Configuraciones de agentes y sesiones","Almacenamiento de datos en carpetas y archivos","Compatibilidad con proyectos locales y globales","Personalización de la estructura de directorio"],"fr":["Organisation des projets de développement","Configurations des agents et des sessions","Stockage des données dans des dossiers et des fichiers","Compatibilité avec les projets locaux et globaux","Personnalisation de la structure de répertoire"],"de":["Organisation von Entwicklungsprojekten","Konfigurationen von Agenten und Sitzungen","Speicherung von Daten in Ordnern und Dateien","Kompatibilität mit lokalen und globalen Projekten","Anpassung der Verzeichnisstruktur"],"pt":["Configurações globais e locais","Modelos de prompt personalizados","Conversas salvas em SQLite","Projetos de ferramentas personalizados","Configurações de servidor MCP"],"ru":["Глобальные и локальные настройки","Пользовательские шаблоны промптов","Сохраненные разговоры в SQLite","Пользовательские проекты инструментов","Настройки сервера MCP"],"ar":["الإعدادات العامه والمحلية","قوالب الاستدعاء المخصصة","المحادثات المحفوظة في SQLite","مشاريع أدوات مخصصة","إعدادات خادم MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kiro 目录布局","开发环境管理","全局配置","本地配置","自定义工具","会话保存","MCP 服务器"],"ja":["Kiro ディレクトリレイアウト","開発環境管理","グローバル構成","ローカル構成","カスタムツール","セッション保存","MCPサーバー"],"ko":["Kiro 디렉토리 레이아웃","개발 환경 관리","전역 구성","로컬 구성","사용자 정의 도구","세션 저장","MCP 서버"],"es":["estructura de directorio Kiro","desarrollo de proyectos","organización de proyectos","configuraciones de agentes","sesiones de desarrollo","almacenamiento de datos"],"fr":["structure de répertoire Kiro","développement de projets","organisation de projets","configurations des agents","sessions de développement","stockage des données"],"de":["Verzeichnisstruktur von Kiro","Entwicklung von Projekten","Organisation von Projekten","Konfigurationen von Agenten","Sitzungen der Entwicklung","Speicherung von Daten"],"pt":["layout de diretório kiro","organização de projetos","configurações globais","modelos de prompt","conversas salvas","ferramentas personalizadas","servidor MCP"],"ru":["макет директории kiro","организация проектов","глобальные настройки","шаблоны промптов","сохраненные разговоры","пользовательские инструменты","сервер mcp"],"ar":["مخطط دليل كيرو","تنظيم المشاريع","الإعدادات العامه","قوالب الاستدعاء","المحادثات المحفوظة","أدوات مخصصة","خادم MCP"]}},"owner":"ryolambert","repo":"kiro-wiz","repoPath":"ryolambert/kiro-wiz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kiro-directory-layout","description":"Reference for the .kiro directory structure and file locations. Use when setting up or organizing Kiro projects.","bodyPreview":"# Kiro Directory Layout\n\n## Global (~/.kiro/)\n```\n~/.kiro/\n├── agents/              # Global agent configs (.json)\n├── settings/\n│   └── cli.json         # Global settings\n├── prompts/             # Global prompt templates\n├── sessions/            # Saved conversations (SQLite)\n├── mcp.json             # Global MCP server config\n└── tools/               # Custom tool projects\n```\n\n## Workspace (.kiro/)\n```\n.kiro/\n├── agents/              # Local agent configs (.json) — override global\n├── settin","body":"# Kiro Directory Layout\n\n## Global (~/.kiro/)\n```\n~/.kiro/\n├── agents/              # Global agent configs (.json)\n├── settings/\n│   └── cli.json         # Global settings\n├── prompts/             # Global prompt templates\n├── sessions/            # Saved conversations (SQLite)\n├── mcp.json             # Global MCP server config\n└── tools/               # Custom tool projects\n```\n\n## Workspace (.kiro/)\n```\n.kiro/\n├── agents/              # Local agent configs (.json) — override global\n├── settings/\n│   └── cli.json         # Workspace settings — override global\n├── steering/            # Steering docs (.md, inclusion: always)\n├── hooks/               # Hook scripts\n├── prompts/             # Local prompt templates\n├── skills/              # Skill resources\n│   └── <name>/\n│       └── SKILL.md     # Requires YAML frontmatter (name, description)\n├── tools/               # Custom tool projects\n├── specs/               # Specification documents\n└── mcp.json             # Workspace MCP config\n```\n\n## Precedence\n- Workspace settings override global settings\n- Local agents override global agents with same name\n- Workspace MCP servers merge with global\n- Steering docs are always included in context\n\n## Key File Formats\n- Agents: JSON (.json)\n- Steering: Markdown with YAML frontmatter\n- Skills: Markdown with YAML frontmatter (name + description required)\n- Settings: JSON (cli.json)\n- MCP: JSON (mcp.json or in agent mcpServers field)\n- Prompts: Markdown or text, referenced via file:// URI\n- Hooks: Shell scripts, referenced in agent hooks config\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:00:04.152Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured directory organization and configuration management via JSON files and SQLite databases.","zh":"非常适合需要通过JSON文件和SQLite数据库进行结构化目录组织和配置管理的AI代理。","ja":"JSONファイルとSQLiteデータベースを使用した構造化されたディレクトリの組織化と設定管理が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"JSON 파일과 SQLite 데이터베이스를 통한 구조화된 디렉토리 조직 및 구성 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una organización de directorios estructurada y una gestión de configuración a través de archivos JSON y bases de datos SQLite.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une organisation de répertoires structurée et d''une gestion de configuration via des fichiers JSON et des bases de données SQLite.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Verzeichnisorganisation und Konfigurationsverwaltung über JSON-Dateien und SQLite-Datenbanken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de organização de diretório estruturada e gerenciamento de configuração via arquivos JSON e bancos de dados SQLite.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется структурированная организация директории и управление конфигурацией через файлы JSON и базы данных SQLite.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تنظيم دليل منظم وإدارة التكوين عبر ملفات JSON وقواعد بيانات SQLite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage global and local configurations using .json files, store prompt templates, and save conversations in SQLite sessions, all while utilizing a standardized directory layout for seamless integration with tools like MCP servers and custom projects.","zh":"能够让代理管理全局和本地配置，使用.json文件存储提示模板，并在SQLite会话中保存对话，同时利用标准化的目录布局实现与MCP服务器和自定义项目的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが全局設定とローカル設定を管理し、.jsonファイルを使用してプロンプテンプレートを保存し、SQLiteセッションに会話を保存することを可能にし、標準化されたディレクトリレイアウトを使用してMCPサーバーやカスタムプロジェクトとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 전역 및 로컬 구성 관리를 사용하고, .json 파일을 사용하여 프롬프트 템플릿을 저장하며, SQLite 세션에서 대화를 저장할 수 있으며, 표준화된 디렉토리 레이아웃을 사용하여 MCP 서버 및 사용자 지정 프로젝트와의 무중단 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar configuraciones globales y locales mediante archivos .json, almacenar plantillas de solicitudes y guardar conversaciones en sesiones de SQLite, todo mientras se utiliza un diseño de directorio estandarizado para una integración perfecta con herramientas como servidores MCP y proyectos personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les configurations globales et locales à l''aide de fichiers .json, de stocker des modèles de requêtes et d''enregistrer des conversations dans des sessions SQLite, le tout en utilisant une disposition de répertoire standardisée pour une intégration transparente avec des outils comme les serveurs MCP et les projets personnalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, globale und lokale Konfigurationen mithilfe von .json-Dateien zu verwalten, Anfragevorlagen zu speichern und Konversationen in SQLite-Sitzungen zu speichern, während ein standardisierter Verzeichnisaufbau für eine nahtlose Integration mit Tools wie MCP-Servern und benutzerdefinierten Projekten verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar configurações globais e locais usando arquivos .json, armazenar modelos de prompts e salvar conversas em sessões SQLite, tudo isso utilizando um layout de diretório padronizado para integração perfeita com ferramentas como servidores MCP e projetos personalizados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять глобальными и локальными конфигурациями с помощью файлов .json, хранить шаблоны приглашений и сохранять разговоры в сессиях SQLite, все это при использовании стандартизированного расположения директории для бесшовной интеграции с инструментами, такими как серверы MCP и пользовательские проекты.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الإعدادات العالمية والمحلية باستخدام ملفات .json، و تخزين قوالب الدعوات وحفظ المحادثات في جلسات SQLite، كل ذلك باستخدام تخطيط دليل معياري لتحقيق التكامل السلس مع أدوات مثل خوادم MCP والمشاريع المخصصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring global agent settings via cli.json","Managing local agent overrides and custom tool projects","Storing and retrieving conversation history from SQLite sessions"],"zh":["通过cli.json配置全局代理设置","管理本地代理覆盖和自定义工具项目","从SQLite会话中存储和检索对话历史"],"ja":["cli.jsonを使用して全局エージェント設定を構成する","ローカルエージェントのオーバーライドとカスタムツールプロジェクトを管理する","SQLiteセッションから会話履歴を保存して取得する"],"ko":["cli.json을 사용하여 전역 에이전트 설정을 구성하는 것","로컬 에이전트 오버라이드 및 사용자 지정 도구 프로젝트 관리","SQLite 세션에서 대화 기록을 저장하고 검색"],"es":["Configuración de la configuración global del agente a través de cli.json","Administración de anulaciones y proyectos de herramientas personalizadas locales","Almacenamiento y recuperación del historial de conversaciones desde sesiones de SQLite"],"fr":["Configuration des paramètres globaux de l''agent via cli.json","Gestion des substitutions et des projets d''outils personnalisés locaux","Stockage et récupération de l''historique des conversations à partir de sessions SQLite"],"de":["Konfiguration der globalen Agenteneinstellungen über cli.json","Verwaltung lokaler Agentenüberschreibungen und benutzerdefinierter Werkzeugprojekte","Speicherung und Abruf des Konversationsverlaufs aus SQLite-Sitzungen"],"pt":["Configurando configurações globais do agente via cli.json","Gerenciando substituições locais do agente e projetos de ferramentas personalizadas","Armazenando e recuperando histórico de conversas de sessões SQLite"],"ru":["Настройка глобальных настроек агента через cli.json","Управление локальными переопределениями агента и пользовательскими проектами","Хранение и извлечение истории разговоров из сессий SQLite"],"ar":["تكوين إعدادات الوكيل العالمية عبر cli.json","إدارة الإعدادات المحلية للوكيل والمشاريع الأدوات المخصصة","تخزين واسترجاع سجل المحادثات من جلسات SQLite"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for directory and file management","Dependent on JSON file format for configuration management","SQLite database required for conversation history storage"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限以进行目录和文件管理","依赖于JSON文件格式进行配置管理","需要SQLite数据库来存储对话历史"],"ja":["ディレクトリとファイルの管理のためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","設定管理のためにJSONファイル形式に依存する","会話履歴の保存のためにSQLiteデータベースが必要"],"ko":["디렉토리 및 파일 관리를 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","구성 관리를 위해 JSON 파일 형식에 의존","대화 기록을 저장하려면 SQLite 데이터베이스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para la gestión de directorios y archivos","Dependiente del formato de archivo JSON para la gestión de configuración","Se requiere una base de datos SQLite para el almacenamiento del historial de conversaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour la gestion des répertoires et des fichiers","Dépendant du format de fichier JSON pour la gestion de la configuration","Une base de données SQLite est requise pour le stockage de l''historique des conversations"],"de":["Benötigt Dateisystemzugriff für die Verwaltung von Verzeichnissen und Dateien","Abhängig vom JSON-Dateiformat für die Konfigurationsverwaltung","Eine SQLite-Datenbank ist erforderlich für die Speicherung des Konversationsverlaufs"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para gerenciamento de diretório e arquivo","Dependente do formato de arquivo JSON para gerenciamento de configuração","Banco de dados SQLite necessário para armazenamento de histórico de conversas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для управления директориями и файлами","Зависит от формата файла JSON для управления конфигурацией","Требуется база данных SQLite для хранения истории разговоров"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لإدارة الدليل والملف","يعتمد على تنسيق ملف JSON لإدارة التكوين","مطلوب قاعدة بيانات SQLite لتخزين سجل المحادثات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
