e"},"description":{"zh":"Clean Code 技术是一种编码标准，旨在使代码更简洁、更易维护和更高效","ja":"Clean Code 技術は、コードを簡潔にし、保守性と効率を高めるためのコーディング規約です","ko":"클린 코드 기술은 코드를 간결하고 유지 보수하기 쉽고 효율적으로 만드는 코딩 표준입니다","es":"Herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Agent, Skill y Workflows de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles","fr":"Outil pour convertir les configurations d''Agent, Skill et Workflows d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles","de":"Werkzeug zum Konvertieren von Agent-, Skill- und Workflow-Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate","pt":"Clean code é uma abordagem de desenvolvimento de software que visa criar códigos concisos e fáceis de manter. Aprenda sobre os princípios fundamentais.","ru":"Чистый код - это подход к разработке программного обеспечения, направленный на создание лаконичного и легко поддерживаемого кода. Узнайте о основных принципах.","ar":"كود نظيف هو نهج لتطوير البرمجيات يهدف إلى إنشاء شفرات متواضعة وسهلة الصيانة. تعرف على المبادئ الأساسية.","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["单一责任原则（SRP）","不要重复自己（DRY）","保持简单（KISS）","你不会需要它（YAGNI）","男孩侦察员规则"],"ja":["単一責任原則（SRP）","自分を繰り返すな（DRY）","簡単に保つ（KISS）","必要ないものを作るな（YAGNI）","ボーイスカウト規則"],"ko":["단일 책임 원칙（SRP）","자기 자신을 반복하지 마세요（DRY）","간단하게 유지하세요（KISS）","필요 없으면 만들지 마세요（YAGNI）","보이스카우트 규칙"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot y otros IDE","Aplicación de principios de código limpio","Implementación de SRP, DRY, KISS y YAGNI","Mejora de la legibilidad y mantenibilidad del código"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot et d''autres IDE","Application des principes de code propre","Mise en œuvre de SRP, DRY, KISS et YAGNI","Amélioration de la lisibilité et de la maintenabilité du code"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot und anderen IDE","Anwendung von Clean-Code-Prinzipien","Implementierung von SRP, DRY, KISS und YAGNI","Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit und Wartbarkeit des Codes"],"pt":["Princípio da Responsabilidade Única (SRP)","Não Repita Você Mesmo (DRY)","Mantenha-o Simples (KISS)","Você Não Vai Precisar Isso (YAGNI)","Deixe o Código Mais Limpo do que Você Encontrou"],"ru":["Принцип единой ответственности (SRP)","Не повторяйтесь (DRY)","Держите все просто (KISS)","Вам это не понадобится (YAGNI)","Оставьте код в более чистом виде, чем вы его нашли"],"ar":["مبدأ المسؤولية الواحدة (SRP)","لا تكرر نفسك (DRY)","احتفظ به بسيطًا (KISS)","لن تحتاج إلى ذلك (YAGNI)","اترك الكود أكثر نظافة مما وجدته"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Clean Code","代码质量","开发效率","软件开发原则","编码标准","代码简洁"],"ja":["Clean Code","コード品質","開発効率","ソフトウェア開発原則","コーディング規約","コードの簡潔"],"ko":["클린 코드","코드 품질","개발 효율","소프트웨어 개발 원칙","코딩 표준","코드 간결"],"es":["código limpio","estándares de codificación","ai","desarrollo de software","github copilot","antigravity ide","compatibilidad de código"],"fr":["code propre","normes de codage","ai","développement de logiciels","github copilot","antigravity ide","compatibilité de code"],"de":["clean code","codierungsstandards","ai","softwareentwicklung","github copilot","antigravity ide","codekompatibilität"],"pt":["clean code","desenvolvimento de software","princípios de codificação","SRP","DRY","KISS","YAGNI","boy scout"],"ru":["чистый код","разработка программного обеспечения","принципы кодирования","SRP","DRY","KISS","YAGNI","скаут"],"ar":["كود نظيف","تطوير البرمجيات","مبادئ البرمجة","SRP","DRY","KISS","YAGNI","كشاف"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clean-code","description":"Pragmatic coding standards - concise, direct, no over-engineering, no unnecessary comments","version":"2.0","bodyPreview":"# Clean Code - Pragmatic AI Coding Standards\n\n> **CRITICAL SKILL** - Be **concise, direct, and solution-focused**.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n| Principle | Rule |\n|-----------|------|\n| **SRP** | Single Responsibility - each function/class does ONE thing |\n| **DRY** | Don''t Repeat Yourself - extract duplicates, reuse |\n| **KISS** | Keep It Simple - simplest solution that works |\n| **YAGNI** | You Aren''t Gonna Need It - don''t build unused features |\n| **Boy Scout** | Leave code cleaner than you fo","body":"# Clean Code - Pragmatic AI Coding Standards\n\n> **CRITICAL SKILL** - Be **concise, direct, and solution-focused**.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n| Principle | Rule |\n|-----------|------|\n| **SRP** | Single Responsibility - each function/class does ONE thing |\n| **DRY** | Don''t Repeat Yourself - extract duplicates, reuse |\n| **KISS** | Keep It Simple - simplest solution that works |\n| **YAGNI** | You Aren''t Gonna Need It - don''t build unused features |\n| **Boy Scout** | Leave code cleaner than you found it |\n\n---\n\n## Naming Rules\n\n| Element | Convention |\n|---------|------------|\n| **Variables** | Reveal intent: `userCount` not `n` |\n| **Functions** | Verb + noun: `getUserById()` not `user()` |\n| **Booleans** | Question form: `isActive`, `hasPermission`, `canEdit` |\n| **Constants** | SCREAMING_SNAKE: `MAX_RETRY_COUNT` |\n\n> **Rule:** If you need a comment to explain a name, rename it.\n\n---\n\n## Function Rules\n\n| Rule | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Small** | Max 20 lines, ideally 5-10 |\n| **One Thing** | Does one thing, does it well |\n| **One Level** | One level of abstraction per function |\n| **Few Args** | Max 3 arguments, prefer 0-2 |\n| **No Side Effects** | Don''t mutate inputs unexpectedly |\n\n---\n\n## Code Structure\n\n| Pattern | Apply |\n|---------|-------|\n| **Guard Clauses** | Early returns for edge cases |\n| **Flat > Nested** | Avoid deep nesting (max 2 levels) |\n| **Composition** | Small functions composed together |\n| **Colocation** | Keep related code close |\n\n---\n\n## AI Coding Style\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| User asks for feature | Write it directly |\n| User reports bug | Fix it, don''t explain |\n| No clear requirement | Ask, don''t assume |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns (DON''T)\n\n| ❌ Pattern | ✅ Fix |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Comment every line | Delete obvious comments |\n| Helper for one-liner | Inline the code |\n| Factory for 2 objects | Direct instantiation |\n| utils.ts with 1 function | Put code where used |\n| \"First we import...\" | Just write code |\n| Deep nesting | Guard clauses |\n| Magic numbers | Named constants |\n| God functions | Split by responsibility |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 Before Editing ANY File (THINK FIRST!)\n\n**Before changing a file, ask yourself:**\n\n| Question | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| **What imports this file?** | They might break |\n| **What does this file import?** | Interface changes |\n| **What tests cover this?** | Tests might fail |\n| **Is this a shared component?** | Multiple places affected |\n\n**Quick Check:**\n```\nFile to edit: UserService.ts\n└── Who imports this? → UserController.ts, AuthController.ts\n└── Do they need changes too? → Check function signatures\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Rule:** Edit the file + all dependent files in the SAME task.\n> 🔴 **Never leave broken imports or missing updates.**\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Do | Don''t |\n|----|-------|\n| Write code directly | Write tutorials |\n| Let code self-document | Add obvious comments |\n| Fix bugs immediately | Explain the fix first |\n| Inline small things | Create unnecessary files |\n| Name things clearly | Use abbreviations |\n| Keep functions small | Write 100+ line functions |\n\n> **Remember: The user wants working code, not a programming lesson.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 Self-Check Before Completing (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before saying \"task complete\", verify:**\n\n| Check | Question |\n|-------|----------|\n| ✅ **Goal met?** | Did I do exactly what user asked? |\n| ✅ **Files edited?** | Did I modify all necessary files? |\n| ✅ **Code works?** | Did I test/verify the change? |\n| ✅ **No errors?** | Lint and TypeScript pass? |\n| ✅ **Nothing forgotten?** | Any edge cases missed? |\n\n> 🔴 **Rule:** If ANY check fails, fix it before completing.\n\n---\n\n## Verification Scripts (MANDATORY)\n\n> 🔴 **CRITICAL:** Each agent runs ONLY their own skill''s scripts after completing work.\n\n### Agent → Script Mapping\n\n| Agent | Script | Command |\n|-------|--------|---------|\n| **frontend-specialist** | UX Audit | `python .agent/skills/frontend-design/scripts/ux_audit.py .` |\n| **frontend-specialist** | A11y Check | `python .agent/skills/frontend-design/scripts/accessibility_checker.py .` |\n| **backend-specialist** | API Validator | `python .agent/skills/api-patterns/scripts/api_validator.py .` |\n| **mobile-developer** | Mobile Audit | `python .agent/skills/mobile-design/scripts/mobile_audit.py .` |\n| **database-architect** | Schema Validate | `python .agent/skills/database-design/scripts/schema_validator.py .` |\n| **security-auditor** | Security Scan | `python .agent/skills/vulnerability-scanner/scripts/security_scan.py .` |\n| **seo-specialist** | SEO Check | `python .agent/skills/seo-fundamentals/scripts/seo_checker.py .` |\n| **seo-specialist** | GEO Check | `python .agent/skills/geo-fundamentals/scripts/geo_checker.py .` |\n| **performance-optimizer** | Lighthouse | `python .agent/skills/performance-profiling/scripts/lighthouse_audit.py <url>` |\n| **test-engineer** | Test Runner | `python .agent/skills/testing-patterns/scripts/test_runner.py .` |\n| **test-engineer** | Playwright | `python .agent/skills/webapp-testing/scripts/playwright_runner.py <url>` |\n| **Any agent** | Lint Check | `python .agent/skills/lint-and-validate/scripts/lint_runner.py .` |\n| **Any agent** | Type Coverage | `python .agent/skills/lint-and-validate/scripts/type_coverage.py .` |\n| **Any agent** | i18n Check | `python .agent/skills/i18n-localization/scripts/i18n_checker.py .` |\n\n> ❌ **WRONG:** `test-engineer` running `ux_audit.py`\n> ✅ **CORRECT:** `frontend-specialist` running `ux_audit.py`\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Script Output Handling (READ → SUMMARIZE → ASK)\n\n**When running a validation script, you MUST:**\n\n1. **Run the script** and capture ALL output\n2. **Parse the output** - identify errors, warnings, and passes\n3. **Summarize to user** in this format:\n\n```markdown\n## Script Results: [script_name.py]\n\n### ❌ Errors Found (X items)\n- [File:Line] Error description 1\n- [File:Line] Error description 2\n\n### ⚠️ Warnings (Y items)\n- [File:Line] Warning description\n\n### ✅ Passed (Z items)\n- Check 1 passed\n- Check 2 passed\n\n**Should I fix the X errors?**\n```\n\n4. **Wait for user confirmation** before fixing\n5. **After fixing** → Re-run script to confirm\n\n> 🔴 **VIOLATION:** Running script and ignoring output = FAILED task.\n> 🔴 **VIOLATION:** Auto-fixing without asking = Not allowed.\n> 🔴 **Rule:** Always READ output → SUMMARIZE → ASK → then fix.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:00:28.587Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to adhere to pragmatic coding standards and best practices, such as SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI, and Boy Scout principles.","zh":"非常适合需要遵循实用编码标准和最佳实践的AI代理，例如SRP、DRY、KISS、YAGNI和童军原则。","ja":"実用的なコーディング標準とベストプラクティスに従う必要があるAIエージェントに適しています。たとえば、SRP、DRY、KISS、YAGNI、ボーイスカウト原則などです。","ko":"실용적인 코딩 표준과 모범 사례를 따라야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예를 들어, SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI 및 보이스카우트 원칙과 같은 것들이 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan adherirse a estándares de codificación pragmáticos y mejores prácticas, como SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI y principios de Boy Scout.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de se conformer à des normes de codage pragmatiques et aux meilleures pratiques, telles que SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI et les principes de Boy Scout.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die pragmatische Codierungsstandards und Best Practices wie SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI und Boy Scout-Prinzipien einhalten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam aderir a padrões de codificação pragmáticos e às melhores práticas, como SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI e princípios do Escoteiro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимо соблюдать прагматические стандарты кодирования и лучшие практики, такие как SRP, DRY, KISS, YAGNI и принципы скаута.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى الالتزام بمعايير البرمجة الواقعية وأفضل الممارسات، مثل SRP و DRY و KISS و YAGNI ومبادئ الكشاف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write concise, direct, and solution-focused code, leveraging principles like Single Responsibility and Don''t Repeat Yourself to improve code quality and reusability, while keeping it simple and avoiding unnecessary features.","zh":"赋予代理编写简洁、直接、面向解决方案的代码的能力，利用单一职责和不重复自己的原则来提高代码质量和可重用性，同时保持简单并避免不必要的功能。","ja":"エージェントにコンサイスで直接的で解決策に焦点を当てたコードを書く能力を与え、シングルレスポンスビリティやDRYの原則を利用してコードの品質と再利用性を高め、シンプルに保ち、不要な機能を避ける。","ko":"에이전트가 간결하고 직접적이며 해결책 중심의 코드를 작성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 코드 품질과 재사용성을 개선하고, 단순성을 유지하며 불필요한 기능을 피함으로써 싱글 책임과 자신을 반복하지 않는 원칙과 같은 원칙을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir un código conciso, directo y centrado en la solución, aprovechando principios como la Responsabilidad Única y No Te Repitas para mejorar la calidad y reutilización del código, manteniéndolo simple y evitando características innecesarias.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire un code concis, direct et axé sur la solution, en exploitant des principes comme la Responsabilité Unique et Ne Te Répète Pas pour améliorer la qualité et la réutilisation du code, tout en le gardant simple et en évitant les fonctionnalités inutiles.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, knappen, direkten und lösungsorientierten Code zu schreiben, indem es Prinzipien wie Einzelverantwortung und Wiederholungsvermeidung nutzt, um die Codequalität und Wiederverwendbarkeit zu verbessern, während es einfach bleibt und unnötige Funktionen vermeidet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem códigos concisos, diretos e focados na solução, utilizando princípios como Responsabilidade Única e Não Repita Você Mesmo para melhorar a qualidade e a reutilização do código, mantendo-o simples e evitando recursos desnecessários.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать краткий, прямой и ориентированный на решение код, используя принципы, такие как единственная ответственность и не повторяй себя, для улучшения качества и повторного использования кода, сохраняя его простым и избегая ненужных функций.","ar":"يتمكّن العملاء من كتابة شفرة مقتضبة ومباشرة ومحورة على الحل، مستخدمين مبادئ مثل المسؤولية الواحدة ولا تكرر نفسك لتحسين جودة الشفرة وإمكانية إعادة استخدامها، مع الحفاظ على بساطتها وتجنب المزايا غير الضرورية."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring existing codebases to follow SRP and DRY principles","Generating clean and readable code for GitHub Copilot and Cursor compatibility","Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to compatible formats"],"zh":["将现有代码库重构为遵循SRP和DRY原则","为GitHub Copilot和Cursor兼容性生成干净且可读的代码","将Antigravity IDE配置转换为兼容格式"],"ja":["SRPとDRYの原則に従うために既存のコードベースをリファクタリングする","GitHub CopilotとCursorの互換性のためにクリーンで読みやすいコードを生成する","Antigravity IDEの設定を互換性のある形式に変換する"],"ko":["SRP와 DRY 원칙을 따르기 위해 기존 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것","GitHub Copilot 및 커서와의 호환성을 위해 깨끗하고 읽기 쉬운 코드를 생성하는 것","Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 호환 가능한 형식으로 변환하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de código existente para seguir los principios SRP y DRY","Generación de código limpio y legible para la compatibilidad de GitHub Copilot y Cursor","Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles"],"fr":["Réorganisation de code existant pour suivre les principes SRP et DRY","Génération de code propre et lisible pour la compatibilité de GitHub Copilot et Cursor","Conversion de configurations de Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles"],"de":["Umstrukturierung bestehenden Codes, um den Prinzipien SRP und DRY zu folgen","Erzeugung sauberen und lesbaren Codes für die Kompatibilität von GitHub Copilot und Cursor","Umwandlung von Antigravity IDE-Konfigurationen in kompatible Formate"],"pt":["Reestruturação de bases de código existentes para seguir os princípios SRP e DRY","Geração de código limpo e legível para compatibilidade com GitHub Copilot e Cursor","Conversão de configurações do IDE Antigravity para formatos compatíveis"],"ru":["Рефакторинг существующих кодовых баз для соблюдения принципов SRP и DRY","Генерация чистого и читаемого кода для совместимости с GitHub Copilot и Cursor","Преобразование конфигураций IDE Antigravity в совместимые форматы"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة قواعد البيانات الحالية لاتباع مبادئ SRP و DRY","توليد شفرة نظيفة وقابلة للقراءة لتوافق GitHub Copilot و Cursor","تحويل إعدادات IDE Antigravity إلى تنسيقات متوافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to specific coding principles","Limited to converting configurations from Antigravity IDE"],"zh":["需要遵循特定的编码原则","仅限于将Antigravity IDE的配置转换为兼容格式"],"ja":["特定のコーディング原則に従う必要がある","Antigravity IDEの設定を互換性のある形式に変換することのみに限定される"],"ko":["특정 코딩 원칙을 따라야 하는 것","Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 호환 가능한 형식으로 변환하는 것에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a principios de codificación específicos","Limitado a la conversión de configuraciones desde Antigravity IDE"],"fr":["Nécessite de se conformer à des principes de codage spécifiques","Limité à la conversion de configurations depuis Antigravity IDE"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung spezifischer Codierungsprinzipien","Begrenzt auf die Umwandlung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE"],"pt":["Exige adesão a princípios de codificação específicos","Limitado à conversão de configurações do IDE Antigravity"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конкретных принципов кодирования","Ограничен преобразованием конфигураций IDE Antigravity"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمبادئ برمجة محددة","محدود بالتحويل من إعدادات IDE Antigravity"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
