ores que habiliten LLM para interactuar con servicios externos","fr":"Le guide de développement de serveurs MCP permet aux développeurs de créer des serveurs qui permettent aux LLM d''interagir avec des services externes","de":"Der MCP-Server-Entwicklungsleitfaden ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Server zu erstellen, die es LLM ermöglichen, mit externen Diensten zu interagieren","pt":"Desenvolva servidores MCP que permitam LLMs interagir com serviços externos de forma eficaz","ru":"Разработайте сервер MCP, который позволяет LLM взаимодействовать с внешними сервисами эффективно","ar":"قم بتطوير خوادم MCP تتيح لل LLM التفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية بفعالية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["构建高质量MCP服务器","实现LLM与外部服务的交互","支持API Coverage和Workflow Tools","提供Deep Research和Planning阶段","支持高级工作流"],"ja":["高品質MCPサーバーの構築","LLMと外部サービスの接続","API CoverageとWorkflow Toolsのサポート","Deep ResearchとPlanningステージの提供","高级工作流のサポート"],"ko":["고품질 MCP 서버 구축","LLM과 외부 서비스의 연결","API Coverage와 Workflow Tools의 지원","Deep Research와 Planning 단계의 제공","고급 작업 흐름의 지원"],"es":["Diseño de API y herramientas de flujo de trabajo","Investigación y planificación profunda","Creación de servidores MCP de alta calidad","Interacción con servicios externos","Habilitación de tareas del mundo real","Optimización del rendimiento del servidor"],"fr":["Conception d''API et d''outils de workflow","Recherche et planification approfondies","Création de serveurs MCP de haute qualité","Interaction avec des services externes","Activation de tâches du monde réel","Optimisation des performances du serveur"],"de":["API- und Workflow-Tool-Design","Tiefe Recherche und Planung","Erstellung von hochwertigen MCP-Servern","Interaktion mit externen Diensten","Ermöglichung von realen Aufgaben","Optimierung der Serverleistung"],"pt":["Criação de servidores MCP personalizados","Integração com serviços externos","Desenvolvimento de ferramentas de workflow","Otimização do desempenho do servidor","Segurança e autenticação avançadas","Suporte a LLMs de última geração"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских серверов MCP","Интеграция с внешними сервисами","Разработка инструментов рабочего процесса","Оптимизация производительности сервера","Продвинутая безопасность и аутентификация","Поддержка LLM последнего поколения"],"ar":["إنشاء خوادم MCP مخصصة","التكامل مع الخدمات الخارجية","تطوير أدوات سير العمل","تحسين أداء الخادم","أمان وتحقق متقدم","دعم LLM من الجيل الأخير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP Builder","MCP服务器","LLM","外部服务","API Coverage","Workflow Tools","Deep Research","Planning"],"ja":["MCP Builder","MCPサーバー","LLM","外部サービス","API Coverage","Workflow Tools","Deep Research","Planning"],"ko":["MCP Builder","MCP 서버","LLM","외부 서비스","API Coverage","Workflow Tools","Deep Research","Planning"],"es":["desarrollo de servidores MCP","LLM","servicios externos","herramientas de flujo de trabajo","diseño de API","alta calidad","tareas del mundo real","optimización del rendimiento"],"fr":["développement de serveurs MCP","LLM","services externes","outils de workflow","conception d''API","haute qualité","tâches du monde réel","optimisation des performances"],"de":["MCP-Server-Entwicklung","LLM","externe Dienste","Workflow-Tools","API-Design","hochwertig","reale Aufgaben","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de servidor MCP","LLM","serviços externos","ferramentas de workflow","otimização de desempenho","segurança e autenticação","servidor MCP personalizado"],"ru":["разработка сервера MCP","LLM","внешние сервисы","инструменты рабочего процесса","оптимизация производительности","безопасность и аутентификация","пользовательский сервер MCP"],"ar":["تطوير خادم MCP","LLM","الخدمات الخارجية","أدوات سير العمل","تحسين الأداء","أمان وتحقق","خادم MCP مخصص"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-builder","description":"Guide for creating high-quality MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers that enable LLMs to interact with external services through well-designed tools. Use when building MCP servers to integrate external APIs or services, whether in Python (FastMCP) or Node/TypeScript (MCP SDK).","bodyPreview":"# MCP Server Development Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers that enable LLMs to interact with external services through well-designed tools. The quality of an MCP server is measured by how well it enables LLMs to accomplish real-world tasks.\n\n---\n\n# Process\n\n## 🚀 High-Level Workflow\n\nCreating a high-quality MCP server involves four main phases:\n\n### Phase 1: Deep Research and Planning\n\n#### 1.1 Understand Modern MCP Design\n\n**API Coverage vs. Workflow Tools:**\nBalan","body":"# MCP Server Development Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers that enable LLMs to interact with external services through well-designed tools. The quality of an MCP server is measured by how well it enables LLMs to accomplish real-world tasks.\n\n---\n\n# Process\n\n## 🚀 High-Level Workflow\n\nCreating a high-quality MCP server involves four main phases:\n\n### Phase 1: Deep Research and Planning\n\n#### 1.1 Understand Modern MCP Design\n\n**API Coverage vs. Workflow Tools:**\nBalance comprehensive API endpoint coverage with specialized workflow tools. Workflow tools can be more convenient for specific tasks, while comprehensive coverage gives agents flexibility to compose operations. Performance varies by client—some clients benefit from code execution that combines basic tools, while others work better with higher-level workflows. When uncertain, prioritize comprehensive API coverage.\n\n**Tool Naming and Discoverability:**\nClear, descriptive tool names help agents find the right tools quickly. Use consistent prefixes (e.g., `github_create_issue`, `github_list_repos`) and action-oriented naming.\n\n**Context Management:**\nAgents benefit from concise tool descriptions and the ability to filter/paginate results. Design tools that return focused, relevant data. Some clients support code execution which can help agents filter and process data efficiently.\n\n**Actionable Error Messages:**\nError messages should guide agents toward solutions with specific suggestions and next steps.\n\n#### 1.2 Study MCP Protocol Documentation\n\n**Navigate the MCP specification:**\n\nStart with the sitemap to find relevant pages: `https://modelcontextprotocol.io/sitemap.xml`\n\nThen fetch specific pages with `.md` suffix for markdown format (e.g., `https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/draft.md`).\n\nKey pages to review:\n- Specification overview and architecture\n- Transport mechanisms (streamable HTTP, stdio)\n- Tool, resource, and prompt definitions\n\n#### 1.3 Study Framework Documentation\n\n**Recommended stack:**\n- **Language**: TypeScript (high-quality SDK support and good compatibility in many execution environments e.g. MCPB. Plus AI models are good at generating TypeScript code, benefiting from its broad usage, static typing and good linting tools)\n- **Transport**: Streamable HTTP for remote servers, using stateless JSON (simpler to scale and maintain, as opposed to stateful sessions and streaming responses). stdio for local servers.\n\n**Load framework documentation:**\n\n- **MCP Best Practices**: [📋 View Best Practices](./reference/mcp_best_practices.md) - Core guidelines\n\n**For TypeScript (recommended):**\n- **TypeScript SDK**: Use WebFetch to load `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/main/README.md`\n- [⚡ TypeScript Guide](./reference/node_mcp_server.md) - TypeScript patterns and examples\n\n**For Python:**\n- **Python SDK**: Use WebFetch to load `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/main/README.md`\n- [🐍 Python Guide](./reference/python_mcp_server.md) - Python patterns and examples\n\n#### 1.4 Plan Your Implementation\n\n**Understand the API:**\nReview the service''s API documentation to identify key endpoints, authentication requirements, and data models. Use web search and WebFetch as needed.\n\n**Tool Selection:**\nPrioritize comprehensive API coverage. List endpoints to implement, starting with the most common operations.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: Implementation\n\n#### 2.1 Set Up Project Structure\n\nSee language-specific guides for project setup:\n- [⚡ TypeScript Guide](./reference/node_mcp_server.md) - Project structure, package.json, tsconfig.json\n- [🐍 Python Guide](./reference/python_mcp_server.md) - Module organization, dependencies\n\n#### 2.2 Implement Core Infrastructure\n\nCreate shared utilities:\n- API client with authentication\n- Error handling helpers\n- Response formatting (JSON/Markdown)\n- Pagination support\n\n#### 2.3 Implement Tools\n\nFor each tool:\n\n**Input Schema:**\n- Use Zod (TypeScript) or Pydantic (Python)\n- Include constraints and clear descriptions\n- Add examples in field descriptions\n\n**Output Schema:**\n- Define `outputSchema` where possible for structured data\n- Use `structuredContent` in tool responses (TypeScript SDK feature)\n- Helps clients understand and process tool outputs\n\n**Tool Description:**\n- Concise summary of functionality\n- Parameter descriptions\n- Return type schema\n\n**Implementation:**\n- Async/await for I/O operations\n- Proper error handling with actionable messages\n- Support pagination where applicable\n- Return both text content and structured data when using modern SDKs\n\n**Annotations:**\n- `readOnlyHint`: true/false\n- `destructiveHint`: true/false\n- `idempotentHint`: true/false\n- `openWorldHint`: true/false\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: Review and Test\n\n#### 3.1 Code Quality\n\nReview for:\n- No duplicated code (DRY principle)\n- Consistent error handling\n- Full type coverage\n- Clear tool descriptions\n\n#### 3.2 Build and Test\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- Run `npm run build` to verify compilation\n- Test with MCP Inspector: `npx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector`\n\n**Python:**\n- Verify syntax: `python -m py_compile your_server.py`\n- Test with MCP Inspector\n\nSee language-specific guides for detailed testing approaches and quality checklists.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: Create Evaluations\n\nAfter implementing your MCP server, create comprehensive evaluations to test its effectiveness.\n\n**Load [✅ Evaluation Guide](./reference/evaluation.md) for complete evaluation guidelines.**\n\n#### 4.1 Understand Evaluation Purpose\n\nUse evaluations to test whether LLMs can effectively use your MCP server to answer realistic, complex questions.\n\n#### 4.2 Create 10 Evaluation Questions\n\nTo create effective evaluations, follow the process outlined in the evaluation guide:\n\n1. **Tool Inspection**: List available tools and understand their capabilities\n2. **Content Exploration**: Use READ-ONLY operations to explore available data\n3. **Question Generation**: Create 10 complex, realistic questions\n4. **Answer Verification**: Solve each question yourself to verify answers\n\n#### 4.3 Evaluation Requirements\n\nEnsure each question is:\n- **Independent**: Not dependent on other questions\n- **Read-only**: Only non-destructive operations required\n- **Complex**: Requiring multiple tool calls and deep exploration\n- **Realistic**: Based on real use cases humans would care about\n- **Verifiable**: Single, clear answer that can be verified by string comparison\n- **Stable**: Answer won''t change over time\n\n#### 4.4 Output Format\n\nCreate an XML file with this structure:\n\n```xml\n<evaluation>\n  <qa_pair>\n    <question>Find discussions about AI model launches with animal codenames. One model needed a specific safety designation that uses the format ASL-X. What number X was being determined for the model named after a spotted wild cat?</question>\n    <answer>3</answer>\n  </qa_pair>\n<!-- More qa_pairs... -->\n</evaluation>\n```\n\n---\n\n# Reference Files\n\n## 📚 Documentation Library\n\nLoad these resources as needed during development:\n\n### Core MCP Documentation (Load First)\n- **MCP Protocol**: Start with sitemap at `https://modelcontextprotocol.io/sitemap.xml`, then fetch specific pages with `.md` suffix\n- [📋 MCP Best Practices](./reference/mcp_best_practices.md) - Universal MCP guidelines including:\n  - Server and tool naming conventions\n  - Response format guidelines (JSON vs Markdown)\n  - Pagination best practices\n  - Transport selection (streamable HTTP vs stdio)\n  - Security and error handling standards\n\n### SDK Documentation (Load During Phase 1/2)\n- **Python SDK**: Fetch from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/main/README.md`\n- **TypeScript SDK**: Fetch from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/main/README.md`\n\n### Language-Specific Implementation Guides (Load During Phase 2)\n- [🐍 Python Implementation Guide](./reference/python_mcp_server.md) - Complete Python/FastMCP guide with:\n  - Server initialization patterns\n  - Pydantic model examples\n  - Tool registration with `@mcp.tool`\n  - Complete working examples\n  - Quality checklist\n\n- [⚡ TypeScript Implementation Guide](./reference/node_mcp_server.md) - Complete TypeScript guide with:\n  - Project structure\n  - Zod schema patterns\n  - Tool registration with `server.registerTool`\n  - Complete working examples\n  - Quality checklist\n\n### Evaluation Guide (Load During Phase 4)\n- [✅ Evaluation Guide](./reference/evaluation.md) - Complete evaluation creation guide with:\n  - Question creation guidelines\n  - Answer verification strategies\n  - XML format specifications\n  - Example questions and answers\n  - Running an evaluation with the provided scripts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:00:47.543Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing to interact with external services through Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers.","zh":"非常适合需要通过模型上下文协议（MCP）服务器与外部服务交互的高级AI代理。","ja":"モデルコンテキストプロトコル（MCP）サーバーを介して外部サービスと交互作用する必要がある高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"외부 서비스와 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜(MCP) 서버를 통해 상호 작용해야 하는 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan interactuar con servicios externos a través de servidores de Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA avancés qui ont besoin d''interagir avec des services externes via des serveurs de protocole de contexte de modèle (MCP).","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die mit externen Diensten über Model Context Protocol (MCP)-Server interagieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que precisam interagir com serviços externos por meio de servidores do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP).","ru":"Идеально подходит для передовых агентов ИИ, которым необходимо взаимодействовать с внешними службами через серверы Протокола контекста модели (MCP).","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين بحاجة للتفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية من خلال خوادم بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality MCP servers that enable Large Language Models (LLMs) to accomplish real-world tasks through well-designed tools and APIs, leveraging workflow tools and API coverage.","zh":"使代理能够创建高质量的MCP服务器，通过精心设计的工具和API，利用工作流工具和API覆盖范围，使大型语言模型（LLM）能够完成实际任务。","ja":"エージェントが、高品質のMCPサーバーを作成できるようにし、美しく設計されたツールやAPIを利用して、ワークフロー ツールやAPIのカバレッジを利用して、大規模言語モデル（LLM）が実世界のタスクを実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 품질의 MCP 서버를 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 잘設計된 도구 및 API를 사용하여 워크플로우 도구 및 API 범위를 利用하여, 대규모 언어 모델(LLM)이 실제 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear servidores MCP de alta calidad que permiten a los Grandes Modelos de Lenguaje (LLMs) realizar tareas del mundo real a través de herramientas y API bien diseñadas, aprovechando herramientas de flujo de trabajo y cobertura de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des serveurs MCP de haute qualité qui permettent aux grands modèles de langage (LLM) d''accomplir des tâches du monde réel grâce à des outils et des API bien conçus, en exploitant les outils de workflow et la couverture de l''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochwertige MCP-Server zu erstellen, die es Großen Sprachmodellen (LLMs) ermöglichen, reale Aufgaben mithilfe gut konzipierter Werkzeuge und APIs zu erfüllen, indem Workflow-Tools und API-Abdeckung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar servidores MCP de alta qualidade que permitem que os Grandes Modelos de Linguagem (LLMs) realizem tarefas do mundo real por meio de ferramentas e APIs bem projetadas, aproveitando ferramentas de fluxo de trabalho e cobertura de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высококачественные серверы MCP, которые позволяют Большым языковым моделям (LLM) выполнять реальные задачи посредством хорошо спроектированных инструментов и API, используя средства управления рабочим процессом иcoverage API.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء خوادم MCP ذات جودة عالية تمكن نماذج اللغة الكبيرة (LLMs) من إنجاز مهام العالم الحقيقي من خلال أدوات وواجهات برمجة تطبيقات مصممة جيدًا، واستغلال أدوات سير العمل وتغطية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing MCP servers for LLMs to interact with external services","Developing workflow tools for MCP servers","Optimizing API coverage for MCP server development"],"zh":["为LLM设计MCP服务器以与外部服务交互","为MCP服务器开发工作流工具","优化MCP服务器开发的API覆盖范围"],"ja":["LLMが外部サービスと交互作用できるようにMCPサーバーを設計する","MCPサーバーのためのワークフロー ツールを開発する","MCPサーバーの開発のためのAPIカバレッジを最適化する"],"ko":["LLM이 외부 서비스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 MCP 서버를 설계하는 것","MCP 서버를 위한 워크플로우 도구 개발","MCP 서버 개발을 위한 API 범위 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar servidores MCP para que los LLM interactúen con servicios externos","Desarrollar herramientas de flujo de trabajo para servidores MCP","Optimizar la cobertura de API para el desarrollo de servidores MCP"],"fr":["Concevoir des serveurs MCP pour que les LLM interagissent avec des services externes","Développer des outils de workflow pour les serveurs MCP","Optimiser la couverture de l''API pour le développement de serveurs MCP"],"de":["Entwerfen von MCP-Servern, damit LLMs mit externen Diensten interagieren können","Entwickeln von Workflow-Tools für MCP-Server","Optimieren der API-Abdeckung für die Entwicklung von MCP-Servern"],"pt":["Projeto de servidores MCP para LLMs interagirem com serviços externos","Desenvolvimento de ferramentas de fluxo de trabalho para servidores MCP","Otimização da cobertura de API para desenvolvimento de servidores MCP"],"ru":["Проектирование серверов MCP для взаимодействия LLM с внешними службами","Разработка инструментов управления рабочим процессом для серверов MCP","Оптимизация покрытия API для разработки серверов MCP"],"ar":["تصميم خوادم MCP لنماذج اللغة الكبيرة للتفاعل مع الخدمات الخارجية","تنمية أدوات سير العمل لخوادم MCP","تحسين تغطية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لتطوير خوادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires deep research and planning","Dependent on quality of MCP server design","Limited to LLMs and MCP protocol"],"zh":["需要深入的研究和规划","依赖于MCP服务器设计的质量","仅限于LLM和MCP协议"],"ja":["深い研究と計画が必要","MCPサーバーの設計の品質に依存する","LLMとMCPプロトコルに限定される"],"ko":["깊은 연구와 계획이 필요함","MCP 서버 설계의 품질에 의존함","LLM 및 MCP 프로토콜에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una profunda investigación y planificación","Depende de la calidad del diseño del servidor MCP","Limitado a LLM y protocolo MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite une recherche et une planification approfondies","Dépend de la qualité de la conception du serveur MCP","Limité aux LLM et au protocole MCP"],"de":["Benötigt tiefe Recherche und Planung","Hängt von der Qualität des MCP-Server-Designs ab","Begrenzt auf LLM und MCP-Protokoll"],"pt":["Exige pesquisa e planejamento aprofundados","Dependente da qualidade do design do servidor MCP","Limitado a LLMs e protocolo MCP"],"ru":["Требует глубоких исследований и планирования","Зависит от качества дизайна сервера MCP","Ограничен для LLM и протокола MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب بحثًا وتخطيطًا متعمقين","يعتمد على جودة تصميم خادم MCP","محدود بنماذج اللغة الكبيرة وبروتوكول MCP"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/vercel-blob', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'vercel-blob', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z', '2026-02-18T13:00:56.404Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/vercel-blob","name":"vercel-blob","description":{"zh":"Vercel Blob 是一个用于文件上传和存储的解决方案，提供快速、安全的数据存储功能","ja":"Vercel Blob はファイルのアップロードと保存のためのソリューションであり、高速かつ安全なデータ保存機能を提供します","ko":"버셀 블롭은 파일 업로드와 저장을 위한 솔루션으로 빠르고 안전한 데이터 저장 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Vercel Blob es una herramienta de almacenamiento de objetos en la nube que permite a los desarrolladores almacenar y servir archivos de manera eficiente.","fr":"Vercel Blob est un outil de stockage d''objets dans le cloud qui permet aux développeurs de stocker et de servir des fichiers de manière efficace.","de":"Vercel Blob ist ein Cloud-Objekt-Speicher-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Dateien effizient zu speichern und bereitzustellen.","pt":"O Vercel Blob é uma solução de armazenamento de arquivos na nuvem que permite gerenciar e servir arquivos de forma eficiente.","ru":"Vercel Blob — это решение для хранения файлов в облаке, которое позволяет эффективно управлять и обслуживать файлы.","ar":"Vercel Blob هو حل لتخزين الملفات السحابي الذي يسمح بإدارة وتقديم الملفات بفعالية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vercel Blob 存储解决方案","ja":"Vercel Blob ストレージソリューション","ko":"버셀 블롭 스토리지 솔루션","es":"Vercel Blob: Almacenamiento de objetos en la nube","fr":"Vercel Blob : Stockage d''objets dans le cloud","de":"Vercel Blob: Cloud-Objekt-Speicher","pt":"Vercel Blob: Armazenamento de Arquivos na Nuvem","ru":"Vercel Blob: Облачное Хранение Файлов","ar":"Vercel Blob: تخزين الملفات السحابي","en":"vercel-blob"},"description":{"zh":"Vercel Blob 是一个用于文件上传和存储的解决方案，提供快速、安全的数据存储功能","ja":"Vercel Blob はファイルのアップロードと保存のためのソリューションであり、高速かつ安全なデータ保存機能を提供します","ko":"버셀 블롭은 파일 업로드와 저장을 위한 솔루션으로 빠르고 안전한 데이터 저장 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Vercel Blob es una herramienta de almacenamiento de objetos en la nube que permite a los desarrolladores almacenar y servir archivos de manera eficiente.","fr":"Vercel Blob est un outil de stockage d''objets dans le cloud qui permet aux développeurs de stocker et de servir des fichiers de manière efficace.","de":"Vercel Blob ist ein Cloud-Objekt-Speicher-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Dateien effizient zu speichern und bereitzustellen.","pt":"O Vercel Blob é uma solução de armazenamento de arquivos na nuvem que permite gerenciar e servir arquivos de forma eficiente.","ru":"Vercel Blob — это решение для хранения файлов в облаке, которое позволяет эффективно управлять и обслуживать файлы.","ar":"Vercel Blob هو حل لتخزين الملفات السحابي الذي يسمح بإدارة وتقديم الملفات بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速文件上传","安全的数据存储","简单的 API 接口","支持多种文件类型","高可用性和可扩展性"],"ja":["高速ファイルアップロード","安全なデータ保存","シンプルな API インターフェイス","多種多様なファイル形式のサポート","高可用性とスケーラビリティ"],"ko":["빠른 파일 업로드","안전한 데이터 저장","간단한 API 인터페이스","다양한 파일 형식 지원","고가용성과 확장성"],"es":["Almacenamiento de objetos en la nube","Servicio de archivos eficiente","Integración con Vercel Dashboard","Token de acceso para leer y escribir","Compatibilidad con varios tipos de archivos"],"fr":["Stockage d''objets dans le cloud","Service de fichiers efficace","Intégration avec Vercel Dashboard","Jeton d''accès pour lire et écrire","Compatibilité avec plusieurs types de fichiers"],"de":["Cloud-Objekt-Speicher","Effizienter Dateidienst","Integration mit Vercel Dashboard","Zugriffstoken für Lesen und Schreiben","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Dateitypen"],"pt":["Armazenamento de arquivos na nuvem","Gerenciamento de arquivos eficiente","Integração com o Vercel Dashboard","Suporte a uploads de arquivos","Segurança e autenticação de arquivos"],"ru":["Хранение файлов в облаке","Эффективное управление файлами","Интеграция с Vercel Dashboard","Поддержка загрузки файлов","Безопасность и аутентификация файлов"],"ar":["تخزين الملفات السحابي","إدارة الملفات بفعالية","التكامل مع لوحة تحكم Vercel","دعم تحميل الملفات","أمان وتحقق الملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel Blob","云存储","文件上传","数据存储","开发者工具","云计算","存储解决方案"],"ja":["Vercel Blob","クラウドストレージ","ファイルアップロード","データ保存","開発者ツール","クラウドコンピューティング","ストレージソリューション"],"ko":["버셀 블롭","클라우드 저장","파일 업로드","데이터 저장","개발자 도구","클라우드 컴퓨팅","저장 솔루션"],"es":["Vercel Blob","almacenamiento de objetos en la nube","servicio de archivos","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Cloud Storage","Vercel Dashboard"],"fr":["Vercel Blob","stockage d''objets dans le cloud","service de fichiers","développement d''applications","Stockage dans le cloud","Vercel Dashboard"],"de":["Vercel Blob","Cloud-Objekt-Speicher","Dateidienst","Anwendungsentwicklung","Cloud-Speicher","Vercel Dashboard"],"pt":["Vercel Blob","armazenamento de arquivos na nuvem","gerenciamento de arquivos","Vercel Dashboard","uploads de arquivos","segurança de arquivos","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de nuvem"],"ru":["Vercel Blob","хранение файлов в облаке","управление файлами","Vercel Dashboard","загрузка файлов","безопасность файлов","разработка программного обеспечения","облачные технологии"],"ar":["Vercel Blob","تخزين الملفات السحابي","إدارة الملفات","لوحة تحكم Vercel","تحميل الملفات","أمان الملفات","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا السحابة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-blob","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Vercel Blob\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Version**: @vercel/blob@2.0.0\n**Skill Version**: 2.1.0\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Create Blob store: Vercel Dashboard → Storage → Blob\nvercel env pull .env.local  # Creates BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN\nnpm install @vercel/blob\n```\n\n**Server Upload**:\n```typescript\n''use server'';\nimport { put } from ''@vercel/blob'';\n\nexport async function uploadFile(formData: FormData) {\n  const file = formData.get(''file'') as File;\n  const blob = await put(file.name, file","body":"# Vercel Blob\n\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Version**: @vercel/blob@2.0.0\n**Skill Version**: 2.1.0\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Create Blob store: Vercel Dashboard → Storage → Blob\nvercel env pull .env.local  # Creates BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN\nnpm install @vercel/blob\n```\n\n**Server Upload**:\n```typescript\n''use server'';\nimport { put } from ''@vercel/blob'';\n\nexport async function uploadFile(formData: FormData) {\n  const file = formData.get(''file'') as File;\n  const blob = await put(file.name, file, { access: ''public'' });\n  return blob.url;\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL**: Never expose `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN` to client. Use `handleUpload()` for client uploads.\n\n---\n\n## Client Upload (Secure)\n\n**Server Action** (generates presigned token):\n```typescript\n''use server'';\nimport { handleUpload } from ''@vercel/blob/client'';\n\nexport async function getUploadToken(filename: string) {\n  return await handleUpload({\n    body: {\n      type: ''blob.generate-client-token'',\n      payload: { pathname: `uploads/${filename}`, access: ''public'' }\n    },\n    request: new Request(''https://dummy''),\n    onBeforeGenerateToken: async (pathname) => ({\n      allowedContentTypes: [''image/jpeg'', ''image/png''],\n      maximumSizeInBytes: 5 * 1024 * 1024\n    })\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**Client Component**:\n```typescript\n''use client'';\nimport { upload } from ''@vercel/blob/client'';\n\nconst tokenResponse = await getUploadToken(file.name);\nconst blob = await upload(file.name, file, {\n  access: ''public'',\n  handleUploadUrl: tokenResponse.url\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## File Management\n\n**List/Delete**:\n```typescript\nimport { list, del } from ''@vercel/blob'';\n\n// List with pagination\nconst { blobs, cursor } = await list({ prefix: ''uploads/'', cursor });\n\n// Delete\nawait del(blobUrl);\n```\n\n**Multipart (>500MB)**:\n```typescript\nimport { createMultipartUpload, uploadPart, completeMultipartUpload } from ''@vercel/blob'';\n\nconst upload = await createMultipartUpload(''large-video.mp4'', { access: ''public'' });\n// Upload chunks in loop...\nawait completeMultipartUpload({ uploadId: upload.uploadId, parts });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n**Always**:\n- ✅ Use `handleUpload()` for client uploads (never expose `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN`)\n- ✅ Validate file type/size before upload\n- ✅ Use pathname organization (`avatars/`, `uploads/`)\n- ✅ Add timestamp/UUID to filenames (avoid collisions)\n\n**Never**:\n- ❌ Expose `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN` to client\n- ❌ Upload >500MB without multipart\n- ❌ Skip file validation\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **16 documented issues**:\n\n### Issue #1: Missing Environment Variable\n**Error**: `Error: BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN is not defined`\n**Source**: https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob\n**Why It Happens**: Token not set in environment\n**Prevention**: Run `vercel env pull .env.local` and ensure `.env.local` in `.gitignore`.\n\n### Issue #2: Client Upload Token Exposed\n**Error**: Security vulnerability, unauthorized uploads\n**Source**: https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob/client-upload\n**Why It Happens**: Using `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN` directly in client code\n**Prevention**: Use `handleUpload()` to generate client-specific tokens with constraints.\n\n### Issue #3: File Size Limit Exceeded\n**Error**: `Error: File size exceeds limit` (500MB)\n**Source**: https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob/limits\n**Why It Happens**: Uploading file >500MB without multipart upload\n**Prevention**: Validate file size before upload, use multipart upload for large files.\n\n### Issue #4: Wrong Content-Type\n**Error**: Browser downloads file instead of displaying (e.g., PDF opens as text)\n**Source**: Production debugging\n**Why It Happens**: Not setting `contentType` option, Blob guesses incorrectly\n**Prevention**: Always set `contentType: file.type` or explicit MIME type.\n\n### Issue #5: Public File Not Cached\n**Error**: Slow file delivery, high egress costs\n**Source**: Vercel Blob best practices\n**Why It Happens**: Using `access: ''private''` for files that should be public\n**Prevention**: Use `access: ''public''` for publicly accessible files (CDN caching).\n\n### Issue #6: List Pagination Not Handled\n**Error**: Only first 1000 files returned, missing files\n**Source**: https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob/using-blob-sdk#list\n**Why It Happens**: Not iterating with cursor for large file lists\n**Prevention**: Use cursor-based pagination in loop until `cursor` is undefined.\n\n### Issue #7: Delete Fails Silently\n**Error**: Files not deleted, storage quota fills up\n**Source**: https://github.com/vercel/storage/issues/150\n**Why It Happens**: Using wrong URL format, blob not found\n**Prevention**: Use full blob URL from `put()` response, check deletion result.\n\n### Issue #8: Upload Timeout (Large Files) + Server-Side 4.5MB Limit\n**Error**: `Error: Request timeout` for files >100MB (server) OR file upload fails at 4.5MB (serverless function limit)\n**Source**: [Vercel function timeout limits](https://vercel.com/docs/limits) + [4.5MB serverless limit](https://vercel.com/docs/limits) + [Community Discussion](https://github.com/payloadcms/payload/discussions/7569)\n**Why It Happens**:\n- Serverless function timeout (10s free tier, 60s pro) for server-side uploads\n- **CRITICAL**: Vercel serverless functions have a hard 4.5MB request body limit. Using `put()` in server actions/API routes fails for files >4.5MB.\n\n**Prevention**: Use client-side upload with `handleUpload()` for files >4.5MB OR use multipart upload.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Server-side upload fails at 4.5MB\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const formData = await request.formData();\n  const file = formData.get(''file'') as File; // Fails if >4.5MB\n  await put(file.name, file, { access: ''public'' });\n}\n\n// ✅ Client upload bypasses 4.5MB limit (supports up to 500MB)\nconst blob = await upload(file.name, file, {\n  access: ''public'',\n  handleUploadUrl: ''/api/upload/token'',\n  multipart: true, // For files >500MB, use multipart\n});\n```\n\n### Issue #9: Filename Collisions\n**Error**: Files overwritten, data loss\n**Source**: Production debugging\n**Why It Happens**: Using same filename for multiple uploads\n**Prevention**: Add timestamp/UUID: `` `uploads/${Date.now()}-${file.name}` `` or `addRandomSuffix: true`.\n\n### Issue #10: Missing Upload Callback\n**Error**: Upload completes but app state not updated\n**Source**: https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob/client-upload#callback-after-upload\n**Why It Happens**: Not implementing `onUploadCompleted` callback\n**Prevention**: Use `onUploadCompleted` in `handleUpload()` to update database/state.\n\n### Issue #11: Client Upload Token Expiration for Large Files\n**Error**: `Error: Access denied, please provide a valid token for this resource`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #443](https://github.com/vercel/storage/issues/443)\n**Why It Happens**: Default token expires after 30 seconds. Large files (>100MB) take longer to upload, causing token expiration before validation.\n**Prevention**: Set `validUntil` parameter for large file uploads.\n\n```typescript\n// For large files (>100MB), extend token expiration\nconst jsonResponse = await handleUpload({\n  body,\n  request,\n  onBeforeGenerateToken: async (pathname) => {\n    return {\n      maximumSizeInBytes: 200 * 1024 * 1024,\n      validUntil: Date.now() + 300000, // 5 minutes\n    };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Issue #12: v2.0.0 Breaking Change - onUploadCompleted Requires callbackUrl (Non-Vercel Hosting)\n**Error**: onUploadCompleted callback doesn''t fire when not hosted on Vercel\n**Source**: [Release Notes @vercel/blob@2.0.0](https://github.com/vercel/storage/releases/tag/%40vercel/blob%402.0.0)\n**Why It Happens**: v2.0.0 removed automatic callback URL inference from client-side `location.href` for security. When not using Vercel system environment variables, you must explicitly provide `callbackUrl`.\n**Prevention**: Explicitly provide `callbackUrl` in `onBeforeGenerateToken` for non-Vercel hosting.\n\n```typescript\n// v2.0.0+ for non-Vercel hosting\nawait handleUpload({\n  body,\n  request,\n  onBeforeGenerateToken: async (pathname) => {\n    return {\n      callbackUrl: ''https://example.com'', // Required for non-Vercel hosting\n    };\n  },\n  onUploadCompleted: async ({ blob, tokenPayload }) => {\n    // Now fires correctly\n  },\n});\n\n// For local development with ngrok:\n// VERCEL_BLOB_CALLBACK_URL=https://abc123.ngrok-free.app\n```\n\n### Issue #13: ReadableStream Upload Not Supported in Firefox\n**Error**: Upload never completes in Firefox\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #881](https://github.com/vercel/storage/issues/881)\n**Why It Happens**: The TypeScript interface accepts `ReadableStream` as a body type, but Firefox does not support `ReadableStream` as a fetch body.\n**Prevention**: Convert stream to Blob or ArrayBuffer for cross-browser support.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Works in Chrome/Edge, hangs in Firefox\nconst stream = new ReadableStream({ /* ... */ });\nawait put(''file.bin'', stream, { access: ''public'' }); // Never completes in Firefox\n\n// ✅ Convert stream to Blob for cross-browser support\nconst chunks: Uint8Array[] = [];\nconst reader = stream.getReader();\nwhile (true) {\n  const { done, value } = await reader.read();\n  if (done) break;\n  chunks.push(value);\n}\nconst blob = new Blob(chunks);\nawait put(''file.bin'', blob, { access: ''public'' });\n```\n\n### Issue #14: Pathname Cannot Be Modified in onBeforeGenerateToken\n**Error**: File uploaded to wrong path despite server-side pathname override attempt\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #863](https://github.com/vercel/storage/issues/863)\n**Why It Happens**: The `pathname` parameter in `onBeforeGenerateToken` cannot be changed. It''s set at `upload(pathname, ...)` time on the client side.\n**Prevention**: Construct pathname on client, validate on server. Use `clientPayload` to pass metadata.\n\n```typescript\n// Client: Construct pathname before upload\nawait upload(`uploads/${Date.now()}-${file.name}`, file, {\n  access: ''public'',\n  handleUploadUrl: ''/api/upload'',\n  clientPayload: JSON.stringify({ userId: ''123'' }),\n});\n\n// Server: Validate pathname matches expected pattern\nawait handleUpload({\n  body,\n  request,\n  onBeforeGenerateToken: async (pathname, clientPayload) => {\n    const { userId } = JSON.parse(clientPayload || ''{}'');\n\n    // Validate pathname starts with expected prefix\n    if (!pathname.startsWith(`uploads/`)) {\n      throw new Error(''Invalid upload path'');\n    }\n\n    return {\n      allowedContentTypes: [''image/jpeg'', ''image/png''],\n      tokenPayload: JSON.stringify({ userId }), // Pass to onUploadCompleted\n    };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Issue #15: Multipart Upload Minimum Chunk Size (5MB)\n**Error**: Manual multipart upload fails with small chunks\n**Source**: [Official Docs](https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-blob/using-blob-sdk#manual) + [Community Discussion](https://community.vercel.com/t/4-5-mb-payload-limit/10500)\n**Why It Happens**: Each part in manual multipart upload must be at least 5MB (except the last part). This conflicts with Vercel''s 4.5MB serverless function limit, making manual multipart uploads impossible via server-side routes.\n**Prevention**: Use automatic multipart (`multipart: true` in `put()`) or client uploads.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Manual multipart upload fails (can''t upload 5MB chunks via serverless function)\nconst upload = await createMultipartUpload(''large.mp4'', { access: ''public'' });\n// uploadPart() requires 5MB minimum - hits serverless limit\n\n// ✅ Use automatic multipart via client upload\nawait upload(''large.mp4'', file, {\n  access: ''public'',\n  handleUploadUrl: ''/api/upload'',\n  multipart: true, // Automatically handles 5MB+ chunks\n});\n```\n\n### Issue #16: Missing File Extension Causes Access Denied Error\n**Error**: `Error: Access denied, please provide a valid token for this resource`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #664](https://github.com/vercel/storage/issues/664)\n**Why It Happens**: Pathname without file extension causes non-descriptive access denied error.\n**Prevention**: Always include file extension in pathname.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Fails with confusing error\nawait upload(''user-12345'', file, {\n  access: ''public'',\n  handleUploadUrl: ''/api/upload'',\n}); // Error: Access denied\n\n// ✅ Extract extension and include in pathname\nconst extension = file.name.split(''.'').pop();\nawait upload(`user-${userId}.${extension}`, file, {\n  access: ''public'',\n  handleUploadUrl: ''/api/upload'',\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Avatar Upload with Replacement**:\n```typescript\n''use server'';\nimport { put, del } from ''@vercel/blob'';\n\nexport async function updateAvatar(userId: string, formData: FormData) {\n  const file = formData.get(''avatar'') as File;\n  if (!file.type.startsWith(''image/'')) throw new Error(''Only images allowed'');\n\n  const user = await db.query.users.findFirst({ where: eq(users.id, userId) });\n  if (user?.avatarUrl) await del(user.avatarUrl); // Delete old\n\n  const blob = await put(`avatars/${userId}.jpg`, file, { access: ''public'' });\n  await db.update(users).set({ avatarUrl: blob.url }).where(eq(users.id, userId));\n  return blob.url;\n}\n```\n\n**Protected Upload** (`access: ''private''`):\n```typescript\nconst blob = await put(`documents/${userId}/${file.name}`, file, { access: ''private'' });\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:00:56.404Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing seamless file upload and storage capabilities using Vercel Blob","zh":"非常适合需要使用Vercel Blob进行无缝文件上传和存储的云代理","ja":"Vercel Blobを使用したシームレスなファイルアップロードとストレージ機能を必要とするクラウドエージェントに最適","ko":"버클 블롭을 사용한 무결점 파일 업로드 및 저장 기능이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes en la Nube que necesitan una carga y almacenamiento de archivos sin problemas utilizando Vercel Blob","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud nécessitant un téléchargement et un stockage de fichiers sans interruption en utilisant Vercel Blob","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die eine nahtlose Datei-Upload- und Speicherfunktion mit Vercel Blob benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que precisam de capacidades de upload e armazenamento de arquivos sem interrupção usando Vercel Blob","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, которым необходимы бесперебойные возможности загрузки и хранения файлов с использованием Vercel Blob","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تحميل و تخزين الملفات دون انقطاع باستخدام Vercel Blob"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to upload files to Vercel Blob stores using the @vercel/blob library, enabling secure file management with BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN authentication and npm installation","zh":"通过@vercel/blob库使代理能够将文件上传到Vercel Blob存储，从而实现使用BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN身份验证和npm安装的安全文件管理","ja":"@vercel/blobライブラリを使用してエージェントがVercel Blobストアにファイルをアップロードできるようにし、BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN認証とnpmインストールを使用した安全なファイル管理を可能にします","ko":"@vercel/blob 라이브러리를 사용하여 에이전트가 버클 블롭 저장소에 파일을 업로드할 수 있도록 하여 BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN 인증 및 npm 설치를 사용한 보안 파일 관리를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar archivos en tiendas de Vercel Blob utilizando la biblioteca @vercel/blob, permitiendo una gestión de archivos segura con autenticación BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN y instalación de npm","fr":"Permet aux agents de télécharger des fichiers dans les magasins Vercel Blob en utilisant la bibliothèque @vercel/blob, permettant une gestion de fichiers sécurisée avec une authentification BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN et une installation npm","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dateien in Vercel Blob-Speichern mit der Bibliothek @vercel/blob hochzuladen, ermöglicht eine sichere Dateiverwaltung mit BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN-Authentifizierung und npm-Installation","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fazer upload de arquivos para lojas Vercel Blob usando a biblioteca @vercel/blob, permitindo gerenciamento de arquivos seguro com autenticação BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN e instalação npm","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью загружать файлы в хранилища Vercel Blob с использованием библиотеки @vercel/blob, обеспечивая безопасное управление файлами с помощью аутентификации BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN и установкой npm","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تحميل الملفات إلى مخازن Vercel Blob باستخدام مكتبة @vercel/blob، و يتيح إدارة الملفات الآمنة مع مصادقة BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN و تثبيت npm"},"useCases":{"en":["Uploading user-generated content to Vercel Blob","Generating signed URLs for secure file access","Integrating Vercel Blob with server-side applications for file storage"],"zh":["将用户生成的内容上传到Vercel Blob","生成安全文件访问的签名URL","将Vercel Blob与服务器端应用程序集成以实现文件存储"],"ja":["ユーザー生成コンテンツをVercel Blobにアップロードする","安全なファイルアクセス用の署名URLを生成する","Vercel Blobをサーバーサイドアプリケーションに統合してファイルストレージを実現する"],"ko":["사용자 생성 콘텐츠를 버클 블롭에 업로드하는 것","보안 파일 액세스용 서명 URL 생성","버클 블롭을 서버 측 애플리케이션과 통합하여 파일 저장소 구현"],"es":["Cargar contenido generado por el usuario en Vercel Blob","Generar URLs firmadas para acceso a archivos seguro","Integrar Vercel Blob con aplicaciones de servidor para almacenamiento de archivos"],"fr":["Télécharger du contenu généré par l''utilisateur dans Vercel Blob","Générer des URL signées pour un accès sécurisé aux fichiers","Intégrer Vercel Blob avec des applications serveur pour le stockage de fichiers"],"de":["Benutzergenerierte Inhalte in Vercel Blob hochladen","Signierte URLs für sicheren Dateizugriff generieren","Vercel Blob in serverseitigen Anwendungen für Dateispeicherung integrieren"],"pt":["Fazer upload de conteúdo gerado pelo usuário para Vercel Blob","Gerar URLs assinadas para acesso seguro a arquivos","Integrar Vercel Blob com aplicações servidoras para armazenamento de arquivos"],"ru":["Загрузка контента, созданного пользователем, в Vercel Blob","Генерация подписанных URL для безопасного доступа к файлам","Интеграция Vercel Blob с серверными приложениями для хранения файлов"],"ar":["تحميل المحتوى الذي يتم إنشاؤه من قبل المستخدم إلى Vercel Blob","إنشاء روابط URL الموقعة للوصول الآمن إلى الملفات","دمج Vercel Blob مع التطبيقات الخادمية لتخزين الملفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel Dashboard setup and BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN generation","Dependent on @vercel/blob library version compatibility"],"zh":["需要Vercel Dashboard设置和BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN生成","依赖@vercel/blob库版本兼容性"],"ja":["Vercel Dashboardの設定とBLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKENの生成が必要","@vercel/blobライブラリのバージョン互換性に依存"],"ko":["버클 대시보드 설정 및 BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN 생성 필요","@vercel/blob 라이브러리 버전 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del panel de Vercel y generación de BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de la versión de la biblioteca @vercel/blob"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration du tableau de bord Vercel et une génération de BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN","Dépend de la compatibilité de la version de la bibliothèque @vercel/blob"],"de":["Benötigt Vercel-Dashboard-Einrichtung und BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN-Generierung","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der @vercel/blob-Bibliotheksversion"],"pt":["Exige configuração do painel Vercel e geração de BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN","Dependente da compatibilidade da versão da biblioteca @vercel/blob"],"ru":["Требует настройки панели Vercel и генерации BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN","Зависит от совместимости версии библиотеки @vercel/blob"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد لوحة التحكم Vercel و إنشاء BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN","يعتمد على توافق إصدار مكتبة @vercel/blob"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
