 Sie Teststrategien für Smart Contracts mit Hardhat, Foundry und fortgeschrittenen Testmustern.","pt":"Desenvolva habilidades em teste de contratos inteligentes Web3 com Hardhat e Foundry","ru":"Развивайте навыки тестирования умных контрактов Web3 с помощью Hardhat и Foundry","ar":"طور مهاراتك في اختبار العقود الذكية Web3 باستخدام Hardhat و Foundry","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Hardhat测试设置","Foundry测试支持","高级测试模式","gas优化测试","边界情况模糊测试"],"ja":["Hardhatテスト設定","Foundryテストサポート","高度なテストパターン","ガス最適化テスト","エッジケースのファジーテスト"],"ko":["Hardhat 테스트 설정","Foundry 테스트 지원","고급 테스트 패턴","가스 최적화 테스트","엣지 케이스 ファジー 테스트"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias para smart contracts","Configuración de suites de pruebas de integración","Pruebas de optimización de gas","Pruebas de borde con fuzzing","Creación de un entorno de prueba realista con fork de mainnet","Automatización de informes de cobertura de pruebas"],"fr":["Tests unitaires pour les smart contracts","Configuration de suites de tests d''intégration","Tests d''optimisation de gaz","Tests de limite avec fuzzing","Création d''un environnement de test réaliste avec fork de mainnet","Automatisation des rapports de couverture de tests"],"de":["Einheitliche Tests für Smart Contracts","Einrichtung von Integrations-Test-Suiten","Tests zur Gas-Optimierung","Randfall-Tests mit Fuzzing","Erstellung einer realistischen Testumgebung durch Forking von Mainnet","Automatisierung von Testabdeckungsberichten"],"pt":["Testes unitários para contratos inteligentes","Configuração de conjuntos de testes de integração","Otimização de gás para testes","Testes de bordas com fuzzing","Testes realistas com fork do mainnet","Relatórios de cobertura de testes automatizados"],"ru":["Юнит-тесты для умных контрактов","Настройка наборов тестов интеграции","Оптимизация газа для тестов","Тесты краевых случаев с помощью fuzzing","Реалистичные тесты с форком mainnet","Автоматические отчеты о покрытии тестов"],"ar":["اختبارات وحدة للعقود الذكية","إعداد مجموعات اختبار التكامل","تحسين الغاز للاختبارات","اختبارات الحالات الحدية مع fuzzing","اختبارات واقعية مع fork من mainnet","تقارير تغطية الاختبار الآلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web3智能合约测试","Hardhat","Foundry","智能合约测试","区块链测试","Solidity测试"],"ja":["Web3スマートコントラクトテスト","Hardhat","Foundry","スマートコントラクトテスト","ブロックチェーンテスト","Solidityテスト"],"ko":["Web3 스마트 계약 테스트","Hardhat","Foundry","스마트 계약 테스트","블록체인 테스트","Solidity 테스트"],"es":["pruebas de smart contracts","web3","hardhat","foundry","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de integración","optimización de gas","fuzzing","pruebas de contrato inteligente"],"fr":["tests de smart contracts","web3","hardhat","foundry","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration","optimisation de gaz","fuzzing","tests de contrat intelligent"],"de":["Smart-Contract-Tests","web3","hardhat","foundry","Einheitliche Tests","Integrations-Tests","Gas-Optimierung","Fuzzing","Intelligente Vertragstests"],"pt":["teste de contratos inteligentes","web3 testing","hardhat","foundry","teste de unidade","teste de integração","otimização de gás","fuzzing"],"ru":["тестирование умных контрактов","web3 testing","hardhat","foundry","юнит-тесты","тесты интеграции","оптимизация газа","fuzzing"],"ar":["اختبار العقود الذكية","web3 testing","hardhat","foundry","اختبارات وحدة","اختبارات التكامل","تحسين الغاز","fuzzing"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"web3-testing","description":"Test smart contracts comprehensively using Hardhat and Foundry with unit tests, integration tests, and mainnet forking. Use when testing Solidity contracts, setting up blockchain test suites, or validating DeFi protocols.","bodyPreview":"# Web3 Smart Contract Testing\n\nMaster comprehensive testing strategies for smart contracts using Hardhat, Foundry, and advanced testing patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing unit tests for smart contracts\n- Setting up integration test suites\n- Performing gas optimization testing\n- Fuzzing for edge cases\n- Forking mainnet for realistic testing\n- Automating test coverage reporting\n- Verifying contracts on Etherscan\n\n## Hardhat Testing Setup\n\n```javascript\n// hardhat.config.js\nrequire(\"@n","body":"# Web3 Smart Contract Testing\n\nMaster comprehensive testing strategies for smart contracts using Hardhat, Foundry, and advanced testing patterns.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing unit tests for smart contracts\n- Setting up integration test suites\n- Performing gas optimization testing\n- Fuzzing for edge cases\n- Forking mainnet for realistic testing\n- Automating test coverage reporting\n- Verifying contracts on Etherscan\n\n## Hardhat Testing Setup\n\n```javascript\n// hardhat.config.js\nrequire(\"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-toolbox\");\nrequire(\"@nomiclabs/hardhat-etherscan\");\nrequire(\"hardhat-gas-reporter\");\nrequire(\"solidity-coverage\");\n\nmodule.exports = {\n  solidity: {\n    version: \"0.8.19\",\n    settings: {\n      optimizer: {\n        enabled: true,\n        runs: 200,\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  networks: {\n    hardhat: {\n      forking: {\n        url: process.env.MAINNET_RPC_URL,\n        blockNumber: 15000000,\n      },\n    },\n    goerli: {\n      url: process.env.GOERLI_RPC_URL,\n      accounts: [process.env.PRIVATE_KEY],\n    },\n  },\n  gasReporter: {\n    enabled: true,\n    currency: \"USD\",\n    coinmarketcap: process.env.COINMARKETCAP_API_KEY,\n  },\n  etherscan: {\n    apiKey: process.env.ETHERSCAN_API_KEY,\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Unit Testing Patterns\n\n```javascript\nconst { expect } = require(\"chai\");\nconst { ethers } = require(\"hardhat\");\nconst {\n  loadFixture,\n  time,\n} = require(\"@nomicfoundation/hardhat-network-helpers\");\n\ndescribe(\"Token Contract\", function () {\n  // Fixture for test setup\n  async function deployTokenFixture() {\n    const [owner, addr1, addr2] = await ethers.getSigners();\n\n    const Token = await ethers.getContractFactory(\"Token\");\n    const token = await Token.deploy();\n\n    return { token, owner, addr1, addr2 };\n  }\n\n  describe(\"Deployment\", function () {\n    it(\"Should set the right owner\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n      expect(await token.owner()).to.equal(owner.address);\n    });\n\n    it(\"Should assign total supply to owner\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n      const ownerBalance = await token.balanceOf(owner.address);\n      expect(await token.totalSupply()).to.equal(ownerBalance);\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"Transactions\", function () {\n    it(\"Should transfer tokens between accounts\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner, addr1 } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      await expect(token.transfer(addr1.address, 50)).to.changeTokenBalances(\n        token,\n        [owner, addr1],\n        [-50, 50],\n      );\n    });\n\n    it(\"Should fail if sender doesn''t have enough tokens\", async function () {\n      const { token, addr1 } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n      const initialBalance = await token.balanceOf(addr1.address);\n\n      await expect(\n        token.connect(addr1).transfer(owner.address, 1),\n      ).to.be.revertedWith(\"Insufficient balance\");\n    });\n\n    it(\"Should emit Transfer event\", async function () {\n      const { token, owner, addr1 } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      await expect(token.transfer(addr1.address, 50))\n        .to.emit(token, \"Transfer\")\n        .withArgs(owner.address, addr1.address, 50);\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"Time-based tests\", function () {\n    it(\"Should handle time-locked operations\", async function () {\n      const { token } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      // Increase time by 1 day\n      await time.increase(86400);\n\n      // Test time-dependent functionality\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"Gas optimization\", function () {\n    it(\"Should use gas efficiently\", async function () {\n      const { token } = await loadFixture(deployTokenFixture);\n\n      const tx = await token.transfer(addr1.address, 100);\n      const receipt = await tx.wait();\n\n      expect(receipt.gasUsed).to.be.lessThan(50000);\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Foundry Testing (Forge)\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.0;\n\nimport \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\nimport \"../src/Token.sol\";\n\ncontract TokenTest is Test {\n    Token token;\n    address owner = address(1);\n    address user1 = address(2);\n    address user2 = address(3);\n\n    function setUp() public {\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        token = new Token();\n    }\n\n    function testInitialSupply() public {\n        assertEq(token.totalSupply(), 1000000 * 10**18);\n    }\n\n    function testTransfer() public {\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        token.transfer(user1, 100);\n\n        assertEq(token.balanceOf(user1), 100);\n        assertEq(token.balanceOf(owner), token.totalSupply() - 100);\n    }\n\n    function testFailTransferInsufficientBalance() public {\n        vm.prank(user1);\n        token.transfer(user2, 100); // Should fail\n    }\n\n    function testCannotTransferToZeroAddress() public {\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        vm.expectRevert(\"Invalid recipient\");\n        token.transfer(address(0), 100);\n    }\n\n    // Fuzzing test\n    function testFuzzTransfer(uint256 amount) public {\n        vm.assume(amount > 0 && amount <= token.totalSupply());\n\n        vm.prank(owner);\n        token.transfer(user1, amount);\n\n        assertEq(token.balanceOf(user1), amount);\n    }\n\n    // Test with cheatcodes\n    function testDealAndPrank() public {\n        // Give ETH to address\n        vm.deal(user1, 10 ether);\n\n        // Impersonate address\n        vm.prank(user1);\n\n        // Test functionality\n        assertEq(user1.balance, 10 ether);\n    }\n\n    // Mainnet fork test\n    function testForkMainnet() public {\n        vm.createSelectFork(\"https://eth-mainnet.alchemyapi.io/v2/...\");\n\n        // Interact with mainnet contracts\n        address dai = 0x6B175474E89094C44Da98b954EedeAC495271d0F;\n        assertEq(IERC20(dai).symbol(), \"DAI\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Testing Patterns\n\n### Snapshot and Revert\n\n```javascript\ndescribe(\"Complex State Changes\", function () {\n  let snapshotId;\n\n  beforeEach(async function () {\n    snapshotId = await network.provider.send(\"evm_snapshot\");\n  });\n\n  afterEach(async function () {\n    await network.provider.send(\"evm_revert\", [snapshotId]);\n  });\n\n  it(\"Test 1\", async function () {\n    // Make state changes\n  });\n\n  it(\"Test 2\", async function () {\n    // State reverted, clean slate\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Mainnet Forking\n\n```javascript\ndescribe(\"Mainnet Fork Tests\", function () {\n  let uniswapRouter, dai, usdc;\n\n  before(async function () {\n    await network.provider.request({\n      method: \"hardhat_reset\",\n      params: [\n        {\n          forking: {\n            jsonRpcUrl: process.env.MAINNET_RPC_URL,\n            blockNumber: 15000000,\n          },\n        },\n      ],\n    });\n\n    // Connect to existing mainnet contracts\n    uniswapRouter = await ethers.getContractAt(\n      \"IUniswapV2Router\",\n      \"0x7a250d5630B4cF539739dF2C5dAcb4c659F2488D\",\n    );\n\n    dai = await ethers.getContractAt(\n      \"IERC20\",\n      \"0x6B175474E89094C44Da98b954EedeAC495271d0F\",\n    );\n  });\n\n  it(\"Should swap on Uniswap\", async function () {\n    // Test with real Uniswap contracts\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Impersonating Accounts\n\n```javascript\nit(\"Should impersonate whale account\", async function () {\n  const whaleAddress = \"0x...\";\n\n  await network.provider.request({\n    method: \"hardhat_impersonateAccount\",\n    params: [whaleAddress],\n  });\n\n  const whale = await ethers.getSigner(whaleAddress);\n\n  // Use whale''s tokens\n  await dai\n    .connect(whale)\n    .transfer(addr1.address, ethers.utils.parseEther(\"1000\"));\n});\n```\n\n## Gas Optimization Testing\n\n```javascript\nconst { expect } = require(\"chai\");\n\ndescribe(\"Gas Optimization\", function () {\n  it(\"Compare gas usage between implementations\", async function () {\n    const Implementation1 =\n      await ethers.getContractFactory(\"OptimizedContract\");\n    const Implementation2 = await ethers.getContractFactory(\n      \"UnoptimizedContract\",\n    );\n\n    const contract1 = await Implementation1.deploy();\n    const contract2 = await Implementation2.deploy();\n\n    const tx1 = await contract1.doSomething();\n    const receipt1 = await tx1.wait();\n\n    const tx2 = await contract2.doSomething();\n    const receipt2 = await tx2.wait();\n\n    console.log(\"Optimized gas:\", receipt1.gasUsed.toString());\n    console.log(\"Unoptimized gas:\", receipt2.gasUsed.toString());\n\n    expect(receipt1.gasUsed).to.be.lessThan(receipt2.gasUsed);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Coverage Reporting\n\n```bash\n# Generate coverage report\nnpx hardhat coverage\n\n# Output shows:\n# File                | % Stmts | % Branch | % Funcs | % Lines |\n# -------------------|---------|----------|---------|---------|\n# contracts/Token.sol |   100   |   90     |   100   |   95    |\n```\n\n## Contract Verification\n\n```javascript\n// Verify on Etherscan\nawait hre.run(\"verify:verify\", {\n  address: contractAddress,\n  constructorArguments: [arg1, arg2],\n});\n```\n\n```bash\n# Or via CLI\nnpx hardhat verify --network mainnet CONTRACT_ADDRESS \"Constructor arg1\" \"arg2\"\n```\n\n## CI/CD Integration\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/test.yml\nname: Tests\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v2\n        with:\n          node-version: \"16\"\n\n      - run: npm install\n      - run: npx hardhat compile\n      - run: npx hardhat test\n      - run: npx hardhat coverage\n\n      - name: Upload coverage to Codecov\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v2\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/hardhat-setup.md**: Hardhat configuration guide\n- **references/foundry-setup.md**: Foundry testing framework\n- **references/test-patterns.md**: Testing best practices\n- **references/mainnet-forking.md**: Fork testing strategies\n- **references/contract-verification.md**: Etherscan verification\n- **assets/hardhat-config.js**: Complete Hardhat configuration\n- **assets/test-suite.js**: Comprehensive test examples\n- **assets/foundry.toml**: Foundry configuration\n- **scripts/test-contract.sh**: Automated testing script\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Test Coverage**: Aim for >90% coverage\n2. **Edge Cases**: Test boundary conditions\n3. **Gas Limits**: Verify functions don''t hit block gas limit\n4. **Reentrancy**: Test for reentrancy vulnerabilities\n5. **Access Control**: Test unauthorized access attempts\n6. **Events**: Verify event emissions\n7. **Fixtures**: Use fixtures to avoid code duplication\n8. **Mainnet Fork**: Test with real contracts\n9. **Fuzzing**: Use property-based testing\n10. **CI/CD**: Automate testing on every commit\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:01:04.230Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Blockchain Agents specializing in smart contract development and needing advanced testing capabilities with Hardhat and Foundry","zh":"非常适合专注于智能合约开发并需要使用Hardhat和Foundry进行高级测试的区块链代理","ja":"スマートコントラクト開発に特化し、HardhatおよびFoundryを使用した高度なテスト機能を必要とするブロックチェーンエージェントに最適","ko":"스마트 계약 개발에 전문적인 블록체인 에이전트에게 적합하며, Hardhat 및 Foundry를 사용한 고급 테스트 기능이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Blockchain que se especializan en el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes y necesitan capacidades de prueba avanzadas con Hardhat y Foundry","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Blockchain spécialisés dans le développement de contrats intelligents et ayant besoin de capacités de test avancées avec Hardhat et Foundry","de":"Perfekt für Blockchain-Agenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung von Smart Contracts spezialisieren und erweiterte Testfunktionen mit Hardhat und Foundry benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Blockchain especializados em desenvolvimento de contratos inteligentes e necessitando de capacidades de teste avançadas com Hardhat e Foundry","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов блокчейна, специализирующихся на разработке умных контрактов и требующих расширенных возможностей тестирования с Hardhat и Foundry","ar":"مثالي لعميل Blockchain المتخصص في تطوير العقود الذكية والذي يحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار متقدمة مع Hardhat و Foundry"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write comprehensive unit tests for smart contracts, perform gas optimization testing, and automate test coverage reporting using Hardhat and Foundry, while also verifying contracts on Etherscan and forking mainnet for realistic testing scenarios","zh":"赋予代理编写智能合约的全面单元测试、执行gas优化测试、使用Hardhat和Foundry自动化测试覆盖报告，并在Etherscan上验证合约，同时还可以分叉主网以进行现实测试场景","ja":"エージェントがスマートコントラクトの包括的なユニットテストを記述し、ガス最適化テストを実行し、HardhatおよびFoundryを使用してテストカバレッジレポートの自動化を行い、Etherscanでコントラクトを検証し、リアルなテストシナリオのためにメインネットをフォークすることを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 스마트 계약을 위한 포괄적인 유닛 테스트를 작성하고, 가스 최적화 테스트를 수행하며, Hardhat 및 Foundry를 사용하여 테스트 커버리지 보고서를 자동화하고, Etherscan에서 계약을 확인하며, 실제 테스트 시나리오를 위해 메인넷을 포크 할 수 있습니다","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir pruebas unitarias integrales para contratos inteligentes, realizar pruebas de optimización de gas, y automatizar la generación de informes de cobertura de pruebas utilizando Hardhat y Foundry, además de verificar contratos en Etherscan y bifurcar la red principal para escenarios de prueba realistas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des tests unitaires complets pour les contrats intelligents, de réaliser des tests d''optimisation de gaz, et d''automatiser la génération de rapports de couverture de tests en utilisant Hardhat et Foundry, tout en vérifiant les contrats sur Etherscan et en forkant le mainnet pour des scénarios de test réaliste","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Unit-Tests für Smart Contracts zu schreiben, Gas-Optimierungs-Tests durchzuführen und Testabdeckungs-Berichte mithilfe von Hardhat und Foundry zu automatisieren, während auch Verträge auf Etherscan verifiziert und das Mainnet für realistische Test-Szenarien geforkt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever testes unitários abrangentes para contratos inteligentes, realizar testes de otimização de gás e automatizar a geração de relatórios de cobertura de testes usando Hardhat e Foundry, além de verificar contratos no Etherscan e bifurcar a mainnet para cenários de teste realistas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать всесторонние модульные тесты для умных контрактов, выполнять тестирование оптимизации газа и автоматизировать создание отчетов о покрытии тестирования с помощью Hardhat и Foundry, а также проверять контракты в Etherscan и форка.mainnet для реалистичных сценариев тестирования","ar":"يمكن للعميل كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة للعقود الذكية، وإجراء اختبارات تحسين الغاز، وتحسين التغطية التلقائية للاختبار باستخدام Hardhat و Foundry، بالإضافة إلى التحقق من العقود على Etherscan وتفرع الشبكة الرئيسية لسيناريوهات الاختبار الواقعية"},"useCases":{"en":["Writing unit tests for smart contracts","Performing gas optimization testing","Fuzzing for edge cases and forking mainnet for realistic testing"],"zh":["编写智能合约的单元测试","执行gas优化测试","模糊测试边缘情况并分叉主网进行现实测试"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのユニットテストを記述する","ガス最適化テストを実行する","エッジケースのためのファジングテストを実行し、メインネットをフォークしてリアルなテストシナリオを実行する"],"ko":["스마트 계약을 위한 유닛 테스트 작성","가스 최적화 테스트 수행","테스트를 위한 에지 케이스에 대한 퍼징 테스트 및 메인넷 포킹을 통한 실제 테스트 시나리오"],"es":["Escribir pruebas unitarias para contratos inteligentes","Realizar pruebas de optimización de gas","Realizar pruebas de borde y bifurcar la red principal para pruebas realistas"],"fr":["Écrire des tests unitaires pour les contrats intelligents","Réalisé des tests d''optimisation de gaz","Fuzzing pour les cas de bordure et forkant le mainnet pour des tests réaliste"],"de":["Unit-Tests für Smart Contracts schreiben","Gas-Optimierungs-Tests durchführen","Fuzzing für Randfälle und Forken des Mainnet für realistische Tests"],"pt":["Escrever testes unitários para contratos inteligentes","Realizar testes de otimização de gás","Fuzzing para casos de bordo e bifurcar a mainnet para cenários de teste realistas"],"ru":["Написание модульных тестов для умных контрактов","Проведение тестирования оптимизации газа","Fuzzing для граничных случаев и форка.mainnet для реалистичных сценариев тестирования"],"ar":["كتابة اختبارات وحدة للعقود الذكية","إجراء اختبارات تحسين الغاز","فضفضة للحالات الحدية وتفرع الشبكة الرئيسية لسيناريوهات الاختبار الواقعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Hardhat or Foundry setup","Etherscan verification needed","Mainnet forking requires specific setup and resources"],"zh":["需要Hardhat或Foundry设置","需要Etherscan验证","主网分叉需要特定的设置和资源"],"ja":["HardhatまたはFoundryのセットアップが必要","Etherscanの検証が必要","メインネットのフォークには特定のセットアップとリソースが必要"],"ko":["Hardhat 또는 Foundry 설정이 필요합니다","Etherscan 확인이 필요합니다","메인넷 포킹에는 특정 설정 및 리소스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Hardhat o Foundry","Se necesita verificación en Etherscan","El forkeo de la red principal requiere una configuración y recursos específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Hardhat ou Foundry","Vérification Etherscan requise","Le fork du mainnet nécessite une configuration et des ressources spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Hardhat- oder Foundry-Setup","Etherscan-Verifizierung erforderlich","Das Forken des Mainnet erfordert eine spezifische Konfiguration und Ressourcen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Hardhat ou Foundry","Verificação do Etherscan necessária","Bifurcar a mainnet requer configuração e recursos específicos"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Hardhat или Foundry","Необходима проверка в Etherscan","Форка.mainnet требует специальной настройки и ресурсов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Hardhat أو Foundry","التحقق من Etherscan ضروري","تفرع الشبكة الرئيسية يتطلب إعدادًا ومواردًا محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
