Bearbeitung"],"pt":["Melhoria do conteúdo de marketing","Edições focadas para preservar a mensagem central","Uso de voz de marca e linguagem do cliente","Otimização para aumentar a conversão","Técnicas de edição de cópia para melhorar o conteúdo","Análise de contexto de marketing de produto"],"ru":["Улучшение маркетингового контента","Фокусированные редактирования для сохранения центрального сообщения","Использование бренд-голоса и языка клиента","Оптимизация для увеличения конверсии","Техники копи-редактирования для улучшения контента","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["تحسين المحتوى التسويقي","تحريرات محددة للحفاظ على الرسالة المركزية","استخدام صوت العلامة التجارية ولغة الزبون","تحسين المحتوى لزيادة التحويل","تقنيات تحرير النسخ لتحسين المحتوى","تحليل سياق التسويق المنتج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["复制编辑","编辑技术","市场效果","转化率","核心信息","品牌声音","客户语言"],"ja":["コピー編集","編集技術","マーケティング効果","コンバージョン率","核心メッセージ","ブランドの声","顧客の言語"],"ko":["복사 편집","편집 기술","마케팅 효과","전환률","핵심 메시지","브랜드 음색","고객 언어"],"es":["edición de copias","copias de marketing","optimización de contenido","eficacia de copias","voz de la marca","lenguaje del cliente","edición sistemática"],"fr":["édition de copies","copies marketing","optimisation de contenu","efficacité des copies","voix de la marque","langage du client","édition systématique"],"de":["Kopienbearbeitung","Marketing-Kopien","Optimierung von Inhalten","Effektivität von Kopien","Markenstimme","Kundensprache","systematische Bearbeitung"],"pt":["edição de cópia","conteúdo de marketing","otimização de conteúdo","conversão","voz de marca","linguagem do cliente","técnicas de edição de cópia"],"ru":["копи-редактирование","маркетинговый контент","оптимизация контента","конверсия","бренд-голос","язык клиента","техники копи-редактирования"],"ar":["تحرير النسخ","المحتوى التسويقي","تحسين المحتوى","التحويل","صوت العلامة التجارية","لغة الزبون","تقنيات تحرير النسخ"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copy-editing","description":"When the user wants to edit, review, or improve existing marketing copy. Also use when the user mentions edit this copy, review my copy, copy feedback, proofread, polish this, make this better, or copy sweep. This skill provides a systematic approach to editing marketing copy through multiple focused passes.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Copy Editing\n\nYou are an expert copy editor specializing in marketing and conversion copy. Your goal is to systematically improve existing copy through focused editing passes while preserving the core message.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before editing. Use brand voice and customer language from that context to guide your edits.\n\nGood copy editing isn''t about rewriting—it''s about enhancing. Each p","body":"# Copy Editing\n\nYou are an expert copy editor specializing in marketing and conversion copy. Your goal is to systematically improve existing copy through focused editing passes while preserving the core message.\n\n## Core Philosophy\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before editing. Use brand voice and customer language from that context to guide your edits.\n\nGood copy editing isn''t about rewriting—it''s about enhancing. Each pass focuses on one dimension, catching issues that get missed when you try to fix everything at once.\n\n**Key principles:**\n- Don''t change the core message; focus on enhancing it\n- Multiple focused passes beat one unfocused review\n- Each edit should have a clear reason\n- Preserve the author''s voice while improving clarity\n\n---\n\n## The Seven Sweeps Framework\n\nEdit copy through seven sequential passes, each focusing on one dimension. After each sweep, loop back to check previous sweeps aren''t compromised.\n\n### Sweep 1: Clarity\n\n**Focus:** Can the reader understand what you''re saying?\n\n**What to check:**\n- Confusing sentence structures\n- Unclear pronoun references\n- Jargon or insider language\n- Ambiguous statements\n- Missing context\n\n**Common clarity killers:**\n- Sentences trying to say too much\n- Abstract language instead of concrete\n- Assuming reader knowledge they don''t have\n- Burying the point in qualifications\n\n**Process:**\n1. Read through quickly, highlighting unclear parts\n2. Don''t correct yet—just note problem areas\n3. After marking issues, recommend specific edits\n4. Verify edits maintain the original intent\n\n**After this sweep:** Confirm the \"Rule of One\" (one main idea per section) and \"You Rule\" (copy speaks to the reader) are intact.\n\n---\n\n### Sweep 2: Voice and Tone\n\n**Focus:** Is the copy consistent in how it sounds?\n\n**What to check:**\n- Shifts between formal and casual\n- Inconsistent brand personality\n- Mood changes that feel jarring\n- Word choices that don''t match the brand\n\n**Common voice issues:**\n- Starting casual, becoming corporate\n- Mixing \"we\" and \"the company\" references\n- Humor in some places, serious in others (unintentionally)\n- Technical language appearing randomly\n\n**Process:**\n1. Read aloud to hear inconsistencies\n2. Mark where tone shifts unexpectedly\n3. Recommend edits that smooth transitions\n4. Ensure personality remains throughout\n\n**After this sweep:** Return to Clarity Sweep to ensure voice edits didn''t introduce confusion.\n\n---\n\n### Sweep 3: So What\n\n**Focus:** Does every claim answer \"why should I care?\"\n\n**What to check:**\n- Features without benefits\n- Claims without consequences\n- Statements that don''t connect to reader''s life\n- Missing \"which means...\" bridges\n\n**The So What test:**\nFor every statement, ask \"Okay, so what?\" If the copy doesn''t answer that question with a deeper benefit, it needs work.\n\n❌ \"Our platform uses AI-powered analytics\"\n*So what?*\n✅ \"Our AI-powered analytics surface insights you''d miss manually—so you can make better decisions in half the time\"\n\n**Common So What failures:**\n- Feature lists without benefit connections\n- Impressive-sounding claims that don''t land\n- Technical capabilities without outcomes\n- Company achievements that don''t help the reader\n\n**Process:**\n1. Read each claim and literally ask \"so what?\"\n2. Highlight claims missing the answer\n3. Add the benefit bridge or deeper meaning\n4. Ensure benefits connect to real reader desires\n\n**After this sweep:** Return to Voice and Tone, then Clarity.\n\n---\n\n### Sweep 4: Prove It\n\n**Focus:** Is every claim supported with evidence?\n\n**What to check:**\n- Unsubstantiated claims\n- Missing social proof\n- Assertions without backup\n- \"Best\" or \"leading\" without evidence\n\n**Types of proof to look for:**\n- Testimonials with names and specifics\n- Case study references\n- Statistics and data\n- Third-party validation\n- Guarantees and risk reversals\n- Customer logos\n- Review scores\n\n**Common proof gaps:**\n- \"Trusted by thousands\" (which thousands?)\n- \"Industry-leading\" (according to whom?)\n- \"Customers love us\" (show them saying it)\n- Results claims without specifics\n\n**Process:**\n1. Identify every claim that needs proof\n2. Check if proof exists nearby\n3. Flag unsupported assertions\n4. Recommend adding proof or softening claims\n\n**After this sweep:** Return to So What, Voice and Tone, then Clarity.\n\n---\n\n### Sweep 5: Specificity\n\n**Focus:** Is the copy concrete enough to be compelling?\n\n**What to check:**\n- Vague language (\"improve,\" \"enhance,\" \"optimize\")\n- Generic statements that could apply to anyone\n- Round numbers that feel made up\n- Missing details that would make it real\n\n**Specificity upgrades:**\n\n| Vague | Specific |\n|-------|----------|\n| Save time | Save 4 hours every week |\n| Many customers | 2,847 teams |\n| Fast results | Results in 14 days |\n| Improve your workflow | Cut your reporting time in half |\n| Great support | Response within 2 hours |\n\n**Common specificity issues:**\n- Adjectives doing the work nouns should do\n- Benefits without quantification\n- Outcomes without timeframes\n- Claims without concrete examples\n\n**Process:**\n1. Highlight vague words and phrases\n2. Ask \"Can this be more specific?\"\n3. Add numbers, timeframes, or examples\n4. Remove content that can''t be made specific (it''s probably filler)\n\n**After this sweep:** Return to Prove It, So What, Voice and Tone, then Clarity.\n\n---\n\n### Sweep 6: Heightened Emotion\n\n**Focus:** Does the copy make the reader feel something?\n\n**What to check:**\n- Flat, informational language\n- Missing emotional triggers\n- Pain points mentioned but not felt\n- Aspirations stated but not evoked\n\n**Emotional dimensions to consider:**\n- Pain of the current state\n- Frustration with alternatives\n- Fear of missing out\n- Desire for transformation\n- Pride in making smart choices\n- Relief from solving the problem\n\n**Techniques for heightening emotion:**\n- Paint the \"before\" state vividly\n- Use sensory language\n- Tell micro-stories\n- Reference shared experiences\n- Ask questions that prompt reflection\n\n**Process:**\n1. Read for emotional impact—does it move you?\n2. Identify flat sections that should resonate\n3. Add emotional texture while staying authentic\n4. Ensure emotion serves the message (not manipulation)\n\n**After this sweep:** Return to Specificity, Prove It, So What, Voice and Tone, then Clarity.\n\n---\n\n### Sweep 7: Zero Risk\n\n**Focus:** Have we removed every barrier to action?\n\n**What to check:**\n- Friction near CTAs\n- Unanswered objections\n- Missing trust signals\n- Unclear next steps\n- Hidden costs or surprises\n\n**Risk reducers to look for:**\n- Money-back guarantees\n- Free trials\n- \"No credit card required\"\n- \"Cancel anytime\"\n- Social proof near CTA\n- Clear expectations of what happens next\n- Privacy assurances\n\n**Common risk issues:**\n- CTA asks for commitment without earning trust\n- Objections raised but not addressed\n- Fine print that creates doubt\n- Vague \"Contact us\" instead of clear next step\n\n**Process:**\n1. Focus on sections near CTAs\n2. List every reason someone might hesitate\n3. Check if the copy addresses each concern\n4. Add risk reversals or trust signals as needed\n\n**After this sweep:** Return through all previous sweeps one final time: Heightened Emotion, Specificity, Prove It, So What, Voice and Tone, Clarity.\n\n---\n\n## Quick-Pass Editing Checks\n\nUse these for faster reviews when a full seven-sweep process isn''t needed.\n\n### Word-Level Checks\n\n**Cut these words:**\n- Very, really, extremely, incredibly (weak intensifiers)\n- Just, actually, basically (filler)\n- In order to (use \"to\")\n- That (often unnecessary)\n- Things, stuff (vague)\n\n**Replace these:**\n\n| Weak | Strong |\n|------|--------|\n| Utilize | Use |\n| Implement | Set up |\n| Leverage | Use |\n| Facilitate | Help |\n| Innovative | New |\n| Robust | Strong |\n| Seamless | Smooth |\n| Cutting-edge | New/Modern |\n\n**Watch for:**\n- Adverbs (usually unnecessary)\n- Passive voice (switch to active)\n- Nominalizations (verb → noun: \"make a decision\" → \"decide\")\n\n### Sentence-Level Checks\n\n- One idea per sentence\n- Vary sentence length (mix short and long)\n- Front-load important information\n- Max 3 conjunctions per sentence\n- No more than 25 words (usually)\n\n### Paragraph-Level Checks\n\n- One topic per paragraph\n- Short paragraphs (2-4 sentences for web)\n- Strong opening sentences\n- Logical flow between paragraphs\n- White space for scannability\n\n---\n\n## Copy Editing Checklist\n\n### Before You Start\n- [ ] Understand the goal of this copy\n- [ ] Know the target audience\n- [ ] Identify the desired action\n- [ ] Read through once without editing\n\n### Clarity (Sweep 1)\n- [ ] Every sentence is immediately understandable\n- [ ] No jargon without explanation\n- [ ] Pronouns have clear references\n- [ ] No sentences trying to do too much\n\n### Voice & Tone (Sweep 2)\n- [ ] Consistent formality level throughout\n- [ ] Brand personality maintained\n- [ ] No jarring shifts in mood\n- [ ] Reads well aloud\n\n### So What (Sweep 3)\n- [ ] Every feature connects to a benefit\n- [ ] Claims answer \"why should I care?\"\n- [ ] Benefits connect to real desires\n- [ ] No impressive-but-empty statements\n\n### Prove It (Sweep 4)\n- [ ] Claims are substantiated\n- [ ] Social proof is specific and attributed\n- [ ] Numbers and stats have sources\n- [ ] No unearned superlatives\n\n### Specificity (Sweep 5)\n- [ ] Vague words replaced with concrete ones\n- [ ] Numbers and timeframes included\n- [ ] Generic statements made specific\n- [ ] Filler content removed\n\n### Heightened Emotion (Sweep 6)\n- [ ] Copy evokes feeling, not just information\n- [ ] Pain points feel real\n- [ ] Aspirations feel achievable\n- [ ] Emotion serves the message authentically\n\n### Zero Risk (Sweep 7)\n- [ ] Objections addressed near CTA\n- [ ] Trust signals present\n- [ ] Next steps are crystal clear\n- [ ] Risk reversals stated (guarantee, trial, etc.)\n\n### Final Checks\n- [ ] No typos or grammatical errors\n- [ ] Consistent formatting\n- [ ] Links work (if applicable)\n- [ ] Core message preserved through all edits\n\n---\n\n## Common Copy Problems & Fixes\n\n### Problem: Wall of Features\n**Symptom:** List of what the product does without why it matters\n**Fix:** Add \"which means...\" after each feature to bridge to benefits\n\n### Problem: Corporate Speak\n**Symptom:** \"Leverage synergies to optimize outcomes\"\n**Fix:** Ask \"How would a human say this?\" and use those words\n\n### Problem: Weak Opening\n**Symptom:** Starting with company history or vague statements\n**Fix:** Lead with the reader''s problem or desired outcome\n\n### Problem: Buried CTA\n**Symptom:** The ask comes after too much buildup, or isn''t clear\n**Fix:** Make the CTA obvious, early, and repeated\n\n### Problem: No Proof\n**Symptom:** \"Customers love us\" with no evidence\n**Fix:** Add specific testimonials, numbers, or case references\n\n### Problem: Generic Claims\n**Symptom:** \"We help businesses grow\"\n**Fix:** Specify who, how, and by how much\n\n### Problem: Mixed Audiences\n**Symptom:** Copy tries to speak to everyone, resonates with no one\n**Fix:** Pick one audience and write directly to them\n\n### Problem: Feature Overload\n**Symptom:** Listing every capability, overwhelming the reader\n**Fix:** Focus on 3-5 key benefits that matter most to the audience\n\n---\n\n## Working with Copy Sweeps\n\nWhen editing collaboratively:\n\n1. **Run a sweep and present findings** - Show what you found, why it''s an issue\n2. **Recommend specific edits** - Don''t just identify problems; propose solutions\n3. **Request the updated copy** - Let the author make final decisions\n4. **Verify previous sweeps** - After each round of edits, re-check earlier sweeps\n5. **Repeat until clean** - Continue until a full sweep finds no new issues\n\nThis iterative process ensures each edit doesn''t create new problems while respecting the author''s ownership of the copy.\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Plain English Alternatives](references/plain-english-alternatives.md): Replace complex words with simpler alternatives\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s the goal of this copy? (Awareness, conversion, retention)\n2. What action should readers take?\n3. Are there specific concerns or known issues?\n4. What proof/evidence do you have available?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For writing new copy from scratch (use this skill to edit after your first draft is complete)\n- **page-cro**: For broader page optimization beyond copy\n- **marketing-psychology**: For understanding why certain edits improve conversion\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing copy variations\n\n---\n\n## When to Use Each Skill\n\n| Task | Skill to Use |\n|------|--------------|\n| Writing new page copy from scratch | copywriting |\n| Reviewing and improving existing copy | copy-editing (this skill) |\n| Editing copy you just wrote | copy-editing (this skill) |\n| Structural or strategic page changes | page-cro |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:01:22.780Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents specializing in marketing and conversion copy, needing advanced editing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合专门从事营销和转换文案的语言代理，需要高级编辑功能。","ja":"マーケティングとコンバージョンコピーを専門とする言語エージェントに最適で、高度な編集機能が必要です。","ko":"마케팅 및 전환 복사를 전문으로 하는 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, 고급 편집 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje especializados en marketing y copias de conversión, que necesitan capacidades de edición avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage spécialisés dans le marketing et la copie de conversion, ayant besoin de fonctionnalités d''édition avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die auf Marketing und Konversionskopien spezialisiert sind und erweiterte Bearbeitungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem especializados em marketing e cópia de conversão, necessitando de capacidades de edição avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, специализирующихся на маркетинге и копировании конверсий, требующих расширенных возможностей редактирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين ي chuyênون في التسويق ونسخ التحويل، وهم في حاجة إلى إمكانيات تحرير متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically improve existing copy through focused editing passes, utilizing brand voice and customer language from product marketing context files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, while preserving the core message and enhancing overall copy quality.","zh":"使代理能够系统地通过集中编辑过程提高现有文案的质量，利用来自产品营销上下文文件（如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）的品牌声音和客户语言，同时保留核心信息并提高整体文案质量。","ja":"エージェントが、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のような製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルから得られるブランドの声と顧客の言語を使用して、集中した編集プロセスを通じて既存のコピーを体系的に改善できるようにします。同時に、核となるメッセージを保持し、全体的なコピーの品質を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 마케팅 콘텍스트 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)에서 얻은 브랜드 목소리와 고객 언어를 사용하여 집중적인 편집 과정을 통해 기존 복사를 체계적으로 개선할 수 있도록 합니다.同時に 핵심 메시지를 유지하고 전체적인 복사 품질을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mejorar sistemáticamente las copias existentes a través de pasos de edición enfocados, utilizando la voz de la marca y el lenguaje del cliente de archivos de contexto de marketing de productos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, al mismo tiempo que se conserva el mensaje central y se mejora la calidad general de la copia.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''améliorer systématiquement les copies existantes à travers des passes d''édition ciblées, en utilisant la voix de la marque et le langage du client à partir de fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, tout en préservant le message central et en améliorant la qualité globale de la copie.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bestehende Kopien systematisch zu verbessern, indem sie fokussierte Bearbeitungsdurchgänge durchführen, die Markenstimme und die Kundensprache aus Kontextdateien für Produktmarketing wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen, während sie die Kernbotschaft bewahren und die Gesamtkopienqualität verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a melhorar sistematicamente a cópia existente por meio de passes de edição focados, utilizando a voz da marca e a linguagem do cliente a partir de arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, preservando a mensagem central e melhorando a qualidade geral da cópia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически улучшать существующую копию посредством сосредоточенных проходов редактирования, используя голос бренда и язык клиента из контекстных файлов маркетинга продукции, таких как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, сохраняя основное сообщение и повышая общее качество копии.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين النسخ الحالية بشكل منهجي من خلال تمريرات تحرير متعمقة، مع استخدام صوت العلامة التجارية ولغة العملاء من ملفات سياق تسويق المنتجات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`، مع الحفاظ على الرسالة الأساسية وتحسين جودة النسخ بشكل عام."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining marketing copy for better conversion rates","Enhancing product descriptions with brand-specific voice","Editing blog posts to align with customer language and tone"],"zh":["完善营销文案以获得更好的转换率","使用品牌特有的声音增强产品描述","编辑博客文章以使其与客户语言和语气相符"],"ja":["コンバージョン率の向上のためにマーケティングコピーを洗練する","ブランド固有の声で製品の説明を強化する","顧客の言語と口調に合わせてブログ記事を編集する"],"ko":["변환 率을 높이기 위한 마케팅 복사 완善","브랜드 고유의 목소리로 제품 설명 강화","고객의 언어와 тон을 일치시키기 위한 블로그 게시물 편집"],"es":["Perfeccionar copias de marketing para mejores tasas de conversión","Mejorar descripciones de productos con una voz específica de la marca","Editar publicaciones de blog para alinearlas con el lenguaje y el tono del cliente"],"fr":["Affiner les copies de marketing pour de meilleurs taux de conversion","Améliorer les descriptions de produits avec une voix spécifique à la marque","Éditer les billets de blog pour les aligner sur le langage et le ton du client"],"de":["Marketingkopien für bessere Konversionsraten verfeinern","Produktbeschreibungen mit einer markenspezifischen Stimme verbessern","Blogbeiträge bearbeiten, um sie an die Sprache und den Ton des Kunden anzupassen"],"pt":["Aperfeiçoar a cópia de marketing para melhores taxas de conversão","Melhorar as descrições de produtos com voz específica da marca","Editar posts de blog para alinhar com a linguagem e o tom do cliente"],"ru":["Уточнить маркетинговую копию для лучших показателей конверсии","Улучшить описания продукции с голосом, специфичным для бренда","Редактировать блог-посты, чтобы выровнять их с языком и тоном клиента"],"ar":["تحسين نسخ التسويق لتحقيق معدلات تحويل أفضل","تحسين وصفات المنتجات مع صوت معين للعلامة التجارية","تحرير منشورات المدونة لتتوافق مع لغة وطابع العملاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Limited to editing existing copy, not generating new content"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销上下文文件","仅限编辑现有文案，不生成新内容"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルへのアクセスが必要","既存のコピーの編集のみ、新しいコンテンツの生成は不可能"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 콘텍스트 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","기존 복사의 편집만 가능, 새로운 콘텐츠 생성은 불가"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos","Limitado a la edición de copias existentes, no a la generación de nuevo contenido"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits","Limité à l''édition de copies existantes, et non à la génération de nouveau contenu"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Kontextdateien für Produktmarketing","Begrenzt auf die Bearbeitung von bestehenden Kopien, nicht auf die Generierung von neuem Inhalt"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos","Limitado à edição de cópia existente, não geração de novo conteúdo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к контекстным файлам маркетинга продукции","Ограничен редактированием существующей копии, не генерирует новый контент"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتجات","محدود بتحرير النسخ الحالية، ولا يولد محتوى جديد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/meme-factory', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'meme-factory', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z', '2026-02-18T13:01:23.633Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/meme-factory","name":"meme-factory","description":{"zh":"Meme Factory API memegen.link API ","ja":"Meme Factory API memegen.link API ","ko":"Meme Factory API memegen.link API ","es":"La fábrica de memes es una herramienta que permite crear memes personalizados utilizando la API memegen.link y formatos de meme textuales. Ofrece varias formas de invocación, incluyendo invocación manual y mediante lenguaje natural.","fr":"L''usine de memes est un outil qui permet de créer des memes personnalisés en utilisant l''API memegen.link et des formats de meme textuels. Elle offre plusieurs modes d''invocation, notamment l''invocation manuelle et via le langage naturel.","de":"Die Meme-Factory ist ein Tool, mit dem benutzerdefinierte Memes mithilfe der memegen.link API und textbasierter Meme-Formate erstellt werden können. Es bietet mehrere Aufrufmethoden, einschließlich manueller und natürlicher Sprache.","pt":"A fábrica de memes é uma ferramenta que permite criar memes personalizados usando a API memegen.link e formatos de meme textuais.","ru":"Фабрика мемов - это инструмент, который позволяет создавать индивидуальные мемы с помощью API memegen.link и текстовых форматов мемов.","ar":"مصنع الميمات هو أداة تمكنك من إنشاء ميمات مخصصة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link وأنماط الميمات النصية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Meme Factory API","ja":"Meme Factory API","ko":"Meme Factory API","es":"Fábrica de Memes: Crea memes con la API memegen.link","fr":"Usine de Memes: Créez des memes avec l''API memegen.link","de":"Meme-Factory: Erstelle Memes mit der memegen.link API","pt":"Fábrica de Memes: Crie Memes com API","ru":"Фабрика Мемов: Создавайте Мемы с API","ar":"مصنع الميمات: أنشئ الميمات باستخدام API","en":"meme-factory"},"description":{"zh":"Meme Factory API memegen.link API ","ja":"Meme Factory API memegen.link API ","ko":"Meme Factory API memegen.link API ","es":"La fábrica de memes es una herramienta que permite crear memes personalizados utilizando la API memegen.link y formatos de meme textuales. Ofrece varias form...","fr":"L''usine de memes est un outil qui permet de créer des memes personnalisés en utilisant l''API memegen.link et des formats de meme textuels. Elle offre plusieu...","de":"Die Meme-Factory ist ein Tool, mit dem benutzerdefinierte Memes mithilfe der memegen.link API und textbasierter Meme-Formate erstellt werden können. Es biete...","pt":"A fábrica de memes é uma ferramenta que permite criar memes personalizados usando a API memegen.link e formatos de meme textuais.","ru":"Фабрика мемов - это инструмент, который позволяет создавать индивидуальные мемы с помощью API memegen.link и текстовых форматов мемов.","ar":"مصنع الميمات هو أداة تمكنك من إنشاء ميمات مخصصة باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link وأنماط الميمات النصية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["memegen.link API"," ","API","Meme ","API"],"ja":["memegen.link API"," ","API","Meme ","API"],"ko":["memegen.link API"," ","API","Meme ","API"],"es":["Creación de memes personalizados con la API memegen.link","Invocación manual y mediante lenguaje natural","Formatos de meme textuales","Personalización de memes con títulos y textos inferiores","Compatibilidad con varios tamaños de imagen","Uso de la API para generar memes de forma programática"],"fr":["Création de memes personnalisés avec l''API memegen.link","Invocation manuelle et via le langage naturel","Formats de meme textuels","Personnalisation de memes avec des titres et des textes inférieurs","Compatibilité avec plusieurs tailles d''image","Utilisation de l''API pour générer des memes de manière programmatique"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Memes mit der memegen.link API","Manuelle und natürliche Sprachaufrufe","Textbasierte Meme-Formate","Anpassung von Memes mit Titeln und Untertiteln","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Bildgrößen","Verwendung der API zur programmatischen Erstellung von Memes"],"pt":["Criação de memes personalizados","Uso da API memegen.link","Formatos de meme textuais","Geração de memes direta","Invocação manual","Requisição por linguagem natural"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных мемов","Использование API memegen.link","Текстовые форматы мемов","Прямая генерация мемов","Ручной вызов","Запрос на естественном языке"],"ar":["إنشاء ميمات مخصصة","استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link","أنماط الميمات النصية","إنشاء ميمات مباشر","الاستدعاء اليدوي","الطلب بلغة طبيعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Meme Factory API","memegen.link API","Meme ","API","Meme Factory","API"],"ja":["Meme Factory API","memegen.link API","Meme ","API","Meme Factory","API"],"ko":["Meme Factory API","memegen.link API","Meme ","API","Meme Factory","API"],"es":["fábrica de memes","creación de memes","API memegen.link","formatos de meme textuales","invocación manual","lenguaje natural","personalización de memes","desarrollo de memes","herramientas de meme"],"fr":["usine de memes","création de memes","API memegen.link","formats de meme textuels","invocation manuelle","langage naturel","personnalisation de memes","développement de memes","outils de meme"],"de":["Meme-Factory","Erstellung von Memes","memegen.link API","textbasierte Meme-Formate","manuelle Aufrufe","natürliche Sprache","Anpassung von Memes","Entwicklung von Memes","Meme-Tools"],"pt":["fábrica de memes","criar memes","API memegen.link","formatos de meme textuais","desenvolvimento de memes","meme personalizado"],"ru":["фабрика мемов","создать мем","API memegen.link","текстовые форматы мемов","разработка мемов","индивидуальный мем"],"ar":["مصنع الميمات","إنشاء الميمات","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link","أنماط الميمات النصية","تطوير الميمات","الميمات المخصصة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"meme-factory","description":"Generate memes using the memegen.link API. Use when users request memes, want to add humor to content, or need visual aids for social media. Supports 100+ popular templates with custom text and styling.","bodyPreview":"# Meme Factory\n\nCreate memes using the free memegen.link API and textual meme formats.\n\n---\n\n## Triggers\n\n| Trigger | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/meme-factory` | Manual invocation |\n| `/meme-factory {template} {top} {bottom}` | Direct meme generation |\n| `meme-factory: create a meme about X` | Natural language request |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Action | Format |\n|--------|--------|\n| Basic meme | `https://api.memegen.link/images/{template}/{top}/{bottom}.png` |\n| With sizing |","body":"# Meme Factory\n\nCreate memes using the free memegen.link API and textual meme formats.\n\n---\n\n## Triggers\n\n| Trigger | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/meme-factory` | Manual invocation |\n| `/meme-factory {template} {top} {bottom}` | Direct meme generation |\n| `meme-factory: create a meme about X` | Natural language request |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Action | Format |\n|--------|--------|\n| Basic meme | `https://api.memegen.link/images/{template}/{top}/{bottom}.png` |\n| With sizing | `?width=1200&height=630` |\n| Custom background | `?style=https://example.com/image.jpg` |\n| All templates | https://api.memegen.link/templates/ |\n| Interactive docs | https://api.memegen.link/docs/ |\n\n**Additional Resources:**\n- [Markdown Memes Guide](references/markdown-memes-guide.md) - 15+ textual meme formats\n- [Examples](references/examples.md) - Practical usage examples\n- [meme_generator.py](scripts/meme_generator.py) - Python helper script\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Basic Meme Structure\n\n```\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/{template}/{top_text}/{bottom_text}.{extension}\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/buzz/memes/memes_everywhere.png\n```\n\nResult: Buzz Lightyear meme with \"memes\" at top and \"memes everywhere\" at bottom.\n\n### Text Formatting\n\n| Character | Encoding |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Space | `_` or `-` |\n| Newline | `~n` |\n| Question mark | `~q` |\n| Percent | `~p` |\n| Slash | `~s` |\n| Hash | `~h` |\n| Single quote | `''''` |\n| Double quote | `\"\"` |\n\n---\n\n## Popular Templates\n\n| Template | Use Case | Example |\n|----------|----------|---------|\n| `buzz` | X, X everywhere | bugs/bugs_everywhere |\n| `drake` | Comparisons | manual_testing/automated_testing |\n| `success` | Victories | deployed/no_errors |\n| `fine` | Things going wrong | server_on_fire/this_is_fine |\n| `fry` | Uncertainty | not_sure_if_bug/or_feature |\n| `changemind` | Hot takes | tabs_are_better_than_spaces |\n| `distracted` | Priorities | my_code/new_framework/current_project |\n| `mordor` | One does not simply | one_does_not_simply/deploy_on_friday |\n\n---\n\n## Template Selection Guide\n\n| Context | Template | Why |\n|---------|----------|-----|\n| Comparing options | `drake` | Two-panel reject/approve format |\n| Celebrating wins | `success` | Positive outcome emphasis |\n| Problems ignored | `fine` | Ironic \"everything is fine\" |\n| Uncertainty | `fry` | \"Not sure if X or Y\" format |\n| Controversial opinion | `changemind` | Statement + challenge |\n| Ubiquitous things | `buzz` | \"X, X everywhere\" |\n| Bad ideas | `mordor` | \"One does not simply...\" |\n\n---\n\n## Validation\n\nAfter generating a meme:\n\n- [ ] URL returns valid image (test in browser)\n- [ ] Text is readable (not too long)\n- [ ] Template matches the message context\n- [ ] Special characters properly encoded\n- [ ] Dimensions appropriate for platform\n\n### Platform Dimensions\n\n| Platform | Dimensions |\n|----------|------------|\n| Social media (Open Graph) | 1200x630 |\n| Slack/Discord | 800x600 |\n| GitHub | Default |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Avoid | Why | Instead |\n|-------|-----|---------|\n| Spaces without encoding | URL breaks | Use `_` or `-` |\n| Too much text | Unreadable | 2-6 words per line |\n| Wrong template | Message mismatch | Match template to context |\n| Missing extension | Invalid URL | Always include `.png`, `.jpg`, etc. |\n| Unencoded special chars | URL breaks | Use `~q`, `~s`, `~p`, etc. |\n| Assuming template exists | 404 error | Check templates list first |\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\nMeme generation is successful when:\n\n1. **URL is valid** - Returns HTTP 200\n2. **Image renders** - Displays correctly in markdown\n3. **Text is visible** - Properly formatted on image\n4. **Context matches** - Template fits the message\n\n**Test command:**\n```bash\ncurl -I \"https://api.memegen.link/images/buzz/test/test.png\"\n# Should return: HTTP/2 200\n```\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Advanced Features</strong></summary>\n\n### Image Formats\n\n| Extension | Use Case |\n|-----------|----------|\n| `.png` | Best quality, default |\n| `.jpg` | Smaller file size |\n| `.webp` | Modern, good compression |\n| `.gif` | Animated templates |\n\n### Dimensions\n\n```\n?width=800\n?height=600\n?width=800&height=600  (padded to exact)\n```\n\n### Layout Options\n\n```\n?layout=top     # Text at top only\n?layout=bottom  # Text at bottom only\n?layout=default # Standard top/bottom\n```\n\n### Custom Fonts\n\nView available: https://api.memegen.link/fonts/\n\n```\n?font=impact  (default)\n```\n\n### Custom Images\n\nUse any image as background:\n\n```\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/custom/hello/world.png?style=https://example.com/image.jpg\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Contextual Memes</strong></summary>\n\n### Code Reviews\n\n```\nTemplate: fry\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/fry/not_sure_if_feature/or_bug.png\n```\n\n### Deployments\n\n```\nTemplate: interesting\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/interesting/i_dont_always_test/but_when_i_do_i_do_it_in_production.png\n```\n\n### Documentation\n\n```\nTemplate: yodawg\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/yodawg/yo_dawg_i_heard_you_like_docs/so_i_documented_the_documentation.png\n```\n\n### Performance Issues\n\n```\nTemplate: fine\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/fine/memory_usage_at_99~/this_is_fine.png\n```\n\n### Successful Deploy\n\n```\nTemplate: success\nhttps://api.memegen.link/images/success/deployed_to_production/zero_downtime.png\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: Workflow Integration</strong></summary>\n\n### Generating Memes in Response\n\n```markdown\nHere''s a relevant meme:\n\n![Meme](https://api.memegen.link/images/buzz/bugs/bugs_everywhere.png)\n```\n\n### Dynamic Generation (Python)\n\n```python\ndef generate_status_meme(status: str, message: str):\n    template_map = {\n        \"success\": \"success\",\n        \"failure\": \"fine\",\n        \"review\": \"fry\",\n        \"deploy\": \"interesting\"\n    }\n\n    template = template_map.get(status, \"buzz\")\n    words = message.split()\n    top = \"_\".join(words[0:3])\n    bottom = \"_\".join(words[3:6])\n\n    return f\"https://api.memegen.link/images/{template}/{top}/{bottom}.png\"\n```\n\n### Using the Helper Script\n\n```python\nfrom meme_generator import MemeGenerator\n\nmeme = MemeGenerator()\nurl = meme.generate(\"buzz\", \"features\", \"features everywhere\")\nprint(url)\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Deep Dive: API Reference</strong></summary>\n\n### Endpoints\n\n| Endpoint | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `/templates/` | List all templates |\n| `/templates/{id}` | Template details |\n| `/fonts/` | Available fonts |\n| `/images/{template}/{top}/{bottom}.{ext}` | Generate meme |\n\n### API Characteristics\n\n- Free and open-source\n- No API key required\n- No rate limiting (normal use)\n- Stateless (all info in URL)\n- Images generated on-demand\n\n### Error Handling\n\n1. Check template at https://api.memegen.link/templates/\n2. Verify text formatting (underscores for spaces)\n3. Check special character encoding\n4. Ensure valid extension\n5. Test URL in browser\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n| Document | Content |\n|----------|---------|\n| [markdown-memes-guide.md](references/markdown-memes-guide.md) | 15+ textual meme formats (greentext, copypasta, ASCII, etc.) |\n| [examples.md](references/examples.md) | Practical usage examples |\n\n### Scripts\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| [meme_generator.py](scripts/meme_generator.py) | Python helper for meme generation |\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nGenerate contextual memes to:\n- Add humor to conversations\n- Create social media visuals\n- Make code reviews engaging\n- Celebrate successes\n\n**Golden rule:** Keep text concise, match template to context.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:01:23.633Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing advanced meme generation capabilities using the memegen.link API","zh":"非常适合需要使用memegen.link API进行高级模因生成的创意代理","ja":"memegen.link APIを使用した高度なミーム生成機能を必要とするクリエイティブエージェントに最適","ko":"memegen.link API를 사용한 고급 미ーム 생성 기능이 필요한 크리에이티브 에이전트에게 완벽한 선택","es":"Perfecto para agentes creativos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de memes utilizando la API de memegen.link","fr":"Parfait pour les agents créatifs ayant besoin de capacités avancées de génération de mèmes en utilisant l''API memegen.link","de":"Perfekt für kreative Agenten, die erweiterte Mem-Generierungsfähigkeiten über die memegen.link-API benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Criativos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de memes usando a API memegen.link","ru":"Идеально для Креативных Агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности генерации мемов с использованием API memegen.link","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإبداع الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء الميمات باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate memes in various formats, including PNG, using the memegen.link API and textual meme templates, enabling creative expression and humor integration into conversations and content","zh":"使代理能够使用memegen.link API和文本模因模板以各种格式（包括PNG）生成模因，从而实现对话和内容中的创意表达和幽默整合","ja":"memegen.link APIとテキストミームテンプレートを使用して、エージェントがPNGを含む様々な形式でミームを生成できるようにし、会話やコンテンツに創造性とユーモアを取り入れることができる","ko":"memegen.link API와 텍스트 미ーム 템플릿을 사용하여 에이전트가 PNG를 포함한 다양한 형식으로 미ーム을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 대화와 콘텐츠에 창의적 표현과 유머를 통합할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar memes en varios formatos, incluyendo PNG, utilizando la API de memegen.link y plantillas de memes textuales, lo que permite la expresión creativa y la integración del humor en conversaciones y contenido","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des mèmes dans divers formats, y compris PNG, en utilisant l''API memegen.link et des modèles de mèmes textuels, permettant ainsi l''expression créative et l''intégration de l''humour dans les conversations et le contenu","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Memes in verschiedenen Formaten, einschließlich PNG, mithilfe der memegen.link-API und textbasierter Mem-Vorlagen zu generieren, wodurch kreativer Ausdruck und die Integration von Humor in Gespräche und Inhalte ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar memes em vários formatos, incluindo PNG, usando a API memegen.link e modelos de memes textuais, permitindo expressão criativa e integração de humor em conversas e conteúdo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать мемы в различных форматах, включая PNG, с использованием API memegen.link и текстовых шаблонов мемов, что позволяет реализовывать творческое выражение и интеграцию юмора в разговоры и контент","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء الميمات بأساليب متعددة، بما في ذلك PNG، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link وقوالب الميمات النصية، مما يتيح التعبير الإبداعي وتكامل الفكاهة في المحادثات والمحتوى"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating memes for social media posts","Creating humorous responses to user queries","Automating meme creation for entertainment purposes"],"zh":["为社交媒体帖子生成模因","创建对用户查询的幽默响应","自动化娱乐目的的模因创建"],"ja":["ソーシャルメディア投稿用のミーム生成","ユーザー問い合わせへのユーモア応答の作成","娯楽目的のミーム作成の自動化"],"ko":["소셜 미디어 게시물용 미ーム 생성","사용자 쿼리 응답용 유머 생성","엔터테인먼트 목적의 미ーム 자동 생성"],"es":["Generar memes para publicaciones en redes sociales","Crear respuestas humorísticas a consultas de usuarios","Automatizar la creación de memes con fines de entretenimiento"],"fr":["Générer des mèmes pour les publications sur les réseaux sociaux","Créer des réponses humoristiques aux requêtes des utilisateurs","Automatiser la création de mèmes à des fins de divertissement"],"de":["Memes für soziale Medien-Beiträge generieren","Humorvolle Antworten auf Benutzeranfragen erstellen","Meme-Erstellung für Unterhaltungszwecke automatisieren"],"pt":["Geração de memes para publicações em mídias sociais","Criação de respostas humoradas para consultas de usuários","Automação da criação de memes para fins de entretenimento"],"ru":["Генерация мемов для публикаций в социальных сетях","Создание юмористических ответов на запросы пользователей","Автоматизация создания мемов для развлекательных целей"],"ar":["إنشاء الميمات لنشرها على وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","creating استجابات مرحة لاستفسارات المستخدمين","آليّة إنشاء الميمات لأغراض الترفيه"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the memegen.link API","Limited to textual meme formats and PNG output"],"zh":["需要访问memegen.link API","仅限文本模因格式和PNG输出"],"ja":["memegen.link APIへのアクセスが必要","テキストミーム形式とPNG出力のみ"],"ko":["memegen.link API에 대한 액세스가 필요","텍스트 미ーム 형식 및 PNG 출력만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de memegen.link","Limitado a formatos de memes textuales y salida PNG"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API memegen.link","Limité aux formats de mèmes textuels et à la sortie PNG"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die memegen.link-API","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Mem-Formate und PNG-Ausgabe"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API memegen.link","Limitado a formatos de memes textuais e saída PNG"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API memegen.link","Ограничен текстовыми форматами мемов и выводом PNG"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات memegen.link","محدود بالتنسيقات النصية للميمات وخرج PNG"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TSGCFO/LogiBill/project-context', 'community', 'TSGCFO', 'LogiBill', 'TSGCFO/LogiBill', 'project-context', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z', '2026-02-18T13:02:13.254Z', NULL, '{"id":"TSGCFO/LogiBill/project-context","name":"project-context","description":{"zh":"项目背景理解是开发过程中的关键步骤，涉及总结项目目标、核心约束和依赖关系","ja":"プロジェクトコンテキストは開発プロセスの重要なステップで、プロジェクトの目的、制約、依存関係をまとめる","ko":"프로젝트 상황 이해는 개발 과정에서 중요한 단계로, 프로젝트 목표, 핵심 제약 및 종속関係을 요약","es":"El contexto de proyecto resume los objetivos, restricciones y dependencias clave. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a mantener un contexto claro y reusable.","fr":"Le contexte de projet résume les objectifs, les contraintes et les dépendances clés. Il aide les développeurs à maintenir un contexte clair et réutilisable.","de":"Der Projekt-Kontext fasst die Ziele, Einschränkungen und Abhängigkeiten zusammen. Er hilft Entwicklern, einen klaren und wiederverwendbaren Kontext beizubehalten.","pt":"O project-context resume os principais objetivos, restrições e dependências de um projeto. Isso inclui decisões de arquitetura e convenções compartilhadas.","ru":"Project-context суммирует основные цели, ограничения и зависимости проекта, включая архитектурные решения и общие соглашения.","ar":"project-context يلخص الأهداف الرئيسية والقيود والاعتماديات للمشروع. هذا يشمل قرارات الهندسة المعمارية والاتفاقيات المشتركة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"项目背景理解","ja":"プロジェクトコンテキスト","ko":"프로젝트 상황 이해","es":"Contexto de proyecto: resumen de objetivos y dependencias","fr":"Contexte de projet : synthèse des objectifs et des dépend...","de":"Projekt-Kontext: Zusammenfassung von Zielen und Abhängigk...","pt":"project-context: Entendendo Objetivos e Restrições","ru":"project-context: Понимание Целей и Ограничений","ar":"project-context: فهم الأهداف والقيود","en":"project-context"},"description":{"zh":"项目背景理解是开发过程中的关键步骤，涉及总结项目目标、核心约束和依赖关系","ja":"プロジェクトコンテキストは開発プロセスの重要なステップで、プロジェクトの目的、制約、依存関係をまとめる","ko":"프로젝트 상황 이해는 개발 과정에서 중요한 단계로, 프로젝트 목표, 핵심 제약 및 종속関係을 요약","es":"El contexto de proyecto resume los objetivos, restricciones y dependencias clave. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a mantener un contexto claro y reusable.","fr":"Le contexte de projet résume les objectifs, les contraintes et les dépendances clés. Il aide les développeurs à maintenir un contexte clair et réutilisable.","de":"Der Projekt-Kontext fasst die Ziele, Einschränkungen und Abhängigkeiten zusammen. Er hilft Entwicklern, einen klaren und wiederverwendbaren Kontext beizubeha...","pt":"O project-context resume os principais objetivos, restrições e dependências de um projeto. Isso inclui decisões de arquitetura e convenções compartilhadas.","ru":"Project-context суммирует основные цели, ограничения и зависимости проекта, включая архитектурные решения и общие соглашения.","ar":"project-context يلخص الأهداف الرئيسية والقيود والاعتماديات للمشروع. هذا يشمل قرارات الهندسة المعمارية والاتفاقيات المشتركة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["总结项目目标","识别核心约束","分析依赖关系","概述架构决策","确立共享约定","验证步骤"],"ja":["プロジェクトの目的をまとめる","核心的な制約を特定","依存関係を分析","アーキテクチャの決定を概説","共有の約束を確立","検証ステップ"],"ko":["프로젝트 목표 요약","핵심 제약 식별","의존 관계 분석","아키텍처 결정 개요","공유 규약 확립","검증 단계"],"es":["Resumen de objetivos del proyecto","Identificación de restricciones y dependencias","Arquitectura y convenciones compartidas","Validación y verificación de pasos","Contexto reusable para futuras tareas"],"fr":["Synthèse des objectifs du projet","Identification des contraintes et des dépendances","Architecture et conventions partagées","Validation et vérification des étapes","Contexte réutilisable pour les tâches futures"],"de":["Zusammenfassung der Projektziele","Identifizierung von Einschränkungen und Abhängigkeiten","Architektur und gemeinsame Konventionen","Validierung und Überprüfung von Schritten","Wiederverwendbarer Kontext für zukünftige Aufgaben"],"pt":["Resumo de objetivos","Identificação de restrições","Análise de dependências","Decisões de arquitetura","Convenções compartilhadas","Etapa de validação"],"ru":["Резюме целей","Определение ограничений","Анализ зависимостей","Архитектурные решения","Общие соглашения","Шаги валидации"],"ar":["ملخص الأهداف","تحديد القيود","تحليل الاعتماديات","قرارات الهندسة المعمارية","الاتفاقيات المشتركة","خطوات التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目背景","开发效率","项目目标","核心约束","依赖关系","架构决策","共享约定","验证步骤"],"ja":["プロジェクトコンテキスト","開発効率","プロジェクトの目的","核心的な制約","依存関係","アーキテクチャの決定","共有の約束","検証ステップ"],"ko":["프로젝트 상황","개발 효율성","프로젝트 목표","핵심 제약","의존 관계","아키텍처 결정","공유 규약","검증 단계"],"es":["contexto de proyecto","resumen de objetivos","restricciones del proyecto","dependencias del proyecto","arquitectura de software","convenciones de desarrollo","validación de proyecto","desarrollo de software","productividad del desarrollador"],"fr":["contexte de projet","synthèse des objectifs","contraintes du projet","dépendances du projet","architecture logicielle","conventions de développement","validation de projet","développement de logiciels","productivité du développeur"],"de":["Projekt-Kontext","Zusammenfassung der Ziele","Einschränkungen des Projekts","Abhängigkeiten des Projekts","Software-Architektur","Entwicklungs-Konventionen","Validierung des Projekts","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität des Entwicklers"],"pt":["project-context","objetivos de projeto","restrições de projeto","dependências de projeto","arquitetura de projeto","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de projeto"],"ru":["project-context","цели проекта","ограничения проекта","зависимости проекта","архитектура проекта","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектом"],"ar":["project-context","أهداف المشروع","قيود المشروع","اعتماديات المشروع","هندسة المشروع","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشروع"]}},"owner":"TSGCFO","repo":"LogiBill","repoPath":"TSGCFO/LogiBill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-context","description":"Summarize the project context and key constraints","bodyPreview":"Summarize the project goals, core constraints, and relevant dependencies.\nCall out any architecture decisions, shared conventions, and validation steps.\nKeep the summary concise and ready to reuse in future tasks.","body":"Summarize the project goals, core constraints, and relevant dependencies.\nCall out any architecture decisions, shared conventions, and validation steps.\nKeep the summary concise and ready to reuse in future tasks.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:02:13.254Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing rapid project understanding and architectural awareness.","zh":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing rapid project understanding and architectural awareness.","ja":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing rapid project understanding and architectural awareness.","ko":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing rapid project understanding and architectural awareness.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan una comprensión rápida del proyecto y conciencia arquitectónica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une compréhension rapide du projet et une conscience architecturale.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die eine schnelle Projektverständnis und architektonische Aufmerksamkeit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que precisam de compreensão rápida do projeto e conscientização arquitetônica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым требуется быстрое понимание проекта и осведомленность об архитектуре.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى فهم سريع للمشروع والوعي بالهيكل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables immediate comprehension of project goals, constraints, and dependencies through automated context summarization. Provides architectural decision mapping and convention identification for streamlined codebase navigation.","zh":"Enables immediate comprehension of project goals, constraints, and dependencies through automated context summarization. Provides architectural decision mapping and convention identification for streamlined codebase navigation.","ja":"Enables immediate comprehension of project goals, constraints, and dependencies through automated context summarization. Provides architectural decision mapping and convention identification for streamlined codebase navigation.","ko":"Enables immediate comprehension of project goals, constraints, and dependencies through automated context summarization. Provides architectural decision mapping and convention identification for streamlined codebase navigation.","es":"Permite la comprensión inmediata de los objetivos del proyecto, las restricciones y las dependencias a través de la automatización de la resumen del contexto. Proporciona mapeo de decisiones arquitectónicas e identificación de convenciones para la navegación fluida de la base de código.","fr":"Permet une compréhension immédiate des objectifs du projet, des contraintes et des dépendances grâce à l''automatisation de la synthèse du contexte. Fournit une cartographie des décisions architecturales et l''identification des conventions pour une navigation fluide de la base de code.","de":"Ermöglicht das unmittelbare Verständnis der Projektziele, Einschränkungen und Abhängigkeiten durch die Automatisierung der Kontextzusammenfassung. Bietet architektonische Entscheidungskartierung und Konventionsidentifizierung für eine schnelle Navigation durch die Codebasis.","pt":"Permite a compreensão imediata dos objetivos do projeto, restrições e dependências por meio da summarização automatizada de contexto. Fornece mapeamento de decisões arquiteturais e identificação de convenções para navegação simplificada da base de código.","ru":"Позволяет сразу же понять цели проекта, ограничения и зависимости с помощью автоматического суммирования контекста. Предоставляет картографирование архитектурных решений и определение соглашений для упрощенной навигации по кодовой базе.","ar":"تمكن من الفهم الفوري لأهداف المشروع والقيود والاعتماديات من خلال تلخيص السياق الآلي. يوفر تخطيط قرارات الهندسة المعمارية وتحديد الاتفاقيات من أجل التنقل السلس في قاعدة الشفرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating project onboarding summaries","Validating architectural compliance","Identifying dependency conflicts","Documenting core constraints for new contributors"],"zh":["Generating project onboarding summaries","Validating architectural compliance","Identifying dependency conflicts","Documenting core constraints for new contributors"],"ja":["Generating project onboarding summaries","Validating architectural compliance","Identifying dependency conflicts","Documenting core constraints for new contributors"],"ko":["Generating project onboarding summaries","Validating architectural compliance","Identifying dependency conflicts","Documenting core constraints for new contributors"],"es":["Generar resúmenes de incorporación de proyectos","Validar la conformidad arquitectónica","Identificar conflictos de dependencias","Documentar las restricciones principales para nuevos contribuyentes"],"fr":["Générer des résumés d''intégration de projet","Valider la conformité architecturale","Identifier les conflits de dépendances","Documenter les contraintes principales pour les nouveaux contributeurs"],"de":["Erstellen von Projekteinbindungszusammenfassungen","Überprüfen der architektonischen Konformität","Identifizieren von Abhängigkeitskonflikten","Dokumentieren von Kernbeschränkungen für neue Mitwirkende"],"pt":["Gerar resumos de integração de projetos","Validar conformidade arquitetônica","Identificar conflitos de dependência","Documentar restrições centrais para novos colaboradores"],"ru":["Генерировать сводки интеграции проектов","Проверять соответствие архитектуре","Определять конфликты зависимостей","Документировать основные ограничения для новых участников"],"ar":["إنتاج ملخصات للتوعية بالمشروع","التحقق من مطابقة الهندسة المعمارية","تحديد تضادات الاعتماديات","توثيق القيود الأساسية للمساهمين الجدد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation and codebase","Depends on clear project structure and documentation quality","Limited to static analysis of existing project artifacts"],"zh":["Requires access to project documentation and codebase","Depends on clear project structure and documentation quality","Limited to static analysis of existing project artifacts"],"ja":["Requires access to project documentation and codebase","Depends on clear project structure and documentation quality","Limited to static analysis of existing project artifacts"],"ko":["Requires access to project documentation and codebase","Depends on clear project structure and documentation quality","Limited to static analysis of existing project artifacts"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto y la base de código","Depende de una estructura de proyecto clara y de la calidad de la documentación","Limitado al análisis estático de los artefactos del proyecto existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du projet et à la base de code","Dépend d''une structure de projet claire et de la qualité de la documentation","Limité à l''analyse statique des artefacts de projet existants"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Projektunterlagen und die Codebasis","Hängt von einer klaren Projektstruktur und der Qualität der Dokumentation ab","Begrenzt auf die statische Analyse der vorhandenen Projektartefakte"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação do projeto e base de código","Depende de estrutura de projeto clara e qualidade da documentação","Limitado à análise estática de artefatos de projeto existentes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта и кодовой базе","Зависит от ясной структуры проекта и качества документации","Ограничен статическим анализом существующих артефактов проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق المشروع وقاعدة الشفرة","يعتمد على هيكل مشروع واضح وجودة التوثيق","محدود بالتحليل الثابت لعناصر المشروع الموجودة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
