OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持Antigravity IDE配置转换","兼容GitHub Copilot、Cursor等IDE","兼容Kiro、OpenCode等CLI","轻松变换配置文件","提高开发效率"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE設定の変換をサポート","GitHub Copilot、CursorなどのIDEと互換性","Kiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIと互換性","設定ファイルの簡単な変換","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 설정 변환 지원","GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등의 IDE와 호환","Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI와 호환","설정 파일의 쉬운 변환","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot y otros entornos de desarrollo","Análisis de trade-offs y toma de decisiones informadas","Documentación de requisitos y clasificación de proyectos","Plantillas de ADR para la toma de decisiones"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot et d''autres environnements de développement","Analyse des trade-offs et prise de décisions éclairées","Documentation des exigences et classification des projets","Modèles d''ADR pour la prise de décisions"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot und anderen Entwicklungsumgebungen","Analyse von Trade-offs und informierte Entscheidungsfindung","Dokumentation von Anforderungen und Projektclassification","ADR-Vorlagen für die Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Suporte a GitHub Copilot e Kiro","Ferramenta de software de código aberto","Documentação de arquitetura de decisão"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Antigravity IDE","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Поддержка GitHub Copilot и Kiro","Программный инструмент с открытым исходным кодом","Документация архитектуры принятия решений"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات Antigravity IDE","التوافق مع IDE و CLI","دعم GitHub Copilot و Kiro","أداة برمجية مفتوحة المصدر","توثيق هندسة معمارية لاتخاذ القرارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["架构转换工具","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","配置转换","开发效率"],"ja":["アーキテクチャ変換ツール","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","設定変換","開発効率"],"ko":["아키텍처 변환 도구","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","설정 변환","개발 효율성"],"es":["arquitectura de software","conversión de configuraciones","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","desarrollo de software","análisis de trade-offs","tomar decisiones informadas"],"fr":["architecture logicielle","conversion de configurations","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","développement de logiciels","analyse des trade-offs","prise de décisions éclairées"],"de":["Software-Architektur","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Software-Entwicklung","Analyse von Trade-offs","informierte Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["arquitetura de conversão de configurações","conversão de configurações","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Kiro","CLI","IDE","ferramenta de software"],"ru":["архитектура конвертации конфигураций","конвертация конфигураций","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Kiro","CLI","IDE","программный инструмент"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية لتحويل التكوينات","تحويل التكوينات","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Kiro","CLI","IDE","أداة برمجية"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture","description":"Architectural decision-making framework. Requirements analysis, trade-off evaluation, ADR documentation. Use when making architecture decisions or analyzing system design.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Decision Framework\n\n> \"Requirements drive architecture. Trade-offs inform decisions. ADRs capture rationale.\"\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `context-discovery.md` | Questions to ask, project classification | Starting architecture design |\n| `trade-off-analysis.md` | ADR templates, trade-off framework | Documenting d","body":"# Architecture Decision Framework\n\n> \"Requirements drive architecture. Trade-offs inform decisions. ADRs capture rationale.\"\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `context-discovery.md` | Questions to ask, project classification | Starting architecture design |\n| `trade-off-analysis.md` | ADR templates, trade-off framework | Documenting decisions |\n| `pattern-selection.md` | Decision trees, anti-patterns | Choosing patterns |\n| `examples.md` | MVP, SaaS, Enterprise examples | Reference implementations |\n| `patterns-reference.md` | Quick lookup for patterns | Pattern comparison |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Skills\n\n| Skill | Use For |\n|-------|---------|\n| `@[skills/database-design]` | Database schema design |\n| `@[skills/api-patterns]` | API design patterns |\n| `@[skills/deployment-procedures]` | Deployment architecture |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**\"Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication.\"**\n\n- Start simple\n- Add complexity ONLY when proven necessary\n- You can always add patterns later\n- Removing complexity is MUCH harder than adding it\n\n---\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing architecture:\n\n- [ ] Requirements clearly understood\n- [ ] Constraints identified\n- [ ] Each decision has trade-off analysis\n- [ ] Simpler alternatives considered\n- [ ] ADRs written for significant decisions\n- [ ] Team expertise matches chosen patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:01:58.842Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing architecture decision framework integration, such as converting configurations from Antigravity IDE to GitHub Copilot or Cursor compatible formats.","zh":"非常适合需要集成架构决策框架的AI代理，例如将配置从Antigravity IDE转换为GitHub Copilot或Cursor兼容格式。","ja":"アーキテクチャ決定フレームワークの統合を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。例えば、Antigravity IDEの設定をGitHub CopilotまたはCursor互換形式に変換する場合などです。","ko":"아키텍처 결정 프레임워크 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다. 예를 들어, Antigravity IDE의 구성을 GitHub Copilot 또는 Cursor 호환 형식으로 변환하는 경우입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necesitan integrar un marco de trabajo para decisiones de arquitectura, como convertir configuraciones del IDE Antigravity a formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot o Cursor.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA nécessitant l''intégration d''un cadre de décision d''architecture, comme la conversion de configurations de l''IDE Antigravity vers des formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot ou Cursor.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die die Integration eines Architektur-Entscheidungsrahmens benötigen, z. B. das Konvertieren von Konfigurationen aus der Antigravity-IDE in GitHub Copilot oder Cursor-kompatible Formate.","pt":"Perfect for AI Agents needing architecture decision framework integration, such as converting configurations from Antigravity IDE to GitHub Copilot or Cursor compatible formats.","ru":"Perfect for AI Agents needing architecture decision framework integration, such as converting configurations from Antigravity IDE to GitHub Copilot or Cursor compatible formats.","ar":"Perfect for AI Agents needing architecture decision framework integration, such as converting configurations from Antigravity IDE to GitHub Copilot or Cursor compatible formats."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture rationale with Architecture Decision Records (ADRs), facilitating trade-off analysis and informed decision-making using context discovery and selective reading rules, all while leveraging markdown files like `context-discovery.md` and `trade-off-analysis.md`.","zh":"赋能代理通过架构决策记录（ADRs）捕获基本原理，利用上下文发现和选择性阅读规则促进权衡分析和明智决策，同时利用`context-discovery.md`和`trade-off-analysis.md`等Markdown文件。","ja":"コンテキスト発見と選択的読み取りルールを活用して、トレードオフ分析と情報に基づいた意思決定を促進するアーキテクチャ決定記録（ADR）で理論的根拠を捕捉する機能をエージェントに付与します。すべては`context-discovery.md`や`trade-off-analysis.md`のようなマークダウンファイルを活用しながら行われます。","ko":"에이전트가 아키텍처 결정 기록(ADR)을 통해 근거를 포착하고, 컨텍스트 발견 및 선택적 읽기 규칙을 사용하여 트레이드오프 분석과 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 용이하게 하는 능력을 부여합니다. 이 모든 것은 `context-discovery.md` 및 `trade-off-analysis.md`와 같은 마크다운 파일을 활용하면서 수행됩니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para capturar la justificación con Registros de Decisión de Arquitectura (ADR), facilitando el análisis de compensaciones y la toma de decisiones informadas mediante el descubrimiento de contexto y reglas de lectura selectiva, todo mientras se aprovechan archivos markdown como `context-discovery.md` y `trade-off-analysis.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer la justification avec les Archives de Décisions d''Architecture (ADR), facilitant l''analyse des compromis et la prise de décision éclairée en utilisant la découverte de contexte et des règles de lecture sélective, le tout en exploitant des fichiers markdown comme `context-discovery.md` et `trade-off-analysis.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Begründung mit Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) zu erfassen, erleichtert die Abwägungsanalyse und fundierte Entscheidungsfindung durch Kontexterkennung und selektive Leseregeln, alles unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie `context-discovery.md` und `trade-off-analysis.md`.","pt":"Empowers agents to capture rationale with Architecture Decision Records (ADRs), facilitating trade-off analysis and informed decision-making using context discovery and selective reading rules, all while leveraging markdown files like `context-discovery.md` and `trade-off-analysis.md`.","ru":"Empowers agents to capture rationale with Architecture Decision Records (ADRs), facilitating trade-off analysis and informed decision-making using context discovery and selective reading rules, all while leveraging markdown files like `context-discovery.md` and `trade-off-analysis.md`.","ar":"Empowers agents to capture rationale with Architecture Decision Records (ADRs), facilitating trade-off analysis and informed decision-making using context discovery and selective reading rules, all while leveraging markdown files like `context-discovery.md` and `trade-off-analysis.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to GitHub Copilot compatible formats","Generating ADR templates for trade-off analysis","Documenting architecture design rationales with markdown files"],"zh":["将Antigravity IDE配置转换为GitHub Copilot兼容格式","生成用于权衡分析的ADR模板","使用Markdown文件记录架构设计原理"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE設定をGitHub Copilot互換形式に変換","トレードオフ分析のためのADRテンプレートの生成","マークダウンファイルを使用したアーキテクチャ設計理論の文書化"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 구성을 GitHub Copilot 호환 형식으로 변환","트레이드오프 분석을 위한 ADR 템플릿 생성","마크다운 파일을 사용한 아키텍처 설계 근거 문서화"],"es":["Convertir configuraciones del IDE Antigravity a formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot","Generar plantillas ADR para análisis de compensaciones","Documentar justificaciones de diseño de arquitectura con archivos markdown"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations de l''IDE Antigravity en formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot","Génération de modèles ADR pour l''analyse des compromis","Documentation des justifications de conception d''architecture avec des fichiers markdown"],"de":["Konvertieren von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in GitHub Copilot-kompatible Formate","Erstellen von ADR-Vorlagen für die Abwägungsanalyse","Dokumentieren von Architektur-Design-Begründungen mit Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to GitHub Copilot compatible formats","Generating ADR templates for trade-off analysis","Documenting architecture design rationales with markdown files"],"ru":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to GitHub Copilot compatible formats","Generating ADR templates for trade-off analysis","Documenting architecture design rationales with markdown files"],"ar":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to GitHub Copilot compatible formats","Generating ADR templates for trade-off analysis","Documenting architecture design rationales with markdown files"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with target IDEs and CLIs","Limited to converting specific configuration formats"],"zh":["需要与目标IDE和CLI兼容","仅限于转换特定的配置格式"],"ja":["対象となるIDEおよびCLIとの互換性が必要","特定の設定形式の変換に限定される"],"ko":["대상 IDE 및 CLI와의 호환성 필요","특정 구성 형식 변환으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con los IDE y CLI objetivo","Limitado a convertir formatos de configuración específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec les IDE et CLI cibles","Limité à la conversion de formats de configuration spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit den Ziel-IDEs und CLIs","Beschränkt auf die Konvertierung spezifischer Konfigurationsformate"],"pt":["Requires compatibility with target IDEs and CLIs","Limited to converting specific configuration formats"],"ru":["Requires compatibility with target IDEs and CLIs","Limited to converting specific configuration formats"],"ar":["Requires compatibility with target IDEs and CLIs","Limited to converting specific configuration formats"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
