нга и генерации кода","Приоритизация правил по воздействию","Улучшение производительности для приложений"],"ar":["57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت و نكست.جس","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التطبيقات وتوليد الكود","تحديد أولويات القواعد حسب التأثير","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","性能优化","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成","数据获取","代码重构"],"ja":["Vercel React","パフォーマンス最適化","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","データ取得","コードリファクタリング"],"ko":["Vercel React","성능 최적화","React 최고의実践","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","데이터 가져오기","코드 리팩토링"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","programación","tecnologías web"],"fr":["Vercel React","bonnes pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","programmation","technologies web"],"de":["Vercel React","beste Praktiken","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Programmierung","Webtechnologien"],"pt":["Vercel React","Práticas recomendadas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","React performance optimization","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","React производительность оптимизация","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["فيرسيل ري액ت","أفضل الممارسات لري액ت","تحسين الأداء لري액ت","نكست.جس","ري액ت تحسين الأداء","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"Jay-Ahirrao","repo":"gen-edu-buildandgrow","repoPath":"Jay-Ahirrao/gen-edu-buildandgrow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bund","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:03:18.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"适用于需要优化React和Next.js应用性能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが最適化されたReactとNext.jsアプリケーションパフォーマンスを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"최적화된 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션 성능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento óptimo de aplicaciones React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un rendement optimisé des applications React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes Leistungsverhalten von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 React и Next.js приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن لتطبيقات React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation with 57 prioritized rules across 8 categories, leveraging React and Next.js best practices for improved performance optimization, data fetching, and bundling, utilizing client and server-side rendering.","zh":"赋予代理自动重构和代码生成的能力，跨8个类别有57个优先规则，利用React和Next.js的最佳实践来改进性能优化、数据获取和打包，利用客户端和服务器端渲染。","ja":"エージェントに自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、8つのカテゴリにわたる57の優先ルールを提供し、ReactとNext.jsのベストプラクティスを利用してパフォーマンス最適化、データ取得、バンドルを改善し、クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのレンダリングを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 자동 리팩터링과 코드 생성을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 8개의 카테고리에 걸쳐 57개의 우선 규칙을 제공하여 React와 Next.js의 모범 사례를 활용하여 성능 최적화, 데이터 가져오기, 번들링을 개선하고 클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código con 57 reglas priorizadas en 8 categorías, utilizando las mejores prácticas de React y Next.js para una mejor optimización del rendimiento, la obtención de datos y la agrupación, utilizando la representación del lado del cliente y del servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la réorganisation et la génération de code avec 57 règles priorisées dans 8 catégories, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques de React et Next.js pour une meilleure optimisation des performances, la récupération de données et le regroupement, en utilisant le rendu côté client et côté serveur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Refaktorisierung und Codegenerierung mit 57 priorisierten Regeln in 8 Kategorien zu automatisieren, indem sie die bewährten Verfahren von React und Next.js für eine verbesserte Leistungsoptimierung, Datenabruf und Bündelung nutzen, unter Einsatz von Client- und Server-Seitiger Darstellung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código com 57 regras prioritárias em 8 categorias, aproveitando as melhores práticas do React e do Next.js para otimização de desempenho aprimorada, busca de dados e empacotamento, utilizando renderização de cliente e servidor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода с 57 приоритизированными правилами в 8 категориях, используя лучшие практики React и Next.js для улучшенной оптимизации производительности, выборки данных и сборки, используя клиентскую и серверную отрисовку.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من توفير الترميز الآلي وإعادة الهيكلة مع 57 قاعدة ذات أولوية في 8 فئات، مستفيدة من أفضل الممارسات لتحسين أداء التطبيقات React و Next.js، وجلب البيانات وتحسين التجميع، باستخدام تقنيات العرض على الجانب العميل والخادم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies for client and server-side rendering","Optimizing bundling for faster application loading times"],"zh":["自动优化React组件的性能","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的Next.js页面","重构现有的React和Next.js代码以获得更好的性能","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取策略","优化包装以实现更快的应用程序加载时间"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのパフォーマンスを自動で最適化する","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化されたNext.jsページを生成する","既存のReactとNext.jsコードをリファクタリングしてパフォーマンスを向上させる","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのレンダリングのために効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する","バンドルを最適化してアプリケーションの読み込み時間を短縮する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트의 성능을 자동으로 최적화합니다.","서버 측 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지를 생성합니다.","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드를 리팩터링하여 성능을 개선합니다.","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현합니다.","번들을 최적화하여 애플리케이션의 로딩 시간을 단축합니다."],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para componentes React","Generar páginas Next.js optimizadas con representación del lado del servidor","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar estrategias de obtención de datos eficientes para la representación del lado del cliente y del servidor","Optimizar la agrupación para tiempos de carga de aplicaciones más rápidos"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu côté serveur","Réorganiser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies d''obtention de données efficaces pour le rendu côté client et côté serveur","Optimiser le regroupement pour des temps de chargement d''applications plus rapides"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit serverseitiger Darstellung","Refaktorisieren des bestehenden React- und Next.js-Codes für ein besseres Leistungsverhalten","Implementieren effizienter Datenabrufstrategien für client- und serverseitige Darstellung","Optimieren der Bündelung für schnellere Applikationsladezeiten"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização no lado do servidor","Reestruturar o código existente do React e do Next.js para melhor desempenho","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados eficientes para renderização de cliente e servidor","Otimizar o empacotamento para tempos de carregamento de aplicativos mais rápidos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной отрисовкой","Перестраивать существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Реализовывать эффективные стратегии выборки данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки","Оптимизировать сборку для более быстрого времени загрузки приложений"],"ar":["توفير تحسين الأداء الآلي لمكونات React","إنشاء صفحات Next.js المُحسّنة مع تقنية العرض على الخادم","إعادة هيكلة الرمز الحالي لتطبيقات React و Next.js لتحسين الأداء","تطبيق استراتيجيات جلب البيانات الكفء للعرض على الجانب العميل والخادم","تحسين التجميع من أجل وقت تحميل للتطبيقات أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application setup","Limited to React and Next.js frameworks","Dependent on Vercel guidelines and updates"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js应用程序设置","仅限于React和Next.js框架","依赖于Vercel指南和更新"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsアプリケーションの設定が必要","ReactとNext.jsのフレームワークのみに限定","Vercelのガイドラインと更新に依存"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 애플리케이션 설정이 필요합니다.","React 및 Next.js 프레임워크에만 제한됩니다.","Vercel 가이드라인 및 업데이트에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere una configuración de aplicaciones React o Next.js","Limitado a los marcos React y Next.js","Dependiente de las directrices y actualizaciones de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''applications React ou Next.js","Limité aux frameworks React et Next.js","Dépendant des directives et des mises à jour de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt eine Einrichtung von React- oder Next.js-Anwendungen","Begrenzt auf die Frameworks React und Next.js","Abhängig von den Richtlinien und Updates von Vercel"],"pt":["Exige configuração de aplicativo React ou Next.js","Limitado aos quadros React e Next.js","Dependente das diretrizes e atualizações do Vercel"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения React или Next.js","Ограничен фреймворками React и Next.js","Зависит от руководящих принципов и обновлений Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق React أو Next.js","محدود بالإطارات العمل React و Next.js","يعتمد على إرشادات وتحديثات Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
