.)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"MCP Builder：AI系统配置转换工具","ja":"MCP Builder：AIシステム構成変換ツール","ko":"MCP Builder: AI 시스템 구성 변환 도구","es":"MCP Builder: Herramienta de conversión de configuraciones","fr":"MCP Builder : Outil de conversion de configurations","de":"MCP Builder: Werkzeug zur Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","pt":"MCP Builder: Ferramenta de Conversão de Configurações","ru":"MCP Builder: Инструмент для конвертации конфигураций","ar":"MCP Builder: أداة لتحويل التكوينات","en":"mcp-builder"},"description":{"zh":"MCP Builder是一款将Antigravity IDE配置转换为其他IDE和CLI兼容格式的工具，支持Model Context Protocol标准","ja":"MCP Builderは、Antigravity IDE構成を他のIDEおよびCLIと互換性のある形式に変換するツールです。Model Context Protocol標準をサポートしています","ko":"MCP Builder는 Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 다른 IDE 및 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 도구로 Model Context Protocol 표준을 지원합니다","es":"MCP Builder es una herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Agent, Skill y Workflows de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con IDEs y CLIs","fr":"MCP Builder est un outil pour convertir les configurations d''Agent, Skill et Workflows d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec les IDE et les CLIs","de":"MCP Builder ist ein Werkzeug zur Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Agent, Skill und Workflows von Antigravity IDE in Formate, die mit IDEs und CLIs kompa...","pt":"O MCP Builder é uma ferramenta para converter configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs, permitindo a integração de sistemas...","ru":"MCP Builder - это инструмент для конвертации конфигураций Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI, что позволяет интегрировать системы ИИ с внешни...","ar":"MCP Builder هو أداة لتحويل التكوينات من Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI، مما يسمح بتكامل أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع أدوات و مصادر بيانات خارجية","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持Model Context Protocol标准","将Antigravity IDE配置转换为GitHub Copilot、Cursor等IDE兼容格式","将Antigravity IDE配置转换为Kiro、OpenCode等CLI兼容格式","简化AI系统配置转换过程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["Model Context Protocol標準をサポート","Antigravity IDE構成をGitHub Copilot、CursorなどのIDEと互換性のある形式に変換","Antigravity IDE構成をKiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIと互換性のある形式に変換","AIシステム構成変換プロセスを簡素化","開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":["Model Context Protocol 표준을 지원","Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등의 IDE와 호환되는 형식으로 변환","Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환","AI 시스템 구성 파일 변환 과정을 간소화","개발 효율을 향상"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y más","Soporte para Agent, Skill y Workflows","Integración con CLIs como Kiro y OpenCode","Arquitectura de servidor flexible"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et plus","Prise en charge d''Agent, Skill et Workflows","Intégration avec des CLIs comme Kiro et OpenCode","Architecture de serveur flexible"],"de":["Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und mehr","Unterstützung für Agent, Skill und Workflows","Integration mit CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Flexible Server-Architektur"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Integração com sistemas de IA","Suporte a protocolo Model Context Protocol (MCP)","Ferramentas e fontes de dados externas"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Antigravity IDE","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Интеграция с системами ИИ","Поддержка протокола Model Context Protocol (MCP)","Внешние инструменты и источники данных"],"ar":["تحويل التكوينات من Antigravity IDE","التوافق مع IDE و CLI","التكامل مع أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم بروتوكول Model Context Protocol (MCP)","أدوات و مصادر بيانات خارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP Builder","AI系统配置转换","Model Context Protocol","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode"],"ja":["MCP Builder","AIシステム構成変換","Model Context Protocol","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode"],"ko":["MCP Builder","AI 시스템 구성 변환","Model Context Protocol","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode"],"es":["MCP Builder","conversión de configuraciones","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["MCP Builder","conversion de configurations","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels"],"de":["MCP Builder","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","künstliche Intelligenz","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["MCP Builder","Conversão de configurações","Antigravity IDE","IDEs e CLIs","Sistemas de IA","Model Context Protocol","Integração de sistemas","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["MCP Builder","Конвертация конфигураций","Antigravity IDE","IDE и CLI","Системы ИИ","Model Context Protocol","Интеграция систем","Инструменты разработки","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["MCP Builder","تحويل التكوينات","Antigravity IDE","IDE و CLI","أنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي","بروتوكول Model Context","تكامل الأنظمة","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp-builder","description":"MCP (Model Context Protocol) server building principles. Tool design, resource patterns, best practices.","bodyPreview":"# MCP Builder\n\n> Principles for building MCP servers.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MCP Overview\n\n### What is MCP?\n\nModel Context Protocol - standard for connecting AI systems with external tools and data sources.\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Tools** | Functions AI can call |\n| **Resources** | Data AI can read |\n| **Prompts** | Pre-defined prompt templates |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Server Architecture\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-mcp-server/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts      # Main entry","body":"# MCP Builder\n\n> Principles for building MCP servers.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MCP Overview\n\n### What is MCP?\n\nModel Context Protocol - standard for connecting AI systems with external tools and data sources.\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| **Tools** | Functions AI can call |\n| **Resources** | Data AI can read |\n| **Prompts** | Pre-defined prompt templates |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Server Architecture\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-mcp-server/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts      # Main entry\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json\n```\n\n### Transport Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Stdio** | Local, CLI-based |\n| **SSE** | Web-based, streaming |\n| **WebSocket** | Real-time, bidirectional |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Tool Design Principles\n\n### Good Tool Design\n\n| Principle | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| Clear name | Action-oriented (get_weather, create_user) |\n| Single purpose | One thing well |\n| Validated input | Schema with types and descriptions |\n| Structured output | Predictable response format |\n\n### Input Schema Design\n\n| Field | Required? |\n|-------|-----------|\n| Type | Yes - object |\n| Properties | Define each param |\n| Required | List mandatory params |\n| Description | Human-readable |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Resource Patterns\n\n### Resource Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static | Fixed data (config, docs) |\n| Dynamic | Generated on request |\n| Template | URI with parameters |\n\n### URI Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Fixed | `docs://readme` |\n| Parameterized | `users://{userId}` |\n| Collection | `files://project/*` |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### Error Types\n\n| Situation | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Invalid params | Validation error message |\n| Not found | Clear \"not found\" |\n| Server error | Generic error, log details |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Return structured errors\n- Don''t expose internal details\n- Log for debugging\n- Provide actionable messages\n\n---\n\n## 6. Multimodal Handling\n\n### Supported Types\n\n| Type | Encoding |\n|------|----------|\n| Text | Plain text |\n| Images | Base64 + MIME type |\n| Files | Base64 + MIME type |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Security Principles\n\n### Input Validation\n\n- Validate all tool inputs\n- Sanitize user-provided data\n- Limit resource access\n\n### API Keys\n\n- Use environment variables\n- Don''t log secrets\n- Validate permissions\n\n---\n\n## 8. Configuration\n\n### Claude Desktop Config\n\n| Field | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|\n| command | Executable to run |\n| args | Command arguments |\n| env | Environment variables |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Testing\n\n### Test Categories\n\n| Type | Focus |\n|------|-------|\n| Unit | Tool logic |\n| Integration | Full server |\n| Contract | Schema validation |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] Clear, action-oriented tool names\n- [ ] Complete input schemas with descriptions\n- [ ] Structured JSON output\n- [ ] Error handling for all cases\n- [ ] Input validation\n- [ ] Environment-based configuration\n- [ ] Logging for debugging\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** MCP tools should be simple, focused, and well-documented. The AI relies on descriptions to use them correctly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:04:20.428Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing seamless integration with various IDEs and CLIs via the Model Context Protocol (MCP) standard.","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要与各种IDE和CLI通过模型上下文协议（MCP）标准实现无缝集成。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しており、Model Context Protocol（MCP）標準を使用して様々なIDEやCLIとシームレスに統合する必要があります。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 다양한 IDE와 CLI를 모델 컨텍스트 프로토콜(MCP) 표준을 통해 무결점으로 통합할 필요가 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una integración sin problemas con varios IDE y CLIs a través del estándar de protocolo de contexto de modelo (MCP).","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA tels que Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une intégration transparente avec divers IDE et CLIs via la norme de protocole de contexte de modèle (MCP).","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine nahtlose Integration mit verschiedenen IDEs und CLIs über den Model Context Protocol (MCP)-Standard benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de integração perfeita com várias IDEs e CLIs por meio do padrão do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих бесшовной интеграции с различными IDE и CLI через стандарт протокола контекста модели (MCP).","ar":"مثالي لعميلين الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع各种 IDEs و CLIs من خلال معيار بروتوكول سياق النموذج (MCP)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert configurations from Antigravity IDE to formats compatible with GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and other CLIs like Kiro and OpenCode, utilizing MCP''s core concepts of Tools, Resources, and Prompts.","zh":"赋予代理将配置从Antigravity IDE转换为与GitHub Copilot、Cursor和其他CLI（如Kiro和OpenCode）兼容的格式的能力，利用MCP的工具、资源和提示的核心概念。","ja":"Antigravity IDEからの設定を、GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIと互換性のある形式に変換するエージェントの能力を提供し、MCPのツール、リソース、プロンプトの核心概念を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Antigravity IDE의 설정을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, MCP의 도구, 리소스, 프롬프트의 핵심 개념을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir configuraciones desde el IDE Antigravity a formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y otros CLIs como Kiro y OpenCode, utilizando los conceptos básicos de MCP de Herramientas, Recursos y Prompts.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des configurations depuis l''IDE Antigravity vers des formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et d''autres CLIs comme Kiro et OpenCode, en utilisant les concepts de base de MCP d''Outils, Ressources et Prompts.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in Formate umzuwandeln, die mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und anderen CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode kompatibel sind, unter Verwendung der Kernkonzepte von MCP wie Tools, Ressourcen und Prompts.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com o GitHub Copilot, Cursor e outros CLIs como Kiro e OpenCode, utilizando os conceitos centrais do MCP de Ferramentas, Recursos e Prompt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать конфигурации из Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с GitHub Copilot, Cursor и другими CLI, такими как Kiro и OpenCode, с использованием основных концепций MCP: Инструментов, Ресурсов и Промптов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحويل التكوينات من Antigravity IDE إلى صيغ متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot و Cursor ووكلاء CLI آخرين مثل Kiro و OpenCode، باستخدام المفاهيم الأساسية للمCP لأدوات والموارد والاستذكار."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Agent configurations for multi-IDE compatibility","Migrating Skill configurations to MCP format","Integrating Workflows with external tools and data sources via MCP"],"zh":["将代理配置转换为多IDE兼容性","将技能配置迁移到MCP格式","通过MCP将工作流集成到外部工具和数据源"],"ja":["エージェントの設定を複数のIDEと互換性のある形式に変換する","スキル設定をMCP形式に移行する","MCPを使用してワークフローを外部ツールやデータソースと統合する"],"ko":["에이전트 설정을 다중 IDE와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 것","스킬 설정을 MCP 형식으로 마이그레이션","MCP를 사용하여 워크플로우를 외부 도구 및 데이터 소스와 통합"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Agentes para la compatibilidad con varios IDE","Migración de configuraciones de Habilidades al formato MCP","Integración de flujos de trabajo con herramientas y fuentes de datos externas a través de MCP"],"fr":["Conversion de configurations d''Agents pour la compatibilité avec plusieurs IDE","Migration de configurations de Compétences vers le format MCP","Intégration de flux de travail avec des outils et des sources de données externes via MCP"],"de":["Konvertierung von Agent-Konfigurationen für die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen IDEs","Migration von Fähigkeitskonfigurationen zum MCP-Format","Integration von Workflows mit externen Tools und Datenquellen über MCP"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações de Agente para compatibilidade com várias IDEs","Migração de configurações de Habilidade para formato MCP","Integração de Fluxos de Trabalho com ferramentas e fontes de dados externas via MCP"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций агента для совместимости с несколькими IDE","Миграция конфигураций навыков в формат MCP","Интеграция рабочих процессов с внешними инструментами и источниками данных через MCP"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات الوكيل لتوافق متعدد مع IDEs","هجرة تكوينات المهارة إلى تنسيق MCP","تكامل سير العمل مع أدوات ومصادر بيانات خارجية عبر MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of MCP standard and its implementation","Compatibility issues may arise with unsupported IDEs or CLIs"],"zh":["需要了解MCP标准及其实现","可能会出现与不支持的IDE或CLI的兼容性问题"],"ja":["MCP標準及其実装の知識が必要","サポートされていないIDEまたはCLIとの互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["MCP 표준 및 구현에 대한 지식이 필요","지원되지 않는 IDE 또는 CLI와의 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del estándar MCP y su implementación","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad con IDE o CLIs no compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la norme MCP et de sa mise en œuvre","Des problèmes de compatibilité peuvent survenir avec des IDE ou des CLIs non pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des MCP-Standards und seiner Implementierung","Kompatibilitätsprobleme können bei nicht unterstützten IDEs oder CLIs auftreten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do padrão MCP e sua implementação","Podem surgir problemas de compatibilidade com IDEs ou CLIs não suportados"],"ru":["Требует знания стандарта MCP и его реализации","Могут возникнуть проблемы совместимости с не поддерживаемыми IDE или CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمعيار MCP وتطبيقه","قد تظهر مشاكل في التوافق مع IDEs أو CLIs غير مدعومة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
