it-Nachrichten","Verwaltung von Versionen und Releases","Teamzusammenarbeit über Pull-Requests"],"pt":["Padronização do fluxo de trabalho","Verificação de código antes do commit","Criação de branches para funcionalidades","Envio de Pull Requests","Gerenciamento de versões"],"ru":["Стандартизация рабочего процесса","Проверка кода перед коммитом","Создание веток для функциональности","Отправка Pull Requests","Управление версиями"],"ar":["تقييس تدفق العمل","التحقق من الكود قبل الإلتزام","إنشاء فروع للوظائف","إرسال طلبات السحب","إدارة الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 工作流","团队协作","提交历史","代码变更","项目可维护性","Git 最佳实践"],"ja":["Git ワークフロー","チームコラボレーション","コミット履歴","コード変更","プロジェクトメンテナンス性","Git ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Git 워크플로우","팀 협업","커밋 기록","코드 변경","프로젝트 유지 보수성","Git 최선의 관행"],"es":["flujo de trabajo Git","colaboración en equipo","gestión de versiones","commit claro","pull request","ramas de función","validación de código"],"fr":["workflow Git","collaboration d''équipe","gestion des versions","commit clair","pull request","branches de fonctionnalité","validation du code"],"de":["Git-Workflow","Teamzusammenarbeit","Versionenverwaltung","klares Commit","Pull-Request","Funktionszweige","Code-Validierung"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho git","desenvolvimento de software","colaboração em equipe","manutenção de projetos","git workflow","boas práticas de git"],"ru":["рабочий процесс git","разработка программного обеспечения","командная работа","поддержка проектов","git workflow","лучшие практики git"],"ar":["تدفق العمل جيت","تطوير البرمجيات","التعاون الفريق","تصحيح مشاكل المشاريع","جيت 워크فلو","أفضل الممارسات لجيت"]}},"owner":"dseirz-rgb","repo":"worker","repoPath":"dseirz-rgb/worker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow (Git 工作流)\n\n> 🔄 **核心理念**: 规范化的 Git 工作流是团队协作的基础，清晰的提交历史是项目可维护性的保障。\n\n## 🔴 第一原则：先验证，再提交\n\n**任何代码修改都必须经过验证才能提交！**\n\n```\n❌ 错误流程: 修改代码 → 直接 commit → push\n✅ 正确流程: 修改代码 → 本地测试 → build 验证 → commit → push → 验证部署\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n使用此技能当你需要：\n- 提交代码变更\n- 创建新分支\n- 发起 Pull Request\n- 合并代码\n- 管理版本发布\n- 编写规范的提交信息\n\n## Not For / Boundaries\n\n此技能不适用于：\n- Git 基础命令学习（请参考 Git 官方文档）\n- 复杂的 Git 操作（如 rebase 冲突解决）\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 🎯 标准工作流程\n\n```\n1. 创建功能分支\n   git checkout -b feat/feature-n","body":"# Git Workflow (Git 工作流)\n\n> 🔄 **核心理念**: 规范化的 Git 工作流是团队协作的基础，清晰的提交历史是项目可维护性的保障。\n\n## 🔴 第一原则：先验证，再提交\n\n**任何代码修改都必须经过验证才能提交！**\n\n```\n❌ 错误流程: 修改代码 → 直接 commit → push\n✅ 正确流程: 修改代码 → 本地测试 → build 验证 → commit → push → 验证部署\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n使用此技能当你需要：\n- 提交代码变更\n- 创建新分支\n- 发起 Pull Request\n- 合并代码\n- 管理版本发布\n- 编写规范的提交信息\n\n## Not For / Boundaries\n\n此技能不适用于：\n- Git 基础命令学习（请参考 Git 官方文档）\n- 复杂的 Git 操作（如 rebase 冲突解决）\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 🎯 标准工作流程\n\n```\n1. 创建功能分支\n   git checkout -b feat/feature-name\n\n2. 开发并提交\n   git add .\n   git commit -m \"feat: 添加新功能\"\n\n3. 本地验证\n   npm run build && npm test\n\n4. 推送并创建 PR\n   git push origin feat/feature-name\n\n5. 代码审查 → 合并 → 删除分支\n```\n\n### 📋 提交前检查清单\n\n| 检查项 | 命令 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| 代码格式 | `npm run lint` | 确保代码风格一致 |\n| 类型检查 | `npm run typecheck` | TypeScript 类型正确 |\n| 单元测试 | `npm test` | 所有测试通过 |\n| 构建验证 | `npm run build` | 构建成功无错误 |\n| 提交信息 | - | 符合 Conventional Commit |\n\n### 🏷️ Conventional Commit 格式\n\n```\n<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n\n<body>\n\n<footer>\n```\n\n**示例:**\n```\nfeat(auth): 添加 Google OAuth 登录\n\n- 集成 next-auth Google provider\n- 添加登录按钮组件\n- 配置回调 URL\n\nCloses #123\n```\n\n### 📝 提交类型速查\n\n| 类型 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `feat` | 新功能 | `feat: 添加用户注册功能` |\n| `fix` | Bug 修复 | `fix: 修复登录状态丢失问题` |\n| `docs` | 文档更新 | `docs: 更新 API 文档` |\n| `style` | 代码格式 | `style: 格式化代码` |\n| `refactor` | 重构 | `refactor: 重构用户模块` |\n| `test` | 测试 | `test: 添加单元测试` |\n| `chore` | 构建/工具 | `chore: 更新依赖版本` |\n\n### 🌿 分支命名规范\n\n| 类型 | 格式 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 功能 | `feat/<name>` | `feat/user-auth` |\n| 修复 | `fix/<name>` | `fix/login-bug` |\n| 热修复 | `hotfix/<name>` | `hotfix/security-patch` |\n| 发布 | `release/<version>` | `release/v1.2.0` |\n\n---\n\n## 详细指南\n\n### Phase 1: 分支管理\n\n**创建分支**\n```bash\n# 从 main 创建功能分支\ngit checkout main\ngit pull origin main\ngit checkout -b feat/new-feature\n```\n\n**分支同步**\n```bash\n# 保持分支与 main 同步\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n# 或使用 merge\ngit merge origin/main\n```\n\n### Phase 2: 提交规范\n\n**原子提交原则**\n- 每个提交只做一件事\n- 提交信息清晰描述变更内容\n- 相关修改合并为一次提交\n\n**提交信息规范**\n```bash\n# 简单提交\ngit commit -m \"feat: 添加用户头像上传功能\"\n\n# 带详细说明的提交\ngit commit -m \"fix(api): 修复并发请求导致的数据竞争\n\n- 添加请求锁机制\n- 优化错误重试逻辑\n- 增加超时处理\n\nFixes #456\"\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Pull Request\n\n**PR 创建流程**\n```bash\n# 1. 推送分支\ngit push origin feat/new-feature\n\n# 2. 创建 PR（通过 GitHub CLI 或网页）\ngh pr create --title \"feat: 添加新功能\" --body \"描述...\"\n\n# 3. 等待 CI 通过\n# 4. 请求代码审查\n# 5. 合并后删除分支\n```\n\n**PR 最佳实践**\n- 保持 PR 小而专注\n- 提供清晰的描述和截图\n- 关联相关 Issue\n- 响应审查意见\n\n### Phase 4: 版本发布\n\n**语义化版本**\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH\n  │     │     └── 向后兼容的 Bug 修复\n  │     └──────── 向后兼容的新功能\n  └────────────── 不兼容的 API 变更\n```\n\n**发布流程**\n```bash\n# 1. 创建发布分支\ngit checkout -b release/v1.2.0\n\n# 2. 更新版本号\nnpm version minor\n\n# 3. 合并到 main 并打 tag\ngit checkout main\ngit merge release/v1.2.0\ngit tag v1.2.0\ngit push origin main --tags\n```\n\n---\n\n## 常见问题\n\n### Q: 提交后发现信息写错了？\n```bash\n# 修改最近一次提交信息\ngit commit --amend -m \"新的提交信息\"\n```\n\n### Q: 需要撤销最近的提交？\n```bash\n# 保留修改，撤销提交\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\n# 完全撤销（慎用）\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1\n```\n\n### Q: 如何合并多个提交？\n```bash\n# 交互式 rebase，合并最近 3 个提交\ngit rebase -i HEAD~3\n# 将 pick 改为 squash 或 s\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- `templates/commit-types.md`: 提交类型详细说明\n- `templates/branch-naming.md`: 分支命名约定\n- `templates/pr-template.md`: PR 描述模板\n\n---\n\n## Maintenance\n\n- **Sources**: Conventional Commits, Git Flow, GitHub Flow\n- **Last Updated**: 2025-01-01\n- **Known Limits**: \n  - 适用于中小型团队\n  - 大型项目可能需要更复杂的分支策略\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:04:44.914Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing standardized Git workflow management.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化 Git 工作流管理的开发代理。","ja":"標準化されたGitワークフローマネジメントを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 Git 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git estandarizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow Git standardisée.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine standardisierte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho do Git padronizado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется стандартизированное управление рабочим процессом Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة تدفق عمل جيت معيارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a standardized Git workflow, utilizing protocols like commit validation and pull requests, ensuring clean commit histories and streamlined project maintenance with features like branch creation and merge management.","zh":"赋予代理人执行标准化的 Git 工作流的能力，利用诸如提交验证和拉取请求等协议，确保干净的提交历史和流畅的项目维护，具有分支创建和合并管理等功能。","ja":"コミットの検証やプルリクエストなどのプロトコルを使用して、標準化されたGitワークフローをエージェントが強制できるようにし、クリーンなコミット履歴とプロジェクトメンテナンスの最適化を実現します。また、ブランチ作成やマージ管理などの機能も提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 표준화된 Git 워크플로우를 강제할 수 있도록 해주며, 제출 검증 및 풀 요청과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 깨끗한 제출 기록 및 프로젝트 유지 보수의 최적화를 보장합니다. 또한 분기 생성 및 병합 관리와 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un flujo de trabajo de Git estandarizado, utilizando protocolos como la validación de confirmaciones y solicitudes de extracción, lo que garantiza historias de confirmación limpias y una mantenimiento de proyectos optimizado con características como la creación de ramas y la gestión de fusiones.","fr":"Équipe les agents pour appliquer un workflow Git standardisé, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la validation des commits et les demandes de tirage, garantissant ainsi des historiques de commit propres et une maintenance de projet optimisée avec des fonctionnalités telles que la création de branches et la gestion de fusion.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein standardisiertes Git-Workflow-Management durchzusetzen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Commit-Validierung und Pull-Requests, um saubere Commit-Verlaufsprotokolle und optimierte Projektunterhaltung mit Funktionen wie Branch-Erstellung und Merge-Verwaltung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor um fluxo de trabalho do Git padronizado, utilizando protocolos como validação de commit e solicitações de pull, garantindo históricos de commit limpos e manutenção de projeto otimizada com recursos como criação de branch e gerenciamento de mesclagem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить стандартизированный рабочий процесс Git, используя протоколы, такие как проверка коммитов и запросы на вытягивание, что обеспечивает чистую историю коммитов и оптимизированное обслуживание проекта с функциями, такими как создание веток и управление слиянием.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض تدفق عمل جيت معياري، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التحقق من التعديلات والطلبات السحابية، مما يضمن سجلات تعديل نظيفة وتحديث المشروع بسهولة باستخدام ميزات مثل إنشاء الفرع وإدارة الدمج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit validation for code changes","Generating new feature branches for collaborative development","Managing version releases with standardized commit messages"],"zh":["自动化代码更改的提交验证","为协作开发生成新功能分支","使用标准化的提交消息管理版本发布"],"ja":["コード変更のコミット検証の自動化","共同開発用の新しい機能ブランチの生成","標準化されたコミットメッセージを使用したバージョンリリースの管理"],"ko":["코드 변경의 제출 검증 자동화","협력 개발을 위한 새로운 기능 분기 생성","표준화된 제출 메시지를 사용한 버전 릴리스 관리"],"es":["Automatizar la validación de confirmaciones para cambios de código","Generar nuevas ramas de características para el desarrollo colaborativo","Gestionar versiones de lanzamiento con mensajes de confirmación estandarizados"],"fr":["Automatiser la validation des commits pour les modifications de code","Générer de nouvelles branches de fonctionnalités pour le développement collaboratif","Gérer les versions de publication avec des messages de commit standardisés"],"de":["Automatisieren der Commit-Validierung für Code-Änderungen","Erstellen neuer Feature-Branches für die gemeinsame Entwicklung","Verwalten von Version-Veröffentlichungen mit standardisierten Commit-Nachrichten"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de commit para alterações de código","Gerar novas branches de recurso para desenvolvimento colaborativo","Gerenciar lançamentos de versão com mensagens de commit padronizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки коммитов для изменений кода","Генерация новых функциональных веток для совместной разработки","Управление выпусками версий с стандартизированными сообщениями коммитов"],"ar":["تأتمتة التحقق من التعديلات للتعديلات على الكود","إنشاء فروع ميزة جديدة للتنمية التعاونية","إدارة إصدارات البرامج مع رسائل تعديل معيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Git repository","Does not support complex Git operations like rebase conflict resolution"],"zh":["需要现有的 Git 仓库","不支持诸如 rebase 冲突解决等复杂的 Git 操作"],"ja":["既存のGitリポジトリが必要","rebaseコンフリクト解決などの複雑なGit操作はサポートされません"],"ko":["既存의 Git 저장소가 필요함","rebase 충돌 해결과 같은 복잡한 Git 작업을 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere un repositorio Git existente","No admite operaciones Git complejas como la resolución de conflictos de rebase"],"fr":["Nécessite un référentiel Git existant","Ne prend pas en charge les opérations Git complexes comme la résolution de conflits de rebase"],"de":["Erfordert ein vorhandenes Git-Repository","Unterstützt keine komplexen Git-Operationen wie die Konfliktlösung von Rebase"],"pt":["Exige repositório Git existente","Não suporta operações Git complexas como resolução de conflitos de rebase"],"ru":["Требует существующего репозитория Git","Не поддерживает сложные операции Git, такие как разрешение конфликтов ребейза"],"ar":["يتطلب مخزن جيت موجود","لا يدعم عمليات جيت المعقدة مثل حل النزاعات إعادة التأسيس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('prime399/packmate/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'prime399', 'packmate', 'prime399/packmate', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z', '2026-02-18T13:04:01.102Z', NULL, '{"id":"prime399/packmate/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一款综合设计指南，包含多种样式、色板、字体组合和UX指南，帮助开发者设计出更好的web和移动应用","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、複数のスタイル、カラーパレット、フォントペア、UXガイドラインを含むデザインガイドで、開発者がより優れたWebおよびモバイルアプリを設計するのに役立ちます","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 다수의 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 폰트 조합, UX 가이드라인을 포함하는 디자인 가이드로 개발자가 더 나은 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 설계하도록 도와줍니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles, con 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes.","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles, avec 50+ styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 combinaisons de polices.","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen, mit 50+ Stilen, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen.","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, com 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по проектированию для веб- и мобильных приложений, включающее 50+ стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 комбинаций шрифтов.","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات على الويب والجوال، مع 50+ أسلوب، 97 لوحة ألوان و 57 زوج من الخطوط.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max - 设计智能指南","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max - デザインインテリジェンス","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max - 디자인 인텔리전스 가이드","es":"UI/UX Pro Max: Diseño Inteligente para Aplicaciones","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max : Intelligence de Conception pour Applications","de":"UI/UX Pro Max: Design-Intelligenz für Anwendungen","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max: Design Inteligente para Aplicativos","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max: Интеллектуальное проектирование для веб и ...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max: تصميم ذكاء للتطبيقات","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max是一款综合设计指南，包含多种样式、色板、字体组合和UX指南，帮助开发者设计出更好的web和移动应用","ja":"UI/UX Pro Maxは、複数のスタイル、カラーパレット、フォントペア、UXガイドラインを含むデザインガイドで、開発者がより優れたWebおよびモバイルアプリを設計するのに役立ちます","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max는 다수의 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 폰트 조합, UX 가이드라인을 포함하는 디자인 가이드로 개발자가 더 나은 웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 설계하도록 도와줍니다","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una guía de diseño integral para aplicaciones web y móviles, con 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes.","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un guide de conception complet pour les applications web et mobiles, avec 50+ styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 combinaisons de polices.","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein umfassender Designleitfaden für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen, mit 50+ Stilen, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen.","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max é um guia de design abrangente para aplicações web e móveis, com 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max - это комплексное руководство по проектированию для веб- и мобильных приложений, включающее 50+ стилей, 97 цветовых палитр и 57 комбинаций шриф...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هو دليل تصميم شامل للتطبيقات على الويب والجوال، مع 50+ أسلوب، 97 لوحة ألوان و 57 زوج من الخطوط.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["50+样式","97色板","57字体组合","99UX指南","25种图表类型"],"ja":["50以上のスタイル","97のカラーパレット","57のフォントペア","99のUXガイドライン","25種類のチャートタイプ"],"ko":["50가지 이상의 스타일","97가지 색상 팔레트","57가지 폰트 조합","99가지 UX 가이드라인","25가지 차트 유형"],"es":["50+ estilos de diseño","97 paletas de colores","57 combinaciones de fuentes","99 directrices de UX","25 tipos de gráficos","Búsqueda en base de datos con recomendaciones prioritarias"],"fr":["50+ styles de conception","97 palettes de couleurs","57 combinaisons de polices","99 directives d''UX","25 types de graphiques","Recherche dans la base de données avec des recommandations basées sur les priorités"],"de":["50+ Designstile","97 Farbpaletten","57 Schriftkombinationen","99 UX-Richtlinien","25 Grafiktypen","Datenbank-Suche mit prioritätsbasierten Empfehlungen"],"pt":["50+ estilos de design","97 paletas de cores","57 combinações de fontes","99 diretrizes de UX","25 tipos de gráficos"],"ru":["50+ стилей дизайна","97 цветовых палитр","57 комбинаций шрифтов","99 руководств по UX","25 типов графиков"],"ar":["50+ أسلوب تصميم","97 لوحة ألوان","57 زوج من الخطوط","99 إرشادات UX","25 نوع من الرسوم البيانية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计智能","设计指南","web设计","移动应用设计","设计资源"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","デザインガイド","Webデザイン","モバイルアプリデザイン","デザインリソース"],"ko":["UI 설계","UX 설계","디자인 인텔리전스","디자인 가이드","웹 설계","모바일 애플리케이션 설계","디자인 리소스"],"es":["diseño de interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario","guias de diseño","recomendaciones de diseño","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","UI/UX"],"fr":["conception d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","guides de conception","recommandations de conception","applications web","applications mobiles","UI/UX"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Designleitfäden","Design-Empfehlungen","Web-Anwendungen","Mobile-Anwendungen","UI/UX"],"pt":["design de interface de usuário","experiência de usuário","guias de design","estilos de design","paletas de cores","combinações de fontes"],"ru":["проектирование пользовательского интерфейса","опыт пользователя","руководства по дизайну","стили дизайна","цветовые палитры","комбинации шрифтов"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","خبرات المستخدم","دلائل التصميم","أسلوب التصميم","لوحات الألوان","أزواج الخطوط"]}},"owner":"prime399","repo":"packmate","repoPath":"prime399/packmate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"UI/UX design intelligence. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 9 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind, shadcn/ui). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient. Integrations: shadcn/ui MCP for component search and examples.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing acce","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nComprehensive design guide for web and mobile applications. Contains 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, 57 font pairings, 99 UX guidelines, and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks. Searchable database with priority-based recommendations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Designing new UI components or pages\n- Choosing color palettes and typography\n- Reviewing code for UX issues\n- Building landing pages or dashboards\n- Implementing accessibility requirements\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Domain |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Accessibility | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 2 | Touch & Interaction | CRITICAL | `ux` |\n| 3 | Performance | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 4 | Layout & Responsive | HIGH | `ux` |\n| 5 | Typography & Color | MEDIUM | `typography`, `color` |\n| 6 | Animation | MEDIUM | `ux` |\n| 7 | Style Selection | MEDIUM | `style`, `product` |\n| 8 | Charts & Data | LOW | `chart` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Accessibility (CRITICAL)\n\n- `color-contrast` - Minimum 4.5:1 ratio for normal text\n- `focus-states` - Visible focus rings on interactive elements\n- `alt-text` - Descriptive alt text for meaningful images\n- `aria-labels` - aria-label for icon-only buttons\n- `keyboard-nav` - Tab order matches visual order\n- `form-labels` - Use label with for attribute\n\n### 2. Touch & Interaction (CRITICAL)\n\n- `touch-target-size` - Minimum 44x44px touch targets\n- `hover-vs-tap` - Use click/tap for primary interactions\n- `loading-buttons` - Disable button during async operations\n- `error-feedback` - Clear error messages near problem\n- `cursor-pointer` - Add cursor-pointer to clickable elements\n\n### 3. Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `image-optimization` - Use WebP, srcset, lazy loading\n- `reduced-motion` - Check prefers-reduced-motion\n- `content-jumping` - Reserve space for async content\n\n### 4. Layout & Responsive (HIGH)\n\n- `viewport-meta` - width=device-width initial-scale=1\n- `readable-font-size` - Minimum 16px body text on mobile\n- `horizontal-scroll` - Ensure content fits viewport width\n- `z-index-management` - Define z-index scale (10, 20, 30, 50)\n\n### 5. Typography & Color (MEDIUM)\n\n- `line-height` - Use 1.5-1.75 for body text\n- `line-length` - Limit to 65-75 characters per line\n- `font-pairing` - Match heading/body font personalities\n\n### 6. Animation (MEDIUM)\n\n- `duration-timing` - Use 150-300ms for micro-interactions\n- `transform-performance` - Use transform/opacity, not width/height\n- `loading-states` - Skeleton screens or spinners\n\n### 7. Style Selection (MEDIUM)\n\n- `style-match` - Match style to product type\n- `consistency` - Use same style across all pages\n- `no-emoji-icons` - Use SVG icons, not emojis\n\n### 8. Charts & Data (LOW)\n\n- `chart-type` - Match chart type to data type\n- `color-guidance` - Use accessible color palettes\n- `data-table` - Provide table alternative for accessibility\n\n## How to Use\n\nSearch specific domains using the CLI tool below.\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n**Always start with `--design-system`** to get comprehensive recommendations with reasoning:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system [-p \"Project Name\"]\n```\n\nThis command:\n1. Searches 5 domains in parallel (product, style, color, landing, typography)\n2. Applies reasoning rules from `ui-reasoning.csv` to select best matches\n3. Returns complete design system: pattern, style, colors, typography, effects\n4. Includes anti-patterns to avoid\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n### Step 2b: Persist Design System (Master + Overrides Pattern)\n\nTo save the design system for **hierarchical retrieval across sessions**, add `--persist`:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\"\n```\n\nThis creates:\n- `design-system/MASTER.md` — Global Source of Truth with all design rules\n- `design-system/pages/` — Folder for page-specific overrides\n\n**With page-specific override:**\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<query>\" --design-system --persist -p \"Project Name\" --page \"dashboard\"\n```\n\nThis also creates:\n- `design-system/pages/dashboard.md` — Page-specific deviations from Master\n\n**How hierarchical retrieval works:**\n1. When building a specific page (e.g., \"Checkout\"), first check `design-system/pages/checkout.md`\n2. If the page file exists, its rules **override** the Master file\n3. If not, use `design-system/MASTER.md` exclusively\n\n**Context-aware retrieval prompt:**\n```\nI am building the [Page Name] page. Please read design-system/MASTER.md.\nAlso check if design-system/pages/[page-name].md exists.\nIf the page file exists, prioritize its rules.\nIf not, use the Master rules exclusively.\nNow, generate the code...\n```\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\nAfter getting the design system, use domain searches to get additional details:\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**When to use detailed searches:**\n\n| Need | Domain | Example |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| More style options | `style` | `--domain style \"glassmorphism dark\"` |\n| Chart recommendations | `chart` | `--domain chart \"real-time dashboard\"` |\n| UX best practices | `ux` | `--domain ux \"animation accessibility\"` |\n| Alternative fonts | `typography` | `--domain typography \"elegant luxury\"` |\n| Landing structure | `landing` | `--domain landing \"hero social-proof\"` |\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nGet implementation-specific best practices. If user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`, `shadcn`, `jetpack-compose`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `react` | React/Next.js performance | waterfall, bundle, suspense, memo, rerender, cache |\n| `web` | Web interface guidelines | aria, focus, keyboard, semantic, virtualize |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n| `shadcn` | shadcn/ui components, theming, forms, patterns |\n| `jetpack-compose` | Composables, Modifiers, State Hoisting, Recomposition |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Requirements\n- Product type: Beauty/Spa service\n- Style keywords: elegant, professional, soft\n- Industry: Beauty/Wellness\n- Stack: html-tailwind (default)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Design System (REQUIRED)\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service elegant\" --design-system -p \"Serenity Spa\"\n```\n\n**Output:** Complete design system with pattern, style, colors, typography, effects, and anti-patterns.\n\n### Step 3: Supplement with Detailed Searches (as needed)\n\n```bash\n# Get UX guidelines for animation and accessibility\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# Get alternative typography options if needed\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury serif\" --domain typography\n```\n\n### Step 4: Stack Guidelines\n\n```bash\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive form\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize design system + detailed searches and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\nThe `--design-system` flag supports two output formats:\n\n```bash\n# ASCII box (default) - best for terminal display\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system\n\n# Markdown - best for documentation\npython3 skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"fintech crypto\" --design-system -f markdown\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n- [ ] Use theme colors directly (bg-primary) not var() wrapper\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:04:01.102Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive UI/UX design guidelines for web and mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要全面UI/UX设计指南的前端代理，用于Web和移动应用程序。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがWebおよびモバイルアプリケーションに適した包括的なUI/UXデザインガイドラインを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션에 적합한 포괄적인 UI/UX 디자인 가이드라인이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan directrices de diseño de UI/UX integrales para aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin de lignes directrices de conception UI/UX complètes pour les applications Web et mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die umfassende UI/UX-Designrichtlinien für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que necessitam de diretrizes abrangentes de design de UI/UX para aplicações web e móveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы комплексные рекомендации по дизайну UI/UX для веб- и мобильных приложений.","ar":"เหมาะ لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة لتصميم واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم للويب وتطبيقات الجوال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually appealing interfaces with 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring seamless user experiences through 99 UX guidelines and priority-based recommendations, utilizing searchable databases and implementing accessibility features.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉上吸引人的界面，具有50+样式、97种颜色调色板和57种字体配对，同时通过99个UX指南和基于优先级的建议，利用可搜索的数据库并实现无障碍功能，确保无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントが50以上のスタイル、97のカラーパレット、57のフォントペアを使用して視覚的に魅力的なインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、99のUXガイドラインと優先順位に基づく推奨事項を使用して、検索可能なデータベースを利用し、アクセシビリティ機能を実装し、シームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 50가지 이상의 스타일, 97가지 색상 팔레트 및 57가지 폰트 조합을 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 99개의 UX 가이드라인 및 우선순위 기반 추천을 통해 검색 가능한 데이터베이스를 활용하고 접근성 기능을 구현하여 무결점의 사용자 경험을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces visualmente atractivas con más de 50 estilos, 97 paletas de colores y 57 combinaciones de fuentes, garantizando al mismo tiempo experiencias de usuario sin problemas a través de 99 pautas de UX y recomendaciones basadas en prioridades, utilizando bases de datos buscables e implementando características de accesibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces visuellement attrayantes avec plus de 50 styles, 97 palettes de couleurs et 57 appariements de polices, tout en garantissant des expériences utilisateur sans problème grâce à 99 lignes directrices d''UX et des recommandations basées sur les priorités, en utilisant des bases de données recherchables et en mettant en œuvre des fonctionnalités d''accessibilité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, visuell ansprechende Schnittstellen mit über 50 Stilen, 97 Farbpaletten und 57 Schriftkombinationen zu erstellen, während sie gleichzeitig eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung durch 99 UX-Richtlinien und prioritätsbasierte Empfehlungen gewährleisten, indem sie durchsuchbare Datenbanken nutzen und Zugriffsmöglichkeiten implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces visualmente atraentes com 50+ estilos, 97 paletas de cores e 57 combinações de fontes, garantindo experiências de usuário sem interrupções por meio de 99 diretrizes de UX e recomendações baseadas em prioridade, utilizando bancos de dados pesquisáveis e implementando recursos de acessibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально привлекательные интерфейсы с 50+ стилями, 97 цветовыми палитрами и 57 комбинациями шрифтов, обеспечивая бесперебойные пользовательские trải nghiệm за счет 99 рекомендаций по UX и рекомендаций на основе приоритета, используя поисковые базы данных и реализуя функции доступности.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إنشاء واجهات تجذب البصر بخمسين نمطًا أو أكثر و97 لوحة ألوان و57 زوجًا من خطوط الكتابة، مع ضمان تجارب مستخدم سلسة من خلال 99 إرشادة لتصميم تجربة المستخدم وتوصيات قائمة على الأولوية، باستخدام قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث وتنفيذ ميزات إمكانية الوصول."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive UI components for cross-platform compatibility","Selecting optimal color palettes and typography for brand consistency","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing accessibility features","Building intuitive landing pages and dashboards with 25 chart types","Developing design systems across 9 technology stacks"],"zh":["设计适用于跨平台兼容性的响应式UI组件","选择适合品牌一致性的最佳颜色调色板和字体","审查代码以查找UX问题并实现无障碍功能","使用25种图表类型构建直观的登陆页面和仪表盘","跨9种技术栈开发设计系统"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの互換性のあるレスポンシブUIコンポーネントを設計する","ブランドの統一性に適した最適なカラーパレットとフォントを選択する","コードをレビューしてUXの問題を特定し、アクセシビリティ機能を実装する","25種類のチャートタイプを使用して直感的なランディングページとダッシュボードを構築する","9種類のテクノロジースタックを跨いでデザインシステムを開発する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 반응형 UI 컴포넌트 설계","브랜드 일관성을 위한 최적의 색상 팔레트 및 타이포그래피 선택","UX 문제를 확인하고 접근성 기능을 구현하기 위한 코드 검토","25가지 차트 유형을 사용하여 직관적인 랜딩 페이지 및 대시보드 구축","9가지 기술 스택에 걸친 디자인 시스템 개발"],"es":["Dis