"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 57 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 57 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Leitfaden für die Leistungsoptimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js, com 57 regras para refatoração e geração de código automática.","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для React и Next.js, содержащее 57 правил для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода.","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js، يحتوي على 57 قاعدة لتحسين وتوليد الكود التلقائي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["57 条性能优化规则","8 个类别的优化指南","自动重构和代码生成","优化 React 和 Next.js 应用","提高应用性能和速度","维护由 Vercel"],"ja":["57 のパフォーマンス最適化ルール","8 つのカテゴリの最適化ガイド","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","React と Next.js アプリの最適化","アプリのパフォーマンスと速度の向上","Vercel によるメンテナンス"],"ko":["57개 성능 최적화 규칙","8개 카테고리의 최적화 가이드","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","리액트와 넥스트_js 애플리케이션 최적화","애플리케이션 성능과 속도 향상","버셀에 의한 유지 보수"],"es":["57 reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","8 categorías para priorizar el impacto","Guía para la refactorización automática","Optimización de la generación de código","Mejora del rendimiento de React y Next.js","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones existentes"],"fr":["57 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour prioriser l''impact","Guide pour la refactoring automatisée","Optimisation de la génération de code","Amélioration des performances de React et Next.js","Compatibilité avec les applications existantes"],"de":["57 Regeln zur Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien zur Priorisierung des Einflusses","Leitfaden für die automatisierte Refactoring","Optimierung der Codegenerierung","Verbesserung der Leistung von React und Next.js","Kompatibilität mit bestehenden Anwendungen"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar a refatoração","Guia para implementação de busca de dados","Otimização de código para React e Next.js","Refatoração automática de código","Geração de código automática"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации рефакторинга","Руководство по реализации поиска данных","Оптимизация кода для React и Next.js","Автоматическая рефакторинга кода","Автоматическая генерация кода"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولوية لتحسين الكود","دليل لتنفيذ بحث البيانات","تحسين الكود لتطبيقات React و Next.js","تحسين الكود التلقائي","توليد الكود التلقائي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 应用","Next.js 应用","Vercel"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React アプリ","Next.js アプリ","Vercel"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","리액트 최적화 가이드","넥스트_js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","리액트 애플리케이션","넥스트_js 애플리케이션","버셀"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","rendimiento","optimización"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","performances","optimisation"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Leistung","Optimierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Refatoração de código","Geração de código automática","Desempenho de aplicações","Melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Рефакторинга кода","Автоматическая генерация кода","Производительность приложений","Лучшие практики разработки"],"ar":["Vercel React","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تحسين الكود","توليد الكود التلقائي","أداء التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات لبرمجة"]}},"owner":"prime399","repo":"packmate","repoPath":"prime399/packmate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:04:43.017Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js development, seeking to enhance application performance and follow best practices.","zh":"非常适合专注于React和Next.js开发的前端代理，寻求提高应用程序性能并遵循最佳实践。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsの開発に特化したフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させ、ベストプラクティスに従うことを目指しています。","ko":"React와 Next.js 개발에 특화된 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 애플리케이션 성능을 향상시키고 최선의 실践을 따르려고 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend especializados en desarrollo de React y Next.js, que buscan mejorar el rendimiento de las aplicaciones y seguir las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend spécialisés dans le développement React et Next.js, cherchant à améliorer les performances des applications et à suivre les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die auf React- und Next.js-Entwicklung spezialisiert sind und die Anwendungsleistung verbessern sowie Best Practices befolgen möchten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em desenvolvimento React e Next.js, que buscam melhorar o desempenho da aplicação e seguir as melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке React и Next.js, стремящихся повысить производительность приложения и следовать лучшим практикам.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين ي专ون في تطوير React و Next.js ، يسعون لتعزيز أداء التطبيق واتباع أفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React and Next.js applications with 57 prioritized rules across 8 categories, facilitating automated refactoring, code generation, and performance enhancement through data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理优化React和Next.js应用程序的能力，跨8个类别有57个优先规则，促进自动重构、代码生成和性能增强，通过使用Vercel指南的数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"ReactとNext.jsアプリケーションを最適化するためのエージェントをEmpowerすることができます。8つのカテゴリにわたる57の優先順位付けられたルールがあり、Vercelのガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドル最適化による自動リファクタリング、コード生成、およびパフォーマンスの向上を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션을 최적화하는 데 필요한 능력을 제공하여, 8개 카테고리에서 57개의 우선순위가 지정된 규칙을 통해 자동 리팩토링, 코드 생성 및 성능 향상을 촉진하며, Vercel 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 통해 성능을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React y Next.js con 57 reglas priorizadas en 8 categorías, facilitando la refactorización automatizada, la generación de código y la mejora del rendimiento a través de la optimización de la recuperación de datos y la agrupación utilizando las pautas de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React et Next.js avec 57 règles priorisées dans 8 catégories, facilitant la refactorisation automatisée, la génération de code et l''amélioration des performances grâce à l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du regroupement en utilisant les directives Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React- und Next.js-Anwendungen mit 57 priorisierten Regeln in 8 Kategorien zu optimieren, wodurch die automatisierte Refaktorierung, Codegenerierung und Leistungssteigerung durch Datenabruf- und Bündeloptimierung unter Verwendung der Vercel-Richtlinien erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicativos React e Next.js com 57 regras priorizadas em 8 categorias, facilitando a refatoração automatizada, geração de código e melhoria de desempenho por meio da otimização da captura de dados e do empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React и Next.js с 57 приоритизированными правилами в 8 категориях, облегчая автоматическую рефакторинг, генерацию кода и повышение производительности путем оптимизации извлечения данных и пакетирования с использованием руководств Vercel.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحسين تطبيقات React و Next.js مع 57 قاعدة ذات أولوية في 8 فئات ، مما يسهل إعادة هيكلة التطبيق التلقائي وإنشاء الكود وتحسين الأداء من خلال تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين الحزمة باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues in React components","Generating optimized Next.js pages with server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React codebases for better performance and maintainability","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies for client and server-side rendering"],"zh":["为React组件的性能问题自动化代码审查","使用服务器端渲染生成优化的Next.js页面","重构现有的React代码库以获得更好的性能和可维护性","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取策略"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのパフォーマンス問題の自動コードレビュー","サーバーサイドレンダリングを使用して最適化されたNext.jsページを生成する","既存のReactコードベースをリファクタリングして、パフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのレンダリングのための効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트의 성능 문제에 대한 자동 코드 리뷰","서버 사이드 렌더링을 사용하여 최적화된 Next.js 페이지 생성","기존 React 코드베이스를 리팩토링하여 성능과 유지 보수성을 향상시키기","클라이언트 사이드와 서버 사이드 렌더링을 위한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략 구현"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento en componentes de React","Generar páginas de Next.js optimizadas con renderizado del lado del servidor","Refactorizar las bases de código de React existentes para un mejor rendimiento y mantenibilidad","Implementar estrategias de recuperación de datos eficientes para renderizado del lado del cliente y del servidor"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances dans les composants React","Générer des pages Next.js optimisées avec un rendu côté serveur","Refactoriser les bases de code React existantes pour une meilleure performance et maintenabilité","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de récupération de données efficaces pour le rendu côté client et côté serveur"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme in React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimierten Next.js-Seiten mit Server-seitigem Rendering","Refaktorisieren bestehender React-Codebasen für bessere Leistung und Wartbarkeit","Implementieren effizienter Datenabrufstrategien für Client- und Server-seitiges Rendering"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho em componentes React","Gerar páginas Next.js otimizadas com renderização no lado do servidor","Refatorar bases de código React existentes para melhor desempenho e manutenibilidade","Implementar estratégias de captura de dados eficientes para renderização no lado do cliente e do servidor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью в компонентах React","Генерировать оптимизированные страницы Next.js с серверной отрисовкой","Пересмотреть существующие базы кода React для лучшей производительности и поддерживаемости","Реализовать эффективные стратегии извлечения данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في استعراض الشفرة لمشاكل الأداء في مكونات React","генерировать صفحات Next.js المُحسّنة مع تقديم الخادم","إعادة هيكلة قواعد الشفرة الحالية React من أجل أداء أفضل وقابلية الصيانة","تنفيذ استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات الفعالة للعرض على جانب العميل والخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel or using similar deployment strategies"],"zh":["需要熟悉React和Next.js生态系统","仅限于托管在Vercel或使用类似部署策略的应用程序"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsのエコシステムに精通している必要がある","Vercelまたは同等のデプロイ戦略を使用するアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React와 Next.js 생태계에 대한熟悉도가 필요","Vercel 또는 유사한 배포 전략을 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con los 