ных среды","Интеграция с Wrangler"],"ar":["تطوير الحواف","تحسين الأداء العالمي","أنماط وقيود محددة","دعم متغيرات البيئة","التكامل مع Wrangler"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers","Cloudflare Workers"],"es":["Cloudflare Workers","Desarrollo de edge","Rendimiento global","Patrones y restricciones","Variables de entorno","Desarrollo local","Producción con Wrangler"],"fr":["Cloudflare Workers","Développement de pointe","Rendement global","Modèles et contraintes","Variables d''environnement","Développement local","Production avec Wrangler"],"de":["Cloudflare Workers","Edge-Entwicklung","Globale Performance","Spezifische Muster und Einschränkungen","Umgebungsvariablen","Lokale Entwicklung","Produktion mit Wrangler"],"pt":["trabalhadores cloudflare","desenvolvimento de edge","melhoria do desempenho","variáveis de ambiente","wrangler","cloud computing"],"ru":["работники cloudflare","разработка на краю","улучшение производительности","переменные среды","wrangler","облачные вычисления"],"ar":["عمال كلاودفلير","تطوير الحواف","تحسين الأداء","متغيرات البيئة","wrangler","حوسبة سحابية"]}},"owner":"captjay98","repo":"livestockai","repoPath":"captjay98/livestockai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Cloudflare Workers","description":"Edge deployment patterns and Cloudflare-specific considerations for LivestockAI","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Workers\n\nLivestockAI is deployed on Cloudflare Workers for global edge performance. This skill covers Workers-specific patterns and constraints.\n\n## Key Constraints\n\n### No `process.env`\n\nCloudflare Workers does NOT support `process.env`. Environment variables come from:\n\n- **Local dev**: `.dev.vars` file\n- **Production**: Wrangler secrets\n\n```bash\n# .dev.vars (local)\nDATABASE_URL=postgres://...\nBETTER_AUTH_SECRET=...\n\n# Production secrets\nwrangler secret put DATABASE_URL\nwrangler s","body":"# Cloudflare Workers\n\nLivestockAI is deployed on Cloudflare Workers for global edge performance. This skill covers Workers-specific patterns and constraints.\n\n## Key Constraints\n\n### No `process.env`\n\nCloudflare Workers does NOT support `process.env`. Environment variables come from:\n\n- **Local dev**: `.dev.vars` file\n- **Production**: Wrangler secrets\n\n```bash\n# .dev.vars (local)\nDATABASE_URL=postgres://...\nBETTER_AUTH_SECRET=...\n\n# Production secrets\nwrangler secret put DATABASE_URL\nwrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET\n```\n\n### Dynamic Imports Required\n\nDatabase and auth modules must use dynamic imports in server functions:\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Correct - works on Workers\nexport const fn = createServerFn().handler(async () => {\n  const { getDb } = await import(''~/lib/db'')\n  const db = await getDb()\n  // ...\n})\n\n// ❌ Wrong - fails on Workers\nimport { db } from ''~/lib/db''\n```\n\n### Memory Limits\n\nWorkers have a 128MB memory limit. For large operations:\n\n- Stream responses instead of buffering\n- Paginate database queries\n- Avoid loading large datasets into memory\n\n## Configuration\n\nThe `wrangler.jsonc` file configures the Worker:\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"livestockai\",\n  \"compatibility_date\": \"2024-01-01\",\n  \"compatibility_flags\": [\"nodejs_compat\"],\n  \"main\": \"./dist/server/index.mjs\",\n}\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to production\nbun run deploy\n# or\nwrangler deploy\n\n# Preview deployment\nwrangler deploy --env preview\n\n# View logs\nwrangler tail\n```\n\n## MCP Servers for Cloudflare\n\nThe `devops-engineer` agent has access to Cloudflare MCP servers:\n\n| Server                     | Purpose                    |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `cloudflare-bindings`      | Manage Workers, KV, R2, D1 |\n| `cloudflare-builds`        | Deployment status and logs |\n| `cloudflare-observability` | Worker logs and debugging  |\n| `cloudflare-docs`          | Documentation search       |\n\nOther agents should delegate Cloudflare tasks to `devops-engineer`.\n\n## Common Issues\n\n### \"Cannot find module\" errors\n\nUse dynamic imports for database connections:\n\n```typescript\nconst { getDb } = await import(''~/lib/db'')\nconst db = await getDb()\n```\n\n### Cold start latency\n\nMinimize bundle size and avoid heavy initialization code.\n\n### Environment variable access\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Works - uses getDb() which handles env detection\nconst { getDb } = await import(''~/lib/db'')\nconst db = await getDb()\n\n// ❌ Fails - process.env not available\nconst url = process.env.DATABASE_URL\n```\n\n## Request Flow\n\n```\nBrowser → Cloudflare CDN → Worker → TanStack Start → Server Functions → Neon PostgreSQL\n```\n\n## Static Assets\n\nStatic assets are served from Cloudflare''s CDN automatically. The `public/` directory contents are deployed alongside the Worker.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `neon-database` - Database connection patterns\n- `dynamic-imports` - Why dynamic imports are required\n- `tanstack-start` - Server function patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:04:58.965Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Edge Compute Agents requiring low-latency, globally distributed application deployment via Cloudflare Workers","zh":"适用于需要低延迟、全球分布式应用程序部署的 Edge Compute Agents，通过 Cloudflare Workers 实现","ja":"低遅延、グローバルに分散されたアプリケーションを Cloudflare Workers を介してデプロイするエッジコンピューティングエージェントに最適","ko":"클라우드플레어 워커스를 통해 낮은 지연 시간 및 글로벌 분산 애플리케이션 배포가 필요한 에지 컴퓨팅 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Computación de Borde que requieren una implementación de aplicaciones de baja latencia y distribuidas a nivel global a través de Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de calcul de bord nécessitant un déploiement d''applications à faible latence et distribué à l''échelle mondiale via Cloudflare Workers","de":"Ideal für Edge-Compute-Agents, die eine low-latency- und global verteilte Anwendungsimplementierung über Cloudflare Workers erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Computação de Borda que exigem implantação de aplicativos de baixa latência e distribuídos globalmente via Cloudflare Workers","ru":"Идеально подходит для एजентских компьютеров Edge, требующих низкой задержки и глобально распределенного развертывания приложений через Cloudflare Workers","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الحاسوبيين الحد الأقصى الذين يتطلبون توزيع تطبيق عالمي منخفض التأخير عبر Cloudflare Workers"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Cloudflare''s edge network for serverless computing, utilizing Wrangler secrets for secure environment variable management and optimizing performance with Workers-specific patterns","zh":"赋予代理利用 Cloudflare 的边缘网络进行无服务器计算，使用 Wrangler 秘钥进行安全的环境变量管理，并通过 Workers 特定的模式优化性能","ja":"エージェントが Cloudflare のエッジネットワークを使用してサーバーレスコンピューティングを行い、Wrangler シークレットを使用して安全な環境変数管理を行い、Workers 固有のパターンを使用してパフォーマンスを最適化する","ko":"에이전트가 클라우드플레어의 에지 네트워크를 사용하여 서버리스 컴퓨팅을 수행하고 Wrangler 비밀을 사용하여 안전한 환경 변수 관리를 하며 Workers 전용 패턴을 사용하여 성능을 최적화하는 것을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la red de borde de Cloudflare para la informática sin servidor, utilizando secretos de Wrangler para una gestión segura de variables de entorno y optimizando el rendimiento con patrones específicos de Workers","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter le réseau de bord de Cloudflare pour le calcul sans serveur, en utilisant des secrets Wrangler pour une gestion sécurisée des variables d''environnement et en optimisant les performances avec des modèles spécifiques à Workers","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das Edge-Netzwerk von Cloudflare für serverlose Computing zu nutzen, indem Wrangler-Geheimnisse für eine sichere Umgebungsvariableverwaltung verwendet werden und die Leistung mit Workers-spezifischen Mustern optimiert wird","pt":"Habilita agentes a aproveitar a rede de borda da Cloudflare para computação sem servidor, utilizando segredos do Wrangler para gerenciamento seguro de variáveis de ambiente e otimizando o desempenho com padrões específicos do Workers","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать сеть Edge от Cloudflare для серверless-вычислений, используя секреты Wrangler для безопасного управления переменными окружения и оптимизации производительности с помощью шаблонов, специфичных для Workers","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستفادة من شبكة الحد الأقصى من Cloudflare للحوسبة بدون خادم، باستخدام أسرار Wrangler لإدارة متغيرات البيئة بشكل آمن وتحسين الأداء باستخدام أنماط محددة لموظفي Cloudflare"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying serverless applications at the edge","Implementing performant content delivery networks (CDNs)","Developing scalable, low-latency APIs with Cloudflare Workers"],"zh":["在边缘部署无服务器应用程序","实现高性能内容分发网络（CDN）","使用 Cloudflare Workers 开发可扩展、低延迟的 API"],"ja":["エッジでサーバーレスアプリケーションをデプロイする","高パフォーマンスのコンテンツ配信ネットワーク（CDN）を実装する","Cloudflare Workers を使用してスケーラブルで低遅延の API を開発する"],"ko":["에지에서 서버리스 애플리케이션을 배포하는 것","고성능 콘텐츠 배포 네트워크(CDN)를 구현하는 것","클라우드플레어 워커스를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 낮은 지연 시간의 API를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de aplicaciones sin servidor en el borde","Implementación de redes de entrega de contenido de alto rendimiento (CDNs)","Desarrollo de API escalables y de baja latencia con Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Déploiement d''applications sans serveur au niveau du bord","Mise en œuvre de réseaux de distribution de contenu performants (CDN)","Développement d''API évolutives et à faible latence avec Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Bereitstellung von serverlosen Anwendungen am Rand","Implementierung von leistungsstarken Content Delivery Networks (CDNs)","Entwicklung von skalierbaren, low-latency-APIs mit Cloudflare Workers"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações sem servidor na borda","Implementação de redes de entrega de conteúdo de alto desempenho (CDNs)","Desenvolvimento de APIs escaláveis e de baixa latência com Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Развертывание серверless-приложений на Edge","Реализация высокопроизводительных контент-доставочных сетей (CDN)","Разработка масштабируемых и низко-задержечных API с помощью Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات بدون خادم على الحد الأقصى","تنفيذ شبكات توصيل المحتوى عالية الأداء (CDN)","تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات قابلة للتطوير ومنخفضة التأخير باستخدام موظفي Cloudflare"]},"limitations":{"en":["No support for `process.env`","Requires Wrangler secrets for environment variable management","Dependent on Cloudflare Workers platform"],"zh":["不支持 `process.env`","需要 Wrangler 秘钥进行环境变量管理","依赖于 Cloudflare Workers 平台"],"ja":["`process.env` はサポートされていない","Wrangler シークレットが環境変数管理に必要","Cloudflare Workers プラットフォームに依存する"],"ko":["`process.env`를 지원하지 않음","Wrangler 비밀이 환경 변수 관리에 필요","클라우드플레어 워커스 플랫폼에 의존"],"es":["No hay soporte para `process.env`","Requiere secretos de Wrangler para la gestión de variables de entorno","Dependiente de la plataforma Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Pas de prise en charge de `process.env`","Nécessite des secrets Wrangler pour la gestion des variables d''environnement","Dépendant de la plate-forme Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Keine Unterstützung für `process.env`","Benötigt Wrangler-Geheimnisse für die Verwaltung von Umgebungsvariablen","Abhängig von der Cloudflare-Workers-Plattform"],"pt":["Sem suporte para `process.env`","Exige segredos do Wrangler para gerenciamento de variáveis de ambiente","Dependente da plataforma Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Нет поддержки для `process.env`","Требует секретов Wrangler для управления переменными окружения","Зависит от платформы Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["لا يدعم `process.env`","يتطلب أسرار Wrangler لإدارة متغيرات البيئة","يعتمد على منصة موظفي Cloudflare"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
