vidad con PowerShell"],"fr":["Modèles critiques pour Windows PowerShell","Règles de syntaxe pour les opérateurs logiques","Restrictions d''Unicode et d''emojis","Conseils pour éviter les erreurs courantes","Amélioration de la productivité avec PowerShell"],"de":["Kritische Muster für Windows PowerShell","Syntaxregeln für logische Operatoren","Unicode- und Emoji-Einschränkungen","Tipps zur Vermeidung häufiger Fehler","Steigerung der Produktivität mit PowerShell"],"pt":["Padrões de sintaxe de operadores","Restrições de unicode e emoji","Melhores práticas para escrita de scripts","Erros comuns e como evitá-los","Otimização de workflow de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Шаблоны синтаксиса операторов","Ограничения юникода и эмодзи","Лучшие практики для написания скриптов","Распространенные ошибки и как их избегать","Оптимизация рабочего процесса разработки"],"ar":["نماذج بناء العوامل","قيود يونيكود والایموجی","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة السكريبتات","الأخطاء الشائعة وكيفية تجنبها","تحسين تدفق عمل التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PowerShell Windows","Antigravity IDE","配置文件转换","运算符语法","Unicode 限制","PowerShell 脚本","开发最佳实践"],"ja":["PowerShell Windows","Antigravity IDE","構成ファイル変換","演算子構文","Unicode 制限","PowerShell スクリプト","開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["PowerShell Windows","Antigravity IDE","구성 파일 변환","연산자 구문","유니코드 제한","PowerShell 스크립트","개발 모범 사례"],"es":["PowerShell","Windows PowerShell","patrones de PowerShell","reglas de sintaxis","restricciones de Unicode","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas","scripting en Windows"],"fr":["PowerShell","Windows PowerShell","modèles PowerShell","règles de syntaxe","restrictions d''Unicode","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches","scripting sous Windows"],"de":["PowerShell","Windows PowerShell","PowerShell-Muster","Syntaxregeln","Unicode-Einschränkungen","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Skripting unter Windows"],"pt":["PowerShell Windows","Padrões de sintaxe","Desenvolvimento de software","Automatização de tarefas","Melhores práticas","Erros comuns","Otimização de workflow"],"ru":["PowerShell Windows","Шаблоны синтаксиса","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизация задач","Лучшие практики","Распространенные ошибки","Оптимизация рабочего процесса"],"ar":["PowerShell النوافذ","نماذج البناء","تطوير البرمجيات","تأهيل المهام","أفضل الممارسات","الأخطاء الشائعة","تحسين تدفق العمل"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"powershell-windows","description":"PowerShell Windows patterns. Critical pitfalls, operator syntax, error handling.","bodyPreview":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRIT","body":"# PowerShell Windows Patterns\n\n> Critical patterns and pitfalls for Windows PowerShell.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Operator Syntax Rules\n\n### CRITICAL: Parentheses Required\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `if (Test-Path \"a\" -or Test-Path \"b\")` | `if ((Test-Path \"a\") -or (Test-Path \"b\"))` |\n| `if (Get-Item $x -and $y -eq 5)` | `if ((Get-Item $x) -and ($y -eq 5))` |\n\n**Rule:** Each cmdlet call MUST be in parentheses when using logical operators.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Unicode/Emoji Restriction\n\n### CRITICAL: No Unicode in Scripts\n\n| Purpose | ❌ Don''t Use | ✅ Use |\n|---------|-------------|--------|\n| Success | ✅ ✓ | [OK] [+] |\n| Error | ❌ ✗ 🔴 | [!] [X] |\n| Warning | ⚠️ 🟡 | [*] [WARN] |\n| Info | ℹ️ 🔵 | [i] [INFO] |\n| Progress | ⏳ | [...] |\n\n**Rule:** Use ASCII characters only in PowerShell scripts.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Null Check Patterns\n\n### Always Check Before Access\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `$array.Count -gt 0` | `$array -and $array.Count -gt 0` |\n| `$text.Length` | `if ($text) { $text.Length }` |\n\n---\n\n## 4. String Interpolation\n\n### Complex Expressions\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `\"Value: $($obj.prop.sub)\"` | Store in variable first |\n\n**Pattern:**\n```\n$value = $obj.prop.sub\nWrite-Output \"Value: $value\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Error Handling\n\n### ErrorActionPreference\n\n| Value | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| Stop | Development (fail fast) |\n| Continue | Production scripts |\n| SilentlyContinue | When errors expected |\n\n### Try/Catch Pattern\n\n- Don''t return inside try block\n- Use finally for cleanup\n- Return after try/catch\n\n---\n\n## 6. File Paths\n\n### Windows Path Rules\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Literal path | `C:\\Users\\User\\file.txt` |\n| Variable path | `Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE \"file.txt\"` |\n| Relative | `Join-Path $ScriptDir \"data\"` |\n\n**Rule:** Use Join-Path for cross-platform safety.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Array Operations\n\n### Correct Patterns\n\n| Operation | Syntax |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Empty array | `$array = @()` |\n| Add item | `$array += $item` |\n| ArrayList add | `$list.Add($item) | Out-Null` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. JSON Operations\n\n### CRITICAL: Depth Parameter\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |\n|----------|-----------|\n| `ConvertTo-Json` | `ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10` |\n\n**Rule:** Always specify `-Depth` for nested objects.\n\n### File Operations\n\n| Operation | Pattern |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Read | `Get-Content \"file.json\" -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json` |\n| Write | `$data | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Out-File \"file.json\" -Encoding UTF8` |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Common Errors\n\n| Error Message | Cause | Fix |\n|---------------|-------|-----|\n| \"parameter ''or''\" | Missing parentheses | Wrap cmdlets in () |\n| \"Unexpected token\" | Unicode character | Use ASCII only |\n| \"Cannot find property\" | Null object | Check null first |\n| \"Cannot convert\" | Type mismatch | Use .ToString() |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Script Template\n\n```powershell\n# Strict mode\nSet-StrictMode -Version Latest\n$ErrorActionPreference = \"Continue\"\n\n# Paths\n$ScriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Path\n\n# Main\ntry {\n    # Logic here\n    Write-Output \"[OK] Done\"\n    exit 0\n}\ncatch {\n    Write-Warning \"Error: $_\"\n    exit 1\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** PowerShell has unique syntax rules. Parentheses, ASCII-only, and null checks are non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:05:23.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced Windows PowerShell scripting capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级Windows PowerShell脚本编写能力的自动化代理。","ja":"Windows PowerShellの高度なスクリプト作成機能を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Windows PowerShell 스크립팅 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de scripting en Windows PowerShell.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation ayant besoin de capacités avancées de script Windows PowerShell.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungs-Agents, die erweiterte Windows PowerShell-Skriptfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de script em Windows PowerShell.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым требуются расширенные возможности скриптинга Windows PowerShell.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatiون الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات برمجة Windows PowerShell المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust PowerShell scripts using critical patterns and pitfalls, including proper operator syntax rules and Unicode/Emoji restrictions, ensuring seamless execution on Windows environments.","zh":"赋予代理编写强大的PowerShell脚本的能力，包括关键模式和陷阱，例如正确的运算符语法规则和Unicode/Emoji限制，确保在Windows环境中无缝执行。","ja":"エージェントが重要なパターンや落とし穴を含む強力なPowerShellスクリプトを記述できるようにし、正しい演算子構文ルールやUnicode/Emojiの制限などを含め、Windows環境でのシームレスな実行を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 중요한 패턴 및 함정 등을 포함한 강력한 PowerShell 스크립트를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 올바른 연산자 구문 규칙 및 유니코드/이모지 제한 등을 포함하여 Windows 환경에서 무중단 실행을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes escribir scripts de PowerShell robustos utilizando patrones críticos y evitando errores comunes, incluyendo reglas de sintaxis de operadores adecuadas y restricciones Unicode/Emoji, garantizando una ejecución sin problemas en entornos Windows.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire des scripts PowerShell robustes en utilisant des modèles critiques et en évitant les pièges, y compris les règles de syntaxe des opérateurs appropriées et les restrictions Unicode/Emoji, assurant une exécution transparente sur les environnements Windows.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, robuste PowerShell-Skripte zu schreiben, indem kritische Muster und Fallstricke verwendet werden, einschließlich korrekter Operatorsyntax-Regeln und Unicode/Emoji-Einschränkungen, um eine nahtlose Ausführung in Windows-Umgebungen zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escrever scripts PowerShell robustos usando padrões críticos e armadilhas, incluindo regras de sintaxe de operador adequadas e restrições de Unicode/Emoji, garantindo execução sem problemas em ambientes Windows.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные скрипты PowerShell, используя критические шаблоны и подводные камни, включая правильные правила синтаксиса операторов и ограничения Unicode/Emoji, обеспечивая бесперебойную работу в средах Windows.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على كتابة برامج نصية PowerShell قوية باستخدام أنماط حرجة وألغام، بما في ذلك قواعد بناء الجملة للمشغلين والقيود الخاصة ب Unicode/Emoji ، مما يضمن التنفيذ السلس في بيئات Windows."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex PowerShell scripts","Automating Windows system administration tasks","Validating PowerShell syntax for logical operators"],"zh":["调试复杂的PowerShell脚本","自动执行Windows系统管理任务","验证PowerShell逻辑运算符的语法"],"ja":["複雑なPowerShellスクリプトのデバッグ","Windowsシステム管理タスクの自動化","PowerShell論理演算子の構文の検証"],"ko":["복잡한 PowerShell 스크립트의 디버깅","Windows 시스템 관리 작업의 자동화","PowerShell 논리 연산자의 구문 확인"],"es":["Depuración de scripts complejos de PowerShell","Automatización de tareas de administración del sistema Windows","Validación de sintaxis de PowerShell para operadores lógicos"],"fr":["Débogage de scripts PowerShell complexes","Automatisation des tâches d''administration du système Windows","Validation de la syntaxe PowerShell pour les opérateurs logiques"],"de":["Debuggen komplexer PowerShell-Skripte","Automatisieren von Windows-Systemadministrationsaufgaben","Validieren der PowerShell-Syntax für logische Operatoren"],"pt":["Depuração de scripts PowerShell complexos","Automatização de tarefas de administração do sistema Windows","Validação da sintaxe PowerShell para operadores lógicos"],"ru":["Отладка сложных скриптов PowerShell","Автоматизация задач администрирования системы Windows","Проверка синтаксиса PowerShell для логических операторов"],"ar":["调试 برامج نصية PowerShell معقدة","أتمتة مهام إدارة النظام في Windows","تحديد بناء الجملة الخاص ب PowerShell للمشغلين المنطقيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows environment","PowerShell compatibility required","Parentheses mandatory for cmdlet calls with logical operators"],"zh":["需要Windows环境","需要PowerShell兼容性","逻辑运算符的cmdlet调用需要括号"],"ja":["Windows環境が必要","PowerShellの互換性が必要","論理演算子のcmdlet呼び出しには括弧が必要"],"ko":["Windows 환경이 필요합니다.","PowerShell 호환성이 필요합니다.","논리 연산자의 cmdlet 호출에는 괄호가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno Windows","Se requiere compatibilidad con PowerShell","Paréntesis obligatorios para llamadas a cmdlets con operadores lógicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Windows","Compatibilité PowerShell requise","Parenthèses obligatoires pour les appels de cmdlets avec des opérateurs logiques"],"de":["Erfordert eine Windows-Umgebung","PowerShell-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Runde Klammern sind für Cmdlet-Aufrufe mit logischen Operatoren obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Windows","Compatibilidade com PowerShell necessária","Parênteses obrigatórios para chamadas de cmdlet com operadores lógicos"],"ru":["Требуется среда Windows","Требуется совместимость с PowerShell","Скобки обязательны для вызовов cmdlet с логическими операторами"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Windows","مطلوب التوافق مع PowerShell","الاقواس مطلوبة لاستدعاءات cmdlet مع المشغلين المنطقيين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
