guração","Suporte a configurações globais e locais","Customização do comportamento do Kiro para fluxos de trabalho específicos"],"ru":["Интерактивное создание агентов в Kiro CLI","Создание агентов через CLI","Ручное создание файлов конфигурации JSON","Поддержка глобальных и локальных конфигураций","Настройка поведения Kiro для конкретных рабочих процессов"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء تفاعلي في كيرو CLI","إنشاء وكلاء عبر CLI","إنشاء ملفات تهيئة JSON يدويا","دعم التهيئات العامه والمحلية","تعديل سلوك كيرو لسير العمل المحدد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kiro 自定义代理","JSON 配置文件","工作流程优化","Kiro CLI","代理配置","自定义行为"],"ja":["Kiro カスタム エージェント","JSON 構成ファイル","ワークフロー最適化","Kiro CLI","エージェント構成","カスタマイズ動作"],"ko":["Kiro 커스텀 에이전트","JSON 구성 파일","워크플로우 최적화","Kiro CLI","에이전트 구성","사용자 정의 동작"],"es":["agentes personalizados de Kiro","configuración de Kiro","flujos de trabajo personalizados","JSON","Kiro CLI","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["agents personnalisés Kiro","configuration de Kiro","flux de travail personnalisés","JSON","Kiro CLI","développement de logiciels"],"de":["benutzerdefinierte Kiro-Agenten","Kiro-Konfiguration","benutzerdefinierte Workflows","JSON","Kiro-CLI","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Kiro CLI","agentes personalizados","configuração JSON","fluxos de trabalho","customização","desenvolvimento","programação","tecnologia"],"ru":["Kiro CLI","кастомные агенты","файлы конфигурации JSON","рабочие процессы","настройка","разработка","программирование","технологии"],"ar":["كيرو CLI","وكلاء مخصصة","ملفات تهيئة JSON","سير العمل","تعديل","تطوير","برمجة","تكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"tkykenmt","repo":"opensearch-feature-explorer","repoPath":"tkykenmt/opensearch-feature-explorer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kiro-custom-agents","description":"Create and configure Kiro CLI custom agents (JSON config files). Use when user asks to create a kiro agent, make a custom agent, configure agent tools, set up MCP servers in an agent, add hooks to an agent, troubleshoot agent config, or any task involving kiro-cli agent JSON configuration, tool permissions, resources, hooks, steering, MCP integration, or code intelligence setup.","bodyPreview":"# Kiro Custom Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide for creating and configuring Kiro CLI custom agents — JSON configuration files that customize Kiro''s behavior for specific workflows.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nCreate an agent interactively in a Kiro CLI session:\n\n```\n/agent generate\n```\n\nOr via CLI:\n\n```bash\nkiro-cli agent create --name my-agent\n```\n\nOr manually create a JSON file:\n- Global: `~/.kiro/agents/<name>.json`\n- Local (project): `.kiro/agents/<name>.json`\n\nMinimal agent:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-agent\",","body":"# Kiro Custom Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide for creating and configuring Kiro CLI custom agents — JSON configuration files that customize Kiro''s behavior for specific workflows.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nCreate an agent interactively in a Kiro CLI session:\n\n```\n/agent generate\n```\n\nOr via CLI:\n\n```bash\nkiro-cli agent create --name my-agent\n```\n\nOr manually create a JSON file:\n- Global: `~/.kiro/agents/<name>.json`\n- Local (project): `.kiro/agents/<name>.json`\n\nMinimal agent:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-agent\",\n  \"description\": \"A custom agent for my workflow\",\n  \"tools\": [\"read\", \"write\"],\n  \"allowedTools\": [\"read\"],\n  \"resources\": [\"file://README.md\"],\n  \"prompt\": \"You are a helpful coding assistant\"\n}\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the agent''s purpose and target workflow\n2. Determine which tools are needed (`tools`) and which to pre-approve (`allowedTools`)\n3. Identify MCP servers if external tools are needed\n4. Choose resources to load (files, skills, knowledge bases)\n5. Add hooks for dynamic context or validation\n6. Configure tool restrictions via `toolsSettings`\n7. Write the JSON config file\n8. Test: `/agent list` → `/agent swap <name>` → `/tools` → test workflows\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n**tools**: What the agent CAN use. `\"*\"` = all, `\"@builtin\"` = built-in only, `\"@server\"` = all from MCP server.\n\n**allowedTools**: What runs WITHOUT permission prompts. Supports glob patterns (`@server/read_*`, `@builtin`). Does NOT support `\"*\"`.\n\n**toolAliases**: Remap tool names to resolve naming collisions or create intuitive names.\n\n**resources**: Context loaded at startup. `file://` = immediate, `skill://` = on-demand, `knowledgeBase` = indexed search.\n\n**hooks**: Commands at lifecycle points. `agentSpawn`, `userPromptSubmit`, `preToolUse` (can block), `postToolUse`, `stop`.\n\n**steering**: NOT auto-included in custom agents. Add explicitly: `\"resources\": [\"file://.kiro/steering/**/*.md\"]`\n\n## Updating This Skill\n\nReference files have `Source: <URL>` headers linking to official Kiro docs. To check for updates:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/fetch_docs.py --diff   # Check which sources changed\npython3 scripts/fetch_docs.py          # Fetch and save raw HTML to references/raw/\n```\n\nAfter fetching, compare `references/raw/*.html` against existing `references/*.md` files and update the summaries as needed. Each reference file is a curated summary — not a raw copy — so review changes before updating.\n\n## References\n\n- **Full config schema**: See [references/configuration-reference.md](references/configuration-reference.md) for all fields, patterns, and best practices\n- **Working examples**: See [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) for AWS, dev workflow, code review, project-specific, and remote MCP agents\n- **Hooks**: See [references/hooks.md](references/hooks.md) for hook types, matchers, exit codes, MCP examples, and use cases\n- **MCP setup**: See [references/mcp.md](references/mcp.md) for MCP server configuration (CLI, mcp.json, agent config, remote)\n- **Steering**: See [references/steering.md](references/steering.md) for steering file scope, team steering, custom files, and integration with agents\n- **Code intelligence**: See [references/code-intelligence.md](references/code-intelligence.md) for LSP setup, pattern search/rewrite, `/code` commands, and language server usage\n- **Context management**: See [references/context.md](references/context.md) for agent resources, session context, knowledge bases, and compaction\n- **Subagents**: See [references/subagents.md](references/subagents.md) for subagent tool availability, `availableAgents`/`trustedAgents` config, and usage\n- **Prompts**: See [references/prompts.md](references/prompts.md) for `/prompts` commands, MCP prompt arguments, and storage priority\n- **Images**: See [references/images.md](references/images.md) for image input methods, supported formats, and use cases\n- **Troubleshooting**: See [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) for common issues and testing checklist\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:05:35.921Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI Agents needing customized workflow automation through JSON configuration files.","zh":"适用于需要通过JSON配置文件自定义工作流自动化的CLI代理。","ja":"CLIエージェントがJSON構成ファイルを介してワークフローの自動化をカスタマイズする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"JSON 구성 파일을 통해 워크플로 자동화를 사용자 지정해야 하는 CLI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de CLI que necesitan automatización de flujo de trabajo personalizada a través de archivos de configuración JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents CLI nécessitant une automatisation de workflow personnalisée via des fichiers de configuration JSON.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-Agents, die eine individualisierte Workflow-Automatisierung über JSON-Konfigurationsdateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes CLI que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho personalizada por meio de arquivos de configuração JSON.","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI, которым требуется настраиваемая автоматизация рабочего процесса через файлы конфигурации JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يحتاج إلى أتمتة تدفق عمل مخصصة من خلال ملفات تكوين JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and configure custom Kiro CLI agents, leveraging JSON configuration files to tailor Kiro''s behavior for specific workflows, utilizing the Kiro CLI session and supporting both global and local project configurations.","zh":"赋予代理创建和配置自定义Kiro CLI代理的能力，利用JSON配置文件来定制Kiro的行为以适应特定的工作流，利用Kiro CLI会话，并支持全局和本地项目配置。","ja":"エージェントがカスタムKiro CLIエージェントを作成および構成できるようにし、JSON構成ファイルを使用して特定のワークフローにKiroの動作を最適化し、Kiro CLIセッションを利用し、グローバルおよびローカルプロジェクト構成の両方をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 지정 Kiro CLI 에이전트를 만들고 구성할 수 있도록 해줍니다. JSON 구성 파일을 사용하여 특정 워크플로에 대한 Kiro의 동작을 맞추고 Kiro CLI 세션을 활용하며 전역 및 로컬 프로젝트 구성 모두를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y configurar agentes Kiro CLI personalizados, aprovechando archivos de configuración JSON para adaptar el comportamiento de Kiro a flujos de trabajo específicos, utilizando la sesión de Kiro CLI y admitiendo tanto configuraciones de proyecto globales como locales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de configurer des agents Kiro CLI personnalisés, en exploitant les fichiers de configuration JSON pour adapter le comportement de Kiro à des flux de travail spécifiques, en utilisant la session Kiro CLI et en prenant en charge à la fois les configurations de projet globales et locales.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte Kiro-CLI-Agents zu erstellen und zu konfigurieren, indem JSON-Konfigurationsdateien genutzt werden, um das Verhalten von Kiro an bestimmte Workflows anzupassen, unter Nutzung der Kiro-CLI-Sitzung und Unterstützung sowohl globaler als auch lokaler Projekt-Konfigurationen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e configurem agentes Kiro CLI personalizados, aproveitando arquivos de configuração JSON para personalizar o comportamento do Kiro para fluxos de trabalho específicos, utilizando a sessão Kiro CLI e suportando tanto configurações de projeto globais quanto locais.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и настраивать пользовательских агентов Kiro CLI, используя файлы конфигурации JSON для адаптации поведения Kiro к конкретным рабочим процессам, используя сессию Kiro CLI и поддерживая как глобальные, так и локальные проектные конфигурации.","ar":"يمنح العميل خيارات لإنشاء وتكوين عملاء Kiro CLI مخصصين، واستخدام ملفات تكوين JSON لتكييف سلوك Kiro لعملية عمل محددة، واستخدام جلسة Kiro CLI ودعم كل من التكوين العالمي والمحلي لمشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating custom agents interactively via Kiro CLI sessions","Creating agents manually through JSON files for global or local project use","Configuring agents for specialized workflows using the `kiro-cli agent create` command"],"zh":["通过Kiro CLI会话交互式生成自定义代理","通过JSON文件手动创建代理以用于全局或本地项目","使用`kiro-cli agent create`命令配置代理以用于专用工作流"],"ja":["Kiro CLIセッションを介してカスタムエージェントをインタラクティブに生成する","JSONファイルを使用してエージェントを作成し、グローバルまたはローカルプロジェクトで使用する","`kiro-cli agent create`コマンドを使用して専用ワークフロー用のエージェントを構成する"],"ko":["Kiro CLI 세션을 통해 사용자 지정 에이전트를 상호 작용하여 생성하는 것","JSON 파일을 통해 에이전트를 수동으로 만들고 전역 또는 로컬 프로젝트에서 사용하는 것","`kiro-cli agent create` 명령을 사용하여 전문 워크플로에 대한 에이전트를 구성하는 것"],"es":["Generación de agentes personalizados de forma interactiva a través de sesiones de Kiro CLI","Creación de agentes de forma manual a través de archivos JSON para uso de proyectos globales o locales","Configuración de agentes para flujos de trabajo especializados utilizando el comando `kiro-cli agent create`"],"fr":["Génération d''agents personnalisés de manière interactive via des sessions Kiro CLI","Création d''agents manuellement via des fichiers JSON pour une utilisation de projets globaux ou locaux","Configuration d''agents pour des flux de travail spécialisés en utilisant la commande `kiro-cli agent create`"],"de":["Erzeugung benutzerdefinierter Agents interaktiv über Kiro-CLI-Sitzungen","Erstellung von Agents manuell über JSON-Dateien für globale oder lokale Projektverwendung","Konfiguration von Agents für spezialisierte Workflows unter Verwendung des Befehls `kiro-cli agent create`"],"pt":["Gerar agentes personalizados de forma interativa por meio de sessões Kiro CLI","Criar agentes manualmente por meio de arquivos JSON para uso global ou local de projeto","Configurar agentes para fluxos de trabalho especializados usando o comando `kiro-cli agent create`"],"ru":["Генерировать пользовательских агентов интерактивно через сессии Kiro CLI","Создавать агентов вручную через файлы JSON для глобального или локального использования проекта","Настроить агентов для специализированных рабочих процессов, используя команду `kiro-cli agent create`"],"ar":["генерировать عملاء مخصصين بشكل تفاعلي من خلال جلسات Kiro CLI","إنشاء عملاء يدويًا من خلال ملفات JSON للاستخدام العالمي أو المحلي لمشروع","تكوين العملاء لعمليات عمل متخصصة باستخدام الأمر `kiro-cli agent create`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kiro CLI installation and access","JSON configuration file management needed"],"zh":["需要Kiro CLI安装和访问","需要JSON配置文件管理"],"ja":["Kiro CLIのインストールとアクセスが必要","JSON構成ファイルの管理が必要"],"ko":["Kiro CLI 설치 및 액세스가 필요합니다.","JSON 구성 파일 관리가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere instalación y acceso de Kiro CLI","Se necesita gestión de archivos de configuración JSON"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et l''accès à Kiro CLI","La gestion de fichiers de configuration JSON est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Kiro-CLI-Installation und -Zugriff","JSON-Konfigurationsdatei-Verwaltung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Kiro CLI e acesso","Gerenciamento de arquivos de configuração JSON necessário"],"ru":["Требуется установка Kiro CLI и доступ","Необходимо управление файлами конфигурации JSON"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Kiro CLI ووصول","يتطلب إدارة ملفات تكوين JSON"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
