","инструмент для тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения","стабильность программного обеспечения","тестирование браузера","снятие экрана","проверка доступности"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","اختبار آلي","أداة الاختبار","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات","استقرار البرمجيات","اختبار المتصفح","التقاط الشاشة","فحص إمكانية الوصول"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Web application testing principles. E2E, Playwright, deep audit strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `","body":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `pip install playwright && playwright install chromium`\n\n---\n\n## 1. Deep Audit Approach\n\n### Discovery First\n\n| Target | How to Find |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Routes | Scan app/, pages/, router files |\n| API endpoints | Grep for HTTP methods |\n| Components | Find component directories |\n| Features | Read documentation |\n\n### Systematic Testing\n\n1. **Map** - List all routes/APIs\n2. **Scan** - Verify they respond\n3. **Test** - Cover critical paths\n\n---\n\n## 2. Testing Pyramid for Web\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical user flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, data flow\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Component (Many)\n                    Individual UI pieces\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. E2E Test Principles\n\n### What to Test\n\n| Priority | Tests |\n|----------|-------|\n| 1 | Happy path user flows |\n| 2 | Authentication flows |\n| 3 | Critical business actions |\n| 4 | Error handling |\n\n### E2E Best Practices\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| Use data-testid | Stable selectors |\n| Wait for elements | Avoid flaky tests |\n| Clean state | Independent tests |\n| Avoid implementation details | Test user behavior |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Playwright Principles\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Page Object Model | Encapsulate page logic |\n| Fixtures | Reusable test setup |\n| Assertions | Built-in auto-wait |\n| Trace Viewer | Debug failures |\n\n### Configuration\n\n| Setting | Recommendation |\n|---------|----------------|\n| Retries | 2 on CI |\n| Trace | on-first-retry |\n| Screenshots | on-failure |\n| Video | retain-on-failure |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Visual Testing\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Scenario | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Design system | High |\n| Marketing pages | High |\n| Component library | Medium |\n| Dynamic content | Lower |\n\n### Strategy\n\n- Baseline screenshots\n- Compare on changes\n- Review visual diffs\n- Update intentional changes\n\n---\n\n## 6. API Testing Principles\n\n### Coverage Areas\n\n| Area | Tests |\n|------|-------|\n| Status codes | 200, 400, 404, 500 |\n| Response shape | Matches schema |\n| Error messages | User-friendly |\n| Edge cases | Empty, large, special chars |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Test Organization\n\n### File Structure\n\n```\ntests/\n├── e2e/           # Full user flows\n├── integration/   # API, data\n├── component/     # UI units\n└── fixtures/      # Shared data\n```\n\n### Naming Convention\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Feature-based | `login.spec.ts` |\n| Descriptive | `user-can-checkout.spec.ts` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. CI Integration\n\n### Pipeline Steps\n\n1. Install dependencies\n2. Install browsers\n3. Run tests\n4. Upload artifacts (traces, screenshots)\n\n### Parallelization\n\n| Strategy | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Per file | Playwright default |\n| Sharding | Large suites |\n| Workers | Multiple browsers |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Test implementation | Test behavior |\n| Hardcode waits | Use auto-wait |\n| Skip cleanup | Isolate tests |\n| Ignore flaky tests | Fix root cause |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** E2E tests are expensive. Use them for critical paths only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:06:41.963Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Testing Agents needing advanced web application testing capabilities with Playwright and Python.","zh":"适合需要使用Playwright和Python进行高级Web应用程序测试的自动化测试代理。","ja":"PlaywrightおよびPythonを使用した高度なWebアプリケーションテスト機能を必要とする自動テストエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Playwright와 Python을 사용하여 고급 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de prueba automatizados que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de prueba de aplicaciones web con Playwright y Python.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de test automatisés ayant besoin de capacités de test d''applications web avancées avec Playwright et Python.","de":"Ideal für automatisierte Testagenten, die erweiterte Webanwendung-Testfunktionen mit Playwright und Python benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Testes Automatizados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de teste de aplicativos web com Playwright e Python.","ru":"Идеально для Автоматизированных Тестовых Агентов, требующих передовых возможностей тестирования веб-приложений с Playwright и Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار آلي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لاختبار التطبيقات الويب باستخدام Playwright و Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute automated browser tests with screenshot and accessibility check capabilities using Playwright scripts, supporting protocols like HTTPS and utilizing libraries such as Python''s playwright_runner.","zh":"赋予代理执行使用Playwright脚本的自动浏览器测试的能力，具有截图和无障碍检查功能，支持HTTPS等协议，并利用Python的playwright_runner等库。","ja":"Playwrightスクリプトを使用した自動ブラウザテストの実行、スクリーンショットの生成、ウェブアクセシビリティのチェックなどの機能をエージェントに提供し、HTTPSなどのプロトコルをサポートし、Pythonのplaywright_runnerなどのライブラリを利用します。","ko":"Playwright 스크립트를 사용하여 자동 브라우저 테스트를 실행하고, 스크린샷을 생성하며, 웹 접근성을 확인하는 등의 기능을 에이전트에 제공하며, HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 지원하며, Python의 playwright_runner 등의 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de navegador automatizadas con capacidades de captura de pantalla y verificación de accesibilidad utilizando scripts de Playwright, que admiten protocolos como HTTPS y utilizan bibliotecas como playwright_runner de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests de navigateur automatisés avec des capacités de capture d''écran et de vérification d''accessibilité en utilisant des scripts Playwright, qui prennent en charge des protocoles tels que HTTPS et utilisent des bibliothèques telles que playwright_runner de Python.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, automatisierte Browsertests mit Screenshot- und Zugriffsprüfungsfunktionen auszuführen, indem Playwright-Skripte verwendet werden, die Protokolle wie HTTPS unterstützen und Bibliotheken wie playwright_runner von Python nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes automatizados de navegador com capacidades de captura de tela e verificação de acessibilidade usando scripts Playwright, suportando protocolos como HTTPS e utilizando bibliotecas como o playwright_runner do Python.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять автоматизированные тесты браузера с возможностями захвата экрана и проверки доступности, используя скрипты Playwright, поддерживающие протоколы như HTTPS и использующие библиотеки, такие как playwright_runner Python.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل اختبارات متصفح آلية مع إمكانيات لقطة الشاشة واختبار الإمكانية باستخدام نصوص برمجة Playwright، داعمة لبروتوكولات مثل HTTPS واستخدام مكتبات مثل playwright_runner لبرنامج Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser testing for web applications","Generating screenshots for visual regression testing","Debugging accessibility issues with a11y checks"],"zh":["自动化浏览器测试用于Web应用程序","生成截图用于视觉回归测试","使用a11y检查调试无障碍问题"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションに対する自動ブラウザテスト","視覚的回帰テストのためのスクリーンショットの生成","a11yチェックを使用したアクセシビリティの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 자동 브라우저 테스트","시각적 회귀 테스트를 위한 스크린샷 생성","a11y 체크를 사용한 웹 접근성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de navegador para aplicaciones web","Generar capturas de pantalla para pruebas de regresión visual","Depurar problemas de accesibilidad con comprobaciones de a11y"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de navigateur pour les applications web","Générer des captures d''écran pour les tests de régression visuelle","Déboguer les problèmes d''accessibilité avec des vérifications a11y"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browsertests für Webanwendungen","Erzeugen von Screenshots für visuelle Regressionsprüfungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Zugriffsproblemen mit a11y-Prüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de navegador para aplicações web","Gerar capturas de tela para testes de regressão visual","Depurar problemas de acessibilidade com verificações a11y"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование браузера для веб-приложений","Генерировать скриншоты для визуального тестирования регрессии","Отладить проблемы с доступностью с помощью проверок a11y"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار المتصفح للتطبيقات الويب","_generating لقطة الشاشة لاختبار الانحدار المرئي","تصحيح أخطاء الوصول باستخدام فحص a11y"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Playwright installation needed","Compatibility with specific IDEs and CLIs like GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and Kiro"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要Playwright安装","特定IDE和CLI如GitHub Copilot、Cursor和Kiro的兼容性"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Playwrightのインストールが必要","特定のIDEおよびCLI（GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiroなど）との互換性"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Playwright 설치가 필요","특정 IDE 및 CLI(GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro 등)와의 호환성"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesita instalación de Playwright","Compatibilidad con IDEs y CLIs específicos como GitHub Copilot, Cursor y Kiro"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","L''installation de Playwright est nécessaire","Compatibilité avec des IDE et des CLIs spécifiques comme GitHub Copilot, Cursor et Kiro"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Playwright-Installation erforderlich","Kompatibilität mit spezifischen IDEs und CLIs wie GitHub Copilot, Cursor und Kiro"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Instalação do Playwright necessária","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs específicos como GitHub Copilot, Cursor e Kiro"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходима установка Playwright","Совместимость с определенными IDE и CLI, такими как GitHub Copilot, Cursor и Kiro"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","تركيب Playwright مطلوب","متوافق مع IDEs و CLIs محددة مثل GitHub Copilot و Cursor و Kiro"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
