ます","ko":"SEO 감사는 웹사이트의 SEO 문제를 식별하고 해결하여 검색엔진 순위를 높이기 위해 수행됩니다","es":"El análisis de SEO es una herramienta para identificar problemas de optimización y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica.","fr":"L''audit SEO est un outil pour identifier les problèmes d''optimisation et améliorer les performances de recherche organique.","de":"Das SEO-Audit ist ein Tool, um Optimierungsprobleme zu identifizieren und die Leistung der organischen Suche zu verbessern.","pt":"A auditoria de SEO é um processo que ajuda a identificar problemas de otimização e melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica. Nossa auditoria fornece recomenda...","ru":"Аудит SEO - это процесс, который помогает выявить проблемы оптимизации и улучшить поисковую производительность. Наша аудит предоставляет рекомендации для улу...","ar":"تدقيق محركات البحث هو عملية تساعد على تحديد مشاكل التحسين وتحسين أداء البحث العضوي. تقدم تدقيقنا توصيات لتحسين وضوحك على الإنترنت.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["网站结构分析","关键词研究","内容优化","技术SEO审计","链接建设分析"],"ja":["ウェブサイト構造分析","キーワードリサーチ","コンテンツ最適化","テクニカル SEO オーディット","リンクビルディング分析"],"ko":["웹사이트 구조 분석","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화","기술 SEO 감사","링크 빌딩 분석"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de estructura de sitio web","Optimización de metadatos","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Análisis de enlaces y redes sociales"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse de la structure du site web","Optimisation des métadonnées","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Analyse des liens et des réseaux sociaux"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse der Website-Struktur","Optimierung von Metadaten","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Analyse von Links und sozialen Netzwerken"],"pt":["Análise de desempenho de busca","Identificação de problemas de otimização","Recomendações para melhorar a visibilidade online","Análise de estrutura de site","Otimização de conteúdo"],"ru":["Анализ поисковой производительности","Выявление проблем оптимизации","Рекомендации для улучшения онлайн-видимости","Анализ структуры сайта","Оптимизация контента"],"ar":["تحليل أداء البحث","تحديد مشاكل التحسين","توصيات لتحسين وضوحك على الإنترنت","تحليل هيكل الموقع","تحسين المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO 审计","搜索引擎优化","网站排名提高","技术SEO","关键词研究"],"ja":["SEO オーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイトランキング向上","テクニカル SEO","キーワードリサーチ"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색엔진 최적화","웹사이트 순위提高","기술 SEO","키워드 연구"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de sitio web","mejora de búsqueda orgánica","desarrollo web","SEO para desarrolladores","herramientas de SEO"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de site web","amélioration de recherche organique","développement web","SEO pour développeurs","outils de SEO"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Website-Optimierung","Verbesserung der organischen Suche","Webentwicklung","SEO für Entwickler","SEO-Tools"],"pt":["auditoria de seo","otimização de busca","desempenho de busca orgânica","visibilidade online","análise de site","recomendações de seo"],"ru":["аудит seo","оптимизация поиска","поисковая производительность","онлайн-видимость","анализ сайта","рекомендации seo"],"ar":["تدقيق محركات البحث","تحسين البحث","أداء البحث العضوي","الوضوح على الإنترنت","تحليل الموقع","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:06:56.545Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced SEO analysis and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO分析和优化能力的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが高度なSEO分析と最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 SEO 분석 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de análisis y optimización de SEO avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et d''une optimisation de SEO avancées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte SEO-Analyse- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise e otimização de SEO.","ru":"Идеально для цифровых маркетинговых агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анализа и оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام الرقمية التي تحتاج إلى возможности تحليل وضبط متقدمة لتحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance, utilizing site context and product marketing context files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed audits.","zh":"赋予代理识别SEO问题和提供可行建议的能力，以提高有机搜索性能，利用站点上下文和产品营销上下文文件（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）进行知情审计。","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を識別し、有機検索パフォーマンスを改善するための実行可能な推奨事項を提供することを可能にします。サイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティングコンテキストファイル（`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`など）を使用して、情報に基づいた監査を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 유기적 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 권장 사항을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. 사이트 컨텍스트 및 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 파일(예: `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`)을 사용하여 정보에 기반한 감사를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones concretas para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica, utilizando archivos de contexto de sitio y contexto de marketing de productos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para auditorías informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations actionnables pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique, en utilisant des fichiers de contexte de site et de contexte de marketing de produits comme `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour des audits éclairés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung zu geben, indem sie auf Site-Kontext- und Produktmarketing-Kontext-Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für fundierte Audits zurückgreifen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações práticas para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica, utilizando arquivos de contexto do site e contexto de marketing de produtos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para auditorias informadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации для улучшения органического поискового трафика, используя контекст сайта и контекст маркетинга продукта, такие как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, для информированных аудитов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي، باستخدام ملفات سياق الموقع وسياق تسويق المنتج مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لأدلة شاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structure for search engine optimization","Analyzing site content for keyword relevance and density","Generating reports on technical SEO issues like site speed and mobile responsiveness"],"zh":["审计网站结构以进行搜索引擎优化","分析网站内容以确定关键词相关性和密度","生成有关技术SEO问题的报告，例如网站速度和移动响应性"],"ja":["検索エンジン最適化のためにウェブサイト構造を監査する","キーワードの関連性と密度を決定するためにサイトコンテンツを分析する","サイト速度やモバイルレスポンスなどの技術SEOの問題に関するレポートを生成する"],"ko":["검색 엔진 최적화를 위해 웹사이트 구조를 감사하는 것","키워드 관련성 및密度를 결정하기 위해 사이트 내용을 분석하는 것","사이트 속도 또는 모바일 응답성과 같은 기술적 SEO 문제에 대한 보고서를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Auditoría de la estructura del sitio web para la optimización de motores de búsqueda","Análisis del contenido del sitio para la relevancia y densidad de palabras clave","Generación de informes sobre problemas técnicos de SEO como la velocidad del sitio y la responsividad móvil"],"fr":["Audit de la structure du site web pour l''optimisation des moteurs de recherche","Analyse du contenu du site pour la pertinence et la densité des mots-clés","Génération de rapports sur les problèmes techniques de SEO comme la vitesse du site et la responsivité mobile"],"de":["Prüfung der Website-Struktur für die Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Analyse des Website-Inhalts für die Relevanz und Dichte von Schlüsselwörtern","Erstellung von Berichten über technische SEO-Probleme wie Website-Geschwindigkeit und Mobile-Responsiveness"],"pt":["Auditoria da estrutura do site para otimização de mecanismos de busca","Análise do conteúdo do site para relevância e densidade de palavras-chave","Geração de relatórios sobre problemas técnicos de SEO, como velocidade do site e responsividade móvel"],"ru":["Аудит структуры сайта для оптимизации поисковых систем","Анализ контента сайта на соответствие и плотность ключевых слов","Генерация отчетов о технических проблемах SEO, таких как скорость сайта и мобильная адаптивность"],"ar":["فحص هيكل الموقع للبحث عن تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل محتوى الموقع لأهمية وكثافة الكلمات الرئيسية","إنتاج تقارير حول مشاكل تقنية لتحسين محركات البحث، مثل سرعة الموقع وتجاوب الهاتف المحمول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context and product marketing context information","Limited to analyzing publicly accessible website data"],"zh":["需要访问站点上下文和产品营销上下文信息","仅限分析公开访问的网站数据"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティングコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","公開アクセス可能なウェブサイトデータのみを分析可能"],"ko":["사이트 컨텍스트 및 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함","공개적으로 액세스할 수 있는 웹사이트 데이터만 분석할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a información de contexto de sitio y contexto de marketing de productos","Limitado al análisis de datos de sitios web accesibles públicamente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des informations de contexte de site et de contexte de marketing de produits","Limité à l''analyse des données de sites web accessibles publiquement"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Site-Kontext- und Produktmarketing-Kontext-Informationen","Begrenzt auf die Analyse öffentlich zugänglicher Website-Daten"],"pt":["Requer acesso a informações de contexto do site e contexto de marketing de produtos","Limitado à análise de dados de sites publicamente acessíveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации контекста сайта и контекста маркетинга продукта","Ограничен анализом публично доступных данных сайта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع وسياق تسويق المنتج","محدود بتحليل بيانات الموقع المتاحة للجمهور"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
