 et des connaissances pour créer des GIF animés optimisés pour Slack.","de":"Der slack-gif-creator ist ein Tool, das Utilities und Wissen für die Erstellung von animierten GIFs, optimiert für Slack, bietet.","pt":"O Criador de GIFs para Slack é uma ferramenta que fornece utilitários e conhecimentos para criar GIFs animados otimizados para o Slack.","ru":"Создатель GIF для Slack — это набор инструментов, который предоставляет утилиты и знания для создания анимированных GIF-изображений, оптимизированных для Slack.","ar":"مُنشئ GIF لاسلاك هو أداة توفر أدوات ومعارف لإنشاء صور GIF متحركة مُحسنة لاسلاك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["128x128","480x480","FPS 10-30","48-128","3"],"ja":["128x128","480x480","FPS 10-30","48-128","3"],"ko":["128x128","480x480","FPS 10-30","48-128","3"],"es":["Dimensiones personalizables para GIF de emoji y mensajes","Control sobre la velocidad de cuadros (FPS) y la duración","Opción para reducir el tamaño del archivo ajustando los colores","Compatibilidad con la biblioteca PIL para la creación de imágenes","Flujo de trabajo principal para la creación de GIF con Python"],"fr":["Dimensions personnalisables pour les GIF d''emoji et de messages","Contrôle de la vitesse d''images (FPS) et de la durée","Option pour réduire la taille du fichier en ajustant les couleurs","Compatibilité avec la bibliothèque PIL pour la création d''images","Flux de travail principal pour la création de GIF avec Python"],"de":["Anpassbare Dimensionen für Emoji- und Nachrichten-GIFs","Kontrolle über die Bildwiederholfrequenz (FPS) und die Dauer","Option, die Dateigröße durch Anpassen der Farben zu reduzieren","Kompatibilität mit der PIL-Bibliothek für die Bildersstellung","Hauptarbeitfluss für die Erstellung von GIFs mit Python"],"pt":["Dimensões recomendadas para GIFs de emoji e mensagem","Parâmetros de FPS, cores e duração para GIFs","Ferramentas para criar GIFs animados otimizados para o Slack","Compatibilidade com a biblioteca PIL para manipulação de imagens","Exemplos de código em Python para criar GIFs personalizados"],"ru":["Рекомендуемые размеры для GIF-изображений эмодзи и сообщений","Параметры FPS, цвета и продолжительность для GIF-изображений","Инструменты для создания анимированных GIF-изображений, оптимизированных для Slack","Совместимость с библиотекой PIL для манипуляции изображениями","Примеры кода на Python для создания пользовательских GIF-изображений"],"ar":["الأحجام الموصى بها لصور GIF الإيموجي والرسائل","معاملات FPS والألوان والمدة لصور GIF","أدوات لإنشاء صور GIF متحركة مُحسنة لاسلاك","التوافق مع مكتبة PIL لتعديل الصور","أمثلة من الكود بلغة Python لإنشاء صور GIF مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slack GIF","GIF","Slack","128x128","480x480","FPS"],"ja":["SlackGIF","GIF","Slack","128x128","480x480","FPS"],"ko":["Slack GIF","GIF","Slack","128x128","480x480","FPS"],"es":["creador de GIF para Slack","GIF animados para Slack","requisitos de Slack para GIF","desarrollo de GIF con Python","optimización de GIF para Slack","herramientas para crear GIF"],"fr":["créateur de GIF pour Slack","GIF animés pour Slack","exigences de Slack pour les GIF","développement de GIF avec Python","optimisation de GIF pour Slack","outils pour créer des GIF"],"de":["Slack GIF Ersteller","animierte GIFs für Slack","Slack-Anforderungen für GIFs","GIF-Entwicklung mit Python","GIF-Optimierung für Slack","Tools für die Erstellung von GIFs"],"pt":["Criador de GIFs para Slack","GIFs animados para Slack","Otimização de GIFs para Slack","Ferramentas de criação de GIFs","Biblioteca PIL para Python","Desenvolvimento de GIFs personalizados"],"ru":["Создатель GIF для Slack","Анимированные GIF-изображения для Slack","Оптимизация GIF-изображений для Slack","Инструменты для создания GIF-изображений","Библиотека PIL для Python","Разработка пользовательских GIF-изображений"],"ar":["مُنشئ GIF لاسلاك","صور GIF متحركة لاسلاك","تحسين صور GIF لاسلاك","أدوات لإنشاء صور GIF","مكتبة PIL لبرمجة Python","تطوير صور GIF مخصصة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.516Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:07:15.365Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing optimized GIF creation for Slack platforms.","zh":"非常适合需要针对Slack平台优化GIF创建的视觉内容代理。","ja":"Slackプラットフォーム向けのGIF作成を最適化する必要があるビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適です。","ko":"슬랙 플랫폼을 위한 GIF 생성을 최적화해야 하는 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contenido Visual que necesitan creación de GIF optimizada para plataformas de Slack.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de création de GIF optimisée pour les plateformes Slack.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die eine optimierte GIF-Erstellung für Slack-Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que precisam de criação de GIF otimizada para plataformas Slack.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных контент-агентов, которым необходима оптимизированная создание GIF для платформ Slack.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء GIF محسّن لمنصات Slack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate animated GIFs using Python and the PIL library, optimizing for Slack''s specific dimensions and parameters such as FPS, colors, and duration, all while utilizing the GIFBuilder utility.","zh":"赋予代理使用Python和PIL库生成动画GIF的能力，针对Slack的特定尺寸和参数（如FPS、颜色和持续时间）进行优化，同时利用GIFBuilder实用程序。","ja":"PythonとPILライブラリを使用してアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントを可能にし、Slackの特定の寸法やパラメータ（FPS、色、期間など）を最適化し、同時にGIFBuilderユーティリティを利用します。","ko":"Python과 PIL 라이브러리를 사용하여 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 슬랙의 특정 크기와 매개변수(FPS, 색상, 기간 등)를 최적화하면서 GIFBuilder 유틸리티를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIF animados utilizando Python y la biblioteca PIL, optimizando las dimensiones y parámetros específicos de Slack como FPS, colores y duración, todo mientras se utiliza la utilidad GIFBuilder.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIF animés en utilisant Python et la bibliothèque PIL, en optimisant les dimensions et les paramètres spécifiques de Slack tels que les FPS, les couleurs et la durée, le tout en utilisant l''utilitaire GIFBuilder.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, animierte GIFs mithilfe von Python und der Bibliothek PIL zu generieren, wobei die spezifischen Dimensionen und Parameter von Slack wie FPS, Farben und Dauer optimiert werden, während die GIFBuilder-Utility verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar GIFs animados usando Python e a biblioteca PIL, otimizando para as dimensões e parâmetros específicos do Slack, como FPS, cores e duração, tudo enquanto utiliza a utilidade GIFBuilder.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать анимированные GIF с помощью Python и библиотеки PIL, оптимизируя для конкретных размеров и параметров Slack, таких как FPS, цвета и продолжительность, все это при использовании утилиты GIFBuilder.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد GIFs متحركة باستخدام Python و مكتبة PIL، مع تحسين الأبعاد والمعاملات المحددة لمنصة Slack، مثل معدل الإطار في الثانية وألوان ومدة العرض، مع استخدام أداة GIFBuilder."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating emoji GIFs with recommended 128x128 dimensions","Generating message GIFs optimized for 480x480 dimensions","Optimizing GIF file size by adjusting FPS and color palette"],"zh":["创建推荐的128x128尺寸的表情符号GIF","生成针对480x480尺寸的优化消息GIF","通过调整FPS和色彩调色板来优化GIF文件大小"],"ja":["推奨される128x128のサイズの絵文字GIFを作成する","480x480のサイズに最適化されたメッセージGIFを生成する","FPSと色彩パレットを調整してGIFファイルのサイズを最適化する"],"ko":["권장되는 128x128 크기의 이모티콘 GIF를 생성한다","480x480 크기에 최적화된 메시지 GIF를 생성한다","FPS와 색상 팔레트를 조정하여 GIF 파일 크기를 최적화한다"],"es":["Crear GIF de emojis con dimensiones recomendadas de 128x128","Generar GIF de mensajes optimizados para dimensiones de 480x480","Optimizar el tamaño del archivo GIF ajustando FPS y paleta de colores"],"fr":["Créer des GIF d''émoticônes avec des dimensions recommandées de 128x128","Générer des GIF de messages optimisés pour des dimensions de 480x480","Optimiser la taille du fichier GIF en ajustant les FPS et la palette de couleurs"],"de":["Erstellen von Emoji-GIFs mit empfohlenen Dimensionen von 128x128","Generieren von Nachrichten-GIFs, optimiert für Dimensionen von 480x480","Optimieren der GIF-Dateigröße durch Anpassen von FPS und Farbpalette"],"pt":["Criar GIFs de emojis com dimensões recomendadas de 128x128","Gerar GIFs de mensagens otimizados para dimensões de 480x480","Otimizar o tamanho do arquivo GIF ajustando FPS e paleta de cores"],"ru":["Создание GIF-изображений эмодзи с рекомендуемыми размерами 128x128","Генерация GIF-изображений сообщений, оптимизированных для размеров 480x480","Оптимизация размера файла GIF путем调整 FPS и цветовой палитры"],"ar":["إنشاء GIFs للأشكال التعبيرية بأبعاد مقترحة 128x128","توليد GIFs للرسائل محسّنة للأبعاد 480x480","تحسين حجم ملف GIF عن طريق ضبط FPS ولوحة الألوان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Specific dimensions and parameters must be adhered to for optimal Slack compatibility","Limited to GIF file format"],"zh":["需要Python环境","必须遵守特定的尺寸和参数以实现与Slack的最佳兼容性","仅限GIF文件格式"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Slackとの最適な互換性を実現するために、特定の寸法やパラメータに従う必要がある","GIFファイル形式のみ"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요하다","슬랙과 최상의 호환성을 달성하기 위해 특정 크기와 매개변수를 따라야 한다","GIF 파일 형식만 해당"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Deben cumplirse las dimensiones y parámetros específicos para la compatibilidad óptima con Slack","Limitado al f