y-IDE-Konfigur...","pt":"Desenvolvimento Mobile: Ferramentas de Design","ru":"Мобильный Дизайн: Инструменты для Конвертации","ar":"تصميم الجوال: أدوات التحويل","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种转换工具，帮助开发者将配置文件从Antigravity IDE转换为兼容的格式，用于GitHub Copilot、Cursor等IDE和Kiro、OpenCode等CLI","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、開発者がAntigravity IDEの設定ファイルをGitHub Copilot、CursorなどのIDEやKiro、OpenCodeなどのCLIで使用できる形式に変換するためのツールです","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 개발자가 Antigravity IDE의 설정 파일을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등의 IDE와 Kiro, OpenCode 등의 CLI에서 사용 가능한 형식으로 변환하는 데 도움이 되는 도구입니다","es":"Herramienta de conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con IDEs y CLIs","fr":"Outil de conversion de configurations Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec les IDEs et les CLIs","de":"Werkzeug zur Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen in Formate kompatibel mit IDEs und CLIs","pt":"O mobile-design é uma ferramenta para converter configurações de Agent, Skill e Workfows para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это инструмент для конвертации конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workfows в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI","ar":"تصميم الجوال هو أداة لتحويل إعدادات الوكيل والمهارة والتدفقات العمل إلى صيغ متوافقة مع بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وأوامر السطر","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持多个IDE和CLI","优化移动端开发体验","提供移动UX和触摸审计功能","支持离线开发","兼容多个平台"],"ja":["複数のIDEとCLIをサポート","モバイル開発体験の最適化","モバイルUXとタッチの監査機能を提供","オフライン開発をサポート","複数のプラットフォームをサポート"],"ko":["여러 IDE와 CLI를 지원","모바일 개발 경험 최적화","모바일 UX와 터치 감사를 제공","오프라인 개발을 지원","여러 플랫폼을 지원"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot y Cursor","Soporte para CLIs como Kiro y OpenCode","Validación con scripts de ejecución","Diseño centrado en la experiencia del usuario móvil"],"fr":["Conversion de configurations Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot et Cursor","Support pour les CLIs comme Kiro et OpenCode","Validation avec des scripts d''exécution","Conception centrée sur l''expérience utilisateur mobile"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot und Cursor","Unterstützung für CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Validierung mit Ausführungsskripten","Design zentriert auf die mobile Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações para formatos compatíveis","Suporte a IDEs e CLIs","Ferramentas de design para desenvolvimento mobile","Validação de configurações com scripts de execução","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis eficientes"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций в совместимые форматы","Поддержка IDE и CLI","Инструменты дизайна для мобильного развития","Валидация конфигураций с помощью скриптов выполнения","Разработка эффективных мобильных приложений"],"ar":["تحويل الإعدادات إلى صيغ متوافقة","دعم بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وأوامر السطر","أدوات تصميم لتطوير التطبيقات المحمولة","التحقق من صحة الإعدادات باستخدام سكريبتات التنفيذ","تطوير تطبيقات محمولة فعالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计系统","转换工具","IDE","CLI","移动开发","优化体验","离线开发","多平台支持"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","変換ツール","IDE","CLI","モバイル開発","体験の最適化","オフライン開発","複数プラットフォームサポート"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","변환 도구","IDE","CLI","모바일 개발","개발 경험 최적화","오프라인 개발","여러 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["diseño móvil","conversión de configuraciones","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","desarrollo móvil"],"fr":["conception mobile","conversion de configurations","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","développement mobile"],"de":["Mobile-Design","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","mobile Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento mobile","ferramentas de design","conversão de configurações","IDEs","CLIs","validação de configurações","aplicações móveis","eficiência de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["мобильное развитие","инструменты дизайна","конвертация конфигураций","IDE","CLI","валидация конфигураций","мобильные приложения","эффективность разработки"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة","أدوات تصميم","تحويل الإعدادات","بيئات التطوير المتكاملة","أوامر السطر","التحقق من صحة الإعدادات","تطبيقات محمولة","فعالية التطوير"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:07:26.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful mobile design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要优先考虑触摸、节能和尊重平台的移动设计能力的 UI/UX 代理。","ja":"タッチファースト、バッテリー意識、プラットフォーム尊重のモバイルデザイン機能を必要とする UI/UX エージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리 소모 최소화, 플랫폼을尊重하는 모바일 디자인 기능을 필요로 하는 UI/UX 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de diseño móvil de primera generación, conscientes de la batería y respetuosas con la plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX qui ont besoin de capacités de conception mobile de première génération, conscientes de la batterie et respectueuses de la plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agents, die touch-first, batteriebewusste und plattformrespektierende Mobile-Designfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de capacidades de design móvel touch-first, conscientes da bateria e respeitosas com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов UI/UX, которым необходимы возможности мобильного дизайна, ориентированные на сенсорный ввод, экономичные и уважающие платформу.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التصميم المحمول التي تضع في اعتبارها الأول اللمس ومدى استهلاك البطارية والاحترام للمنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design mobile interfaces with consideration for mobile constraints, utilizing Python scripts like mobile_audit.py for validation, and respecting platform choices for seamless user experiences.","zh":"赋予代理设计移动界面能力，考虑移动设备的限制，利用 Python 脚本（如 mobile_audit.py）进行验证，并尊重平台选择以提供无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントに、モバイルの制約を考慮してモバイルインターフェイスを設計する機能を提供し、Python スクリプト（mobile_audit.py など）を使用して検証し、プラットフォームの選択を尊重してシームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트에게 모바일 인터페이스를 디자인 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 모바일 제약을 고려하고 Python 스크립트(mobile_audit.py 등)를 사용하여 검증하며 플랫폼 선택을尊重하여無縫な 사용자 경험을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar interfaces móviles con consideración de las limitaciones móviles, utilizando scripts de Python como mobile_audit.py para la validación y respetando las opciones de plataforma para experiencias de usuario sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des interfaces mobiles en tenant compte des contraintes mobiles, en utilisant des scripts Python comme mobile_audit.py pour la validation et en respectant les choix de plateforme pour des expériences utilisateur sans interruption.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile Schnittstellen unter Berücksichtigung der mobilen Einschränkungen zu entwerfen, indem Python-Skripte wie mobile_audit.py für die Validierung verwendet und die Plattformwahl für eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung respektiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem interfaces móveis com consideração pelas restrições móveis, utilizando scripts Python como mobile_audit.py para validação e respeitando as escolhas de plataforma para experiências de usuário sem interrupções.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность проектировать мобильные интерфейсы с учетом мобильных ограничений, используя скрипты Python, такие как mobile_audit.py, для проверки и уважения выбора платформы для бесперебойного взаимодействия с пользователем.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تصميم واجهات المستخدم المحمول مع مراعاة القيود المحمول، واستخدام نصوص بايثون مثل mobile_audit.py للتحقق، واحترام اختيار المنصة لتجارب المستخدم دون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating mobile UX and touch interactions using scripts like mobile_audit.py","Designing platform-respectful interfaces for offline-capable mobile applications","Auditing mobile applications for battery-conscious and touch-first design principles"],"zh":["使用脚本（如 mobile_audit.py）验证移动 UX 和触摸交互","为离线功能的移动应用程序设计尊重平台的界面","审计移动应用程序以确保遵循节能和触摸优先的设计原则"],"ja":["スクリプト（mobile_audit.py など）を使用してモバイル UX とタッチインタラクションを検証する","オフライン機能を備えたモバイルアプリケーションのためのプラットフォーム尊重のインターフェイスを設計する","モバイルアプリケーションを監査して、バッテリー意識とタッチファーストの設計原則に従っていることを確認する"],"ko":["스크립트(mobile_audit.py 등)를 사용하여 모바일 UX 와 터치 상호작용을 검증","오프라인 기능을 갖춘 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 플랫폼을尊重하는 인터페이스를 설계","모바일 애플리케이션을 감사하여 배터리 소모 최소화와 터치 우선의 설계 원칙을 준수하는지 확인"],"es":["Validar la experiencia del usuario móvil y las interacciones táctiles mediante scripts como mobile_audit.py","Diseñar interfaces respetuosas con la plataforma para aplicaciones móviles capaces de funcionar sin conexión","Auditar aplicaciones móviles para principios de diseño conscientes de la batería y de primera generación"],"fr":["Valider l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les interactions tactiles à l''aide de scripts comme mobile_audit.py","Concevoir des interfaces respectueuses de la plateforme pour des applications mobiles capables de fonctionner hors ligne","Auditer des applications mobiles pour des principes de conception respectueux de la batterie et de première génération"],"de":["Überprüfen der mobilen Benutzeroberfläche und der Touch-Interaktionen mithilfe von Skripten wie mobile_audit.py","Entwerfen plattformrespektierender Schnittstellen für offline-fähige Mobile-Anwendungen","Überprüfen mobiler Anwendungen auf batteriebewusste und touch-first-Designprinzipien"],"pt":["Validar a experiência do usuário móvel e interações por toque usando scripts como mobile_audit.py","Projetar interfaces respeitosas com a plataforma para aplicativos móveis capazes de funcionar offline","Auditar aplicativos móveis para princípios de design conscientes da bateria e do toque"],"ru":["Проверять пользовательский опыт мобильного взаимодействия и сенсорные взаимодействия с помощью скриптов, таких как mobile_audit.py","Проектировать интерфейсы, уважающие платформу, для мобильных приложений, способных работать в автономном режиме","Проводить аудит мобильных приложений на предмет соблюдения принципов проектирования, учитывающих потребление энергии и сенсорный ввод"],"ar":["التحقق من تجربة المستخدم المحمول وتفاعلات اللمس باستخدام نصوص مثل mobile_audit.py","تصميم واجهات احترامية للمنصة لتطبيقات المحمول القادرة على العمل دون اتصال","فحص تطبيقات المحمول لمبادئ التصميم التي تضع في اعتبارها استهلاك البطارية واللمس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for script execution","Limited to mobile design principles and may not be directly applicable to desktop applications"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境来执行脚本","仅限于移动设计原则，可能不直接适用于桌面应用程序"],"ja":["スクリプトを実行するために Python 環境が必要","モバイルデザイン原則に限定され、デスクトップアプリケーションには直接適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["스크립트를 실행하기 위해 Python 환경이 필요","모바일 디자인 원칙에 한정되어 있으며 데스크톱 애플리케이션에는 직접 적용할 수 없을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts","Limitado a principios de diseño móvil y puede no ser directamente aplicable a aplicaciones de escritorio"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution de scripts","Limité aux principes de conception mobile et peut ne pas être directement applicable aux applications de bureau"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die Skriptausführung","Begrenzt auf Mobile-Designprinzipien und kann möglicherweise nicht direkt auf Desktop-Anwendungen angewendet werden"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python para execução de scripts","Limitado a princípios de design móvel e pode não ser diretamente aplicável a aplicações de área de trabalho"],"ru":["Требует среды Python для выполнения скриптов","Ограничен принципами мобильного дизайна и может не быть直接 применим к настольным приложениям"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون لتشغيل النصوص","محدود بمبادئ تصميم المحمول وقد لا يكون قابلا للتطبيق مباشرة على تطبيقات سطح المكتب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
