enho"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации оптимизации","Руководство для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода","Оптимизация для React и Next.js","Лучшие практики для написания компонентов React","Оптимизация(bundle и производительности)"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولوية للتحسين","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التلقائية وإنشاء الكود","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت و نيكست.جس","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة مكونات رياكت","تحسين حزمة الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","性能优化","React","Next.js","自动重构","代码生成","数据获取","代码复用"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","React","Next.js","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","データ取得","コード再利用"],"ko":["버셀 리액트","최적화 가이드","성능 최적화","리액트","넥스트_js","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","데이터 가져오기","코드 재사용"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web","rendimiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web","performances des applications"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web","React performance optimization","Vercel React best practices","React development","Web development"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Next.js","Разработка веб-приложений","React производительность оптимизация","Vercel React лучшие практики","React разработка","Веб разработка"],"ar":["فيرسيل رياكت","أفضل الممارسات رياكت","تحسين أداء رياكت","نيكست.جس","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","رياكت تحسين الأداء","فيرسيل رياكت أفضل الممارسات","رياكت التطوير","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"HugoCL","repo":"round-robin-rmpe","repoPath":"HugoCL/round-robin-rmpe","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:07:36.522Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js development, seeking to optimize application performance.","zh":"非常适合专门从事 React 和 Next.js 开发的前端代理，旨在优化应用程序性能。","ja":"React と Next.js 開発に特化したフロントエンド エージェントに最適で、アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化することを目指しています。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 개발에 전문적인 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화하는 것을 목표로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend especializados en desarrollo de React y Next.js, que buscan optimizar el rendimiento de las aplicaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend spécialisés dans le développement React et Next.js, cherchant à optimiser les performances des applications.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die auf React- und Next.js-Entwicklung spezialisiert sind und die Anwendungsleistung optimieren möchten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em desenvolvimento React e Next.js, buscando otimizar o desempenho da aplicação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке React и Next.js, стремящихся оптимизировать производительность приложения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصص في تطوير React و Next.js ، يسعى لتحسين أداء التطبيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories, including data fetching and bundling optimization, to enhance overall performance and efficiency, utilizing Vercel''s comprehensive guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 和 Next.js 应用程序，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别，包括数据获取和捆绑优化，以提高整体性能和效率，利用 Vercel 的综合指南。","ja":"エージェントに React と Next.js アプリケーションの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって利用して、データ取得やバンドル最適化などを実施し、全体的なパフォーマンスと効率を高め、Vercel の包括的なガイドラインを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 57개의 규칙을 8개의 카테고리에서 활용하여 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화 등을 통해 전체적인 성능 및 효율성을 향상시키고, Vercel의 포괄적인 가이드라인을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, incluyendo la optimización de la recuperación de datos y el empaquetado, para mejorar el rendimiento y la eficiencia en general, utilizando las directrices integrales de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, notamment l''optimisation de la récupération de données et du bundling, pour améliorer les performances et l''efficacité globales, en utilisant les directives complètes de Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem es 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf- und Bundling-Optimierung, um die Gesamtleistung und Effizienz zu verbessern und die umfassenden Richtlinien von Vercel zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento, para melhorar o desempenho e a eficiência geral, utilizando as diretrizes abrangentes da Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и упаковки, для повышения общей производительности и эффективности, используя комплексные рекомендации Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير الترميز وتوليد الشفرة للطبيقات React و Next.js ، باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات ، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين التعبئة ، لتحسين الأداء والكفاءة العامة ، باستخدام إرشادات Vercel الشاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components and Next.js pages","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies for client and server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React and Next.js codebases for improved performance and maintainability"],"zh":["自动优化新 React 组件和 Next.js 页面的性能","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取策略","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码库以提高性能和可维护性"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントと Next.js ページのパフォーマンスを自動で最適化する","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドレンダリングのための効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する","既存の React と Next.js コードベースをリファクタリングしてパフォーマンスとメンテナンス性を向上させる"],"ko":["새로운 React 컴포넌트 및 Next.js 페이지의 성능을 자동으로 최적화하는 것","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현하는 것","기존의 React 및 Next.js 코드베이스를 리팩토링하여 성능 및 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes de React y páginas de Next.js","Implementar estrategias de recuperación de datos eficientes para rendering de cliente y servidor","Refactorizar las bases de código existentes de React y Next.js para mejorar el rendimiento y la mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React et les pages Next.js","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de récupération de données efficaces pour le rendering client et serveur","Refactoriser les bases de code existantes de React et Next.js pour améliorer les performances et la maintenabilité"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Implementieren effizienter Datenabrufstrategien für Client- und Server-Seitige Rendering","Refaktorisieren bestehender React- und Next.js-Codebasen für verbesserte Leistung und Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React e páginas Next.js","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados eficientes para renderização de cliente e servidor","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhorar o desempenho e a manutenção"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React и страниц Next.js","Реализовать эффективные стратегии извлечения данных для клиентской и серверной отрисовки","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для улучшения производительности и поддержки"],"ar":["توفير تحسين الأداء التلقائي لمكونات React الجديدة وصفحات Next.js","تطبيق استراتيجيات استرجاع البيانات الفعالة لتحويل العميل والخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء والصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel or utilizing Vercel''s optimization guidelines"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js 生态系统的知识","仅限于托管在 Vercel 或使用 Vercel 优化指南的应用程序"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムに関する知識が必要","Vercel にホストされているか、Vercel の最適化ガイドラインを使用するアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요함","Vercel에 호스팅되거나 Vercel의 최적화 가이드라인을 사용하는 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en Vercel o que utilizan las directrices de optimización de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des écosystèmes React et Next.js","Limité aux applications hébergées sur Vercel ou utilisant les directives d''optimisation de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die auf Vercel gehostet werden oder Vercels Optimierungsrichtlinien nutzen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações hospedadas na Vercel ou que utilizam as diretrizes de otimização da Vercel"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, размещенных на Vercel или использующих рекомендации по оптимизации Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بيئات React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المضيفة على Vercel أو التي تستخدم إرشادات تحسين Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
