lität mit React und Next.js"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar melhorias","Guia para escrita de código eficiente","Otimização de bundling e carregamento","Melhoria do desempenho do código"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для приоритизации улучшений","Руководство для написания эффективного кода","Оптимизация бандлинга и загрузки","Улучшение производительности кода"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولويات","دليل لكتابة كود فعال","تحسين حزمة و تحميل","تحسين أداء الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React最佳实践","React性能优化","Next.js性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","性能优化规则"],"ja":["Vercel Reactベストプラクティス","Reactパフォーマンス最適化","Next.jsパフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","パフォーマンス最適化ルール"],"ko":["버셀 리액트 베스트 프랙티스","리액트 성능 최적화","넥스트.js 성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","성능 최적화 규칙"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","Melhores práticas","Desenvolvimento web","React","Next.js","Bundling","Carregamento"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","Лучшие практики","Веб-разработка","React","Next.js","Бандлинг","Загрузка"],"ar":["Vercel React","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الويب","React","Next.js","حزمة","تحميل"]}},"owner":"LeeCuongg","repo":"stock-flow-qt-food","repoPath":"LeeCuongg/stock-flow-qt-food","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:07:54.614Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js application performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のアプリケーションパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Next.js 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de aplicaciones React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de performances optimisées pour les applications React et Next.js.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte Leistung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 приложений React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى أداء تطبيقات React و Next.js المُحسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories for comprehensive performance optimization, including data fetching and bundling optimization using Vercel guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理自动化重构和代码生成的能力，用于 React 组件和 Next.js 页面，利用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别进行全面性能优化，包括使用 Vercel 指南进行数据获取和打包优化。","ja":"React コンポーネントと Next.js ページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって使用して包括的なパフォーマンス最適化を行い、Vercel ガイドラインを使用したデータ取得とバンドリングの最適化を含む。","ko":"리액트 컴포넌트와 넥스트 자스 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 57개의 규칙을 8개의 카테고리에 걸쳐 사용하여 포괄적인 성능 최적화를 수행하며, 버셀 가이드라인을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 및 번들 최적화를 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes React y páginas Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización integral del rendimiento, incluyendo la obtención de datos y la optimización de bundling utilizando las directrices de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactorisation et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en tirant parti de 57 règles réparties en 8 catégories pour une optimisation complète des performances, y compris la récupération de données et l''optimisation du bundling en utilisant les directives de Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents das Automatisieren von Refactoring und Code-Generierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten unter Nutzung von 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für umfassende Leistungsoptimierung, einschließlich Datenabfrage und Bundling-Optimierung nach Vercel-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, utilizando 57 regras em 8 categorias para otimização abrangente de desempenho, incluindo otimização de busca de dados e empacotamento usando diretrizes do Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для комплексной оптимизации производительности, включая оптимизацию извлечения данных и упаковки с использованием руководств Vercel.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من توفير تلقائي لإعادة هيكلة وإنشاء رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الشامل، بما في ذلك تحسين استرجاع البيانات وتحسين التعبئة باستخدام إرشادات Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for new React components","Generating optimized code for client and server-side data fetching","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Reviewing code for performance issues using Vercel''s 8 categories","Optimizing bundling for faster application loading"],"zh":["自动优化新 React 组件的性能","为客户端和服务器端数据获取生成优化代码","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能","使用 Vercel 的 8 个类别审查代码的性能问题","优化打包以实现更快的应用程序加载"],"ja":["新しい React コンポーネントのパフォーマンスを自動で最適化する","クライアントサイドとサーバーサイドのデータ取得のための最適化コードを生成する","既存の React と Next.js コードをより良いパフォーマンスのためにリファクタリングする","Vercel の 8 つのカテゴリを使用してコードのパフォーマンスの問題をレビューする","アプリケーションのロードを高速化するためにバンドルを最適化する"],"ko":["새로운 리액트 컴포넌트의 성능을 자동으로 최적화하는 것","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 데이터 가져오기를 위한 최적화 코드를 생성하는 것","기존의 리액트 및 넥스트 자스 코드를 더 나은 성능을 위해 리팩토링하는 것","버셀의 8개 카테고리를 사용하여 코드의 성능 문제를 검토하는 것","애플리케이션 로드를 더 빠르게 하기 위해 번들을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización del rendimiento para nuevos componentes React","Generación de código optimizado para la obtención de datos en el lado del cliente y del servidor","Refactorización de código existente de React y Next.js para mejorar el rendimiento","Revisión de código para detectar problemas de rendimiento utilizando las 8 categorías de Vercel","Optimización del bundling para una carga más rápida de la aplicación"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation des performances pour les nouveaux composants React","Génération de code optimisé pour la récupération de données côté client et serveur","Refactorisation du code React et Next.js existant pour de meilleures performances","Revue du code pour détecter les problèmes de performance en utilisant les 8 catégories de Vercel","Optimisation du bundling pour un chargement plus rapide de l''application"],"de":["Automatisierung der Leistungsoptimierung für neue React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für client- und serverseitige Datenabfragen","Refactoring von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für bessere Leistung","Überprüfung von Code auf Leistungsprobleme anhand der 8 Vercel-Kategorien","Optimierung des Bundlings für schnellere Anwendungsladezeiten"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para novos componentes React","Gerar código otimizado para busca de dados do lado do cliente e do servidor","Refatorar código existente React e Next.js para melhor desempenho","Revisar código para problemas de desempenho usando as 8 categorias do Vercel","Otimizar empacotamento para carregamento de aplicativos mais rápido"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для новых компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для извлечения данных на стороне клиента и сервера","Рефакторить существующий код React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Просматривать код на наличие проблем с производительностью, используя 8 категорий Vercel","Оптимизировать упаковку для более быстрой загрузки приложений"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتحسين الأداء لعناصر React الجديدة","إنشاء رمز محسّن لاسترجاع البيانات على جانب العميل وخادم","إعادة هيكلة رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء","استعراض الرمز لتحديد مشاكل الأداء باستخدام الفئات الثمانية من Vercel","تحسين التعبئة لتحميل التطبيقات بسرعة أكبر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to applications hosted on Vercel","May require manual review of automated refactoring suggestions"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js","仅限于托管在 Vercel 的应用程序","可能需要手动审查自动重构建议"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","Vercel でホストされているアプリケーションに限定される","自動リファクタリングの提案を手動でレビューする必要がある場合がある"],"ko":["리액트 및 넥스트 자スの 지식이 필요합니다","버셀에서 호스팅되는 애플리케이션으로 제한됩니다","자동 리팩토링 제안을 수동으로 검토해야 할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones alojadas en Vercel","Puede requerir revisión manual de las sugerencias de refactorización automatizada"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de React et Next.js","Limité aux applications hébergées sur Vercel","Peut nécessiter une revue manuelle des suggestions de refactorisation automatisée"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse in React und Next.js","Beschränkt auf Anwendungen, die auf Vercel gehostet werden","Kann manuelle Überprüfung der automatisierten Refactoring-Vorschläge erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado a aplicações hospedadas no Vercel","Pode exigir revisão manual de sugestões de refatoração automatizadas"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен для приложений, размещенных на Vercel","Может потребовать ручной проверки автоматических предложений по рефакторингу"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود للتطبيقات المضيفة على Vercel","يمكن أن يتطلب مراجعة يدوية لاقتراحات إعادة الهيكلة التلقائية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/mobile-ios-design', 'community', 'yashvinthan', 'DuskSpendr', 'yashvinthan/DuskSpendr', 'mobile-ios-design', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:07:53.074Z', NULL, '{"id":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr/mobile-ios-design","name":"mobile-ios-design","description":{"zh":"iOS, SwiftUI, Apple HIG.","ja":"iOS, SwiftUI, Apple HIG.","ko":"iOS, SwiftUI, Apple HIG.","es":"El diseño de iOS implica la creación de interfaces de usuario nativas y personalizadas para aplicaciones móviles","fr":"La conception iOS implique la création d''interfaces utilisateur natives et personnalisées pour les applications mobiles","de":"Das iOS-Design umfasst die Erstellung von nativen und maßgeschneiderten Benutzeroberflächen für mobile Anwendungen","pt":"Masterize o design de iOS com SwiftUI e crie aplicativos nativos que seguem as diretrizes da Apple","ru":"Освойте дизайн iOS с помощью SwiftUI и создайте родные приложения, соответствующие рекомендациям Apple","ar":"استخدم تصميم iOS مع SwiftUI وإنشاء تطبيقات أصلية تتوافق مع إرشادات Apple","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"iOS ","ja":"iOS","ko":"iOS ","es":"Diseño de iOS: Guía para Desarrolladores","fr":"Conception iOS: Guide pour Développeurs","de":"iOS-Design: Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Design de iOS: Crie Aplicativos Nativos com SwiftUI","ru":"Дизайн iOS: Создание родных приложений с помощью SwiftUI","ar":"تصميم iOS: إنشاء تطبيقات أصلية مع SwiftUI","en":"mobile-ios-design"},"description":{"zh":"iOS, SwiftUI, Apple HIG.","ja":"iOS, SwiftUI, Apple HIG.","ko":"iOS, SwiftUI, Apple HIG.","es":"El diseño de iOS implica la creación de interfaces de usuario nativas y personalizadas para aplicaciones móviles","fr":"La conception iOS implique la création d''interfaces utilisateur natives et personnalisées pour les applications mobiles","de":"Das iOS-Design umfasst die Erstellung von nativen und maßgeschneiderten Benutzeroberflächen für mobile Anwendungen","pt":"Masterize o design de iOS com SwiftUI e crie aplicativos nativos que seguem as diretrizes da Apple","ru":"Освойте дизайн iOS с помощью SwiftUI и создайте родные приложения, соответствующие рекомендациям Apple","ar":"استخدم تصميم iOS مع SwiftUI وإنشاء تطبيقات أصلية تتوافق مع إرشادات Apple","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols"],"ja":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols"],"ko":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","NavigationStack","TabView","SF Symbols"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario con SwiftUI","Implementación de patrones de navegación de iOS","Creación de diseños adaptativos para iPhone y iPad","Uso de SF Symbols y tipografía del sistema","Creación de interfaces de usuario accesibles"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur avec SwiftUI","Mise en œuvre de modèles de navigation iOS","Création de conceptions adaptatives pour iPhone et iPad","Utilisation de SF Symbols et de la typographie du système","Création d''interfaces utilisateur accessibles"],"de":["Entwurf von Benutzeroberflächen mit SwiftUI","Implementierung von iOS-Navigationsmustern","Erstellung von adaptiven Designs für iPhone und iPad","Verwendung von SF Symbols und Systemtypografie","Erstellung von zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário com SwiftUI","Implementação de padrões de navegação da Apple","Criação de layouts adaptáveis para iPhone e iPad","Uso de SF Symbols e tipografia do sistema","Criação de interfaces de usuário acessíveis"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов пользователя с помощью SwiftUI","Реализация рекомендаций Apple по навигации","Создание адаптивных макетов для iPhone и iPad","Использование SF Symbols и системной типографики","Создание доступных интерфейсов пользователя"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات المستخدم مع SwiftUI","تنفيذ إرشادات Apple للتنقل","إنشاء تخطيطات متكيفة لجهاز iPhone و iPad","استخدام SF Symbols والtypography النظام","إنشاء واجهات المستخدم المتوفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","iOS","iOS","iOS","SwiftUI","iOS"],"ja":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","iOS","iOS","iOS","SwiftUI","iOS"],"ko":["iOS","SwiftUI","Apple HIG","iOS","iOS","iOS","SwiftUI","iOS"],"es":["diseño de iOS","SwiftUI","patrones de interfaz de usuario","navegación de iOS","diseños adaptativos","SF Symbols","tipografía del sistema","interfaz de usuario accesible"],"fr":["conception iOS","SwiftUI","modèles d''interface utilisateur","navigation iOS","conceptions adaptatives","SF Symbols","typographie du système","interface utilisateur accessible"],"de":["iOS-Design","SwiftUI","Benutzeroberflächenmuster","iOS-Navigation","adaptive Designs","SF Symbols","Systemtypografie","zugängliche Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["design de iOS","SwiftUI","aplicativos iOS","diretrizes da Apple","interfaces de usuário","navegação da Apple","layouts adaptáveis","SF Symbols","tipografia do sistema"],"ru":["дизайн iOS","SwiftUI","приложения iOS","рекомендации Apple","интерфейсы пользователя","навигация Apple","адаптивные макеты","SF Symbols","системная типография"],"ar":["تصميم iOS","SwiftUI","تطبيقات iOS","إرشادات Apple","واجهات المستخدم","تنقل Apple","تخطيطات متكيفة","SF Symbols","typography النظام"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-ios-design","description":"Master iOS Human Interface Guidelines and SwiftUI patterns for building native iOS apps. Use when designing iOS interfaces, implementing SwiftUI views, or ensuring apps follow Apples design principles.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Mobile Design\n\nMaster iOS Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and SwiftUI patterns to build polished, native iOS applications that feel at home on Apple platforms.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG\n- Building SwiftUI views and layouts\n- Implementing iOS navigation patterns (NavigationStack, TabView, sheets)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad\n- Using SF Symbols and system typography\n- Building accessible iOS interfaces\n- Implementing iO","body":"# iOS Mobile Design\n\nMaster iOS Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) and SwiftUI patterns to build polished, native iOS applications that feel at home on Apple platforms.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing iOS app interfaces following Apple HIG\n- Building SwiftUI views and layouts\n- Implementing iOS navigation patterns (NavigationStack, TabView, sheets)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for iPhone and iPad\n- Using SF Symbols and system typography\n- Building accessible iOS interfaces\n- Implementing iOS-specific gestures and interactions\n- Designing for Dynamic Type and Dark Mode\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Human Interface Guidelines Principles\n\n**Clarity**: Content is legible, icons are precise, adornments are subtle\n**Deference**: UI helps users understand content without competing with it\n**Depth**: Visual layers and motion convey hierarchy and enable navigation\n\n**Platform Considerations:**\n\n- **iOS**: Touch-first, compact displays, portrait orientation\n- **iPadOS**: Larger canvas, multitasking, pointer support\n- **visionOS**: Spatial computing, eye/hand input\n\n### 2. SwiftUI Layout System\n\n**Stack-Based Layouts:**\n\n```swift\n// Vertical stack with alignment\nVStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 12) {\n    Text(\"Title\")\n        .font(.headline)\n    Text(\"Subtitle\")\n        .font(.subheadline)\n        .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n}\n\n// Horizontal stack with flexible spacing\nHStack {\n    Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")\n    Text(\"Featured\")\n    Spacer()\n    Text(\"View All\")\n        .foregroundStyle(.blue)\n}\n```\n\n**Grid Layouts:**\n\n```swift\n// Adaptive grid that fills available width\nLazyVGrid(columns: [\n    GridItem(.adaptive(minimum: 150, maximum: 200))\n], spacing: 16) {\n    ForEach(items) { item in\n        ItemCard(item: item)\n    }\n}\n\n// Fixed column grid\nLazyVGrid(columns: [\n    GridItem(.flexible()),\n    GridItem(.flexible()),\n    GridItem(.flexible())\n], spacing: 12) {\n    ForEach(items) { item in\n        ItemThumbnail(item: item)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Navigation Patterns\n\n**NavigationStack (iOS 16+):**\n\n```swift\nstruct ContentView: View {\n    @State private var path = NavigationPath()\n\n    var body: some View {\n        NavigationStack(path: $path) {\n            List(items) { item in\n                NavigationLink(value: item) {\n                    ItemRow(item: item)\n                }\n            }\n            .navigationTitle(\"Items\")\n            .navigationDestination(for: Item.self) { item in\n                ItemDetailView(item: item)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**TabView:**\n\n```swift\nstruct MainTabView: View {\n    @State private var selectedTab = 0\n\n    var body: some View {\n        TabView(selection: $selectedTab) {\n            HomeView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Home\", systemImage: \"house\")\n                }\n                .tag(0)\n\n            SearchView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Search\", systemImage: \"magnifyingglass\")\n                }\n                .tag(1)\n\n            ProfileView()\n                .tabItem {\n                    Label(\"Profile\", systemImage: \"person\")\n                }\n                .tag(2)\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. System Integration\n\n**SF Symbols:**\n\n```swift\n// Basic symbol\nImage(systemName: \"heart.fill\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.red)\n\n// Symbol with rendering mode\nImage(systemName: \"cloud.sun.fill\")\n    .symbolRenderingMode(.multicolor)\n\n// Variable symbol (iOS 16+)\nImage(systemName: \"speaker.wave.3.fill\", variableValue: volume)\n\n// Symbol effect (iOS 17+)\nImage(systemName: \"bell.fill\")\n    .symbolEffect(.bounce, value: notificationCount)\n```\n\n**Dynamic Type:**\n\n```swift\n// Use semantic fonts\nText(\"Headline\")\n    .font(.headline)\n\nText(\"Body text that scales with user preferences\")\n    .font(.body)\n\n// Custom font that respects Dynamic Type\nText(\"Custom\")\n    .font(.custom(\"Avenir\", size: 17, relativeTo: .body))\n```\n\n### 5. Visual Design\n\n**Colors and Materials:**\n\n```swift\n// Semantic colors that adapt to light/dark mode\nText(\"Primary\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.primary)\nText(\"Secondary\")\n    .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n\n// System materials for blur effects\nRectangle()\n    .fill(.ultraThinMaterial)\n    .frame(height: 100)\n\n// Vibrant materials for overlays\nText(\"Overlay\")\n    .padding()\n    .background(.regularMaterial, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n```\n\n**Shadows and Depth:**\n\n```swift\n// Standard card shadow\nRoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 16)\n    .fill(.background)\n    .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.1), radius: 8, y: 4)\n\n// Elevated appearance\n.shadow(radius: 2, y: 1)\n.shadow(radius: 8, y: 4)\n```\n\n## Quick Start Component\n\n```swift\nimport SwiftUI\n\nstruct FeatureCard: View {\n    let title: String\n    let description: String\n    let systemImage: String\n\n    var body: some View {\n        HStack(spacing: 16) {\n            Image(systemName: systemImage)\n                .font(.title)\n                .foregroundStyle(.blue)\n                .frame(width: 44, height: 44)\n                .background(.blue.opacity(0.1), in: Circle())\n\n            VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 4) {\n                Text(title)\n                    .font(.headline)\n                Text(description)\n                    .font(.subheadline)\n                    .foregroundStyle(.secondary)\n                    .lineLimit(2)\n            }\n\n            Spacer()\n\n            Image(systemName: \"chevron.right\")\n                .foregroundStyle(.tertiary)\n        }\n        .padding()\n        .background(.background, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))\n        .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.05), radius: 4, y: 2)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Semantic Colors**: Always use `.primary`, `.secondary`, `.background` for automatic light/dark mode support\n2. **Embrace SF Symbols**: Use system symbols for consistency and automatic accessibility\n3. **Support Dynamic Type**: Use semantic fonts (`.body`, `.headline`) instead of fixed sizes\n4. **Add Accessibility**: Include `.accessibilityLabel()` and `.accessibilityHint()` modifiers\n5. **Use Safe Areas**: Respect `safeAreaInset` and avoid hardcoded padding at screen edges\n6. **Implement State Restoration**: Use `@SceneStorage` for preserving user state\n7. **Support iPad Multitasking**: Design for split view and slide over\n8. **Test on Device**: Simulator doesn''t capture full haptic and performance experience\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Layout Breaking**: Use `.fixedSize()` sparingly; prefer flexible layouts\n- **Performance Issues**: Use `LazyVStack`/`LazyHStack` for long scrolling lists\n- **Navigation Bugs**: Ensure `NavigationLink` values are `Hashable`\n- **Dark Mode Problems**: Avoid hardcoded colors; use semantic or asset catalog colors\n- **Accessibility Failures**: Test with VoiceOver enabled\n- **Memory Leaks**: Watch for strong reference cycles in closures\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Human Interface Guidelines](https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/)\n- [SwiftUI Documentation](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/swiftui)\n- [SF Symbols App](https://developer.apple.com/sf-symbols/)\n- [WWDC SwiftUI Sessions](https://developer.apple.com/videos/swiftui/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:07:53.074Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Interface Agents specializing in Apple ecosystem development, seeking mastery of iOS Human Interface Guidelines and SwiftUI patterns.","zh":"适合专注于 Apple 生态系统开发的接口代理，寻求掌握 iOS 人机界面指南和 SwiftUI 模式的代理。","ja":"Apple エコシステム開発に特化したインターフェイス エージェントに適しています。iOS Human Interface Guidelines と SwiftUI パターンのマスターを目指します。","ko":"Apple 생태계 개발에 전문적인 인터페이스 에이전트에게 적합합니다. iOS Human Interface Guidelines 및 SwiftUI 패턴의 마스터리를 추구합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Interfaz que se especializan en el desarrollo del ecosistema de Apple, buscando dominar las Guías de Interfaz Humana de iOS y los patrones de SwiftUI.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Interface spécialisés dans le développement de l''écosystème Apple, cherchant à maîtriser les Lignes directrices d''interface humaine d''iOS et les modèles de SwiftUI.","de":"Ideal für Interface-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung des Apple-Ökosystems spezialisieren und die Beherrschung der iOS-Richtlinien für die Benutzeroberfläche und der SwiftUI-Muster anstreben.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Interface especializados no desenvolvimento do ecossistema Apple, buscando domínio das Diretrizes de Interface Humana do iOS e padrões do SwiftUI.","ru":"Идеально для Интерфейсных Агентов, специализирующихся на разработке экосистемы Apple, стремящихся к совершенству в руководстве по интерфейсу человека iOS и шаблонах SwiftUI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة المتخصص في تطوير نظام الإيكوسيستيم من أبل، يسعى إلى إتقان إرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشرية من آي أو إس وأنساق سوفت وير كيت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design polished, native iOS applications using SwiftUI, implementing iOS navigation patterns like NavigationStack and TabView, and creating adaptive layouts with SF Symbols and system typography for seamless user experiences.","zh":"赋予代理设计精致的原生 iOS 应用程序的能力，使用 SwiftUI 实现 iOS 导航模式，如 NavigationStack 和 TabView，并使用 SF Symbols 和系统字体创建自适应布局，以实现无缝的用户体验。","ja":"エージェントが SwiftUI を使用して、ナビゲーションスタックやタブビューなどの iOS ナビゲーションパターンを実装し、SF シンボルやシステムフォントを使用して適応型レイアウトを作成し、シームレスなユーザーエクスペリエンスを実現するネイティブの iOS アプリケーションを設計できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 SwiftUI를 사용하여 네이티브 iOS 애플리케이션을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. iOS 네비게이션 패턴을 구현하고 SF Symbols 및 시스템 글꼴을 사용하여 적응형 레이아웃을 생성하여 무결점의 사용자 경험을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar aplicaciones iOS nativas y pulidas utilizando SwiftUI, implementando patrones de navegación de iOS como NavigationStack y TabView, y creando diseños adaptables con SF Symbols y tipografía del sistema para experiencias de usuario perfectas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des applications iOS natives et polies en utilisant SwiftUI, en implémentant des modèles de navigation d''iOS tels que NavigationStack et TabView, et en créant des dispositions adaptables avec des symboles SF et une typographie système pour des expériences utilisateur sans rupture.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, native und polierte iOS-Anwendungen mit SwiftUI zu entwerfen, indem sie iOS-Navigationsmuster wie NavigationStack und TabView implementieren und adaptive Layouts mit SF-Symbolen und Systemtypografie für nahtlose Benutzererfahrungen erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar aplicativos iOS nativos e polidos usando o SwiftUI, implementando padrões de navegação do iOS como NavigationStack e TabView, e criando layouts adaptáveis com SF Symbols e tipografia do sistema para experiências de usuário sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать отполированные, родные приложения iOS с помощью SwiftUI, реализуя шаблоны навигации iOS, такие как NavigationStack и TabView, и создавая адаптивные макеты с SF Symbols и системной типографией для бесперебойных пользовательских опытов.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تصميم تطبيقات آي أو إس الأصلية والمحسنة باستخدام سوفت وير كيت، وتنفيذ أنماط الملاحة في آي أو إس مثل NavigationStack و TabView، وخلق تخطيطات متكيفة مع رموز إس إف والطباعة النظامية لتحقيق تجارب مستخدم بدون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing intuitive iOS app interfaces following Apple''s Human Interface Guidelines","Building responsive SwiftUI views and layouts for iPhone and iPad","Implementing accessible iOS interfaces with adaptive navigation and typography"],"zh":["设计符合 Apple 人机界面指南的直观 iOS 应用程序接口","为 iPhone 和 iPad 构建响应式的 SwiftUI 视图和布局","实施具有适应性导航和字体的可访问 iOS 接口"],"ja":["Apple 人機インターフェイス ガイドラインに従った直感的な iOS アプリケーション インターフェイスを設計する","iPhone と iPad のためのレスポンシブな SwiftUI ビューとレイアウトを構築する","適応型ナビゲーションとフォントを備えたアクセス可能な iOS インターフェイスを実装する"],"ko":["Apple 人机 인터페이스 가이드라인을 따르는直관적인 iOS 애플리케이션 인터페이스를 설계","iPhone 및 iPad를 위한 반응형 SwiftUI 뷰 및 레이아웃을 구축","적응형 네비게이션 및 글꼴을 갖춘 접근 가능한 iOS 인터페이스를 구현"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de aplicaciones iOS intuitivas siguiendo las Guías de Interfaz Humana de Apple","Crear vistas y diseños responsivos de SwiftUI para iPhone y iPad","Implementar interfaces iOS accesibles con navegación adaptables y tipografía"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces d''applications iOS intuitives en suivant les Lignes directrices d''interface humaine d''Apple","Créer des vues et des dispositions de SwiftUI réactives pour iPhone et iPad","Implémenter des interfaces iOS accessibles avec une navigation adaptable et une typographie"],"de":["Intuitive iOS-App-Interfaces entwerfen, die den Richtlinien für die Benutzeroberfläche von Apple folgen","Reaktive SwiftUI-Ansichten und -Layouts für iPhone und iPad erstellen","Zugängliche iOS-Interfaces mit adaptiver Navigation und Typografie implementieren"],"pt":["Projetando interfaces de aplicativos iOS intuitivas seguindo as Diretrizes de Interface Humana da Apple","Construindo visualizações e layouts do SwiftUI responsivos para iPhone e iPad","Implementando interfaces do iOS acessíveis com navegação e tipografia adaptáveis"],"ru":["Проектирование интуитивно понятных интерфейсов приложений iOS, следуя руководству по интерфейсу человека Apple","Создание отзывчивых представлений и макетов SwiftUI для iPhone и iPad","Реализация доступных интерфейсов iOS с адаптивной навигацией и типографией"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات تطبيقات آي أو إس بديهية متوافقة مع إرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشرية من أبل","بناء معاينة وتصميمات سوفت وير كيت المستجيبة للهاتف الخلوي وآي باد","تنفيذ واجهات آي أو إس القابلة للوصول مع الملاحة والطباعة المتكيفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Swift programming language","Exclusive to iOS platform development","Adherence to Apple''s Human Interface Guidelines necessary"],"zh":["需要 Swift 编程语言的知识","仅限于 iOS 平台开发","需要遵守 Apple 人机界面指南"],"ja":["Swift プログラミング言語の知識が必要","iOS プラットフォーム開発に限定される","Apple 人機インターフェイス ガイドラインの遵守が必要"],"ko":["Swift 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식이 필요","iOS 플랫폼 개발에만 국한","Apple 人机 인터페이스 가이드라인을 준수해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Swift","Exclusivo para el desarrollo de la plataforma iOS","Necesaria la adhesión a las Guías de Interfaz Humana de Apple"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage de programmation Swift","Exclusif au développement de la plate-forme iOS","L''adhésion aux Lignes directrices d''interface humaine d''Apple est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Swift-Programmiersprache","Exklusiv für die Entwicklung der iOS-Plattform","Die Einhaltung der Richtlinien für die Benutzeroberfläche von Apple ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da linguagem de programação Swift","Exclusivo para desenvolvimento de plataforma do iOS","Adesão às Diretrizes de Interface Humana da Apple necessária"],"ru":["Требует знания языка программирования Swift","Эксклюзивно для разработки платформы iOS","Соблюдение руководства по интерфейсу человека Apple необходимо"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة برمجة سوفت","حصري لتنمية منصة آي أو إس","الامتثال لإرشادات واجهة المستخدم البشرية من أبل ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
