cacité et des performances des applications"],"de":["57 Regeln zur Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für einen umfassenden Leitfaden","Priorisierung von Regeln nach Auswirkung","Automatisierung von Refactoring und Codegenerierung","Optimierung von Bundles und Leistung","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Leistung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para priorizar o impacto","Guia para refatoração automática e geração de código","Otimização para aplicações React e Next.js","Melhoria da performance com práticas recomendadas"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для определения приоритета влияния","Руководство для автоматического рефакторинга и генерации кода","Оптимизация для приложений React и Next.js","Улучшение производительности с помощью рекомендуемых практик"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحديد الأولوية للتأثير","دليل لإعادة هيكلة التطبيق وإنشاء الكود","تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات React و Next.js","تحسين الأداء باستخدام أفضل الممارسات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","最佳实践","性能优化","React 优化","Next.js 优化","自动重构","代码生成"],"ja":["Vercel React","ベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成"],"ko":["Vercel React","최적화 가이드","성능 최적화","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성"],"es":["Vercel React","optimización de rendimiento","aplicaciones React","Next.js","mejores prácticas","refactorización","generación de código","optimización de bundles","eficiencia y rendimiento"],"fr":["Vercel React","optimisation des performances","applications React","Next.js","meilleures pratiques","refactoring","génération de code","optimisation des bundles","efficacité et performances"],"de":["Vercel React","Leistungsoptimierung","React-Anwendungen","Next.js","Best-Practices","Refactoring","Codegenerierung","Optimierung von Bundles","Effizienz und Leistung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas React","Otimização de desempenho React","Desenvolvimento de aplicações React","React performance optimization","Next.js optimization"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики React","Оптимизация производительности React","Разработка приложений React","React производительность оптимизация","Next.js оптимизация"],"ar":["Vercel React","أفضل الممارسات لتفعل React","تحسين أداء React","تطوير تطبيقات React","تحسين أداء React","تحسين Next.js"]}},"owner":"Kujikuu","repo":"reality-accelerator","repoPath":"Kujikuu/reality-accelerator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:07:40.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要全面React和Next.js性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが包括的なReactおよびNext.jsのパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전면 에이전트가 포괄적인 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de optimización de rendimiento completas de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des fonctionnalités complètes d''optimisation des performances React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die umfassende React- und Next.js-Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que precisam de capacidades abrangentes de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات شاملة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React components and Next.js pages, leveraging 57 rules across 8 categories for impact-driven optimization, including data fetching and bundling.","zh":"赋予代理自动重构和代码生成的能力，用于React组件和Next.js页面，利用57条规则跨8个类别进行影响驱动的优化，包括数据获取和打包。","ja":"エージェントにReactコンポーネントとNext.jsページの自動リファクタリングとコード生成を可能にし、影響のある最適化のための8つのカテゴリにわたる57のルールを利用し、データの取得やバンドルを含む。","ko":"에이전트에게 리액트 컴포넌트 및 넥스트.js 페이지의 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 가능하게 하며, 데이터 가져오기 및 번들링을 포함하여 영향 있는 최적화를 위한 8개 범주에 걸쳐 57개 규칙을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para componentes de React y páginas de Next.js, aprovechando 57 reglas en 8 categorías para una optimización impulsada por el impacto, incluida la recuperación de datos y la agrupación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les composants React et les pages Next.js, en exploitant 57 règles dans 8 catégories pour une optimisation axée sur l''impact, y compris la récupération de données et le regroupement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten zu automatisieren, indem es 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien für eine auswirkungsorientierte Optimierung nutzt, einschließlich Datenabruf und Bündelung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e geração de código para componentes React e páginas Next.js, aproveitando 57 regras em 8 categorias para otimização orientada ao impacto, incluindo busca de dados e empacotamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для компонентов React и страниц Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях для оптимизации, ориентированной на воздействие, включая получение данных и сборку.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تutomation إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز لمكونات React وصفحات Next.js، مستفيدا من 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات لتحسين الأداء الموجه للتأثير، بما في ذلك استرداد البيانات وتحزيمها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components","Refactoring existing Next.js code for better performance"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以发现性能问题","生成优化的React组件","重构现有的Next.js代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を発見するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化されたReactコンポーネントの生成","パフォーマンスの向上のための既存のNext.jsコードのリファクタリング"],"ko":["성능 문제를 발견하기 위한 코드 리뷰의 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트의 생성","성능 개선을 위한 기존 넥스트.js 코드의 리팩토링"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generar componentes de React optimizados","Reorganizar el código existente de Next.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances","Générer des composants React optimisés","Réorganiser le code existant de Next.js pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generieren von optimierten React-Komponenten","Umstrukturieren des bestehenden Next.js-Codes für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React otimizados","Refatorar código Next.js existente para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода на наличие проблем с производительностью","Генерировать оптимизированные компоненты React","Рефакторить существующий код Next.js для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["توسيع مراجعة رمز لمشاكل الأداء","توليد مكونات React محسنة","إعادة هيكلة رمز Next.js الحالي من أجل أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js project setup","Limited to JavaScript ecosystem"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js项目设置","仅限于JavaScript生态系统"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","JavaScriptのエコシステムに限定"],"ko":["리액트 또는 넥스트.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","자바스크립트 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto React o Next.js","Limitado al ecosistema de JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React ou Next.js","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt React- oder Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf JavaScript-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto React ou Next.js","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React или Next.js","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React أو Next.js","محدود بنظام JavaScript"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('prime399/packmate/seo-audit', 'community', 'prime399', 'packmate', 'prime399/packmate', 'seo-audit', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:08:07.728Z', NULL, '{"id":"prime399/packmate/seo-audit","name":"seo-audit","description":{"zh":"SEO审计是识别和解决网站搜索引擎优化问题的过程，以提高网站在搜索引擎中的排名和可见性","ja":"SEOオーディットは、ウェブサイトの検索エンジン最適化の問題を特定して解決し、検索エンジンでのランキングと可視性を向上させるプロセスです","ko":"SEO 감사는 웹사이트의 검색 엔진 최적화 문제를 식별하고 해결하여 검색 엔진에서 랭크와 가시성을 향상시키는 프로세스입니다","es":"El análisis de SEO ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica. Obtén recomendaciones para tu sitio web.","fr":"L''audit SEO aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer les performances de recherche organique. Obtenez des recommandations pour votre site Web.","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft bei der Identifizierung von Problemen und der Verbesserung der Leistung der organischen Suche. Erhalten Sie Empfehlungen für Ihre Website.","pt":"Realize uma análise de SEO para identificar problemas e melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica. Obtenha recomendações práticas para otimizar seu site.","ru":"Проведите аудит SEO, чтобы выявить проблемы и улучшить результаты поиска. Получите практические рекомендации для оптимизации вашего сайта.","ar":"أجر فحصًا لتحسين محركات البحث لتحديد المشاكل وتحسين أداء البحث العضوي. احصل على توصيات عملية لتحسين موقعك.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SEO 审计工具","ja":"SEO オーディットツール","ko":"SEO 감사 도구","es":"Análisis de SEO para Desarrolladores","fr":"Audit SEO pour Développeurs","de":"SEO-Audit für Entwickler","pt":"Análise de SEO: Otimização de Desempenho de Busca","ru":"Аудит SEO: Улучшение Результатов Поиска","ar":"فحص تحسين محركات البحث: تحسين أداء البحث","en":"seo-audit"},"description":{"zh":"SEO审计是识别和解决网站搜索引擎优化问题的过程，以提高网站在搜索引擎中的排名和可见性","ja":"SEOオーディットは、ウェブサイトの検索エンジン最適化の問題を特定して解決し、検索エンジンでのランキングと可視性を向上させるプロセスです","ko":"SEO 감사는 웹사이트의 검색 엔진 최적화 문제를 식별하고 해결하여 검색 엔진에서 랭크와 가시성을 향상시키는 프로세스입니다","es":"El análisis de SEO ayuda a identificar problemas y mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica. Obtén recomendaciones para tu sitio web.","fr":"L''audit SEO aide à identifier les problèmes et à améliorer les performances de recherche organique. Obtenez des recommandations pour votre site Web.","de":"Das SEO-Audit hilft bei der Identifizierung von Problemen und der Verbesserung der Leistung der organischen Suche. Erhalten Sie Empfehlungen für Ihre Website.","pt":"Realize uma análise de SEO para identificar problemas e melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica. Obtenha recomendações práticas para otimizar seu site.","ru":"Проведите аудит SEO, чтобы выявить проблемы и улучшить результаты поиска. Получите практические рекомендации для оптимизации вашего сайта.","ar":"أجر فحصًا لتحسين محركات البحث لتحديد المشاكل وتحسين أداء البحث العضوي. احصل على توصيات عملية لتحسين موقعك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["网站结构分析","关键词研究","内容优化","技术优化","链接建设"],"ja":["ウェブサイト構造分析","キーワードリサーチ","コンテンツ最適化","テクニカル最適化","リンクビルディング"],"ko":["웹사이트 구조 분석","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화","기술 최적화","링크 구축"],"es":["Identificación de problemas de SEO","Análisis de contexto de sitio","Recomendaciones para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda","Optimización de contenido","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Análisis de competidores"],"fr":["Identification des problèmes de SEO","Analyse du contexte du site","Recommandations pour améliorer les performances de recherche","Optimisation du contenu","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Analyse des concurrents"],"de":["Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","Analyse des Kontexts der Website","Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Suchleistung","Optimierung von Inhalten","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Analyse der Wettbewerber"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de SEO","Análise de contexto de site","Recomendações práticas para otimização","Melhoria do desempenho de busca orgânica","Análise de marketing de produto","Otimização de site para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Выявление проблем SEO","Анализ контекста сайта","Практические рекомендации для оптимизации","Улучшение результатов поиска","Анализ маркетинга продукта","Оптимизация сайта для лучшего результата"],"ar":["تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث","تحليل سياق الموقع","توصيات عملية لتحسين","تحسين أداء البحث العضوي","تحليل تسويق المنتج","تحسين موقع الويب لتحقيق أفضل نتائج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SEO审计","搜索引擎优化","网站排名","可见性","关键词研究","内容优化"],"ja":["SEOオーディット","検索エンジン最適化","ウェブサイトランキング","可視性","キーワードリサーチ","コンテンツ最適化"],"ko":["SEO 감사","검색 엔진 최적화","웹사이트 랭크","가시성","키워드 연구","콘텐츠 최적화"],"es":["análisis de SEO","optimización de sitio web","mejora de búsqueda orgánica","recomendaciones de SEO","análisis de competidores","experiencia del usuario","contenido optimizado","rendimiento de búsqueda","problemas de SEO"],"fr":["audit SEO","optimisation de site Web","amélioration de recherche organique","recommandations SEO","analyse des concurrents","expérience utilisateur","contenu optimisé","performances de recherche","problèmes de SEO"],"de":["SEO-Audit","Optimierung von Websites","Verbesserung der organischen Suche","SEO-Empfehlungen","Analyse der Wettbewerber","Benutzererfahrung","optimierter Inhalt","Suchleistung","SEO-Probleme"],"pt":["análise de SEO","otimização de site","desempenho de busca orgânica","recomendações de SEO","marketing de produto","auditoria de SEO","melhoria de desempenho de busca","otimização de site para SEO"],"ru":["аудит SEO","оптимизация сайта","результаты поиска","рекомендации SEO","маркетинг продукта","анализ контекста сайта","улучшение результатов поиска","оптимизация сайта для SEO"],"ar":["فحص تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين موقع الويب","أداء البحث العضوي","توصيات تحسين محركات البحث","تسويق المنتج","تحليل سياق الموقع","تحسين أداء البحث","تحسين موقع الويب لتحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"prime399","repo":"packmate","repoPath":"prime399/packmate","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:08:07.728Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing expert search engine optimization analysis and recommendations.","zh":"非常适合需要专家搜索引擎优化分析和建议的数字营销代理。","ja":"デジタルマーケティングエージェントが専門の検索エンジン最適化分析と推奨事項を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"디지털 마케팅 에이전트가 전문적인 검색 엔진 최적화 분석 및 추천을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan un análisis y recomendaciones de optimización de motores de búsqueda expertos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin d''une analyse et de recommandations d''optimisation de moteur de recherche expertes.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketingagenten, die eine Expertenanalyse und Empfehlungen zur Suchmaschinenoptimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de análise e recomendações de otimização de mecanismo de busca especializadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы экспертные анализ и рекомендации по оптимизации поисковых систем.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تسويق رقمية التي تحتاج إلى تحليل وتوصيات خبيرة لتحسين محركات البحث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance, utilizing site context and product marketing information, including checking for files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and understanding site types.","zh":"赋予代理识别SEO问题并提供可行的建议以改善有机搜索性能的能力，利用站点上下文和产品营销信息，包括检查`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`等文件以及理解站点类型。","ja":"エージェントがSEOの問題を特定し、有機検索パフォーマンスを改善するための実行可能な推奨事項を提供することを可能にします。サイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティング情報を利用し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルを確認し、サイトの種類を理解します。","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 유기적 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실행 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. 사이트 컨텍스트와 제품 마케팅 정보를 활용하여 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 확인하고 사이트 유형을 이해합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones con acciones para mejorar el rendimiento de la búsqueda orgánica, utilizando el contexto del sitio y la información de marketing de productos, incluyendo la comprobación de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y la comprensión de los tipos de sitios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations avec des actions pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique, en utilisant le contexte du site et les informations de marketing de produits, notamment en vérifiant les fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en comprenant les types de sites.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der organischen Suchleistung zu geben, unter Verwendung des Kontexts der Website und der Produktmarketinginformationen, einschließlich der Überprüfung von Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` und dem Verständnis der Seitentypen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações eficazes para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica, utilizando o contexto do site e as informações de marketing de produto, incluindo a verificação de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e a compreensão dos tipos de site.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации для улучшения органического поискового результата, используя контекст сайта и информацию о маркетинге продукта, включая проверку файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и понимание типов сайтов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء البحث العضوي، باستخدام سياق الموقع ومعلومات تسويق المنتج، بما في ذلك التحقق من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وفهم أنواع الموقع."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing websites for SEO issues and providing recommendations","Analyzing site context to inform SEO strategies","Reviewing product marketing context to optimize search performance"],"zh":["为网站进行SEO问题的审计并提供建议","分析网站上下文以指导SEO策略","审查产品营销上下文以优化搜索性能"],"ja":["SEOの問題の監査と推奨事項の提供","サイトのコンテキストを分析してSEO戦略を決定する","製品マーケティングコンテキストをレビューして検索パフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["SEO 문제에 대한 웹 사이트 감사를 수행하고 추천을 제공하는 경우","사이트 컨텍스트를 분석하여 SEO 전략을 정보로 하는 경우","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 검토하여 검색 성능을 최적화하는 경우"],"es":["Auditoría de sitios web para problemas de SEO y proporcionar recomendaciones","Análisis del contexto del sitio para informar las estrategias de SEO","Revisión del contexto de marketing de productos para optimizar el rendimiento de la búsqueda"],"fr":["Audit de sites Web pour les problèmes de SEO et fournir des recommandations","Analyse du contexte du site pour informer les stratégies de SEO","Examen du contexte de marketing de produits pour optimiser les performances de recherche"],"de":["Prüfung von Webseiten auf SEO-Probleme und Bereitstellung von Empfehlungen","Analyse des Kontexts der Website, um SEO-Strategien zu informieren","Überprüfung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts zur Optimierung der Suchleistung"],"pt":["Auditoria de sites para problemas de SEO e fornecimento de recomendações","Análise do contexto do site para informar estratégias de SEO","Revisão do contexto de marketing de produto para otimizar o desempenho de busca"],"ru":["Проверка сайтов на наличие проблем SEO и предоставление рекомендаций","Анализ контекста сайта для разработки стратегий SEO","Просмотр контекста маркетинга продукта для оптимизации поискового результата"],"ar":["مراجعة المواقع الإلكترونية لتحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث وتقديم التوصيات","تحليل سياق الموقع لإعلام استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث","مراجعة سياق تسويق المنتج لتحسين أداء البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site and product marketing context information","Limited to analyzing provided site context and product marketing data"],"zh":["需要访问网站和产品营销上下文信息","仅限于分析提供的网站上下文和产品营销数据"],"ja":["サイトと製品マーケティングのコンテキスト情報へのアクセスが必要","提供されたサイトのコンテキストと製品マーケティングデータのみを分析する"],"ko":["사이트와 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요함","제공된 사이트 컨텍스트 및 제품 마케팅 데이터만을 분석함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la información del contexto del sitio y del marketing de productos","Limitado al análisis de la información del contexto del sitio y del marketing de productos proporcionada"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''information de contexte du site et de marketing de produits","Limité à l''analyse des informations de contexte du site et de marketing de produits fournies"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kontextinformationen der Website und des Produktmarketings","Begrenzt auf die Analyse der bereitgestellten Kontextinformationen der Website und des Produktmarketings"],"pt":["Requer acesso a informações de contexto do site e de marketing de produto","Limitado à análise do contexto do site e dos dados de marketing de produto fornecidos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к информации о контексте сайта и маркетинге продукта","Ограничен анализом предоставленного контекста сайта и данных о маркетинге продукта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معلومات سياق الموقع وتسويق المنتج","محدود بتحليل سياق الموقع ومعلومات تسويق المنتج المقدّمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rongma1sheng/kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant/slack-gif-creator', 'community', 'rongma1sheng', 'kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant', 'rongma1sheng/kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant', 'slack-gif-creator', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:08:41.158Z', NULL, '{"id":"rongma1sheng/kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant/slack-gif-creator","name":"slack-gif-creator","description":{"zh":"Slack GIF 创建工具提供了一系列实用工具和知识，帮助您创建适用于 Slack 的动态 GIF","ja":"Slack GIF 作成ツールは、Slack 用のアニメーション GIF を作成するためのユーティリティと知識を提供します","ko":"슬랙 GIF 생성 도구는 슬랙용 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하기 위한 유용한 도구와 지식을 제공합니다","es":"El creador de GIF para Slack es una herramienta que proporciona utilidades y conocimientos para crear GIF animados optimizados para la plataforma.","fr":"Le créateur de GIF pour Slack est un outil qui fournit des utilitaires et des connaissances pour créer des GIF animés optimisés pour la plateforme.","de":"Der Slack GIF Ersteller ist ein Toolkit, das Utilities und Wissen für die Erstellung von animierten GIFs für die Plattform bietet","en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Slack GIF 创建工具","ja":"Slack GIF 作成ツール","ko":"슬랙 GIF 생성 도구","es":"Creador de GIF para Slack","fr":"Créateur de GIF pour Slack","de":"Slack GIF Ersteller","en":"slack-gif-creator"},"description":{"zh":"Slack GIF 创建工具提供了一系列实用工具和知识，帮助您创建适用于 Slack 的动态 GIF","ja":"Slack GIF 作成ツールは、Slack 用のアニメーション GIF を作成するためのユーティリティと知識を提供します","ko":"슬랙 GIF 생성 도구는 슬랙용 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하기 위한 유용한 도구와 지식을 제공합니다","es":"El creador de GIF para Slack es una herramienta que proporciona utilidades y conocimientos para crear GIF animados optimizados para la plataforma.","fr":"Le créateur de GIF pour Slack est un outil qui fournit des utilitaires et des connaissances pour créer des GIF animés optimisés pour la plateforme.","de":"Der Slack GIF Ersteller ist ein Toolkit, das Utilities und Wissen für die Erstellung von animierten GIFs für die Plattform bietet","en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"definition":{"en":"🤖 Kiro智能开发助手 - AI驱动的开发支持系统"},"features":{"zh":["支持创建适用于 Slack 的动态 GIF","提供 GIF 尺寸和参数的优化建议","支持 Python 库的集成","提供核心工作流程示例代码","支持自定义 GIF 动画"],"ja":["Slack 用のアニメーション GIF の作成をサポート","GIF サイズとパラメータの最適化を提案","Python ライブラリの統合をサポート","コア ワークフロー例コードを提供","カスタム GIF アニメーションのサポート"],"ko":["슬랙용 애니메이션 GIF 생성을 지원","GIF 크기와 매개변수의 최적화를 제안","파이썬 라이브러리의 통합을 지원","코어 워크플로우 예시 코드 제공","사용자 지정 GIF 애니메이션 지원"],"es":["Dimensiones personalizables para GIF de emojis y mensajes","Parámetros de FPS, colores y duración configurables","Compatibilidad con la biblioteca PIL para la creación de imágenes","GIFs optimizados para una carga rápida en Slack","Integración con el flujo de trabajo de desarrollo de Python"],"fr":["Dimensions personnalisables pour les GIF d''émoticônes et de messages","Paramètres de FPS, de couleurs et de durée configurables","Compatibilité avec la bibliothèque PIL pour la création d''images","GIF optimisés pour un chargement rapide sur Slack","Intégration avec le flux de travail de développement Python"],"de":["Anpassbare Dimensionen für Emojy-GIFs und Nachrichten-GIFs","Konfigurierbare Parameter für FPS, Farben und Dauer","Kompatibilität mit der Bibliothek PIL für die Erstellung von Bildern","GIFs optimiert für ein schnelles Laden in Slack","Integration mit dem Entwicklungs-Workflow von Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Slack GIF","GIF 创建工具","动态 GIF","Slack 开发","Python 库","GIF 优化","Slack 实用工具"],"ja":["Slack GIF","GIF 作成ツール","アニメーション GIF","Slack 開発","Python ライブラリ","GIF 最適化","Slack ユーティリティ"],"ko":["슬랙 GIF","GIF 생성 도구","애니메이션 GIF","슬랙 개발","파이썬 라이브러리","GIF 최적화","슬랙 유용한 도구"],"es":["creador de GIF para Slack","GIF animados para Slack","herramientas de desarrollo para Slack","optimización de GIF para Slack","desarrollo de Python para Slack","biblioteca PIL para la creación de imágenes"],"fr":["créateur de GIF pour Slack","GIF animés pour Slack","outils de développement pour Slack","optimisation de GIF pour Slack","développement Python pour Slack","bibliothèque PIL pour la création d''images"],"de":["Slack GIF Ersteller","animierte GIFs für Slack","Entwicklertools für Slack","GIF-Optimierung für Slack","Python-Entwicklung für Slack","Bibliothek PIL für die Erstellung von Bildern"]}},"owner":"rongma1sheng","repo":"kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant","repoPath":"rongma1sheng/kiro-intelligent-dev-assistant","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:08:41.158Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced animated GIF creation capabilities for Slack optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级动画GIF创建功能以优化Slack的视觉内容代理。","ja":"Slackの最適化のために高度なアニメーションGIF作成機能を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適。","ko":"슬랙 최적화를 위한 고급 애니메이션 GIF 생성 기능이 필요한 비주얼 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de GIF animados para la optimización de Slack.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création de GIF animés pour l''optimisation de Slack.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Erstellung von animierten GIFs für die Optimierung von Slack benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de GIF animados para otimização do Slack.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных контент-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности создания анимированных GIF для оптимизации Slack.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء GIF متحرك لتحسين Slack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate optimized animated GIFs using Python libraries like PIL, with customizable parameters such as FPS, colors, and duration, to create engaging visual content for Slack.","zh":"赋予代理生成使用Python库（如PIL）并可自定义参数（如FPS、颜色、持续时间）来创建Slack的吸引人视觉内容的优化动画GIF的能力。","ja":"PILなどのPythonライブラリを使用して、FPS、色、時間などのパラメータをカスタマイズして、Slackの魅力的なビジュアルコンテンツを作成するための最適化されたアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"PIL과 같은 Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 FPS, 색상, 지속 시간 등의 매개 변수를 사용자 정의하여 슬랙의 매력적인 비주얼 콘텐츠를 생성하기 위한 최적화된 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIF animados optimizados mediante bibliotecas de Python como PIL, con parámetros personalizables como FPS, colores y duración, para crear contenido visual atractivo para Slack.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIF animés optimisés à l''aide de bibliothèques Python comme PIL, avec des paramètres personnalisables tels que FPS, couleurs et durée, pour créer un contenu visuel attrayant pour Slack.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, optimierte animierte GIFs mithilfe von Python-Bibliotheken wie PIL zu erstellen, mit anpassbaren Parametern wie FPS, Farben und Dauer, um ansprechende visuelle Inhalte für Slack zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar GIFs animados otimizados usando bibliotecas Python como PIL, com parâmetros personalizáveis como FPS, cores e duração, para criar conteúdo visual atraente para o Slack.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать оптимизированные анимированные GIF, используя библиотеки Python, такие как PIL, с настраиваемыми параметрами, такими как FPS, цвета и продолжительность, для создания привлекательного визуального контента для Slack.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من generar GIFs متحركة معززة باستخدام مكتبات Python مثل PIL، مع معلمات قابلة للتعديل مثل FPS والألوان والمده، لإنشاء محتوى مرئي جذاب لاسلك."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating animated GIFs for Slack emoji and message optimization","Creating visually appealing GIFs with customizable dimensions and parameters","Optimizing GIF file size for faster loading times in Slack"],"zh":["为Slack表情符号和消息优化生成动画GIF","使用可自定义的尺寸和参数创建视觉上吸引人的GIF","优化GIF文件大小以加快Slack中的加载速度"],"ja":["Slackの絵文字とメッセージの最適化のためにアニメーションGIFを生成する","カスタマイズ可能な寸法とパラメータを使用して視覚的に魅力的なGIFを作成する","Slackでの読み込み時間の高速化のためにGIFファイルサイズを最適化する"],"ko":["슬랙 이모티콘 및 메시지 최적화를 위해 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하는 것","사용자 정의 가능한 크기 및 매개 변수를 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 GIF를 생성하는 것","슬랙에서 로딩 시간을 더 빠르게 하기 위해 GIF 파일 크기를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Generación de GIF animados para la optimización de emojis y mensajes de Slack","Creación de GIF visuales atractivos con dimensiones y parámetros personalizables","Optimización del tamaño del archivo GIF para tiempos de carga más rápidos en Slack"],"fr":["Génération de GIF animés pour l''optimisation des émojis et des messages Slack","Création de GIF visuels attrayants avec des dimensions et des paramètres personnalisables","Optimisation de la taille du fichier GIF pour des temps de chargement plus rapides dans Slack"],"de":["Erstellung von animierten GIFs zur Optimierung von Emojis und Nachrichten in Slack","Erstellung von visuell ansprechenden GIFs mit anpassbaren Dimensionen und Parametern","Optimierung der GIF-Dateigröße für schnellere Ladezeiten in Slack"],"pt":["Geração de GIFs animados para otimização de emojis e mensagens do Slack","Criação de GIFs visualmente atraentes com dimensões e parâmetros personalizáveis","Otimização do tamanho do arquivo GIF para tempos de carregamento mais rápidos no Slack"],"ru":["Генерация анимированных GIF для оптимизации эмодзи и сообщений Slack","Создание визуально привлекательных GIF с настраиваемыми размерами и параметрами","Оптимизация размера файла GIF для более быстрой загрузки в Slack"],"ar":["إنشاء GIFs متحركة لتحسين الإيموجي والرسائل في Slack","إنشاء GIFs جذابة بصريًا مع أبعاد ومعلمات قابلة للتعديل","تحسين حجم ملف GIF لتحقيق أوقات تحميل أسرع في Slack"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment with PIL library","GIF duration limited to under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs","Dimensions limited to 128x128 for emoji GIFs and 480x480 for message GIFs"],"zh":["需要Python环境和PIL库","GIF持续时间仅限于表情符号GIF的3秒以下","尺寸仅限于表情符号GIF的128x128和消息GIF的480x480"],"ja":["Python環境とPILライブラリが必要","GIFの時間は絵文字GIFの3秒以下に限定される","寸法は絵文字GIFの128x128とメッセージGIFの480x480に限定される"],"ko":["Python 환경 및 PIL 라이브러리가 필요합니다.","GIF 지속 시간은 이모티콘 GIF의 3초 이하로 제한됩니다.","크기 제한은 이모티콘 GIF의 128x128 및 메시지 GIF의 480x480로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python con la biblioteca PIL","La duración del GIF está limitada a menos de 3 segundos para los GIF de emojis","Las dimensiones están limitadas a 128x128 para los GIF de emojis y 480x480 para los GIF de mensajes"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python avec la bibliothèque PIL","La durée du GIF est limitée à moins de 3 secondes pour les GIF d''émojis","Les dimensions sont limitées à 128x128 pour les GIF d''émojis et 480x480 pour les GIF de messages"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung mit der Bibliothek PIL","Die Dauer des GIFs ist auf unter 3 Sekunden für Emoji-GIFs begrenzt","Die Dimensionen sind auf 128x128 für Emoji-GIFs und 480x480 für Nachrichten-GIFs begrenzt"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python com biblioteca PIL","Duração do GIF limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emojis","Dimensões limitadas a 128x128 para GIFs de emojis e 480x480 para GIFs de mensagens"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python с библиотекой PIL","Продолжительность GIF ограничена менее 3 секунд для GIF эмодзи","Размеры ограничены 128x128 для GIF эмодзи и 480x480 для GIF сообщений"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python مع مكتبة PIL","مدة GIF مقيدة بأقل من 3 ثوانٍ لملفات GIF الإيموجي","الأبعاد مقيدة ب 128x128 لملفات GIF الإيموجي و 480x480 لملفات GIF الرسائل"]},"v