":"jira"},"description":{"zh":"Jira自然语言交互技能支持多个后端，包括CLI和Atlassian MCP","ja":"Jira自然言語インタラクションスキルは、CLIとAtlassian MCPを含む複数のバックエンドをサポートする","ko":"Jira 자연어 상호작용 스킬은 CLI와 Atlassian MCP를 포함한 여러 백엔드를 지원합니다","es":"La integración de Jira con interfaz de lenguaje natural permite interactuar con Jira de manera eficiente. Soporta múltiples backends y ofrece una guía para d...","fr":"L''intégration Jira avec interaction langage naturel permet d''interagir avec Jira de manière efficace. Elle prend en charge plusieurs backends et propose un g...","de":"Die Jira-Integration mit natürlicher Sprachinteraktion ermöglicht eine effiziente Interaktion mit Jira. Sie unterstützt mehrere Backends und bietet eine Anle...","pt":"A integração Jira permite interação natural com Jira, suportando múltiplos backends e detecção automática do backend mais adequado.","ru":"Jira интеграция позволяет естественно взаимодействовать с Jira, поддерживая несколько бэкендов и автоматически обнаруживая наиболее подходящий бэкенд.","ar":"تسمح تكامل جيرا بالتفاعل الطبيعي مع جيرا، مع دعم للخلفيات المتعددة والكشف التلقائي عن الخلفية الأكثر ملاءمة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多个后端","自然语言交互","简化工作流程","支持CLI和Atlassian MCP"],"ja":["複数のバックエンドをサポート","自然言語インタラクション","ワークフローを簡素化","CLIとAtlassian MCPをサポート"],"ko":["여러 백엔드를 지원","자연어 상호작용","워크플ロー 간소화","CLI와 Atlassian MCP 지원"],"es":["Interfaz de lenguaje natural para interactuar con Jira","Soporte para múltiples backends","Guía para determinar el backend adecuado","Integración con la línea de comandos de Jira","Compatibilidad con Atlassian MCP"],"fr":["Interface de langage naturel pour interagir avec Jira","Prise en charge de plusieurs backends","Guide pour déterminer le backend approprié","Intégration avec la ligne de commande Jira","Compatibilité avec Atlassian MCP"],"de":["Natürliche Sprachinteraktion für die Interaktion mit Jira","Unterstützung für mehrere Backends","Anleitung zur Bestimmung des geeigneten Backends","Integration mit der Jira-Kommandozeile","Kompatibilität mit Atlassian MCP"],"pt":["Interação natural com Jira","Suporte a múltiplos backends","Detecção automática do backend mais adequado","Compatibilidade com Jira CLI e Atlassian MCP","Guia de configuração para usuários"],"ru":["Естественное взаимодействие с Jira","Поддержка нескольких бэкендов","Автоматическое обнаружение наиболее подходящего бэкенда","Совместимость с Jira CLI и Atlassian MCP","Руководство по настройке для пользователей"],"ar":["التفاعل الطبيعي مع جيرا","دعم للخلفيات المتعددة","الكشف التلقائي عن الخلفية الأكثر ملاءمة","التوافق مع جيرا CLI و Atlassian MCP","دليل الإعداد للمستخدمين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira自然语言交互","Jira后端","CLI","Atlassian MCP","自然语言处理","工作流程自动化"],"ja":["Jira自然言語インタラクション","Jiraバックエンド","CLI","Atlassian MCP","自然言語処理","ワークフロー自動化"],"ko":["Jira 자연어 상호작용","Jira 백엔드","CLI","Atlassian MCP","자연어 처리","워크플ロー 자동화"],"es":["Jira","integración de Jira","interfaz de lenguaje natural","gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","integración con la línea de comandos","Atlassian MCP"],"fr":["Jira","intégration Jira","interface de langage naturel","gestion de projets","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","intégration avec la ligne de commande","Atlassian MCP"],"de":["Jira","Jira-Integration","natürliche Sprachinteraktion","Projektmanagement","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Integration mit der Kommandozeile","Atlassian MCP"],"pt":["integração jira","jira cli","atlassian mcp","gestão de projetos","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["jira интеграция","jira cli","atlassian mcp","управление проектами","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تكامل جيرا","جيرا CLI","Atlassian MCP","إدارة المشاريع","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira","description":"Use when the user mentions Jira issues (e.g., PROJ-123), asks about tickets, wants to create/view/update issues, check sprint status, or manage their Jira workflow. Triggers on keywords like jira, issue, ticket, sprint, backlog, or issue key patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Jira\n\nNatural language interaction with Jira. Supports multiple backends.\n\n## Backend Detection\n\n**Run this check first** to determine which backend to use:\n\n```\n1. Check if jira CLI is available:\n   → Run: which jira\n   → If found: USE CLI BACKEND\n\n2. If no CLI, check for Atlassian MCP:\n   → Look for mcp__atlassian__* tools\n   → If available: USE MCP BACKEND\n\n3. If neither available:\n   → GUIDE USER TO SETUP\n```\n\n| Backend | When to Use | Reference |\n|---------|-------------|-----------|\n| **","body":"# Jira\n\nNatural language interaction with Jira. Supports multiple backends.\n\n## Backend Detection\n\n**Run this check first** to determine which backend to use:\n\n```\n1. Check if jira CLI is available:\n   → Run: which jira\n   → If found: USE CLI BACKEND\n\n2. If no CLI, check for Atlassian MCP:\n   → Look for mcp__atlassian__* tools\n   → If available: USE MCP BACKEND\n\n3. If neither available:\n   → GUIDE USER TO SETUP\n```\n\n| Backend | When to Use | Reference |\n|---------|-------------|-----------|\n| **CLI** | `jira` command available | `references/commands.md` |\n| **MCP** | Atlassian MCP tools available | `references/mcp.md` |\n| **None** | Neither available | Guide to install CLI |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference (CLI)\n\n> Skip this section if using MCP backend.\n\n| Intent | Command |\n|--------|---------|\n| View issue | `jira issue view ISSUE-KEY` |\n| List my issues | `jira issue list -a$(jira me)` |\n| My in-progress | `jira issue list -a$(jira me) -s\"In Progress\"` |\n| Create issue | `jira issue create -tType -s\"Summary\" -b\"Description\"` |\n| Move/transition | `jira issue move ISSUE-KEY \"State\"` |\n| Assign to me | `jira issue assign ISSUE-KEY $(jira me)` |\n| Unassign | `jira issue assign ISSUE-KEY x` |\n| Add comment | `jira issue comment add ISSUE-KEY -b\"Comment text\"` |\n| Open in browser | `jira open ISSUE-KEY` |\n| Current sprint | `jira sprint list --state active` |\n| Who am I | `jira me` |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference (MCP)\n\n> Skip this section if using CLI backend.\n\n| Intent | MCP Tool |\n|--------|----------|\n| Search issues | `mcp__atlassian__searchJiraIssuesUsingJql` |\n| View issue | `mcp__atlassian__getJiraIssue` |\n| Create issue | `mcp__atlassian__createJiraIssue` |\n| Update issue | `mcp__atlassian__editJiraIssue` |\n| Get transitions | `mcp__atlassian__getTransitionsForJiraIssue` |\n| Transition | `mcp__atlassian__transitionJiraIssue` |\n| Add comment | `mcp__atlassian__addCommentToJiraIssue` |\n| User lookup | `mcp__atlassian__lookupJiraAccountId` |\n| List projects | `mcp__atlassian__getVisibleJiraProjects` |\n\nSee `references/mcp.md` for full MCP patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Triggers\n\n- \"create a jira ticket\"\n- \"show me PROJ-123\"\n- \"list my tickets\"\n- \"move ticket to done\"\n- \"what''s in the current sprint\"\n\n---\n\n## Issue Key Detection\n\nIssue keys follow the pattern: `[A-Z]+-[0-9]+` (e.g., PROJ-123, ABC-1).\n\nWhen a user mentions an issue key in conversation:\n- **CLI:** `jira issue view KEY` or `jira open KEY`\n- **MCP:** `mcp__atlassian__jira_get_issue` with the key\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n**Creating tickets:**\n1. Research context if user references code/tickets/PRs\n2. Draft ticket content\n3. Review with user\n4. Create using appropriate backend\n\n**Updating tickets:**\n1. Fetch issue details first\n2. Check status (careful with in-progress tickets)\n3. Show current vs proposed changes\n4. Get approval before updating\n5. Add comment explaining changes\n\n---\n\n## Before Any Operation\n\nAsk yourself:\n\n1. **What''s the current state?** — Always fetch the issue first. Don''t assume status, assignee, or fields are what user thinks they are.\n\n2. **Who else is affected?** — Check watchers, linked issues, parent epics. A \"simple edit\" might notify 10 people.\n\n3. **Is this reversible?** — Transitions may have one-way gates. Some workflows require intermediate states. Description edits have no undo.\n\n4. **Do I have the right identifiers?** — Issue keys, transition IDs, account IDs. Display names don''t work for assignment (MCP).\n\n---\n\n## NEVER\n\n- **NEVER transition without fetching current status** — Workflows may require intermediate states. \"To Do\" → \"Done\" might fail silently if \"In Progress\" is required first.\n\n- **NEVER assign using display name (MCP)** — Only account IDs work. Always call `lookupJiraAccountId` first, or assignment silently fails.\n\n- **NEVER edit description without showing original** — Jira has no undo. User must see what they''re replacing.\n\n- **NEVER use `--no-input` without all required fields (CLI)** — Fails silently with cryptic errors. Check project''s required fields first.\n\n- **NEVER assume transition names are universal** — \"Done\", \"Closed\", \"Complete\" vary by project. Always get available transitions first.\n\n- **NEVER bulk-modify without explicit approval** — Each ticket change notifies watchers. 10 edits = 10 notification storms.\n\n---\n\n## Safety\n\n- Always show the command/tool call before running it\n- Always get approval before modifying tickets\n- Preserve original information when editing\n- Verify updates after applying\n- Always surface authentication issues clearly so the user can resolve them\n\n---\n\n## No Backend Available\n\nIf neither CLI nor MCP is available, guide the user:\n\n```\nTo use Jira, you need one of:\n\n1. **jira CLI** (recommended):\n   https://github.com/ankitpokhrel/jira-cli\n\n   Install: brew install ankitpokhrel/jira-cli/jira-cli\n   Setup:   jira init\n\n2. **Atlassian MCP**:\n   Configure in your MCP settings with Atlassian credentials.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Deep Dive\n\n**LOAD reference when:**\n- Creating issues with complex fields or multi-line content\n- Building JQL queries beyond simple filters\n- Troubleshooting errors or authentication issues\n- Working with transitions, linking, or sprints\n\n**Do NOT load reference for:**\n- Simple view/list operations (Quick Reference above is sufficient)\n- Basic status checks (`jira issue view KEY`)\n- Opening issues in browser\n\n| Task | Load Reference? |\n|------|-----------------|\n| View single issue | No |\n| List my tickets | No |\n| Create with description | **Yes** — CLI needs `/tmp` pattern |\n| Transition issue | **Yes** — need transition ID workflow |\n| JQL search | **Yes** — for complex queries |\n| Link issues | **Yes** — MCP limitation, need script |\n\nReferences:\n- CLI patterns: `references/commands.md`\n- MCP patterns: `references/mcp.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:08:38.873Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing seamless Jira integration and natural language interaction.","zh":"非常适合需要与Jira实现无缝集成和自然语言交互的项目管理代理。","ja":"Jiraとのシームレスな統合と自然言語のやり取りを必要とするプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"지라와의 무결점 통합 및 자연어 상호작용이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que requieren una integración sin problemas con Jira y una interacción en lenguaje natural.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une intégration transparente à Jira et une interaction en langage naturel.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Jira-Integration und eine natürliche Sprachinteraktion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Jira e interação em linguagem natural.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с Jira и взаимодействие на естественном языке.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع Jira وتفاعل لغة طبيعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Jira using natural language, supporting multiple backends such as Jira CLI and Atlassian MCP, enabling efficient issue tracking and project management through protocols like backend detection.","zh":"赋予代理使用自然语言与Jira交互的能力，支持多个后端，如Jira CLI和Atlassian MCP，通过后端检测等协议实现高效的问题跟踪和项目管理。","ja":"エージェントが自然言語でJiraとやり取りできるようにし、Jira CLIやAtlassian MCPなどの複数のバックエンドをサポートし、バックエンド検出などのプロトコルを介して効率的な問題追跡とプロジェクト管理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어를 사용하여 지라와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하며 지라 CLI 및 앳라시안 MCP를 포함한 여러 백엔드를 지원하여 백엔드 감지 등의 프로토콜을 통해 효율적인 이슈 추적 및 프로젝트 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con Jira utilizando lenguaje natural, admitiendo múltiples backends como Jira CLI y Atlassian MCP, lo que permite un seguimiento eficiente de problemas y gestión de proyectos a través de protocolos como la detección de backend.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec Jira en utilisant le langage naturel, en prenant en charge plusieurs backends tels que Jira CLI et Atlassian MCP, permettant ainsi un suivi efficace des problèmes et une gestion de projet via des protocoles tels que la détection de backend.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mit Jira über natürliche Sprache zu interagieren, unterstützt dabei mehrere Backends wie Jira CLI und Atlassian MCP, ermöglicht so eine effiziente Problemmeldung und Projektverwaltung durch Protokolle wie die Backend-Erkennung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagirem com o Jira usando linguagem natural, suportando vários backends, como Jira CLI e Atlassian MCP, permitindo um acompanhamento eficiente de problemas e gerenciamento de projetos por meio de protocolos como detecção de backend.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с Jira с помощью естественного языка, поддерживая несколько бэкендов, таких как Jira CLI и Atlassian MCP, обеспечивая эффективный отслеживание проблем и управление проектами через протоколы, такие как обнаружение бэкенда.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التفاعل مع Jira باستخدام لغة طبيعية، ودعم الخوادم الخلفية المتعددة مثل Jira CLI و Atlassian MCP، وتمكين تتبع فعال للمشاكل وإدارة المشاريع من خلال بروتوكولات مثل كشف الخادم الخلفي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Jira issue creation","Debugging project workflows using Jira CLI","Integrating Atlassian MCP for enhanced project management"],"zh":["自动化Jira问题创建","使用Jira CLI调试项目工作流","集成Atlassian MCP以增强项目管理"],"ja":["Jiraの問題作成を自動化する","Jira CLIを使用してプロジェクトのワークフローをデバッグする","Atlassian MCPを統合してプロジェクト管理を強化する"],"ko":["지라 이슈 생성 자동화","지라 CLI를 사용한 프로젝트 워크플로 디버깅","앳라시안 MCP 통합을 통한 프로젝트 관리 강화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas de Jira","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de proyecto utilizando Jira CLI","Integración de Atlassian MCP para una gestión de proyecto mejorada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes Jira","Débogage des flux de travail de projet en utilisant Jira CLI","Intégration d''Atlassian MCP pour une gestion de projet améliorée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Jira-Problemerstellung","Fehlerbehebung von Projektworkflows mit Jira CLI","Integration von Atlassian MCP für eine verbesserte Projektverwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas do Jira","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de projeto usando Jira CLI","Integrar Atlassian MCP para gestão de projeto aprimorada"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания проблем Jira","Отладка рабочих процессов проекта с помощью Jira CLI","Интеграция Atlassian MCP для улучшенного управления проектами"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء مشاكل Jira","تصحيح مشاكل في تدفقات العمل للمشروع باستخدام Jira CLI","دمج Atlassian MCP لتحسين إدارة المشاريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira CLI or Atlassian MCP setup","Backend detection required for initial setup"],"zh":["需要Jira CLI或Atlassian MCP设置","需要后端检测进行初始设置"],"ja":["Jira CLIまたはAtlassian MCPの設定が必要","初期設定にはバックエンド検出が必要"],"ko":["지라 CLI 또는 앳라시안 MCP 설정이 필요","초기 설정을 위해 백엔드 감지가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Jira CLI o Atlassian MCP","Se requiere detección de backend para la configuración inicial"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Jira CLI ou Atlassian MCP","La détection de backend est requise pour la configuration initiale"],"de":["Benötigt Jira CLI- oder Atlassian-MCP-Setup","Backend-Erkennung erforderlich für die anfängliche Einrichtung"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Jira CLI ou Atlassian MCP","Detecção de backend necessária para configuração inicial"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Jira CLI или Atlassian MCP","Обнаружение бэкенда необходимо для начальной настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Jira CLI أو Atlassian MCP","يتطلب كشف الخادم الخلفي لإعداد الأولي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('laude-institute/harbor-datasets/gh-cli', 'community', 'laude-institute', 'harbor-datasets', 'laude-institute/harbor-datasets', 'gh-cli', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:08:30.705Z', NULL, '{"id":"laude-institute/harbor-datasets/gh-cli","name":"gh-cli","description":{"zh":"GitHub CLI（gh）是一种命令行工具，用于管理GitHub仓库、问题和拉取请求。它提供了多种命令来简化开发流程","ja":"GitHub CLI（gh）は、GitHubリポジトリ、問題、プルリクエストを管理するためのコマンドラインツールです。開発フローを簡素化するための多くのコマンドを提供します","ko":"GitHub CLI(gh)는 GitHub 저장소, 문제, 풀 요청을 관리하는 명령줄 도구입니다. 개발 흐름을 단순화하기 위한 다양한 명령을 제공합니다","es":"GitHub CLI es una herramienta de línea de comandos para interactuar con GitHub. Permite gestionar repositorios, problemas y solicitudes de extracción de manera eficiente.","fr":"GitHub CLI est un outil de ligne de commande pour interagir avec GitHub. Il permet de gérer des référentiels, des problèmes et des demandes d''extraction de manière efficace.","de":"GitHub CLI ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zum Interagieren mit GitHub. Es ermöglicht die effiziente Verwaltung von Repositorys, Problemen und Pull-Requests.","pt":"O gh-cli é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que permite trabalhar com o GitHub de forma eficiente, gerenciando issues, pull requests e repositórios","ru":"gh-cli - это инструмент командной строки, который позволяет работать с GitHub эффективно, управляя проблемами, запросами на включение и репозиториями","ar":"أداة سطر الأوامر gh-cli تتيح لك العمل مع GitHub بفعالية، وتتيح لك إدارة المشكلات والطلبات السحابية والمستودعات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub CLI（gh）- 命令行工具","ja":"GitHub CLI（gh）- コマンドラインツール","ko":"GitHub CLI(gh) - 명령줄 도구","es":"GitHub CLI: Trabaja con GitHub desde la línea de comandos","fr":"GitHub CLI : Travaillez avec GitHub depuis la ligne de co...","de":"GitHub CLI: Arbeiten Sie mit GitHub von der Kommandozeile...","pt":"gh-cli: Ferramenta de Linha de Comando do GitHub","ru":"gh-cli: Инструмент командной строки GitHub","ar":"gh-cli: أداة سطر الأوامر الخاصة bằngithub","en":"gh-cli"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub CLI（gh）是一种命令行工具，用于管理GitHub仓库、问题和拉取请求。它提供了多种命令来简化开发流程","ja":"GitHub CLI（gh）は、GitHubリポジトリ、問題、プルリクエストを管理するためのコマンドラインツールです。開発フローを簡素化するための多くのコマンドを提供します","ko":"GitHub CLI(gh)는 GitHub 저장소, 문제, 풀 요청을 관리하는 명령줄 도구입니다. 개발 흐름을 단순화하기 위한 다양한 명령을 제공합니다","es":"GitHub CLI es una herramienta de línea de comandos para interactuar con GitHub. Permite gestionar repositorios, problemas y solicitudes de extracción de mane...","fr":"GitHub CLI est un outil de ligne de commande pour interagir avec GitHub. Il permet de gérer des référentiels, des problèmes et des demandes d''extraction de m...","de":"GitHub CLI ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zum Interagieren mit GitHub. Es ermöglicht die effiziente Verwaltung von Repositorys, Problemen und Pull-Requests.","pt":"O gh-cli é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que permite trabalhar com o GitHub de forma eficiente, gerenciando issues, pull requests e repositórios","ru":"gh-cli - это инструмент командной строки, который позволяет работать с GitHub эффективно, управляя проблемами, запросами на включение и репозиториями","ar":"أداة سطر الأوامر gh-cli تتيح لك العمل مع GitHub بفعالية، وتتيح لك إدارة المشكلات والطلبات السحابية والمستودعات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["仓库管理","问题管理","拉取请求管理","API请求","工作流运行查看"],"ja":["リポジトリ管理","問題管理","プルリクエスト管理","APIリクエスト","ワークフローの実行状況の表示"],"ko":["저장소 관리","문제 관리","풀 요청 관리","API 요청","워크플로 실행 상황 보기"],"es":["Gestión de repositorios","Gestión de problemas","Gestión de solicitudes de extracción","Acceso a la API de GitHub","Visualización de detalles de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Gestion de référentiels","Gestion de problèmes","Gestion de demandes d''extraction","Accès à l''API de GitHub","Visualisation de détails de flux de travail"],"de":["Repository-Verwaltung","Probleme-Verwaltung","Pull-Request-Verwaltung","Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Anzeige von Workflow-Details"],"pt":["Gerenciar issues","Gerenciar pull requests","Criar, clonar, bifurcar e visualizar repositórios","Fazer solicitações autenticadas à API do GitHub","Visualizar detalhes sobre execuções de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Управление проблемами","Управление запросами на включение","Создание, клонирование, вилка и просмотр репозиториев","Выполнение аутентифицированных запросов к API GitHub","Просмотр деталей о запусках рабочих процессов"],"ar":["إدارة المشكلات","إدارة الطلبات السحابية","إنشاء، استنساخ، تقليع ومعاينة المستودعات","إرسال طلبات موثقة إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","معاينة تفاصيل حول عمليات تشغيل سير العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","命令行工具","仓库管理","问题管理","拉取请求管理","API请求","工作流运行"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","コマンドラインツール","リポジトリ管理","問題管理","プルリクエスト管理","APIリクエスト","ワークフローの実行"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","명령줄 도구","저장소 관리","문제 관리","풀 요청 관리","API 요청","워크플로 실행"],"es":["GitHub CLI","línea de comandos","gestión de repositorios","gestión de problemas","gestión de solicitudes de extracción","API de GitHub","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","ligne de commande","gestion de référentiels","gestion de problèmes","gestion de demandes d''extraction","API de GitHub","développement de logiciels"],"de":["GitHub CLI","Kommandozeile","Repository-Verwaltung","Probleme-Verwaltung","Pull-Request-Verwaltung","GitHub-API","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["gh-cli","GitHub CLI","ferramenta de linha de comando","gerenciamento de issues","gerenciamento de pull requests","repositórios GitHub","API GitHub","fluxo de trabalho GitHub"],"ru":["gh-cli","GitHub CLI","инструмент командной строки","управление проблемами","управление запросами на включение","репозитории GitHub","API GitHub","рабочие процессы GitHub"],"ar":["gh-cli","واجهة سطر الأوامر الخاصة bằngithub","أداة سطر الأوامر","إدارة المشكلات","إدارة الطلبات السحابية","مستودعات GitHub","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","سير العمل الخاصة bằngithub"]}},"owner":"laude-institute","repo":"harbor-datasets","repoPath":"laude-institute/harbor-datasets","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-cli","description":"The gh CLI is GitHubs official command line tool for interacting with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and more. When needs to interact with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and more, use this skill.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ngh <command> <subcommand> [flags]\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n```\n  issue:      Manage issues\n  pr:         Manage pull requests\n  repo:       Create, clone, fork, and view repositories\n  api:        Make an authenticated GitHub API request\n  run:        View details about workflow runs\n```\n\nUse `gh <command> --help` for more information about a command.\n\n---\n\n## gh pr\n\nWork with GitHub pull requests.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh","body":"# GitHub CLI (gh)\n\nWork seamlessly with GitHub from the command line.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ngh <command> <subcommand> [flags]\n```\n\n## Core Commands\n\n```\n  issue:      Manage issues\n  pr:         Manage pull requests\n  repo:       Create, clone, fork, and view repositories\n  api:        Make an authenticated GitHub API request\n  run:        View details about workflow runs\n```\n\nUse `gh <command> --help` for more information about a command.\n\n---\n\n## gh pr\n\nWork with GitHub pull requests.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh pr <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  checkout:   Check out a pull request in git\n  checks:     Show CI status for a single pull request\n  close:      Close a pull request\n  comment:    Create a new pr comment\n  create:     Create a pull request\n  diff:       View changes in a pull request\n  edit:       Edit a pull request\n  list:       List and filter pull requests in this repository\n  merge:      Merge a pull request\n  ready:      Mark a pull request as ready for review\n  reopen:     Reopen a pull request\n  review:     Add a review to a pull request\n  status:     Show status of relevant pull requests\n  view:       View a pull request\n\nFLAGS\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  A pull request can be supplied as argument in any of the following formats:\n  - by number, e.g. \"123\";\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/pull/123\"; or\n  - by the name of its head branch, e.g. \"patch-1\" or \"OWNER:patch-1\".\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh pr checkout 353\n  $ gh pr create --fill\n  $ gh pr view --web\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use ''gh <command> <subcommand> --help'' for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n```\n\n---\n\n## gh issue\n\nWork with GitHub issues.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh issue <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  close:      Close issue\n  comment:    Create a new issue comment\n  create:     Create a new issue\n  delete:     Delete issue\n  edit:       Edit an issue\n  list:       List and filter issues in this repository\n  reopen:     Reopen issue\n  status:     Show status of relevant issues\n  transfer:   Transfer issue to another repository\n  view:       View an issue\n\nFLAGS\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  An issue can be supplied as argument in any of the following formats:\n  - by number, e.g. \"123\"; or\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO/issues/123\".\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh issue list\n  $ gh issue create --label bug\n  $ gh issue view --web\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use ''gh <command> <subcommand> --help'' for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n```\n\n---\n\n## gh repo\n\nWork with GitHub repositories.\n\n```\nUSAGE\n  gh repo <command> [flags]\n\nCORE COMMANDS\n  archive:    Archive a repository\n  clone:      Clone a repository locally\n  create:     Create a new repository\n  delete:     Delete a repository\n  edit:       Edit repository settings\n  fork:       Create a fork of a repository\n  list:       List repositories owned by user or organization\n  rename:     Rename a repository\n  sync:       Sync a repository\n  view:       View a repository\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nARGUMENTS\n  A repository can be supplied as an argument in any of the following formats:\n  - \"OWNER/REPO\"\n  - by URL, e.g. \"https://github.com/OWNER/REPO\"\n\nEXAMPLES\n  $ gh repo create\n  $ gh repo clone cli/cli\n  $ gh repo view --web\n```\n\n## Search Query Syntax\n\nThe `--search` flag uses GitHub search syntax. Full documentation: https://docs.github.com/en/search-github/getting-started-with-searching-on-github/understanding-the-search-syntax\n\n### Comparison Operators\n\n| Query | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `>n` | Greater than | `stars:>1000` |\n| `>=n` | Greater than or equal | `topics:>=5` |\n| `<n` | Less than | `size:<10000` |\n| `<=n` | Less than or equal | `stars:<=50` |\n\n### Range Queries\n\n| Query | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `n..n` | Between range | `stars:10..50` |\n| `n..*` | Greater than or equal | `stars:10..*` (same as `>=10`) |\n| `*..n` | Less than or equal | `stars:*..10` (same as `<=10`) |\n\n### Date Queries\n\nDate format: `YYYY-MM-DD` (ISO8601). Optional time: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+00:00`\n\n| Query | Example |\n|-------|---------|\n| `>YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:>2024-04-29` — after April 29, 2024 |\n| `>=YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:>=2024-04-01` — on or after April 1, 2024 |\n| `<YYYY-MM-DD` | `pushed:<2024-07-05` — before July 5, 2024 |\n| `<=YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:<=2024-07-04` — on or before July 4, 2024 |\n| `YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:2024-04-30..2024-07-04` — date range |\n| `YYYY-MM-DD..*` | `created:2024-04-30..*` — on or after date |\n| `*..YYYY-MM-DD` | `created:*..2024-07-04` — on or before date |\n\n### Exclude Results\n\nPrefix qualifier with `-` to exclude:\n\n| Query | Example |\n|-------|---------|\n| `-QUALIFIER` | `stars:>10 -language:javascript` — exclude JavaScript repos |\n| `NOT` | `hello NOT world` — has \"hello\" but not \"world\" |\n\n### Usernames\n\n| Query | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `author:USERNAME` | Filter by specific user |\n| `author:@me` | Filter by current user |\n| `assignee:@me` | Assigned to current user |\n\n### Queries with Whitespace\n\nUse quotation marks for multi-word values:\n- `label:\"bug fix\"` — label with space\n- `cats NOT \"hello world\"` — exclude phrase\n\n---\n\n## JSON Output\n\nCommon fields for `--json`:\n\n**PR**:\n\n```\nadditions\nassignees\nauthor\nbaseRefName\nbody\nchangedFiles\nclosed\nclosedAt\ncomments\ncommits\ncreatedAt\ndeletions\nfiles\nheadRefName\nheadRepository\nheadRepositoryOwner\nid\nisCrossRepository\nisDraft\nlabels\nmaintainerCanModify\nmergeCommit\nmergeStateStatus\nmergeable\nmergedAt\nmergedBy\nmilestone\nnumber\npotentialMergeCommit\nprojectCards\nreactionGroups\nreviewDecision\nreviewRequests\nreviews\nstate\nstatusCheckRollup\ntitle\nupdatedAt\nurl\n```\n\n**Issue**:\n\n```\nclose\n  comment\n  create\n  delete\n  edit\n  list\n  reopen\n  status\n  transfer\n  view\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:08:30.705Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring seamless GitHub integration and automation from the command line.","zh":"适用于需要无缝 GitHub 集成和命令行自动化的 DevOps Agents。","ja":"GitHub のシームレスな統合とコマンドラインからの自動化を必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適です。","ko":"시ーム리스한 GitHub 통합과 명령줄 자동화를 필요로 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una integración perfecta con GitHub y automatización desde la línea de comandos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une intégration transparente avec GitHub et une automatisation à partir de la ligne de commande.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit GitHub und eine Automation von der Kommandozeile benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem integração perfeita com o GitHub e automação a partir da linha de comando.","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих бесшовной интеграции с GitHub и автоматизации из командной строки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج سلس مع GitHub وتوافق آلي من سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage GitHub issues, pull requests, and repositories using authenticated API requests, while also viewing workflow runs, all through a unified gh-cli interface utilizing flags and subcommands.","zh":"赋予代理管理 GitHub 问题、拉取请求和仓库的能力，使用经过身份验证的 API 请求，同时也可以查看工作流运行，所有这些都通过统一的 gh-cli 接口使用标志和子命令。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub の問題、プルリクエスト、リポジトリを管理する機能を提供し、認証された API リクエストを使用して、ワークフロー実行も表示できる、統一された gh-cli インターフェイスをフラグとサブコマンドで利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 문제, 풀 요청 및 저장소를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 인증된 API 요청을 사용하여 워크플로 실행도 볼 수 있는統一された gh-cli 인터페이스를 플래그와 서브 커맨드로 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar problemas de GitHub, solicitudes de extracción y repositorios mediante solicitudes de API autenticadas, y también a ver flujos de trabajo, todo a través de una interfaz unificada gh-cli que utiliza indicadores y subcomandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les problèmes GitHub, les demandes d''extraction et les référentiels en utilisant des demandes d''API authentifiées, tout en visualisant les exécutions de workflow, le tout via une interface gh-cli unifiée utilisant des indicateurs et des sous-commandes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, GitHub-Probleme, Pull-Requests und Repositorys über authentifizierte API-Anfragen zu verwalten und Workflows anzuzeigen, alles über eine einheitliche gh-cli-Schnittstelle mit Flags und Unterbefehlen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar problemas do GitHub, solicitações de pull e repositórios usando solicitações de API autenticadas, além de visualizar fluxos de trabalho, tudo por meio de uma interface gh-cli unificada que utiliza sinalizadores e subcomandos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять проблемами GitHub, запросами на вытягивание и репозиториями с помощью аутентифицированных запросов API, а также просматривать выполнения рабочих процессов, все через унифицированный интерфейс gh-cli, использующий флаги и подкоманды.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة مشاكل GitHub وطلبات السحب والمستودعات باستخدام طلبات API المُوثقة، بالإضافة إلى عرض تشغيل سير العمل، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة موحدة gh-cli تستخدم أعلامًا وفرعية الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue management with gh issue","Creating and managing pull requests using gh pr","Cloning and forking repositories with gh repo","Making authenticated GitHub API requests via gh api"],"zh":["使用 gh issue 自动化问题管理","使用 gh pr 创建和管理拉取请求","使用 gh repo 克隆和分叉仓库","通过 gh api 进行认证的 GitHub API 请求"],"ja":["gh issue を使用した問題管理の自動化","gh pr を使用したプルリクエストの作成と管理","gh repo を使用したリポジトリの複製とフォーク","gh api を使用した認証された GitHub API リクエスト"],"ko":["gh issue를 사용한 이슈 관리 자동화","gh pr를 사용한 풀 요청 생성 및 관리","gh repo를 사용한 저장소 복제 및 포크","gh api를 사용한 인증된 GitHub API 요청"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de problemas con gh issue","Creación y gestión de solicitudes de extracción con gh pr","Clonación y bifurcación de repositorios con gh repo","Realización de solicitudes de API autenticadas de GitHub a través de gh api"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des problèmes avec gh issue","Création et gestion des demandes d''extraction avec gh pr","Clonage et forkage de référentiels avec gh repo","Réalisations de demandes d''API authentifiées GitHub via gh api"],"de":["Automatisierung des Problemmangements mit gh issue","Erstellen und Verwalten von Pull-Requests mit gh pr","Klonen und Forken von Repositorys mit gh repo","Ausführen authentifizierter GitHub-API-Anfragen über gh api"],"pt":["Automatizar gerenciamento de problemas com gh issue","Criar e gerenciar solicitações de pull usando gh pr","Clonar e bifurcar repositórios com gh repo","Fazer solicitações de API do GitHub autenticadas via gh api"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление проблемами с помощью gh issue","Создавать и управлять запросами на вытягивание с помощью gh pr","Клонировать и вилить репозитории с помощью gh repo","Выполнять аутентифицированные запросы API GitHub через gh api"],"ar":["توفير تلقيني لإدارة المشاكل مع gh issue","إنشاء وإدارة طلبات السحب باستخدام gh pr","استنساخ وتفرع المستودعات باستخدام gh repo","إجراء طلبات API المُوثقة لجيت هاب عبر gh api"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub authentication","Command line interface only","Specific commands and subcommands needed for different functionalities"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 身份验证","仅命令行接口","需要不同的命令和子命令来实现不同的功能"],"ja":["GitHub の認証が必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスのみ","異なる機能を実現するために異なるコマンドとサブコマンドが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 인증이 필요합니다.","명령줄 인터페이스만 사용할 수 있습니다.","다른 기능을 구현하기 위해 다른 명령과 서브 커맨드가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere autenticación de GitHub","Interfaz de línea de comandos solo","Comandos y subcomandos específicos necesarios para diferentes funcionalidades"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification GitHub","Interface de ligne de commande uniquement","Commandes et sous-commandes spécifiques nécessaires pour différentes fonctionnalités"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Authentifizierung","Nur Kommandozeileninterface","Spezifische Befehle und Unterbefehle erforderlich für unterschiedliche Funktionalitäten"],"pt":["Exige autenticação do GitHub","Interface de linha de comando apenas","Comandos e subcomandos específicos necessários para diferentes funcionalidades"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации GitHub","Только командная строка интерфейса","Конкретные команды и подкоманды необходимы для различных функций"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة جيت هاب","واجهة سطر الأوامر فقط","أوامر وفرعية أوامر محددة مطلوبة لتفاصيل مختلفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/app-builder', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'agent-bridge-kit', 'HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit', 'app-builder', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:08:34.980Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/app-builder","name":"app-builder","description":{"zh":"应用构建器是一种转换工具，用于将Antigravity IDE配置转换为其他IDE和CLI兼容格式，简化开发流程","ja":"アプリビルダーは、Antigravity IDEの設定を他のIDEやCLIと互換性のある形式に変換するツールです","ko":"애플리케이션 빌더는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 다른 IDE 및 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 툴입니다","es":"El constructor de aplicaciones es una herramienta que analiza solicitudes de usuarios y convierte configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles","fr":"Le constructeur d''applications est un outil qui analyse les demandes des utilisateurs et convertit les configurations d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles","de":"Der App-Builder ist ein Werkzeug, das Benutzeranfragen analysiert und Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate konvertiert","pt":"O App Builder é uma ferramenta que converte configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs.","ru":"Строитель приложений - это инструмент, который конвертирует конфигурации Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI.","ar":"أداة بناء التطبيقات هي أداة لتحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI.","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"应用构建器 - 转换工具","ja":"アプリビルダー - 変換ツール","ko":"애플리케이션 빌더 - 변환 툴","es":"Constructor de Aplicaciones: Herramienta de Conversión de...","fr":"Constructeur d''Applications: Outil de Conversion de Confi...","de":"App-Builder: Werkzeug zur Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","pt":"Construtor de Aplicativos - Ferramenta de Conversão de Co...","ru":"Строитель приложений - инструмент для конвертации конфигу...","ar":"بناء التطبيقات - أداة لتحويل الإعدادات","en":"app-builder"},"description":{"zh":"应用构建器是一种转换工具，用于将Antigravity IDE配置转换为其他IDE和CLI兼容格式，简化开发流程","ja":"アプリビルダーは、Antigravity IDEの設定を他のIDEやCLIと互換性のある形式に変換するツールです","ko":"애플리케이션 빌더는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 다른 IDE 및 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 툴입니다","es":"El constructor de aplicaciones es una herramienta que analiza solicitudes de usuarios y convierte configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles","fr":"Le constructeur d''applications est un outil qui analyse les demandes des utilisateurs et convertit les configurations d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles","de":"Der App-Builder ist ein Werkzeug, das Benutzeranfragen analysiert und Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate konvertiert","pt":"O App Builder é uma ferramenta que converte configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs.","ru":"Строитель приложений - это инструмент, который конвертирует конфигурации Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI.","ar":"أداة بناء التطبيقات هي أداة لتحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI.","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持多种IDE和CLI","简化开发流程","提高开发效率","兼容多种配置格式","易于使用"],"ja":["多くのIDEとCLIをサポート","開発プロセスを簡素化","開発効率を向上","多くの設定形式を対応","使いやすい"],"ko":["다수의 IDE 및 CLI 지원","개발 프로세스 간소화","개발 효율성 향상","다수의 설정 형식 호환","사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot y otros IDEs","Análisis de solicitudes de usuarios","Planificación de estructuras de aplicaciones","Coordinación de agentes y flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Conversion de configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot et d''autres IDEs","Analyse des demandes des utilisateurs","Planification de structures d''applications","Coordination d''agents et de flux de travail"],"de":["Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE","Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot und anderen IDEs","Analyse von Benutzeranfragen","Planung von Anwendungsstrukturen","Koordination von Agenten und Workflows"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Análise de solicitações do usuário","Planejamento de estrutura","Coordenação de agentes"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Antigravity IDE","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Анализ запросов пользователя","Планирование структуры","Координация агентов"],"ar":["تحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE","التوافق مع IDE و CLI","تحليل طلبات المستخدم","تخطيط الهيكل","تنسيق الوكلاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["应用构建器","转换工具","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","开发流程","开发效率"],"ja":["アプリビルダー","変換ツール","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","開発プロセス","開発効率"],"ko":["애플리케이션 빌더","변환 툴","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode","개발 프로세스","개발 효율성"],"es":["constructor de aplicaciones","conversión de configuraciones","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","desarrollo de aplicaciones","integración de APIs"],"fr":["constructeur d''applications","conversion de configurations","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","développement d''applications","intégration d''APIs"],"de":["App-Builder","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Anwendungsentwicklung","API-Integration"],"pt":["construtor de aplicativos","ferramenta de conversão","configurações de desenvolvimento","Antigravity IDE","IDEs","CLIs"],"ru":["строитель приложений","инструмент конвертации","конфигурации разработки","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI"],"ar":["بناء التطبيقات","أداة تحويل","إعدادات التطوير","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"app-builder","description":"Main application building orchestrator. Creates full-stack applications from natural language requests. Determines project type, selects tech stack, coordinates agents.","bodyPreview":"# App Builder - Application Building Orchestrator\n\n> Analyzes user''s requests, determines tech stack, plans structure, and coordinates agents.\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `project-detection.md` | Keyword matrix, project type detection | Starting new project |\n| `tech-stack.md` | 2026 default stack, alternatives | Choosing techno","body":"# App Builder - Application Building Orchestrator\n\n> Analyzes user''s requests, determines tech stack, plans structure, and coordinates agents.\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `project-detection.md` | Keyword matrix, project type detection | Starting new project |\n| `tech-stack.md` | 2026 default stack, alternatives | Choosing technologies |\n| `agent-coordination.md` | Agent pipeline, execution order | Coordinating multi-agent work |\n| `scaffolding.md` | Directory structure, core files | Creating project structure |\n| `feature-building.md` | Feature analysis, error handling | Adding features to existing project |\n| `templates/SKILL.md` | **Project templates** | Scaffolding new project |\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Templates (13)\n\nQuick-start scaffolding for new projects. **Read the matching template only!**\n\n| Template | Tech Stack | When to Use |\n|----------|------------|-------------|\n| [nextjs-fullstack](templates/nextjs-fullstack/TEMPLATE.md) | Next.js + Prisma | Full-stack web app |\n| [nextjs-saas](templates/nextjs-saas/TEMPLATE.md) | Next.js + Stripe | SaaS product |\n| [nextjs-static](templates/nextjs-static/TEMPLATE.md) | Next.js + Framer | Landing page |\n| [nuxt-app](templates/nuxt-app/TEMPLATE.md) | Nuxt 3 + Pinia | Vue full-stack app |\n| [express-api](templates/express-api/TEMPLATE.md) | Express + JWT | REST API |\n| [python-fastapi](templates/python-fastapi/TEMPLATE.md) | FastAPI | Python API |\n| [react-native-app](templates/react-native-app/TEMPLATE.md) | Expo + Zustand | Mobile app |\n| [flutter-app](templates/flutter-app/TEMPLATE.md) | Flutter + Riverpod | Cross-platform mobile |\n| [electron-desktop](templates/electron-desktop/TEMPLATE.md) | Electron + React | Desktop app |\n| [chrome-extension](templates/chrome-extension/TEMPLATE.md) | Chrome MV3 | Browser extension |\n| [cli-tool](templates/cli-tool/TEMPLATE.md) | Node.js + Commander | CLI app |\n| [monorepo-turborepo](templates/monorepo-turborepo/TEMPLATE.md) | Turborepo + pnpm | Monorepo |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Agents\n\n| Agent | Role |\n|-------|------|\n| `project-planner` | Task breakdown, dependency graph |\n| `frontend-specialist` | UI components, pages |\n| `backend-specialist` | API, business logic |\n| `database-architect` | Schema, migrations |\n| `devops-engineer` | Deployment, preview |\n\n---\n\n## Usage Example\n\n```\nUser: \"Make an Instagram clone with photo sharing and likes\"\n\nApp Builder Process:\n1. Project type: Social Media App\n2. Tech stack: Next.js + Prisma + Cloudinary + Clerk\n3. Create plan:\n   ├─ Database schema (users, posts, likes, follows)\n   ├─ API routes (12 endpoints)\n   ├─ Pages (feed, profile, upload)\n   └─ Components (PostCard, Feed, LikeButton)\n4. Coordinate agents\n5. Report progress\n6. Start preview\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:08:34.980Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents requiring seamless integration with various IDEs and CLIs, such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and Kiro.","zh":"非常适合需要与各种IDE和CLI（如GitHub Copilot、Cursor和Kiro）实现无缝集成的AI代理。","ja":"GitHub Copilot、Cursor、Kiroなどの様々なIDEおよびCLIとのシームレスな統合を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Kiro 등 다양한 IDE 및 CLI와의 무결점 통합을 요하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que requieren una integración sin problemas con varias IDE y CLI, como GitHub Copilot, Cursor y Kiro.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une intégration transparente avec diverses IDE et CLI, telles que GitHub Copilot, Cursor et Kiro.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit verschiedenen IDEs und CLIs benötigen, wie GitHub Copilot, Cursor und Kiro.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que exigem integração sem interrupções com várias IDEs e CLIs, como GitHub Copilot, Cursor e Kiro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих бесшовной интеграции с различными IDE и CLI, такими как GitHub Copilot, Cursor и Kiro.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب دمجًا بدون انقطاع مع各种 بيئات تطوير متكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر، مثل GitHub Copilot و Cursor و Kiro."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert configurations from Antigravity IDE to compatible formats, leveraging keyword matrix and project type detection, while coordinating with other agents and planning the tech stack, including alternatives and default stacks like those outlined in tech-stack.md.","zh":"赋予代理转换Antigravity IDE配置为兼容格式的能力，利用关键字矩阵和项目类型检测，同时与其他代理协调并规划技术栈，包括tech-stack.md中概述的替代方案和默认栈。","ja":"Antigravity IDEの設定を互換性のある形式に変換する機能をエージェントに与え、キーワードマトリックスとプロジェクトタイプの検出を利用し、他のエージェントと協調し、tech-stack.mdに概説されている代替およびデフォルトのスタックを含むテクノロジースタックを計画します。","ko":"에이전트가 Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 호환 가능한 형식으로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 키워드 매트릭스 및 프로젝트 유형 탐지를 활용하며, 다른 에이전트와의 협력을 조정하고, tech-stack.md에 개요된 대체 및 기본 기술 스택을 포함하여 기술 스택을 계획합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles, aprovechando la matriz de palabras clave y la detección de tipo de proyecto, mientras coordina con otros agentes y planifica la pila tecnológica, incluyendo alternativas y pilas predeterminadas como las descritas en tech-stack.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des configurations Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles, en exploitant la matrice de mots clés et la détection de type de projet, tout en coordonnant avec d''autres agents et en planifiant la pile technologique, y compris des alternatives et des piles par défaut comme celles décrites dans tech-stack.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate zu konvertieren, indem es die Schlüsselwortmatrix und die Projekttypenerkennung nutzt, während es mit anderen Agents koordiniert und den Technologie-Stack plant, einschließlich Alternativen und Standard-Stacks wie in tech-stack.md beschrieben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis, aproveitando a matriz de palavras-chave e a detecção do tipo de projeto, enquanto coordena com outros agentes e planeja a pilha de tecnologia, incluindo alternativas e pilhas padrão, como as descritas em tech-stack.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать конфигурации Antigravity IDE в совместимые форматы, используя матрицу ключевых слов и обнаружение типа проекта, при этом координируя с другими агентами и планируя технологический стек, включая альтернативы и стандартные стеки, такие как описано в tech-stack.md.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تحويل التكوينات من بيئة تطوير Antigravity المتكاملة إلى صيغ متوافقة، مستفيدًا من مصفوفة الكلمات الرئيسية واكتشاف نوع المشروع، مع التنسيق مع وكيلات أخرى وتخطيط مكدس التكنولوجيا، بما في ذلك البديلات ومكدس التكنولوجيا الافتراضي مثل ما هو موضح في tech-stack.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations for GitHub Copilot compatibility","Planning project structures based on keyword matrices","Coordinating agent workflows with Kiro and OpenCode CLIs"],"zh":["将Antigravity IDE配置转换为GitHub Copilot兼容性","基于关键字矩阵规划项目结构","与Kiro和OpenCode CLIs协调代理工作流"],"ja":["Antigravity IDEの設定をGitHub Copilotと互換性のある形式に変換する","キーワードマトリックスに基づいてプロジェクト構造を計画する","KiroおよびOpenCode CLIsとエージェントのワークフローを調整する"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 구성 파일을 GitHub Copilot와 호환되는 형식으로 변환","키워드 매트릭스를 기반으로 프로젝트 구조를 계획","Kiro 및 OpenCode CLIs와 에이전트 워크플로우를 조정"],"es":["Convertir configuraciones de Antigravity IDE para la compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot","Planificar estructuras de proyectos en función de matrices de palabras clave","Coordinar flujos de trabajo de agentes con Kiro y OpenCode CLIs"],"fr":["Convertir des configurations Antigravity IDE pour la compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot","Planifier des structures de projets en fonction de matrices de mots clés","Coordiner des flux de travail d''agents avec Kiro et OpenCode CLIs"],"de":["Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE für die Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot konvertieren","Projektstrukturen basierend auf Schlüsselwortmatrizen planen","Arbeitsabläufe von Agents mit Kiro und OpenCode CLIs koordinieren"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE para compatibilidade com o GitHub Copilot","Planejamento de estruturas de projeto com base em matrizes de palavras-chave","Coordenação de fluxos de trabalho de agentes com CLIs Kiro e OpenCode"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Antigravity IDE для совместимости с GitHub Copilot","Планирование структуры проекта на основе матрицы ключевых слов","Координация рабочих процессов агентов с CLI Kiro и OpenCode"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات بيئة تطوير Antigravity المتكاملة لتوافقها مع GitHub Copilot","تخطيط هيكل المشروع بناءً على مصفوفة الكلمات الرئيسية","تنسيق سير عمل الوكيل مع واجهات سطر الأوامر Kiro و OpenCode"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Antigravity IDE configurations","Compatibility limited to specified IDEs and CLIs, such as Cursor and GitHub Copilot"],"zh":["需要访问Antigravity IDE配置","兼容性仅限于指定的IDE和CLI，例如Cursor和GitHub Copilot"],"ja":["Antigravity IDEの設定へのアクセスが必要","CursorおよびGitHub Copilotなどの指定されたIDEおよびCLIへの互換性のみが提供される"],"ko":["Antigravity IDE 구성 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","Cursor 및 GitHub Copilot 등 지정된 IDE 및 CLI에 대한 호환성만 제공"],"es":["Requiere acceso a configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad limitada a IDE y CLI especificados, como Cursor y GitHub Copilot"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux configurations Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité limitée aux IDE et CLI spécifiés, tels que Cursor et GitHub Copilot"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE","Kompatibilität beschränkt auf angegebene IDEs und CLIs, wie Cursor und GitHub Copilot"],"pt":["Exige acesso às configurações do Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidade limitada às IDEs e CLIs especificadas, como Cursor e GitHub Copilot"],"ru":["Требует доступа к конфигурациям Antigravity IDE","Совместимость ограничена указанными IDE и CLI, такими как Cursor и GitHub Copilot"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تكوينات بيئة تطوير Antigravity المتكاملة","التوافق مقيد بالبيئات المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر المحددة، مثل Cursor و GitHub Copilot"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/vcpkg', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'vcpkg', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:08:59.314Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/vcpkg","name":"vcpkg","description":{"zh":"Vcpkg是由Microsoft开发的C++包管理器，用于简化依赖管理和提高开发效率","ja":"VcpkgはMicrosoftによって開発されたC++パッケージマネージャーで、依存関係の管理と開発の効率化を目的としています","ko":"Vcpkg는 마이크로소프트에서 개발한 C++ 패키지 매니저로, 종속성 관리와 개발 효율성을 높이기 위해 설계되었습니다","es":"vcpkg es un administrador de paquetes C++ que permite a los desarrolladores gestionar y integrar fácilmente bibliotecas y dependencias en sus proyectos","fr":"vcpkg est un gestionnaire de paquets C++ qui permet aux développeurs de gérer et d''intégrer facilement des bibliothèques et des dépendances dans leurs projets","de":"vcpkg ist ein C++-Paket-Manager, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Bibliotheken und Abhängigkeiten in ihren Projekten einfach zu verwalten und zu integrieren","pt":"O vcpkg é um gerenciador de pacotes C++ que simplifica o desenvolvimento de aplicativos. Ele fornece uma forma fácil de instalar e gerenciar dependências","ru":"Vcpkg — это менеджер пакетов C++, который упрощает разработку приложений. Он предоставляет простой способ установки и управления зависимостями","ar":"Vcpkg هو مدير حزم C++ يبسط تطوير التطبيقات. يوفر طريقة سهلة لتثبيت وإدارة الإعتماديات","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vcpkg：C++包管理器","ja":"Vcpkg：C++パッケージマネージャー","ko":"Vcpkg: C++ 패키지 매니저","es":"vcpkg: Administrador de Paquetes C++","fr":"vcpkg: Gestionnaire de Paquets C++","de":"vcpkg: C++-Paket-Manager","pt":"Vcpkg: Gerenciador de Pacotes C++","ru":"Vcpkg: Менеджер пакетов C++","ar":"Vcpkg: مدير حزم C++","en":"vcpkg"},"description":{"zh":"Vcpkg