tion"],"ko":["UI/UX","UX","UI","a11y","conversion","usability","visual","implementation"],"es":["análisis UI/UX","herramienta de análisis","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","diseño de interfaz de usuario","desarrollo de aplicaciones","análisis de usabilidad"],"fr":["analyse UI/UX","outils d''analyse","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","conception d''interface utilisateur","développement d''applications","analyse de l''utilisabilité"],"de":["UI/UX-Analyse","Analyse-Tool","Verbesserung der Benutzeroberfläche","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Benutzbarkeitsanalyse"],"pt":["análise de UI/UX","melhoria de experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","análise de tela","auditoria de fluxo de usuário","revisão de aplicação"],"ru":["анализ UI/UX","улучшение пользовательского опыта","разработка приложений","анализ экрана","аудит потока пользователя","обзор приложения"],"ar":["تحليل UI/UX","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تطوير التطبيقات","تحليل الشاشة","تدقيق مسار المستخدم","مراجعة التطبيق"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"roast","description":"Multi-perspective UI/UX roasting workflow with iterative improvement cycles","bodyPreview":"# 🔥 UI/UX Roast Skill\n\nBrutally honest UI/UX critique with multi-perspective analysis and iterative improvement.\n\n## Command Syntax\n\n```bash\n/roast [mode] [target] [options]\n\n# Modes\nscreen <target>     # Single screen analysis (default)\nflow <target>       # Multi-screen user journey\naudit               # Full application review\n\n# Options\n--iterations=<1-10> # Roast cycles (default: 3)\n--focus=<area>      # Priority: a11y|conversion|usability|visual|implementation\n--output=<path>     # Output","body":"# 🔥 UI/UX Roast Skill\n\nBrutally honest UI/UX critique with multi-perspective analysis and iterative improvement.\n\n## Command Syntax\n\n```bash\n/roast [mode] [target] [options]\n\n# Modes\nscreen <target>     # Single screen analysis (default)\nflow <target>       # Multi-screen user journey\naudit               # Full application review\n\n# Options\n--iterations=<1-10> # Roast cycles (default: 3)\n--focus=<area>      # Priority: a11y|conversion|usability|visual|implementation\n--output=<path>     # Output directory (default: reports/roast/)\n--fix=<mode>        # Fix handling: auto|report|ask (default: ask)\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n/roast screen login                     # Roast login screen\n/roast screen settings --focus=a11y     # Focus on accessibility\n/roast flow checkout --iterations=5     # 5-iteration checkout flow\n/roast flow onboarding --fix=auto       # Auto-fix issues found\n/roast audit                            # Full app audit\n```\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n### 1. Immediate Start\n\n**Do NOT ask questions upfront.** Apply smart defaults and begin immediately.\n\n```\n🔥 ROAST SESSION STARTED\n├─ Mode: screen\n├─ Target: login\n├─ Iterations: 3\n├─ Focus: balanced\n└─ Output: reports/roast/\n```\n\n### 2. Screenshot Capture\n\nAuto-detect screenshot method:\n\n```\n📸 Capturing screenshot...\n├─ Xcode MCP: [✓ found | ✗ not found]\n├─ Playwright MCP: [✓ found | ✗ not found]\n└─ Using: [xcode | playwright | manual upload]\n```\n\n**Detection priority:**\n1. `mcp__xcodebuildmcp__screenshot` → iOS/macOS\n2. `mcp__playwright__browser_take_screenshot` → Web\n3. Request user upload → Fallback\n\n**CRITICAL: Always specify the output path explicitly!**\n\n```typescript\n// First, ensure directory exists\nBash: mkdir -p reports/roast/screenshots\n\n// Playwright MCP - specify filename parameter\nmcp__playwright__browser_take_screenshot({\n  type: \"png\",\n  filename: \"reports/roast/screenshots/[target]_[iteration].png\"\n})\n\n// Xcode MCP - specify path parameter\nmcp__xcodebuildmcp__screenshot({\n  path: \"reports/roast/screenshots/[target]_[iteration].png\"\n})\n```\n\nWithout explicit path, screenshots go to wrong location (e.g., `.playwright-mcp/`).\n\n### 3. Parallel Analysis with Progress\n\nShow real-time progress:\n\n```\n🔥 Roasting: login (1/3)\n├─ 📸 Screenshot ✓\n├─ 🎨 Designer: analyzing...\n├─ 💻 Developer: analyzing...\n├─ 👤 User: analyzing...\n├─ ♿ A11y: analyzing...\n└─ 📈 Marketing: analyzing...\n```\n\nLaunch agents in parallel:\n\n```typescript\n// All 5 agents run simultaneously\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-designer\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-developer\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-user\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-a11y\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-marketing\", prompt=\"...\")\n```\n\nUpdate as each completes:\n\n```\n├─ 🎨 Designer: ✓ 3 issues\n├─ 💻 Developer: ✓ 2 issues\n├─ 👤 User: ✓ 4 issues\n├─ ♿ A11y: ✓ 5 issues (2 critical!)\n└─ 📈 Marketing: ✓ 2 issues\n```\n\n### 4. Results Summary\n\nDisplay in terminal before asking about fixes:\n\n```\n🔥 ROAST RESULTS (Iteration 1/3)\n\nFound 16 issues:\n├─ 🔴 Critical: 2\n├─ 🟠 Major: 6\n└─ 🟡 Minor: 8\n\nTop Critical Issues:\n1. Missing form labels - add aria-label to inputs\n2. Contrast ratio 2.1:1 - increase to 4.5:1 minimum\n\n📄 Full report: reports/roast/roast_login_1.md\n```\n\n### 5. Fix Decision (After Results)\n\nAsk ONLY after showing results:\n\n```\nHow should we handle these 16 issues?\n\n[1] Auto-fix critical & major (8 fixes)\n[2] Fix all issues (16 fixes)\n[3] Cherry-pick fixes\n[4] Report only (no changes)\n```\n\n### 6. Fix Implementation\n\nIf fixes chosen:\n\n```\n🔧 Implementing fixes...\n├─ [1/8] Adding aria-labels... ✓\n├─ [2/8] Fixing contrast... ✓\n├─ [3/8] Increasing touch targets... ✓\n...\n└─ ✓ Complete\n\n📸 Capturing updated screenshot...\n```\n\n### 7. Next Iteration\n\n```\nIteration 2/3 starting...\n[Repeat steps 2-6]\n```\n\n### 8. Final Summary\n\n```\n🔥 FINAL ROAST SUMMARY\n\nSession Complete!\n├─ Iterations: 3\n├─ Issues found: 24\n├─ Issues fixed: 18\n└─ Resolution: 75%\n\nScore Improvement:\n| Category      | Before | After | Δ    |\n|---------------|--------|-------|------|\n| Visual        | 4/10   | 8/10  | +4   |\n| Usability     | 5/10   | 9/10  | +4   |\n| Accessibility | 3/10   | 8/10  | +5   |\n| Overall       | 4/10   | 8/10  | +4   |\n\n📄 reports/roast/roast_login_final.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mode-Specific Behavior\n\n### Screen Mode\n\nSingle screen, multiple iterations:\n\n```\n/roast screen login --iterations=3\n\nIteration 1: Capture → Analyze → Report → Fix?\nIteration 2: Capture → Analyze → Report → Fix?\nIteration 3: Capture → Analyze → Final Report\n```\n\n### Flow Mode\n\nMultiple screens, analyze journey:\n\n```\n/roast flow checkout\n\n🗺️ Flow: checkout (5 steps)\n├─ [1/5] Cart → 📸 analyzing...\n├─ [2/5] Shipping → 📸 analyzing...\n├─ [3/5] Payment → 📸 analyzing...\n├─ [4/5] Review → 📸 analyzing...\n└─ [5/5] Confirmation → 📸 analyzing...\n\nCross-screen checks:\n├─ Visual consistency\n├─ Navigation clarity\n├─ Progress indication\n└─ Drop-off risk points\n```\n\n### Audit Mode\n\nAuto-detect and roast all critical screens:\n\n```\n/roast audit\n\n🔍 Scanning for critical screens...\n├─ Login ✓\n├─ Dashboard ✓\n├─ Settings ✓\n├─ Checkout ✓\n└─ Profile ✓\n\nRoasting 5 screens (3 iterations each)...\n```\n\n---\n\n## Agent Configuration\n\n| Agent | Model | Focus | Weight |\n|-------|-------|-------|--------|\n| roaster (orchestrator) | Opus | Synthesis | - |\n| roaster-designer | Sonnet | Visual, typography, color | 1.0x |\n| roaster-developer | Sonnet | Implementation, structure | 1.0x |\n| roaster-user | Sonnet | Usability, friction | 1.0x |\n| roaster-a11y | Sonnet | Accessibility, WCAG | 1.0x |\n| roaster-marketing | Sonnet | Conversion, trust | 1.0x |\n\n**With `--focus` option:**\n- Focused agent: 1.5x weight\n- Other agents: 0.5x weight\n\n---\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\nreports/roast/\n├─ roast_[target]_1.md\n├─ roast_[target]_2.md\n├─ roast_[target]_final.md\n└─ screenshots/\n   ├─ [target]_1.png\n   ├─ [target]_2.png\n   └─ [target]_final.png\n```\n\n---\n\n## Report Format\n\n```markdown\n# 🔥 Roast Report: [Target] - Iteration [N]\n\n**Mode:** screen | **Focus:** balanced | **Date:** 2024-01-15\n\n![Screenshot](screenshots/login_1.png)\n\n## The Verdict\n\n[Brutal 2-3 sentence summary]\n\n## Issues by Severity\n\n### 🔴 Critical (2)\n| Issue | Agent | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| Missing labels | A11y | Add aria-label=\"Email\" |\n| Low contrast | Designer | Change #999 to #595959 |\n\n### 🟠 Major (6)\n...\n\n### 🟡 Minor (8)\n...\n\n## Agent Deep Dives\n\n### 🎨 Designer\n[Full analysis]\n\n### ♿ A11y Expert\n[Full analysis]\n\n...\n\n## Quick Wins\n- [ ] Fix 1 (< 2 min)\n- [ ] Fix 2 (< 2 min)\n\n## Scores\n| Category | Score |\n|----------|-------|\n| Visual | 4/10 |\n| Usability | 5/10 |\n| Accessibility | 3/10 |\n| Overall | 4/10 |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Voice Guidelines\n\n1. **Brutal but fair** - Harsh critique, always with solutions\n2. **Specific values** - \"#2563eb\", \"48px\", \"font-weight: 600\"\n3. **Actionable fixes** - Every issue has a concrete fix\n4. **Fast start** - Begin immediately, ask questions later\n5. **Progress visibility** - Always show what''s happening\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:09:08.599Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Analysis Agents needing brutal multi-perspective design critique capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要进行多角度设计批判的 UI/UX 分析代理。","ja":"UI/UX 分析エージェントが多角度の設計批判機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"다각도 디자인 비평 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de crítica de diseño multi-perspectiva brutal.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse UI/UX ayant besoin de capacités de critique de conception multi-perspective brutale.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Analyseagenten, die brutale multi-perspektivische Design-Kritikfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de UI/UX que necessitam de capacidades de crítica de design multi-perspectiva brutal.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа UI/UX, которым необходимы возможности жесткой многосторонней критики дизайна.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى قدرات نقد تصميم متعددة المنظور قاسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive UI/UX evaluation through iterative roast cycles with focus modes for accessibility (a11y), conversion optimization, usability, visual design, and implementation analysis. Supports both single-screen analysis and multi-screen user journey evaluations.","zh":"通过迭代的批判循环和针对可访问性（a11y）、转换优化、可用性、视觉设计和实现分析的关注模式，实现全面 UI/UX 评估。支持单屏分析和多屏用户旅程评估。","ja":"アクセシビリティ（a11y）、コンバージョン最適化、ユーザビリティ、ビジュアルデザイン、実装分析などの焦点モードを備えたイテレーティブなローストサイクルを通じて、包括的な UI/UX 評価を可能にします。シングルスクリーン分析とマルチスクリーン ユーザージャーニー評価の両方をサポートします。","ko":"접근성(a11y), 전환 최적화, 사용성, 시각적 디자인 및 구현 분석을 위한焦点 모드를備えた 반복적인 로스트 사이클을 통해 종합적인 UI/UX 평가를 가능하게 합니다. 단일 화면 분석과 다중 화면 사용자 여정 평가를 모두 지원합니다.","es":"Permite una evaluación integral de UI/UX a través de ciclos de crítica iterativos con modos de enfoque para accesibilidad (a11y), optimización de conversión, usabilidad, diseño visual y análisis de implementación. Admite tanto el análisis de pantalla única como las evaluaciones del recorrido del usuario multi-pantalla.","fr":"Permet une évaluation complète de UI/UX grâce à des cycles de critique itératifs avec des modes de focus pour l''accessibilité (a11y), l''optimisation de la conversion, l''utilisabilité, la conception visuelle et l''analyse de la mise en œuvre. Prend en charge à la fois l''analyse d''écran unique et les évaluations du parcours utilisateur multi-écran.","de":"Ermöglicht eine umfassende UI/UX-Bewertung durch iterative Kritikzyklen mit Fokusmodi für Zugänglichkeit (a11y), Konvertierungsoptimierung, Benutzerfreundlichkeit, visuelles Design und Implementierungsanalyse. Unterstützt sowohl Einzelscreen-Analyse als auch Multi-Screen-Benutzerreise-Bewertungen.","pt":"Permite uma avaliação abrangente de UI/UX por meio de ciclos de crítica iterativos com modos de foco para acessibilidade (a11y), otimização de conversão, usabilidade, design visual e análise de implementação. Suporta tanto a análise de tela única quanto as avaliações da jornada do usuário em múltiplas telas.","ru":"Позволяет проводить всестороннюю оценку UI/UX посредством итеративных циклов критики с режимами фокусировки для доступности (a11y), оптимизации конверсии, удобства использования, визуального дизайна и анализа реализации. Поддерживает как анализ единственной экранной поверхности, так и оценки пользовательского пути на нескольких экранах.","ar":"يمكّن التقييم الشامل لبرنامج واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم من خلال دورات نقد متكررة مع أوضاع التركيز على إمكانية الوصول (a11y) وتحسين التحويل والقابلية للاستخدام والتصميم البصري وتحليل التنفيذ. يدعم كل من تحليل الشاشة الواحدة وتقييمات رحلة المستخدم عبر شاشات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Performing accessibility audits on web interfaces","Optimizing conversion funnels through user flow analysis","Identifying usability pain points in application screens","Conducting visual design critiques with iterative improvements","Running full application audits with prioritized focus areas"],"zh":["对网页接口进行可访问性审计","通过用户流分析优化转换漏斗","在应用程序屏幕中确定可用性痛点","进行视觉设计批判并进行迭代改进","运行具有优先焦点区域的完整应用程序审计"],"ja":["Web インターフェイスのアクセシビリティ監査を実行する","ユーザーフロー分析を通じてコンバージョン漏斗を最適化する","アプリケーションスクリーンでユーザビリティの痛点を特定する","視覚的デザイン批判を実施し、イテレーティブな改善を行う","優先焦点領域を持つフルアプリケーション監査を実行する"],"ko":["웹 인터페이스에 대한 접근성 감사를 수행한다","사용자 흐름 분석을 통해 전환漏斗를 최적화한다","애플리케이션 화면에서 사용성痛点을 식별한다","시각적 디자인 비평을 수행하고 반복적인 개선을 thực施한다","우선순위焦点 영역을 갖는 전체 애플리케이션 감사를実施한다"],"es":["Realizar auditorías de accesibilidad en interfaces web","Optimizar embudos de conversión a través del análisis de flujos de usuario","Identificar puntos de dolor de usabilidad en pantallas de aplicaciones","Realizar críticas de diseño visual con mejoras iterativas","Ejecutar auditorías de aplicaciones completas con áreas de enfoque prioritarias"],"fr":["Réalisant des audits d''accessibilité sur les interfaces Web","Optimiser les entonnoirs de conversion grâce à l''analyse du flux d''utilisateurs","Identifier les points de douleur de l''utilisabilité sur les écrans d''applications","Réalisant des critiques de conception visuelle avec des améliorations itératives","Exécuter des audits d''applications complets avec des zones de focus prioritaires"],"de":["Durchführung von Zugänglichkeitsaudits in Web-Schnittstellen","Optimierung von Konvertierungs-Trichtern durch Benutzerflussanalyse","Identifizierung von Usability-Schmerzpunkten in Anwendungsbildschirmen","Durchführung visueller Design-Kritiken mit iterativen Verbesserungen","Durchführung von vollständigen Anwendungsaudits mit priorisierten Fokusgebieten"],"pt":["Realizar auditorias de acessibilidade em interfaces web","Otimizar funis de conversão por meio da análise de fluxo de usuário","Identificar pontos de dor de usabilidade em telas de aplicativos","Realizar críticas de design visual com melhorias iterativas","Executar auditorias de aplicativos completas com áreas de foco priorizadas"],"ru":["Проведение аудитов доступности веб-интерфейсов","Оптимизация воронок конверсии посредством анализа пользовательского потока","Определение болевых точек удобства использования на экранах приложений","Проведение критик визуального дизайна с итеративными улучшениями","Проведение полных аудитов приложений с приоритизированными областями фокусировки"],"ar":["إجراء عمليات تدقيق لتحقيق إمكانية الوصول إلى واجهات الويب","تحسين قنوات التحويل من خلال تحليل تدفق المستخدم","تحديد نقاط الألم في تجربة المستخدم على شاشات التطبيقات","إجراء نقد للتصميم البصري مع تحسينات متكررة","تشغيل عمليات تدقيق كاملة للتطبيقات مع مجالات تركيز ذات أولوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires visual target input for analysis","Limited to 10 iterative roast cycles maximum","Needs specific focus area selection for priority analysis"],"zh":["需要视觉目标输入进行分析","最多限制为 10 个迭代的批判循环","需要特定的焦点区域选择以进行优先分析"],"ja":["分析のために視覚的ターゲット入力を必要とする","最大 10 回のイテレーティブなローストサイクルに制限される","優先分析のために特定の焦点領域の選択が必要である"],"ko":["분석을 위해 시각적 대상 입력이 필요합니다","최대 10 회의 반복적인 로스트 사이클로 제한됩니다","우선순위 분석을 위해 특정焦点 영역의 선택이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de objetivo visual para el análisis","Limitado a 10 ciclos de crítica iterativos como máximo","Necesita una selección de área de enfoque específica para el análisis de prioridad"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée cible visuelle pour l''analyse","Limité à 10 cycles de critique itératifs maximum","Nécessite une sélection d''une zone de focus spécifique pour l''analyse de priorité"],"de":["Benötigt eine visuelle Ziel-Eingabe für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf 10 iterative Kritikzyklen maximal","Benötigt eine spezifische Auswahl eines Fokusgebiets für die Prioritätsanalyse"],"pt":["Requer entrada de alvo visual para análise","Limitado a 10 ciclos de crítica iterativos máximo","Necessita de seleção de área de foco específica para análise de prioridade"],"ru":["Требует визуального целевого входа для анализа","Ограничен 10 итеративными циклами критики максимум","Требует выбора конкретной области фокусировки для приоритетного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال هدف مرئي للتحليل","محدود بـ 10 دورات نقد متكرر كحد أقصى","يحتاج إلى اختيار منطقة تركيز محددة للتحليل بالأولوية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills/canva-automation', 'community', 'sickn33', 'antigravity-awesome-skills', 'sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills', 'canva-automation', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:08:36.772Z', NULL, '{"id":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills/canva-automation","name":"canva-automation","description":{"zh":"Canva 自动化技能是通过 Rube MCP 实现的，可以自动化 Canva 设计操作","ja":"Canva 自動化スキルは Rube MCP を使用して実現され、Canva デザイン操作を自動化する","ko":"Canva 자동화 스킬은 Rube MCP를 사용하여 구현되어 Canva 디자인 작업을 자동화한다","es":"La automatización de Canva con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores optimizar sus flujos de trabajo de diseño. Conecta Rube MCP y la herramienta de Canva para empezar a automatizar.","fr":"L''automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs d''optimiser leurs flux de travail de conception. Connectez Rube MCP et l''outil Canva pour commencer à automatiser.","de":"Die Automatisierung von Canva mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Design-Arbeitsabläufe zu optimieren. Verbinden Sie Rube MCP und die Canva-Toolbox, um mit der Automatisierung zu beginnen.","pt":"A automação Canva via Rube MCP permite automatizar operações de design do Canva com o toolkit Composio. Conecte-se ao Rube MCP e ao Canva para começar.","ru":"Автоматизация Canva через Rube MCP позволяет автоматизировать операции дизайна Canva с помощью инструментария Composio. Подключитесь к Rube MCP и Canva, чтобы начать.","ar":"تأتمتة كانفا من خلال Rube MCP تسمح بتأتمتة عمليات تصميم كانفا باستخدام أداة Composio. اتصل ب Rube MCP و كانفا لبدء التشغيل.","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Canva 自动化技能","ja":"Canva 自動化スキル","ko":"Canva 자동화 스킬","es":"Automatización de Canva con Rube MCP","fr":"Automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP","de":"Canva-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP","pt":"Automação Canva com Rube MCP","ru":"Автоматизация Canva с Rube MCP","ar":"تأتمتة كانفا مع Rube MCP","en":"canva-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Canva 自动化技能是通过 Rube MCP 实现的，可以自动化 Canva 设计操作","ja":"Canva 自動化スキルは Rube MCP を使用して実現され、Canva デザイン操作を自動化する","ko":"Canva 자동화 스킬은 Rube MCP를 사용하여 구현되어 Canva 디자인 작업을 자동화한다","es":"La automatización de Canva con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores optimizar sus flujos de trabajo de diseño. Conecta Rube MCP y la herramienta de Canva p...","fr":"L''automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs d''optimiser leurs flux de travail de conception. Connectez Rube MCP et l''outil Canva pour com...","de":"Die Automatisierung von Canva mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Design-Arbeitsabläufe zu optimieren. Verbinden Sie Rube MCP und die Canva-Toolbox,...","pt":"A automação Canva via Rube MCP permite automatizar operações de design do Canva com o toolkit Composio. Conecte-se ao Rube MCP e ao Canva para começar.","ru":"Автоматизация Canva через Rube MCP позволяет автоматизировать операции дизайна Canva с помощью инструментария Composio. Подключитесь к Rube MCP и Canva, чтоб...","ar":"تأتمتة كانفا من خلال Rube MCP تسمح بتأتمتة عمليات تصميم كانفا باستخدام أداة Composio. اتصل ب Rube MCP و كانفا لبدء التشغيل.","en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official sk..."},"definition":{"en":"The Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel."},"features":{"zh":["通过 Rube MCP 实现 Canva 设计操作自动化","无需 API 密钥，仅需添加 MCP 服务器","支持 Composio 的 Canva 工具包","可以自动化 Canva 的设计、布局和样式","提高开发效率和生产力"],"ja":["Rube MCP を使用して Canva デザイン操作を自動化","API キーは不要、MCP サーバーを追加するのみ","Composio の Canva ツールキットをサポート","Canva のデザイン、レイアウト、スタイルを自動化","開発効率と生産性を向上させる"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 Canva 디자인 작업을 자동화","API 키가 필요하지 않으며 MCP 서버만 추가하면 됨","Composio의 Canva 툴킷을 지원","Canva의 디자인, 레이아웃, 스타일을 자동화","개발 효율성과 생산성을 향상"],"es":["Automatización de operaciones de diseño de Canva","Integración con Rube MCP","Uso de la herramienta de Composio","Configuración sencilla","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de diseño"],"fr":["Automatisation des opérations de conception de Canva","Intégration avec Rube MCP","Utilisation de l''outil Composio","Configuration simple","Optimisation des flux de travail de conception"],"de":["Automatisierung von Canva-Designoperationen","Integration mit Rube MCP","Verwendung der Composio-Toolbox","Einfache Konfiguration","Optimierung von Design-Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["Automação de operações de design do Canva","Integração com o toolkit Composio","Conexão ao Rube MCP","Melhoria da eficiência do fluxo de trabalho","Fácil configuração sem chaves de API","Compatibilidade com Claude Code, Antigravity e Cursor"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций дизайна Canva","Интеграция с инструментарием Composio","Подключение к Rube MCP","Повышение эффективности рабочего процесса","Легкая настройка без ключей API","Совместимость с Claude Code, Antigravity и Cursor"],"ar":["تأتمتة عمليات تصميم كانفا","التكامل مع أداة Composio","التواصل مع Rube MCP","تحسين كفاءة تدفق العمل","إعداد سهل بدون مفاتيح API","التوافق مع Claude Code, Antigravity و Cursor"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Canva 自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","自动化工具","开发效率","生产力"],"ja":["Canva 自動化","Rube MCP","Composio","自動化ツール","開発効率","生産性"],"ko":["Canva 자동화","Rube MCP","Composio","자동화 도구","개발 효율성","생산성"],"es":["automatización de Canva","Rube MCP","Composio","diseño de Canva","automatización de diseño","optimización de flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["automatisation de Canva","Rube MCP","Composio","conception de Canva","automatisation de conception","optimisation des flux de travail"],"de":["Canva-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva-Design","Automatisierung von Design","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["automação canva","rube mcp","composio","design canva","fluxo de trabalho","eficiência","claude code","antigravity","cursor"],"ru":["автоматизация canva","rube mcp","composio","дизайн canva","рабочий процесс","эффективность","claude code","antigravity","cursor"],"ar":["تأتمتة كانفا","rube mcp","composio","تصميم كانفا","تدفق العمل","كفاءة","claude code","antigravity","cursor"]}},"owner":"sickn33","repo":"antigravity-awesome-skills","repoPath":"sickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canva-automation","description":"Automate Canva tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): designs, exports, folders, brand templates, autofill. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1.","body":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Canva OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Browse Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find existing designs or browse their Canva library\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - List all designs with optional filters [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `query`: Search term to filter designs by name\n- `continuation`: Pagination token from previous response\n- `ownership`: Filter by ''owned'', ''shared'', or ''any''\n- `sort_by`: Sort field (e.g., ''modified_at'', ''title'')\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Results are paginated; follow `continuation` token until absent\n- Deleted designs may still appear briefly; check design status\n- Search is substring-based, not fuzzy matching\n\n### 2. Create and Design\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a new Canva design from scratch or from a template\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - Browse available brand templates [Optional]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET` - Create a new design [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_type`: Type of design (e.g., ''Presentation'', ''Poster'', ''SocialMedia'')\n- `title`: Name for the new design\n- `asset_id`: Optional asset to include in the design\n- `width` / `height`: Custom dimensions in pixels\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Design type must match Canva''s predefined types exactly\n- Custom dimensions have minimum and maximum limits\n- Asset must be uploaded first via CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB before referencing\n\n### 3. Upload Assets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to upload images or files to Canva for use in designs\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB` - Initiate the asset upload [Required]\n2. `CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS` - Poll until upload completes [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Display name for the asset\n- `url`: Public URL of the file to upload (for URL-based uploads)\n- `job_id`: Upload job ID returned from step 1 (for status polling)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Upload is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job status until it completes\n- Supported formats include PNG, JPG, SVG, MP4, GIF\n- File size limits apply; large files may take longer to process\n- The `job_id` from CREATE returns the ID needed for status polling\n- Status values: ''in_progress'', ''success'', ''failed''\n\n### 4. Export Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to download or export a Canva design as PDF, PNG, or other format\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - Find the design to export [Prerequisite]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB` - Start the export process [Required]\n3. `CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT` - Poll until export completes and get download URL [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_id`: ID of the design to export\n- `format`: Export format (''pdf'', ''png'', ''jpg'', ''svg'', ''mp4'', ''gif'', ''pptx'')\n- `pages`: Specific page numbers to export (array)\n- `quality`: Export quality (''regular'', ''high'')\n- `job_id`: Export job ID for polling status\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Export is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job result until it completes\n- Download URLs from completed exports expire after a limited time\n- Large designs with many pages take longer to export\n- Not all formats support all design types (e.g., MP4 only for animations)\n- Poll interval: wait 2-3 seconds between status checks\n\n### 5. Organize with Folders\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create folders or organize designs into folders\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_POST_FOLDERS` - Create a new folder [Required]\n2. `CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER` - Move designs into folders [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Folder name\n- `parent_folder_id`: Parent folder for nested organization\n- `item_id`: ID of the design or asset to move\n- `folder_id`: Target folder ID\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Folder names must be unique within the same parent folder\n- Moving items between folders updates their location immediately\n- Root-level folders have no parent_folder_id\n\n### 6. Autofill from Brand Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate designs by filling brand template placeholders with data\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - List available brand templates [Required]\n2. `CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB` - Start autofill with data [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `brand_template_id`: ID of the brand template to use\n- `title`: Title for the generated design\n- `data`: Key-value mapping of placeholder names to replacement values\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Template placeholders must match exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Autofill is asynchronous; poll for completion\n- Only brand templates support autofill, not regular designs\n- Data values must match the expected type for each placeholder (text, image URL)\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Async Job Pattern\n\nMany Canva operations are asynchronous:\n```\n1. Initiate job (upload, export, autofill) -> get job_id\n2. Poll status endpoint with job_id every 2-3 seconds\n3. Check for ''success'' or ''failed'' status\n4. On success, extract result (asset_id, download_url, design_id)\n```\n\n### ID Resolution\n\n**Design name -> Design ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS with query=design_name\n2. Find matching design in results\n3. Extract id field\n```\n\n**Brand template name -> Template ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST\n2. Find template by name\n3. Extract brand_template_id\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Check response for `continuation` token\n- Pass token in next request''s `continuation` parameter\n- Continue until `continuation` is absent or empty\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Async Operations**:\n- Uploads, exports, and autofills are all asynchronous\n- Always poll job status; do not assume immediate completion\n- Download URLs from exports expire; use them promptly\n\n**Asset Management**:\n- Assets must be uploaded before they can be used in designs\n- Upload job must reach ''success'' status before the asset_id is valid\n- Supported formats vary; check Canva documentation for current limits\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Canva API has rate limits per endpoint\n- Implement exponential backoff for bulk operations\n- Batch operations where possible to reduce API calls\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` key\n- Job status responses include different fields based on completion state\n- Parse defensively with fallbacks for optional fields\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List designs | CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS | query, continuation |\n| Create design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET | design_type, title |\n| Upload asset | CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB | name, url |\n| Check upload | CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS | job_id |\n| Export design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB | design_id, format |\n| Get export | CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT | job_id |\n| Create folder | CANVA_POST_FOLDERS | name, parent_folder_id |\n| Move to folder | CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER | item_id, folder_id |\n| List templates | CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST | (none) |\n| Autofill template | CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB | brand_template_id, data |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:08:36.772Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Design Agents needing advanced Canva automation capabilities via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要高级Canva自动化功能的视觉设计代理，通过Rube MCP实现","ja":"Rube MCPを介して高度なCanva自動化機能を必要とするビジュアルデザインエージェントに最適","ko":"루베 MCP를 통해 고급 Canva 자동화 기능을 필요한 시각적 디자인 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de diseño visual que necesitan capacidades de automatización avanzadas de Canva a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception visuelle ayant besoin de capacités d''automatisation avancées de Canva via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle-Design-Agenten, die erweiterte Canva-Automatisierungsfunktionen über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design Visual que precisam de capacidades avançadas de automação do Canva via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Дизайн Агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности автоматизации Canva через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لعميل التصميم المرئي الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في أتمتة كانفا عبر رUBE MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and supporting protocols like MCP","zh":"通过Composio的Canva工具包实现代理自动化Canva设计操作，利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS进行无缝集成，并支持MCP等协议","ja":"ComposioのCanvaツールキットを使用してエージェントがCanvaデザイン操作を自動化し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用してシームレスに統合し、MCPなどのプロトコルをサポート","ko":"컴포지오의 카바 툴킷을 사용하여 에이전트가 카바 디자인 작업을 자동화하고, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 무縫 통합을 지원하며, MCP 등의 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de diseño de Canva a través de la herramienta de Canva de Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una integración sin problemas, y soportando protocolos como MCP","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de conception de Canva via la boîte à outils Canva de Composio, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une intégration transparente, et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que MCP","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Canva-Designoperationen über Composios Canva-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden und Protokolle wie MCP unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de design d