ть المحتوى المرئي من خلال أداة كومبوسيو","إدارة الاتصالات كانفا من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Canva connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Canva连接","需要先调用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS来获取当前工具架构"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続の必要性","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介したCanva接続の必要性","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを最初に呼び出して現在のツールスキーマを取得する必要性"],"ko":["루베 MCP 연결이 필요한","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 카바 연결이 필요한","현재 도구 스키마를 가져오기 위해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 먼저 호출해야 하는"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP","Conexión activa de Canva a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS debe llamarse primero para obtener los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion Canva active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS doit être appelé en premier pour obtenir les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Canva-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS muss zuerst aufgerufen werden, um die aktuellen Tool-Schemata zu erhalten"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa do Canva via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS deve ser chamado primeiro para obter esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP","Активное соединение Canva через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS должен быть вызван первым для получения текущих схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال رUBE MCP","اتصال كانفا النشط عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","يجب استدعاء RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS أولاً للحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
