cliniques pour les environnements d''exécution de code","de":"Die M4 Python API bietet programmatischen Zugriff auf klinische Datensätze für Code-Ausführungsumgebungen","pt":"A M4 API fornece acesso programático a conjuntos de dados clínicos em Python, permitindo análises complexas e manipulação de dados","ru":"M4 API предоставляет программный доступ к клиническим наборам данных на Python, позволяя выполнять сложные анализы и манипулировать данными","ar":"توفر M4 API وصول برمجي إلى مجموعات بيانات سريرية في بايثون، مما يسمح بالتحليلات المعقدة وتصريف البيانات","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["M4 API","M4 API","MCP","API","Python"],"ja":["M4 API","M4 API","MCP","API","Python"],"ko":["M4 API","M4 API","MCP","API","Python"],"es":["Análisis clínico complejo","Resultados a gran escala","Tipos de datos nativos de Python","Entornos de ejecución de código","Análisis estadísticos","Unión de consultas"],"fr":["Analyse clinique complexe","Résultats à grande échelle","Types de données Python natifs","Environnements d''exécution de code","Analyses statistiques","Jointure de requêtes"],"de":["Erweiterte klinische Analyse","Ergebnisse in großem Umfang","Native Python-Datentypen","Code-Ausführungsumgebungen","Statistische Analysen","Abfrageverbindungen"],"pt":["Acesso a conjuntos de dados clínicos","Análise clínica complexa","Manipulação de dados em Python","Retorno de tipos de dados nativos do Python","Suporte a grandes conjuntos de dados"],"ru":["Доступ к клиническим наборам данных","Сложный клинический анализ","Манипулирование данными на Python","Возвращение родных типов данных Python","Поддержка больших наборов данных"],"ar":["الوصول إلى مجموعات بيانات سريرية","التحليل السريري المعقد","تصريف البيانات في بايثون","إرجاع أنواع بيانات بايثون الأصلية","دعم مجموعات بيانات كبيرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["M4 API","Python API","MCP","API","Python","M4"],"ja":["M4 API","Python API","MCP","API","Python","M4"],"ko":["M4 API","Python API","MCP","API","Python","M4"],"es":["API M4 Python","análisis clínico","conjuntos de datos clínicos","entornos de ejecución de código","resultados a gran escala","tipos de datos nativos de Python","análisis estadísticos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["API M4 Python","analyse clinique","jeux de données cliniques","environnements d''exécution de code","résultats à grande échelle","types de données Python natifs","analyses statistiques","développement de logiciels"],"de":["M4 Python API","klinische Analyse","klinische Datensätze","Code-Ausführungsumgebungen","Ergebnisse in großem Umfang","native Python-Datentypen","statistische Analysen","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["M4 API","Análise clínica","Dados clínicos","Python","API de saúde","Análise de dados","Desenvolvimento de software","Saúde digital"],"ru":["M4 API","Клинический анализ","Клинические данные","Python","API здравоохранения","Анализ данных","Разработка программного обеспечения","Цифровое здравоохранение"],"ar":["M4 API","التحليل السريري","بيانات سريرية","بايثون","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الصحة","تحليل البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات","الصحة الرقمية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m4-api","description":"Use the M4 Python API to query clinical datasets (MIMIC-IV, eICU) programmatically. Triggers on M4 API, query MIMIC with Python, clinical data analysis, EHR data, execute SQL on MIMIC, or when writing code to access clinical databases.","bodyPreview":"# M4 Python API\n\nThe M4 Python API provides programmatic access to clinical datasets for code execution environments. It mirrors the MCP tools but returns native Python types (DataFrames, dicts) instead of formatted strings.\n\n## When to Use the API vs MCP Tools\n\n**Use the Python API when:**\n- **Complex clinical analysis** - Multi-step analyses that require intermediate results, joins across queries, or statistical computations\n- **Large result sets** - Query results with thousands of rows can be","body":"# M4 Python API\n\nThe M4 Python API provides programmatic access to clinical datasets for code execution environments. It mirrors the MCP tools but returns native Python types (DataFrames, dicts) instead of formatted strings.\n\n## When to Use the API vs MCP Tools\n\n**Use the Python API when:**\n- **Complex clinical analysis** - Multi-step analyses that require intermediate results, joins across queries, or statistical computations\n- **Large result sets** - Query results with thousands of rows can be stored in DataFrames without dumping into context\n- **Mathematical operations** - Aggregations, percentile calculations, statistical tests, and counting that benefit from pandas/numpy\n- **Iterative exploration** - Building up analysis through multiple queries where each step informs the next\n\n**Use MCP tools when:**\n- Simple one-off queries where the result fits comfortably in context\n- Interactive exploration where you want to see results immediately\n\n## Required Workflow\n\n**You must follow this sequence:**\n\n1. `set_dataset()` - Select which dataset to query (REQUIRED FIRST)\n2. `get_schema()` / `get_table_info()` - Explore available tables\n3. `execute_query()` - Run SQL queries\n\n```python\nfrom m4 import set_dataset, get_schema, get_table_info, execute_query\n\n# Step 1: Always set dataset first\nset_dataset(\"mimic-iv\")  # or \"mimic-iv-demo\", \"eicu\", \"mimic-iv-note\"\n\n# Step 2: Explore schema\nschema = get_schema()\nprint(schema[''tables''])  # List of table names\n\n# Step 3: Inspect specific tables before querying\ninfo = get_table_info(\"hosp_patients\")\nprint(info[''schema''])  # DataFrame with column names, types\nprint(info[''sample''])  # DataFrame with sample rows\n\n# Step 4: Execute queries\ndf = execute_query(\"SELECT gender, COUNT(*) as n FROM hosp_patients GROUP BY gender\")\n# Returns pd.DataFrame - use pandas operations freely\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\n### Dataset Management\n\n| Function | Returns | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `list_datasets()` | `list[str]` | Available dataset names |\n| `set_dataset(name)` | `str` | Set active dataset (confirmation message) |\n| `get_active_dataset()` | `str` | Get current dataset name |\n\n### Tabular Data (requires TABULAR modality)\n\n| Function | Returns | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `get_schema()` | `dict` | `{''backend_info'': str, ''tables'': list[str]}` |\n| `get_table_info(table, show_sample=True)` | `dict` | `{''schema'': DataFrame, ''sample'': DataFrame}` |\n| `execute_query(sql)` | `DataFrame` | Query results as pandas DataFrame |\n\n### Clinical Notes (requires NOTES modality)\n\n| Function | Returns | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `search_notes(query, note_type, limit, snippet_length)` | `dict` | `{''results'': dict[str, DataFrame]}` |\n| `get_note(note_id, max_length)` | `dict` | `{''text'': str, ''subject_id'': int, ...}` |\n| `list_patient_notes(subject_id, note_type, limit)` | `dict` | `{''notes'': dict[str, DataFrame]}` |\n\n## Error Handling\n\nM4 uses a hierarchy of exceptions. Catch specific types to handle errors appropriately:\n\n```\nM4Error (base)\n├── DatasetError      # Dataset doesn''t exist or not configured\n├── QueryError        # SQL syntax error, table not found, query failed\n└── ModalityError     # Tool incompatible with dataset (e.g., notes on tabular-only)\n```\n\n**Recovery patterns:**\n\n```python\nfrom m4 import execute_query, set_dataset, DatasetError, QueryError, ModalityError\n\ntry:\n    df = execute_query(\"SELECT * FROM hosp_patients\")\nexcept DatasetError as e:\n    # No dataset selected, or dataset not found\n    # Recovery: call set_dataset() first, or check list_datasets()\n    set_dataset(\"mimic-iv\")\n    df = execute_query(\"SELECT * FROM hosp_patients\")\nexcept QueryError as e:\n    # SQL error or table not found\n    # Recovery: check table name with get_schema(), fix SQL syntax\n    print(f\"Query failed: {e}\")\nexcept ModalityError as e:\n    # Tried notes function on tabular-only dataset\n    # Recovery: switch to dataset with NOTES modality\n    set_dataset(\"mimic-iv-note\")\n```\n\n## Dataset State\n\n**Important:** Dataset selection is module-level state that persists across function calls.\n\n```python\nset_dataset(\"mimic-iv\")\ndf1 = execute_query(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM hosp_patients\")  # Uses mimic-iv\n\nset_dataset(\"eicu\")\ndf2 = execute_query(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM patient\")        # Uses eicu\n```\n\n## MCP Tool Equivalence\n\nThe Python API mirrors MCP tools but with better return types:\n\n| MCP Tool | Python Function | MCP Returns | Python Returns |\n|----------|-----------------|-------------|----------------|\n| `execute_query` | `execute_query()` | Formatted string | `pd.DataFrame` |\n| `get_database_schema` | `get_schema()` | Formatted string | `dict` with `tables` list |\n| `get_table_info` | `get_table_info()` | Formatted string | `dict` with `schema`/`sample` DataFrames |\n\nUse the Python API when you need to:\n- Chain queries in analysis pipelines\n- Perform pandas operations on results\n- Avoid parsing formatted output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:09:39.936Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Clinical Analysis Agents needing advanced programmatic access to clinical datasets via Python DataFrames and dictionaries.","zh":"适合于需要通过Python数据框和字典高级程序化访问临床数据集的临床分析代理。","ja":"Python DataFrameおよび辞書を介した臨床データセットへのプログラムによるアクセスが必要な臨床分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"파이썬 데이터 프레임 및 사전을 통해 임상 데이터 세트에 고급 프로그래밍 방식으로 액세스해야 하는 임상 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis clínico que necesitan acceso programático avanzado a conjuntos de datos clínicos a través de DataFrames y diccionarios de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse clinique nécessitant un accès programmatique avancé aux ensembles de données cliniques via des DataFrames et des dictionnaires Python.","de":"Perfekt für klinische Analyseagenten, die einen erweiterten programmaticchen Zugriff auf klinische Datensätze über Python-DataFrames und Dictionary benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Clínica que necessitam de acesso programático avançado a conjuntos de dados clínicos via DataFrames e dicionários Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов клинического анализа, которым требуется продвинутый программный доступ к клиническим наборам данных через фреймы данных Python и словари.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل السريرية الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول البرمجي المتقدم إلى مجموعات بيانات سريرية من خلال إطارات بيانات بايثون والقواميس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform complex clinical analyses using native Python types, enabling multi-step analyses, joins across queries, and statistical computations with large result sets via the M4 Python API.","zh":"赋予代理执行复杂的临床分析的能力，使用原生Python类型，实现多步骤分析、查询之间的连接以及通过M4 Python API处理大型结果集的统计计算。","ja":"エージェントがネイティブPythonタイプを使用して複雑な臨床分析を実行できるようにし、複数ステップの分析、クエリ間の結合、およびM4 Python APIを介した大規模な結果セットの統計計算を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 파이썬 유형을 사용하여 복잡한 임상 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하여 다단계 분석, 쿼리 간 조인 및 M4 파이썬 API를 통해 대규모 결과 집합의 통계 계산을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis clínicos complejos utilizando tipos nativos de Python, lo que permite análisis multietapa, combinaciones entre consultas y cálculos estadísticos con grandes conjuntos de resultados a través de la API de Python M4.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des analyses cliniques complexes en utilisant des types natifs Python, ce qui permet des analyses mult étapes, des joints entre requêtes et des calculs statistiques avec de grands ensembles de résultats via l''API Python M4.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe klinische Analysen mit nativen Python-Typen durchzuführen, wodurch Mehrschrittanalysen, Joins über Abfragen und statistische Berechnungen mit großen Ergebnismengen über die M4-Python-API ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análises clínicas complexas usando tipos nativos Python, permitindo análises multi-etapa, junções em consultas e computações estatísticas com conjuntos de resultados grandes via a API Python M4.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять сложные клинические анализы с использованием родных типов Python, что позволяет осуществлять многоступенчатые анализы, соединения между запросами и статистические вычисления с большими наборами результатов через API Python M4.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أداء تحليلات سريرية معقدة باستخدام أنواع بايثون الأصلية، مما يسمح بالتحليلات متعددة المراحل والانضمام عبر الاستفسارات والحسابات الإحصائية مع مجموعات نتائج كبيرة من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات بايثون M4."},"useCases":{"en":["Performing complex clinical analyses with intermediate results","Handling large result sets with thousands of rows","Executing code with joins across queries and statistical computations"],"zh":["执行具有中间结果的复杂临床分析","处理具有数千行的large结果集","执行具有查询间连接和统计计算的代码"],"ja":["中間結果を伴う複雑な臨床分析の実行","数千行を伴う大規模な結果セットの処理","クエリ間の結合および統計計算を伴うコードの実行"],"ko":["중간 결과를 사용하는 복잡한 임상 분석 수행","수천 개의 행을 포함하는 대규모 결과 집합 처리","쿼리 간 조인 및 통계 계산을 포함하는 코드 실행"],"es":["Realizar análisis clínicos complejos con resultados intermedios","Manipular grandes conjuntos de resultados con miles de filas","Ejecutar código con combinaciones entre consultas y cálculos estadísticos"],"fr":["Effectuer des analyses cliniques complexes avec des résultats intermédiaires","Gérer de grands ensembles de résultats avec des milliers de lignes","Exécuter du code avec des joints entre requêtes et des calculs statistiques"],"de":["Durchführen komplexer klinischer Analysen mit Zwischenergebnissen","Bearbeiten großer Ergebnismengen mit Tausenden von Zeilen","Ausführen von Code mit Joins über Abfragen und statistischen Berechnungen"],"pt":["Realizar análises clínicas complexas com resultados intermediários","Lidar com conjuntos de resultados grandes com milhares de linhas","Executar código com junções em consultas e computações estatísticas"],"ru":["Выполнять сложные клинические анализы с промежуточными результатами","Обрабатывать большие наборы результатов с тысячами строк","Выполнять код с соединениями между запросами и статистическими вычислениями"],"ar":["أداء تحليلات سريرية معقدة مع نتائج وسيطة","تعامل مع مجموعات نتائج كبيرة مع آلاف السطور","تنفيذ التعليمات البرمجية مع الانضمام عبر الاستفسارات والحسابات الإحصائية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires programmatic access to clinical datasets","Limited to Python execution environments","Native Python types only (DataFrames, dicts)"],"zh":["需要对临床数据集进行程序化访问","仅限Python执行环境","仅限原生Python类型（数据框、字典）"],"ja":["臨床データセットへのプログラムによるアクセスが必要","Python実行環境のみ","ネイティブPythonタイプのみ（データフレーム、辞書）"],"ko":["임상 데이터 세트에 대한 프로그래밍 방식 액세스가 필요","파이썬 실행 환경만","네이티브 파이썬 유형만 (데이터 프레임, 사전)"],"es":["Requiere acceso programático a conjuntos de datos clínicos","Limitado a entornos de ejecución de Python","Solo tipos nativos de Python (DataFrames, diccionarios)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès programmatique aux ensembles de données cliniques","Limité aux environnements d''exécution Python","Uniquement des types natifs Python (DataFrames, dictionnaires)"],"de":["Benötigt programmaticchen Zugriff auf klinische Datensätze","Begrenzt auf Python-Ausführungsumgebungen","Nur native Python-Typen (DataFrames, Dictionary)"],"pt":["Requer acesso programático a conjuntos de dados clínicos","Limitado a ambientes de execução Python","Apenas tipos Python nativos (DataFrames, dicionários)"],"ru":["Требует программного доступа к клиническим наборам данных","Ограничен средами выполнения Python","Только родные типы Python (фреймы данных, словари)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول البرمجي إلى مجموعات بيانات سريرية","محدود بالبيئات التنفيذية لبايثون","فقط أنواع بايثون الأصلية (إطارات البيانات والقواميس)"]},"version":3