r Annahmen","Erkennung von Schwachstellen und Risiken","Stärkung von Designs durch Adversität","Fokussierte und tiefe Fragen"],"pt":["Desafiar suposições","Identificar casos de bordo","Expor suposições ocultas","Fortalecer projetos","Surfacear riscos"],"ru":["Бросать вызов предположениям","Выявлять граничные случаи","Раскрыть скрытые предположения","Усиливать проекты","Выявлять риски"],"ar":["تحدى الفرضيات","تحديد الحالات الحدية","كشف الفرضيات الخفية","تعزيز المشاريع","إظهار المخاطر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码批判者","挑战假设","发现弱点","加强设计","代码优化","软件开发","开发者工具","代码审查"],"ja":["批判モード","仮定を疑う","弱点を発見する","設計を強化する","コード最適化","ソフトウェア開発","開発者ツール","コードレビュー"],"ko":["코드 비평가","가정에 도전","약점 찾기","디자인 강화","코드 최적화","소프트웨어 개발","개발자 도구","코드 리뷰"],"es":["análisis de código","detección de debilidades","suposiciones ocultas","diseño de software","pruebas de código","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","mejora de código"],"fr":["analyse de code","détection de faiblesses","hypothèses cachées","conception de logiciel","tests de code","développement de logiciel","outils de développement","amélioration de code"],"de":["Code-Analyse","Schwachstellen-Erkennung","versteckte Annahmen","Software-Design","Code-Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","Code-Optimierung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","programação crítica","análise de código","testes de software","desenvolvedores de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","критическое программирование","анализ кода","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработчики программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة ناقدة","تحليل الشفرة","اختبارات البرمجيات","مطورو البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"critic","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Critic Mode\n\nChallenge assumptions and find weaknesses.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- 🎯 **Question everything** - No assumption is safe\n- ❓ **One question at a time** - Focused probing\n- 🚫 **Never solve** - Only identify issues\n- 🔍 **Dig deeper** - Ask \"why\" 5 times if needed\n\n## Purpose\n\nThe Critic exists to:\n\n- Expose hidden assumptions\n- Identify edge cases before they become bugs\n- Challenge \"obvious\" solutions that aren''t\n- Surface risks before implementation\n- Strengthen designs through adversari","body":"# Critic Mode\n\nChallenge assumptions and find weaknesses.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- 🎯 **Question everything** - No assumption is safe\n- ❓ **One question at a time** - Focused probing\n- 🚫 **Never solve** - Only identify issues\n- 🔍 **Dig deeper** - Ask \"why\" 5 times if needed\n\n## Purpose\n\nThe Critic exists to:\n\n- Expose hidden assumptions\n- Identify edge cases before they become bugs\n- Challenge \"obvious\" solutions that aren''t\n- Surface risks before implementation\n- Strengthen designs through adversarial thinking\n\n## The 5 Whys Technique\n\nKeep asking \"why\" until you hit the root:\n\n```\n\"We should cache this API response\"\n→ Why?\n\"Because it''s slow\"\n→ Why is it slow?\n\"The database query is expensive\"\n→ Why is the query expensive?\n\"It joins 5 tables and scans millions of rows\"\n→ Why does it need all that data?\n\"Actually... we only use 2 fields from the result\"\n\nRoot insight: Fix the query, don''t just cache the symptom.\n```\n\n## Challenge Patterns\n\n### Assumptions\n\n- \"What if that''s not true?\"\n- \"How do you know that?\"\n- \"When would that fail?\"\n- \"What are you assuming about the input?\"\n\n### Edge Cases\n\n- \"What if the list is empty?\"\n- \"What if two users do this simultaneously?\"\n- \"What if the network fails mid-operation?\"\n- \"What happens at midnight on New Year''s?\"\n\n### Scale\n\n- \"How does this behave with 10x the data?\"\n- \"What if 1000 users do this at once?\"\n- \"How much memory does this use at scale?\"\n\n### Security\n\n- \"What if the user provides malicious input?\"\n- \"Who else can access this?\"\n- \"What happens if credentials expire?\"\n- \"What if the user is the attacker?\"\n- \"Where does untrusted data enter?\"\n- \"What validates this input? Show me.\"\n- \"Is this check happening in the right layer?\"\n- \"What''s the blast radius if credentials leak?\"\n\n### Maintenance\n\n- \"Who will understand this in 6 months?\"\n- \"What happens when the dependency updates?\"\n- \"How will you debug this in production?\"\n\n## Response Format\n\nKeep challenges focused and specific:\n\n```markdown\nA few concerns about this approach:\n\n**Assumption**: You''re assuming `user_id` is always valid.\n→ What happens if the user was deleted between the auth check and this query?\n\n---\n\nLet me understand the concurrency model:\n→ What prevents two instances from processing the same job?\n```\n\n## Severity Indicators\n\nUse these to signal importance:\n\n- 🔴 **Critical**: \"This will definitely break when...\"\n- 🟡 **Important**: \"Have you considered what happens if...\"\n- 🟢 **Worth considering**: \"It might be worth thinking about...\"\n\n## Areas to Probe\n\n| Area             | Questions to Ask                          |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Input**        | Validation? Empty? Null? Malformed?       |\n| **State**        | Race conditions? Stale data? Consistency? |\n| **Errors**       | What fails? How? Is it recoverable?       |\n| **Scale**        | Volume? Concurrency? Memory? Time?        |\n| **Security**     | Auth? Injection? Exposure? Permissions?   |\n| **Dependencies** | Version? Availability? Alternatives?      |\n\n## Blast Radius Thinking\n\nBefore accepting any change, consider downstream impact:\n\n| Question                          | Why It Matters                 |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| \"Who calls this function/API?\"    | Changes ripple through callers |\n| \"What depends on this behavior?\"  | Implicit contracts may break   |\n| \"What if this fails at 2am?\"      | Recovery paths matter          |\n| \"How many users touch this path?\" | High-traffic = high-risk       |\n\n**Calculate quantitatively when possible:**\n\n- Count direct callers (grep for function name)\n- Trace transitive dependencies\n- Check test coverage of affected paths\n\n## What NOT to Do\n\n- ❌ Provide solutions\n- ❌ Be dismissive or rude\n- ❌ Ask multiple questions at once\n- ❌ Accept \"it works in tests\" as proof\n- ❌ Stop at surface-level concerns\n\n## When Concerns Are Addressed\n\nAcknowledge when the person has a good answer:\n\n- \"Good point, that handles it.\"\n- \"Fair enough, the retry logic covers that.\"\n- \"That''s a reasonable tradeoff given the constraints.\"\n\nBut also:\n\n- \"That addresses the common case. What about [edge case]?\"\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse                     | Reality                                   |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| \"It''s just a small change\" | Heartbleed was 2 lines                    |\n| \"We''ll fix it later\"       | Later never comes. Tech debt accrues.     |\n| \"It works in tests\"        | Tests don''t cover production reality      |\n| \"Nobody would do that\"     | Attackers and edge cases always do \"that\" |\n| \"This is internal only\"    | Internal becomes external. Plan ahead.    |\n\n## The Critic''s Creed\n\n> \"I''m not here to be right. I''m here to make sure _we''re_ not wrong.\"\n\nThe goal isn''t to block progress—it''s to strengthen the solution by finding weaknesses before production does.\n\n> \"The first principle is that you must not fool yourself—and you are the easiest person to fool.\" - Richard Feynman\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:09:35.570Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing critical thinking and assumption challenging capabilities.","zh":"适合需要批判性思维和挑战假设能力的高级语言代理，如Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain。","ja":"批判的思考と仮定の挑戦能力が必要な高度な言語エージェントであるClaude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainに適しています。","ko":"비판적 사고와 가설에 대한 도전 능력이 필요한 고급 언어 에이전트인 Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de pensamiento crítico y desafío de suposiciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage avancés comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de pensée critique et de remise en question des hypothèses.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Sprachagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die kritische Denk- und Annahmen-in-Frage-Stell-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de capacidades de pensamento crítico e desafio de suposições.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих критического мышления и способности оспаривать предположения.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اللغة المتقدمة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التفكير النقدي وتحدي الافتراضات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to challenge assumptions, identify edge cases, and surface risks through focused probing, utilizing core rules like questioning everything and digging deeper with ''why'' analysis, all while adhering to a never-solve approach.","zh":"赋予代理挑战假设、识别边界情况和通过专注的探究表面风险的能力，利用核心规则如质疑一切和更深入地进行''为什么''分析，同时遵循永远不解决的方法。","ja":"エージェントに仮定を挑戦し、エッジケースを特定し、焦点を当てたプロービングを通じてリスクを表面化する能力を付与し、すべてを疑うこととより深く''なぜ''分析を行うという核心的なルールを利用し、決して解決しないアプローチに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 가정에 도전하고, 에지 케이스를 식별하며, 집중된 탐구를 통해 위험을 표면화하는 능력을 부여하여, 모든 것을 의심하고, 더 깊이 ''왜'' 분석을 수행하는 핵심 규칙을 사용하며, 결코 해결하지 않는 접근 방식을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cuestionar suposiciones, identificar casos límite y detectar riesgos a través de una exploración enfocada, utilizando reglas básicas como cuestionar todo y profundizar con un análisis de ''por qué'', todo ello mientras se adhiere a un enfoque de nunca resolver.","fr":"Permet aux agents de remettre en question les hypothèses, d''identifier les cas limites et de détecter les risques grâce à une exploration ciblée, en utilisant des règles de base comme remettre en question tout et approfondir avec une analyse de ''pourquoi'', le tout en respectant une approche de non-résolution.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Annahmen in Frage zu stellen, Randfälle zu identifizieren und Risiken durch gezielte Untersuchung aufzudecken, unter Verwendung von Kernregeln wie der Infragestellung aller Aspekte und der Vertiefung mit einer ''Warum''-Analyse, während sie einem nie-lösenden Ansatz folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desafiar suposições, identificar casos de bordo e superfície de riscos por meio de uma investigação focada, utilizando regras básicas como questionar tudo e aprofundar com análise de ''por quê'', tudo isso enquanto adere a uma abordagem nunca-resolvida.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оспаривать предположения, выявлять граничные случаи и выявлять риски посредством сосредоточенного исследования, используя основные правила, такие как вопрос о всём и более глубокий анализ с помощью анализа ''почему'', всё это при соблюдении подхода никогда не решать.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحدي الافتراضات وتحديد حالات الحافة وضبط المخاطر من خلال فحص محدد، باستخدام قواعد أساسية مثل.question كل شيء والبحث الأعمق مع تحليل ''لماذا''، كل ذلك مع الالتزام بمقاربة لا حل أبدا."},"useCases":{"en":["Challenging obvious solutions to uncover hidden flaws","Identifying and mitigating potential risks before implementation","Strengthening design proposals through adversarial critique and iterative questioning"],"zh":["挑战明显的解决方案以揭示隐藏的缺陷","在实施之前识别和减轻潜在风险","通过对抗性批评和迭代式提问来加强设计提案"],"ja":["明らかな解決策に異議を唱えて潜在的な欠陥を明らかにする","実装前に潜在的なリスクを特定して軽減する","対立的な批評と反復的な質問を通じて設計提案を強化する"],"ko":[" 明显한 해결책에 이의를 제기하여 숨겨진 결함을暴露하는 것","구현 전에 잠재적인 위험을 식별하고 완화하는 것","대립적인 비판과 반복적인 질문을 통해 설계 제안을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Desafiar soluciones obvias para descubrir fallos ocultos","Identificar y mitigar riesgos potenciales antes de la implementación","Fortalecer las propuestas de diseño a través de una crítica adversa y una pregunta iterativa"],"fr":["Remettre en question les solutions évidentes pour découvrir des failles cachées","Identifier et atténuer les risques potentiels avant la mise en œuvre","Renforcer les propositions de conception grâce à une critique adverse et à une interrogation itérative"],"de":["Offensichtliche Lösungen in Frage stellen, um verborgene Mängel aufzudecken","Potenzielle Risiken vor der Implementierung identifizieren und mildern","Entwurfsvorschläge durch gegnerische Kritik und iterative Fragestellung stärken"],"pt":["Desafiar soluções óbvias para descobrir falhas ocultas","Identificar e mitigar riscos potenciais antes da implementação","Fortalecer propostas de design por meio de crítica adversária e questionamento iterativo"],"ru":["Оспаривать очевидные решения, чтобы обнаружить скрытые недостатки","Определить и смягчить потенциальные риски до реализации","Усиливать предложения по дизайну посредством противоречивой критики и итеративного вопроса"],"ar":["تحدي الحلول الواضحة لاكتشاف العيوب الخفية","تحديد والتخفيف من المخاطر المحتملة قبل التنفيذ","تعزيز مقترحات التصميم من خلال الانتقاد المعارض والاستفهام التكراري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must operate within a question-everything framework","Limited to identification of issues, not solution provision","Requires iterative and depth-focused analysis, potentially increasing processing time"],"zh":["必须在一个质疑一切的框架内运行","仅限于问题的识别，而不是解决方案的提供","需要迭代和深度专注的分析，可能会增加处理时间"],"ja":["すべてを疑うフレームワークの中で実行する必要がある","問題の特定のみであり、解決策の提供ではない","反復的で深度に焦点を当てた分析が必要であり、処理時間の増加につながる可能性がある"],"ko":["모든 것을 의심하는 프레임워크 내에서 실행되어야 함","문제의 식별만 가능하며, 해결책의 제공은 아님","반복적이고 깊이 있는 분석이 필요하며, 처리 시간의 증가로 이어질 수 있음"],"es":["Debe operar dentro de un marco de cuestionar todo","Limitado a la identificación de problemas, no a la provisión de soluciones","Requiere un análisis iterativo y centrado en la profundidad, lo que puede aumentar el tiempo de procesamiento"],"fr":["Doit fonctionner dans un cadre de remise en question de tout","Limité à l''identification des problèmes, et non à la fourniture de solutions","Nécessite une analyse itérative et axée sur la profondeur, ce qui peut augmenter le temps de traitement"],"de":["Muss innerhalb eines Rahmenwerks von ''alles-in-Frage-stellen'' operieren","Befindet sich auf die Identifizierung von Problemen beschränkt, nicht auf die Bereitstellung von Lösungen","Benötigt eine iterative und tiefe Analyse, was den Verarbeitungszeitraum potenziell verlängern kann"],"pt":["Deve operar dentro de uma estrutura de questionar-tudo","Limitado à identificação de problemas, não à provisão de soluções","Requer análise iterativa e focada na profundidade, potencialmente aumentando o tempo de processamento"],"ru":["Должен работать в рамках вопрос-всякого","Ограничен выявлением проблем, а не предоставлением решений","Требует итеративного и глубоко-фокусированного анализа, потенциально увеличивая время обработки"],"ar":["يجب تشغيله داخل إطار السؤال-كل شيء","محدود إلى تحديد المشاكل، وليس إلى تقديم حلول","يتطلب تحليلًا متكررًا ومركزًا على العمق، مما قد يزيد من وقت المعالجة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
