s 도구 사용","다양한 파일 형식 지원"],"es":["Evaluación de la distribución del tamaño de fragmentos","Cálculo de la puntuación de enriquecimiento de TSS","Uso de herramientas como Picard y samtools","Análisis de la calidad de los datos de secuenciación","Identificación de posibles problemas de calidad"],"fr":["Évaluation de la distribution de la taille des fragments","Calcul du score d''enrichissement de TSS","Utilisation d''outils comme Picard et samtools","Analyse de la qualité des données de séquençage","Identification de problèmes de qualité potentiels"],"de":["Bewertung der Verteilung der Fragmentgröße","Berechnung des TSS-Anreicherungsscores","Verwendung von Tools wie Picard und samtools","Analyse der Qualität der Sequenzierungsdaten","Identifizierung von möglichen Qualitätsproblemen"],"pt":["Análise de tamanho de fragmento","Pontuação de enriquecimento TSS","Uso de ferramentas como Picard e samtools","Garantia de precisão dos resultados","Análise de dados de sequenciamento"],"ru":["Анализ размера фрагментов","Оценка обогащения TSS","Использование инструментов, таких как Picard и samtools","Гарантия точности результатов","Анализ данных секвенирования"],"ar":["تحليل حجم القطع","درجة التخصيب TSS","استخدام أدوات مثل Picard و samtools","ضمان دقة النتائج","تحليل بيانات التتابع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ATAC-seq","质量控制","片段大小分布","TSS丰富度评分","bio-atac-seq-atac-qc","Picard","samtools"],"ja":["ATAC-seq","品質管理","フラグメントサイズの分布","TSSの豊富度スコア","bio-atac-seq-atac-qc","Picard","samtools"],"ko":["ATAC-seq","품질 관리","단편 크기 분포","TSS 풍부도 점수","bio-atac-seq-atac-qc","Picard","samtools"],"es":["control de calidad ATAC-seq","secuenciación ATAC-seq","análisis de datos de secuenciación","herramientas de bioinformática","Picard","samtools","TSS","enriquecimiento de TSS"],"fr":["contrôle de qualité ATAC-seq","séquençage ATAC-seq","analyse de données de séquençage","outils de bioinformatique","Picard","samtools","TSS","enrichissement de TSS"],"de":["Qualitätskontrolle ATAC-seq","ATAC-seq-Sequenzierung","Analyse von Sequenzierungsdaten","Bioinformatik-Tools","Picard","samtools","TSS","TSS-Anreicherung"],"pt":["controle de qualidade ATAC-seq","análise de tamanho de fragmento","pontuação de enriquecimento TSS","Picard","samtools","sequenciamento","biologia computacional"],"ru":["контроль качества ATAC-seq","анализ размера фрагментов","оценка обогащения TSS","Picard","samtools","секвенирование","компьютерная биология"],"ar":["مراقبة الجودة ATAC-seq","تحليل حجم القطع","درجة التخصيب TSS","Picard","samtools","التتابع","علم الأحياء الحاسوبي"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bio-atac-seq-atac-qc","description":"Quality control metrics for ATAC-seq data including fragment size distribution, TSS enrichment, FRiP, and library complexity. Use when assessing ATAC-seq library quality before or after peak calling to identify problematic samples.","bodyPreview":"# ATAC-seq Quality Control\n\n## Fragment Size Distribution\n\n```bash\n# Using Picard\njava -jar picard.jar CollectInsertSizeMetrics \\\n    I=sample.bam \\\n    O=insert_sizes.txt \\\n    H=insert_sizes.pdf \\\n    M=0.5\n\n# Using samtools\nsamtools view -f 66 sample.bam | \\\n    awk ''{print sqrt($9^2)}'' | \\\n    sort | uniq -c | \\\n    awk ''{print $2\"\\t\"$1}'' > fragment_sizes.txt\n```\n\n## TSS Enrichment Score\n\n```bash\n# Using deepTools\n# 1. Create TSS BED file (from GTF)\nawk ''$3==\"transcript\" {print $1\"\\t\"$4-1\"\\t","body":"# ATAC-seq Quality Control\n\n## Fragment Size Distribution\n\n```bash\n# Using Picard\njava -jar picard.jar CollectInsertSizeMetrics \\\n    I=sample.bam \\\n    O=insert_sizes.txt \\\n    H=insert_sizes.pdf \\\n    M=0.5\n\n# Using samtools\nsamtools view -f 66 sample.bam | \\\n    awk ''{print sqrt($9^2)}'' | \\\n    sort | uniq -c | \\\n    awk ''{print $2\"\\t\"$1}'' > fragment_sizes.txt\n```\n\n## TSS Enrichment Score\n\n```bash\n# Using deepTools\n# 1. Create TSS BED file (from GTF)\nawk ''$3==\"transcript\" {print $1\"\\t\"$4-1\"\\t\"$4\"\\t\"$14\"\\t\"0\"\\t\"$7}'' genes.gtf | \\\n    tr -d ''\";'' | sort -k1,1 -k2,2n > tss.bed\n\n# 2. Compute matrix around TSS\ncomputeMatrix reference-point \\\n    -S sample.bw \\\n    -R tss.bed \\\n    -a 2000 -b 2000 \\\n    -o tss_matrix.gz\n\n# 3. Plot TSS enrichment\nplotProfile -m tss_matrix.gz \\\n    -o tss_enrichment.png \\\n    --perGroup\n```\n\n## Calculate TSS Enrichment Score\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport pyBigWig\n\ndef calculate_tss_enrichment(bigwig_file, tss_bed, flank=2000):\n    ''''''Calculate TSS enrichment score.''''''\n    bw = pyBigWig.open(bigwig_file)\n\n    signals = []\n    for line in open(tss_bed):\n        fields = line.strip().split(''\\t'')\n        chrom, tss = fields[0], int(fields[1])\n        strand = fields[5] if len(fields) > 5 else ''+''\n\n        try:\n            vals = bw.values(chrom, max(0, tss - flank), tss + flank)\n            if strand == ''-'':\n                vals = vals[::-1]\n            signals.append(vals)\n        except:\n            continue\n\n    avg_signal = np.nanmean(signals, axis=0)\n\n    # TSS enrichment = signal at TSS / background\n    background = np.nanmean([avg_signal[:100], avg_signal[-100:]])\n    tss_signal = np.nanmean(avg_signal[flank-50:flank+50])\n\n    enrichment = tss_signal / background if background > 0 else 0\n\n    return enrichment, avg_signal\n\nenrichment, signal = calculate_tss_enrichment(''sample.bw'', ''tss.bed'')\nprint(f''TSS Enrichment Score: {enrichment:.2f}'')\n```\n\n## FRiP (Fraction of Reads in Peaks)\n\n```bash\n# Total reads\ntotal=$(samtools view -c -F 4 sample.bam)\n\n# Reads in peaks\nin_peaks=$(bedtools intersect -a sample.bam -b peaks.narrowPeak -u | \\\n    samtools view -c)\n\n# FRiP\nfrip=$(echo \"scale=4; $in_peaks / $total\" | bc)\necho \"FRiP: $frip\"\n\n# Good FRiP for ATAC-seq: >0.2 (20%)\n```\n\n## Mitochondrial Read Fraction\n\n```bash\n# Mitochondrial reads\nmt_reads=$(samtools view -c sample.bam chrM)\ntotal_reads=$(samtools view -c sample.bam)\n\nmt_frac=$(echo \"scale=4; $mt_reads / $total_reads\" | bc)\necho \"Mitochondrial fraction: $mt_frac\"\n\n# Ideal: <20%, concerning: >50%\n```\n\n## Library Complexity (NRF, PBC1, PBC2)\n\n```bash\n# Using Picard EstimateLibraryComplexity\njava -jar picard.jar EstimateLibraryComplexity \\\n    I=sample.bam \\\n    O=complexity.txt\n\n# Or calculate from BAM\n# NRF = unique reads / total reads\n# PBC1 = locations with exactly 1 read / locations with >= 1 read\n# PBC2 = locations with exactly 1 read / locations with exactly 2 reads\n```\n\n```python\nimport pysam\n\ndef calculate_complexity(bam_file):\n    ''''''Calculate library complexity metrics.''''''\n    bam = pysam.AlignmentFile(bam_file, ''rb'')\n\n    positions = {}\n    total = 0\n    for read in bam.fetch():\n        if read.is_unmapped or read.is_secondary:\n            continue\n        total += 1\n        pos = (read.reference_name, read.reference_start)\n        positions[pos] = positions.get(pos, 0) + 1\n\n    distinct = len(positions)\n    m1 = sum(1 for v in positions.values() if v == 1)\n    m2 = sum(1 for v in positions.values() if v == 2)\n\n    nrf = distinct / total if total > 0 else 0\n    pbc1 = m1 / distinct if distinct > 0 else 0\n    pbc2 = m1 / m2 if m2 > 0 else 0\n\n    return {''NRF'': nrf, ''PBC1'': pbc1, ''PBC2'': pbc2}\n```\n\n## deepTools QC\n\n```bash\n# Fingerprint plot (assesses enrichment)\nplotFingerprint \\\n    -b sample.bam \\\n    --labels sample \\\n    -o fingerprint.png\n\n# Correlation between replicates\nmultiBamSummary bins \\\n    -b sample1.bam sample2.bam \\\n    -o results.npz\n\nplotCorrelation \\\n    -in results.npz \\\n    --corMethod pearson \\\n    --whatToPlot heatmap \\\n    -o correlation.png\n```\n\n## ATACseqQC (R)\n\n```r\nlibrary(ATACseqQC)\nlibrary(TxDb.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.knownGene)\n\n# Read BAM\nbamfile <- ''sample.bam''\n\n# Fragment size distribution\nfragSizeDist(bamfile, ''fragment_size.pdf'')\n\n# TSS enrichment\ntsse <- TSSEscore(bamfile, TxDb.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.knownGene)\nprint(paste(''TSS Enrichment:'', round(tsse$TSSEscore, 2)))\n\n# Nucleosome positioning\nnucs <- nucleosomePositioningScore(bamfile, TxDb.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.knownGene)\n```\n\n## Comprehensive QC Report\n\n```python\nimport subprocess\nimport pandas as pd\n\ndef atac_qc_report(bam_file, peaks_file, output_prefix):\n    ''''''Generate comprehensive ATAC-seq QC report.''''''\n    metrics = {}\n\n    # Total reads\n    result = subprocess.check_output(f''samtools view -c -F 4 {bam_file}'', shell=True)\n    metrics[''total_reads''] = int(result.strip())\n\n    # Mapped reads\n    result = subprocess.check_output(f''samtools view -c -F 4 -F 256 {bam_file}'', shell=True)\n    metrics[''mapped_reads''] = int(result.strip())\n\n    # Mitochondrial reads\n    result = subprocess.check_output(f''samtools view -c {bam_file} chrM'', shell=True)\n    metrics[''mt_reads''] = int(result.strip())\n    metrics[''mt_fraction''] = metrics[''mt_reads''] / metrics[''total_reads'']\n\n    # Reads in peaks (FRiP)\n    result = subprocess.check_output(\n        f''bedtools intersect -a {bam_file} -b {peaks_file} -u | samtools view -c'', shell=True)\n    metrics[''reads_in_peaks''] = int(result.strip())\n    metrics[''frip''] = metrics[''reads_in_peaks''] / metrics[''total_reads'']\n\n    # Peak count\n    result = subprocess.check_output(f''wc -l < {peaks_file}'', shell=True)\n    metrics[''peak_count''] = int(result.strip())\n\n    # Write report\n    with open(f''{output_prefix}_qc.txt'', ''w'') as f:\n        for k, v in metrics.items():\n            if isinstance(v, float):\n                f.write(f''{k}: {v:.4f}\\n'')\n            else:\n                f.write(f''{k}: {v}\\n'')\n\n    return metrics\n```\n\n## QC Thresholds\n\n| Metric | Good | Acceptable | Poor |\n|--------|------|------------|------|\n| TSS Enrichment | >10 | 5-10 | <5 |\n| FRiP | >0.3 | 0.1-0.3 | <0.1 |\n| MT Fraction | <0.1 | 0.1-0.3 | >0.3 |\n| NRF | >0.9 | 0.8-0.9 | <0.8 |\n| PBC1 | >0.9 | 0.7-0.9 | <0.7 |\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- atac-seq/atac-peak-calling - Peak calling\n- alignment-files/bam-statistics - Alignment QC\n- chip-seq/chipseq-visualization - Visualization approaches\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:09:45.786Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Bioinformatics Agents needing advanced ATAC-seq quality control and analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级ATAC-seq质量控制和分析能力的生物信息学代理。","ja":"ATAC-seqの高度な品質管理と分析機能を必要とするバイオインフォマティクスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 ATAC-seq 품질 관리 및 분석 기능이 필요한 생명 정보학 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bioinformática que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de control y análisis de calidad de ATAC-seq.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de bioinformatique ayant besoin de capacités avancées de contrôle et d''analyse de la qualité de ATAC-seq.","de":"Perfekt für Bioinformatik-Agenten, die erweiterte ATAC-seq-Qualitätskontroll- und Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de bioinformática que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de controle e análise de qualidade ATAC-seq.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов биоинформатики, которым требуются передовые возможности контроля и анализа качества ATAC-seq.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات البيوانيات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمراقبة جودة وتحليل ATAC-seq."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform fragment size distribution analysis using Picard and samtools, and calculate TSS enrichment scores with deepTools, enabling comprehensive assessment of ATAC-seq data quality and genomic feature enrichment.","zh":"赋予代理使用Picard和samtools执行片段大小分布分析的能力，并使用deepTools计算TSS丰富度评分，从而实现对ATAC-seq数据质量和基因组特征丰富度的全面评估。","ja":"Picardとsamtoolsを使用してフラグメントサイズ分布分析を実行し、deepToolsを使用してTSSエンリッチメントスコアを計算することで、ATAC-seqデータの品質とゲノム特性のエンリッチメントを包括的に評価する能力をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"Picard와 samtools를 사용하여 조각 크기 분포 분석을 수행하고, deepTools를 사용하여 TSS 풍부도 점수를 계산하여 ATAC-seq 데이터 품질 및 유전체 특징 풍부도를 종합적으로 평가할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis de distribución de tamaño de fragmentos utilizando Picard y samtools, y calcular puntuaciones de enriquecimiento de TSS con deepTools, lo que permite una evaluación integral de la calidad de los datos de ATAC-seq y el enriquecimiento de características genómicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une analyse de distribution de taille de fragment en utilisant Picard et samtools, et de calculer des scores d''enrichissement de TSS avec deepTools, permettant ainsi une évaluation complète de la qualité des données de ATAC-seq et de l''enrichissement des caractéristiques génomiques.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Fragment-Größenverteilungsanalysen mit Picard und samtools durchzuführen und TSS-Anreicherungspunkte mit deepTools zu berechnen, wodurch eine umfassende Bewertung der ATAC-seq-Datenqualität und der genetischen Merkmalanreicherung ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análise de distribuição de tamanho de fragmentos usando Picard e samtools, e calcular escores de enriquecimento de TSS com deepTools, permitindo uma avaliação abrangente da qualidade dos dados ATAC-seq e do enriquecimento de recursos genômicos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять анализ распределения размеров фрагментов с помощью Picard и samtools, и рассчитывать показатели обогащения TSS с помощью deepTools, что обеспечивает всестороннюю оценку качества данных ATAC-seq и обогащения геномных признаков.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من أداء تحليل توزيع حجم القطع باستخدام Picard و samtools، و حساب نقاط غنى TSS مع أدوات глубين، مما يتيح تقييمًا شاملاً لجودة بيانات ATAC-seq وتكاثر الميزات الجينومية."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing fragment size distributions to assess ATAC-seq library quality","Calculating TSS enrichment scores to evaluate transcription factor binding site accessibility","Generating insert size metrics and visualizations for ATAC-seq data using Picard and samtools"],"zh":["分析片段大小分布以评估ATAC-seq文库质量","计算TSS丰富度评分以评估转录因子结合位点的可及性","使用Picard和samtools生成ATAC-seq数据的插入大小度量和可视化"],"ja":["ATAC-seqライブラリの品質を評価するためにフラグメントサイズ分布を分析する","転写因子の結合部位の可及性を評価するためにTSSエンリッチメントスコアを計算する","Picardとsamtoolsを使用してATAC-seqデータの挿入サイズメトリックと視覚化を生成する"],"ko":["ATAC-seq 라이브러리 품질을 평가하기 위해 조각 크기 분포를 분석한다","전사 인자의 결합 부위의 접근성을 평가하기 위해 TSS 풍부도 점수를 계산한다","Picard와 samtools를 사용하여 ATAC-seq 데이터의 삽입 크기 측정 및 시각화를 생성한다"],"es":["Analizar distribuciones de tamaño de fragmentos para evaluar la calidad de la biblioteca de ATAC-seq","Calcular puntuaciones de enriquecimiento de TSS para evaluar la accesibilidad de los sitios de unión de factores de transcripción","Generar métricas y visualizaciones de tamaño de inserción para datos de ATAC-seq utilizando Picard y samtools"],"fr":["Analyser les distributions de taille de fragment pour évaluer la qualité de la bibliothèque de ATAC-seq","Calculer des scores d''enrichissement de TSS pour évaluer l''accessibilité des sites de liaison des facteurs de transcription","Générer des métriques et des visualisations de taille d''insertion pour les données de ATAC-seq en utilisant Picard et samtools"],"de":["Analysieren von Fragment-Größenverteilungen, um die Qualität der ATAC-seq-Bibliothek zu bewerten","Berechnen von TSS-Anreicherungspunkten, um die Zugänglichkeit von Transkriptionsfaktor-Bindungsstellen zu bewerten","Erstellen von Insert-Größenmetriken und Visualisierungen für ATAC-seq-Daten mit Picard und samtools"],"pt":["Analisar distribuições de tamanho de fragmentos para avaliar a qualidade da biblioteca ATAC-seq","Calcular escores de enriquecimento de TSS para avaliar a acessibilidade do local de ligação do fator de transcrição","Gerar métricas de tamanho de inserção e visualizações para dados ATAC-seq usando Picard e samtools"],"ru":["Анализировать распределение размеров фрагментов для оценки качества библиотеки ATAC-seq","Рассчитывать показатели обогащения TSS для оценки доступности места связывания фактора транскрипции","Генерировать метрики размера вставки и визуализации для данных ATAC-seq с помощью Picard и samtools"],"ar":["تحليل توزيع حجم القطع لتقييم جودة مكتبة ATAC-seq","حساب نقاط غنى TSS لتقييم إمكانية الوصول إلى موقع ربط عامل النسخ","إنتاج مقاييس حجم الإدراج والتصورات البيانية لبيانات ATAC-seq باستخدام Picard و samtools"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires BAM files as input","Dependent on Picard, samtools, and deepTools libraries","Limited to ATAC-seq data analysis"],"zh":["需要BAM文件作为输入","依赖于Picard、samtools和deepTools库","仅限于ATAC-seq数据分析"],"ja":["入力としてBAMファイルが必要","Picard、samtools、deepToolsライブラリに依存している","ATAC-seqデータ分析のみに限定される"],"ko":["입력으로 BAM 파일이 필요합니다","Picard, samtools, deepTools 라이브러리에 의존합니다","ATAC-seq 데이터 분석에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere archivos BAM como entrada","Dependiente de las bibliotecas Picard, samtools y deepTools","Limitado al análisis de datos de ATAC-seq"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers BAM comme entrée","Dépendant des bibliothèques Picard, samtools et deepTools","Limité à l''analyse de données de ATAC-seq"],"de":["Benötigt BAM-Dateien als Eingabe","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken Picard, samtools und deepTools","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von ATAC-seq-Daten"],"pt":["Requer arquivos BAM como entrada","Dependente das bibliotecas Picard, samtools e deepTools","Limitado à análise de dados ATAC-seq"],"ru":["Требует файлов BAM в качестве входных данных","Зависит от библиотек Picard, samtools и deepTools","Ограничен анализом данных ATAC-seq"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات BAM كمدخلات","يعتمد على المكتبات Picard و samtools و deepTools","محدود بتحليل بيانات ATAC-seq"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
