ja":"Cloudflare, KV, R2","ko":"Cloudflare, KV, R2","es":"Estrategias para escalar arquitecturas de Cloudflare de manera eficiente en términos de costo. Mejora del rendimiento y la escalabilidad","fr":"Stratégies pour mettre à l''échelle les architectures Cloudflare de manière efficace en termes de coût. Amélioration des performances et de la scalabilité","de":"Strategien zum effizienten Skalieren von Cloudflare-Architekturen in Bezug auf Kosten. Verbesserung der Leistung und Skalierbarkeit","pt":"Estratégias de escala para arquiteturas Cloudflare, incluindo soluções para latência de leitura, throughput de gravação e armazenamento. Melhore o desempenho...","ru":"Стратегии масштабирования архитектур Cloudflare, включая решения для задержки чтения, пропускной способности записи и хранения. Улучшите производительность и...","ar":"استراتيجيات التوسع لمعمارية Cloudflare، بما في ذلك حلول للاتصال بذات القراءة والكتابة والتخزين. تحسين الأداء وتقليل التكاليف.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["KV","R2","50ms","Batch ","Key "],"ja":["KV","R2","50ms","Batch ","Key "],"ko":["KV","R2","50ms","Batch ","Key "],"es":["Mejora de la latencia de lectura de D1","Optimización del rendimiento de escritura de D1","Almacenamiento eficiente con R2","Implementación de capas de caché KV","Mejora de la escalabilidad con particionamiento de tablas"],"fr":["Amélioration de la latence de lecture de D1","Optimisation des performances d''écriture de D1","Stockage efficace avec R2","Mise en œuvre de couches de cache KV","Amélioration de la scalabilité avec le partitionnement de tables"],"de":["Verbesserung der Lese-Latenz von D1","Optimierung der Schreibleistung von D1","Effizientes Speichern mit R2","Implementierung von KV-Cache-Schichten","Verbesserung der Skalierbarkeit durch Tabellenpartitionierung"],"pt":["Estratégias de escala para arquiteturas Cloudflare","Soluções para latência de leitura e throughput de gravação","Otimização de armazenamento e redução de custos","Melhoria do desempenho e da eficiência","Integração com KV cache e R2"],"ru":["Стратегии масштабирования архитектур Cloudflare","Решения для задержки чтения и пропускной способности записи","Оптимизация хранения и снижение затрат","Улучшение производительности и эффективности","Интеграция с KV кэшем и R2"],"ar":["استراتيجيات التوسع لمعمارية Cloudflare","حلول للاتصال بذات القراءة والكتابة","تحسين التخزين وتقليل التكاليف","تحسين الأداء والكفاءة","التكامل مع ذاكرة KV و R2"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare","KV","R2","50ms","Batch ","Key ","Cloudflare "],"ja":["Cloudflare","KV","R2","50ms","Batch ","Key ","Cloudflare "],"ko":["Cloudflare","KV","R2","50ms","Batch ","Key ","Cloudflare "],"es":["escalado de Cloudflare","arquitectura de Cloudflare","eficiencia de costo","rendimiento de D1","almacenamiento en R2","caché KV","particionamiento de tablas"],"fr":["mise à l''échelle de Cloudflare","architecture Cloudflare","efficacité coûts","performances de D1","stockage sur R2","cache KV","partitionnement de tables"],"de":["Cloudflare-Skalierung","Cloudflare-Architektur","Kosten-Effizienz","D1-Leistung","Speicherung in R2","KV-Cache","Tabellenpartitionierung"],"pt":["escala cloudflare","arquitetura cloudflare","latência de leitura","throughput de gravação","armazenamento cloudflare","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["масштабирование cloudflare","архитектура cloudflare","задержка чтения","пропускная способность записи","хранение cloudflare","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["توسع cloudflare","معمارية cloudflare","اتصال بذات القراءة","اتصال بذات الكتابة","تخزين cloudflare","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scale","description":"Recommend sharding, caching strategies, and read-replication patterns for Cloudflare architectures. Use this skill when preparing for growth, hitting limits, or optimizing for high traffic.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Scaling Skill\n\nStrategies for scaling Cloudflare architectures beyond default limits while maintaining cost efficiency.\n\n## Scaling Decision Matrix\n\n| Bottleneck | Symptom | Solution |\n|------------|---------|----------|\n| D1 read latency | >50ms queries | Add KV cache layer |\n| D1 write throughput | Queue backlog | Batch writes, add queue buffer |\n| D1 storage | Approaching 10GB | Archive to R2, partition tables |\n| KV read latency | Cache misses | Key prefixing, predictable keys |","body":"# Cloudflare Scaling Skill\n\nStrategies for scaling Cloudflare architectures beyond default limits while maintaining cost efficiency.\n\n## Scaling Decision Matrix\n\n| Bottleneck | Symptom | Solution |\n|------------|---------|----------|\n| D1 read latency | >50ms queries | Add KV cache layer |\n| D1 write throughput | Queue backlog | Batch writes, add queue buffer |\n| D1 storage | Approaching 10GB | Archive to R2, partition tables |\n| KV read latency | Cache misses | Key prefixing, predictable keys |\n| KV write rate | 1 write/sec/key limit | Shard keys, batch writes |\n| R2 throughput | Slow uploads | Presigned URLs, multipart |\n| Worker memory | 128MB limit | Streaming, chunked processing |\n| Worker CPU | 30s timeout | Queues, Workflows, DO |\n| Subrequests | 1000/request limit | Service Bindings RPC |\n| Queue throughput | Consumer lag | Increase concurrency, batch size |\n\n## Caching Strategies\n\n### Cache Hierarchy\n\n```\nRequest → Edge Cache → KV Cache → D1 → Origin\n           (Tiered)    (Global)   (Primary)\n```\n\n### KV Cache Patterns\n\n#### Write-Through Cache\n```typescript\nasync function getWithCache<T>(\n  kv: KVNamespace,\n  db: D1Database,\n  key: string,\n  query: () => Promise<T>,\n  ttl: number = 3600\n): Promise<T> {\n  // Try cache first\n  const cached = await kv.get(key, ''json'');\n  if (cached !== null) {\n    return cached as T;\n  }\n\n  // Cache miss - fetch from D1\n  const fresh = await query();\n\n  // Write to cache (non-blocking)\n  kv.put(key, JSON.stringify(fresh), { expirationTtl: ttl });\n\n  return fresh;\n}\n```\n\n#### Cache Invalidation\n```typescript\n// Pattern 1: TTL-based (simple, eventual consistency)\nawait kv.put(key, value, { expirationTtl: 300 }); // 5 min\n\n// Pattern 2: Version-based (immediate, more complex)\nconst version = await kv.get(''cache:version'');\nconst key = `data:${id}:v${version}`;\n\n// Invalidate by incrementing version\nawait kv.put(''cache:version'', String(Number(version) + 1));\n\n// Pattern 3: Tag-based (flexible, requires cleanup)\nawait kv.put(`user:${userId}:profile`, data);\nawait kv.put(`user:${userId}:settings`, settings);\n\n// Invalidate all user data\nconst keys = await kv.list({ prefix: `user:${userId}:` });\nfor (const key of keys.keys) {\n  await kv.delete(key.name);\n}\n```\n\n### Tiered Cache (Cloudflare CDN)\n\nEnable in Worker for static-like responses:\n```typescript\n// Cache API for fine-grained control\nconst cache = caches.default;\n\napp.get(''/api/products/:id'', async (c) => {\n  const cacheKey = new Request(c.req.url);\n\n  // Check cache\n  const cached = await cache.match(cacheKey);\n  if (cached) {\n    return cached;\n  }\n\n  // Fetch fresh data\n  const product = await getProduct(c.env.DB, c.req.param(''id''));\n\n  const response = c.json(product);\n  response.headers.set(''Cache-Control'', ''s-maxage=300'');\n\n  // Store in cache\n  c.executionCtx.waitUntil(cache.put(cacheKey, response.clone()));\n\n  return response;\n});\n```\n\n## Sharding Strategies\n\n### Key-Based Sharding (KV)\n\nWhen hitting 1 write/sec/key limit:\n\n```typescript\n// Problem: High-frequency counter\nawait kv.put(''page:views'', views); // Limited to 1/sec\n\n// Solution: Shard across multiple keys\nconst SHARD_COUNT = 10;\n\nasync function incrementCounter(kv: KVNamespace, key: string) {\n  const shard = Math.floor(Math.random() * SHARD_COUNT);\n  const shardKey = `${key}:shard:${shard}`;\n\n  const current = Number(await kv.get(shardKey)) || 0;\n  await kv.put(shardKey, String(current + 1));\n}\n\nasync function getCounter(kv: KVNamespace, key: string): Promise<number> {\n  let total = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < SHARD_COUNT; i++) {\n    const value = await kv.get(`${key}:shard:${i}`);\n    total += Number(value) || 0;\n  }\n  return total;\n}\n```\n\n### Time-Based Sharding (D1)\n\nFor high-volume time-series data:\n\n```sql\n-- Partition by month\nCREATE TABLE events_2025_01 (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    timestamp TEXT NOT NULL,\n    data TEXT\n);\n\nCREATE TABLE events_2025_02 (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    timestamp TEXT NOT NULL,\n    data TEXT\n);\n\n-- Query router in code\nfunction getEventsTable(date: Date): string {\n  const year = date.getFullYear();\n  const month = String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, ''0'');\n  return `events_${year}_${month}`;\n}\n```\n\n### Entity-Based Sharding (D1)\n\nFor multi-tenant applications:\n\n```typescript\n// Tenant-specific D1 databases\ninterface Bindings {\n  DB_TENANT_A: D1Database;\n  DB_TENANT_B: D1Database;\n  // Or use Hyperdrive for external Postgres\n}\n\nfunction getDbForTenant(env: Bindings, tenantId: string): D1Database {\n  const dbMapping: Record<string, D1Database> = {\n    ''tenant-a'': env.DB_TENANT_A,\n    ''tenant-b'': env.DB_TENANT_B,\n  };\n  return dbMapping[tenantId] ?? env.DB_DEFAULT;\n}\n```\n\n## Read Replication Patterns\n\n### D1 Read Replicas\n\nD1 automatically creates read replicas. Optimize access:\n\n```typescript\n// Enable Smart Placement in wrangler.jsonc\n{\n  \"placement\": { \"mode\": \"smart\" }\n}\n\n// Worker runs near data, reducing latency\n```\n\n### Multi-Region with Durable Objects\n\nFor global coordination with regional caching:\n\n```typescript\n// Durable Object for region-local state\nexport class RegionalCache {\n  private state: DurableObjectState;\n  private cache: Map<string, { value: unknown; expires: number }>;\n\n  constructor(state: DurableObjectState) {\n    this.state = state;\n    this.cache = new Map();\n  }\n\n  async fetch(request: Request): Promise<Response> {\n    const url = new URL(request.url);\n    const key = url.searchParams.get(''key'');\n\n    if (request.method === ''GET'' && key) {\n      const cached = this.cache.get(key);\n      if (cached && cached.expires > Date.now()) {\n        return Response.json({ value: cached.value, source: ''cache'' });\n      }\n      return Response.json({ value: null, source: ''miss'' });\n    }\n\n    if (request.method === ''PUT'' && key) {\n      const { value, ttl } = await request.json();\n      this.cache.set(key, {\n        value,\n        expires: Date.now() + (ttl * 1000),\n      });\n      return Response.json({ success: true });\n    }\n\n    return Response.json({ error: ''Invalid request'' }, { status: 400 });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Eventual Consistency Pattern\n\nFor data that can tolerate staleness:\n\n```typescript\ninterface CacheEntry<T> {\n  data: T;\n  cachedAt: number;\n  staleAfter: number;\n  expireAfter: number;\n}\n\nasync function getWithStaleWhileRevalidate<T>(\n  kv: KVNamespace,\n  key: string,\n  fetcher: () => Promise<T>,\n  options: {\n    staleAfter: number;  // Serve stale, revalidate in background\n    expireAfter: number; // Force fresh fetch\n  }\n): Promise<T> {\n  const cached = await kv.get<CacheEntry<T>>(key, ''json'');\n  const now = Date.now();\n\n  if (cached) {\n    // Fresh - return immediately\n    if (now < cached.staleAfter) {\n      return cached.data;\n    }\n\n    // Stale but not expired - return stale, revalidate async\n    if (now < cached.expireAfter) {\n      // Background revalidation\n      kv.put(key, JSON.stringify(await buildCacheEntry(fetcher, options)));\n      return cached.data;\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Expired or missing - must fetch fresh\n  const entry = await buildCacheEntry(fetcher, options);\n  await kv.put(key, JSON.stringify(entry));\n  return entry.data;\n}\n\nasync function buildCacheEntry<T>(\n  fetcher: () => Promise<T>,\n  options: { staleAfter: number; expireAfter: number }\n): Promise<CacheEntry<T>> {\n  const now = Date.now();\n  return {\n    data: await fetcher(),\n    cachedAt: now,\n    staleAfter: now + options.staleAfter,\n    expireAfter: now + options.expireAfter,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Queue Scaling\n\n### Horizontal Scaling (Concurrency)\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"queues\": {\n    \"consumers\": [\n      {\n        \"queue\": \"events\",\n        \"max_batch_size\": 100,     // Max messages per invocation\n        \"max_concurrency\": 20,     // Parallel consumer instances\n        \"max_retries\": 1,\n        \"dead_letter_queue\": \"events-dlq\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Batch Processing Optimization\n\n```typescript\nexport default {\n  async queue(batch: MessageBatch, env: Bindings) {\n    // Group messages for efficient D1 batching\n    const byType = new Map<string, unknown[]>();\n\n    for (const msg of batch.messages) {\n      const type = msg.body.type;\n      if (!byType.has(type)) byType.set(type, []);\n      byType.get(type)!.push(msg.body.payload);\n    }\n\n    // Process each type as a batch\n    for (const [type, payloads] of byType) {\n      await processBatch(type, payloads, env);\n    }\n\n    // Ack all at once\n    batch.ackAll();\n  },\n};\n\nasync function processBatch(\n  type: string,\n  payloads: unknown[],\n  env: Bindings\n) {\n  // Batch insert to D1 (≤1000 at a time)\n  const BATCH_SIZE = 1000;\n  for (let i = 0; i < payloads.length; i += BATCH_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = payloads.slice(i, i + BATCH_SIZE);\n    await insertBatch(env.DB, type, chunk);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Memory Management\n\n### Streaming for Large Payloads\n\n```typescript\n// Problem: Loading entire file into memory\nconst data = await r2.get(key);\nconst json = await data.json(); // May exceed 128MB\n\n// Solution: Stream processing\napp.get(''/export/:key'', async (c) => {\n  const object = await c.env.R2.get(c.req.param(''key''));\n  if (!object) return c.json({ error: ''Not found'' }, 404);\n\n  return new Response(object.body, {\n    headers: {\n      ''Content-Type'': object.httpMetadata?.contentType ?? ''application/octet-stream'',\n      ''Content-Length'': String(object.size),\n    },\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Chunked Processing with Durable Objects\n\n```typescript\n// For files >50MB, process in chunks with checkpointing\nexport class ChunkedProcessor {\n  private state: DurableObjectState;\n\n  async processFile(r2Key: string, chunkSize: number = 1024 * 1024) {\n    // Get checkpoint\n    let offset = (await this.state.storage.get<number>(''offset'')) ?? 0;\n\n    const object = await this.env.R2.get(r2Key, {\n      range: { offset, length: chunkSize },\n    });\n\n    if (!object) {\n      // Processing complete\n      await this.state.storage.delete(''offset'');\n      return { complete: true };\n    }\n\n    // Process chunk\n    await this.processChunk(await object.arrayBuffer());\n\n    // Save checkpoint\n    await this.state.storage.put(''offset'', offset + chunkSize);\n\n    // Schedule next chunk via alarm\n    await this.state.storage.setAlarm(Date.now() + 100);\n\n    return { complete: false, offset: offset + chunkSize };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Scaling Checklist\n\n### Before Launch\n- [ ] KV cache layer for hot data\n- [ ] D1 indexes on all query columns\n- [ ] Queue DLQs configured\n- [ ] Smart Placement enabled\n- [ ] Batch size ≤1000 for D1 writes\n\n### At 10K req/day\n- [ ] Monitor D1 query performance\n- [ ] Review cache hit rates\n- [ ] Check queue consumer lag\n\n### At 100K req/day\n- [ ] Add Analytics Engine for metrics (free)\n- [ ] Consider key sharding for hot KV keys\n- [ ] Review batch processing efficiency\n\n### At 1M req/day\n- [ ] Implement Tiered Cache\n- [ ] Add read-through caching\n- [ ] Consider time-based D1 partitioning\n- [ ] Review and optimize indexes\n\n### At 10M req/day\n- [ ] Multi-region strategy\n- [ ] Entity-based sharding\n- [ ] Durable Objects for coordination\n- [ ] Custom rate limiting\n\n## Cost Implications\n\n| Scaling Strategy | Additional Cost | When to Use |\n|------------------|-----------------|-------------|\n| KV caching | $0.50/M reads | D1 read heavy |\n| Key sharding | More KV reads | >1 write/sec/key |\n| Time partitioning | None (same D1) | >10GB data |\n| Tiered Cache | None (CDN) | Cacheable responses |\n| DO coordination | CPU time | Global state |\n| Queue scaling | Per message | High throughput |\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Problem | Solution |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Cache everything | KV costs add up | Cache hot data only |\n| Shard too early | Complexity without benefit | Monitor first |\n| Ignore TTLs | Stale data | Set appropriate TTLs |\n| Skip DLQ | Lost messages | Always add DLQ |\n| Over-replicate | Cost multiplication | Right-size replication |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:09:48.505Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Optimization Agents needing advanced scaling strategies for D1 architectures.","zh":"适用于需要为D1架构提供高级扩展策略的Cloudflare优化代理。","ja":"D1アーキテクチャの高度なスケーリング戦略が必要なCloudflare最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"D1 아키텍처에 대한 고급 확장 전략이 필요한 Cloudflare 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de Cloudflare que necesitan estrategias de escalado avanzadas para arquitecturas D1.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation Cloudflare ayant besoin de stratégies d''évolution avancées pour les architectures D1.","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare-Optimierungsagenten, die fortschrittliche Skalierungsstrategien für D1-Architekturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização da Cloudflare que necessitam de estratégias de dimensionamento avançadas para arquiteturas D1.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации Cloudflare, которым требуются продвинутые стратегии масштабирования для архитектур D1.","ar":"مثالي لعميل برمجة الخادم السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى استراتيجيات قياسية متقدمة لعمارة D1."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement cost-efficient scaling solutions using KV cache layers, batch writes, and queue buffers, while optimizing D1 read latency, write throughput, and storage capacity.","zh":"赋予代理实施使用KV缓存层、批量写入和队列缓冲区的成本有效的扩展解决方案的能力，同时优化D1读取延迟、写入吞吐量和存储容量。","ja":"KVキャッシュ層、バッチ書き込み、キュー缓冲区を使用したコスト効率の高いスケーリングソリューションを実装するエージェントを可能にし、同時にD1の読み取り待ち時間、書き込みスループット、ストレージ容量を最適化します。","ko":"KV 캐시 계층, 배치 쓰기 및 큐 버퍼를 사용하여 비용 효율적인 확장 솔루션을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고同時に D1의 읽기 대기 시간, 쓰기 처리량 및 저장소 용량을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar soluciones de escalado rentables utilizando capas de caché KV, escrituras por lotes y buffers de cola, al mismo tiempo que se optimiza la latencia de lectura D1, el rendimiento de escritura y la capacidad de almacenamiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des solutions d''évolution rentables en utilisant des couches de cache KV, des écritures par lots et des tampons de file d''attente, tout en optimisant la latence de lecture D1, le débit d''écriture et la capacité de stockage.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kosteneffiziente Skalierungslösungen mithilfe von KV-Cache-Schichten, Batch-Schreibvorgängen und Warteschlangenpuffern zu implementieren, während gleichzeitig die D1-Lese-Latenz, Schreibdurchsatz und Speicherkapazität optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar soluções de dimensionamento eficientes em termos de custo, utilizando camadas de cache KV, gravações em batch e buffers de fila, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza a latência de leitura do D1, a taxa de transferência de gravação e a capacidade de armazenamento.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать экономически эффективные решения для масштабирования, используя слои кэша KV, пакетную запись и буферы очереди, а также оптимизировать задержку чтения D1, пропускную способность записи и емкость хранилища.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتنفيذ حلول لتوسيع النطاق بكفاءة في التكلفة، باستخدام طبقات ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت KV والكتابة الدفعية وحوض الفئات، وفي الوقت نفسه تحسين تأخير قراءة D1 وسرعة نقل الكتابة وسعة التخزين."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaling D1 databases beyond default limits","Optimizing KV cache performance using key prefixing and predictable keys","Archiving data to R2 storage for efficient data management"],"zh":["超出默认限制扩展D1数据库","使用键前缀和可预测键优化KV缓存性能","将数据归档到R2存储以实现高效的数据管理"],"ja":["デフォルトの限制を超えてD1データベースをスケーリングする","キー接頭辞と予測可能なキーを使用してKVキャッシュのパフォーマンスを最適化する","データをR2ストレージにアーカイブして効率的なデータ管理を行う"],"ko":["기본 제한을 초과하여 D1 데이터베이스 확장","키 접두사 및 예측 가능한 키를 사용하여 KV 캐시 성능 최적화","데이터를 R2 저장소에 아카이브하여 효율적인 데이터 관리 수행"],"es":["Escalado de bases de datos D1 más allá de los límites predeterminados","Optimización del rendimiento de la caché KV utilizando prefijos de clave y claves predecibles","Archivado de datos en almacenamiento R2 para una gestión de datos eficiente"],"fr":["Mise à l''échelle des bases de données D1 au-delà des limites par défaut","Optimisation des performances du cache KV à l''aide de préfixes de clé et de clés prévisibles","Archivage des données sur le stockage R2 pour une gestion de données efficace"],"de":["Skalierung von D1-Datenbanken über die Standardgrenzen hinaus","Optimierung der KV-Cache-Leistung durch Verwendung von Schlüsselprefixen und vorhersehbaren Schlüsseln","Archivierung von Daten im R2-Speicher für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung"],"pt":["Dimensionamento de bancos de dados D1 além dos limites padrão","Otimização do desempenho do cache KV usando prefixos de chave e chaves previsíveis","Arquivamento de dados para armazenamento R2 para gerenciamento de dados eficiente"],"ru":["Масштабирование баз данных D1 за пределами стандартных ограничений","Оптимизация производительности кэша KV с помощью префиксов ключей и предсказуемых ключей","Архивация данных в хранилище R2 для эффективного управления данными"],"ar":["توسيع نطاق قواعد بيانات D1 ما وراء الحدود الافتراضية","تحسين أداء ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت KV باستخدام بادئة المفتاح والمفاتيح القابلة للتنبؤ","أرشفة البيانات إلى تخزين R2 لإدارة البيانات الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare account and D1 database setup","Limited to Cloudflare architecture optimization"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare帐户和D1数据库设置","仅限Cloudflare架构优化"],"ja":["CloudflareアカウントとD1データベースの設定が必要","Cloudflareアーキテクチャの最適化に限定される"],"ko":["Cloudflare 계정 및 D1 데이터베이스 설정 필요","Cloudflare 아키텍처 최적화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere cuenta de Cloudflare y configuración de base de datos D1","Limitado a la optimización de la arquitectura de Cloudflare"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Cloudflare et une configuration de base de données D1","Limité à l''optimisation de l''architecture Cloudflare"],"de":["Benötigt ein Cloudflare-Konto und eine D1-Datenbank-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung der Cloudflare-Architektur"],"pt":["Exige conta Cloudflare e configuração de banco de dados D1","Limitado à otimização da arquitetura Cloudflare"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Cloudflare и настройки базы данных D1","Ограничен оптимизацией архитектуры Cloudflare"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Cloudflare وإعداد قاعدة بيانات D1","محدود بتحسين هيكل Cloudflare"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
