d` - Detailed query performance analysis\n- `index-recommendations.md` - Missing indexes and impact analysis\n- `performance-metrics.md` - Before/after performance comparisons\n- `implementation-plan.md` - Index creation strategy and migration plan\n- `monitoring-setup.md` - Performance monitoring and alerting\n\n**Semantic Database Task ID Examples:**\n\n- `user-query-optimization`\n- `order-performance-indexes`\n- `search-query-acceleration`\n- `relationship-index-analysis`\n- `slow-query-investigation`\n\nPlease analyze all database queries, identify missing indexes, and document recommendations according to the standards above.\n\n$ARGUMENTS\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:10:40.910Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Database Analysis Agents needing advanced indexing optimization capabilities for PostgreSQL","zh":"适用于需要高级索引优化功能的 PostgreSQL 数据库分析代理","ja":"PostgreSQL に対して高度なインデックス最適化機能を必要とするデータベース分析エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 인덱스 최적화 기능이 필요한 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Base de Datos que necesitan capacidades de optimización de indexación avanzadas para PostgreSQL","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Base de Données nécessitant des capacités d''optimisation d''index avancées pour PostgreSQL","de":"Perfekt für Datenbankanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte Indexoptimierungs-Funktionen für PostgreSQL benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Banco de Dados que necessitam de capacidades de otimização de indexação avançadas para PostgreSQL","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа баз данных, требующих расширенных возможностей оптимизации индексации для PostgreSQL","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل قاعدة البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحسين الفهرسة المتقدمة لبرنامج PostgreSQL"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scan entire codebases for missing indexes, providing comprehensive database analysis documentation and optimizing query performance using PostgreSQL and psql","zh":"赋予代理扫描整个代码库以查找缺失索引的能力，提供全面的数据库分析文