Generierung von Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung von Forschungsmethoden","Computergestützte Datenanalyse","Generierung von Forschungsmanuskripten","Automatisierung von Forschungsprozessen","Integration mit den Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph"],"pt":["Análise de dados para geração de hipóteses de pesquisa","Desenvolvimento de metodologias de pesquisa","Análise computacional de dados","Criação de manuscritos de pesquisa"],"ru":["Анализ данных для генерации гипотез исследования","Разработка методологий исследования","Компьютерный анализ данных","Создание исследовательских статей"],"ar":["تحليل البيانات لتوليد فرضيات البحث","تطوير منهجية البحث","تحليل البيانات الحاسوبي","إنشاء مخطوطات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Denario","AI","AG2","LangGraph","","API"],"ja":["Denario","AI","AG2","LangGraph","","API"],"ko":["Denario","AI","AG2","LangGraph","","API"],"es":["inteligencia artificial","investigación científica","automatización de flujos de trabajo","generación de hipótesis","desarrollo de metodologías","análisis de datos","manuscritos de investigación","AG2","LangGraph"],"fr":["intelligence artificielle","recherche scientifique","automatisation de flux de travail","génération d''hypothèses","développement de méthodologies","analyse de données","manuscrits de recherche","AG2","LangGraph"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz","wissenschaftliche Forschung","Automatisierung von Forschungsprozessen","Generierung von Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung von Forschungsmethoden","Datenanalyse","Forschungsmanuskripte","AG2","LangGraph"],"pt":["pesquisa científica","automatização de pesquisa","sistema de IA","análise de dados","geração de hipóteses","desenvolvimento de metodologias"],"ru":["научное исследование","автоматизация исследования","система ИИ","анализ данных","генерация гипотез","разработка методологий"],"ar":["البحث العلمي","أتمتة البحث","نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل البيانات","توليد الفرضيات","تطوير المنهجية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"denario","description":"Multiagent AI system for scientific research assistance that automates research workflows from data analysis to publication. This skill should be used when generating research ideas from datasets, developing research methodologies, executing computational experiments, performing literature searches, or generating publication-ready papers in LaTeX format. Supports end-to-end research pipelines with customizable agent orchestration.","bodyPreview":"# Denario\n\n## Overview\n\nDenario is a multiagent AI system designed to automate scientific research workflows from initial data analysis through publication-ready manuscripts. Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, it orchestrates multiple specialized agents to handle hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses\n- Developing structured research","body":"# Denario\n\n## Overview\n\nDenario is a multiagent AI system designed to automate scientific research workflows from initial data analysis through publication-ready manuscripts. Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, it orchestrates multiple specialized agents to handle hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses\n- Developing structured research methodologies\n- Executing computational experiments and generating visualizations\n- Conducting literature searches for research context\n- Writing journal-formatted LaTeX papers from research results\n- Automating the complete research pipeline from data to publication\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall denario using uv (recommended):\n\n```bash\nuv init\nuv add \"denario[app]\"\n```\n\nOr using pip:\n\n```bash\nuv pip install \"denario[app]\"\n```\n\nFor Docker deployment or building from source, see `references/installation.md`.\n\n## LLM API Configuration\n\nDenario requires API keys from supported LLM providers. Supported providers include:\n- Google Vertex AI\n- OpenAI\n- Other LLM services compatible with AG2/LangGraph\n\nStore API keys securely using environment variables or `.env` files. For detailed configuration instructions including Vertex AI setup, see `references/llm_configuration.md`.\n\n## Core Research Workflow\n\nDenario follows a structured four-stage research pipeline:\n\n### 1. Data Description\n\nDefine the research context by specifying available data and tools:\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Denario\n\nden = Denario(project_dir=\"./my_research\")\nden.set_data_description(\"\"\"\nAvailable datasets: time-series data on X and Y\nTools: pandas, sklearn, matplotlib\nResearch domain: [specify domain]\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n### 2. Idea Generation\n\nGenerate research hypotheses from the data description:\n\n```python\nden.get_idea()\n```\n\nThis produces a research question or hypothesis based on the described data. Alternatively, provide a custom idea:\n\n```python\nden.set_idea(\"Custom research hypothesis\")\n```\n\n### 3. Methodology Development\n\nDevelop the research methodology:\n\n```python\nden.get_method()\n```\n\nThis creates a structured approach for investigating the hypothesis. Can also accept markdown files with custom methodologies:\n\n```python\nden.set_method(\"path/to/methodology.md\")\n```\n\n### 4. Results Generation\n\nExecute computational experiments and generate analysis:\n\n```python\nden.get_results()\n```\n\nThis runs the methodology, performs computations, creates visualizations, and produces findings. Can also provide pre-computed results:\n\n```python\nden.set_results(\"path/to/results.md\")\n```\n\n### 5. Paper Generation\n\nCreate a publication-ready LaTeX paper:\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Journal\n\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\nThe generated paper includes proper formatting for the specified journal, integrated figures, and complete LaTeX source.\n\n## Available Journals\n\nDenario supports multiple journal formatting styles:\n- `Journal.APS` - American Physical Society format\n- Additional journals may be available; check `references/research_pipeline.md` for the complete list\n\n## Launching the GUI\n\nRun the graphical user interface:\n\n```bash\ndenario run\n```\n\nThis launches a web-based interface for interactive research workflow management.\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### End-to-End Research Pipeline\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Denario, Journal\n\n# Initialize project\nden = Denario(project_dir=\"./research_project\")\n\n# Define research context\nden.set_data_description(\"\"\"\nDataset: Time-series measurements of [phenomenon]\nAvailable tools: pandas, sklearn, scipy\nResearch goal: Investigate [research question]\n\"\"\")\n\n# Generate research idea\nden.get_idea()\n\n# Develop methodology\nden.get_method()\n\n# Execute analysis\nden.get_results()\n\n# Create publication\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\n### Hybrid Workflow (Custom + Automated)\n\n```python\n# Provide custom research idea\nden.set_idea(\"Investigate the correlation between X and Y using time-series analysis\")\n\n# Auto-generate methodology\nden.get_method()\n\n# Auto-generate results\nden.get_results()\n\n# Generate paper\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\n### Literature Search Integration\n\nFor literature search functionality and additional workflow examples, see `references/examples.md`.\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n- **Multiagent orchestration**: AG2 and LangGraph coordinate specialized agents for different research tasks\n- **Reproducible research**: All stages produce structured outputs that can be version-controlled\n- **Journal integration**: Automatic formatting for target publication venues\n- **Flexible input**: Manual or automated at each pipeline stage\n- **Docker deployment**: Containerized environment with LaTeX and all dependencies\n\n## Detailed References\n\nFor comprehensive documentation:\n- **Installation options**: `references/installation.md`\n- **LLM configuration**: `references/llm_configuration.md`\n- **Complete API reference**: `references/research_pipeline.md`\n- **Example workflows**: `references/examples.md`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nCommon issues and solutions:\n- **API key errors**: Ensure environment variables are set correctly (see `references/llm_configuration.md`)\n- **LaTeX compilation**: Install TeX distribution or use Docker image with pre-installed LaTeX\n- **Package conflicts**: Use virtual environments or Docker for isolation\n- **Python version**: Requires Python 3.12 or higher\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:10:12.080Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Research Agents requiring automated scientific research workflows and publication-ready manuscript generation","zh":"适用于需要自动化科学研究工作流程和出版就绪稿生成的高级研究代理","ja":"高度な研究エージェントが自動化された科学研究ワークフローと出版用の原稿生成を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"자동화된 과학 연구 워크플로 및 출판 가능한 원고 생성이 필요한 고급 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de investigación avanzada que requieren flujos de trabajo de investigación científica automatizados y generación de manuscritos listos para publicación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche avancée nécessitant des flux de travail de recherche scientifique automatisés et une génération de manuscrits prêts pour publication","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche Forschungsagenten, die automatisierte wissenschaftliche Forschungsworkflows und die Generierung von veröffentlichungsreifen Manuskripten erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa Avançada que requerem fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica automatizados e geração de manuscritos prontos para publicação","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых исследовательских агентов, требующих автоматизированных научных исследовательских рабочих процессов и генерации рукописей, готовых к публикации","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء البحثية المتقدمة التي تتطلب سير عمل أبحاث علمية آليّة وتوليد مخطوطات جاهزة للنشر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate multiple specialized agents for hypothesis generation, methodology development, and computational analysis using AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, streamlining research from data analysis to manuscript writing","zh":"赋予代理编排多个专用代理以使用AG2和LangGraph框架生成假设、开发方法和进行计算分析，从而简化数据分析到原稿编写的研究过程","ja":"AG2およびLangGraphフレームワークを使用して仮説の生成、方法の開発、計算分析を行う複数の専用エージェントをオーケストレートすることで、データ分析から原稿作成までの研究をストリームライン化するエージェントをエンパワーする","ko":"AG2 및 LangGraph 프레임워크를 사용하여 가설 생성, 방법 개발 및 계산 분석을 수행하는 여러 전문 에이전트를 오케스트레이션하여 데이터 분석에서 원고 작성까지의 연구를 간소화하는 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes orquestar múltiples agentes especializados para la generación de hipótesis, el desarrollo de metodologías y el análisis computacional utilizando los marcos AG2 y LangGraph, simplificando la investigación desde el análisis de datos hasta la escritura de manuscritos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer plusieurs agents spécialisés pour la génération d''hypothèses, le développement de méthodologies et l''analyse computationnelle en utilisant les cadres AG2 et LangGraph, rationalisant la recherche depuis l''analyse de données jusqu''à la rédaction de manuscrits","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere spezialisierte Agenten für die Hypothesengenerierung, Methodenentwicklung und computergestützte Analyse unter Verwendung der Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph zu orchestrieren, wodurch die Forschung von der Datenanalyse bis zur Manuskripterstellung rationalisiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar vários agentes especializados para geração de hipóteses, desenvolvimento de metodologias e análise computacional usando os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph, simplificando a pesquisa desde a análise de dados até a escrita de manuscritos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестровать несколько специализированных агентов для генерации гипотез, разработки методологий и вычислительного анализа с использованием фреймворков AG2 и LangGraph, оптимизируя исследование от анализа данных до написания рукописей","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أوركسترة وكلاء متخصصين متعددين من أجل توليد فرضيات وتنمية منهجيات وتحليل حاسوبي باستخدام إطارات AG2 وLangGraph، وبذلك يُبسط البحث من تحليل البيانات إلى كتابة المخطوطات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dataset analysis to generate novel research hypotheses","Developing structured research methodologies with multiple agents","Generating publication-ready manuscripts through collaborative agent workflows"],"zh":["自动化数据集分析以生成新颖的研究假设","使用多个代理开发结构化的研究方法","通过协作代理工作流程生成出版就绪的稿件"],"ja":["新しい研究仮説を生成するためにデータセット分析を自動化する","複数のエージェントを使用して構造化された研究方法を開発する","協調的なエージェントのワークフローを通じて出版用の原稿を生成する"],"ko":["새로운 연구 가설을 생성하기 위한 데이터셋 분석 자동화","여러 에이전트를 사용하여 구조화된 연구 방법을 개발하기","공동 에이전트 워크플로우를 통해 출판 가능한 원고 생성하기"],"es":["Automatización del análisis de conjuntos de datos para generar nuevas hipótesis de investigación","Desarrollo de metodologías de investigación estructuradas con múltiples agentes","Generación de manuscritos listos para publicación a través de flujos de trabajo de agentes colaborativos"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''analyse de jeux de données pour générer de nouvelles hypothèses de recherche","Développement de méthodologies de recherche structurées avec plusieurs agents","Génération de manuscrits prêts pour publication à travers des flux de travail d''agents collaboratifs"],"de":["Automatisierung der Datensatzanalyse zur Generierung neuer Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung strukturierter Forschungsmethoden mit mehreren Agenten","Generierung von veröffentlichungsreifen Manuskripten durch kollaborative Agenten-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de conjuntos de dados para gerar novas hipóteses de pesquisa","Desenvolver metodologias de pesquisa estruturadas com vários agentes","Gerar manuscritos prontos para publicação por meio de fluxos de trabalho de agentes colaborativos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ наборов данных для генерации новых исследовательских гипотез","Разрабатывать структурированные исследовательские методологии с помощью нескольких агентов","Генерировать рукописи, готовые к публикации, с помощью совместных рабочих процессов агентов"],"ar":["آليّة تحليل مجموعات البيانات لتوليد فرضيات بحثية جديدة","تنمية منهجيات بحثية منظّمة مع وكلاء متعددين","توليد مخطوطات جاهزة للنشر من خلال سير عمل وكلاء تعاوني"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with AG2 and LangGraph frameworks","Dependent on specialized agents for various research tasks"],"zh":["需要与AG2和LangGraph框架集成","依赖于各种研究任务的专用代理"],"ja":["AG2およびLangGraphフレームワークとの統合が必要","さまざまな研究タスクの専用エージェントに依存する"],"ko":["AG2 및 LangGraph 프레임워크와의 통합이 필요함","여러 연구 작업을 위한 전문 에이전트에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere integración con los marcos AG2 y LangGraph","Depende de agentes especializados para diversas tareas de investigación"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec les cadres AG2 et LangGraph","Dépend de agents spécialisés pour diverses tâches de recherche"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit den Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph","Ist abhängig von spezialisierten Agenten für verschiedene Forschungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer integração com os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph","Depende de agentes especializados para várias tarefas de pesquisa"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с фреймворками AG2 и LangGraph","Зависит от специализированных агентов для различных исследовательских задач"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع إطارات AG2 وLangGraph","يعتمد على وكلاء متخصصين لمهام بحثية متنوعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
