llung von Fähigkeiten","Analyse des Cortex-Speichers","Lesevorgang von PRD-Dateien","Analyse von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Análise de memória do Cortex","Leitura de arquivos PRD","Análise de tarefas","Criação automática de habilidades","Detecção de padrões recorrentes","Integração com o ecossistema de habilidades"],"ru":["Анализ памяти Cortex","Чтение файлов PRD","Анализ задач","Автоматическое создание навыков","Обнаружение повторяющихся закономерностей","Интеграция с экосистемой навыков"],"ar":["تحليل ذاكرة الكورتيكس","قراءة ملفات PRD","تحليل المهام","إنشاء مهارات آلي","اكتشاف الأنماط المتكررة","التكامل مع نظام المهارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["自动技能生成","工作模式分析","技能生成器","Cortex 内存分析","PRD 文件分析","任务分析","模式检测","技能创建"],"ja":["自動スキル生成","作業パターン分析","スキル生成ツール","Cortex メモリ分析","PRD ファイル分析","タスク分析","パターンの検出","スキルの作成"],"ko":["자동 스킬 생성","작업 패턴 분석","스킬 생성기","코텍스 메모리 분석","PRD 파일 분석","태스크 분석","패턴의 감지","스킬의 생성"],"es":["generador de habilidades","análisis de patrones","creación automática","ecosistema de habilidades","desarrollo de software","automatización de procesos","análisis de datos","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["générateur de compétences","analyse de modèles","création automatique","écosystème de compétences","développement de logiciels","automatisation de processus","analyse de données","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Fähigkeitsgenerator","Musteranalyse","automatische Erstellung","Fähigkeitennetzwerk","Softwareentwicklung","Prozessautomatisierung","Datenanalyse","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["gerador de habilidades","análise de padrões de trabalho","ecossistema de habilidades","automatização de habilidades","desenvolvimento de habilidades","tecnologia de habilidades","inteligência artificial","aprendizado de máquina"],"ru":["генератор навыков","анализ закономерностей работы","экосистема навыков","автоматизация навыков","развитие навыков","технология навыков","искусственный интеллект","машинное обучение"],"ar":["مولد مهارات","تحليل أنماط العمل","نظام المهارات","آلية المهارات","تطوير المهارات","تكنولوجيا المهارات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","التعلم الآلي"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"synapse","description":"Pattern detection and automatic skill recommendation system. Activates when analyzing Cortex memory files, detecting recurring work patterns, or determining if new skills are needed. Analyzes .cortex_log.md, PRD files, and task lists to identify patterns (API calls, testing, deployment, etc.) appearing 5+ times. Generates Synapse_RECOMMENDATIONS.md with prioritized skill suggestions. Use when optimizing workflows or identifying automation opportunities.","bodyPreview":"# Synapse - Automatic Skill Generator\n\n**Analyzes your work patterns and automatically generates the skills you need.**\n\nSynapse is the brain of the skill ecosystem. It watches Cortex memory, reads your PRD files, analyzes your tasks, and automatically creates new skills when patterns emerge.\n\n## What Synapse Does\n\nSynapse performs unified analysis from multiple sources:\n\n### 1. Cortex Memory Analysis\n- Reads `.cortex_log.md` and `.cortex_status.json`\n- Detects recurring patterns (API calls, dat","body":"# Synapse - Automatic Skill Generator\n\n**Analyzes your work patterns and automatically generates the skills you need.**\n\nSynapse is the brain of the skill ecosystem. It watches Cortex memory, reads your PRD files, analyzes your tasks, and automatically creates new skills when patterns emerge.\n\n## What Synapse Does\n\nSynapse performs unified analysis from multiple sources:\n\n### 1. Cortex Memory Analysis\n- Reads `.cortex_log.md` and `.cortex_status.json`\n- Detects recurring patterns (API calls, data processing, errors, etc.)\n- Identifies patterns that appear ≥ threshold (default: 5 times)\n- Calculates priority based on frequency\n\n### 2. PRD Analysis\n- Scans for PRD files (`*PRD*.md`, `*REQUIREMENTS*.md`, `*ROADMAP*.md`)\n- Extracts tasks and requirements\n- Classifies by domain (api, testing, deployment, etc.)\n- Counts tasks per domain to identify skill needs\n\n### 3. Task Analysis\n- Reads TODO files and task lists\n- Parses checkboxes, numbered lists, bullets\n- Groups related tasks\n- Identifies skill opportunities\n\n## Automatic Skill Generation\n\n**Synapse runs automatically and generates skills without user intervention:**\n\n- **Periodically**: Every 30 minutes via cron (optional)\n- **On git commit**: Via post-commit hook (optional)\n- **When critical patterns detected**: Immediate generation\n\n**Skills are auto-generated when:**\n- Pattern appears ≥ threshold (default: 5 times)\n- Priority is high or critical\n- Skill doesn''t already exist\n\n## How It Works\n\n```\nYou work normally\n        ↓\nCortex traces everything\n        ↓\nSynapse monitors automatically:\n  - Cortex memory (patterns)\n  - PRD files (requirements)\n  - Task lists (TODO)\n        ↓\nDetects patterns >= threshold\n        ↓\nAuto-generates skills if priority >= high:\n  - Creates .claude/skills/[skill-name]/\n  - Generates SKILL.md with progressive disclosure\n  - Creates scripts with Cortex API integration\n  - Records in Cortex memory\n        ↓\nNew skill ready immediately!\n        ↓\nClaude uses it automatically\n```\n\n**No user intervention needed.**\n\n## Priority Levels\n\nSynapse assigns priorities based on frequency and task count:\n\n- **🔴 CRITICAL**: Pattern appears 2+ times/day → Auto-generate immediately\n- **🟠 HIGH**: Pattern appears 1+ times/day → Auto-generate\n- **🟡 MEDIUM**: Pattern appears 3-7 times/week → Monitor\n- **🟢 LOW**: Pattern appears <3 times/week → Monitor\n\nOnly HIGH and CRITICAL priorities trigger automatic generation.\n\n## Output\n\nSynapse generates `Synapse_RECOMMENDATIONS.md` with prioritized skill recommendations:\n\n```markdown\n# Synapse Skill Recommendations\n\n## Summary\n- Total recommendations: 3\n- High priority: 2\n- Medium priority: 1\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n### 1. 🔴 api-optimizer (CRITICAL)\n**Pattern:** api_call\n**Frequency:** 3.5 times/day (24 total in 7 days)\n**Reason:** Frequent API operations detected\n...\n```\n\nSee [OUTPUT_FORMAT.md](references/OUTPUT_FORMAT.md) for complete output specification.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Automatic Mode (Recommended)\n\nRun auto-generator to analyze and generate skills automatically:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/synapse/scripts/auto_skill_generator.py\n```\n\nSkills with HIGH or CRITICAL priority will be generated automatically.\n\n### Analysis Only\n\nGenerate recommendations without auto-creating skills:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/synapse/scripts/synapse_analyzer.py\n```\n\nThis creates `Synapse_RECOMMENDATIONS.md` for manual review.\n\n### Setup Monitoring\n\nAdd to crontab for automatic periodic checks:\n\n```bash\n# Every 30 minutes\n*/30 * * * * /path/to/.claude/skills/synapse/scripts/synapse_auto_watch.sh\n```\n\nOr use as git hook (see [INSTALLATION.md](references/INSTALLATION.md)).\n\n## Integration with Cortex\n\nSynapse and Cortex work together seamlessly:\n\n1. **Cortex traces** your work and records events\n2. **Synapse analyzes** Cortex memory for patterns\n3. **Synapse generates** skills when patterns reach threshold\n4. **New skills use** Cortex API to record their own events\n5. **Pattern detection improves** as more skills contribute data\n\nThis creates a self-improving system where skills emerge from actual usage patterns.\n\n## Generated Skill Structure\n\nSynapse creates skills following best practices:\n\n```\ngenerated-skill/\n├── SKILL.md (with YAML frontmatter)\n├── scripts/\n│   └── main.py (with Cortex API integration)\n└── references/ (if needed)\n```\n\nAll generated skills:\n- ✅ Follow progressive disclosure principles\n- ✅ Include Cortex API integration\n- ✅ Have concise SKILL.md (<200 lines)\n- ✅ Record their own events for future pattern detection\n- ✅ Work with Claude Code, GPT, and Gemini\n\n## Multi-LLM Support\n\nSynapse works with any CLI-based LLM:\n- ✅ **Claude Code**: Native integration\n- ✅ **GPT/Codex**: Reads `Synapse_RECOMMENDATIONS.md`\n- ✅ **Gemini CLI**: Reads `Synapse_RECOMMENDATIONS.md`\n\nSee [MULTI_LLM.md](references/MULTI_LLM.md) for LLM-specific guides.\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n- **Pattern merging**: Combines Cortex + PRD patterns for higher priority\n- **Duplicate detection**: Never generates skills that already exist\n- **Context preservation**: Recommendations include example usage\n- **Custom thresholds**: Configure sensitivity via command-line args\n\nSee [ADVANCED.md](references/ADVANCED.md) for detailed documentation.\n\n## Configuration\n\nCreate `.synapse_config.json` for custom settings:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"analysis\": {\n    \"threshold\": 5,\n    \"window_days\": 7\n  },\n  \"sources\": {\n    \"cortex_memory\": true,\n    \"prd_files\": true,\n    \"task_lists\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee [CONFIGURATION.md](references/CONFIGURATION.md) for all options.\n\n## References\n\n- **[INSTALLATION.md](references/INSTALLATION.md)** - Setup and git hooks\n- **[MANUAL_USAGE.md](references/MANUAL_USAGE.md)** - Command-line options\n- **[OUTPUT_FORMAT.md](references/OUTPUT_FORMAT.md)** - Recommendation file format\n- **[EXAMPLES.md](references/EXAMPLES.md)** - Real-world skill generation examples\n- **[ADVANCED.md](references/ADVANCED.md)** - Pattern merging, customization\n- **[CONFIGURATION.md](references/CONFIGURATION.md)** - Complete config reference\n- **[MULTI_LLM.md](references/MULTI_LLM.md)** - Using with GPT, Gemini, etc.\n\n## Part of the Ecosystem\n\n**Cortex** → Remembers everything\n**Synapse** → Analyzes and generates\n**Generated skills** → Solve specific problems\n**Skills use Cortex** → Pattern detection improves\n\nSynapse makes the system intelligent and self-improving.\n\n---\n\n*Synapse - The universal skill recommendation and generation engine*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:10:22.390Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing automated skill generation and pattern analysis from Cortex memory and PRD files.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化技能生成和从 Cortex 内存和 PRD 文件中进行模式分析的 AI 代理。","ja":"Cortex メモリと PRD ファイルから自動化されたスキル生成とパターン分析が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cortex 메모리 및 PRD 파일에서 자동화된 스킬 생성 및 패턴 분석이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan generación automática de habilidades y análisis de patrones desde la memoria de Cortex y archivos PRD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une génération automatique de compétences et d''une analyse de modèles à partir de la mémoire Cortex et des fichiers PRD.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Fähigkeitsgenerierung und Musteranalyse aus Cortex-Speicher und PRD-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de geração automática de habilidades e análise de padrões a partir da memória do Cortex e arquivos PRD.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются автоматизированная генерация навыков и анализ закономерностей из памяти Cortex и файлов PRD.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكياء الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلقائي للمهارات وتحليل الأنماط من ذاكرة Cortex وملفات PRD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically generate new skills by analyzing work patterns, reading `.cortex_log.md` and `.cortex_status.json` files, and detecting recurring patterns such as API calls and data usage, leveraging unified analysis from multiple sources.","zh":"使代理能够通过分析工作模式、读取 `.cortex_log.md` 和 `.cortex_status.json` 文件以及检测诸如 API 调用和数据使用等重复模式，利用多个来源的统一分析来自动生成新技能。","ja":"エージェントが `.cortex_log.md` ファイルと `.cortex_status.json` ファイルを読み込み、API 呼び出しやデータ使用などの反復パターンを検出することで、作業パターンを分析し、新しいスキルを自動生成することができます。また、複数の情報源から統一分析を利用することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 작업 패턴을 분석하고 `.cortex_log.md` 및 `.cortex_status.json` 파일을 읽어 API 호출 및 데이터 사용과 같은 반복 패턴을 감지하여 새로운 스킬을 자동으로 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 여러 소스의 통합 분석을 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar automáticamente nuevas habilidades analizando patrones de trabajo, leyendo archivos `.cortex_log.md` y `.cortex_status.json` y detectando patrones recurrentes como llamadas a API y uso de datos, aprovechando el análisis unificado de múltiples fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer automatiquement de nouvelles compétences en analysant les modèles de travail, en lisant les fichiers `.cortex_log.md` et `.cortex_status.json` et en détectant des modèles récurrents tels que des appels d''API et une utilisation de données, en exploitant l''analyse unifiée de plusieurs sources.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, automatisch neue Fähigkeiten zu generieren, indem sie Arbeitsmuster analysieren, `.cortex_log.md`- und `.cortex_status.json`-Dateien lesen und wiederkehrende Muster wie API-Aufrufe und Datenverwendung erkennen, indem sie die einheitliche Analyse mehrerer Quellen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar automaticamente novas habilidades analisando padrões de trabalho, lendo arquivos `.cortex_log.md` e `.cortex_status.json` e detectando padrões recorrentes, como chamadas de API e uso de dados, aproveitando a análise unificada de várias fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически генерировать новые навыки, анализируя закономерности работы, читая файлы `.cortex_log.md` и `.cortex_status.json` и обнаруживая повторяющиеся закономерности, такие как вызовы API и использование данных, используя унифицированный анализ из нескольких источников.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد مهارات جديدة تلقائيًا من خلال تحليل أنماط العمل، وقراءة ملفات `.cortex_log.md` و `.cortex_status.json` ،และการ الكشف عن الأنماط المتكررة مثل مكالمات API واستخدام البيانات، واستغلال التحليل الموحد من عدة مصادر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating skill creation based on detected patterns","Analyzing Cortex memory for recurring API calls","Generating new skills from task analysis and PRD files"],"zh":["根据检测到的模式自动创建技能","分析 Cortex 内存以检测重复的 API 调用","从任务分析和 PRD 文件中生成新的技能"],"ja":["検出されたパターンに基づいてスキルを作成する自動化","Cortex メモリを分析して反復的な API 呼び出しを検出する","タスク分析と PRD ファイルから新しいスキルを生成する"],"ko":["검출된 패턴을 기반으로 스킬 생성 자동화","Cortex 메모리를 분석하여 반복적인 API 호출을 감지","태스크 분석 및 PRD 파일에서 새로운 스킬 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de habilidades en función de los patrones detectados","Análisis de la memoria de Cortex para llamadas a API recurrentes","Generación de nuevas habilidades a partir del análisis de tareas y archivos PRD"],"fr":["Automation de la création de compétences en fonction des modèles détectés","Analyse de la mémoire Cortex pour les appels d''API récurrents","Génération de nouvelles compétences à partir de l''analyse de tâches et de fichiers PRD"],"de":["Automatisierung der Fähigkeitsgenerierung basierend auf erkannten Mustern","Analyse des Cortex-Speichers für wiederkehrende API-Aufrufe","Generierung neuer Fähigkeiten aus der Aufgabenanalyse und PRD-Dateien"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de habilidades com base em padrões detectados","Analizar a memória do Cortex para chamadas de API recorrentes","Gerar novas habilidades a partir da análise de tarefas e arquivos PRD"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание навыков на основе обнаруженных закономерностей","Анализировать память Cortex для повторяющихся вызовов API","Генерировать новые навыки на основе анализа задач и файлов PRD"],"ar":["توليد مهارات تلقائيًا بناءً على الأنماط المكتشفة","تحليل ذاكرة Cortex للكشف عن مكالمات API المتكررة","توليد مهارات جديدة من تحليل المهام وملفات PRD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Cortex memory and PRD files","Limited to analyzing specific file formats such as `.cortex_log.md` and `.cortex_status.json`"],"zh":["需要访问 Cortex 内存和 PRD 文件","仅限分析特定的文件格式，例如 `.cortex_log.md` 和 `.cortex_status.json`"],"ja":["Cortex メモリと PRD ファイルへのアクセスが必要","特定のファイル形式（`.cortex_log.md` および `.cortex_status.json` など）のみを分析可能"],"ko":["Cortex 메모리 및 PRD 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","특정 파일 형식(.cortex_log.md 및 .cortex_status.json 등)만 분석 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la memoria de Cortex y archivos PRD","Limitado a analizar formatos de archivo específicos como `.cortex_log.md` y `.cortex_status.json`"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la mémoire Cortex et aux fichiers PRD","Limité à l''analyse de formats de fichier spécifiques tels que `.cortex_log.md` et `.cortex_status.json`"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Cortex-Speicher und PRD-Dateien","Begrenzt auf die Analyse spezifischer Dateiformate wie `.cortex_log.md` und `.cortex_status.json`"],"pt":["Requer acesso à memória do Cortex e arquivos PRD","Limitado à análise de formatos de arquivo específicos, como `.cortex_log.md` e `.cortex_status.json`"],"ru":["Требует доступа к памяти Cortex и файлам PRD","Ограничен анализом конкретных форматов файлов, таких как `.cortex_log.md` и `.cortex_status.json`"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ذاكرة Cortex وملفات PRD","محدود بتحليل تنسيقات ملفات محددة مثل `.cortex_log.md` و `.cortex_status.json`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
