"es":["Extracción de notas de reuniones","Archivado de notas con inteligencia artificial","Análisis de reuniones para identificar empresas discutidas","Identificación de tareas pendientes de las reuniones","Compatibilidad con macOS","Integración con OpenAI API"],"fr":["Extraction de notes de réunion","Archivage de notes avec intelligence artificielle","Analyse de réunions pour identifier les entreprises discutées","Identification des tâches pendantes des réunions","Compatibilité avec macOS","Intégration avec OpenAI API"],"de":["Extraktion von Meetings-Notizen","Archivierung von Notizen mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Analyse von Meetings zur Identifizierung von diskutierten Unternehmen","Identifizierung von Aufgaben aus Meetings","Kompatibilität mit macOS","Integration mit OpenAI API"],"pt":["Extração de notas de reunião","Arquivamento de notas","Opção de inteligência AI","Integração com OpenAI API","Suporte a macOS","Análise de reuniões"],"ru":["Извлечение заметок о встречах","Сохранение заметок","Опция ИИ","Интеграция с OpenAI API","Поддержка macOS","Анализ встреч"],"ar":["استخراج ملاحظات الاجتماع","تحليل ملاحظات الاجتماع","خيار الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكامل مع OpenAI API","دعم نظام macOS","تحليل الاجتماعات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Granola 会议提取","自动化会议记录","AI 智能分析","macOS 开发","OpenAI API KEY","会议记录存档"],"ja":["Granola ミーティング抽出","ミーティング記録の自動化","AI インテリジェンス分析","macOS 開発","OpenAI API KEY","ミーティング記録の保存"],"ko":["Granola 미팅 추출","미팅 기록 자동화","AI 지능 분석","macOS 개발","OpenAI API KEY","미팅 기록 저장"],"es":["Granola","inteligencia artificial","extracción de notas","archivado de reuniones","análisis de reuniones","macOS","OpenAI API","desarrollo de software","productividad"],"fr":["Granola","intelligence artificielle","extraction de notes","archivage de réunions","analyse de réunions","macOS","OpenAI API","développement de logiciels","productivité"],"de":["Granola","künstliche Intelligenz","Extraktion von Notizen","Archivierung von Meetings","Analyse von Meetings","macOS","OpenAI API","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität"],"pt":["Granola","extração de notas de reunião","inteligência AI","produtividade","organização","OpenAI API","macOS","análise de reuniões"],"ru":["Гранола","извлечение заметок о встречах","ИИ","производительность","организация","OpenAI API","macOS","анализ встреч"],"ar":["غرانولا","استخراج ملاحظات الاجتماع","الذكاء الاصطناعي","الإنتاجية","التنظيم","OpenAI API","نظام macOS","تحليل الاجتماعات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"granola","description":"Extract and analyze Granola meeting notes. USE WHEN user asks to extract granola meetings, analyze my meetings, or what meetings did I have. OUTPUT structured markdown with people, companies, TODOs, and insights to ~/.granola-archivist/output/","bodyPreview":"# Granola Meeting Extraction\n\nExtract and archive Granola meeting notes with optional AI intelligence.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks: \"Extract my last 7 days of Granola meetings\"\n- User asks: \"Analyze my meeting with [Person]\"\n- User asks: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n- User asks: \"What TODOs came from my meetings?\"\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Granola installed** on macOS with at least one recorded meeting\n2. **OpenAI API key** stored in `~/.granola-archivist/.env` (optional, only for AI","body":"# Granola Meeting Extraction\n\nExtract and archive Granola meeting notes with optional AI intelligence.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks: \"Extract my last 7 days of Granola meetings\"\n- User asks: \"Analyze my meeting with [Person]\"\n- User asks: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n- User asks: \"What TODOs came from my meetings?\"\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Granola installed** on macOS with at least one recorded meeting\n2. **OpenAI API key** stored in `~/.granola-archivist/.env` (optional, only for AI extraction)\n\n## Setup Instructions\n\n### First-Time Setup\n\nTell the user:\n```\nTo enable AI extraction, you need to set up your OpenAI API key.\n\nRun these commands:\nmkdir -p ~/.granola-archivist\necho \"OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_key_here\" > ~/.granola-archivist/.env\n\nThen try: \"Extract my last 7 days of Granola meetings\"\n```\n\n### Checking Setup\n\nBefore running AI extraction, check if `.env` exists:\n- File exists at `~/.granola-archivist/.env` → proceed\n- File missing → show setup instructions above\n\n## Usage\n\n### Extract Recent Meetings\n\n**User**: \"Extract my last 5 Granola meetings\"\n\n**You should**:\n1. If AI is requested, check setup (`~/.granola-archivist/.env` exists)\n2. Run: `python skills/granola/extract.py --days 7` (add `--no-intelligence` if no AI)\n3. Show results: Meeting titles, attendees, where files were saved\n\n### Get Intelligence from Meetings\n\n**User**: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n\n**You should**:\n1. Extract last 7 days of meetings\n2. Parse output files from `~/.granola-archivist/output/`\n3. Summarize companies mentioned across all meetings\n\n### Extract TODOs\n\n**User**: \"What action items came from my meetings?\"\n\n**You should**:\n1. Extract recent meetings with intelligence (requires API key)\n2. Parse TODO sections from output files\n3. Present consolidated TODO list with owners and deadlines\n\n## Output Format\n\nFiles are saved to: `~/.granola-archivist/output/`\n\nFilename format: `YYYY-MM-DD-meeting-title-attendee-name.md`\n\nEach file contains:\n- Meeting metadata (title, date, attendees, location)\n- Your manual notes from Granola\n- AI-generated summary from Granola\n- Extracted intelligence:\n  - People (with roles, insights, network connections)\n  - Companies discussed (with stage, funding, context)\n  - Network connections (who knows who)\n  - TODOs (with owners, deadlines, context)\n  - Key insights (investment opportunities, market insights)\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Extract Recent Meetings\n\n```\nUser: \"Extract my last 3 Granola meetings\"\n\nYou: \"I''ll extract your last 3 Granola meetings. Let me check your setup first...\"\n\n[Checks ~/.granola-archivist/.env exists]\n\nYou: \"Setup looks good. Extracting meetings...\"\n\n[Runs: python skills/granola/extract.py --days 7 --limit 3]\n\nYou: \"✓ Extracted 3 meetings:\n- 2026-01-14: Fund Discussion with Srihita Vatsavaya\n- 2026-01-13: Rollout AI Sync with Camden Ko\n- 2026-01-12: Notion Strategy with Jade Doan\n\nFiles saved to: ~/.granola-archivist/output/\n\nWould you like me to:\n1. Show summaries of all 3 meetings\n2. Extract companies discussed\n3. Pull out action items\"\n```\n\n### Example 2: Missing Setup\n\n```\nUser: \"Extract my Granola meetings\"\n\nYou: \"If you''d like AI extraction, set up your OpenAI API key first. Please run:\n\nmkdir -p ~/.granola-archivist\necho ''OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_key_here'' > ~/.granola-archivist/.env\n\nReplace ''sk-your_key_here'' with your actual OpenAI API key.\n\nIf you prefer no AI, I can still export your meetings without a key.\"\n```\n\n### Example 3: Extract Companies\n\n```\nUser: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n\nYou: \"Let me extract your meetings from the last 7 days and analyze them...\"\n\n[Extracts meetings, parses output files]\n\nYou: \"Here are the companies discussed across 5 meetings this week:\n\n**Rollout AI** (mentioned 8 times)\n- Stage: Series A\n- Discussed in: Camden meeting, Investor call\n- Context: Potential investment target, strong growth\n\n**Notion** (mentioned 5 times)\n- Stage: Late-stage\n- Discussed in: Jade meeting\n- Context: Partnership opportunity\n\n**OpenAI** (mentioned 3 times)\n- Discussed in: Multiple meetings\n- Context: API integration plans\n\nWould you like more details on any of these?\"\n```\n\n## Cost Information\n\nUsing GPT-5-nano (cheapest model):\n- Cost per meeting: ~$0.0009\n- 30 meetings/month: ~$0.03\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Granola cache not found\"\n- Ensure Granola is installed\n- Record at least one meeting\n- Check: `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/cache-v3.json` exists\n\n### \"OpenAI API key not found\"\n- Setup .env file: `~/.granola-archivist/.env`\n- Format: `OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...`\n\n### Legacy config\n- If `~/.granola-claude/` exists, it will still be detected\n\n### \"No meetings found\"\n- Check date range (default: last 7 days)\n- Ensure Granola has meetings in that period\n\n## Privacy\n\n- No data collection or tracking\n- Transcripts stay on your machine\n- Only sent to your OpenAI account (you control your data)\n- Your API key = you control your data\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:10:50.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Productivity Agents seeking to extract and analyze meeting notes from Granola with optional AI-driven insights.","zh":"适用于寻求从Granola中提取和分析会议笔记的生产力代理，并可选择使用AI驱动的洞察。","ja":"Granolaから会議ノートを抽出して分析する生産性エージェントに適しています。オプションでAIドリブンの洞察も使用できます。","ko":"Granola에서 회의 노트를 추출하고 분석하는 생산성 에이전트에 적합하며, 선택적으로 AI 驱动형洞察를 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de productividad que buscan extraer y analizar notas de reuniones de Granola con información adicional opcional impulsada por inteligencia artificial.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de productivité cherchant à extraire et à analyser les notes de réunion de Granola avec des informations supplémentaires facultatives basées sur l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Ideal für Produktivitätsagenten, die Granola-Meetings-Notizen extrahieren und analysieren möchten, mit optionalen AI-gesteuerten Erkenntnissen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Produtividade que buscam extrair e analisar notas de reuniões do Granola com insights opcionais impulsionados por IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов производительности, стремящихся извлечь и проанализировать заметки о встречах из Granola с необязательными идеями, основанными на ИИ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإنتاجية الذين يبحثون عن استخراج وتحليل ملاحظات الاجتماعات من Granola مع رؤى مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي الخيارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract and archive Granola meeting notes, leveraging OpenAI API for advanced analysis, and providing capabilities such as TODO extraction and company discussion tracking through macOS-integrated Granola installations.","zh":"赋予代理从Granola中提取和存档会议笔记的能力，利用OpenAI API进行高级分析，并提供诸如TODO提取和公司讨论跟踪等功能，通过在macOS上集成Granola安装。","ja":"エージェントにGranolaの会議ノートを抽出してアーカイブする能力を与え、OpenAI APIを使用して高度な分析を行い、TODOの抽出や会社の議論の追跡などの機能を提供します。macOSにGranolaを統合することでこれらの機能を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Granola 회의 노트를 추출하고 아카이브하는 기능을 제공하며, OpenAI API를 사용하여 고급 분석을 수행하고, TODO 추출 및 회사 논의 추적 등의 기능을 제공합니다. macOS에서 Granola를 통합하여 이러한 기능을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer y archivar notas de reuniones de Granola, utilizando la API de OpenAI para un análisis avanzado, y proporcionando capacidades como la extracción de TODO y el seguimiento de discusiones de empresas a través de instalaciones de Granola integradas en macOS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire et d''archiver les notes de réunion de Granola, en utilisant l''API OpenAI pour une analyse avancée, et en offrant des capacités telles que l''extraction de TODO et le suivi des discussions d''entreprises via des installations Granola intégrées à macOS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Granola-Meetings-Notizen zu extrahieren und zu archivieren, indem sie die OpenAI-API für eine erweiterte Analyse nutzen und Fähigkeiten wie TODO-Extraktion und Unternehmensdiskussionen-Verfolgung über macOS-integrierte Granola-Installationen bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair e arquivar notas de reuniões do Granola, utilizando a API do OpenAI para análise avançada e fornecendo capacidades como extração de TODO e acompanhamento de discussões de empresas por meio de instalações do Granola integradas ao macOS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлечь и архивировать заметки о встречах из Granola, используя API OpenAI для расширенного анализа и предоставляя возможности, такие как извлечение TODO и отслеживание обсуждений компаний через интегрированные с macOS установки Granola.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخراج وتخزين ملاحظات الاجتماعات من Granola، واستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI للتحليل المتقدم وتوفير إمكانيات مثل استخراج TODO وتتبع مناقشات الشركات من خلال تثبيتات Granola المتكاملة مع نظام macOS."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting meeting notes from the last 7 days","Analyzing meetings with specific individuals","Identifying discussed companies","Generating TODO lists from meeting notes"],"zh":["过去7天的会议笔记提取","与特定个人的会议分析","讨论的公司识别","从会议笔记生成TODO列表"],"ja":["過去7日の会議ノートの抽出","特定の個人の会議分析","議論された会社の識別","会議ノートからTODOリストの生成"],"ko":["과거 7일간의 회의 노트 추출","특정 개인과의 회의 분석","논의된 회사의 식별","회의 노트에서 TODO 목록 생성"],"es":["Extraer notas de reuniones de los últimos 7 días","Analizar reuniones con personas específicas","Identificar empresas discutidas","Generar listas de TODO a partir de notas de reuniones"],"fr":["Extraire les notes de réunion des 7 derniers jours","Analyser les réunions avec des personnes spécifiques","Identifier les entreprises discutées","Générer des listes de TODO à partir des notes de réunion"],"de":["Notizen von Meetings der letzten 7 Tage extrahieren","Meetings mit bestimmten Personen analysieren","Diskutierte Unternehmen identifizieren","TODO-Listen aus Meetings-Notizen generieren"],"pt":["Extrair notas de reuniões dos últimos 7 dias","Analizar reuniões com indivíduos específicos","Identificar empresas discutidas","Gerar listas de TODO a partir de notas de reuniões"],"ru":["Извлечение заметок о встречах за последние 7 дней","Анализ встреч с конкретными людьми","Определение обсуждаемых компаний","Генерация списков TODO из заметок о встречах"],"ar":["استخراج ملاحظات الاجتماعات من الأيام السبعة الأخيرة","تحليل الاجتماعات مع أفراد معينين","تحديد الشركات المناقشة","تمكين قوائم TODO من ملاحظات الاجتماعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Granola installed on macOS","Needs at least one recorded meeting","Optional OpenAI API key required for AI intelligence features"],"zh":["需要在macOS上安装Granola","需要至少一条记录的会议","可选的OpenAI API密钥用于AI智能功能"],"ja":["macOSにGranolaをインストールする必要がある","少なくとも1つの会議の記録が必要","AIインテリジェンス機能にOpenAI APIキーが必要"],"ko":["macOS에서 Granola를 설치해야 함","적어도 하나의 녹음된 회의가 필요","AI 지능 기능을 위한 선택적 OpenAI API 키"],"es":["Requiere Granola instalado en macOS","Necesita al menos una reunión grabada","Se requiere una clave API de OpenAI opcional para características de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Nécessite Granola installé sur macOS","Nécessite au moins une réunion enregistrée","Clé API OpenAI facultative requise pour les fonctionnalités d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Benötigt Granola auf macOS installiert","Benötigt mindestens eine aufgezeichnete Besprechung","Optional erforderlicher OpenAI-API-Schlüssel für künstliche Intelligenz-Features"],"pt":["Requer Granola instalado no macOS","Necessita de pelo menos uma reunião registrada","Chave API do OpenAI opcional necessária para recursos de inteligência de IA"],"ru":["Требуется установка Granola на macOS","Требуется хотя бы одна записанная встреча","Необязательный ключ API OpenAI необходим для функций ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Granola على نظام macOS","يحتاج إلىAJتماعات مسجلة على الأقل","مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI اختياري مطلوب لميزات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
