ronce","diseño de pines"],"fr":["connecteurs Sullins","solutions de connecteurs","structure de MPN","développeurs de connecteurs","séries de connecteurs","montage de connecteurs","couleurs de connecteurs","contacts de bronze phosphoreux","conception de broches"],"de":["Sullins-Stecker","Steckverbinder-Lösungen","MPN-Struktur","Entwickler von Steckverbindern","Steckverbinder-Serien","Steckverbinder-Montage","Steckverbinder-Farben","Phosphor-Bronze-Kontakte","Steckverbinder-Design"],"pt":["conector sullins","conexão de alta qualidade","série sbh/sfh","especificações codificadas","conectoras de alta qualidade","aplicações de conexão confiável"],"ru":["коннектор sullins","высококачественное соединение","серия sbh/sfh","закодированные спецификации","высококачественные коннекторы","приложения с высоким уровнем надежности"],"ar":["موصل sullins","اتصال عالية الجودة","سلسلة sbh/sfh","مواصفات مشفرة","موصلات عالية الجودة","تطبيقات اتصال موثوقة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sullins","description":"Sullins Connector Solutions MPN encoding patterns, series decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Sullins connectors or SullinsHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Sullins Connector Solutions Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nSullins uses letter-prefix series with encoded specifications:\n\n### SBH/SFH Series (Box Headers, FFC/FPC)\n\n```\nSBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK\n |  |   |   |   |  |\n |  |   |   |   |  +-- Color (BK=Black, GY=Gray)\n |  |   |   |   +-- Mount (ST=Straight, RA=Right Angle)\n |  |   |   +-- Pin count (D10 = Dual 10 = 20 total pins)\n |  |   +-- Contact type (PBPC=Phosphor Bronze, Tin)\n |  +-- Series variant (11, 21, etc.)\n +-- Series prefix (SBH=B","body":"# Sullins Connector Solutions Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nSullins uses letter-prefix series with encoded specifications:\n\n### SBH/SFH Series (Box Headers, FFC/FPC)\n\n```\nSBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK\n |  |   |   |   |  |\n |  |   |   |   |  +-- Color (BK=Black, GY=Gray)\n |  |   |   |   +-- Mount (ST=Straight, RA=Right Angle)\n |  |   |   +-- Pin count (D10 = Dual 10 = 20 total pins)\n |  |   +-- Contact type (PBPC=Phosphor Bronze, Tin)\n |  +-- Series variant (11, 21, etc.)\n +-- Series prefix (SBH=Box Header, SFH=FFC/FPC)\n```\n\n### PPPC/PRPC/NPPN Series (Headers)\n\n```\nPRPC040SAAN-RC\n |   | ||| |  |\n |   | ||| |  +-- Mount suffix (RC=Through-Hole, SC=SMT)\n |   | ||| +-- Plating (N=Tin, etc.)\n |   | ||+-- Contact options\n |   | |+-- Contact type\n |   | +-- Row count (1=Single, 2=Dual)\n |   +-- Pin count (040 = 40 pins)\n +-- Series (PRPC=Male, PPPC=Female, NPPN=Pin)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Reference\n\n### SBH Series - Box Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Shrouded male header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Dual row |\n\nPattern: `^SBH[0-9]+-[A-Z]+-D[0-9]+.*`\n\n### PPPC Series - Female Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Female socket header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Single or dual |\n\nPattern: `^PPPC[0-9]+.*`\n\n### PRPC Series - Male Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Male pin header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Single or dual |\n\nPattern: `^PRPC[0-9]+.*`\n\n### NPPN Series - Pin Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Pin header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Configurable |\n\nPattern: `^NPPN[0-9]+.*`\n\n### SFH Series - FFC/FPC Connectors\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Flat flex cable connector |\n| Pitch | 1.27mm |\n| Rated Current | 1.0A |\n| Row Config | Dual row |\n\nPattern: `^SFH[0-9]+-[A-Z]+-D[0-9]+.*`\n\n---\n\n## Pin Count Extraction\n\n### SBH/SFH Series\n\nPin count follows \"D\" prefix and is doubled for dual row:\n\n```java\n// SBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK -> 10 * 2 = 20 pins\nMatcher m = Pattern.compile(\"D([0-9]+)\").matcher(mpn);\nif (m.find()) {\n    return Integer.parseInt(m.group(1)) * 2;  // Dual row\n}\n```\n\n### PPPC/PRPC/NPPN Series\n\nPin count is first 2-3 digits after series prefix:\n\n```java\n// PRPC040SAAN-RC -> 40 pins\n// PPPC081LFBN-RC -> 8 pins\nPattern.compile(\"(PPPC|PRPC|NPPN)([0-9]+)\").matcher(mpn);\nreturn Integer.parseInt(m.group(2));\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mounting Type Codes\n\n### Suffix Codes\n\n| Code | Mounting Type |\n|------|---------------|\n| -RC | Through-Hole |\n| -SC | SMT |\n| ST | Straight (Through-Hole) |\n| RA | Right Angle (Through-Hole) |\n| SM | Surface Mount |\n\n### Detection Example\n\n```java\nString upper = mpn.toUpperCase();\nif (upper.contains(\"-RC\")) return \"Through-Hole\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-SC\")) return \"SMT\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-RA\")) return \"Through-Hole Right Angle\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-ST\")) return \"Through-Hole Straight\";\n```\n\n---\n\n## Gender Detection\n\n| Series | Gender |\n|--------|--------|\n| PPPC | Female (Socket) |\n| PRPC | Male (Pin) |\n| NPPN | Male (Pin) |\n| SBH | Male (Shrouded) |\n| SFH | Male (Shrouded) |\n\n---\n\n## Row Count Detection\n\n### SBH/SFH\n\nAlways dual row (indicated by \"D\" prefix before pin count).\n\n### PPPC/PRPC/NPPN\n\nDigit after pin count indicates rows:\n\n```java\n// PRPC040SAAN-RC\n//        ^ Row digit (S=Single, but position encoding varies)\n// Check the digit after the pin count digits\n\n// More reliable: Parse with regex\nPattern.compile(\"(PPPC|PRPC|NPPN)([0-9]+)([0-9])\").matcher(mpn);\nint rows = Integer.parseInt(m.group(3));  // 1=single, 2=dual\n```\n\n---\n\n## Contact Plating\n\n| Code | Plating Type |\n|------|--------------|\n| GN, G/ | Gold |\n| SN, T/ | Tin |\n| LF | Lead-Free Tin |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// Extract known series prefixes\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"SBH\")) return \"SBH\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"PPPC\")) return \"PPPC\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"PRPC\")) return \"PRPC\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"NPPN\")) return \"NPPN\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"SFH\")) return \"SFH\";\n\n// Generic extraction (3-4 letter prefix before digits)\nPattern.compile(\"^([A-Z]{3,4})[0-9]\").matcher(mpn);\n```\n\n### Package Code Extraction\n\n```java\n// SBH/SFH: Mount type is in dash-separated field\n// Example: SBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK -> ST = Straight\n\n// PPPC/PRPC/NPPN: Mount type is suffix\n// Example: PRPC040SAAN-RC -> RC = Through-Hole\n\n// Look for standard suffix codes\nif (upper.contains(\"-RC\")) return \"Through-Hole\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-SC\")) return \"SMT\";\n```\n\n### Replacement Compatibility\n\n```java\n// Compatible if:\n// 1. Same series\n// 2. Same pin count\n// 3. Compatible mounting type (both THT or both SMT)\n\nString series1 = extractSeries(mpn1);\nString series2 = extractSeries(mpn2);\nif (!series1.equals(series2)) return false;\n\nint pins1 = extractPinCount(mpn1);\nint pins2 = extractPinCount(mpn2);\nif (pins1 != pins2) return false;\n\nreturn areCompatibleMountingTypes(mpn1, mpn2);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Part Numbers\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| PRPC040SAAN-RC | 40-pin male header, single row, through-hole |\n| PPPC081LFBN-RC | 8-pin female header, lead-free, through-hole |\n| SBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK | 20-pin box header (10x2), straight, black |\n| NPPN101BFCN-RC | 10-pin header, through-hole |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/SullinsHandler.java`\n- Supported types: `CONNECTOR`, `IC`\n- No manufacturer-specific ComponentType enum entries\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **Row count encoding**: For PPPC/PRPC/NPPN, the digit after the pin count indicates row count (1=single, 2=dual).\n- **SBH/SFH always dual**: Box headers and FFC connectors are always dual row. Pin count in MPN is per-row, multiply by 2.\n- **Pitch by series**: SBH/PPPC/PRPC/NPPN are 2.54mm pitch. SFH is 1.27mm pitch (fine pitch FFC).\n- **Right angle detection**: Look for \"RA\" in package code OR in the dash-separated fields. Beware: \"stRAight\" contains \"RA\".\n- **Color codes**: BK=Black, GY=Gray, WH=White, BL=Blue appear at the end of SBH/SFH MPNs.\n- **Dual connector type**: Handler registers both CONNECTOR and IC types.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:10:44.869Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Electronics Agents deciphering Sullins connector part numbers and specifications.","zh":"适用于电子代理人解码Sullins连接器部件编号和规格。","ja":"Sullinsコネクタの部品番号や仕様を解読する電子エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Sullins 커넥터 부품 번호 및 사양을 해독하는 전자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Electrónica que descifran números y especificaciones de partes de conectores Sullins.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents électroniques qui déchiffrent les numéros et spécifications de pièces de connecteurs Sullins.","de":"Ideal für Elektronikagenten, die Sullins-Stecker-Teilenummern und -Spezifikationen entschlüsseln.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Eletrônica que decifram números de peça e especificações de conectores Sullins.","ru":"Идеально для Электронных Агентов, расшифровывающих номера деталей и спецификации разъемов Sullins.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإلكترونيات لفك تشفير أرقام قطع و مواصفات موصلات Sullins."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to decode Sullins MPN structures, including series prefixes, series variants, contact types, pin counts, mounts, and colors, using specifications like SBH/SFH Series for Box Headers and FFC/FPC connectors.","zh":"使代理人能够解码Sullins MPN结构，包括系列前缀、系列变体、接触类型、针数、安装座和颜色，使用诸如SBH/SFH系列用于盒式头和FFC/FPC连接器的规格。","ja":"エージェントがSullins MPN構造を解読できるようにし、シリーズプレフィックス、シリーズバリアント、コンタクタタイプ、ピン数、マウント、カラーなどを、SBH/SFHシリーズなどのボックスヘッダやFFC/FPCコネクタの仕様を使用して解読します。","ko":"에이전트가 Sullins MPN 구조를 해독할 수 있도록 하며, 시리즈 접두사, 시리즈 변형, 접점 유형, 핀 수, 마운트 및 색상 등을 SBH/SFH 시리즈와 같은 박스 헤더 및 FFC/FPC 커넥터 사양을 사용하여 해독합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes decodificar estructuras de MPN de Sullins, incluyendo prefijos de serie, variantes de serie, tipos de contacto, recuentos de pines, montajes y colores, utilizando especificaciones como la serie SBH/SFH para encabezados de caja y conectores FFC/FPC.","fr":"Permet aux agents de décoder les structures de MPN de Sullins, y compris les préfixes de série, les variantes de série, les types de contact, les décomptes de broches, les supports et les couleurs, en utilisant des spécifications comme la série SBH/SFH pour les en-têtes de boîtier et les connecteurs FFC/FPC.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Sullins-MPN-Strukturen zu entschlüsseln, einschließlich Serienpräfixen, Serienvarianten, Kontakttypen, Pinzählungen, Montagen und Farben, unter Verwendung von Spezifikationen wie der SBH/SFH-Serie für Box-Header und FFC/FPC-Stecker.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a decodificar estruturas de MPN da Sullins, incluindo prefixos de série, variantes de série, tipos de contato, contagens de pinos, suportes e cores, usando especificações como série SBH/SFH para Caixas de Cabos e conectores FFC/FPC.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью декодировать структуры MPN компании Sullins, включая префиксы серий, вариации серий, типы контактов, количество контактов, типы крепления и цвета, используя спецификации, такие как серии SBH/SFH для коробочных разъемов и разъемов FFC/FPC.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من فك تشفير هياكل أرقام الجزء المتوافقة مع Sullins، بما في ذلك بادئات السلسلة، وأشكال السلسلة، وأنواع الاتصال، وعدد الدبوس، والنظام الضميمي، والألوان، باستخدام مواصفات مثل سلسلة SBH/SFH لبوكسات التوصيل وموصلات FFC/FPC."},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding Sullins part numbers for procurement and inventory management","Generating specifications for Sullins connectors based on application requirements","Validating Sullins MPN structures for compliance and compatibility checks"],"zh":["采购和库存管理的Sullins部件编号解码","根据应用要求生成Sullins连接器的规格","验证Sullins MPN结构以进行合规性和兼容性检查"],"ja":["調達と在庫管理のためのSullins部品番号の解読","アプリケーションの要件に基づくSullinsコネクタの仕様の生成","Sullins MPN構造の検証によるコンプライアンスと互換性の確認"],"ko":["조달 및 재고 관리를 위한 Sullins 부품 번호 해독","응용 프로그램 요구 사항에 따라 Sullins 커넥터 사양 생성","Sullins MPN 구조에 대한 확인을 통한 규정 준수 및 호환성 확인"],"es":["Decodificar números de parte de Sullins para la gestión de adquisiciones y inventario","Generar especificaciones para conectores Sullins en función de los requisitos de la aplicación","Validar estructuras de MPN de Sullins para controles de cumplimiento y compatibilidad"],"fr":["Décoder les numéros de pièces de Sullins pour la gestion des approvisionnements et des stocks","Générer des spécifications pour les connecteurs Sullins en fonction des exigences de l''application","Valider les structures de MPN de Sullins pour les vérifications de conformité et de compatibilité"],"de":["Sullins-Teilenummern für Beschaffungs- und Lagerverwaltung entschlüsseln","Spezifikationen für Sullins-Stecker basierend auf Anwendungsanforderungen generieren","Sullins-MPN-Strukturen für Konformitäts- und Kompatibilitätsprüfungen validieren"],"pt":["Decodificação de números de peça da Sullins para gestão de compras e inventário","Geração de especificações para conectores Sullins com base em requisitos de aplicação","Validação de estruturas de MPN da Sullins para verificação de conformidade e compatibilidade"],"ru":["Декодирование номеров деталей компании Sullins для управления закупками и инвентаризацией","Генерация спецификаций для разъемов Sullins на основе требований применения","Валидация структур MPN компании Sullins для проверки соответствия и совместимости"],"ar":["فك تشفير أرقام قطع موصلات Sullins لإدارة المشتريات وإدارة المخزون","توليد مواصفات لموصلات Sullins استناداً إلى متطلبات التطبيق","التحقق من صحة هياكل أرقام الجزء المتوافقة مع Sullins للتحقق من المطابقة والتوافق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Sullins connector product lines","Limited to Sullins-specific MPN decoding and specification generation"],"zh":["需要了解Sullins连接器产品线","仅限Sullins特定MPN解码和规格生成"],"ja":["Sullinsコネクタ製品ラインの知識が必要","Sullins特有のMPN解読と仕様生成のみ"],"ko":["Sullins 커넥터 제품 라인의 지식이 필요함","Sullins 특정 MPN 해독 및 사양 생성만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las líneas de productos de conectores Sullins","Limitado a la decodificación y generación de especificaciones de MPN específicas de Sullins"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des lignes de produits de connecteurs Sullins","Limité à la décoding et à la génération de spécifications de MPN spécifiques à Sullins"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Sullins-Stecker-Produktlinien","Begrenzt auf Sullins-spezifische MPN-Entschlüsselung und Spezifikationsgenerierung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das linhas de produtos de conectores da Sullins","Limitado à decodificação de MPN específica da Sullins e geração de especificações"],"ru":["Требует знания линий продукции разъемов компании Sullins","Ограничен декодированием MPN только для компании Sullins и генерацией спецификаций"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمجموعات منتجات موصلات Sullins","محدود بفك تشفير أرقام الجزء المتوافقة مع Sullins وتوليد المواصفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
