ダブルット モデルにおける物理知識の提供","円形流線沿いの輸送問題の解決","流線幾何学計算の変更のサポート","輸送解析器の変更のサポート"],"ko":["2D 더블릿 모델의 물리학 지식 제공","원형 흐름선에 따른 전송 문제 해결","흐름선 기하학 계산 수정 지원","전송 해석기 변경 지원"],"es":["Simulación de flujos en un par de pozos de inyección-producción","Resolución de problemas de advección-reacción-difusión","Cálculos de geometría de flujo en coordenadas bipolares","Implementación de solvers de transporte hidrodinámico, químico y térmico","Integración de curvas de avance","Modificación de la geometría del flujo y los solvers de transporte"],"fr":["Simulation de flux dans une paire de puits d''injection-production","Résolution de problèmes d''advection-réaction-diffusion","Calculs de géométrie de flux en coordonnées bipolaires","Implémentation de solveurs de transport hydrodynamique, chimique et thermique","Intégration de courbes d''avance","Modification de la géométrie du flux et des solveurs de transport"],"de":["Stromsimulierung in einem Injektions-Produktions-Bohrloch-Paar","Lösung von Advektions-Reaktions-Diffusionsproblemen","Berechnungen der Stromgeometrie in bipolaren Koordinaten","Implementierung von Transportlösern für Hydrodynamik, Chemie und Thermik","Integration von Durchbruchskurven","Modifizierung der Stromgeometrie und der Transportlöser"],"pt":["Simulação de fluxo em 2D","Resolução de problemas de advecção-reação-difusão","Cálculo de geometria de linhas de fluxo","Integração de curvas de ruptura","Modificação de solvers de transporte","Implementação de métodos de streamline"],"ru":["Симуляция потока в 2D","Решение проблем адвекции-реакции-диффузии","Расчет геометрии линий потока","Интеграция кривых разрыва","Модификация решателей транспорта","Реализация методов потока"],"ar":["محاكاة التدفق في الأبعاد 2D","حل مشاكل الحمل-التفاعل-الانتشار","حساب هندسة خطوط التدفق","تكامل منحنيات الكسر","تعديل محللات النقل","تنفيذ أساليب التدفق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Doublet 技术","二维双点模型","物理知识","传输问题","流线方法","数值模拟"],"ja":["Doublet スキル","2D ダブルット モデル","物理知識","輸送問題","流線法","数値シミュレーション"],"ko":["Doublet 기술","2D 더블릿 모델","물리학 지식","전송 문제","흐름선 방법","수치 시뮬레이션"],"es":["modelo de doblete","simulación de flujos","física de fluidos","advección-reacción-difusión","geométrica de flujo","solvers de transporte","curvas de avance","inyección-producción","pozos de petróleo"],"fr":["modèle de doublet","simulation de flux","physique des fluides","advection-réaction-diffusion","géométrie de flux","solveurs de transport","courbes d''avance","injection-production","puits de pétrole"],"de":["Doppelmodell","Stromsimulierung","Fluidphysik","Advektions-Reaktions-Diffusion","Stromgeometrie","Transportlöser","Durchbruchskurven","Injektions-Produktions-Bohrloch","Erdölbohrungen"],"pt":["Doublet","modelo de física","simulação de fluxo","advecção-reação-difusão","streamline","transporte hidrodinâmico","curvas de ruptura","geometria de linhas de fluxo"],"ru":["Двойник","модель физики","симуляция потока","адвекция-реакция-диффузия","поток","транспорт гидродинамики","кривые разрыва","геометрия линий потока"],"ar":["دوبلت","نموذج فيزيائي","محاكاة التدفق","الحمل-التفاعل-الانتشار","التدفق","نقل الهيدروديناميكا","منحنيات الكسر","هندسة خطوط التدفق"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doublet","description":"Validates code and provides physics reasoning for the 2-D injection-production doublet model using streamline methods. Use when modifying streamline geometry, transport calculations (hydrodynamic, chemical, thermal), breakthrough curves, or Greens function kernels. Also use when debugging simulation behavior or explaining physics concepts.","bodyPreview":"# Doublet Streamline Model Physics Knowledge\n\nThis skill provides physics knowledge for the 2-D doublet (injection-production well pair) model using streamline methods. The model solves advection-reaction-dispersion problems along circular streamlines in a potential flow field.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Modifying streamline geometry calculations (bipolar coordinates)\n- Changing transport solvers (hydrodynamic, chemical, thermal)\n- Implementing or modifying breakthrough curve integration\n- W","body":"# Doublet Streamline Model Physics Knowledge\n\nThis skill provides physics knowledge for the 2-D doublet (injection-production well pair) model using streamline methods. The model solves advection-reaction-dispersion problems along circular streamlines in a potential flow field.\n\n## When This Skill Applies\n\n- Modifying streamline geometry calculations (bipolar coordinates)\n- Changing transport solvers (hydrodynamic, chemical, thermal)\n- Implementing or modifying breakthrough curve integration\n- Working with Green''s function kernels for thermal transport\n- Debugging unexpected breakthrough behavior\n- Planning changes to physics-related code\n- Explaining why the model behaves a certain way\n\n## Core Physics Reference\n\nThe model tracks transport in a 2-D potential flow field between an injector (+a, 0) and producer (-a, 0):\n\n| Module | Transport Type | Solution Method |\n|--------|----------------|-----------------|\n| Hydrodynamic | Pure advection | Time-of-flight along streamlines |\n| Chemical | Advection + capacity-limited reaction | Logistic traveling wave |\n| Thermal | Advection + fluid-matrix exchange | Bessel-function Green''s kernel |\n\nKey state variables:\n\n| Variable | Symbol | Meaning | Units |\n|----------|--------|---------|-------|\n| Take-off angle | β | Angle at which streamline leaves injector | rad |\n| Time-of-flight | τ(β) | Travel time from injector to producer | s |\n| Arc position | φ | Angle along circular streamline | rad |\n| Concentration | C(φ,t) | Solute mass fraction | kg/kg |\n| Capacity | S(φ,t) | Remaining reaction capacity | kg/kg |\n| Fluid temperature | Tf(φ,t) | Fluid temperature along streamline | °C |\n| Matrix temperature | Tm(φ,t) | Rock matrix temperature | °C |\n\nFor detailed equations, see [EQUATIONS.md](EQUATIONS.md).\nFor symbol definitions and units, see [SYMBOLS.md](SYMBOLS.md).\nFor derivation logic, see [DERIVATIONS.md](DERIVATIONS.md).\nFor edge cases and sanity checks, see [SANITY_CHECKS.md](SANITY_CHECKS.md).\n\n---\n\n## Workflow A: Physics Validation\n\nUse this workflow when reviewing or planning code changes.\n\n### Step 1: Identify affected transport type\n\nDetermine which transport physics is affected:\n- **Hydrodynamic**: Streamline geometry, time-of-flight, velocity field\n- **Chemical**: Capacity-limited reaction, logistic traveling wave\n- **Thermal**: Fluid-matrix exchange, Bessel function kernel\n\n### Step 2: Check coordinate system consistency\n\nThe model uses multiple coordinate systems:\n- Cartesian (x, y) for plotting\n- Bipolar (ξ, β) for streamline parameterization\n- Polar about streamline center (R, φ) for local calculations\n\nVerify transformations are applied correctly.\n\n### Step 3: Verify breakthrough integration\n\nBreakthrough curves integrate over all streamlines:\n```\nC_prod(t) = (1/π) ∫_0^π C(β, t) dβ\n```\n\nCheck that:\n- Integration weights are correct (trapezoidal or custom)\n- β limits span [0, π] (or arrived streamlines only)\n- Singularities at β → 0, π are handled\n\n### Step 4: Check Green''s function stability (thermal)\n\nFor thermal transport, the Bessel kernel G(τ, t) can overflow:\n- Verify exponent recentering is applied\n- Check that i1e (scaled Bessel I1) is used instead of i1\n- Verify prefix integrals use cumulative_trapezoid\n\n### Step 5: Report findings\n\nSummarize:\n- Which transport type is affected\n- Any coordinate transformation issues\n- Any integration boundary issues\n- Any numerical stability concerns\n- Recommendations for correction\n\n---\n\n## Workflow B: Physics Reasoning\n\nUse this workflow when explaining behavior, debugging, or proposing solutions.\n\n### For explaining physics concepts:\n\n1. Identify the relevant equations and parameters\n2. State the physical interpretation\n3. Explain cause-and-effect relationships\n4. Use the derivation steps from [DERIVATIONS.md](DERIVATIONS.md) to show connections\n\n### For debugging simulation issues:\n\n1. Identify which transport type shows unexpected behavior\n2. Check if the issue relates to:\n   - Breakthrough timing (τ calculation)\n   - Front retardation (reaction capacity)\n   - Thermal lag (fluid-matrix exchange rates)\n3. Trace through the analytical solution\n4. Check edge cases against [SANITY_CHECKS.md](SANITY_CHECKS.md)\n\n### For proposing physics-consistent changes:\n\n1. Identify which equations are affected\n2. Show how new terms integrate into the transport equations\n3. Demonstrate that mass/energy balance is preserved\n4. Identify any new sanity checks needed\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference: Module Structure\n\n| Module | Purpose | Key Functions |\n|--------|---------|---------------|\n| `doublet.py` | Main model (streamlines, chemical, thermal) | `Tf`, `Ctf`, `Cxf`, `Ttf`, `Txf`, `breakthrough` |\n| `streamlines.py` | Bipolar coordinate streamlines | `streamline_bipolar`, `streamtube_width` |\n| `diffusion.py` | Green''s kernel solver with diffusion | `solve_kernel_capacity`, `cxfD`, `ctDf` |\n| `thermal.py` | Thermal kernel (alternative impl.) | `thermal_kernel_Tf_Tm_xvec_t` |\n| `thermal2.py` | Optimized thermal solver | `G_grid_efficient`, `run_breakthrough`, `Tprodf` |\n| `notebook_widgets.py` | Interactive Jupyter visualizations | `visualize_*` functions |\n\n---\n\n## Key Physical Constraints\n\nThese must always hold:\n\n1. **Streamline geometry**: Streamlines are circular arcs through (±a, 0)\n2. **Travel time bounds**: T(β=0) = 4πna²/(3Q) is minimum arrival time\n3. **Velocity singularity**: v → ∞ at wells (handled by coordinate transformation)\n4. **Conservation**: Integrated flux across all streamlines equals Q\n5. **Retardation**: Chemical front travels at speed v·C_inj/(C_inj + S_0)\n6. **Thermal equilibrium**: As t → ∞, Tf → Tm → T_inj (behind the front)\n\n---\n\n## Transport Type Classification\n\n| Transport | Governing Equation | Solution Type |\n|-----------|-------------------|---------------|\n| Hydrodynamic | ∂C/∂t + v·∇C = 0 | Method of characteristics |\n| Chemical (no diffusion) | ∂C/∂t + v·∇C = -kCS | Logistic traveling wave |\n| Chemical (with diffusion) | ∂C/∂t + v·∇C = D∇²C - kCS | Green''s function convolution |\n| Thermal | ∂Tf/∂t + v·∇Tf = -γ(Tf - Tm) | Bessel kernel (Eq. 47) |\n| Matrix | ∂Tm/∂t = β(Tf - Tm) | Exponential convolution (Eq. 48) |\n\n---\n\n## Dimensionless Groups\n\n| Group | Definition | Physical Meaning |\n|-------|------------|------------------|\n| Retardation R | (C_inj + S_0)/C_inj | Front slowdown factor |\n| Damköhler Da | k·τ | Reaction extent over travel time |\n| Péclet Pe | v·L/D | Advection vs diffusion |\n| β·τ | (exchange rate)·(travel time) | Matrix equilibration extent |\n| γ·τ | (exchange rate)·(travel time) | Fluid cooling extent |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:11:51.456Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Physics-based Agents needing advanced 2-D doublet model simulations with streamline methods","zh":"非常适合需要采用流线方法进行高级二维偶极子模型模拟的基于物理的智能体","ja":"流線法を用いた高度な2次元ダブレットモデルシミュレーションを必要とする物理学ベースのエージェントに最適","ko":"정밀한 2차원 더블렛 모델 시뮬레이션과 유선 방법이 필요한 물리학 기반 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en física que necesitan simulaciones avanzadas de modelos de doblete 2-D con métodos de líneas de corriente","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur la physique nécessitant des simulations avancées de modèles de doublet 2-D avec des méthodes de lignes de courant","de":"Perfekt für physikbasierte Agenten, die erweiterte 2-D-Doppelt-Modell-Simulationen mit Stromlinienmethoden benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes baseados em física que necessitam de simulações avançadas de modelo de duplo 2-D com métodos de linhas de corrente","ru":"Идеально для физических агентов, которым требуются продвинутые симуляции двумерной двойной модели с методами потока","ar":"مثالي لワーエージェント التي تقوم بالفيزياء وتحتاج إلى محاكاة متقدمة لنموذج ثنائي الأبعاد مع أساليب تدفق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to solve advection-reaction-dispersion problems along circular streamlines in a potential flow field, leveraging bipolar coordinates and transport solvers like hydrodynamic, chemical, and thermal","zh":"使智能体能够利用双极坐标和诸如流体动力学、化学和热传导等输运求解器，解决势流场中沿圆形流线的平流-反应-弥散问题","ja":"双極座標および流体力学、化学、熱などの輸送ソルバーを活用して、ポテンシャル流場における円形流線に沿った移流-反応-分散問題を解決するエージェントを可能にします","ko":"이극 좌표 및 수력학적, 화학적, 열적 전달 솔버를 활용하여 포텐셜 흐름 필드에서 원형 유선을 따라 이류-반응-분산 문제를 해결하는 에이전트의 능력을 강화함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver problemas de advección-reacción-dispersión a lo largo de líneas de corriente circulares en un campo de flujo potencial, aprovechando coordenadas bipolares y solvers de transporte como hidrodinámicos, químicos y térmicos","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre des problèmes d''advection-réaction-dispersion le long de lignes de courant circulaires dans un champ de flux potentiel, en exploitant les coordonnées bipolaires et les solveurs de transport tels que les solveurs hydrodynamiques, chimiques et thermiques","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Advektions-Reaktions-Dispersionsprobleme entlang kreisförmiger Stromlinien in einem Potentialstromfeld zu lösen, indem bipolare Koordinaten und Transportsolver wie hydrodynamische, chemische und thermische eingesetzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver problemas de advecção-reacção-dispersão ao longo de linhas de corrente circulares em um campo de fluxo potencial, utilizando coordenadas bipolares e solvers de transporte como hidrodinâmico, químico e térmico","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью решать проблемы адвекции-реакции-распределения вдоль круговых линий тока в потенциальном поле потока, используя биполярные координаты и средства решения задач транспорта, такие как гидродинамические, химические и тепловые","ar":"يمنح الوكالات khảية حل مشاكل الحمل-التفاعل-التشتت على طول خطوط الجريان الدائرية في مجال جريان محتمل، باستخدام إحداثيات ثنائية القطب ومحسّنات النقل مثل الهيدروديناميكية والكيميائية والحرارية"},"useCases":{"en":["Modifying streamline geometry calculations","Implementing breakthrough curve integration","Changing transport solvers for hydrodynamic, chemical, or thermal problems"],"zh":["修改流线几何计算","实施穿透曲线积分","更改用于流体动力学、化学或热传导问题的输运求解器"],"ja":["流線形状計算の変更","ブレークスルーカーブ積分の実装","流体力学、化学、または熱問題に対する輸送ソルバーの変更"],"ko":["유선 형상 계산 수정","돌파 곡선 통합 구현","수력학적, 화학적 또는 열적 문제를 위한 전달 솔버 변경"],"es":["Modificar cálculos de geometría de líneas de corriente","Implementar integración de curvas de avance","Cambiar solvers de transporte para problemas hidrodinámicos, químicos o térmicos"],"fr":["Modifier les calculs de géométrie de lignes de courant","Mettre en œuvre l''intégration de courbes de percée","Changer les solveurs de transport pour des problèmes hydrodynamiques, chimiques ou thermiques"],"de":["Ändern von Stromlinien-Geometrieberechnungen","Implementierung von Durchbruchs-Kurven-Integration","Ändern von Transportsolvern für hydrodynamische, chemische oder thermische Probleme"],"pt":["Modificar cálculos de geometria de linhas de corrente","Implementar integração de curva de avanço","Alterar solvers de transporte para problemas hidrodinâmicos, químicos ou térmicos"],"ru":["Модифицировать расчеты геометрии линий тока","Реализовать интеграцию кривой прорыва","Изменить средства решения задач транспорта для гидродинамических, химических или тепловых проблем"],"ar":["تعديل حسابات هندسة خطوط الجريان","تنفيذ تكامل منحنى الاختراق","تغيير محسّنات النقل لمشاكل هيدروديناميكية أو كيميائية أو حرارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of potential flow fields","Limited to 2-D doublet models","Streamline methods may have computational constraints"],"zh":["需要具备势流场知识","仅限于二维偶极子模型","流线方法可能存在计算限制"],"ja":["ポテンシャル流場の知識が必要","2次元ダブレットモデルに限定","流線法には計算上の制約がある可能性があります"],"ko":["포텐셜 흐름 필드에 대한 지식 필요","2차원 더블렛 모델로 제한됨","유선 방법에는 계산상의 제약이 있을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de campos de flujo potencial","Limitado a modelos de doblete 2-D","Los métodos de líneas de corriente pueden tener limitaciones computacionales"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en champs de flux potentiel","Limité aux modèles de doublet 2-D","Les méthodes de lignes de courant peuvent avoir des contraintes de calcul"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über Potentialstromfelder","Begrenzt auf 2-D-Doppelt-Modelle","Stromlinienmethoden können computergesteuerte Einschränkungen haben"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de campos de fluxo potencial","Limitado a modelos de duplo 2-D","Métodos de linhas de corrente podem ter restrições computacionais"],"ru":["Требует знания потенциальных полей потока","Ограничен двумерными двойными моделями","Методы линий тока могут иметь вычислительные ограничения"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة مجالات الجريان المحتملة","محدود بنماذج ثنائية الأبعاد","أساليب خطوط الجريان قد يكون لها قيود حسابية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
