ites web de manière efficace","de":"Netlify ist eine Web-Entwicklungsplattform, die die Bereitstellung und den Hosting von Websites auf effiziente Weise ermöglicht","pt":"Netlify é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento web moderna para implantar e hospedar sites de forma rápida e segura.","ru":"Netlify - это современная платформа веб-разработки для быстрого и безопасного развертывания веб-сайтов.","ar":"Netlify هي منصة تطوير ويب حديثة لنشر واستضافة المواقع بسرعة وأمان.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["CLI","Git ",""," ","",""],"ja":["CLI","Git","","","",""],"ko":["CLI","Git ","","","",""],"es":["Despliegue y hospedaje de sitios web","Instalación de CLI","Inicio de sesión y autenticación","Configuración de repositorios Git","Despliegue en producción"],"fr":["Déploiement et hébergement de sites web","Installation de CLI","Connexion et authentification","Configuration de répertoires Git","Déploiement en production"],"de":["Bereitstellung und Hosting von Websites","Installation von CLI","Anmeldung und Authentifizierung","Konfiguration von Git-Repositorys","Bereitstellung in der Produktion"],"pt":["Instalação do CLI","Login e autenticação","Implantação de sites","Configuração de repositórios Git","Deploy para produção"],"ru":["Установка CLI","Вход и аутентификация","Развертывание сайтов","Настройка репозиториев Git","Развертывание в производство"],"ar":["تثبيت CLI","تسجيل الدخول والتحقق","نشر المواقع","تهيئة مستودعات Git","نشر إلى الإنتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Netlify","CLI","Git",""," "," ","",""],"ja":["Netlify","CLI","Git","","","","",""],"ko":["Netlify","CLI","Git","","","","",""],"es":["Netlify","desarrollo web","despliegue de sitios web","hospedaje de sitios web","CLI","Git","producción"],"fr":["Netlify","développement web","déploiement de sites web","hébergement de sites web","CLI","Git","production"],"de":["Netlify","Web-Entwicklung","Bereitstellung von Websites","Hosting von Websites","CLI","Git","Produktion"],"pt":["Netlify","desenvolvimento web","implantação de sites","hospedagem de sites","CLI","Git","produção"],"ru":["Netlify","веб-разработка","развертывание сайтов","хостинг сайтов","CLI","Git","производство"],"ar":["Netlify","تطوير ويب","نشر مواقع","استضافة مواقع","CLI","Git","إنتاج"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"netlify","description":"Deploys applications to Netlify including functions, forms, redirects, and edge functions. Use when deploying static sites, JAMstack applications, or serverless functions.","bodyPreview":"# Netlify\n\nThe modern web development platform for deploying and hosting websites.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Install CLI:**\n```bash\nnpm install -g netlify-cli\n```\n\n**Login:**\n```bash\nnetlify login\n```\n\n**Deploy:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy\n```\n\n**Deploy to production:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Connect Git Repository\n\n1. Go to app.netlify.com\n2. Add new site > Import from Git\n3. Select repository\n4. Configure build settings\n5. Deploy\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nVisit `https://app.n","body":"# Netlify\n\nThe modern web development platform for deploying and hosting websites.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Install CLI:**\n```bash\nnpm install -g netlify-cli\n```\n\n**Login:**\n```bash\nnetlify login\n```\n\n**Deploy:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy\n```\n\n**Deploy to production:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Connect Git Repository\n\n1. Go to app.netlify.com\n2. Add new site > Import from Git\n3. Select repository\n4. Configure build settings\n5. Deploy\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nVisit `https://app.netlify.com/drop` and drag your build folder.\n\n### netlify.toml Configuration\n\n```toml\n[build]\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  functions = \"netlify/functions\"\n\n[build.environment]\n  NODE_VERSION = \"18\"\n\n# Production context\n[context.production]\n  command = \"npm run build:prod\"\n\n# Preview context (branch deploys)\n[context.deploy-preview]\n  command = \"npm run build:preview\"\n\n# Branch-specific\n[context.staging]\n  command = \"npm run build:staging\"\n\n# Dev settings\n[dev]\n  command = \"npm run dev\"\n  port = 3000\n  targetPort = 5173\n\n# Headers\n[[headers]]\n  for = \"/*\"\n  [headers.values]\n    X-Frame-Options = \"DENY\"\n    X-XSS-Protection = \"1; mode=block\"\n\n# Redirects\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"/.netlify/functions/:splat\"\n  status = 200\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Setting Variables\n\n**Via Dashboard:**\nSite settings > Environment variables > Add variable\n\n**Via CLI:**\n```bash\nnetlify env:set MY_VAR \"value\"\nnetlify env:list\nnetlify env:get MY_VAR\nnetlify env:unset MY_VAR\n```\n\n### Context-Specific Variables\n\n```toml\n# netlify.toml\n[context.production.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://api.example.com\"\n\n[context.deploy-preview.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://staging-api.example.com\"\n\n[context.branch-deploy.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://dev-api.example.com\"\n```\n\n### Using Variables\n\n```javascript\n// In build process\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL;\n\n// In functions\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  const secret = process.env.API_SECRET;\n}\n```\n\n## Serverless Functions\n\n### Basic Function\n\n```javascript\n// netlify/functions/hello.js\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  return {\n    statusCode: 200,\n    body: JSON.stringify({ message: ''Hello, World!'' }),\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### TypeScript Function\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/users.ts\nimport type { Handler, HandlerEvent, HandlerContext } from ''@netlify/functions'';\n\ninterface User {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n\nconst handler: Handler = async (event: HandlerEvent, context: HandlerContext) => {\n  const { httpMethod, body, queryStringParameters } = event;\n\n  if (httpMethod === ''GET'') {\n    const users: User[] = await getUsers();\n    return {\n      statusCode: 200,\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(users),\n    };\n  }\n\n  if (httpMethod === ''POST'') {\n    const data = JSON.parse(body || ''{}'');\n    const user = await createUser(data);\n    return {\n      statusCode: 201,\n      body: JSON.stringify(user),\n    };\n  }\n\n  return {\n    statusCode: 405,\n    body: ''Method Not Allowed'',\n  };\n};\n\nexport { handler };\n```\n\n### Scheduled Functions\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/scheduled.ts\nimport { schedule } from ''@netlify/functions'';\n\nconst handler = async () => {\n  console.log(''Running scheduled task'');\n  await runTask();\n  return { statusCode: 200 };\n};\n\n// Run every day at midnight\nexport const handler = schedule(''0 0 * * *'', handler);\n```\n\n### Background Functions\n\n```javascript\n// netlify/functions/background-task-background.js\n// Suffix with -background for async processing\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  // Long-running task (up to 15 minutes)\n  await processLargeDataset();\n\n  return {\n    statusCode: 200,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### Basic Edge Function\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/edge-functions/geo.ts\nimport type { Context } from ''@netlify/edge-functions'';\n\nexport default async (request: Request, context: Context) => {\n  const country = context.geo.country?.code ?? ''Unknown'';\n  const city = context.geo.city ?? ''Unknown'';\n\n  return new Response(\n    JSON.stringify({\n      message: `Hello from ${city}, ${country}!`,\n    }),\n    {\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n    }\n  );\n};\n\nexport const config = { path: ''/api/geo'' };\n```\n\n### Edge Function with Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/edge-functions/auth.ts\nimport type { Context } from ''@netlify/edge-functions'';\n\nexport default async (request: Request, context: Context) => {\n  const token = request.headers.get(''Authorization'');\n\n  if (!token) {\n    return new Response(''Unauthorized'', { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  // Validate token\n  const user = await validateToken(token);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    return new Response(''Invalid token'', { status: 403 });\n  }\n\n  // Continue to origin\n  return context.next();\n};\n\nexport const config = { path: ''/api/*'' };\n```\n\n### Edge Function Declaration\n\n```toml\n# netlify.toml\n[[edge_functions]]\n  path = \"/api/geo\"\n  function = \"geo\"\n\n[[edge_functions]]\n  path = \"/api/*\"\n  function = \"auth\"\n```\n\n## Redirects & Rewrites\n\n### _redirects File\n\n```\n# Simple redirect\n/old-page /new-page 301\n\n# Wildcard redirect\n/blog/* /posts/:splat 301\n\n# Rewrite (proxy)\n/api/* /.netlify/functions/:splat 200\n\n# SPA fallback\n/* /index.html 200\n\n# Conditional redirect\n/country/* /us/:splat 200 Country=us\n/country/* /uk/:splat 200 Country=gb\n```\n\n### netlify.toml Redirects\n\n```toml\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/old\"\n  to = \"/new\"\n  status = 301\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"https://api.example.com/:splat\"\n  status = 200\n  force = true\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n  conditions = { Role = [\"admin\"] }\n```\n\n## Forms\n\n### HTML Form\n\n```html\n<form name=\"contact\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\">\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact\" />\n  <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required />\n  <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required />\n  <textarea name=\"message\" required></textarea>\n  <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n### React Form\n\n```tsx\nfunction ContactForm() {\n  const [status, setStatus] = useState('''');\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const form = e.currentTarget;\n    const formData = new FormData(form);\n\n    try {\n      await fetch(''/'', {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'' },\n        body: new URLSearchParams(formData as any).toString(),\n      });\n      setStatus(''success'');\n    } catch (error) {\n      setStatus(''error'');\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      name=\"contact\"\n      method=\"POST\"\n      data-netlify=\"true\"\n      onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n    >\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required />\n      <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required />\n      <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Form Notifications\n\nConfigure in Dashboard: Forms > [Form Name] > Settings > Notifications\n\n## Identity (Auth)\n\n### Setup\n\n```html\n<!-- Add to HTML -->\n<script src=\"https://identity.netlify.com/v1/netlify-identity-widget.js\"></script>\n```\n\n### JavaScript API\n\n```javascript\nimport netlifyIdentity from ''netlify-identity-widget'';\n\nnetlifyIdentity.init();\n\n// Open modal\nnetlifyIdentity.open();\n\n// Login\nnetlifyIdentity.on(''login'', user => {\n  console.log(''Logged in:'', user);\n});\n\n// Logout\nnetlifyIdentity.on(''logout'', () => {\n  console.log(''Logged out'');\n});\n\n// Get current user\nconst user = netlifyIdentity.currentUser();\n```\n\n## Large Media (Git LFS)\n\n```bash\n# Install\nnetlify lm:install\n\n# Setup\nnetlify lm:setup\n\n# Track files\ngit lfs track \"*.jpg\" \"*.png\" \"*.gif\"\n```\n\n## Blobs (Storage)\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/upload.ts\nimport { getStore } from ''@netlify/blobs'';\n\nexport async function handler(event) {\n  const store = getStore(''uploads'');\n\n  // Store blob\n  await store.set(''file-key'', event.body, {\n    metadata: { contentType: ''image/png'' },\n  });\n\n  // Get blob\n  const blob = await store.get(''file-key'');\n\n  // Delete blob\n  await store.delete(''file-key'');\n\n  return { statusCode: 200 };\n}\n```\n\n## Local Development\n\n```bash\n# Start dev server\nnetlify dev\n\n# Start with specific port\nnetlify dev --port 3000\n\n# Link to site\nnetlify link\n\n# Pull environment variables\nnetlify env:pull\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use netlify.toml** - Version control your config\n2. **Set up branch deploys** - Preview before production\n3. **Use context-specific vars** - Different values per environment\n4. **Enable form spam filtering** - Protect forms\n5. **Use edge functions** - For low-latency operations\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Missing form-name input | Add hidden input with form name |\n| Wrong publish directory | Check framework output folder |\n| Functions not found | Use netlify/functions directory |\n| Redirects not working | Check order (first match wins) |\n| Build failures | Check build logs, Node version |\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- [references/functions.md](references/functions.md) - Function patterns\n- [references/forms.md](references/forms.md) - Form handling\n- [references/edge.md](references/edge.md) - Edge functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:11:24.819Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing streamlined website deployment and hosting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化网站部署和托管能力的Web开发代理。","ja":"Web開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたWebサイトのデプロイとホスティングの機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 웹사이트 배포 및 호스팅 기능을 간소화하는 데 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan una implementación y alojamiento de sitios web optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web nécessitant un déploiement et un hébergement de sites web rationalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Bereitstellung und Hosting von Websites benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de implantação e capacidades de hospedagem de sites simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности развертывания и хостинга веб-сайтов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تسهيل عملية نشر المواقع الإلكترونية واستضافتها"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy and host websites using Netlify''s CLI, leveraging features like Git repository connections and automated builds, while supporting protocols like npm for seamless installation and updates.","zh":"赋予代理使用Netlify的CLI部署和托管网站的能力，利用Git仓库连接和自动构建等功能，同时支持npm等协议实现无缝安装和更新。","ja":"NetlifyのCLIを使用してWebサイトをデプロイおよびホストするエージェントをEmpowerし、Gitリポジトリ接続や自動ビルドなどの機能を活用し、npmなどのプロトコルをサポートしてシームレスなインストールと更新を可能にします。","ko":"Netlify의 CLI를 사용하여 웹 사이트를 배포하고 호스팅할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여, Git 리포지토리 연결 및 자동 빌드 등의 기능을 사용하며, npm 등의 프로토콜을 지원하여 무제한 설치 및 업데이트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar y alojar sitios web utilizando la CLI de Netlify, aprovechando características como conexiones de repositorios Git y compilaciones automatizadas, al mismo tiempo que admite protocolos como npm para una instalación y actualización sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et d''héberger des sites web en utilisant la CLI Netlify, en exploitant des fonctionnalités telles que les connexions de référentiels Git et les constructions automatisées, tout en prenant en charge des protocoles comme npm pour une installation et des mises à jour sans rupture.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Websites mithilfe der Netlify-CLI zu deployen und zu hosten, indem es Funktionen wie Git-Repository-Verbindungen und automatisierte Builds nutzt, während es Protokolle wie npm für eine reibungslose Installation und Updates unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar e hospedar sites usando a CLI do Netlify, aproveitando recursos como conexões de repositórios Git e compilações automatizadas, além de suportar protocolos como npm para instalação e atualizações sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать и хостить веб-сайты, используя CLI Netlify, используя такие функции, как подключения к репозиториям Git и автоматизированные сборки, а также поддерживая протоколы, такие как npm для бесшовной установки и обновления.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر المواقع الإلكترونية واستضافتها باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر Netlify، ويسهم في استغلال الميزات مثل الاتصالات بمخازن Git والبناء التلقائي، مع دعم بروتوكولات مثل npm من أجل التثبيت والتحديث دون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying web applications to production environments","Configuring build settings for Git-connected repositories","Automating website updates using Netlify''s deploy command"],"zh":["将Web应用程序部署到生产环境","为Git连接的仓库配置构建设置","使用Netlify的部署命令自动更新网站"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションを生产環境にデプロイする","Git接続のリポジトリのビルド設定を構成する","Netlifyのデプロイコマンドを使用してWebサイトを自動更新する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 프로덕션 환경에 배포하는 것","Git 연결 리포지토리의 빌드 설정을 구성하는 것","Netlify의 배포 명령을 사용하여 웹 사이트를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones web en entornos de producción","Configurar la configuración de compilación para repositorios conectados a Git","Automatizar las actualizaciones del sitio web mediante el comando de implementación de Netlify"],"fr":["Déployer des applications web dans des environnements de production","Configurer les paramètres de build pour les référentiels connectés à Git","Automatiser les mises à jour du site web à l''aide de la commande de déploiement Netlify"],"de":["Webanwendungen in Produktionsumgebungen bereitstellen","Build-Einstellungen für Git-verbundene Repositorys konfigurieren","Website-Updates mithilfe des Netlify-Deploy-Befehls automatisieren"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações web em ambientes de produção","Configuração de configurações de compilação para repositórios conectados ao Git","Automatização de atualizações de sites usando o comando de implantação do Netlify"],"ru":["Развертывание веб-приложений в производственных средах","Настройка параметров сборки для репозиториев, подключенных к Git","Автоматизация обновлений веб-сайтов с помощью команды развертывания Netlify"],"ar":["نشر التطبيقات الويب في بيئات الإنتاج","تكوين إعدادات البناء لمخازن Git المتصلة","تحسين تحديثات المواقع الإلكترونية باستخدام أمر النشر من Netlify"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Netlify CLI installation via npm","Needs active Git repository connection","Dependent on Netlify platform services"],"zh":["需要通过npm安装Netlify CLI","需要活跃的Git仓库连接","依赖于Netlify平台服务"],"ja":["Netlify CLIをnpm経由でインストールする必要がある","アクティブなGitリポジトリ接続が必要","Netlifyプラットフォームサービスに依存する"],"ko":["Netlify CLI를 npm을 통해 설치해야 함","활성화된 Git 리포지토리 연결이 필요함","Netlify 플랫폼 서비스에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de Netlify a través de npm","Necesita una conexión de repositorio Git activa","Dependiente de los servicios de la plataforma Netlify"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI Netlify via npm","Nécessite une connexion de référentiel Git active","Dépendante des services de la plate-forme Netlify"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der Netlify-CLI über npm","Benötigt eine aktive Git-Repository-Verbindung","Abhängig von den Diensten der Netlify-Plattform"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da CLI do Netlify via npm","Necessita de uma conexão ativa de repositório Git","Dependente dos serviços de plataforma do Netlify"],"ru":["Требует установки CLI Netlify через npm","Требует активного подключения к репозиторию Git","Зависит от услуг платформы Netlify"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر Netlify عبر npm","يحتاج إلى اتصال نشط بمخزن Git","يعتمد على خدمات منصة Netlify"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/camsnap', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'camsnap', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:11:44.655Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/camsnap","name":"camsnap","description":{"zh":"camsnap ","ja":"camsnap","ko":"camsnap ","es":"Camsnap es una herramienta para capturar momentos, clips o eventos de movimiento desde cámaras configuradas. Permite configurar cámaras y realizar acciones como capturar instantáneas o clips.","fr":"Camsnap est un outil pour capturer des moments, des clips ou des événements de mouvement à partir de caméras configurées. Il permet de configurer des caméras et de réaliser des actions telles que la capture d''instantanés ou de clips.","de":"Camsnap ist ein Tool zum Erfassen von Momenten, Clips oder Bewegungsergebnissen von konfigurierten Kameras. Es ermöglicht die Konfiguration von Kameras und die Ausführung von Aktionen wie dem Erfassen von Momentaufnahmen oder Clips.","pt":"O camsnap é uma ferramenta para capturar imagens e vídeos de câmeras. Ele oferece comandos para descobrir, capturar e monitorar.","ru":"Camsnap — это инструмент для захвата изображений и видео с камер. Он предоставляет команды для обнаружения, захвата и мониторинга.","ar":"camsnap هو أداة لالتقاط الصور والفيديو من الكاميرات. يقدم أوامر للكشف والالتقاط والمراقبة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"camsnap ","ja":"camsnap","ko":"camsnap","es":"Camsnap: captura de momentos con cámaras configuradas","fr":"Camsnap: capturez des moments avec des caméras configurées","de":"Camsnap: Momentaufnahmen mit konfigurierten Kameras","pt":"Camsnap: Ferramenta de Captura de Imagens e Vídeo","ru":"Camsnap: Инструмент для захвата изображений и видео","ar":"camsnap: أداة لالتقاط الصور والفيديو","en":"camsnap"},"description":{"zh":"camsnap ","ja":"camsnap","ko":"camsnap ","es":"Camsnap es una herramienta para capturar momentos, clips o eventos de movimiento desde cámaras configuradas. Permite configurar cámaras y realizar acciones c...","fr":"Camsnap est un outil pour capturer des moments, des clips ou des événements de mouvement à partir de caméras configurées. Il permet de configurer des caméras...","de":"Camsnap ist ein Tool zum Erfassen von Momenten, Clips oder Bewegungsergebnissen von konfigurierten Kameras. Es ermöglicht die Konfiguration von Kameras und d...","pt":"O camsnap é uma ferramenta para capturar imagens e vídeos de câmeras. Ele oferece comandos para descobrir, capturar e monitorar.","ru":"Camsnap — это инструмент для захвата изображений и видео с камер. Он предоставляет команды для обнаружения, захвата и мониторинга.","ar":"camsnap هو أداة لالتقاط الصور والفيديو من الكاميرات. يقدم أوامر للكشف والالتقاط والمراقبة.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":[" camsnap","config.yaml","camsnap add","camsnap discover","camsnap snap","camsnap clip"],"ja":["camsnap","config.yaml","camsnap add","camsnap discover","camsnap snap","camsnap clip"],"ko":["camsnap","config.yaml","camsnap add","camsnap discover","camsnap snap","camsnap clip"],"es":["Configuración de cámaras","Captura de instantáneas","Grabación de clips","Detección de movimiento","Comandos personalizables"],"fr":["Configuration de caméras","Capture d''instantanés","Enregistrement de clips","Détection de mouvement","Commandes personnalisables"],"de":["Konfiguration von Kameras","Erfassung von Momentaufnahmen","Aufnahme von Clips","Bewegungserkennung","Anpassbare Befehle"],"pt":["Captura de imagens de câmeras","Gravação de vídeos de câmeras","Monitoramento de movimento","Configuração de câmeras via arquivo YAML","Comandos para descobrir e capturar conteúdo"],"ru":["Захват изображений с камер","Запись видео с камер","Мониторинг движения","Настройка камер через файл YAML","Команды для обнаружения и захвата контента"],"ar":["التقاط الصور من الكاميرات","تسجيل الفيديو من الكاميرات","مراقبة الحركة","إعداد الكاميرات عبر ملف YAML","أوامر للكشف والتقاط المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["camsnap","IP","config.yaml","camsnap add","camsnap discover","camsnap snap","camsnap clip","camsnap watch"],"ja":["camsnap","IP","config.yaml","camsnap add","camsnap discover","camsnap snap","camsnap clip","camsnap watch"],"ko":["camsnap","IP","config.yaml","camsnap add","camsnap discover","camsnap snap","camsnap clip","camsnap watch"],"es":["camsnap","captura de momentos","configuración de cámaras","detección de movimiento","comandos personalizables","herramienta de código abierto"],"fr":["camsnap","capture de moments","configuration de caméras","détection de mouvement","commandes personnalisables","outil open source"],"de":["camsnap","Erfassung von Momenten","Konfiguration von Kameras","Bewegungserkennung","anpassbare Befehle","Open-Source-Tool"],"pt":["camsnap","captura de imagens","gravação de vídeos","monitoramento de movimento","configuração de câmeras","comandos de linha","ferramenta de captura","software de vigilância"],"ru":["camsnap","захват изображений","запись видео","мониторинг движения","настройка камер","команды строки","инструмент захвата","программное обеспечение для видеонаблюдения"],"ar":["camsnap","التقاط الصور","تسجيل الفيديو","مراقبة الحركة","إعداد الكاميرات","أوامر السطر","أداة التقاط","برنامج المراقبة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"camsnap","description":"Capture frames or clips from RTSP/ONVIF cameras.","bodyPreview":"# camsnap\n\nUse `camsnap` to grab snapshots, clips, or motion events from configured cameras.\n\nSetup\n- Config file: `~/.config/camsnap/config.yaml`\n- Add camera: `camsnap add --name kitchen --host 192.168.0.10 --user user --pass pass`\n\nCommon commands\n- Discover: `camsnap discover --info`\n- Snapshot: `camsnap snap kitchen --out shot.jpg`\n- Clip: `camsnap clip kitchen --dur 5s --out clip.mp4`\n- Motion watch: `camsnap watch kitchen --threshold 0.2 --action ''...''`\n- Doctor: `camsnap doctor --probe`","body":"# camsnap\n\nUse `camsnap` to grab snapshots, clips, or motion events from configured cameras.\n\nSetup\n- Config file: `~/.config/camsnap/config.yaml`\n- Add camera: `camsnap add --name kitchen --host 192.168.0.10 --user user --pass pass`\n\nCommon commands\n- Discover: `camsnap discover --info`\n- Snapshot: `camsnap snap kitchen --out shot.jpg`\n- Clip: `camsnap clip kitchen --dur 5s --out clip.mp4`\n- Motion watch: `camsnap watch kitchen --threshold 0.2 --action ''...''`\n- Doctor: `camsnap doctor --probe`\n\nNotes\n- Requires `ffmpeg` on PATH.\n- Prefer a short test capture before longer clips.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:11:44.655Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Surveillance Agents needing automated camera snapshot and video clip capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动拍照和视频剪辑功能的监视代理。","ja":"自動カメラスナップショットおよびビデオクリップ機能を必要とする監視エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동 카메라 스냅샷 및 비디오 클립 기능이 필요한 감시 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Vigilancia que necesitan capacidades automatizadas de instantánea de cámara y clip de video.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Surveillance ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de capture automatique d''images et de clips vidéo.","de":"Perfekt für Überwachungsagenten, die automatisierte Kamerainsätzen- und Videoclips-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Vigilância que necessitam de capacidades de snapshot de câmera e clipe de vídeo automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов видеонаблюдения, которым необходимы автоматические возможности съемки фотографий и видеороликов с камер.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات المراقبة التي تحتاج إلى قدرات撮影 كاميرا وملف فيديو آلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture snapshots, clips, or motion events from configured cameras using YAML config files and command-line interfaces, supporting features like discovery, snapshotting, and motion detection with threshold settings.","zh":"使代理能够使用YAML配置文件和命令行接口捕获配置的摄像机的快照、剪辑或运动事件，支持发现、快照和运动检测等功能，并具有阈值设置。","ja":"YAML設定ファイルとコマンドラインインターフェイスを使用して、エージェントが設定されたカメラからのスナップショット、クリップ、またはモーションイベントをキャプチャできるようにし、検出、スナップショット、モーション検出などの機能と閾値設定をサポートします。","ko":"YAML 구성 파일과 명령줄 인터페이스를 사용하여 에이전트가 설정된 카메라의 스냅샷, 클립 또는 모션 이벤트를 캡처할 수 있도록 하며, 검색, 스냅샷 및 모션 감지와 같은 기능과 임계값 설정을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar instantáneas, clips o eventos de movimiento desde cámaras configuradas utilizando archivos de configuración YAML y interfaces de línea de comandos, con características como detección, captura de instantáneas y detección de movimiento con ajustes de umbral.","fr":"Équipe les agents pour capturer des instantanés, des clips ou des événements de mouvement à partir de caméras configurées en utilisant des fichiers de configuration YAML et des interfaces de ligne de commande, prenant en charge des fonctionnalités telles que la découverte, la capture d''instantanés et la détection de mouvement avec des paramètres de seuil.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Snapshot, Clips oder Bewegungsergebnisse von konfigurierten Kameras mithilfe von YAML-Konfigurationsdateien und Befehlszeilen-Schnittstellen zu erfassen, mit Funktionen wie Erkennung, Momentaufnahme und Bewegungserkennung mit Schwellenwert-Einstellungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar fotografias, clipes ou eventos de movimento de câmeras configuradas usando arquivos de configuração YAML e interfaces de linha de comando, com recursos como descoberta, captura de instantâneos e detecção de movimento com configurações de limiar.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватывать фотографии, клипы или события движения с настроенных камер, используя файлы конфигурации YAML и командные интерфейсы, поддерживая функции, такие как обнаружение, создание снимков и обнаружение движения с настройками порога.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التقاط الصور أو مقاطع الفيديو أو أحداث الحركة من الكاميرات المكوّنة باستخدام ملفات YAML وتواجه واجهة سطر الأوامر، مع ميزات مثل الكشف والتصوير الفوتوغرافي والكشف عن الحركة مع إعدادات العتبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Capturing periodic snapshots from IP cameras","Recording video clips with specified durations","Monitoring motion events with customizable threshold settings"],"zh":["从IP摄像机捕获周期性快照","录制指定时长的视频剪辑","监测具有可自定义阈值设置的运动事件"],"ja":["IPカメラからの周期的なスナップショットのキャプチャ","指定された時間のビデオクリップの録画","カスタマイズ可能な閾値設定を持つモーションイベントの監視"],"ko":["IP 카메라에서 주기적인 스냅샷을 캡처","지정된 기간의 비디오 클립을 녹화","사용자 지정 가능한 임계값 설정을 가진 모션 이벤트를 모니터링"],"es":["Capturar instantáneas periódicas desde cámaras IP","Grabar clips de video con duraciones especificadas","Supervisar eventos de movimiento con ajustes de umbral personalizables"],"fr":["Capturer des instantanés périodiques à partir de caméras IP","Enregistrer des clips vidéo avec des durées spécifiées","Surveiller les événements de mouvement avec des paramètres de seuil personnalisables"],"de":["Periodische Momentaufnahmen von IP-Kameras erfassen","Video-Clips mit angegebenen Dauern aufzeichnen","Bewegungsergebnisse mit anpassbaren Schwellenwert-Einstellungen überwachen"],"pt":["Capturar fotografias periódicas de câmeras IP","Gravar clipes de vídeo com durações especificadas","Monitorar eventos de movimento com configurações de limiar personalizadas"],"ru":["Получать периодические снимки с IP-камер","Записывать видеоклипы с указанными продолжительностями","Отслеживать события движения с настраиваемыми пороговыми настройками"],"ar":["التقاط صور دورية من كاميرات IP","تسجيل مقاطع فيديو بأطوال محددة","مراقبة أحداث الحركة مع إعدادات عتبات قابلة للتعديل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires camera configuration via YAML file","Needs network access to camera hosts","Dependent on camera device compatibility"],"zh":["需要通过YAML文件配置摄像机","需要访问摄像机主机的网络","依赖于摄像机设备的兼容性"],"ja":["YAMLファイルを使用したカメラの設定が必要","カメラホストへのネットワークアクセスが必要","カメラデバイスの互換性に依存"],"ko":["YAML 파일을 사용한 카메라 구성이 필요","카메라 호스트에 대한 네트워크 액세스가 필요","카메라 장치의 호환성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere configuración de cámara a través de archivo YAML","Necesita acceso a la red a los hosts de cámara","Dependiente de la compatibilidad del dispositivo de cámara"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de caméra via un fichier YAML","A besoin d''un accès réseau aux hôtes de caméra","Dépend de la compatibilité de l''appareil de caméra"],"de":["Benötigt Kamerakonfiguration über YAML-Datei","Benötigt Netzwerkzugriff auf Kamerahosts","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität des Kamerageräts"],"pt":["Requer configuração de câmera via arquivo YAML","Necessita de acesso à rede para hospedar câmeras","Depende da compatibilidade do dispositivo de câmera"],"ru":["Требует настройки камеры через файл YAML","Требует доступа к сети для хостинга камер","Зависит от совместимости устройства камеры"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين الكاميرا عبر ملف YAML","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى الشبكة لاستضافة الكاميرات","يعتمد على توافق جهاز الكاميرا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry/canva-automation', 'community', 'mshraditya', 'SkillsForAgentRegistry', 'mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry', 'canva-automation', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:12:12.411Z', NULL, '{"id":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry/canva-automation","name":"canva-automation","description":{"zh":"Canva自动化是通过Rube MCP实现的Composio Canva工具包，用于优化设计操作","ja":"Canva自動化は、Rube MCPを通じて実現されるComposioのCanvaツールキットであり、デザイン操作の最適化に使用されます","ko":"Canva 자동화는 Rube MCP를 통해 구현되는 Composio의 Canva 도구 키트로 디자인 운영을 최적화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La automatización de Canva con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores ahorrar tiempo y aumentar la eficiencia. Conecta y configura la herramienta para empezar.","fr":"L''automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de gagner du temps et d''augmenter l''efficacité. Connectez et configurez l''outil pour commencer.","de":"Die Automatisierung von Canva mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Zeit zu sparen und die Effizienz zu steigern. Verbinden und konfigurieren Sie das Tool, um zu beginnen.","pt":"Automatize operações de design do Canva com a ferramenta Composio via Rube MCP. Configure agora e aumente a produtividade.","ru":"Автоматизируйте операции по дизайну Canva с помощью инструмента Composio через Rube MCP. Настройте сейчас и увеличьте производительность.","ar":"آلة تلوين عمليات تصميم كانفا باستخدام أداة كومبوسيو عبر روب إم سي بي. قم بالتهيئة الآن وزيادة الإنتاجية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Canva自动化 - 通过Rube MCP优化设计操作","ja":"Canva自動化 - Rube MCPによるデザイン操作の最適化","ko":"Canva 자동화 - Rube MCP를 통한 디자인 운영 최적화","es":"Automatización de Canva con Rube MCP","fr":"Automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP","de":"Canva-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP","pt":"Automatize Canva com Rube MCP","ru":"Автоматизация Canva с Rube MCP","ar":"آلة تلوين تلقائية مع Rube MCP","en":"canva-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Canva自动化是通过Rube MCP实现的Composio Canva工具包，用于优化设计操作","ja":"Canva自動化は、Rube MCPを通じて実現されるComposioのCanvaツールキットであり、デザイン操作の最適化に使用されます","ko":"Canva 자동화는 Rube MCP를 통해 구현되는 Composio의 Canva 도구 키트로 디자인 운영을 최적화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"La automatización de Canva con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores ahorrar tiempo y aumentar la eficiencia. Conecta y configura la herramienta para empezar.","fr":"L''automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de gagner du temps et d''augmenter l''efficacité. Connectez et configurez l''outil pour commencer.","de":"Die Automatisierung von Canva mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Zeit zu sparen und die Effizienz zu steigern. Verbinden und konfigurieren Sie das Tool,...","pt":"Automatize operações de design do Canva com a ferramenta Composio via Rube MCP. Configure agora e aumente a produtividade.","ru":"Автоматизируйте операции по дизайну Canva с помощью инструмента Composio через Rube MCP. Настройте сейчас и увеличьте производительность.","ar":"آلة تلوين عمليات تصميم كانفا باستخدام أداة كومبوسيو عبر روب إم سي بي. قم بالتهيئة الآن وزيادة الإنتاجية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["通过Rube MCP连接实现自动化","支持Composio的Canva工具包","无需API密钥即可使用","轻松设置和配置","提高设计操作的效率和生产力"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続による自動化の実現","ComposioのCanvaツールキットのサポート","APIキー不要","簡単な設定と構成","デザイン操作の効率と生産性の向上"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결을 통한 자동화 구현","Composio의 Canva 도구 키트 지원","API 키 필요 없음","간단한 설정 및 구성","디자인 운영의 효율성과 생산성 향상"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP","Automatización de operaciones de diseño de Canva","Uso de la herramienta de Canva de Composio","Configuración sencilla sin necesidad de claves API","Compatibilidad con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP","Automatisation des opérations de conception de Canva","Utilisation de l''outil de Canva de Composio","Configuration simple sans nécessité de clés API","Compatibilité avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Verbindung zu Rube MCP","Automatisierung von Canva-Designoperationen","Verwendung des Canva-Tools von Composio","Einfache Konfiguration ohne API-Schlüssel","Kompatibilität mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatize operações de design do Canva","Integração com Rube MCP","Ferramenta Composio para automação","Configuração simples e rápida","Aumente a produtividade"],"ru":["Автоматизируйте операции по дизайну Canva","Интеграция с Rube MCP","Инструмент Composio для автоматизации","Простая и быстрая настройка","Увеличьте производительность"],"ar":["آلة تلوين عمليات تصميم كانفا","التكامل مع روب إم سي بي","أداة كومبوسيو لتلقين","التهيئة البسيطة والسريعة","زيادة الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Canva自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva工具包","设计操作自动化","效率优化","生产力提高"],"ja":["Canva自動化","Rube MCP","Composio","Canvaツールキット","デザイン操作自動化","効率最適化","生産性向上"],"ko":["Canva 자동화","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva 도구 키트","디자인 운영 자동화","효율성 최적화","생산성 향상"],"es":["automatización de Canva","Rube MCP","herramienta de Canva","Composio","desarrollo de software","automatización de diseño","eficiencia en el diseño","herramientas de diseño automático"],"fr":["automatisation de Canva","Rube MCP","outil de Canva","Composio","développement de logiciels","automatisation de la conception","efficacité dans la conception","outils de conception automatique"],"de":["Canva-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Canva-Tool","Composio","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung von Design","Effizienz im Design","Tools für automatisches Design"],"pt":["Canva Automation","Rube MCP","Composio","Automação de design","Produtividade","Ferramentas de automação"],"ru":["Автоматизация Canva","Rube MCP","Composio","Автоматизация дизайна","Производительность","Инструменты автоматизации"],"ar":["آلة تلوين كانفا","روب إم سي بي","كومبوسيو","تلقين تصميم","الإنتاجية","أدوات تلقين"]}},"owner":"mshraditya","repo":"SkillsForAgentRegistry","repoPath":"mshraditya/SkillsForAgentRegistry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canva-automation","description":"Automate Canva tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): designs, exports, folders, brand templates, autofill. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1.","body":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Canva OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Browse Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find existing designs or browse their Canva library\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - List all designs with optional filters [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `query`: Search term to filter designs by name\n- `continuation`: Pagination token from previous response\n- `ownership`: Filter by ''owned'', ''shared'', or ''any''\n- `sort_by`: Sort field (e.g., ''modified_at'', ''title'')\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Results are paginated; follow `continuation` token until absent\n- Deleted designs may still appear briefly; check design status\n- Search is substring-based, not fuzzy matching\n\n### 2. Create and Design\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a new Canva design from scratch or from a template\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - Browse available brand templates [Optional]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET` - Create a new design [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_type`: Type of design (e.g., ''Presentation'', ''Poster'', ''SocialMedia'')\n- `title`: Name for the new design\n- `asset_id`: Optional asset to include in the design\n- `width` / `height`: Custom dimensions in pixels\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Design type must match Canva''s predefined types exactly\n- Custom dimensions have minimum and maximum limits\n- Asset must be uploaded first via CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB before referencing\n\n### 3. Upload Assets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to upload images or files to Canva for use in designs\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB` - Initiate the asset upload [Required]\n2. `CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS` - Poll until upload completes [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Display name for the asset\n- `url`: Public URL of the file to upload (for URL-based uploads)\n- `job_id`: Upload job ID returned from step 1 (for status polling)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Upload is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job status until it completes\n- Supported formats include PNG, JPG, SVG, MP4, GIF\n- File size limits apply; large files may take longer to process\n- The `job_id` from CREATE returns the ID needed for status polling\n- Status values: ''in_progress'', ''success'', ''failed''\n\n### 4. Export Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to download or export a Canva design as PDF, PNG, or other format\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - Find the design to export [Prerequisite]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB` - Start the export process [Required]\n3. `CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT` - Poll until export completes and get download URL [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_id`: ID of the design to export\n- `format`: Export format (''pdf'', ''png'', ''jpg'', ''svg'', ''mp4'', ''gif'', ''pptx'')\n- `pages`: Specific page numbers to export (array)\n- `quality`: Export quality (''regular'', ''high'')\n- `job_id`: Export job ID for polling status\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Export is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job result until it completes\n- Download URLs from completed exports expire after a limited time\n- Large designs with many pages take longer to export\n- Not all formats support all design types (e.g., MP4 only for animations)\n- Poll interval: wait 2-3 seconds between status checks\n\n### 5. Organize with Folders\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create folders or organize designs into folders\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_POST_FOLDERS` - Create a new folder [Required]\n2. `CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER` - Move designs into folders [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Folder name\n- `parent_folder_id`: Parent folder for nested organization\n- `item_id`: ID of the design or asset to move\n- `folder_id`: Target folder ID\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Folder names must be unique within the same parent folder\n- Moving items between folders updates their location immediately\n- Root-level folders have no parent_folder_id\n\n### 6. Autofill from Brand Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate designs by filling brand template placeholders with data\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - List available brand templates [Required]\n2. `CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB` - Start autofill with data [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `brand_template_id`: ID of the brand template to use\n- `title`: Title for the generated design\n- `data`: Key-value mapping of placeholder names to replacement values\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Template placeholders must match exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Autofill is asynchronous; poll for completion\n- Only brand templates support autofill, not regular designs\n- Data values must match the expected type for each placeholder (text, image URL)\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Async Job Pattern\n\nMany Canva operations are asynchronous:\n```\n1. Initiate job (upload, export, autofill) -> get job_id\n2. Poll status endpoint with job_id every 2-3 seconds\n3. Check for ''success'' or ''failed'' status\n4. On success, extract result (asset_id, download_url, design_id)\n```\n\n### ID Resolution\n\n**Design name -> Design ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS with query=design_name\n2. Find matching design in results\n3. Extract id field\n```\n\n**Brand template name -> Template ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST\n2. Find template by name\n3. Extract brand_template_id\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Check response for `continuation` token\n- Pass token in next request''s `continuation` parameter\n- Continue until `continuation` is absent or empty\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Async Operations**:\n- Uploads, exports, and autofills are all asynchronous\n- Always poll job status; do not assume immediate completion\n- Download URLs from exports expire; use them promptly\n\n**Asset Management**:\n- Assets must be uploaded before they can be used in designs\n- Upload job must reach ''success'' status before the asset_id is valid\n- Supported formats vary; check Canva documentation for current limits\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Canva API has rate limits per endpoint\n- Implement exponential backoff for bulk operations\n- Batch operations where possible to reduce API calls\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` key\n- Job status responses include different fields based on completion state\n- Parse defensively with fallbacks for optional fields\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List designs | CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS | query, continuation |\n| Create design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET | design_type, title |\n| Upload asset | CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB | name, url |\n| Check upload | CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS | job_id |\n| Export design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB | design_id, format |\n| Get export | CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT | job_id |\n| Create folder | CANVA_POST_FOLDERS | name, parent_folder_id |\n| Move to folder | CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER | item_id, folder_id |\n| List templates | CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST | (none) |\n| Autofill template | CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB | brand_template_id, data |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:12:12.411Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Design Agents needing automated graphic design capabilities via Canva integration.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Canva集成实现自动化图形设计功能的视觉设计代理。","ja":"Canvaの統合を介して自動化されたグラフィックデザイン機能を必要とするビジュアルデザインエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Canva 통합을 통해 자동화된 그래픽 디자인 기능을 필요로 하는 시각적 디자인 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de diseño visual que necesitan capacidades de diseño gráfico automatizado a través de la integración de Canva.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception visuelle ayant besoin de capacités de conception graphique automatisées via l''intégration de Canva.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Design-Agenten, die automatisierte Grafikdesign-Funktionen über die Canva-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design Visual que precisam de capacidades de design gráfico automatizadas via integração com o Canva.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуального дизайна, которым необходимы автоматические возможности графического дизайна через интеграцию с Canva.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التصميم المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تصميم رسومات أوتوماتيكية من خلال التكامل مع Canva."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and enabling features like automated content preview and design workflow optimization.","zh":"通过Composio的Canva工具包和Rube MCP实现对Canva设计操作的自动化，利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS实现无缝集成，并启用自动内容预览和设计工作流优化等功能。","ja":"ComposioのCanvaツールキットとRube MCPを通じて、Canvaのデザイン操作の自動化を可能にし、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを利用してシームレスな統合を実現し、自動コンテンツプレビューやデザインワークフローの最適化などの機能を有効にします。","ko":"Composio의 Canva 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 통해 Canva 디자인 작업의 자동화를 가능하게 하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 无缝な 통합을 구현하고 자동 콘텐츠 미리 보기 및 디자인 워크플로우 최적화 등의 기능을 활성화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de diseño de Canva a través de la herramienta de Canva de Composio a través de Rube MCP, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una integración perfecta, y habilitando características como la previsualización automática de contenido y la optimización del flujo de trabajo de diseño.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de conception de Canva via le kit de outils Canva de Composio via Rube MCP, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une intégration transparente, et en activant des fonctionnalités telles que la prévisualisation automatique de contenu et l''optimisation du flux de travail de conception.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Canva-Designoperationen über Composios Canva-Toolkit via Rube MCP zu automatisieren, indem RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden, und Funktionen wie automatische Inhaltsvorschau und Design-Workflows-Optimierung aktivieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de design do Canva por meio da ferramenta do Canva da Composio via Rube MCP, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para integração sem problemas, e habilitando recursos como pré-visualização de conteúdo automatizada e otimização do fluxo de trabalho de design.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции дизайна Canva через набор инструментов Canva от Composio посредством Rube MCP, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для бесперебойной интеграции, и обеспечивающий функции, такие как автоматическое предварительное просмотр содержания и оптимизация рабочего процесса дизайна.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على توفير عمليات تصميم Canva أوتوماتيكيا من خلال مجموعة أدوات Canva من Composio عبر Rube MCP، باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل التكامل السلس، وتتمكن من الميزات مثل معاينة المحتوى الأوتوماتيكية وتحسين تدفق عمل التصميم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Canva design workflows","Generating visual content previews","Streamlining design operations via Rube MCP"],"zh":["自动化Canva设计工作流程","生成视觉内容预览","通过Rube MCP简化设计操作"],"ja":["Canvaデザインワークフローの自動化","ビジュアルコンテンツプレビューの生成","Rube MCPを通じたデザイン操作の合理化"],"ko":["Canva 디자인 워크플로우 자동화","시각적 콘텐츠 미리 보기 생성","Rube MCP를 통해 디자인 작업의 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de diseño de Canva","Generar vistas previas de contenido visual","Optimizar operaciones de diseño a través de Rube MCP"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de conception de Canva","Générer des aperçus de contenu visuel","Optimiser les opérations de conception via Rube MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung von Canva-Design-Workflows","Generierung von Vorschauen für visuellen Inhalt","Optimierung von Designoperationen über Rube MCP"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de design do Canva","Gerar pré-visualizações de conteúdo visual","Otimizar operações de design via Rube MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов дизайна Canva","Генерация предварительных просмотров визуального контента","Оптимизация операций дизайна через Rube MCP"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل تصميم Canva","генерация معاينات المحتوى المرئي","تحسين عمليات التصميم من خلال Rube MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Canva connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Canva连接","必须首先调用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS以获取当前工具架构"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続の必要性","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを通じたCanva接続の必要性","現在のツールスキーマを取得するためにRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを最初に呼び出す必要"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 Canva 연결이 필요","현재 도구 스키마를 가져오기 위해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 먼저 호출해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP","Conexión activa de Canva a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS debe llamarse primero para obtener los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion active Canva via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS doit être appelé en premier pour obtenir les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Canva-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS muss zuerst aufgerufen werden, um die aktuellen Toolschemas zu erhalten"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa do Canva via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS deve ser chamado primeiro para obter esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требуется соединение Rube MCP","Активное подключение к Canva через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS необходимо","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS должно быть вызвано первым, чтобы получить текущие схемы инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال Rube MCP","يتطلب الاتصال النشط إلى Canva من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","يجب استدعاء RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS أولاً للحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
