","Vérification des comportements d''interface utilisateur","Débogage des problèmes d''applications web","Capture d''écrans pour documentation ou débogage","Inspection des journaux de console du navigateur","Validation des soumissions de formulaires et des flux d''utilisateur"],"de":["Frontend-Funktionalitätstests in einem echten Browser","Überprüfung von Benutzeroberflächenverhaltensweisen","Debuggen von Webanwendungsproblemen","Bildschirmfotos für Dokumentation oder Debuggen","Überprüfung von Browser-Konsolenprotokollen","Validierung von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen"],"pt":["Testar funcionalidade frontend em um navegador real","Verificar comportamento de UI e interações","Depurar problemas de aplicativos web","Capturar telas para documentação ou depuração","Inspecionar logs do console do navegador"],"ru":["Тестировать функциональность frontend в реальном браузере","Проверять поведение UI и взаимодействия","Отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений","Сделать скриншоты для документации или отладки","Просмотреть журналы консоли браузера"],"ar":["اختبار الوظائف الأمامية في متصفح حقيقي","التحقق من سلوك واجهة المستخدم و التفاعلات","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب","التقاط شاشات لتوثيق أو تصحيح","فحص سجلات وحدة التحكم في المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web应用测试","Playwright自动化","前端功能测试","UI行为验证","Web应用调试","截图捕获","浏览器控制台日志"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","Playwright自動化","フロントエンド機能テスト","UIの動作検証","Webアプリケーションデバッグ","スクリーンショットキャプチャ","ブラウザコンソールログ"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 테스트","Playwright 자동화","프론트엔드 기능 테스트","UI 동작 검증","웹 애플리케이션 디버깅","스크린샷 캡처","브라우저 콘솔 로그"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","playwright","automatización de pruebas","depuración de aplicaciones web","pruebas de interfaz de usuario","pruebas de funcionalidad frontend","validación de formularios","pruebas de diseño responsivo"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","playwright","automatisation de tests","débogage d''applications web","tests d''interface utilisateur","tests de fonctionnalité frontend","validation de formulaires","tests de conception responsivo"],"de":["webanwendungstests","playwright","automatisierung von tests","debuggen von webanwendungen","benutzeroberflächentests","frontend-funktionalitätstests","validierung von formulareingaben","tests von responsivem design"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","playwright automation","desenvolvimento web","teste de frontend","depuração de aplicativos web","qualidade de código"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","playwright automation","веб-разработка","тестирование frontend","отладка веб-приложений","качество кода"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","playwright automation","تطوير الويب","اختبار الواجهة الأمامية","تصحيح تطبيقات الويب","جودة الكود"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisit","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js installed on the system\n- A locally running web application (or accessible URL)\n- Playwright will be installed automatically if not present\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Browser Automation\n- Navigate to URLs\n- Click buttons and links\n- Fill form fields\n- Select dropdowns\n- Handle dialogs and alerts\n\n### 2. Verification\n- Assert element presence\n- Verify text content\n- Check element visibility\n- Validate URLs\n- Test responsive behavior\n\n### 3. Debugging\n- Capture screenshots\n- View console logs\n- Inspect network requests\n- Debug failed tests\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Example 1: Basic Navigation Test\n```javascript\n// Navigate to a page and verify title\nawait page.goto(''http://localhost:3000'');\nconst title = await page.title();\nconsole.log(''Page title:'', title);\n```\n\n### Example 2: Form Interaction\n```javascript\n// Fill out and submit a form\nawait page.fill(''#username'', ''testuser'');\nawait page.fill(''#password'', ''password123'');\nawait page.click(''button[type=\"submit\"]'');\nawait page.waitForURL(''**/dashboard'');\n```\n\n### Example 3: Screenshot Capture\n```javascript\n// Capture a screenshot for debugging\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''debug.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Always verify the app is running** - Check that the local server is accessible before running tests\n2. **Use explicit waits** - Wait for elements or navigation to complete before interacting\n3. **Capture screenshots on failure** - Take screenshots to help debug issues\n4. **Clean up resources** - Always close the browser when done\n5. **Handle timeouts gracefully** - Set reasonable timeouts for slow operations\n6. **Test incrementally** - Start with simple interactions before complex flows\n7. **Use selectors wisely** - Prefer data-testid or role-based selectors over CSS classes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: Wait for Element\n```javascript\nawait page.waitForSelector(''#element-id'', { state: ''visible'' });\n```\n\n### Pattern: Check if Element Exists\n```javascript\nconst exists = await page.locator(''#element-id'').count() > 0;\n```\n\n### Pattern: Get Console Logs\n```javascript\npage.on(''console'', msg => console.log(''Browser log:'', msg.text()));\n```\n\n### Pattern: Handle Errors\n```javascript\ntry {\n  await page.click(''#button'');\n} catch (error) {\n  await page.screenshot({ path: ''error.png'' });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Requires Node.js environment\n- Cannot test native mobile apps (use React Native Testing Library instead)\n- May have issues with complex authentication flows\n- Some modern frameworks may require specific configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:11:58.745Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing comprehensive web application testing and debugging capabilities using Playwright automation.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Playwright自动化进行全面Web应用程序测试和调试功能的前端代理。","ja":"Playwright自動化を使用して包括的なWebアプリケーションテストとデバッグ機能が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Playwright 자동화를 사용하여 포괄적인 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de prueba y depuración de aplicaciones web integrales utilizando la automatización de Playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de test et de débogage d''applications web complètes utilisant l''automatisation Playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die umfassende Webanwendungstest- und Debugging-Fähigkeiten unter Verwendung der Playwright-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades abrangentes de teste e depuração de aplicativos web usando automação Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности тестирования и отладки веб-приложений с помощью автоматизации Playwright.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات شاملة لاختبار وتحسين تطبيقات الويب باستخدام أتمتة Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate frontend functionality testing, verify UI behavior, and debug web application issues using real browser interactions, inspecting browser console logs, and validating form submissions via Playwright.","zh":"赋予代理自动化前端功能测试、验证UI行为、使用Playwright进行实际浏览器交互、检查浏览器控制台日志并验证表单提交的能力。","ja":"フロントエンドの機能テストの自動化、UIの動作の検証、Playwrightを使用した実際のブラウザとのやり取り、ブラウザのコンソールログの検査、フォーム送信の検証などの機能をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright를 사용하여 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하고, UI 동작을 검증하고, 실제 브라우저 상호작용, 브라우저 콘솔 로그 검사 및 양식 제출 확인 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la prueba de funcionalidad frontend, verificar el comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y depurar problemas de aplicaciones web utilizando interacciones de navegador reales, inspeccionando registros de la consola del navegador y validando envíos de formularios a través de Playwright.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité frontend, de vérifier le comportement de l''interface utilisateur et de déboguer les problèmes d''applications web en utilisant des interactions de navigateur réelles, en inspectant les journaux de la console du navigateur et en validant les soumissions de formulaires via Playwright.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Funktionalitätstests von Frontend zu automatisieren, das Verhalten der Benutzeroberfläche zu überprüfen und Webanwendungsprobleme unter Verwendung von echten Browserinteraktionen, indem sie Browserkonsolenprotokolle untersuchen und Formulareingaben über Playwright validieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend, verificar o comportamento da interface do usuário e depurar problemas de aplicativos web usando interações de navegador reais, inspecionando logs de console do navegador e validando envios de formulário via Playwright.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование функциональности frontend, проверять поведение пользовательского интерфейса и отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений с помощью реальных взаимодействий браузера, осматривая журналы консоли браузера и проверяя отправку форм с помощью Playwright.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة اختبار وظائف الواجهة الأمامية، والتحقق من سلوك واجهة المستخدم، وتصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب باستخدام تفاعلات المتصفح الحقيقي، وفحص سجلات جهاز المتصفح، والتحقق من إرسال النماذج عبر Playwright."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend functionality testing in real browsers","Debugging web application issues and capturing screenshots for documentation","Validating responsive design across various viewports and user flows"],"zh":["在实际浏览器中自动化前端功能测试","调试Web应用程序问题并捕获屏幕截图用于文档记录","在各种视口和用户流中验证响应式设计"],"ja":["実際のブラウザでフロントエンドの機能テストを自動化する","Webアプリケーションの問題をデバッグし、ドキュメント作成用にスクリーンショットをキャプチャする","様々なビューポートやユーザーフローでレスポンシブデザインを検証する"],"ko":["실제 브라우저에서 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하는 것","웹 애플리케이션 문제를 디버깅하고 문서 작성용 스크린샷을 캡처하는 것","다양한 뷰포트 및 사용자 흐름에서 반응형 디자인을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la prueba de funcionalidad frontend en navegadores reales","Depuración de problemas de aplicaciones web y captura de pantallas para documentación","Validación de diseño responsivo en varios puntos de vista y flujos de usuario"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de fonctionnalité frontend dans des navigateurs réels","Débogage des problèmes d''applications web et capture d''écrans pour documentation","Validation de la conception réactive sur différents points de vue et flux d''utilisateurs"],"de":["Automatisierung von Frontend-Funktionalitätstests in echten Browsern","Fehlerbehebung bei Webanwendungsproblemen und Erfassung von Screenshots für Dokumentation","Validierung von responsivem Design bei verschiedenen Blickwinkeln und Benutzerflüssen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend em navegadores reais","Depurar problemas de aplicativos web e capturar telas para documentação","Validar design responsivo em diferentes pontos de vista e fluxos de usuário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование функциональности frontend в реальных браузерах","Отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений и захватывать скриншоты для документации","Проверять адаптивный дизайн на различных видах и потоках пользователей"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار وظائف الواجهة الأمامية في المتصفحات الحقيقية","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب والتقاط لقطات للوثائق","التحقق من تصميم متجاوب عبر مختلف النقاط والتدفقات المستخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright automation setup","Limited to local web applications"],"zh":["需要Playwright自动化设置","仅限本地Web应用程序"],"ja":["Playwright自動化の設定が必要","ローカルのWebアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Playwright 자동화 설정이 필요함","로컬 웹 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de automatización de Playwright","Limitado a aplicaciones web locales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''automatisation Playwright","Limité aux applications web locales"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Automatisierungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Exige configuração de automação Playwright","Limitado a aplicativos web locais"],"ru":["Требует настройки автоматизации Playwright","Ограничен локальными веб-приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد أتمتة Playwright","محدود بتطبيقات الويب المحلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
