anva","Utilisation de l''outil Composio pour simplifier le flux de travail","Nécessite pas de clés d''API pour la connexion","Configuration facile et rapide"],"de":["Einfache Verbindung mit Rube MCP","Automatisierung von Designoperationen in Canva","Verwendung des Composio-Tools zur Vereinfachung des Arbeitsablaufs","Benötigt keine API-Schlüssel für die Verbindung","Einfache und schnelle Konfiguration"],"pt":["Automatize operações de design do Canva","Conexão com o Rube MCP","Uso do toolkit de Canva da Composio","Nenhuma chave de API necessária","Configuração fácil do Rube MCP","Otimização de processos de design"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций дизайна Canva","Соединение с Rube MCP","Использование инструмента Canva от Composio","Нет необходимости в ключе API","Простая настройка Rube MCP","Оптимизация процессов дизайна"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات تصميم كانفا","الارتباط بروبي إم سي بي","استخدام أداة كانفا من كومبوسيو","لا حاجة لمفتاح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إعداد روبي إم سي بي بسهولة","تحسين عمليات التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Canva 自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva 设计操作","自动化工具","设计操作效率","生产力提高","MCP 服务器"],"ja":["Canva オートメーション","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva デザイン操作","自動化ツール","デザイン操作効率","生産性向上","MCP サーバー"],"ko":["Canva 자동화","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva 디자인 운영","자동화 툴","디자인 운영 효율","생산성 향상","MCP 서버"],"es":["automatización de Canva","Rube MCP","herramienta de Composio","diseño automático","conexión a Canva","desarrollo de software","automatización de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["automatisation de Canva","Rube MCP","outil Composio","conception automatique","connexion à Canva","développement de logiciels","automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["Automatisierung von Canva","Rube MCP","Composio-Tool","automatisches Design","Verbindung zu Canva","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["Canva Automation","Rube MCP","Composio","Automatização de design","Otimização de processos","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de design","Integração de API"],"ru":["Автоматизация Canva","Rube MCP","Composio","Автоматизация дизайна","Оптимизация процессов","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты дизайна","Интеграция API"],"ar":["أتمتة كانفا","روبي إم سي بي","كومبوسيو","أتمتة التصميم","تحسين العمليات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التصميم","دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canva-automation","description":"Automate Canva tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): designs, exports, folders, brand templates, autofill. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1.","body":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Canva OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Browse Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find existing designs or browse their Canva library\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - List all designs with optional filters [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `query`: Search term to filter designs by name\n- `continuation`: Pagination token from previous response\n- `ownership`: Filter by ''owned'', ''shared'', or ''any''\n- `sort_by`: Sort field (e.g., ''modified_at'', ''title'')\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Results are paginated; follow `continuation` token until absent\n- Deleted designs may still appear briefly; check design status\n- Search is substring-based, not fuzzy matching\n\n### 2. Create and Design\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a new Canva design from scratch or from a template\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - Browse available brand templates [Optional]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET` - Create a new design [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_type`: Type of design (e.g., ''Presentation'', ''Poster'', ''SocialMedia'')\n- `title`: Name for the new design\n- `asset_id`: Optional asset to include in the design\n- `width` / `height`: Custom dimensions in pixels\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Design type must match Canva''s predefined types exactly\n- Custom dimensions have minimum and maximum limits\n- Asset must be uploaded first via CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB before referencing\n\n### 3. Upload Assets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to upload images or files to Canva for use in designs\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB` - Initiate the asset upload [Required]\n2. `CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS` - Poll until upload completes [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Display name for the asset\n- `url`: Public URL of the file to upload (for URL-based uploads)\n- `job_id`: Upload job ID returned from step 1 (for status polling)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Upload is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job status until it completes\n- Supported formats include PNG, JPG, SVG, MP4, GIF\n- File size limits apply; large files may take longer to process\n- The `job_id` from CREATE returns the ID needed for status polling\n- Status values: ''in_progress'', ''success'', ''failed''\n\n### 4. Export Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to download or export a Canva design as PDF, PNG, or other format\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - Find the design to export [Prerequisite]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB` - Start the export process [Required]\n3. `CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT` - Poll until export completes and get download URL [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_id`: ID of the design to export\n- `format`: Export format (''pdf'', ''png'', ''jpg'', ''svg'', ''mp4'', ''gif'', ''pptx'')\n- `pages`: Specific page numbers to export (array)\n- `quality`: Export quality (''regular'', ''high'')\n- `job_id`: Export job ID for polling status\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Export is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job result until it completes\n- Download URLs from completed exports expire after a limited time\n- Large designs with many pages take longer to export\n- Not all formats support all design types (e.g., MP4 only for animations)\n- Poll interval: wait 2-3 seconds between status checks\n\n### 5. Organize with Folders\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create folders or organize designs into folders\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_POST_FOLDERS` - Create a new folder [Required]\n2. `CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER` - Move designs into folders [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Folder name\n- `parent_folder_id`: Parent folder for nested organization\n- `item_id`: ID of the design or asset to move\n- `folder_id`: Target folder ID\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Folder names must be unique within the same parent folder\n- Moving items between folders updates their location immediately\n- Root-level folders have no parent_folder_id\n\n### 6. Autofill from Brand Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate designs by filling brand template placeholders with data\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - List available brand templates [Required]\n2. `CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB` - Start autofill with data [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `brand_template_id`: ID of the brand template to use\n- `title`: Title for the generated design\n- `data`: Key-value mapping of placeholder names to replacement values\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Template placeholders must match exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Autofill is asynchronous; poll for completion\n- Only brand templates support autofill, not regular designs\n- Data values must match the expected type for each placeholder (text, image URL)\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Async Job Pattern\n\nMany Canva operations are asynchronous:\n```\n1. Initiate job (upload, export, autofill) -> get job_id\n2. Poll status endpoint with job_id every 2-3 seconds\n3. Check for ''success'' or ''failed'' status\n4. On success, extract result (asset_id, download_url, design_id)\n```\n\n### ID Resolution\n\n**Design name -> Design ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS with query=design_name\n2. Find matching design in results\n3. Extract id field\n```\n\n**Brand template name -> Template ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST\n2. Find template by name\n3. Extract brand_template_id\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Check response for `continuation` token\n- Pass token in next request''s `continuation` parameter\n- Continue until `continuation` is absent or empty\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Async Operations**:\n- Uploads, exports, and autofills are all asynchronous\n- Always poll job status; do not assume immediate completion\n- Download URLs from exports expire; use them promptly\n\n**Asset Management**:\n- Assets must be uploaded before they can be used in designs\n- Upload job must reach ''success'' status before the asset_id is valid\n- Supported formats vary; check Canva documentation for current limits\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Canva API has rate limits per endpoint\n- Implement exponential backoff for bulk operations\n- Batch operations where possible to reduce API calls\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` key\n- Job status responses include different fields based on completion state\n- Parse defensively with fallbacks for optional fields\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List designs | CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS | query, continuation |\n| Create design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET | design_type, title |\n| Upload asset | CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB | name, url |\n| Check upload | CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS | job_id |\n| Export design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB | design_id, format |\n| Get export | CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT | job_id |\n| Create folder | CANVA_POST_FOLDERS | name, parent_folder_id |\n| Move to folder | CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER | item_id, folder_id |\n| List templates | CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST | (none) |\n| Autofill template | CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB | brand_template_id, data |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:12:21.492Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing automated design operations in Canva via Rube MCP.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Canva 中通过 Rube MCP 进行自动化设计操作的视觉内容代理","ja":"Canva で Rube MCP を使用して自動化されたデザイン操作が必要なビジュアル コンテンツ エージェントに最適","ko":"Canva에서 Rube MCP를 통해 자동화된 디자인 운영이 필요한 비주얼 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 완벽한 선택","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido visual que necesitan operaciones de diseño automatizadas en Canva a través de Rube MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin d''opérations de conception automatisées dans Canva via Rube MCP.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die automatisierte Designoperationen in Canva über Rube MCP benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de operações de design automatizadas no Canva via Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Контент-агентов, которым необходимы автоматизированные операции по дизайну в Canva через Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات تصميم أوتوماتيكية في Canva من خلال Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit, utilizing Rube MCP for streamlined workflows and leveraging the `canva` toolkit for seamless integration, all while ensuring compatibility with various AI agents such as Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code.","zh":"赋予代理自动化 Canva 设计操作的能力，通过 Composio 的 Canva 工具包，利用 Rube MCP 实现流程优化，并通过 `canva` 工具包实现无缝集成，同时确保与各种 AI 代理（如 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code）兼容","ja":"Composio の Canva ツールキットを使用して、Rube MCP でワークフローを最適化し、`canva` ツールキットでシームレスな統合を実現しながら、Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などのさまざまな AI エージェントと互換性を保つことで、エージェントに Canva デザイン操作の自動化能力を付与する","ko":"컴포지오의 카나바 툴킷을 사용하여 루비 MCP로 워크플ロー 최적화를 thực現하고, `카나바` 툴킷으로 무결점 통합을 실현하면서, 커서, 윈드서프 및 클로드 코드 등 다양한 AI 에이전트와의 호환성을 보장하는 동시에 에이전트에 카나바 디자인 운영 자동화를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de diseño de Canva a través de la herramienta de Canva de Composio, utilizando Rube MCP para flujos de trabajo optimizados y aprovechando la herramienta `canva` para una integración sin problemas, todo mientras se garantiza la compatibilidad con varios agentes de inteligencia artificial como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de conception de Canva via la boîte à outils Canva de Composio, en utilisant Rube MCP pour des flux de travail rationalisés et en exploitant la boîte à outils `canva` pour une intégration sans accroc, le tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec différents agents d''intelligence artificielle tels que Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Canva-Designoperationen über Composios Canva-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem Rube MCP für optimierte Workflows verwendet wird und das `canva`-Toolkit für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt wird, während gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações de design do Canva por meio da toolkit do Canva da Composio, utilizando o Rube MCP para fluxos de trabalho otimizados e aproveitando a toolkit `canva` para integração sem problemas, garantindo compatibilidade com vários agentes de IA, como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции по дизайну в Canva с помощью инструментария Canva от Composio, используя Rube MCP для оптимизации рабочих процессов и используя инструментарий `canva` для бесшовной интеграции, обеспечивая совместимость с различными агентами ИИ, такими как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تutomation عمليات التصميم في Canva من خلال أدوات Canva من Composio، باستخدام Rube MCP لتحسين تدفقات العمل وتحقيق التكامل السلس باستخدام أداة `canva` ، مع ضمان التوافق مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المختلفين مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Canva design tasks via Rube MCP","Generating visual content through Composio''s Canva toolkit","Streamlining design operations with `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` and `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"],"zh":["通过 Rube MCP 自动化 Canva 设计任务","通过 Composio 的 Canva 工具包生成视觉内容","使用 `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` 和 `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` 流线化设计操作"],"ja":["Rube MCP を使用して Canva デザイン タスクを自動化する","Composio の Canva ツールキットを使用してビジュアル コンテンツを生成する","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` と `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` を使用してデザイン操作を最適化する"],"ko":["루비 MCP를 사용하여 카나바 디자인 작업 자동화","컴포지오의 카나바 툴킷을 사용하여 비주얼 콘텐츠 생성","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` 및 `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`를 사용하여 디자인 운영 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de diseño de Canva a través de Rube MCP","Generar contenido visual a través de la herramienta de Canva de Composio","Optimizar las operaciones de diseño con `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` y `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches de conception de Canva via Rube MCP","Générer du contenu visuel via la boîte à outils Canva de Composio","Rationaliser les opérations de conception avec `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` et `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"],"de":["Automatisierung von Canva-Designtasks über Rube MCP","Erzeugung von visuellem Inhalt über Composios Canva-Toolkit","Optimierung der Designoperationen mit `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` und `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de design do Canva via Rube MCP","Gerar conteúdo visual por meio da toolkit do Canva da Composio","Otimizar operações de design com `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` e `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи дизайна в Canva через Rube MCP","Генерировать визуальный контент с помощью инструментария Canva от Composio","Оптимизировать операции по дизайну с помощью `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` и `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"],"ar":["تأتمتة مهام تصميم Canva من خلال Rube MCP","генерировать المحتوى المرئي من خلال أدوات Canva من Composio","تحسين عمليات التصميم باستخدام `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` و `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` available","Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva` necessary","Compatibility with specific AI agents such as AutoGPT and LangChain may require additional setup"],"zh":["需要具有 `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` 的 Rube MCP 连接","需要通过 `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` 的活跃 Canva 连接和 `canva` 工具包","可能需要额外设置以确保与 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等特定 AI 代理的兼容性"],"ja":["`RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` を使用できる Rube MCP 接続が必要","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` を使用した Canva 接続と `canva` ツールキットが必要","AutoGPT や LangChain などの特定の AI エージェントとの互換性を確保するために、追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["`RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`를 사용할 수 있는 루비 MCP 연결이 필요","`RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS`를 사용한 카나바 연결 및 `카나바` 툴킷이 필요","오토지피티 및 랭체인 등 특정 AI 에이전트와의 호환성을 보장하기 위해 추가 설정이 필요한 경우가 있음"],"es":["Requiere conexión con Rube MCP con `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` disponibles","Conexión activa de Canva a través de `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` con la herramienta `canva` necesaria","La compatibilidad con agentes de inteligencia artificial específicos como AutoGPT y LangChain puede requerir una configuración adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion avec Rube MCP avec `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` disponibles","Connexion active de Canva via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` avec la boîte à outils `canva` nécessaire","La compatibilité avec des agents d''intelligence artificielle spécifiques tels que AutoGPT et LangChain peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung mit Rube MCP mit verfügbaren `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`","Aktive Canva-Verbindung über `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` mit dem `canva`-Toolkit erforderlich","Die Kompatibilität mit bestimmten KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Requer conexão com Rube MCP com `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` disponível","Conexão ativa com Canva via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` com toolkit `canva` necessária","Compatibilidade com agentes de IA específicos, como AutoGPT e LangChain, pode requerer configuração adicional"],"ru":["Требуется подключение к Rube MCP с доступными `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS`","Активное подключение к Canva через `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` с инструментарием `canva` необходимо","Совместимость с определенными агентами ИИ, такими как AutoGPT и LangChain, может потребовать дополнительной настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال ب Rube MCP مع أداة `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` المتاحة","اتصال نشط إلى Canva من خلال `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` مع أداة `canva` ضروري","التوافق مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المحددين ، مثل AutoGPT و LangChain ، قد يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/lc-show', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'lc-show', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:11:42.363Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/lc-show","name":"lc-show","description":{"zh":"lc-show LeetCode , Rust .","ja":"lc-show LeetCode , Rust ","ko":"lc-show LeetCode , Rust ","es":"La habilidad lc-show muestra detalles de problemas de LeetCode y genera plantillas de código Rust. Utiliza /lc-show para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"La compétence lc-show affiche les détails des problèmes LeetCode et génère des modèles de code Rust. Utilisez /lc-show pour améliorer votre flux de travail","de":"Die Fähigkeit lc-show zeigt Details zu LeetCode-Problemen an und generiert Rust-Code-Vorlagen. Verwenden Sie /lc-show, um Ihren Arbeitsablauf zu verbessern","pt":"O lc-show é uma ferramenta para exibir detalhes de problemas do LeetCode e gerar modelos de código Rust","ru":"Lc-show - это инструмент для отображения деталей задачи LeetCode и генерации шаблонов кода на Rust","ar":"lc-show هو أداة لإظهار تفاصيل مشكلة LeetCode وتوليد قوالب رموز الرست","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"lc-show: LeetCode ","ja":"lc-show: LeetCode","ko":"lc-show: LeetCode ","es":"Mostrar detalles de LeetCode con lc-show","fr":"Afficher les détails de LeetCode avec lc-show","de":"LeetCode-Details mit lc-show anzeigen","pt":"Mostrar Detalhes de Problemas do LeetCode com lc-show","ru":"Показать детали задачи LeetCode с помощью lc-show","ar":"إظهار تفاصيل مشكلة LeetCode باستخدام lc-show","en":"lc-show"},"description":{"zh":"lc-show LeetCode , Rust .","ja":"lc-show LeetCode , Rust ","ko":"lc-show LeetCode , Rust ","es":"La habilidad lc-show muestra detalles de problemas de LeetCode y genera plantillas de código Rust. Utiliza /lc-show para mejorar tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"La compétence lc-show affiche les détails des problèmes LeetCode et génère des modèles de code Rust. Utilisez /lc-show pour améliorer votre flux de travail","de":"Die Fähigkeit lc-show zeigt Details zu LeetCode-Problemen an und generiert Rust-Code-Vorlagen. Verwenden Sie /lc-show, um Ihren Arbeitsablauf zu verbessern","pt":"O lc-show é uma ferramenta para exibir detalhes de problemas do LeetCode e gerar modelos de código Rust","ru":"Lc-show - это инструмент для отображения деталей задачи LeetCode и генерации шаблонов кода на Rust","ar":"lc-show هو أداة لإظهار تفاصيل مشكلة LeetCode وتوليد قوالب رموز الرست","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["LeetCode ","Rust ","ID"," "],"ja":["LeetCode ","Rust ","ID"," "],"ko":["LeetCode ","Rust ","ID"," "],"es":["Muestra detalles de problemas de LeetCode","Genera plantillas de código Rust","Utiliza el comando /lc-show","Mejora la productividad","Compatibilidad con problemas de LeetCode"],"fr":["Affiche les détails des problèmes LeetCode","Génère des modèles de code Rust","Utilise la commande /lc-show","Améliore la productivité","Compatibilité avec les problèmes LeetCode"],"de":["Zeigt Details zu LeetCode-Problemen an","Generiert Rust-Code-Vorlagen","Verwendet den Befehl /lc-show","Steigert die Produktivität","Kompatibilität mit LeetCode-Problemen"],"pt":["Exibe detalhes de problemas do LeetCode","Gera modelos de código Rust","Salva arquivos gerados no diretório problems/","Suporte a comando de linha de comando","Integração com o LeetCode"],"ru":["Отображает детали задачи LeetCode","Генерирует шаблоны кода на Rust","Сохраняет сгенерированные файлы в директории problems/","Поддержка командной строки","Интеграция с LeetCode"],"ar":["يعرض تفاصيل مشكلة LeetCode","يتوليد قوالب رموز الرست","يحفظ الملفات المولدة في الدليل problems/","دعم سطر الأوامر","التكامل مع LeetCode"]},"keywords":{"zh":["lc-show","LeetCode","Rust","LeetCode ","Rust "," "],"ja":["lc-show","LeetCode","Rust","LeetCode ","Rust "," "],"ko":["lc-show","LeetCode","Rust","LeetCode ","Rust "," "],"es":["LeetCode","lc-show","plantillas de código Rust","problemas de programación","desarrollo de software","productividad","Rust"],"fr":["LeetCode","lc-show","modèles de code Rust","problèmes de programmation","développement de logiciels","productivité","Rust"],"de":["LeetCode","lc-show","Rust-Code-Vorlagen","Programmierprobleme","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität","Rust"],"pt":["LeetCode","Rust","lc-show","desenvolvimento de software","programação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["LeetCode","Rust","lc-show","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["LeetCode","Rust","lc-show","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lc-show","description":"Show LeetCode problem details and generate Rust template (project)","bodyPreview":"# LeetCode Show\n\nShow problem details and generate Rust template in `problems/` directory.\n\n## Usage\n\n`/lc-show <problem_id>` - Show problem and generate Rust code template\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `leetcode show <problem_id> 2>/dev/null` to display the problem description\n2. Show the problem details to the user\n3. Run `leetcode show <problem_id> -g -l rust 2>/dev/null` to generate the Rust template\n4. Move the generated file to `problems/` directory:\n   ```\n   mv <problem_id>.<problem-name>.rs","body":"# LeetCode Show\n\nShow problem details and generate Rust template in `problems/` directory.\n\n## Usage\n\n`/lc-show <problem_id>` - Show problem and generate Rust code template\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `leetcode show <problem_id> 2>/dev/null` to display the problem description\n2. Show the problem details to the user\n3. Run `leetcode show <problem_id> -g -l rust 2>/dev/null` to generate the Rust template\n4. Move the generated file to `problems/` directory:\n   ```\n   mv <problem_id>.<problem-name>.rs problems/\n   ```\n5. Tell the user the file is ready at `problems/<problem_id>.<problem-name>.rs`\n\n## File Format\n\n```rust\nuse std::collections::HashMap; // if needed\n\nimpl Solution {\n    pub fn function_name(...) -> ... {\n        // implementation\n    }\n}\n```\n\nNote: `struct Solution;` は含めない（LeetCode側で定義されるため）。rust-analyzer用には build.rs が lib.rs 経由で提供する。\n\n## Commands\n\n- Test: `leetcode test problems/<file>.rs`\n- Submit: `leetcode submit problems/<file>.rs`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:11:42.363Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Rust-focused Coding Agents specializing in competitive programming and LeetCode problem solving.","zh":"适用于专注于Rust编程的编码代理，特别是在竞争性编程和LeetCode问题解决方面。","ja":"Rustに特化した競技プログラミングおよびLeetCode問題解決を専門とするコーディングエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"Rust에 중점을 둔 경쟁 프로그래밍 및 LeetCode 문제 해결을 전문으로 하는 코딩 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Codificación enfocados en Rust que se especializan en programación competitiva y resolución de problemas de LeetCode.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Codage axés sur Rust spécialisés dans la programmation compétitive et la résolution de problèmes LeetCode.","de":"Wesentlich für Rust-fokussierte Codierungsagenten, die sich auf Competitive Programming und LeetCode-Problemverständnis spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Codificação com foco em Rust especializados em programação competitiva e resolução de problemas do LeetCode.","ru":"Необходим для агентов кодирования, ориентированных на Rust, специализирующихся на конкурентном программировании и решении задач LeetCode.","ar":"ضروري لعميل الترميز الذي يركز على الرست ويختص في البرمجة التنافسية وحل مشاكل لييتكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Automates LeetCode problem retrieval and Rust template generation by executing `leetcode show` CLI commands, streamlining the coding workflow for algorithm challenges. It organizes generated code into a dedicated `problems/` directory with proper file naming conventions.","zh":"通过执行`leetcode show` CLI命令，自动化LeetCode问题检索和Rust模板生成，简化算法挑战的编码工作流程。它将生成的代码组织到一个专用的`problems/`目录中，具有适当的文件命名约定。","ja":"CLIコマンド`leetcode show`を実行してLeetCode問題の取得とRustテンプレートの生成を自動化し、アルゴリズムの課題に対するコーディングのワークフローを合理化します。生成されたコードを、適切なファイル命名規則を持つ専用の`problems/`ディレクトリに整理します。","ko":"CLI 명령어 `leetcode show`를 실행하여 LeetCode 문제 검색 및 Rust 템플릿 생성을 자동화하고 알고리즘 과제에 대한 코딩 워크플로우를 간소화합니다. 생성된 코드를 적절한 파일 이름 규칙을 갖춘 전용 `problems/` 디렉토리에 조직합니다.","es":"Automatiza la recuperación de problemas de LeetCode y la generación de plantillas de Rust mediante la ejecución de comandos CLI `leetcode show`, simplificando el flujo de trabajo de codificación para desafíos de algoritmos. Organiza el código generado en un directorio dedicado `problems/` con convenciones de nomenclatura de archivos adecuadas.","fr":"Automatise la récupération des problèmes LeetCode et la génération de modèles Rust en exécutant des commandes CLI `leetcode show`, simplifiant le flux de travail de codage pour les défis d''algorithmes. Organise le code généré dans un répertoire dédié `problems/` avec des conventions de nommage de fichiers appropriées.","de":"Automatisiert die Abrufung von LeetCode-Problemen und die Generierung von Rust-Vorlagen durch die Ausführung von `leetcode show`-CLI-Befehlen, wodurch der Codierungs-Workfluss für Algorithmus-Herausforderungen gestreamt wird. Organisiert den generierten Code in einem dedizierten `problems/`-Verzeichnis mit entsprechenden Dateinamenskonventionen.","pt":"Automatiza a recuperação de problemas do LeetCode e a geração de modelos de Rust, executando comandos CLI `leetcode show`, simplificando o fluxo de trabalho de codificação para desafios de algoritmos. Ele organiza o código gerado em um diretório dedicado `problems/` com convenções de nomenclatura de arquivos adequadas.","ru":"Автоматизирует получение задач LeetCode и генерацию шаблонов Rust, выполняя команды CLI `leetcode show`, оптимизируя рабочий процесс кодирования для алгоритмических задач. Он организует сгенерированный код в отдельном каталоге `problems/` с правильными соглашениями об именах файлов.","ar":"يعمل على أتمتة استرجاع مشاكل لييتكود وإنشاء قوالب الرست من خلال تنفيذ أوامر واجهة سطر الأوامر `leetcode show` ، مبسطاً تدفق عمل الترميز للتحديات الخوارزمية. ينظم الشفرة المولدّة في دليل مخصص `problems/` مع اتفاقيات تسمية الملفات المناسبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Rust code template generation for LeetCode problems","Streamlining algorithm practice workflows","Organizing coding challenge solutions in a structured directory"],"zh":["自动化LeetCode问题的Rust代码模板生成","简化算法练习工作流程","组织编码挑战解决方案到结构化目录"],"ja":["LeetCode問題のRustコードテンプレートの自動生成","アルゴリズム練習のワークフローの合理化","コーディング課題の解決を構造化ディレクトリに組織"],"ko":["LeetCode 문제에 대한 Rust 코드 템플릿 자동 생성","알고리즘 연습 워크플로우 간소화","코딩 과제 해결을 구조화된 디렉토리에 조직"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de plantillas de código Rust para problemas de LeetCode","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de práctica de algoritmos","Organización de soluciones de desafíos de codificación en un directorio estructurado"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de modèles de code Rust pour les problèmes LeetCode","Optimisation des flux de travail de pratique d''algorithmes","Organisation des solutions de défis de codage dans un répertoire structuré"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Rust-Code-Vorlagen für LeetCode-Probleme","Optimierung von Algorithmus-Übungs-Workflows","Organisation von Lösungen für Codier-Herausforderungen in einem strukturierten Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Automatização da geração de modelos de código Rust para problemas do LeetCode","Otimização do fluxo de trabalho de prática de algoritmos","Organização de soluções de desafios de codificação em um diretório estruturado"],"ru":["Автоматизация генерации шаблонов кода Rust для задач LeetCode","Оптимизация рабочего процесса практики алгоритмов","Организация решений задач кодирования в структурированном каталоге"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد قوالب شفرة الرست لمشاكل لييتكود","تبسيط سير عمل ممارسة الخوارزميات","تنظيم حلول تحديات الترميز في دليل منظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires leetcode-cli tool installation","Dependent on external LeetCode CLI functionality","Rust language specific template generation only"],"zh":["需要安装leetcode-cli工具","依赖于外部LeetCode CLI功能","仅支持Rust语言模板生成"],"ja":["leetcode-cliツールのインストールが必要","外部のLeetCode CLI機能に依存","Rust言語専用のテンプレート生成のみ"],"ko":["leetcode-cli 툴 설치가 필요","외부 LeetCode CLI 기능에 의존","Rust 언어 전용 템플릿 생성만 지원"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la herramienta leetcode-cli","Dependiente de la funcionalidad externa de LeetCode CLI","Generación de plantillas de lenguaje Rust específicas solo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''outil leetcode-cli","Dépendante de la fonctionnalité externe LeetCode CLI","Génération de modèles de langage Rust spécifiques uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des leetcode-cli-Tools","Abhängig von der externen LeetCode-CLI-Funktionalität","Rust-Sprachspezifische Vorlagengenerierung nur"],"pt":["Requer a instalação da ferramenta leetcode-cli","Dependente da funcionalidade externa do CLI do LeetCode","Geração de modelos de linguagem Rust apenas"],"ru":["Требует установки инструмента leetcode-cli","Зависит от внешней функциональности CLI LeetCode","Генерация шаблонов только для языка Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة سطر الأوامر لييتكود","يعتمد على وظيفة واجهة سطر الأوامر الخارجية للييتكود","توليد قوالب لغة الرست فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YPYT1/All-skills/canva-automation', 'community', 'YPYT1', 'All-skills', 'YPYT1/All-skills', 'canva-automation', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:12:20.104Z', NULL, '{"id":"YPYT1/All-skills/canva-automation","name":"canva-automation","description":{"zh":"Canva 自动化通过 Rube MCP 实现，简化设计操作流程","ja":"Canva オートメーションは Rube MCP を使用して実現され、設計操作プロセスを簡素化する","ko":"Canva 자동화는 Rube MCP 를 사용하여 구현되어 디자인 운영 프로세스를 단순화한다","es":"Automatiza operaciones de diseño de Canva con la herramienta de Canva de Composio a través de Rube MCP. Conecta con Rube MCP y Canva para empezar","fr":"Automatisez les opérations de conception de Canva avec l''outil de Canva de Composio via Rube MCP. Connectez-vous à Rube MCP et Canva pour commencer","de":"Automatisieren Sie Canva-Designoperationen mit dem Canva-Toolkit von Composio über Rube MCP. Verbinden Sie sich mit Rube MCP und Canva, um loszulegen","pt":"A automação Canva via Rube MCP permite automatizar operações de design Canva com o toolkit Composio. Configure Rube MCP e comece a automatizar.","ru":"Автоматизация Canva через Rube MCP позволяет автоматизировать операции дизайна Canva с помощью инструмента Composio. Настройте Rube MCP и начните автоматизировать.","ar":"تسهيل كانفا عبر Rube MCP يسمح بتسهيل عمليات تصميم كانفا باستخدام أداة Composio. قم بالتكوين وابدأ في تسهيل العمليات.","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Canva 自动化_via_Rube_MCP","ja":"Canva オートメーション via Rube MCP","ko":"Canva 자동화 via Rube MCP","es":"Automatización de Canva con Rube MCP","fr":"Automatisation de Canva avec Rube MCP","de":"Canva-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP","pt":"Automação Canva via Rube MCP","ru":"Автоматизация Canva через Rube MCP","ar":"أتمتة كانفا عبر Rube MCP","en":"canva-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Canva 自动化通过 Rube MCP 实现，简化设计操作流程","ja":"Canva オートメーションは Rube MCP を使用して実現され、設計操作プロセスを簡素化する","ko":"Canva 자동화는 Rube MCP 를 사용하여 구현되어 디자인 운영 프로세스를 단순화한다","es":"Automatiza operaciones de diseño de Canva con la herramienta de Canva de Composio a través de Rube MCP. Conecta con Rube MCP y Canva para empezar","fr":"Automatisez les opérations de conception de Canva avec l''outil de Canva de Composio via Rube MCP. Connectez-vous à Rube MCP et Canva pour commencer","de":"Automatisieren Sie Canva-Designoperationen mit dem Canva-Toolkit von Composio über Rube MCP. Verbinden Sie sich mit Rube MCP und Canva, um loszulegen","pt":"A automação Canva via Rube MCP permite automatizar operações de design Canva com o toolkit Composio. Configure Rube MCP e comece a automatizar.","ru":"Автоматизация Canva через Rube MCP позволяет автоматизировать операции дизайна Canva с помощью инструмента Composio. Настройте Rube MCP и начните автоматизир...","ar":"تسهيل كانفا عبر Rube MCP يسمح بتسهيل عمليات تصميم كانفا باستخدام أداة Composio. قم بالتكوين وابدأ في تسهيل العمليات.","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["通过 Rube MCP 连接实现自动化","支持 Composio 的 Canva 工具包","简化设计操作流程","提高开发效率","无需 API 密钥"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続による自動化","Composio の Canva ツールキットをサポート","設計操作プロセスの簡素化","開発効率の向上","API キーは必要なし"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결을 통해 자동화","Composio 의 Canva 툴킷을 지원","디자인 운영 프로세스를 단순화","개발 효율성을 향상","API 키가 필요 없음"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP","Herramienta de Canva de Composio","Automatización de operaciones de diseño","Configuración sencilla","No requiere claves de API"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP","Outil de Canva de Composio","Automatisation des opérations de conception","Configuration simple","N''a pas besoin de clés d''API"],"de":["Verbindung mit Rube MCP","Canva-Toolkit von Composio","Automatisierung von Designoperationen","Einfache Konfiguration","Benötigt keine API-Schlüssel"],"pt":["Automação de operações de design Canva","Integração com o toolkit Composio","Configuração fácil com Rube MCP","Sem necessidade de chaves de API","Compatibilidade com vários clientes"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций дизайна Canva","Интеграция с инструментом Composio","Легкая настройка с Rube MCP","Не требуется ключи API","Совместимость с несколькими клиентами"],"ar":["تسهيل عمليات تصميم كانفا","التكامل مع أداة Composio","تكوين سهل مع Rube MCP","لا حاجة لمفاتيح API","التوافق مع عدة عملاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Canva 自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva 工具包","设计操作自动化","开发效率"],"ja":["Canva オートメーション","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva ツールキット","設計操作自動化","開発効率"],"ko":["Canva 자동화","Rube MCP","Composio","Canva 툴킷","디자인 운영 자동화","개발 효율성"],"es":["automatización de Canva","Rube MCP","herramienta de Canva","diseño automático","desarrollo de software","integración de API"],"fr":["automatisation de Canva","Rube MCP","outil de Canva","conception automatique","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API"],"de":["Canva-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Canva-Toolkit","automatisches Design","Software-Entwicklung","API-Integration"],"pt":["automação canva","rube mcp","composio","design canva","automatização de design","ferramentas de design"],"ru":["автоматизация canva","rube mcp","composio","дизайн canva","автоматизация дизайна","инструменты дизайна"],"ar":["تسهيل كانفا","rube mcp","composio","تصميم كانفا","تسهيل تصميم","أدوات تصميم"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canva-automation","description":"Automate Canva tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): designs, exports, folders, brand templates, autofill. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1.","body":"# Canva Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Canva design operations through Composio''s Canva toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Canva connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `canva`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Canva OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Browse Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find existing designs or browse their Canva library\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - List all designs with optional filters [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `query`: Search term to filter designs by name\n- `continuation`: Pagination token from previous response\n- `ownership`: Filter by ''owned'', ''shared'', or ''any''\n- `sort_by`: Sort field (e.g., ''modified_at'', ''title'')\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Results are paginated; follow `continuation` token until absent\n- Deleted designs may still appear briefly; check design status\n- Search is substring-based, not fuzzy matching\n\n### 2. Create and Design\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a new Canva design from scratch or from a template\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - Browse available brand templates [Optional]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET` - Create a new design [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_type`: Type of design (e.g., ''Presentation'', ''Poster'', ''SocialMedia'')\n- `title`: Name for the new design\n- `asset_id`: Optional asset to include in the design\n- `width` / `height`: Custom dimensions in pixels\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Design type must match Canva''s predefined types exactly\n- Custom dimensions have minimum and maximum limits\n- Asset must be uploaded first via CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB before referencing\n\n### 3. Upload Assets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to upload images or files to Canva for use in designs\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB` - Initiate the asset upload [Required]\n2. `CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS` - Poll until upload completes [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Display name for the asset\n- `url`: Public URL of the file to upload (for URL-based uploads)\n- `job_id`: Upload job ID returned from step 1 (for status polling)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Upload is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job status until it completes\n- Supported formats include PNG, JPG, SVG, MP4, GIF\n- File size limits apply; large files may take longer to process\n- The `job_id` from CREATE returns the ID needed for status polling\n- Status values: ''in_progress'', ''success'', ''failed''\n\n### 4. Export Designs\n\n**When to use**: User wants to download or export a Canva design as PDF, PNG, or other format\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS` - Find the design to export [Prerequisite]\n2. `CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB` - Start the export process [Required]\n3. `CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT` - Poll until export completes and get download URL [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `design_id`: ID of the design to export\n- `format`: Export format (''pdf'', ''png'', ''jpg'', ''svg'', ''mp4'', ''gif'', ''pptx'')\n- `pages`: Specific page numbers to export (array)\n- `quality`: Export quality (''regular'', ''high'')\n- `job_id`: Export job ID for polling status\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Export is asynchronous; you MUST poll the job result until it completes\n- Download URLs from completed exports expire after a limited time\n- Large designs with many pages take longer to export\n- Not all formats support all design types (e.g., MP4 only for animations)\n- Poll interval: wait 2-3 seconds between status checks\n\n### 5. Organize with Folders\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create folders or organize designs into folders\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_POST_FOLDERS` - Create a new folder [Required]\n2. `CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER` - Move designs into folders [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Folder name\n- `parent_folder_id`: Parent folder for nested organization\n- `item_id`: ID of the design or asset to move\n- `folder_id`: Target folder ID\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Folder names must be unique within the same parent folder\n- Moving items between folders updates their location immediately\n- Root-level folders have no parent_folder_id\n\n### 6. Autofill from Brand Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate designs by filling brand template placeholders with data\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST` - List available brand templates [Required]\n2. `CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB` - Start autofill with data [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `brand_template_id`: ID of the brand template to use\n- `title`: Title for the generated design\n- `data`: Key-value mapping of placeholder names to replacement values\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Template placeholders must match exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Autofill is asynchronous; poll for completion\n- Only brand templates support autofill, not regular designs\n- Data values must match the expected type for each placeholder (text, image URL)\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Async Job Pattern\n\nMany Canva operations are asynchronous:\n```\n1. Initiate job (upload, export, autofill) -> get job_id\n2. Poll status endpoint with job_id every 2-3 seconds\n3. Check for ''success'' or ''failed'' status\n4. On success, extract result (asset_id, download_url, design_id)\n```\n\n### ID Resolution\n\n**Design name -> Design ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS with query=design_name\n2. Find matching design in results\n3. Extract id field\n```\n\n**Brand template name -> Template ID**:\n```\n1. Call CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST\n2. Find template by name\n3. Extract brand_template_id\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Check response for `continuation` token\n- Pass token in next request''s `continuation` parameter\n- Continue until `continuation` is absent or empty\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Async Operations**:\n- Uploads, exports, and autofills are all asynchronous\n- Always poll job status; do not assume immediate completion\n- Download URLs from exports expire; use them promptly\n\n**Asset Management**:\n- Assets must be uploaded before they can be used in designs\n- Upload job must reach ''success'' status before the asset_id is valid\n- Supported formats vary; check Canva documentation for current limits\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Canva API has rate limits per endpoint\n- Implement exponential backoff for bulk operations\n- Batch operations where possible to reduce API calls\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` key\n- Job status responses include different fields based on completion state\n- Parse defensively with fallbacks for optional fields\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List designs | CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS | query, continuation |\n| Create design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_WITH_OPTIONAL_ASSET | design_type, title |\n| Upload asset | CANVA_CREATE_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB | name, url |\n| Check upload | CANVA_FETCH_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB_STATUS | job_id |\n| Export design | CANVA_CREATE_CANVA_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB | design_id, format |\n| Get export | CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT | job_id |\n| Create folder | CANVA_POST_FOLDERS | name, parent_folder_id |\n| Move to folder | CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER | item_id, folder_id |\n| List templates | CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST | (none) |\n| Autofill template | CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB | brand_template_id, data |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:12:20.104Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for design automation agents needing to streamline Canva operations through MCP integration.","zh":"适用于需要通过MCP集成简化Canva操作的设计自动化代理。","ja":"Canvaの操作をMCP 統合を通じて最適化する必要があるデザイン自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"MCP 통합을 통해 Canva 작업을 최적화해야 하는 디자인 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de diseño que necesitan simplificar las operaciones de Canva a través de la integración con MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de conception ayant besoin de rationaliser les opérations Canva via l''intégration MCP.","de":"Perfekt für Designautomatisierungsagenten, die Canva-Operationen über die MCP-Integration rationalisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de automação de design que precisam otimizar operações do Canva por meio da integração com o MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации дизайна, которым необходимо оптимизировать операции Canva посредством интеграции с MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تصميم الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تسهيل عمليات كانفا من خلال التكامل مع MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct automation of Canva design workflows via Rube MCP and Composio''s toolkit, providing programmatic access to design creation and manipulation without manual intervention. Requires RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS initialization and active Canva connection through RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","zh":"通过Rube MCP和Composio的工具包，实现对Canva设计工作流的直接自动化，提供对设计创建和操作的程序化访问，而无需手动干预。需要RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS初始化和通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Canva连接。","ja":"Rube MCPとComposioのツールキットを通じて、Canvaのデザインワークフローを直接自動化し、手動介入を必要とせずにデザインの作成と操作にプログラム的にアクセスできるようにします。RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSの初期化とRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSによるCanvaのアクティブな接続が必要です。","ko":"Rube MCP와 Composio의 툴킷을 통해 Canva 디자인 워크플로의 직접 자동화를 가능하게 하며, 수동 개입 없이 디자인 생성 및 조작에 프로그래밍 방식으로 액세스할 수 있습니다. RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 초기화 및 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 Canva의 활성 연결이 필요합니다.","es":"Habilita la automatización directa de flujos de trabajo de diseño de Canva a través de Rube MCP y la herramienta de Composio, proporcionando acceso programático a la creación y manipulación de diseños sin intervención manual. Requiere la inicialización de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y una conexión activa de Canva a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","fr":"Permet l''automatisation directe des flux de travail de conception Canva via Rube MCP et le kit d''outils de Composio, fournissant un accès programmatique à la création et à la manipulation de conceptions sans intervention manuelle. Nécessite l''initialisation de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et une connexion Canva active via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Automatisierung von Canva-Design-Arbeitsabläufen über Rube MCP und Composios Toolkit, wodurch ein programmatischer Zugriff auf die Erstellung und Manipulation von Designs ohne manuelle Eingriffe möglich ist. Erfordert die Initialisierung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und eine aktive Canva-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","pt":"Permite a automação direta de fluxos de trabalho de design do Canva por meio do Rube MCP e da caixa de ferramentas da Composio, fornecendo acesso programático à criação e manipulação de design sem intervenção manual. Requer inicialização do RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e conexão ativa do Canva por meio do RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую автоматизировать рабочие процессы дизайна Canva посредством Rube MCP и набора инструментов Composio, обеспечивая программный доступ к созданию и манипулированию дизайном без ручного вмешательства. Требует инициализации RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и активной связи с Canva через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS.","ar":"يمكن تسهيل عمليات تصميم كانفا تلقائيًا من خلال Rube MCP وأدوات Composio، وتقديم وصول برمجي إلى إنشاء التصميم وتعديله دون تدخل يدوي. يتطلب تهيئة RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و اتصال كانفا نشط من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating template-based design generation","Managing Canva connections programmatically","Streamlining bulk design operations","Integrating Canva workflows into agent ecosystems"],"zh":["基于模板的设计生成自动化","程序化地管理Canva连接","批量设计操作的优化","将Canva工作流集成到代理生态系统中"],"ja":["テンプレートベースのデザイン生成の自動化","Canva接続のプログラムによる管理","一括設計操作の最適化","Canvaワークフローのエージェントエコシステムへの統合"],"ko":["템플릿 기반 디자인 생성 자동화","프로그램 방식으로 Canva 연결 관리","대량 디자인 작업의 최적화","Canva 워크플로를 에이전트 생태계에 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de diseños basados en plantillas","Administración de conexiones de Canva de forma programática","Optimización de operaciones de diseño por lotes","Integración de flujos de trabajo de Canva en ecosistemas de agentes"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de conceptions basées sur des modèles","Gestion des connexions Canva de manière programmatique","Optimisation des opérations de conception par lots","Intégration des flux de travail Canva dans les écosystèmes d''agents"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Vorlagen-basierten Designs","Verwaltung von Canva-Verbindungen programmgesteuert","Optimierung von Design-Batchoperationen","Integration von Canva-Arbeitsabläufen in Agenten-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Automatizar geração de design baseada em modelos","Gerenciar conexões com o Canva de forma programática","Otimizar operações de design em massa","Integrar fluxos de trabalho do Canva em ecossistemas de agentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию дизайна на основе шаблонов","Управлять соединениями с Canva программно","Оптимизировать массовые операции дизайна","Интегрировать рабочие процессы Canva в экосистемы агентов"],"ar":["تسهيل توليد التصاميم المبنية على القوالب","إدارة الاتصالات بكانفا بشكل برمجي","تسهيل عمليات التصميم بالجملة","إدماج سير عمل كانفا في بيئات الوكلاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP server connection","Needs active Canva toolkit connection","Mandatory RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS call before operations"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP服务器连接","需要活跃的Canva工具包连接","操作前必须调用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ja":["Rube MCPサーバー接続の必要性","Canvaツールキット接続のアクティブな接続の必要性","操作前にRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを呼び出す必要性"],"ko":["Rube MCP 서버 연결이 필요함","활성 Canva 툴킷 연결이 필요함","작업 전에 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 호출해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una conexión al servidor de Rube MCP","Necesita una conexión activa a la herramienta de Canva","Llamada obligatoria a RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS antes de las operaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion au serveur Rube MCP","Nécessite une connexion active à l''outil Canva","Appel obligatoire à RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS avant les opérations"],"de":["Erfordert eine Verbindung zum Rube-MCP-Server","Benötigt eine aktive Verbindung zur Canva-Toolkit","Pflichtaufruf von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS vor den Operationen"],"pt":["Requer conexão com o servidor do Rube MCP","Necessita de conexão ativa com a caixa de ferramentas do Canva","Chamada obrigatória do RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS antes das operações"],"ru":["Требует соединения с сервером Rube MCP","Требует активной связи с набором инструментов Canva","Обязательный вызов RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS перед операциями"],"ar":["يتطلب اتصالًا بخادم Rube MCP","يحتاج إلى اتصال نشط بأدوات كانفا","يتطلب呼呼 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS قبل العمليات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SamarthaKV29/antigravity-god-mode/canva-automation', 'community', 'SamarthaKV29', 'antigravity-god-mode', 'SamarthaKV29/antigravity-god-mode', 'canva-automation', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:12:28.115Z', NULL, '{"id":"SamarthaKV29/antigravity-god-mode/canva-automation","name":"canva-automation","description":{"zh":"Canva 自动化是通过 Rube MCP 实现的，可以自动化设计操作","ja":"Canva 自動化は Rube MCP を使用して実現され、デザイン操作を自動化する","ko":"Canva 자동화는 Rube MCP를 사용하여 구현되며, 디자인 작업을 자동화합니다","es":"La automatización de Canva permite a los desarrolladores automatizar operaciones de diseño mediante la herramienta de Composio","fr":"L''automatisation de Canva permet aux développeurs d''automatiser les opérations de conception via l''outil de Composio","de":"Die Canva-Automatisierung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Designoperationen mit der Composio-Tool zu automatisieren","pt":"A automação do Canva permite que os desenvolvedores criem ferramentas personalizadas para melhorar a produtividade. Com a Composio, é possível automatizar operações de design.","ru":"Автоматизация Canva позволяет разработчикам создавать индивидуальные инструменты для повышения производительности. С помощью Composio можно автоматизировать операции дизайна.","ar":"تتيح أتمتة كانفا للمطورين إنشاء أدوات مخصصة لتحسين الإنتاجية. باستخدام كومبوسيو، يمكن توفير العمليات التلقائية لتصميم كانفا.","en":"Drop-in skill pack that turns any AI coding agent into a full engineering team."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Canva 自动化 - 实现设计操作自动化","ja":"Canva 自動化 - デザイン操作の自動化を実現","ko":"Canva 자동화 - 디자인 작업 자동화 구현","es":"Automatización de Canva para Desarrolladores","fr":"Automatisation de Canva pour les Développeurs","de":"Canva-Automatisierung für Entwickler","pt":"Automação Canva: Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento","ru":"Автоматизация Canva: Инструменты для Разработки","ar":"أتمتة كانفا: أ