rendimiento"],"fr":["Authentification avec Microsoft Entra ID","Compatibilité avec React et Cloudflare Workers","Prise en charge de MSAL v5","Migration depuis ADAL","Prise en charge d''Azure AD B2C","Mises à jour de sécurité et de performances"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit Microsoft Entra ID","Kompatibilität mit React und Cloudflare Workers","Unterstützung für MSAL v5","Migration von ADAL","Unterstützung für Azure AD B2C","Sicherheits- und Leistungsaktualisierungen"],"pt":["Integração com Microsoft Entra ID","Suporte a Cloudflare Workers","Utilização de @azure/msal-react e @azure/msal-browser","Gerenciamento de autenticação para aplicações React","Suporte a migração de MSAL v4 para v5"],"ru":["Интеграция с Microsoft Entra ID","Поддержка Cloudflare Workers","Использование @azure/msal-react и @azure/msal-browser","Управление авторизацией для приложений React","Поддержка миграции MSAL v4 на v5"],"ar":["التكامل مع مايكروسوفت إنترا آي دي","دعم Cloudflare Workers","استخدام @azure/msal-react و @azure/msal-browser","إدارة التحقق من الهوية للتطبيقات ري액ت","دعم هجرة MSAL v4 إلى v5"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Auth","Microsoft Entra ID","React","Cloudflare Workers","身份验证","授权","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","ADAL"],"ja":["Azure Auth","Microsoft Entra ID","React","Cloudflare Workers","認証","認可","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","ADAL"],"ko":["Azure Auth","Microsoft Entra ID","React","Cloudflare Workers","인증","인가","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","ADAL"],"es":["autenticación azure","microsoft entra id","react","cloudflare workers","msal v5","adal","azure ad b2c","seguridad","rendimiento"],"fr":["authentification azure","microsoft entra id","react","cloudflare workers","msal v5","adal","azure ad b2c","sécurité","performances"],"de":["azure-authentifizierung","microsoft entra id","react","cloudflare worker","msal v5","adal","azure ad b2c","sicherheit","leistung"],"pt":["azure auth","react","cloudflare workers","autenticação","microsoft entra id","msal react","msal browser","desenvolvimento de aplicações"],"ru":["авторизация azure","react","cloudflare workers","авторизация","microsoft entra id","msal react","msal browser","разработка приложений"],"ar":["التحقق من هوية azure","ري액ت","cloudflare workers","تحقق الهوية","مايكروسوفت إنترا آي دي","msal react","msal browser","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"danstrem2","repo":"clawdbot-skill-master-pack","repoPath":"danstrem2/clawdbot-skill-master-pack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-auth","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID for React + Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Package Versions**: @azure/msal-react@5.0.2, @azure/msal-browser@5.0.2, jose@6.1.3\n**Breaking Changes**: MSAL v4→v5 migration (January 2026), Azure AD B2C sunset (May 2025 - new signups blocked, existing until 2030), ADAL retirement (Sept 2025 - complete)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   React SPA         │────▶│","body":"# Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID for React + Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Package Versions**: @azure/msal-react@5.0.2, @azure/msal-browser@5.0.2, jose@6.1.3\n**Breaking Changes**: MSAL v4→v5 migration (January 2026), Azure AD B2C sunset (May 2025 - new signups blocked, existing until 2030), ADAL retirement (Sept 2025 - complete)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   React SPA         │────▶│  Microsoft Entra ID  │────▶│  Cloudflare Worker  │\n│   @azure/msal-react │     │  (login.microsoft)   │     │  jose JWT validation│\n└─────────────────────┘     └──────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘\n        │                                                          │\n        │  Authorization Code + PKCE                               │\n        │  (access_token, id_token)                                │\n        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                    Bearer token in Authorization header\n```\n\n**Key Constraint**: MSAL.js does NOT work in Cloudflare Workers (relies on browser/Node.js APIs). Use jose library for backend token validation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Frontend (React SPA)\nnpm install @azure/msal-react @azure/msal-browser\n\n# Backend (Cloudflare Workers)\nnpm install jose\n```\n\n### 2. Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. Go to **Microsoft Entra ID** → **App registrations** → **New registration**\n2. Set **Redirect URI** to `http://localhost:5173` (SPA type)\n3. Note the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) ID**\n4. Under **Authentication**:\n   - Enable **Access tokens** and **ID tokens**\n   - Add production redirect URI\n5. Under **API permissions**:\n   - Add `User.Read` (Microsoft Graph)\n   - Grant admin consent if required\n\n---\n\n## Frontend: MSAL React Setup\n\n### Configuration (src/auth/msal-config.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Configuration, LogLevel } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\n\nexport const msalConfig: Configuration = {\n  auth: {\n    clientId: import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID,\n    authority: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID}`,\n    redirectUri: window.location.origin,\n    postLogoutRedirectUri: window.location.origin,\n    navigateToLoginRequestUrl: true,\n  },\n  cache: {\n    cacheLocation: \"localStorage\", // or \"sessionStorage\"\n    storeAuthStateInCookie: true, // Required for Safari/Edge issues\n  },\n  system: {\n    loggerOptions: {\n      logLevel: LogLevel.Warning,\n      loggerCallback: (level, message) => {\n        if (level === LogLevel.Error) console.error(message);\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};\n\n// Scopes for token requests\nexport const loginRequest = {\n  scopes: [\"User.Read\", \"openid\", \"profile\", \"email\"],\n};\n\n// Scopes for API calls (add your API scope here)\nexport const apiRequest = {\n  scopes: [`api://${import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID}/access_as_user`],\n};\n```\n\n### MsalProvider Setup (src/main.tsx)\n\n```typescript\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport ReactDOM from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport { PublicClientApplication, EventType } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { MsalProvider } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { msalConfig } from \"./auth/msal-config\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\n// CRITICAL: Initialize MSAL outside component tree to prevent re-instantiation\nconst msalInstance = new PublicClientApplication(msalConfig);\n\n// Handle redirect promise on page load\nmsalInstance.initialize().then(() => {\n  // Set active account after redirect\n  // IMPORTANT: Use getAllAccounts() (returns array), NOT getActiveAccount() (returns single account or null)\n  const accounts = msalInstance.getAllAccounts();\n  if (accounts.length > 0) {\n    msalInstance.setActiveAccount(accounts[0]);\n  }\n\n  // Listen for sign-in events\n  msalInstance.addEventCallback((event) => {\n    if (event.eventType === EventType.LOGIN_SUCCESS && event.payload) {\n      const account = (event.payload as { account: any }).account;\n      msalInstance.setActiveAccount(account);\n    }\n  });\n\n  ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(\n    <React.StrictMode>\n      <MsalProvider instance={msalInstance}>\n        <App />\n      </MsalProvider>\n    </React.StrictMode>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n### Protected Route Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMsal, useIsAuthenticated } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { InteractionStatus } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { loginRequest } from \"./msal-config\";\n\nexport function ProtectedRoute({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const { instance, inProgress } = useMsal();\n  const isAuthenticated = useIsAuthenticated();\n\n  // Wait for MSAL to finish any in-progress operations\n  if (inProgress !== InteractionStatus.None) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  if (!isAuthenticated) {\n    // Trigger login redirect\n    instance.loginRedirect(loginRequest);\n    return <div>Redirecting to login...</div>;\n  }\n\n  return <>{children}</>;\n}\n```\n\n### Acquiring Tokens for API Calls\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMsal } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { InteractionRequiredAuthError } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { apiRequest } from \"./msal-config\";\n\nexport function useApiToken() {\n  const { instance, accounts } = useMsal();\n\n  async function getAccessToken(): Promise<string | null> {\n    if (accounts.length === 0) return null;\n\n    const request = {\n      ...apiRequest,\n      account: accounts[0],\n    };\n\n    try {\n      // Try silent token acquisition first\n      const response = await instance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n      return response.accessToken;\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (error instanceof InteractionRequiredAuthError) {\n        // Silent acquisition failed, need interactive login\n        // This handles expired refresh tokens (AADSTS700084)\n        await instance.acquireTokenRedirect(request);\n        return null;\n      }\n      throw error;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { getAccessToken };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Backend: Cloudflare Workers JWT Validation\n\n### Why jose Instead of MSAL\n\nMSAL.js relies on browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage) and Node.js crypto modules that don''t exist in Cloudflare Workers'' V8 isolate runtime. The jose library is pure JavaScript and works perfectly in Workers.\n\n### JWT Validation (src/auth/validate-token.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as jose from \"jose\";\n\ninterface EntraTokenPayload {\n  aud: string;       // Audience (your client ID or API URI)\n  iss: string;       // Issuer (https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant}/v2.0)\n  sub: string;       // Subject (user''s unique ID)\n  oid: string;       // Object ID (user''s Azure AD object ID)\n  preferred_username: string;\n  name: string;\n  email?: string;\n  roles?: string[];  // App roles if configured\n  scp?: string;      // Scopes (space-separated)\n}\n\n// Cache JWKS to avoid fetching on every request\nlet jwksCache: jose.JWTVerifyGetKey | null = null;\nlet jwksCacheTime = 0;\nconst JWKS_CACHE_DURATION = 3600000; // 1 hour\n\nasync function getJWKS(tenantId: string): Promise<jose.JWTVerifyGetKey> {\n  const now = Date.now();\n\n  if (jwksCache && now - jwksCacheTime < JWKS_CACHE_DURATION) {\n    return jwksCache;\n  }\n\n  // CRITICAL: Azure AD JWKS is NOT at .well-known/jwks.json\n  // Must fetch from openid-configuration first\n  const configUrl = `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration`;\n  const configResponse = await fetch(configUrl);\n  const config = await configResponse.json() as { jwks_uri: string };\n\n  // Now fetch JWKS from the correct URL\n  jwksCache = jose.createRemoteJWKSet(new URL(config.jwks_uri));\n  jwksCacheTime = now;\n\n  return jwksCache;\n}\n\nexport async function validateEntraToken(\n  token: string,\n  env: {\n    AZURE_TENANT_ID: string;\n    AZURE_CLIENT_ID: string;\n  }\n): Promise<EntraTokenPayload | null> {\n  try {\n    const jwks = await getJWKS(env.AZURE_TENANT_ID);\n\n    const { payload } = await jose.jwtVerify(token, jwks, {\n      issuer: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${env.AZURE_TENANT_ID}/v2.0`,\n      audience: env.AZURE_CLIENT_ID, // or your API URI: api://{client_id}\n    });\n\n    return payload as unknown as EntraTokenPayload;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"Token validation failed:\", error);\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Worker Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport { validateEntraToken } from \"./auth/validate-token\";\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env): Promise<Response> {\n    // Skip auth for public routes\n    const url = new URL(request.url);\n    if (url.pathname === \"/\" || url.pathname.startsWith(\"/public\")) {\n      return handlePublicRoute(request, env);\n    }\n\n    // Extract Bearer token\n    const authHeader = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\");\n    if (!authHeader?.startsWith(\"Bearer \")) {\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Missing authorization\" }), {\n        status: 401,\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      });\n    }\n\n    const token = authHeader.slice(7);\n    const user = await validateEntraToken(token, env);\n\n    if (!user) {\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Invalid token\" }), {\n        status: 401,\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Add user to request context\n    const requestWithUser = new Request(request);\n    // Pass user info downstream (e.g., via headers or context)\n\n    return handleProtectedRoute(request, env, user);\n  },\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors & Fixes\n\n### 1. AADSTS50058 - Silent Sign-In Loop\n\n**Error**: \"A silent sign-in request was sent but no user is signed in\"\n\n**Cause**: `acquireTokenSilent` called when no cached user exists.\n\n**Fix**:\n```typescript\n// Always check for accounts before silent acquisition\nconst accounts = instance.getAllAccounts();\nif (accounts.length === 0) {\n  // No cached user, trigger interactive login\n  await instance.loginRedirect(loginRequest);\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. AADSTS700084 - Refresh Token Expired\n\n**Error**: \"The refresh token was issued to a single page app (SPA), and therefore has a fixed, limited lifetime of 1.00:00:00\"\n\n**Cause**: SPA refresh tokens expire after 24 hours. Cannot be extended.\n\n**Fix**:\n```typescript\ntry {\n  const response = await instance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof InteractionRequiredAuthError) {\n    // Refresh token expired, need fresh login\n    await instance.acquireTokenRedirect(request);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. React Router v6 Redirect Loop\n\n**Error**: Infinite redirects between login page and app.\n\n**Cause**: React Router v6 may strip the hash fragment containing auth response.\n\n**Fix**: Use custom NavigationClient:\n```typescript\nimport { NavigationClient } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nclass CustomNavigationClient extends NavigationClient {\n  private navigate: ReturnType<typeof useNavigate>;\n\n  constructor(navigate: ReturnType<typeof useNavigate>) {\n    super();\n    this.navigate = navigate;\n  }\n\n  async navigateInternal(url: string, options: { noHistory: boolean }) {\n    const relativePath = url.replace(window.location.origin, \"\");\n    if (options.noHistory) {\n      this.navigate(relativePath, { replace: true });\n    } else {\n      this.navigate(relativePath);\n    }\n    return false; // Prevent MSAL from doing its own navigation\n  }\n}\n\n// In your App component:\nconst navigate = useNavigate();\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const navigationClient = new CustomNavigationClient(navigate);\n  instance.setNavigationClient(navigationClient);\n}, [instance, navigate]);\n```\n\n### 4. NextJS Dynamic Route Error\n\n**Error**: `no_cached_authority_error` in dynamic routes.\n\n**Cause**: MSAL instance not properly initialized before component renders.\n\n**Fix**: Initialize MSAL in `_app.tsx` before any routing:\n```typescript\n// pages/_app.tsx\nimport { PublicClientApplication } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { MsalProvider } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { msalConfig } from \"../auth/msal-config\";\n\n// Initialize outside component\nconst msalInstance = new PublicClientApplication(msalConfig);\n\n// Ensure initialization completes before render\nexport default function App({ Component, pageProps }) {\n  const [isInitialized, setIsInitialized] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    msalInstance.initialize().then(() => setIsInitialized(true));\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!isInitialized) return <div>Loading...</div>;\n\n  return (\n    <MsalProvider instance={msalInstance}>\n      <Component {...pageProps} />\n    </MsalProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Safari/Edge Cookie Issues\n\n**Error**: Auth state lost, infinite loop on Safari or Edge. On iOS 18 Safari specifically, silent token refresh fails with AADSTS50058 even when third-party cookies are enabled.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7384](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/7384)\n\n**Cause**: These browsers have stricter cookie policies affecting session storage. iOS 18 Safari doesn''t store the required session cookies for login.microsoftonline.com, even with third-party cookies explicitly allowed in settings.\n\n**Testing Note**: Works in Chrome on iOS 18, but fails in Safari on iOS 18.\n\n**Fix**: Enable cookie storage in MSAL config:\n```typescript\ncache: {\n  cacheLocation: \"localStorage\",\n  storeAuthStateInCookie: true, // REQUIRED for Safari/Edge\n}\n```\n\n**iOS 18 Safari Limitation**: If users still experience issues on iOS 18 Safari after enabling cookie storage, this is a known browser limitation with no current workaround. Recommend using Chrome on iOS or desktop browser.\n\n### 6. JWKS URL Not Found (Workers)\n\n**Error**: Failed to fetch JWKS from `.well-known/jwks.json`.\n\n**Cause**: Azure AD doesn''t serve JWKS at the standard OpenID Connect path.\n\n**Fix**: Fetch `openid-configuration` first, then use `jwks_uri`:\n```typescript\n// WRONG - Azure AD doesn''t use this path\nconst jwks = createRemoteJWKSet(\n  new URL(`https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/.well-known/jwks.json`)\n);\n\n// CORRECT - Fetch config first\nconst config = await fetch(\n  `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration`\n).then(r => r.json());\nconst jwks = createRemoteJWKSet(new URL(config.jwks_uri));\n```\n\n### 7. React Router Loader State Conflict\n\n**Error**: React warning about updating state during render when using `acquireTokenSilent` in React Router loaders.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7068](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/7068)\n\n**Cause**: Using the same `PublicClientApplication` instance in both the router loader and `MsalProvider` causes state updates during rendering.\n\n**Fix**: Call `initialize()` again in the loader:\n```typescript\nconst protectedLoader = async () => {\n  await msalInstance.initialize(); // Prevents state conflict\n  const response = await msalInstance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n  return { data };\n};\n```\n\n### 8. setActiveAccount Doesn''t Trigger Re-render (Community-sourced)\n\n**Error**: Components using `useMsal()` don''t update after calling `setActiveAccount()`.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6989](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/6989)\n\n**Verified**: Multiple users confirmed in GitHub issue\n\n**Cause**: `setActiveAccount()` updates the MSAL instance but doesn''t notify React of the change.\n\n**Fix**: Force re-render with state:\n```typescript\nconst [accountKey, setAccountKey] = useState(0);\n\nconst switchAccount = (newAccount) => {\n  msalInstance.setActiveAccount(newAccount);\n  setAccountKey(prev => prev + 1); // Force update\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Tenant vs Single-Tenant\n\n### Single Tenant (Recommended for Enterprise)\n\n```typescript\nauthority: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${TENANT_ID}`,\n```\n\n- Only users from your organization can sign in\n- Token issuer: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant_id}/v2.0`\n\n### Multi-Tenant\n\n```typescript\nauthority: \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/common\",\n// or for work/school accounts only:\nauthority: \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/organizations\",\n```\n\n- Users from any Azure AD tenant can sign in\n- Token issuer varies by user''s tenant\n- **Backend validation must handle multiple issuers**:\n\n```typescript\n// Multi-tenant issuer validation\nconst tenantId = payload.tid; // Tenant ID from token\nconst expectedIssuer = `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0`;\nif (payload.iss !== expectedIssuer) {\n  throw new Error(\"Invalid issuer\");\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Frontend (.env)\n\n```bash\nVITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-guid\nVITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID=your-tenant-id-guid\n```\n\n### Backend (wrangler.jsonc)\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-api\",\n  \"vars\": {\n    \"AZURE_TENANT_ID\": \"your-tenant-id-guid\",\n    \"AZURE_CLIENT_ID\": \"your-client-id-guid\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Azure AD B2C Sunset\n\n**Timeline**:\n- **May 1, 2025**: Azure AD B2C no longer available for new customer signups\n- **March 15, 2026**: Azure AD B2C P2 discontinued for all customers\n- **May 2030**: Microsoft will continue supporting existing B2C customers with standard support\n\n**Source**: [Microsoft Q&A](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/questions/2119363/migrating-existing-azure-ad-b2c-to-microsoft-entra)\n\n**Existing B2C Customers**: Can continue using B2C until 2030, but should plan migration to Entra External ID.\n\n**New Projects**: Use **Microsoft Entra External ID** for consumer/customer identity scenarios.\n\n**Migration Status**: As of January 2026, automated migration tools are in testing phase. Manual migration guidance available at Microsoft Learn.\n\n**Migration Path**:\n- Different authority URL format (`{tenant}.ciamlogin.com` vs `{tenant}.b2clogin.com`)\n- Updated SDK support (same MSAL libraries)\n- New pricing model (consumption-based)\n- Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR) approach available for user migration\n- Seamless migration samples on GitHub (preview)\n\nSee: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/external-id/\nMigration Guide: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/external-id/customers/how-to-migrate-users\n\n---\n\n## ADAL Retirement (Complete)\n\n**Status**: Azure AD Authentication Library (ADAL) was retired on September 30, 2025. Apps using ADAL no longer receive security updates.\n\n**If you''re migrating from ADAL**:\n1. ADAL → MSAL migration is required\n2. ADAL used v1.0 endpoints; MSAL uses v2.0 endpoints\n3. Token cache format differs - users must re-authenticate\n4. Scopes replace \"resources\" in token requests\n\n**Key Migration Changes**:\n```typescript\n// ADAL (deprecated) - resource-based\nacquireToken({ resource: \"https://graph.microsoft.com\" })\n\n// MSAL (current) - scope-based\nacquireTokenSilent({ scopes: [\"https://graph.microsoft.com/User.Read\"] })\n```\n\nSee: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/msal/javascript/migration/msal-net-migration\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [MSAL React Documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/msal/javascript/react/)\n- [Microsoft Entra ID App Registration](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/quickstart-register-app)\n- [MSAL.js GitHub Issues](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues)\n- [jose Library](https://github.com/panva/jose)\n- [Cloudflare Workers + Azure AD Blog](https://hajekj.net/2021/11/12/cloudflare-workers-and-azure-ad/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:12:56.087Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Security Agents requiring secure Microsoft Entra ID authentication flows.","zh":"适用于需要安全的Microsoft Entra ID身份验证流的云安全代理。","ja":"Microsoft Entra IDのセキュアな認証フローを必要とするクラウドセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"안전한 Microsoft Entra ID 인증 흐름이 필요한 클라우드 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad en la nube que requieren flujos de autenticación de Microsoft Entra ID seguros.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité cloud nécessitant des flux d''authentification Microsoft Entra ID sécurisés.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die sichere Microsoft Entra ID-Authentifizierungsflüsse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança de Nuvem que exigem fluxos de autenticação de ID da Microsoft Entra seguros.","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности облака, требующих безопасных потоков аутентификации Microsoft Entra ID.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أمناء السحابة الذين يتطلبون تدفقات مصادقة آمنة لمايكروسوفت إنترا آي دي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement secure authentication protocols for React SPAs and Cloudflare Workers using MSAL v5. Provides seamless integration with Microsoft Entra ID (formerly Azure AD) for token management and B2C scenarios.","zh":"允许代理实现React SPAs和Cloudflare Workers使用MSAL v5的安全身份验证协议。为Microsoft Entra ID（以前的Azure AD）提供无缝的令牌管理和B2C场景集成。","ja":"MSAL v5を使用したReact SPAsとCloudflare Workersのセキュアな認証プロトコルをエージェントが実装できるようにします。Microsoft Entra ID（旧Azure AD）とのトークン管理とB2Cシナリオのシームレスな統合を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 MSAL v5를 사용하여 React SPAs 및 Cloudflare Workers에 대한 보안 인증 프로토콜을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. Microsoft Entra ID(이전 Azure AD)와의 토큰 관리 및 B2C 시나리오에 대한無縫な 통합을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar protocolos de autenticación seguros para SPAs de React y Cloudflare Workers con MSAL v5. Proporciona una integración sin problemas con Microsoft Entra ID (anteriormente Azure AD) para la administración de tokens y escenarios B2C.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des protocoles d''authentification sécurisés pour les SPAs React et les Cloudflare Workers avec MSAL v5. Fournit une intégration transparente avec Microsoft Entra ID (anciennement Azure AD) pour la gestion des jetons et les scénarios B2C.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, sichere Authentifizierungsprotokolle für React-SPAs und Cloudflare-Worker mit MSAL v5 zu implementieren. Bietet eine nahtlose Integration mit Microsoft Entra ID (früher Azure AD) für Tokenverwaltung und B2C-Szenarien.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem protocolos de autenticação seguros para SPAs do React e Cloudflare Workers usando MSAL v5. Fornece integração perfeita com Microsoft Entra ID (anteriormente Azure AD) para gerenciamento de token e cenários B2C.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать безопасные протоколы аутентификации для React SPAs и Cloudflare Workers с использованием MSAL v5. Обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию с Microsoft Entra ID (ранее Azure AD) для управления токенами и сценариев B2C.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ بروتوكولات مصادقة آمنة لمواقع التطبيقات الواحدة من رياكت وتطبيقات كلاود فلير باستخدام إم إس إيه إل 5. يوفر تكاملًا سلسًا مع مايكروسوفت إنترا آي دي (سابقًا أزور آد) لإدارة الرموز والأحوال بى تو سى."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure SPA authentication flows","Managing Azure AD B2C user sign-ins","Validating JWT tokens in Cloudflare Workers","Migrating from ADAL to MSAL v5"],"zh":["实现安全的SPA身份验证流程","管理Azure AD B2C用户登录","在Cloudflare Workers中验证JWT令牌","从ADAL迁移到MSAL v5"],"ja":["セキュアなSPA認証フローの実装","Azure AD B2Cユーザーのサインインの管理","Cloudflare WorkersでのJWTトークンの検証","ADALからMSAL v5への移行"],"ko":["보안 SPA 인증 흐름 구현","Azure AD B2C 사용자 로그인 관리","Cloudflare Workers에서 JWT 토큰 검증","ADAL에서 MSAL v5로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Implementar flujos de autenticación de SPA seguros","Administrar los registros de inicio de sesión de usuario de Azure AD B2C","Validar tokens JWT en Cloudflare Workers","Migrar de ADAL a MSAL v5"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des flux d''authentification de SPA sécurisés","Gérer les connexions de l''utilisateur Azure AD B2C","Valider les jetons JWT dans les Cloudflare Workers","Migrer de ADAL à MSAL v5"],"de":["Implementierung sicherer SPA-Authentifizierungsflüsse","Verwalten von Azure AD B2C-Benutzeranmeldungen","Validieren von JWT-Tokens in Cloudflare-Workern","Migration von ADAL zu MSAL v5"],"pt":["Implementar fluxos de autenticação de SPA seguros","Gerenciar entradas de usuário do Azure AD B2C","Validar tokens JWT nos Cloudflare Workers","Migrar do ADAL para o MSAL v5"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных потоков аутентификации SPA","Управление входами пользователей Azure AD B2C","Проверка токенов JWT в Cloudflare Workers","Миграция с ADAL на MSAL v5"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات مصادقة تطبيق واحد آمنة","إدارة عمليات تسجيل الدخول للمستخدمين في أزور آد بى تو سى"," التحقق من رموز جى دبليو تى في تطبيقات كلاود فلير","الانتقال من أدال إلى إم إس إيه إل 5"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MSAL v4→v5 migration by January 2026","Azure AD B2C new signups blocked after May 2025","ADAL retirement complete by September 2025"],"zh":["需要2026年1月前完成MSAL v4→v5迁移","2025年5月后Azure AD B2C新注册将被阻止","2025年9月前ADAL退役完成"],"ja":["2026年1月までにMSAL v4→v5の移行を完了する必要","2025年5月以降のAzure AD B2C新規登録はブロックされる","2025年9月までにADALの廃止を完了"],"ko":["2026년 1월까지 MSAL v4→v5 마이그레이션 완료 필요","2025년 5월 이후 Azure AD B2C 신규 가입 차단","2025년 9월까지 ADAL 폐지 완료"],"es":["Requiere la migración de MSAL v4 a v5 antes de enero de 2026","Nuevos registros de Azure AD B2C bloqueados después de mayo de 2025","Jubilación completa de ADAL antes de septiembre de 2025"],"fr":["Nécessite la migration de MSAL v4 à v5 avant janvier 2026","Nouveaux inscriptions Azure AD B2C bloquées après mai 2025","Retraite complète d''ADAL avant septembre 2025"],"de":["Erfordert die Migration von MSAL v4 zu v5 bis Januar 2026","Neue Azure AD B2C-Registrierungen nach Mai 2025 gesperrt","Vollständige Einstellung von ADAL bis September 2025"],"pt":["Exige migração do MSAL v4 para v5 até janeiro de 2026","Novos cadastros do Azure AD B2C bloqueados após maio de 2025","Aposentadoria do ADAL concluída até setembro de 2025"],"ru":["Требует миграции с MSAL v4 на v5 до января 2026 года","Новые регистрации Azure AD B2C заблокированы после мая 2025 года","Полное завершение вывода из эксплуатации ADAL к сентябрю 2025 года"],"ar":["يتطلب تحويل إم إس إيه إل 4 إلى 5 قبل يناير 2026","حظر التسجيلات الجديدة لأزور آد بى تو سى بعد مايو 2025","إتمام إيقاف أدال تمامًا قبل سبتمبر 2025"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jyasuu/cheat-sheet/vcpkg', 'community', 'jyasuu', 'cheat-sheet', 'jyasuu/cheat-sheet', 'vcpkg', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:13:26.079Z', NULL, '{"id":"jyasuu/cheat-sheet/vcpkg","name":"vcpkg","description":{"zh":"Vcpkg是微软开发的C++包管理器，用于简化C++库的获取和集成过程","ja":"Vcpkgはマイクロソフトが開発したC++パッケージマネージャーであり、C++ライブラリの取得と統合を簡素化するために使用される","ko":"Vcpkg는 마이크로소프트에서 개발한 C++ 패키지 매니저로서 C++ 라이브러리의 가져오기 및 통합 과정을 단순화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"vcpkg es un administrador de paquetes para C++ que facilita la instalación y configuración de bibliotecas y dependencias.","fr":"vcpkg est un gestionnaire de packages pour C++ qui facilite l''installation et la configuration de bibliothèques et de dépendances.","de":"vcpkg ist ein Paket-Manager für C++, der die Installation und Konfiguration von Bibliotheken und Abhängigkeiten erleichtert.","pt":"O vcpkg é um gerenciador de pacotes C++ que facilita a instalação e gestão de dependências em projetos C++","ru":"vcpkg — это менеджер пакетов C++, который упрощает установку и управление зависимостями в проектах C++","ar":"vcpkg هو مدير حزم C++ يسهل عملية تثبيت وإدارة الإعتماديات في مشاريع C++","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Vcpkg：C++包管理器","ja":"Vcpkg：C++パッケージマネージャー","ko":"Vcpkg: C++ 패키지 매니저","es":"vcpkg: Administrador de Paquetes C++","fr":"vcpkg: Gestionnaire de Packages C++","de":"vcpkg: C++-Paket-Manager","pt":"vcpkg: Gerenciador de Pacotes C++","ru":"vcpkg: Менеджер пакетов C++","ar":"vcpkg: مدير حزم C++","en":"vcpkg"},"description":{"zh":"Vcpkg是微软开发的C++包管理器，用于简化C++库的获取和集成过程","ja":"Vcpkgはマイクロソフトが開発したC++パッケージマネージャーであり、C++ライブラリの取得と統合を簡素化するために使用される","ko":"Vcpkg는 마이크로소프트에서 개발한 C++ 패키지 매니저로서 C++ 라이브러리의 가져오기 및 통합 과정을 단순화하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"vcpkg es un administrador de paquetes para C++ que facilita la instalación y configuración de bibliotecas y dependencias.","fr":"vcpkg est un gestionnaire de packages pour C++ qui facilite l''installation et la configuration de bibliothèques et de dépendances.","de":"vcpkg ist ein Paket-Manager für C++, der die Installation und Konfiguration von Bibliotheken und Abhängigkeiten erleichtert.","pt":"O vcpkg é um gerenciador de pacotes C++ que facilita a instalação e gestão de dependências em projetos C++","ru":"vcpkg — это менеджер пакетов C++, который упрощает установку и управление зависимостями в проектах C++","ar":"vcpkg هو مدير حزم C++ يسهل عملية تثبيت وإدارة الإعتماديات في مشاريع C++","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["简化C++库的获取和集成","支持多个平台，包括Windows、Linux和macOS","提供了大量的C++库和框架","支持自定义包的创建和发布","集成了环境变量设置和PATH配置"],"ja":["C++ライブラリの取得と統合を簡素化","複数のプラットフォーム、包括してWindows、Linux、macOSをサポート","多数のC++ライブラリとフレームワークを提供","カスタムパッケージの作成と公開をサポート","環境変数の設定とPATHの構成を統合"],"ko":["C++ 라이브러리의 가져오기 및 통합을 단순화","여러 플랫폼을 지원, 포함하여 Windows, Linux 및 macOS","많은 C++ 라이브러리와 프레임워크를 제공","사용자 정의 패키지의 생성 및 게시를 지원","환경 변수 설정 및 PATH 구성 통합"],"es":["Instalación de paquetes C++","Configuración de entornos de desarrollo","Gestión de dependencias","Integración con proyectos de C++","Soporte para múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Installation de packages C++","Configuration des environnements de développement","Gestion des dépendances","Intégration avec des projets C++","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Installation von C++-Paketen","Konfiguration von Entwicklungsumgebungen","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Integration mit C++-Projekten","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen"],"pt":["Instalação de pacotes C++","Gestão de dependências","Integração com o ambiente de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Facilidade de uso"],"ru":["Установка пакетов C++","Управление зависимостями","Интеграция с средой разработки","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Легкость использования"],"ar":["تثبيت حزم C++","إدارة الإعتماديات","التكامل مع بيئة التطوير","دعم منصات متعددة","سهولة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vcpkg","C++包管理器","C++库","依存关系管理","开发工具","微软开发"],"ja":["Vcpkg","C++パッケージマネージャー","C++ライブラリ","依存関係管理","開発ツール","マイクロソフト開発"],"ko":["Vcpkg","C++ 패키지 매니저","C++ 라이브러리","의존성 관리","개발 도구","마이크로소프트 개발"],"es":["vcpkg","administrador de paquetes C++","gestión de dependencias","instalación de paquetes","configuración de entornos de desarrollo","C++","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["vcpkg","gestionnaire de packages C++","gestion des dépendances","installation de packages","configuration des environnements de développement","C++","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["vcpkg","Paket-Manager für C++","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten","Installation von Paketen","Konfiguration von Entwicklungsumgebungen","C++","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["vcpkg","gerenciador de pacotes C++","desenvolvimento C++","dependências C++","bibliotecas C++","instalação de pacotes"],"ru":["vcpkg","менеджер пакетов C++","разработка C++","зависимости C++","библиотеки C++","установка пакетов"],"ar":["vcpkg","مدير حزم C++","تطوير C++","إعتماديات C++","مكتبات C++","تثبيت حزم"]}},"owner":"jyasuu","repo":"cheat-sheet","repoPath":"jyasuu/cheat-sheet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vcpkg","description":"C++ package manager for Windows with installation, environment setup, and package installation commands.","bodyPreview":"# Vcpkg — C++ Package Manager\n\n**Bootstrap**\n\n```powershell\ngit clone https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg\ncd vcpkg; .\\bootstrap-vcpkg.bat\n```\n\n**Env Setup**\n\n```powershell\n$env:VCPKG_ROOT = \"D:\\git\\vcpkg\"\n$env:PATH = \"$env:VCPKG_ROOT;$env:PATH\"\n```\n\n**Install Package**\n\n```powershell\nvcpkg install libxml2:x64-windows\nvcpkg integrate install\n```\n\n🔗 [Official Guide](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/vcpkg/get_started/get-started?pivots=shell-powershell)","body":"# Vcpkg — C++ Package Manager\n\n**Bootstrap**\n\n```powershell\ngit clone https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg\ncd vcpkg; .\\bootstrap-vcpkg.bat\n```\n\n**Env Setup**\n\n```powershell\n$env:VCPKG_ROOT = \"D:\\git\\vcpkg\"\n$env:PATH = \"$env:VCPKG_ROOT;$env:PATH\"\n```\n\n**Install Package**\n\n```powershell\nvcpkg install libxml2:x64-windows\nvcpkg integrate install\n```\n\n🔗 [Official Guide](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/vcpkg/get_started/get-started?pivots=shell-powershell)"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:13:26.079Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for C++ Development Agents needing efficient package management and integration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效包管理和集成能力的C++开发代理。","ja":"C++開発エージェントが効率的なパッケージ管理と統合機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 패키지 관리와 통합 기능이 필요한 C++ 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de C++ que necesitan una gestión de paquetes eficiente y capacidades de integración.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement C++ ayant besoin d''une gestion de packages efficace et de capacités d''intégration.","de":"Perfekt für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente Paketverwaltung und Integrationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que necessitam de gerenciamento de pacotes eficiente e capacidades de integração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки C++, которым необходим эффективный менеджер пакетов и возможности интеграции.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير سي ++ الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة حزمة فعالة وقدرات دمج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly install and manage C++ libraries like libxml2, integrate them into projects, and leverage the vcpkg package manager for efficient dependency resolution, all while utilizing PowerShell for scripting and automation.","zh":"赋予代理无缝安装和管理C++库（如libxml2），将它们集成到项目中，并利用vcpkg包管理器进行高效的依赖解析，同时利用PowerShell进行脚本编写和自动化。","ja":"エージェントはC++ライブラリ（libxml2など）をシームレスにインストールして管理し、プロジェクトに統合し、vcpkgパッケージマネージャーを使用して依存関係を効率的に解決し、PowerShellを使用してスクリプト作成と自動化を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 C++ 라이브러리（libxml2 등）를無縫하게 설치하고 관리하고, 프로젝트에 통합하고, vcpkg 패키지 관리자를 사용하여 의존성을 효율적으로 해결하며, PowerShell를 사용하여 스크립트 작성과 자동화를 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar y administrar bibliotecas de C++ como libxml2 de manera transparente, integrarlas en proyectos y aprovechar el administrador de paquetes vcpkg para una resolución de dependencias eficiente, todo mientras se utiliza PowerShell para scripting y automatización.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer et de gérer des bibliothèques C++ comme libxml2 de manière transparente, de les intégrer dans des projets et d''utiliser le gestionnaire de packages vcpkg pour une résolution de dépendances efficace, le tout en utilisant PowerShell pour le scripting et l''automatisation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, C++-Bibliotheken wie libxml2 nahtlos zu installieren und zu verwalten, sie in Projekte zu integrieren und den Paket-Manager vcpkg für eine effiziente Abhängigkeitsauflösung zu nutzen, und zwar unter Verwendung von PowerShell für Skripting und Automatisierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar e gerenciar bibliotecas C++ como libxml2 de forma transparente, integrá-las em projetos e aproveitar o gerenciador de pacotes vcpkg para resolução eficiente de dependências, tudo isso utilizando o PowerShell para scripting e automação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовно устанавливать и управлять библиотеками C++, такими как libxml2, интегрировать их в проекты и использовать менеджер пакетов vcpkg для эффективного разрешения зависимостей, все это при использовании PowerShell для скриптинга и автоматизации.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تثبيت وإدارة مكتبات سي ++ مثل libxml2 بطريقة прозрачة ، ودمجها في المشاريع ، وتوفير مدير الحزم vcpkg لحل التبعيات بكفاءة ، كل ذلك باستخدام PowerShell للبرمجة النصية والتحكم الآلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Installing C++ libraries for cross-platform development","Integrating vcpkg with existing C++ projects","Managing dependencies for large-scale C++ applications"],"zh":["为跨平台开发安装C++库","将vcpkg与现有的C++项目集成","管理大型C++应用程序的依赖项"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム開発のためのC++ライブラリのインストール","vcpkgを既存のC++プロジェクトに統合する","大規模C++アプリケーションの依存関係の管理"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 개발을 위한 C++ 라이브러리 설치","기존 C++ 프로젝트에 vcpkg 통합","대규모 C++ 애플리케이션의 의존성 관리"],"es":["Instalación de bibliotecas de C++ para el desarrollo multiplataforma","Integración de vcpkg con proyectos de C++ existentes","Administración de dependencias para aplicaciones de C++ a gran escala"],"fr":["Installation de bibliothèques C++ pour le développement multiplateforme","Intégration de vcpkg avec des projets C++ existants","Gestion des dépendances pour les applications C++ à grande échelle"],"de":["Installation von C++-Bibliotheken für die Cross-Plattform-Entwicklung","Integration von vcpkg in bestehende C++-Projekte","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten für große C++-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Instalar bibliotecas C++ para desenvolvimento cross-plataforma","Integrar vcpkg com projetos C++ existentes","Gerenciar dependências para aplicações C++ em larga escala"],"ru":["Установка библиотек C++ для кроссплатформенного развития","Интеграция vcpkg с существующими проектами C++","Управление зависимостями для крупномасштабных приложений C++"],"ar":["تثبيت مكتبات سي ++ للتنمية متعددة المنصات","دمج vcpkg مع مشاريع سي ++ الحالية","إدارة التبعيات لتطبيقات سي ++ على نطاق واسع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PowerShell for scripting and automation","Limited to C++ package management","Needs specific environment setup with VCPKG_ROOT and PATH variables"],"zh":["需要PowerShell进行脚本编写和自动化","仅限C++包管理","需要设置特定的环境变量VCPKG_ROOT和PATH"],"ja":["スクリプト作成と自動化にPowerShellが必要","C++パッケージ管理のみ","VCPKG_ROOTとPATH変数の特定の環境設定が必要"],"ko":["스크립트 작성과 자동화에 PowerShell가 필요","C++ 패키지 관리만","VCPKG_ROOT와 PATH 변수의 특정 환경 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere PowerShell para scripting y automatización","Limitado a la gestión de paquetes de C++","Necesita un entorno de configuración específico con variables VCPKG_ROOT y PATH"],"fr":["Nécessite PowerShell pour le scripting et l''automatisation","Limité à la gestion de packages C++","Nécessite une configuration d''environnement spécifique avec des variables VCPKG_ROOT et PATH"],"de":["Benötigt PowerShell für Skripting und Automatisierung","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von C++-Paketen","Benötigt eine spezifische Umgebungs-einrichtung mit VCPKG_ROOT- und PATH-Variablen"],"pt":["Requer PowerShell para scripting e automação","Limitado ao gerenciamento de pacotes C++","Necessita de configuração de ambiente específica com variáveis VCPKG_ROOT e PATH"],"ru":["Требует PowerShell для скриптинга и автоматизации","Ограничен менеджером пакетов C++","Требует специальной настройки окружения с переменными VCPKG_ROOT и PATH"],"ar":["يتطلب PowerShell للبرمجة النصية والتحكم الآلي","محدود لإدارة حزمة سي ++","يحتاج إلى إعداد بيئة محدد مع متغيرات VCPKG_ROOT و PATH"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('evolv3ai/claude-skills-archive/azure-auth', 'community', 'evolv3ai', 'claude-skills-archive', 'evolv3ai/claude-skills-archive', 'azure-auth', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:12:38.739Z', NULL, '{"id":"evolv3ai/claude-skills-archive/azure-auth","name":"azure-auth","description":{"zh":"Azure Auth是一套用于React和Cloudflare Workers的生产就绪技能，支持Microsoft Entra ID身份验证","ja":"Azure Authは、Microsoft Entra ID認証をサポートするReactとCloudflare Workers用のプロダクションレディースキルセットです","ko":"Azure Auth는 Microsoft Entra ID 인증을 지원하는 React 및 Cloudflare Workers용 생산 준비 스킬 세트입니다","es":"Azure Auth es un paquete para autenticar aplicaciones React con Azure AD y Cloudflare Workers, compatible con MSAL v5","fr":"Azure Auth est un package pour authentifier les applications React avec Azure AD et Cloudflare Workers, compatible avec MSAL v5","de":"Azure Auth ist ein Paket zur Authentifizierung von React-Anwendungen mit Azure AD und Cloudflare Workers, kompatibel mit MSAL v5","pt":"O azure-auth é um skill de código para implementar autenticação Azure em aplicações React com Cloudflare Workers e MSAL.","ru":"Azure-auth — это навык кода для реализации авторизации Azure в приложениях React с Cloudflare Workers и MSAL.","ar":"أزرور أوتو هو مهارة كود لتنفيذ التحقق من هوية أزرور في تطبيقات الرياكت مع كلاود فلير ووركرز و إم إس إيه إل","en":"Production-ready skills for Claude Code CLI - Cloudflare, React, Tailwind v4, and AI integrations"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Azure Auth集成：React与Cloudflare Workers的身份验证解决方案","ja":"Azure Auth統合：ReactとCloudflare Workersの認証ソリューション","ko":"Azure Auth 통합: React 및 Cloudflare Workers의 인증 솔루션","es":"Autenticación de Azure para React y Cloudflare","fr":"Authentification Azure pour React et Cloudflare","de":"Azure-Authentifizierung für React und Cloudflare","pt":"Azure Auth para React e Cloudflare","ru":"Авторизация Azure для React и Cloudflare","ar":"أزرور أوتو للرياكت وكلاودفلار","en":"azure-auth"},"description":{"zh":"Azure Auth是一套用于React和Cloudflare Workers的生产就绪技能，支持Microsoft Entra ID身份验证","ja":"Azure Authは、Microsoft Entra ID認証をサポートするReactとCloudflare Workers用のプロダクションレディースキルセットです","ko":"Azure Auth는 Microsoft Entra ID 인증을 지원하는 React 및 Cloudflare Workers용 생산 준비 스킬 세트입니다","es":"Azure Auth es un paquete para autenticar aplicaciones React con Azure AD y Cloudflare Workers, compatible con MSAL v5","fr":"Azure Auth est un package pour authentifier les applications React avec Azure AD et Cloudflare Workers, compatible avec MSAL v5","de":"Azure Auth ist ein Paket zur Authentifizierung von React-Anwendungen mit Azure AD und Cloudflare Workers, kompatibel mit MSAL v5","pt":"O azure-auth é um skill de código para implementar autenticação Azure em aplicações React com Cloudflare Workers e MSAL.","ru":"Azure-auth — это навык кода для реализации авторизации Azure в приложениях React с Cloudflare Workers и MSAL.","ar":"أزرور أوتو هو مهارة كود لتنفيذ التحقق من هوية أزرور في تطبيقات الرياكت مع كلاود فلير ووركرز و إم إس إيه إل","en":"Production-ready skills for Claude Code CLI - Cloudflare, React, Tailwind v4, and AI integrations"},"definition":{"en":"Production-ready skills for Claude Code CLI - Cloudflare, React, Tailwind v4, and AI integrations"},"features":{"zh":["Microsoft Entra ID身份验证","React和Cloudflare Workers集成","最新的MSAL和Azure AD B2C功能","生产就绪技能","安全的身份验证"],"ja":["Microsoft Entra ID認証","ReactとCloudflare Workers統合","最新のMSALとAzure AD B2C機能","プロダクションレディースキル","安全な認証"],"ko":["Microsoft Entra ID 인증","React 및 Cloudflare Workers 통합","최신 MSAL 및 Azure AD B2C 기능","생산 준비 스킬","보안 인증"],"es":["Integración con Azure AD y Cloudflare Workers","Compatibilidad con MSAL v5","Soporte para aplicaciones React","Autenticación segura con Microsoft Entra ID","Actualizaciones de paquetes automatizadas"],"fr":["Intégration avec Azure AD et Cloudflare Workers","Compatibilité avec MSAL v5","Prise en charge des applications React","Authentification sécurisée avec Microsoft Entra ID","Mises à jour de packages automatiques"],"de":["Integration mit Azure AD und Cloudflare Workers","Kompatibilität mit MSAL v5","Unterstützung für React-Anwendungen","Sichere Authentifizierung mit Microsoft Entra ID","Automatisierte Paket-Updates"],"pt":["Implementação de autenticação Azure em aplicações React","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Suporte a MSAL (Microsoft Authentication Library)","Compatibilidade com React e Tailwind v4","Suporte a AI integrations"],"ru":["Реализация авторизации Azure в приложениях React","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка MSAL (Microsoft Authentication Library)","Совместимость с React и Tailwind v4","Поддержка интеграций AI"],"ar":["تنفيذ التحقق من هوية أزرور في تطبيقات الرياكت","التكامل مع كلاود فلير ووركرز","دعم إم إس إيه إل (مكتبة التحقق من هوية مايكروسوفت)","التوافق مع الرياكت وتايل ويند v4","دعم تكاملات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Auth","React","Cloudflare Workers","Microsoft Entra ID","身份验证","MSAL","Azure AD B2C"],"ja":["Azure Auth","React","Cloudflare Workers","Microsoft Entra ID","認証","MSAL","Azure AD B2C"],"ko":["Azure Auth","React","Cloudflare Workers","Microsoft Entra ID","인증","MSAL","Azure AD B2C"],"es":["azure auth","react azure ad","cloudflare workers","msal v5","autenticación segura","desarrollo de aplicaciones","azure ad b2c","adal retirement"],"fr":["azure auth","react azure ad","cloudflare workers","msal v5","authentification sécurisée","développement d''applications","azure ad b2c","adal retirement"],"de":["azure auth","react azure ad","cloudflare workers","msal v5","sichere authentifizierung","anwendungsentwicklung","azure ad b2c","adal retirement"],"pt":["azure auth","autenticação azure","react","cloudflare workers","msal","tailwind v4","ai integrations","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["авторизация azure","azure auth","react","cloudflare workers","msal","tailwind v4","интеграции ai","веб-разработка"],"ar":["أزرور أوتو","التحقق من هوية أزرور","رياكت","كلاود فلير ووركرز","إم إس إيه إل","تايل ويند v4","تكاملات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"evolv3ai","repo":"claude-skills-archive","repoPath":"evolv3ai/claude-skills-archive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-auth","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID for React + Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Package Versions**: @azure/msal-react@5.0.2, @azure/msal-browser@5.0.2, jose@6.1.3\n**Breaking Changes**: MSAL v4→v5 migration (January 2026), Azure AD B2C sunset (May 2025 - new signups blocked, existing until 2030), ADAL retirement (Sept 2025 - complete)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   React SPA         │────▶│","body":"# Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID for React + Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Package Versions**: @azure/msal-react@5.0.2, @azure/msal-browser@5.0.2, jose@6.1.3\n**Breaking Changes**: MSAL v4→v5 migration (January 2026), Azure AD B2C sunset (May 2025 - new signups blocked, existing until 2030), ADAL retirement (Sept 2025 - complete)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   React SPA         │────▶│  Microsoft Entra ID  │────▶│  Cloudflare Worker  │\n│   @azure/msal-react │     │  (login.microsoft)   │     │  jose JWT validation│\n└─────────────────────┘     └──────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘\n        │                                                          │\n        │  Authorization Code + PKCE                               │\n        │  (access_token, id_token)                                │\n        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                    Bearer token in Authorization header\n```\n\n**Key Constraint**: MSAL.js does NOT work in Cloudflare Workers (relies on browser/Node.js APIs). Use jose library for backend token validation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Frontend (React SPA)\nnpm install @azure/msal-react @azure/msal-browser\n\n# Backend (Cloudflare Workers)\nnpm install jose\n```\n\n### 2. Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. Go to **Microsoft Entra ID** → **App registrations** → **New registration**\n2. Set **Redirect URI** to `http://localhost:5173` (SPA type)\n3. Note the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) ID**\n4. Under **Authentication**:\n   - Enable **Access tokens** and **ID tokens**\n   - Add production redirect URI\n5. Under **API permissions**:\n   - Add `User.Read` (Microsoft Graph)\n   - Grant admin consent if required\n\n---\n\n## Frontend: MSAL React Setup\n\n### Configuration (src/auth/msal-config.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Configuration, LogLevel } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\n\nexport const msalConfig: Configuration = {\n  auth: {\n    clientId: import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID,\n    authority: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID}`,\n    redirectUri: window.location.origin,\n    postLogoutRedirectUri: window.location.origin,\n    navigateToLoginRequestUrl: true,\n  },\n  cache: {\n    cacheLocation: \"localStorage\", // or \"sessionStorage\"\n    storeAuthStateInCookie: true, // Required for Safari/Edge issues\n  },\n  system: {\n    loggerOptions: {\n      logLevel: LogLevel.Warning,\n      loggerCallback: (level, message) => {\n        if (level === LogLevel.Error) console.error(message);\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};\n\n// Scopes for token requests\nexport const loginRequest = {\n  scopes: [\"User.Read\", \"openid\", \"profile\", \"email\"],\n};\n\n// Scopes for API calls (add your API scope here)\nexport const apiRequest = {\n  scopes: [`api://${import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID}/access_as_user`],\n};\n```\n\n### MsalProvider Setup (src/main.tsx)\n\n```typescript\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport ReactDOM from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport { PublicClientApplication, EventType } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { MsalProvider } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { msalConfig } from \"./auth/msal-config\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\n// CRITICAL: Initialize MSAL outside component tree to prevent re-instantiation\nconst msalInstance = new PublicClientApplication(msalConfig);\n\n// Handle redirect promise on page load\nmsalInstance.initialize().then(() => {\n  // Set active account after redirect\n  // IMPORTANT: Use getAllAccounts() (returns array), NOT getActiveAccount() (returns single account or null)\n  const accounts = msalInstance.getAllAccounts();\n  if (accounts.length > 0) {\n    msalInstance.setActiveAccount(accounts[0]);\n  }\n\n  // Listen for sign-in events\n  msalInstance.addEventCallback((event) => {\n    if (event.eventType === EventType.LOGIN_SUCCESS && event.payload) {\n      const account = (event.payload as { account: any }).account;\n      msalInstance.setActiveAccount(account);\n    }\n  });\n\n  ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(\n    <React.StrictMode>\n      <MsalProvider instance={msalInstance}>\n        <App />\n      </MsalProvider>\n    </React.StrictMode>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n### Protected Route Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMsal, useIsAuthenticated } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { InteractionStatus } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { loginRequest } from \"./msal-config\";\n\nexport function ProtectedRoute({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const { instance, inProgress } = useMsal();\n  const isAuthenticated = useIsAuthenticated();\n\n  // Wait for MSAL to finish any in-progress operations\n  if (inProgress !== InteractionStatus.None) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  if (!isAuthenticated) {\n    // Trigger login redirect\n    instance.loginRedirect(loginRequest);\n    return <div>Redirecting to login...</div>;\n  }\n\n  return <>{children}</>;\n}\n```\n\n### Acquiring Tokens for API Calls\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMsal } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { InteractionRequiredAuthError } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { apiRequest } from \"./msal-config\";\n\nexport function useApiToken() {\n  const { instance, accounts } = useMsal();\n\n  async function getAccessToken(): Promise<string | null> {\n    if (accounts.length === 0) return null;\n\n    const request = {\n      ...apiRequest,\n      account: accounts[0],\n    };\n\n    try {\n      // Try silent token acquisition first\n      const response = await instance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n      return response.accessToken;\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (error instanceof InteractionRequiredAuthError) {\n        // Silent acquisition failed, need interactive login\n        // This handles expired refresh tokens (AADSTS700084)\n        await instance.acquireTokenRedirect(request);\n        return null;\n      }\n      throw error;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { getAccessToken };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Backend: Cloudflare Workers JWT Validation\n\n### Why jose Instead of MSAL\n\nMSAL.js relies on browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage) and Node.js crypto modules that don''t exist in Cloudflare Workers'' V8 isolate runtime. The jose library is pure JavaScript and works perfectly in Workers.\n\n### JWT Validation (src/auth/validate-token.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as jose from \"jose\";\n\ninterface EntraTokenPayload {\n  aud: string;       // Audience (your client ID or API URI)\n  iss: string;       // Issuer (https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant}/v2.0)\n  sub: string;       // Subject (user''s unique ID)\n  oid: string;       // Object ID (user''s Azure AD object ID)\n  preferred_username: string;\n  name: string;\n  email?: string;\n  roles?: string[];  // App roles if configured\n  scp?: string;      // Scopes (space-separated)\n}\n\n// Cache JWKS to avoid fetching on every request\nlet jwksCache: jose.JWTVerifyGetKey | null = null;\nlet jwksCacheTime = 0;\nconst JWKS_CACHE_DURATION = 3600000; // 1 hour\n\nasync function getJWKS(tenantId: string): Promise<jose.JWTVerifyGetKey> {\n  const now = Date.now();\n\n  if (jwksCache && now - jwksCacheTime < JWKS_CACHE_DURATION) {\n    return jwksCache;\n  }\n\n  // CRITICAL: Azure AD JWKS is NOT at .well-known/jwks.json\n  // Must fetch from openid-configuration first\n  const configUrl = `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration`;\n  const configResponse = await fetch(configUrl);\n  const config = await configResponse.json() as { jwks_uri: string };\n\n  // Now fetch JWKS from the correct URL\n  jwksCache = jose.createRemoteJWKSet(new URL(config.jwks_uri));\n  jwksCacheTime = now;\n\n  return jwksCache;\n}\n\nexport async function validateEntraToken(\n  token: string,\n  env: {\n    AZURE_TENANT_ID: string;\n    AZURE_CLIENT_ID: string;\n  }\n): Promise<EntraTokenPayload | null> {\n  try {\n    const jwks = await getJWKS(env.AZURE_TENANT_ID);\n\n    const { payload } = await jose.jwtVerify(token, jwks, {\n      issuer: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${env.AZURE_TENANT_ID}/v2.0`,\n      audience: env.AZURE_CLIENT_ID, // or your API URI: api://{client_id}\n    });\n\n    return payload as unknown as EntraTokenPayload;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"Token validation failed:\", error);\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Worker Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport { validateEntraToken } from \"./auth/validate-token\";\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env): Promise<Response> {\n    // Skip auth for public routes\n    const url = new URL(request.url);\n    if (url.pathname === \"/\" || url.pathname.startsWith(\"/public\")) {\n      return handlePublicRoute(request, env);\n    }\n\n    // Extract Bearer token\n    const authHeader = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\");\n    if (!authHeader?.startsWith(\"Bearer \")) {\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Missing authorization\" }), {\n        status: 401,\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      });\n    }\n\n    const token = authHeader.slice(7);\n    const user = await validateEntraToken(token, env);\n\n    if (!user) {\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Invalid token\" }), {\n        status: 401,\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Add user to request context\n    const requestWithUser = new Request(request);\n    // Pass user info downstream (e.g., via headers or context)\n\n    return handleProtectedRoute(request, env, user);\n  },\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors & Fixes\n\n### 1. AADSTS50058 - Silent Sign-In Loop\n\n**Error**: \"A silent sign-in request was sent but no user is signed in\"\n\n**Cause**: `acquireTokenSilent` called when no cached user exists.\n\n**Fix**:\n```typescript\n// Always check for accounts before silent acquisition\nconst accounts = instance.getAllAccounts();\nif (accounts.length === 0) {\n  // No cached user, trigger interactive login\n  await instance.loginRedirect(loginRequest);\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. AADSTS700084 - Refresh Token Expired\n\n**Error**: \"The refresh token was issued to a single page app (SPA), and therefore has a fixed, limited lifetime of 1.00:00:00\"\n\n**Cause**: SPA refresh tokens expire after 24 hours. Cannot be extended.\n\n**Fix**:\n```typescript\ntry {\n  const response = await instance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof InteractionRequiredAuthError) {\n    // Refresh token expired, need fresh login\n    await instance.acquireTokenRedirect(request);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. React Router v6 Redirect Loop\n\n**Error**: Infinite redirects between login page and app.\n\n**Cause**: React Router v6 may strip the hash fragment containing auth response.\n\n**Fix**: Use custom NavigationClient:\n```typescript\nimport { NavigationClient } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nclass CustomNavigationClient extends NavigationClient {\n  private navigate: ReturnType<typeof useNavigate>;\n\n  constructor(navigate: ReturnType<typeof useNavigate>) {\n    super();\n    this.navigate = navigate;\n  }\n\n  async navigateInternal(url: string, options: { noHistory: boolean }) {\n    const relativePath = url.replace(window.location.origin, \"\");\n    if (options.noHistory) {\n      this.navigate(relativePath, { replace: true });\n    } else {\n      this.navigate(relativePath);\n    }\n    return false; // Prevent MSAL from doing its own navigation\n  }\n}\n\n// In your App component:\nconst navigate = useNavigate();\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const navigationClient = new CustomNavigationClient(navigate);\n  instance.setNavigationClient(navigationClient);\n}, [instance, navigate]);\n```\n\n### 4. NextJS Dynamic Route Error\n\n**Error**: `no_cached_authority_error` in dynamic routes.\n\n**Cause**: MSAL instance not properly initialized before component renders.\n\n**Fix**: Initialize MSAL in `_app.tsx` before any routing:\n```typescript\n// pages/_app.tsx\nimport { PublicClientApplication } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { MsalProvider } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { msalConfig } from \"../auth/msal-config\";\n\n// Initialize outside component\nconst msalInstance = new PublicClientApplication(msalConfig);\n\n// Ensure initialization completes before render\nexport default function App({ Component, pageProps }) {\n  const [isInitialized, setIsInitialized] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    msalInstance.initialize().then(() => setIsInitialized(true));\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!isInitialized) return <div>Loading...</div>;\n\n  return (\n    <MsalProvider instance={msalInstance}>\n      <Component {...pageProps} />\n    </MsalProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Safari/Edge Cookie Issues\n\n**Error**: Auth state lost, infinite loop on Safari or Edge. On iOS 18 Safari specifically, silent token refresh fails with AADSTS50058 even when third-party cookies are enabled.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7384](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/7384)\n\n**Cause**: These browsers have stricter cookie policies affecting session storage. iOS 18 Safari doesn''t store the required session cookies for login.microsoftonline.com, even with third-party cookies explicitly allowed in settings.\n\n**Testing Note**: Works in Chrome on iOS 18, but fails in Safari on iOS 18.\n\n**Fix**: Enable cookie storage in MSAL config:\n```typescript\ncache: {\n  cacheLocation: \"localStorage\",\n  storeAuthStateInCookie: true, // REQUIRED for Safari/Edge\n}\n```\n\n**iOS 18 Safari Limitation**: If users still experience issues on iOS 18 Safari after enabling cookie storage, this is a known browser limitation with no current workaround. Recommend using Chrome on iOS or desktop browser.\n\n### 6. JWKS URL Not Found (Workers)\n\n**Error**: Failed to fetch JWKS from `.well-known/jwks.json`.\n\n**Cause**: Azure AD doesn''t serve JWKS at the standard OpenID Connect path.\n\n**Fix**: Fetch `openid-configuration` first, then use `jwks_uri`:\n```typescript\n// WRONG - Azure AD doesn''t use this path\nconst jwks = createRemoteJWKSet(\n  new URL(`https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/.well-known/jwks.json`)\n);\n\n// CORRECT - Fetch config first\nconst config = await fetch(\n  `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration`\n).then(r => r.json());\nconst jwks = createRemoteJWKSet(new URL(config.jwks_uri));\n```\n\n### 7. React Router Loader State Conflict\n\n**Error**: React warning about updating state during render when using `acquireTokenSilent` in React Router loaders.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7068](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/7068)\n\n**Cause**: Using the same `PublicClientApplication` instance in both the router loader and `MsalProvider` causes state updates during rendering.\n\n**Fix**: Call `initialize()` again in the loader:\n```typescript\nconst protectedLoader = async () => {\n  await msalInstance.initialize(); // Prevents state conflict\n  const response = await msalInstance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n  return { data };\n};\n```\n\n### 8. setActiveAccount Doesn''t Trigger Re-render (Community-sourced)\n\n**Error**: Components using `useMsal()` don''t update after calling `setActiveAccount()`.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6989](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/6989)\n\n**Verified**: Multiple users confirmed in GitHub issue\n\n**Cause**: `setActiveAccount()` updates the MSAL instance but doesn''t notify React of the change.\n\n**Fix**: Force re-render with state:\n```typescript\nconst [accountKey, setAccountKey] = useState(0);\n\nconst switchAccount = (newAccount) => {\n  msalInstance.setActiveAccount(newAccount);\n  setAccountKey(prev => prev + 1); // Force update\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Tenant vs Single-Tenant\n\n### Single Tenant (Recommended for Enterprise)\n\n```typescript\nauthority: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${TENANT_ID}`,\n```\n\n- Only users from your organization can sign in\n- Token issuer: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant_id}/v2.0`\n\n### Multi-Tenant\n\n```typescript\nauthority: \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/common\",\n// or for work/school accounts only:\nauthority: \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/organizations\",\n```\n\n- Users from any Azure AD tenant can sign in\n- Token issuer varies by user''s tenant\n- **Backend validation must handle multiple issuers**:\n\n```typescript\n// Multi-tenant issuer validation\nconst tenantId = payload.tid; // Tenant ID from token\nconst expectedIssuer = `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0`;\nif (payload.iss !== expectedIssuer) {\n  throw new Error(\"Invalid issuer\");\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Frontend (.env)\n\n```bash\nVITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-guid\nVITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID=your-tenant-id-guid\n```\n\n### Backend (wrangler.jsonc)\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-api\",\n  \"vars\": {\n    \"AZURE_TENANT_ID\": \"your-tenant-id-guid\",\n    \"AZURE_CLIENT_ID\": \"your-client-id-guid\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Azure AD B2C Sunset\n\n**Timeline**:\n- **May 1, 2025**: Azure AD B2C no longer available for new customer signups\n- **March 15, 2026**: Azure AD B2C P2 discontinued for all customers\n- **May 2030**: Microsoft will continue supporting existing B2C customers with standard support\n\n**Source**: [Microsoft Q&A](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/questions/2119363/migrating-existing-azure-ad-b2c-to-microsoft-entra)\n\n**Existing B2C Customers**: Can continue using B2C until 2030, but should plan migration to Entra External ID.\n\n**New Projects**: Use **Microsoft Entra External ID** for consumer/customer identity scenarios.\n\n**Migration Status**: As of January 2026, automated migration tools are in testing phase. Manual migration guidance available at Microsoft Learn.\n\n**Migration Path**:\n- Different authority URL format (`{tenant}.ciamlogin.com` vs `{tenant}.b2clogin.com`)\n- Updated SDK support (same MSAL libraries)\n- New pricing model (consumption-based)\n- Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR) approach available for user migration\n- Seamless migration samples on GitHub (preview)\n\nSee: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/external-id/\nMigration Guide: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/external-id/customers/how-to-migrate-users\n\n---\n\n## ADAL Retirement (Complete)\n\n**Status**: Azure AD Authentication Library (ADAL) was retired on September 30, 2025. Apps using ADAL no longer receive security updates.\n\n**If you''re migrating from ADAL**:\n1. ADAL → MSAL migration is required\n2. ADAL used v1.0 endpoints; MSAL uses v2.0 endpoints\n3. Token cache format differs - users must re-authenticate\n4. Scopes replace \"resources\" in token requests\n\n**Key Migration Changes**:\n```typescript\n// ADAL (deprecated) - resource-based\nacquireToken({ resource: \"https://graph.microsoft.com\" })\n\n// MSAL (current) - scope-based\nacquireTokenSilent({ scopes: [\"https://graph.microsoft.com/User.Read\"] })\n```\n\nSee: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/msal/javascript/migration/msal-net-migration\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [MSAL React Documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/msal/javascript/react/)\n- [Microsoft Entra ID App Registration](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/quickstart-register-app)\n- [MSAL.js GitHub Issues](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues)\n- [jose Library](https://github.com/panva/jose)\n- [Cloudflare Workers + Azure AD Blog](https://hajekj.net/2021/11/12/cloudflare-workers-and-azure-ad/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:12:38.739Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Workers and React Agents needing seamless Azure authentication integration with Microsoft Entra ID","zh":"非常适合需要与 Microsoft Entra ID 无缝集成 Azure 身份验证的 Cloudflare Workers 和 React 代理","ja":"Microsoft Entra ID とのシームレスな Azure 認証統合を必要とする Cloudflare Workers および React エージェントに最適","ko":"Microsoft Entra ID와의 무결점 Azure 인증 통합을 필요로 하는 Cloudflare Workers 및 React 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Cloudflare Workers y agentes de React que necesitan una integración de autenticación de Azure sin problemas con Microsoft Entra ID","fr":"Parfait pour les Cloudflare Workers et les agents React nécessitant une intégration d''authentification Azure transparente avec Microsoft Entra ID","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare Workers und React-Agents, die eine nahtlose Azure-Authentifizierung mit Microsoft Entra ID benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Cloudflare Workers e Agentes React que necessitam de uma integração perfeita de autenticação Azure com o Microsoft Entra ID","ru":"Идеально подходит для Cloudflare Workers и React Agents, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция аутентификации Azure с Microsoft Entra ID","ar":"مثالي لعامل Cloudflare Workers وعوامل React التي تحتاج إلى تكامل سلس لمصادقة Azure مع Microsoft Entra ID"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate users via Azure AD B2C using MSAL v5 libraries, including @azure/msal-react and @azure/msal-browser, while handling breaking changes like the MSAL v4→v5 migration and Azure AD B2C sunset","zh":"使代理能够通过 Azure AD B2C 使用 MSAL v5 库进行用户身份验证，包括 @azure/msal-react 和 @azure/msal-browser，同时处理破坏性变更，如从 MSAL v4 到 v5 的迁移和 Azure AD B2C 停止","ja":"エージェントが Azure AD B2C を使用して MSAL v5 ライブラリ (@azure/msal-react および @azure/msal-browser を含む) でユーザーを認証できるようにし、MSAL v4 から v5 への移行や Azure AD B2C の停止などの破壊的変更に対処","ko":"에이전트가 Azure AD B2C를 사용하여 MSAL v5 라이브러리(@azure/msal-react 및 @azure/msal-browser 포함)를 통해 사용자를 인증할 수 있도록 하며, MSAL v4에서 v5로의 마이그레이션 및 Azure AD B2C 중단과 같은 중단 변경 사항을 처리","es":"Habilita a los agentes para autenticar a los usuarios a través de Azure AD B2C utilizando las bibliotecas MSAL v5, incluyendo @azure/msal-react y @azure/msal-browser, mientras maneja cambios importantes como la migración de MSAL v4 a v5 y el fin de la vida útil de Azure AD B2C","fr":"Permet aux agents d''authentifier les utilisateurs via Azure AD B2C en utilisant les bibliothèques MSAL v5, notamment @azure/msal-react et @azure/msal-browser, tout en gérant les changements importants comme la migration de MSAL v4 à v5 et la fin de vie d''Azure AD B2C","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Benutzer über Azure AD B2C mithilfe der MSAL-Bibliotheken v5 zu authentifizieren, einschließlich @azure/msal-react und @azure/msal-browser, während es wichtige Änderungen wie den Wechsel von MSAL v4 zu v5 und das Auslaufen von Azure AD B2C bewältigt","pt":"Capacita os agentes a autenticar utilizadores através do Azure AD B2C utilizando as bibliotecas MSAL v5, incluindo @azure/msal-react e @azure/msal-browser, enquanto gere alterações disruptivas como a migração de MSAL v4→v5 e o fim do suporte para Azure AD B2C","ru":"Позволяет агентам аутентифицировать пользователей через Azure AD B2C с использованием библиотек MSAL v5, включая @azure/msal-react и @azure/msal-browser, а также обрабатывает критические изменения, такие как миграция с MSAL v4 на v5 и прекращение поддержки Azure AD B2C","ar":"يمكّن العوامل من مصادقة المستخدمين عبر Azure AD B2C باستخدام مكتبات MSAL v5، بما في ذلك @azure/msal-react و @azure/msal-browser، مع التعامل مع التغييرات الجذرية مثل انتقال MSAL من الإصدار v4 إلى v5 وإنهاء دعم Azure AD B2C"},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating users in React SPAs with Azure AD","Integrating Azure authentication with Cloudflare Workers","Migrating from ADAL to MSAL for enhanced security"],"zh":["在 React SPAs 中使用 Azure AD 进行用户身份验证","将 Azure 身份验证集成到 Cloudflare Workers","从 ADAL 迁移到 MSAL 以提高安全性"],"ja":["React SPAs で Azure AD を使用したユーザー認証","Cloudflare Workers への Azure 認証の統合","ADAL から MSAL への移行によるセキュリティの向上"],"ko":["React SPAs에서 Azure AD를 사용한 사용자 인증","Cloudflare Workers에 Azure 인증 통합","보안 강화를 위한 ADAL에서 MSAL로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Autenticar a los usuarios en aplicaciones web de una sola página de React con Azure AD","Integrar la autenticación de Azure con Cloudflare Workers","Migrar desde ADAL a MSAL para una mayor seguridad"],"fr":["Authentifier les utilisateurs dans les applications web monopage React avec Azure AD","Intégrer l''authentification Azure avec Cloudflare Workers","Migrer de ADAL à MSAL pour une sécurité renforcée"],"de":["Benutzer in React-SPAs mit Azure AD authentifizieren","Azure-Authentifizierung in Cloudflare Workers integrieren","Von ADAL zu MSAL migrieren, um die Sicherheit zu erhöhen"],"pt":["Autenticação de utilizadores em SPAs React com Azure AD","Integração da autenticação Azure com Cloudflare Workers","Migração de ADAL para MSAL para segurança reforçada"],"ru":["Аутентификация пользователей в React SPA с помощью Azure AD","Интеграция аутентификации Azure с Cloudflare Workers","Миграция с ADAL на MSAL для повышения безопасности"],"ar":["مصادقة المستخدمين في تطبيقات الصفحة الواحدة (SPA) باستخدام React مع Azure AD","دمج مصادقة Azure مع Cloudflare Workers","الانتقال من ADAL إلى MSAL لتعزيز الأمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Microsoft Entra ID setup","Affected by Azure AD B2C sunset in 2030","MSAL v5 compatibility required"],"zh":["需要设置 Microsoft Entra ID","受 Azure AD B2C 2030 年停止的影响","需要 MSAL v5 兼容性"],"ja":["Microsoft Entra ID の設定が必要","2030 年の Azure AD B2C 停止の影響を受ける","MSAL v5 の互換性が必要"],"ko":["Microsoft Entra ID 설정이 필요","2030년 Azure AD B2C 중단의 영향을 받음","MSAL v5 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de Microsoft Entra ID","Verse afectado por el fin de la vida útil de Azure AD B2C en 2030","Se requiere compatibilidad con MSAL v5"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de Microsoft Entra ID","Est affecté par la fin de vie d''Azure AD B2C en 2030","Nécessite la compatibilité avec MSAL v5"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von Microsoft Entra ID","Wird von dem Auslaufen von Azure AD B2C im Jahr 2030 betroffen","Benötigt MSAL-v5-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Microsoft Entra ID","Afetado pelo fim do suporte para Azure AD B2C em 2030","Requer compatibilidade com MSAL v5"],"ru":["Требует настройки Microsoft Entra ID","Затронут прекращением поддержки Azure AD B2C в 2030 году","Требуется совместимость с MSAL v5"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Microsoft Entra ID","يتأثر بإنهاء دعم Azure AD B2C في عام 2030","يتطلب توافقًا مع MSAL v5"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega/azure-auth', 'community', 'brendadeeznuts1111', 'tier-1380-omega', 'brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega', 'azure-auth', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:12:53.995Z', NULL, '{"id":"brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega/azure-auth","name":"azure-auth","description":{"zh":"Azure Auth 是一个用于 React 和 Cloudflare Workers 的 Microsoft Entra ID 身份验证和授权解决方案","ja":"Azure Auth は、React と Cloudflare Workers 用の Microsoft Entra ID 認証と認可のソリューションです","ko":"Azure Auth는 React와 Cloudflare Workers를 위한 Microsoft Entra ID 인증 및 인가 솔루션입니다","es":"La autenticación de Azure permite a los desarrolladores proteger sus aplicaciones React y Cloudflare Workers con Azure Entra ID y MSAL","fr":"L''authentification Azure permet aux développeurs de protéger leurs applications React et Cloudflare Workers avec Azure Entra ID et MSAL","de":"Die Azure-Authentifizierung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre React- und Cloudflare-Worker-Anwendungen mit Azure Entra ID und MSAL zu schützen","pt":"A autenticação Azure para React e Cloudflare Workers permite uma integração segura e escalável. Saiba mais sobre as versões do pacote e as mudanças de quebra.","ru":"Авторизация Azure для React и Cloudflare Workers позволяет обеспечить безопасную и масштабируемую интеграцию. Узнайте больше о версиях пакета и изменениях.","ar":"التحقق من هوية أزور لري액ت ووكرفلاو كلاود يسمح بالتكامل الآمن والموسع. تعرف على المزيد حول إصدارات الحزمة والتغييرات","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID 集成","ja":"Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID 統合","ko":"Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID 통합","es":"Autenticación de Azure para React y Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Authentification Azure pour React et Cloudflare Workers","de":"Azure-Authentifizierung für React und Cloudflare Workers","pt":"Autenticação Azure para React e Cloudflare Workers","ru":"Авторизация Azure для React и Cloudflare Workers","ar":"التحقق من هوية أزور لري액ت ووكرفلاو كلاود","en":"azure-auth"},"description":{"zh":"Azure Auth 是一个用于 React 和 Cloudflare Workers 的 Microsoft Entra ID 身份验证和授权解决方案","ja":"Azure Auth は、React と Cloudflare Workers 用の Microsoft Entra ID 認証と認可のソリューションです","ko":"Azure Auth는 React와 Cloudflare Workers를 위한 Microsoft Entra ID 인증 및 인가 솔루션입니다","es":"La autenticación de Azure permite a los desarrolladores proteger sus aplicaciones React y Cloudflare Workers con Azure Entra ID y MSAL","fr":"L''authentification Azure permet aux développeurs de protéger leurs applications React et Cloudflare Workers avec Azure Entra ID et MSAL","de":"Die Azure-Authentifizierung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre React- und Cloudflare-Worker-Anwendungen mit Azure Entra ID und MSAL zu schützen","pt":"A autenticação Azure para React e Cloudflare Workers permite uma integração segura e escalável. Saiba mais sobre as versões do pacote e as mudanças de quebra.","ru":"Авторизация Azure для React и Cloudflare Workers позволяет обеспечить безопасную и масштабируемую интеграцию. Узнайте больше о версиях пакета и изменениях.","ar":"التحقق من هوية أزور لري액ت ووكرفلاو كلاود يسمح بالتكامل الآمن والموسع. تعرف على المزيد حول إصدارات الحزمة والتغييرات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 React 和 Cloudflare Workers","使用 Microsoft Entra ID 进行身份验证和授权","支持 MSAL v4 到 v5 迁移","支持 Azure AD B2C 阻止新注册","支持 ADAL 退役","提供安全的身份验证和授权解决方案"],"ja":["React と Cloudflare Workers をサポート","Microsoft Entra ID を使用した認証と認可","MSAL v4 から v5 への移行をサポート","Azure AD B2C の新規登録をブロック","ADAL の廃止をサポート","セキュアな認証と認可のソリューションを提供"],"ko":["React와 Cloudflare Workers 지원","Microsoft Entra ID를 사용한 인증 및 인가","MSAL v4에서 v5로의 마이그레이션 지원","Azure AD B2C의 신규 등록을 차단","ADAL의废弃을 지원","보안 인증 및 인가를 제공"],"es":["Autenticación con Azure Entra ID","Compatibilidad con MSAL y Azure AD B2C","Soporte para aplicaciones React y Cloudflare Workers","Migración de MSAL v4 a v5","Retiro de ADAL y Azure AD B2C"],"fr":["Authentification avec Azure Entra ID","Compatibilité avec MSAL et Azure AD B2C","Prise en charge des applications React et Cloudflare Workers","Migration de MSAL v4 à v5","Retrait de ADAL et Azure AD B2C"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit Azure Entra ID","Kompatibilität mit MSAL und Azure AD B2C","Unterstützung für React- und Cloudflare-Worker-Anwendungen","Migration von MSAL v4 zu v5","Einstellung von ADAL und Azure AD B2C"],"pt":["Integração com React e Cloudflare Workers","Suporte ao MSAL v5","Migração do MSAL v4 para v5","Suporte à Azure AD B2C","Retirement do ADAL","Versões de pacote atualizadas"],"ru":["Интеграция с React и Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка MSAL v5","Миграция с MSAL v4 на v5","Поддержка Azure AD B2C","Устаревание ADAL","Обновленные версии пакета"],"ar":["التكامل مع ري액ت ووكرفلاو كلاود","دعم إم إس آي إل v5","هجرة من إم إس آي إل v4 إلى v5","دعم أزور آد بي 2 سي","التخلي عن إيه دي آي إل","إصدارات حزمة محدثة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Auth","Microsoft Entra ID","React","Cloudflare Workers","身份验证","授权","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","ADAL"],"ja":["Azure Auth","Microsoft Entra ID","React","Cloudflare Workers","認証","認可","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","ADAL"],"ko":["Azure Auth","Microsoft Entra ID","React","Cloudflare Workers","인증","인가","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","ADAL"],"es":["autenticación de Azure","Azure Entra ID","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","React","Cloudflare Workers","seguridad de aplicaciones","autenticación de usuarios"],"fr":["authentification Azure","Azure Entra ID","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","React","Cloudflare Workers","sécurité des applications","authentification des utilisateurs"],"de":["Azure-Authentifizierung","Azure Entra ID","MSAL","Azure AD B2C","React","Cloudflare Workers","Anwendungssicherheit","Benutzerauthentifizierung"],"pt":["autenticação azure","react","cloudflare workers","msal","azure ad b2c","adal","segurança","integração","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["авторизация azure","react","cloudflare workers","msal","azure ad b2c","adal","безопасность","интеграция","веб-разработка"],"ar":["التحقق من هوية أزور","ري액ت","وكرفلاو كلاود","إم إس آي إل","أزور آد بي 2 سي","إيه دي آي إل","أمان","تكامل","تطوير ويب"]}},"owner":"brendadeeznuts1111","repo":"tier-1380-omega","repoPath":"brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-auth","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID for React + Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Package Versions**: @azure/msal-react@5.0.2, @azure/msal-browser@5.0.2, jose@6.1.3\n**Breaking Changes**: MSAL v4→v5 migration (January 2026), Azure AD B2C sunset (May 2025 - new signups blocked, existing until 2030), ADAL retirement (Sept 2025 - complete)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   React SPA         │────▶│","body":"# Azure Auth - Microsoft Entra ID for React + Cloudflare Workers\n\n**Package Versions**: @azure/msal-react@5.0.2, @azure/msal-browser@5.0.2, jose@6.1.3\n**Breaking Changes**: MSAL v4→v5 migration (January 2026), Azure AD B2C sunset (May 2025 - new signups blocked, existing until 2030), ADAL retirement (Sept 2025 - complete)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────────┐\n│   React SPA         │────▶│  Microsoft Entra ID  │────▶│  Cloudflare Worker  │\n│   @azure/msal-react │     │  (login.microsoft)   │     │  jose JWT validation│\n└─────────────────────┘     └──────────────────────┘     └─────────────────────┘\n        │                                                          │\n        │  Authorization Code + PKCE                               │\n        │  (access_token, id_token)                                │\n        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                    Bearer token in Authorization header\n```\n\n**Key Constraint**: MSAL.js does NOT work in Cloudflare Workers (relies on browser/Node.js APIs). Use jose library for backend token validation.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Frontend (React SPA)\nnpm install @azure/msal-react @azure/msal-browser\n\n# Backend (Cloudflare Workers)\nnpm install jose\n```\n\n### 2. Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. Go to **Microsoft Entra ID** → **App registrations** → **New registration**\n2. Set **Redirect URI** to `http://localhost:5173` (SPA type)\n3. Note the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) ID**\n4. Under **Authentication**:\n   - Enable **Access tokens** and **ID tokens**\n   - Add production redirect URI\n5. Under **API permissions**:\n   - Add `User.Read` (Microsoft Graph)\n   - Grant admin consent if required\n\n---\n\n## Frontend: MSAL React Setup\n\n### Configuration (src/auth/msal-config.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Configuration, LogLevel } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\n\nexport const msalConfig: Configuration = {\n  auth: {\n    clientId: import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID,\n    authority: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID}`,\n    redirectUri: window.location.origin,\n    postLogoutRedirectUri: window.location.origin,\n    navigateToLoginRequestUrl: true,\n  },\n  cache: {\n    cacheLocation: \"localStorage\", // or \"sessionStorage\"\n    storeAuthStateInCookie: true, // Required for Safari/Edge issues\n  },\n  system: {\n    loggerOptions: {\n      logLevel: LogLevel.Warning,\n      loggerCallback: (level, message) => {\n        if (level === LogLevel.Error) console.error(message);\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};\n\n// Scopes for token requests\nexport const loginRequest = {\n  scopes: [\"User.Read\", \"openid\", \"profile\", \"email\"],\n};\n\n// Scopes for API calls (add your API scope here)\nexport const apiRequest = {\n  scopes: [`api://${import.meta.env.VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID}/access_as_user`],\n};\n```\n\n### MsalProvider Setup (src/main.tsx)\n\n```typescript\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport ReactDOM from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport { PublicClientApplication, EventType } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { MsalProvider } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { msalConfig } from \"./auth/msal-config\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\n// CRITICAL: Initialize MSAL outside component tree to prevent re-instantiation\nconst msalInstance = new PublicClientApplication(msalConfig);\n\n// Handle redirect promise on page load\nmsalInstance.initialize().then(() => {\n  // Set active account after redirect\n  // IMPORTANT: Use getAllAccounts() (returns array), NOT getActiveAccount() (returns single account or null)\n  const accounts = msalInstance.getAllAccounts();\n  if (accounts.length > 0) {\n    msalInstance.setActiveAccount(accounts[0]);\n  }\n\n  // Listen for sign-in events\n  msalInstance.addEventCallback((event) => {\n    if (event.eventType === EventType.LOGIN_SUCCESS && event.payload) {\n      const account = (event.payload as { account: any }).account;\n      msalInstance.setActiveAccount(account);\n    }\n  });\n\n  ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(\n    <React.StrictMode>\n      <MsalProvider instance={msalInstance}>\n        <App />\n      </MsalProvider>\n    </React.StrictMode>\n  );\n});\n```\n\n### Protected Route Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMsal, useIsAuthenticated } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { InteractionStatus } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { loginRequest } from \"./msal-config\";\n\nexport function ProtectedRoute({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const { instance, inProgress } = useMsal();\n  const isAuthenticated = useIsAuthenticated();\n\n  // Wait for MSAL to finish any in-progress operations\n  if (inProgress !== InteractionStatus.None) {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  if (!isAuthenticated) {\n    // Trigger login redirect\n    instance.loginRedirect(loginRequest);\n    return <div>Redirecting to login...</div>;\n  }\n\n  return <>{children}</>;\n}\n```\n\n### Acquiring Tokens for API Calls\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMsal } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { InteractionRequiredAuthError } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { apiRequest } from \"./msal-config\";\n\nexport function useApiToken() {\n  const { instance, accounts } = useMsal();\n\n  async function getAccessToken(): Promise<string | null> {\n    if (accounts.length === 0) return null;\n\n    const request = {\n      ...apiRequest,\n      account: accounts[0],\n    };\n\n    try {\n      // Try silent token acquisition first\n      const response = await instance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n      return response.accessToken;\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (error instanceof InteractionRequiredAuthError) {\n        // Silent acquisition failed, need interactive login\n        // This handles expired refresh tokens (AADSTS700084)\n        await instance.acquireTokenRedirect(request);\n        return null;\n      }\n      throw error;\n    }\n  }\n\n  return { getAccessToken };\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Backend: Cloudflare Workers JWT Validation\n\n### Why jose Instead of MSAL\n\nMSAL.js relies on browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage) and Node.js crypto modules that don''t exist in Cloudflare Workers'' V8 isolate runtime. The jose library is pure JavaScript and works perfectly in Workers.\n\n### JWT Validation (src/auth/validate-token.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as jose from \"jose\";\n\ninterface EntraTokenPayload {\n  aud: string;       // Audience (your client ID or API URI)\n  iss: string;       // Issuer (https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant}/v2.0)\n  sub: string;       // Subject (user''s unique ID)\n  oid: string;       // Object ID (user''s Azure AD object ID)\n  preferred_username: string;\n  name: string;\n  email?: string;\n  roles?: string[];  // App roles if configured\n  scp?: string;      // Scopes (space-separated)\n}\n\n// Cache JWKS to avoid fetching on every request\nlet jwksCache: jose.JWTVerifyGetKey | null = null;\nlet jwksCacheTime = 0;\nconst JWKS_CACHE_DURATION = 3600000; // 1 hour\n\nasync function getJWKS(tenantId: string): Promise<jose.JWTVerifyGetKey> {\n  const now = Date.now();\n\n  if (jwksCache && now - jwksCacheTime < JWKS_CACHE_DURATION) {\n    return jwksCache;\n  }\n\n  // CRITICAL: Azure AD JWKS is NOT at .well-known/jwks.json\n  // Must fetch from openid-configuration first\n  const configUrl = `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration`;\n  const configResponse = await fetch(configUrl);\n  const config = await configResponse.json() as { jwks_uri: string };\n\n  // Now fetch JWKS from the correct URL\n  jwksCache = jose.createRemoteJWKSet(new URL(config.jwks_uri));\n  jwksCacheTime = now;\n\n  return jwksCache;\n}\n\nexport async function validateEntraToken(\n  token: string,\n  env: {\n    AZURE_TENANT_ID: string;\n    AZURE_CLIENT_ID: string;\n  }\n): Promise<EntraTokenPayload | null> {\n  try {\n    const jwks = await getJWKS(env.AZURE_TENANT_ID);\n\n    const { payload } = await jose.jwtVerify(token, jwks, {\n      issuer: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${env.AZURE_TENANT_ID}/v2.0`,\n      audience: env.AZURE_CLIENT_ID, // or your API URI: api://{client_id}\n    });\n\n    return payload as unknown as EntraTokenPayload;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"Token validation failed:\", error);\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Worker Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport { validateEntraToken } from \"./auth/validate-token\";\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env): Promise<Response> {\n    // Skip auth for public routes\n    const url = new URL(request.url);\n    if (url.pathname === \"/\" || url.pathname.startsWith(\"/public\")) {\n      return handlePublicRoute(request, env);\n    }\n\n    // Extract Bearer token\n    const authHeader = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\");\n    if (!authHeader?.startsWith(\"Bearer \")) {\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Missing authorization\" }), {\n        status: 401,\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      });\n    }\n\n    const token = authHeader.slice(7);\n    const user = await validateEntraToken(token, env);\n\n    if (!user) {\n      return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Invalid token\" }), {\n        status: 401,\n        headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Add user to request context\n    const requestWithUser = new Request(request);\n    // Pass user info downstream (e.g., via headers or context)\n\n    return handleProtectedRoute(request, env, user);\n  },\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors & Fixes\n\n### 1. AADSTS50058 - Silent Sign-In Loop\n\n**Error**: \"A silent sign-in request was sent but no user is signed in\"\n\n**Cause**: `acquireTokenSilent` called when no cached user exists.\n\n**Fix**:\n```typescript\n// Always check for accounts before silent acquisition\nconst accounts = instance.getAllAccounts();\nif (accounts.length === 0) {\n  // No cached user, trigger interactive login\n  await instance.loginRedirect(loginRequest);\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. AADSTS700084 - Refresh Token Expired\n\n**Error**: \"The refresh token was issued to a single page app (SPA), and therefore has a fixed, limited lifetime of 1.00:00:00\"\n\n**Cause**: SPA refresh tokens expire after 24 hours. Cannot be extended.\n\n**Fix**:\n```typescript\ntry {\n  const response = await instance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof InteractionRequiredAuthError) {\n    // Refresh token expired, need fresh login\n    await instance.acquireTokenRedirect(request);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. React Router v6 Redirect Loop\n\n**Error**: Infinite redirects between login page and app.\n\n**Cause**: React Router v6 may strip the hash fragment containing auth response.\n\n**Fix**: Use custom NavigationClient:\n```typescript\nimport { NavigationClient } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nclass CustomNavigationClient extends NavigationClient {\n  private navigate: ReturnType<typeof useNavigate>;\n\n  constructor(navigate: ReturnType<typeof useNavigate>) {\n    super();\n    this.navigate = navigate;\n  }\n\n  async navigateInternal(url: string, options: { noHistory: boolean }) {\n    const relativePath = url.replace(window.location.origin, \"\");\n    if (options.noHistory) {\n      this.navigate(relativePath, { replace: true });\n    } else {\n      this.navigate(relativePath);\n    }\n    return false; // Prevent MSAL from doing its own navigation\n  }\n}\n\n// In your App component:\nconst navigate = useNavigate();\nuseEffect(() => {\n  const navigationClient = new CustomNavigationClient(navigate);\n  instance.setNavigationClient(navigationClient);\n}, [instance, navigate]);\n```\n\n### 4. NextJS Dynamic Route Error\n\n**Error**: `no_cached_authority_error` in dynamic routes.\n\n**Cause**: MSAL instance not properly initialized before component renders.\n\n**Fix**: Initialize MSAL in `_app.tsx` before any routing:\n```typescript\n// pages/_app.tsx\nimport { PublicClientApplication } from \"@azure/msal-browser\";\nimport { MsalProvider } from \"@azure/msal-react\";\nimport { msalConfig } from \"../auth/msal-config\";\n\n// Initialize outside component\nconst msalInstance = new PublicClientApplication(msalConfig);\n\n// Ensure initialization completes before render\nexport default function App({ Component, pageProps }) {\n  const [isInitialized, setIsInitialized] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    msalInstance.initialize().then(() => setIsInitialized(true));\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!isInitialized) return <div>Loading...</div>;\n\n  return (\n    <MsalProvider instance={msalInstance}>\n      <Component {...pageProps} />\n    </MsalProvider>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Safari/Edge Cookie Issues\n\n**Error**: Auth state lost, infinite loop on Safari or Edge. On iOS 18 Safari specifically, silent token refresh fails with AADSTS50058 even when third-party cookies are enabled.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7384](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/7384)\n\n**Cause**: These browsers have stricter cookie policies affecting session storage. iOS 18 Safari doesn''t store the required session cookies for login.microsoftonline.com, even with third-party cookies explicitly allowed in settings.\n\n**Testing Note**: Works in Chrome on iOS 18, but fails in Safari on iOS 18.\n\n**Fix**: Enable cookie storage in MSAL config:\n```typescript\ncache: {\n  cacheLocation: \"localStorage\",\n  storeAuthStateInCookie: true, // REQUIRED for Safari/Edge\n}\n```\n\n**iOS 18 Safari Limitation**: If users still experience issues on iOS 18 Safari after enabling cookie storage, this is a known browser limitation with no current workaround. Recommend using Chrome on iOS or desktop browser.\n\n### 6. JWKS URL Not Found (Workers)\n\n**Error**: Failed to fetch JWKS from `.well-known/jwks.json`.\n\n**Cause**: Azure AD doesn''t serve JWKS at the standard OpenID Connect path.\n\n**Fix**: Fetch `openid-configuration` first, then use `jwks_uri`:\n```typescript\n// WRONG - Azure AD doesn''t use this path\nconst jwks = createRemoteJWKSet(\n  new URL(`https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/.well-known/jwks.json`)\n);\n\n// CORRECT - Fetch config first\nconst config = await fetch(\n  `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration`\n).then(r => r.json());\nconst jwks = createRemoteJWKSet(new URL(config.jwks_uri));\n```\n\n### 7. React Router Loader State Conflict\n\n**Error**: React warning about updating state during render when using `acquireTokenSilent` in React Router loaders.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7068](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/7068)\n\n**Cause**: Using the same `PublicClientApplication` instance in both the router loader and `MsalProvider` causes state updates during rendering.\n\n**Fix**: Call `initialize()` again in the loader:\n```typescript\nconst protectedLoader = async () => {\n  await msalInstance.initialize(); // Prevents state conflict\n  const response = await msalInstance.acquireTokenSilent(request);\n  return { data };\n};\n```\n\n### 8. setActiveAccount Doesn''t Trigger Re-render (Community-sourced)\n\n**Error**: Components using `useMsal()` don''t update after calling `setActiveAccount()`.\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6989](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues/6989)\n\n**Verified**: Multiple users confirmed in GitHub issue\n\n**Cause**: `setActiveAccount()` updates the MSAL instance but doesn''t notify React of the change.\n\n**Fix**: Force re-render with state:\n```typescript\nconst [accountKey, setAccountKey] = useState(0);\n\nconst switchAccount = (newAccount) => {\n  msalInstance.setActiveAccount(newAccount);\n  setAccountKey(prev => prev + 1); // Force update\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Tenant vs Single-Tenant\n\n### Single Tenant (Recommended for Enterprise)\n\n```typescript\nauthority: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${TENANT_ID}`,\n```\n\n- Only users from your organization can sign in\n- Token issuer: `https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant_id}/v2.0`\n\n### Multi-Tenant\n\n```typescript\nauthority: \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/common\",\n// or for work/school accounts only:\nauthority: \"https://login.microsoftonline.com/organizations\",\n```\n\n- Users from any Azure AD tenant can sign in\n- Token issuer varies by user''s tenant\n- **Backend validation must handle multiple issuers**:\n\n```typescript\n// Multi-tenant issuer validation\nconst tenantId = payload.tid; // Tenant ID from token\nconst expectedIssuer = `https://login.microsoftonline.com/${tenantId}/v2.0`;\nif (payload.iss !== expectedIssuer) {\n  throw new Error(\"Invalid issuer\");\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Frontend (.env)\n\n```bash\nVITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-guid\nVITE_AZURE_TENANT_ID=your-tenant-id-guid\n```\n\n### Backend (wrangler.jsonc)\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-api\",\n  \"vars\": {\n    \"AZURE_TENANT_ID\": \"your-tenant-id-guid\",\n    \"AZURE_CLIENT_ID\": \"your-client-id-guid\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Azure AD B2C Sunset\n\n**Timeline**:\n- **May 1, 2025**: Azure AD B2C no longer available for new customer signups\n- **March 15, 2026**: Azure AD B2C P2 discontinued for all customers\n- **May 2030**: Microsoft will continue supporting existing B2C customers with standard support\n\n**Source**: [Microsoft Q&A](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/questions/2119363/migrating-existing-azure-ad-b2c-to-microsoft-entra)\n\n**Existing B2C Customers**: Can continue using B2C until 2030, but should plan migration to Entra External ID.\n\n**New Projects**: Use **Microsoft Entra External ID** for consumer/customer identity scenarios.\n\n**Migration Status**: As of January 2026, automated migration tools are in testing phase. Manual migration guidance available at Microsoft Learn.\n\n**Migration Path**:\n- Different authority URL format (`{tenant}.ciamlogin.com` vs `{tenant}.b2clogin.com`)\n- Updated SDK support (same MSAL libraries)\n- New pricing model (consumption-based)\n- Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR) approach available for user migration\n- Seamless migration samples on GitHub (preview)\n\nSee: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/external-id/\nMigration Guide: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/external-id/customers/how-to-migrate-users\n\n---\n\n## ADAL Retirement (Complete)\n\n**Status**: Azure AD Authentication Library (ADAL) was retired on September 30, 2025. Apps using ADAL no longer receive security updates.\n\n**If you''re migrating from ADAL**:\n1. ADAL → MSAL migration is required\n2. ADAL used v1.0 endpoints; MSAL uses v2.0 endpoints\n3. Token cache format differs - users must re-authenticate\n4. Scopes replace \"resources\" in token requests\n\n**Key Migration Changes**:\n```typescript\n// ADAL (deprecated) - resource-based\nacquireToken({ resource: \"https://graph.microsoft.com\" })\n\n// MSAL (current) - scope-based\nacquireTokenSilent({ scopes: [\"https://graph.microsoft.com/User.Read\"] })\n```\n\nSee: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/msal/javascript/migration/msal-net-migration\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- [MSAL React Documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/msal/javascript/react/)\n- [Microsoft Entra ID App Registration](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/quickstart-register-app)\n- [MSAL.js GitHub Issues](https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-js/issues)\n- [jose Library](https://github.com/panva/jose)\n- [Cloudflare Workers + Azure AD Blog](https://hajekj.net/2021/11/12/cloudflare-workers-and-azure-ad/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:12:53.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring secure, token-based authentication flows with Microsoft Entra ID and Azure B2C.","zh":"适用于需要安全的基于令牌的身份验证流的 AI 代理，特别是与 Microsoft Entra ID 和 Azure B2C 配合使用。","ja":"Microsoft Entra IDおよびAzure B2Cを使用したセキュアなトークン ベースの認証フローを必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"마이크로소프트 엔트라 ID 및 Azure B2C와 함께 사용되는 보안 토큰 기반 인증 흐름이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren flujos de autenticación seguros basados en tokens con Microsoft Entra ID y Azure B2C.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant des flux d''authentification sécurisés basés sur des jetons avec Microsoft Entra ID et Azure B2C.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die sichere, tokenbasierte Authentifizierungsflüsse mit Microsoft Entra ID und Azure B2C erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem fluxos de autenticação baseados em token seguros com Microsoft Entra ID e Azure B2C.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих безопасных потоков аутентификации на основе токенов с Microsoft Entra ID и Azure B2C.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب تدفقات مصادقة آمنة قائمة على الرموز مع مايكروسوفت إنترا آي دي وأزور بى 2 سى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement MSAL v5 authentication in React SPAs and Cloudflare Workers, providing secure token acquisition and validation using jose. Directly handles critical Azure AD B2C sunset and ADAL retirement timelines.","zh":"使代理能够在React SPAs和Cloudflare Workers中实现MSAL v5身份验证，使用jose提供安全的令牌获取和验证。直接处理关键的Azure AD B2C停用和ADAL退役时间表。","ja":"React SPAsおよびCloudflare WorkersでMSAL v5認証を実装できるようにし、joseを使用してセキュアなトークンの取得および検証を提供します。Azure AD B2Cの停止およびADALの廃止に関する重要なタイムラインを直接処理します。","ko":"리액트 SPAs 및 Cloudflare Workers에서 MSAL v5 인증을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 조세를 사용하여 보안 토큰의 획득 및 검증을 제공합니다. Azure AD B2C 중단 및 ADAL 폐지와 관련된 중요한 타임라인을 직접 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar la autenticación MSAL v5 en aplicaciones SPAs de React y Workers de Cloudflare, proporcionando la adquisición y validación seguras de tokens mediante jose. Maneja directamente los plazos críticos de la jubilación de Azure AD B2C y la jubilación de ADAL.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre l''authentification MSAL v5 dans les applications SPAs React et les Workers de Cloudflare, fournissant l''acquisition et la validation sécurisées de jetons à l''aide de jose. Gère directement les délais critiques de la fin de vie d''Azure AD B2C et du retrait d''ADAL.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Authentifizierung MSAL v5 in React-SPAs und Cloudflare-Workern zu implementieren, wodurch eine sichere Tokenbeschaffung und -validierung mit jose bereitgestellt wird. Behandelt direkt die kritischen Zeitpläne für das Auslaufen von Azure AD B2C und das Ende von ADAL.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem a autenticação MSAL v5 em SPAs do React e Cloudflare Workers, fornecendo aquisição e validação de token seguras usando jose. Lidar diretamente com prazos críticos de sunset do Azure AD B2C e aposentadoria do ADAL.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать аутентификацию MSAL v5 в React SPAs и Cloudflare Workers, обеспечивая безопасное получение и проверку токенов с использованием jose. Прямо обрабатывает критические сроки завершения работы Azure AD B2C и выхода из эксплуатации ADAL.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مصادقة إم إس إيه إل 5 في تطبيقات رياكت إس بى إيه ووكلاء كلاودفلير، وتوفير الحصول على رموز آمنة وتمكين التحقق باستخدام جوزيه. يتعامل بشكل مباشر مع جداول موعد إنهاء أزور أدي بى 2 سى وأدال."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure login flows for React applications","Validating JWT tokens in Cloudflare Worker environments","Migrating legacy Azure AD B2C implementations to modern Entra ID"],"zh":["为React应用程序实现安全登录流程","在Cloudflare Worker环境中验证JWT令牌","将旧Azure AD B2C实现迁移到现代Entra ID"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーションのセキュアなログインフローを実装する","Cloudflare Worker環境でJWTトークンを検証する","レガシーのAzure AD B2C実装を最新のEntra IDに移行する"],"ko":["리액트 애플리케이션에 대한 보안 로그인 흐름 구현","Cloudflare Worker 환경에서 JWT 토큰 검증","레거시 Azure AD B2C 구현을 최신 Entra ID로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Implementar flujos de inicio de sesión seguros para aplicaciones React","Validar tokens JWT en entornos de Cloudflare Worker","Migrar implementaciones heredadas de Azure AD B2C a Entra ID moderna"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des flux de connexion sécurisés pour les applications React","Valider les jetons JWT dans les environnements de Cloudflare Worker","Migrer les implementations héritées d''Azure AD B2C vers Entra ID moderne"],"de":["Implementieren von sicheren Anmeldeflüssen für React-Anwendungen","Validieren von JWT-Tokens in Cloudflare-Worker-Umgebungen","Migration von veralteten Azure AD B2C-Implementierungen zu moderner Entra ID"],"pt":["Implementar fluxos de login seguros para aplicações React","Validar tokens JWT em ambientes de Cloudflare Worker","Migrar implementações legadas do Azure AD B2C para Entra ID moderno"],"ru":["Реализовать безопасные потоки входа для приложений React","Проверять токены JWT в средах Cloudflare Worker","Переместить устаревшие реализации Azure AD B2C в современный Entra ID"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات تسجيل الدخول الآمنة لتطبيقات رياكت","التحقق من رموز جى دبليو تى في بيئات وكلاء كلاودفلير","نقل عمليات تنفيذ أزور أدي بى 2 سى القديمة إلى هوية إنترا الحديثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MSAL v4→v5 migration by January 2026","Azure AD B2C new signups blocked after May 2025","ADAL support ends September 2025"],"zh":["需要在2026年1月之前从MSAL v4迁移到v5","2025年5月之后Azure AD B2C新注册将被阻止","2025年9月ADAL支持结束"],"ja":["2026年1月までにMSAL v4からv5に移行する必要がある","2025年5月以降のAzure AD B2C新規登録はブロックされる","2025年9月のADALサポート終了"],"ko":["2026년 1월까지 MSAL v4에서 v5로 마이그레이션해야 함","2025년 5월 이후 Azure AD B2C 신규 가입을 차단","2025년 9월 ADAL 지원 종료"],"es":["Requiere la migración de MSAL v4 a v5 antes de enero de 2026","Nuevas suscripciones de Azure AD B2C bloqueadas después de mayo de 2025","La compatibilidad con ADAL finaliza en septiembre de 2025"],"fr":["Nécessite la migration de MSAL v4 à v5 avant janvier 2026","Nouveaux abonnements Azure AD B2C bloqués après mai 2025","La prise en charge d''ADAL se termine en septembre 2025"],"de":["Erfordert die Migration von MSAL v4 auf v5 bis Januar 2026","Neue Azure AD B2C-Registrierungen werden nach Mai 2025 blockiert","Die Unterstützung für ADAL endet im September 2025"],"pt":["Exige a migração do MSAL v4→v5 até janeiro de 2026","Novos registros do Azure AD B2C bloqueados após maio de 2025","Suporte ao ADAL termina em setembro de 2025"],"ru":["Требует миграции с MSAL v4→v5 до января 2026 года","Новые регистрации Azure AD B2C блокируются после мая 2025 года","Поддержка ADAL заканчивается в сентябре 2025 года"],"ar":["يتطلب هجرة إم إس إيه إل 4 إلى 5 قبل يناير 2026","التسجيلات الجديدة لأزور أدي بى 2 سى محظورة بعد مايو 2025","دعم أدال ينتهي في سبتمبر 2025"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega/office', 'community', 'brendadeeznuts1111', 'tier-1380-omega', 'brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega', 'office', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:13:27.315Z', NULL, '{"id":"brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega/office","name":"office","description":{"zh":"office","ja":"office","ko":"office","es":"Genera documentos de Office como Word, Excel y PowerPoint con TypeScript y bibliotecas de JavaScript puro","fr":"Générez des documents Office tels que Word, Excel et PowerPoint avec TypeScript et des bibliothèques JavaScript pures","de":"Erstellen Sie Office-Dokumente wie Word, Excel und PowerPoint mit TypeScript und reinen JavaScript-Bibliotheken","pt":"Gere documentos Office com TypeScript e bibliotecas JavaScript puro. Suporte a docx, xlsx, pdf e pptx","ru":"Создайте документы Office с помощью TypeScript и чистых библиотек JavaScript. Поддержка docx, xlsx, pdf и pptx","ar":"انشئ مستندات أوفيس مع تایپ اسكريبت ومكتبات جافا سكريبت النقية. دعم ل docx و xlsx و pdf و pptx","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"office","ja":"office","ko":"office","es":"Generación de documentos de Office con JavaScript","fr":"Génération de documents Office avec JavaScript","de":"Erstellung von Office-Dokumenten mit JavaScript","pt":"Geração de Documentos Office com TypeScript","ru":"Создание документов Office с помощью TypeScript","ar":"إنشاء مستندات أوفيس مع تایب اسكريبت","en":"office"},"description":{"zh":"office","ja":"office","ko":"office","es":"Genera documentos de Office como Word, Excel y PowerPoint con TypeScript y bibliotecas de JavaScript puro","fr":"Générez des documents Office tels que Word, Excel et PowerPoint avec TypeScript et des bibliothèques JavaScript pures","de":"Erstellen Sie Office-Dokumente wie Word, Excel und PowerPoint mit TypeScript und reinen JavaScript-Bibliotheken","pt":"Gere documentos Office com TypeScript e bibliotecas JavaScript puro. Suporte a docx, xlsx, pdf e pptx","ru":"Создайте документы Office с помощью TypeScript и чистых библиотек JavaScript. Поддержка docx, xlsx, pdf и pptx","ar":"انشئ مستندات أوفيس مع تایپ اسكريبت ومكتبات جافا سكريبت النقية. دعم ل docx و xlsx و pdf و pptx","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["office","office","office","office","office","office"],"ja":["office","office","office","office","office","office"],"ko":["office","office","office","office","office","office"],"es":["Generación de documentos de Word con docx","Creación de archivos de Excel con xlsx","Generación de presentaciones de PowerPoint con pptxgenjs","Compatibilidad con ejecución en Worker, Browser y Node.js","Soporte para la creación de PDFs con pdf-lib"],"fr":["Génération de documents Word avec docx","Création de fichiers Excel avec xlsx","Génération de présentations PowerPoint avec pptxgenjs","Compatibilité avec l''exécution en Worker, Browser et Node.js","Prise en charge de la création de PDF avec pdf-lib"],"de":["Erstellung von Word-Dokumenten mit docx","Erstellung von Excel-Dateien mit xlsx","Erstellung von PowerPoint-Präsentationen mit pptxgenjs","Kompatibilität mit der Ausführung in Worker, Browser und Node.js","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von PDFs mit pdf-lib"],"pt":["Geração de documentos docx","Criação de planilhas xlsx","Geração de arquivos pdf","Criação de apresentações pptx","Suporte a TypeScript","Bibliotecas JavaScript puro"],"ru":["Создание документов docx","Создание таблиц xlsx","Генерация файлов pdf","Создание презентаций pptx","Поддержка TypeScript","Чистые библиотеки JavaScript"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات docx","إنشاء جداول xlsx","إنشاء ملفات pdf","إنشاء عروض تقديمية pptx","دعم تایپ اسكريبت","مكتبات جافا سكريبت النقية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office"],"ja":["office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office"],"ko":["office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office","office"],"es":["generación de documentos de Office","TypeScript","JavaScript puro","docx","xlsx","pptxgenjs","pdf-lib","programación de documentos de Office"],"fr":["génération de documents Office","TypeScript","JavaScript pur","docx","xlsx","pptxgenjs","pdf-lib","programmation de documents Office"],"de":["Erstellung von Office-Dokumenten","TypeScript","reines JavaScript","docx","xlsx","pptxgenjs","pdf-lib","programmierte Erstellung von Office-Dokumenten"],"pt":["geração de documentos office","typescript","javascript puro","docx","xlsx","pdf","pptx","desenvolvimento de software","programação"],"ru":["создание документов office","typescript","чистые библиотеки javascript","docx","xlsx","pdf","pptx","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات أوفيس","تایپ اسكريبت","مكتبات جافا سكريبت النقية","docx","xlsx","pdf","pptx","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"brendadeeznuts1111","repo":"tier-1380-omega","repoPath":"brendadeeznuts1111/tier-1380-omega","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"office","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Office Document Generation\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-12\n**Dependencies**: None (pure JavaScript libraries)\n**Latest Versions**: docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5, pdf-lib@1.17.1, pptxgenjs@4.0.1\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate Microsoft Office documents and PDFs programmatically with TypeScript. All libraries are pure JavaScript with zero native dependencies, enabling universal runtime support:\n\n| Format | Library | Workers | Browser | Node.js |\n|--------|---------|---------|--","body":"# Office Document Generation\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-12\n**Dependencies**: None (pure JavaScript libraries)\n**Latest Versions**: docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5, pdf-lib@1.17.1, pptxgenjs@4.0.1\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nGenerate Microsoft Office documents and PDFs programmatically with TypeScript. All libraries are pure JavaScript with zero native dependencies, enabling universal runtime support:\n\n| Format | Library | Workers | Browser | Node.js |\n|--------|---------|---------|---------|---------|\n| **DOCX** | `docx` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **XLSX** | `xlsx` (SheetJS) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **PDF** | `pdf-lib` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| **PPTX** | `pptxgenjs` | ⚠️* | ✅ | ✅ |\n\n*PPTX in Workers: Works for local images/data. Remote image fetching needs workaround (uses `https` module).\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install all four (or pick what you need)\nnpm install docx xlsx pdf-lib pptxgenjs\n```\n\n### Create a Word Document (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun } from ''docx'';\nimport { writeFileSync } from ''fs'';\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({\n        children: [\n          new TextRun({ text: ''Hello World'', bold: true, size: 48 }),\n        ],\n      }),\n    ],\n  }],\n});\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nconst buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\nwriteFileSync(''hello.docx'', buffer);\n\n// Browser/Workers: Get as blob\nconst blob = await Packer.toBlob(doc);\n```\n\n### Create an Excel Spreadsheet (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as XLSX from ''xlsx'';\n\n// Create workbook with data\nconst data = [\n  [''Name'', ''Amount'', ''Date''],\n  [''Invoice #1'', 1500, ''2026-01-12''],\n  [''Invoice #2'', 2300, ''2026-01-13''],\n];\n\nconst worksheet = XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(data);\nconst workbook = XLSX.utils.book_new();\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(workbook, worksheet, ''Invoices'');\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nXLSX.writeFile(workbook, ''invoices.xlsx'');\n\n// Browser/Workers: Get as buffer\nconst buffer = XLSX.write(workbook, { type: ''buffer'', bookType: ''xlsx'' });\n```\n\n### Create a PDF (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument, StandardFonts, rgb } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\nconst pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.create();\nconst page = pdfDoc.addPage([612, 792]); // Letter size\nconst font = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.Helvetica);\n\npage.drawText(''Hello World'', {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 700,\n  size: 24,\n  font,\n  color: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n});\n\n// Get as bytes (works everywhere)\nconst pdfBytes = await pdfDoc.save();\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nwriteFileSync(''hello.pdf'', pdfBytes);\n```\n\n### Create a PowerPoint (30 seconds)\n\n```typescript\nimport pptxgen from ''pptxgenjs'';\n\nconst pptx = new pptxgen();\npptx.author = ''Your Name'';\npptx.title = ''Sample Presentation'';\n\n// Add a slide\nconst slide = pptx.addSlide();\nslide.addText(''Hello World'', {\n  x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 1.5,\n  fontSize: 36, bold: true, color: ''363636'',\n});\n\n// Node.js: Save to file\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''hello.pptx'' });\n\n// Browser: Trigger download\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''hello.pptx'' });\n```\n\n---\n\n## DOCX: Word Documents\n\n### Key Concepts\n\nThe `docx` package uses a builder pattern:\n- **Document** - The root container\n- **Section** - Contains pages (most docs have 1 section)\n- **Paragraph** - A line/block of text\n- **TextRun** - Formatted text within a paragraph\n- **Table** - Grid of TableRow → TableCell → Paragraph\n\n### Document with Headings and Paragraphs\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun, HeadingLevel } from ''docx'';\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({\n        text: ''Monthly Report'',\n        heading: HeadingLevel.HEADING_1,\n      }),\n      new Paragraph({\n        children: [\n          new TextRun(''This is a ''),\n          new TextRun({ text: ''bold'', bold: true }),\n          new TextRun('' and ''),\n          new TextRun({ text: ''italic'', italics: true }),\n          new TextRun('' text example.''),\n        ],\n      }),\n    ],\n  }],\n});\n```\n\n### Tables\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Table, TableRow, TableCell, Paragraph, WidthType } from ''docx'';\n\nconst table = new Table({\n  width: { size: 100, type: WidthType.PERCENTAGE },\n  rows: [\n    new TableRow({\n      children: [\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Header 1'')] }),\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Header 2'')] }),\n      ],\n    }),\n    new TableRow({\n      children: [\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Data 1'')] }),\n        new TableCell({ children: [new Paragraph(''Data 2'')] }),\n      ],\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{ children: [table] }],\n});\n```\n\n### Images\n\n```typescript\nimport { Document, Paragraph, ImageRun } from ''docx'';\nimport { readFileSync } from ''fs'';\n\nconst imageBuffer = readFileSync(''logo.png'');\n\nconst doc = new Document({\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({\n        children: [\n          new ImageRun({\n            data: imageBuffer,\n            transformation: { width: 200, height: 100 },\n            type: ''png'',\n          }),\n        ],\n      }),\n    ],\n  }],\n});\n```\n\n### Export Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Node.js - Save to file\nimport { writeFileSync } from ''fs'';\nconst buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\nwriteFileSync(''document.docx'', buffer);\n\n// Browser - Download\nconst blob = await Packer.toBlob(doc);\nconst url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\nconst a = document.createElement(''a'');\na.href = url;\na.download = ''document.docx'';\na.click();\n\n// Cloudflare Workers - Return as Response\nconst buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\nreturn new Response(buffer, {\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document'',\n    ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"document.docx\"'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## XLSX: Excel Spreadsheets\n\n### Key Concepts\n\nSheetJS (xlsx) uses utility functions:\n- **Workbook** - Container for sheets\n- **Worksheet** - Single sheet (grid of cells)\n- **utils.aoa_to_sheet** - Array of arrays → worksheet\n- **utils.json_to_sheet** - JSON array → worksheet\n- **utils.book_new/book_append_sheet** - Create/add sheets\n\n### From Array of Arrays\n\n```typescript\nimport * as XLSX from ''xlsx'';\n\nconst data = [\n  [''Product'', ''Price'', ''Quantity'', ''Total''],\n  [''Widget A'', 10, 5, { f: ''B2*C2'' }],  // Formula\n  [''Widget B'', 15, 3, { f: ''B3*C3'' }],\n  ['''', '''', ''Grand Total:'', { f: ''SUM(D2:D3)'' }],\n];\n\nconst ws = XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(data);\nconst wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, ws, ''Sales'');\n```\n\n### From JSON\n\n```typescript\nconst invoices = [\n  { id: 1, customer: ''Acme Corp'', amount: 1500, date: ''2026-01-12'' },\n  { id: 2, customer: ''Globex'', amount: 2300, date: ''2026-01-13'' },\n];\n\nconst ws = XLSX.utils.json_to_sheet(invoices);\nconst wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, ws, ''Invoices'');\n```\n\n### Column Widths\n\n```typescript\n// Set column widths (in characters)\nws[''!cols''] = [\n  { wch: 10 },  // Column A\n  { wch: 20 },  // Column B\n  { wch: 15 },  // Column C\n];\n```\n\n### Multiple Sheets\n\n```typescript\nconst wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\n\nconst summaryData = [[''Total Sales'', 3800]];\nconst detailData = [[''Item'', ''Amount''], [''Item 1'', 1500], [''Item 2'', 2300]];\n\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(summaryData), ''Summary'');\nXLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, XLSX.utils.aoa_to_sheet(detailData), ''Details'');\n```\n\n### Export Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Node.js - Save to file\nXLSX.writeFile(workbook, ''report.xlsx'');\n\n// Browser/Workers - Get buffer\nconst buffer = XLSX.write(workbook, { type: ''buffer'', bookType: ''xlsx'' });\n\n// Cloudflare Workers - Return as Response\nreturn new Response(buffer, {\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet'',\n    ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"report.xlsx\"'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## PDF: PDF Documents\n\n### Key Concepts\n\npdf-lib uses a page-based approach:\n- **PDFDocument** - The PDF file\n- **PDFPage** - Individual page\n- **Coordinates** - Origin at BOTTOM-LEFT (not top-left!)\n- **Units** - Points (72 points = 1 inch)\n\n### Standard Page Sizes\n\n```typescript\n// Common sizes in points [width, height]\nconst LETTER = [612, 792];    // 8.5\" x 11\"\nconst A4 = [595.28, 841.89];  // 210mm x 297mm\nconst LEGAL = [612, 1008];    // 8.5\" x 14\"\n```\n\n### Text and Fonts\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument, StandardFonts, rgb } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\nconst pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.create();\nconst page = pdfDoc.addPage([612, 792]);\n\n// Embed standard fonts\nconst helvetica = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.Helvetica);\nconst helveticaBold = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.HelveticaBold);\n\n// Draw text (y=0 is BOTTOM of page)\npage.drawText(''Invoice #12345'', {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 750,  // Near top of page\n  size: 24,\n  font: helveticaBold,\n  color: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n});\n\npage.drawText(''Thank you for your business!'', {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 50,  // Near bottom of page\n  size: 12,\n  font: helvetica,\n  color: rgb(0.5, 0.5, 0.5),\n});\n```\n\n### Drawing Shapes\n\n```typescript\n// Rectangle\npage.drawRectangle({\n  x: 50,\n  y: 600,\n  width: 200,\n  height: 100,\n  borderColor: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n  borderWidth: 1,\n  color: rgb(0.95, 0.95, 0.95),  // Fill color\n});\n\n// Line\npage.drawLine({\n  start: { x: 50, y: 500 },\n  end: { x: 550, y: 500 },\n  thickness: 1,\n  color: rgb(0, 0, 0),\n});\n```\n\n### Images\n\n```typescript\n// From URL/fetch\nconst imageBytes = await fetch(''https://example.com/logo.png'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\nconst image = await pdfDoc.embedPng(imageBytes);\n\n// Or embedJpg for JPEG\n// const image = await pdfDoc.embedJpg(imageBytes);\n\npage.drawImage(image, {\n  x: 50,\n  y: 700,\n  width: 100,\n  height: 50,\n});\n```\n\n### Fill PDF Forms\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\n// Load existing PDF with form\nconst existingPdfBytes = await fetch(''form.pdf'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\nconst pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.load(existingPdfBytes);\n\n// Get form and fields\nconst form = pdfDoc.getForm();\nconst nameField = form.getTextField(''customer_name'');\nconst dateField = form.getTextField(''date'');\n\n// Fill fields\nnameField.setText(''John Doe'');\ndateField.setText(''2026-01-12'');\n\n// Flatten form (make fields non-editable)\nform.flatten();\n\nconst pdfBytes = await pdfDoc.save();\n```\n\n### Merge PDFs\n\n```typescript\nimport { PDFDocument } from ''pdf-lib'';\n\nconst pdf1Bytes = await fetch(''doc1.pdf'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\nconst pdf2Bytes = await fetch(''doc2.pdf'').then(r => r.arrayBuffer());\n\nconst mergedPdf = await PDFDocument.create();\nconst pdf1 = await PDFDocument.load(pdf1Bytes);\nconst pdf2 = await PDFDocument.load(pdf2Bytes);\n\n// Copy all pages from both documents\nconst pages1 = await mergedPdf.copyPages(pdf1, pdf1.getPageIndices());\nconst pages2 = await mergedPdf.copyPages(pdf2, pdf2.getPageIndices());\n\npages1.forEach(page => mergedPdf.addPage(page));\npages2.forEach(page => mergedPdf.addPage(page));\n\nconst mergedBytes = await mergedPdf.save();\n```\n\n---\n\n## PPTX: PowerPoint Presentations\n\n### Key Concepts\n\npptxgenjs uses a slide-based approach:\n- **Presentation** - The PPTX file (new pptxgen())\n- **Slide** - Individual slide (addSlide())\n- **Elements** - Text, images, shapes, tables, charts\n- **Units** - Inches by default (can change to cm/points)\n\n### Basic Presentation\n\n```typescript\nimport pptxgen from ''pptxgenjs'';\n\nconst pptx = new pptxgen();\npptx.author = ''Author Name'';\npptx.title = ''Presentation Title'';\npptx.subject = ''Subject'';\npptx.company = ''Company'';\n\n// Title slide\nconst titleSlide = pptx.addSlide();\ntitleSlide.addText(''Quarterly Report'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 2, w: 9, h: 1,\n  fontSize: 44, bold: true, color: ''0066CC'', align: ''center'',\n});\ntitleSlide.addText(''Q1 2026'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 3.5, w: 9, h: 0.5,\n  fontSize: 24, color: ''666666'', align: ''center'',\n});\n```\n\n### Slide with Bullet Points\n\n```typescript\nconst contentSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\n// Title\ncontentSlide.addText(''Key Highlights'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 9, h: 0.8,\n  fontSize: 32, bold: true, color: ''333333'',\n});\n\n// Bullet points\ncontentSlide.addText([\n  { text: ''Revenue up 25% YoY'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n  { text: ''Customer base grew to 10,000'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n  { text: ''New product launch successful'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n  { text: ''Expanded to 5 new markets'', options: { bullet: true, fontSize: 20 } },\n], { x: 0.5, y: 1.5, w: 8, h: 4, valign: ''top'' });\n```\n\n### Tables\n\n```typescript\nconst tableSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\ntableSlide.addText(''Sales Summary'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 9, h: 0.8,\n  fontSize: 28, bold: true,\n});\n\nconst tableData = [\n  [{ text: ''Region'', options: { bold: true, fill: ''0066CC'', color: ''FFFFFF'' } },\n   { text: ''Q1'', options: { bold: true, fill: ''0066CC'', color: ''FFFFFF'' } },\n   { text: ''Q2'', options: { bold: true, fill: ''0066CC'', color: ''FFFFFF'' } }],\n  [''North America'', ''$2.5M'', ''$2.8M''],\n  [''Europe'', ''$1.8M'', ''$2.1M''],\n  [''Asia Pacific'', ''$1.2M'', ''$1.5M''],\n];\n\ntableSlide.addTable(tableData, {\n  x: 0.5, y: 1.5, w: 9,\n  border: { pt: 1, color: ''CCCCCC'' },\n  fontFace: ''Arial'',\n  fontSize: 14,\n  align: ''center'',\n  valign: ''middle'',\n});\n```\n\n### Charts\n\n```typescript\nconst chartSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\nchartSlide.addText(''Revenue Trend'', {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 9, h: 0.6,\n  fontSize: 28, bold: true,\n});\n\nchartSlide.addChart(pptx.ChartType.line, [\n  { name: ''Revenue'', labels: [''Jan'', ''Feb'', ''Mar'', ''Apr''], values: [100, 120, 150, 180] },\n  { name: ''Expenses'', labels: [''Jan'', ''Feb'', ''Mar'', ''Apr''], values: [80, 85, 90, 95] },\n], {\n  x: 0.5, y: 1.2, w: 9, h: 4,\n  showLegend: true,\n  legendPos: ''b'',\n  showTitle: false,\n});\n```\n\n### Images\n\n```typescript\nimport { readFileSync } from ''fs'';\n\nconst imageSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\n// From file (Node.js)\nimageSlide.addImage({\n  path: ''logo.png'',\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 2, h: 1,\n});\n\n// From base64\nconst imageBase64 = readFileSync(''chart.png'').toString(''base64'');\nimageSlide.addImage({\n  data: `image/png;base64,${imageBase64}`,\n  x: 0.5, y: 2, w: 4, h: 3,\n});\n\n// From URL (Node.js only - uses https module)\nimageSlide.addImage({\n  path: ''https://example.com/image.png'',\n  x: 5, y: 2, w: 4, h: 3,\n});\n```\n\n### Shapes\n\n```typescript\nconst shapeSlide = pptx.addSlide();\n\n// Rectangle\nshapeSlide.addShape(pptx.ShapeType.rect, {\n  x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 3, h: 2,\n  fill: { color: ''0066CC'' },\n  line: { color: ''004499'', pt: 2 },\n});\n\n// Circle/Oval\nshapeSlide.addShape(pptx.ShapeType.ellipse, {\n  x: 4, y: 0.5, w: 2, h: 2,\n  fill: { color: ''00AA00'' },\n});\n\n// Arrow\nshapeSlide.addShape(pptx.ShapeType.rightArrow, {\n  x: 1, y: 3, w: 3, h: 1,\n  fill: { color: ''FF6600'' },\n});\n```\n\n### Slide Layouts and Masters\n\n```typescript\n// Define a master slide\npptx.defineSlideMaster({\n  title: ''COMPANY_MASTER'',\n  background: { color: ''FFFFFF'' },\n  objects: [\n    { text: { text: ''Company Name'', options: { x: 0.5, y: 0.2, w: 4, h: 0.3, fontSize: 10, color: ''999999'' } } },\n    { line: { x: 0.5, y: 0.6, w: 9, h: 0, line: { color: ''0066CC'', pt: 2 } } },\n  ],\n});\n\n// Use the master\nconst slide = pptx.addSlide({ masterName: ''COMPANY_MASTER'' });\n```\n\n### Export Patterns\n\n```typescript\n// Node.js - Save to file\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''presentation.pptx'' });\n\n// Browser - Trigger download\nawait pptx.writeFile({ fileName: ''presentation.pptx'' });\n\n// Get as base64 (for email, API, etc.)\nconst base64 = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''base64'' });\n\n// Get as Blob (browser)\nconst blob = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''blob'' });\n\n// Get as ArrayBuffer\nconst arrayBuffer = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''arraybuffer'' });\n\n// Cloudflare Workers - Return as Response\nconst arrayBuffer = await pptx.write({ outputType: ''arraybuffer'' });\nreturn new Response(arrayBuffer, {\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation'',\n    ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"presentation.pptx\"'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Cloudflare Workers Integration\n\nAll four libraries work in Cloudflare Workers (PPTX with caveats for remote images).\n\n### DOCX Generation Endpoint\n\n```typescript\nimport { Hono } from ''hono'';\nimport { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun } from ''docx'';\n\nconst app = new Hono();\n\napp.get(''/api/invoice/:id'', async (c) => {\n  const invoiceId = c.req.param(''id'');\n\n  const doc = new Document({\n    sections: [{\n      children: [\n        new Paragraph({\n          children: [new TextRun({ text: `Invoice #${invoiceId}`, bold: true, size: 48 })],\n        }),\n      ],\n    }],\n  });\n\n  const buffer = await Packer.toBuffer(doc);\n\n  return new Response(buffer, {\n    headers: {\n      ''Content-Type'': ''application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document'',\n      ''Content-Disposition'': `attachment; filename=\"invoice-${invoiceId}.docx\"`,\n    },\n  });\n});\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### HTML to PDF with Browser Rendering\n\nFor complex layouts with CSS, use Cloudflare Browser Rendering (paid feature):\n\n```typescript\nimport puppeteer from ''@cloudflare/puppeteer'';\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request, env) {\n    const browser = await puppeteer.launch(env.BROWSER);\n    const page = await browser.newPage();\n\n    // Set HTML content\n    await page.setContent(`\n      <html>\n        <head>\n          <style>\n            body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 40px; }\n            h1 { color: #333; }\n            table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }\n            td, th { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; }\n          </style>\n        </head>\n        <body>\n          <h1>Invoice #12345</h1>\n          <table>\n            <tr><th>Item</th><th>Amount</th></tr>\n            <tr><td>Service</td><td>$500</td></tr>\n          </table>\n        </body>\n      </html>\n    `);\n\n    const pdf = await page.pdf({ format: ''A4'' });\n    await browser.close();\n\n    return new Response(pdf, {\n      headers: {\n        ''Content-Type'': ''application/pdf'',\n        ''Content-Disposition'': ''attachment; filename=\"invoice.pdf\"'',\n      },\n    });\n  },\n};\n```\n\n**wrangler.jsonc binding:**\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"browser\": {\n    \"binding\": \"BROWSER\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Use `await Packer.toBuffer()` for DOCX (it''s async)\n✅ Remember PDF coordinates start at BOTTOM-LEFT\n✅ Use `type: ''buffer''` for XLSX in Workers/browser\n✅ Embed fonts in PDF before using them\n✅ Set proper Content-Type headers for downloads\n✅ Use `await pptx.writeFile()` or `await pptx.write()` for PPTX\n✅ Use base64 images in PPTX for Workers (avoid remote URLs)\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `Packer.toBuffer()` without await (returns Promise)\n❌ Assume PDF y=0 is at top (it''s at bottom)\n❌ Use `writeFile` in Workers (use Response instead)\n❌ Forget to set Content-Disposition for downloads\n❌ Use Node.js fs module in browser/Workers\n❌ Use PPTX path URLs in Workers (https module not available)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\n### Issue #1: DOCX Packer Returns Promise\n**Error**: `[object Promise]` in file or empty document\n**Why**: `Packer.toBuffer()` is async but called without await\n**Prevention**: Always `await Packer.toBuffer(doc)`\n\n### Issue #2: PDF Text at Wrong Position\n**Error**: Text appears at bottom of page or off-page\n**Why**: PDF coordinates have origin at bottom-left, not top-left\n**Prevention**: For text near top, use high y values (e.g., y=750 for letter size)\n\n### Issue #3: XLSX Formula Not Calculating\n**Error**: Cell shows formula text instead of result\n**Why**: SheetJS doesn''t execute formulas, Excel does on open\n**Prevention**: This is expected - formulas calculate when opened in Excel\n\n### Issue #4: Workers DOCX/PDF Returns Empty\n**Error**: Downloaded file is empty or corrupted\n**Why**: Returning wrong type or missing Content-Type header\n**Prevention**: Return buffer directly with proper headers\n\n### Issue #5: PPTX Remote Images Fail in Workers\n**Error**: `https is not defined` or image not appearing\n**Why**: pptxgenjs uses Node.js `https` module for remote images\n**Prevention**: Use base64 data URIs or local images in Workers environment\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n- `docx-basic.ts` - Complete Word document with headings, tables, images\n- `xlsx-basic.ts` - Excel workbook with formulas and formatting\n- `pdf-basic.ts` - PDF with text, images, shapes\n- `pptx-basic.ts` - PowerPoint with slides, charts, tables\n- `workers-pdf.ts` - Cloudflare Workers PDF generation example\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `docx-api.md` - Quick reference for docx npm package\n- `xlsx-api.md` - Quick reference for SheetJS functions\n- `pdf-lib-api.md` - Quick reference for pdf-lib methods\n- `pptxgenjs-api.md` - Quick reference for pptxgenjs\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\n- `verify-deps.sh` - Check library versions are current\n\n---\n\n## Limitations vs Anthropic''s Official Skills\n\nThis skill focuses on **document creation** with portable TypeScript libraries:\n\n| Feature | This Skill | Anthropic''s Skills |\n|---------|------------|-------------------|\n| Create DOCX/XLSX/PDF/PPTX | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Works in Cloudflare Workers | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Plugin installable | ✅ | ❌ |\n| TypeScript-first | ✅ | ❌ (Python) |\n| Edit existing DOCX with tracked changes | ❌ | ✅ |\n| Excel formula validation | ❌ | ✅ |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | ❌ | ✅ |\n\nFor advanced editing scenarios (tracked changes, formula validation), consider Anthropic''s official skills with Python tooling.\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-12)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"docx\": \"^9.5.0\",\n    \"xlsx\": \"^0.18.5\",\n    \"pdf-lib\": \"^1.17.1\",\n    \"pptxgenjs\": \"^4.0.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **docx**: https://docx.js.org/\n- **SheetJS (xlsx)**: https://docs.sheetjs.com/\n- **pdf-lib**: https://pdf-lib.js.org/\n- **pptxgenjs**: https://gitbrent.github.io/PptxGenJS/\n- **Cloudflare Browser Rendering**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/browser-rendering/\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\n- [ ] Installed required packages (`npm install docx xlsx pdf-lib`)\n- [ ] Verified import statements match runtime (Node.js vs browser)\n- [ ] Used proper export method for target environment\n- [ ] Set Content-Type headers for HTTP responses\n- [ ] Tested document opens correctly in target application\n- [ ] Confirmed Workers compatibility (if deploying to edge)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:13:27.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Document Generation Agents needing to create Microsoft Office documents and PDFs programmatically with TypeScript.","zh":"适用于需要使用TypeScript编程生成Microsoft Office文档和PDF的文档生成代理。","ja":"TypeScriptを使用してMicrosoft OfficeドキュメントとPDFをプログラムで生成する必要があるドキュメント生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"TypeScript를 사용하여 Microsoft Office 문서와 PDF를 프로그래밍 방식으로 생성해야 하는 문서 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Documentos que necesitan crear documentos de Microsoft Office y PDF de forma programática con TypeScript.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de documents nécessitant la création de documents Microsoft Office et de PDF de manière programmatique avec TypeScript.","de":"Ideal für Dokumentgenerierungsagenten, die Microsoft Office-Dokumente und PDFs programmgesteuert mit TypeScript erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Documentos que precisam criar documentos do Microsoft Office e PDFs programaticamente com TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации документов, которым необходимо создавать документы Microsoft Office и PDF программно с помощью TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل генера генریشن الدوكمینتات الذي يحتاج إلى ایجاد وثائق مايكروسوفت أوفيس و PDFs برمجيًا باستخدام TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate docx, xlsx, and pptx files using libraries like docx, xlsx, and pptxgenjs, enabling universal runtime support across workers, browsers, and Node.js environments with zero native dependencies.","zh":"赋予代理使用类似docx、xlsx和pptxgenjs的库生成docx、xlsx和pptx文件的能力，实现跨工作线程、浏览器和Node.js环境的通用运行时支持，且无本地依赖。","ja":"エージェントがdocx、xlsx、pptxgenjsなどのライブラリを使用してdocx、xlsx、pptxファイルを生成できるようにし、ワーカー、ブラウザー、Node.js環境を横断してゼロのネイティブ依存関係でユニバーサルランタイムサポートを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 docx, xlsx, pptxgenjs와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 docx, xlsx, pptx 파일을 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 작업자, 브라우저 및 Node.js 환경을横断하여 영 네이티브 종속성으로 유니버설 런타임 지원을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar archivos docx, xlsx y pptx utilizando bibliotecas como docx, xlsx y pptxgenjs, lo que permite una compatibilidad de ejecución universal en workers, navegadores y entornos de Node.js con cero dependencias nativas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers docx, xlsx et pptx en utilisant des bibliothèques telles que docx, xlsx et pptxgenjs, ce qui permet un support d''exécution universel sur les workers, les navigateurs et les environnements Node.js avec zéro dépendances natives.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, docx-, xlsx- und pptx-Dateien mithilfe von Bibliotheken wie docx, xlsx und pptxgenjs zu generieren, wodurch eine universelle Laufzeitunterstützung über Worker, Browser und Node.js-Umgebungen mit null nativen Abhängigkeiten ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos docx, xlsx e pptx usando bibliotecas como docx, xlsx e pptxgenjs, permitindo suporte de tempo de execução universal em trabalhadores, navegadores e ambientes Node.js com zero dependências nativas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать файлы docx, xlsx и pptx с помощью библиотек seperti docx, xlsx и pptxgenjs, обеспечивая универсальную поддержку среды выполнения на рабочих местах, браузерах и средах Node.js с нулевыми родными зависимостями.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على generar ملفات docx و xlsx و pptx باستخدام مكتبات مثل docx و xlsx و pptxgenjs، مما يتيح دعم وقت التشغيل العالمي عبر العمال والمتصفحات وبيئات Node.js مع عدم وجود зависимости أصلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating Microsoft Office documents programmatically","Creating PDFs using pdf-lib","Automating report generation in docx and xlsx formats"],"zh":["以编程方式生成Microsoft Office文档","使用pdf-lib创建PDF","自动以docx和xlsx格式生成报告"],"ja":["Microsoft Officeドキュメントをプログラムで生成する","pdf-libを使用してPDFを作成する","レポートをdocxおよびxlsx形式で自動生成する"],"ko":["Microsoft Office 문서를 프로그래밍 방식으로 생성하는 것","pdf-lib를 사용하여 PDF를 생성하는 것","docx 및 xlsx 형식으로 보고서를 자동 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generación de documentos de Microsoft Office de forma programática","Creación de PDF utilizando pdf-lib","Automatización de la generación de informes en formatos docx y xlsx"],"fr":["Génération de documents Microsoft Office de manière programmatique","Création de PDF à l''aide de pdf-lib","Automatisation de la génération de rapports au format docx et xlsx"],"de":["Programmgesteuerte Erstellung von Microsoft Office-Dokumenten","Erstellung von PDFs mit pdf-lib","Automatisierung der Berichtsgenerierung im docx- und xlsx-Format"],"pt":["Geração de documentos do Microsoft Office programaticamente","Criação de PDFs usando pdf-lib","Automação da geração de relatórios nos formatos docx e xlsx"],"ru":["Программная генерация документов Microsoft Office","Создание PDF с помощью pdf-lib","Автоматизация генерации отчетов в форматах docx и xlsx"],"ar":["генрация وثائق مايكروسوفت أوفيس برمجيًا","إنشاء PDFs باستخدام pdf-lib","آلية généração التقارير في صيغ docx و xlsx"]},"limitations":{"en":["Dependencies on specific library versions (e.g., docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)"],"zh":["依赖于特定库版本（例如docx@9.5.0，xlsx@0.18.5）"],"ja":["特定のライブラリバージョン（たとえばdocx@9.5.0、xlsx@0.18.5）に依存する"],"ko":["특정 라이브러리 버전에 대한 종속성（예: docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5）"],"es":["Dependencias de versiones específicas de bibliotecas (por ejemplo, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)"],"fr":["Dépendances de versions spécifiques de bibliothèques (par exemple, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)"],"de":["Abhängigkeiten von spezifischen Bibliotheksversionen (z.B. docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)"],"pt":["Dependências de versões específicas de bibliotecas (por exemplo, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)"],"ru":["Зависимости от конкретных версий библиотек (например, docx@9.5.0, xlsx@0.18.5)"],"ar":["اعتمادية على إصدارات محددة من المكتبات (على سبيل المثال docx@9.5.0، xlsx@0.18.5)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('muspelheim/claude-roaster/roast', 'community', 'muspelheim', 'claude-roaster', 'muspelheim/claude-roaster', 'roast', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z', '2026-02-18T13:13:23.955Z', NULL, '{"id":"muspelheim/claude-roaster/roast","name":"roast","description":{"zh":"UI/UX, ","ja":"UI/UX","ko":"UI/UX ","es":"La herramienta de análisis UI/UX Roast ofrece una crítica honesta y análisis multi-perspectivo para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"L''outil d''analyse UI/UX Roast propose une critique honnête et une analyse multi-perspective pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Das UI/UX Roast Analyse Tool bietet eine ehrliche Kritik und eine multi-perspektivische Analyse, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern.","pt":"A ferramenta Roast oferece análise UI/UX honesta e melhoria iterativa para melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Инструмент Roast предоставляет честный анализ UI/UX и итеративное улучшение для повышения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"أداة Roast توفر تحليلًا صادقًا وتحسينًا متكررًا لواجهة المستخدم لتحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX ","ja":"UI/UX","ko":"UI/UX ","es":"Herramienta de Análisis UI/UX Roast","fr":"Outil d''Analyse UI/UX Roast","de":"UI/UX Roast Analyse Tool","pt":"Otimização de UI/UX com Roast","ru":"Рост UI/UX с помощью Roast","ar":"تحسين واجهة المستخدم مع Roast","en":"roast"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX, ","ja":"UI/UX","ko":"UI/UX ","es":"La herramienta de análisis UI/UX Roast ofrece una crítica honesta y análisis multi-perspectivo para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"L''outil d''analyse UI/UX Roast propose une critique honnête et une analyse multi-perspective pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Das UI/UX Roast Analyse Tool bietet eine ehrliche Kritik und eine multi-perspektivische Analyse, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern.","pt":"A ferramenta Roast oferece análise UI/UX honesta e melhoria iterativa para melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Инструмент Roast предоставляет честный анализ UI/UX и итеративное улучшение для повышения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"أداة Roast توفر تحليلًا صادقًا وتحسينًا متكررًا لواجهة المستخدم لتحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["UI/UX","","","a11y","UI/UX"],"ja":["UI/UX","","","a11y","UI/UX"],"ko":["UI/UX","","","a11y","UI/UX "],"es":["Análisis de pantalla única","Auditoría de flujo de usuario multi-pantalla","Revisión de aplicaciones completas","Opciones de iteración y enfoque personalizables","Salida de resultados personalizable"],"fr":["Analyse d''écran unique","Audit de parcours utilisateur multi-écran","Révision d''applications complètes","Options d''itération et de focus personnalisables","Sortie de résultats personnalisable"],"de":["Einzelbildschirm-Analyse","Benutzerfluss-Multi-Bildschirm-Audit","Vollständige Anwendungsüberprüfung","Anpassbare Iterations- und Fokus-Optionen","Anpassbare Ergebnisausgabe"],"pt":["Análise de tela única","Análise de fluxo de usuário","Revisão de aplicativos completos","Opções de iterações personalizáveis","Foco em acessibilidade, conversão, usabilidade, visual e implementação"],"ru":["Анализ единственного экрана","Анализ потока пользователя","Полный обзор приложений","Настройка итераций","Фокус на доступности, конверсии, удобстве использования, визуальном и реализации"],"ar":["تحليل الشاشة الفردي","تحليل تدفق المستخدم","مراجعة تطبيقات كاملة","خيارات تكرار مخصصة","التركيز على إمكانية الوصول وتنفيذ التحويلات وسهولة الاستخدام والتصميم والتطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX","UI/UX","a11y","UI/UX","UI/UX","UI/UX"],"ja":["UI/UX","UI/UX","a11y","UI/UX","UI/UX","UI/UX"],"ko":["UI/UX","UI/UX","a11y","UI/UX","UI/UX","UI/UX "],"es":["análisis UI/UX","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","herramienta de análisis","crítica honesta","mejoras iterativas","diseño de interfaz de usuario","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["analyse UI/UX","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","outil d''analyse","critique honnête","améliorations itératives","conception d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["UI/UX-Analyse","Benutzererfahrung Verbesserung","Analyse Tool","ehrliche Kritik","iterative Verbesserungen","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["otimização de UI/UX","análise de UI/UX","ferramenta de UI/UX","melhoria de experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","usabilidade"],"ru":["Оптимизация UI/UX","Анализ UI/UX","Инструмент UI/UX","Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Разработка приложений","Удобство использования"],"ar":["تحسين واجهة المستخدم","تحليل واجهة المستخدم","أداة واجهة المستخدم","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تطوير التطبيقات","سهولة الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"muspelheim","repo":"claude-roaster","repoPath":"muspelheim/claude-roaster","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.517Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"roast","description":"Multi-perspective UI/UX roasting workflow with iterative improvement cycles","bodyPreview":"# 🔥 UI/UX Roast Skill\n\nBrutally honest UI/UX critique with multi-perspective analysis and iterative improvement.\n\n## Command Syntax\n\n```bash\n/roast [mode] [target] [options]\n\n# Modes\nscreen <target>     # Single screen analysis (default)\nflow <target>       # Multi-screen user journey\naudit               # Full application review\n\n# Options\n--iterations=<1-10> # Roast cycles (default: 3)\n--focus=<area>      # Priority: a11y|conversion|usability|visual|implementation\n--output=<path>     # Output","body":"# 🔥 UI/UX Roast Skill\n\nBrutally honest UI/UX critique with multi-perspective analysis and iterative improvement.\n\n## Command Syntax\n\n```bash\n/roast [mode] [target] [options]\n\n# Modes\nscreen <target>     # Single screen analysis (default)\nflow <target>       # Multi-screen user journey\naudit               # Full application review\n\n# Options\n--iterations=<1-10> # Roast cycles (default: 3)\n--focus=<area>      # Priority: a11y|conversion|usability|visual|implementation\n--output=<path>     # Output directory (default: reports/roast/)\n--fix=<mode>        # Fix handling: auto|report|ask (default: ask)\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n/roast screen login                     # Roast login screen\n/roast screen settings --focus=a11y     # Focus on accessibility\n/roast flow checkout --iterations=5     # 5-iteration checkout flow\n/roast flow onboarding --fix=auto       # Auto-fix issues found\n/roast audit                            # Full app audit\n```\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n### 1. Immediate Start\n\n**Do NOT ask questions upfront.** Apply smart defaults and begin immediately.\n\n```\n🔥 ROAST SESSION STARTED\n├─ Mode: screen\n├─ Target: login\n├─ Iterations: 3\n├─ Focus: balanced\n└─ Output: reports/roast/\n```\n\n### 2. Screenshot Capture\n\nAuto-detect screenshot method:\n\n```\n📸 Capturing screenshot...\n├─ Xcode MCP: [✓ found | ✗ not found]\n├─ Playwright MCP: [✓ found | ✗ not found]\n└─ Using: [xcode | playwright | manual upload]\n```\n\n**Detection priority:**\n1. `mcp__xcodebuildmcp__screenshot` → iOS/macOS\n2. `mcp__playwright__browser_take_screenshot` → Web\n3. Request user upload → Fallback\n\n**CRITICAL: Always specify the output path explicitly!**\n\n```typescript\n// First, ensure directory exists\nBash: mkdir -p reports/roast/screenshots\n\n// Playwright MCP - specify filename parameter\nmcp__playwright__browser_take_screenshot({\n  type: \"png\",\n  filename: \"reports/roast/screenshots/[target]_[iteration].png\"\n})\n\n// Xcode MCP - specify path parameter\nmcp__xcodebuildmcp__screenshot({\n  path: \"reports/roast/screenshots/[target]_[iteration].png\"\n})\n```\n\nWithout explicit path, screenshots go to wrong location (e.g., `.playwright-mcp/`).\n\n### 3. Parallel Analysis with Progress\n\nShow real-time progress:\n\n```\n🔥 Roasting: login (1/3)\n├─ 📸 Screenshot ✓\n├─ 🎨 Designer: analyzing...\n├─ 💻 Developer: analyzing...\n├─ 👤 User: analyzing...\n├─ ♿ A11y: analyzing...\n└─ 📈 Marketing: analyzing...\n```\n\nLaunch agents in parallel:\n\n```typescript\n// All 5 agents run simultaneously\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-designer\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-developer\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-user\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-a11y\", prompt=\"...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"claude-roaster:roaster-marketing\", prompt=\"...\")\n```\n\nUpdate as each completes:\n\n```\n├─ 🎨 Designer: ✓ 3 issues\n├─ 💻 Developer: ✓ 2 issues\n├─ 👤 User: ✓ 4 issues\n├─ ♿ A11y: ✓ 5 issues (2 critical!)\n└─ 📈 Marketing: ✓ 2 issues\n```\n\n### 4. Results Summary\n\nDisplay in terminal before asking about fixes:\n\n```\n🔥 ROAST RESULTS (Iteration 1/3)\n\nFound 16 issues:\n├─ 🔴 Critical: 2\n├─ 🟠 Major: 6\n└─ 🟡 Minor: 8\n\nTop Critical Issues:\n1. Missing form labels - add aria-label to inputs\n2. Contrast ratio 2.1:1 - increase to 4.5:1 minimum\n\n📄 Full report: reports/roast/roast_login_1.md\n```\n\n### 5. Fix Decision (After Results)\n\nAsk ONLY after showing results:\n\n```\nHow should we handle these 16 issues?\n\n[1] Auto-fix critical & major (8 fixes)\n[2] Fix all issues (16 fixes)\n[3] Cherry-pick fixes\n[4] Report only (no changes)\n```\n\n### 6. Fix Implementation\n\nIf fixes chosen:\n\n```\n🔧 Implementing fixes...\n├─ [1/8] Adding aria-labels... ✓\n├─ [2/8] Fixing contrast... ✓\n├─ [3/8] Increasing touch targets... ✓\n...\n└─ ✓ Complete\n\n📸 Capturing updated screenshot...\n```\n\n### 7. Next Iteration\n\n```\nIteration 2/3 starting...\n[Repeat steps 2-6]\n```\n\n### 8. Final Summary\n\n```\n🔥 FINAL ROAST SUMMARY\n\nSession Complete!\n├─ Iterations: 3\n├─ Issues found: 24\n├─ Issues fixed: 18\n└─ Resolution: 75%\n\nScore Improvement:\n| Category      | Before | After | Δ    |\n|---------------|--------|-------|------|\n| Visual        | 4/10   | 8/10  | +4   |\n| Usability     | 5/10   | 9/10  | +4   |\n| Accessibility | 3/10   | 8/10  | +5   |\n| Overall       | 4/10   | 8/10  | +4   |\n\n📄 reports/roast/roast_login_final.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mode-Specific Behavior\n\n### Screen Mode\n\nSingle screen, multiple iterations:\n\n```\n/roast screen login --iterations=3\n\nIteration 1: Capture → Analyze → Report → Fix?\nIteration 2: Capture → Analyze → Report → Fix?\nIteration 3: Capture → Analyze → Final Report\n```\n\n### Flow Mode\n\nMultiple screens, analyze journey:\n\n```\n/roast flow checkout\n\n🗺️ Flow: checkout (5 steps)\n├─ [1/5] Cart → 📸 analyzing...\n├─ [2/5] Shipping → 📸 analyzing...\n├─ [3/5] Payment → 📸 analyzing...\n├─ [4/5] Review → 📸 analyzing...\n└─ [5/5] Confirmation → 📸 analyzing...\n\nCross-screen checks:\n├─ Visual consistency\n├─ Navigation clarity\n├─ Progress indication\n└─ Drop-off risk points\n```\n\n### Audit Mode\n\nAuto-detect and roast all critical screens:\n\n```\n/roast audit\n\n🔍 Scanning for critical screens...\n├─ Login ✓\n├─ Dashboard ✓\n├─ Settings ✓\n├─ Checkout ✓\n└─ Profile ✓\n\nRoasting 5 screens (3 iterations each)...\n```\n\n---\n\n## Agent Configuration\n\n| Agent | Model | Focus | Weight |\n|-------|-------|-------|--------|\n| roaster (orchestrator) | Opus | Synthesis | - |\n| roaster-designer | Sonnet | Visual, typography, color | 1.0x |\n| roaster-developer | Sonnet | Implementation, structure | 1.0x |\n| roaster-user | Sonnet | Usability, friction | 1.0x |\n| roaster-a11y | Sonnet | Accessibility, WCAG | 1.0x |\n| roaster-marketing | Sonnet | Conversion, trust | 1.0x |\n\n**With `--focus` option:**\n- Focused agent: 1.5x weight\n- Other agents: 0.5x weight\n\n---\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\nreports/roast/\n├─ roast_[target]_1.md\n├─ roast_[target]_2.md\n├─ roast_[target]_final.md\n└─ screenshots/\n   ├─ [target]_1.png\n   ├─ [target]_2.png\n   └─ [target]_final.png\n```\n\n---\n\n## Report Format\n\n```markdown\n# 🔥 Roast Report: [Target] - Iteration [N]\n\n**Mode:** screen | **Focus:** balanced | **Date:** 2024-01-15\n\n![Screenshot](screenshots/login_1.png)\n\n## The Verdict\n\n[Brutal 2-3 sentence summary]\n\n## Issues by Severity\n\n### 🔴 Critical (2)\n| Issue | Agent | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| Missing labels | A11y | Add aria-label=\"Email\" |\n| Low contrast | Designer | Change #999 to #595959 |\n\n### 🟠 Major (6)\n...\n\n### 🟡 Minor (8)\n...\n\n## Agent Deep Dives\n\n### 🎨 Designer\n[Full analysis]\n\n### ♿ A11y Expert\n[Full analysis]\n\n...\n\n## Quick Wins\n- [ ] Fix 1 (< 2 min)\n- [ ] Fix 2 (< 2 min)\n\n## Scores\n| Category | Score |\n|----------|-------|\n| Visual | 4/10 |\n| Usability | 5/10 |\n| Accessibility | 3/10 |\n| Overall | 4/10 |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Voice Guidelines\n\n1. **Brutal but fair** - Harsh critique, always with solutions\n2. **Specific values** - \"#2563eb\", \"48px\", \"font-weight: 600\"\n3. **Actionable fixes** - Every issue has a concrete fix\n4. **Fast start** - Begin immediately, ask questions later\n5. **Progress visibility** - Always show what''s happening\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:13:23.955Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Analysis Agents needing brutally honest multi-perspective critique and iterative improvement capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要毫无保留的多角度批评和迭代改进能力的UI/UX分析代理。","ja":"UI/UX分析エージェントが必要とする、容赦ない多角度からの批判と改善のための機能を完璧に備えています。","ko":"무자비한 다각도 비평과 반복적인 개선 기능이 필요한 UI/UX 분석 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de UI/UX que necesitan una crítica honesta y multifacética y capacidades de mejora iterativa.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse UI/UX ayant besoin d''une critique brutale et multiforme ainsi que de capacités d''amélioration itérative.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Analyse-Agenten, die eine brutal ehrliche, mehrperspektivische Kritik und iterative Verbesserungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de análise de UI/UX que necessitam de críticas honestas e multifacetadas e capacidades de melhoria iterativa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа UI/UX, которым необходима честная и многогранная критика, а также возможности итеративного совершенствования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل واجهة المستخدم وتجربة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى نقد شديد الصراحة ومتعددة الزوايا وقدرات تحسين تكراري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform screen and flow analysis, full application audits, and iterative improvements using command-line options like --iterations and --focus, analyzing areas such as accessibility, conversion, usability, visual design, and implementation.","zh":"赋予代理执行屏幕和流程分析、完整应用程序审计以及使用命令行选项（如--iterations和--focus）进行的迭代改进，分析诸如无障碍、转换、可用性、视觉设计和实现等领域。","ja":"エージェントに、スクリーンおよびフロー分析、フルアプリケーションの監査、および--iterationsおよび--focusなどのコマンドラインオプションを使用した反復的な改善を実行する機能を提供し、アクセシビリティ、コンバージョン、ユーザビリティ、視覚的なデザイン、実装などの分野を分析します。","ko":"에이전트가 화면 및 흐름 분석, 전체 애플리케이션 감사 및 --iterations 및 --focus와 같은 명령줄 옵션을 사용하여 반복적인 개선 작업을 수행하도록 하며, 접근성, 전환, 사용성, 시각적 디자인, 구현 등 다양한 분야를 분석합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar análisis de pantalla y flujo, auditorías de aplicaciones completas y mejoras iterativas utilizando opciones de línea de comandos como --iterations y --focus, analizando áreas como accesibilidad, conversión, usabilidad, diseño visual e implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des analyses d''écran et de flux, des audits d''applications complets et des améliorations itératives en utilisant des options de ligne de commande comme --iterations et --focus, en analysant des domaines tels que l''accessibilité, la conversion, l''utilisabilité, la conception visuelle et la mise en œuvre.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Bildschirm- und Flussanalysen durchzuführen, vollständige Anwendungsaudits und iterative Verbesserungen mithilfe von Befehlszeilenoptionen wie --iterations und --focus, die Bereiche wie Zugänglichkeit, Konvertierung, Benutzerfreundlichkeit, visuelles Design und Implementierung analysieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análises de tela e fluxo, auditorias de aplicativos completas e melhorias iterativas usando opções de linha de comando como --iterations e --focus, analisando áreas como acessibilidade, conversão, usabilidade, design visual e implementação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять анализ экрана и потока, полные аудиты приложений и итеративные улучшения с использованием опций командной строки, таких как --iterations и --focus, анализируя такие области, как доступность, конверсия, удобство использования, визуальный дизайн и реализация.","ar":"تمكن العميل من أداء تحليلات للشاشة والتدفق وتحليلات تامة للتطبيقات وتحسينات متكررة باستخدام خيارات سطر الأوامر مثل --iterations و --focus ، وتحليل مجالات مثل سهولة الوصول و الإحتواء وسهولة الاستخدام والتصميم المرئي والتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing single screen layouts for usability issues","Auditing full applications for accessibility compliance","Iteratively improving multi-screen user journeys for conversion rate optimization"],"zh":["分析单个屏幕布局以查找可用性问题","审核完整应用程序以确保无障碍兼容性","反复改进多屏用户旅程以优化转换率"],"ja":["ユーザビリティの問題を特定するための単一画面レイアウトの分析","アクセシビリティの準拠を確保するためのフルアプリケーションの監査","コンバージョン率の最適化のためのマルチスクリーン ユーザージャーニーの反復的な改善"],"ko":["사용성 문제를 찾기 위한 단일 화면 레이아웃 분석","접근성 규정 준수를 위해 전체 애플리케이션 감사","전환률 최적화를 위한 멀티스크린 사용자 여정의 반복적인 개선"],"es":["Análisis de diseños de pantalla única para problemas de usabilidad","Auditoría de aplicaciones completas para cumplimiento de accesibilidad","Mejora iterativa de trayectorias de usuario multipantalla para optimización de la tasa de conversión"],"fr":["Analyse de mises en page d''écran unique pour les problèmes d''utilisabilité","Audit d''applications complètes pour la conformité à l''accessibilité","Amélioration itérative de parcours utilisateur multicode pour l''optimisation du taux de conversion"],"de":["Analyse von einzelnen Bildschirmlayouts für Usability-Probleme","Auditing von vollständigen Anwendungen für die Einhaltung der Zugänglichkeitsvorschriften","Iterative Verbesserung von Mehrbildschirm-Benutzerreisen für die Optimierung des Konvertierungssatzes"],"pt":["Analisar layouts de tela única para problemas de usabilidade","Auditar aplicativos completos para conformidade com acessibilidade","Melhorar iterativamente jornadas de usuário de múltiplas telas para otimização da taxa de conversão"],"ru":["Анализировать макеты одного экрана для проблем с удобством использования","Проводить аудит полных приложений для соответствия требованиям доступности","Итеративно улучшать пользовательские пути на нескольких экранах для оптимизации коэффициента конверсии"],"ar":["تحليل تصميمات الشاشة الواحدة لمشاكل سهولة الاستخدام","إجراء تدقيق شاملة للتطبيقات للامتثال لمعايير سهولة الوصول","تحسين متكرر لمسارات المستخدم على شاشات متعددة لتحسين نسبة التحويل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires command-line interface access","Limited to 10 roast cycles (--iterations option)"],"zh":["需要命令行接口访问","限制为10次烘焙循环（--iterations选项）"],"ja":["コマンドラインインターフェイスへのアクセスが必要","10回のローストサイクル（--iterationsオプション）に制限される"],"ko":["명령줄 인터페이스 액세스가 필요","10 회의 로스팅 주기 (--iterations 옵션)로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de línea de comandos","Limitado a 10 ciclos de asado (opción --iterations)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface de ligne de commande","Limité à 10 cycles de rôtisserie (option --iterations)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Befehlszeilenoberfläche","Begrenzt auf 10 Röstzyklen (Option --iterations)"],"pt":["Requer acesso à interface de linha de comando","Limitado a 10 ciclos de crítica (--iterations option)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к командной строке","Ограничен 10 циклами критики (опция --iterations)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر","محدود بـ 10 دورات نقد (خيار --iterations)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
