"Denario AI AG2 LangGraph 100+ 300+.","ja":"Denario AI AG2 LangGraph 100 300.","ko":"Denario AI AG2 LangGraph 100 300 .","es":"Denario es un sistema de IA que automatiza flujos de trabajo de investigación científica, desde el análisis de datos hasta la generación de manuscritos","fr":"Denario est un système d''IA qui automatise les flux de travail de recherche scientifique, de l''analyse des données à la génération de manuscrits","de":"Denario ist ein KI-System, das wissenschaftliche Forschungsprozesse automatisiert, von der Datenanalyse bis zur Generierung von Manuskripten","pt":"Denario é um sistema de IA multiagente que automatiza fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica, com 100+ Droids personalizados e 300+ habilidades.","ru":"Denario - это многоагентная система ИИ, которая автоматизирует потоки научных исследований, с 100+ настраиваемыми Droids и 300+ навыками.","ar":"ديناريو هو نظام ذكاء اصطناعي متعدد الوكلاء يautomatiza تدفقات البحث العلمي، مع 100+ دроيد مخصص و 300+ مهارة.","en":"Comprehensive collection of 100+ custom Droids & 300+ Skills for FactoryAI Droid system"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive collection of 100+ custom Droids & 300+ Skills for FactoryAI Droid system"},"features":{"zh":["100+ ","300+ ","AG2 LangGraph"," "," "],"ja":["100 ","300 ","AG2 LangGraph","",""],"ko":["100 ","300 ","AG2 LangGraph"," "," "],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de investigación científica","Generación de hipótesis de investigación","Desarrollo de metodologías de investigación","Análisis computacional de datos","Generación de manuscritos de investigación"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de recherche scientifique","Génération d''hypothèses de recherche","Développement de méthodologies de recherche","Analyse computationnelle de données","Génération de manuscrits de recherche"],"de":["Automatisierung von wissenschaftlichen Forschungsprozessen","Generierung von Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung von Forschungsmethoden","Computergestützte Datenanalyse","Generierung von Forschungsmanuskripten"],"pt":["Automatização de fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica","100+ Droids personalizados para tarefas específicas","300+ habilidades para análise de dados e geração de hipóteses","Integração com frameworks AG2 e LangGraph","Geração de manuscritos prontos para publicação"],"ru":["Автоматизация потоков научных исследований","100+ настраиваемых Droids для конкретных задач","300+ навыков для анализа данных и генерации гипотез","Интеграция с фреймворками AG2 и LangGraph","Генерация готовых к публикации рукописей"],"ar":["تأتمتة تدفقات البحث العلمي","100+ درويد مخصص لمهام محددة","300+ مهارة لتحليل البيانات وتوليد الفرضيات","التكامل مع الإطارات AG2 و LangGraph","توليد مخطوطات جاهزة للنشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Denario AI","FactoryAI Droid","AG2","LangGraph","AI "," "],"ja":["Denario AI","FactoryAI Droid","AG2","LangGraph","AI",""],"ko":["Denario AI","FactoryAI Droid","AG2","LangGraph","AI "," "],"es":["investigación científica","automatización de flujos de trabajo","sistema de IA multiagente","generación de hipótesis","análisis de datos","generación de manuscritos"],"fr":["recherche scientifique","automatisation des flux de travail","système d''IA multiagent","génération d''hypothèses","analyse de données","génération de manuscrits"],"de":["wissenschaftliche Forschung","Automatisierung von Forschungsprozessen","Multiagenten-KI-System","Generierung von Forschungshypothesen","Datenanalyse","Generierung von Forschungsmanuskripten"],"pt":["Denario","IA para pesquisa científica","Automatização de fluxos de trabalho","Análise de dados","Geração de hipóteses","Escrita de artigos","AG2","LangGraph"],"ru":["Denario","ИИ для научных исследований","Автоматизация потоков","Анализ данных","Генерация гипотез","Написание статей","AG2","LangGraph"],"ar":["ديناريو","ذكاء اصطناعي للبحث العلمي","تأتمتة تدفقات البحث","تحليل البيانات","توليد الفرضيات","كتابة المقالات","AG2","LangGraph"]}},"owner":"ovachiever","repo":"droid-tings","repoPath":"ovachiever/droid-tings","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"denario","description":"Multiagent AI system for scientific research assistance that automates research workflows from data analysis to publication. This skill should be used when generating research ideas from datasets, developing research methodologies, executing computational experiments, performing literature searches, or generating publication-ready papers in LaTeX format. Supports end-to-end research pipelines with customizable agent orchestration.","bodyPreview":"# Denario\n\n## Overview\n\nDenario is a multiagent AI system designed to automate scientific research workflows from initial data analysis through publication-ready manuscripts. Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, it orchestrates multiple specialized agents to handle hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses\n- Developing structured research","body":"# Denario\n\n## Overview\n\nDenario is a multiagent AI system designed to automate scientific research workflows from initial data analysis through publication-ready manuscripts. Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, it orchestrates multiple specialized agents to handle hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses\n- Developing structured research methodologies\n- Executing computational experiments and generating visualizations\n- Conducting literature searches for research context\n- Writing journal-formatted LaTeX papers from research results\n- Automating the complete research pipeline from data to publication\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall denario using uv (recommended):\n\n```bash\nuv init\nuv add \"denario[app]\"\n```\n\nOr using pip:\n\n```bash\nuv pip install \"denario[app]\"\n```\n\nFor Docker deployment or building from source, see `references/installation.md`.\n\n## LLM API Configuration\n\nDenario requires API keys from supported LLM providers. Supported providers include:\n- Google Vertex AI\n- OpenAI\n- Other LLM services compatible with AG2/LangGraph\n\nStore API keys securely using environment variables or `.env` files. For detailed configuration instructions including Vertex AI setup, see `references/llm_configuration.md`.\n\n## Core Research Workflow\n\nDenario follows a structured four-stage research pipeline:\n\n### 1. Data Description\n\nDefine the research context by specifying available data and tools:\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Denario\n\nden = Denario(project_dir=\"./my_research\")\nden.set_data_description(\"\"\"\nAvailable datasets: time-series data on X and Y\nTools: pandas, sklearn, matplotlib\nResearch domain: [specify domain]\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n### 2. Idea Generation\n\nGenerate research hypotheses from the data description:\n\n```python\nden.get_idea()\n```\n\nThis produces a research question or hypothesis based on the described data. Alternatively, provide a custom idea:\n\n```python\nden.set_idea(\"Custom research hypothesis\")\n```\n\n### 3. Methodology Development\n\nDevelop the research methodology:\n\n```python\nden.get_method()\n```\n\nThis creates a structured approach for investigating the hypothesis. Can also accept markdown files with custom methodologies:\n\n```python\nden.set_method(\"path/to/methodology.md\")\n```\n\n### 4. Results Generation\n\nExecute computational experiments and generate analysis:\n\n```python\nden.get_results()\n```\n\nThis runs the methodology, performs computations, creates visualizations, and produces findings. Can also provide pre-computed results:\n\n```python\nden.set_results(\"path/to/results.md\")\n```\n\n### 5. Paper Generation\n\nCreate a publication-ready LaTeX paper:\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Journal\n\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\nThe generated paper includes proper formatting for the specified journal, integrated figures, and complete LaTeX source.\n\n## Available Journals\n\nDenario supports multiple journal formatting styles:\n- `Journal.APS` - American Physical Society format\n- Additional journals may be available; check `references/research_pipeline.md` for the complete list\n\n## Launching the GUI\n\nRun the graphical user interface:\n\n```bash\ndenario run\n```\n\nThis launches a web-based interface for interactive research workflow management.\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### End-to-End Research Pipeline\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Denario, Journal\n\n# Initialize project\nden = Denario(project_dir=\"./research_project\")\n\n# Define research context\nden.set_data_description(\"\"\"\nDataset: Time-series measurements of [phenomenon]\nAvailable tools: pandas, sklearn, scipy\nResearch goal: Investigate [research question]\n\"\"\")\n\n# Generate research idea\nden.get_idea()\n\n# Develop methodology\nden.get_method()\n\n# Execute analysis\nden.get_results()\n\n# Create publication\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\n### Hybrid Workflow (Custom + Automated)\n\n```python\n# Provide custom research idea\nden.set_idea(\"Investigate the correlation between X and Y using time-series analysis\")\n\n# Auto-generate methodology\nden.get_method()\n\n# Auto-generate results\nden.get_results()\n\n# Generate paper\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\n### Literature Search Integration\n\nFor literature search functionality and additional workflow examples, see `references/examples.md`.\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n- **Multiagent orchestration**: AG2 and LangGraph coordinate specialized agents for different research tasks\n- **Reproducible research**: All stages produce structured outputs that can be version-controlled\n- **Journal integration**: Automatic formatting for target publication venues\n- **Flexible input**: Manual or automated at each pipeline stage\n- **Docker deployment**: Containerized environment with LaTeX and all dependencies\n\n## Detailed References\n\nFor comprehensive documentation:\n- **Installation options**: `references/installation.md`\n- **LLM configuration**: `references/llm_configuration.md`\n- **Complete API reference**: `references/research_pipeline.md`\n- **Example workflows**: `references/examples.md`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nCommon issues and solutions:\n- **API key errors**: Ensure environment variables are set correctly (see `references/llm_configuration.md`)\n- **LaTeX compilation**: Install TeX distribution or use Docker image with pre-installed LaTeX\n- **Package conflicts**: Use virtual environments or Docker for isolation\n- **Python version**: Requires Python 3.12 or higher\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:13:58.186Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing automated scientific research workflow capabilities from data analysis to publication-ready manuscripts.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化科学研究工作流的研究代理，从数据分析到出版准备稿的能力。","ja":"研究エージェントが自動化された科学研究ワークフロー機能を必要とする場合に最適です。データ分析から出版可能な原稿まで。","ko":"자동화된 과학 연구 워크플로 기능이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 데이터 분석부터 출판 가능한 원고까지입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan capacidades de flujo de trabajo de investigación científica automatizado desde el análisis de datos hasta manuscritos listos para publicación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de capacités de workflow de recherche scientifique automatisé, de l''analyse des données à des manuscrits prêts pour publication.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die ein automatisiertes wissenschaftliches Forschungsarbeit-Workflow benötigen, von Datenanalyse bis hin zu publikationsreifen Manuskripten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que necessitam de capacidades de fluxo de trabalho de pesquisa científica automatizado, desde a análise de dados até manuscritos prontos para publicação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для исследовательских агентов, которым необходимы автоматизированные возможности научных исследований, от анализа данных до готовых к публикации рукописей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات سير عمل البحث العلمي الآلي، من تحليل البيانات إلى المخطوطات الجاهزة للنشر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate multiple specialized agents for hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing, leveraging AG2 and LangGraph frameworks for comprehensive research workflow automation.","zh":"赋予代理人编排多个专用代理人的能力，用于假设生成、方法开发、计算分析和论文写作，利用AG2和LangGraph框架实现全面研究工作流自动化。","ja":"エージェントが仮説生成、方法開発、計算分析、および論文執筆のための複数の専門エージェントをオーケストレーションできるようにし、AG2とLangGraphフレームワークを使用して包括的な研究ワークフローの自動化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 가설 생성, 방법 개발, 계산 분석 및 논문 작성을 위한 여러 전문 에이전트를 오케스트레이션할 수 있도록 하며, AG2 및 LangGraph 프레임워크를 사용하여 종합적인 연구 워크플로 자동화를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes orquestar múltiples agentes especializados para la generación de hipótesis, el desarrollo de metodologías, el análisis computacional y la escritura de artículos, aprovechando los marcos AG2 y LangGraph para una automatización integral del flujo de trabajo de investigación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer plusieurs agents spécialisés pour la génération d''hypothèses, le développement de méthodologies, l''analyse computationnelle et la rédaction d''articles, en exploitant les cadres AG2 et LangGraph pour une automatisation complète du flux de travail de recherche.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere spezialisierte Agenten für die Hypothesengenerierung, Methodenentwicklung, computergestützte Analyse und Papiererstellung zu orchestrieren, indem es die Rahmenwerke AG2 und LangGraph für eine umfassende Automatisierung des Forschungsarbeit-Workflows nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar vários agentes especializados para geração de hipóteses, desenvolvimento de metodologias, análise computacional e redação de artigos, aproveitando os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph para automação abrangente do fluxo de trabalho de pesquisa.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать несколько специализированных агентов для генерации гипотез, разработки методологий, вычислительного анализа и написания статей, используя фреймворки AG2 и LangGraph для всесторонней автоматизации исследовательского рабочего процесса.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق وكلاء متخصصين متعددين لإنشاء فرضيات وتنمية منهجيات و تحليل حسابي وكتابة أوراق، مستفيدا من الإطارات AG2 و LangGraph لتحقيق تام لآليّة سير عمل البحث."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses","Developing structured research methodologies","Automating computational analysis for research papers"],"zh":["分析数据集以生成新颖的研究假设","开发结构化的研究方法","自动化计算分析以撰写研究论文"],"ja":["新しい研究仮説を生成するためのデータセットの分析","構造化された研究方法の開発","研究論文の作成のための計算分析の自動化"],"ko":["새로운 연구 가설을 생성하기 위한 데이터셋 분석","구조화된 연구 방법론 개발","연구 논문의 작성을 위한 계산 분석 자동화"],"es":["Analizar conjuntos de datos para generar nuevas hipótesis de investigación","Desarrollar metodologías de investigación estructuradas","Automatizar el análisis computacional para artículos de investigación"],"fr":["Analyser des jeux de données pour générer de nouvelles hypothèses de recherche","Développer des méthodologies de recherche structurées","Automatiser l''analyse computationnelle pour les articles de recherche"],"de":["Datenmengen analysieren, um neue Forschungshypothesen zu generieren","Strukturierte Forschungsmethoden entwickeln","Computergestützte Analyse für Forschungsarbeiten automatisieren"],"pt":["Analisar conjuntos de dados para gerar novas hipóteses de pesquisa","Desenvolver metodologias de pesquisa estruturadas","Automatizar a análise computacional para artigos de pesquisa"],"ru":["Анализ наборов данных для генерации новых исследовательских гипотез","Разработка структурированных исследовательских методологий","Автоматизация вычислительного анализа для исследовательских статей"],"ar":["تحليل مجموعات البيانات لتوليد فرضيات بحثية جديدة","تنمية منهجيات بحثية منظمّة","آليّة التحليل الحسابي لأوراق البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks","Requires integration with FactoryAI Droid system"],"zh":["建立在AG2和LangGraph框架之上","需要与FactoryAI Droid系统集成"],"ja":["AG2とLangGraphフレームワークに基づいて構築","FactoryAI Droidシステムとの統合が必要"],"ko":["AG2 및 LangGraph 프레임워크에 기반하여 구축","FactoryAI Droid 시스템과 통합이 필요"],"es":["Construido sobre los marcos AG2 y LangGraph","Requiere integración con el sistema FactoryAI Droid"],"fr":["Construit sur les cadres AG2 et LangGraph","Nécessite une intégration avec le système FactoryAI Droid"],"de":["Basierend auf den Rahmenwerken AG2 und LangGraph","Benötigt Integration mit dem FactoryAI-Droid-System"],"pt":["Construído sobre os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph","Requer integração com o sistema FactoryAI Droid"],"ru":["Построен на фреймворках AG2 и LangGraph","Требует интеграции с системой FactoryAI Droid"],"ar":["مبني على الإطارات AG2 و LangGraph","يتطلب التكامل مع نظام FactoryAI Droid"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('varadhjain/granola-claude-plugin/granola', 'community', 'varadhjain', 'granola-claude-plugin', 'varadhjain/granola-claude-plugin', 'granola', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z', '2026-02-18T13:13:57.340Z', NULL, '{"id":"varadhjain/granola-claude-plugin/granola","name":"granola","description":{"zh":"Granola会议笔记智能提取工具，帮助开发者快速提取和归档会议信息","ja":"GranolaミーティングノートのAI抽出ツールは、開発者がミーティング情報を迅速に抽出してアーカイブするのに役立ちます","ko":"그라노라 미팅 노트 인텔리전스 추출 도구는 개발자가 미팅 정보를 신속하게 추출하고 아카이브하는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"Extrae y archiva notas de reuniones de Granola con inteligencia artificial opcional. Analiza tus reuniones y extrae información valiosa.","fr":"Extrait et archivez des notes de réunion Granola avec une intelligence artificielle facultative. Analysez vos réunions et extrayez des informations précieuses.","de":"Extrahieren und archivieren Sie Granola-Meetings-Notizen mit optionaler KI. Analysieren Sie Ihre Meetings und extrahieren Sie wertvolle Informationen.","pt":"Extraia e arquive notas de reunião Granola com inteligência opcional de IA. Melhore a produtividade com nossa ferramenta.","ru":"Извлекайте и архивируйте заметки встреч Granola с опциональным ИИ. Повышайте производительность с нашей утилитой.","ar":"استخرج وأرشف ملاحظات اجتماعات Granola مع ذكاء إيه آي اختياري. تحسين الإنتاجية مع أداتنا.","en":"Extract intelligence from Granola meeting notes with AI"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Granola 会议笔记智能提取","ja":"Granola ミーティングノートのAI抽出","ko":"그라노라 미팅 노트 인텔리전스 추출","es":"Extrae inteligencia de notas de reuniones de Granola con IA","fr":"Extraitre l''intelligence des notes de réunion Granola ave...","de":"Intelligenz aus Granola-Meetings-Notizen mit KI extrahieren","pt":"Extraia Inteligência de Notas de Reunião Granola com IA","ru":"Извлечение интеллекта из заметок встреч Granola с помощью ИИ","ar":"استخراج الذكاء من ملاحظات اجتماعات Granola مع