mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Archivierung von Meetings-Notizen","Extraktion von wertvollen Informationen aus Meetings","Kompatibilität mit macOS","Integration mit OpenAI-API"],"pt":["Extração de notas de reunião Granola","Arquivamento de notas com inteligência de IA","Análise de reuniões com pessoas específicas","Identificação de empresas discutidas","Extração de tarefas pendentes"],"ru":["Извлечение заметок встреч Granola","Архивирование заметок с опциональным ИИ","Анализ встреч с конкретными людьми","Определение обсуждаемых компаний","Извлечение задач"],"ar":["استخراج ملاحظات اجتماعات Granola","أرشفة الملاحظات مع ذكاء إيه آي اختياري","تحليل الاجتماعات مع أشخاص محددين","تحديد الشركات المناقشة","استخراج المهام المعلقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Granola会议笔记","AI智能提取","会议信息管理","开发者工具","macOS平台","智能分析"],"ja":["Granolaミーティングノート","AI抽出","ミーティング情報管理","開発者ツール","macOSプラットフォーム","インテリジェンス分析"],"ko":["그라노라 미팅 노트","인텔리전스 추출","미팅 정보 관리","개발자 도구","macOS 플랫폼","인텔리전스 분석"],"es":["inteligencia artificial","notas de reuniones","Granola","análisis de reuniones","extracción de información","macOS","OpenAI API","desarrollo de software","herramientas de productividad"],"fr":["intelligence artificielle","notes de réunion","Granola","analyse de réunions","extraction d''informations","macOS","API OpenAI","développement de logiciels","outils de productivité"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz","Meetings-Notizen","Granola","Meetings-Analyse","Informationsextraktion","macOS","OpenAI-API","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivitätstools"],"pt":["Granola Meeting Extraction","Extração de notas de reunião","Inteligência de IA","Produtividade","Automatização","Reuniões","Notas de reunião","Análise de reuniões"],"ru":["Granola Meeting Extraction","Извлечение заметок встреч","Интеллект ИИ","Производительность","Автоматизация","Встречи","Заметки встреч","Анализ встреч"],"ar":["استخراج اجتماعات Granola","استخراج ملاحظات اجتماعات","ذكاء إيه آي","الإنتاجية","أتمتة","الاجتماعات","ملاحظات الاجتماعات","تحليل الاجتماعات"]}},"owner":"varadhjain","repo":"granola-claude-plugin","repoPath":"varadhjain/granola-claude-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"granola","description":"Extract and analyze Granola meeting notes. USE WHEN user asks to extract granola meetings, analyze my meetings, or what meetings did I have. OUTPUT structured markdown with people, companies, TODOs, and insights to ~/.granola-archivist/output/","bodyPreview":"# Granola Meeting Extraction\n\nExtract and archive Granola meeting notes with optional AI intelligence.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks: \"Extract my last 7 days of Granola meetings\"\n- User asks: \"Analyze my meeting with [Person]\"\n- User asks: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n- User asks: \"What TODOs came from my meetings?\"\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Granola installed** on macOS with at least one recorded meeting\n2. **OpenAI API key** stored in `~/.granola-archivist/.env` (optional, only for AI","body":"# Granola Meeting Extraction\n\nExtract and archive Granola meeting notes with optional AI intelligence.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks: \"Extract my last 7 days of Granola meetings\"\n- User asks: \"Analyze my meeting with [Person]\"\n- User asks: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n- User asks: \"What TODOs came from my meetings?\"\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. **Granola installed** on macOS with at least one recorded meeting\n2. **OpenAI API key** stored in `~/.granola-archivist/.env` (optional, only for AI extraction)\n\n## Setup Instructions\n\n### First-Time Setup\n\nTell the user:\n```\nTo enable AI extraction, you need to set up your OpenAI API key.\n\nRun these commands:\nmkdir -p ~/.granola-archivist\necho \"OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_key_here\" > ~/.granola-archivist/.env\n\nThen try: \"Extract my last 7 days of Granola meetings\"\n```\n\n### Checking Setup\n\nBefore running AI extraction, check if `.env` exists:\n- File exists at `~/.granola-archivist/.env` → proceed\n- File missing → show setup instructions above\n\n## Usage\n\n### Extract Recent Meetings\n\n**User**: \"Extract my last 5 Granola meetings\"\n\n**You should**:\n1. If AI is requested, check setup (`~/.granola-archivist/.env` exists)\n2. Run: `python skills/granola/extract.py --days 7` (add `--no-intelligence` if no AI)\n3. Show results: Meeting titles, attendees, where files were saved\n\n### Get Intelligence from Meetings\n\n**User**: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n\n**You should**:\n1. Extract last 7 days of meetings\n2. Parse output files from `~/.granola-archivist/output/`\n3. Summarize companies mentioned across all meetings\n\n### Extract TODOs\n\n**User**: \"What action items came from my meetings?\"\n\n**You should**:\n1. Extract recent meetings with intelligence (requires API key)\n2. Parse TODO sections from output files\n3. Present consolidated TODO list with owners and deadlines\n\n## Output Format\n\nFiles are saved to: `~/.granola-archivist/output/`\n\nFilename format: `YYYY-MM-DD-meeting-title-attendee-name.md`\n\nEach file contains:\n- Meeting metadata (title, date, attendees, location)\n- Your manual notes from Granola\n- AI-generated summary from Granola\n- Extracted intelligence:\n  - People (with roles, insights, network connections)\n  - Companies discussed (with stage, funding, context)\n  - Network connections (who knows who)\n  - TODOs (with owners, deadlines, context)\n  - Key insights (investment opportunities, market insights)\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Extract Recent Meetings\n\n```\nUser: \"Extract my last 3 Granola meetings\"\n\nYou: \"I''ll extract your last 3 Granola meetings. Let me check your setup first...\"\n\n[Checks ~/.granola-archivist/.env exists]\n\nYou: \"Setup looks good. Extracting meetings...\"\n\n[Runs: python skills/granola/extract.py --days 7 --limit 3]\n\nYou: \"✓ Extracted 3 meetings:\n- 2026-01-14: Fund Discussion with Srihita Vatsavaya\n- 2026-01-13: Rollout AI Sync with Camden Ko\n- 2026-01-12: Notion Strategy with Jade Doan\n\nFiles saved to: ~/.granola-archivist/output/\n\nWould you like me to:\n1. Show summaries of all 3 meetings\n2. Extract companies discussed\n3. Pull out action items\"\n```\n\n### Example 2: Missing Setup\n\n```\nUser: \"Extract my Granola meetings\"\n\nYou: \"If you''d like AI extraction, set up your OpenAI API key first. Please run:\n\nmkdir -p ~/.granola-archivist\necho ''OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_key_here'' > ~/.granola-archivist/.env\n\nReplace ''sk-your_key_here'' with your actual OpenAI API key.\n\nIf you prefer no AI, I can still export your meetings without a key.\"\n```\n\n### Example 3: Extract Companies\n\n```\nUser: \"What companies did I discuss this week?\"\n\nYou: \"Let me extract your meetings from the last 7 days and analyze them...\"\n\n[Extracts meetings, parses output files]\n\nYou: \"Here are the companies discussed across 5 meetings this week:\n\n**Rollout AI** (mentioned 8 times)\n- Stage: Series A\n- Discussed in: Camden meeting, Investor call\n- Context: Potential investment target, strong growth\n\n**Notion** (mentioned 5 times)\n- Stage: Late-stage\n- Discussed in: Jade meeting\n- Context: Partnership opportunity\n\n**OpenAI** (mentioned 3 times)\n- Discussed in: Multiple meetings\n- Context: API integration plans\n\nWould you like more details on any of these?\"\n```\n\n## Cost Information\n\nUsing GPT-5-nano (cheapest model):\n- Cost per meeting: ~$0.0009\n- 30 meetings/month: ~$0.03\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Granola cache not found\"\n- Ensure Granola is installed\n- Record at least one meeting\n- Check: `~/Library/Application Support/Granola/cache-v3.json` exists\n\n### \"OpenAI API key not found\"\n- Setup .env file: `~/.granola-archivist/.env`\n- Format: `OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...`\n\n### Legacy config\n- If `~/.granola-claude/` exists, it will still be detected\n\n### \"No meetings found\"\n- Check date range (default: last 7 days)\n- Ensure Granola has meetings in that period\n\n## Privacy\n\n- No data collection or tracking\n- Transcripts stay on your machine\n- Only sent to your OpenAI account (you control your data)\n- Your API key = you control your data\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:13:57.340Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Natural Language Processing Agents needing advanced meeting note analysis capabilities with Granola","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Granola 进行高级会议记录分析的自然语言处理代理","ja":"Granola を使用した高度なミーティングノート分析機能を必要とする自然言語処理エージェントに最適","ko":"Granola를 사용하여 고급 미팅 노트 분석 기능이 필요한 자연어 처리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Procesamiento de Lenguaje Natural que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de notas de reuniones con Granola","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de Traitement du Langage Naturel ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''analyse de notes de réunion avec Granola","de":"Perfekt für natürliche Sprachverarbeitungsagenten, die erweiterte Besprechungsnotizanalysefunktionen mit Granola benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de Processamento de Linguagem Natural que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise de notas de reunião com Granola","ru":"Идеально для агентов обработки естественного языка, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа заметок о встречах с Granola","ar":"مثالي لعمليات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل ملاحظات الاجتماع مع Granola"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract actionable intelligence from Granola meeting notes using OpenAI API for optional AI-driven insights, enabling efficient TODO tracking and company discussion analysis via archived meeting notes","zh":"赋予代理从 Granola 会议记录中提取可执行的智能，并使用 OpenAI API 获取可选的 AI 驱动的洞察，从而实现高效的待办事项跟踪和公司讨论分析","ja":"OpenAI API を使用してエージェントが Granola ミーティングノートから実行可能なインテリジェンスを抽出し、効率的な TODO の追跡と会社のディスカッション分析を可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 Granola 미팅 노트에서 실행 가능한 인텔리เจンス를 추출하고, 옵션으로 OpenAI API를 사용하여 AI驱动형 인사이트를 제공하여, 효율적인 TODO 추적과 회사 논의 분석을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer inteligencia accionable de las notas de las reuniones de Granola utilizando la API de OpenAI para obtener informaciónoptional impulsada por IA, lo que permite un seguimiento eficiente de TODO y análisis de discusiones de la empresa a través de notas de reuniones archivadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des informations intelligentes à partir des notes de réunion Granola en utilisant l''API OpenAI pour des insights optionnels basés sur l''IA, permettant ainsi un suivi efficace de TODO et une analyse des discussions d''entreprise via des notes de réunion archivées","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, handlungsfähige Erkenntnisse aus Granola-Besprechungsnotizen mithilfe der OpenAI-API für optional künstlich intelligente Erkenntnisse zu gewinnen, wodurch effizientes TODO-Tracking und Unternehmensdiskussionsanalyse über archivierte Besprechungsnotizen ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair inteligência ação de notas de reunião Granola usando a API OpenAI para insights impulsionados por IA opcionais, permitindo o acompanhamento eficiente de TODO e análise de discussões da empresa por meio de notas de reunião arquivadas","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать действенные интеллектуальные данные из заметок о встречах Granola, используя API OpenAI для необязательных интеллектуальных данных, управляемых ИИ, что позволяет эффективно отслеживать списки дел и анализировать обсуждения компании через архивированные заметки о встречах","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخراج استخبارات قابلة للتنفيذ من ملاحظات اجتماعات Granola باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI للرؤى القائمة على الذكاء الاصطناعي الاختيارية، مما يتيح تتبع كفء لقائمة المهام وتحليل مناقشات الشركة عبر ملاحظات الاجتماعات المأرشفة"},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting key takeaways from recent Granola meetings","Analyzing discussions with specific individuals","Identifying companies mentioned during meetings","Automating TODO list generation from meeting notes"],"zh":["从最近的 Granola 会议中提取关键要点","分析与特定个人之间的讨论","识别会议中提到的公司","从会议记录中自动生成 TODO 列表"],"ja":["最近の Granola ミーティングから重要なポイントを抽出","特定の個人とのディスカッションを分析","ミーティングで言及された会社を特定","ミーティングノートから TODO リストを自動生成"],"ko":["最近의 Granola 미팅에서 주요 사항 추출","특정 개인과의 논의 분석","미팅에서 언급된 회사 식별","미팅 노트에서 TODO 목록 자동 생성"],"es":["Extraer puntos clave de las reuniones recientes de Granola","Analizar discusiones con individuos específicos","Identificar empresas mencionadas durante las reuniones","Automatizar la generación de listas de tareas pendientes a partir de notas de reuniones"],"fr":["Extraire les points clés des réunions récentes de Granola","Analyser les discussions avec des individus spécifiques","Identifier les entreprises mentionnées lors des réunions","Automatiser la génération de listes de tâches à partir de notes de réunion"],"de":["Wichtigste Punkte aus aktuellen Granola-Besprechungen extrahieren","Diskussionen mit bestimmten Personen analysieren","Unternehmen identifizieren, die während der Besprechungen erwähnt werden","Automatisierte Erstellung von TODO-Listen aus Besprechungsnotizen"],"pt":["Extração de principais pontos de reuniões recentes do Granola","Análise de discussões com indivíduos específicos","Identificação de empresas mencionadas durante as reuniões","Geração automática de listas de tarefas a partir de notas de reunião"],"ru":["Извлечение основных моментов из недавних встреч Granola","Анализ обсуждений с конкретными людьми","Определение компаний, упомянутых во время встреч","Автоматическая генерация списка задач из заметок о встречах"],"ar":["استخراج النقاط الرئيسية من اجتماعات Granola الأخيرة","تحليل المناقشات مع أفراد محددين","تحديد الشركات المذكورة أثناء الاجتماعات","توليد قائمة المهام تلقائيًا من ملاحظات الاجتماع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Granola installation on macOS","Needs at least one recorded meeting","Optional OpenAI API key required for AI intelligence"],"zh":["需要在 macOS 上安装 Granola","需要至少一条记录的会议","可选的 OpenAI API 密钥用于 AI 智能"],"ja":["macOS に Granola をインストールする必要","少なくとも 1 つのレコーディングされたミーティングが必要","AI インテリジェンスに使用するためのオプションの OpenAI API キー"],"ko":["macOS에서 Granola 설치 필요","최소 한 개의 녹음된 미팅 필요","AI 인텔리전스에 사용할 수 있는 옵션 OpenAI API 키"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Granola en macOS","Necesita al menos una reunión grabada","Se requiere una clave API de OpenAI opcional para la inteligencia de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Granola sur macOS","Nécessite au moins une réunion enregistrée","Clé API OpenAI facultative requise pour l''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Benötigt Granola-Installation auf macOS","Benötigt mindestens eine aufgezeichnete Besprechung","Optional erforderlicher OpenAI-API-Schlüssel für künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Granola no macOS","Necessita de pelo menos uma reunião registrada","Chave API OpenAI opcional necessária para inteligência de IA"],"ru":["Требуется установка Granola на macOS","Требуется как минимум одна записанная встреча","Необязательный ключ API OpenAI требуется для интеллекта ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Granola على macOS","يحتاج إلى مقابلة مسجلة واحدة على الأقل","مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI اختياري مطلوب للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
