ntegração com Git"],"ru":["Установка CLI","Вход и аутентификация","Развертывание проектов","Настройка сборки","Интеграция с Git"],"ar":["تثبيت CLI","الدخول والتحقق","نشر المشاريع","تكوين البناء","التكامل مع Git"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Netlify","Web","CLI","Git","API","","DevOps"],"ja":["Netlify","Web","CLI","Git","API","","DevOps"],"ko":["Netlify","Web","CLI","Git","API","","DevOps"],"es":["despliegue web","netlify","desarrollo web","alojamiento web","git","build","deploy","proyectos web","seguridad web"],"fr":["déploiement web","netlify","développement web","hébergement web","git","build","déploiement","projets web","sécurité web"],"de":["web-entwicklung","netlify","web-bereitstellung","web-hosting","git","build","deploy","web-projekte","web-sicherheit"],"pt":["Netlify","desenvolvimento web","implantação de sites","hospedagem de sites","CLI","Git","deploy"],"ru":["Netlify","веб-разработка","развертывание сайтов","хостинг сайтов","CLI","Git","deploy"],"ar":["Netlify","تطوير الويب","نشر المواقع","تشغيل المواقع","CLI","Git","نشر"]}},"owner":"mgd34msu","repo":"goodvibes-gemini","repoPath":"mgd34msu/goodvibes-gemini","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"netlify","description":"Deploys applications to Netlify including functions, forms, redirects, and edge functions. Use when deploying static sites, JAMstack applications, or serverless functions.","bodyPreview":"# Netlify\n\nThe modern web development platform for deploying and hosting websites.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Install CLI:**\n```bash\nnpm install -g netlify-cli\n```\n\n**Login:**\n```bash\nnetlify login\n```\n\n**Deploy:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy\n```\n\n**Deploy to production:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Connect Git Repository\n\n1. Go to app.netlify.com\n2. Add new site > Import from Git\n3. Select repository\n4. Configure build settings\n5. Deploy\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nVisit `https://app.n","body":"# Netlify\n\nThe modern web development platform for deploying and hosting websites.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Install CLI:**\n```bash\nnpm install -g netlify-cli\n```\n\n**Login:**\n```bash\nnetlify login\n```\n\n**Deploy:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy\n```\n\n**Deploy to production:**\n```bash\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Connect Git Repository\n\n1. Go to app.netlify.com\n2. Add new site > Import from Git\n3. Select repository\n4. Configure build settings\n5. Deploy\n\n### Drag and Drop\n\nVisit `https://app.netlify.com/drop` and drag your build folder.\n\n### netlify.toml Configuration\n\n```toml\n[build]\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  functions = \"netlify/functions\"\n\n[build.environment]\n  NODE_VERSION = \"18\"\n\n# Production context\n[context.production]\n  command = \"npm run build:prod\"\n\n# Preview context (branch deploys)\n[context.deploy-preview]\n  command = \"npm run build:preview\"\n\n# Branch-specific\n[context.staging]\n  command = \"npm run build:staging\"\n\n# Dev settings\n[dev]\n  command = \"npm run dev\"\n  port = 3000\n  targetPort = 5173\n\n# Headers\n[[headers]]\n  for = \"/*\"\n  [headers.values]\n    X-Frame-Options = \"DENY\"\n    X-XSS-Protection = \"1; mode=block\"\n\n# Redirects\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"/.netlify/functions/:splat\"\n  status = 200\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Setting Variables\n\n**Via Dashboard:**\nSite settings > Environment variables > Add variable\n\n**Via CLI:**\n```bash\nnetlify env:set MY_VAR \"value\"\nnetlify env:list\nnetlify env:get MY_VAR\nnetlify env:unset MY_VAR\n```\n\n### Context-Specific Variables\n\n```toml\n# netlify.toml\n[context.production.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://api.example.com\"\n\n[context.deploy-preview.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://staging-api.example.com\"\n\n[context.branch-deploy.environment]\n  API_URL = \"https://dev-api.example.com\"\n```\n\n### Using Variables\n\n```javascript\n// In build process\nconst apiUrl = process.env.API_URL;\n\n// In functions\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  const secret = process.env.API_SECRET;\n}\n```\n\n## Serverless Functions\n\n### Basic Function\n\n```javascript\n// netlify/functions/hello.js\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  return {\n    statusCode: 200,\n    body: JSON.stringify({ message: ''Hello, World!'' }),\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### TypeScript Function\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/users.ts\nimport type { Handler, HandlerEvent, HandlerContext } from ''@netlify/functions'';\n\ninterface User {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n\nconst handler: Handler = async (event: HandlerEvent, context: HandlerContext) => {\n  const { httpMethod, body, queryStringParameters } = event;\n\n  if (httpMethod === ''GET'') {\n    const users: User[] = await getUsers();\n    return {\n      statusCode: 200,\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(users),\n    };\n  }\n\n  if (httpMethod === ''POST'') {\n    const data = JSON.parse(body || ''{}'');\n    const user = await createUser(data);\n    return {\n      statusCode: 201,\n      body: JSON.stringify(user),\n    };\n  }\n\n  return {\n    statusCode: 405,\n    body: ''Method Not Allowed'',\n  };\n};\n\nexport { handler };\n```\n\n### Scheduled Functions\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/scheduled.ts\nimport { schedule } from ''@netlify/functions'';\n\nconst handler = async () => {\n  console.log(''Running scheduled task'');\n  await runTask();\n  return { statusCode: 200 };\n};\n\n// Run every day at midnight\nexport const handler = schedule(''0 0 * * *'', handler);\n```\n\n### Background Functions\n\n```javascript\n// netlify/functions/background-task-background.js\n// Suffix with -background for async processing\nexport async function handler(event, context) {\n  // Long-running task (up to 15 minutes)\n  await processLargeDataset();\n\n  return {\n    statusCode: 200,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Edge Functions\n\n### Basic Edge Function\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/edge-functions/geo.ts\nimport type { Context } from ''@netlify/edge-functions'';\n\nexport default async (request: Request, context: Context) => {\n  const country = context.geo.country?.code ?? ''Unknown'';\n  const city = context.geo.city ?? ''Unknown'';\n\n  return new Response(\n    JSON.stringify({\n      message: `Hello from ${city}, ${country}!`,\n    }),\n    {\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n    }\n  );\n};\n\nexport const config = { path: ''/api/geo'' };\n```\n\n### Edge Function with Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/edge-functions/auth.ts\nimport type { Context } from ''@netlify/edge-functions'';\n\nexport default async (request: Request, context: Context) => {\n  const token = request.headers.get(''Authorization'');\n\n  if (!token) {\n    return new Response(''Unauthorized'', { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  // Validate token\n  const user = await validateToken(token);\n\n  if (!user) {\n    return new Response(''Invalid token'', { status: 403 });\n  }\n\n  // Continue to origin\n  return context.next();\n};\n\nexport const config = { path: ''/api/*'' };\n```\n\n### Edge Function Declaration\n\n```toml\n# netlify.toml\n[[edge_functions]]\n  path = \"/api/geo\"\n  function = \"geo\"\n\n[[edge_functions]]\n  path = \"/api/*\"\n  function = \"auth\"\n```\n\n## Redirects & Rewrites\n\n### _redirects File\n\n```\n# Simple redirect\n/old-page /new-page 301\n\n# Wildcard redirect\n/blog/* /posts/:splat 301\n\n# Rewrite (proxy)\n/api/* /.netlify/functions/:splat 200\n\n# SPA fallback\n/* /index.html 200\n\n# Conditional redirect\n/country/* /us/:splat 200 Country=us\n/country/* /uk/:splat 200 Country=gb\n```\n\n### netlify.toml Redirects\n\n```toml\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/old\"\n  to = \"/new\"\n  status = 301\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\"\n  to = \"https://api.example.com/:splat\"\n  status = 200\n  force = true\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/*\"\n  to = \"/index.html\"\n  status = 200\n  conditions = { Role = [\"admin\"] }\n```\n\n## Forms\n\n### HTML Form\n\n```html\n<form name=\"contact\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\">\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact\" />\n  <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required />\n  <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required />\n  <textarea name=\"message\" required></textarea>\n  <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n</form>\n```\n\n### React Form\n\n```tsx\nfunction ContactForm() {\n  const [status, setStatus] = useState('''');\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const form = e.currentTarget;\n    const formData = new FormData(form);\n\n    try {\n      await fetch(''/'', {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'' },\n        body: new URLSearchParams(formData as any).toString(),\n      });\n      setStatus(''success'');\n    } catch (error) {\n      setStatus(''error'');\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <form\n      name=\"contact\"\n      method=\"POST\"\n      data-netlify=\"true\"\n      onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n    >\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required />\n      <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required />\n      <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Form Notifications\n\nConfigure in Dashboard: Forms > [Form Name] > Settings > Notifications\n\n## Identity (Auth)\n\n### Setup\n\n```html\n<!-- Add to HTML -->\n<script src=\"https://identity.netlify.com/v1/netlify-identity-widget.js\"></script>\n```\n\n### JavaScript API\n\n```javascript\nimport netlifyIdentity from ''netlify-identity-widget'';\n\nnetlifyIdentity.init();\n\n// Open modal\nnetlifyIdentity.open();\n\n// Login\nnetlifyIdentity.on(''login'', user => {\n  console.log(''Logged in:'', user);\n});\n\n// Logout\nnetlifyIdentity.on(''logout'', () => {\n  console.log(''Logged out'');\n});\n\n// Get current user\nconst user = netlifyIdentity.currentUser();\n```\n\n## Large Media (Git LFS)\n\n```bash\n# Install\nnetlify lm:install\n\n# Setup\nnetlify lm:setup\n\n# Track files\ngit lfs track \"*.jpg\" \"*.png\" \"*.gif\"\n```\n\n## Blobs (Storage)\n\n```typescript\n// netlify/functions/upload.ts\nimport { getStore } from ''@netlify/blobs'';\n\nexport async function handler(event) {\n  const store = getStore(''uploads'');\n\n  // Store blob\n  await store.set(''file-key'', event.body, {\n    metadata: { contentType: ''image/png'' },\n  });\n\n  // Get blob\n  const blob = await store.get(''file-key'');\n\n  // Delete blob\n  await store.delete(''file-key'');\n\n  return { statusCode: 200 };\n}\n```\n\n## Local Development\n\n```bash\n# Start dev server\nnetlify dev\n\n# Start with specific port\nnetlify dev --port 3000\n\n# Link to site\nnetlify link\n\n# Pull environment variables\nnetlify env:pull\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use netlify.toml** - Version control your config\n2. **Set up branch deploys** - Preview before production\n3. **Use context-specific vars** - Different values per environment\n4. **Enable form spam filtering** - Protect forms\n5. **Use edge functions** - For low-latency operations\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Missing form-name input | Add hidden input with form name |\n| Wrong publish directory | Check framework output folder |\n| Functions not found | Use netlify/functions directory |\n| Redirects not working | Check order (first match wins) |\n| Build failures | Check build logs, Node version |\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- [references/functions.md](references/functions.md) - Function patterns\n- [references/forms.md](references/forms.md) - Form handling\n- [references/edge.md](references/edge.md) - Edge functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:14:25.541Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing streamlined website deployment and hosting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化网站部署和托管能力的Web开发代理。","ja":"Web開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたWebサイトの展開とホスティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 웹사이트 배포 및 호스팅 기능을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan una implementación y alojamiento de sitios web optimizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web ayant besoin d''un déploiement et d''un hébergement de sites web rationalisés.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Website-Bereitstellung und -Hosting benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento web que precisam de implantação e capacidades de hospedagem de sites simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности развертывания и размещения веб-сайтов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الويب الذين يحتاجون إلى تثبيت موقع ويب مبسط وقدرات استضافة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy and host websites on Netlify using the Netlify CLI, supporting features like Git repository connection and drag-and-drop deployment, all while leveraging npm and Netlify''s build settings.","zh":"赋予代理在Netlify上使用Netlify CLI部署和托管网站的能力，支持Git仓库连接和拖拽部署等功能，同时利用npm和Netlify的构建设置。","ja":"Netlify CLIを使用してNetlify上でWebサイトを展開およびホストできるようにエージェントに権限を与え、Gitリポジトリの接続やドラッグアンドドロップ展開などの機能をサポートし、同時にnpmおよびNetlifyのビルド設定を活用します。","ko":"Netlify CLI를 사용하여 Netlify에서 웹 사이트를 배포 및 호스팅할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 제공하며, Git 저장소 연결 및 드래그 앤 드롭 배포와 같은 기능을 지원하고,同時に npm 및 Netlify의 빌드 설정을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar y alojar sitios web en Netlify utilizando la CLI de Netlify, que admite características como la conexión de repositorio Git y la implementación de arrastrar y soltar, aprovechando npm y la configuración de compilación de Netlify.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et d''héberger des sites web sur Netlify en utilisant la CLI Netlify, qui prend en charge des fonctionnalités comme la connexion de référentiel Git et le déploiement par glisser-déposer, tout en exploitant npm et les paramètres de build de Netlify.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Websites auf Netlify mithilfe der Netlify-CLI zu bereitstellen und zu hosten, die Funktionen wie Git-Repository-Verbindung und Drag-and-Drop-Bereitstellung unterstützt, während npm und Netlifys Build-Einstellungen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar e hospedar sites no Netlify usando o Netlify CLI, com recursos como conexão de repositório Git e implantação por arrastar e soltar, aproveitando as configurações de compilação do npm e do Netlify.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать и размещать веб-сайты на Netlify с помощью Netlify CLI, поддерживая функции, такие как подключение репозитория Git и развертывание путем перетаскивания, используя настройки сборки npm и Netlify.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على نشر واستضافة المواقع على Netlify باستخدام واجهة命令 Netlify، مع دعم الميزات مثل الاتصال بمستودع Git ونشر السحب والإفلات، مع الاستفادة من إعدادات البناء من npm وإعدادات البناء من Netlify"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating website deployments to production environments","Configuring build settings for Git-connected repositories","Deploying websites using the Netlify CLI with --prod flag"],"zh":["自动将网站部署到生产环境","为Git连接的仓库配置构建设置","使用Netlify CLI和--prod标志部署网站"],"ja":["生産環境へのWebサイトの自動展開","Git接続リポジトリのビルド設定の構成","Netlify CLIおよび--prodフラグを使用したWebサイトの展開"],"ko":["웹사이트를 자동으로 프로덕션 환경에 배포하는こと","Git 연결 저장소에 대한 빌드 설정 구성","Netlify CLI 및 --prod 플래그를 사용한 웹사이트 배포"],"es":["Automatizar las implementaciones de sitios web en entornos de producción","Configurar la configuración de compilación para repositorios conectados a Git","Implementar sitios web mediante la CLI de Netlify con la marca --prod"],"fr":["Automatiser les déploiements de sites web dans des environnements de production","Configurer les paramètres de build pour les référentiels connectés à Git","Déployer des sites web à l''aide de la CLI Netlify avec le drapeau --prod"],"de":["Automatisieren der Website-Bereitstellungen in Produktionsumgebungen","Konfigurieren der Build-Einstellungen für Git-verbundene Repositorys","Bereitstellen von Websites mithilfe der Netlify-CLI mit der --prod-Flagge"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de sites para ambientes de produção","Configurar configurações de compilação para repositórios conectados ao Git","Implantar sites usando o Netlify CLI com a flag --prod"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание веб-сайтов в производственные среды","Настроить параметры сборки для репозиториев, подключенных к Git","Развертывать веб-сайты с помощью Netlify CLI с флагом --prod"],"ar":["التحكم 자동 في نشر المواقع على بيئات الإنتاج","تكوين إعدادات البناء لمستودعات متصلة ب جيت","نشر المواقع باستخدام واجهة命令 Netlify مع علم --prod"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Netlify CLI installation via npm","Not all features available due to differences between Gemini CLI and Claude Code CLI","CURRENTLY NOT WORKING as per the provided description"],"zh":["需要通过npm安装Netlify CLI","由于Gemini CLI和Claude Code CLI之间的差异，不是所有功能都可用","当前不工作，如所提供的描述"],"ja":["Netlify CLIをnpm経由でインストールする必要がある","Gemini CLIとClaude Code CLIの違いにより、すべての機能が利用できない","現在は提供された説明通りに動作していない"],"ko":["Netlify CLI를 npm을 통해 설치해야 함","Gemini CLI와 Claude Code CLI의 차이로 인해 모든 기능이 사용되지 않음","현재 제공된 설명과 같이 작동하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de Netlify a través de npm","No todas las características están disponibles debido a las diferencias entre la CLI de Gemini y la CLI de Claude Code","ACTUALMENTE NO FUNCIONA según la descripción proporcionada"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI Netlify via npm","Toutes les fonctionnalités ne sont pas disponibles en raison des différences entre la CLI Gemini et la CLI Claude Code","ACTUELLEMENT NON FONCTIONNEL selon la description fournie"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der Netlify-CLI über npm","Nicht alle Funktionen sind verfügbar aufgrund der Unterschiede zwischen der Gemini-CLI und der Claude-Code-CLI","DERZEIT NICHT FUNKTIONIEREND gemäß der bereitgestellten Beschreibung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Netlify CLI via npm","Não todos os recursos estão disponíveis devido às diferenças entre o Gemini CLI e o Claude Code CLI","ATUALMENTE NÃO FUNCIONA de acordo com a descrição fornecida"],"ru":["Требует установки Netlify CLI через npm","Не все функции доступны из-за различий между Gemini CLI и Claude Code CLI","СЕЙЧАС НЕ РАБОТАЕТ в соответствии с предоставленным описанием"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Netlify CLI عبر npm","لا جميع الميزات متاحة بسبب الفروق بين Gemini CLI و Claude Code CLI","الحالي لا يعمل حسب الوصف المقدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
