 automatise les flux de travail de recherche scientifique, de l''analyse des données à la génération de manuscrits p...","de":"Denario ist ein Multiagenten-KI-System, das wissenschaftliche Forschungsprozesse automatisiert, von der Datenanalyse bis zur Generierung von veröffentlichbar...","pt":"Denario é um sistema de IA que automatiza fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica, utilizando frameworks AG2 e LangGraph.","ru":"Denario - система ИИ, которая автоматизирует потоки научных исследований, используя фреймворки AG2 и LangGraph.","ar":"ديناريو نظام ذكاء اصطناعي يؤتمّ عمليات البحث العلمي، باستخدام إطارات العمل AG2 و LangGraph.","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de investigación científica","Análisis de datos y generación de hipótesis de investigación","Desarrollo de metodologías de investigación","Análisis computacional y generación de manuscritos publicables","Integración con frameworks AG2 y LangGraph","Instalación de un solo clic y verificación de calidad"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de recherche scientifique","Analyse des données et génération d''hypothèses de recherche","Développement de méthodologies de recherche","Analyse computationnelle et génération de manuscrits publiables","Intégration avec les frameworks AG2 et LangGraph","Installation en un seul clic et vérification de la qualité"],"de":["Automatisierung von wissenschaftlichen Forschungsprozessen","Datenanalyse und Generierung von Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung von Forschungsmethoden","Computergestützte Analyse und Generierung von veröffentlichbaren Manuskripten","Integration mit den Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph","Ein-Klick-Installation und Qualitätsüberprüfung"],"pt":["Automação de fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica","Análise de dados para geração de hipóteses de pesquisa","Desenvolvimento de metodologias de pesquisa","Análise computacional e escrita de artigos","Utilização de frameworks AG2 e LangGraph"],"ru":["Автоматизация потоков научных исследований","Анализ данных для генерации гипотез исследований","Разработка методологий исследований","Компьютерный анализ и написание статей","Использование фреймворков AG2 и LangGraph"],"ar":["آليّة عمليات البحث العلمي","تحليل البيانات لتوليد فرضيات البحث","تطوير منهجيات البحث","التحليل الحاسوبي وكتابة المقالات","استخدام إطارات العمل AG2 و LangGraph"]},"keywords":{"es":["investigación científica","automatización de investigación","IA multiagente","análisis de datos","generación de hipótesis","desarrollo de metodologías","análisis computacional","manuscritos publicables","frameworks AG2 y LangGraph"],"fr":["recherche scientifique","automatisation de la recherche","IA multiagent","analyse des données","génération d''hypothèses","développement de méthodologies","analyse computationnelle","manuscrits publiables","frameworks AG2 et LangGraph"],"de":["wissenschaftliche Forschung","Automatisierung der Forschung","Multiagenten-KI","Datenanalyse","Generierung von Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung von Forschungsmethoden","computergestützte Analyse","veröffentlichbare Manuskripte","Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph"],"pt":["Denario","IA","pesquisa científica","automação","análise de dados","metodologias de pesquisa","artigos científicos","AG2","LangGraph"],"ru":["Denario","ИИ","научные исследования","автоматизация","анализ данных","методологии исследований","научные статьи","AG2","LangGraph"],"ar":["ديناريو","ذكاء اصطناعي","البحث العلمي","آليّة","تحليل البيانات","منهجيات البحث","المقالات العلمية","AG2","LangGraph"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"denario","description":"Multiagent AI system for scientific research assistance that automates research workflows from data analysis to publication. This skill should be used when generating research ideas from datasets, developing research methodologies, executing computational experiments, performing literature searches, or generating publication-ready papers in LaTeX format. Supports end-to-end research pipelines with customizable agent orchestration.","bodyPreview":"# Denario\n\n## Overview\n\nDenario is a multiagent AI system designed to automate scientific research workflows from initial data analysis through publication-ready manuscripts. Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, it orchestrates multiple specialized agents to handle hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses\n- Developing structured research","body":"# Denario\n\n## Overview\n\nDenario is a multiagent AI system designed to automate scientific research workflows from initial data analysis through publication-ready manuscripts. Built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, it orchestrates multiple specialized agents to handle hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Analyzing datasets to generate novel research hypotheses\n- Developing structured research methodologies\n- Executing computational experiments and generating visualizations\n- Conducting literature searches for research context\n- Writing journal-formatted LaTeX papers from research results\n- Automating the complete research pipeline from data to publication\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall denario using uv (recommended):\n\n```bash\nuv init\nuv add \"denario[app]\"\n```\n\nOr using pip:\n\n```bash\nuv pip install \"denario[app]\"\n```\n\nFor Docker deployment or building from source, see `references/installation.md`.\n\n## LLM API Configuration\n\nDenario requires API keys from supported LLM providers. Supported providers include:\n- Google Vertex AI\n- OpenAI\n- Other LLM services compatible with AG2/LangGraph\n\nStore API keys securely using environment variables or `.env` files. For detailed configuration instructions including Vertex AI setup, see `references/llm_configuration.md`.\n\n## Core Research Workflow\n\nDenario follows a structured four-stage research pipeline:\n\n### 1. Data Description\n\nDefine the research context by specifying available data and tools:\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Denario\n\nden = Denario(project_dir=\"./my_research\")\nden.set_data_description(\"\"\"\nAvailable datasets: time-series data on X and Y\nTools: pandas, sklearn, matplotlib\nResearch domain: [specify domain]\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n### 2. Idea Generation\n\nGenerate research hypotheses from the data description:\n\n```python\nden.get_idea()\n```\n\nThis produces a research question or hypothesis based on the described data. Alternatively, provide a custom idea:\n\n```python\nden.set_idea(\"Custom research hypothesis\")\n```\n\n### 3. Methodology Development\n\nDevelop the research methodology:\n\n```python\nden.get_method()\n```\n\nThis creates a structured approach for investigating the hypothesis. Can also accept markdown files with custom methodologies:\n\n```python\nden.set_method(\"path/to/methodology.md\")\n```\n\n### 4. Results Generation\n\nExecute computational experiments and generate analysis:\n\n```python\nden.get_results()\n```\n\nThis runs the methodology, performs computations, creates visualizations, and produces findings. Can also provide pre-computed results:\n\n```python\nden.set_results(\"path/to/results.md\")\n```\n\n### 5. Paper Generation\n\nCreate a publication-ready LaTeX paper:\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Journal\n\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\nThe generated paper includes proper formatting for the specified journal, integrated figures, and complete LaTeX source.\n\n## Available Journals\n\nDenario supports multiple journal formatting styles:\n- `Journal.APS` - American Physical Society format\n- Additional journals may be available; check `references/research_pipeline.md` for the complete list\n\n## Launching the GUI\n\nRun the graphical user interface:\n\n```bash\ndenario run\n```\n\nThis launches a web-based interface for interactive research workflow management.\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### End-to-End Research Pipeline\n\n```python\nfrom denario import Denario, Journal\n\n# Initialize project\nden = Denario(project_dir=\"./research_project\")\n\n# Define research context\nden.set_data_description(\"\"\"\nDataset: Time-series measurements of [phenomenon]\nAvailable tools: pandas, sklearn, scipy\nResearch goal: Investigate [research question]\n\"\"\")\n\n# Generate research idea\nden.get_idea()\n\n# Develop methodology\nden.get_method()\n\n# Execute analysis\nden.get_results()\n\n# Create publication\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\n### Hybrid Workflow (Custom + Automated)\n\n```python\n# Provide custom research idea\nden.set_idea(\"Investigate the correlation between X and Y using time-series analysis\")\n\n# Auto-generate methodology\nden.get_method()\n\n# Auto-generate results\nden.get_results()\n\n# Generate paper\nden.get_paper(journal=Journal.APS)\n```\n\n### Literature Search Integration\n\nFor literature search functionality and additional workflow examples, see `references/examples.md`.\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n- **Multiagent orchestration**: AG2 and LangGraph coordinate specialized agents for different research tasks\n- **Reproducible research**: All stages produce structured outputs that can be version-controlled\n- **Journal integration**: Automatic formatting for target publication venues\n- **Flexible input**: Manual or automated at each pipeline stage\n- **Docker deployment**: Containerized environment with LaTeX and all dependencies\n\n## Detailed References\n\nFor comprehensive documentation:\n- **Installation options**: `references/installation.md`\n- **LLM configuration**: `references/llm_configuration.md`\n- **Complete API reference**: `references/research_pipeline.md`\n- **Example workflows**: `references/examples.md`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nCommon issues and solutions:\n- **API key errors**: Ensure environment variables are set correctly (see `references/llm_configuration.md`)\n- **LaTeX compilation**: Install TeX distribution or use Docker image with pre-installed LaTeX\n- **Package conflicts**: Use virtual environments or Docker for isolation\n- **Python version**: Requires Python 3.12 or higher\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:14:22.626Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Research Agents leveraging AG2 and LangGraph frameworks for automated scientific research workflows.","zh":"适用于利用AG2和LangGraph框架进行自动化科学研究工作流的研究代理","ja":"AG2およびLangGraphフレームワークを使用した自動化科学研究ワークフローに最適な研究エージェント","ko":"AG2와 LangGraph 프레임워크를 사용하여 자동화된 과학 연구 워크플로에 적합한 연구 에이전트","es":"Ideal para agentes de investigación que utilizan los marcos AG2 y LangGraph para flujos de trabajo de investigación científica automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche utilisant les cadres AG2 et LangGraph pour les flux de travail de recherche scientifique automatisés.","de":"Ideal für Forschungsagenten, die die Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph für automatisierte wissenschaftliche Forschungsworkflows nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa que utilizam os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph para fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa científica automatizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-исследователей, использующих фреймворки AG2 и LangGraph для автоматизированных научных исследовательских рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء البحث الذين يستفيدون من الإطارات AG2 و LangGraph لتدفقات العمل البحثية العلمية الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate hypothesis generation, methodology development, computational analysis, and paper writing using multiagent orchestration, built on AG2 and LangGraph frameworks, and leveraging quality-verified, security-audited skills for Claude, Codex, and Claude Code.","zh":"赋予代理自动化假设生成、方法开发、计算分析和论文写作的能力，使用多代理编排，建立在AG2和LangGraph框架上，并利用经过质量验证和安全审计的技能，适用于Claude、Codex和Claude Code","ja":"AG2およびLangGraphフレームワークを使用した多エージェントオーケストレーションを構築し、Claude、Codex、Claude Code向けに品質保証済みおよびセキュリティ監査済みのスキルを利用することで、エージェントに仮説の生成、方法の開発、計算分析、論文の執筆を自動化する能力を付与する","ko":"다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 구축하여 AG2 및 LangGraph 프레임워크를 사용하고 Claude, Codex 및 Claude Code를 위한 품질 검증 및 보안 감사된 스킬을 활용하여 에이전트가 가설 생성, 방법 개발, 컴퓨팅 분석 및 논문 작성과 같은 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la generación de hipótesis, el desarrollo de metodologías, el análisis computacional y la escritura de artículos utilizando una orquestación multiagente, basada en los marcos AG2 y LangGraph, y aprovechando habilidades verificadas de calidad y auditorías de seguridad para Claude, Codex y Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la génération d''hypothèses, l''élaboration de méthodologies, l''analyse computationnelle et la rédaction d''articles en utilisant une orchestration multiagent, basée sur les cadres AG2 et LangGraph, et en exploitant des compétences vérifiées pour la qualité et des audits de sécurité pour Claude, Codex et Claude Code.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Hypothesengenerierung, Methodenentwicklung, computergestützte Analyse und Papiererstellung mithilfe einer Multiagenten-Orchestrierung zu automatisieren, die auf den Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph basiert und qualitätsgeprüfte, sicherheitsgeprüfte Fähigkeiten für Claude, Codex und Claude Code nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a geração de hipóteses, desenvolvimento de metodologias, análise computacional e escrita de artigos usando orquestração multiagente, construída sobre os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph, e aproveitando habilidades verificadas pela qualidade, auditadas por segurança para Claude, Codex e Claude Code.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать генерацию гипотез, разработку методологий, вычислительный анализ и написание статей с помощью многоагентной оркестрации, построенной на фреймворках AG2 и LangGraph, и использующей навыки, проверенные на качество и прошедшие аудит безопасности для Claude, Codex и Claude Code.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير توليد الفرضيات وتطوير المنهجيات والتحليل الحاسوبي وكتابة الأوراق باستخدام توجيه متعدد الوكلاء، مبني على إطارات AG2 و LangGraph، وتسخير مهارات تم التحقق من جودتها ومراجعتها أمنيًا لصالح Claude و Codex و Claude Code."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dataset analysis to generate novel research hypotheses","Developing structured research methodologies","Orchestrating multiple specialized agents for computational analysis and paper writing"],"zh":["自动化数据集分析以生成新颖的研究假设","开发结构化的研究方法","编排多个专门的代理进行计算分析和论文写作"],"ja":["新しい研究仮説を生成するためのデータセット分析の自動化","構造化された研究方法の開発","計算分析および論文執筆のための複数の専門エージェントのオーケストレーション"],"ko":["새로운 연구 가설을 생성하기 위한 데이터셋 분석 자동화","구조화된 연구 방법 개발","컴퓨팅 분석 및 논문 작성 위한 여러 전문 에이전트 오케스트레이션"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis de conjuntos de datos para generar nuevas hipótesis de investigación","Desarrollar metodologías de investigación estructuradas","Orquestar múltiples agentes especializados para análisis computacional y escritura de artículos"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse de jeux de données pour générer de nouvelles hypothèses de recherche","Développer des méthodologies de recherche structurées","Orchestrer plusieurs agents spécialisés pour l''analyse computationnelle et la rédaction d''articles"],"de":["Automatisierung der Analyse von Datensätzen zur Generierung neuer Forschungshypothesen","Entwicklung strukturierter Forschungsmethoden","Orchestrierung mehrerer spezialisierter Agenten für computergestützte Analyse und Papiererstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de conjuntos de dados para gerar novas hipóteses de pesquisa","Desenvolver metodologias de pesquisa estruturadas","Orquestrar vários agentes especializados para análise computacional e escrita de artigos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ наборов данных для генерации новых исследовательских гипотез","Разрабатывать структурированные методологии исследований","Оркестрировать несколько специализированных агентов для вычислительного анализа и написания статей"],"ar":["توفير تحليل مجموعات البيانات لتوليد فرضيات بحثية جديدة","تطوير منهجيات بحثية منظمّة","توجيه وكلاء متخصصين متعددين للتحليل الحاسوبي وكتابة الأوراق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with AG2 and LangGraph frameworks","Specifically designed for Claude, Codex, and Claude Code integration"],"zh":["需要与AG2和LangGraph框架兼容","专门为Claude、Codex和Claude Code集成而设计"],"ja":["AG2およびLangGraphフレームワークとの互換性が必要","Claude、Codex、Claude Codeの統合のために特別に設計"],"ko":["AG2 및 LangGraph 프레임워크와의 호환성 필요","Claude, Codex 및 Claude Code 통합을 위해 특별히 설계"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con los marcos AG2 y LangGraph","Diseñado específicamente para la integración de Claude, Codex y Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec les cadres AG2 et LangGraph","Conçu spécifiquement pour l''intégration de Claude, Codex et Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit den Frameworks AG2 und LangGraph","Speziell für die Integration von Claude, Codex und Claude Code konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com os frameworks AG2 e LangGraph","Projetado especificamente para integração com Claude, Codex e Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с фреймворками AG2 и LangGraph","Разработан специально для интеграции с Claude, Codex и Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب متوافقية مع الإطارات AG2 و LangGraph","صُمّم خصيصًا للتكامل مع Claude و Codex و Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
