":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter","description":"Provides comprehensive guidance for Flutter development including widgets, state management, navigation, platform channels, and mobile app development. Use when the user asks about Flutter, needs to create Flutter applications, implement Flutter widgets, or work with Flutter features.","bodyPreview":"## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill whenever the user wants to:\n- [待完善：根据具体工具添加使用场景]\n\n## How to use this skill\n\n[待完善：根据具体工具添加使用指南]\n\n## Best Practices\n\n[待完善：根据具体工具添加最佳实践]\n\n## Keywords\n\n[待完善：根据具体工具添加关键词]","body":"## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill whenever the user wants to:\n- [待完善：根据具体工具添加使用场景]\n\n## How to use this skill\n\n[待完善：根据具体工具添加使用指南]\n\n## Best Practices\n\n[待完善：根据具体工具添加最佳实践]\n\n## Keywords\n\n[待完善：根据具体工具添加关键词]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:14:29.457Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cross-Platform Agents needing to develop natively compiled applications for mobile, web, and desktop using the Dart programming language.","zh":"适用于需要为移动、Web 和桌面开发本地编译应用的跨平台代理，使用Dart编程语言。","ja":"Dartプログラミング言語を使用してモバイル、Web、デスクトップ向けにネイティブにコンパイルされたアプリケーションを開発する必要があるクロスプラットフォームエージェントに最適です。","ko":"모바일, 웹 및 데스크톱을 위한 네이티브 컴파일된 애플리케이션을 개발해야 하는 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Dart 프로그래밍 언어를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan desarrollar aplicaciones compiladas de forma nativa para móviles, web y escritorio utilizando el lenguaje de programación Dart.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de plateforme croisée qui ont besoin de développer des applications compilées de manière native pour mobile, web et bureau en utilisant le langage de programmation Dart.","de":"Ideal für Cross-Platform-Agents, die native kompilierte Anwendungen für mobile, Web- und Desktop-Anwendungen mithilfe der Dart-Programmiersprache entwickeln müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que precisam desenvolver aplicações compiladas nativamente para mobile, web e desktop usando a linguagem de programação Dart.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, работающих на нескольких платформах, которым необходимо создавать нативно компилируемые приложения для мобильных устройств, веба и настольных компьютеров, используя язык программирования Dart.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة المنصات التي تحتاج إلى تطوير التطبيقات المجمعة أصلا لموبايل والويب وأجهزة الكمبيوتر المكتبية باستخدام لغة برمجة Dart."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build fast, scalable, and visually appealing user interfaces using Flutter''s widget-based architecture, supporting platforms like Android, iOS, Linux, macOS, and Windows, with features like hot reload and a rich set of Material Design and Cupertino widgets.","zh":"赋予代理构建快速、可扩展、视觉效果出众的用户界面使用Flutter的基于小部件的架构，支持Android、iOS、Linux、macOS和Windows等平台，并具有热重载和丰富的Material Design和Cupertino小部件等功能。","ja":"エージェントが、Android、iOS、Linux、macOS、Windowsなどのプラットフォームをサポートし、ホットリロードや豊富なMaterial DesignとCupertinoウィジェットなどの機能を備えたFlutterのウィジェットベースのアーキテクチャを使用して、高速でスケーラブルで視覚的に魅力的なユーザーインターフェイスを構築できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 안드로이드, iOS, 리눅스, 맥OS, 윈도우 등 플랫폼을 지원하고, 핫 리로드와 풍부한 물자 디자인 및 쿠퍼티노 위젯 등의 기능을 갖춘 플러터의 위젯 기반 아키텍처를 사용하여 빠르고 확장 가능하며 시각적으로 매력적인 사용자 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario rápidas, escalables y visualmente atractivas utilizando la arquitectura basada en widgets de Flutter, que admite plataformas como Android, iOS, Linux, macOS y Windows, con características como recarga en caliente y un rico conjunto de widgets de Material Design y Cupertino.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur rapides, évolutives et visuellement attrayantes en utilisant l''architecture basée sur les widgets de Flutter, qui prend en charge des plateformes telles que Android, iOS, Linux, macOS et Windows, avec des fonctionnalités comme le rechargement à chaud et un riche ensemble de widgets de Material Design et Cupertino.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schnelle, skalierbare und visuell ansprechende Benutzeroberflächen mit der widgetbasierten Architektur von Flutter zu erstellen, die Plattformen wie Android, iOS, Linux, macOS und Windows unterstützt, mit Funktionen wie Hot Reload und einer umfangreichen Sammlung von Material Design- und Cupertino-Widgets.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces de usuário rápidas, escaláveis e visualmente atraentes, usando a arquitetura baseada em widgets do Flutter, que suporta plataformas como Android, iOS, Linux, macOS e Windows, com recursos como recarregamento quente e um conjunto rico de widgets de Material Design e Cupertino.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать быстрые, масштабируемые и визуально привлекательные пользовательские интерфейсы, используя архитектуру, основанную на виджетах, от Flutter, поддерживающую платформы, такие как Android, iOS, Linux, macOS и Windows, с функциями, такими как горячая перезагрузка и богатый набор виджетов Material Design и Cupertino.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء واجهات مستخدم سريعة وقابلة للتوسيع وذات مظهر جذاب، باستخدام هندسة Flutter القائمة على Widgets، والتي تدعم منصات مثل Android وiOS وLinux وmacOS وWindows، مع ميزات مثل إعادة التحميل الساخن ومجموعة غنية من widgets Material Design وCupertino."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing multi-platform mobile applications","Creating responsive web applications with Flutter Web","Designing desktop applications for Windows, macOS, and Linux"],"zh":["开发多平台移动应用程序","使用Flutter Web创建响应式Web应用程序","为Windows、macOS和Linux设计桌面应用程序"],"ja":["複数のプラットフォーム向けモバイルアプリケーションの開発","Flutter Webを使用したレスポンシブWebアプリケーションの作成","Windows、macOS、Linux向けデスクトップアプリケーションの設計"],"ko":["다중 플랫폼 모바일 애플리케이션 개발","플러터 웹을 사용한 반응형 웹 애플리케이션 생성","윈도우, 맥OS, 리눅스용 데스크톱 애플리케이션 디자인"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones móviles multiplataforma","Crear aplicaciones web responsivas con Flutter Web","Diseñar aplicaciones de escritorio para Windows, macOS y Linux"],"fr":["Développer des applications mobiles multiplateformes","Créer des applications web responsives avec Flutter Web","Concevoir des applications de bureau pour Windows, macOS et Linux"],"de":["Entwicklung von Multi-Platform-Mobilanwendungen","Erstellung von responsiven Webanwendungen mit Flutter Web","Entwurf von Desktop-Anwendungen für Windows, macOS und Linux"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações móveis multiplataforma","Criar aplicações web responsivas com Flutter Web","Projetar aplicações de desktop para Windows, macOS e Linux"],"ru":["Разработка много платформенных мобильных приложений","Создание отзывчивых веб-приложений с помощью Flutter Web","Проектирование настольных приложений для Windows, macOS и Linux"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات المحمول متعددة المنصات","إنشاء تطبيقات الويب المرنة باستخدام Flutter Web","تصميم تطبيقات سطح المكتب لنظامي Windows وmacOS وLinux"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dart programming language knowledge","Limited support for certain native platform features without additional plugins or packages"],"zh":["需要Dart编程语言知识","某些本地平台功能在没有额外插件或包的情况下支持有限"],"ja":["Dartプログラミング言語の知識が必要","特定のネイティブプラットフォーム機能に対するサポートが追加のプラグインやパッケージなしに限定される"],"ko":["Dart 프로그래밍 언어 지식 필요","추가 플러그인이나 패키지 없이 특정 네이티브 플랫폼 기능에 대한 지원이 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Dart","Soporte limitado para ciertas características de plataforma nativa sin plugins o paquetes adicionales"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage de programmation Dart","Support limité pour certaines fonctionnalités de plateforme native sans plugins ou packages supplémentaires"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Dart-Programmiersprache","Eingeschränkter Support für bestimmte native Plattformfunktionen ohne zusätzliche Plugins oder Pakete"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da linguagem de programação Dart","Suporte limitado a recursos de plataformas nativas sem plugins ou pacotes adicionais"],"ru":["Требует знания языка программирования Dart","Ограниченная поддержка некоторых функций родных платформ без дополнительных плагинов или пакетов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة برمجة Dart","دعم محدود لبعض ميزات المنصات الأصلية بدون إضافات أو حزم إضافية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Heyvhuang/ship-faster/tool-programmatic-seo', 'community', 'Heyvhuang', 'ship-faster', 'Heyvhuang/ship-faster', 'tool-programmatic-seo', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z', '2026-02-18T13:15:38.216Z', NULL, '{"id":"Heyvhuang/ship-faster/tool-programmatic-seo","name":"tool-programmatic-seo","description":{"zh":"程序化SEO是使用模板和数据创建大规模SEO优化页面的技术","ja":"プログラマティックSEOは、テンプレートとデータを使用して大規模なSEO最適化ページを作成する技術です","ko":"프로그램 적 SEO는 템플릿 및 데이터를 사용하여 대규모 SEO 최적화 페이지를 생성하는 기술입니다","es":"El SEO programático implica la creación de páginas optimizadas para motores de búsqueda a escala, utilizando plantillas y datos para mejorar la visibilidad y el tráfico","fr":"Le SEO programmatique consiste à créer des pages optimisées pour les moteurs de recherche à grande échelle, en utilisant des modèles et des données pour améliorer la visibilité et le trafic","de":"Das programmatische SEO beinhaltet die Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten im großen Maßstab, unter Verwendung von Vorlagen und Daten, um die Sichtbarkeit und den Traffik zu verbessern","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"程序化SEO工具","ja":"プログラマティックSEOツール","ko":"프로그램 적 SEO 도구","es":"SEO Programático: Construye Páginas Optimizadas","fr":"SEO Programmatique: Créez des Pages Optimisées","de":"Programmatisches SEO: Baue Optimierte Seiten","en":"tool-programmatic-seo"},"description":{"zh":"程序化SEO是使用模板和数据创建大规模SEO优化页面的技术","ja":"プログラマティックSEOは、テンプレートとデータを使用して大規模なSEO最適化ページを作成する技術です","ko":"프로그램 적 SEO는 템플릿 및 데이터를 사용하여 대규모 SEO 최적화 페이지를 생성하는 기술입니다","es":"El SEO programático implica la creación de páginas optimizadas para motores de búsqueda a escala, utilizando plantillas y datos para mejorar la visibilidad y...","fr":"Le SEO programmatique consiste à créer des pages optimisées pour les moteurs de recherche à grande échelle, en utilisant des modèles et des données pour amél...","de":"Das programmatische SEO beinhaltet die Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten im großen Maßstab, unter Verwendung von Vorlagen und Daten, um die Sichtbarkeit ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["大规模页面创建","SEO优化","模板和数据驱动","避免薄内容惩罚","提高页面排名"],"ja":["大量のページ作成","SEO最適化","テンプレートとデータ駆動","薄内容ペナルティの回避","ページランキングの向上"],"ko":["대규모 페이지 생성","SEO 최적화","템플릿 및 데이터 驱动","얇은 내용 페널티 회피","페이지 랭킹 향상"],"es":["Creación de páginas optimizadas a escala","Uso de plantillas y datos para mejorar la visibilidad","Mejora del posicionamiento en buscadores","Incremento del tráfico y la conversión","Evitación de penalizaciones por contenido delgado"],"fr":["Création de pages optimisées à grande échelle","Utilisation de modèles et de données pour améliorer la visibilité","Amélioration du référencement","Augmentation du trafic et de la conversion","Évitement des pénalités pour contenu mince"],"de":["Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten im großen Maßstab","Verwendung von Vorlagen und Daten zur Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit","Verbesserung der Suchmaschinen-Positionierung","Steigerung des Traffik und der Konversion","Vermeidung von Strafen für dünnen Inhalt"]},"keywords":{"zh":["程序化SEO","SEO优化","模板和数据","大规模页面创建","薄内容惩罚","页面排名"],"ja":["プログラマティックSEO","SEO最適化","テンプレートとデータ","大量のページ作成","薄内容ペナルティ","ページランキング"],"ko":["프로그램 적 SEO","SEO 최적화","템플릿 및 데이터","대규모 페이지 생성","얇은 내용 페널티","페이지 랭킹"],"es":["SEO programático","páginas optimizadas","plantillas y datos","posicionamiento en buscadores","tráfico y conversión","contenido delgado","optimización de sitio web"],"fr":["SEO programmatique","pages optimisées","modèles et données","référencement","trafic et conversion","contenu mince","optimisation de site web"],"de":["programmatisches SEO","SEO-optimierte Seiten","Vorlagen und Daten","Suchmaschinen-Positionierung","Traffik und Konversion","dünnen Inhalt","Optimierung von Webseiten"]}},"owner":"Heyvhuang","repo":"ship-faster","repoPath":"Heyvhuang/ship-faster","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tool-programmatic-seo","description":"When the user wants to create SEO-driven pages at scale using templates and data. Also use when the user mentions programmatic SEO, template pages, pages at scale, directory pages, location pages, [keyword] + [city] pages, comparison pages, integration pages, or building many pages for SEO. For auditing existing SEO issues, see review-seo-audit.","bodyPreview":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strategy, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context**\n   - What''s the product/service?\n   - Who is the target audience?\n   - What''s the conversion goal for these pages?\n\n2. **Opportunity Assessment**\n   - What search patterns exist?","body":"# Programmatic SEO\n\nYou are an expert in programmatic SEO—building SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data. Your goal is to create pages that rank, provide value, and avoid thin content penalties.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\nBefore designing a programmatic SEO strategy, understand:\n\n1. **Business Context**\n   - What''s the product/service?\n   - Who is the target audience?\n   - What''s the conversion goal for these pages?\n\n2. **Opportunity Assessment**\n   - What search patterns exist?\n   - How many potential pages?\n   - What''s the search volume distribution?\n\n3. **Competitive Landscape**\n   - Who ranks for these terms now?\n   - What do their pages look like?\n   - What would it take to beat them?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Unique Value Per Page\nEvery page must provide value specific to that page:\n- Unique data, insights, or combinations\n- Not just swapped variables in a template\n- Maximize unique content—the more differentiated, the better\n- Avoid \"thin content\" penalties by adding real depth\n\n### 2. Proprietary Data Wins\nThe best pSEO uses data competitors can''t easily replicate:\n- **Proprietary data**: Data you own or generate\n- **Product-derived data**: Insights from your product usage\n- **User-generated content**: Reviews, comments, submissions\n- **Aggregated insights**: Unique analysis of public data\n\nHierarchy of data defensibility:\n1. Proprietary (you created it)\n2. Product-derived (from your users)\n3. User-generated (your community)\n4. Licensed (exclusive access)\n5. Public (anyone can use—weakest)\n\n### 3. Clean URL Structure\n**Always use subfolders, not subdomains**:\n- Good: `yoursite.com/templates/resume/`\n- Bad: `templates.yoursite.com/resume/`\n\nSubfolders pass authority to your main domain. Subdomains are treated as separate sites by Google.\n\n**URL best practices**:\n- Short, descriptive, keyword-rich\n- Consistent pattern across page type\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Human-readable slugs\n\n### 4. Genuine Search Intent Match\nPages must actually answer what people are searching for:\n- Understand the intent behind each pattern\n- Provide the complete answer\n- Don''t over-optimize for keywords at expense of usefulness\n\n### 5. Scalable Quality, Not Just Quantity\n- Quality standards must be maintained at scale\n- Better to have 100 great pages than 10,000 thin ones\n- Build quality checks into the process\n\n### 6. Avoid Google Penalties\n- No doorway pages (thin pages that just funnel to main site)\n- No keyword stuffing\n- No duplicate content across pages\n- Genuine utility for users\n\n---\n\n## The 12 Programmatic SEO Playbooks\n\nBeyond mixing and matching data point permutations, these are the proven playbooks for programmatic SEO:\n\n### 1. Templates\n**Pattern**: \"[Type] template\" or \"free [type] template\"\n**Example searches**: \"resume template\", \"invoice template\", \"pitch deck template\"\n\n**What it is**: Downloadable or interactive templates users can use directly.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- High intent—people need it now\n- Shareable/linkable assets\n- Natural for product-led companies\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Actually usable templates (not just previews)\n- Multiple variations per type\n- Quality comparable to paid options\n- Easy download/use flow\n\n**URL structure**: `/templates/[type]/` or `/templates/[category]/[type]/`\n\n---\n\n### 2. Curation\n**Pattern**: \"best [category]\" or \"top [number] [things]\"\n**Example searches**: \"best website builders\", \"top 10 crm software\", \"best free design tools\"\n\n**What it is**: Curated lists ranking or recommending options in a category.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Comparison shoppers searching for guidance\n- High commercial intent\n- Evergreen with updates\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Genuine evaluation criteria\n- Real testing or expertise\n- Regular updates (date visible)\n- Not just affiliate-driven rankings\n\n**URL structure**: `/best/[category]/` or `/[category]/best/`\n\n---\n\n### 3. Conversions\n**Pattern**: \"[X] to [Y]\" or \"[amount] [unit] in [unit]\"\n**Example searches**: \"$10 USD to GBP\", \"100 kg to lbs\", \"pdf to word\"\n\n**What it is**: Tools or pages that convert between formats, units, or currencies.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Instant utility\n- Extremely high search volume\n- Repeat usage potential\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Accurate, real-time data\n- Fast, functional tool\n- Related conversions suggested\n- Mobile-friendly interface\n\n**URL structure**: `/convert/[from]-to-[to]/` or `/[from]-to-[to]-converter/`\n\n---\n\n### 4. Comparisons\n**Pattern**: \"[X] vs [Y]\" or \"[X] alternative\"\n**Example searches**: \"webflow vs wordpress\", \"notion vs coda\", \"figma alternatives\"\n\n**What it is**: Head-to-head comparisons between products, tools, or options.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- High purchase intent\n- Clear search pattern\n- Scales with number of competitors\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Honest, balanced analysis\n- Actual feature comparison data\n- Clear recommendation by use case\n- Updated when products change\n\n**URL structure**: `/compare/[x]-vs-[y]/` or `/[x]-vs-[y]/`\n\n*See also: competitor-alternatives skill for detailed frameworks*\n\n---\n\n### 5. Examples\n**Pattern**: \"[type] examples\" or \"[category] inspiration\"\n**Example searches**: \"saas landing page examples\", \"email subject line examples\", \"portfolio website examples\"\n\n**What it is**: Galleries or collections of real-world examples for inspiration.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Research phase traffic\n- Highly shareable\n- Natural for design/creative tools\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Real, high-quality examples\n- Screenshots or embeds\n- Categorization/filtering\n- Analysis of why they work\n\n**URL structure**: `/examples/[type]/` or `/[type]-examples/`\n\n---\n\n### 6. Locations\n**Pattern**: \"[service/thing] in [location]\"\n**Example searches**: \"coworking spaces in san diego\", \"dentists in austin\", \"best restaurants in brooklyn\"\n\n**What it is**: Location-specific pages for services, businesses, or information.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Local intent is massive\n- Scales with geography\n- Natural for marketplaces/directories\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Actual local data (not just city name swapped)\n- Local providers/options listed\n- Location-specific insights (pricing, regulations)\n- Map integration helpful\n\n**URL structure**: `/[service]/[city]/` or `/locations/[city]/[service]/`\n\n---\n\n### 7. Personas\n**Pattern**: \"[product] for [audience]\" or \"[solution] for [role/industry]\"\n**Example searches**: \"payroll software for agencies\", \"crm for real estate\", \"project management for freelancers\"\n\n**What it is**: Tailored landing pages addressing specific audience segments.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Speaks directly to searcher''s context\n- Higher conversion than generic pages\n- Scales with personas\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Genuine persona-specific content\n- Relevant features highlighted\n- Testimonials from that segment\n- Use cases specific to audience\n\n**URL structure**: `/for/[persona]/` or `/solutions/[industry]/`\n\n---\n\n### 8. Integrations\n**Pattern**: \"[your product] [other product] integration\" or \"[product] + [product]\"\n**Example searches**: \"slack asana integration\", \"zapier airtable\", \"hubspot salesforce sync\"\n\n**What it is**: Pages explaining how your product works with other tools.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Captures users of other products\n- High intent (they want the solution)\n- Scales with integration ecosystem\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Real integration details\n- Setup instructions\n- Use cases for the combination\n- Working integration (not vaporware)\n\n**URL structure**: `/integrations/[product]/` or `/connect/[product]/`\n\n---\n\n### 9. Glossary\n**Pattern**: \"what is [term]\" or \"[term] definition\" or \"[term] meaning\"\n**Example searches**: \"what is pSEO\", \"api definition\", \"what does crm stand for\"\n\n**What it is**: Educational definitions of industry terms and concepts.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Top-of-funnel awareness\n- Establishes expertise\n- Natural internal linking opportunities\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Clear, accurate definitions\n- Examples and context\n- Related terms linked\n- More depth than a dictionary\n\n**URL structure**: `/glossary/[term]/` or `/learn/[term]/`\n\n---\n\n### 10. Translations\n**Pattern**: Same content in multiple languages\n**Example searches**: \"qué es pSEO\", \"was ist SEO\", \"マーケティングとは\"\n\n**What it is**: Your content translated and localized for other language markets.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Opens entirely new markets\n- Lower competition in many languages\n- Multiplies your content reach\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Quality translation (not just Google Translate)\n- Cultural localization\n- hreflang tags properly implemented\n- Native speaker review\n\n**URL structure**: `/[lang]/[page]/` or `yoursite.com/es/`, `/de/`, etc.\n\n---\n\n### 11. Directory\n**Pattern**: \"[category] tools\" or \"[type] software\" or \"[category] companies\"\n**Example searches**: \"ai copywriting tools\", \"email marketing software\", \"crm companies\"\n\n**What it is**: Comprehensive directories listing options in a category.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Research phase capture\n- Link building magnet\n- Natural for aggregators/reviewers\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Comprehensive coverage\n- Useful filtering/sorting\n- Details per listing (not just names)\n- Regular updates\n\n**URL structure**: `/directory/[category]/` or `/[category]-directory/`\n\n---\n\n### 12. Profiles\n**Pattern**: \"[person/company name]\" or \"[entity] + [attribute]\"\n**Example searches**: \"stripe ceo\", \"airbnb founding story\", \"elon musk companies\"\n\n**What it is**: Profile pages about notable people, companies, or entities.\n\n**Why it works**:\n- Informational intent traffic\n- Builds topical authority\n- Natural for B2B, news, research\n\n**Value requirements**:\n- Accurate, sourced information\n- Regularly updated\n- Unique insights or aggregation\n- Not just Wikipedia rehash\n\n**URL structure**: `/people/[name]/` or `/companies/[name]/`\n\n---\n\n## Choosing Your Playbook\n\n### Match to Your Assets\n\n| If you have... | Consider... |\n|----------------|-------------|\n| Proprietary data | Stats, Directories, Profiles |\n| Product with integrations | Integrations |\n| Design/creative product | Templates, Examples |\n| Multi-segment audience | Personas |\n| Local presence | Locations |\n| Tool or utility product | Conversions |\n| Content/expertise | Glossary, Curation |\n| International potential | Translations |\n| Competitor landscape | Comparisons |\n\n### Combine Playbooks\n\nYou can layer multiple playbooks:\n- **Locations + Personas**: \"Marketing agencies for startups in Austin\"\n- **Curation + Locations**: \"Best coworking spaces in San Diego\"\n- **Integrations + Personas**: \"Slack for sales teams\"\n- **Glossary + Translations**: Multi-language educational content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Framework\n\n### 1. Keyword Pattern Research\n\n**Identify the pattern**:\n- What''s the repeating structure?\n- What are the variables?\n- How many unique combinations exist?\n\n**Validate demand**:\n- Aggregate search volume for pattern\n- Volume distribution (head vs. long tail)\n- Seasonal patterns\n- Trend direction\n\n**Assess competition**:\n- Who ranks currently?\n- What''s their content quality?\n- What''s their domain authority?\n- Can you realistically compete?\n\n### 2. Data Requirements\n\n**Identify data sources**:\n- What data populates each page?\n- Where does that data come from?\n- Is it first-party, scraped, licensed, public?\n- How is it updated?\n\n**Data schema design**:\n```\nFor \"[Service] in [City]\" pages:\n\ncity:\n  - name\n  - population\n  - relevant_stats\n\nservice:\n  - name\n  - description\n  - typical_pricing\n\nlocal_providers:\n  - name\n  - rating\n  - reviews_count\n  - specialty\n\nlocal_data:\n  - regulations\n  - average_prices\n  - market_size\n```\n\n### 3. Template Design\n\n**Page structure**:\n- Header with target keyword\n- Unique intro (not just variables swapped)\n- Data-driven sections\n- Related pages / internal links\n- CTAs appropriate to intent\n\n**Ensuring uniqueness**:\n- Each page needs unique value\n- Conditional content based on data\n- User-generated content where possible\n- Original insights/analysis per page\n\n**Template example**:\n```\nH1: [Service] in [City]: [Year] Guide\n\nIntro: [Dynamic paragraph using city stats + service context]\n\nSection 1: Why [City] for [Service]\n[City-specific data and insights]\n\nSection 2: Top [Service] Providers in [City]\n[Data-driven list with unique details]\n\nSection 3: Pricing for [Service] in [City]\n[Local pricing data if available]\n\nSection 4: FAQs about [Service] in [City]\n[Common questions with city-specific answers]\n\nRelated: [Service] in [Nearby Cities]\n```\n\n### 4. Internal Linking Architecture\n\n**Hub and spoke model**:\n- Hub: Main category page\n- Spokes: Individual programmatic pages\n- Cross-links between related spokes\n\n**Avoid orphan pages**:\n- Every page reachable from main site\n- Logical category structure\n- XML sitemap for all pages\n\n**Breadcrumbs**:\n- Show hierarchy\n- Structured data markup\n- User navigation aid\n\n### 5. Indexation Strategy\n\n**Prioritize important pages**:\n- Not all pages need to be indexed\n- Index high-volume patterns\n- Noindex very thin variations\n\n**Crawl budget management**:\n- Paginate thoughtfully\n- Avoid infinite crawl traps\n- Use robots.txt wisely\n\n**Sitemap strategy**:\n- Separate sitemaps by page type\n- Monitor indexation rate\n- Prioritize by importance\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checks\n\n### Pre-Launch Checklist\n\n**Content quality**:\n- [ ] Each page provides unique value\n- [ ] Not just variable substitution\n- [ ] Answers search intent\n- [ ] Readable and useful\n\n**Technical SEO**:\n- [ ] Unique titles and meta descriptions\n- [ ] Proper heading structure\n- [ ] Schema markup implemented\n- [ ] Canonical tags correct\n- [ ] Page speed acceptable\n\n**Internal linking**:\n- [ ] Connected to site architecture\n- [ ] Related pages linked\n- [ ] No orphan pages\n- [ ] Breadcrumbs implemented\n\n**Indexation**:\n- [ ] In XML sitemap\n- [ ] Crawlable\n- [ ] Not blocked by robots.txt\n- [ ] No conflicting noindex\n\n### Monitoring Post-Launch\n\n**Track**:\n- Indexation rate\n- Rankings by page pattern\n- Traffic by page pattern\n- Engagement metrics\n- Conversion rate\n\n**Watch for**:\n- Thin content warnings in Search Console\n- Ranking drops\n- Manual actions\n- Crawl errors\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### Thin Content\n- Just swapping city names in identical content\n- No unique information per page\n- \"Doorway pages\" that just redirect\n\n### Keyword Cannibalization\n- Multiple pages targeting same keyword\n- No clear hierarchy\n- Competing with yourself\n\n### Over-Generation\n- Creating pages with no search demand\n- Too many low-quality pages dilute authority\n- Quantity over quality\n\n### Poor Data Quality\n- Outdated information\n- Incorrect data\n- Missing data showing as blank\n\n### Ignoring User Experience\n- Pages exist for Google, not users\n- No conversion path\n- Bouncy, unhelpful content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Strategy Document\n\n**Opportunity Analysis**:\n- Keyword pattern identified\n- Search volume estimates\n- Competition assessment\n- Feasibility rating\n\n**Implementation Plan**:\n- Data requirements and sources\n- Template structure\n- Number of pages (phases)\n- Internal linking plan\n- Technical requirements\n\n**Content Guidelines**:\n- What makes each page unique\n- Quality standards\n- Update frequency\n\n### Page Template\n\n**URL structure**: `/category/variable/`\n**Title template**: [Variable] + [Static] + [Brand]\n**Meta description template**: [Pattern with variables]\n**H1 template**: [Pattern]\n**Content outline**: Section by section\n**Schema markup**: Type and required fields\n\n### Launch Checklist\n\nSpecific pre-launch checks for this implementation\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What keyword patterns are you targeting?\n2. What data do you have (or can acquire)?\n3. How many pages are you planning to create?\n4. What does your site authority look like?\n5. Who currently ranks for these terms?\n6. What''s your technical stack for generating pages?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **review-seo-audit**: For auditing programmatic pages after launch\n- **tool-schema-markup**: For adding structured data to templates\n- **copywriting**: For the non-templated copy portions\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring programmatic page performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:15:38.216Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Digital Marketing Agents needing advanced programmatic SEO capabilities to build scalable and optimized web pages.","zh":"非常适合需要高级程序化SEO功能来构建可扩展和优化网页的数字营销代理。","ja":"スケーラブルで最適化されたWebページを構築するための高度なプログラムSEO機能を必要とするデジタルマーケティングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"확장 가능하고 최적화된 웹 페이지를 구축하기 위해 고급 프로그래매틱 SEO 기능이 필요한 디지털 마케팅 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing digital que necesitan capacidades de SEO programático avanzadas para crear páginas web escalables y optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing numérique ayant besoin de capacités de SEO programmatique avancées pour créer des pages web évolutives et optimisées.","de":"Perfekt für digitale Marketingagenten, die erweiterte programmatische SEO-Fähigkeiten benötigen, um skalierbare und optimierte Webseiten zu erstellen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing Digital que precisam de capacidades avançadas de SEO programático para criar páginas web escaláveis e otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов цифрового маркетинга, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности программного SEO для создания масштабируемых и оптимизированных веб-страниц.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين الرقميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لبرمجة تحسين محركات البحث لتطوير صفحات ويب قابلة للتطوير ومحسنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate SEO-optimized pages at scale using templates and data, providing value and avoiding thin content penalties through strategic business context and opportunity assessments, leveraging search patterns and conversion goals.","zh":"使代理能够使用模板和数据大规模生成SEO优化的页面，通过战略业务背景和机会评估，利用搜索模式和转化目标来提供价值并避免低质量内容处罚。","ja":"テンプレートとデータを使用してSEO最適化されたページを大規模に生成する機能をエージェントに提供し、検索パターンとコンバージョン目標を活用した戦略的なビジネスコンテキストと機会評価を通じて価値を提供し、薄いコンテンツのペナルティを回避します。","ko":"템플릿과 데이터를 사용하여 대규모로 SEO 최적화된 페이지를 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원하며, 전략적 비즈니스 컨텍스트와 기회 평가를 통해 검색 패턴과 전환 목표를 활용하여 가치를 제공하고 저품질 콘텐츠 패널티를 방지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar páginas optimizadas para SEO a gran escala utilizando plantillas y datos, proporcionando valor y evitando penalizaciones por contenido delgado a través de evaluaciones estratégicas de contexto y oportunidades comerciales, aprovechando patrones de búsqueda y objetivos de conversión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des pages optimisées pour le SEO à grande échelle en utilisant des modèles et des données, fournissant de la valeur et évitant les pénalités pour contenu mince grâce à des évaluations stratégiques de contexte et d''opportunités commerciales, en exploitant les modèles de recherche et les objectifs de conversion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, SEO-optimierte Seiten im großen Maßstab mithilfe von Vorlagen und Daten zu generieren, indem es Wert bietet und Strafen für dünnen Inhalt durch strategische Geschäftskontext- und Chancenbewertungen vermeidet, indem es Suchmuster und Konversionsziele nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar páginas otimizadas para SEO em larga escala, utilizando modelos e dados, fornecendo valor e evitando penalidades de conteúdo fino por meio de avaliações estratégicas de contexto e oportunidades comerciais, aproveitando padrões de pesquisa e metas de conversão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать страницы, оптимизированные для SEO, в крупном масштабе с использованием шаблонов и данных, обеспечивая ценность и избегая штрафов за тонкий контент посредством стратегической оценки делового контекста и оценки возможностей, используя закономерности поиска и цели конверсии.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد صفحات محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث على نطاق واسع باستخدام القوالب والبيانات، وتوفير القيمة وتجنب عقوبات المحتوى الرقيق من خلال التقييمات الاستراتيجية للسياق التجاري وتقييم الفرص، واستغلال أنماط البحث وأهداف التحويل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO-optimized page generation for large product catalogs","Generating data-driven content templates for targeted audiences","Analyzing search patterns to inform programmatic SEO strategies"],"zh":["为大容量产品目录自动化生成SEO优化页面","为目标受众生成数据驱动的内容模板","分析搜索模式以指导程序化SEO策略"],"ja":["大規模な製品カタログ向けのSEO最適化ページ生成の自動化","ターゲットオーディエンス向けのデータ駆動型コンテンツテンプレートの生成","プログラムSEO戦略を情報提供するための検索パターンの分析"],"ko":["대규모 제품 카탈로그를 위한 SEO 최적화 페이지 생성 자동화","타겟 대상에 대한 데이터 기반 콘텐츠 템플릿 생성","프로그래매틱 SEO 전략에 정보를 제공하기 위한 검색 패턴 분석"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de páginas optimizadas para SEO para grandes catálogos de productos","Generación de plantillas de contenido impulsadas por datos para audiencias objetivo","Análisis de patrones de búsqueda para informar estrategias de SEO programático"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de pages optimisées pour le SEO pour de grands catalogues de produits","Génération de modèles de contenu pilotés par des données pour des publics ciblés","Analyse des modèles de recherche pour éclairer les stratégies de SEO programmatique"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von SEO-optimierten Seiten für große Produktkataloge","Erstellung von datengetriebenen Inhaltsvorlagen für Zielgruppen","Analyse von Suchmustern, um programmatische SEO-Strategien zu unterstützen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de páginas otimizadas para SEO para grandes catálogos de produtos","Gerar modelos de conteúdo impulsionados por dados para audiências direcionadas","Analizar padrões de pesquisa para informar estratégias de SEO programático"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию страниц, оптимизированных для SEO, для крупных каталогов продуктов","Генерировать шаблоны контента, управляемые данными, для целевой аудитории","Анализировать закономерности поиска для информирования программных стратегий SEO"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد صفحات محسنة لتحسين محركات البحث لكتل كبيرة من المنتجات","توليد قوالب المحتوى الموجهة بالبيانات للجماهير المستهدفة","تحليل أنماط البحث لإعلام استراتيجيات تحسين محركات البحث البرمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of business context and target audience","Dependent on high-quality data for template generation","May require ongoing monitoring to avoid thin content penalties"],"zh":["需要理解业务背景和目标受众","模板生成依赖于高质量数据","可能需要持续监控以避免低质量内容处罚"],"ja":["ビジネスコンテキストとターゲットオーディエンスの理解が必要","テンプレート生成は高品質なデータに依存","薄いコンテンツのペナルティを回避するために継続的な監視が必要な場合がある"],"ko":["비즈니스 컨텍스트와 타겟 대상에 대한 이해가 필요함","템플릿 생성은 고품질 데이터에 의존함","저품질 콘텐츠 패널티를 피하기 위해 지속적인 모니터링이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del contexto empresarial y del público objetivo","Depende de datos de alta calidad para la generación de plantillas","Puede requerir un seguimiento continuo para evitar penalizaciones por contenido delgado"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du contexte commercial et du public cible","Dépend de données de haute qualité pour la génération de modèles","Peut nécessiter un suivi continu pour éviter les pénalités pour contenu mince"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis des Geschäftskontexts und der Zielgruppe","Hängt von hochwertigen Daten für die Vorlagenerstellung ab","Kann ein kontinuierliches Monitoring erfordern, um Strafen für dünnen Inhalt zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do contexto comercial e do público-alvo","Depende de dados de alta qualidade para geração de modelos","Pode exigir monitoramento contínuo para evitar penalidades de conteúdo fino"],"ru":["Требует понимания делового контекста и целевой аудитории","Зависит от высококачественных данных для генерации шаблонов","Может требовать постоянного мониторинга для избежания штрафов за тонкий контент"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا للسياق التجاري والجمهور المستهدف","يعتمد على بيانات عالية الجودة لتوليد القوالب","يمكن أن يتطلب مراقبة مستمرة لتجنب عقوبات المحتوى الرقيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
