بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير التطبيقات","مكتبات بايثون","الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"cnemri","repo":"google-genai-skills","repoPath":"cnemri/google-genai-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-genai-sdk-python","description":"Expert guidance for writing Python code using the official Google GenAI SDK (google-genai) for Gemini API and Vertex AI. Use for text generation, multimodal inputs, reasoning, tools, and media generation.","bodyPreview":"# Google GenAI Python SDK Skill\n\nUse this skill to write high-quality, idiomatic Python code for the Gemini API.\n\n## Reference Materials\n\nIdentify the user''s task and refer to the relevant file:\n\n- **[Setup & Client](references/setup.md)**: Installation, auth, client initialization.\n- **[Models](references/models.md)**: Recommended models (Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen, Veo).\n- **[Text Generation](references/text_generation.md)**: Basic inference, streaming, system instructions, safety.\n- **[Chat](re","body":"# Google GenAI Python SDK Skill\n\nUse this skill to write high-quality, idiomatic Python code for the Gemini API.\n\n## Reference Materials\n\nIdentify the user''s task and refer to the relevant file:\n\n- **[Setup & Client](references/setup.md)**: Installation, auth, client initialization.\n- **[Models](references/models.md)**: Recommended models (Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen, Veo).\n- **[Text Generation](references/text_generation.md)**: Basic inference, streaming, system instructions, safety.\n- **[Chat](references/chat.md)**: Multi-turn conversations and history.\n- **[Reasoning](references/reasoning.md)**: Thinking config (`thinking_level` / `thinking_budget`), thought signatures.\n- **[Structured Output](references/structured_output.md)**: JSON schemas, Pydantic models, Enums.\n- **[Multimodal Inputs](references/multimodal_inputs.md)**: Images, audio, video, PDFs, media resolution.\n- **[Tools](references/tools.md)**: Function calling, code execution, Google Search grounding.\n- **[Media Generation](references/media_generation.md)**: Image generation/editing (Imagen), video generation (Veo).\n- **[Source Code](references/source_code.md)**: Raw SDK source code for deep inspection.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **Unified SDK**: Always use `google-genai`.\n2.  **Stateless Models**: Use `client.models` for single requests.\n3.  **Stateful Chats**: Use `client.chats` for conversations.\n4.  **Types**: Import from `google.genai.types`."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:15:39.689Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced Gemini API integration for text generation and chat functionalities in Python","zh":"适合需要高级Gemini API集成以进行文本生成和聊天功能的Python AI代理","ja":"Pythonでテキスト生成およびチャット機能のための高度なGemini API統合を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"파이썬에서 텍스트 생성 및 채팅 기능을 위한 고급 Gemini API 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una integración avanzada de la API Gemini para la generación de texto y funcionalidades de chat en Python","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une intégration avancée de l''API Gemini pour la génération de texte et les fonctionnalités de chat en Python","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration der Gemini-API für Textgenerierung und Chat-Funktionen in Python benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que necessitam de integração avançada da API Gemini para geração de texto e funcionalidades de chat em Python","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция с API Gemini для генерации текста и функций чата на Python","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل متقدم لبروتوكول Gemini لإنشاء النص وتوابع الدردشة في بايثون"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage the Gemini API for high-quality text generation, utilizing models like Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen, and Veo, while ensuring safety and streaming capabilities through the Google GenAI Python SDK, enabling seamless interactions with the API for client initialization, auth, and model selection","zh":"赋予代理使用Gemini API进行高质量文本生成的能力，利用诸如Flash、Pro、Lite、Imagen和Veo等模型，同时通过Google GenAI Python SDK确保安全性和流媒体功能，实现与API的无缝交互，包括客户端初始化、身份验证和模型选择","ja":"エージェントに、Flash、Pro、Lite、Imagen、Veoなどのモデルを使用して、Gemini APIによる高品質テキスト生成を可能にし、Google GenAI Python SDKを通じて、安全性とストリーミング機能を確保し、クライアントの初期化、認証、モデル選択などのAPIとのシームレスなやり取りを可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen 및 Veo와 같은 모델을 사용하여 Gemini API를 통해 고품질 텍스트 생성을 가능하게 하며 Google GenAI Python SDK를 통해 보안 및 스트리밍 기능을 보장하고 클라이언트 초기화, 인증, 모델 선택 등과 같은 API와의 무缝 상호 작용을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la API Gemini para la generación de texto de alta calidad, utilizando modelos como Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen y Veo, y garantizando la seguridad y las capacidades de transmisión a través del SDK de Python de Google GenAI, lo que permite interacciones sin problemas con la API para la inicialización del cliente, la autenticación y la selección de modelos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter l''API Gemini pour la génération de texte de haute qualité, en utilisant des modèles tels que Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen et Veo, tout en garantissant la sécurité et les capacités de diffusion via le SDK Python de Google GenAI, ce qui permet des interactions sans heurts avec l''API pour l''initialisation du client, l''authentification et la sélection de modèles","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Gemini-API für die Erzeugung von Texten in hoher Qualität zu nutzen, unter Verwendung von Modellen wie Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen und Veo, und stellt dabei die Sicherheit und Streaming-Fähigkeiten durch das Google GenAI Python SDK sicher, wodurch eine nahtlose Interaktion mit der API für die Client-Initialisierung, Authentifizierung und Modellauswahl ermöglicht wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem a API Gemini para geração de texto de alta qualidade, utilizando modelos como Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen e Veo, garantindo a segurança e as capacidades de transmissão em tempo real por meio do SDK do Google GenAI para Python, permitindo interações sem problemas com a API para inicialização do cliente, autenticação e seleção de modelo","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать API Gemini для генерации текста высокого качества, используя модели như Flash, Pro, Lite, Imagen и Veo, обеспечивая безопасность и возможности потоковой передачи через SDK Google GenAI для Python, обеспечивая бесшовное взаимодействие с API для инициализации клиента, аутентификации и выбора модели","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من بروتوكول Gemini لإنشاء نص عالي الجودة، باستخدام نماذج مثل Flash و Pro و Lite و Imagen و Veo، مع ضمان السلامة وقدرات البث المباشر من خلال SDK Google GenAI لبايثون، مما يسمح بالتفاعلات السلسة مع البروتوكول لتهيئة العميل وتحقيق التحقق وتحديد النموذج"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating human-like text responses","Initializing and managing Gemini API clients","Streaming text generation for real-time applications"],"zh":["生成类似人类的文本响应","初始化和管理Gemini API客户端","实时应用的流媒体文本生成"],"ja":["人間のようなテキスト応答を生成する","Gemini APIクライアントの初期化と管理","リアルタイムアプリケーションのストリーミングテキスト生成"],"ko":["인간과 같은 텍스트 응답 생성","Gemini API 클라이언트 초기화 및 관리","실시간 애플리케이션을 위한 스트리밍 텍스트 생성"],"es":["Generación de respuestas de texto similares a las humanas","Inicialización y administración de clientes de la API Gemini","Transmisión de generación de texto para aplicaciones en tiempo real"],"fr":["Génération de réponses de texte similaires à celles des humains","Initialisation et gestion des clients de l''API Gemini","Diffusion de la génération de texte pour les applications en temps réel"],"de":["Erzeugung von menschenähnlichen Textantworten","Initialisierung und Verwaltung von Gemini-API-Clients","Streaming von Texterzeugung für Echtzeit-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerar respostas de texto semelhantes às humanas","Inicializar e gerenciar clientes da API Gemini","Transmissão de geração de texto para aplicações em tempo real"],"ru":["Генерировать текстовые ответы, подобные человеческим","Инициализировать и управлять клиентами API Gemini","Потоковая генерация текста для приложений реального времени"],"ar":["إنشاء استجابات نصية شبيهة بالإنسانية","تهيئة وإدارة عملاء بروتوكول Gemini","بث إنشاء النص لتطبيقات الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google GenAI API access","Python environment needed","Dependent on Gemini API model availability and limitations"],"zh":["需要Google GenAI API访问","需要Python环境","依赖于Gemini API模型的可用性和限制"],"ja":["Google GenAI APIへのアクセスが必要","Python環境が必要","Gemini APIモデルの可用性と制限に依存"],"ko":["Google GenAI API 액세스 필요","Python 환경 필요","Gemini API 모델 가용성 및 제한에 종속"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Google GenAI","Se necesita un entorno de Python","Depende de la disponibilidad y las limitaciones de los modelos de la API Gemini"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API Google GenAI","Un environnement Python est nécessaire","Dépend de la disponibilité et des limitations des modèles de l''API Gemini"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Google GenAI API","Ein Python-Umgebung ist erforderlich","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit und den Einschränkungen der Gemini-API-Modelle ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do Google GenAI","Ambiente Python necessário","Dependente da disponibilidade e limitações do modelo da API Gemini"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API Google GenAI","Необходимо окружение Python","Зависит от наличия и ограничений модели API Gemini"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بروتوكول Google GenAI","بيئة بايثون ضرورية","يعتمد على توافر نموذج بروتوكول Gemini والقيود المحددة له"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('PaulRBerg/agent-skills/commit', 'community', 'PaulRBerg', 'agent-skills', 'PaulRBerg/agent-skills', 'commit', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z', '2026-02-18T13:15:18.542Z', NULL, '{"id":"PaulRBerg/agent-skills/commit","name":"commit","description":{"zh":"Git Commit 是一种通过预检、暂存和提交来创建原子式提交的技术","ja":"Git Commit は、プレフライトチェック、ステージング、コミットを通じて原子的なコミットを作成する技術です","ko":"Git Commit은 예비 확인, 스테이징, 커밋을 통해 원자적인 커밋을 생성하는 기술입니다","es":"El commit es una habilidad de agente que permite crear commits atómicos en Git. Verifica el estado del trabajo y crea mensajes de commit convencionales.","fr":"Le commit est une compétence d''agent qui permet de créer des commits atomiques dans Git. Il vérifie l''état du travail et crée des messages de commit conventionnels.","de":"Der Commit ist eine Agentenfähigkeit, die das Erstellen von atomaren Commits in Git ermöglicht. Er überprüft den Arbeitsstatus und erstellt konventionelle Commit-Mitteilungen.","pt":"Crie commits atômicos no Git com facilidade, verificando o diff e compondo mensagens de commit convencionais.","ru":"Создайте атомарные коммиты в Git с легкостью, проверив diff и составив конвенциональные сообщения коммита.","ar":"قم بإنشاء التزامات ذرية في Git بسهولة، وفحص الفرق، وكتابة رسائل التزام تقليدية.","en":"PRB''s collection of agent skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git Commit 技术","ja":"Git Commit スキル","ko":"Git Commit 기능","es":"Commit: Crear Commits Atómicos con Git","fr":"Commit: Créer des Commits Atomiques avec Git","de":"Commit: Erstellen von Atomaren Commits mit Git","pt":"Commit Git: Crie Commits Atômicos com Eficiência","ru":"Коммит Git: Создайте Атомарные Коммиты с Лёгкостью","ar":"التزام Git: قم بإنشاء التزامات ذرية بكفاءة","en":"commit"},"description":{"zh":"Git Commit 是一种通过预检、暂存和提交来创建原子式提交的技术","ja":"Git Commit は、プレフライトチェック、ステージング、コミットを通じて原子的なコミットを作成する技術です","ko":"Git Commit은 예비 확인, 스테이징, 커밋을 통해 원자적인 커밋을 생성하는 기술입니다","es":"El commit es una habilidad de agente que permite crear commits atómicos en Git. Verifica el estado del trabajo y crea mensajes de commit convencionales.","fr":"Le commit est une compétence d''agent qui permet de créer des commits atomiques dans Git. Il vérifie l''état du travail et crée des messages de commit conventi...","de":"Der Commit ist eine Agentenfähigkeit, die das Erstellen von atomaren Commits in Git ermöglicht. Er überprüft den Arbeitsstatus und erstellt konventionelle Co...","pt":"Crie commits atômicos no Git com facilidade, verificando o diff e compondo mensagens de commit convencionais.","ru":"Создайте атомарные коммиты в Git с легкостью, проверив diff и составив конвенциональные сообщения коммита.","ar":"قم بإنشاء التزامات ذرية في Git بسهولة، وفحص الفرق، وكتابة رسائل التزام تقليدية.","en":"PRB''s collection of agent skills"},"definition":{"en":"PRB''s collection of agent skills"},"features":{"zh":["预检检查","暂存文件","分析暂存差异","编写标准提交消息","可选推送"],"ja":["プレフライトチェック","ファイルのステージング","ステージング差異の分析","標準的なコミットメッセージの作成","オプションのプッシュ"],"ko":["예비 확인","파일 스테이징","스테이징 차이 분석","표준 커밋 메시지 작성","선택적 푸시"],"es":["Verificación del estado del trabajo","Análisis de las diferencias","Creación de mensajes de commit convencionales","Opción de enviar los cambios","Verificación de la integridad del repositorio"],"fr":["Vérification de l''état du travail","Analyse des différences","Création de messages de commit conventionnels","Option d''envoyer les modifications","Vérification de l''intégrité du référentiel"],"de":["Überprüfung des Arbeitsstatus","Analyse der Unterschiede","Erstellung von konventionellen Commit-Mitteilungen","Option zum Senden der Änderungen","Überprüfung der Integrität des Repository"],"pt":["Verificação de pré-voo","Análise do diff","Composição de mensagens de commit convencionais","Opção de fazer push","Verificação de estado de rebase/merge/cherry-pick"],"ru":["Предполетные проверки","Анализ diff","Составление конвенциональных сообщений коммита","Опция пуша","Проверка состояния ребейза/мерджа/чери-пика"],"ar":["فحص ما قبل الطيران","تحليل الفرق","كتابة رسائل التزام تقليدية","خيار الدفع","فحص حالة إعادة التركيب/الدمج/التحديد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git Commit","原子式提交","预检检查","暂存文件","提交消息","Git 技术"],"ja":["Git Commit","原子的なコミット","プレフライトチェック","ファイルのステージング","コミットメッセージ","Git 技術"],"ko":["Git Commit","원자적인 커밋","예비 확인","파일 스테이징","커밋 메시지","Git 기술"],"es":["commit","git","commits atómicos","mensaje de commit","verificación del estado del trabajo","análisis de diferencias","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["commit","git","commits atomiques","message de commit","vérification de l''état du travail","analyse des différences","développement de logiciels"],"de":["commit","git","atomare commits","commit-mitteilung","überprüfung des arbeitsstatus","analyse der unterschiede","software-entwicklung"],"pt":["commit git","commits atômicos","git commit","diff","mensagem de commit","push","rebase","merge","cherry-pick"],"ru":["коммит гит","атомарные коммиты","git коммит","diff","сообщение коммита","пуш","ребейз","мердж","чери-пик"],"ar":["التزام جيت","التزامات ذرية","جيت التزام","الفرق","رسالة التزام","الدفع","إعادة التركيب","الدمج","التحديد"]}},"owner":"PaulRBerg","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"PaulRBerg/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to commit changes, craft a commit message, stage and commit, commit only session edits, or run a commit workflow with flags like --all, --deep, or --push. Creates atomic git commits with heuristic analysis, conventional-commit formatting, staging rules, optional deep analysis, and optional push.","bodyPreview":"# Git Commit\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate atomic commits by staging the right files, analyzing the staged diff, composing a conventional commit message, and optionally pushing.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 0) Pre-flight checks\n\n- Verify inside a git worktree: `git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree`\n- Verify not detached: `git symbolic-ref HEAD`\n- Verify not in rebase/merge/cherry-pick state: check for `.git/rebase-merge`, `.git/MERGE_HEAD`, `.git/CHERRY_PICK_HEAD`\n- If any check fails, stop with a clear error and su","body":"# Git Commit\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate atomic commits by staging the right files, analyzing the staged diff, composing a conventional commit message, and optionally pushing.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 0) Pre-flight checks\n\n- Verify inside a git worktree: `git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree`\n- Verify not detached: `git symbolic-ref HEAD`\n- Verify not in rebase/merge/cherry-pick state: check for `.git/rebase-merge`, `.git/MERGE_HEAD`, `.git/CHERRY_PICK_HEAD`\n- If any check fails, stop with a clear error and suggested fix.\n\n### 1) Collect context\n\n- Current branch: `git branch --show-current`\n- Git status: `git status --short --branch`\n- Initial staged diff: `git diff --cached`\n- Arguments: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\nNote: The staged diff may become stale after staging changes; re-read `git diff --cached` after STEP 2.\n\n### 2) Handle staging\n\n- If `--all`:\n  - If no changes at all: error \"No changes to commit\"\n  - If unstaged changes exist: `git add -A`\n  - If already staged: proceed\n  - Log staged files with status (A/M/D)\n- Otherwise (atomic commits):\n  - Session-modified files = files edited in this session\n  - Currently staged files: `git diff --cached --name-only`\n  - For staged files NOT in session-modified set: `git restore --staged <file>`\n  - For session-modified files with changes: `git add <file>`\n  - Log staged files with status (A/M/D)\n  - If none: error \"No files modified in this session\"\n- **Unrelated changes**: session-modified files may contain pre-existing uncommitted changes (hunks not from this session). Include the entire file—partial staging is impractical. Never revert, discard, or `git checkout` unrelated changes.\n- Re-read staged diff: `git diff --cached`\n\n### 3) Parse arguments\n\n- Flags:\n  - `--all` commit all changes\n  - `--deep` deep analysis, breaking changes, concise body\n  - `--push` push after commit\n- Value arguments:\n  - Type keyword (any conventional type) overrides inferred type\n  - Quoted text overrides inferred description\n- Precedence:\n  1. Explicit type keyword in arguments\n  2. Heuristic inference from diff\n  3. Quoted text in arguments\n  4. Heuristic inference from diff\n\n### 4) Analyze changes\n\n- Default:\n  - Read the staged diff\n  - Ignore unrelated hunks (pre-existing changes not from this session) when determining type, scope, and description. If unrelated changes are in the same file as session changes, they are included in the commit scope but should not influence the commit message.\n  - Determine change type from behavior:\n    - New functionality -> `feat`\n    - Bug fix or error handling -> `fix`\n    - Code reorganization without behavior change -> `refactor`\n    - Documentation changes -> `docs`\n    - Test additions/changes -> `test`\n    - Build system (webpack, vite, esbuild configs) -> `build`\n    - CI/CD pipelines (.github/workflows, .gitlab-ci) -> `ci`\n    - Dependencies -> `chore(deps)`\n    - Formatting/whitespace only -> `style`\n    - Performance improvements -> `perf`\n    - Reverting previous commit -> `revert`\n    - Other maintenance -> `chore`\n    - AI config (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, .claude/, .gemini/, .codex/) -> `ai`\n  - Infer scope only when path makes it obvious (lowercase)\n  - Extract a specific description of what changed (not just which files)\n- If `--deep`:\n  - Deep semantic analysis; detect breaking changes\n  - Infer scope from code structure even when path isn''t clear\n  - Check for GitHub issues in the chat transcript\n  - Keep output concise\n\nConventional types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, build, ci, perf, revert, ai\n\n### 5) Compose message\n\n- Subject line (\\<= 50 chars): `type(scope): description` or `type: description`\n- Imperative mood (\"add\" not \"added\"), lowercase, no period\n- Describe what the change does, not which files changed\n- Default mode:\n  - Subject line required\n  - Body: hyphenated lines for distinct changes\n  - Skip body for trivial changes\n- If `--deep`:\n  - Body: 2-3 hyphenated lines max, focus on WHY\n  - Breaking change: `BREAKING CHANGE:` + one-line migration note\n  - GitHub issues: `Closes #123`\n\n### 6) Commit\n\n- Use `git commit -m \"subject\"` (add `-m \"body\"` only if body is non-empty)\n- Output: commit hash + subject + file count summary\n- If failed: show error + suggest fix\n\n### 7) Push (if `--push`)\n\n- If upstream exists: `git push`\n- If no upstream: `git push -u origin HEAD`\n- If failed: show error + suggest fix (pull/rebase first, set upstream, check auth)\n\n## Examples\n\nTrivial changes (subject only):\n\n```\nfix: correct typo in error message\nstyle: format config file\nchore(deps): bump lodash to 4.17.21\n```\n\nDefault (subject + brief body):\n\n```\nfeat(auth): add oauth2 login support\n\n- Add Google and GitHub OAuth providers\n- Integrate alongside existing password auth\n```\n\nDeep mode (concise, focused on WHY):\n\n```\nfeat(webhooks): add retry mechanism for failed deliveries\n\n- Prevent data loss when downstream services are temporarily unavailable\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:15:18.542Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing precise Git version control and commit management.","zh":"适合需要精确 Git 版本控制和提交管理的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが正確なGitバージョン管理とコミット管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"정확한 Git 버전 관리 및 커밋 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan un control de versión de Git preciso y una gestión de commits.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un contrôle de version Git précis et d''une gestion de commit.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine präzise Git-Versionskontrolle und eine Commit-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de controle de versão Git preciso e gerenciamento de commits.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется точный контроль версий Git и управление коммитами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى التحكم الدقيق في إصدار Git وإدارة التعليقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create atomic commits by staging files, analyzing staged diffs, composing conventional commit messages, and optionally pushing using Git protocols and commands like ''git rev-parse'' and ''git symbolic-ref''.","zh":"赋予代理创建原子提交的能力，通过暂存文件、分析暂存的差异、编写符合约定的提交消息，并可选择使用Git协议和命令（如''git rev-parse''和''git symbolic-ref''）进行推送。","ja":"エージェントがステージングされたファイルを分析し、通常のコミットメッセージを構成し、オプションでGitプロトコルおよびコマンド（''git rev-parse''および''git symbolic-ref''など）を使用してプッシュすることで、原子コミットを作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 파일을 스테이징하고 스테이징된 차이를 분석하고 규약에 맞는 커밋 메시지를 작성하고 선택적으로 Git 프로토콜 및 명령(''git rev-parse'' 및 ''git symbolic-ref'' 등)을 사용하여 푸시함으로써 원자 커밋을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear commits atómicos al organizar archivos, analizar diferencias organizadas, componer mensajes de commit convencionales y, opcionalmente, enviar usando protocolos y comandos de Git como ''git rev-parse'' y ''git symbolic-ref''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des commits atomiques en organisant des fichiers, en analysant des différences organisées, en composant des messages de commit conventionnels et, facultativement, en envoyant en utilisant des protocoles et des commandes Git comme ''git rev-parse'' et ''git symbolic-ref''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, atomare Commits zu erstellen, indem Dateien gestaged, analysierte Diffs analysiert, konventionelle Commit-Nachrichten komponiert und optional mithilfe von Git-Protokollen und -Befehlen wie ''git rev-parse'' und ''git symbolic-ref'' gesendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem commits atômicos ao organizar arquivos, analisar difs organizados, compor mensagens de commit convencionais e, opcionalmente, fazer push usando protocolos e comandos Git como ''git rev-parse'' e ''git symbolic-ref''.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать атомарные коммиты, организовывая файлы, анализируя организованные diff, составляя конвенциональные сообщения коммитов и, при необходимости, выполняя push с использованием протоколов и команд Git, таких как ''git rev-parse'' и ''git symbolic-ref''.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء تعليقات ذرية من خلال تنظيم الملفات وتحليل DIFFs المنظمة وكتابة رسائل تعليقات تقليدية اختياريًا باستخدام بروتوكولات وأوامر Git مثل ''git rev-parse'' و ''git symbolic-ref''"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Git commit workflows with pre-flight checks","Generating conventional commit messages for clear version history","Debugging Git repository states to prevent rebase/merge conflicts"],"zh":["使用预检自动化Git提交工作流程","生成符合约定的提交消息以获得明确的版本历史","调试Git存储库状态以防止变基/合并冲突"],"ja":["プレフライトチェックを使用してGitコミットワークフローを自動化する","明確なバージョン履歴を得るために通常のコミットメッセージを生成する","リベース/マージのコンフリクトを防ぐためにGitリポジトリの状態をデバッグする"],"ko":["예비 검사를 사용하여 Git 커밋 워크플로 자동화","명확한 버전 기록을 얻기 위해 규약에 맞는 커밋 메시지 생성","재배치/병합 충돌을 방지하기 위해 Git 저장소 상태 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de commit de Git con controles previos al vuelo","Generar mensajes de commit convencionales para una historia de versiones clara","Depurar estados de repositorio de Git para prevenir conflictos de rebase/merge"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de commit Git avec des contrôles pré-vols","Générer des messages de commit conventionnels pour une histoire de version claire","Déboguer les états de référentiel Git pour prévenir les conflits de rebase/merge"],"de":["Automatisierung von Git-Commit-Arbeitsabläufen mit Vorab-Checks","Generierung konventioneller Commit-Nachrichten für eine klare Versionsgeschichte","Fehlerbehebung von Git-Repository-Zuständen, um Rebase/Merge-Konflikte zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de commit Git com verificações de pré-voo","Gerar mensagens de commit convencionais para histórico de versão claro","Depurar estados de repositório Git para prevenir conflitos de rebase/merge"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы коммитов Git с предварительными проверками","Генерировать конвенциональные сообщения коммитов для ясной истории версий","Отладить состояния репозитория Git, чтобы предотвратить конфликты rebase/merge"],"ar":["تأتمتة سير عمل تعليقات Git مع التحقق المسبق","توليد رسائل تعليقات تقليدية لتسجيل إصدار واضح","تصحيح أخطاء حالات مستودع Git للوقاية من تحديد Conflicts / Merge"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git worktree and repository access","Needs to verify non-detached HEAD state","Must check for rebase/merge/cherry-pick states before committing"],"zh":["需要Git工作树和存储库访问","需要验证非分离HEAD状态","提交之前需要检查变基/合并/樱桃拾取状态"],"ja":["Gitワークツリーとリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","非分離HEAD状態の検証が必要","コミット前にリベース/マージ/チェリーピックの状態を確認する必要がある"],"ko":["Git 작업 트리 및 저장소 액세스가 필요","분리되지 않은 헤드 상태를 확인해야 함","커밋 전에 재배치/병합/체리 피킹 상태를 확인해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al área de trabajo y al repositorio de Git","Necesita verificar el estado de HEAD no desprendido","Debe verificar los estados de rebase/merge/cherry-pick antes de confirmar"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''arborescence de travail et au référentiel Git","Doit vérifier l''état de HEAD non détaché","Doit vérifier les états de rebase/merge/cherry-pick avant de confirmer"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Git-Arbeitsbereich und -Repository","Muss den nicht abgetrennten HEAD-Zustand überprüfen","Muss die Zustände von Rebase/Merge/Cherry-pick vor dem Commit überprüfen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao worktree e repositório Git","Precisa verificar o estado non-detached HEAD","Deve verificar os estados rebase/merge/cherry-pick antes de fazer commit"],"ru":["Требует доступа к worktree и репозиторию Git","Необходимо проверить состояние non-detached HEAD","Должно проверять состояния rebase/merge/cherry-pick перед коммитом"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى worktree ومستودع Git","يحتاج إلى التحقق من حالة non-detached HEAD","يجب التحقق من حالات rebase/merge/cherry-pick قبل التعليق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
