ت","أتمتة المهام","الذكاء الاصطناعي","ديف أوبس"]}},"owner":"PaulRBerg","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"PaulRBerg/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bump-deps","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update dependencies, update npm packages, bump dependencies, upgrade node packages, check for outdated packages, update package.json, or mentions dependency updates, npm/pnpm/yarn/bun package upgrades, or taze CLI usage.","bodyPreview":"# Bump Dependencies Skill\n\nUpdate Node.js dependencies using taze CLI with smart prompting: auto-apply MINOR/PATCH updates, prompt for MAJOR updates individually, skip fixed-version packages.\n\nWhen package names are provided as arguments (e.g. `/bump-deps react typescript`), scope all taze commands to only those packages using `--include`.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting, verify taze is installed by running:\n\n```bash\nscripts/run-taze.sh\n```\n\nIf exit code is 1, stop and inform the user that ta","body":"# Bump Dependencies Skill\n\nUpdate Node.js dependencies using taze CLI with smart prompting: auto-apply MINOR/PATCH updates, prompt for MAJOR updates individually, skip fixed-version packages.\n\nWhen package names are provided as arguments (e.g. `/bump-deps react typescript`), scope all taze commands to only those packages using `--include`.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting, verify taze is installed by running:\n\n```bash\nscripts/run-taze.sh\n```\n\nIf exit code is 1, stop and inform the user that taze must be installed:\n\n- Global install: `npm install -g taze`\n- One-time: `npx taze`\n\n## Update Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Scan for Updates\n\nRun the taze script to discover available updates. The script auto-detects monorepo projects (`workspaces` in package.json or `pnpm-workspace.yaml`) and enables recursive mode automatically.\n\n```bash\nscripts/run-taze.sh\n```\n\n### Step 2: Parse and Categorize Updates\n\nFrom the taze output, categorize each package update:\n\n| Category  | Version Change                              | Action        |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| **Fixed** | No `^` or `~` prefix (e.g., `\"1.0.0\"`)      | Skip entirely |\n| **PATCH** | `x.y.z` → `x.y.Z` (e.g., `1.0.0` → `1.0.1`) | Auto-apply    |\n| **MINOR** | `x.y.z` → `x.Y.0` (e.g., `1.0.0` → `1.1.0`) | Auto-apply    |\n| **MAJOR** | `x.y.z` → `X.0.0` (e.g., `1.0.0` → `2.0.0`) | Prompt user   |\n\nIf package arguments were provided, filter to only those packages.\n\n**Identifying fixed versions:** In package.json, fixed versions have no range prefix:\n\n- Fixed: `\"lodash\": \"4.17.21\"` → skip\n- Ranged: `\"lodash\": \"^4.17.21\"` → process\n\n### Step 3: Apply MINOR/PATCH Updates\n\nApply all non-major updates automatically without prompting:\n\n```bash\n# All packages\ntaze minor --write\n\n# Specific packages only (when args provided)\ntaze minor --write --include react,typescript\n```\n\nThe script auto-detects monorepo mode, but when running taze directly, detect it yourself: check for `workspaces` in package.json or `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and add `-r` if present.\n\nReport the packages that were updated.\n\n### Step 4: Prompt for MAJOR Updates\n\n**Auto-skip packages:** Never prompt for these packages—auto-apply their major updates:\n\n- `lucide-react` (icon library with frequent major bumps, backward-compatible in practice)\n\nFor each remaining package with a major update available, use `AskUserQuestion` to ask the user individually:\n\n```\nPackage: <package-name>\nCurrent: <current-version>\nAvailable: <new-version>\n\nUpdate to major version?\n```\n\n**Question format:**\n\n- header: Package name (max 12 chars, truncate if needed)\n- options: \"Yes, update\" / \"No, skip\"\n- multiSelect: false\n\nCollect all approved major updates.\n\n### Step 5: Apply Approved MAJOR Updates\n\nAfter collecting user approvals, apply the approved major updates:\n\n```bash\ntaze major --write --include <pkg1>,<pkg2>,<pkg3>\n```\n\nAdd `-r` if monorepo was detected.\n\n### Step 6: Update Bun Catalogs\n\nAfter applying all updates, check the **root** `package.json` for Bun workspace catalogs. Bun monorepos can centralize dependency versions using `catalog` and `catalogs` fields inside the `workspaces` object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workspaces\": {\n    \"packages\": [\"packages/*\"],\n    \"catalog\": {\n      \"react\": \"^19.0.0\"\n    },\n    \"catalogs\": {\n      \"testing\": {\n        \"jest\": \"^30.0.0\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWorkspace packages reference these with `\"react\": \"catalog:\"` (default catalog) or `\"jest\": \"catalog:testing\"` (named catalog).\n\n**Skip this step** if neither `workspaces.catalog` nor `workspaces.catalogs` exists in the root `package.json`.\n\nFor each package that was updated in Steps 3/5:\n\n1. Check if it appears in `workspaces.catalog` — if so, update the version there\n2. Check each named catalog in `workspaces.catalogs` — if the package appears, update the version there\n\nPreserve the existing range prefix (`^`, `~`, or none) from the catalog entry. For example, if the catalog has `\"react\": \"^19.0.0\"` and taze bumped react to `19.1.0`, update the catalog to `\"react\": \"^19.1.0\"`.\n\nUse `Edit` to apply the version changes directly to the root `package.json`.\n\n### Step 7: Install Dependencies\n\nAfter all updates are applied, remind the user to run their package manager''s install command:\n\n```bash\nnpm install\n# or\npnpm install\n# or\nbun install\n# or\nyarn install\n```\n\n## Taze Output Interpretation\n\nTaze displays updates grouped by type. Example output:\n\n```\n@types/node  ^20.0.0  →  ^22.0.0   (major)\ntypescript   ^5.3.0   →  ^5.4.0    (minor)\neslint       ^8.56.0  →  ^8.57.0   (patch)\n```\n\nThe rightmost column indicates update type (major/minor/patch).\n\nPackages shown with `--include-locked` that have no `^` or `~` are fixed versions—skip these entirely.\n\n## Script Reference\n\n| Script                | Purpose                                              |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `scripts/run-taze.sh` | Run taze in non-interactive mode, check installation |\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Fixed-version dependencies (no `^` or `~`) indicate intentional pinning—never modify these\n- MAJOR updates may contain breaking changes—always prompt the user\n- MINOR/PATCH updates are backward-compatible by semver convention—safe to auto-apply\n- The `--include` flag accepts comma-separated package names or regex patterns\n- Monorepo detection is automatic—no flag needed\n- Bun catalogs (`workspaces.catalog` / `workspaces.catalogs`) are the source of truth for workspace packages using the `catalog:` protocol—always update catalog entries alongside regular deps\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:16:00.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js Agents needing automated dependency updates with taze CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要使用taze CLI自动更新依赖的Node.js代理","ja":"taze CLIを使用して依存関係を自動更新する必要があるNode.jsエージェントに最適","ko":"taze CLI를 사용하여 의존성을 자동으로 업데이트해야 하는 Node.js 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Node.js que necesitan actualizaciones de dependencias automatizadas con taze CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js nécessitant des mises à jour de dépendances automatisées avec taze CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Node.js-Agents, die automatisierte Abhängigkeitsupdates mit taze CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js que precisam de atualizações de dependência automatizadas com o taze CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node.js, которым необходимы автоматические обновления зависимостей с помощью taze CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات تبعية آلية مع تاز CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to auto-apply MINOR/PATCH updates and prompt for MAJOR updates individually using smart prompting, while skipping fixed-version packages, all through the taze CLI with options like --include for scoped updates.","zh":"赋予代理自动应用MINOR/PATCH更新的能力，并使用智能提示个别提示MAJOR更新，同时跳过固定版本包，所有这些都通过taze CLI实现，带有诸如--include的选项，用于范围更新","ja":"エージェントにMINOR/PATCH更新を自動的に適用し、SMARTなプロンプトを使用してMAJOR更新を個別に提示する機能を提供し、固定バージョンのパッケージをスキップし、すべてtaze CLIで実行され、--includeなどのオプションを使用して更新の範囲を指定","ko":"에이전트가 MINOR/PATCH 업데이트를 자동으로 적용하고 스마트한 프롬프트를 사용하여 주요 업데이트를 개별적으로 프롬프트하는 기능을 제공하며, 고정 버전 패키지를 건너뛰고 모든 작업을 taze CLI에서 수행하며 --include와 같은 옵션을 사용하여 업데이트의 범위를 지정","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar automáticamente actualizaciones MENORES/CORRECCIONES y solicitar actualizaciones MAYORES individualmente mediante una llamada inteligente, mientras se omiten los paquetes de versión fija, todo a través de taze CLI con opciones como --include para actualizaciones de ámbito.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer automatiquement des mises à jour mineures/correctives et de demander des mises à jour majeures individuellement en utilisant une invite intelligente, tout en ignorant les packages de version fixe, le tout via taze CLI avec des options comme --include pour des mises à jour étendues.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, MINOR/PATCH-Updates automatisch anzuwenden und um MAJOR-Updates individuell mit intelligenter Aufforderung zu bitten, während Pakete mit fester Version übersprungen werden, alles über taze CLI mit Optionen wie --include für bereichsbezogene Updates.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar automaticamente atualizações MENORES/CORREÇÕES e solicitar atualizações MAIORES individualmente usando prompt inteligente, pulando pacotes com versão fixa, tudo por meio do taze CLI com opções como --include para atualizações de escopo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически применять ОБНОВЛЕНИЯ/ИСПРАВЛЕНИЯ и запрашивать отдельные ОБНОВЛЕНИЯ MAJOR с помощью умного приглашения, пропуская пакеты с фиксированной версией, все через taze CLI с опциями, такими как --include для обновлений в определенном объеме.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تطبيق تحديثات MINOR/PATCH آليًا وطلب تحديثات MAJOR بشكل فردي باستخدام التحفيز الذكي، مع تجاوز حزم الإصدار الثابت، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر taze مع خيارات مثل --include لتحديثات النطاق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Node.js dependency updates","Prompting for major version updates","Scoping updates to specific packages like react and typescript"],"zh":["自动更新Node.js依赖","提示进行主要版本更新","将更新范围限定为特定的包，如react和typescript"],"ja":["Node.jsの依存関係の自動更新","メジャー版の更新を提示","更新の範囲を特定のパッケージ（例：react、typescript）に限定"],"ko":["Node.js 의존성 자동 업데이트","메이저 버전 업데이트提示","업데이트 범위를 특정 패키지(예: react, typescript)로 범위 지정"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de dependencias de Node.js","Solicitud de actualizaciones de versión principal","Alcance de actualizaciones a paquetes específicos como react y typescript"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour des dépendances Node.js","Demande de mises à jour de version majeure","Étendue des mises à jour à des packages spécifiques tels que react et typescript"],"de":["Automatisierung von Node.js-Abhängigkeitsupdates","Anfrage von Major-Version-Updates","Bereichsbezogene Updates auf bestimmte Pakete wie react und typescript"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de dependência do Node.js","Solicitar atualizações de versão principal","Definir atualizações para pacotes específicos como react e typescript"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений зависимостей Node.js","Запрос обновлений основной версии","Ограничение обновлений для определенных пакетов, таких как react и typescript"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات التبعيات لعميل Node.js","طلب تحديثات الإصدار الرئيسي","تحديد التحديثات لحزم محددة مثل react و typescript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires taze installation","Node.js environment only","Dependent on scripts/run-taze.sh for verification"],"zh":["需要安装taze","仅限Node.js环境","需要依赖脚本/run-taze.sh进行验证"],"ja":["tazeのインストールが必要","Node.js環境のみ","スクリプト(run-taze.sh)が必要なバリデーションに依存"],"ko":["taze 설치가 필요","Node.js 환경만 해당","스크립트(run-taze.sh)에 의존하여 검증"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de taze","Entorno de Node.js solo","Dependiente de scripts/run-taze.sh para la verificación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de taze","Environnement Node.js uniquement","Dépend de scripts/run-taze.sh pour la vérification"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von taze","Node.js-Umgebung nur","Abhängig von scripts/run-taze.sh für die Überprüfung"],"pt":["Exige instalação do taze","Ambiente Node.js apenas","Dependente de scripts/run-taze.sh para verificação"],"ru":["Требует установки taze","Только среда Node.js","Зависит от scripts/run-taze.sh для проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت تاز","بيئة Node.js فقط","يعتمد على scripts/run-taze.sh للتحقق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
