lerbehandlung","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","claude code","Softwareentwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Ausnahmen","try-catch-Blöcke","benutzerfreundliche Fehlermeldungen"],"pt":["tratamento de erros globais","segurança de código","padrões de codificação","erros de programação","exceções personalizadas","blocos try-catch"],"ru":["глобальная обработка ошибок","безопасность кода","стандарты кодирования","ошибки программирования","пользовательские классы исключений","блоки try-catch"],"ar":["معالجة الأخطاء العالمية","أمان الكود","معايير البرمجة","أخطاء البرمجة","فئات استثناء مخصصة","كتل try-catch"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"global-error-handling","description":"Implement user-friendly error handling with specific exception types, centralized error handling, graceful degradation, and proper resource cleanup. Use this skill when implementing error handling in controllers, services, or API endpoints, when creating custom exception classes, when writing try-catch blocks, when handling external service failures, when implementing retry strategies, when displaying error messages to users, when cleaning up resources in finally blocks, or when implementing fail-fast validation and error detection.","bodyPreview":"# Global Error Handling\n\nThis Skill provides Claude Code with specific guidance on how to adhere to coding standards as they relate to how it should handle global error handling.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When implementing error handling in controllers, services, or API endpoints\n- When creating custom exception classes for specific error scenarios\n- When writing try-catch blocks for error handling\n- When providing user-friendly error messages without exposing technical details\n- When implem","body":"# Global Error Handling\n\nThis Skill provides Claude Code with specific guidance on how to adhere to coding standards as they relate to how it should handle global error handling.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When implementing error handling in controllers, services, or API endpoints\n- When creating custom exception classes for specific error scenarios\n- When writing try-catch blocks for error handling\n- When providing user-friendly error messages without exposing technical details\n- When implementing fail-fast validation and precondition checks\n- When handling errors at appropriate boundaries (controllers, API layers)\n- When implementing graceful degradation for non-critical service failures\n- When creating retry strategies with exponential backoff for external services\n- When cleaning up resources (file handles, database connections) in finally blocks\n- When centralizing error handling rather than scattering try-catch everywhere\n- When handling transient vs. permanent failures differently\n- When logging errors appropriately while protecting sensitive information\n\n## Instructions\n\nFor details, refer to the information provided in this file:\n[global error handling](../../../agent-os/standards/global/error-handling.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:17:06.063Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code-based Agents like Claude Code needing robust global error handling mechanisms.","zh":"非常适合基于代码的代理（如Claude Code），需要强大的全局错误处理机制。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなコードベースのエージェントに最適で、堅牢なグローバルエラー処理メカニズムを必要とします。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 코드 기반 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합하며, 강력한 글로벌 오류 처리 메커니즘이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en código como Claude Code que necesitan mecanismos de manejo de errores globales robustos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur le code comme Claude Code ayant besoin de mécanismes de gestion d''erreurs globaux robustes.","de":"Perfekt für codebasierte Agenten wie Claude Code, die robuste globale Fehlerbehandlungsmechanismen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes baseados em código, como Claude Code, que necessitam de mecanismos robustos de tratamento de erros globais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, основанных на коде, таких как Claude Code, требующих надежных глобальных механизмов обработки ошибок.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القائمين على الكود مثل كلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى آليات متينة لمعالجة الأخطاء على مستوى العالم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement try-catch blocks, create custom exception classes, and provide user-friendly error messages without exposing technical details, utilizing coding standards for controllers, services, and API endpoints.","zh":"使代理能够实现try-catch块、创建自定义异常类，并利用控制器、服务和API端点的编码标准提供用户友好的错误消息，而不会暴露技术细节。","ja":"コントローラー、サービス、APIエンドポイントのコーディング標準を利用して、技術的な詳細を公開することなく、try-catchブロックの実装、特定の例外クラスの作成、ユーザーフレンドリーなエラーメッセージの提供をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"컨트롤러, 서비스 및 API 엔드포인트에 대한 코딩 표준을 활용하여 기술적 세부 사항을 노출하지 않으면서 사용자 친화적인 오류 메시지를 제공하고, try-catch 블록을 구현하며, 사용자 정의 예외 클래스를 생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar bloques try-catch, crear clases de excepción personalizadas y proporcionar mensajes de error de fácil uso sin exponer detalles técnicos, utilizando estándares de codificación para controladores, servicios y puntos de conexión de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des blocs try-catch, de créer des classes d''exceptions personnalisées et de fournir des messages d''erreur conviviaux sans exposer des détails techniques, en utilisant des normes de codage pour les contrôleurs, les services et les points de terminaison d''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, try-catch-Blöcke zu implementieren, benutzerdefinierte Ausnahmeklassen zu erstellen und benutzerfreundliche Fehlermeldungen bereitzustellen, ohne technische Details offenzulegen, unter Verwendung von Codierungsstandards für Controller, Dienste und API-Endpunkte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar blocos try-catch, criar classes de exceção personalizadas e fornecer mensagens de erro amigáveis ao usuário sem expor detalhes técnicos, utilizando padrões de codificação para controladores, serviços e pontos de extremidade de API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать блоки try-catch, создавать пользовательские классы исключений и предоставлять пользовательские сообщения об ошибках без раскрытия технических деталей, используя стандарты кодирования для контроллеров, служб и конечных точек API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ كتل try-catch وإنشاء فئات استثناء مخصصة وتقديم رسائل خطأ thânية للمستخدم دون الكشف عن التفاصيل الفنية، باستخدام معايير الترميز للتحكمات والخدمات ونقاط النهاية API."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing error handling in controllers and services","Creating custom exception classes for specific error scenarios","Writing robust try-catch blocks for error handling in API endpoints","Providing user-friendly error messages without exposing sensitive technical details"],"zh":["在控制器和服务中实现错误处理","为特定错误场景创建自定义异常类","为API端点中的错误处理编写健壮的try-catch块","提供用户友好的错误消息而不暴露敏感技术细节"],"ja":["コントローラーとサービスでのエラー処理の実装","特定のエラーシナリオに対するカスタム例外クラスの作成","APIエンドポイントでのエラー処理のための堅牢なtry-catchブロックの記述","機密性の高い技術的詳細を公開せずにユーザーフレンドリーなエラーメッセージを提供"],"ko":["컨트롤러 및 서비스에서 오류 처리 구현","특정 오류 시나리오에 대한 사용자 정의 예외 클래스 생성","API 엔드포인트에서 오류 처리를 위한 강력한 try-catch 블록 작성","민감한 기술적 세부 사항을 노출하지 않으면서 사용자 친화적인 오류 메시지 제공"],"es":["Implementar el manejo de errores en controladores y servicios","Crear clases de excepción personalizadas para escenarios de error específicos","Escribir bloques try-catch robustos para el manejo de errores en puntos de conexión de API","Proporcionar mensajes de error de fácil uso sin exponer detalles técnicos sensibles"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la gestion des erreurs dans les contrôleurs et les services","Créer des classes d''exceptions personnalisées pour des scénarios d''erreur spécifiques","Écrire des blocs try-catch robustes pour la gestion des erreurs dans les points de terminaison d''API","Fournir des messages d''erreur conviviaux sans exposer des détails techniques sensibles"],"de":["Implementierung der Fehlerbehandlung in Controllern und Diensten","Erstell