des modèles réactifs en utilisant RxJS dans des applications Angular, améliorant la sécurité et l''efficacité","de":"Dieses Skill hilft bei der Implementierung reaktiver Muster mit RxJS in Angular-Anwendungen, um die Sicherheit und Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"Este skill ajuda a implementar padrões reativos usando RxJS em aplicações Angular, melhorando a eficiência e segurança","ru":"Этот навык помогает реализовать реактивные шаблоны с помощью RxJS в приложениях Angular, повышая эффективность и безопасность","ar":"هذا المهارة يساعد في تنفيذ أنماط تفاعلية باستخدام RxJS في تطبيقات Angular، مما يحسن الكفاءة والأمان","en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"definition":{"en":"Security-audited skills for Claude, Codex & Claude Code. One-click install, quality verified."},"features":{"zh":["Signals First","Auto Cleanup","Interop","AsyncPipe","RxJS","Angular"],"ja":["Signals First","Auto Cleanup","Interop","AsyncPipe","RxJS","Angular"],"ko":["Signals First","Auto Cleanup","Interop","AsyncPipe","RxJS","Angular"],"es":["Signals First para estado","Auto Cleanup con takeUntilDestroyed()","Interop con toSignal() y toObservable()","AsyncPipe para templates","Seguridad auditada"],"fr":["Signals First pour l''état","Auto Cleanup avec takeUntilDestroyed()","Interop avec toSignal() et toObservable()","AsyncPipe pour les modèles","Sécurité auditée"],"de":["Signals First für Zustand","Auto Cleanup mit takeUntilDestroyed()","Interop mit toSignal() und toObservable()","AsyncPipe für Vorlagen","Sicherheitsüberprüfung"],"pt":["Signals First para estado","Auto Cleanup para gerenciamento de assinaturas","Interop para conversão entre Signals e Observables","AsyncPipe para templates","Padrões reativos para operações assíncronas","Melhoria da eficiência e segurança"],"ru":["Signals First для состояния","Auto Cleanup для управления подписками","Interop для конвертации между Signals и Observables","AsyncPipe для шаблонов","Реактивные шаблоны для асинхронных операций","Повышение эффективности и безопасности"],"ar":["Signals First للوضع","Auto Cleanup لإدارة التسجيلات","Interop لتحويل الإشارات والملاحظات","AsyncPipe للقوالب","نماذج تفاعلية للعمليات غير المتزامنة","تحسين الكفاءة والأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular RxJS","RxJS","Angular","Reactive Programming","Signals","Observables","Async Operations"],"ja":["Angular RxJS","RxJS","Angular","Reactive Programming","Signals","Observables","Async Operations"],"ko":["Angular RxJS","RxJS","Angular","Reactive Programming","Signals","Observables","Async Operations"],"es":["RxJS","Angular","patrones reactivos","programación reactiva","seguridad","eficiencia"," Signals First","Auto Cleanup","Interop"],"fr":["RxJS","Angular","modèles réactifs","programmation réactive","sécurité","efficacité","Signals First","Auto Cleanup","Interop"],"de":["RxJS","Angular","reaktive Muster","reaktive Programmierung","Sicherheit","Effizienz","Signals First","Auto Cleanup","Interop"],"pt":["RxJS","Angular","Padrões reativos","Signals","Observables","AsyncPipe","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Eficiência","Segurança"],"ru":["RxJS","Angular","Реактивные шаблоны","Signals","Observables","AsyncPipe","Разработка приложений","Эффективность","Безопасность"],"ar":["RxJS","Angular","نماذج تفاعلية","الإشارات","الملاحظات","AsyncPipe","تطوير التطبيقات","الكفاءة","الأمان"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rxjs-patterns-for-angular","description":"Implement RxJS patterns for reactive programming in Angular. Use this skill when working with Observables, operators, subscriptions, async data flows, and error handling. Covers common patterns like combineLatest, switchMap, debounceTime, catchError, retry logic, and integration with Angular Signals using toSignal() and toObservable(). Ensures proper subscription cleanup with takeUntilDestroyed().","bodyPreview":"# RxJS Patterns for Angular Skill\n\nThis skill helps implement reactive patterns using RxJS in Angular applications.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Modern Angular + RxJS\n- **Signals First**: Use Signals for state, RxJS for async operations\n- **Auto Cleanup**: Use `takeUntilDestroyed()` for subscription management\n- **Interop**: Use `toSignal()` and `toObservable()` for Signal/Observable conversion\n- **AsyncPipe**: Prefer AsyncPipe in templates when not using Signals\n\n### Key Concepts\n- Observables for","body":"# RxJS Patterns for Angular Skill\n\nThis skill helps implement reactive patterns using RxJS in Angular applications.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Modern Angular + RxJS\n- **Signals First**: Use Signals for state, RxJS for async operations\n- **Auto Cleanup**: Use `takeUntilDestroyed()` for subscription management\n- **Interop**: Use `toSignal()` and `toObservable()` for Signal/Observable conversion\n- **AsyncPipe**: Prefer AsyncPipe in templates when not using Signals\n\n### Key Concepts\n- Observables for async data streams\n- Operators for data transformation\n- Subscription management and cleanup\n- Error handling and retry logic\n\n## Signal + RxJS Integration\n\n### toSignal() - Observable to Signal\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { toSignal } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { HttpClient } from ''@angular/common/http'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-task-list'',\n  template: `\n    @if (tasks(); as taskList) {\n      @for (task of taskList; track task.id) {\n        <div>{{ task.title }}</div>\n      }\n    }\n  `\n})\nexport class TaskListComponent {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  \n  // Convert Observable to Signal\n  tasks = toSignal(\n    this.http.get<Task[]>(''/api/tasks''),\n    { initialValue: [] }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### toObservable() - Signal to Observable\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, signal } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { toObservable } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { switchMap } from ''rxjs/operators'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-search'',\n  template: `\n    <input \n      nz-input \n      [ngModel]=\"searchQuery()\" \n      (ngModelChange)=\"searchQuery.set($event)\" \n    />\n    \n    @if (results(); as resultList) {\n      @for (result of resultList; track result.id) {\n        <div>{{ result.name }}</div>\n      }\n    }\n  `\n})\nexport class SearchComponent {\n  searchQuery = signal('''');\n  \n  // Convert Signal to Observable and transform\n  private searchQuery$ = toObservable(this.searchQuery);\n  \n  results = toSignal(\n    this.searchQuery$.pipe(\n      debounceTime(300),\n      distinctUntilChanged(),\n      switchMap(query => this.searchService.search(query))\n    ),\n    { initialValue: [] }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Subscription Management\n\n### takeUntilDestroyed() - Auto Cleanup\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component, inject, signal, DestroyRef } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { takeUntilDestroyed } from ''@angular/core/rxjs-interop'';\nimport { interval } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-timer'',\n  template: `<div>Time: {{ time() }}</div>`\n})\nexport class TimerComponent {\n  private destroyRef = inject(DestroyRef);\n  time = signal(0);\n  \n  constructor() {\n    // Subscription automatically cleaned up on component destroy\n    interval(1000)\n      .pipe(takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef))\n      .subscribe(value => this.time.set(value));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Manual Cleanup (Legacy Pattern - Avoid)\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ DON''T: Manual subscription management (old pattern)\nexport class LegacyComponent implements OnDestroy {\n  private subscription = new Subscription();\n  \n  ngOnInit() {\n    this.subscription.add(\n      this.dataService.getData().subscribe(data => {\n        // handle data\n      })\n    );\n  }\n  \n  ngOnDestroy() {\n    this.subscription.unsubscribe();\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ DO: Use takeUntilDestroyed()\nexport class ModernComponent {\n  private destroyRef = inject(DestroyRef);\n  data = signal<any>(null);\n  \n  constructor() {\n    this.dataService.getData()\n      .pipe(takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef))\n      .subscribe(data => this.data.set(data));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Operators\n\n### switchMap - Switch to New Observable\n\n```typescript\n// Switch to new search on every query change\nsearchResults$ = this.searchQuery$.pipe(\n  debounceTime(300),\n  switchMap(query => this.http.get(`/api/search?q=${query}`))\n);\n```\n\n### mergeMap - Merge Multiple Observables\n\n```typescript\n// Process all tasks in parallel\nprocessTasks$ = this.tasks$.pipe(\n  mergeMap(tasks => \n    from(tasks).pipe(\n      mergeMap(task => this.processTask(task))\n    )\n  )\n);\n```\n\n### concatMap - Process Sequentially\n\n```typescript\n// Process tasks one by one in order\nprocessTasks$ = this.tasks$.pipe(\n  concatMap(tasks =>\n    from(tasks).pipe(\n      concatMap(task => this.processTask(task))\n    )\n  )\n);\n```\n\n### debounceTime - Debounce Input\n\n```typescript\n// Wait 300ms after user stops typing\nsearch$ = this.searchInput$.pipe(\n  debounceTime(300),\n  distinctUntilChanged(),\n  switchMap(query => this.searchService.search(query))\n);\n```\n\n### distinctUntilChanged - Skip Duplicates\n\n```typescript\n// Only emit when value actually changes\nstatus$ = this.statusSubject$.pipe(\n  distinctUntilChanged()\n);\n```\n\n### filter - Filter Values\n\n```typescript\n// Only emit non-empty strings\nnonEmptySearch$ = this.searchQuery$.pipe(\n  filter(query => query.trim().length > 0),\n  switchMap(query => this.search(query))\n);\n```\n\n### map - Transform Values\n\n```typescript\n// Transform task to display format\ntaskDisplay$ = this.task$.pipe(\n  map(task => ({\n    title: task.title,\n    status: task.status.toUpperCase(),\n    dueDate: formatDate(task.dueDate)\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n### tap - Side Effects\n\n```typescript\n// Log without transforming\ntasks$ = this.http.get<Task[]>(''/api/tasks'').pipe(\n  tap(tasks => console.log(''Loaded tasks:'', tasks.length)),\n  tap(tasks => this.analyticsService.track(''tasks_loaded''))\n);\n```\n\n## Combining Observables\n\n### combineLatest - Wait for All\n\n```typescript\nimport { combineLatest } from ''rxjs'';\n\n// Combine multiple observables\nviewModel$ = combineLatest([\n  this.tasks$,\n  this.users$,\n  this.settings$\n]).pipe(\n  map(([tasks, users, settings]) => ({\n    tasks,\n    users,\n    settings\n  }))\n);\n\n// Convert to Signal\nviewModel = toSignal(this.viewModel$);\n```\n\n### forkJoin - Wait for All to Complete\n\n```typescript\nimport { forkJoin } from ''rxjs'';\n\n// Load multiple resources in parallel\nloadAll$ = forkJoin({\n  tasks: this.taskService.getTasks(),\n  users: this.userService.getUsers(),\n  projects: this.projectService.getProjects()\n}).pipe(\n  map(({ tasks, users, projects }) => ({\n    tasks,\n    users,\n    projects\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n### merge - Merge Multiple Streams\n\n```typescript\nimport { merge } from ''rxjs'';\n\n// Combine multiple event streams\nallEvents$ = merge(\n  this.createEvent$,\n  this.updateEvent$,\n  this.deleteEvent$\n).pipe(\n  tap(event => this.handleEvent(event))\n);\n```\n\n### zip - Pair Up Values\n\n```typescript\nimport { zip } from ''rxjs'';\n\n// Pair up matching values from two streams\npaired$ = zip(\n  this.stream1$,\n  this.stream2$\n).pipe(\n  map(([value1, value2]) => ({ value1, value2 }))\n);\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### catchError - Handle Errors\n\n```typescript\ntasks$ = this.http.get<Task[]>(''/api/tasks'').pipe(\n  catchError(error => {\n    console.error(''Failed to load tasks:'', error);\n    this.notificationService.error(''Failed to load tasks'');\n    return of([]); // Return empty array as fallback\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### retry - Retry on Failure\n\n```typescript\ntasks$ = this.http.get<Task[]>(''/api/tasks'').pipe(\n  retry(3), // Retry up to 3 times\n  catchError(error => {\n    console.error(''Failed after 3 retries:'', error);\n    return of([]);\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### retryWhen - Conditional Retry with Backoff\n\n```typescript\nimport { retryWhen, delay, scan, throwError } from ''rxjs'';\n\ntasks$ = this.http.get<Task[]>(''/api/tasks'').pipe(\n  retryWhen(errors =>\n    errors.pipe(\n      scan((retryCount, error) => {\n        if (retryCount >= 3) {\n          throw error; // Max retries reached\n        }\n        console.log(`Retry ${retryCount + 1}/3`);\n        return retryCount + 1;\n      }, 0),\n      delay(1000) // Wait 1 second between retries\n    )\n  ),\n  catchError(error => {\n    console.error(''Failed after retries:'', error);\n    return of([]);\n  })\n);\n```\n\n## Real-Time Data\n\n### interval - Periodic Updates\n\n```typescript\nimport { interval, switchMap } from ''rxjs'';\n\n// Poll every 30 seconds\nliveData$ = interval(30000).pipe(\n  startWith(0), // Emit immediately\n  switchMap(() => this.http.get(''/api/live-data'')),\n  takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef)\n);\n\nliveData = toSignal(this.liveData$);\n```\n\n### WebSocket Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport { webSocket } from ''rxjs/webSocket'';\n\nexport class RealtimeService {\n  private socket$ = webSocket(''wss://api.example.com/ws'');\n  \n  messages$ = this.socket$.pipe(\n    catchError(error => {\n      console.error(''WebSocket error:'', error);\n      return EMPTY;\n    }),\n    retry({ delay: 5000 }) // Reconnect after 5 seconds\n  );\n  \n  sendMessage(msg: any): void {\n    this.socket$.next(msg);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Loading States\n\n### Share Loading State\n\n```typescript\nimport { shareReplay } from ''rxjs'';\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class TaskService {\n  private http = inject(HttpClient);\n  \n  // Cache and share the result\n  tasks$ = this.http.get<Task[]>(''/api/tasks'').pipe(\n    shareReplay({ bufferSize: 1, refCount: true })\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Loading Indicator Pattern\n\n```typescript\n@Component({\n  selector: ''app-task-list'',\n  template: `\n    @if (loading()) {\n      <nz-spin />\n    } @else if (error()) {\n      <nz-alert nzType=\"error\" [nzMessage]=\"error()!\" />\n    } @else {\n      @for (task of tasks(); track task.id) {\n        <div>{{ task.title }}</div>\n      }\n    }\n  `\n})\nexport class TaskListComponent {\n  private taskService = inject(TaskService);\n  private destroyRef = inject(DestroyRef);\n  \n  loading = signal(false);\n  error = signal<string | null>(null);\n  tasks = signal<Task[]>([]);\n  \n  constructor() {\n    this.loadTasks();\n  }\n  \n  loadTasks(): void {\n    this.loading.set(true);\n    this.error.set(null);\n    \n    this.taskService.tasks$\n      .pipe(takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef))\n      .subscribe({\n        next: (tasks) => {\n          this.tasks.set(tasks);\n          this.loading.set(false);\n        },\n        error: (err) => {\n          this.error.set(err.message || ''Failed to load tasks'');\n          this.loading.set(false);\n        }\n      });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Throttle vs Debounce\n\n```typescript\nimport { throttleTime, debounceTime } from ''rxjs'';\n\n// Throttle: Emit first, then ignore for duration\nthrottled$ = this.clicks$.pipe(\n  throttleTime(1000) // Max once per second\n);\n\n// Debounce: Wait for quiet period\ndebounced$ = this.input$.pipe(\n  debounceTime(300) // Wait 300ms after last input\n);\n```\n\n### Scan - Accumulate Values\n\n```typescript\n// Running total\ntotal$ = this.amounts$.pipe(\n  scan((acc, value) => acc + value, 0)\n);\n\n// History accumulation\nhistory$ = this.events$.pipe(\n  scan((history, event) => [...history, event], [] as Event[])\n);\n```\n\n### startWith - Initial Value\n\n```typescript\n// Start with loading state\nstatus$ = this.dataLoad$.pipe(\n  map(() => ''loaded''),\n  startWith(''loading'')\n);\n```\n\n### pairwise - Previous + Current\n\n```typescript\n// Compare with previous value\nchanges$ = this.value$.pipe(\n  pairwise(),\n  map(([prev, curr]) => ({\n    previous: prev,\n    current: curr,\n    diff: curr - prev\n  }))\n);\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n\n```typescript\n// Use toSignal() for reactive data in templates\ndata = toSignal(this.data$, { initialValue: [] });\n\n// Use takeUntilDestroyed() for cleanup\nthis.data$.pipe(takeUntilDestroyed(this.destroyRef)).subscribe();\n\n// Use switchMap for user-triggered requests\nsearch$ = this.query$.pipe(switchMap(q => this.search(q)));\n\n// Handle errors explicitly\ndata$ = this.http.get(''/api/data'').pipe(\n  catchError(err => of(null))\n);\n```\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n\n```typescript\n// Don''t forget to unsubscribe\nthis.data$.subscribe(); // Memory leak!\n\n// Don''t use nested subscribes\nthis.data$.subscribe(data => {\n  this.process(data).subscribe(); // Anti-pattern!\n});\n\n// Don''t use async pipe with signals\n@if (data$ | async) { } // Use signals instead\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\nWhen using RxJS:\n\n- [ ] Use toSignal() to convert Observables to Signals\n- [ ] Use takeUntilDestroyed() for subscription cleanup\n- [ ] Handle errors with catchError()\n- [ ] Debounce user input (300ms)\n- [ ] Use switchMap for cancellable requests\n- [ ] Share expensive Observables with shareReplay()\n- [ ] Provide initial values with startWith()\n- [ ] Filter out empty/null values\n- [ ] Test async operations\n- [ ] Document complex operator chains\n\n## References\n\n- [RxJS Documentation](https://rxjs.dev/)\n- [Angular Signals + RxJS Interop](https://angular.dev/guide/signals/rxjs-interop)\n- [RxJS Operators](https://rxjs.dev/guide/operators)\n- [Learn RxJS](https://www.learnrxjs.io/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:18:14.241Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced reactive pattern implementation in Angular applications using RxJS.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Angular 应用中使用 RxJS 实现高级响应式模式的前端代理。","ja":"Angular アプリケーションで RxJS を使用して高度なリアクティブ パターンを実装する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular 애플리케이션에서 RxJS를 사용하여 고급 반응형 패턴을 구현해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una implementación avanzada de patrones reactivos en aplicaciones Angular utilizando RxJS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée de modèles réactifs dans les applications Angular en utilisant RxJS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Implementierung von reaktiven Mustern in Angular-Anwendungen unter Verwendung von RxJS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de implementação de padrões reativos avançados em aplicações Angular usando RxJS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов фронтенда, которым требуется продвинутая реализация реактивных шаблонов в приложениях Angular с использованием RxJS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ نمط استجابة متقدم في تطبيقات Angular باستخدام RxJS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement reactive patterns using RxJS in Angular applications, providing features like Signals for state management, auto cleanup with takeUntilDestroyed(), and interop between Signals and Observables using toSignal() and toObservable(), all while preferring AsyncPipe in templates for seamless async operation handling.","zh":"赋予代理实现 Angular 应用中使用 RxJS 的响应式模式的能力，提供诸如 Signals 用于状态管理、使用 takeUntilDestroyed() 实现自动清理，以及使用 toSignal() 和 toObservable() 实现 Signals 和 Observables 之间的互操作等功能，同时在模板中更倾向于使用 AsyncPipe 处理无缝异步操作。","ja":"Angular アプリケーションで RxJS を使用したリアクティブ パターンの実装をエージェントに可能にする機能を提供します。状態管理用のシグナル、takeUntilDestroyed() による自動クリーンアップ、toSignal() と toObservable() によるシグナルとオブザーバブルの相互運用などを提供し、テンプレートでは AsyncPipe を優先してシームレスな非同期操作の処理を行います。","ko":"에이전트가 Angular 애플리케이션에서 RxJS를 사용하여 반응형 패턴을 구현할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 상태 관리를 위한 신호, takeUntilDestroyed()를 통한 자동 정리, toSignal() 및 toObservable()를 통한 신호 및 옵저버블 간의 상호 운용성 등을 제공하며, 템플릿에서는 AsyncPipe를 선호하여 비동기 작업 처리를 원활하게 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar patrones reactivos utilizando RxJS en aplicaciones Angular, proporcionando características como Señales para la gestión de estado, limpieza automática con takeUntilDestroyed() e interoperabilidad entre Señales y Observables utilizando toSignal() y toObservable(), todo mientras prefiere AsyncPipe en plantillas para el manejo de operaciones asíncronas sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des modèles réactifs en utilisant RxJS dans les applications Angular, en fournissant des fonctionnalités telles que des signaux pour la gestion d''état, un nettoyage automatique avec takeUntilDestroyed() et une interopérabilité entre signaux et observables en utilisant toSignal() et toObservable(), le tout en préférant AsyncPipe dans les modèles pour un traitement d''opérations asynchrones sans problème.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, reaktive Muster mit RxJS in Angular-Anwendungen umzusetzen, wobei Funktionen wie Signale für die Zustandsverwaltung, automatische Bereinigung mit takeUntilDestroyed() und Interoperabilität zwischen Signalen und Observables mit toSignal() und toObservable() bereitgestellt werden, und zwar bevorzugt mit AsyncPipe in Vorlagen für eine nahtlose asynchrone Operationenverarbeitung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar padrões reativos usando RxJS em aplicações Angular, fornecendo recursos como Sinais para gerenciamento de estado, limpeza automática com takeUntilDestroyed() e interoperabilidade entre Sinais e Observáveis usando toSignal() e toObservable(), tudo isso preferindo AsyncPipe em modelos para tratamento de operações assíncronas sem problemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать реактивные шаблоны с использованием RxJS в приложениях Angular, предоставляя функции, такие как Сигналы для управления состоянием, автоматическая очистка с takeUntilDestroyed() и взаимодействие между Сигналами и Observables с помощью toSignal() и toObservable(), все это при предпочтении AsyncPipe в шаблонах для бесшовного xử lý асинхронных операций.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ أنماط استجابة باستخدام RxJS في تطبيقات Angular، مما يوفر ميزات مثل الإشارات لإدارة الحالة، وتنظيف التلقائي مع takeUntilDestroyed()، والتعامل بين الإشارات والمشاهدات باستخدام toSignal() و toObservable()، وكل ذلك مع تفضيل AsyncPipe في القوالب لمعالجة العمليات المتزامنة بشكل سلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing reactive state management in Angular components using Signals","Automating subscription cleanup with takeUntilDestroyed() for memory leak prevention","Converting between Signals and Observables for interoperability in complex applications"],"zh":["在 Angular 组件中使用 Signals 实现响应式状态管理","使用 takeUntilDestroyed() 自动清理订阅以防止内存泄漏","在复杂应用中使用 toSignal() 和 toObservable() 将 Signals 和 Observables 转换为互操作"],"ja":["Angular コンポーネントでシグナルを使用したリアクティブ状態管理の実装","takeUntilDestroyed() を使用したサブスクライブの自動クリーンアップによるメモリーリークの防止","toSignal() と toObservable() を使用したシグナルとオブザーバブルの相互運用の実装"],"ko":["Angular 컴포넌트에서 신호를 사용하여 반응형 상태 관리 구현","takeUntilDestroyed()를 사용하여 구독 자동 정리 및 메모리 누수 방지","toSignal() 및 toObservable()를 사용하여 신호 및 옵저버블 간의 상호 운용성 구현"],"es":["Implementación de la gestión de estado reactivo en componentes de Angular mediante Señales","Automatización de la limpieza de suscripciones con takeUntilDestroyed() para la prevención de fugas de memoria","Conversión entre Señales y Observables para la interoperabilidad en aplicaciones complejas"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de la gestion d''état réactive dans les composants Angular à l''aide de signaux","Automatisation du nettoyage des abonnements avec takeUntilDestroyed() pour la prévention des fuites de mémoire","Conversion entre signaux et observables pour l''interopérabilité dans les applications complexes"],"de":["Implementierung der reaktiven Zustandsverwaltung in Angular-Komponenten mit Hilfe von Signalen","Automatisierung der Bereinigung von Abonnements mit takeUntilDestroyed() zur Verhinderung von Speichermengenlecks","Umwandlung zwischen Signalen und Observables zur Interoperabilität in komplexen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de gerenciamento de estado reativo em componentes Angular usando Sinais","Automatização da limpeza de assinaturas com takeUntilDestroyed() para prevenção de vazamento de memória","Conversão entre Sinais e Observáveis para interoperabilidade em aplicações complexas"],"ru":["Реализация реактивного управления состоянием в компонентах Angular с использованием Сигналов","Автоматизация очистки подписок с takeUntilDestroyed() для предотвращения утечки памяти","Преобразование между Сигналами и Observables для взаимодействия в сложных приложениях"],"ar":["تنفيذ إدارة الحالة الاستجابة في مكونات Angular باستخدام الإشارات","تutomatización تنظيف الاشتراكات مع takeUntilDestroyed() لمنع تسرب الذاكرة","تحويل بين الإشارات والمشاهدات لتحقيق التفاعل في التطبيقات المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular and RxJS setup in the project","Limited to Angular applications, not compatible with other frontend frameworks"],"zh":["需要在项目中设置 Angular 和 RxJS","仅限 Angular 应用，不兼容其他前端框架"],"ja":["プロジェクトに Angular と RxJS を設定する必要がある","Angular アプリケーションに限定され、他のフロントエンド フレームワークと互換性がない"],"ko":["프로젝트에 Angular 및 RxJS를 설정해야 함","Angular 애플리케이션에 제한되며, 다른 프론트엔드 프레임워크와 호환되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de Angular y RxJS en el proyecto","Limitado a aplicaciones Angular, no compatible con otros marcos de trabajo de frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''Angular et de RxJS dans le projet","Limité aux applications Angular, non compatible avec d''autres cadres de travail de frontend"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung von Angular und RxJS im Projekt","Begrenzt auf Angular-Anwendungen, nicht kompatibel mit anderen Frontend-Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Angular e RxJS no projeto","Limitado a aplicações Angular, não compatível com outros frameworks de frontend"],"ru":["Требует настройки Angular и RxJS в проекте","Ограничен приложениями Angular, не совместим с другими фронтенд-фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Angular و RxJS في المشروع","محدود بتطبيقات Angular، غير متوافق مع إطارات واجهة المستخدم الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
