を向上させる","ko":"맞춤형 이력서 생성기는 개발자가 특정 직무에 맞는 이력서를 작성하는 것을 도와주어 취업 성공률을 높입니다","es":"El generador de CV personalizado analiza descripciones de trabajo y resume tus habilidades para aumentar tus posibilidades de ser contratado.","fr":"Le générateur de CV sur mesure analyse les descriptions de travail et résume vos compétences pour augmenter vos chances d''être embauché.","de":"Der individuelle Lebenslauf-Generator analysiert Stellenbeschreibungen und fasst Ihre Fähigkeiten zusammen, um Ihre Chancen auf eine Einstellung zu erhöhen.","pt":"O gerador de currículos personalizados ajuda a criar currículos otimizados para vagas específicas","ru":"Индивидуальный генератор резюме помогает создать оптимальное резюме для конкретной вакансии","ar":"مُولِد السِيرَة الذَاتِيَّة المُحَسَّن يُسَاعَد في إنشَاء سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة مُحَسَّنَة لِلْوَظَائِف المحددة","en":"Run, deploy and monitor CLI agents in secure cloud sandboxes. "},"definition":{"en":"Run, deploy and monitor CLI agents in secure cloud sandboxes. "},"features":{"zh":["分析工作描述","提取关键要求","创建多个简历版本","优化简历以通过ATS","突出相关经验","强调特定技能"],"ja":["仕事の説明を分析","重要な要件を抽出","複数の履歴書バージョンを作成","履歴書をATSに最適化","関連する経験を強調","特定のスキルを強調"],"ko":["작업 설명 분석","핵심 요구사항 추출","다중 이력서 버전 생성","이력서를 ATS에 최적화","관련 경험 강조","특정 기술 강조"],"es":["Análisis de descripciones de trabajo","Resumen de habilidades y competencias","Creación de CV personalizados","Optimización para sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes","Creación de múltiples versiones de CV"],"fr":["Analyse des descriptions de travail","Résumé des compétences et qualifications","Création de CV sur mesure","Optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","Création de plusieurs versions de CV"],"de":["Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Zusammenfassung von Fähigkeiten und Qualifikationen","Erstellung individueller Lebensläufe","Optimierung für Bewerberverfolgungssysteme","Erstellung mehrerer Lebenslaufversionen"],"pt":["Análise de descrições de vagas","Extração de requisitos e habilidades","Otimização para sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","Criação de múltiplas versões de currículos","Destaque de experiências relevantes"],"ru":["Анализ описаний вакансий","Извлечение требований и навыков","Оптимизация для систем отслеживания кандидатов","Создание нескольких версий резюме","Подчеркивание соответствующего опыта"],"ar":["تَحْلِيل وَصْف الْوَظَائِف","اسْتِخْرَاج الْمُتَطَلِّبَات وَالمَهَارَات","تَحْسِين لِنُظُم تَعَقُب المُرَشِّحِين","إنشَاء مُتَعَدِّدَة مِن إصْدَار السِيرَة الذَاتِيَّة","تَأْكِيد الْخَبَرَات المُتَفَاقَة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["个性化简历生成","简历优化","ATS通过率","工作申请","简历生成工具","开发者工具","职场技能","简历创建","工作搜索"],"ja":["カスタムResume生成","履歴書最適化","ATS通過率","仕事申し込み","履歴書生成ツール","開発者ツール","職場スキル","履歴書作成","仕事検索"],"ko":["맞춤형 이력서 생성","이력서 최적화","ATS 통과율","직업 신청","이력서 생성 도구","개발자 도구","직장 기술","이력서 작성","직업 검색"],"es":["generador de CV","CV personalizado","análisis de descripciones de trabajo","optimización para ATS","creación de CV","currículum vitae"],"fr":["générateur de CV","CV sur mesure","analyse des descriptions de travail","optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures","création de CV","curriculum vitae"],"de":["Lebenslauf-Generator","individueller Lebenslauf","Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Optimierung für Bewerberverfolgungssysteme","Erstellung von Lebensläufen","Lebenslauf"],"pt":["gerador de currículos","currículo personalizado","otimização de currículos","sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","desenvolvimento de carreira","currículos para vagas específicas"],"ru":["генератор резюме","индивидуальное резюме","оптимизация резюме","системы отслеживания кандидатов","развитие карьеры","резюме для конкретных вакансий"],"ar":["مُولِد سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة","سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة مُحَسَّنَة","تَحْسِين سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة","نُظُم تَعَقُب المُرَشِّحِين","تَنْمِيَة الْمَسَار الْمِهْنِي","سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة لِلْوَظَائِف المحددة"]}},"owner":"evolving-machines-lab","repo":"evolve","repoPath":"evolving-machines-lab/evolve","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailored-resume-generator","description":"Analyzes job descriptions and generates tailored resumes that highlight relevant experience, skills, and achievements to maximize interview chances","bodyPreview":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifi","body":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifications, and keywords from job postings\n2. **Identifies Priorities**: Determines what employers value most based on the job description language and structure\n3. **Tailors Content**: Reorganizes and emphasizes relevant experience, skills, and achievements\n4. **Optimizes Keywords**: Incorporates ATS-friendly keywords naturally throughout the resume\n5. **Formats Professionally**: Creates clean, professional resume layouts suitable for various formats\n6. **Provides Recommendations**: Suggests improvements and highlights gaps to address\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Usage\nProvide a job description and your background information:\n\n```\nI''m applying for this job:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nHere''s my background:\n- 5 years as software engineer at TechCorp\n- Led team of 3 developers on mobile app project\n- Expert in Python, JavaScript, React\n- Computer Science degree from State University\n```\n\n### With Existing Resume\nUpload or paste your current resume along with the job description:\n\n```\nPlease tailor my resume for this position:\n\nJob Description:\n[paste job description]\n\nMy Current Resume:\n[paste resume content]\n```\n\n### Career Transition\nWhen changing industries or roles:\n\n```\nI''m transitioning from marketing to product management.\nHere''s the job I''m applying for:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nMy transferable experience:\n- 7 years in digital marketing\n- Led cross-functional teams\n- Managed product launches\n- Data analysis and A/B testing\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User Request:**\n```\nI need a tailored resume for this job:\n\nSenior Data Analyst Position\n\nRequirements:\n- 5+ years experience in data analysis\n- Expert in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools\n- Experience with A/B testing and statistical analysis\n- Strong communication skills to present findings\n- Healthcare industry experience preferred\n\nMy background:\n- Data Analyst at RetailCo (2019-2024)\n- Created dashboards using Tableau and Power BI\n- Built Python scripts for data automation\n- Worked with marketing team on campaign analysis\n- Business Analytics degree\n- Also did 1 year internship at HealthPlus clinic\n```\n\n**Generated Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# JOHN DOE\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nResults-driven Data Analyst with 5+ years of experience leveraging SQL, Python, and advanced\nvisualization tools to deliver actionable insights. Proven track record in statistical analysis,\nA/B testing, and cross-functional collaboration. Healthcare industry experience with strong\nability to communicate complex data findings to stakeholders.\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n- **Data Analysis & Programming**: SQL, Python, Statistical Analysis, A/B Testing\n- **Visualization Tools**: Tableau, Power BI, Advanced Dashboard Development\n- **Data Management**: Data Automation, ETL Processes, Database Optimization\n- **Business Intelligence**: Campaign Analytics, Performance Metrics, KPI Tracking\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\n**Data Analyst** | RetailCo | 2019 - 2024\n- Designed and implemented 50+ SQL queries and Python automation scripts, reducing manual\n  data processing time by 60%\n- Conducted rigorous A/B testing and statistical analysis for marketing campaigns,\n  improving campaign ROI by 35%\n- Built interactive Tableau and Power BI dashboards for executive team, enabling\n  data-driven decision making\n- Presented analytical findings to cross-functional stakeholders including marketing,\n  operations, and executive leadership\n- Collaborated with marketing team to analyze customer behavior patterns and optimize\n  targeting strategies\n\n**Data Analysis Intern** | HealthPlus Clinic | 2018 - 2019\n- Supported healthcare analytics initiatives by analyzing patient data and operational metrics\n- Gained exposure to healthcare industry data management and HIPAA compliance requirements\n- Assisted in creating reports for clinical staff to improve patient care workflows\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Business Analytics**\nState University | Graduated 2018\n\n## KEY ACHIEVEMENTS\n- Reduced data processing time by 60% through Python automation\n- Improved marketing campaign ROI by 35% through A/B testing and optimization\n- Created data visualization system now used across entire organization\n```\n\n**Additional Recommendations:**\n- Consider adding any specific healthcare projects or certifications\n- Quantify more achievements with metrics when possible\n- If you have experience with R or advanced statistical methods, add them\n- Consider mentioning any familiarity with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests resume tailoring:\n\n### 1. Gather Information\n\n**Job Description Analysis**:\n- Request the full job description if not provided\n- Ask for the company name and job title\n\n**Candidate Background**:\n- If user provides existing resume, use it as the foundation\n- If not, request:\n  - Work history (job titles, companies, dates, responsibilities)\n  - Education background\n  - Key skills and technical proficiencies\n  - Notable achievements and metrics\n  - Certifications or awards\n  - Any other relevant information\n\n### 2. Analyze Job Requirements\n\nExtract and prioritize:\n- **Must-have qualifications**: Years of experience, required skills, education\n- **Key skills**: Technical tools, methodologies, competencies\n- **Soft skills**: Communication, leadership, teamwork\n- **Industry knowledge**: Domain-specific experience\n- **Keywords**: Repeated terms, phrases, and buzzwords for ATS optimization\n- **Company values**: Cultural fit indicators from job description\n\nCreate a mental map of:\n- Priority 1: Critical requirements (deal-breakers)\n- Priority 2: Important qualifications (strongly desired)\n- Priority 3: Nice-to-have skills (bonus points)\n\n### 3. Map Candidate Experience to Requirements\n\nFor each job requirement:\n- Identify matching experience from candidate''s background\n- Find transferable skills if no direct match\n- Note gaps that need to be addressed or de-emphasized\n- Identify unique strengths to highlight\n\n### 4. Structure the Tailored Resume\n\n**Professional Summary** (3-4 lines):\n- Lead with years of experience in the target role/field\n- Include top 3-4 required skills from job description\n- Mention industry experience if relevant\n- Highlight unique value proposition\n\n**Technical/Core Skills Section**:\n- Group skills by category matching job requirements\n- List required tools and technologies first\n- Use exact terminology from job description\n- Only include skills you can substantiate with experience\n\n**Professional Experience**:\n- For each role, emphasize responsibilities and achievements aligned with job requirements\n- Use action verbs: Led, Developed, Implemented, Optimized, Managed, Created, Analyzed\n- **Quantify achievements**: Include numbers, percentages, timeframes, scale\n- Reorder bullet points to prioritize most relevant experience\n- Use keywords naturally from job description\n- Format: **[Action Verb] + [What] + [How/Why] + [Result/Impact]**\n\n**Education**:\n- List degrees, certifications relevant to position\n- Include relevant coursework if early career\n- Add certifications that match job requirements\n\n**Optional Sections** (if applicable):\n- Certifications & Licenses\n- Publications or Speaking Engagements\n- Awards & Recognition\n- Volunteer Work (if relevant to role)\n- Projects (especially for technical roles)\n\n### 5. Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n\n- Use standard section headings (Professional Experience, Education, Skills)\n- Incorporate exact keywords from job description naturally\n- Avoid tables, graphics, headers/footers, or complex formatting\n- Use standard fonts and bullet points\n- Include both acronyms and full terms (e.g., \"SQL (Structured Query Language)\")\n- Match job title terminology where truthful\n\n### 6. Format and Present\n\n**Format Options**:\n- **Markdown**: Clean, readable, easy to copy\n- **Plain Text**: ATS-optimized, safe for all systems\n- **Tips for Word/PDF**: Provide formatting guidance\n\n**Resume Structure Guidelines**:\n- Keep to 1 page for <10 years experience, 2 pages for 10+ years\n- Use consistent formatting and spacing\n- Ensure contact information is prominent\n- Use reverse chronological order (most recent first)\n- Maintain clean, scannable layout with white space\n\n### 7. Provide Strategic Recommendations\n\nAfter presenting the tailored resume, offer:\n\n**Strengths Analysis**:\n- What makes this candidate competitive\n- Unique qualifications to emphasize in cover letter or interview\n\n**Gap Analysis**:\n- Requirements not fully met\n- Suggestions for addressing gaps (courses, projects, reframing experience)\n\n**Interview Preparation Tips**:\n- Key talking points aligned with resume\n- Stories to prepare based on job requirements\n- Questions to ask that demonstrate fit\n\n**Cover Letter Hooks**:\n- Suggest 2-3 opening lines for cover letter\n- Key achievements to expand upon\n\n### 8. Iterate and Refine\n\nAsk if user wants to:\n- Adjust emphasis or tone\n- Add or remove sections\n- Generate alternative versions for different roles\n- Create format variations (traditional vs. modern)\n- Develop role-specific versions (if applying to multiple similar positions)\n\n### 9. Best Practices to Follow\n\n**Do**:\n- Be truthful and accurate - never fabricate experience\n- Use industry-standard terminology\n- Quantify achievements with specific metrics\n- Tailor each resume to specific job\n- Proofread for grammar and consistency\n- Keep language concise and impactful\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Include personal information (age, marital status, photo unless requested)\n- Use first-person pronouns (I, me, my)\n- Include references (\"available upon request\" is outdated)\n- List every job if career is 20+ years (focus on relevant, recent experience)\n- Use generic templates without customization\n- Exceed 2 pages unless very senior role\n\n### 10. Special Considerations\n\n**Career Changers**:\n- Use functional or hybrid resume format\n- Emphasize transferable skills\n- Create compelling narrative in summary\n- Focus on relevant projects and coursework\n\n**Recent Graduates**:\n- Lead with education\n- Include relevant coursework, projects, internships\n- Emphasize leadership in student organizations\n- Include GPA if 3.5+\n\n**Senior Executives**:\n- Lead with executive summary\n- Focus on leadership and strategic impact\n- Include board memberships, speaking engagements\n- Emphasize revenue growth, team building, vision\n\n**Technical Roles**:\n- Include technical skills section prominently\n- List programming languages, frameworks, tools\n- Include GitHub, portfolio, or project links\n- Mention methodologies (Agile, Scrum, etc.)\n\n**Creative Roles**:\n- Include link to portfolio\n- Highlight creative achievements and campaigns\n- Mention tools and software proficiencies\n- Consider more creative formatting (while maintaining ATS compatibility)\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- **Be specific**: Provide complete job descriptions and detailed background information\n- **Share metrics**: Include numbers, percentages, and quantifiable achievements when describing your experience\n- **Indicate format preference**: Let the skill know if you need ATS-optimized, creative, or traditional format\n- **Mention constraints**: Share any specific requirements (page limits, sections to include/exclude)\n- **Iterate**: Don''t hesitate to ask for revisions or alternative approaches\n- **Multiple applications**: Generate separate tailored versions for different roles\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill processes your personal and professional information to generate tailored resumes. Always review the output before submitting to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Remove or modify any information you prefer not to share with potential employers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:18:34.391Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Career Guidance Agents needing advanced resume customization capabilities for ATS optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要高级简历定制功能以优化申请跟踪系统的职业指导代理","ja":"キャリアガイダンスエージェントが高度な履歴書カスタマイズ機能を必要とする場合に最適です","ko":"고급 이력서 사용자 정의 기능이 필요한 職業 指導 エージェント에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de orientación profesional que necesitan capacidades de personalización de currículums avanzadas para la optimización de los sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''orientation de carrière qui ont besoin de capacités de personnalisation de CV avancées pour l''optimisation des systèmes de suivi des candidatures.","de":"Perfekt für Karriereberatungsagenten, die erweiterte Anpassungsfähigkeiten für Lebensläufe zur Optimierung von Bewerberverwaltungssystemen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Orientação de Carreira que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de personalização de currículos para otimização do ATS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по карьерному консультированию, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности настройки резюме для оптимизации ATS.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التوجيه الوظيفي الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности تخصيص سيرة ذاتية متقدمة لتحسين نظام تتبع المتقدمين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze job descriptions, extract key requirements, and generate tailored resumes in various formats, utilizing natural language processing and machine learning algorithms to highlight relevant experience and skills, while ensuring compatibility with Applicant Tracking Systems.","zh":"使代理能够分析工作描述、提取关键要求并生成定制的简历，利用自然语言处理和机器学习算法突出相关经验和技能，同时确保与申请跟踪系统的兼容性","ja":"エージェントが求人説明を分析し、重要な要件を抽出し、様々な形式のカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成できるようにし、自然言語処理と機械学習アルゴリズムを利用して関連する経験とスキルを強調し、同時にアプリケーショントラッキングシステムとの互換性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 일자리 설명을 분석하고 주요 요구 사항을 추출하여 다양한 형식의 맞춤형 이력서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 처리 및 기계 학습 알고리즘을 사용하여 관련 경험 및 기술을 강조하며, 동시에 지원자 추적 시스템과의 호환성을 보장합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar descripciones de trabajo, extraer requisitos clave y generar currículums personalizados en varios formatos, utilizando procesamiento de lenguaje natural y algoritmos de aprendizaje automático para destacar experiencias y habilidades relevantes, garantizando al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad con los sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les descriptions de poste, d''extraire les exigences clés et de générer des CV personnalisés dans différents formats, en utilisant le traitement automatique des langues et les algorithmes d''apprentissage automatique pour mettre en évidence les expériences et les compétences pertinentes, tout en garantissant la compatibilité avec les systèmes de suivi des candidatures.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Stellenbeschreibungen zu analysieren, Schlüsselanforderungen zu extrahieren und auf maßgeschneiderte Lebensläufe in verschiedenen Formaten zu generieren, die natürliche Sprachverarbeitung und maschinelles Lernen verwenden, um relevante Erfahrungen und Fähigkeiten hervorzuheben, während sie gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit Bewerberverwaltungssystemen gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar descrições de trabalhos, extrair requisitos-chave e gerar currículos personalizados em vários formatos, utilizando processamento de linguagem natural e algoritmos de aprendizado de máquina para destacar experiências e habilidades relevantes, garantindo compatibilidade com Sistemas de Rastreamento de Candidatos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать описания вакансий, извлекать ключевые требования и генерировать адаптированные резюме в различных форматах, используя обработку естественного языка и алгоритмы машинного обучения для выделения соответствующего опыта и навыков, гарантируя совместимость с системами отслеживания заявок.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتحليل وصفات الوظائف واستخراج المتطلبات الرئيسية وتوليد سير ذاتية مخصصة في صيغ مختلفة، باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وخوارزميات التعلم الآلي لتحديد الخبرات والمهارات ذات الصلة، مع ضمان التوافق مع نظام تتبع المتقدمين."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating resume generation for specific job positions","Customizing resumes for different industries or roles","Optimizing resumes for ATS to increase application visibility"],"zh":["为特定工作职位自动生成简历","为不同行业或角色定制简历","优化简历以增加申请可见度"],"ja":["特定の仕事のポジションのための履歴書を自動生成する","様々な業界または役割のための履歴書をカスタマイズする","アプリケーションの可視性を高めるために履歴書を最適化する"],"ko":["특정 직업 위치를 위한 이력서 자동 생성","다양한 산업 또는 역할을 위한 이력서 사용자 정의","지원서 가시성을 높이기 위한 이력서 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de currículums para puestos de trabajo específicos","Personalización de currículums para diferentes industrias o roles","Optimización de currículums para sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes para aumentar la visibilidad de las solicitudes"],"fr":["Automation de la génération de CV pour des postes spécifiques","Personnalisation de CV pour différents secteurs ou rôles","Optimisation de CV pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures pour augmenter la visibilité des candidatures"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Lebensläufen für bestimmte Stellen","Anpassung von Lebensläufen für verschiedene Branchen oder Rollen","Optimierung von Lebensläufen für Bewerberverwaltungssysteme, um die Sichtbarkeit der Bewerbungen zu erhöhen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de currículos para posições de trabalho específicas","Personalizar currículos para diferentes setores ou funções","Otimizar currículos para ATS para aumentar a visibilidade das candidaturas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию резюме для конкретных вакансий","Настроить резюме для разных отраслей или ролей","Оптимизировать резюме для ATS для увеличения видимости заявок"],"ar":["آليّة توليد السير الذاتية لمواقع العمل المحددة","تخصيص السير الذاتية لمجالات أو أدوار مختلفة","تحسين السير الذاتية لنظام تتبع المتقدمين لزيادة ظهور الطلبات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to job description data","Limited to resume generation in text-based formats"],"zh":["需要访问工作描述数据","仅限于文本格式的简历生成"],"ja":["仕事説明データへのアクセスが必要","テキスト形式の履歴書生成のみ"],"ko":["작업 설명 데이터에 액세스해야 함","텍스트 형식의 이력서 생성만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de descripciones de trabajo","Limitado a la generación de currículums en formatos basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données de descriptions de poste","Limité à la génération de CV dans des formats basés sur le texte"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Stellenbeschreibungsdaten","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Lebensläufen in textbasierten Formaten"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de descrição de trabalhos","Limitado à geração de currículos em formatos baseados em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным описания вакансий","Ограничен генерацией резюме в текстовых форматах"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات وصفات الوظائف","محدود بتوليد السير الذاتية في صيغ نصية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('artivilla/agents-config/rams', 'community', 'artivilla', 'agents-config', 'artivilla/agents-config', 'rams', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z', '2026-02-18T13:18:48.300Z', NULL, '{"id":"artivilla/agents-config/rams","name":"rams","description":{"zh":"Rams 设计审查技能用于审查代码的无障碍性和视觉设计问题，确保开发项目符合 WCAG 2.1 标准","ja":"Rams デザインレビュースキルは、コードのアクセシビリティと視覚デザインの問題をレビューし、開発プロジェクトを WCAG 2.1 標準に準拠させるために使用されます","ko":"Rams 디자인 리뷰 스킬은 코드의 无障碍性와 시각 디자인 문제를 리뷰하여 개발 프로젝트를 WCAG 2.1 표준에 준수하도록 합니다","es":"Rams es una herramienta de revisión de diseño que analiza el código para detectar problemas de accesibilidad y diseño visual","fr":"Rams est un outil d''examen de conception qui analyse le code pour détecter les problèmes d''accessibilité et de conception visuelle","de":"Rams ist ein Design-Überprüfungstool, das den Code analysiert, um Probleme mit der Barrierefreiheit und der visuellen Gestaltung zu erkennen","pt":"Rams é uma ferramenta de revisão de design que ajuda os desenvolvedores a identificar problemas de acessibilidade e design visual em seus projetos","ru":"Rams - это инструмент для проверки дизайна, который помогает разработчикам выявлять проблемы доступности и визуального дизайна в их проектах","ar":"Rams هي أداة مراجعة التصميم التي تساعد المطورين على تحديد مشاكل في سهولة الوصول والتصميم المرئي في مشاريعهم","en":"config with settings and sklils for multiple agents"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Rams 设计审查：WCAG 2.1 无障碍指南","ja":"Rams デザインレビュー：WCAG 2.1 アクセシビリティガイド","ko":"Rams 디자인 리뷰: WCAG 2.1 无障碍 지침","es":"Rams: Herramienta de revisión de diseño para accesibilidad","fr":"Rams: Outil d''examen de conception pour l''accessibilité","de":"Rams: Design-Überprüfungstool für Barrierefreiheit","pt":"Rams: Ferramenta de Revisão de Design para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Rams: Инструмент для проверки дизайна для разработчиков","ar":"Rams: أداة م