s MINOR/PATCH de manera automática","Solicita confirmación para actualizaciones MAJOR","Omite paquetes con versiones fijas"],"fr":["Mettre à jour les dépendances Node.js de manière automatique","Utilise taze CLI avec une promotion intelligente","Applique les mises à jour MINOR/PATCH de manière automatique","Demander une confirmation pour les mises à jour MAJOR","Ignorer les packages avec des versions fixes"],"de":["Aktualisiert Abhängigkeiten von Node.js automatisch","Verwendet taze CLI mit intelligenter Förderung","Wendet MINOR/PATCH-Updates automatisch an","Fordert Bestätigung für MAJOR-Updates an","Überspringt Pakete mit festen Versionen"],"pt":["Atualizações MINOR/PATCH automáticas","Controle de atualizações MAJOR","Uso do taze CLI","Prompts inteligentes","Suporte a atualizações seletivas","Integração com scripts de automação"],"ru":["Автоматические обновления MINOR/PATCH","Контроль обновлений MAJOR","Использование taze CLI","Умные промпты","Поддержка выбора обновлений","Интеграция со скриптами автоматизации"],"ar":["تحديثات MINOR/PATCH تلقائيًا","مراقبة التحديثات MAJOR","استخدام taze CLI","ترويج ذكية","دعم تحديثات انتقائية","تكامل مع البرامج النصية التلقائية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Node.js 依赖更新","智能更新","taze CLI","MINOR/PATCH 更新","MAJOR 更新","自动应用更新","个别更新提示","跳过固定版本包"],"ja":["Node.js 依存関係の更新","スマート更新","taze CLI","MINOR/PATCH 更新","MAJOR 更新","自動適用更新","個別更新提示","固定バージョンパッケージのスキップ"],"ko":["Node.js 의존성 업데이트","스마트 업데이트","taze CLI","MINOR/PATCH 업데이트","MAJOR 업데이트","자동 적용 업데이트","개별 업데이트提示","고정 버전 패키지의 스킵"],"es":["bump-deps","actualizar dependencias","Node.js","taze CLI","promoción inteligente","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["bump-deps","mettre à jour les dépendances","Node.js","taze CLI","promotion intelligente","développement de logiciels"],"de":["bump-deps","Abhängigkeiten aktualisieren","Node.js","taze CLI","intelligente Förderung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["bump-deps","atualização de dependências","Node.js","taze CLI","prompts inteligentes","automatização de atualizações","controle de versões","desenvolvimento de software","gerenciamento de dependências"],"ru":["bump-deps","обновление зависимостей","Node.js","taze CLI","умные промпты","автоматизация обновлений","контроль версий","разработка программного обеспечения","управление зависимостями"],"ar":["تطوير التبعيات","تحديث التبعيات","Node.js","taze CLI","ترويج ذكية","التلقائية لتحديثات","مراقبة الإصدارات","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة التبعيات"]}},"owner":"PaulRBerg","repo":"dot-agents","repoPath":"PaulRBerg/dot-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bump-deps","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update dependencies, update npm packages, bump dependencies, upgrade node packages, check for outdated packages, update package.json, or mentions dependency updates, npm/pnpm/yarn/bun package upgrades, or taze CLI usage.","bodyPreview":"# Bump Dependencies Skill\n\nUpdate Node.js dependencies using taze CLI with smart prompting: auto-apply MINOR/PATCH updates, prompt for MAJOR updates individually, skip fixed-version packages.\n\nWhen package names are provided as arguments (e.g. `/bump-deps react typescript`), scope all taze commands to only those packages using `--include`.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting, verify taze is installed by running:\n\n```bash\nscripts/run-taze.sh\n```\n\nIf exit code is 1, stop and inform the user that ta","body":"# Bump Dependencies Skill\n\nUpdate Node.js dependencies using taze CLI with smart prompting: auto-apply MINOR/PATCH updates, prompt for MAJOR updates individually, skip fixed-version packages.\n\nWhen package names are provided as arguments (e.g. `/bump-deps react typescript`), scope all taze commands to only those packages using `--include`.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore starting, verify taze is installed by running:\n\n```bash\nscripts/run-taze.sh\n```\n\nIf exit code is 1, stop and inform the user that taze must be installed:\n\n- Global install: `npm install -g taze`\n- One-time: `npx taze`\n\n## Update Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Scan for Updates\n\nRun the taze script to discover available updates. The script auto-detects monorepo projects (`workspaces` in package.json or `pnpm-workspace.yaml`) and enables recursive mode automatically.\n\n```bash\nscripts/run-taze.sh\n```\n\n### Step 2: Parse and Categorize Updates\n\nFrom the taze output, categorize each package update:\n\n| Category  | Version Change                              | Action        |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| **Fixed** | No `^` or `~` prefix (e.g., `\"1.0.0\"`)      | Skip entirely |\n| **PATCH** | `x.y.z` → `x.y.Z` (e.g., `1.0.0` → `1.0.1`) | Auto-apply    |\n| **MINOR** | `x.y.z` → `x.Y.0` (e.g., `1.0.0` → `1.1.0`) | Auto-apply    |\n| **MAJOR** | `x.y.z` → `X.0.0` (e.g., `1.0.0` → `2.0.0`) | Prompt user   |\n\nIf package arguments were provided, filter to only those packages.\n\n**Identifying fixed versions:** In package.json, fixed versions have no range prefix:\n\n- Fixed: `\"lodash\": \"4.17.21\"` → skip\n- Ranged: `\"lodash\": \"^4.17.21\"` → process\n\n### Step 3: Apply MINOR/PATCH Updates\n\nApply all non-major updates automatically without prompting:\n\n```bash\n# All packages\ntaze minor --write\n\n# Specific packages only (when args provided)\ntaze minor --write --include react,typescript\n```\n\nThe script auto-detects monorepo mode, but when running taze directly, detect it yourself: check for `workspaces` in package.json or `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and add `-r` if present.\n\nReport the packages that were updated.\n\n### Step 4: Prompt for MAJOR Updates\n\n**Auto-skip packages:** Never prompt for these packages—auto-apply their major updates:\n\n- `lucide-react` (icon library with frequent major bumps, backward-compatible in practice)\n\nFor each remaining package with a major update available, use `AskUserQuestion` to ask the user individually:\n\n```\nPackage: <package-name>\nCurrent: <current-version>\nAvailable: <new-version>\n\nUpdate to major version?\n```\n\n**Question format:**\n\n- header: Package name (max 12 chars, truncate if needed)\n- options: \"Yes, update\" / \"No, skip\"\n- multiSelect: false\n\nCollect all approved major updates.\n\n### Step 5: Apply Approved MAJOR Updates\n\nAfter collecting user approvals, apply the approved major updates:\n\n```bash\ntaze major --write --include <pkg1>,<pkg2>,<pkg3>\n```\n\nAdd `-r` if monorepo was detected.\n\n### Step 6: Update Bun Catalogs\n\nAfter applying all updates, check the **root** `package.json` for Bun workspace catalogs. Bun monorepos can centralize dependency versions using `catalog` and `catalogs` fields inside the `workspaces` object:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workspaces\": {\n    \"packages\": [\"packages/*\"],\n    \"catalog\": {\n      \"react\": \"^19.0.0\"\n    },\n    \"catalogs\": {\n      \"testing\": {\n        \"jest\": \"^30.0.0\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWorkspace packages reference these with `\"react\": \"catalog:\"` (default catalog) or `\"jest\": \"catalog:testing\"` (named catalog).\n\n**Skip this step** if neither `workspaces.catalog` nor `workspaces.catalogs` exists in the root `package.json`.\n\nFor each package that was updated in Steps 3/5:\n\n1. Check if it appears in `workspaces.catalog` — if so, update the version there\n2. Check each named catalog in `workspaces.catalogs` — if the package appears, update the version there\n\nPreserve the existing range prefix (`^`, `~`, or none) from the catalog entry. For example, if the catalog has `\"react\": \"^19.0.0\"` and taze bumped react to `19.1.0`, update the catalog to `\"react\": \"^19.1.0\"`.\n\nUse `Edit` to apply the version changes directly to the root `package.json`.\n\n### Step 7: Install Dependencies\n\nAfter all updates are applied, remind the user to run their package manager''s install command:\n\n```bash\nnpm install\n# or\npnpm install\n# or\nbun install\n# or\nyarn install\n```\n\n## Taze Output Interpretation\n\nTaze displays updates grouped by type. Example output:\n\n```\n@types/node  ^20.0.0  →  ^22.0.0   (major)\ntypescript   ^5.3.0   →  ^5.4.0    (minor)\neslint       ^8.56.0  →  ^8.57.0   (patch)\n```\n\nThe rightmost column indicates update type (major/minor/patch).\n\nPackages shown with `--include-locked` that have no `^` or `~` are fixed versions—skip these entirely.\n\n## Script Reference\n\n| Script                | Purpose                                              |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `scripts/run-taze.sh` | Run taze in non-interactive mode, check installation |\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Fixed-version dependencies (no `^` or `~`) indicate intentional pinning—never modify these\n- MAJOR updates may contain breaking changes—always prompt the user\n- MINOR/PATCH updates are backward-compatible by semver convention—safe to auto-apply\n- The `--include` flag accepts comma-separated package names or regex patterns\n- Monorepo detection is automatic—no flag needed\n- Bun catalogs (`workspaces.catalog` / `workspaces.catalogs`) are the source of truth for workspace packages using the `catalog:` protocol—always update catalog entries alongside regular deps\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:19:32.124Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Ecosystems needing automated Node.js dependency updates with smart prompting","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 Node.js 依赖更新和智能提示的 AI 代理生态系统","ja":"AI エージェント エコシステムで Node.js 依赖関係の自動更新とスマート プロンプティングが必要な場合に最適","ko":"Node.js 의존성 자동 업데이트 및 스마트 프롬프트가 필요한 AI 에이전트 생태계에 적합","es":"Ideal para ecosistemas de agentes de IA que necesitan actualizaciones automatizadas de dependencias de Node.js con solicitudes inteligentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les écosystèmes d''agents IA nécessitant des mises à jour automatisées des dépendances Node.js avec des invites intelligentes.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten-Ökosysteme, die automatisierte Node.js-Abhängigkeitsupdates mit intelligenten Aufforderungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Ecossistemas de Agentes de IA que necessitam de atualizações automatizadas de dependências do Node.js com prompts inteligentes","ru":"Идеально подходит для экосистем агентов ИИ, требующих автоматического обновления зависимостей Node.js с умным приглашением","ar":"مثالي لنظام بيئي وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات تلقائية لاعتماديات Node.js مع إشارات ذكية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to auto-apply MINOR/PATCH updates, prompt for MAJOR updates individually, and skip fixed-version packages using taze CLI, ensuring seamless dependency management with --include for scoped updates","zh":"赋予代理自动应用 MINOR/PATCH 更新、个别提示 MAJOR 更新，并使用 taze CLI 跳过固定版本包，确保使用 --include 进行范围更新的无缝依赖管理","ja":"エージェントに MINOR/PATCH 更新を自動適用し、MAJOR 更新は個別にプロンプティングし、taze CLI を使用して固定バージョンのパッケージをスキップして --include で範囲更新を行うことでシームレスな依存関係管理を可能に","ko":"에이전트가 MINOR/PATCH 업데이트를 자동 적용하고 MAJOR 업데이트는 개별적으로 프롬프트하고 taze CLI를 사용하여 고정 버전 패키지를 건너뛰어 --include로 범위 업데이트를 수행하여 무결점 의존성 관리를 보장","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar automáticamente actualizaciones MINOR/PATCH, solicitar individualmente actualizaciones MAJOR y omitir paquetes de versión fija utilizando la CLI de taze, garantizando una gestión de dependencias perfecta con --include para actualizaciones con alcance.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer automatiquement les mises à jour MINEURES/CORRECTIVES, de demander individuellement les mises à jour MAJEURES et d''ignorer les paquets à version fixe en utilisant la CLI taze, garantissant une gestion transparente des dépendances avec --include pour les mises à jour ciblées.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten das automatische Anwenden von MINOR/PATCH-Updates, das individuelle Anfordern von MAJOR-Updates und das Überspringen von Paketen mit fester Version unter Verwendung der taze-CLI, wodurch eine nahtlose Abhängigkeitsverwaltung mit --include für bereichsbezogene Updates gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar automaticamente atualizações MENORES/CORREÇÕES, solicitar atualizações MAIORES individualmente e ignorar pacotes de versão fixa usando o CLI do taze, garantindo uma gestão de dependências sem interrupções com --include para atualizações com escopo","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматически применять ОБНОВЛЕНИЯ/ИСПРАВЛЕНИЯ, запрашивать БОЛЬШИЕ обновления индивидуально и пропускать пакеты с фиксированной версией, используя CLI taze, обеспечивая бесперебойное управление зависимостями с --include для обновлений в области видимости","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطبيق تحديثات صغيرة وتصحيحات تلقائية، وطلب تحديثات كبيرة بشكل فردي، وتجاوز حزم الإصدار الثابت باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر taze، وضمان إدارة الاعتماديات بدون انقطاع مع --include لتحديثات النطاق"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Node.js dependency updates with smart prompting","Updating specific packages like react and typescript using --include","Skipping fixed-version packages for customized dependency management"],"zh":["使用智能提示自动更新 Node.js 依赖关系","使用 --include 更新特定包，如 react 和 typescript","跳过固定版本包以实现自定义依赖关系管理"],"ja":["スマート プロンプティングを使用して Node.js 依存関係を自動更新する","--include を使用して react や typescript などの特定のパッケージを更新する","固定バージョンのパッケージをスキップしてカスタマイズされた依存関係管理を行う"],"ko":["스마트 프롬프트를 사용하여 Node.js 의존성을 자동 업데이트하는 것","--include를 사용하여 react 및 typescript와 같은 특정 패키지를 업데이트하는 것","고정 버전 패키지를 건너뛰어 사용자 지정 의존성 관리를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de dependencias de Node.js con solicitudes inteligentes","Actualización de paquetes específicos como react y typescript usando --include","Omitir paquetes de versión fija para una gestión de dependencias personalizada"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour des dépendances Node.js avec des invites intelligentes","Mise à jour de paquets spécifiques comme react et typescript en utilisant --include","Ignorer les paquets à version fixe pour une gestion personnalisée des dépendances"],"de":["Automatisierung von Node.js-Abhängigkeitsupdates mit intelligenten Aufforderungen","Aktualisieren spezifischer Pakete wie react und typescript mit --include","Überspringen von Paketen mit fester Version für eine angepasste Abhängigkeitsverwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de dependências do Node.js com prompts inteligentes","Atualizar pacotes específicos como react e typescript usando --include","Ignorar pacotes de versão fixa para gestão de dependências personalizada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления зависимостей Node.js с умным приглашением","Обновлять конкретные пакеты, такие как react и typescript, используя --include","Пропускать пакеты с фиксированной версией для индивидуального управления зависимостями"],"ar":["توتير تحديثات الاعتماديات Node.js مع إشارات ذكية","تحديث حزم محددة مثل react و typescript باستخدام --include","تجاوز حزم الإصدار الثابت لإدارة الاعتماديات المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires taze CLI installation","Node.js dependencies only","Exit code 1 indicates taze installation failure"],"zh":["需要安装 taze CLI","仅适用于 Node.js 依赖关系","退出代码 1 表示 taze 安装失败"],"ja":["taze CLI のインストールが必要","Node.js 依存関係のみ","終了コード 1 は taze のインストールに失敗したことを示す"],"ko":["taze CLI 설치가 필요함","Node.js 의존성만 해당함","종료 코드 1은 taze 설치 실패를 나타냄"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la CLI de taze","Solo dependencias de Node.js","El código de salida 1 indica un fallo en la instalación de taze"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la CLI taze","Dépendances Node.js uniquement","Le code de sortie 1 indique un échec de l''installation de taze"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation der taze-CLI","Nur Node.js-Abhängigkeiten","Exit-Code 1 zeigt einen fehlgeschlagenen taze-Installationsvorgang an"],"pt":["Requer instalação do CLI do taze","Apenas dependências do Node.js","Código de saída 1 indica falha na instalação do taze"],"ru":["Требуется установка CLI taze","Только зависимости Node.js","Код выхода 1 указывает на сбой установки taze"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر taze","اعتماديات Node.js فقط","رمز الخروج 1 يشير إلى فشل في تثبيت taze"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
