''éléments de travail autonomes","Détection de type assistée par IA","Conversations naturelles","Personnalisation de flux de travail","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Erstellung eigenständiger Arbeitsartikel","IA-gestützte Typenerkennung","Natürliche Konversationen","Anpassung von Arbeitsabläufen","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Criação de itens de trabalho autônomos","Detecção de tipo assistida por IA","Compatibilidade com projetos específicos","Tipos de problemas personalizáveis","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Создание самостоятельных рабочих элементов","Обнаружение типа, поддерживаемое ИИ","Совместимость с конкретными проектами","Пользовательские типы проблем","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["إنشاء عناصر عمل مستقلة","الكشف عن النوع المدعوم بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","التوافق مع مشاريع محددة","أنواع مشاكل مخصصة","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Issue技能","AI驱动的生活管理","自然对话","工作项创建","个人生产力"],"ja":["Issueスキル","AIドリブンのライフマネジメント","自然な会話","ワークアイテムの作成","個人生産性"],"ko":["이슈 스킬","AI 기반의 생활 관리","자연스러운 대화","작업 항목 생성","개인 생산성"],"es":[" Issue","Gestión de vida","Productividad personal","IA","Conversaciones naturales","Flujos de trabajo personalizados","Claude Code"],"fr":["Issue","Gestion de vie","Productivité personnelle","IA","Conversations naturelles","Flux de travail personnalisés","Claude Code"],"de":["Issue","Lebensmanagement","Persönliche Produktivität","KI","Natürliche Konversationen","Anpassung von Arbeitsabläufen","Claude Code"],"pt":["gerenciamento de vida personalizado","itens de trabalho autônomos","detecção de tipo assistida por IA","Claude Code","produtividade pessoal","gerenciamento de projetos"],"ru":["настраиваемый каркас управления жизнью","самостоятельные рабочие элементы","обнаружение типа, поддерживаемое ИИ","Claude Code","личная производительность","управление проектами"],"ar":["إطار إدارة الحياة المخصص","عناصر عمل مستقلة","الكشف عن النوع المدعوم بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","Claude Code","النتاجية الشخصية","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"TaylorHuston","repo":"local-life-manager","repoPath":"TaylorHuston/local-life-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"issue","description":"Create standalone work items (TASK, BUG, or SPIKE) with AI-assisted type detection. Use when you need to track work that needs doing, exploration needed, or something broken.","bodyPreview":"# /issue\n\nCreate standalone work items through natural conversation with AI-assisted type detection.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/issue                                    # Start conversation\n/issue \"Implement authentication\"         # AI detects: TASK\n/issue \"Compare GraphQL vs REST\"          # AI detects: SPIKE\n/issue \"Broken link in project-brief\"     # AI detects: BUG\n/issue --project coordinatr               # Create for specific project\n```\n\n## Issue Types\n\n| Type | Purpose | Detection Keywords |\n|","body":"# /issue\n\nCreate standalone work items through natural conversation with AI-assisted type detection.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/issue                                    # Start conversation\n/issue \"Implement authentication\"         # AI detects: TASK\n/issue \"Compare GraphQL vs REST\"          # AI detects: SPIKE\n/issue \"Broken link in project-brief\"     # AI detects: BUG\n/issue --project coordinatr               # Create for specific project\n```\n\n## Issue Types\n\n| Type | Purpose | Detection Keywords |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| **TASK** | Work that needs doing | implement, create, add, build, write, set up |\n| **SPIKE** | Time-boxed exploration | compare, vs, should we, evaluate, explore, research, feasibility |\n| **BUG** | Something broken/wrong | fix, broken, incorrect, outdated, wrong, error |\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nideas/[project]/issues/\n└── 001-implement-auth/\n    ├── TASK.md       # or SPIKE.md or BUG.md\n    ├── PLAN.md       # Created by /plan\n    └── WORKLOG.md    # Progress tracking\n```\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### 1. Gather Context\n\nIf no description: \"What needs to be done?\"\nIf no project: \"Which project?\"\n\n### 2. Detect Type\n\nAnalyze description keywords, present detection:\n> \"This sounds like a **TASK**. Create as issue 002? (yes / spike / bug)\"\n\n### 3. Determine Next Issue Number\n\n```bash\nls ideas/[project]/issues/ | grep -E ''^[0-9]{3}-'' | sort -n | tail -1\n```\n\n### 4. Ask About Spec Section\n\nCheck if project has a spec:\n```bash\nGlob: spaces/[project]/docs/specs/*.md\n```\n\nIf spec exists:\n> \"Which spec section does this implement?\"\n> - docs/specs/required-features.md#authentication\n> - docs/specs/required-features.md#documents\n> - none (standalone task)\n\n### 5. Create Issue Files\n\n**TASK.md:**\n```markdown\n---\nstatus: open\ncreated: YYYY-MM-DD\nimplements: docs/specs/required-features.md#authentication  # or empty if standalone\ndepends_on: []\n---\n\n# TASK-###: [Title]\n\n## Description\n\n[What needs to be done and why]\n\n## Implements\n\n**Spec Section:** [docs/specs/required-features.md#authentication](../../spaces/[project]/docs/specs/required-features.md#authentication)\n\n**Requirements from spec:**\n- [Requirement 1 from spec]\n- [Requirement 2 from spec]\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Criterion 1\n- [ ] Criterion 2\n\n## Context\n\n[Background, relevant decisions, technical notes]\n```\n\n**SPIKE.md:**\n```markdown\n---\nstatus: open\ncreated: YYYY-MM-DD\ntimebox: X hours\n---\n\n# SPIKE-###: [Title]\n\n## Questions\n\n- Question 1?\n- Question 2?\n\n## Approaches to Explore\n\n1. Approach A\n2. Approach B\n\n## Findings\n\n(filled after exploration)\n\n## Recommendation\n\n(filled after exploration)\n```\n\n**BUG.md:**\n```markdown\n---\nstatus: open\ncreated: YYYY-MM-DD\n---\n\n# BUG-###: [Title]\n\n## What''s Broken\n\n[Description of the problem]\n\n## Location\n\n[File paths, URLs, etc.]\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n[What should happen]\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Step 1\n2. Step 2\n```\n\n### 6. Mark Spec Section In Progress (if implements spec)\n\nIf the issue implements a spec section, update the inline status markers in the spec:\n\n```markdown\n# Before\n- ⏳ User registration with email/password\n\n# After\n- 🚧 User registration with email/password\n```\n\nThe `/complete` command will mark these ✅ when done.\n\n### 7. Next Steps\n\n- For TASK/BUG: Suggest `/plan ###` to create implementation phases\n- For SPIKE: Suggest `/plan ###` to create exploration plan\n\n## Status Values\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `open` | Not started |\n| `in_progress` | Being worked on |\n| `blocked` | Waiting on something |\n| `complete` | Done |\n\n## Spec Integration\n\n### Task Scoping\n\n**One TASK = One requirement line item**\n\nA TASK should be atomic and shippable:\n- Implements exactly one spec requirement\n- Can be pushed to main independently\n- Updates one `⏳` → `✅` marker when complete\n\n```markdown\n# Spec line items (each becomes a TASK)\n- ⏳ User registration with email/password    ← TASK-002\n- ⏳ User login with JWT token                ← TASK-003\n- ⏳ Password reset flow                      ← TASK-004\n```\n\n**Don''t create:** \"TASK: Implement Authentication\" (too broad)\n**Do create:** \"TASK: User registration endpoint\" (one requirement)\n\n### implements: Field\n\n```yaml\n# Points to the specific requirement\nimplements: docs/specs/required-features.md#user-registration-with-email-password\n```\n\nThis creates a direct link between work items and the exact requirement they fulfill.\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\n/spec → /issue → /plan → (work) → /complete\n         ↓\n   implements: spec section\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:21:32.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing AI-assisted issue type detection and workflow integration.","zh":"非常适合需要 AI 辅助问题类型检测和工作流集成的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが AI アシストによる問題タイプ検出とワークフロー統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"AI 보조 문제 유형 감지 및 워크플로 통합이 필요한 태스크 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de tareas que necesitan detección de tipo de problema asistida por IA y integración de flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches ayant besoin d''une détection de type de problème assistée par IA et d''une intégration de workflow.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die eine AI-gestützte Problemtyp-Erkennung und eine Workflow-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de detecção de tipo de problema assistida por IA e integração de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, которым требуется обнаружение типа проблемы с помощью ИИ и интеграция рабочего процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المهام التي تحتاج إلى اكتشاف نوع القضية بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي وتكامل سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standalone work items through natural conversation, utilizing AI-assisted type detection for tasks, spikes, and bugs, and supporting project-specific issue creation with options like --project coordinatr.","zh":"能够通过自然对话使代理创建独立的工作项，利用 AI 辅助类型检测任务、斜线和 bug，并支持项目特定的问题创建，选项如 --project 协调器。","ja":"エージェントが自然な会話を通じてスタンドアロンなワークアイテムを作成できるようにし、タスク、スパイク、バグの AI アシストによるタイプ検出を利用し、--project フラグなどのオプションを使用してプロジェクト固有の問題作成をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 자연스러운 대화를 통해 독립적인 작업 항목을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 태스크, 스파이크, 버그에 대한 AI 보조 유형 감지를 활용하고, --project 플래그와 같은 옵션을 사용하여 프로젝트 특정 문제 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear elementos de trabajo independientes a través de conversaciones naturales, utilizando la detección de tipo asistida por IA para tareas, picos y errores, y admitiendo la creación de problemas específicos del proyecto con opciones como --project coordinatr.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des éléments de travail autonomes via des conversations naturelles, en utilisant la détection de type assistée par IA pour les tâches, les pics et les bogues, et en supportant la création de problèmes spécifiques au projet avec des options comme --project coordinatr.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eigenständige Arbeits-elemente durch natürliche Konversationen zu erstellen, indem sie die AI-gestützte Typ-Erkennung für Aufgaben, Spikes und Fehler verwenden und die Erstellung von projektspezifischen Problemen mit Optionen wie --project coordinatr unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar itens de trabalho autônomos por meio de conversação natural, utilizando detecção de tipo assistida por IA para tarefas, spikes e bugs, e suportando criação de problemas específicos de projeto com opções como --project coordinatr.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать самостоятельные рабочие элементы через естественную беседу, используя обнаружение типа с помощью ИИ для задач, спайков и ошибок, и поддержку создания проблем, специфичных для проекта, с опциями, такими как --project coordinatr.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء عناصر عمل مستقلة من خلال محادثة طبيعية، باستخدام اكتشاف النوع بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي للأعمال والزلازل والbugs، ودعم إنشاء مشاكل محددة للمشروع مع خيارات مثل --project coordinatr."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue tracking with AI-detected task types","Generating project-specific work items with --project flags","Debugging workflow integrations with natural conversation interfaces"],"zh":["使用 AI 检测的任务类型自动跟踪问题","使用 --project 标志生成项目特定的工作项","使用自然对话接口调试工作流集成"],"ja":["AI 検出によるタスクタイプを使用した問題追跡の自動化","--project フラグを使用したプロジェクト固有のワークアイテムの生成","自然な会話インターフェイスを使用したワークフロー統合のデバッグ"],"ko":["AI 감지된 태스크 유형을 사용하여 문제 추적 자동화","--project 플래그를 사용하여 프로젝트 특정 작업 항목 생성","자연스러운 대화 인터페이스를 사용하여 워크플로 통합 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de problemas con tipos de tareas detectados por IA","Generación de elementos de trabajo específicos del proyecto con indicadores --project","Depuración de integraciones de flujo de trabajo con interfaces de conversación natural"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des problèmes avec des types de tâches détectés par IA","Génération d''éléments de travail spécifiques au projet avec des indicateurs --project","Débogage des intégrations de workflow avec des interfaces de conversation naturelle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Fehlerverfolgung mit AI-erkannten Aufgabentypen","Erzeugung von projektspezifischen Arbeits-Elementen mit --project-Flags","Fehlerbehebung bei Workflow-Integrationen mit natürlichen Konversations-Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Automatizar o acompanhamento de problemas com tipos de tarefas detectados por IA","Gerar itens de trabalho específicos do projeto com flags --project","Depurar integrações de fluxo de trabalho com interfaces de conversação natural"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание проблем с обнаружением типов задач с помощью ИИ","Генерировать рабочие элементы, специфичные для проекта, с флагами --project","Отлаживать интеграции рабочего процесса с интерфейсами естественной беседы"],"ar":["أتمتة تتبع المشاكل بالاكتشاف النوعي للأعمال بمساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي","توليد عناصر عمل محددة للمشروع مع أعلام --project","تصحيح أخطاء تكاملات سير العمل بواجهات المحادثة الطبيعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code integration","Limited to specific issue types (TASK, SPIKE, BUG)"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 集成","仅限特定问题类型 (TASK, SPIKE, BUG)"],"ja":["Claude Code 統合が必要","特定の問題タイプ (TASK, SPIKE, BUG) だけに限定される"],"ko":["Claude Code 통합이 필요","특정 문제 유형 (TASK, SPIKE, BUG) 만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Limitado a tipos de problemas específicos (TAREA, SPIKE, ERROR)"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Limité à des types de problèmes spécifiques (TÂCHE, SPIKE, BOGUE)"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit Claude Code","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Problemtypen (AUFGABE, SPIKE, FEHLER)"],"pt":["Requer integração com Claude Code","Limitado a tipos de problemas específicos (TAREFA, SPIKE, BUG)"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Ограничен конкретными типами проблем (ЗАДАЧА, СПАЙК, ОШИБКА)"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع Claude Code","محدود بنوع محدد من المشاكل (مهمة، زلزال، خطأ)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
