ое резюме","оптимизация резюме","системы отслеживания кандидатов","развитие карьеры","резюме для конкретных вакансий"],"ar":["مُحسّن سيرة ذاتية","سيرة ذاتية مُحسّنة","تحسين سيرة ذاتية","نظام تتبع المرشحين","تطوير المسار الوظيفي","سيرة ذاتية للوظائف المحددة"]}},"owner":"haniakrim21","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"haniakrim21/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailored-resume-generator","description":"Analyzes job descriptions and generates tailored resumes that highlight relevant experience, skills, and achievements to maximize interview chances","bodyPreview":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifi","body":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifications, and keywords from job postings\n2. **Identifies Priorities**: Determines what employers value most based on the job description language and structure\n3. **Tailors Content**: Reorganizes and emphasizes relevant experience, skills, and achievements\n4. **Optimizes Keywords**: Incorporates ATS-friendly keywords naturally throughout the resume\n5. **Formats Professionally**: Creates clean, professional resume layouts suitable for various formats\n6. **Provides Recommendations**: Suggests improvements and highlights gaps to address\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Usage\nProvide a job description and your background information:\n\n```\nI''m applying for this job:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nHere''s my background:\n- 5 years as software engineer at TechCorp\n- Led team of 3 developers on mobile app project\n- Expert in Python, JavaScript, React\n- Computer Science degree from State University\n```\n\n### With Existing Resume\nUpload or paste your current resume along with the job description:\n\n```\nPlease tailor my resume for this position:\n\nJob Description:\n[paste job description]\n\nMy Current Resume:\n[paste resume content]\n```\n\n### Career Transition\nWhen changing industries or roles:\n\n```\nI''m transitioning from marketing to product management.\nHere''s the job I''m applying for:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nMy transferable experience:\n- 7 years in digital marketing\n- Led cross-functional teams\n- Managed product launches\n- Data analysis and A/B testing\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User Request:**\n```\nI need a tailored resume for this job:\n\nSenior Data Analyst Position\n\nRequirements:\n- 5+ years experience in data analysis\n- Expert in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools\n- Experience with A/B testing and statistical analysis\n- Strong communication skills to present findings\n- Healthcare industry experience preferred\n\nMy background:\n- Data Analyst at RetailCo (2019-2024)\n- Created dashboards using Tableau and Power BI\n- Built Python scripts for data automation\n- Worked with marketing team on campaign analysis\n- Business Analytics degree\n- Also did 1 year internship at HealthPlus clinic\n```\n\n**Generated Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# JOHN DOE\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nResults-driven Data Analyst with 5+ years of experience leveraging SQL, Python, and advanced\nvisualization tools to deliver actionable insights. Proven track record in statistical analysis,\nA/B testing, and cross-functional collaboration. Healthcare industry experience with strong\nability to communicate complex data findings to stakeholders.\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n- **Data Analysis & Programming**: SQL, Python, Statistical Analysis, A/B Testing\n- **Visualization Tools**: Tableau, Power BI, Advanced Dashboard Development\n- **Data Management**: Data Automation, ETL Processes, Database Optimization\n- **Business Intelligence**: Campaign Analytics, Performance Metrics, KPI Tracking\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\n**Data Analyst** | RetailCo | 2019 - 2024\n- Designed and implemented 50+ SQL queries and Python automation scripts, reducing manual\n  data processing time by 60%\n- Conducted rigorous A/B testing and statistical analysis for marketing campaigns,\n  improving campaign ROI by 35%\n- Built interactive Tableau and Power BI dashboards for executive team, enabling\n  data-driven decision making\n- Presented analytical findings to cross-functional stakeholders including marketing,\n  operations, and executive leadership\n- Collaborated with marketing team to analyze customer behavior patterns and optimize\n  targeting strategies\n\n**Data Analysis Intern** | HealthPlus Clinic | 2018 - 2019\n- Supported healthcare analytics initiatives by analyzing patient data and operational metrics\n- Gained exposure to healthcare industry data management and HIPAA compliance requirements\n- Assisted in creating reports for clinical staff to improve patient care workflows\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Business Analytics**\nState University | Graduated 2018\n\n## KEY ACHIEVEMENTS\n- Reduced data processing time by 60% through Python automation\n- Improved marketing campaign ROI by 35% through A/B testing and optimization\n- Created data visualization system now used across entire organization\n```\n\n**Additional Recommendations:**\n- Consider adding any specific healthcare projects or certifications\n- Quantify more achievements with metrics when possible\n- If you have experience with R or advanced statistical methods, add them\n- Consider mentioning any familiarity with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests resume tailoring:\n\n### 1. Gather Information\n\n**Job Description Analysis**:\n- Request the full job description if not provided\n- Ask for the company name and job title\n\n**Candidate Background**:\n- If user provides existing resume, use it as the foundation\n- If not, request:\n  - Work history (job titles, companies, dates, responsibilities)\n  - Education background\n  - Key skills and technical proficiencies\n  - Notable achievements and metrics\n  - Certifications or awards\n  - Any other relevant information\n\n### 2. Analyze Job Requirements\n\nExtract and prioritize:\n- **Must-have qualifications**: Years of experience, required skills, education\n- **Key skills**: Technical tools, methodologies, competencies\n- **Soft skills**: Communication, leadership, teamwork\n- **Industry knowledge**: Domain-specific experience\n- **Keywords**: Repeated terms, phrases, and buzzwords for ATS optimization\n- **Company values**: Cultural fit indicators from job description\n\nCreate a mental map of:\n- Priority 1: Critical requirements (deal-breakers)\n- Priority 2: Important qualifications (strongly desired)\n- Priority 3: Nice-to-have skills (bonus points)\n\n### 3. Map Candidate Experience to Requirements\n\nFor each job requirement:\n- Identify matching experience from candidate''s background\n- Find transferable skills if no direct match\n- Note gaps that need to be addressed or de-emphasized\n- Identify unique strengths to highlight\n\n### 4. Structure the Tailored Resume\n\n**Professional Summary** (3-4 lines):\n- Lead with years of experience in the target role/field\n- Include top 3-4 required skills from job description\n- Mention industry experience if relevant\n- Highlight unique value proposition\n\n**Technical/Core Skills Section**:\n- Group skills by category matching job requirements\n- List required tools and technologies first\n- Use exact terminology from job description\n- Only include skills you can substantiate with experience\n\n**Professional Experience**:\n- For each role, emphasize responsibilities and achievements aligned with job requirements\n- Use action verbs: Led, Developed, Implemented, Optimized, Managed, Created, Analyzed\n- **Quantify achievements**: Include numbers, percentages, timeframes, scale\n- Reorder bullet points to prioritize most relevant experience\n- Use keywords naturally from job description\n- Format: **[Action Verb] + [What] + [How/Why] + [Result/Impact]**\n\n**Education**:\n- List degrees, certifications relevant to position\n- Include relevant coursework if early career\n- Add certifications that match job requirements\n\n**Optional Sections** (if applicable):\n- Certifications & Licenses\n- Publications or Speaking Engagements\n- Awards & Recognition\n- Volunteer Work (if relevant to role)\n- Projects (especially for technical roles)\n\n### 5. Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n\n- Use standard section headings (Professional Experience, Education, Skills)\n- Incorporate exact keywords from job description naturally\n- Avoid tables, graphics, headers/footers, or complex formatting\n- Use standard fonts and bullet points\n- Include both acronyms and full terms (e.g., \"SQL (Structured Query Language)\")\n- Match job title terminology where truthful\n\n### 6. Format and Present\n\n**Format Options**:\n- **Markdown**: Clean, readable, easy to copy\n- **Plain Text**: ATS-optimized, safe for all systems\n- **Tips for Word/PDF**: Provide formatting guidance\n\n**Resume Structure Guidelines**:\n- Keep to 1 page for <10 years experience, 2 pages for 10+ years\n- Use consistent formatting and spacing\n- Ensure contact information is prominent\n- Use reverse chronological order (most recent first)\n- Maintain clean, scannable layout with white space\n\n### 7. Provide Strategic Recommendations\n\nAfter presenting the tailored resume, offer:\n\n**Strengths Analysis**:\n- What makes this candidate competitive\n- Unique qualifications to emphasize in cover letter or interview\n\n**Gap Analysis**:\n- Requirements not fully met\n- Suggestions for addressing gaps (courses, projects, reframing experience)\n\n**Interview Preparation Tips**:\n- Key talking points aligned with resume\n- Stories to prepare based on job requirements\n- Questions to ask that demonstrate fit\n\n**Cover Letter Hooks**:\n- Suggest 2-3 opening lines for cover letter\n- Key achievements to expand upon\n\n### 8. Iterate and Refine\n\nAsk if user wants to:\n- Adjust emphasis or tone\n- Add or remove sections\n- Generate alternative versions for different roles\n- Create format variations (traditional vs. modern)\n- Develop role-specific versions (if applying to multiple similar positions)\n\n### 9. Best Practices to Follow\n\n**Do**:\n- Be truthful and accurate - never fabricate experience\n- Use industry-standard terminology\n- Quantify achievements with specific metrics\n- Tailor each resume to specific job\n- Proofread for grammar and consistency\n- Keep language concise and impactful\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Include personal information (age, marital status, photo unless requested)\n- Use first-person pronouns (I, me, my)\n- Include references (\"available upon request\" is outdated)\n- List every job if career is 20+ years (focus on relevant, recent experience)\n- Use generic templates without customization\n- Exceed 2 pages unless very senior role\n\n### 10. Special Considerations\n\n**Career Changers**:\n- Use functional or hybrid resume format\n- Emphasize transferable skills\n- Create compelling narrative in summary\n- Focus on relevant projects and coursework\n\n**Recent Graduates**:\n- Lead with education\n- Include relevant coursework, projects, internships\n- Emphasize leadership in student organizations\n- Include GPA if 3.5+\n\n**Senior Executives**:\n- Lead with executive summary\n- Focus on leadership and strategic impact\n- Include board memberships, speaking engagements\n- Emphasize revenue growth, team building, vision\n\n**Technical Roles**:\n- Include technical skills section prominently\n- List programming languages, frameworks, tools\n- Include GitHub, portfolio, or project links\n- Mention methodologies (Agile, Scrum, etc.)\n\n**Creative Roles**:\n- Include link to portfolio\n- Highlight creative achievements and campaigns\n- Mention tools and software proficiencies\n- Consider more creative formatting (while maintaining ATS compatibility)\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- **Be specific**: Provide complete job descriptions and detailed background information\n- **Share metrics**: Include numbers, percentages, and quantifiable achievements when describing your experience\n- **Indicate format preference**: Let the skill know if you need ATS-optimized, creative, or traditional format\n- **Mention constraints**: Share any specific requirements (page limits, sections to include/exclude)\n- **Iterate**: Don''t hesitate to ask for revisions or alternative approaches\n- **Multiple applications**: Generate separate tailored versions for different roles\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill processes your personal and professional information to generate tailored resumes. Always review the output before submitting to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Remove or modify any information you prefer not to share with potential employers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:21:04.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Career Guidance Agents needing advanced resume customization and ATS optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级简历定制和申请跟踪系统优化能力的职业指导代理。","ja":"キャリアガイダンスエージェントが高度な履歴書カスタマイズとATS最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"진급을 위한 이력서.customization 및 ATS 최적화 기능이 필요한 職業 指導 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de orientación profesional que necesitan personalización avanzada de currículos y capacidades de optimización para sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes (ATS).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''orientation de carrière ayant besoin d''une personnalisation de curriculum vitae avancée et de capacités d''optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures (ATS).","de":"Perfekt für Karriereberatungsagenten, die erweiterte Möglichkeiten zur Anpassung von Lebensläufen und zur Optimierung von Bewerberverwaltungssystemen (ATS) benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Orientação de Carreira que necessitam de personalização avançada de currículos e capacidades de otimização do ATS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по карьерному консультированию, которым требуются продвинутые возможности настройки резюме и оптимизации ATS.","ar":"مثالي لعميل توجيه مسار الوظيفي الذي يحتاج إلى تخصيص متقدم لاستئناف العمل وابتكار نظام تتبع الطلبات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze job descriptions, extract key requirements, and generate tailored resumes using natural language processing, highlighting relevant experience and skills for career transitions and optimizing for Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS).","zh":"赋予代理分析工作描述、提取关键要求并使用自然语言处理生成定制的简历，突出相关经验和技能以实现职业转型，并针对申请者跟踪系统进行优化。","ja":"エージェントが求人描述を分析し、重要な要件を抽出し、自然言語処理を使用してカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成し、キャリア転換のための関連する経験とスキルを強調し、アプリカント・トラッキング・システムに最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 작업 설명을 분석하고 주요 요구 사항을 추출하여 자연어 처리를 사용하여 맞춤형 이력서를 생성하여 경력 전환을 위한 관련 경험과 기술을 강조하며 지원자 추적 시스템을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar descripciones de trabajo, extraer requisitos clave y generar currículos personalizados utilizando procesamiento de lenguaje natural, destacando experiencia y habilidades relevantes para transiciones laborales y optimizando para sistemas de seguimiento de solicitudes (ATS).","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les descriptions de poste, d''extraire les exigences clés et de générer des curriculum vitae personnalisés en utilisant le traitement automatique des langues, mettant en évidence l''expérience et les compétences pertinentes pour les transitions de carrière et en optimisant pour les systèmes de suivi des candidatures (ATS).","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Stellenbeschreibungen zu analysieren, Schlüsselanforderungen zu extrahieren und auf maßgeschneiderte Lebensläufe mithilfe der Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache hinzuweisen, relevante Erfahrung und Fähigkeiten für Karriereübergänge hervorzuheben und für Bewerberverwaltungssysteme (ATS) zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar descrições de trabalho, extrair requisitos-chave e gerar currículos personalizados usando processamento de linguagem natural, destacando experiência e habilidades relevantes para transições de carreira e otimizando para Sistemas de Rastreamento de Candidatos (ATS).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать описания работы, извлекать ключевые требования и генерировать индивидуальные резюме с использованием обработки естественного языка, подчеркивая соответствующий опыт и навыки для карьерных переходов и оптимизации для систем отслеживания заявок (ATS).","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحليل وصفات العمل، و استخراج المتطلبات الرئيسية، و إنتاج سيرة ذاتية مخصصة باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية، و تسليط الضوء على الخبرة والمهارات ذات الصلة لتحولات مسار الوظيفي و تحسين نظام تتبع الطلبات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating resume generation for specific job positions","Customizing resumes for different industries or roles","Optimizing resumes for ATS compatibility and improving candidate visibility"],"zh":["为特定工作职位自动生成简历","为不同行业或角色定制简历","优化简历以适应ATS兼容性并提高候选人可见性"],"ja":["特定の仕事のポジションのための履歴書の自動生成","さまざまな業界や役割のための履歴書のカスタマイズ","ATSの互換性のための履歴書の最適化と候補者の可視性の向上"],"ko":["특정 작업 위치에 대한 이력서 자동 생성","다른 산업 또는 역할을 위한 이력서 사용자 지정","ATS 호환성을 위한 이력서 최적화 및 후보자 가시성 개선"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de currículos para puestos de trabajo específicos","Personalizar currículos para diferentes industrias o roles","Optimizar currículos para la compatibilidad con ATS y mejorar la visibilidad de los candidatos"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de curriculum vitae pour des postes spécifiques","Personnaliser les curriculum vitae pour différents secteurs ou rôles","Optimiser les curriculum vitae pour la compatibilité avec les systèmes de suivi des candidatures (ATS) et améliorer la visibilité des candidats"],"de":["Automatisieren der Lebenslaugereration für bestimmte Stellen","Anpassen von Lebensläufen für verschiedene Branchen oder Rollen","Optimieren von Lebensläufen für die Kompatibilität mit Bewerberverwaltungssystemen (ATS) und Verbesserung der Sichtbarkeit der Bewerber"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de currículos para cargos de trabalho específicos","Personalizar currículos para diferentes indústrias ou funções","Otimizar currículos para compatibilidade com o ATS e melhorar a visibilidade do candidato"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию резюме для конкретных рабочих позиций","Настроить резюме для разных отраслей или ролей","Оптимизировать резюме для совместимости с ATS и улучшить видимость кандидата"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء سيرة ذاتية لمواقع وظيفية محددة","تخصيص سيرة ذاتية لمجالات أو أدوار مختلفة","تحسين سيرة ذاتية لتوافق نظام تتبع الطلبات و تحسين ظهور المرشح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires job description input","Limited to resume generation and customization","May require additional human review for final resume polish"],"zh":["需要工作描述输入","仅限于简历生成和定制","可能需要额外的人工审查以完成最终的简历抛光"],"ja":["求人描述の入力が必要","履歴書の生成とカスタマイズに限定される","最終的な履歴書の磨きに追加の人間によるレビューが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["작업 설명 입력이 필요함","이력서 생성 및 사용자 지정에만 제한됨","최종 이력서를完成하기 위해 추가적인 인간의 검토가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la entrada de descripciones de trabajo","Limitado a la generación y personalización de currículos","Puede requerir una revisión adicional humana para el pulido final del currículum"],"fr":["Nécessite la saisie de descriptions de poste","Limité à la génération et à la personnalisation de curriculum vitae","Peut nécessiter un examen humain supplémentaire pour le polissage final du curriculum vitae"],"de":["Benötigt die Eingabe von Stellenbeschreibungen","Begrenzt auf die Generierung und Anpassung von Lebensläufen","Kann eine zusätzliche menschliche Überprüfung für den endgültigen Feinschliff des Lebenslaufs erfordern"],"pt":["Requer entrada de descrição de trabalho","Limitado à geração e personalização de currículos","Pode exigir revisão adicional humana para polir o currículo final"],"ru":["Требует ввода описания работы","Ограничен генерацией и настройкой резюме","Может потребовать дополнительного человеческого обзора для окончательной доработки резюме"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال وصف العمل","محدود بإنشاء و تخصيص السيرة الذاتية","يمكن أن يتطلب مراجعة إضافية من قبل الإنسان لتنعيم السيرة الذاتية النهائية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('akiojin/playfab-mcp-server/Writing Hookify Rules', 'community', 'akiojin', 'playfab-mcp-server', 'akiojin/playfab-mcp-server', 'Writing Hookify Rules', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z', '2026-02-18T13:22:05.555Z', NULL, '{"id":"akiojin/playfab-mcp-server/Writing Hookify Rules","name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":{"es":"Las reglas Hookify permiten definir patrones y mensajes personalizados para PlayFab MCP. Aprende a crearlas con YAML y markdown.","fr":"Les règles Hookify permettent de définir des modèles et des messages personnalisés pour PlayFab MCP. Découvrez comment les créer avec YAML et markdown.","de":"Hookify-Regeln ermöglichen die Definition von Mustern und benutzerdefinierten Nachrichten für PlayFab MCP. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie mit YAML und markdown erstellen.","pt":"As regras Hookify permitem automatizar notificações no PlayFab MCP com CI/CD e release-please, utilizando arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML","ru":"Правила Hookify позволяют автоматизировать уведомления на сервере PlayFab MCP с CI/CD и release-please, используя файлы markdown с YAML-заголовком","ar":"تسمح قواعد Hookify بتلقيم الإشعارات في خادم PlayFab MCP مع CI/CD و release-please، باستخدام ملفات markdown مع YAML-المعلومات الأمامية","en":"PlayFab MCP server with CI/CD and release-please"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Escribir reglas Hookify para PlayFab MCP","fr":"Écrire des règles Hookify pour PlayFab MCP","de":"Hookify-Regeln für PlayFab MCP schreiben","pt":"Regras Hookify: Automatize Notificações com YAML","ru":"Правила Hookify: Автоматизация Уведомлений с YAML","ar":"قواعد Hookify: تلقيم الإشعارات باستخدام YAML","en":"Writing Hookify Rules"},"description":{"es":"Las reglas Hookify permiten definir patrones y mensajes personalizados para PlayFab MCP. Aprende a crearlas con YAML y markdown.","fr":"Les règles Hookify permettent de définir des modèles et des messages personnalisés pour PlayFab MCP. Découvrez comment les créer avec YAML et markdown.","de":"Hookify-Regeln ermöglichen die Definition von Mustern und benutzerdefinierten Nachrichten für PlayFab MCP. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie mit YAML und markdown er...","pt":"As regras Hookify permitem automatizar notificações no PlayFab MCP com CI/CD e release-please, utilizando arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML","ru":"Правила Hookify позволяют автоматизировать уведомления на сервере PlayFab MCP с CI/CD и release-please, используя файлы markdown с YAML-заголовком","ar":"تسمح قواعد Hookify بتلقيم الإشعارات في خادم PlayFab MCP مع CI/CD و release-please، باستخدام ملفات markdown مع YAML-المعلومات الأمامية","en":"PlayFab MCP server with CI/CD and release-please"},"definition":{"en":"PlayFab MCP server with CI/CD and release-please"},"features":{"es":["Definir patrones con expresiones regulares","Crear mensajes personalizados con markdown","Habilitar o deshabilitar reglas individuales","Almacenar reglas en archivos markdown locales","Integración con PlayFab MCP y CI/CD"],"fr":["Définir des modèles avec des expressions régulières","Créer des messages personnalisés avec markdown","Activer ou désactiver des règles individuelles","Stockage des règles dans des fichiers markdown locaux","Intégration avec PlayFab MCP et CI/CD"],"de":["Muster mit regulären Ausdrücken definieren","Benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten mit markdown erstellen","Regeln individuell aktivieren oder deaktivieren","Regeln in lokalen Markdown-Dateien speichern","Integration mit PlayFab MCP und CI/CD"],"pt":["Arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML","Padrões personalizados para assistir","Mensagens personalizadas para exibir","Integração com PlayFab MCP","Suporte a CI/CD e release-please"],"ru":["Файлы markdown с YAML-заголовком","Пользовательские шаблоны для наблюдения","Пользовательские сообщения для отображения","Интеграция с сервером PlayFab MCP","Поддержка CI/CD и release-please"],"ar":["ملفات markdown مع YAML-المعلومات الأمامية","أنماط مخصصة للمراقبة","رسائل مخصصة لإظهارها","التكامل مع خادم PlayFab MCP","دعم CI/CD و release-please"]},"keywords":{"es":["reglas Hookify","PlayFab MCP","CI/CD","release-please","YAML","markdown","desarrollo de juegos","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["règles Hookify","PlayFab MCP","CI/CD","release-please","YAML","markdown","développement de jeux","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Hookify-Regeln","PlayFab MCP","CI/CD","release-please","YAML","markdown","Spieleentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Regras Hookify","PlayFab MCP","CI/CD","release-please","Automatização de notificações","YAML","Markdown"],"ru":["Правила Hookify","Сервер PlayFab MCP","CI/CD","release-please","Автоматизация уведомлений","YAML","Markdown"],"ar":["قواعد Hookify","خادم PlayFab MCP","CI/CD","release-please","تلقيم الإشعارات","YAML","Markdown"]}},"owner":"akiojin","repo":"playfab-mcp-server","repoPath":"akiojin/playfab-mcp-server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a hookify rule, write a hook rule, configure hookify, add a hookify rule, or needs guidance on hookify rule syntax and patterns.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggest","body":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggestions, etc.\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\n**name** (required): Unique identifier for the rule\n- Use kebab-case: `warn-dangerous-rm`, `block-console-log`\n- Be descriptive and action-oriented\n- Start with verb: warn, prevent, block, require, check\n\n**enabled** (required): Boolean to activate/deactivate\n- `true`: Rule is active\n- `false`: Rule is disabled (won''t trigger)\n- Can toggle without deleting rule\n\n**event** (required): Which hook event to trigger on\n- `bash`: Bash tool commands\n- `file`: Edit, Write, MultiEdit tools\n- `stop`: When agent wants to stop\n- `prompt`: When user submits a prompt\n- `all`: All events\n\n**action** (optional): What to do when rule matches\n- `warn`: Show message but allow operation (default)\n- `block`: Prevent operation (PreToolUse) or stop session (Stop events)\n- If omitted, defaults to `warn`\n\n**pattern** (simple format): Regex pattern to match\n- Used for simple single-condition rules\n- Matches against command (bash) or new_text (file)\n- Python regex syntax\n\n**Example:**\n```yaml\nevent: bash\npattern: rm\\s+-rf\n```\n\n### Advanced Format (Multiple Conditions)\n\nFor complex rules with multiple conditions:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: warn-env-file-edits\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.env$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: API_KEY\n---\n\nYou''re adding an API key to a .env file. Ensure this file is in .gitignore!\n```\n\n**Condition fields:**\n- `field`: Which field to check\n  - For bash: `command`\n  - For file: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- `operator`: How to match\n  - `regex_match`: Regex pattern matching\n  - `contains`: Substring check\n  - `equals`: Exact match\n  - `not_contains`: Substring must NOT be present\n  - `starts_with`: Prefix check\n  - `ends_with`: Suffix check\n- `pattern`: Pattern or string to match\n\n**All conditions must match for rule to trigger.**\n\n## Message Body\n\nThe markdown content after frontmatter is shown to Claude when the rule triggers.\n\n**Good messages:**\n- Explain what was detected\n- Explain why it''s problematic\n- Suggest alternatives or best practices\n- Use formatting for clarity (bold, lists, etc.)\n\n**Example:**\n```markdown\n⚠️ **Console.log detected!**\n\nYou''re adding console.log to production code.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Debug logs shouldn''t ship to production\n- Console.log can expose sensitive data\n- Impacts browser performance\n\n**Alternatives:**\n- Use a proper logging library\n- Remove before committing\n- Use conditional debug builds\n```\n\n## Event Type Guide\n\n### bash Events\n\nMatch Bash command patterns:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: bash\npattern: sudo\\s+|rm\\s+-rf|chmod\\s+777\n---\n\nDangerous command detected!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Dangerous commands: `rm\\s+-rf`, `dd\\s+if=`, `mkfs`\n- Privilege escalation: `sudo\\s+`, `su\\s+`\n- Permission issues: `chmod\\s+777`, `chown\\s+root`\n\n### file Events\n\nMatch Edit/Write/MultiEdit operations:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\npattern: console\\.log\\(|eval\\(|innerHTML\\s*=\n---\n\nPotentially problematic code pattern detected!\n```\n\n**Match on different fields:**\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.tsx?$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: console\\.log\\(\n---\n\nConsole.log in TypeScript file!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Debug code: `console\\.log\\(`, `debugger`, `print\\(`\n- Security risks: `eval\\(`, `innerHTML\\s*=`, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`\n- Sensitive files: `\\.env$`, `credentials`, `\\.pem$`\n- Generated files: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`\n\n### stop Events\n\nMatch when agent wants to stop (completion checks):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: stop\npattern: .*\n---\n\nBefore stopping, verify:\n- [ ] Tests were run\n- [ ] Build succeeded\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n**Use for:**\n- Reminders about required steps\n- Completion checklists\n- Process enforcement\n\n### prompt Events\n\nMatch user prompt content (advanced):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: prompt\nconditions:\n  - field: user_prompt\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: deploy to production\n---\n\nProduction deployment checklist:\n- [ ] Tests passing?\n- [ ] Reviewed by team?\n- [ ] Monitoring ready?\n```\n\n## Pattern Writing Tips\n\n### Regex Basics\n\n**Literal characters:** Most characters match themselves\n- `rm` matches \"rm\"\n- `console.log` matches \"console.log\"\n\n**Special characters need escaping:**\n- `.` (any char) → `\\.` (literal dot)\n- `(` `)` → `\\(` `\\)` (literal parens)\n- `[` `]` → `\\[` `\\]` (literal brackets)\n\n**Common metacharacters:**\n- `\\s` - whitespace (space, tab, newline)\n- `\\d` - digit (0-9)\n- `\\w` - word character (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, _)\n- `.` - any character\n- `+` - one or more\n- `*` - zero or more\n- `?` - zero or one\n- `|` - OR\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nrm\\s+-rf         Matches: rm -rf, rm  -rf\nconsole\\.log\\(   Matches: console.log(\n(eval|exec)\\(    Matches: eval( or exec(\nchmod\\s+777      Matches: chmod 777, chmod  777\nAPI_KEY\\s*=      Matches: API_KEY=, API_KEY =\n```\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\nTest regex patterns before using:\n\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import re; print(re.search(r''your_pattern'', ''test text''))\"\n```\n\nOr use online regex testers (regex101.com with Python flavor).\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Too broad:**\n```yaml\npattern: log    # Matches \"log\", \"login\", \"dialog\", \"catalog\"\n```\nBetter: `console\\.log\\(|logger\\.`\n\n**Too specific:**\n```yaml\npattern: rm -rf /tmp  # Only matches exact path\n```\nBetter: `rm\\s+-rf`\n\n**Escaping issues:**\n- YAML quoted strings: `\"pattern\"` requires double backslashes `\\\\s`\n- YAML unquoted: `pattern: \\s` works as-is\n- **Recommendation**: Use unquoted patterns in YAML\n\n## File Organization\n\n**Location:** All rules in `.claude/` directory\n**Naming:** `.claude/hookify.{descriptive-name}.local.md`\n**Gitignore:** Add `.claude/*.local.md` to `.gitignore`\n\n**Good names:**\n- `hookify.dangerous-rm.local.md`\n- `hookify.console-log.local.md`\n- `hookify.require-tests.local.md`\n- `hookify.sensitive-files.local.md`\n\n**Bad names:**\n- `hookify.rule1.local.md` (not descriptive)\n- `hookify.md` (missing .local)\n- `danger.local.md` (missing hookify prefix)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Creating a Rule\n\n1. Identify unwanted behavior\n2. Determine which tool is involved (Bash, Edit, etc.)\n3. Choose event type (bash, file, stop, etc.)\n4. Write regex pattern\n5. Create `.claude/hookify.{name}.local.md` file in project root\n6. Test immediately - rules are read dynamically on next tool use\n\n### Refining a Rule\n\n1. Edit the `.local.md` file\n2. Adjust pattern or message\n3. Test immediately - changes take effect on next tool use\n\n### Disabling a Rule\n\n**Temporary:** Set `enabled: false` in frontmatter\n**Permanent:** Delete the `.local.md` file\n\n## Examples\n\nSee `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/examples/` for complete examples:\n- `dangerous-rm.local.md` - Block dangerous rm commands\n- `console-log-warning.local.md` - Warn about console.log\n- `sensitive-files-warning.local.md` - Warn about editing .env files\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Minimum viable rule:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: bash\npattern: dangerous_command\n---\n\nWarning message here\n```\n\n**Rule with conditions:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.ts$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: any\n---\n\nWarning message\n```\n\n**Event types:**\n- `bash` - Bash commands\n- `file` - File edits\n- `stop` - Completion checks\n- `prompt` - User input\n- `all` - All events\n\n**Field options:**\n- Bash: `command`\n- File: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- Prompt: `user_prompt`\n\n**Operators:**\n- `regex_match`, `contains`, `equals`, `not_contains`, `starts_with`, `ends_with`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:22:05.555Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude needing custom event handling and notification capabilities through YAML frontmatter and markdown files.","zh":"非常适合需要自定义事件处理和通知能力的AI代理，如Claude，通过YAML前置和markdown文件实现。","ja":"Claudeのようなカスタムイベントハンドリングと通知機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。YAMLフロントマターとマークダウンファイルを使用して実現します。","ko":"Claude와 같은 사용자 정의 이벤트 처리 및 알림 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. YAML 프론티어와 마크다운 파일을 통해 구현됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude que necesitan capacidades de manejo de eventos personalizados y notificaciones a través de YAML frontmatter y archivos markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude ayant besoin d''une gestion d''événements personnalisée et de capacités de notification via YAML frontmatter et des fichiers markdown.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, die benutzerdefinierte Ereignishandhabung und Benachrichtigungsfunktionen über YAML-Frontmatter und Markdown-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude que necessitam de tratamento de eventos personalizados e capacidades de notificação por meio de frontmatter YAML e arquivos markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, которые требуют настраиваемой обработки событий и возможностей уведомления через YAML frontmatter и файлы markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude التي تحتاج إلى معالجة أحداث مخصصة وقدرات إعلام من خلال YAML frontmatter وملفات markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define patterns and messages using regex patterns and markdown formatting, triggering custom responses based on events like bash, file, stop, prompt, or all, stored in .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md files.","zh":"赋予代理定义使用正则表达式模式和markdown格式的模式和消息的能力，触发基于事件的自定义响应，如bash、文件、停止、提示或全部，存储在.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md文件中。","ja":"エージェントが正規表現パターンとマークダウン形式を使用してパターンとメッセージを定義し、bash、ファイル、停止、プロンプト、またはすべてなどのイベントに基づいてカスタムレスポンスをトリガーする機能を提供します。.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.mdファイルに保存されます。","ko":"에이전트가 정규식 패턴과 마크다운 형식을 사용하여 패턴과 메시지를 정의하고, bash, 파일, 중지, 프롬프트 또는 모든 것과 같은 이벤트를 기반으로 사용자 지정 응답을 트리거하는 기능을 제공합니다. .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md 파일에 저장됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir patrones y mensajes utilizando patrones de regex y formato de markdown, desencadenando respuestas personalizadas basadas en eventos como bash, archivo, detener, prompt o todos, almacenados en archivos .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des modèles et des messages en utilisant des modèles de regex et un format de markdown, déclenchant des réponses personnalisées en fonction d''événements tels que bash, fichier, arrêter, invite ou tous, stockés dans des fichiers .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Muster und Nachrichten mithilfe von Regex-Mustern und Markdown-Formatierung zu definieren, die benutzerdefinierte Antworten auf Ereignisse wie bash, Datei, stoppen, Prompt oder alle auslösen, die in Dateien .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md gespeichert sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir padrões e mensagens usando padrões regex e formatação markdown, acionando respostas personalizadas com base em eventos como bash, arquivo, parar, prompt ou todos, armazenados em arquivos .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять шаблоны и сообщения, используя шаблоны regex и форматирование markdown, запуская пользовательские ответы на основе событий, таких как bash, файл, остановка, запрос или все, хранящиеся в файлах .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تعريف الأنماط والرسائل باستخدام أنماط regex وتنسيق markdown ، وتفعيل استجابات مخصصة بناءً على أحداث مثل bash وملف وايقاف وتعليق أو كلها ، المخزنة في ملفات .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining custom event handlers for PlayFab MCP servers","Generating notifications based on regex pattern matches","Creating markdown-formatted messages for Claude"],"zh":["为PlayFab MCP服务器定义自定义事件处理程序","根据正则表达式匹配生成通知","为Claude创建markdown格式的消息"],"ja":["PlayFab MCPサーバーのカスタムイベントハンドラーを定義する","正規表現パターンマッチに基づいて通知を生成する","Claude用のマークダウン形式のメッセージを作成する"],"ko":["PlayFab MCP 서버를 위한 사용자 정의 이벤트 핸들러 정의","정규식 패턴 일치에 기반한 알림 생성","Claude를 위한 마크다운 형식의 메시지 생성"],"es":["Definir controladores de eventos personalizados para servidores PlayFab MCP","Generar notificaciones en función de coincidencias de patrones de regex","Crear mensajes con formato markdown para Claude"],"fr":["Définir des gestionnaires d''événements personnalisés pour les serveurs PlayFab MCP","Générer des notifications en fonction de correspondances de modèles de regex","Créer des messages formatés markdown pour Claude"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Ereignishandler für PlayFab-MCP-Server definieren","Benachrichtigungen auf Basis von Regex-Mustertreffer generieren","Markdown-formatierte Nachrichten für Claude erstellen"],"pt":["Definindo manipuladores de eventos personalizados para servidores PlayFab MCP","Gerando notificações com base em correspondências de padrões regex","Criando mensagens formatadas em markdown para Claude"],"ru":["Определение пользовательских обработчиков событий для серверов PlayFab MCP","Генерация уведомлений на основе совпадений шаблонов regex","Создание сообщений, отформатированных в markdown, для Claude"],"ar":["تحديد معالجات أحداث مخصصة لخادم PlayFab MCP","توليد الإشعارات بناءً على مطابقات أنماط regex","إنشاء رسائل مع تنسيق markdown لبرنامج Claude"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PlayFab MCP server setup","CI/CD and release-please integration needed","Stored in specific .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md file format"],"zh":["需要PlayFab MCP服务器设置","需要CI/CD和release-please集成","存储在特定的.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md文件格式中"],"ja":["PlayFab MCPサーバーの設定が必要","CI/CDとrelease-pleaseの統合が必要","特定の.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.mdファイル形式で保存される"],"ko":["PlayFab MCP 서버 설정이 필요합니다","CI/CD 및 release-please 통합이 필요합니다","특정 .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md 파일 형식으로 저장됩니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de servidor PlayFab MCP","Se necesita integración de CI/CD y release-please","Almacenados en formato de archivo .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md específico"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de serveur PlayFab MCP","Une intégration de CI/CD et release-please est nécessaire","Stockés dans un format de fichier .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md spécifique"],"de":["Benötigt PlayFab-MCP-Server-Setup","CI/CD- und release-please-Integration erforderlich","Gespeichert im spezifischen Dateiformat .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md"],"pt":["Exige configuração do servidor PlayFab MCP","Necessário integração com CI/CD e release-please","Armazenado em formato de arquivo .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md específico"],"ru":["Требует настройки сервера PlayFab MCP","Необходимо интегрирование с CI/CD и release-please","Хранится в специальном формате файла .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم PlayFab MCP","يتطلب تكامل CI/CD و release-please","مخزنة في تنسيق ملف .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md محدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ManuelKugelmann/BitBot/claude-get-session-info', 'community', 'ManuelKugelmann', 'BitBot', 'ManuelKugelmann/BitBot', 'claude-get-session-info', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z', '2026-02-18T13:21:51.044Z', NULL, '{"id":"ManuelKugelmann/BitBot/claude-get-session-info","name":"claude-get-session-info","description":{"zh":"Claude 会话信息获取是一个共享的实用工具，用于会话管理，通过脚本源码使用，导出环境变量","ja":"Claude セッション情報取得は、セッション管理のための共有ユーティリティです。スクリプトソースを使用して、環境変数をエクスポートします","ko":"Claude 세션 정보 가져오기는 세션 관리를 위한 공유 유틸리티입니다. 스크립트 소스를 사용하여 환경 변수를 내보냅니다","es":"La habilidad de Claude para obtener información de sesión es una utilidad compartida para la gestión de sesiones que exporta variables de entorno CLAUDE_PID y SESSION_ID.","fr":"La compétence de Claude pour obtenir des informations de session est une utility partagée pour la gestion des sessions qui exporte les variables d''environnement CLAUDE_PID et SESSION_ID.","de":"Die Fähigkeit von Claude, um Sitzungsinformationen zu erhalten, ist eine gemeinsam genutzte Utility für die Sitzungsverwaltung, die die Umgebungsvariablen CLAUDE_PID und SESSION_ID exportiert.","pt":"A habilidade claude-get-session-info é uma utilidade compartilhada para gerenciamento de sessões, que exporta variáveis de ambiente CLAUDE_PID e SESSION_ID","ru":"Навык claude-get-session-info является общей утилитой для управления сессиями, который экспортирует переменные среды CLAUDE_PID и SESSION_ID","ar":"مهارة claude-get-session-info هي أداة مشتركة لإدارة الجلسات، التي تصدر متغيرات بيئة CLAUDE_PID و SESSION_ID","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Claude 会话信息获取","ja":"Claude セッション情報取得","ko":"Claude 세션 정보 가져오기","es":"Obtén información de sesión con Claude","fr":"Obtenez des informations de session avec Claude","de":"Erhalten Sie Sitzungsinformationen mit Claude","pt":"Obtenha informações de sessão com Claude","ru":"Получите и