:"sc-managing-worktrees 스킬은 Git 작업 트리를 관리하고 표준화된 구조와 추적 기능을 제공","es":"sc-managing-worktrees es una habilidad que te permite gestionar worktrees de Git con una estructura y seguimiento estándar.","fr":"sc-managing-worktrees est une compétence qui vous permet de gérer des worktrees Git avec une structure et un suivi standard.","de":"sc-managing-worktrees ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Ihnen ermöglicht, Git-Worktrees mit einer standardmäßigen Struktur und Nachverfolgung zu verwalten.","pt":"O skill de gerenciamento de worktrees permite criar, scanear e limpar worktrees com facilidade","ru":"Навык управления worktrees позволяет создавать, сканировать и очищать worktrees с легкостью","ar":"مهارة إدارة شجرة العمل تمكن من إنشاء و مسح و تنظيف شجرة العمل بسهولة","en":"The neural network of developer creativity"},"definition":{"en":"The neural network of developer creativity"},"features":{"zh":["创建工作树","扫描工作树","清理工作树","标准化工作树结构","跟踪工作树变化","支持多语言"],"ja":["ワークツリーの作成","ワークツリーのスキャン","ワークツリーのクリーンアップ","ワークツリー構造の標準化","ワークツリーの変更追跡","多言語対応"],"ko":["작업 트리 생성","작업 트리 스캔","작업 트리 클리닝","작업 트리 구조 표준화","작업 트리 변경 추적","다국어 지원"],"es":["Crea worktrees de Git con una estructura estándar","Escanea worktrees para detectar cambios y problemas","Limpia worktrees para eliminar archivos y directorios innecesarios","Utiliza el comando /sc-git-worktree para invocar la habilidad","Delega tareas a agentes especializados a través de la herramienta Task"],"fr":["Créez des worktrees Git avec une structure standard","Scannez les worktrees pour détecter les changements et les problèmes","Nettoyez les worktrees pour supprimer les fichiers et les dossiers inutiles","Utilisez la commande /sc-git-worktree pour invoquer la compétence","Déleguez des tâches à des agents spécialisés via l''outil Task"],"de":["Erstellen Sie Git-Worktrees mit einer standardmäßigen Struktur","Scannen Sie Worktrees, um Änderungen und Probleme zu erkennen","Bereinigen Sie Worktrees, um unnötige Dateien und Verzeichnisse zu entfernen","Verwenden Sie den Befehl /sc-git-worktree, um die Fähigkeit aufzurufen","Delegieren Sie Aufgaben an spezialisierte Agenten über das Task-Tool"],"pt":["Criação de worktrees com estrutura padrão","Rastreamento de worktrees","Scan de worktrees para recomendações","Limpeza de worktrees desnecessários","Integração com o Task tool"],"ru":["Создание worktrees со стандартной структурой","Отслеживание worktrees","Сканирование worktrees для рекомендаций","Очистка ненужных worktrees","Интеграция с Task tool"],"ar":["إنشاء شجرة العمل مع هيكل معياري","تتبع شجرة العمل","مسح شجرة العمل لتحسينات","تنظيف شجرة العمل غير ضرورية","التكامل مع أداة المهمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git工作树管理","sc-managing-worktrees","Git工作树创建","Git工作树扫描","Git工作树清理","Git工作树跟踪","Git工作树标准化","Git开发工具"],"ja":["Gitワークツリー管理","sc-managing-worktrees","Gitワークツリー作成","Gitワークツリースキャン","Gitワークツリークリーンアップ","Gitワークツリー追跡","Gitワークツリー標準化","Git開発ツール"],"ko":["Git 작업 트리 관리","sc-managing-worktrees","Git 작업 트리 생성","Git 작업 트리 스캔","Git 작업 트리 클리닝","Git 작업 트리 추적","Git 작업 트리 표준화","Git 개발 도구"],"es":["sc-managing-worktrees","Git worktrees","gestión de worktrees","creación de worktrees","escaneo de worktrees","limpieza de worktrees","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["sc-managing-worktrees","worktrees Git","gestion de worktrees","création de worktrees","scannage de worktrees","nettoyage de worktrees","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["sc-managing-worktrees","Git-Worktrees","Verwaltung von Worktrees","Erstellung von Worktrees","Scannen von Worktrees","Bereinigung von Worktrees","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["gerenciamento de worktrees","git worktrees","rastreamento de worktrees","criação de worktrees","limpeza de worktrees","task tool","desenvolvimento de software","controle de versão"],"ru":["управление worktrees","git worktrees","отслеживание worktrees","создание worktrees","очистка worktrees","task tool","разработка программного обеспечения","контроль версий"],"ar":["إدارة شجرة العمل","شجرة العمل الجيت","تتبع شجرة العمل","إنشاء شجرة العمل","تنظيف شجرة العمل","أداة المهمة","تطوير البرمجيات","مراقبة الإصدار"]}},"owner":"randlee","repo":"synaptic-canvas","repoPath":"randlee/synaptic-canvas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sc-managing-worktrees","description":">","version":"0.8.0","bodyPreview":"# Managing Git Worktrees\n\nUse this skill to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking. Use the `/sc-git-worktree` command to invoke this skill.\n\n## Agent Delegation\n\nThis skill delegates to specialized agents via the **Task tool**:\n\n| Operation | Agent | Returns |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Create | `sc-worktree-create` | JSON: success, path, branch, tracking_row |\n| Scan | `sc-worktree-scan` | JSON: success, worktrees list, recommendations |\n| Cleanup | `sc-worktree-cleanup","body":"# Managing Git Worktrees\n\nUse this skill to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking. Use the `/sc-git-worktree` command to invoke this skill.\n\n## Agent Delegation\n\nThis skill delegates to specialized agents via the **Task tool**:\n\n| Operation | Agent | Returns |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| Create | `sc-worktree-create` | JSON: success, path, branch, tracking_row |\n| Scan | `sc-worktree-scan` | JSON: success, worktrees list, recommendations |\n| Cleanup | `sc-worktree-cleanup` | JSON: success, branch_deleted, tracking_update |\n| Abort | `sc-worktree-abort` | JSON: success, worktree_removed, tracking_update |\n| Update | `sc-worktree-update` | JSON: success, commits_pulled, conflicts (if any) |\n\nTo invoke an agent, use the Task tool with:\n- Prompt file: `.claude/agents/<agent-name>.md`\n- Parameters as documented in each agent''s Inputs section\n\n## Standards and paths\n- Repo root: current directory.\n- Default worktree base: `../synaptic-canvas-worktrees`.\n- Worktrees live in `<worktree_base>/<branch>`.\n- Tracking document (if used): `<worktree_base>/worktree-tracking.md` must be updated on create/scan/cleanup/abandon. Allow a toggle to disable tracking for repos that don''t use it.\n- Naming: worktree directory = branch name; branch naming follows repo policy (e.g., master release; develop/DevBranch integration; feature from integration; hotfix from master; release branches as needed).\n- Branch protections/hooks: no direct commits to protected branches; ensure hooks/branch protections are respected across worktrees.\n- Cleanliness: worktrees must be removed and tracking updated when work is complete or branch is merged.\n\n## Protected Branch Configuration\n\nProtected branches (main, develop, master, etc.) require special handling to prevent accidental deletion:\n\n```yaml\n# Configuration (typically in repo .claude/config or passed to agents)\ngit_flow:\n  enabled: true  # boolean: whether git-flow workflow is used\n  main_branch: \"main\"  # or \"master\" - the primary production branch\n  develop_branch: \"develop\"  # only if git_flow.enabled = true\n\nprotected_branches:\n  - \"main\"\n  - \"develop\"\n  - \"master\"\n  # Can include additional patterns: \"release/*\", \"hotfix/*\"\n```\n\n**Protected Branch Rules:**\n- If `git_flow.enabled: false` → protect only `main_branch`\n- If `git_flow.enabled: true` → protect `main_branch` + `develop_branch`\n- Additional branches can be added to `protected_branches` array\n- **Cleanup/abort agents NEVER delete protected branches** (local or remote)\n- Protected branches can only be removed from worktrees, never deleted\n- Use `--update` to safely pull changes for protected branches in worktrees\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Scaffolding (if missing)\n- Ensure base path exists: `<worktree_base>`. If missing, create it.\n- If tracking is enabled, ensure tracking doc exists with headers.\n\n### Create worktree (and branch)\n1) Inputs: `--branch <name>`, `--base <master|develop|...>`, optional `--path`.\n2) Ensure scaffolding/tracking doc exists (if enabled); fetch all: `git fetch --all --prune`.\n3) Confirm base branch exists and is up to date.\n4) Determine path: default `<worktree_base>/<branch>` (or override).\n5) Create branch/worktree:\n   - If branch does not yet exist: `git worktree add -b <branch> <path> <base>`.\n   - If branch exists: `git worktree add <path> <branch>`.\n6) In the new worktree, ensure hooks apply and verify status is clean.\n7) If tracking enabled, add/refresh entry in tracking doc (branch, path, base, purpose, owner, created date, status).\n8) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-create` agent; it returns structured JSON (tracking row, status).\n\n### Scan/verify worktrees\n1) List worktrees: `git worktree list --porcelain`.\n2) Cross-check tracking doc (if enabled); flag missing/stale entries or extra rows.\n3) For each worktree, check status and merge state:\n   - `git -C <path> status --short`\n   - `git -C <path> fetch`\n   - `git branch --remotes --contains <branch>` to see if merged.\n4) Identify issues: untracked changes, diverged branches, merged-but-not-cleaned worktrees, missing tracking entries.\n5) Update tracking doc with current state and issues (if enabled); propose cleanup where appropriate.\n6) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-scan` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Clean-up worktree (post-merge or finished work)\n1) **Check if branch is protected**: If branch is in protected_branches list, ONLY remove worktree, NEVER delete the branch.\n2) If `git status` is not clean, stop and request explicit approval/coordination.\n3) Ensure all work is committed/pushed or explicitly confirmed to discard.\n4) Confirm target branch merged or otherwise approved for removal.\n5) Remove worktree: `git worktree remove <path>` (use `--force` only with approval).\n6) For **non-protected branches**: If merged and no unique commits, delete the branch locally (`git branch -d <branch>`) and remotely (`git push origin --delete <branch>`) by default; only skip if the user explicitly opts out. If the remote branch is already absent, continue without error. If not merged, only delete with explicit approval.\n7) For **protected branches**: Only remove worktree, preserve branch locally and remotely. Update tracking to note \"worktree removed, branch preserved (protected)\".\n8) If tracking enabled, update tracking doc to remove/mark cleaned with merge SHA/date.\n9) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-cleanup` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Abandon worktree (discard work)\n1) **Check if branch is protected**: If branch is in protected_branches list, ONLY remove worktree, NEVER delete the branch.\n2) If `git status` is not clean, stop and request explicit approval/coordination.\n3) Confirm user approval to discard local changes and optionally delete the branch.\n4) Remove worktree: `git worktree remove <path>` (force only with approval).\n5) For **non-protected branches**: If instructed, delete the branch locally (`git branch -D <branch>`) and remotely (`git push origin --delete <branch>`).\n6) For **protected branches**: Only remove worktree, preserve branch locally and remotely. Require confirmation: \"Branch is protected. Remove worktree but preserve branch?\"\n7) If tracking enabled, update tracking doc to remove the entry and note abandonment.\n8) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-abort` agent; it returns structured JSON.\n\n### Update protected branch (pull latest changes)\n1) **Verify branch is protected**: Only operates on branches in protected_branches list. If no branch is specified, update all protected branches that have worktrees.\n2) Check if worktree exists at expected path; error if missing.\n3) If `git status` is not clean, stop and report dirty state.\n4) Fetch and pull: `git fetch origin <branch>` then `git pull origin <branch>`.\n5) **If merge conflicts occur**:\n   - Collect conflicted files: `git diff --name-only --diff-filter=U`\n   - Return control to main agent with conflict details\n   - Main agent coordinates with user to resolve conflicts\n   - After resolution, user commits and continues\n6) **If clean pull**: Update tracking with last_checked timestamp and commits pulled count.\n7) Agent option: delegate to `sc-worktree-update` agent; it returns structured JSON with success or conflict details.\n\n## Safety and reminders\n- **NEVER delete protected branches** (main, develop, master) under any circumstances.\n- Protected branches can only be removed from worktrees; the branch itself must always be preserved.\n- Never delete branches or force-remove worktrees without explicit approval.\n- Never clean/abandon a worktree with uncommitted changes unless explicitly approved.\n- Keep tracking doc in sync on every operation when enabled.\n- Respect branch protections and hooks; no direct commits to protected branches.\n- Use background agents for long scans/cleanups; keep the main context focused on decisions and summaries.\n- When updating protected branches in worktrees, handle merge conflicts by returning control to main agent for user coordination.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:22:08.499Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring efficient Git worktree management and tracking via the `/sc-git-worktree` command.","zh":"适用于需要高效的 Git 工作树管理和通过 `/sc-git-worktree` 命令进行跟踪的开发者代理。","ja":"開発者エージェントが効率的な Git ワークツリー管理と `/sc-git-worktree` コマンドによる追跡を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"개발자 에이전트가 효율적인 Git 작업 트리 관리와 `/sc-git-worktree` 명령을 통해 추적을 필요로 하는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren una gestión eficiente del área de trabajo de Git y seguimiento a través del comando `/sc-git-worktree`.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développeur nécessitant une gestion efficace de l''arborescence de travail Git et un suivi via la commande `/sc-git-worktree`.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente Git-Arbeitsbereichsverwaltung und Nachverfolgung über den Befehl `/sc-git-worktree` benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de worktree do Git e acompanhamento via o comando `/sc-git-worktree`.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков, требующих эффективного управления рабочим пространством Git и отслеживания через команду `/sc-git-worktree`.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يتطلبون إدارة شجرة العمل في Git وفحصًا عبر الأمر `/sc-git-worktree`."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage worktrees with a standard structure and tracking, utilizing the Task tool to delegate operations like create, scan, and cleanup to specialized agents such as `sc-worktree-create` and `sc-worktree-scan`, returning JSON data including success status, path, branch, and worktrees list.","zh":"赋予代理管理工作树的标准结构和跟踪能力，利用任务工具将操作如创建、扫描和清理委托给专用代理，如 `sc-worktree-create` 和 `sc-worktree-scan`，返回包含成功状态、路径、分支和工作树列表的 JSON 数据。","ja":"エージェントが標準構造と追跡のワークツリーを管理できるようにし、Task ツールを使用して、作成、スキャン、クリーンアップなどの操作を `sc-worktree-create` や `sc-worktree-scan` などの専用エージェントに委任し、成功状態、パス、ブランチ、ワークツリーリストを含む JSON データを返します。","ko":"에이전트가 표준 구조와 추적의 작업 트리를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 작업 도구를 사용하여 생성, 스캔, 정리 등의 작업을 `sc-worktree-create` 및 `sc-worktree-scan` 등의 전문 에이전트에 위임하고, 성공 상태, 경로, 분기 및 작업 트리 목록을 포함한 JSON 데이터를 반환합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar áreas de trabajo con una estructura estándar y seguimiento, utilizando la herramienta Task para delegar operaciones como crear, escanear y limpiar a agentes especializados como `sc-worktree-create` y `sc-worktree-scan`, devolviendo datos JSON que incluyen estado de éxito, ruta, rama y lista de áreas de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des arbres de travail avec une structure standard et un suivi, en utilisant l''outil Task pour déléguer des opérations comme créer, analyser et nettoyer à des agents spécialisés tels que `sc-worktree-create` et `sc-worktree-scan`, renvoyant des données JSON incluant le statut de réussite, le chemin, la branche et la liste des arbres de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Arbeitsbereiche mit einer Standardstruktur und Nachverfolgung zu verwalten, indem sie das Task-Tool verwenden, um Operationen wie Erstellen, Scannen und Bereinigen an spezialisierte Agenten wie `sc-worktree-create` und `sc-worktree-scan` zu delegieren, und gibt JSON-Daten zurück, die den Erfolgsstatus, den Pfad, den Zweig und die Liste der Arbeitsbereiche enthalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar worktrees com estrutura padrão e acompanhamento, utilizando a ferramenta Task para delegar operações como criar, varrer e limpar para agentes especializados como `sc-worktree-create` e `sc-worktree-scan`, retornando dados JSON incluindo status de sucesso, caminho, branch e lista de worktrees.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять рабочими пространствами с стандартной структурой и отслеживанием, используя инструмент Task для делегирования операций, таких как создание, сканирование и очистка, специализированным агентам, таким как `sc-worktree-create` и `sc-worktree-scan`, возвращая данные JSON, включая статус успеха, путь, ветку и список рабочих пространств.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة أشجار العمل ب هيكل معياري وتتبع، باستخدام أداة المهمة لتفويض عمليات مثل إنشاء ومسح وتنظيف إلى وكلاء متخصصين مثل `sc-worktree-create` و `sc-worktree-scan`، وإرجاع بيانات JSON بما في ذلك حالة النجاح والمسار والفرع وقائمة أشجار العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating worktree creation with standardized tracking","Scanning existing worktrees for recommendations","Cleaning up unused worktrees for repository optimization"],"zh":["使用标准化跟踪自动创建工作树","扫描现有的工作树以获取建议","清理未使用的工作树以优化存储库"],"ja":["標準化された追跡を使用してワークツリーを作成する自動化","推奨されるワークツリーのスキャン","リポジトリの最適化のために使用されていないワークツリーをクリーンアップする"],"ko":["표준화된 추적을 사용하여 작업 트리를 자동으로 생성하는 것","추천을 받기 위해 기존 작업 트리를 스캔하는 것","저장소 최적화를 위해 사용되지 않는 작업 트리를 정리하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de áreas de trabajo con seguimiento estandarizado","Análisis de áreas de trabajo existentes para recomendaciones","Limpieza de áreas de trabajo no utilizadas para la optimización del repositorio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création d''arbres de travail avec un suivi standardisé","Analyse d''arbres de travail existants pour des recommandations","Nettoyage d''arbres de travail inutilisés pour l''optimisation du référentiel"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Arbeitsbereichen mit standardisiertem Nachverfolgen","Analyse bestehender Arbeitsbereiche für Empfehlungen","Bereinigung nicht genutzter Arbeitsbereiche für die Optimierung des Repositoriums"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de worktree com acompanhamento padronizado","Digitalizar worktrees existentes para recomendações","Limpar worktrees não utilizados para otimização do repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание рабочего пространства с стандартизированным отслеживанием","Сканировать существующие рабочие пространства для рекомендаций","Очистить неиспользуемые рабочие пространства для оптимизации репозитория"],"ar":["توفير автомاتيزير créer شجرة العمل مع تتبع معياري","مسح أشجار العمل الحالية للتحسينات","تنظيف أشجار العمل غير المستخدمة لتحسين المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Dependent on Task tool for agent delegation"],"zh":["需要 Git 存储库访问权限","依赖于任务工具进行代理委托"],"ja":["Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","エージェントの委任に Task ツールに依存する"],"ko":["Git 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요함","에이전트 위임에 작업 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Dependiente de la herramienta Task para la delegación de agentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Dépend de l''outil Task pour la délégation d''agents"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Abhängig von dem Task-Tool für die Delegation von Agenten"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Git","Dependente da ferramenta Task para delegação de agentes"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git","Зависит от инструмента Task для делегирования агентов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","يعتمد على أداة المهمة لتفويض الوكلاء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
