ados analiza descripciones de trabajo y destaca habilidades relevantes para mejorar tus posibilidades de ser contratado","fr":"Le générateur de CV sur mesure analyse les descriptions de travail et met en avant les compétences pertinentes pour améliorer vos chances d''être embauché","de":"Der individuelle Lebenslauf-Generator analysiert Stellenbeschreibungen und betont relevante Fähigkeiten, um Ihre Chancen auf eine Einstellung zu erhöhen","pt":"O gerador de currículos personalizados analisa descrições de vagas e cria currículos customizados","ru":"Генератор индивидуальных резюме анализирует описания вакансий и создает персонализированные резюме","ar":"مُولِد السِيرَة الذَاتِيَّة المُخْتَصَة يُحَلِّل وَصْف الوظيفة وَيُنْشِئ سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة مُخْتَصَة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["根据职位描述提取关键要求","自定义简历以适应不同行业和职位","突出相关经验以适应职业转换","优化简历以适应申请跟踪系统","创建多个简历版本以适应不同职位申请","强调职位描述中提到的特定技能"],"ja":["求人要件から关键的な要素を抽出","業界や職種に合わせて履歴書をカスタマイズ","関連する経験を強調してキャリア転換に適応","履歴書をATSに最適化","さまざまな職種への応募に合わせて複数の履歴書バージョンを作成","求人要件に記載された特定のスキルを強調"],"ko":["직무 опис에서 핵심 요구 사항을 추출","산업 분야와 직무에 맞게 이력서를 맞춤 설정","관련 경험을 강조하여 경력 전환에 적응","이력서를 ATS에 최적화","다양한 직무에 대한 지원에 맞게 여러 버전의 이력서를 생성","직무 설명에 언급된 특정 기술을 강조"],"es":["Análisis de descripciones de trabajo","Personalización de currículums para diferentes sectores","Destacado de habilidades relevantes","Optimización para sistemas de seguimiento de candidatos","Creación de múltiples versiones de currículums"],"fr":["Analyse des descriptions de travail","Personnalisation de CV pour différents secteurs","Mise en avant des compétences pertinentes","Optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidats","Création de multiples versions de CV"],"de":["Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Anpassung von Lebensläufen an verschiedene Branchen","Hervorhebung relevanter Fähigkeiten","Optimierung für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme","Erstellung mehrerer Lebenslauf-Versionen"],"pt":["Análise de descrições de vagas","Criação de currículos customizados","Otimização para sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","Criação de múltiplas versões de currículos","Destaque para habilidades relevantes"],"ru":["Анализ описаний вакансий","Создание персонализированных резюме","Оптимизация для систем отслеживания кандидатов","Создание нескольких версий резюме","Подчеркивание соответствующих навыков"],"ar":["تَحْليل وَصْف الوظيفة","إنشاء سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة مُخْتَصَة","تَأَمين للسِستِمات المُتَابِعَة لِلمُرَشَحين","إنشاء مُتَغَيِّرات مُتَعَدِّدَة مِن السِيرَة الذَاتِيَّة","تَأْكيد الْمَهَارَات المُتَوافِقَة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["个性化简历","简历生成器","职位描述分析","简历优化","申请跟踪系统","职业转换","简历定制","职位申请"],"ja":["カスタムResume","Resume生成ツール","求人要件分析","履歴書最適化","ATS","キャリア転換","履歴書カスタマイズ","職種応募"],"ko":["맞춤형 이력서","이력서 생성기","직무 설명 분석","이력서 최적화","ATS","경력 전환","이력서 맞춤 설정","직무 지원"],"es":["generador de currículums","currículum personalizado","análisis de descripciones de trabajo","optimización para ATS","creación de currículums","personalización de currículums"],"fr":["générateur de CV","CV sur mesure","analyse des descriptions de travail","optimisation pour les systèmes de suivi des candidats","création de CV","personnalisation de CV"],"de":["Lebenslauf-Generator","individueller Lebenslauf","Analyse von Stellenbeschreibungen","Optimierung für Bewerber-Tracking-Systeme","Erstellung von Lebensläufen","Anpassung von Lebensläufen"],"pt":["gerador de currículos","currículo personalizado","vagas de emprego","sistemas de rastreamento de candidatos","otimização de currículo","habilidades relevantes"],"ru":["генератор резюме","индивидуальное резюме","вакансии","системы отслеживания кандидатов","оптимизация резюме","соответствующие навыки"],"ar":["مُولِد سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة","سِيرَة ذَاتِيَّة مُخْتَصَة","وَظَائِف شاغرة","سِستِمات مُتَابِعَة لِلمُرَشَحين","تَأَمين السِيرَة الذَاتِيَّة","الْمَهَارَات المُتَوافِقَة"]}},"owner":"Fancu1","repo":"dotfile","repoPath":"Fancu1/dotfile","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailored-resume-generator","description":"Analyzes job descriptions and generates tailored resumes that highlight relevant experience, skills, and achievements to maximize interview chances","bodyPreview":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifi","body":"# Tailored Resume Generator\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Applying for a specific job position\n- Customizing your resume for different industries or roles\n- Highlighting relevant experience for career transitions\n- Optimizing your resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n- Creating multiple resume versions for different job applications\n- Emphasizing specific skills mentioned in job postings\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes Job Descriptions**: Extracts key requirements, skills, qualifications, and keywords from job postings\n2. **Identifies Priorities**: Determines what employers value most based on the job description language and structure\n3. **Tailors Content**: Reorganizes and emphasizes relevant experience, skills, and achievements\n4. **Optimizes Keywords**: Incorporates ATS-friendly keywords naturally throughout the resume\n5. **Formats Professionally**: Creates clean, professional resume layouts suitable for various formats\n6. **Provides Recommendations**: Suggests improvements and highlights gaps to address\n\n## How to Use\n\n### Basic Usage\nProvide a job description and your background information:\n\n```\nI''m applying for this job:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nHere''s my background:\n- 5 years as software engineer at TechCorp\n- Led team of 3 developers on mobile app project\n- Expert in Python, JavaScript, React\n- Computer Science degree from State University\n```\n\n### With Existing Resume\nUpload or paste your current resume along with the job description:\n\n```\nPlease tailor my resume for this position:\n\nJob Description:\n[paste job description]\n\nMy Current Resume:\n[paste resume content]\n```\n\n### Career Transition\nWhen changing industries or roles:\n\n```\nI''m transitioning from marketing to product management.\nHere''s the job I''m applying for:\n\n[paste job description]\n\nMy transferable experience:\n- 7 years in digital marketing\n- Led cross-functional teams\n- Managed product launches\n- Data analysis and A/B testing\n```\n\n## Example\n\n**User Request:**\n```\nI need a tailored resume for this job:\n\nSenior Data Analyst Position\n\nRequirements:\n- 5+ years experience in data analysis\n- Expert in SQL, Python, and data visualization tools\n- Experience with A/B testing and statistical analysis\n- Strong communication skills to present findings\n- Healthcare industry experience preferred\n\nMy background:\n- Data Analyst at RetailCo (2019-2024)\n- Created dashboards using Tableau and Power BI\n- Built Python scripts for data automation\n- Worked with marketing team on campaign analysis\n- Business Analytics degree\n- Also did 1 year internship at HealthPlus clinic\n```\n\n**Generated Output:**\n\n```markdown\n# JOHN DOE\nEmail: john.doe@email.com | Phone: (555) 123-4567 | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/johndoe\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nResults-driven Data Analyst with 5+ years of experience leveraging SQL, Python, and advanced\nvisualization tools to deliver actionable insights. Proven track record in statistical analysis,\nA/B testing, and cross-functional collaboration. Healthcare industry experience with strong\nability to communicate complex data findings to stakeholders.\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n- **Data Analysis & Programming**: SQL, Python, Statistical Analysis, A/B Testing\n- **Visualization Tools**: Tableau, Power BI, Advanced Dashboard Development\n- **Data Management**: Data Automation, ETL Processes, Database Optimization\n- **Business Intelligence**: Campaign Analytics, Performance Metrics, KPI Tracking\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\n**Data Analyst** | RetailCo | 2019 - 2024\n- Designed and implemented 50+ SQL queries and Python automation scripts, reducing manual\n  data processing time by 60%\n- Conducted rigorous A/B testing and statistical analysis for marketing campaigns,\n  improving campaign ROI by 35%\n- Built interactive Tableau and Power BI dashboards for executive team, enabling\n  data-driven decision making\n- Presented analytical findings to cross-functional stakeholders including marketing,\n  operations, and executive leadership\n- Collaborated with marketing team to analyze customer behavior patterns and optimize\n  targeting strategies\n\n**Data Analysis Intern** | HealthPlus Clinic | 2018 - 2019\n- Supported healthcare analytics initiatives by analyzing patient data and operational metrics\n- Gained exposure to healthcare industry data management and HIPAA compliance requirements\n- Assisted in creating reports for clinical staff to improve patient care workflows\n\n## EDUCATION\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Business Analytics**\nState University | Graduated 2018\n\n## KEY ACHIEVEMENTS\n- Reduced data processing time by 60% through Python automation\n- Improved marketing campaign ROI by 35% through A/B testing and optimization\n- Created data visualization system now used across entire organization\n```\n\n**Additional Recommendations:**\n- Consider adding any specific healthcare projects or certifications\n- Quantify more achievements with metrics when possible\n- If you have experience with R or advanced statistical methods, add them\n- Consider mentioning any familiarity with healthcare regulations (HIPAA, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen a user requests resume tailoring:\n\n### 1. Gather Information\n\n**Job Description Analysis**:\n- Request the full job description if not provided\n- Ask for the company name and job title\n\n**Candidate Background**:\n- If user provides existing resume, use it as the foundation\n- If not, request:\n  - Work history (job titles, companies, dates, responsibilities)\n  - Education background\n  - Key skills and technical proficiencies\n  - Notable achievements and metrics\n  - Certifications or awards\n  - Any other relevant information\n\n### 2. Analyze Job Requirements\n\nExtract and prioritize:\n- **Must-have qualifications**: Years of experience, required skills, education\n- **Key skills**: Technical tools, methodologies, competencies\n- **Soft skills**: Communication, leadership, teamwork\n- **Industry knowledge**: Domain-specific experience\n- **Keywords**: Repeated terms, phrases, and buzzwords for ATS optimization\n- **Company values**: Cultural fit indicators from job description\n\nCreate a mental map of:\n- Priority 1: Critical requirements (deal-breakers)\n- Priority 2: Important qualifications (strongly desired)\n- Priority 3: Nice-to-have skills (bonus points)\n\n### 3. Map Candidate Experience to Requirements\n\nFor each job requirement:\n- Identify matching experience from candidate''s background\n- Find transferable skills if no direct match\n- Note gaps that need to be addressed or de-emphasized\n- Identify unique strengths to highlight\n\n### 4. Structure the Tailored Resume\n\n**Professional Summary** (3-4 lines):\n- Lead with years of experience in the target role/field\n- Include top 3-4 required skills from job description\n- Mention industry experience if relevant\n- Highlight unique value proposition\n\n**Technical/Core Skills Section**:\n- Group skills by category matching job requirements\n- List required tools and technologies first\n- Use exact terminology from job description\n- Only include skills you can substantiate with experience\n\n**Professional Experience**:\n- For each role, emphasize responsibilities and achievements aligned with job requirements\n- Use action verbs: Led, Developed, Implemented, Optimized, Managed, Created, Analyzed\n- **Quantify achievements**: Include numbers, percentages, timeframes, scale\n- Reorder bullet points to prioritize most relevant experience\n- Use keywords naturally from job description\n- Format: **[Action Verb] + [What] + [How/Why] + [Result/Impact]**\n\n**Education**:\n- List degrees, certifications relevant to position\n- Include relevant coursework if early career\n- Add certifications that match job requirements\n\n**Optional Sections** (if applicable):\n- Certifications & Licenses\n- Publications or Speaking Engagements\n- Awards & Recognition\n- Volunteer Work (if relevant to role)\n- Projects (especially for technical roles)\n\n### 5. Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\n\n- Use standard section headings (Professional Experience, Education, Skills)\n- Incorporate exact keywords from job description naturally\n- Avoid tables, graphics, headers/footers, or complex formatting\n- Use standard fonts and bullet points\n- Include both acronyms and full terms (e.g., \"SQL (Structured Query Language)\")\n- Match job title terminology where truthful\n\n### 6. Format and Present\n\n**Format Options**:\n- **Markdown**: Clean, readable, easy to copy\n- **Plain Text**: ATS-optimized, safe for all systems\n- **Tips for Word/PDF**: Provide formatting guidance\n\n**Resume Structure Guidelines**:\n- Keep to 1 page for <10 years experience, 2 pages for 10+ years\n- Use consistent formatting and spacing\n- Ensure contact information is prominent\n- Use reverse chronological order (most recent first)\n- Maintain clean, scannable layout with white space\n\n### 7. Provide Strategic Recommendations\n\nAfter presenting the tailored resume, offer:\n\n**Strengths Analysis**:\n- What makes this candidate competitive\n- Unique qualifications to emphasize in cover letter or interview\n\n**Gap Analysis**:\n- Requirements not fully met\n- Suggestions for addressing gaps (courses, projects, reframing experience)\n\n**Interview Preparation Tips**:\n- Key talking points aligned with resume\n- Stories to prepare based on job requirements\n- Questions to ask that demonstrate fit\n\n**Cover Letter Hooks**:\n- Suggest 2-3 opening lines for cover letter\n- Key achievements to expand upon\n\n### 8. Iterate and Refine\n\nAsk if user wants to:\n- Adjust emphasis or tone\n- Add or remove sections\n- Generate alternative versions for different roles\n- Create format variations (traditional vs. modern)\n- Develop role-specific versions (if applying to multiple similar positions)\n\n### 9. Best Practices to Follow\n\n**Do**:\n- Be truthful and accurate - never fabricate experience\n- Use industry-standard terminology\n- Quantify achievements with specific metrics\n- Tailor each resume to specific job\n- Proofread for grammar and consistency\n- Keep language concise and impactful\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Include personal information (age, marital status, photo unless requested)\n- Use first-person pronouns (I, me, my)\n- Include references (\"available upon request\" is outdated)\n- List every job if career is 20+ years (focus on relevant, recent experience)\n- Use generic templates without customization\n- Exceed 2 pages unless very senior role\n\n### 10. Special Considerations\n\n**Career Changers**:\n- Use functional or hybrid resume format\n- Emphasize transferable skills\n- Create compelling narrative in summary\n- Focus on relevant projects and coursework\n\n**Recent Graduates**:\n- Lead with education\n- Include relevant coursework, projects, internships\n- Emphasize leadership in student organizations\n- Include GPA if 3.5+\n\n**Senior Executives**:\n- Lead with executive summary\n- Focus on leadership and strategic impact\n- Include board memberships, speaking engagements\n- Emphasize revenue growth, team building, vision\n\n**Technical Roles**:\n- Include technical skills section prominently\n- List programming languages, frameworks, tools\n- Include GitHub, portfolio, or project links\n- Mention methodologies (Agile, Scrum, etc.)\n\n**Creative Roles**:\n- Include link to portfolio\n- Highlight creative achievements and campaigns\n- Mention tools and software proficiencies\n- Consider more creative formatting (while maintaining ATS compatibility)\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n- **Be specific**: Provide complete job descriptions and detailed background information\n- **Share metrics**: Include numbers, percentages, and quantifiable achievements when describing your experience\n- **Indicate format preference**: Let the skill know if you need ATS-optimized, creative, or traditional format\n- **Mention constraints**: Share any specific requirements (page limits, sections to include/exclude)\n- **Iterate**: Don''t hesitate to ask for revisions or alternative approaches\n- **Multiple applications**: Generate separate tailored versions for different roles\n\n## Privacy Note\n\nThis skill processes your personal and professional information to generate tailored resumes. Always review the output before submitting to ensure accuracy and appropriateness. Remove or modify any information you prefer not to share with potential employers.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:21:18.377Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Career Development Agents needing advanced resume customization capabilities for ATS optimization and job-specific highlighting.","zh":"非常适合需要高级简历定制功能以优化申请跟踪系统（ATS）和职位特定突出显示的职业发展代理","ja":"キャリア開発エージェントが、高度な履歴書カスタマイズ機能を使用してATS最適化とジョブ特定のハイライトを行う必要がある場合に最適","ko":"고급 이력서 커스터마이징 기능을 사용하여 ATS 최적화 및 작업별 하이라이트를 수행해야 하는 경력 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de carrera que necesitan capacidades de personalización de currículum avanzadas para la optimización de ATS y la destacación de puestos específicos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de carrière ayant besoin de capacités de personnalisation de CV avancées pour l''optimisation de ATS et la mise en évidence de postes spécifiques.","de":"Perfekt für Karriereentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Möglichkeiten zur Anpassung von Lebensläufen für die ATS-Optimierung und die hervorhebung von jobspezifischen Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Carreira que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de personalização de currículos para otimização do ATS e realce de vagas específicas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по карьерному развитию, которым необходимы расширенные возможности настройки резюме для оптимизации системы отслеживания заявок (ATS) и выделения требований к конкретным вакансиям.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير المسار المهني التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحديث السيرة الذاتية من أجل تحسين نظام تتبع الطلبات وتسليط الضوء على الوظائف المحددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze job descriptions, extract key requirements, and generate tailored resumes in various formats, utilizing natural language processing and machine learning algorithms to emphasize relevant experience and skills, while ensuring compatibility with Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) protocols.","zh":"使代理能够分析工作描述、提取关键要求，并使用自然语言处理和机器学习算法生成各种格式的定制简历，强调相关经验和技能，同时确保与申请跟踪系统（ATS）协议的兼容性","ja":"エージェントがジョブの説明を分析し、重要な要件を抽出し、自然言語処理と機械学習アルゴリズムを使用して関連する経験とスキルを強調しながら、様々な形式のカスタマイズされた履歴書を生成し、同時にアプリケーショントラッキングシステム（ATS）プロトコルの互換性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 작업 설명을 분석하고 주요 요구 사항을 추출하여 다양한 형식의 맞춤형 이력서를 생성하고 자연 언어 처리 및 기계 학습 알고리즘을 사용하여 관련 경험 및 기술을 강조하면서 동시에 애플리케이션 트래킹 시스템(ATS) 프로토콜과의 호환성을 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar descripciones de trabajo, extraer requisitos clave y generar currículums personalizados en varios formatos, utilizando procesamiento de lenguaje natural y algoritmos de aprendizaje automático para enfatizar experiencias y habilidades relevantes, garantizando al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad con los protocolos de los sistemas de seguimiento de solicitantes (ATS).","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les descriptions de postes, d''extraire les exigences clés et de générer des CV personnalisés dans différents formats, en utilisant le traitement du langage naturel et les algorithmes d''apprentissage automatique pour mettre en évidence les expériences et les compétences pertinentes, tout en assurant la compatibilité avec les protocoles des systèmes de suivi des candidats (ATS).","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Stellenbeschreibungen zu analysieren, Schlüsselanforderungen zu extrahieren und maßgeschneiderte Lebensläufe in verschiedenen Formaten zu generieren, indem sie die Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache und maschinelles Lernen verwenden, um relevante Erfahrungen und Fähigkeiten hervorzuheben, während sie gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit den Protokollen von Bewerber-Verfolgungssystemen (ATS) gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar descrições de vagas, extrair requisitos-chave e gerar currículos personalizados em vários formatos, utilizando processamento de linguagem natural e algoritmos de aprendizado de máquina para realçar experiências e habilidades relevantes, garantindo compatibilidade com protocolos de sistemas de acompanhamento de candidatos (ATS).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать описания вакансий, извлекать ключевые требования и генерировать индивидуальные резюме в различных форматах, используя обработку естественного языка и алгоритмы машинного обучения для выделения соответствующего опыта и навыков, обеспечивая совместимость с протоколами систем отслеживания заявок (ATS).","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل وصفات الوظائف واستخراج المتطلبات الرئيسية وإنشاء سير ذاتية مخصصة بصور متعددة، مستخدمين معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وخوارزميات التعلم الآلي لتوضيح الخبرات والمهارات ذات الصلة، مع ضمان التوافق مع بروتوكولات أنظمة تتبع الطلبات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating resume generation for multiple job applications","Optimizing resumes for ATS compatibility and improved candidate ranking","Generating customized resume versions for different industries or roles"],"zh":["为多个工作申请自动生成简历","优化简历以兼容ATS并提高候选人排名","为不同行业或角色生成定制的简历版本"],"ja":["複数のジョブ申請用の履歴書を自動生成する","履歴書をATS互換性と候補者ランキングの向上のために最適化する","異なる業界または役割のためのカスタマイズされた履歴書バージョンを生成する"],"ko":["여러 작업 신청을 위한 이력서 자동 생성","ATS 호환성 및 후보자 순위를 개선하기 위한 이력서 최적화","다른 산업 또는 역할을 위한 맞춤형 이력서 버전 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de currículums para múltiples solicitudes de trabajo","Optimización de currículums para la compatibilidad con ATS y la mejora del ranking de los candidatos","Generación de versiones de currículum personalizadas para diferentes industrias o funciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de CV pour de multiples candidatures","Optimisation des CV pour la compatibilité avec les ATS et l''amélioration du classement des candidats","Génération de versions de CV personnalisées pour différents secteurs ou postes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Lebenslaugerstellung für mehrere Bewerbungen","Optimierung von Lebensläufen für die Kompatibilität mit ATS und die Verbesserung der Kandidatenrangliste","Generierung von maßgeschneiderten Lebenslaubfassungen für verschiedene Branchen oder Rollen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de currículos para múltiplas solicitações de emprego","Otimizar currículos para compatibilidade com o ATS e melhoria do ranqueamento dos candidatos","Gerar versões personalizadas de currículos para diferentes setores ou funções"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию резюме для нескольких заявок на работу","Оптимизировать резюме для совместимости с системой отслеживания заявок (ATS) и улучшения рейтинга кандидатов","Генерировать индивидуальные версии резюме для разных отраслей или ролей"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء السيرة الذاتية لمجموعة من الطلبات الوظيفية","تحسين السيرة الذاتية لتوافقها مع نظام تتبع الطلبات وتحسين تصنيف المرشحين","إنشاء نسخ مخصصة من السيرة الذاتية لمجالات أو وظائف مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to job descriptions and applicant information","Limited to resume generation and customization, not a full-fledged career development platform"],"zh":["需要访问工作描述和申请人信息","仅限于简历生成和定制，不是全面的职业发展平台"],"ja":["ジョブの説明と申請者の情報へのアクセスが必要","履歴書の生成とカスタマイズのみに限定され、包括的なキャリア開発プラットフォームではない"],"ko":["작업 설명 및 신청자 정보에 대한 액세스가 필요","이력서 생성 및 맞춤화에만 제한되며, 포괄적인 경력 개발 플랫폼이 아님"],"es":["Requiere acceso a descripciones de trabajo y información de solicitantes","Limitado a la generación y personalización de currículums, no es una plataforma de desarrollo de carrera completa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux descriptions de postes et aux informations des candidats","Limité à la génération et à la personnalisation de CV, ce n''est pas une plate-forme de développement de carrière complète"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Stellenbeschreibungen und Bewerberinformationen","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Anpassung von Lebensläufen, keine umfassende Karriereentwicklungsplattform"],"pt":["Requer acesso a descrições de vagas e informações de candidatos","Limitado à geração e personalização de currículos, não é uma plataforma completa de desenvolvimento de carreira"],"ru":["Требует доступа к описаниям вакансий и информации о заявителях","Ограничен генерацией и настройкой резюме, не является полноценной платформой карьерного развития"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وصفات الوظائف ومعلومات المتقدمين","محدود بإنشاء السيرة الذاتية وتحديثها، وليس منصة شاملة لتطوير المسار المهني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
