ers agents to ensure consistency, professionalism, clarity, and compliance across all communications by analyzing content against HMS IT''s governance framework, utilizing access to files for review and adhering to style guides and quality assurance protocols"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating content against HMS IT governance standards","Ensuring editorial compliance across communications","Reviewing files for adherence to quality assurance protocols"],"zh":["验证内容是否符合HMS IT治理标准","确保编辑合规性在整个通信过程中","审查文件以确保遵守质量保证协议"],"ja":["HMS ITのガバナンス基準に対するコンテンツの検証","コミュニケーション全体における編集のコンプライアンスの確保","品質保証プロトコルの遵守のためのファイルのレビュー"],"ko":["HMS IT 거버넌스 표준에 대한 콘텐츠 검증","전체 커뮤니케이션에서 편집 규정 준수를 보장","품질 보증 프로토콜을 준수하기 위한 파일 검토"],"es":["Validar contenido contra los estándares de gobierno de HMS IT","Garantizar el cumplimiento editorial en las comunicaciones","Revisar archivos para verificar el cumplimiento de protocolos de garantía de calidad"],"fr":["Valider le contenu par rapport aux normes de gouvernance de HMS IT","Garantir la conformité éditoriale dans les communications","Examiner les fichiers pour le respect des protocoles d''assurance qualité"],"de":["Validierung von Inhalten gegen HMS IT-Governance-Standards","Sicherstellung der redaktionellen Compliance in Kommunikationen","Überprüfung von Dateien auf Einhaltung von Qualitätssicherungsprotokollen"],"pt":["Validating content against HMS IT governance standards","Ensuring editorial compliance across communications","Reviewing files for adherence to quality assurance protocols"],"ru":["Validating content against HMS IT governance standards","Ensuring editorial compliance across communications","Reviewing files for adherence to quality assurance protocols"],"ar":["Validating content against HMS IT governance standards","Ensuring editorial compliance across communications","Reviewing files for adherence to quality assurance protocols"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to files for review","Beta status may imply ongoing development and potential instability","Currently designed for platforms like Claude Code"],"zh":["需要访问文件以进行审查","测试状态可能意味着正在进行的开发和潜在的不稳定性","目前仅适用于Claude Code等平台"],"ja":["レビューを行うためにファイルへのアクセスが必要","ベータ版のため、開発が進行中であり、潜在的な不安定性が存在する可能性","現在、Claude Codeなどのプラットフォームでのみ設計されている"],"ko":["검토를 수행하려면 파일에 액세스해야 함","베타 버전으로 인해 개발이 진행 중이며 잠재적인 불안정성이 있을 수 있음","현재 클라우드 코드와 같은 플랫폼에서만 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos para su revisión","El estado beta puede implicar desarrollo continuo y potencial inestabilidad","Actualmente diseñado para plataformas como Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers pour examen","Le statut bêta peut impliquer un développement continu et une instabilité potentielle","Actuellement conçu pour des plateformes comme Claude Code"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Dateien zur Überprüfung","Beta-Status kann laufende Entwicklung und potenzielle Instabilität bedeuten","Aktuell für Plattformen wie Claude Code konzipiert"],"pt":["Requires access to files for review","Beta status may imply ongoing development and potential instability","Currently designed for platforms like Claude Code"],"ru":["Requires access to files for review","Beta status may imply ongoing development and potential instability","Currently designed for platforms like Claude Code"],"ar":["Requires access to files for review","Beta status may imply ongoing development and potential instability","Currently designed for platforms like Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
