,"Idéal pour le contenu statique et le SEO critique","Intégration avec les thèmes de Shopify","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Optimales Leistungsverhalten mit Liquid","Inhalt wird auf dem Server gerendert","Ideal für statischen Inhalt und SEO-kritischen Inhalt","Integration mit Shopify-Themen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Renderização Liquid nativa do Shopify","Desempenho de loja ótimo","Conteúdo renderizado no servidor","Otimização para SEO crítico","Suporte a conteúdo estático e semi-estático"],"ru":["Родная обработка Liquid от Shopify","Оптимальная производительность магазина","Контент отображается на сервере","Оптимизация для критического SEO","Поддержка статического и полу-статического контента"],"ar":["إمكانية تحويل Liquid الأصلية من Shopify","أداء متجر مثالي","المحتوى يتم تحويله على الخادم","تحسين لتحسين محركات البحث الحرج","دعم المحتوى الثابت والشبه-ثابت"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shopify主题扩展","Shopify开发","Liquid渲染","店铺性能优化","静态内容","半静态内容","SEO优化"],"ja":["Shopifyテーマ拡張","Shopify開発","Liquidレンダリング","ストアのパフォーマンスを最適化","静的コンテンツ","半静的コンテンツ","SEO最適化"],"ko":["Shopify 테마 확장","Shopify 개발","Liquid 렌더링","스토어 성능 최적화","정적 콘텐츠","반정적 콘텐츠","SEO 최적화"],"es":["desarrollo de extensiones de tema","Shopify","Liquid","rendimiento óptimo","contenido estático","SEO crítico","temas de Shopify","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["développement d''extensions de thème","Shopify","Liquid","rendement optimal","contenu statique","SEO critique","thèmes de Shopify","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Entwicklung von Theme-Erweiterungen","Shopify","Liquid","optimales Leistungsverhalten","statischer Inhalt","SEO-kritischer Inhalt","Shopify-Themen","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["extensão de tema","shopify","renderização liquid","desempenho de loja","seo crítico","conteúdo estático","conteúdo semi-estático"],"ru":["тема расширения","shopify","обработка liquid","производительность магазина","критический seo","статический контент","полу-статический контент"],"ar":["امتداد الموضوع","shopify","إمكانية تحويل liquid","أداء المتجر","تحسين محركات البحث الحرج","المحتوى الثابت","المحتوى الشبه-ثابت"]}},"owner":"ducnm-mimhus","repo":"Avada-Simple-Sales-Pop","repoPath":"ducnm-mimhus/Avada-Simple-Sales-Pop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"theme-extension","description":"Use this skill when the user asks about theme extension, app blocks, Liquid templates, app embed, storefront rendering, app proxy, or any Theme App Extension development work. Provides patterns for Liquid-first storefront rendering with minimal JavaScript.","bodyPreview":"# Theme App Extension Development\n\n## Overview\n\nTheme App Extensions use Shopify''s native Liquid rendering for **optimal storefront performance**. Content is server-rendered before reaching the customer''s browser.\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Approach | Use For |\n|----------|---------|\n| **Theme Extension** | Static/semi-static content, SEO-critical content, product displays |\n| **Scripttag** | Highly interactive widgets, real-time updates, complex UI |\n\n---\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nextensions/theme-","body":"# Theme App Extension Development\n\n## Overview\n\nTheme App Extensions use Shopify''s native Liquid rendering for **optimal storefront performance**. Content is server-rendered before reaching the customer''s browser.\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Approach | Use For |\n|----------|---------|\n| **Theme Extension** | Static/semi-static content, SEO-critical content, product displays |\n| **Scripttag** | Highly interactive widgets, real-time updates, complex UI |\n\n---\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nextensions/theme-extension/\n├── blocks/                    # App blocks (merchant can position)\n│   ├── feature-block.liquid   # Main feature block\n│   └── badge.liquid           # Small badge/snippet\n├── snippets/                  # Reusable Liquid snippets\n│   └── component.liquid       # Shared components\n├── assets/                    # JS/CSS files\n│   ├── app-embed.js           # Minimal JS (forms, interactions)\n│   └── styles.css             # Scoped styles\n└── locales/\n    └── en.default.json        # Translations\n```\n\n---\n\n## App Block Pattern\n\n### Block Schema\n\n```liquid\n{% schema %}\n{\n  \"name\": \"Feature Name\",\n  \"target\": \"section\",\n  \"enabled_by_default\": false,\n  \"settings\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"range\",\n      \"id\": \"items_per_page\",\n      \"label\": \"Items per page\",\n      \"min\": 3,\n      \"max\": 20,\n      \"default\": 10\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"color\",\n      \"id\": \"primary_color\",\n      \"label\": \"Primary color\",\n      \"default\": \"#000000\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n{% endschema %}\n\n{% comment %} Block content {% endcomment %}\n<div class=\"app-feature\" data-resource-id=\"{{ product.id }}\">\n  {% render ''app-component'', resource: product, settings: block.settings %}\n</div>\n\n{% stylesheet %}\n  .app-feature { /* scoped styles */ }\n{% endstylesheet %}\n\n{% javascript %}\n  // Minimal JS only when needed\n{% endjavascript %}\n```\n\n### Block Targets\n\n| Target | Use For |\n|--------|---------|\n| `section` | Product page, collection page content |\n| `body` | Global elements (popups, floating buttons) |\n\n---\n\n## App Embed (Global Script)\n\nFor loading global CSS and minimal JS across all pages:\n\n```liquid\n{% schema %}\n{\n  \"name\": \"App Embed\",\n  \"target\": \"body\",\n  \"enabled_by_default\": true,\n  \"settings\": []\n}\n{% endschema %}\n\n{% comment %} Load styles globally {% endcomment %}\n{{ ''styles.css'' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n\n{% comment %} Minimal JS - forms, interactions only {% endcomment %}\n<script src=\"{{ ''app-embed.js'' | asset_url }}\" defer></script>\n\n{% comment %} Pass data to JS {% endcomment %}\n<script>\n  window.APP_CONFIG = {\n    shopDomain: ''{{ shop.permanent_domain }}'',\n    customerId: ''{{ customer.id | default: \"\" }}'',\n    locale: ''{{ request.locale.iso_code }}''\n  };\n</script>\n```\n\n---\n\n## App Proxy Integration\n\n### Configure in shopify.app.toml\n\n```toml\n[app_proxy]\nurl = \"https://<firebase-url>/clientApi\"\nsubpath = \"app-name\"\nsubpath_prefix = \"apps\"\n```\n\n### Fetch Data via App Proxy\n\n```liquid\n{% comment %}\n  App proxy URL: /apps/app-name/endpoint\n  Shopify adds shop param automatically\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% assign api_url = shop.url | append: ''/apps/app-name/data/'' | append: resource.id %}\n```\n\n### Backend Handler\n\n```javascript\n// clientApi controller - receives ''shop'' query param from app proxy\nexport async function getData(ctx) {\n  const shopDomain = ctx.query.shop;\n  const {id} = ctx.params;\n\n  const shop = await shopRepository.getShopByShopifyDomain(shopDomain);\n  if (!shop) {\n    ctx.body = {success: false, error: ''Shop not found''};\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const data = await service.getData(shop.id, id);\n  ctx.body = data;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Async Data Fetching with Loading States\n\nWhen blocks need dynamic data from app proxy, use loading states for good UX.\n\n### HTML Structure\n\n```liquid\n{% comment %}\n  Generic async widget pattern\n  - Unique IDs using resource ID (product, collection, page, etc.)\n  - Data attributes for JS configuration\n  - Loading/content/error states\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% assign widget_id = product.id | default: collection.id | default: ''global'' %}\n\n<div class=\"app-widget\"\n     data-resource-id=\"{{ widget_id }}\"\n     data-resource-type=\"{{ resource_type | default: ''product'' }}\"\n     data-shop=\"{{ shop.permanent_domain }}\"\n     id=\"app-widget-{{ widget_id }}\">\n\n  <div class=\"app-widget__loading\" id=\"app-loading-{{ widget_id }}\">\n    <span class=\"app-widget__spinner\"></span>\n    {{ ''app.loading'' | t | default: ''Loading...'' }}\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"app-widget__content\" id=\"app-content-{{ widget_id }}\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    {%- comment -%} Content populated by JS {%- endcomment -%}\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"app-widget__error\" id=\"app-error-{{ widget_id }}\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    {{ ''app.error'' | t | default: ''Unable to load content'' }}\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### JavaScript Pattern\n\n```javascript\n(function() {\n  // Configuration\n  var PROXY_PATH = ''/apps/proxy'';  // Your app proxy path\n  var ENDPOINT = ''/data'';          // Your endpoint\n\n  // Get elements\n  var containers = document.querySelectorAll(''.app-widget'');\n\n  containers.forEach(function(container) {\n    var resourceId = container.dataset.resourceId;\n    var resourceType = container.dataset.resourceType;\n    var shop = container.dataset.shop;\n\n    var loadingEl = document.getElementById(''app-loading-'' + resourceId);\n    var contentEl = document.getElementById(''app-content-'' + resourceId);\n    var errorEl = document.getElementById(''app-error-'' + resourceId);\n\n    async function fetchData() {\n      try {\n        var params = new URLSearchParams({\n          resource_id: resourceId,\n          resource_type: resourceType,\n          shop: shop\n        });\n\n        var response = await fetch(PROXY_PATH + ENDPOINT + ''?'' + params);\n        var result = await response.json();\n\n        if (!result.success) {\n          throw new Error(result.error || ''Request failed'');\n        }\n\n        if (!result.data) {\n          container.dataset.hidden = ''true'';\n          return;\n        }\n\n        renderContent(result.data, result.settings);\n        loadingEl.style.display = ''none'';\n        contentEl.style.display = ''block'';\n      } catch (error) {\n        console.error(''Widget error:'', error);\n        loadingEl.style.display = ''none'';\n        errorEl.style.display = ''block'';\n      }\n    }\n\n    function renderContent(data, settings) {\n      // Build your HTML from data\n      contentEl.innerHTML = buildHTML(data, settings);\n    }\n\n    // Initialize on DOM ready\n    if (document.readyState === ''loading'') {\n      document.addEventListener(''DOMContentLoaded'', fetchData);\n    } else {\n      fetchData();\n    }\n  });\n})();\n```\n\n### CSS Utilities\n\n```css\n/* Loading spinner */\n.app-widget__spinner {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  border: 2px solid #e5e5e5;\n  border-top-color: var(--app-accent-color, #008060);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  animation: app-spin 0.8s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes app-spin {\n  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n}\n\n/* Hide widget when no data */\n.app-widget[data-hidden=\"true\"] {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n/* Loading state */\n.app-widget__loading {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  color: #666;\n}\n\n/* Error state */\n.app-widget__error {\n  padding: 16px;\n  color: #c00;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n```\n\n### Key Points\n\n| Aspect | Recommendation |\n|--------|----------------|\n| Unique IDs | Use resource ID (product, collection, etc.) for uniqueness |\n| Loading state | Always show spinner while fetching |\n| Error handling | Show user-friendly error, hide widget on failure |\n| Empty state | Use `data-hidden=\"true\"` to hide when no data |\n| Translations | Use Liquid `t` filter for user-facing text |\n\n---\n\n## Liquid-First Rendering\n\n### Server-Side Data Display\n\n```liquid\n{% comment %} Data from metafields or app proxy {% endcomment %}\n{% assign items = product.metafields.app_namespace.items.value %}\n\n{% if items.size > 0 %}\n  <div class=\"items-list\">\n    {% for item in items %}\n      {% render ''item-card'', item: item %}\n    {% endfor %}\n  </div>\n{% else %}\n  <p class=\"no-items\">{{ ''app.no_items'' | t }}</p>\n{% endif %}\n```\n\n### Reusable Snippets\n\n```liquid\n{% comment %} snippets/rating-display.liquid {% endcomment %}\n{% comment %}\n  @param value {number} - Value to display\n  @param max {number} - Maximum value\n  @param size {string} - ''small'' | ''medium'' | ''large''\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<div class=\"rating-display rating-display--{{ size | default: ''medium'' }}\">\n  {% for i in (1..max) %}\n    {% if i <= value %}\n      <span class=\"rating-unit rating-unit--filled\"></span>\n    {% else %}\n      <span class=\"rating-unit rating-unit--empty\"></span>\n    {% endif %}\n  {% endfor %}\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Minimal JavaScript Pattern\n\n### When JS is Needed\n\n| Use JS For | Keep in Liquid |\n|------------|----------------|\n| Form submission | Static content display |\n| File upload | Badges and indicators |\n| Pagination/load more | Product lists |\n| Real-time validation | SEO content |\n\n### Minimal JS Structure\n\n```javascript\n// assets/app-embed.js\n\n(function() {\n  ''use strict'';\n\n  const config = window.APP_CONFIG || {};\n\n  // Form handling\n  function initForms() {\n    document.querySelectorAll(''[data-app-form]'').forEach(form => {\n      form.addEventListener(''submit'', handleSubmit);\n    });\n  }\n\n  async function handleSubmit(e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const form = e.target;\n    const data = new FormData(form);\n\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch(form.action, {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        body: JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(data)),\n        headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''}\n      });\n\n      const result = await response.json();\n      if (result.success) {\n        showMessage(form, ''success'', result.data.message);\n      } else {\n        showMessage(form, ''error'', result.error);\n      }\n    } catch (err) {\n      showMessage(form, ''error'', ''Something went wrong'');\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Initialize when DOM ready\n  if (document.readyState === ''loading'') {\n    document.addEventListener(''DOMContentLoaded'', initForms);\n  } else {\n    initForms();\n  }\n})();\n```\n\n---\n\n## Translations\n\n### Locale File Structure\n\n```json\n{\n  \"app\": {\n    \"title\": \"Feature Title\",\n    \"submit\": \"Submit\",\n    \"success\": \"Submitted successfully\",\n    \"error\": \"Something went wrong\",\n    \"no_items\": \"No items yet\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Using Translations\n\n```liquid\n{% comment %} In Liquid {% endcomment %}\n{{ ''app.title'' | t }}\n\n{% comment %} With variables {% endcomment %}\n{{ ''app.count'' | t: count: items.size }}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Guidelines\n\n### Do''s\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| Render in Liquid | Server-side = faster |\n| Use snippets | Reusable, cacheable |\n| Defer JS loading | Non-blocking |\n| Scope CSS | Avoid conflicts |\n\n### Don''ts\n\n| Avoid | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| Heavy JS frameworks | Bundle size |\n| Inline styles | Cache miss |\n| Blocking scripts | Slow page load |\n| Fetch on page load | Delays rendering |\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Block Development\n\n```\n- Schema defines all settings\n- Uses snippets for reusable parts\n- Translations for all text\n- Scoped CSS (no global pollution)\n- Minimal/no inline JS\n```\n\n### App Proxy Integration\n\n```\n- shopify.app.toml configured\n- Backend validates shop parameter\n- Returns JSON for JS consumption\n- HTML rendering for Liquid consumption\n```\n\n### Performance\n\n```\n- JS deferred or async\n- CSS in stylesheet (not inline)\n- Images lazy loaded\n- No external dependencies\n- Bundle < 20KB total\n```"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:23:12.231Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Shopify-focused AI Agents that optimize storefront performance through server-side rendering.","zh":"对于专注于Shopify的AI代理来说，通过服务器端渲染优化商店性能是必不可少的。","ja":"Shopifyに焦点を当てたAIエージェントがサーバーサイドレンダリングを通じてストアフロントのパフォーマンスを最適化するには不可欠です。","ko":"Shopify를 중점으로 하는 AI 에이전트가 서버 사이드 렌더링을 통해 스토어 프론트 성능을 최적화하는 데에는 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA centrados en Shopify que optimizan el rendimiento de la tienda a través de la renderización en el servidor.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''IA axés sur Shopify qui optimisent les performances de la boutique via le rendu côté serveur.","de":"Wesentlich für Shopify-fokussierte KI-Agents, die die Leistung des Shops durch Server-seitige Rendering optimieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA focados no Shopify que otimizam o desempenho da loja virtual por meio de renderização no lado do servidor.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Shopify, которые оптимизируют производительность витрины магазина посредством серверной отрисовки.","ar":"ضروري لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على Shopify ويهتمون بتحسين أداء متجر التجزئة من خلال العرض على الخادم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct integration with Shopify''s native Liquid templating system for server-rendered content delivery. This provides superior SEO optimization and faster load times compared to client-side alternatives.","zh":"通过直接与Shopify的原生Liquid模板系统集成，实现服务器渲染内容的交付，从而提供比客户端替代方案更好的SEO优化和更快的加载时间。","ja":"ShopifyのネイティブLiquidテンプレートシステムとの直接統合により、サーバーサイドレンダリングされたコンテンツの配信が可能になり、クライアントサイドの代替手段よりも優れたSEO最適化とより高速な読み込み時間が提供されます。","ko":"Shopify의 네이티브 Liquid 템플릿 시스템과 직접 통합하여 서버 사이드 렌더링된 콘텐츠를 제공함으로써 클라이언트 사이드 대체 방법보다 더 나은 SEO 최적화와 더 빠른 로딩 시간을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa con el sistema de plantillas Liquid nativo de Shopify para la entrega de contenido renderizado en el servidor. Esto proporciona una optimización SEO superior y tiempos de carga más rápidos en comparación con las alternativas del lado del cliente.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe avec le système de modèles Liquid natif de Shopify pour la livraison de contenu rendu côté serveur. Cela fournit une optimisation SEO supérieure et des temps de chargement plus rapides par rapport aux alternatives côté client.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration mit dem nativen Liquid-Template-System von Shopify für die Auslieferung von serverseitig gerendertem Inhalt. Dies bietet eine überlegene SEO-Optimierung und schnellere Ladezeiten im Vergleich zu Client-seitigen Alternativen.","pt":"Permite a integração direta com o sistema de modelagem de template Liquid nativo do Shopify para entrega de conteúdo renderizado no servidor. Isso fornece uma otimização de SEO superior e tempos de carregamento mais rápidos em comparação com as alternativas do lado do cliente.","ru":"Позволяет осуществлять прямую интеграцию с родной системой шаблонов Liquid от Shopify для доставки контента, отрисованного на сервере. Это обеспечивает лучшую оптимизацию для поисковых систем и более быстрые время загрузки по сравнению с альтернативами на стороне клиента.","ar":"يسمح بالتكامل المباشر مع نظام قوالب Liquid الأصلي من Shopify لتقديم محتوى تم عرضه على الخادم. يوفر ذلك تحسينًا إضافيًا لتحسين محرك البحث ووقت تحميل أسرع مقارنة ببدائل العميل."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing SEO-critical static content blocks","Implementing server-rendered product displays","Creating performance-optimized theme sections","Building semi-static content with Liquid templates"],"zh":["开发SEO关键的静态内容块","实施服务器渲染的产品显示","创建性能优化的主题部分","使用Liquid模板构建半静态内容"],"ja":["SEOクリティカルな静的コンテンツブロックの開発","サーバーサイドレンダリングされた製品表示の実装","パフォーマンス最適化されたテーマセクションの作成","Liquidテンプレートを使用したセミスタティックコンテンツの構築"],"ko":["SEO 중요한 정적 콘텐츠 블록 개발","서버 사이드 렌더링된 제품 표시 구현","성능 최적화된 테마 섹션 생성","Liquid 템플릿을 사용한 세미 정적 콘텐츠 구축"],"es":["Desarrollar bloques de contenido estático críticos para SEO","Implementar pantallas de productos renderizadas en el servidor","Crear secciones de temas optimizadas para el rendimiento","Crear contenido semiestático con plantillas Liquid"],"fr":["Développer des blocs de contenu statique critiques pour le SEO","Mettre en œuvre des affichages de produits rendus côté serveur","Créer des sections de thèmes optimisées pour les performances","Créer du contenu semi-statique avec des modèles Liquid"],"de":["Entwicklung von SEO-kritischen statischen Inhaltblöcken","Implementierung von serverseitig gerenderten Produktdarstellungen","Erstellung von leistungsoptimierten Themenbereichen","Erstellung von semistatischem Inhalt mit Liquid-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Desenvolver blocos de conteúdo estático críticos para SEO","Implementar exibições de produtos renderizadas no servidor","Criar seções de tema otimizadas para desempenho","Construir conteúdo semi-estático com modelos Liquid"],"ru":["Разработка статических блоков контента, критических для SEO","Реализация серверных отображений продуктов","Создание оптимизированных для производительности разделов темы","Построение полу-статического контента с помощью шаблонов Liquid"],"ar":["تطوير كتل محتوى ثابتة حرجة لتحسين محرك البحث","تنفيذ عروض منتجات معروضة على الخادم","إنشاء أقسام موضوع محسّنة للأداء","بناء محتوى شبه ثابت باستخدام قوالب Liquid"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Shopify''s Liquid rendering system","Not suitable for highly interactive widgets requiring real-time updates","Requires Shopify theme development environment"],"zh":["仅限于Shopify的Liquid渲染系统","不适合需要实时更新的高交互式小部件","需要Shopify主题开发环境"],"ja":["ShopifyのLiquidレンダリングシステムのみに限定","リアルタイム更新が必要な高対話的小部品には不適","Shopifyテーマ開発環境が必要"],"ko":["Shopify의 Liquid 렌더링 시스템만으로 제한됨","실시간 업데이트가 필요한 고상호작용 위젯에는 부적합","Shopify 테마 개발 환경이 필요"],"es":["Limitado al sistema de renderizado Liquid de Shopify","No adecuado para widgets altamente interactivos que requieren actualizaciones en tiempo real","Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de temas de Shopify"],"fr":["Limité au système de rendu Liquid de Shopify","Non adapté pour les widgets hautement interactifs nécessitant des mises à jour en temps réel","Nécessite un environnement de développement de thèmes Shopify"],"de":["Begrenzt auf das Liquid-Renderingsystem von Shopify","Nicht geeignet für hochinteraktive Widgets, die Echtzeit-Updates erfordern","Benötigt eine Shopify-Themen-Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Limitado ao sistema de renderização Liquid do Shopify","Não adequado para widgets altamente interativos que requerem atualizações em tempo real","Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento de temas do Shopify"],"ru":["Ограничен системой рендеринга Liquid от Shopify","Не подходит для высокоинтерактивных виджетов, требующих обновлений в реальном времени","Требует среды разработки темы Shopify"],"ar":["محدود بنظام عرض Liquid من Shopify","غير مناسب للعناصر التفاعلية شديدة الارتباط التي تتطلب تحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","يتطلب بيئة تطوير موضوعات Shopify"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
