 herramienta para probar la escalabilidad de tus sistemas, descubriendo qué funciona y qué no a gran escala.","fr":"Scale Game est un outil pour tester l''évolutivité de vos systèmes, découvrant ce qui fonctionne et ce qui ne fonctionne pas à grande échelle.","de":"Scale Game ist ein Tool, um die Skalierbarkeit Ihrer Systeme zu testen und herauszufinden, was auf großem Maßstab funktioniert und was nicht.","pt":"O Jogo de Escala é uma ferramenta para testar a robustez de suas soluções em escalas extremas","ru":"Игра Масштаба - это инструмент для тестирования прочности ваших решений в крайних масштабах","ar":"لعبة التوسع هي أداة لاختبار متانة حلولك في المقاييس القصوى","en":"version 3 of JJ"},"definition":{"en":"version 3 of JJ"},"features":{"zh":["测试算法复杂性","评估异步需求","验证缓存需求","支持大规模用户测试","提供性能优化建议"],"ja":["アルゴリズムの複雑性をテストする","非同期要件を評価する","キャッシュ要件を検証する","大規模ユーザーテストをサポートする","パフォーマンス最適化の提案を提供する"],"ko":["알고리즘 복잡성을 테스트","비동기 요구 사항을 평가","캐싱 요구 사항을 검증","대규모 사용자 테스트를 지원","성능 최적화 제안을 제공"],"es":["Prueba de escalabilidad para identificar límites","Análisis de complejidad algorítmica","Evaluación de requisitos de concurrencia","Análisis de necesidades de caché","Prueba de velocidad y volumen","Identificación de debilidades en la escalabilidad"],"fr":["Test d''échelle pour identifier les limites","Analyse de la complexité algorithmique","Évaluation des besoins de concurrence","Analyse des besoins de cache","Test de vitesse et de volume","Identification des faiblesses dans l''évolutivité"],"de":["Skalierbarkeitstest, um Grenzen zu identifizieren","Analyse der algorithmischen Komplexität","Bewertung der Anforderungen an die Konkurrenz","Analyse der Cache-Bedürfnisse","Test von Geschwindigkeit und Volumen","Identifizierung von Schwachstellen in der Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Teste de desempenho em escalas extremas","Análise de complexidade algorítmica","Verificação de requisitos assíncronos","Análise de necessidades de cache","Teste de concorrência de usuários"],"ru":["Тестирование производительности в крайних масштабах","Анализ алгоритмической сложности","Проверка асинхронных требований","Анализ потребностей в кэше","Тестирование конкурентоспособности пользователей"],"ar":["اختبار الأداء في المقاييس القصوى","تحليل التعقيد الخوارزمي","فحص متطلبات غير المتزامنة","تحليل احتياجات التخزين المؤقت","اختبار المنافسة بين المستخدمين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["规模游戏","极限条件测试","算法复杂性","异步需求","缓存需求","大规模用户测试","性能优化"],"ja":["スケールゲーム","極限条件テスト","アルゴリズムの複雑性","非同期要件","キャッシュ要件","大規模ユーザーテスト","パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["스케일 게임","극한 조건 테스트","알고리즘 복잡성","비동기 요구 사항","캐싱 요구 사항","대규모 사용자 테스트","성능 최적화"],"es":["prueba de escalabilidad","diseño de sistemas escalables","análisis de complejidad algorítmica","requisitos de concurrencia","necesidades de caché","prueba de velocidad","prueba de volumen","desarrollo de software escalable"],"fr":["test d''échelle","conception de systèmes évolutifs","analyse de complexité algorithmique","besoins de concurrence","besoins de cache","test de vitesse","test de volume","développement de logiciels évolutifs"],"de":["Skalierbarkeitstest","Entwurf von skalierbaren Systemen","Analyse der algorithmischen Komplexität","Anforderungen an die Konkurrenz","Cache-Bedürfnisse","Geschwindigkeitstest","Volumentest","Entwicklung von skalierbarer Software"],"pt":["teste de desempenho","escala extrema","complexidade algorítmica","requisitos assíncronos","necessidades de cache","concorrência de usuários","desenvolvimento de software","teste de software"],"ru":["тестирование производительности","крайний масштаб","алгоритмическая сложность","асинхронные требования","потребности в кэше","конкурентоспособность пользователей","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اختبار الأداء","المقاييس القصوى","تعقيد الخوارزمية","متطلبات غير المتزامنة","احتياجات التخزين المؤقت","منافسة بين المستخدمين","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبار البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Dmccarty30","repo":"Journeyman-Jobs","repoPath":"Dmccarty30/Journeyman-Jobs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Scale Game","description":"Test at extremes (1000x bigger/smaller, instant/year-long) to expose fundamental truths hidden at normal scales","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Scale Game\n\n## Overview\n\nTest your approach at extreme scales to find what breaks and what surprisingly survives.\n\n**Core principle:** Extremes expose fundamental truths hidden at normal scales.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Scale Dimension | Test At Extremes | What It Reveals |\n|-----------------|------------------|-----------------|\n| Volume | 1 item vs 1B items | Algorithmic complexity limits |\n| Speed | Instant vs 1 year | Async requirements, caching needs |\n| Users | 1 user vs 1B users | Concurr","body":"# Scale Game\n\n## Overview\n\nTest your approach at extreme scales to find what breaks and what surprisingly survives.\n\n**Core principle:** Extremes expose fundamental truths hidden at normal scales.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Scale Dimension | Test At Extremes | What It Reveals |\n|-----------------|------------------|-----------------|\n| Volume | 1 item vs 1B items | Algorithmic complexity limits |\n| Speed | Instant vs 1 year | Async requirements, caching needs |\n| Users | 1 user vs 1B users | Concurrency issues, resource limits |\n| Duration | Milliseconds vs years | Memory leaks, state growth |\n| Failure rate | Never fails vs always fails | Error handling adequacy |\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Pick dimension** - What could vary extremely?\n2. **Test minimum** - What if this was 1000x smaller/faster/fewer?\n3. **Test maximum** - What if this was 1000x bigger/slower/more?\n4. **Note what breaks** - Where do limits appear?\n5. **Note what survives** - What''s fundamentally sound?\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Error Handling\n**Normal scale:** \"Handle errors when they occur\" works fine\n**At 1B scale:** Error volume overwhelms logging, crashes system\n**Reveals:** Need to make errors impossible (type systems) or expect them (chaos engineering)\n\n### Example 2: Synchronous APIs\n**Normal scale:** Direct function calls work\n**At global scale:** Network latency makes synchronous calls unusable\n**Reveals:** Async/messaging becomes survival requirement, not optimization\n\n### Example 3: In-Memory State\n**Normal duration:** Works for hours/days\n**At years:** Memory grows unbounded, eventual crash\n**Reveals:** Need persistence or periodic cleanup, can''t rely on memory\n\n## Red Flags You Need This\n\n- \"It works in dev\" (but will it work in production?)\n- No idea where limits are\n- \"Should scale fine\" (without testing)\n- Surprised by production behavior\n\n## Remember\n\n- Extremes reveal fundamentals\n- What works at one scale fails at another\n- Test both directions (bigger AND smaller)\n- Use insights to validate architecture early\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:22:33.735Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for System Analysis Agents tasked with identifying scalability bottlenecks and architectural limits.","zh":"适用于负责识别可扩展性瓶颈和架构限制的系统分析代理。","ja":"スケーラビリティのボトルネックやアーキテクチャの限界を特定するタスクに最適なシステム分析エージェントです。","ko":"확장성 병목 현상과 아키텍처 제한을 식별하는 시스템 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de sistemas encargados de identificar cuellos de botella de escalabilidad y límites arquitectónicos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de systèmes chargés d''identifier les goulots d''étranglement de scalabilité et les limites architecturales.","de":"Ideal für Systemanalyseagenten, die mit der Identifizierung von Skalierbarkeitsengpässen und architektonischen Grenzen betraut sind.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Sistema encarregados de identificar gargalos de escalabilidade e limites arquitetônicos.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов анализа системы, задачей которых является выявление узких мест масштабируемости и архитектурных ограничений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء قادرون على تحليل النظام مكلفين بتحديد عُقبات التوسع والحدود المعمارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to perform extreme-scale testing across volume, speed, and user concurrency dimensions. It reveals algorithmic complexity limits, async requirements, and concurrency handling capabilities by pushing systems to their breaking points.","zh":"使代理能够在体积、速度和用户并发性维度上执行极限规模测试。它通过将系统推到极限来揭示算法复杂性限制、异步要求和并发处理能力。","ja":"エージェントがボリューム、速度、ユーザー同時実行性の次元で極限スケールのテストを実行できるようにします。アルゴリズムの複雑さの限界、非同期要件、および並行処理能力をシステムを限界まで追い込むことで明らかにします。","ko":"에이전트가 볼륨, 속도 및 사용자 동시성 차원에서 극한 규모의 테스트를 수행하도록启用합니다. 시스템을 한계까지 밀어붙여 알고리즘 복잡성 제한, 비동기 요구 사항 및 동시 처리 기능을 드러냅니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar pruebas de escalabilidad extrema en las dimensiones de volumen, velocidad y concurrencia de usuarios. Revela los límites de complejidad algorítmica, los requisitos asíncronos y las capacidades de manejo de concurrencia al llevar los sistemas a sus límites de ruptura.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des tests d''échelle extrême sur les dimensions de volume, de vitesse et de concurrence utilisateur. Révèle les limites de complexité algorithmique, les exigences asynchrones et les capacités de gestion de la concurrence en poussant les systèmes à leurs points de rupture.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, extreme Skalierbarkeitstests über Volumen-, Geschwindigkeits- und Benutzerkonkurrenzdimensionen durchzuführen. Es zeigt die Grenzen der algorithmischen Komplexität, asynchrone Anforderungen und Konkurrenzhandhabungsfähigkeiten, indem es Systeme an ihre Bruchpunkte bringt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem testes de escala extrema em volume, velocidade e dimensões de concorrência de usuários. Isso revela limites de complexidade algorítmica, requisitos assíncronos e capacidades de tratamento de concorrência, levando os sistemas ao seu ponto de ruptura.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять тестирование экстремальной масштабируемости по объемам, скорости и размерам одновременного доступа пользователей. Это раскрывает пределы алгоритмической сложности, асинхронные требования и возможности обработки одновременного доступа, доводя системы до точки их разрушения.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإجراء اختبارات الحجم القصوى عبر الأبعاد الحجمية والسرعة وتزامن المستخدمين. هذا يكشف عن حدود التعقيد الخوارزمي والمتطلبات غير المتزامنة وقدرات التعامل مع التزامن من خلال دفع الأنظمة إلى نقاط انكسارها."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing algorithmic complexity with 1B items","Identifying async requirements through extreme speed variations","Stress-testing concurrency handling under 1B simulated users","Exposing fundamental system truths hidden at normal operational scales"],"zh":["使用10亿个项目测试算法复杂性","通过极端速度变化识别异步要求","在10亿个模拟用户下测试并发处理","暴露在正常操作规模下隐藏的基本系统真相"],"ja":["10億アイテムを使用してアルゴリズムの複雑さをテストする","極端な速度変化を通じて非同期要件を特定する","10億人のシミュレートユーザー下で並行処理をストレステストする","通常の運用スケールで隠されている基本的なシステムの真実を暴露する"],"ko":["10억 개의 항목을 사용하여 알고리즘 복잡성 테스트","극단적인 속도 변동을 통해 비동기 요구 사항 식별","10억 명의 시뮬레이션 사용자 아래에서 병렬 처리 스트레스 테스트","정상 작동 규모에서 숨겨진 기본 시스템 진실暴露"],"es":["Pruebas de complejidad algorítmica con 1.000 millones de elementos","Identificación de requisitos asíncronos a través de variaciones extremas de velocidad","Pruebas de estrés de manejo de concurrencia con 1.000 millones de usuarios simulados","Exposición de verdades fundamentales del sistema ocultas a escalas de operación normales"],"fr":["Tests de complexité algorithmique avec 1 milliard d''éléments","Identification des exigences asynchrones via des variations extrêmes de vitesse","Tests de contrainte de gestion de la concurrence avec 1 milliard d''utilisateurs simulés","Exposition de vérités fondamentales du système cachées à des échelles d''exploitation normales"],"de":["Tests der algorithmischen Komplexität mit 1 Milliarde Elementen","Identifizierung asynchroner Anforderungen durch extreme Geschwindigkeitsvariationen","Stresstests der Konkurrenzhandhabung unter 1 Milliarde simulierten Benutzern","Enthüllung grundlegender Systemwahrheiten, die bei normalen Betriebsskalen verborgen sind"],"pt":["Testar complexidade algorítmica com 1 bilhão de itens","Identificar requisitos assíncronos por meio de variações extremas de velocidade","Testar estresse de tratamento de concorrência sob 1 bilhão de usuários simulados","Expor verdades fundamentais do sistema ocultas em escalas operacionais normais"],"ru":["Тестирование алгоритмической сложности с 1 миллиардом элементов","Выявление асинхронных требований посредством экстремальных изменений скорости","Тестирование обработки одновременного доступа под нагрузкой 1 миллиарда模拟рованных пользователей","Раскрытие основных истин системы, скрытых на обычных операционных масштабах"],"ar":["اختبار التعقيد الخوارزمي مع مليار عنصر","تحديد المتطلبات غير المتزامنة من خلال变化ات سرعة قصوى","اختبار الضغط على معالجة التزامن تحت مليار مستخدم محاكى","كشف الحقائق الأساسية للنظام المخفية في المقاييس التشغيلية العادية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to target system for testing","Dependent on available computational resources for extreme simulations"],"zh":["需要访问目标系统进行测试","依赖于可用的计算资源进行极端模拟"],"ja":["テストのためにターゲットシステムへのアクセスが必要","極端なシミュレーションには利用可能な計算リソースに依存する"],"ko":["테스트를 위한 대상 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요","극한의 시뮬레이션에는 사용 가능한 계산 리소스에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema objetivo para pruebas","Dependiente de los recursos computacionales disponibles para simulaciones extremas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système cible pour les tests","Dépend des ressources computationnelles disponibles pour les simulations extrêmes"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Ziel-System für Tests","Abhängig von den verfügbaren Rechenressourcen für extreme Simulationen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema-alvo para testes","Depende dos recursos computacionais disponíveis para simulações extremas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к целевой системе для тестирования","Зависит от доступных вычислительных ресурсов для экстремальных симуляций"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى النظام المستهدف للاختبارات","يعتمد على الموارد الحاسوبية المتاحة للتحاكي القصوى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vjr2005/Challenge/project-structure', 'community', 'vjr2005', 'Challenge', 'vjr2005/Challenge', 'project-structure', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z', '2026-02-18T13:23:34.192Z', NULL, '{"id":"vjr2005/Challenge/project-structure","name":"project-structure","description":{"zh":"本指南介绍了项目结构的最佳实践，帮助开发者正确组织代码和文件","ja":"このガイドでは、プロジェクト構造のベストプラクティスを紹介し、開発者がコードとファイルを正しく組織できるようにします","ko":"이 가이드는 프로젝트 구조에 대한 모범 사례를 소개하여 개발자가 코드와 파일을 올바르게 구성할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"La estructura de proyecto es fundamental para el desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables y mantenibles. Nuestra guía te ayudará a organizar tus archivos y directorios de manera eficiente.","fr":"La structure de projet est fondamentale pour le développement d''applications évolutives et maintenables. Notre guide vous aidera à organiser vos fichiers et répertoires de manière efficace.","de":"Die Projektstruktur ist für die Entwicklung von skalierbaren und wartbaren Anwendungen von entscheidender Bedeutung. Unser Leitfaden hilft Ihnen, Ihre Dateien und Verzeichnisse effizient zu organisieren.","pt":"O guia de estrutura de projeto é essencial para desenvolvedores que desejam organizar seus arquivos e pastas de forma eficiente.","ru":"Руководство по структуре проекта является обязательным для разработчиков, которые хотят организовать свои файлы и папки эффективно.","ar":"دليل هيكل المشروع ضروري للمطورين الذين يرغبون في تنظيم ملفاتهم ومجلداتهم بفعالية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"项目结构指南","ja":"プロジェクト構造ガイド","ko":"프로젝트 구조 가이드","es":"Estructura de Proyecto para Desarrolladores","fr":"Structure de Projet pour les Développeurs","de":"Projektstruktur für Entwickler","pt":"Estrutura de Projeto: Guia de Organização","ru":"Структура Проекта: Руководство по Организации","ar":"هيكل المشروع: دليل التنظيم","en":"project-structure"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍了项目结构的最佳实践，帮助开发者正确组织代码和文件","ja":"このガイドでは、プロジェクト構造のベストプラクティスを紹介し、開発者がコードとファイルを正しく組織できるようにします","ko":"이 가이드는 프로젝트 구조에 대한 모범 사례를 소개하여 개발자가 코드와 파일을 올바르게 구성할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"La estructura de proyecto es fundamental para el desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables y mantenibles. Nuestra guía te ayudará a organizar tus archivos y dire...","fr":"La structure de projet est fondamentale pour le développement d''applications évolutives et maintenables. Notre guide vous aidera à organiser vos fichiers et ...","de":"Die Projektstruktur ist für die Entwicklung von skalierbaren und wartbaren Anwendungen von entscheidender Bedeutung. Unser Leitfaden hilft Ihnen, Ihre Dateie...","pt":"O guia de estrutura de projeto é essencial para desenvolvedores que desejam organizar seus arquivos e pastas de forma eficiente.","ru":"Руководство по структуре проекта является обязательным для разработчиков, которые хотят организовать свои файлы и папки эффективно.","ar":"دليل هيكل المشروع ضروري للمطورين الذين يرغبون في تنظيم ملفاتهم ومجلداتهم بفعالية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建新特性模块","组织文件正确","理解代码库布局","添加扩展到现有类型"],"ja":["新しい機能モジュールを作成","ファイルを正しく組織","コードベースのレイアウトを理解","既存のタイプに拡張を追加"],"ko":["새 기능 모듈 생성","파일을 올바르게 구성","코드베이스 레이아웃 이해","기존 유형에 확장 추가"],"es":["Organización de archivos y directorios","Estructura de proyecto escalable","Mejora de la claridad y el rendimiento","Integración con frameworks y bibliotecas","Flexibilidad para adaptarse a diferentes necesidades"],"fr":["Organisation de fichiers et de répertoires","Structure de projet évolutives","Amélioration de la clarté et des performances","Intégration avec des frameworks et des bibliothèques","Flexibilité pour s''adapter à différents besoins"],"de":["Organisation von Dateien und Verzeichnissen","Skalierbare Projektstruktur","Verbesserung der Klarheit und Leistung","Integration mit Frameworks und Bibliotheken","Flexibilität, um sich an unterschiedliche Anforderungen anzupassen"],"pt":["Organização de arquivos e pastas","Criação de módulos de recursos","Entendimento do layout do código","Adição de extensões a tipos existentes","Melhoria da manutenção do código"],"ru":["Организация файлов и папок","Создание модулей функций","Понимание компоновки кода","Добавление расширений к существующим типам","Улучшение поддержки кода"],"ar":["تنظيم الملفات والمجلدات","إنشاء وحدات الميزات","فهم تخطيط الكود","إضافة امتدادات إلى الأنواع الموجودة","تحسين صيانة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目结构","代码组织","目录结构","开发最佳实践","代码可读性","维护性"],"ja":["プロジェクト構造","コード組織","ディレクトリ構造","開発ベストプラクティス","コード可読性","保守性"],"ko":["프로젝트 구조","코드 구성","디렉토리 구조","개발 모범 사례","코드 가독성","유지 보수성"],"es":["estructura de proyecto","desarrollo de software","organización de archivos","directorios","escalabilidad","claridad","rendimiento"],"fr":["structure de projet","développement de logiciels","organisation de fichiers","répertoires","évolution","clarté","performances"],"de":["Projektstruktur","Software-Entwicklung","Dateiorganisation","Verzeichnisse","Skalierbarkeit","Klarheit","Leistung"],"pt":["estrutura de projeto","organização de arquivos","desenvolvimento de software","módulos de recursos","layout do código","manutenção do código"],"ru":["структура проекта","организация файлов","разработка программного обеспечения","модули функций","компоновка кода","поддержка кода"],"ar":["هيكل المشروع","تنظيم الملفات","تطوير البرمجيات","وحدات الميزات","تخطيط الكود","صيانة الكود"]}},"owner":"vjr2005","repo":"Challenge","repoPath":"vjr2005/Challenge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-structure","description":"Project organization and directory structure. Use when creating features, organizing files, or understanding the codebase layout.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: Project Structure\n\nGuide for project organization and directory structure.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Create a new feature module\n- Organize files correctly\n- Understand the codebase layout\n- Add extensions to existing types\n\n---\n\n## Project Overview\n\n```\n{AppName}/\n├── App/\n│   ├── Sources/\n│   │   ├── {AppName}App.swift        # Minimal entry point (imports AppKit)\n│   │   └── Resources/\n│   │       └── Assets.xcassets/\n│   └── Tests/\n│       └── UI/                       # UI test","body":"# Skill: Project Structure\n\nGuide for project organization and directory structure.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- Create a new feature module\n- Organize files correctly\n- Understand the codebase layout\n- Add extensions to existing types\n\n---\n\n## Project Overview\n\n```\n{AppName}/\n├── App/\n│   ├── Sources/\n│   │   ├── {AppName}App.swift        # Minimal entry point (imports AppKit)\n│   │   └── Resources/\n│   │       └── Assets.xcassets/\n│   └── Tests/\n│       └── UI/                       # UI tests only\n├── AppKit/                           # Testable app code (no TEST_HOST needed)\n│   ├── Sources/\n│   │   ├── AppContainer.swift        # Composition Root (centralized DI)\n│   │   ├── Data/\n│   │   │   └── AppEnvironment+API.swift\n│   │   └── Presentation/\n│   │       ├── Navigation/\n│   │       │   └── AppNavigationRedirect.swift\n│   │       └── Views/\n│   │           └── RootContainerView.swift\n│   └── Tests/\n│       ├── Unit/                     # Unit tests\n│       ├── Snapshots/                # Snapshot tests\n│       └── Shared/                   # Shared resources\n├── Features/\n│   ├── {Feature}/\n│   └── Home/\n├── Libraries/\n│   ├── Core/\n│   ├── Networking/\n│   ├── DesignSystem/\n│   └── SnapshotTestKit/\n├── Shared/\n│   └── Resources/\n├── Derived/                          # Generated by Tuist (gitignored)\n│   └── InfoPlists/\n├── Tuist/\n│   └── ProjectDescriptionHelpers/\n├── Project.swift\n├── Tuist.swift\n└── CLAUDE.md\n```\n\n**Key Architecture:**\n- **App**: Minimal entry point that imports `ChallengeAppKit`\n- **AppKit**: Framework containing testable app code (AppContainer, RootContainerView, AppNavigationRedirect). Tests run without TEST_HOST.\n\n---\n\n## Feature Naming\n\nFeature directory names must **not** contain the word \"Feature\". Use simple, descriptive names:\n\n```\n// RIGHT\nFeatures/User/\nFeatures/Character/\nFeatures/Home/\n\n// WRONG\nFeatures/UserFeature/\nFeatures/CharacterFeature/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Feature Module Structure\n\nEach feature module follows this internal structure:\n\n```\nFeatureName/\n├── Sources/\n│   ├── {Feature}Feature.swift              # Public entry point (navigation + deep links)\n│   ├── {Feature}Container.swift            # Dependency composition (factories)\n│   ├── Domain/\n│   │   ├── Models/\n│   │   │   └── {Name}.swift                # Domain models\n│   │   ├── UseCases/\n│   │   │   └── Get{Name}UseCase.swift      # Business logic\n│   │   └── Repositories/\n│   │       └── {Name}RepositoryContract.swift  # Repository contracts\n│   ├── Data/\n│   │   ├── DataSources/\n│   │   │   ├── Remote/\n│   │   │   │   ├── {Name}RemoteDataSourceContract.swift\n│   │   │   │   └── {Name}RESTDataSource.swift\n│   │   │   └── Local/\n│   │   │       ├── {Name}LocalDataSourceContract.swift\n│   │   │       └── {Name}MemoryDataSource.swift\n│   │   ├── DTOs/\n│   │   │   └── {Name}DTO.swift\n│   │   ├── Mappers/\n│   │   │   └── {Name}Mapper.swift\n│   │   └── Repositories/\n│   │       └── {Name}Repository.swift\n│   └── Presentation/\n│       ├── Navigation/                             # Feature-level navigation (inside Presentation)\n│       │   ├── {Feature}IncomingNavigation.swift   # Navigation destinations\n│       │   ├── {Feature}OutgoingNavigation.swift   # Cross-feature navigation (optional)\n│       │   └── {Feature}DeepLinkHandler.swift      # Deep link handler\n│       ├── {Name}List/\n│       │   ├── Navigator/\n│       │   │   ├── {Name}ListNavigatorContract.swift\n│       │   │   └── {Name}ListNavigator.swift\n│       │   ├── Tracker/\n│       │   │   ├── {Name}ListTrackerContract.swift\n│       │   │   ├── {Name}ListTracker.swift\n│       │   │   └── {Name}ListEvent.swift\n│       │   ├── Views/\n│       │   │   └── {Name}ListView.swift\n│       │   └── ViewModels/\n│       │       ├── {Name}ListViewModel.swift\n│       │       └── {Name}ListViewState.swift\n│       └── {Name}Detail/\n│           ├── Navigator/\n│           │   ├── {Name}DetailNavigatorContract.swift\n│           │   └── {Name}DetailNavigator.swift\n│           ├── Tracker/\n│           │   ├── {Name}DetailTrackerContract.swift\n│           │   ├── {Name}DetailTracker.swift\n│           │   └── {Name}DetailEvent.swift\n│           ├── Views/\n│           │   └── {Name}DetailView.swift\n│           └── ViewModels/\n│               ├── {Name}DetailViewModel.swift\n│               └── {Name}DetailViewState.swift\n├── Tests/\n│   ├── Unit/                                # Unit tests (Swift Testing)\n│   │   ├── Domain/\n│   │   │   └── UseCases/\n│   │   │       └── Get{Name}UseCaseTests.swift\n│   │   ├── Data/\n│   │   │   └── {Name}RepositoryTests.swift\n│   │   ├── Presentation/\n│   │   │   ├── Navigation/\n│   │   │   │   └── {Feature}DeepLinkHandlerTests.swift\n│   │   │   └── {Name}List/\n│   │   │       └── ViewModels/\n│   │   │           └── {Name}ListViewModelTests.swift\n│   │   └── Feature/\n│   │       └── {Feature}FeatureTests.swift\n│   ├── Snapshots/                           # Snapshot tests (ChallengeSnapshotTestKit)\n│   │   └── Presentation/\n│   │       └── {Name}List/\n│   │           ├── {Name}ListViewSnapshotTests.swift\n│   │           └── __Snapshots__/\n│   └── Shared/                              # Shared resources\n│       ├── Stubs/\n│       │   └── {Name}+Stub.swift\n│       ├── Mocks/\n│       │   ├── Get{Name}UseCaseMock.swift\n│       │   └── {Name}RepositoryMock.swift\n│       ├── Fixtures/\n│       │   └── {name}.json\n│       ├── Extensions/\n│       │   └── {Name}ViewState+Equatable.swift\n│       └── Resources/\n│           └── test-avatar.jpg\n└── Mocks/                                   # Public mocks (if needed)\n    └── {Name}RepositoryMock.swift\n```\n\n---\n\n## Presentation Layer Organization\n\nThe Presentation layer groups related Views and ViewModels by feature name:\n\n```\nPresentation/\n├── CharacterDetail/            # Feature: Character detail screen\n│   ├── Navigator/\n│   │   ├── CharacterDetailNavigatorContract.swift\n│   │   └── CharacterDetailNavigator.swift\n│   ├── Tracker/\n│   │   ├── CharacterDetailTrackerContract.swift\n│   │   ├── CharacterDetailTracker.swift\n│   │   └── CharacterDetailEvent.swift\n│   ├── Views/\n│   │   └── CharacterDetailView.swift\n│   └── ViewModels/\n│       ├── CharacterDetailViewModel.swift\n│       └── CharacterDetailViewState.swift\n├── CharacterList/              # Feature: Character list screen\n│   ├── Navigator/\n│   │   ├── CharacterListNavigatorContract.swift\n│   │   └── CharacterListNavigator.swift\n│   ├── Tracker/\n│   │   ├── CharacterListTrackerContract.swift\n│   │   ├── CharacterListTracker.swift\n│   │   └── CharacterListEvent.swift\n│   ├── Views/\n│   │   └── CharacterListView.swift\n│   └── ViewModels/\n│       ├── CharacterListViewModel.swift\n│       └── CharacterListViewState.swift\n└── ...\n```\n\n**Naming conventions:**\n- Folder name matches the feature (e.g., `CharacterDetail`)\n- Navigator: `{Feature}Navigator.swift` and `{Feature}NavigatorContract.swift`\n- Tracker: `{Feature}Tracker.swift`, `{Feature}TrackerContract.swift`, and `{Feature}Event.swift`\n- View: `{Feature}View.swift`\n- ViewModel: `{Feature}ViewModel.swift`\n- ViewState: `{Feature}ViewState.swift`\n\n---\n\n## Extensions\n\nExtensions of external framework types (Foundation, UIKit, SwiftUI, etc.) must be placed in an `Extensions/` folder.\n\n### Location\n\n```\nSources/\n├── Extensions/\n│   ├── URL+QueryItems.swift\n│   ├── Date+Formatting.swift\n│   └── String+Validation.swift\n└── ...\n\nTests/\n├── Extensions/\n│   ├── URLSession+Mock.swift\n│   ├── HTTPURLResponse+Mock.swift\n│   └── URLRequest+BodyData.swift\n└── ...\n```\n\n### Naming Convention\n\n**Pattern:** `TypeName+Purpose.swift`\n\n```swift\n// URL+QueryItems.swift\nextension URL {\n    func appendingQueryItems(_ items: [URLQueryItem]) -> URL { ... }\n}\n\n// URLSession+Mock.swift (in Tests)\nextension URLSession {\n    static func mockSession() -> URLSession { ... }\n}\n\n// Date+Formatting.swift\nextension Date {\n    func formatted(style: DateFormatter.Style) -> String { ... }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tests Directory Structure\n\n```\nTests/\n├── Unit/                         # Unit tests (Swift Testing)\n│   ├── Domain/\n│   │   └── UseCases/\n│   │       └── Get{Name}UseCaseTests.swift\n│   ├── Data/\n│   │   ├── {Name}RepositoryTests.swift\n│   │   └── {Name}RemoteDataSourceTests.swift\n│   ├── Presentation/\n│   │   └── {ScreenName}/\n│   │       └── ViewModels/\n│   │           └── {ScreenName}ViewModelTests.swift\n│   └── Feature/\n│       └── {Feature}FeatureTests.swift\n├── Snapshots/                    # Snapshot tests (ChallengeSnapshotTestKit)\n│   └── Presentation/\n│       └── {ScreenName}/\n│           ├── {ScreenName}ViewSnapshotTests.swift\n│           └── __Snapshots__/\n├── UI/                           # UI tests (XCTest, App only)\n└── Shared/                       # Shared resources (used by Unit, Snapshots, and UI)\n    ├── Stubs/                    # Domain model test data\n    │   ├── Character+Stub.swift\n    │   └── Location+Stub.swift\n    ├── Mocks/                    # Internal test mocks\n    │   ├── Get{Name}UseCaseMock.swift\n    │   └── {Name}RepositoryMock.swift\n    ├── Fixtures/                 # JSON fixtures for DTOs\n    │   ├── character.json\n    │   └── character_list.json\n    ├── Extensions/               # Test helpers (Equatable, etc.)\n    │   └── {Name}ViewState+Equatable.swift\n    ├── Scenarios/                # Reusable SwiftMockServer configurations (UI tests)\n    │   └── UITestCase+Scenarios.swift\n    └── Resources/                # Test images\n        └── test-avatar.jpg\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mocks Location\n\n| Location | Visibility | Usage |\n|----------|------------|-------|\n| `Mocks/` (framework) | Public | Mocks used by other modules |\n| `Tests/Shared/Mocks/` | Internal | Mocks shared between Unit and Snapshot tests |\n\n```\nFeatureName/\n├── Mocks/                    # Public mocks ({AppName}FeatureNameMocks framework)\n│   └── {Name}RepositoryMock.swift\n└── Tests/\n    └── Shared/\n        └── Mocks/            # Internal test-only mocks\n            └── {Name}DataSourceMock.swift\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Module\n\n```\nLibraries/Core/\n├── Sources/\n│   ├── AppEnvironment/\n│   │   └── AppEnvironment.swift      # Base environment enum\n│   ├── Feature/\n│   │   └── FeatureContract.swift      # Feature protocol\n│   ├── Navigation/\n│   │   ├── NavigationCoordinator.swift   # @Observable path manager\n│   │   ├── NavigatorContract.swift       # Navigation protocol\n│   │   ├── NavigationRedirectContract.swift\n│   │   ├── Navigation.swift              # Base navigation protocol\n│   │   ├── AnyNavigation.swift           # Type-erased wrapper\n│   │   └── DeepLinkHandler.swift\n│   ├── ImageLoader/\n│   │   ├── ImageLoaderContract.swift\n│   │   ├── CachedImageLoader.swift\n│   │   ├── ImageLoaderEnvironment.swift\n│   │   ├── DiskCache/\n│   │   │   ├── ImageDiskCacheContract.swift\n│   │   │   ├── ImageDiskCache.swift\n│   │   │   ├── DiskCacheConfiguration.swift\n│   │   │   ├── FileSystemContract.swift\n│   │   │   └── FileSystem.swift\n│   │   └── MemoryCache/\n│   │       ├── ImageMemoryCacheContract.swift\n│   │       └── ImageMemoryCache.swift\n│   ├── Tracking/\n│   │   ├── TrackerContract.swift\n│   │   ├── Tracker.swift\n│   │   ├── TrackingEventContract.swift\n│   │   └── Providers/\n│   │       ├── TrackingProviderContract.swift\n│   │       └── ConsoleTrackingProvider.swift\n│   └── Extensions/\n│       └── ...\n├── Tests/\n│   └── Unit/\n│       ├── AppEnvironment/\n│       │   └── AppEnvironmentTests.swift\n│       ├── Navigation/\n│       │   └── NavigationCoordinatorTests.swift\n│       └── Tracking/\n│           ├── TrackerTests.swift\n│           └── ConsoleTrackingProviderTests.swift\n└── Mocks/\n    ├── NavigatorMock.swift\n    ├── TrackerMock.swift\n    ├── ImageLoaderMock.swift\n    └── Bundle+JSON.swift\n```\n\n---\n\n## Networking Module\n\n```\nLibraries/Networking/\n├── Sources/\n│   ├── HTTP/\n│   │   ├── HTTPClient.swift\n│   │   ├── HTTPClientContract.swift\n│   │   ├── Endpoint.swift\n│   │   ├── HTTPMethod.swift\n│   │   └── HTTPError.swift\n├── Tests/\n│   └── Unit/\n└── Mocks/\n    └── HTTPClientMock.swift\n```\n\n---\n\n## Shared Directory\n\nThe `Shared/` directory contains app-specific modules (not reusable across apps).\n\n### Resources Module\n\n```\nShared/Resources/\n├── Sources/\n│   ├── Extensions/\n│   │   ├── Bundle+Module.swift       # Manual Bundle.module accessor\n│   │   └── String+Localized.swift    # localized() extension\n│   └── Resources/\n│       └── Localizable.xcstrings\n└── Tests/\n```\n\nThe Resources module provides:\n- **Localization**: Centralized `Localizable.xcstrings` and `String.localized()` extension\n- **Bundle.module**: Manual accessor (Tuist generation disabled)\n\n**Note:** Modules needing `Bundle.module` must include their own `Bundle+Module.swift`.\n\n---\n\n## Derived Directory\n\nTuist generates files in `Derived/` (gitignored):\n\n```\nDerived/\n└── InfoPlists/\n    ├── {AppName}-Info.plist\n    ├── {AppName}Core-Info.plist\n    ├── {AppName}Resources-Info.plist\n    ├── {AppName}{Feature}-Info.plist\n    └── ...\n```\n\n**Contents:** Only `Info.plist` files for each target.\n\n**No generated Swift code:** `disableBundleAccessors` and `disableSynthesizedResourceAccessors` are enabled in `Project.swift`.\n\n---\n\n## App and AppKit Directories\n\nThe app code is split into two modules:\n- **App**: Minimal entry point with UI tests only\n- **AppKit**: Testable app code (unit and snapshot tests run here without TEST_HOST)\n\n```\nApp/\n├── Sources/\n│   ├── {AppName}App.swift        # Minimal entry point (imports AppKit)\n│   └── Resources/\n│       └── Assets.xcassets/\n│           ├── AppIcon.appiconset/        # Production icon\n│           ├── AppIconDev.appiconset/     # Development icon\n│           └── AppIconStaging.appiconset/ # Staging icon\n└── Tests/\n    ├── Shared/\n    │   ├── Robots/               # Robot pattern for UI interactions\n    │   ├── Scenarios/            # Reusable SwiftMockServer configurations\n    │   ├── Stubs/                # Test data helpers\n    │   ├── Fixtures/             # JSON fixtures\n    │   └── Resources/            # Test images\n    └── UI/                       # UI tests only (XCTest)\n\nAppKit/\n├── Sources/\n│   ├── AppContainer.swift        # Composition Root (centralized DI)\n│   ├── Data/\n│   │   └── AppEnvironment+API.swift  # API configuration extension\n│   └── Presentation/\n│       ├── Navigation/\n│       │   └── AppNavigationRedirect.swift\n│       └── Views/\n│           └── RootContainerView.swift    # Root view with navigation\n└── Tests/\n    ├── Unit/                     # Unit tests (Swift Testing)\n    │   ├── Data/\n    │   │   └── AppEnvironment+APITests.swift\n    │   └── Presentation/\n    │       └── Navigation/\n    │           ├── AppContainerNavigationTests.swift\n    │           └── AppNavigationRedirectTests.swift\n    ├── Snapshots/                # Snapshot tests\n    │   └── Presentation/\n    └── Shared/                   # Shared resources\n        └── Stubs/\n```\n\n**Why AppKit?** Unit and snapshot tests for app-level code can run without launching the app (no TEST_HOST required).\n\n---\n\n## File Naming Summary\n\n| Component | Naming Pattern | Example |\n|-----------|----------------|---------|\n| Feature folder | `{Name}/` | `Character/` |\n| Public entry | `{Feature}Feature.swift` | `CharacterFeature.swift` |\n| Container | `{Feature}Container.swift` | `CharacterContainer.swift` |\n| Navigation | `Presentation/Navigation/{Feature}IncomingNavigation.swift` | `Presentation/Navigation/CharacterIncomingNavigation.swift` |\n| Domain model | `{Name}.swift` | `Character.swift` |\n| DTO | `{Name}DTO.swift` | `CharacterDTO.swift` |\n| UseCase | `{Action}{Name}UseCase.swift` | `GetCharacterUseCase.swift` |\n| Repository | `{Name}Repository.swift` | `CharacterRepository.swift` |\n| Mapper | `{Name}Mapper.swift` | `CharacterMapper.swift` |\n| Contract | `{Name}Contract.swift` | `CharacterRepositoryContract.swift` |\n| DataSource Contract | `{Name}{Type}DataSourceContract.swift` | `CharacterRemoteDataSourceContract.swift` |\n| DataSource Implementation | `{Name}{Impl}DataSource.swift` | `CharacterRESTDataSource.swift`, `CharacterMemoryDataSource.swift` |\n| Navigator | `{ScreenName}Navigator.swift` | `CharacterDetailNavigator.swift` |\n| NavigatorContract | `{ScreenName}NavigatorContract.swift` | `CharacterDetailNavigatorContract.swift` |\n| Tracker | `{ScreenName}Tracker.swift` | `CharacterDetailTracker.swift` |\n| TrackerContract | `{ScreenName}TrackerContract.swift` | `CharacterDetailTrackerContract.swift` |\n| Event | `{ScreenName}Event.swift` | `CharacterDetailEvent.swift` |\n| View | `{ScreenName}View.swift` | `CharacterDetailView.swift` |\n| ViewModel | `{ScreenName}ViewModel.swift` | `CharacterDetailViewModel.swift` |\n| ViewState | `{ScreenName}ViewState.swift` | `CharacterDetailViewState.swift` |\n| Test | `{Component}Tests.swift` | `CharacterRepositoryTests.swift` |\n| Feature Test | `{Feature}FeatureTests.swift` | `CharacterFeatureTests.swift` |\n| Stub | `{Name}+Stub.swift` | `Character+Stub.swift` |\n| Mock | `{Name}Mock.swift` | `CharacterRepositoryMock.swift` |\n| Extension | `{Type}+{Purpose}.swift` | `URL+QueryItems.swift` |\n| Bundle accessor | `Bundle+Module.swift` | `Bundle+Module.swift` |\n| JSON fixture | `{name}.json` | `character.json` |\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] App contains only `{AppName}App.swift` and UI tests (with Robots, Scenarios, Stubs, Fixtures)\n- [ ] AppKit contains testable code: `AppContainer.swift`, `RootContainerView.swift`, `AppNavigationRedirect.swift`\n- [ ] Feature folder does not contain \"Feature\" suffix\n- [ ] {Feature}Container.swift for dependency composition\n- [ ] {Feature}Feature.swift as public entry point with `makeMainView()` and `resolve()`\n- [ ] Sources organized by layer: Domain, Data, Presentation\n- [ ] Navigation folder inside `Presentation/Navigation/`\n- [ ] Presentation organized by screen: {ScreenName}/Navigator/, {ScreenName}/Tracker/, {ScreenName}/Views/, {ScreenName}/ViewModels/\n- [ ] Unit tests in `Tests/Unit/` mirroring Sources structure\n- [ ] Snapshot tests in `Tests/Snapshots/`\n- [ ] Feature tests in `Tests/Unit/Feature/`\n- [ ] Extensions in dedicated `Extensions/` folder\n- [ ] Extension files named `{Type}+{Purpose}.swift`\n- [ ] Public mocks in `Mocks/`, internal mocks in `Tests/Shared/Mocks/`\n- [ ] Stubs in `Tests/Shared/Stubs/`\n- [ ] JSON fixtures in `Tests/Shared/Fixtures/`\n- [ ] Test resources in `Tests/Shared/Resources/`\n- [ ] If module needs `Bundle.module`, include `Bundle+Module.swift`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:23:34.192Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing standardized project organization and directory structure capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化项目组织和目录结构功能的代码分析智能体。","ja":"標準化されたプロジェクト構成とディレクトリ構造機能を必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 프로젝트 구성 및 디렉터리 구조 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan una organización y estructura de directorios de proyecto estandarizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une organisation et une structure de répertoire de projet standardisées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine standardisierte Projektorganisation und Verzeichnisstruktur benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de organização de projeto padronizada e capacidades de estrutura de diretório.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходима стандартизированная организация проекта и возможности структуры каталогов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى تنظيم مشروع معياري وقدرات هيكل الدليل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate and maintain complex codebases using modular directory structures, including Sources and Resources organization, and understand AppKit imports for minimal entry points.","zh":"使智能体能够使用模块化目录结构（包括Sources和Resources组织）导航和维护复杂的代码库，并理解AppKit导入以实现最小入口点。","ja":"SourcesとResourcesの編成を含むモジュール式ディレクトリ構造を使用して複雑なコードベースをナビゲートおよび維持し、最小限のエントリポイントのためにAppKitのインポートを理解する能力をエージェントに付与します。","ko":"모듈식 디렉터리 구조(소스 및 리소스 구성 포함)를 사용하여 복잡한 코드베이스를 탐색 및 유지하고 최소 진입점을 위한 AppKit 가져오기를 이해할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar y mantener códigos complejos utilizando estructuras de directorios modulares, incluyendo la organización de Fuentes y Recursos, y a entender las importaciones de AppKit para puntos de entrada mínimos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer et de maintenir des bases de code complexes en utilisant des structures de répertoire modulaires, y compris l''organisation des Sources et des Ressources, et de comprendre les imports AppKit pour des points d''entrée minimaux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Codebases mithilfe modularen Verzeichnisstrukturen zu navigieren und zu warten, einschließlich der Organisation von Quellen und Ressourcen, und das Verständnis von AppKit-Importen für minimale Einstiegspunkte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar e manter bases de código complexas usando estruturas de diretório modulares, incluindo organização de Fontes e Recursos, e entender imports do AppKit para pontos de entrada mínimos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ориентироваться и поддерживать сложные кодовые базы с помощью модульных структур каталогов, включая организацию источников и ресурсов, а также понимание импортов AppKit для минимальных точек входа.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التنقل في قواعد الشفرة المعقدة والحفاظ عليها باستخدام هياكل دليلية معيارية، بما في ذلك تنظيم المصادر والموارد، وفهم استيرادات AppKit لنقاط الدخول الصغرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing files for new feature modules","Creating modular directory structures for existing projects","Understanding codebase layouts for efficient navigation"],"zh":["为新功能模块组织文件","为现有项目创建模块化目录结构","理解代码库布局以实现高效导航"],"ja":["新機能モジュールのファイル編成","既存プロジェクトのためのモジュール式ディレクトリ構造の作成","効率的なナビゲーションのためのコードベースレイアウトの理解"],"ko":["새 기능 모듈을 위한 파일 구성","기존 프로젝트를 위한 모듈식 디렉터리 구조 생성","효율적인 탐색을 위한 코드베이스 레이아웃 이해"],"es":["Organizar archivos para módulos de nuevas características","Crear estructuras de directorios modulares para proyectos existentes","Comprender diseños de codebase para una navegación eficiente"],"fr":["Organiser les fichiers pour les modules de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Créer des structures de répertoire modulaires pour les projets existants","Comprendre les conceptions de codebase pour une navigation efficace"],"de":["Dateien für neue Feature-Module organisieren","Modulare Verzeichnisstrukturen für bestehende Projekte erstellen","Codebase-Layouts für eine effiziente Navigation verstehen"],"pt":["Organizar arquivos para módulos de recursos novos","Criar estruturas de diretório modulares para projetos existentes","Entender layouts de codebase para navegação eficiente"],"ru":["Организация файлов для новых модулей функций","Создание модульных структур каталогов для существующих проектов","Понимание макетов кодовой базы для эффективной навигации"],"ar":["تنظيم الملفات لأقسام الميزات الجديدة","إنشاء هياكل دليلية معيارية للمشاريع الحالية","فهم تخطيطات قاعدة الشفرة من أجل التنقل الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of AppKit and Swift","Specific to AppName directory structure"],"zh":["需要具备AppKit和Swift的知识","特定于AppName目录结构"],"ja":["AppKitとSwiftの知識が必要","AppNameディレクトリ構造に固有"],"ko":["AppKit 및 Swift에 대한 지식 필요","AppName 디렉터리 구조에 특화됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de AppKit y Swift","Específico para la estructura de directorios de AppName"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en AppKit et Swift","Spécifique à la structure de répertoire d''AppName"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von AppKit und Swift","Spezifisch für die Verzeichnisstruktur von AppName"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de AppKit e Swift","Específico para estrutura de diretório do AppName"],"ru":["Требует знания AppKit и Swift","Специфичен для структуры каталогов AppName"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة AppKit و Swift","محدد لهيكل دليل AppName"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
