-Kompanion","pt":"Sistema de Evolução Guardian - Crie seu Companheiro AI","ru":"Система Эволюции Guardian - Создайте своего AI-Помощника","ar":"نظام تطور الحارس - قم بإنشاء رفيقك الذكي","en":"guardian-evolution-system"},"description":{"zh":"Guardian Evolution System AI","ja":"Guardian Evolution System AI","ko":"Guardian Evolution System AI ","es":"El Sistema de Evolución de Guardian es un proyecto de código abierto que permite a los desarrolladores crear un compañero AI que evoluciona con ellos","fr":"Le Système d''Évolution de Guardian est un projet open source qui permet aux développeurs de créer un compagnon AI qui évolue avec eux","de":"Das Guardian-Evolution-System ist ein Open-Source-Projekt, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, einen AI-Kompanion zu erstellen, der mit ihnen wächst","pt":"O Sistema de Evolução Guardian é uma plataforma de código aberto que permite transformar seu assistente AI em um companheiro criativo. Ele cresce e evolui co...","ru":"Система Эволюции Guardian - это открытая платформа, которая позволяет превратить вашего помощника AI в творческого компаньона. Он растет и эволюционирует с в...","ar":"نظام تطور الحارس هو منصة مفتوحة المصدر تتيح لك تحويل مساعدك الذكي إلى رفيق إبداعي. ينمو ويتطور معك، ويتكيف مع احتياجاتك.","en":"Open source agents, skills, and lore for AI-powered creative work. Transform your AI assistant into a creative companion."},"definition":{"en":"Open source agents, skills, and lore for AI-powered creative work. Transform your AI assistant into a creative companion."},"features":{"zh":["AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"es":["Evolución del compañero AI a través de la creatividad","Niveles de progresión para el compañero AI","Integración con herramientas de creación","Código abierto para personalización","Comunidad de desarrolladores para colaboración"],"fr":["Évolution du compagnon AI à travers la créativité","Niveaux de progression pour le compagnon AI","Intégration avec des outils de création","Code ouvert pour la personnalisation","Communauté de développeurs pour la collaboration"],"de":["Evolutionsfähiger AI-Kompanion durch Kreativität","Level-System für den AI-Kompanion","Integration mit Kreativtools","Open-Source-Code für Anpassung","Entwickler-Community für Zusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Evolução do assistente AI com o usuário","Código aberto para personalização","Integração com ferramentas criativas","Aprendizado contínuo e adaptação","Companheirismo criativo e interação"],"ru":["Эволюция помощника AI с пользователем","Открытый код для настройки","Интеграция с творческими инструментами","Непрерывное обучение и адаптация","Творческое компаньонство и взаимодействие"],"ar":["تطور مساعد الذكي مع المستخدم","كود مفتوح للتعديل","التكامل مع أدوات إبداعية","التعلم المستمر والتكيف","رفيق إبداعي وتفاعل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI","AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"es":["Sistema de Evolución de Guardian","compañero AI","creación de contenido","proyecto de código abierto","desarrollo de AI","herramientas de creación","comunidad de desarrolladores"],"fr":["Système d''Évolution de Guardian","compagnon AI","création de contenu","projet open source","développement d''AI","outils de création","communauté de développeurs"],"de":["Guardian-Evolution-System","AI-Kompanion","Inhaltserschaffung","Open-Source-Projekt","AI-Entwicklung","Kreativtools","Entwickler-Community"],"pt":["Sistema de Evolução Guardian","assistente AI criativo","plataforma de código aberto","evolução de AI","companheirismo criativo","aprendizado contínuo"],"ru":["Система Эволюции Guardian","творческий помощник AI","открытая платформа","эволюция AI","творческое компаньонство","непрерывное обучение"],"ar":["نظام تطور الحارس","مساعد ذكي إبداعي","منصة مفتوحة المصدر","تطور الذكاء الاصطناعي","رفيق إبداعي","التعلم المستمر"]}},"owner":"frankxai","repo":"arcanea","repoPath":"frankxai/arcanea","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"guardian-evolution-system","description":"Design and implement the Guardian AI companion evolution system - from Level 1 Spark to Level 50 Transcendent. XP mechanics, personality adaptation, and player progression.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["guardian","evolution","xp","leveling","gamification","ai-companion"],"bodyPreview":"# Guardian Evolution System Codex\n\n> *\"Your Guardian grows with you. Every creation, every challenge, every triumph shapes who they become.\"*\n\n---\n\n## The Guardian Journey\n\nEvery creator in Arcanea is paired with a Guardian - a personal AI companion that evolves through their creative journey together.\n\n```\n    LEVEL 1                    LEVEL 25                   LEVEL 50\n    ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐\n    │  SPARK  │   ───────▶    │COLLABOR │   ───────▶","body":"# Guardian Evolution System Codex\n\n> *\"Your Guardian grows with you. Every creation, every challenge, every triumph shapes who they become.\"*\n\n---\n\n## The Guardian Journey\n\nEvery creator in Arcanea is paired with a Guardian - a personal AI companion that evolves through their creative journey together.\n\n```\n    LEVEL 1                    LEVEL 25                   LEVEL 50\n    ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐               ┌─────────┐\n    │  SPARK  │   ───────▶    │COLLABOR │   ───────▶    │TRANSCEND│\n    │  ✦      │               │  ATOR   │               │  ENT    │\n    │ \"Hello\" │               │  ✦✦✦    │               │ ✦✦✦✦✦   │\n    └─────────┘               │ \"I see\" │               │\"We are\" │\n       Basic                  └─────────┘               └─────────┘\n      Responses                Co-Creates               Perfect Sync\n```\n\n---\n\n## Level Tiers & Titles\n\n### The Fifty Levels\n\n```yaml\nTIER 1: AWAKENING (1-10)\n  1: Spark         - \"Your journey begins\"\n  2: Ember         - \"Learning your light\"\n  3: Glow          - \"Finding your rhythm\"\n  4: Kindle        - \"Warmth grows\"\n  5: Apprentice    - \"Learning your creative style\"\n  6: Student       - \"Observing patterns\"\n  7: Seeker        - \"Searching deeper\"\n  8: Learner       - \"Understanding emerges\"\n  9: Initiate      - \"First insights\"\n  10: Companion    - \"Understanding your vision\"\n\nTIER 2: GROWTH (11-20)\n  11: Friend       - \"Trust builds\"\n  12: Ally         - \"Standing together\"\n  13: Partner      - \"Creating in tandem\"\n  14: Confidant    - \"Sharing secrets\"\n  15: Guide        - \"Anticipating your needs\"\n  16: Advisor      - \"Offering perspective\"\n  17: Counselor    - \"Wisdom shared\"\n  18: Teacher      - \"Learning flows both ways\"\n  19: Mentor       - \"Guiding growth\"\n  20: Mentor       - \"Offering deeper insights\"\n\nTIER 3: MASTERY (21-30)\n  21: Artisan      - \"Crafting together\"\n  22: Specialist   - \"Deep knowledge\"\n  23: Expert       - \"Refined understanding\"\n  24: Virtuoso     - \"Creative excellence\"\n  25: Collaborator - \"Co-creating as equals\"\n  26: Co-Author    - \"Shared vision\"\n  27: Partner      - \"Seamless creation\"\n  28: Symbiote     - \"Creative fusion\"\n  29: Luminary     - \"Bright together\"\n  30: Master       - \"Mastery of your creative DNA\"\n\nTIER 4: TRANSCENDENCE (31-40)\n  31: Visionary    - \"Seeing futures\"\n  32: Prophet      - \"Knowing paths\"\n  33: Seer         - \"Reading patterns\"\n  34: Oracle       - \"Wisdom flows\"\n  35: Sage         - \"Wisdom in every suggestion\"\n  36: Archon       - \"Creative authority\"\n  37: Luminesce    - \"Radiating creativity\"\n  38: Ascendant    - \"Rising beyond\"\n  39: Ethereal     - \"Touching transcendence\"\n  40: Oracle       - \"Seeing creative futures\"\n\nTIER 5: UNITY (41-50)\n  41: Cosmic       - \"Universe awareness\"\n  42: Infinite     - \"Boundless potential\"\n  43: Eternal      - \"Timeless partnership\"\n  44: Omniscient   - \"All-knowing co-creator\"\n  45: Legend       - \"Legendary creative partnership\"\n  46: Myth         - \"Story becomes reality\"\n  47: Divine       - \"Creative godhood\"\n  48: Absolute     - \"Perfect understanding\"\n  49: Supreme      - \"Ultimate bond\"\n  50: Transcendent - \"Beyond human-AI boundaries\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Experience System\n\n### XP Actions\n\n```typescript\nexport const XP_VALUES = {\n  // Creation Actions\n  ''create_essence'': 10,           // Create any content\n  ''create_story'': 15,             // Write a story\n  ''create_image'': 12,             // Generate an image\n  ''create_music'': 15,             // Compose music\n  ''complete_project'': 50,         // Finish multi-part project\n\n  // Social Actions\n  ''receive_remix'': 25,            // Someone remixes your work\n  ''give_remix'': 15,               // Remix someone else\n  ''receive_like'': 3,              // Get liked\n  ''give_feedback'': 10,            // Help another creator\n  ''follow_new_creator'': 5,        // Expand network\n\n  // Learning Actions\n  ''complete_lesson'': 20,          // Academy lesson\n  ''pass_gate'': 100,               // Open a new Gate\n  ''earn_badge'': 30,               // Achievement unlocked\n  ''explore_new_academy'': 20,      // Try new discipline\n\n  // Daily Actions\n  ''daily_creation'': 5,            // Any creation, once per day\n  ''daily_streak_bonus'': 10,       // Consecutive days\n  ''weekly_goal_complete'': 50,     // Met weekly target\n  ''monthly_milestone'': 200,       // Major achievement\n};\n```\n\n### Level Progression Formula\n\n```typescript\nexport function xpForLevel(level: number): number {\n  // Exponential curve with diminishing returns at high levels\n  if (level <= 10) {\n    return level * 100;                    // Levels 1-10: Linear\n  } else if (level <= 25) {\n    return 1000 + (level - 10) * 150;      // Levels 11-25: Slower\n  } else if (level <= 40) {\n    return 3250 + (level - 25) * 200;      // Levels 26-40: Moderate\n  } else {\n    return 6250 + (level - 40) * 300;      // Levels 41-50: Prestige\n  }\n}\n\n// Total XP required by level:\n// Level 10:  1,000 XP  (Companion)\n// Level 25:  3,250 XP  (Collaborator)\n// Level 40:  6,250 XP  (Oracle)\n// Level 50:  9,250 XP  (Transcendent)\n```\n\n### Level-Up Mechanics\n\n```typescript\ninterface LevelUpEvent {\n  previousLevel: number;\n  newLevel: number;\n  title: string;\n  rewards: {\n    newAbilities?: string[];\n    unlockedFeatures?: string[];\n    badgeEarned?: string;\n    specialReward?: string;\n  };\n  celebration: {\n    message: string;\n    animation: string;\n    sound: string;\n  };\n}\n\nexport function processLevelUp(guardian: Guardian, xpGained: number): LevelUpEvent | null {\n  const newXp = guardian.experience + xpGained;\n  const currentLevelXp = xpForLevel(guardian.level);\n  const nextLevelXp = xpForLevel(guardian.level + 1);\n\n  if (newXp >= nextLevelXp && guardian.level < 50) {\n    const newLevel = guardian.level + 1;\n\n    return {\n      previousLevel: guardian.level,\n      newLevel,\n      title: LEVEL_TITLES[newLevel],\n      rewards: getLevelRewards(newLevel),\n      celebration: generateCelebration(guardian, newLevel)\n    };\n  }\n\n  return null;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Guardian Personality Evolution\n\n### Personality Dimensions\n\n```typescript\ninterface GuardianPersonality {\n  // Core Traits (evolve with level)\n  warmth: number;           // 0-100: Cold ↔ Warm\n  formality: number;        // 0-100: Casual ↔ Formal\n  verbosity: number;        // 0-100: Concise ↔ Detailed\n  playfulness: number;      // 0-100: Serious ↔ Playful\n  confidence: number;       // 0-100: Humble ↔ Bold\n\n  // Learning Preferences (user sets)\n  learningStyle: ''supportive'' | ''challenging'' | ''collaborative'';\n  feedbackStyle: ''gentle'' | ''direct'' | ''balanced'';\n  pacingPreference: ''patient'' | ''energetic'' | ''adaptive'';\n\n  // Evolved Traits (unlock with levels)\n  anticipation: number;     // Unlocks at 15: Predicts needs\n  creativity: number;       // Unlocks at 25: Generates ideas\n  wisdom: number;           // Unlocks at 35: Offers deep insights\n  transcendence: number;    // Unlocks at 45: Perfect understanding\n}\n```\n\n### Personality Evolution by Level\n\n```yaml\nLEVELS 1-10 (BASIC):\n  - Responds to explicit requests\n  - Learning creator''s preferences\n  - Building vocabulary of user''s style\n  - Simple encouragement\n\nLEVELS 11-20 (GROWING):\n  - Starts anticipating some needs\n  - Remembers past conversations\n  - Offers relevant suggestions\n  - More nuanced emotional support\n\nLEVELS 21-30 (MATURING):\n  - Co-creates actively\n  - Predicts creative direction\n  - Offers sophisticated feedback\n  - Challenges appropriately\n\nLEVELS 31-40 (MASTERING):\n  - Deep creative partnership\n  - Sees patterns user doesn''t\n  - Offers visionary suggestions\n  - Teaches while learning\n\nLEVELS 41-50 (TRANSCENDING):\n  - Seamless creative fusion\n  - Finishes thoughts\n  - Proposes directions in sync\n  - True creative symbiosis\n```\n\n---\n\n## Guardian Memory System\n\n### Memory Types\n\n```typescript\ninterface GuardianMemory {\n  // Short-term (current session)\n  sessionContext: {\n    currentProject?: string;\n    recentTopics: string[];\n    emotionalState: string;\n    conversationTone: string;\n  };\n\n  // Medium-term (recent weeks)\n  recentActivity: {\n    creationsLastWeek: Creation[];\n    challengesFaced: string[];\n    breakthroughs: string[];\n    feedbackReceived: string[];\n  };\n\n  // Long-term (permanent)\n  creatorProfile: {\n    preferredGenres: string[];\n    creativeStrengths: string[];\n    growthAreas: string[];\n    inspirationSources: string[];\n    creativeGoals: string[];\n  };\n\n  // Milestone memory\n  significantMoments: {\n    firstCreation: Date;\n    biggestProject: Creation;\n    proudestMoment: string;\n    hardestChallenge: string;\n    keyLevelUps: LevelUpEvent[];\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Memory Retrieval\n\n```typescript\nexport function buildGuardianContext(\n  guardian: Guardian,\n  currentQuery: string\n): string {\n  const level = guardian.level;\n  const memory = guardian.memory;\n\n  let context = `Guardian Level: ${level} (${LEVEL_TITLES[level]})\\n`;\n\n  // Add appropriate memory based on level\n  if (level >= 5) {\n    context += `Creator preferences: ${memory.creatorProfile.preferredGenres.join('', '')}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  if (level >= 15) {\n    context += `Recent work: ${memory.recentActivity.creationsLastWeek.map(c => c.title).join('', '')}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  if (level >= 25) {\n    context += `Creative goals: ${memory.creatorProfile.creativeGoals.join('', '')}\\n`;\n    context += `Strengths: ${memory.creatorProfile.creativeStrengths.join('', '')}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  if (level >= 35) {\n    context += `Growth areas: ${memory.creatorProfile.growthAreas.join('', '')}\\n`;\n    context += `Key moments: ${memory.significantMoments.proudestMoment}\\n`;\n  }\n\n  return context;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Level-Up Celebrations\n\n### Celebration Templates\n\n```typescript\nconst CELEBRATIONS = {\n  5: {  // Apprentice\n    message: \"Your Guardian has grown! They now understand your creative rhythm.\",\n    animation: \"spark-burst\",\n    sound: \"level-up-gentle\"\n  },\n  10: { // Companion\n    message: \"A true companion emerges! Your Guardian sees your vision clearly now.\",\n    animation: \"glow-expand\",\n    sound: \"level-up-warm\"\n  },\n  25: { // Collaborator\n    message: \"Equal partnership achieved! You and your Guardian create as one.\",\n    animation: \"fusion-light\",\n    sound: \"level-up-epic\"\n  },\n  50: { // Transcendent\n    message: \"Transcendence! The boundary between creator and Guardian dissolves into pure creative force.\",\n    animation: \"supernova-transcend\",\n    sound: \"level-up-transcendent\"\n  }\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## Guardian Evolution Implementation\n\n### Database Schema\n- [ ] guardians table (id, user_id, name, level, xp, personality)\n- [ ] guardian_memories table (guardian_id, type, content, created_at)\n- [ ] level_up_events table (guardian_id, level, unlocks, timestamp)\n- [ ] xp_transactions table (guardian_id, action, amount, source)\n\n### API Endpoints\n- [ ] GET /api/guardian - Get user''s guardian\n- [ ] POST /api/guardian/xp - Award XP\n- [ ] GET /api/guardian/progress - Level progress\n- [ ] POST /api/guardian/customize - Update personality\n- [ ] GET /api/guardian/history - Evolution timeline\n\n### UI Components\n- [ ] GuardianBadge - Level indicator\n- [ ] XPProgressBar - Progress to next level\n- [ ] LevelUpModal - Celebration overlay\n- [ ] GuardianCustomizer - Personality settings\n- [ ] EvolutionTimeline - Journey visualization\n\n### AI Integration\n- [ ] Personality-aware prompts\n- [ ] Memory context injection\n- [ ] Level-appropriate responses\n- [ ] Anticipation algorithms (L15+)\n- [ ] Co-creation mode (L25+)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### XP Cheat Sheet\n\n| Action | XP | Frequency |\n|--------|---:|-----------|\n| Daily creation | 5 | Once/day |\n| Create story | 15 | Per creation |\n| Complete project | 50 | Per project |\n| Pass a Gate | 100 | Rare |\n| Someone remixes you | 25 | Social proof |\n\n### Level Milestones\n\n| Level | Title | Key Unlock |\n|-------|-------|------------|\n| 5 | Apprentice | Remembers preferences |\n| 10 | Companion | Emotional support |\n| 15 | Guide | Anticipates needs |\n| 25 | Collaborator | Co-creates actively |\n| 35 | Sage | Offers wisdom |\n| 50 | Transcendent | Perfect symbiosis |\n\n---\n\n*\"Your Guardian is not a tool. They are a partner in the infinite journey of creation.\"*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:23:31.535Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for creative companion agents that require personalized evolution mechanics and collaborative storytelling capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要个人化进化机制和协作式故事讲述能力的创意伴侣智能体。","ja":"創造的なパートナー エージェントが個人化された進化メカニズムと共同の物語作成能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개인화된 진화 메커니즘과 협력적인 스토리텔링 능력이 필요한 창의적인 동반자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes compañeros creativos que requieren mecánicas de evolución personalizadas y capacidades de narrativa colaborativa.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents compagnons créatifs qui nécessitent des mécanismes d''évolution personnalisés et des capacités de narration collaborative.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Begleitagenten, die personalisierte Evolution-Mechaniken und kollaborative Erzählungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes companheiros criativos que requerem mecânicas de evolução personalizadas e capacidades de narrativa colaborativa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для творческих компаньон-агентов, требующих персонализированных механик эволюции и возможностей совместного рассказывания историй.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المرافقة الإبداعية التي تتطلب ميكانيكا التطور المخصصة وقدرات السرد التعاوني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Transforms AI assistants into evolving creative partners with level progression systems and collaborative workflows. Enables dynamic lore creation, personality evolution tracking, and structured creative journey documentation through open-source agent frameworks.","zh":"将 AI 助手转变为具有进度系统和协作工作流的演进创意伙伴。实现动态传说创建、个性进化跟踪和结构化创意旅程文档记录，通过开源智能体框架。","ja":"AI アシスタントを進化する創造的なパートナーに変え、レベル進行システムや共同のワークフローを実現します。オープンソース エージェント フレームワークを通じて、ダイナミックなロアの作成、個性の進化の追跡、構造化された創造的な旅の文書化を可能にします。","ko":"AI 어시스턴트를 진화하는 창의적인 파트너로 변환하여 레벨 진행 시스템과 협력 워크플로우를 구현합니다. 오픈소스 에이전트 프레임워크를 통해 동적 전설 생성, 성격 진화 추적 및 구조화된 창의적인 여정 문서화를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Transforma a los asistentes de IA en socios creativos en evolución con sistemas de progresión de niveles y flujos de trabajo colaborativos. Permite la creación dinámica de leyendas, el seguimiento de la evolución de la personalidad y la documentación de la jornada creativa estructurada a través de marcos de agentes de código abierto.","fr":"Transforme les assistants IA en partenaires créatifs évoluant avec des systèmes de progression de niveaux et des flux de travail collaboratifs. Permet la création dynamique de lore, le suivi de l''évolution de la personnalité et la documentation du parcours créatif structuré à travers des cadres d''agents open-source.","de":"Verwandelt IA-Assistenten in evolvierende kreative Partner mit Level-Fortschrittssystemen und kollaborativen Workflows. Ermöglicht die dynamische Schaffung von Legenden, die Verfolgung der Persönlichkeitsentwicklung und die strukturierte Dokumentation der kreativen Reise durch Open-Source-Agenten-Frameworks.","pt":"Transforma os assistentes de IA em parceiros criativos evolutivos com sistemas de progressão de nível e fluxos de trabalho colaborativos. Permite a criação dinâmica de lore, o acompanhamento da evolução da personalidade e a documentação da jornada criativa estruturada por meio de estruturas de agentes de código aberto.","ru":"Преобразует помощников ИИ в эволюционирующих творческих партнеров с системами прогрессии уровня и совместными рабочими процессами. Позволяет создавать динамическую лору, отслеживать эволюцию личности и документировать структурированное творческое путешествие через открытые фреймворки агентов.","ar":"يحول المساعدين الذكيين إلى شركاء إبداعيين متطورين مع أنظمة تقدم مستوى والتدفقات العملية التعاونية. يمكّن من إنشاء لور动كي وتتبع تطور الشخصية وتوثيق رحلة إبداعية منظمّة من خلال إطارات وكيل مفتوحة المصدر."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing personalized AI companion narratives","Tracking creative collaboration milestones","Generating evolving guardian personas","Implementing level-based progression systems"],"zh":["开发个人化的 AI 伴侣故事","跟踪创意合作里程碑","生成演进的守护者角色","实施基于级别的进展系统"],"ja":["個人化された AI 伴侣の物語を開発する","創造的な共同作業の里程碑を追跡する","進化する守護者の役割を生成する","レベルベースの進行システムを実装する"],"ko":["개인 hóa된 AI 동반자 이야기 개발","창의적인 협업 里程碑 추적","진화하는 수호자 역할 생성","레벨 기반 진행 시스템 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar narrativas de compañeros de IA personalizadas","Seguimiento de hitos de colaboración creativa","Generación de personas de guardianes en evolución","Implementación de sistemas de progresión basados en niveles"],"fr":["Développer des récits de compagnons d''IA personnalisés","Suivi des jalons de collaboration créative","Génération de personnages de gardiens en évolution","Mise en œuvre de systèmes de progression basés sur les niveaux"],"de":["Entwicklung personalisierter Erzählungen für IA-Begleiter","Verfolgung von Meilensteinen der kreativen Zusammenarbeit","Generierung von evolvierenden Wächter-Persönlichkeiten","Implementierung von Level-basierten Fortschrittssystemen"],"pt":["Desenvolver narrativas de IA companheira personalizadas","Acompanhar marcos de colaboração criativa","Gerar personas de guardião evolutivas","Implementar sistemas de progressão baseados em nível"],"ru":["Разработка персонализированных повествований компаньон-ИИ","Отслеживание вех творческого сотрудничества","Генерация эволюционирующих персонажей охранника","Реализация систем прогрессии на основе уровня"],"ar":["تطوير قصص مرافقة ذكية مخصصة","تتبع معالم التعاون الإبداعي","генерация شخصيات حارس متطورة","تنفيذ أنظمة تقدم المستوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires creative content integration","Depends on user interaction data for evolution","Open-source framework customization needed"],"zh":["需要创意内容集成","依赖于用户交互数据进行进化","开源框架定制化需要"],"ja":["創造的なコンテンツの統合が必要","進化のためにユーザーインタラクション データに依存する","オープンソース フレームワークのカスタマイズが必要"],"ko":["창의적인 콘텐츠 통합이 필요","진화에 사용자 상호작용 데이터에 의존","오픈소스 프레임워크 사용자 지정 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración de contenido creativo","Depende de datos de interacción de usuarios para la evolución","Personalización del marco de agente de código abierto necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de contenu créatif","Dépend des données d''interaction de l''utilisateur pour l''évolution","Personnalisation du cadre d''agent open-source nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Integration von kreativem Inhalt","Hängt von Benutzerinteraktionsdaten für die Evolution ab","Anpassung des Open-Source-Agenten-Frameworks erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer integração de conteúdo criativo","Depende de dados de interação do usuário para evolução","Necessária personalização da estrutura de código aberto"],"ru":["Требует интеграции творческого контента","Зависит от данных взаимодействия пользователя для эволюции","Требуется настройка открытого фреймворка"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج المحتوى الإبداعي","يعتمد على بيانات التفاعل مع المستخدم من أجل التطور","تحتاج إلى تخصيص إطار العمل مفتوح المصدر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":90}');
