スの問題を検出するプロジェクト専用のマッチングアプリです","ko":"MeshIt 아키텍처 리뷰는 코드베이스의 문제를檢出하는 프로젝트専用의 매칭 애플리케이션입니다","es":"La revisión de arquitectura es una herramienta de codebase health check para MeshIt que detecta problemas de código y mejora la calidad del software.","fr":"La révision d''architecture est un outil de vérification de la santé du codebase pour MeshIt qui détecte les problèmes de code et améliore la qualité du logic...","de":"Die Architektur-Überprüfung ist ein Codebase-Health-Check-Tool für MeshIt, das Codeprobleme erkennt und die Softwarequalität verbessert.","pt":"A revisão de arquitetura é uma ferramenta para melhorar a saúde do código, detectando problemas como código duplicado e anti-padrões.","ru":"Обзор архитектуры - это инструмент для улучшения здоровья кодовой базы, обнаруживающий проблемы, такие как дубликаты кода и анти-шаблоны.","ar":"استعراض الهيكل هو أداة لتحسين صحة الشفرة، حيث يمكن كشف المشاكل مثل الشفرة المكررة و المعايير السلبية.","en":"Project-focused matching app"},"definition":{"en":"Project-focused matching app"},"features":{"zh":["检测重复代码","识别反模式","分析复杂性","检查不一致性","支持 Next.js + Supabase + SWR 栈"],"ja":["重複コードの検出","アンチパターンの識別","複雑さの分析","不一致性のチェック","Next.js + Supabase + SWR スタックのサポート"],"ko":["중복 코드 검출","반 패턴 식별","복잡성 분석","불일치 점검","Next.js + Supabase + SWR 스택 지원"],"es":["Detección de código duplicado","Análisis de anti-patrones","Medición de complejidad","Detección de inconsistencias","Compatibilidad con Next.js, Supabase y SWR"],"fr":["Détection de code dupliqué","Analyse d''anti-patrons","Mesure de complexité","Détection d''incohérences","Compatibilité avec Next.js, Supabase et SWR"],"de":["Erkennung von dupliziertem Code","Analyse von Anti-Mustern","Messung von Komplexität","Erkennung von Inkonsistenzen","Kompatibilität mit Next.js, Supabase und SWR"],"pt":["Detecção de código duplicado","Análise de anti-padrões","Verificação de complexidade","Análise de inconsistências","Suporte a Next.js, Supabase e SWR","Execução periódica"],"ru":["Обнаружение дубликатов кода","Анализ анти-шаблонов","Проверка сложности","Анализ несоответствий","Поддержка Next.js, Supabase и SWR","Периодический запуск"],"ar":["كشف الشفرة المكررة","تحليل المعايير السلبية","فحص التعقيد","تحليل الاختلافات","دعم Next.js و Supabase و SWR","التشغيل الدوري"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MeshIt","架构审查","代码库健康检查","重复代码检测","反模式识别","Next.js","Supabase","SWR"],"ja":["MeshIt","アーキテクチャレビュー","コードベースのヘルスチェック","重複コード検出","アンチパターン識別","Next.js","Supabase","SWR"],"ko":["MeshIt","아키텍처 리뷰","코드베이스 건강 점검","중복 코드 검출","반 패턴 식별","Next.js","Supabase","SWR"],"es":["revisión de arquitectura","codebase health check","Next.js","Supabase","SWR","detección de código duplicado","análisis de anti-patrones","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["révision d''architecture","vérification de la santé du codebase","Next.js","Supabase","SWR","détection de code dupliqué","analyse d''anti-patrons","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Architektur-Überprüfung","Codebase-Health-Check","Next.js","Supabase","SWR","Erkennung von dupliziertem Code","Analyse von Anti-Mustern","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de arquitetura","saúde do código","desenvolvimento de software","análise de código","detecção de erros","melhoria de desempenho","Next.js","Supabase","SWR"],"ru":["обзор архитектуры","здоровье кодовой базы","разработка программного обеспечения","анализ кода","обнаружение ошибок","улучшение производительности","Next.js","Supabase","SWR"],"ar":["استعراض الهيكل","صحة الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","تحليل الشفرة","كشف الأخطاء","تحسين الأداء","Next.js","Supabase","SWR"]}},"owner":"AJB-ajb","repo":"MeshIt","repoPath":"AJB-ajb/MeshIt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-review","description":"Scans MeshIt codebase for duplicated code, bad patterns, complexity hotspots, and inconsistencies. Run periodically or before major releases. Produces actionable findings with severity and file locations.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Review\n\nCodebase health check for MeshIt. Detects duplicated code, anti-patterns, complexity, and inconsistencies across the Next.js + Supabase + SWR stack.\n\n## When to Run\n\n- Before major releases or deploys\n- After merging parallel branches\n- When debugging unexplained bugs\n- Periodically (weekly/biweekly)\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Read this file for the checklist and categories\n2. For each category, scan the relevant files using the patterns described\n3. Check individual `rules/` file","body":"# Architecture Review\n\nCodebase health check for MeshIt. Detects duplicated code, anti-patterns, complexity, and inconsistencies across the Next.js + Supabase + SWR stack.\n\n## When to Run\n\n- Before major releases or deploys\n- After merging parallel branches\n- When debugging unexplained bugs\n- Periodically (weekly/biweekly)\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Read this file for the checklist and categories\n2. For each category, scan the relevant files using the patterns described\n3. Check individual `rules/` files for detailed detection guidance\n4. Report findings as: `AREA > FILE(S) > SEVERITY > RECOMMENDATION`\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### 1. Duplication (CRITICAL)\n\nScan for repeated code blocks that should be extracted to shared utilities.\n\n| Pattern                       | Where to check               | Rule                   |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| JSON body parsing boilerplate | `src/app/api/**/route.ts`    | `dup-json-parsing`     |\n| Provider identity checking    | hooks + API routes           | `dup-provider-check`   |\n| Record transformation logic   | API routes returning DB rows | `dup-record-transform` |\n\n### 2. Error Handling (HIGH)\n\n| Pattern                            | Where to check            | Rule                    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Fire-and-forget fetch calls        | hooks, components         | `err-fire-and-forget`   |\n| Silent `.catch(() => {})`          | entire `src/`             | `err-silent-catch`      |\n| Unhandled promise rejections       | components with `.then()` | `err-unhandled-promise` |\n| Inconsistent error response format | API routes                | `err-response-format`   |\n\n### 3. Supabase Client (HIGH)\n\n| Pattern                                    | Where to check                    | Rule                    |\n| ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Multiple client instances in one component | components with `createClient()`  | `supa-client-instances` |\n| Server/browser client confusion            | hooks importing from wrong module | `supa-client-boundary`  |\n| Missing null checks after type casting     | API routes with `as Record<>`     | `supa-unsafe-cast`      |\n\n### 4. SWR & Data Fetching (MEDIUM)\n\n| Pattern                                   | Where to check                        | Rule                     |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| Missing revalidation after mutations      | hooks with `.update()` or `.insert()` | `swr-missing-revalidate` |\n| N+1 query patterns                        | hooks fetching per-item in loops      | `swr-n-plus-one`         |\n| `select(\"*\")` instead of specific columns | API routes + hooks                    | `perf-select-star`       |\n\n### 5. Type Safety (MEDIUM)\n\n| Pattern                                   | Where to check                     | Rule                 |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| Generic `Json` type for structured data   | `src/lib/supabase/types.ts`, hooks | `type-generic-json`  |\n| Explicit `: any` usage                    | entire `src/`                      | `type-any`           |\n| Unsafe type assertions without validation | API routes, components             | `type-unsafe-assert` |\n\n### 6. Component Structure (MEDIUM)\n\n| Pattern                               | Where to check           | Rule                      |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------- |\n| Components over 300 lines             | `src/components/`        | `comp-too-large`          |\n| Missing error boundaries              | route layouts, dashboard | `comp-error-boundary`     |\n| Mixed fetch patterns (hook vs direct) | components               | `comp-inconsistent-fetch` |\n\n## Severity Guide\n\n- **CRITICAL**: Causes bugs, data loss, or security issues. Fix immediately.\n- **HIGH**: Creates maintenance burden or silent failures. Fix this sprint.\n- **MEDIUM**: Inconsistency or code smell. Fix when touching the file.\n- **LOW**: Style/preference. Fix opportunistically.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\n## Architecture Review - [date]\n\n### Findings\n\n1. **[SEVERITY] [AREA]**: [description]\n   - Files: [file paths with line numbers]\n   - Recommendation: [what to do]\n\n### Summary\n- Critical: N\n- High: N\n- Medium: N\n- Quick wins: [list easy fixes]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:24:01.203Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced Next.js, Supabase, and SWR stack analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Next.js、Supabase 和 SWR 栈分析能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"Next.js、Supabase、SWR スタックの高度な分析機能を必要とするコードレビュー エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Next.js, Supabase 및 SWR 스택 분석 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan capacidades de análisis de pila avanzadas de Next.js, Supabase y SWR.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant des capacités d''analyse de pile avancées de Next.js, Supabase et SWR.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die erweiterte Next.js-, Supabase- und SWR-Stack-Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise de pilha Next.js, Supabase e SWR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, требующих расширенных возможностей анализа стека Next.js, Supabase и SWR.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل مجموعة Next.js و Supabase و SWR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect duplicated code, anti-patterns, complexity, and inconsistencies across the Next.js + Supabase + SWR stack, providing a comprehensive codebase health check through periodic scans and rule-based inspections.","zh":"赋予代理检测 Next.js + Supabase + SWR 栈中的重复代码、反模式、复杂性和不一致性，通过周期性扫描和基于规则的检查提供全面代码库健康检查。","ja":"Next.js + Supabase + SWR スタック内の重複コード、反パターン、複雑さ、不一致を検出するエージェントを可能にし、周期的なスキャンとルールベースの検査を通じて包括的なコードベースのヘルスチェックを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js + Supabase + SWR 스택에서 중복 코드, 반 패턴, 복잡성 및 불일치를 감지할 수 있도록 하여 주기적인 스캔 및 규칙 기반 검사를 통해 코드베이스의 toàn diện한 헬스 체크를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar código duplicado, anti-patrones, complejidad e inconsistencias en toda la pila de Next.js + Supabase + SWR, proporcionando un control de salud integral del código a través de análisis periódicos y inspecciones basadas en reglas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter le code dupliqué, les anti-modèles, la complexité et les incohérences dans l''ensemble de la pile Next.js + Supabase + SWR, fournissant un contrôle de santé complet du codebase grâce à des analyses périodiques et des inspections basées sur des règles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, duplizierten Code, Antimuster, Komplexität und Inkonsistenzen im gesamten Next.js + Supabase + SWR-Stack zu erkennen und bietet durch periodische Analysen und regelbasierte Inspektionen eine umfassende Gesundheitsprüfung des Codebases.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar código duplicado, anti-padrões, complexidade e inconsistências em toda a pilha Next.js + Supabase + SWR, fornecendo uma verificação abrangente da saúde do código por meio de varreduras periódicas e inspeções baseadas em regras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать дублированный код, анти-шаблоны, сложность и несоответствия во всей стеке Next.js + Supabase + SWR, обеспечивая комплексную проверку здоровья кода посредством периодических сканирований и инспекций на основе правил.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على اكتشاف الكود المكرر والأنماط المضادة والتعقيد والتناقضات عبر مجموعة Next.js + Supabase + SWR ، مع تقديم فحص شامل لصحة الكود من خلال المسح الدوري والتفتيش القائم على القواعد."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging unexplained bugs through codebase analysis","Performing pre-deploy checks for major releases","Automating weekly code health checks for consistency and quality"],"zh":["通过代码库分析调试无法解释的错误","执行主要版本的预部署检查","自动执行每周代码健康检查以确保一致性和质量"],"ja":["コードベース分析を通じて説明できないバグをデバッグする","メジャー リリースの事前デプロイ チェックを実行する","一貫性と品質を確保するために毎週コードヘルス チェックを自動化する"],"ko":["코드베이스 분석을 통해 설명할 수 없는 버그를 디버깅합니다","주요 릴리스의 사전 배포 확인을 수행합니다","일관성 및 품질을 보장하기 위해 매주 코드 헬스 체크를 자동화합니다"],"es":["Depuración de errores inexplicables a través del análisis del código","Realización de controles pre-despliegue para lanzamientos importantes","Automatización de controles semanales de salud del código para coherencia y calidad"],"fr":["Débogage de bogues inexplicables grâce à l''analyse du codebase","Exécution de contrôles pré-déploiement pour les versions majeures","Automatisation des contrôles hebdomadaires de santé du code pour la cohérence et la qualité"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung unerklärlicher Fehler durch Codebase-Analyse","Durchführung von Vor-Deploy-Checks für größere Releases","Automatisierung wöchentlicher Code-Gesundheitschecks für Konsistenz und Qualität"],"pt":["Depuração de bugs inexplicáveis por meio da análise do código","Realização de verificações pré-lançamento para lançamentos principais","Automatização de verificações semanais de saúde do código para consistência e qualidade"],"ru":["Отладка необъяснимых ошибок через анализ кода","Проведение предзапусковых проверок для основных релизов","Автоматизация еженедельных проверок здоровья кода для последовательности и качества"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء غير المفسرة من خلال تحليل الكود","إجراء فحوصات ما قبل الإطلاق للنشر الرئيسي","تأتمتية فحوصات صحة الكود الأسبوعية من أجل الاتساق والجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the codebase and relevant files","Limited to Next.js, Supabase, and SWR stack"],"zh":["需要访问代码库和相关文件","仅限 Next.js、Supabase 和 SWR 栈"],"ja":["コードベースと関連ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Next.js、Supabase、SWR スタックのみに限定される"],"ko":["코드베이스와 관련 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","Next.js, Supabase 및 SWR 스택에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código y a los archivos relevantes","Limitado a la pila de Next.js, Supabase y SWR"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au codebase et aux fichiers pertinents","Limité à la pile Next.js, Supabase et SWR"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Code und die relevanten Dateien","Begrenzt auf den Next.js-, Supabase- und SWR-Stack"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código e aos arquivos relevantes","Limitado à pilha Next.js, Supabase e SWR"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду и соответствующим файлам","Ограничен стеком Next.js, Supabase и SWR"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الكود والملفات ذات الصلة","محدود بمجموعة Next.js و Supabase و SWR"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
