модели","Генерация примеров кода","Проверка инициализации сервера PAL"],"ar":["قائمة أدوات متاحة","تشغيل اختبارات سريعة","تشغيل اختبارات مع مكالمات موديل حية","توليد أمثلة من الشفرة","التحقق من تشغيل خادم PAL"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PAL MCPorter","开发者工具","命令行工具","自测试功能","API 密钥","快速入门"],"ja":["PAL MCPorter","開発者ツール","コマンドラインツール","セルフテスト機能","API キー","クイックスタート"],"ko":["PAL MCPorter","개발자 도구","명령줄 도구","자체 테스트 기능","API 키","빠른 시작"],"es":["pal-mcporter","herramientas de línea de comandos","desarrollo de software","productividad","CLI","scripts","servidores PAL","pruebas de autocomprobación"],"fr":["pal-mcporter","outils de ligne de commande","développement de logiciels","productivité","CLI","scripts","serveurs PAL","tests de auto-vérification"],"de":["pal-mcporter","Befehlszeilentools","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität","CLI","Skripte","PAL-Server","Selbsttests"],"pt":["PAL MCPorter","ferramentas de linha de comando","gerenciamento de tarefas","testes rápidos","chamadas de modelo ao vivo","exemplos de código","inicialização do servidor PAL"],"ru":["PAL MCPorter","инструменты командной строки","управление задачами","быстрые тесты","живые вызовы модели","примеры кода","инициализация сервера PAL"],"ar":["PAL MCPorter","أدوات سطر الأوامر","إدارة المهام","اختبارات سريعة","مكالمات موديل حية","أمثلة من الشفرة","تشغيل خادم PAL"]}},"owner":"prateek","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"prateek/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pal-mcporter","description":"Run PAL MCP tools (precommit, codereview, secaudit, debug, apilookup, listmodels, etc.) via the `mcporter` CLI against the PAL stdio MCP server (`uvx … pal-mcp-server`) instead of configuring PAL as a Codex MCP server in `~/.codex/config.toml`. Use when you want shell/script-friendly PAL runs, want to avoid MCP tool-schema context overhead, or need PAL access in an environment without Codex MCP wiring.","bodyPreview":"# PAL via MCPorter\n\n## Quick start\n\n- See which tools are available (from the bundled generated CLI help):\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\"`\n- Print copy/pastable examples for every tool currently exposed by your PAL server:\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" examples`\n- Run a fast self-test (validates bundled CLI + PAL server startup; no live model call):\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" selftest`\n- Run self-test including live model calls (costs tokens; requires an API key):","body":"# PAL via MCPorter\n\n## Quick start\n\n- See which tools are available (from the bundled generated CLI help):\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\"`\n- Print copy/pastable examples for every tool currently exposed by your PAL server:\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" examples`\n- Run a fast self-test (validates bundled CLI + PAL server startup; no live model call):\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" selftest`\n- Run self-test including live model calls (costs tokens; requires an API key):\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" selftest --live`\n- Call tools:\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" -o json version`\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" -o json listmodels`\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" -o markdown apilookup --prompt \"OpenAI Responses API streaming\"`\n  - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" -o markdown chat --prompt \"ping\" --working-directory-absolute-path \"$PWD\" --model auto`\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Read the embedded tool list.\n   - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\"`\n2) Use examples to find minimal calls / argument shapes (recommended).\n   - `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" examples`\n3) Call the tool via the bundled CLI.\n   - Prefer `--raw ''{...}''` for complex payloads and optional parameters.\n   - Global flags (`-o/--output`, `-t/--timeout`) must come **before** the tool name.\n4) Treat stdout as the tool result.\n   - Use `-o markdown` for readability or `-o json` when you want structured output.\n\n## Does this match `pal-mcp-server`?\n\nMostly. This skill runs PAL via `uvx … pal-mcp-server` and bundles a CLI generated from PAL’s tool schemas via `mcporter generate-cli`. If upstream adds/removes tools, the bundled CLI may need to be regenerated.\n\n- Check which PAL version you’re running: `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" -o json version`\n- Source-of-truth tool surface (live): `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\" examples`\n\n## Notes (from upstream + schemas)\n\n- Tool surface can be reduced with `DISABLED_TOOLS` (helpful for clients that ingest tool schemas). Upstream often recommends: `analyze,refactor,testgen,secaudit,docgen,tracer` to save context.\n- Upstream PAL supports multi-turn threads via `continuation_id`, but this skill runs PAL in ad-hoc STDIO mode (fresh server per invocation), so continuations generally won’t resume across separate `pal` commands.\n- Prefer passing files via `absolute_file_paths` (and images via `images`) rather than pasting large blobs into prompts.\n\n## Selftest knobs\n\n- `PAL_SELFTEST_CLI_NAME`: which CLI `clink` should call in `selftest --live` (auto-detects `codex`, `claude`, `gemini` if present in `PATH`)\n- `PAL_SELFTEST_MODEL`: optionally override the model used during `selftest --live` (when supported by the tool)\n- `PAL_SELFTEST_THINKING_MODE`: defaults to `minimal`\n\n## Configuration\n\nThis skill uses ad-hoc stdio mode (no `mcporter.json` required) and ships a bundled CLI at `scripts/pal-cli.js`.\n\nSet these env vars when needed:\n\n- `OPENAI_API_KEY` (required for OpenAI-backed PAL usage; alternatives include `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, etc.)\n- `PAL_DEFAULT_MODEL` (default: `auto`; forwarded as `DEFAULT_MODEL` when `DEFAULT_MODEL` is unset)\n- `PAL_MCP_FROM` (default: `git+https://github.com/BeehiveInnovations/pal-mcp-server.git`)\n- `MCPORTER_VERSION` (default pinned in `\"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\"`)\n- `PAL_MCPORTER_TIMEOUT_MS` (default: `120000`)\n- `DISABLED_TOOLS` (PAL setting; comma-separated tool names to hide/disable in the server; unset/empty enables all)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `bash \"<path-to-skill>/scripts/pal\"` is the quick “what’s available?” view; use `examples` when you need parameter shapes.\n- STDIO mode inherits your shell environment automatically; avoid passing secrets via `--env KEY=value` unless you have to.\n- If PAL startup is slow (first `uvx` run), increase timeouts with `PAL_MCPORTER_TIMEOUT_MS` or `-t <ms>`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:25:24.751Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-based AI Agents needing rapid PAL server testing and validation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要快速PAL服务器测试和验证功能的基于CLI的AI代理。","ja":"CLIベースのAIエージェントが高速なPALサーバーのテストと検証機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"빠른 PAL 서버 테스트 및 검증 기능이 필요한 CLI 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en CLI que necesitan capacidades de prueba y validación rápidas del servidor PAL.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA basés sur CLI nécessitant des capacités de test et de validation rapides du serveur PAL.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-basierte KI-Agents, die eine schnelle PAL-Server-Test- und Validierungsfunktion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em CLI que necessitam de capacidades de teste e validação rápidas do servidor PAL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе CLI, которым необходимы быстрые возможности тестирования и проверки сервера PAL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل الذكي القائم على واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات اختبار وتحقق سريعة لخادم PAL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run fast self-tests, validate CLI and PAL server startup, and generate copy/pastable examples for exposed tools via bash scripts, leveraging API keys for live model calls and utilizing protocols like CLI help generation.","zh":"赋予代理快速运行自我测试、验证CLI和PAL服务器启动，并通过bash脚本为公开工具生成可复制的示例，利用API密钥进行实时模型调用，并利用诸如CLI帮助生成等协议。","ja":"エージェントが高速な自己テストを実行し、CLIとPALサーバーの起動を検証し、bashスクリプトを使用して公開ツールのコピーと貼り付け可能な例を生成し、APIキーを使用してライブモデルの呼び出しを行い、CLIヘルプ生成などのプロトコルを使用することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 빠른 자체 테스트를 실행하고 CLI 및 PAL 서버 시작을 검증하며 bash 스크립트를 사용하여 공개 도구에 대한 복사 및 붙여넣기 가능한 예를 생성하며 API 키를 사용하여 라이브 모델 호출을 수행하며 CLI 도움말 생성 등의 프로토콜을 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar autotest rápidos, validar el inicio de CLI y PAL server, y generar ejemplos copiables y pegables para herramientas expuestas a través de scripts de bash, aprovechando claves de API para llamadas de modelo en vivo y utilizando protocolos como la generación de ayuda de CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des autotests rapides, de valider le démarrage de CLI et du serveur PAL, et de générer des exemples copiables et collables pour les outils exposés via des scripts bash, en exploitant les clés d''API pour les appels de modèle en direct et en utilisant des protocoles tels que la génération d''aide de CLI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, schnelle Selbsttests durchzuführen, den Start von CLI und PAL-Server zu validieren und beispielhafte Kopier- und Einfügemöglichkeiten für freigegebene Tools über Bash-Skripte zu generieren, indem API-Schlüssel für Live-Modellaufrufe genutzt und Protokolle wie die CLI-Hilfegenerierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar autotestes rápidos, validar o inicio do CLI e do servidor PAL e gerar exemplos copiáveis/coláveis para ferramentas expostas via scripts de bash, utilizando chaves de API para chamadas de modelo ao vivo e utilizando protocolos como geração de ajuda do CLI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять быстрые самотесты, проверять запуск CLI и сервера PAL, а также генерировать копируемые/вставляемые примеры для открытых инструментов через скрипты bash, используя ключи API для вызовов живых моделей и используя протоколы, такие как генерация справки CLI.","ar":"يُفعِّل العميل الوكيل الذكي لتشغيل الاختبارات الذاتية السريعة وتحقق بدء تشغيل واجهة سطر الأوامر وخادم PAL وتوليد أمثلة قابلة للنسبة/اللصق للأدوات المعروضة عبر سكريبتات bash، باستخدام مفاتيح API للنداءات الحية للنموذج واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل توليد مساعدة واجهة سطر الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Running self-tests for PAL server validation","Generating examples for exposed tools via CLI","Validating bundled CLI and PAL server startup"],"zh":["运行自我测试以验证PAL服务器","通过CLI生成公开工具的示例","验证捆绑的CLI和PAL服务器启动"],"ja":["PALサーバーの検証のための自己テストの実行","CLIを使用して公開ツールの例を生成する","バンドルされたCLIとPALサーバーの起動を検証する"],"ko":["PAL 서버 검증을 위한 자체 테스트 실행","CLI를 사용하여 공개 도구의 예를 생성","번들된 CLI 및 PAL 서버 시작을 검증"],"es":["Ejecución de autotest para la validación del servidor PAL","Generación de ejemplos para herramientas expuestas a través de CLI","Validación del inicio de CLI y PAL server empaquetado"],"fr":["Exécution d''autotests pour la validation du serveur PAL","Génération d''exemples pour les outils exposés via CLI","Validation du démarrage de CLI et du serveur PAL empaqueté"],"de":["Ausführung von Selbsttests für die Validierung des PAL-Servers","Generierung von Beispielen für freigegebene Tools über CLI","Validierung des Starts von CLI und PAL-Server-Paket"],"pt":["Executar autotestes para validação do servidor PAL","Gerar exemplos para ferramentas expostas via CLI","Validar o inicio do CLI e do servidor PAL empacotados"],"ru":["Выполнение самотестов для проверки сервера PAL","Генерация примеров для открытых инструментов через CLI","Проверка запуска CLI и сервера PAL в составе пакета"],"ar":["تشغيل الاختبارات الذاتية لتحقق خادم PAL","توليد أمثلة للأدوات المعروضة عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر","تحقق بدء تشغيل واجهة سطر الأوامر وخادم PAL المجمّع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API key for live model calls","Bash script execution required","Token costs apply for live model calls"],"zh":["需要API密钥进行实时模型调用","需要bash脚本执行","实时模型调用需要代币成本"],"ja":["ライブモデルの呼び出しにはAPIキーが必要","bashスクリプトの実行が必要","ライブモデルの呼び出しにはトークンコストが適用される"],"ko":["라이브 모델 호출에는 API 키가 필요합니다.","bash 스크립트 실행이 필요합니다.","라이브 모델 호출에는 토큰 비용이 적용됩니다."],"es":["Requiere una clave de API para llamadas de modelo en vivo","Se requiere la ejecución de scripts de bash","Se aplican costos de token para llamadas de modelo en vivo"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API pour les appels de modèle en direct","L''exécution de scripts bash est requise","Des coûts de jeton s''appliquent pour les appels de modèle en direct"],"de":["Benötigt einen API-Schlüssel für Live-Modellaufrufe","Bash-Skriptausführung ist erforderlich","Tokenkosten gelten für Live-Modellaufrufe"],"pt":["Exige chave de API para chamadas de modelo ao vivo","Execução de script de bash necessária","Custos de token se aplicam para chamadas de modelo ao vivo"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API для вызовов живых моделей","Требуется выполнение скрипта bash","Применяются затраты на токены для вызовов живых моделей"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API للنداءات الحية للنموذج","يتطلب تشغيل سكريبت bash","تطبق تكاليف رمز للنداءات الحية للنموذج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EricOo0/stock-trading-platform/verification-before-completion', 'community', 'EricOo0', 'stock-trading-platform', 'EricOo0/stock-trading-platform', 'verification-before-completion', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z', '2026-02-18T13:25:37.424Z', NULL, '{"id":"EricOo0/stock-trading-platform/verification-before-completion","name":"verification-before-completion","description":{"zh":"验证前完成是确保工作质量和可靠性的关键原则，强调在完成工作前必须进行验证","ja":"完了前の検証は仕事の品質と信頼性を確保するための重要な原則であり、仕事を完了する前に検証することを強調しています","ko":"완료 전 검증은 작업의 품질과 신뢰성을 확보하는 중요한 원칙으로 완료하기 전에 검증해야 함을 강조합니다","es":"La verificación antes de completar es un principio fundamental para garantizar la calidad y precisión en el desarrollo","fr":"La vérification avant achèvement est un principe fondamental pour assurer la qualité et la précision dans le développement","de":"Die Verifizierung vor Abschluss ist ein grundlegendes Prinzip, um die Qualität und Genauigkeit in der Entwicklung zu gewährleisten","pt":"A verificação antes da conclusão é um princípio fundamental para garantir a eficiência e a confiabilidade dos resultados.","ru":"Верификация перед завершением является основным принципом для обеспечения эффективности и надежности результатов.","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال هو مبدأ أساسي لضمان الكفاءة وموثوقية النتائج.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"验证前完成技能","ja":"完了前の検証スキル","ko":"완료 전 검증 스킬","es":"Verificación antes de completar: principios y beneficios","fr":"Vérification avant achèvement : principes et avantages","de":"Verifizierung vor Abschluss: Prinzipien und Vorteile","pt":"Verificação Antes da Conclusão: Eficiência com Evidências","ru":"Верификация До Завершения: Эффективность С Доказательствами","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال: الكفاءة مع الأدلة","en":"verification-before-completion"},"description":{"zh":"验证前完成是确保工作质量和可靠性的关键原则，强调在完成工作前必须进行验证","ja":"完了前の検証は仕事の品質と信頼性を確保するための重要な原則であり、仕事を完了する前に検証することを強調しています","ko":"완료 전 검증은 작업의 품질과 신뢰성을 확보하는 중요한 원칙으로 완료하기 전에 검증해야 함을 강조합니다","es":"La verificación antes de completar es un principio fundamental para garantizar la calidad y precisión en el desarrollo","fr":"La vérification avant achèvement est un principe fondamental pour assurer la qualité et la précision dans le développement","de":"Die Verifizierung vor Abschluss ist ein grundlegendes Prinzip, um die Qualität und Genauigkeit in der Entwicklung zu gewährleisten","pt":"A verificação antes da conclusão é um princípio fundamental para garantir a eficiência e a confiabilidade dos resultados.","ru":"Верификация перед завершением является основным принципом для обеспечения эффективности и надежности результатов.","ar":"التحقق قبل الإكمال هو مبدأ أساسي لضمان الكفاءة وموثوقية النتائج.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["验证前完成的原则","确保工作质量","提高工作可靠性","减少错误率","提高效率"],"ja":["完了前の検証の原則","仕事の品質を確保","仕事の信頼性を高める","エラー率を減らす","効率を高める"],"ko":["완료 전 검증의 원칙","작업의 품질을 확보","작업의 신뢰성을 높임","오류율을 降低","효율을 높임"],"es":["Garantiza la calidad y precisión en el desarrollo","Evita errores y omisiones","Fomenta la transparencia y la confianza","Mejora la eficiencia y productividad","Reducir los riesgos y costos asociados con errores"],"fr":["Assure la qualité et la précision dans le développement","Évite les erreurs et les omissions","Favorise la transparence et la confiance","Améliore l''efficacité et la productivité","Réduit les risques et les coûts associés aux erreurs"],"de":["Gewährleistet die Qualität und Genauigkeit in der Entwicklung","Vermeidet Fehler und Auslassungen","Fördert die Transparenz und das Vertrauen","Verbessert die Effizienz und Produktivität","Reduziert die Risiken und Kosten im Zusammenhang mit Fehlern"],"pt":["Garantia de precisão dos resultados","Melhoria da eficiência e produtividade","Redução de erros e retrabalho","Aumento da confiabilidade e credibilidade","Otimização do processo de verificação"],"ru":["Гарантия точности результатов","Повышение эффективности и производительности","Сокращение ошибок и повторной работы","Увеличение надежности и достоверности","Оптимизация процесса верификации"],"ar":["ضمان دقة النتائج","تحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية","تقليل الأخطاء والعمل الإضافي","زيادة الموثوقية والمصداقية","تحسين عملية التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["验证前完成","工作质量","可靠性","效率","原则","检验","测试"],"ja":["完了前の検証","仕事の品質","信頼性","効率","原則","検証","テスト"],"ko":["완료 전 검증","작업의 품질","신뢰성","효율","원칙","검증","테스트"],"es":["verificación antes de completar","desarrollo de software","calidad y precisión","eficiencia y productividad","transparencia y confianza","reducción de errores"],"fr":["vérification avant achèvement","développement de logiciels","qualité et précision","efficacité et productivité","transparence et confiance","réduction des erreurs"],"de":["Verifizierung vor Abschluss","Software-Entwicklung","Qualität und Genauigkeit","Effizienz und Produktivität","Transparenz und Vertrauen","Fehlerreduzierung"],"pt":["verificação antes da conclusão","eficiência","confiabilidade","precisão","produtividade","erros","retrabalho"],"ru":["верификация перед завершением","эффективность","надежность","точность","производительность","ошибки","повторная работа"],"ar":["التحقق قبل الإكمال","الكفاءة","الموثوقية","الدقة","الإنتاجية","الأخطاء","العمل الإضافي"]}},"owner":"EricOo0","repo":"stock-trading-platform","repoPath":"EricOo0/stock-trading-platform","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"verification-before-completion","description":"Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing or creating PRs - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always","bodyPreview":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing sati","body":"# Verification Before Completion\n\n## Overview\n\nClaiming work is complete without verification is dishonesty, not efficiency.\n\n**Core principle:** Evidence before claims, always.\n\n**Violating the letter of this rule is violating the spirit of this rule.**\n\n## The Iron Law\n\n```\nNO COMPLETION CLAIMS WITHOUT FRESH VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n```\n\nIf you haven''t run the verification command in this message, you cannot claim it passes.\n\n## The Gate Function\n\n```\nBEFORE claiming any status or expressing satisfaction:\n\n1. IDENTIFY: What command proves this claim?\n2. RUN: Execute the FULL command (fresh, complete)\n3. READ: Full output, check exit code, count failures\n4. VERIFY: Does output confirm the claim?\n   - If NO: State actual status with evidence\n   - If YES: State claim WITH evidence\n5. ONLY THEN: Make the claim\n\nSkip any step = lying, not verifying\n```\n\n## Common Failures\n\n| Claim | Requires | Not Sufficient |\n|-------|----------|----------------|\n| Tests pass | Test command output: 0 failures | Previous run, \"should pass\" |\n| Linter clean | Linter output: 0 errors | Partial check, extrapolation |\n| Build succeeds | Build command: exit 0 | Linter passing, logs look good |\n| Bug fixed | Test original symptom: passes | Code changed, assumed fixed |\n| Regression test works | Red-green cycle verified | Test passes once |\n| Agent completed | VCS diff shows changes | Agent reports \"success\" |\n| Requirements met | Line-by-line checklist | Tests passing |\n\n## Red Flags - STOP\n\n- Using \"should\", \"probably\", \"seems to\"\n- Expressing satisfaction before verification (\"Great!\", \"Perfect!\", \"Done!\", etc.)\n- About to commit/push/PR without verification\n- Trusting agent success reports\n- Relying on partial verification\n- Thinking \"just this once\"\n- Tired and wanting work over\n- **ANY wording implying success without having run verification**\n\n## Rationalization Prevention\n\n| Excuse | Reality |\n|--------|---------|\n| \"Should work now\" | RUN the verification |\n| \"I''m confident\" | Confidence ≠ evidence |\n| \"Just this once\" | No exceptions |\n| \"Linter passed\" | Linter ≠ compiler |\n| \"Agent said success\" | Verify independently |\n| \"I''m tired\" | Exhaustion ≠ excuse |\n| \"Partial check is enough\" | Partial proves nothing |\n| \"Different words so rule doesn''t apply\" | Spirit over letter |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n**Tests:**\n```\n✅ [Run test command] [See: 34/34 pass] \"All tests pass\"\n❌ \"Should pass now\" / \"Looks correct\"\n```\n\n**Regression tests (TDD Red-Green):**\n```\n✅ Write → Run (pass) → Revert fix → Run (MUST FAIL) → Restore → Run (pass)\n❌ \"I''ve written a regression test\" (without red-green verification)\n```\n\n**Build:**\n```\n✅ [Run build] [See: exit 0] \"Build passes\"\n❌ \"Linter passed\" (linter doesn''t check compilation)\n```\n\n**Requirements:**\n```\n✅ Re-read plan → Create checklist → Verify each → Report gaps or completion\n❌ \"Tests pass, phase complete\"\n```\n\n**Agent delegation:**\n```\n✅ Agent reports success → Check VCS diff → Verify changes → Report actual state\n❌ Trust agent report\n```\n\n## Why This Matters\n\nFrom 24 failure memories:\n- your human partner said \"I don''t believe you\" - trust broken\n- Undefined functions shipped - would crash\n- Missing requirements shipped - incomplete features\n- Time wasted on false completion → redirect → rework\n- Violates: \"Honesty is a core value. If you lie, you''ll be replaced.\"\n\n## When To Apply\n\n**ALWAYS before:**\n- ANY variation of success/completion claims\n- ANY expression of satisfaction\n- ANY positive statement about work state\n- Committing, PR creation, task completion\n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:25:37.424Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Quality Assurance Agents requiring rigorous verification protocols to ensure accuracy and honesty in task completion.","zh":"适合需要严格校验协议以确保任务完成准确性和诚实性的质量保证代理。","ja":"タスクの完了の精度と誠実性を確保するための厳密な検証プロトコルを必要とする品質保証エージェントに最適です。","ko":"작업 완료의 정확성과誠實性을 보장하기 위한 엄격한検증 프로토콜이 필요한 품질 보증 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de aseguramiento de la calidad que requieren protocolos de verificación rigurosos para garantizar la precisión y la honestidad en la finalización de tareas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''assurance qualité nécessitant des protocoles de vérification rigoureux pour garantir l''exactitude et l''honnêteté dans l''achèvement des tâches.","de":"Ideal für Qualitäts-Sicherungsagenten, die strenge Verifizierungsprotokolle erfordern, um Genauigkeit und Ehrlichkeit bei der Aufgabenerfüllung zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Garantia de Qualidade que requerem protocolos de verificação rigorosos para garantir a precisão e a honestidade na conclusão de tarefas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обеспечению качества, требующих строгих протоколов проверки для обеспечения точности и честности при выполнении задач.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء ضمان الجودة الذين يحتاجون إلى بروتوكولات التحقق الصارمة لضمان الدقة والصدق في إكمال المهام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a strict verification-before-completion protocol, ensuring claims are backed by fresh evidence, and adhering to the core principle of evidence before claims, utilizing the Iron Law and Gate Function to maintain integrity.","zh":"赋予代理人执行严格的检验前完成协议的能力，确保声明有新鲜的证据支持，并遵循证据先于声明的核心原则，利用铁律和门函数来维护完整性。","ja":"エージェントに、厳密な検証前完了プロトコルを実施する能力を付与し、声明が新しい証拠によって裏付けられ、証拠が声明よりも先にあるという核心原則に従い、鉄法とゲート関数を使用して整合性を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 검증 전 완료 프로토콜을 시행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 진술이 새로운 증거에 의해 뒷받침되고, 증거가 진술보다 먼저라는 핵심 원칙을 따르며, 철법과 게이트 함수를 사용하여 일관성을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un protocolo estricto de verificación antes de la finalización, garantizando que las reclamaciones estén respaldadas por pruebas frescas y que se adhiera al principio fundamental de pruebas antes de reclamaciones, utilizando la Ley de Hierro y la Función de Puerta para mantener la integridad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un protocole de vérification strict avant l''achèvement, garantissant que les réclamations soient étayées par des preuves fraîches et qu''elles adhèrent au principe fondamental de preuves avant réclamations, en utilisant la Loi de Fer et la Fonction de Porte pour maintenir l''intégrité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ein strenges Verifizierungs- vor-Fertigstellungsprotokoll durchzusetzen, um sicherzustellen, dass Ansprüche durch frische Beweise gestützt werden und dem Kernprinzip von Beweisen vor Ansprüchen entsprechen, unter Verwendung des Eisernen Gesetzes und der Torfunktion, um die Integrität aufrechtzuerhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor um protocolo estrito de verificação-antes-de-conclusão, garantindo que as afirmações sejam respaldadas por evidências recentes e aderindo ao princípio fundamental de evidências antes de afirmações, utilizando a Lei de Ferro e a Função de Porta para manter a integridade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать строгий протокол проверки перед завершением, гарантируя, что претензии подтверждаются свежими доказательствами и придерживаются основного принципа доказательств перед претензиями, используя Железный закон и Функцию Ворота для поддержания целостности.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء صلاحية تنفيذ بروتوكول صارم للتحقق قبل اكتمال المهمة، ويضمن أن تكون المطالبات مدعومة بالأدلة الحديثة والالتزام بمبدأ الأساس للأدلة قبل المطالبات، باستخدام قانون الحديد ووظيفة البوابة للحفاظ على السلامة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating task completion with fresh verification evidence","Enforcing the Iron Law in automated workflows","Implementing the Gate Function to prevent premature status claims"],"zh":["使用新鲜的检验证据来验证任务完成","在自动化工作流中执行铁律","实施门函数来防止过早的状态声明"],"ja":["新しい検証証拠を使用してタスクの完了を検証する","自動化されたワークフローで鉄法を実施する","門関数を実装して早すぎるステータス宣言を防ぐ"],"ko":["새로운 검증 증거를 사용하여 작업 완료를 검증하는 것","자동화된 워크플ロー에서 철법을 시행하는 것","게이트 함수를 구현하여 너무 이른 상태 선언을 방지하는 것"],"es":["Validar la finalización de tareas con pruebas de verificación frescas","Hacer cumplir la Ley de Hierro en flujos de trabajo automatizados","Implementar la Función de Puerta para prevenir reclamaciones de estado prematuro"],"fr":["Valider l''achèvement des tâches avec des preuves de vérification fraîches","Faire respecter la Loi de Fer dans les flux de travail automatisés","Mettre en œuvre la Fonction de Porte pour prévenir les réclamations de statut prématurées"],"de":["Überprüfen der Aufgabenerfüllung mit frischen Verifizierungsnachweisen","Durchsetzen des Eisernen Gesetzes in automatisierten Workflows","Implementieren der Torfunktion, um vorzeitige Statusansprüche zu verhindern"],"pt":["Validar a conclusão da tarefa com evidências de verificação recentes","Impor a Lei de Ferro em fluxos de trabalho automatizados","Implementar a Função de Porta para prevenir alegações de status prematuras"],"ru":["Проверка завершения задачи с помощью свежих доказательств","Внедрение Железного закона в автоматизированных рабочих процессах","Реализация Функции Ворота для предотвращения преждевременных претензий на статус"],"ar":["التحقق من إكمال المهمة مع أدلة التحقق الحديثة","تنفيذ قانون الحديد في سير العمل الآلي","تنفيذ وظيفة البوابة لمنع المطالبات المسبقة بالحالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to the verification protocol","May introduce additional latency due to verification steps"],"zh":["需要严格遵守检验协议","可能由于检验步骤而引入额外的延迟"],"ja":["検証プロトコルに厳密に従う必要がある","検証ステップにより追加の遅延が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["검증 프로토콜을 엄격히 따라야 하는 것","검증 단계로 인해 추가적인 지연이 발생할 가능성이 있는 것"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión al protocolo de verificación","Puede introducir una latencia adicional debido a los pasos de verificación"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte au protocole de vérification","Peut introduire une latence supplémentaire en raison des étapes de vérification"],"de":["Erfordert eine strenge Einhaltung des Verifizierungsprotokolls","Kann aufgrund der Verifizierungsschritte zusätzliche Latenz einführen"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita ao protocolo de verificação","Pode introduzir latência adicional devido às etapas de verificação"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения протокола проверки","Может ввести дополнительную задержку из-за шагов проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباعًا صارمًا لبروتوكول التحقق","يمكن أن يؤدي إلى تأخير إضافي بسبب خطوات التحقق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('akiojin/llmlb/plan', 'community', 'akiojin', 'llmlb', 'akiojin/llmlb', 'plan', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z', '2026-02-18T13:25:23.099Z', NULL, '{"id":"akiojin/llmlb/plan","name":"plan","description":{"zh":"计划技能是一种分布式LLM路由器，具有负载均衡和自动模型分配功能，帮助开发者创建结构化计划","ja":"プランスキルは分散型LLMルーターであり、負荷分散と自動モデル分配機能を備え、開発者が構造化されたプランを作成するのを支援します","ko":"계획 스킬은 분산형 LLM 라우터로 부하 분산 및 자동 모델 분배 기능을 제공하여 개발자가 구조화된 계획을 생성하도록 도와줍니다","es":"El plan es una habilidad que permite crear planes estructurados para proyectos con distribución automática de modelos y equilibrio de carga.","fr":"Le plan est une compétence qui permet de créer des plans structurés pour les projets avec distribution automatique de modèles et équilibrage de charge.","de":"Der Plan ist eine Fähigkeit, die es ermöglicht, strukturierte Pläne für Projekte mit automatischer Modellverteilung und Lastenausgleich zu erstellen.","pt":"O skill de planejamento permite criar planos estruturados para projetos, incluindo escopo, requisitos e ações","ru":"Навык планирования позволяет создавать структурированные планы для проектов, включая объем, требования и действия","ar":"مهارة التخطيط تمكن من إنشاء خطط منظمّة لمشاريع، بما في ذلك النطاق والمتطلبات والإجراءات","en":"Distributed LLM router with load balancing and automatic model distribution"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"计划技能：分布式LLM路由器与负载均衡","ja":"プランスキル：分散型LLMルーターと負荷分散","ko":"计划 스킬: 분산형 LLM 라우터 및 부하 분산","es":"Planificación de Proyectos con Ruta de Modelo de Carga","fr":"Planification de Projets avec Routage de Modèle de Charge","de":"Projektplanung mit Modell-Lastenverteilung","pt":"Planejamento de Projetos com Distribuição de Carga","ru":"Планирование Проектов с Распределением Нагрузки","ar":"تخطيط المشاريع مع توزيع الحمل","en":"plan"},"description":{"zh":"计划技能是一种分布式LLM路由器，具有负载均衡和自动模型分配功能，帮助开发者创建结构化计划","ja":"プランスキルは分散型LLMルーターであり、負荷分散と自動モデル分配機能を備え、開発者が構造化されたプランを作成するのを支援します","ko":"계획 스킬은 분산형 LLM 라우터로 부하 분산 및 자동 모델 분배 기능을 제공하여 개발자가 구조화된 계획을 생성하도록 도와줍니다","es":"El plan es una habilidad que permite crear planes estructurados para proyectos con distribución automática de modelos y equilibrio de carga.","fr":"Le plan est une compétence qui permet de créer des plans structurés pour les projets avec distribution automatique de modèles et équilibrage de charge.","de":"Der Plan ist eine Fähigkeit, die es ermöglicht, strukturierte Pläne für Projekte mit automatischer Modellverteilung und Lastenausgleich zu erstellen.","pt":"O skill de planejamento permite criar planos estruturados para projetos, incluindo escopo, requisitos e ações","ru":"Навык планирования позволяет создавать структурированные планы для проектов, включая объем, требования и действия","ar":"مهارة التخطيط تمكن من إنشاء خطط منظمّة لمشاريع، بما في ذلك النطاق والمتطلبات والإجراءات","en":"Distributed LLM router with load balancing and automatic model distribution"},"definition":{"en":"Distributed LLM router with load balancing and automatic model distribution"},"features":{"zh":["分布式LLM路由器","负载均衡","自动模型分配","结构化计划创建","Markdown文件保存"],"ja":["分散型LLMルーター","負荷分散","自動モデル分配","構造化されたプランの作成","Markdownファイルの保存"],"ko":["분산형 LLM 라우터","부하 분산","자동 모델 분배","구조화된 계획 생성","Markdown 파일 저장"],"es":["Distribución automática de modelos","Equilibrio de carga","Creación de planes estructurados","Guardado de planes en formato Markdown","Compatibilidad con YAML frontmatter"],"fr":["Distribution automatique de modèles","Équilibrage de charge","Création de plans structurés","Enregistrement de plans au format Markdown","Compatibilité avec YAML frontmatter"],"de":["Automatische Modellverteilung","Lastenausgleich","Erstellung strukturierter Pläne","Speicherung von Plänen im Markdown-Format","Kompatibilität mit YAML-Frontmatter"],"pt":["Criação de planos estruturados","Distribuição de carga e balanceamento de modelos","Salvamento de planos em formato Markdown","Suporte a YAML frontmatter","Geração de resumos de projetos"],"ru":["Создание структурированных планов","Распределение нагрузки и балансировка моделей","Сохранение планов в формате Markdown","Поддержка YAML frontmatter","Генерация обзоров проектов"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط منظمّة","توزيع الحمل وتنسيق النماذج","حفظ الخطط في صيغة Markdown","دعم YAML frontmatter","توليد ملخصات المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["计划技能","分布式LLM路由器","负载均衡","自动模型分配","结构化计划","开发效率"],"ja":["プランスキル","分散型LLMルーター","負荷分散","自動モデル分配","構造化されたプラン","開発効率"],"ko":["계획 스킬","분산형 LLM 라우터","부하 분산","자동 모델 분배","구조화된 계획","개발 효율성"],"es":["planificación de proyectos","distribución de modelos","equilibrio de carga","creación de planes","gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["planification de projets","distribution de modèles","équilibrage de charge","création de plans","gestion de projets","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Projektplanung","Modellverteilung","Lastenausgleich","Erstellung von Plänen","Projektmanagement","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["planejamento de projetos","distribuição de carga","balanceamento de modelos","criação de planos","salvamento de planos","YAML frontmatter","Markdown","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["планирование проектов","распределение нагрузки","балансировка моделей","создание планов","сохранение планов","YAML frontmatter","Markdown","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تخطيط المشاريع","توزيع الحمل","تنسيق النماذج","إنشاء خطط","حفظ الخطط","YAML frontmatter","Markdown","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"akiojin","repo":"llmlb","repoPath":"akiojin/llmlb","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan","description":"Generate a plan for how an agent should accomplish a complex coding task. Use when a user asks for a plan, and optionally when they want to save, find, read, update, or delete plan files in $CODEX_HOME/plans (default ~/.codex/plans).","bodyPreview":"# Plan\n\n## Overview\n\nDraft structured plans that clarify intent, scope, requirements, action items, testing/validation, and risks.\n\nOptionally, save plans to disk as markdown files with YAML frontmatter and free-form content. When drafting in chat, output only the plan body without frontmatter; add frontmatter only when saving to disk. Only write to the plans folder; do not modify the repository codebase.\n\nThis skill can also be used to draft codebase or system overviews.\n\n## Core rules\n\n- Resol","body":"# Plan\n\n## Overview\n\nDraft structured plans that clarify intent, scope, requirements, action items, testing/validation, and risks.\n\nOptionally, save plans to disk as markdown files with YAML frontmatter and free-form content. When drafting in chat, output only the plan body without frontmatter; add frontmatter only when saving to disk. Only write to the plans folder; do not modify the repository codebase.\n\nThis skill can also be used to draft codebase or system overviews.\n\n## Core rules\n\n- Resolve the plans directory as `$CODEX_HOME/plans` or `~/.codex/plans` when `CODEX_HOME` is not set.\n- Create the plans directory if it does not exist.\n- Never write to the repo; only read files to understand context.\n- Require frontmatter with **only** `name` and `description` (single-line values) for on-disk plans.\n- When presenting a draft plan in chat, omit frontmatter and start at `# Plan`.\n- Enforce naming rules: short, lower-case, hyphen-delimited; filename must equal `<name>.md`.\n- If a plan is not found, state it clearly and offer to create one.\n- Allow overview-style plans that document flows, architecture, or context without a work checklist.\n\n## Decide the task\n\n1. **Find/list**: discover plans by frontmatter summary; confirm if multiple matches exist.\n2. **Read/use**: validate frontmatter; present summary and full contents.\n3. **Create**: inspect repo read-only; choose plan style (implementation vs overview); draft plan; write to plans directory only.\n4. **Update**: load plan; revise content and/or description; preserve frontmatter keys; overwrite the plan file.\n5. **Delete**: confirm intent, then remove the plan file if asked.\n\n## Plan discovery\n\n- Prefer `scripts/list_plans.py` for quick summaries.\n- Use `scripts/read_plan_frontmatter.py` to validate a specific plan.\n- If name mismatches filename or frontmatter is missing fields, call it out and ask whether to fix.\n\n## Plan creation workflow\n\n1. Scan context quickly: read README.md and obvious docs (docs/, CONTRIBUTING.md, ARCHITECTURE.md); skim likely touched files; identify constraints (language, frameworks, CI/test commands, deployment).\n2. Ask follow-ups only if blocked: at most 1-2 questions, prefer multiple-choice. If unsure but not blocked, state assumptions and proceed.\n3. Identify scope, constraints, and data model/API implications (or capture existing behavior for an overview).\n4. Draft either an ordered implementation plan or a structured overview plan with diagrams/notes as needed.\n5. Immediately output the plan body only (no frontmatter), then ask the user if they want to 1. Make changes, 2. Implement it, 3. Save it as per plan.\n6. If the user wants to save it, prepend frontmatter and save the plan under the computed plans directory using `scripts/create_plan.py`.\n\n\n## Plan update workflow\n\n- Re-read the plan and related code/docs before updating.\n- Keep the plan name stable unless the user explicitly wants a rename.\n- If renaming, update both frontmatter `name` and filename together.\n\n## Scripts (low-freedom helpers)\n\nCreate a plan file (body only; frontmatter is written for you). Run from the plan skill directory:\n\n```bash\npython ./scripts/create_plan.py \\\n  --name codex-rate-limit-overview \\\n  --description \"Scope and update plan for Codex rate limiting\" \\\n  --body-file /tmp/plan-body.md\n```\n\nRead frontmatter summary for a plan (run from the plan skill directory):\n\n```bash\npython ./scripts/read_plan_frontmatter.py ~/.codex/plans/codex-rate-limit-overview.md\n```\n\nList plan summaries (optional filter; run from the plan skill directory):\n\n```bash\npython ./scripts/list_plans.py --query \"rate limit\"\n```\n\n## Plan file format\n\nUse one of the structures below for the plan body. When drafting, output only the body (no frontmatter). When saving, prepend this frontmatter:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: <plan-name>\ndescription: <1-line summary>\n---\n```\n\n### Implementation plan body template\n\n```markdown\n# Plan\n\n<1-3 sentences: intent, scope, and approach.>\n\n## Requirements\n- <Requirement 1>\n- <Requirement 2>\n\n## Scope\n- In:\n- Out:\n\n## Files and entry points\n- <File/module/entry point 1>\n- <File/module/entry point 2>\n\n## Data model / API changes\n- <If applicable, describe schema or contract changes>\n\n## Action items\n- [ ] <Step 1>\n- [ ] <Step 2>\n- [ ] <Step 3>\n- [ ] <Step 4>\n- [ ] <Step 5>\n- [ ] <Step 6>\n\n## Testing and validation\n- <Tests, commands, or validation steps>\n\n## Risks and edge cases\n- <Risk 1>\n- <Risk 2>\n\n## Open questions\n- <Question 1>\n- <Question 2>\n```\n\n### Overview plan body template\n\n```markdown\n# Plan\n\n<1-3 sentences: intent and scope of the overview.>\n\n## Overview\n<Describe the system, flow, or architecture at a high level.>\n\n## Diagrams\n<Include text or Mermaid diagrams if helpful.>\n\n## Key file references\n- <File/module/entry point 1>\n- <File/module/entry point 2>\n\n## Auth / routing / behavior notes\n- <Capture relevant differences (e.g., auth modes, routing paths).>\n\n## Current status\n- <What is live today vs pending work, if known.>\n\n## Action items\n- None (overview only).\n\n## Testing and validation\n- None (overview only).\n\n## Risks and edge cases\n- None (overview only).\n\n## Open questions\n- None.\n```\n\n## Writing guidance\n\n- Start with 1 short paragraph describing intent and approach.\n- Keep action items ordered and atomic (discovery -> changes -> tests -> rollout); use verb-first phrasing.\n- Scale action item count to complexity (simple: 1-2; complex: up to about 10).\n- Include file/entry-point hints and concrete validation steps where useful.\n- Always include testing/validation and risks/edge cases in implementation plans; include safe rollout/rollback when relevant.\n- Use open questions only when necessary (max 3).\n- Avoid vague steps, micro-steps, and code snippets; keep the plan implementation-agnostic.\n- For overview plans, keep action items minimal and set non-applicable sections to \"None.\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:25:23.099Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing structured planning capabilities with load balancing and automatic model distribution","zh":"适用于像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，它们需要结构化的规划能力，具有负载均衡和自动模型分布","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに適しています。これらのエージェントは、負荷分散および自動モデル配布を備えた構造化された計画機能を必要とします","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 구조화된 계획 기능과 부하 분산 및 자동 모델 배포가 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades de planificación estructurada con equilibrio de carga y distribución automática de modelos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de planification structurée avec équilibrage de charge et distribution automatique de modèles","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die strukturierte Planungsfähigkeiten mit Lastenausgleich und automatischer Modellverteilung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades de planejamento estruturado com balanceamento de carga e distribuição automática de modelos","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих структурированных возможностей планирования с балансировкой нагрузки и автоматическим распределением моделей","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى قدرات التخطيط المنظم مع توازن الحمل والتوزيع التلقائي للنموذج"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to draft structured plans with YAML frontmatter, clarifying intent, scope, requirements, and action items, while also handling load balancing and model distribution across distributed LLM routers, utilizing markdown files for plan storage","zh":"赋予代理创建结构化计划的能力，使用YAML前置内容来阐明意图、范围、要求和操作项，同时处理分布式LLM路由器上的负载均衡和模型分布，利用markdown文件进行计划存储","ja":"エージェントに構造化された計画を作成する能力を与えます。YAMLフロントマターを使用して意図、範囲、要件、およびアクション項目を明確にし、同時に分散型LLMルーター上的負荷分散およびモデル配布を処理します。マークダウンファイルを使用して計画を保存します","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 계획을 작성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. YAML 프론트매터를 사용하여 의도, 범위, 요구 사항 및 작업 항목을 명확히 하며 동시에 분산형 LLM 라우터上的 부하 분산 및 모델 배포를 처리합니다. 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 계획을 저장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a elaborar planes estructurados con frontmatter YAML, aclarando la intención, el alcance, los requisitos y los elementos de acción, mientras también maneja el equilibrio de carga y la distribución de modelos en routers LLM distribuidos, utilizando archivos markdown para el almacenamiento de planes","fr":"Permet aux agents de rédiger des plans structurés avec un frontmatter YAML, clarifiant l''intention, la portée, les exigences et les éléments d''action, tout en gérant l''équilibrage de charge et la distribution de modèles sur des routeurs LLM distribués, en utilisant des fichiers markdown pour le stockage des plans","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, strukturierte Pläne mit YAML-Frontmatter zu erstellen, die Absicht, den Umfang, die Anforderungen und die Aktivitäten klärend, während auch die Lastverteilung und Modellverteilung auf verteilten LLM-Routern gehandhabt werden, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien für die Planspeicherung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos estruturados com frontmatter YAML, esclarecendo a intenção, o escopo, os requisitos e os itens de ação, além de lidar com o balanceamento de carga e a distribuição de modelos em roteadores LLM distribuídos, utilizando arquivos markdown para armazenamento de planos","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать структурированные планы с YAML-заголовком, уточняя цель, объем, требования и пункты действий, а также обрабатывает балансировку нагрузки и распределение моделей по распределенным маршрутизаторам LLM, используя файлы markdown для хранения планов","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من صياغة خطط منسقة مع YAML frontmatter، توضيح النية، والمدى، والمتطلبات، وأصناف الإجراءات، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع توازن الحمل وتوزيع النموذج عبر متجاوزات LLM الموزعة، مع استخدام ملفات markdown لتخزين الخطط"},"useCases":{"en":["Drafting system overviews with automatic model distribution","Creating structured plans with scope, requirements, and testing/validation details","Saving plans to disk as markdown files with YAML frontmatter for easy access and modification"],"zh":["使用自动模型分布来创建系统概述","使用范围、要求和测试/验证详细信息来创建结构化计划","将计划保存到磁盘为markdown文件，带有YAML前置内容，以便于访问和修改"],"ja":["自動モデル配布を使用してシステムの概要を作成する","範囲、要件、およびテスト/検証の詳細を使用して構造化された計画を作成する","計画をマークダウンファイルとしてディスクに保存し、YAMLフロントマターを使用して簡単にアクセスおよび変更できるようにする"],"ko":["자동 모델 배포를 사용하여 시스템 개요를 작성합니다","범위, 요구 사항 및 테스트/검증 세부 정보를 사용하여 구조화된 계획을 작성합니다","계획을 디스크에 마크다운 파일로 저장하고 YAML 프론트매터를 사용하여 쉽게 액세스 및 수정할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Creación de vistas generales del sistema con distribución automática de modelos","Creación de planes estructurados con alcance, requisitos y detalles de prueba/validación","Guardado de planes en disco como archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML para un fácil acceso y modificación"],"fr":["Création de vues d''ensemble du système avec distribution automatique de modèles","Création de plans structurés avec portée, exigences et détails de test/validation","Enregistrement de plans sur disque sous forme de fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML pour un accès et une modification faciles"],"de":["Erstellung von Systemübersichten mit automatischer Modellverteilung","Erstellung von strukturierten Plänen mit Umfang, Anforderungen und Test-/Validierungsdetails","Speichern von Plänen auf Datenträger als Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter für einfachen Zugriff und Änderung"],"pt":["Criar visões gerais do sistema com distribuição automática de modelos","Criar planos estruturados com escopo, requisitos e detalhes de teste/validação","Salvar planos no disco como arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML para acesso e modificação fáceis"],"ru":["Создание обзоров системы с автоматическим распределением моделей","Создание структурированных планов с объемом, требованиями и деталями тестирования/валидации","Сохранение планов на диск в виде файлов markdown с YAML-заголовком для легкого доступа и изменения"],"ar":["إعداد نظرات عامة للنظام مع توزيع تلقائي للنموذج","إنشاء خطط منسقة مع نطاق ومتطلبات وتفاصيل اختبار/تحقق","حفظ الخطط على القرص كملفات markdown مع YAML frontmatter للوصول والتعديل السهل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Only writes to the plans folder, does not modify the repository codebase","Requires specific folder structure for plan storage","Output is limited to plan body without frontmatter when drafting in chat"],"zh":["仅写入计划文件夹，不修改代码库","需要特定的文件夹结构来存储计划","在聊天中草拟时，输出仅限于计划正文，不包括前置内容"],"ja":["計画フォルダのみに書き込み、リポジトリのコードベースは変更しません","計画を保存するための特定のフォルダ構造が必要です","チャットで草案を作成するとき、出力はプラン本体のみで、フロントマターは含まれません"],"ko":["계획 폴더에만 쓰기, 저장소 코드베이스 수정 안 함","계획을 저장하기 위한 특정 폴더 구조가 필요함","채팅에서 초안을 작성할 때, 출력은 계획 본문만으로, 프론트매터는 포함되지 않음"],"es":["Solo escribe en la carpeta de planes, no modifica la base de código del repositorio","Requiere una estructura de carpeta específica para el almacenamiento de planes","La salida se limita al cuerpo del plan sin frontmatter al crear en chat"],"fr":["N''écrit que dans le dossier des plans, ne modifie pas la base de code du référentiel","Exige une structure de dossier spécifique pour le stockage des plans","La sortie est limitée au corps du plan sans frontmatter lors de la création dans le chat"],"de":["Schreibt nur in den Plans-Ordner, ändert nicht die Codebasis des Repository","Benötigt eine spezifische Ordnerstruktur für die Planspeicherung","Die Ausgabe ist auf den Plan-Body ohne Frontmatter beschränkt, wenn im Chat erstellt wird"],"pt":["Apenas escreve na pasta de planos, não modifica a base de código do repositório","Requer uma estrutura de pasta específica para armazenamento de planos","A saída é limitada ao corpo do plano sem frontmatter ao criar em chat"],"ru":["Только пишет в папку планов, не изменяет кодовую базу репозитория","Требует конкретной структуры папки для хранения планов","Выход ограничен телом плана без заголовка при создании в чате"],"ar":["يكتب فقط في مجلد الخطط، ولا يعدل على قاعدة الشفرة للمستودع","يتطلب هيكلاً محدداً للمجلد لتخزين الخطط","الخرج مقيد بجسم الخطة دون YAML frontmatter عند الإنشاء في الدردشة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
