ий Инструмент","ar":"كاتب المحتوى: أداة الكتابة الآلية","en":"content-writer"},"description":{"zh":"内容写作技能是基于Vercel的AI SDK v6的Deep Agent Harness框架，能够自动生成高质量的内容","ja":"コンテンツライター スキルは、VercelのAI SDK v6に基づくDeep Agent Harnessフレームワークで、高品質なコンテンツを自動生成","ko":"컨텐츠라이ター 스킬은 Vercel의 AI SDK v6를 기반으로 하는 Deep Agent Harness 프레임워크로 고품질의 컨텐츠를 자동 생성","es":"El skill de escritor de contenido es un framework de agente profundo que utiliza la IA para generar contenido de alta calidad en diferentes plataformas y aud...","fr":"Le skill d''écrivain de contenu est un framework d''agent profond qui utilise l''IA pour générer du contenu de haute qualité sur différentes plateformes et audi...","de":"Das Content-Writer-Skill ist ein Framework für tiefere Agenten, das KI verwendet, um hochwertigen Inhalt auf verschiedenen Plattformen und Zielgruppen zu ers...","pt":"A ferramenta de escritor de conteúdo é uma solução de tecnologia de IA que cria conteúdo de alta qualidade em diferentes plataformas e estilos","ru":"Инструмент создания контента - это решение технологии ИИ, которое создает высококачественный контент на разных платформах и в разных стилях","ar":"أداة كاتب المحتوى هي حل تقنية ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة على منصات و بأسلوب مختلف","en":"A Deep Agent Harness framework built with Vercel''s AI SDK v6"},"definition":{"en":"A Deep Agent Harness framework built with Vercel''s AI SDK v6"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种内容类型，包括技术博客、社交媒体内容、教程等","根据任务自动选择合适的写作风格","支持Vercel的AI SDK v6","能够自动生成高质量的内容","支持多种平台和受众"],"ja":["複数のコンテンツタイプをサポート、技術ブログ、ソーシャルメディアコンテンツ、チュートリアル等","タスクに応じて適切なライティングスタイルを自動的に選択","VercelのAI SDK v6をサポート","高品質なコンテンツを自動生成","複数のプラットフォームや受講者をサポート"],"ko":["다양한 컨텐츠 유형을 지원, 기술 블로그, 소셜 미디어 컨텐츠, 튜토리얼 등","작업에 따라 적절한 작성 스타일을 자동으로 선택","Vercel의 AI SDK v6를 지원","고품질의 컨텐츠를 자동 생성","다양한 플랫폼과 대상자를 지원"],"es":["Generación de contenido de alta calidad","Selección dinámica de estilo de escritura","Compatibilidad con diferentes plataformas y audiencias","Inclusión de estilos de escritura técnicos y de redes sociales","Aplicación consistente del estilo de escritura seleccionado"],"fr":["Génération de contenu de haute qualité","Sélection dynamique de style d''écriture","Compatibilité avec différentes plateformes et audiences","Inclusion de styles d''écriture techniques et de réseaux sociaux","Application cohérente du style d''écriture sélectionné"],"de":["Erstellung von hochwertigem Inhalt","Dynamische Auswahl des Schreibstils","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Plattformen und Zielgruppen","Einbeziehung von technischen und sozialen Schreibstilen","Konsistente Anwendung des ausgewählten Schreibstils"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo de alta qualidade","Estilos de escrita personalizados","Compatibilidade com diferentes plataformas","Tecnologia de IA avançada","Capacidade de criar conteúdo em diferentes formatos"],"ru":["Генерация высококачественного контента","Индивидуальные стили письма","Совместимость с разными платформами","Продвинутая технология ИИ","Возможность создавать контент в разных форматах"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى عالي الجودة","أسلوب الكتابة المخصص","التوافق مع منصات مختلفة","تقنية الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدمة","القدرة على إنشاء المحتوى في تنسيقات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["内容写作技能","人工智能内容生成","Deep Agent Harness","Vercel AI SDK","内容生成","技术博客","社交媒体内容","教程"],"ja":["コンテンツライター スキル","AIコンテンツ生成","Deep Agent Harness","Vercel AI SDK","コンテンツ生成","技術ブログ","ソーシャルメディアコンテンツ","チュートリアル"],"ko":["컨텐츠라이ター 스킬","인공지능 컨텐츠 생성","Deep Agent Harness","Vercel AI SDK","컨텐츠 생성","기술 블로그","소셜 미디어 컨텐츠","튜토리얼"],"es":["generador de contenido","escritor de contenido","IA para contenido","plataformas de contenido","estilos de escritura","contenido de alta calidad","desarrollo de contenido","herramientas de contenido","tecnologías de contenido"],"fr":["générateur de contenu","écrivain de contenu","IA pour contenu","plateformes de contenu","styles d''écriture","contenu de haute qualité","développement de contenu","outils de contenu","technologies de contenu"],"de":["Inhalts-Generator","Content-Writer","KI für Inhalte","Inhaltsplattformen","Schreibstile","hochwertiger Inhalt","Inhaltsentwicklung","Inhalts-Tools","Inhaltstechnologien"],"pt":["escritor de conteúdo","ferramenta de redação automática","tecnologia de IA","geração de conteúdo","estilos de escrita","plataformas de mídia social"],"ru":["создатель контента","автоматический инструмент","технология ИИ","генерация контента","стили письма","платформы социальных сетей"],"ar":["كاتب المحتوى","أداة الكتابة الآلية","تقنية الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء المحتوى","أسلوب الكتابة","منصات التواصل الاجتماعي"]}},"owner":"chrispangg","repo":"deepagentsdk","repoPath":"chrispangg/deepagentsdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"content-writer","description":"Writing content across different platforms and styles. This skill should be used when creating blog posts, LinkedIn posts, X/Twitter threads, technical documentation, or other written content. It intelligently selects the appropriate writing style based on the platform, audience, and content type, then applies that style consistently throughout the piece.","bodyPreview":"# Content Writer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill enables writing high-quality content across different platforms and audiences. It dynamically selects the appropriate writing style based on the task, then applies that style consistently. Available styles include deep technical blog posts, social media content (LinkedIn, X/Twitter), tutorials, and more.\n\n## Style Selection\n\nBefore writing, determine the appropriate style based on these factors:\n\n| Factor | Consider |\n|--------|----------|\n| **Platform**","body":"# Content Writer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill enables writing high-quality content across different platforms and audiences. It dynamically selects the appropriate writing style based on the task, then applies that style consistently. Available styles include deep technical blog posts, social media content (LinkedIn, X/Twitter), tutorials, and more.\n\n## Style Selection\n\nBefore writing, determine the appropriate style based on these factors:\n\n| Factor | Consider |\n|--------|----------|\n| **Platform** | Blog, LinkedIn, X/Twitter, documentation, newsletter |\n| **Audience** | Engineers, executives, general tech audience, developers |\n| **Depth** | Deep-dive technical, lightweight explainer, announcement |\n| **Tone** | Authoritative, conversational, promotional, educational |\n| **Length** | Long-form (2000+ words), medium (500-1500), short (<500), thread |\n\n### Style Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this for social media?\n├─ Yes → LinkedIn or X/Twitter style\n│   ├─ Professional/B2B → LinkedIn Style\n│   └─ Tech community/casual → X/Twitter Style\n│\n└─ No → Is this a technical blog post?\n    ├─ Yes → What voice/style?\n    │   ├─ Karpathy-style (conversational, personal, pragmatic) → Karpathy Style\n    │   ├─ Opinion-forward analysis → Deep Technical Style\n    │   ├─ Lightweight explainer → Simplified Technical Style\n    │   └─ Tutorial/how-to → Tutorial Style\n    │\n    └─ No → What type?\n        ├─ Announcement → Announcement Style\n        ├─ Newsletter → Newsletter Style\n        └─ Documentation → Documentation Style\n```\n\n## Available Styles\n\n### 1. Karpathy Style (Conversational Technical)\n\n**Use when:** Writing technical content that feels personal and accessible. Best for blog posts about AI/ML, tutorials, or technical essays where you want the voice of an expert friend explaining things over coffee.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- First-person, conversational tone (\"I''ve found that...\", \"Here''s what I learned...\")\n- Starts with personal experience or intriguing premise\n- Progressive complexity (simple → detailed)\n- Dry wit and occasional humor\n- Honest about limitations and failures\n- Pragmatic (\"It only has to be right more often than not\")\n- Numbered frameworks and structured approaches\n- Memorable, quotable lines\n\n**Load:** `references/karpathy-style.md` for comprehensive guidance\n\n**Core Philosophy:** \"Don''t be a hero. Start simple. Be patient.\"\n\n**Opening Hooks (choose one):**\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Personal experience | \"I still remember when I trained my first recurrent network...\" |\n| Intriguing premise | \"We''re going to feed 2 million selfies to a neural network and have it tell us what makes a selfie good.\" |\n| Leaky abstraction | \"Neural nets are not ''off-the-shelf'' technology the second you deviate slightly from training an ImageNet classifier.\" |\n| Strong observation | \"Trees are solidified air.\" |\n\n**Example opening:**\n> \"I''ve trained a lot of neural networks over the years and I''ve come to find that the process isn''t nearly as simple as it seems. They are a leaky abstraction. Here''s what I''ve learned.\"\n\n**Tweet/X style (short-form):**\n- Pithy observations that compress insight\n- Strong statements (90% true, ignore counterexample police)\n- Unexpected connections between domains\n- Personal candor about struggles and discoveries\n\n### 2. Deep Technical Style (Opinion-Forward Analysis)\n\n**Use when:** Writing opinion-forward technical analysis about AI, LLMs, agents, or engineering topics. Best for content targeting senior engineers who want bold takes backed by evidence.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Contrarian, opinion-forward opening hooks\n- \"Do the simple thing first\" philosophy\n- Concrete examples with specific numbers\n- Takes clear positions and makes predictions\n- Varied sentence length, active voice\n\n**Load:** `references/deep-technical-style.md` for comprehensive guidance\n\n**Core Philosophy:** \"Do the simple thing first.\"\n\n- Embrace the black box: Focus on inputs/outputs, not internal mechanisms\n- Domain expertise over technical knowledge\n- Simplicity as virtue: Start simple, add complexity only when necessary\n- Opinion-forward: Take clear positions and make predictions boldly\n\n**Opening Hooks (choose one):**\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Contrarian position | \"The death of prompt engineering has been greatly exaggerated.\" |\n| Practical pain point | \"So you need to hire someone to build your LLM multi-agent system...\" |\n| Challenge assumptions | \"If you''ve been stuffing thousands of tokens thinking ''more context = better''...\" |\n| Surprising simplicity | \"Claude Code isn''t built on a complex multi-agent swarm. It''s a single-threaded loop.\" |\n\n**Example opening:**\n> \"Most AI architectures are overengineered. A single-threaded loop often outperforms elaborate multi-agent orchestrations.\"\n\n### 3. LinkedIn Style\n\n**Use when:** Writing professional content for LinkedIn—thought leadership, announcements, industry insights.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Hook in first line (appears before \"see more\")\n- Short paragraphs (1-2 sentences each)\n- Line breaks between paragraphs for mobile readability\n- Personal angle or story\n- Call-to-action or question at the end\n- Strategic use of emojis (sparingly, professionally)\n- 1300 characters ideal, 3000 max\n\n**Structure:**\n\n```\n[Hook line that creates curiosity]\n\n[Personal context or story - 2-3 short paragraphs]\n\n[Key insight or lesson - bulleted if multiple points]\n\n[Call-to-action or engaging question]\n\n#relevanthashtags (3-5 max)\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n> Most AI features never make it to production.\n>\n> Not because the models aren''t good enough.\n>\n> Because teams build for demos, not for users.\n>\n> After shipping 50+ AI features, here''s what actually matters:\n>\n> → Start with the simplest possible implementation\n> → Measure what users do, not what they say\n> → Treat AI like any other code: test it, monitor it, iterate\n>\n> What''s the biggest lesson you''ve learned shipping AI?\n\n### 4. X/Twitter Style\n\n**Use when:** Writing for X/Twitter—quick insights, hot takes, thread explainers, engagement posts.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Punchy, high-signal first tweet\n- No filler words\n- Threads: numbered, each tweet standalone valuable\n- Contrarian takes perform well\n- Code snippets or visuals boost engagement\n- 280 characters per tweet, threads typically 5-15 tweets\n\n**Thread structure:**\n\n```\n1/ [Bold claim or hook]\n\n2/ [Context or \"here''s why\"]\n\n3-N/ [Key points, one per tweet]\n\nN+1/ [Takeaway or call-to-action]\n\n[Optional: link to longer content]\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n> Unpopular opinion: RAG is overengineered for most use cases.\n>\n> A well-crafted system prompt often outperforms a poorly designed RAG pipeline.\n>\n> Thread on when to use (and skip) RAG 🧵\n\n### 5. Simplified Technical Style\n\n**Use when:** Writing accessible technical content for broader audiences—explainers, introductions, \"what is X\" posts.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Start with the \"why it matters\" not the \"what it is\"\n- Analogies to familiar concepts\n- Avoid jargon or define it immediately\n- Progressive complexity (simple → detailed)\n- Concrete examples before abstract explanations\n\n**Example opening:**\n\n> Every time you ask ChatGPT a question, something interesting happens behind the scenes. The AI doesn''t just \"know\" the answer—it builds one, word by word, based on patterns it learned from millions of conversations.\n\n### 6. Tutorial Style\n\n**Use when:** Writing step-by-step guides, how-tos, implementation walkthroughs.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Clear prerequisites upfront\n- Numbered steps\n- Code blocks with comments\n- \"What you''ll learn\" summary\n- Troubleshooting section\n- Working example at the end\n\n**Structure:**\n\n```\n## What You''ll Build\n[One sentence + screenshot/diagram]\n\n## Prerequisites\n[Bulleted list]\n\n## Steps\n### Step 1: [Action verb]\n[Explanation + code]\n\n### Step 2: ...\n\n## Troubleshooting\n[Common issues + solutions]\n\n## Next Steps\n[Where to go from here]\n```\n\n### 7. Announcement Style\n\n**Use when:** Announcing features, releases, milestones, company news.\n\n**Characteristics:**\n\n- Lead with the news, not the backstory\n- What it is → Why it matters → How to use it\n- Keep it concise\n- Clear call-to-action\n- Links to more detailed content\n\n**Example:**\n\n> We just shipped streaming support for Deep Agent.\n>\n> Now you can see your agent''s thinking in real-time—tool calls, responses, everything—as it happens.\n>\n> Why it matters: Debugging agent loops is 10x easier when you can watch them run.\n>\n> Try it: `createDeepAgent({ model, onEvent: console.log })`\n\n## Writing Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Style\n\nAsk these questions:\n\n1. Where will this be published?\n2. Who is the primary audience?\n3. What action should readers take after reading?\n4. How much time will readers spend on this?\n\n### Step 2: Load Style Reference\n\nFor Deep Technical style, load `references/deep-technical-style.md` for detailed guidance including:\n\n- 7 opening hook patterns with examples\n- 5 argumentative structures\n- 10+ rhetorical techniques\n- 8 recurring themes to weave throughout\n- Sentence-level craft patterns\n- Pre-publication checklist\n\nFor other styles, refer to the characteristics above.\n\n### Step 3: Draft with Style Constraints\n\nApply the chosen style''s characteristics from the start. Don''t write generically then \"style\" it later—the style should inform structure, not just tone.\n\n### Step 4: Review Against Style Checklist\n\nEach style has implicit requirements. Before finalizing:\n\n**Karpathy Style:**\n\n- [ ] First-person, conversational voice?\n- [ ] Opens with personal experience or intriguing premise?\n- [ ] Honest about limitations (\"This might be wrong, but...\")?\n- [ ] Progressive complexity (simple → detailed)?\n- [ ] Contains dry wit or memorable lines?\n- [ ] Pragmatic advice, not theoretical?\n\n**Deep Technical Style:**\n\n- [ ] Contrarian or surprising opening?\n- [ ] Specific numbers/examples?\n- [ ] Clear position taken?\n- [ ] Explains \"why\" not just \"what\"?\n- [ ] Subheadings as mini-arguments?\n- [ ] Active voice throughout?\n\n**LinkedIn Style:**\n\n- [ ] Hook visible before \"see more\"?\n- [ ] Mobile-friendly spacing?\n- [ ] Personal angle included?\n- [ ] Ends with engagement prompt?\n\n**X/Twitter Style:**\n\n- [ ] First tweet standalone compelling?\n- [ ] Each tweet <280 chars?\n- [ ] No filler words?\n- [ ] Thread numbered clearly?\n\n## AI Slop Avoidance\n\n**Critical:** All content must avoid patterns that signal AI-generated text. Load `references/ai-slop-avoidance.md` for comprehensive guidance.\n\n### Quick Reference: Words to Ban\n\nNever use these overused AI words:\n\n| Category | Banned Words |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **Verbs** | delve, embark, unleash, harness, unlock, navigate, revolutionize, foster, elevate |\n| **Adjectives** | vibrant, bustling, intricate, pivotal, crucial, cutting-edge, robust, seamless, meticulous |\n| **Nouns** | tapestry, realm, landscape, paradigm, synergy, beacon, testament, game-changer |\n| **Phrases** | \"it''s important to note\", \"in today''s digital age\", \"dive into\", \"at its core\", \"a myriad of\" |\n\n### Quick Reference: Patterns to Avoid\n\n| Pattern | Problem | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| **Em-dashes (—)** | Strong AI signal, ban entirely | Use commas, parentheses, periods (hyphens/en-dashes OK) |\n| Uniform sentences | All ~25-30 words | Mix 5-word punches with 40-word explanations |\n| Excessive hedging | \"might\", \"arguably\", \"perhaps\" | Take clear positions |\n| Immediate lists | Jump to bullets without narrative | Build tension first |\n| Perfect grammar | Zero typos feels robotic | Occasional imperfection is human |\n| Balanced both-sides | Artificial neutrality | Take a stance |\n\n### AI Slop Checklist (Apply to All Content)\n\n- [ ] Zero banned words from the list above?\n- [ ] **Zero em-dashes (—) in the entire piece?**\n- [ ] Sentence lengths vary dramatically (some <10 words, some >35)?\n- [ ] Contains specific names, numbers, dates?\n- [ ] Has personal voice or anecdotes?\n- [ ] Takes clear positions without excessive hedging?\n- [ ] Avoids \"In conclusion\" / \"To summarize\" closings?\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/\n\n- `karpathy-style.md` - Guide for writing in Andrej Karpathy''s conversational, pragmatic technical style with blog post patterns, tweet patterns, and recurring themes\n- `deep-technical-style.md` - Comprehensive guide for opinion-forward technical blog posts with detailed examples, rhetorical techniques, and pre-publication checklist\n- `ai-slop-avoidance.md` - Detailed guide to avoiding AI-generated content patterns\n\n## Extending This Skill\n\nTo add new writing styles:\n\n1. Analyze 5-10 examples of the target style\n2. Extract patterns: opening hooks, structure, tone, length constraints\n3. Create a reference file in `references/[style-name]-style.md`\n4. Add the style to the decision tree and Available Styles section\n5. Include a checklist for that style in the Review step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:25:35.894Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced content generation capabilities across multiple platforms.","zh":"适合像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要在多个平台上具备高级内容生成能力。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しており、複数のプラットフォームで高度なコンテンツ生成機能を必要とする。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 오토 GPT 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 여러 플랫폼에서 고급 콘텐츠 생성 기능을 필요로 함.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de contenido en múltiples plataformas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de génération de contenu avancées sur plusieurs plateformes.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Inhaltsgenerierungsfähigkeiten auf mehreren Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de conteúdo em várias plataformas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации контента на нескольких платформах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى возможات متقدمة لإنشاء المحتوى عبر منصات متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically generate high-quality content in various styles, including deep technical blog posts and social media content, using Vercel''s AI SDK v6, and applying consistent writing styles based on the task and platform.","zh":"赋予代理生成各种样式的高质量内容的能力，包括深度技术博客文章和社交媒体内容，使用 Vercel 的 AI SDK v6，并根据任务和平台应用一致的写作风格。","ja":"Vercel の AI SDK v6 を使用し、タスクとプラットフォームに応じて一貫した書き言葉を適用して、深い技術ブログ記事やソーシャルメディアコンテンツなどの様々なスタイルの高品質コンテンツを動的に生成する能力をエージェントに与える。","ko":"에이전트가 다양한 스타일의 고품질 콘텐츠를 동적으로 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, 이는 Vercel의 AI SDK v6를 사용하여 수행되며, 작업 및 플랫폼에 따라 일관된 작성 스타일을 적용하여 심층 기술 블로그 게시물 및 소셜 미디어 콘텐츠와 같은 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있음.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar dinámicamente contenido de alta calidad en varios estilos, incluyendo publicaciones de blog técnicas profundas y contenido de redes sociales, utilizando el SDK de IA de Vercel v6 y aplicando estilos de escritura coherentes en función de la tarea y la plataforma.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer dynamiquement du contenu de haute qualité dans différents styles, notamment des billets de blog techniques approfondis et du contenu de réseaux sociaux, en utilisant le SDK IA de Vercel v6 et en appliquant des styles d''écriture cohérents en fonction de la tâche et de la plateforme.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertigen Inhalt in verschiedenen Stilen dynamisch zu generieren, einschließlich tiefer technischer Blog-Beiträge und sozialer Medieninhalte, unter Verwendung des Vercel AI-SDK v6 und unter Anwendung konsistenter Schreibstile basierend auf der Aufgabe und der Plattform.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar dinamicamente conteúdo de alta qualidade em vários estilos, incluindo posts de blog técnicos profundos e conteúdo de mídia social, usando o SDK de IA da Vercel v6 e aplicando estilos de escrita consistentes com base na tarefa e plataforma.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью динамически генерировать контент высокого качества в различных стилях, включая глубокие технические блог-посты и контент социальных сетей, используя AI SDK Vercel v6 и применяя последовательные стили написания на основе задачи и платформы.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد المحتوى عالي الجودة بشكل ديناميكي في各种 الأساليب، بما في ذلك المنشورات التكنولوجية على 블وق العميقة والمحتوى على وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية، باستخدام SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي من Vercel v6 وتطبيق أساليب الكتابة المتسقة بناءً على المهمة والمنصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating technical blog posts for LinkedIn","Creating social media content for X/Twitter","Producing tutorials with adaptive writing styles"],"zh":["为 LinkedIn 生成技术博客文章","为 X/Twitter 创建社交媒体内容","使用自适应写作风格生成教程"],"ja":["LinkedIn 用の技術ブログ記事を生成する","X/Twitter 用のソーシャルメディアコンテンツを作成する","適応型書き言葉を使用してチュートリアルを生成する"],"ko":["링크드인용 기술 블로그 게시물 생성","X/트위터용 소셜 미디어 콘텐츠 생성","적응형 작성 스타일을 사용하여 튜토리얼 생성"],"es":["Generar publicaciones de blog técnicas para LinkedIn","Crear contenido de redes sociales para X/Twitter","Producir tutoriales con estilos de escritura adaptativos"],"fr":["Générer des billets de blog techniques pour LinkedIn","Créer du contenu de réseaux sociaux pour X/Twitter","Produire des didacticiels avec des styles d''écriture adaptatifs"],"de":["Erstellung technischer Blog-Beiträge für LinkedIn","Erstellen von sozialen Medieninhalten für X/Twitter","Erzeugen von Tutorien mit adaptiven Schreibstilen"],"pt":["Gerar posts de blog técnicos para LinkedIn","Criar conteúdo de mídia social para X/Twitter","Produzir tutoriais com estilos de escrita adaptáveis"],"ru":["Генерировать технические блог-посты для LinkedIn","Создавать контент социальных сетей для X/Twitter","Производить учебные пособия с адаптивными стилями написания"],"ar":["توليد منشورات بلوق تقنية لموقع LinkedIn","إنشاء محتوى لوسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية لموقع X/تويتر","إنتاج دروس تعليمية بأساليب كتابة متكيفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel''s AI SDK v6","Dependent on task and platform analysis for style selection"],"zh":["需要 Vercel 的 AI SDK v6","依赖于任务和平台分析来选择样式"],"ja":["Vercel の AI SDK v6 が必要","スタイルの選択にはタスクとプラットフォームの分析に依存する"],"ko":["Vercel의 AI SDK v6 필요","스타일 선택에 작업 및 플랫폼 분석에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el SDK de IA de Vercel v6","Dependiente del análisis de tarea y plataforma para la selección de estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK IA de Vercel v6","Dépend de l''analyse de tâche et de plateforme pour la sélection de style"],"de":["Benötigt das Vercel AI-SDK v6","Abhängig von der Aufgaben- und Plattformanalyse für die Stilwahl"],"pt":["Exige o SDK de IA da Vercel v6","Depende da análise da tarefa e plataforma para seleção de estilo"],"ru":["Требует AI SDK Vercel v6","Зависит от анализа задачи и платформы для выбора стиля"],"ar":["يتطلب SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي من Vercel v6","يعتمد على تحليل المهمة والمنصة لاختيار الأسلوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
