iption":{"zh":"Duit Maintainer 是一个 Golang DSL，用于 Duit 框架，提供驱动 UI 工具包的功能","ja":"Duit Maintainer は、Duit フレームワーク用の Golang DSL であり、駆動 UI ツールキットを提供する","ko":"Duit Maintainer는 Duit 프레임워크를 위한 Golang DSL로,駆動 UI 툴킷을 제공합니다","es":"Duit Maintainer es un DSL de Golang para el framework Duit, que permite crear widgets personalizados para Flutter de manera eficiente","fr":"Duit Maintainer est un DSL Golang pour le framework Duit, qui permet de créer des widgets personnalisés pour Flutter de manière efficace","de":"Duit Maintainer ist ein Golang-DSL für das Duit-Framework, mit dem Sie benutzerdefinierte Widgets für Flutter effizient erstellen können","pt":"O Duit Maintainer é uma DSL em Golang para o framework Duit, permitindo a criação de widgets personalizados para Flutter","ru":"Duit Maintainer - это DSL на Golang для фреймворка Duit, позволяющая создавать пользовательские виджеты для Flutter","ar":"Duit Maintainer هو DSL في Golang لصندوق أدوات Duit ، مما يسمح بإنشاء أدوات مخصصة لFlutter","en":"Golang DSL for Duit Framework - drived UI toolkit for Flutter"},"definition":{"en":"Golang DSL for Duit Framework - drived UI toolkit for Flutter"},"features":{"zh":["创建自定义 Flutter 小部件","简化 UI 开发流程","提供驱动 UI 工具包","支持 Golang DSL","易于使用"],"ja":["カスタム Flutter ウィジェットの作成","UI 開発プロセスの簡素化","駆動 UI ツールキットの提供","Golang DSL のサポート","使いやすい"],"ko":["커스텀 Flutter 위젯 생성","UI 개발 프로세스 단순화","駆動 UI 툴킷 제공","Golang DSL 지원","사용하기 쉽습니다"],"es":["Creación de estructuras de atributos personalizados","Implementación de nuevos tipos de widgets","Generación de código automática","Integración con Flutter","Desarrollo de widgets personalizados"],"fr":["Création de structures d''attributs personnalisés","Implémentation de nouveaux types de widgets","Génération de code automatique","Intégration avec Flutter","Développement de widgets personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Attributstrukturen","Implementierung neuer Widget-Typen","Automatische Codegenerierung","Integration mit Flutter","Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Widgets"],"pt":["Criação de atributos personalizados","Adição de tipos de widgets","Geração de código automática","Implementação de testes","Integração com o framework Duit"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских атрибутов","Добавление типов виджетов","Автоматическая генерация кода","Реализация тестов","Интеграция с фреймворком Duit"],"ar":["إنشاء سمات مخصصة","إضافة أنواع أدوات","توليد الكود التلقائي","تنفيذ الاختبارات","التكامل مع صندوق أدوات Duit"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Duit Maintainer","Flutter","UI 工具包","Golang DSL","自定义小部件","UI 开发"],"ja":["Duit Maintainer","Flutter","UI ツールキット","Golang DSL","カスタムウィジェット","UI 開発"],"ko":["Duit Maintainer","Flutter","UI 툴킷","Golang DSL","커스텀 위젯","UI 개발"],"es":["Duit Maintainer","Golang DSL","Duit Framework","Flutter","widgets personalizados","desarrollo de interfaz de usuario","lenguaje de definición de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Duit Maintainer","DSL Golang","Duit Framework","Flutter","widgets personnalisés","développement d''interface utilisateur","langage de définition d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Duit Maintainer","Golang-DSL","Duit Framework","Flutter","benutzerdefinierte Widgets","Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen","Benutzeroberflächen-Definitionssprache"],"pt":["Duit Maintainer","Golang","Flutter","DSL","widgets personalizados","framework Duit","desenvolvimento de software","programação"],"ru":["Duit Maintainer","Golang","Flutter","DSL","пользовательские виджеты","фреймворк Duit","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование"],"ar":["Duit Maintainer","Golang","Flutter","DSL","أدوات مخصصة","صندوق أدوات Duit","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة"]}},"owner":"Duit-Foundation","repo":"duit_go","repoPath":"Duit-Foundation/duit_go","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"duit-maintainer","description":"Implements new Flutter widgets following Duit project patterns, conducts code reviews, writes tests, and enforces coding conventions. Use when implementing new widget functionality, reviewing Flutter widget code, or maintaining the Duit library.","bodyPreview":"# Duit Maintainer\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen implementing a new Flutter widget for the Duit library, follow this workflow:\n\n1. Create attributes structure in `pkg/duit_attributes/`\n2. Add widget type to `pkg/duit_core/element_type.go`\n3. Add widget function in `pkg/duit_widget/`\n4. Run code generation: `make gogen`\n5. Write tests if required\n\n## Widget Implementation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Create Attributes Structure\n\nCreate a new file in `pkg/duit_attributes/` named `{widget_name}_attributes.go`:\n\n``","body":"# Duit Maintainer\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen implementing a new Flutter widget for the Duit library, follow this workflow:\n\n1. Create attributes structure in `pkg/duit_attributes/`\n2. Add widget type to `pkg/duit_core/element_type.go`\n3. Add widget function in `pkg/duit_widget/`\n4. Run code generation: `make gogen`\n5. Write tests if required\n\n## Widget Implementation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Create Attributes Structure\n\nCreate a new file in `pkg/duit_attributes/` named `{widget_name}_attributes.go`:\n\n```go\npackage duit_attributes\n\nimport (\n    \"errors\"\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_utils\"\n)\n\n// WidgetNameAttributes defines attributes for WidgetName widget.\n// See: https://api.flutter.dev/flutter/widgets/WidgetName-class.html\ntype WidgetNameAttributes struct {\n    *ValueReferenceHolder `gen:\"wrap\"`\n    *ThemeConsumer        `gen:\"wrap\"`\n    Property1             duit_utils.Tristate[bool] `json:\"property1,omitempty\"`\n    Property2             string                     `json:\"property2,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// NewWidgetNameAttributes creates a new WidgetNameAttributes instance.\nfunc NewWidgetNameAttributes() *WidgetNameAttributes {\n    return &WidgetNameAttributes{}\n}\n\n// SetProperty1 sets the property1 and returns WidgetNameAttributes for method chaining.\nfunc (r *WidgetNameAttributes) SetProperty1(property1 bool) *WidgetNameAttributes {\n    r.Property1 = duit_utils.BoolValue(property1)\n    return r\n}\n\n// SetProperty2 sets the property2 and returns WidgetNameAttributes for method chaining.\nfunc (r *WidgetNameAttributes) SetProperty2(property2 string) *WidgetNameAttributes {\n    r.Property2 = property2\n    return r\n}\n\n//bindgen:exclude\nfunc (r *WidgetNameAttributes) Validate() error {\n    if err := r.ValueReferenceHolder.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return err\n    }\n\n    if err := r.ThemeConsumer.Validate(); err != nil {\n        return err\n    }\n\n    if r.Property1 == nil {\n        return errors.New(\"property1 is required\")\n    }\n\n    return nil\n}\n```\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Use `*ValueReferenceHolder` with `gen:\"wrap\"` tag\n- Use `*ThemeConsumer` with `gen:\"wrap\"` tag\n- Use `duit_utils.Tristate[T]` for optional boolean properties\n- Add `json:\"propertyName,omitempty\"` tag for all fields\n- Method receiver must be named `r`\n- Add `//bindgen:exclude` comment to `Validate()` method\n- Documentation must be in English\n\n### Step 2: Add Widget Type\n\nAdd a constant to `pkg/duit_core/element_type.go`:\n\n```go\nconst (\n    // ... existing types\n    WidgetName DuitElementType = \"WidgetName\"\n)\n```\n\nFollow naming convention: Use PascalCase with no spaces or underscores.\n\n### Step 3: Add Widget Function\n\nCreate a new file in `pkg/duit_widget/` named `{widget_name}.go`:\n\n```go\npackage duit_widget\n\nimport (\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_attributes\"\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_core\"\n)\n\n/*\nExample:\n    WidgetName(\n        duit_attributes.NewWidgetNameAttributes().\n            SetProperty1(true).\n            SetProperty2(\"value\"),\n        \"id\",\n        false,\n        nil,\n    )\n*/\nfunc WidgetName(attributes *duit_attributes.WidgetNameAttributes, id string, controlled bool, child *duit_core.DuitElementModel) *duit_core.DuitElementModel {\n    checkAttributes(attributes)\n    return new(duit_core.DuitElementModel).CreateElement(duit_core.WidgetName, id, \"\", attributes, nil, controlled, 1, nil, child)\n}\n```\n\n**Function signature patterns:**\n\n- **Single child**: `func WidgetName(attributes *Attrs, id string, controlled bool, child *DuitElementModel) *DuitElementModel`\n- **Multiple children**: `func WidgetName(attributes *Attrs, id string, controlled bool, children []*DuitElementModel) *DuitElementModel`\n- **Optional child**: `func WidgetName(attributes *Attrs, id string, child *DuitElementModel) *DuitElementModel`\n\n**CreateElement parameters:**\n\n1. Widget type constant\n2. ID string\n3. Tag string (empty for most widgets)\n4. Attributes\n5. Commands (nil for most widgets)\n6. Controlled boolean\n7. Children count (use 2 for widgets with optional child like Visibility)\n8. Nil (reserved)\n9. Children (variadic)\n\n**Rules:**\n\n- Always call `checkAttributes(attributes)` to validate\n- Use `new(DuitElementModel).CreateElement(...)`\n- Add example usage in comment\n\n### Step 4: Run Code Generation\n\n```bash\nmake gogen\n```\n\nThis generates embedded struct delegates and other boilerplate code.\n\n### Step 5: Write Tests\n\nOnly write tests when explicitly required. When required, create `{widget_name}_attributes_test.go` in `pkg/duit_attributes/`:\n\n```go\npackage duit_attributes_test\n\nimport (\n    \"testing\"\n\n    \"github.com/Duit-Foundation/duit_go/v4/pkg/duit_attributes\"\n)\n\nfunc TestWidgetNameAttributes_Validate_ValidAttributes(t *testing.T) {\n    attrs := &duit_attributes.WidgetNameAttributes{\n        Property1: duit_utils.BoolValue(true),\n    }\n\n    err := attrs.Validate()\n    if err != nil {\n        t.Fatal(\"expected no error for valid attributes, got:\", err)\n    }\n}\n\nfunc TestWidgetNameAttributes_Validate_MissingRequiredProperty(t *testing.T) {\n    attrs := &duit_attributes.WidgetNameAttributes{\n        Property1: nil, // missing required property\n    }\n\n    err := attrs.Validate()\n    if err == nil {\n        t.Fatal(\"expected error for missing required property\")\n    }\n}\n\nfunc TestWidgetNameAttributes_SetProperty1(t *testing.T) {\n    attrs := duit_attributes.NewWidgetNameAttributes()\n    property1 := true\n\n    result := attrs.SetProperty1(property1)\n\n    if *attrs.Property1 != property1 {\n        t.Fatalf(\"expected Property1 to be %v, got: %v\", property1, attrs.Property1)\n    }\n\n    if result != attrs {\n        t.Fatal(\"expected SetProperty1 to return same instance for method chaining\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Testing rules:**\n\n- Test filename: `{target_file}_test.go`\n- Only test properties explicitly used in structure''s methods\n- Always test `Tristate[T]` properties for JSON serialization\n- Never check error text, only check if error exists\n- Never cover embedded fields or embedded structs\n- Test setter methods return same instance for chaining\n\n## Code Review Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing widget implementations, check:\n\n- [ ] Receiver name is `r` for all structure methods\n- [ ] Documentation is in English\n- [ ] Method chaining returns same instance (`return r`)\n- [ ] Required properties validated in `Validate()` method\n- [ ] `Validate()` has `//bindgen:exclude` comment\n- [ ] `checkAttributes()` called in widget function\n- [ ] Widget type follows naming convention (PascalCase)\n- [ ] Attributes use appropriate types (`Tristate[T]` for optionals)\n- [ ] JSON tags use `omitempty` suffix\n- [ ] Example usage comment present in widget file\n- [ ] Nil checks for potentially nil receivers before method calls\n\n## Coding Conventions\n\n### Style Rules\n\nFrom `pkg/.cursor/rules/style.mdc`:\n\n1. Method receiver name must always be \"r\"\n2. Documentation must be in English\n3. Explicit nil checks for potentially nil receivers\n\n### Testing Rules\n\nFrom `pkg/.cursor/rules/testing.mdc`:\n\n1. Never cover embedded fields or embedded structs with tests\n2. Always add tests for `Tristate[T]` properties (JSON serialization)\n3. Test filename: `{target_file}_test.go`\n4. Only test properties explicitly used in structure''s methods\n5. Never check error text, only check if error exists\n\n### Flutter Documentation Reference\n\nAlways reference official Flutter documentation in attributes structure:\n\n```go\n// See: https://api.flutter.dev/flutter/widgets/WidgetName-class.html\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Required Properties\n\n```go\nif r.RequiredProperty == nil {\n    return errors.New(\"requiredProperty is required\")\n}\n```\n\n### Optional Properties (Tristate)\n\n```go\ntype WidgetAttributes struct {\n    OptionalProperty duit_utils.Tristate[bool] `json:\"optionalProperty,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// SetOptionalProperty sets the optional property.\nfunc (r *WidgetAttributes) SetOptionalProperty(optional bool) *WidgetAttributes {\n    r.OptionalProperty = duit_utils.BoolValue(optional)\n    return r\n}\n```\n\n### String Properties\n\n```go\ntype WidgetAttributes struct {\n    TextProperty string `json:\"textProperty,omitempty\"`\n}\n\n// SetTextProperty sets the text property.\nfunc (r *WidgetAttributes) SetTextProperty(text string) *WidgetAttributes {\n    r.TextProperty = text\n    return r\n}\n```\n\n### Nil-Safe Method Calls\n\n```go\nfunc SomeFunction(widget *DuitElementModel) {\n    if widget == nil {\n        return\n    }\n    widget.SomeMethod()\n}\n```\n\n## Makefile Commands\n\n```bash\n# Generate code\nmake gogen\n\n# Run tests\nmake test\n\n# Run vet\nmake vet\n```\n\nAlways run `make gogen` after adding new widgets.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Code generation fails\n\n- Check that `gen:\"wrap\"` tags are present for embedded structs\n- Verify attribute struct has no syntax errors\n- Ensure all referenced types are imported\n\n### Tests fail\n\n- Check that required properties are set in test\n- Verify Tristate properties are tested for JSON serialization\n- Ensure error checks don''t compare error text\n\n### Widget not recognized\n\n- Verify type is added to `element_type.go`\n- Check type name matches exactly in widget function\n- Run `make gogen` to regenerate delegates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:25:59.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Flutter Development Agents requiring customized UI toolkit integration with Golang DSL","zh":"适用于需要自定义UI工具包集成Golang DSL的Flutter开发代理","ja":"Flutter開発エージェントがカスタマイズされたUIツールキットをGolang DSLと統合する必要がある場合に иде的な","ko":"Golang DSL과 통합된 사용자 지정 UI 툴킷이 필요한 Flutter 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Flutter que requieren una integración personalizada de la herramienta de interfaz de usuario con Golang DSL","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Flutter nécessitant une intégration d''outils d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec Golang DSL","de":"Ideal für Flutter-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine angepasste Integration von UI-Toolkit mit Golang-DSL erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Flutter que exigem integração personalizada de kit de interface do usuário com DSL Golang","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Flutter, требующих настраиваемой интеграции набора инструментов интерфейса пользователя с DSL Golang","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير Flutter الذي يتطلب تكامل أداة واجهة مستخدم مخصصة مع DSL Golang"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate customized Flutter widgets using the Duit Framework, leveraging Golang''s DSL for streamlined UI development, and integrating with protocols like code generation via ''make gogen''","zh":"赋予代理生成使用Duit框架的自定义Flutter小部件的能力，利用Golang的DSL进行流畅的UI开发，并集成代码生成等协议，如''make gogen''","ja":"Duitフレームワークを使用してカスタマイズされたFlutterウィジェットを生成するエージェントの能力を付与し、GolangのDSLを使用してUI開発をストリームライン化し、コード生成などのプロトコルを''integration via make gogen''とともに統合する","ko":"Duit 프레임워크를 사용하여 사용자 지정 Flutter 위젯을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Golang의 DSL을 사용하여 UI 개발을 간소화하고, 코드 생성과 같은 프로토콜을 ''make gogen''을 통해 통합","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar widgets personalizados de Flutter utilizando el marco Duit, aprovechando el DSL de Golang para un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario optimizado e integrándose con protocolos como la generación de código a través de ''make gogen''","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des widgets Flutter personnalisés en utilisant le framework Duit, en exploitant le DSL de Golang pour un développement d''interface utilisateur rationalisé et en s''intégrant avec des protocoles tels que la génération de code via ''make gogen''","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Flutter-Widgets mit dem Duit-Framework zu generieren, indem es Golangs DSL für ein optimiertes UI-Entwicklungsprozess nutzt und sich in Protokolle wie Codegenerierung über ''make gogen'' integriert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar widgets Flutter personalizados usando o Framework Duit, aproveitando o DSL do Golang para desenvolvimento de UI simplificado e integrando com protocolos como geração de código via ''make gogen''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать настраиваемые виджеты Flutter с помощью фреймворка Duit, используя DSL Golang для упрощенного разработки интерфейса пользователя и интегрируя с протоколами, такими как генерация кода через ''make gogen''","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من生成 أدوات Flutter المخصصة باستخدام إطار Duit ، والاستفادة من DSL Golang لتطوير واجهة المستخدم المبسطة ، وتكاملها مع بروتوكولات مثل توليد الكود عبر ''make gogen''"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing new Flutter widgets for the Duit library","Generating widget attributes structures in ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","Creating widget functions in ''pkg/duit_widget/''"],"zh":["为Duit库实现新的Flutter小部件","在''pkg/duit_attributes/''中生成小部件属性结构","在''pkg/duit_widget/''中创建小部件函数"],"ja":["Duitライブラリの新しいFlutterウィジェットを実装する","''pkg/duit_attributes/''でウィジェット属性構造を生成する","''pkg/duit_widget/''でウィジェット関数を作成する"],"ko":["Duit 라이브러리의 새로운 Flutter 위젯을 구현","''pkg/duit_attributes/''에서 위젯 속성 구조를 생성","''pkg/duit_widget/''에서 위젯 함수를 생성"],"es":["Implementar nuevos widgets de Flutter para la biblioteca Duit","Generar estructuras de atributos de widget en ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","Crear funciones de widget en ''pkg/duit_widget/''"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre de nouveaux widgets Flutter pour la bibliothèque Duit","Générer des structures d''attributs de widget dans ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","Créer des fonctions de widget dans ''pkg/duit_widget/''"],"de":["Implementierung neuer Flutter-Widgets für die Duit-Bibliothek","Erzeugen von Widget-Attribut-Strukturen in ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","Erstellen von Widget-Funktionen in ''pkg/duit_widget/''"],"pt":["Implementar novos widgets Flutter para a biblioteca Duit","Gerar estruturas de atributos de widget em ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","Criar funções de widget em ''pkg/duit_widget/''"],"ru":["Реализация новых виджетов Flutter для библиотеки Duit","Генерация структур атрибутов виджетов в ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","Создание функций виджетов в ''pkg/duit_widget/''"],"ar":["تنفيذ أدوات Flutter الجديدة لمكتبة Duit","توليد هياكل سمات الأداة في ''pkg/duit_attributes/''","إنشاء دوال الأداة في ''pkg/duit_widget/''"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Golang and Flutter setup","Limited to Duit Framework and Flutter ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Golang和Flutter设置","仅限于Duit框架和Flutter生态系统"],"ja":["GolangとFlutterの設定が必要","DuitフレームワークとFlutterエコシステムのみに限定される"],"ko":["Golang과 Flutter 설정이 필요","Duit 프레임워크와 Flutter 생태계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Golang y Flutter","Limitado al marco Duit y al ecosistema Flutter"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Golang et Flutter","Limité au framework Duit et à l''écosystème Flutter"],"de":["Benötigt Golang- und Flutter-Setup","Begrenzt auf Duit-Framework und Flutter-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Golang e Flutter","Limitado ao Framework Duit e ao ecossistema Flutter"],"ru":["Требует настройки Golang и Flutter","Ограничен фреймворком Duit и экосистемой Flutter"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Golang و Flutter","محدود بإطار Duit وبيئة Flutter"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
