зработка GIF"],"ar":["اسلاك جيف كريتور","صور GIF متحركة","تحسين لاسلاك","أبعاد صورة GIF","معايير صورة GIF","بايثون لصورة GIF","مكتبة بي آي إل","تطوير صورة GIF"]}},"owner":"noammarom609","repo":"archiflow-independent","repoPath":"noammarom609/archiflow-independent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:26:37.464Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing optimized GIF creation for Slack platforms.","zh":"非常适合需要为Slack平台优化GIF创建的视觉内容代理。","ja":"Slackプラットフォームの最適化されたGIF作成を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Slack 플랫폼을 위한 최적화된 GIF 생성이 필요한 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido visual que necesitan la creación de GIF optimizados para plataformas de Slack.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel ayant besoin de la création de GIF optimisés pour les plateformes Slack.","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die optimierte GIF-Erstellung für Slack-Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de criação de GIF otimizada para plataformas Slack.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Контент-агентов, которым необходима оптимизированная создание GIF для платформ Slack.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء GIF محسّن لمنصات Slack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate optimized animated GIFs using Python and the PIL library, with customizable parameters such as FPS, colors, and duration, ensuring seamless integration with Slack''s dimensions and file size requirements.","zh":"通过Python和PIL库赋予代理生成最优化的动画GIF的能力，具有可自定义的参数，如FPS、颜色和持续时间，确保与Slack的尺寸和文件大小要求的无缝集成。","ja":"PythonとPILライブラリを使用して、FPS、色、期間などのカスタマイズ可能なパラメータを使用して最適化されたアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントをEmpowersし、Slackの寸法とファイルサイズの要件とのシームレスな統合を保証します。","ko":"Python 및 PIL 라이브러리를 사용하여 FPS, 색상, 기간 등의 사용자 정의 가능한 매개 변수를 사용하여 최적화된 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하는 에이전트에게 권한을 부여하여 Slack의 크기 및 파일 크기 요구 사항과의 无缝한 통합을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIF animados optimizados utilizando Python y la biblioteca PIL, con parámetros personalizables como FPS, colores y duración, garantizando una integración sin problemas con los requisitos de dimensiones y tamaño de archivo de Slack.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIF animés optimisés en utilisant Python et la bibliothèque PIL, avec des paramètres personnalisables tels que FPS, couleurs et durée, assurant une intégration sans problème avec les exigences de dimensions et de taille de fichier de Slack.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, optimierte animierte GIFs mit Python und der PIL-Bibliothek zu erstellen, mit anpassbaren Parametern wie FPS, Farben und Dauer, und stellt so eine nahtlose Integration mit Slack''s Dimensionen- und Dateigrößenanforderungen sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar GIFs animados otimizados usando Python e a biblioteca PIL, com parâmetros personalizáveis como FPS, cores e duração, garantindo integração perfeita com as dimensões e requisitos de tamanho de arquivo do Slack.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать оптимизированные анимированные GIF, используя Python и библиотеку PIL, с настраиваемыми параметрами, такими как FPS, цвета и продолжительность, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию с размерами и требованиями к размеру файла Slack.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من生成 GIFs متحركة محسّنة باستخدام Python ومكتبة PIL، مع معلمات قابلة للتخصيص مثل FPS والألوان والمدة، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع أبعاد Slack ومتطلبات حجم الملف."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating emoji GIFs with recommended 128x128 dimensions","Creating message GIFs with 480x480 dimensions for Slack","Optimizing GIF file size by adjusting FPS and colors"],"zh":["生成推荐的128x128尺寸的表情符号GIF","为Slack创建480x480尺寸的消息GIF","通过调整FPS和颜色来优化GIF文件大小"],"ja":["推奨される128x128のサイズの絵文字GIFを生成する","Slack用に480x480のサイズのメッセージGIFを作成する","FPSと色を調整してGIFファイルサイズを最適化する"],"ko":["권장되는 128x128 크기의 이모티콘 GIF 생성","Slack용 480x480 크기의 메시지 GIF 생성","FPS 및 색상 조정을 통해 GIF 파일 크기 최적화"],"es":["Generar GIF de emojis con dimensiones recomendadas de 128x128","Crear GIF de mensajes con dimensiones de 480x480 para Slack","Optimizar el tamaño del archivo GIF ajustando FPS y colores"],"fr":["Générer des GIF d''émoticônes avec des dimensions recommandées de 128x128","Créer des GIF de messages avec des dimensions de 480x480 pour Slack","Optimiser la taille du fichier GIF en ajustant FPS et couleurs"],"de":["Erstellen von Emoji-GIFs mit empfohlenen Dimensionen von 128x128","Erstellen von Nachrichten-GIFs mit Dimensionen von 480x480 für Slack","Optimieren der GIF-Dateigröße durch Anpassen von FPS und Farben"],"pt":["Geração de GIFs de emojis com dimensões recomendadas de 128x128","Criação de GIFs de mensagens com dimensões de 480x480 para o Slack","Otimização do tamanho do arquivo GIF ajustando FPS e cores"],"ru":["Генерация GIF-изображений эмодзи с рекомендуемыми размерами 128x128","Создание GIF-изображений сообщений с размерами 480x480 для Slack","Оптимизация размера файла GIF путем регулировки FPS и цветов"],"ar":["توليد GIFs بالأشكال التعبيرية بأبعاد 128x128 الموصى بها","إنشاء GIFs للرسائل بأبعاد 480x480 لمنصة Slack","تحسين حجم ملف GIF عن طريق ضبط FPS والألوان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and PIL library","GIF duration limited to under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs","Specific dimensions required for Slack compatibility"],"zh":["需要Python和PIL库","表情符号GIF的持续时间限制在3秒以内","需要特定的尺寸以便与Slack兼容"],"ja":["PythonとPILライブラリが必要","絵文字GIFの期間は3秒以内に制限される","Slackとの互換性を保つために特定の寸法が必要"],"ko":["Python 및 PIL 라이브러리가 필요","이모티콘 GIF의 기간은 3초 이내로 제한","Slack와의 호환성을 유지하기 위해 특정 크기가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Python y la biblioteca PIL","La duración del GIF está limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIF de emojis","Se requieren dimensiones específicas para la compatibilidad con Slack"],"fr":["Nécessite Python et la bibliothèque PIL","La durée du GIF est limitée à moins de 3 secondes pour les GIF d''émoticônes","Des dimensions spécifiques sont requises pour la compatibilité avec Slack"],"de":["Benötigt Python und die PIL-Bibliothek","Die GIF-Dauer ist auf unter 3 Sekunden für Emoji-GIFs begrenzt","Spezifische Dimensionen sind für die Slack-Kompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer Python e biblioteca PIL","Duração do GIF limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emojis","Dimensões específicas necessárias para compatibilidade com o Slack"],"ru":["Требуется Python и библиотека PIL","Продолжительность GIF ограничена менее 3 секунд для GIF-изображений эмодзи","Требуются конкретные размеры для совместимости со Slack"],"ar":["يتطلب Python ومكتبة PIL","محدود مدة GIF إلى أقل من 3 ثوانٍ لملفات GIF بالأشكال التعبيرية","مطلوب أبعاد محددة للتوافق مع Slack"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
