sarrollo de juegos implica la aplicación de principios y herramientas para crear experiencias de juego inmersivas","fr":"Le développement de jeux implique l''application de principes et d''outils pour créer des expériences de jeu immersives","de":"Die Spiele-Entwicklung beinhaltet die Anwendung von Grundlagen und Werkzeugen, um immersive Spiel-Erlebnisse zu schaffen","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos envolve a aplicação de princípios e técnicas para criar experiências de jogo imersivas.","ru":"Разработка игр включает в себя применение принципов и техник для создания иммерсивных игровых trải nghiệm.","ar":"تطوير الألعاب ي涉ل تطبيق المبادئ والتقنيات لإنشاء تجارب لعب غامرة.","en":"LLM Agnostic Skills based on Anthropics Skills Framework"},"definition":{"en":"LLM Agnostic Skills based on Anthropics Skills Framework"},"features":{"zh":["顺序思考","复杂问题解决","游戏开发原则","路由到专门的子技能","核心原则"],"ja":["順序思考","複雑な問題解決","ゲーム開発の基本原則","専門のサブスキルへのルーティング","基本原則"],"ko":["순차적 사고","복잡한 문제 해결","게임 개발의 핵심 원칙","전문 서브 스킬로의 라우팅","핵심 원칙"],"es":["Principios básicos del desarrollo de juegos","Herramientas para la creación de juegos","Diseño de procesos y depuración","Pensamiento secuencial para la resolución de problemas","Acceso a sub-habilidades especializadas"],"fr":["Principes de base du développement de jeux","Outils pour la création de jeux","Conception de processus et débogage","Pensée séquentielle pour la résolution de problèmes","Accès à des sous-compétences spécialisées"],"de":["Grundlagen der Spiele-Entwicklung","Werkzeuge für die Erstellung von Spielen","Prozess-Design und Fehlersuche","Sequentielles Denken für die Lösung von Problemen","Zugriff auf spezialisierte Unterfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos","Técnicas de pensamento sequencial","Resolução de problemas complexos","Criação de experiências de jogo imersivas","Aplicação de técnicas de programação"],"ru":["Основы разработки игр","Техники последовательного мышления","Решение сложных проблем","Создание иммерсивных игровых trải nghiệm","Применение техник программирования"],"ar":["مبادئ تطوير الألعاب","تقنيات التفكير المتسلسل","حل المشكلات المعقدة","إنشاء تجارب لعب غامرة","تطبيق تقنيات البرمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发","顺序思考","复杂问题解决","游戏开发原则","路由到专门的子技能","核心原则","游戏开发技能"],"ja":["ゲーム開発","順序思考","複雑な問題解決","ゲーム開発の基本原則","専門のサブスキルへのルーティング","基本原則","ゲーム開発スキル"],"ko":["게임 개발","순차적 사고","복잡한 문제 해결","게임 개발의 핵심 원칙","전문 서브 스킬로의 라우팅","핵심 원칙","게임 개발 스킬"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos","creación de juegos","diseño de juegos","programación de juegos","herramientas de juego","principios de juego"],"fr":["développement de jeux","création de jeux","conception de jeux","programmation de jeux","outils de jeu","principes de jeu"],"de":["Spiele-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Spielen","Spiele-Design","Spiele-Programmierung","Spiele-Tools","Spiele-Grundlagen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos","técnicas de pensamento sequencial","resolução de problemas complexos","criação de experiências de jogo imersivas","programação de jogos"],"ru":["разработка игр","основы разработки игр","техники последовательного мышления","решение сложных проблем","создание иммерсивных игровых trải nghiệm","программирование игр"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب","مبادئ تطوير الألعاب","تقنيات التفكير المتسلسل","حل المشكلات المعقدة","إنشاء تجارب لعب غامرة","برمجة الألعاب"]}},"owner":"darthlinuxer","repo":"Agentic-Skills","repoPath":"darthlinuxer/Agentic-Skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-development","description":"Game development orchestrator. Routes to platform-specific skills based","bodyPreview":"# Game Development\n\n> **🧠 MCP Tool Available**: Use **Sequential Thinking** for complex problem-solving in this domain. Break down decisions, debug chains, or design processes into structured reasoning steps.\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---","body":"# Game Development\n\n> **🧠 MCP Tool Available**: Use **Sequential Thinking** for complex problem-solving in this domain. Break down decisions, debug chains, or design processes into structured reasoning steps.\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-games` |\n| Mobile (iOS, Android) | `game-development/mobile-games` |\n| PC (Steam, Desktop) | `game-development/pc-games` |\n| VR/AR headsets | `game-development/vr-ar` |\n\n### Dimension Selection\n\n| If the game is... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|-------------------|---------------|\n| 2D (sprites, tilemaps) | `game-development/2d-games` |\n| 3D (meshes, shaders) | `game-development/3d-games` |\n\n### Specialty Areas\n\n| If you need... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|----------------|---------------|\n| GDD, balancing, player psychology | `game-development/game-design` |\n| Multiplayer, networking | `game-development/multiplayer` |\n| Visual style, asset pipeline, animation | `game-development/game-art` |\n| Sound design, music, adaptive audio | `game-development/game-audio` |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles (All Platforms)\n\n### 1. The Game Loop\n\nEvery game, regardless of platform, follows this pattern:\n\n```\nINPUT  → Read player actions\nUPDATE → Process game logic (fixed timestep)\nRENDER → Draw the frame (interpolated)\n```\n\n**Fixed Timestep Rule:**\n- Physics/logic: Fixed rate (e.g., 50Hz)\n- Rendering: As fast as possible\n- Interpolate between states for smooth visuals\n\n---\n\n### 2. Pattern Selection Matrix\n\n| Pattern | Use When | Example |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| **State Machine** | 3-5 discrete states | Player: Idle→Walk→Jump |\n| **Object Pooling** | Frequent spawn/destroy | Bullets, particles |\n| **Observer/Events** | Cross-system communication | Health→UI updates |\n| **ECS** | Thousands of similar entities | RTS units, particles |\n| **Command** | Undo, replay, networking | Input recording |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Complex AI decisions | Enemy AI |\n\n**Decision Rule:** Start with State Machine. Add ECS only when performance demands.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Input Abstraction\n\nAbstract input into ACTIONS, not raw keys:\n\n```\n\"jump\"  → Space, Gamepad A, Touch tap\n\"move\"  → WASD, Left stick, Virtual joystick\n```\n\n**Why:** Enables multi-platform, rebindable controls.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Performance Budget (60 FPS = 16.67ms)\n\n| System | Budget |\n|--------|--------|\n| Input | 1ms |\n| Physics | 3ms |\n| AI | 2ms |\n| Game Logic | 4ms |\n| Rendering | 5ms |\n| Buffer | 1.67ms |\n\n**Optimization Priority:**\n1. Algorithm (O(n²) → O(n log n))\n2. Batching (reduce draw calls)\n3. Pooling (avoid GC spikes)\n4. LOD (detail by distance)\n5. Culling (skip invisible)\n\n---\n\n### 5. AI Selection by Complexity\n\n| AI Type | Complexity | Use When |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **FSM** | Simple | 3-5 states, predictable behavior |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Medium | Modular, designer-friendly |\n| **GOAP** | High | Emergent, planning-based |\n| **Utility AI** | High | Scoring-based decisions |\n\n---\n\n### 6. Collision Strategy\n\n| Type | Best For |\n|------|----------|\n| **AABB** | Rectangles, fast checks |\n| **Circle** | Round objects, cheap |\n| **Spatial Hash** | Many similar-sized objects |\n| **Quadtree** | Large worlds, varying sizes |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns (Universal)\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Update everything every frame | Use events, dirty flags |\n| Create objects in hot loops | Object pooling |\n| Cache nothing | Cache references |\n| Optimize without profiling | Profile first |\n| Mix input with logic | Abstract input layer |\n\n---\n\n## Routing Examples\n\n### Example 1: \"I want to make a browser-based 2D platformer\"\n→ Start with `game-development/web-games` for framework selection\n→ Then `game-development/2d-games` for sprite/tilemap patterns\n→ Reference `game-development/game-design` for level design\n\n### Example 2: \"Mobile puzzle game for iOS and Android\"\n→ Start with `game-development/mobile-games` for touch input and stores\n→ Use `game-development/game-design` for puzzle balancing\n\n### Example 3: \"Multiplayer VR shooter\"\n→ `game-development/vr-ar` for comfort and immersion\n→ `game-development/3d-games` for rendering\n→ `game-development/multiplayer` for networking\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Great games come from iteration, not perfection. Prototype fast, then polish.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:27:07.940Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured game development principles and sequential thinking for complex problem-solving","zh":"非常适合需要结构化游戏开发原则和顺序思考来解决复杂问题的AI代理","ja":"構造化されたゲーム開発の原則と複雑な問題解決のための順序思考が必要なAIエージェントに最適","ko":"구조화된 게임 개발 원칙과 복잡한 문제 해결을 위한 순차적 사고가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan principios de desarrollo de juegos estructurados y pensamiento secuencial para la resolución de problemas complejos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de principes de développement de jeux structurés et de pensée séquentielle pour la résolution de problèmes complexes","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die strukturierte Spielentwicklungsprinzipien und sequenzielles Denken für die Lösung komplexer Probleme benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos estruturados e pensamento sequencial para resolução de problemas complexos","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимы структурированные принципы разработки игр и последовательное мышление для решения сложных проблем","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى مبادئ تطوير الألعاب المنظمة والتفكير المتسلسل لحل المشكلات المعقدة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply core game development principles, leveraging sequential thinking to break down decisions, debug chains, or design processes into structured reasoning steps, utilizing skills like MCP Tool for complex problem-solving","zh":"使代理能够应用核心游戏开发原则，利用顺序思考将决策、调试链或设计过程分解为结构化的推理步骤，利用像MCP工具这样的技能来解决复杂问题","ja":"エージェントがコアゲーム開発の原則を適用できるようにし、順序思考を利用して、決定、デバッグチェーン、または設計プロセスを構造化された推論ステップに分解し、MCPツールのようなスキルを使用して複雑な問題を解決する","ko":"에이전트가 핵심 게임 개발 원칙을 적용할 수 있도록 하며, 순차적 사고를 활용하여 결정, 디버그 체인 또는 설계 프로세스를 구조화된 추론 단계로 분해하며, MCP 도구와 같은 기술을 사용하여 복잡한 문제를 해결","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar principios básicos de desarrollo de juegos, aprovechando el pensamiento secuencial para descomponer decisiones, cadenas de depuración o procesos de diseño en pasos de razonamiento estructurados, utilizando habilidades como la herramienta MCP para la resolución de problemas complejos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les principes fondamentaux de développement de jeux, en exploitant la pensée séquentielle pour décomposer les décisions, les chaînes de débogage ou les processus de conception en étapes de raisonnement structurées, en utilisant des compétences comme l''outil MCP pour la résolution de problèmes complexes","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kernprinzipien der Spielentwicklung anzuwenden, indem sie sequenzielles Denken nutzen, um Entscheidungen, Debug-Ketten oder Entwicklungsprozesse in strukturierte Denkschritte zu unterteilen, unter Nutzung von Fähigkeiten wie dem MCP-Tool für die Lösung komplexer Probleme","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar princípios básicos de desenvolvimento de jogos, aproveitando o pensamento sequencial para quebrar decisões, cadeias de depuração ou processos de design em etapas de raciocínio estruturado, utilizando habilidades como a Ferramenta MCP para resolução de problemas complexos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять основные принципы разработки игр, используя последовательное мышление для разбиения решений, цепочек отладки или процессов проектирования на структурированные шаги рассуждения, используя навыки, такие как инструмент MCP для решения сложных проблем","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق مبادئ أساسية لتطوير الألعاب، مستفيدة من التفكير المتسلسل لتقسيم القرارات أو سلاسل تصحيح الأخطاء أو عمليات التصميم إلى خطوات معقولة من التفكير المنظم، باستخدام مهارات مثل أداة MCP لحل المشكلات المعقدة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing game architectures","Debugging game logic chains","Developing structured game development processes"],"zh":["设计游戏架构","调试游戏逻辑链","开发结构化游戏开发流程"],"ja":["ゲームアーキテクチャの設計","ゲームロジックチェーンのデバッグ","構造化されたゲーム開発プロセスの開発"],"ko":["게임 아키텍처 설계","게임 로직 체인의 디버깅","구조화된 게임 개발 프로세스의 개발"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de juegos","Depurar cadenas de lógica de juegos","Desarrollar procesos de desarrollo de juegos estructurados"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de jeux","Déboguer des chaînes de logique de jeux","Développer des processus de développement de jeux structurés"],"de":["Spielarchitekturen entwerfen","Spiellogik-Ketten debuggen","Strukturierte Spielentwicklungsprozesse entwickeln"],"pt":["Projetar arquiteturas de jogos","Depurar cadeias de lógica de jogos","Desenvolver processos de desenvolvimento de jogos estruturados"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектуры игр","Отладка цепочек игровой логики","Разработка структурированных процессов разработки игр"],"ar":["تصميم هياكل الألعاب","تصحيح سلاسل المنطق اللعبة","تطوير عمليات تطوير الألعاب المنظمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP Tool availability","LLM Agnostic Skills framework compatibility"],"zh":["需要MCP工具的可用性","LLM Agnostic Skills框架的兼容性"],"ja":["MCPツールの可用性の必要性","LLM Agnostic Skillsフレームワークの互換性"],"ko":["MCP 도구의 가용성 필요","LLM Agnostic Skills 프레임워크의 호환성"],"es":["Requiere la disponibilidad de la herramienta MCP","Compatibilidad con el marco de habilidades agnóstico LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite la disponibilité de l''outil MCP","Compatibilité avec le cadre de compétences LLM agnostique"],"de":["Benötigt die Verfügbarkeit des MCP-Tools","Kompatibilität mit dem LLM-agnostischen Fähigkeitsframework"],"pt":["Requer disponibilidade da Ferramenta MCP","Compatibilidade com o framework de habilidades LLM Agnóstico"],"ru":["Требует наличия инструмента MCP","Совместимость с фреймворком навыков LLM Агностик"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى توافر أداة MCP","متوافق مع إطار مهارات LLM المتيقظ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
