 de formatos","extração de texto","OCR","redação de informações de identificação pessoal","assinatura digital","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["обработка документов","API обработки документов","конвертация форматов","извлечение текста","OCR","редактирование персональных данных","цифровая подпись","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["معالجة الوثائق","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات معالجة الوثائق","تحويل الصيغ","استخراج النص","OCR","التعديل على المعلومات الشخصية","التوقيع الرقمي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nutrient-document-processing","description":"Process, convert, OCR, extract, redact, sign, and fill documents using the Nutrient DWS API. Works with PDFs, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, HTML, and images.","bodyPreview":"# Nutrient Document Processing\n\nProcess documents with the [Nutrient DWS Processor API](https://www.nutrient.io/api/). Convert formats, extract text and tables, OCR scanned documents, redact PII, add watermarks, digitally sign, and fill PDF forms.\n\n## Setup\n\nGet a free API key at **[nutrient.io](https://dashboard.nutrient.io/sign_up/?product=processor)**\n\n```bash\nexport NUTRIENT_API_KEY=\"pdf_live_...\"\n```\n\nAll requests go to `https://api.nutrient.io/build` as multipart POST with an `instructions","body":"# Nutrient Document Processing\n\nProcess documents with the [Nutrient DWS Processor API](https://www.nutrient.io/api/). Convert formats, extract text and tables, OCR scanned documents, redact PII, add watermarks, digitally sign, and fill PDF forms.\n\n## Setup\n\nGet a free API key at **[nutrient.io](https://dashboard.nutrient.io/sign_up/?product=processor)**\n\n```bash\nexport NUTRIENT_API_KEY=\"pdf_live_...\"\n```\n\nAll requests go to `https://api.nutrient.io/build` as multipart POST with an `instructions` JSON field.\n\n## Operations\n\n### Convert Documents\n\n```bash\n# DOCX to PDF\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.docx=@document.docx\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.docx\"}]}'' \\\n  -o output.pdf\n\n# PDF to DOCX\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"output\":{\"type\":\"docx\"}}'' \\\n  -o output.docx\n\n# HTML to PDF\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"index.html=@index.html\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"html\":\"index.html\"}]}'' \\\n  -o output.pdf\n```\n\nSupported inputs: PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, DOC, XLS, PPT, PPS, PPSX, ODT, RTF, HTML, JPG, PNG, TIFF, HEIC, GIF, WebP, SVG, TGA, EPS.\n\n### Extract Text and Data\n\n```bash\n# Extract plain text\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"output\":{\"type\":\"text\"}}'' \\\n  -o output.txt\n\n# Extract tables as Excel\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"output\":{\"type\":\"xlsx\"}}'' \\\n  -o tables.xlsx\n```\n\n### OCR Scanned Documents\n\n```bash\n# OCR to searchable PDF (supports 100+ languages)\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"scanned.pdf=@scanned.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"scanned.pdf\"}],\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"ocr\",\"language\":\"english\"}]}'' \\\n  -o searchable.pdf\n```\n\nLanguages: Supports 100+ languages via ISO 639-2 codes (e.g., `eng`, `deu`, `fra`, `spa`, `jpn`, `kor`, `chi_sim`, `chi_tra`, `ara`, `hin`, `rus`). Full language names like `english` or `german` also work. See the [complete OCR language table](https://www.nutrient.io/guides/document-engine/ocr/language-support/) for all supported codes.\n\n### Redact Sensitive Information\n\n```bash\n# Pattern-based (SSN, email)\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"redaction\",\"strategy\":\"preset\",\"strategyOptions\":{\"preset\":\"social-security-number\"}},{\"type\":\"redaction\",\"strategy\":\"preset\",\"strategyOptions\":{\"preset\":\"email-address\"}}]}'' \\\n  -o redacted.pdf\n\n# Regex-based\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"redaction\",\"strategy\":\"regex\",\"strategyOptions\":{\"regex\":\"\\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{6}\\\\b\"}}]}'' \\\n  -o redacted.pdf\n```\n\nPresets: `social-security-number`, `email-address`, `credit-card-number`, `international-phone-number`, `north-american-phone-number`, `date`, `time`, `url`, `ipv4`, `ipv6`, `mac-address`, `us-zip-code`, `vin`.\n\n### Add Watermarks\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"watermark\",\"text\":\"CONFIDENTIAL\",\"fontSize\":72,\"opacity\":0.3,\"rotation\":-45}]}'' \\\n  -o watermarked.pdf\n```\n\n### Digital Signatures\n\n```bash\n# Self-signed CMS signature\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"document.pdf=@document.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"document.pdf\"}],\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"sign\",\"signatureType\":\"cms\"}]}'' \\\n  -o signed.pdf\n```\n\n### Fill PDF Forms\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.nutrient.io/build \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NUTRIENT_API_KEY\" \\\n  -F \"form.pdf=@form.pdf\" \\\n  -F ''instructions={\"parts\":[{\"file\":\"form.pdf\"}],\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"fillForm\",\"formFields\":{\"name\":\"Jane Smith\",\"email\":\"jane@example.com\",\"date\":\"2026-02-06\"}}]}'' \\\n  -o filled.pdf\n```\n\n## MCP Server (Alternative)\n\nFor native tool integration, use the MCP server instead of curl:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"nutrient-dws\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@nutrient-sdk/dws-mcp-server\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"NUTRIENT_DWS_API_KEY\": \"YOUR_API_KEY\",\n        \"SANDBOX_PATH\": \"/path/to/working/directory\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Converting documents between formats (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, HTML, images)\n- Extracting text, tables, or key-value pairs from PDFs\n- OCR on scanned documents or images\n- Redacting PII before sharing documents\n- Adding watermarks to drafts or confidential documents\n- Digitally signing contracts or agreements\n- Filling PDF forms programmatically\n\n## Links\n\n- [API Playground](https://dashboard.nutrient.io/processor-api/playground/)\n- [Full API Docs](https://www.nutrient.io/guides/dws-processor/)\n- [Agent Skill Repo](https://github.com/PSPDFKit-labs/nutrient-agent-skill)\n- [npm MCP Server](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@nutrient-sdk/dws-mcp-server)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:27:29.933Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Processing Agents needing advanced PDF manipulation and data extraction capabilities via the Nutrient DWS Processor API","zh":"非常适合需要通过Nutrient DWS Processor API进行高级PDF操作和数据提取的文档处理智能体","ja":"Nutrient DWS Processor APIを介した高度なPDF操作とデータ抽出機能を必要とする文書処理エージェントに最適です","ko":"Nutrient DWS Processor API를 통한 고급 PDF 조작 및 데이터 추출 기능이 필요한 문서 처리 에이전트에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Procesamiento de Documentos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de PDF y extracción de datos a través de la API del Procesador DWS de Nutrient","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Traitement de Documents nécessitant des capacités de manipulation avancées de PDF et d''extraction de données via l''API du Processeur DWS de Nutrient","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenverarbeitungsagenten, die erweiterte PDF-Manipulations- und Datenextraktionsfunktionen über die Nutrient DWS-Prozessor-API benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Documentos que precisam de manipulação avançada de PDF e capacidades de extração de dados via API do Processador DWS Nutrient","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки документов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности манипулирования PDF и извлечения данных через API процессора DWS Nutrient","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معالجة المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة PDF متقدمة وقدرات استخراج البيانات من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات معالج DWS Nutrient"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert document formats, extract text and tables, perform OCR on scanned documents, redact PII, add watermarks, digitally sign, and fill PDF forms using multipart POST requests to the Nutrient API endpoint","zh":"使智能体能够通过向Nutrient API端点发送multipart POST请求来转换文档格式、提取文本和表格、对扫描文档执行OCR、编辑个人身份信息(PII)、添加水印、数字签名以及填写PDF表单","ja":"Nutrient APIエンドポイントへのマルチパートPOSTリクエストを使用して、ドキュメント形式の変換、テキストと表の抽出、スキャン文書のOCR処理、個人識別情報(PII)の墨消し、透かしの追加、デジタル署名、PDFフォームへの入力を行う機能をエージェントに提供します","ko":"Nutrient API 엔드포인트에 multipart POST 요청을 사용하여 문서 형식 변환, 텍스트 및 테이블 추출, 스캔 문서에 대한 OCR 수행, 개인 식별 정보(PII) 편집, 워터마크 추가, 디지털 서명 및 PDF 양식 작성 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir formatos de documento, extraer texto y tablas, realizar OCR en documentos escaneados, tachar información de identificación personal (PII), agregar marcas de agua, firmar digitalmente y rellenar formularios PDF utilizando solicitudes POST de varios partes al punto de conexión de la API de Nutrient","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des formats de document, d''extraire du texte et des tableaux, de réaliser une reconnaissance optique de caractères (OCR) sur des documents scannés, de masquer les informations personnelles identifiables (PII), d''ajouter des filigranes, de signer numériquement et de remplir des formulaires PDF à l''aide de requêtes POST multipart vers le point de terminaison de l''API Nutrient","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dokumentformate zu konvertieren, Text und Tabellen zu extrahieren, OCR auf gescannte Dokumente auszuführen, personenbezogene Identifikationsinformationen (PII) zu schwärzen, Wasserzeichen hinzuzufügen, digital zu signieren und PDF-Formulare mithilfe von POST-Anfragen mit mehreren Teilen an den Nutrient-API-Endpunkt auszufüllen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter formatos de documentos, extrair texto e tabelas, realizar OCR em documentos digitalizados, redigir PII, adicionar filigranas, assinar digitalmente e preencher formulários PDF usando solicitações POST multipart para o ponto de extremidade da API Nutrient","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать форматы документов, извлекать текст и таблицы, выполнять OCR над сканированными документами, удалять ПII, добавлять водяные знаки, подписывать цифровой и заполнять формы PDF с помощью запросов POST multipart к конечной точке API Nutrient","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل صيغ المستندات واستخراج النص والجداول وتنفيذ OCR على المستندات الممسوحة ضوئيًا وحذف PII وإضافة الختم المائي والتوقيع الرقمي وتعبئة نماذج PDF باستخدام طلبات POST متعددة لنقطة النهاية API Nutrient"},"useCases":{"en":["Converting formats for compatibility","Extracting insights from tables and text within documents","Automating OCR for scanned document processing","Redacting personally identifiable information (PII) for compliance","Digitally signing and watermarking documents for security and authentication"],"zh":["转换格式以确保兼容性","从文档内的表格和文本中提取见解","自动化OCR以处理扫描文档","编辑个人身份信息(PII)以确保合规性","为保障安全和认证而对文档进行数字签名和添加水印"],"ja":["互換性のための形式変換","文書内の表とテキストからのインサイト抽出","スキャン文書処理のためのOCR自動化","コンプライアンスのための個人識別情報(PII)の墨消し","セキュリティと認証のためのデジタル署名と透かし追加"],"ko":["호환성을 위한 형식 변환","문서 내 테이블 및 텍스트에서 인사이트 추출","스캔 문서 처리를 위한 OCR 자동화","규정 준수를 위한 개인 식별 정보(PII) 편집","보안 및 인증을 위한 디지털 서명 및 워터마크 추가"],"es":["Convertir formatos para la compatibilidad","Extraer información de tablas y texto dentro de los documentos","Automatizar la OCR para el procesamiento de documentos escaneados","Tachar información de identificación personal (PII) para el cumplimiento","Firmar digitalmente y agregar marcas de agua a los documentos para la seguridad y la autenticación"],"fr":["Convertir des formats pour la compatibilité","Extraire des informations à partir de tableaux et de texte à l''intérieur des documents","Automatiser la reconnaissance optique de caractères (OCR) pour le traitement de documents scannés","Masquer les informations personnelles identifiables (PII) pour le respect de la réglementation","Signer numériquement et ajouter des filigranes aux documents pour la sécurité et l''authentification"],"de":["Formate für die Kompatibilität konvertieren","Erkenntnisse aus Tabellen und Text innerhalb von Dokumenten extrahieren","OCR für das Verarbeiten von gescannten Dokumenten automatisieren","Personenbezogene Identifikationsinformationen (PII) für die Einhaltung schwärzen","Dokumente digital signieren und mit Wasserzeichen versehen für Sicherheit und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Conversão de formatos para compatibilidade","Extração de informações de tabelas e texto dentro dos documentos","Automatização da OCR para processamento de documentos digitalizados","Redação de informações de identificação pessoal (PII) para conformidade","Assinatura digital e filigrana de documentos para segurança e autenticação"],"ru":["Преобразование форматов для совместимости","Извлечение информации из таблиц и текста внутри документов","Автоматизация OCR для обработки сканированных документов","Удаление личной идентифицирующей информации (PII) для соответствия требованиям","Цифровая подпись и водяной знак документов для безопасности и аутентификации"],"ar":["تحويل الصيغ لتحقيق التوافق","استخراج المعلومات من الجداول والنص داخل المستندات","تأتمتة OCR لمعالجة المستندات الممسوحة ضوئيًا","حذف المعلومات التعريفية الشخصية (PII) للامتثال","التوقيع الرقمي والختم المائي للمستندات لأغراض الأمان والتحقق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a Nutrient API key","Dependent on the Nutrient DWS Processor API for functionality","Limited to the capabilities and constraints of the Nutrient API"],"zh":["需要Nutrient API密钥","功能依赖于Nutrient DWS Processor API","受限于Nutrient API的功能和约束"],"ja":["Nutrient APIキーが必要","機能はNutrient DWS Processor APIに依存","Nutrient APIの機能と制約に限定されます"],"ko":["Nutrient API 키가 필요함","기능은 Nutrient DWS Processor API에 종속됨","Nutrient API의 기능과 제약으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de Nutrient","Depende de la API del Procesador DWS de Nutrient para la funcionalidad","Limitado a las capacidades y restricciones de la API de Nutrient"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API de Nutrient","Dépend de l''API du Processeur DWS de Nutrient pour la fonctionnalité","Limité aux capacités et contraintes de l''API Nutrient"],"de":["Benötigt einen Nutrient-API-Schlüssel","Ist von der Nutrient DWS-Prozessor-API für die Funktionalität abhängig","Begrenzt auf die Fähigkeiten und Einschränkungen der Nutrient-API"],"pt":["Exige uma chave de API Nutrient","Dependente da API do Processador DWS Nutrient para funcionalidade","Limitado às capacidades e restrições da API Nutrient"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API Nutrient","Зависит от API процессора DWS Nutrient для функциональности","Ограничен возможностями и ограничениями API Nutrient"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Nutrient","يعتمد على واجهة برمجة تطبيقات معالج DWS Nutrient للوظائف","محدود bằng قدرات وقيود واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Nutrient"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":100}');
