s 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화를 위한 포괄적인 안내서입니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React y Next.js, con 57 reglas en 8 categorías","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React et Next.js, avec 57 règles dans 8 catégories","de":"Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen, mit 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien","pt":"Otimização de desempenho para aplicativos React e Next.js com o guia da Vercel, contendo 57 regras em 8 categorias","ru":"Оптимизация производительности для приложений React и Next.js с помощью руководства Vercel, содержащего 57 правил в 8 категориях","ar":"تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت ونيكست.جس باستخدام دليل فيرسيل، الذي يحتوي على 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["57 条性能优化规则","8 个优化类别","自动重构和代码生成","适用于 React 和 Next.js 应用","提高应用性能和速度","维护由 Vercel"],"ja":["57 ルールのパフォーマンス最適化","8 カテゴリーの最適化","自動リファクタリングとコード生成","React と Next.js アプリ対応","アプリのパフォーマンスとスピードの向上","Vercel によるメンテナンス"],"ko":["57개의 성능 최적화 규칙","8개의 최적화 카테고리","자동 리팩토링과 코드 생성","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션 지원","애플리케이션 성능과 속도 향상","Vercel에 의한 유지 보수"],"es":["57 reglas para optimizar el rendimiento","8 categorías para priorizar tareas","Guía para la refactorización automática","Optimización de la generación de código","Mejora del rendimiento de React y Next.js"],"fr":["57 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour prioriser les tâches","Guide pour la refactorisation automatique","Optimisation de la génération de code","Amélioration des performances de React et Next.js"],"de":["57 Regeln zur Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien zur Priorisierung von Aufgaben","Leitfaden zur automatischen Refaktorierung","Optimierung der Codegenerierung","Verbesserung der Leistung von React und Next.js"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para React e Next.js","57 regras em 8 categorias","Priorização de regras por impacto","Refatoração automática e geração de código","Guia para desenvolvedores para melhorar a performance","Compatibilidade com React e Next.js"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для React и Next.js","57 правил в 8 категориях","Приоритизация правил по воздействию","Автоматическая рефакторинг и генерация кода","Руководство для разработчиков по улучшению производительности","Совместимость с React и Next.js"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت ونيكست.جس","57 قاعدة في 8 فئات","التحديد الأولوي للقواعد حسب التأثير","إعادة هيكلة التطبيق وإنشاء رمز تلقائي","دليل للمطورين لتحسين الأداء","توافق مع رياكت ونيكست.جس"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 应用","Next.js 应用"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React アプリ","Next.js アプリ"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 최적화 가이드","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 애플리케이션","Next.js 애플리케이션"],"es":["Vercel React","mejores prácticas","optimización de rendimiento","React","Next.js","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Vercel React","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des performances","React","Next.js","développement web"],"de":["Vercel React","Best Practices","Leistungsoptimierung","React","Next.js","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Melhores práticas","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento web","Performance","Refatoração","Geração de código"],"ru":["Vercel React","Лучшие практики","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Веб-разработка","Производительность","Рефакторинг","Генерация кода"],"ar":["فيرسيل رياكت","أفضل الممارسات","تحسين الأداء","رياكت","نيكست.جس","تطوير الويب","الأداء","إعادة هيكلة","إنشاء رمز"]}},"owner":"itrpp","repo":"portalrpp","repoPath":"itrpp/portalrpp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:27:55.783Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for React and Next.js Development Agents optimizing application performance and bundle size.","zh":"适用于React和Next.js开发代理，优化应用程序性能和包大小。","ja":"ReactとNext.js開発エージェントのアプリケーションパフォーマンスとバンドルサイズの最適化に不可欠です。","ko":"리액트 및 Next.js 개발 에이전트를 위한 필수 기능으로, 애플리케이션 성능 및 번들 크기 최적화에 도움이 됩니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de desarrollo de React y Next.js que optimizan el rendimiento de la aplicación y el tamaño del paquete.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement React et Next.js qui optimisent les performances de l''application et la taille du paquet.","de":"Wesentlich für React- und Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die die Anwendungsleistung und die Bundle-Größe optimieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do React e Next.js que otimizam o desempenho e o tamanho do pacote da aplicação.","ru":"Необходим для агентов разработки React и Next.js, оптимизирующих производительность и размер пакета приложения.","ar":"حيوي لعمليات تنمية التطبيقات التي تستخدم React و Next.js وتحسين أداء التطبيق وحجم الحزمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides automated refactoring guidance for 57 performance rules across 8 categories, enabling agents to optimize data fetching (client/server-side), component architecture, and bundling strategies in React/Next.js applications.","zh":"为57个性能规则提供自动重构指导，涵盖8个类别，使得代理能够优化React/Next.js应用程序中的数据获取（客户端/服务器端）、组件架构和打包策略。","ja":"57のパフォーマンスルールを網羅する8つのカテゴリにわたる自動リファクタリングのガイダンスを提供し、エージェントがReact/Next.jsアプリケーションにおけるデータ取得（クライアント/サーバー側）、コンポーネントアーキテクチャ、バンドル戦略を最適化できるようにします。","ko":"8개 카테고리에 걸친 57개의 성능 규칙에 대한 자동 리팩터링 가이드를 제공하여, 에이전트가 리액트/Next.js 애플리케이션의 데이터 수신(클라이언트/서버 측), 컴포넌트 아키텍처 및 번들링 전략을 최적화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Ofrece orientación de refactorización automatizada para 57 reglas de rendimiento en 8 categorías, lo que permite a los agentes optimizar la recuperación de datos (lado del cliente/servidor), la arquitectura de componentes y las estrategias de empaquetado en aplicaciones React/Next.js.","fr":"Fournit des conseils de refactorisation automatisés pour 57 règles de performances dans 8 catégories, permettant ainsi aux agents d''optimiser la récupération de données (côté client/serveur), l''architecture de composants et les stratégies de regroupement dans les applications React/Next.js.","de":"Bietet automatisierte Refactoring-Anleitungen für 57 Leistungsregeln in 8 Kategorien, sodass Agenten die Datenabfrage (Client-/Server-Seite), die Komponentenarchitektur und die Bündelungsstrategien in React-/Next.js-Anwendungen optimieren können.","pt":"Fornece orientação de refatoração automatizada para 57 regras de desempenho em 8 categorias, permitindo que os agentes otimizem a busca de dados (lado do cliente/servidor), arquitetura de componentes e estratégias de empacotamento em aplicações React/Next.js.","ru":"Предоставляет автоматизированное руководство по рефакторингу для 57 правил производительности в 8 категориях, позволяя агентам оптимизировать получение данных (клиент/сервер), архитектуру компонентов и стратегии пакетирования в приложениях React/Next.js.","ar":"توفر إرشادات إعادة هيكلة آلية لـ 57 قاعدة لأداء في 8 فئات، ممكنة للوكلاء تحسين استرجاع البيانات (جانب العميل/الخادم) وهيكلة المكونات واستراتيجيات التعبئة في تطبيقات React/Next.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance audits of React components","Generating optimized code for Next.js pages","Refactoring existing codebases against Vercel''s best practices","Implementing data fetching optimization strategies"],"zh":["自动化React组件的性能审计","为Next.js页面生成优化代码","根据Vercel的最佳实践重构现有的代码库","实施数据获取优化策略"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのパフォーマンス監査の自動化","Next.jsページの最適化コードの生成","Vercelのベストプラクティスに従った既存のコードベースのリファクタリング","データ取得の最適化戦略の実装"],"ko":["리액트 컴포넌트의 성능 감사를 자동화하는 것","Next.js 페이지를 위한 최적화된 코드를 생성하는 것","Vercel의 모범 사례에 따라 기존 코드베이스를 리팩터링하는 것","데이터 수신 최적화 전략을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de auditorías de rendimiento de componentes de React","Generación de código optimizado para páginas de Next.js","Reestructuración de bases de código existentes según las mejores prácticas de Vercel","Implementación de estrategias de optimización de la recuperación de datos"],"fr":["Automatisation des audits de performances des composants React","Génération de code optimisé pour les pages Next.js","Réorganisation des bases de code existantes selon les meilleures pratiques de Vercel","Mise en œuvre de stratégies d''optimisation de la récupération de données"],"de":["Automatisierung von Leistungsaudits von React-Komponenten","Generierung von optimiertem Code für Next.js-Seiten","Umstrukturierung bestehender Codebasen gemäß Vercels Best Practices","Implementierung von Datenabfrage-Optimierungsstrategien"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de desempenho de componentes do React","Gerar código otimizado para páginas do Next.js","Refatorar bases de código existentes contra as melhores práticas da Vercel","Implementar estratégias de otimização de busca de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты производительности компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для страниц Next.js","Рефакторить существующие кодовые базы в соответствии с лучшими практиками Vercel","Реализовывать стратегии оптимизации получения данных"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات التدقيق الأوتوماتيكية لأداء مكونات React","توليد رمز محسّن لأجزاء Next.js","إعادة هيكلة القواعد الكودية الحالية وفقًا لأفضل الممارسات التي توفرها Vercel","تنفيذ استراتيجيات تحسين استرجاع البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["React/Next.js specific only","Requires existing codebase for refactoring","Prioritization based on impact levels needed"],"zh":["仅适用于React/Next.js","需要现有的代码库进行重构","需要基于影响级别的优先级"],"ja":["React/Next.js専用","リファクタリングには既存のコードベースが必要","影響レベルに基づく優先順位が必要"],"ko":["리액트/Next.js 전용","리팩터링을 위해 기존 코드베이스가 필요함","영향 수준에 따라 우선순위가 필요함"],"es":["Específico solo para React/Next.js","Requiere una base de código existente para la reestructuración","Priorización basada en los niveles de impacto necesarios"],"fr":["Spécifique à React/Next.js uniquement","Nécessite une base de code existante pour la réorganisation","Priorisation basée sur les niveaux d''impact nécessaires"],"de":["Nur spezifisch für React/Next.js","Benötigt eine bestehende Codebasis für die Umstrukturierung","Priorisierung basierend auf den erforderlichen Auswirkungsniveaus"],"pt":["Específico apenas para React/Next.js","Exige base de código existente para refatoração","Priorização com base em níveis de impacto necessários"],"ru":["Только для React/Next.js","Требует существующей кодовой базы для рефакторинга","Приоритизация на основе необходимых уровней воздействия"],"ar":["محدد للتطبيقات التي تستخدم React/Next.js فقط","يتطلب قاعدة كود موجودة للتحديث","الترتيب الأولوي وفقًا لمستويات التأثير اللازمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
