,"description":{"es":"Los patrones JPA son fundamentales para una buena modelización de datos y rendimiento en Spring Boot. Aprende a implementarlos","fr":"Les modèles JPA sont essentiels pour une bonne modélisation de données et des performances dans Spring Boot. Découvrez comment les appliquer","de":"JPA-Muster sind entscheidend für eine gute Datenmodellierung und Leistung in Spring Boot. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie implementieren","pt":"Padrões JPA/Hibernate comprovados para modelagem de dados, implementação de repositórios e otimização de performance em aplicações Spring Boot. Configurações...","ru":"Проверенные паттерны JPA/Hibernate для моделирования данных, реализации репозиториев и оптимизации производительности в приложениях Spring Boot. Протестирова...","ar":"أنماط JPA/Hibernate مثبتة لنمذجة البيانات وتنفيذ المستودعات وتحسين الأداء في تطبيقات Spring Boot. إعدادات مجربة للإنتاج من فائز بمسابقة Anthropic Hackathon.","en":"Complete Claude Code configuration collection - agents, skills, hooks, commands, rules, MCPs. Battle-tested configs from an Anthropic hackathon winner."},"definition":{"en":"Complete Claude Code configuration collection - agents, skills, hooks, commands, rules, MCPs. Battle-tested configs from an Anthropic hackathon winner."},"features":{"es":["Diseño de entidades","Configuración de repositorios","Optimización del rendimiento","Uso de anotaciones JPA","Implementación de auditorías"],"fr":["Conception d''entités","Configuration de dépôts","Optimisation des performances","Utilisation d''annotations JPA","Mise en œuvre d''audits"],"de":["Entitätsdesign","Konfiguration von Repositorien","Leistungsverbesserung","Verwendung von JPA-Annotierungen","Implementierung von Audits"],"pt":["Design de entidades com anotações JPA otimizadas","Configuração de índices e constraints únicas","Padrões de repositório Spring Data JPA","Otimização de performance e queries","Entity Listeners e auditoria automática","Estratégias de geração de IDs eficientes"],"ru":["Проектирование сущностей с оптимизированными аннотациями JPA","Настройка индексов и уникальных ограничений","Паттерны репозиториев Spring Data JPA","Оптимизация производительности и запросов","Entity Listeners и автоматический аудит","Эффективные стратегии генерации ID"],"ar":["تصميم الكيانات باستخدام annotations JPA محسنة","إعداد الفهارس والقيود الفريدة","أنماط مستودعات Spring Data JPA","تحسين الأداء والاستعلامات","Entity Listeners والتدقيق التلقائي","استراتيجيات فعالة لتوليد المعرفات"]},"keywords":{"es":["JPA","Spring Boot","modelización de datos","rendimiento","patrones de diseño","entidades","repositorios","auditorías"],"fr":["JPA","Spring Boot","modélisation de données","performances","modèles de conception","entités","dépôts","audits"],"de":["JPA","Spring Boot","Datenmodellierung","Leistung","Entwurfsmuster","Entitäten","Repositorien","Audits"],"pt":["jpa patterns spring boot","hibernate performance tuning","entity design jpa","spring data jpa repositories","database indexes jpa","auditing entity listeners","jpa optimization techniques","spring boot data modeling"],"ru":["jpa паттерны spring boot","оптимизация производительности hibernate","проектирование сущностей jpa","репозитории spring data jpa","индексы базы данных jpa","аудит entity listeners","методы оптимизации jpa","моделирование данных spring boot"],"ar":["أنماط jpa spring boot","تحسين أداء hibernate","تصميم كيانات jpa","مستودعات spring data jpa","فهارس قاعدة البيانات jpa","التدقيق entity listeners","تقنيات تحسين jpa","نمذجة البيانات spring boot"]}},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jpa-patterns","description":"JPA/Hibernate patterns for entity design, relationships, query optimization, transactions, auditing, indexing, pagination, and pooling in Spring Boot.","bodyPreview":"# JPA/Hibernate Patterns\n\nUse for data modeling, repositories, and performance tuning in Spring Boot.\n\n## Entity Design\n\n```java\n@Entity\n@Table(name = \"markets\", indexes = {\n  @Index(name = \"idx_markets_slug\", columnList = \"slug\", unique = true)\n})\n@EntityListeners(AuditingEntityListener.class)\npublic class MarketEntity {\n  @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)\n  private Long id;\n\n  @Column(nullable = false, length = 200)\n  private String name;\n\n  @Column(nullable = false, uniq","body":"# JPA/Hibernate Patterns\n\nUse for data modeling, repositories, and performance tuning in Spring Boot.\n\n## Entity Design\n\n```java\n@Entity\n@Table(name = \"markets\", indexes = {\n  @Index(name = \"idx_markets_slug\", columnList = \"slug\", unique = true)\n})\n@EntityListeners(AuditingEntityListener.class)\npublic class MarketEntity {\n  @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)\n  private Long id;\n\n  @Column(nullable = false, length = 200)\n  private String name;\n\n  @Column(nullable = false, unique = true, length = 120)\n  private String slug;\n\n  @Enumerated(EnumType.STRING)\n  private MarketStatus status = MarketStatus.ACTIVE;\n\n  @CreatedDate private Instant createdAt;\n  @LastModifiedDate private Instant updatedAt;\n}\n```\n\nEnable auditing:\n```java\n@Configuration\n@EnableJpaAuditing\nclass JpaConfig {}\n```\n\n## Relationships and N+1 Prevention\n\n```java\n@OneToMany(mappedBy = \"market\", cascade = CascadeType.ALL, orphanRemoval = true)\nprivate List<PositionEntity> positions = new ArrayList<>();\n```\n\n- Default to lazy loading; use `JOIN FETCH` in queries when needed\n- Avoid `EAGER` on collections; use DTO projections for read paths\n\n```java\n@Query(\"select m from MarketEntity m left join fetch m.positions where m.id = :id\")\nOptional<MarketEntity> findWithPositions(@Param(\"id\") Long id);\n```\n\n## Repository Patterns\n\n```java\npublic interface MarketRepository extends JpaRepository<MarketEntity, Long> {\n  Optional<MarketEntity> findBySlug(String slug);\n\n  @Query(\"select m from MarketEntity m where m.status = :status\")\n  Page<MarketEntity> findByStatus(@Param(\"status\") MarketStatus status, Pageable pageable);\n}\n```\n\n- Use projections for lightweight queries:\n```java\npublic interface MarketSummary {\n  Long getId();\n  String getName();\n  MarketStatus getStatus();\n}\nPage<MarketSummary> findAllBy(Pageable pageable);\n```\n\n## Transactions\n\n- Annotate service methods with `@Transactional`\n- Use `@Transactional(readOnly = true)` for read paths to optimize\n- Choose propagation carefully; avoid long-running transactions\n\n```java\n@Transactional\npublic Market updateStatus(Long id, MarketStatus status) {\n  MarketEntity entity = repo.findById(id)\n      .orElseThrow(() -> new EntityNotFoundException(\"Market\"));\n  entity.setStatus(status);\n  return Market.from(entity);\n}\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\n```java\nPageRequest page = PageRequest.of(pageNumber, pageSize, Sort.by(\"createdAt\").descending());\nPage<MarketEntity> markets = repo.findByStatus(MarketStatus.ACTIVE, page);\n```\n\nFor cursor-like pagination, include `id > :lastId` in JPQL with ordering.\n\n## Indexing and Performance\n\n- Add indexes for common filters (`status`, `slug`, foreign keys)\n- Use composite indexes matching query patterns (`status, created_at`)\n- Avoid `select *`; project only needed columns\n- Batch writes with `saveAll` and `hibernate.jdbc.batch_size`\n\n## Connection Pooling (HikariCP)\n\nRecommended properties:\n```\nspring.datasource.hikari.maximum-pool-size=20\nspring.datasource.hikari.minimum-idle=5\nspring.datasource.hikari.connection-timeout=30000\nspring.datasource.hikari.validation-timeout=5000\n```\n\nFor PostgreSQL LOB handling, add:\n```\nspring.jpa.properties.hibernate.jdbc.lob.non_contextual_creation=true\n```\n\n## Caching\n\n- 1st-level cache is per EntityManager; avoid keeping entities across transactions\n- For read-heavy entities, consider second-level cache cautiously; validate eviction strategy\n\n## Migrations\n\n- Use Flyway or Liquibase; never rely on Hibernate auto DDL in production\n- Keep migrations idempotent and additive; avoid dropping columns without plan\n\n## Testing Data Access\n\n- Prefer `@DataJpaTest` with Testcontainers to mirror production\n- Assert SQL efficiency using logs: set `logging.level.org.hibernate.SQL=DEBUG` and `logging.level.org.hibernate.orm.jdbc.bind=TRACE` for parameter values\n\n**Remember**: Keep entities lean, queries intentional, and transactions short. Prevent N+1 with fetch strategies and projections, and index for your read/write paths.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:28:53.566Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java-based Agents needing advanced data modeling and performance tuning capabilities with JPA and Hibernate","zh":"非常适合基于Java的智能体，需要利用JPA和Hibernate进行高级数据建模和性能调优","ja":"JPAとHibernateによる高度なデータモデリングとパフォーマンスチューニング機能を必要とするJavaベースのエージェントに最適","ko":"JPA와 Hibernate를 통한 고급 데이터 모델링 및 성능 튜닝 기능이 필요한 Java 기반 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes basados en Java que necesitan capacidades de modelado de datos avanzadas y ajuste de rendimiento con JPA y Hibernate","fr":"Parfait pour les agents basés sur Java nécessitant un modelage de données avancé et des capacités de réglage de performances avec JPA et Hibernate","de":"Perfekt für Java-basierte Agenten, die erweiterte Datenmodellierungs- und Leistungsanpassungsfunktionen mit JPA und Hibernate benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes baseados em Java que necessitam de modelagem de dados avançada e capacidades de ajuste de desempenho com JPA e Hibernate","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов на основе Java, требующих продвинутой моделирования данных и возможностей настройки производительности с JPA и Hibernate","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يستندون إلى جافا الذين يحتاجون إلى نمذجة بيانات متقدمة وقدرات ضبط الأداء مع JPA و Hibernate"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize data access and manipulation using JPA/Hibernate patterns, enabling efficient entity design, repository implementation, and performance tuning in Spring Boot applications, leveraging annotations like @Entity, @Table, and @Index","zh":"赋能智能体利用JPA/Hibernate模式优化数据访问和操作，在Spring Boot应用程序中实现高效的实体设计、存储库实现和性能调优，充分利用诸如@Entity、@Table和@Index等注解","ja":"JPA/Hibernateパターンを使用してデータアクセスと操作を最適化し、@Entity、@Table、@Indexなどのアノテーションを活用して、Spring Bootアプリケーションにおける効率的なエンティティ設計、リポジトリ実装、パフォーマンスチューニングを可能にする","ko":"JPA/Hibernate 패턴을 사용하여 데이터 액세스 및 조작을 최적화하여 Spring Boot 애플리케이션에서 @Entity, @Table, @Index와 같은 어노테이션을 활용하여 효율적인 엔티티 설계, 리포지토리 구현 및 성능 튜닝을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el acceso y la manipulación de datos utilizando patrones JPA/Hibernate, lo que permite un diseño de entidad eficiente, implementación de repositorio y ajuste de rendimiento en aplicaciones Spring Boot, aprovechando anotaciones como @Entity, @Table y @Index","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser l''accès et la manipulation des données en utilisant des modèles JPA/Hibernate, ce qui permet une conception d''entité efficace, une mise en œuvre de référentiel et un réglage de performances dans les applications Spring Boot, en exploitant des annotations comme @Entity, @Table et @Index","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Datenzugriff und die Datenmanipulation mithilfe von JPA/Hibernate-Mustern zu optimieren, was ein effizientes Entity-Design, Repository-Implementierung und Leistungsanpassung in Spring-Boot-Anwendungen ermöglicht, indem Annotations wie @Entity, @Table und @Index genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o acesso e a manipulação de dados usando padrões JPA/Hibernate, permitindo o design eficiente de entidades, implementação de repositórios e ajuste de desempenho em aplicações Spring Boot, aproveitando anotações como @Entity, @Table e @Index","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать доступ и манипуляцию данными с помощью шаблонов JPA/Hibernate, обеспечивая эффективный проектирование сущностей, реализацию репозиториев и настройку производительности в приложениях Spring Boot, используя аннотации như @Entity, @Table и @Index","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين الوصول والتعامل مع البيانات باستخدام أنماط JPA/Hibernate، مما يتيح تصميم الكيانات بفعالية وتنفيذ مستودعات وتحسين الأداء في تطبيقات Spring Boot، واستخدام التعليقات مثل @Entity و @Table و @Index"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing and implementing scalable entity models with JPA","Optimizing database queries and performance using Hibernate","Implementing auditing and logging mechanisms with EntityListeners"],"zh":["使用JPA设计和实现可扩展的实体模型","使用Hibernate优化数据库查询和性能","使用EntityListeners实现审计和日志记录机制"],"ja":["JPAを使用したスケーラブルなエンティティモデルの設計と実装","Hibernateを使用したデータベースクエリとパフォーマンスの最適化","EntityListenersを使用した監査とロギングメカニズムの実装"],"ko":["JPA로 확장 가능한 엔티티 모델 설계 및 구현","Hibernate를 사용하여 데이터베이스 쿼리 및 성능 최적화","EntityListeners로 감사 및 로깅 메커니즘 구현"],"es":["Diseñar e implementar modelos de entidad escalables con JPA","Optimizar consultas de base de datos y rendimiento utilizando Hibernate","Implementar mecanismos de auditoría y registro con EntityListeners"],"fr":["Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des modèles d''entité scalables avec JPA","Optimiser les requêtes de base de données et les performances en utilisant Hibernate","Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes d''audit et de journalisation avec EntityListeners"],"de":["Entwurf und Implementierung von skalierbaren Entity-Modellen mit JPA","Optimierung von Datenbankabfragen und Leistung mit Hibernate","Implementierung von Überwachungs- und Protokollmechanismen mit EntityListeners"],"pt":["Projeto e implementação de modelos de entidades escaláveis com JPA","Otimização de consultas de banco de dados e desempenho usando Hibernate","Implementação de mecanismos de auditoria e registro com EntityListeners"],"ru":["Проектирование и реализация масштабируемых моделей сущностей с помощью JPA","Оптимизация запросов к базе данных и производительности с помощью Hibernate","Реализация механизмов аудита и журналирования с помощью EntityListeners"],"ar":["تصميم وتنفيذ نماذج الكيانات القابلة للت