asses","Accès à des ressources partagées via l''instance de Experience","Implémentation de méthodes de cycle de vie standardisées","Création de composants personnalisés","Nettoyage des ressources","Interaction avec la scène 3D"],"de":["Singleton-Muster auf der Basis von Klassen","Zugriff auf gemeinsame Ressourcen über die Experience-Instanz","Implementierung standardisierter Lebenszyklusmethoden","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Komponenten","Ressourcenbereinigung","Interaktion mit der 3D-Szene"],"pt":["Padrão de singleton baseado em classes","Extração de recursos compartilhados","Implementação de métodos de ciclo de vida padrão","Criação de objetos 3D, gerenciadores, controladores e utilitários","Interação com a cena 3D"],"ru":["Классический синглтоновый шаблон","Извлечение общих ресурсов","Реализация стандартизированных методов жизненного цикла","Создание 3D-объектов, менеджеров, контроллеров и утилит","Взаимодействие со сценой 3D"],"ar":["نمط Singleton القائم على الفئات","استخراج الموارد المشتركة","تنفيذ طرق دورة الحياة المعيارية","إنشاء كائنات ثلاثية الأبعاد، مديرين، مراقبين وبرامج مساعدة","التفاعل مع المشهد الثلاثي الأبعاد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite","Three.js","3D 组件","类单例模式","生命周期方法","前端开发","3D 渲染"],"ja":["Vite","Three.js","3D コンポーネント","シングルトンパターン","ライフサイクルメソッド","フロントエンド開発","3D レンダリング"],"ko":["Vite","Three.js","3D 컴포넌트","클래스 단일체 패턴","수명주기 방법","프론트엔드 개발","3D 렌더링"],"es":["modelo de componentes 3D","patrón de singleton","componentes personalizados","recursos compartidos","ciclo de vida","escena 3D","vite-threejs","desarrollo de juegos","realidad virtual"],"fr":["modèle de composant 3D","patron de singleton","composants personnalisés","ressources partagées","cycle de vie","scène 3D","vite-threejs","développement de jeux","réalité virtuelle"],"de":["3D-Komponentenmodell","Singleton-Muster","benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","gemeinsame Ressourcen","Lebenszyklus","3D-Szene","vite-threejs","Spielentwicklung","Virtuelle Realität"],"pt":["Vite Threejs","Componente 3D","Singleton","Ciclo de vida","Recursos compartilhados","Experiências imersivas","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Realidade virtual"],"ru":["Vite Threejs","3D-компонент","Синглтон","Жизненный цикл","Общие ресурсы","Иммерсивные trải nghiệm","Разработка игр","Виртуальная реальность"],"ar":["Vite Threejs","المكون الثلاثي الأبعاد","Singleton","دورة الحياة","الموارد المشتركة","التجارب الغامرة","تطوير الألعاب","الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"hexianWeb","repo":"Third-Person-MC","repoPath":"hexianWeb/Third-Person-MC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vtj-component-model","description":"Creates 3D components using the Experience singleton pattern. Use when building new classes in src/js/, implementing lifecycle methods, or managing Three.js objects.","bodyPreview":"# vite-threejs 3D Component Model\n\n## Overview\n\nAll 3D components in this project follow a **class-based singleton pattern**. Components access shared resources through the `Experience` singleton and implement standardized lifecycle methods.\n\n**Core principle**: Extract only what you need, implement all required lifecycle methods, always clean up resources.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating any new class in `src/js/`\n- Building 3D objects, managers, controllers, or utilities that interact with the sce","body":"# vite-threejs 3D Component Model\n\n## Overview\n\nAll 3D components in this project follow a **class-based singleton pattern**. Components access shared resources through the `Experience` singleton and implement standardized lifecycle methods.\n\n**Core principle**: Extract only what you need, implement all required lifecycle methods, always clean up resources.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating any new class in `src/js/`\n- Building 3D objects, managers, controllers, or utilities that interact with the scene\n- Wrapping Three.js functionality in reusable components\n\n## Component Template\n\n```javascript\nimport Experience from ''@/js/experience.js''\nimport emitter from ''@/js/utils/event-bus.js''\nimport * as THREE from ''three''\n\nexport default class YourComponent {\n  constructor(options = {}) {\n    // 1. 获取 Experience 单例\n    this.experience = new Experience()\n\n    // 2. 按需提取依赖（仅取所需，避免冗余）\n    this.scene = this.experience.scene\n    this.resources = this.experience.resources\n    this.debug = this.experience.debug\n\n    // 3. 组件参数\n    this.params = {\n      enabled: options.enabled ?? true,\n      // ... 其他参数\n    }\n\n    // 4. 组件状态\n    this.mesh = null\n\n    // 5. 初始化\n    this._init()\n\n    // 6. 调试面板（必须在 debug.active 条件下调用）\n    if (this.debug.active) {\n      this.debugInit()\n    }\n  }\n\n  _init() {\n    // 创建 3D 对象并添加到场景\n    this.mesh = new THREE.Mesh(/* ... */)\n    this.scene.add(this.mesh)\n  }\n\n  debugInit() {\n    // 调试面板 - 详见 vtj-debug-panel skill\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    // 每帧更新逻辑\n    // 时间通过 this.experience.time 访问，不通过参数传递\n  }\n\n  resize() {\n    // 窗口尺寸变化时调用\n  }\n\n  destroy() {\n    // 清理资源 - 涉及 Object3D 的组件必须实现\n    if (this.mesh) {\n      this.scene.remove(this.mesh)\n      this.mesh.geometry?.dispose()\n      this.mesh.material?.dispose()\n      this.mesh = null\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Extraction Rules\n\n**只提取组件实际需要的依赖**：\n\n| 组件类型 | 典型依赖 |\n|----------|----------|\n| 渲染对象 | `scene`, `resources` |\n| 交互组件 | `scene`, `camera.instance`, `iMouse` |\n| 动画组件 | `scene`, `time` |\n| 调试组件 | `debug` |\n| UI 相关 | `sizes`, `canvas` |\n\n```javascript\n// ✅ GOOD: 只取所需\nthis.scene = this.experience.scene\nthis.resources = this.experience.resources\n\n// ❌ BAD: 提取全部\nthis.scene = this.experience.scene\nthis.camera = this.experience.camera\nthis.renderer = this.experience.renderer\nthis.time = this.experience.time\nthis.sizes = this.experience.sizes\nthis.iMouse = this.experience.iMouse\nthis.debug = this.experience.debug\n// ... 大部分根本用不到\n```\n\n## Lifecycle Methods\n\n| 方法 | 必需条件 | 调用方 |\n|------|----------|--------|\n| `debugInit()` | 有可调参数 | 构造函数，`if (debug.active)` |\n| `update()` | 有逐帧逻辑 | 父组件的 `update()` |\n| `resize()` | 响应尺寸变化 | 父组件的 `resize()` |\n| `destroy()` | **涉及 Object3D** | 父组件的 `destroy()` |\n\n### destroy() 是强制要求\n\n**任何涉及 Object3D 的组件必须实现 `destroy()` 方法**。\n\n```javascript\ndestroy() {\n  // 1. 移除事件监听\n  emitter.off(''some:event'', this._handler)\n\n  // 2. 从场景移除对象\n  if (this.mesh) {\n    this.scene.remove(this.mesh)\n  }\n\n  // 3. 销毁几何体\n  this.mesh?.geometry?.dispose()\n\n  // 4. 销毁材质\n  if (this.mesh?.material) {\n    if (Array.isArray(this.mesh.material)) {\n      this.mesh.material.forEach(m => m.dispose())\n    } else {\n      this.mesh.material.dispose()\n    }\n  }\n\n  // 5. 销毁纹理（如果组件自己创建的）\n  this.texture?.dispose()\n\n  // 6. 销毁子组件\n  this.childComponent?.destroy()\n\n  // 7. 清空引用\n  this.mesh = null\n}\n```\n\n## Debug Access Pattern\n\n**统一使用以下方式访问调试系统**：\n\n```javascript\n// 在构造函数中\nthis.debug = this.experience.debug\n\n// 检查是否激活\nif (this.debug.active) {\n  this.debugInit()\n}\n\n// 在 debugInit() 中创建面板\ndebugInit() {\n  this.debugFolder = this.debug.ui.addFolder({\n    title: ''Component Name'',\n    expanded: false,\n  })\n\n  this.debugFolder.addBinding(this.params, ''someValue'', {\n    label: ''参数名称'',\n    min: 0,\n    max: 1,\n  })\n}\n```\n\n**注意**：\n- 方法名统一使用 `debugInit()`（不是 `debugInit` 或 `setDebug`）\n- 通过 `this.debug.ui` 访问 Tweakpane 实例\n- 通过 `this.debug.active` 判断是否启用\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### ❌ 缺少 destroy() 方法\n\n```javascript\n// BAD: 组件创建了 mesh 但没有 destroy\nclass BadComponent {\n  constructor() {\n    this.mesh = new THREE.Mesh(...)\n    this.scene.add(this.mesh)\n  }\n  // 没有 destroy() → 内存泄漏\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ 调试方法命名不一致\n\n```javascript\n// BAD: 使用其他命名\ndebuggerInit() { }      // ❌\nsetDebug() { }       // ❌\n\n// GOOD: 统一命名\ndebugInit() { }   // ✅\n```\n\n### ❌ 直接访问 debug.ui 而非 debug\n\n```javascript\n// BAD: 直接提取 ui\nthis.debug = this.experience.debug.ui // ❌\n\n// GOOD: 提取 debug 对象\nthis.debug = this.experience.debug // ✅\n// 然后通过 this.debug.ui 访问面板\n```\n\n### ❌ 事件监听未清理\n\n```javascript\n// BAD: 绑定事件但没清理\nconstructor() {\n  emitter.on(''game:event'', this.handler.bind(this))\n}\n// 没有在 destroy() 中 emitter.off()\n\n// GOOD: 保存引用并清理\nconstructor() {\n  this._boundHandler = this.handler.bind(this)\n  emitter.on(''game:event'', this._boundHandler)\n}\ndestroy() {\n  emitter.off(''game:event'', this._boundHandler)\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ 通过 update() 参数传递时间\n\n```javascript\n// BAD: 通过参数传递\nupdate(deltaTime) {\n  this.mesh.rotation.y += deltaTime\n}\n\n// GOOD: 通过 Experience 访问\nupdate() {\n  const delta = this.experience.time.delta\n  this.mesh.rotation.y += delta * 0.001\n}\n```\n\n## Special Case: Independent Scene\n\n如需创建独立于主场景的 3D 视图（如 UI 预览），**不使用 Experience 单例**：\n\n```javascript\n// 参考 src/js/components/skin-preview-scene.js\nclass IndependentScene {\n  constructor(canvas) {\n    // 创建独立的 scene/camera/renderer\n    this.scene = new THREE.Scene()\n    this.camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(...)\n    this.renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n这是唯一允许不使用 Experience 单例的情况。\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| 规则 | 要求 |\n|------|------|\n| 单例访问 | `this.experience = new Experience()` |\n| 依赖提取 | 只取所需 |\n| 调试方法 | `debugInit()`（统一命名） |\n| 调试访问 | `this.debug = this.experience.debug` |\n| 时间访问 | `this.experience.time`（不通过参数） |\n| destroy | 涉及 Object3D 必须实现 |\n| 事件清理 | destroy() 中 `emitter.off()` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:28:37.548Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing 3D component modeling with Vite and Three.js","zh":"非常适合需要使用Vite和Three.js进行3D组件建模的前端代理","ja":"ViteとThree.jsを使用した3Dコンポーネントモデリングが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Vite와 Three.js를 사용하여 3D 컴포넌트 모델링이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan modelado de componentes 3D con Vite y Three.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend qui ont besoin de modélisation de composants 3D avec Vite et Three.js","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die 3D-Komponenten-Modellierung mit Vite und Three.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de modelagem de componentes 3D com Vite e Three.js","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима трехмерная модель компонентов с помощью Vite и Three.js","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى نمذجة مكونات 3D باستخدام Vite و Three.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standardized 3D components using a class-based singleton pattern, implementing lifecycle methods and accessing shared resources through the Experience singleton, leveraging Vite and Three.js for optimized 3D rendering","zh":"赋予代理创建标准化的3D组件的能力，使用基于类的单例模式，实现生命周期方法，通过Experience单例访问共享资源，利用Vite和Three.js进行优化的3D渲染","ja":"クラスベースのシングルトンパターンを使用して標準化された3Dコンポーネントを作成するエージェントを可能にし、ライフサイクルメソッドを実装し、Experienceシングルトンを介して共有リソースにアクセスし、ViteとThree.jsを使用して最適化された3Dレンダリングを実現する","ko":"클래스 기반의 싱글턴 패턴을 사용하여 표준화된 3D 컴포넌트를 생성하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 라이프사이클 메서드를 구현하고, Experience 싱글턴을 통해 공유 리소스에 접근하며, Vite와 Three.js를 사용하여 최적화된 3D 렌더링을 실현하는","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes 3D estandarizados utilizando un patrón de singleton basado en clase, implementando métodos de ciclo de vida y accediendo a recursos compartidos a través de la instancia Experience, aprovechando Vite y Three.js para una representación 3D optimizada","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants 3D standardisés en utilisant un modèle de singleton basé sur une classe, en implémentant des méthodes de cycle de vie et en accédant à des ressources partagées via l''instance Experience, en exploitant Vite et Three.js pour un rendu 3D optimisé","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, standardisierte 3D-Komponenten mithilfe eines klassenbasierten Singleton-Musters zu erstellen, Lebenszyklusmethoden zu implementieren und über das Experience-Singleton auf gemeinsam genutzte Ressourcen zuzugreifen, wobei Vite und Three.js für eine optimierte 3D-Darstellung genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes 3D padronizados usando um padrão de singleton baseado em classes, implementando métodos de ciclo de vida e acessando recursos compartilhados por meio do singleton Experience, aproveitando Vite e Three.js para renderização 3D otimizada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стандартизированные трехмерные компоненты, используя классический шаблон singleton, реализуя методы жизненного цикла и получая доступ к общим ресурсам через singleton Experience, используя Vite и Three.js для оптимизированной трехмерной визуализации","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات 3D معيارية باستخدام نمط 单一 الحالة المبني على الفئات، وتنفيذ طرق دورة الحياة والوصول إلى الموارد المشتركة من خلال Experience 单一 الحالة، واستغلال Vite و Three.js لتحسين تقديم 3D"},"useCases":{"en":["Building 3D objects with standardized lifecycle methods","Creating managers and controllers for 3D scenes","Implementing utilities for 3D component interaction"],"zh":["使用标准化的生命周期方法构建3D对象","创建3D场景的管理器和控制器","实现3D组件交互的实用程序"],"ja":["標準化されたライフサイクルメソッドを使用して3Dオブジェクトを構築する","3Dシーンのマネージャーとコントローラーを作成する","3Dコンポーネントの相互作用のためのユーティリティを実装する"],"ko":["표준화된 라이프사이클 메서드를 사용하여 3D 객체를 구축하는","3D 장면의 관리자와 컨트롤러를 생성하는","3D 컴포넌트 상호작용을 위한 유틸리티를 구현하는"],"es":["Construir objetos 3D con métodos de ciclo de vida estandarizados","Crear administradores y controladores para escenas 3D","Implementar utilidades para la interacción con componentes 3D"],"fr":["Construire des objets 3D avec des méthodes de cycle de vie standardisées","Créer des gestionnaires et des contrôleurs pour des scènes 3D","Implémenter des utilitaires pour l''interaction avec des composants 3D"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Objekten mit standardisierten Lebenszyklusmethoden","Erstellen von Managern und Controllern für 3D-Szenen","Implementieren von Utilitys für die Interaktion mit 3D-Komponenten"],"pt":["Construir objetos 3D com métodos de ciclo de vida padronizados","Criar gerentes e controladores para cenas 3D","Implementar utilitários para interação de componentes 3D"],"ru":["Построение трехмерных объектов со стандартизированными методами жизненного цикла","Создание менеджеров и контроллеров для трехмерных сцен","Реализация утилит для взаимодействия с трехмерными компонентами"],"ar":["بناء كائنات 3D ذات دورة حياة معيارية","إنشاء مديرين ومراقبين لمشهد 3D","تنفيذ أدوات لتفاعل مكونات 3D"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite and Three.js integration","Follows a specific class-based singleton pattern","Limited to 3D component modeling use cases"],"zh":["需要Vite和Three.js集成","遵循特定的基于类的单例模式","仅限3D组件建模用例"],"ja":["ViteとThree.jsの統合が必要","特定のクラスベースのシングルトンパターンに従う","3Dコンポーネントモデリングのユースケースに限定される"],"ko":["Vite와 Three.js의 통합이 필요","특정 클래스 기반의 싱글턴 패턴을 따름","3D 컴포넌트 모델링의 유스케이스에 제한"],"es":["Requiere la integración de Vite y Three.js","Sigue un patrón de singleton basado en clase específico","Limitado a casos de uso de modelado de componentes 3D"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de Vite et Three.js","Suive un modèle de singleton basé sur une classe spécifique","Limité à des cas d''utilisation de modélisation de composants 3D"],"de":["Benötigt die Integration von Vite und Three.js","Folgt einem bestimmten klassenbasierten Singleton-Muster","Begrenzt auf Anwendungsfälle für die Modellierung von 3D-Komponenten"],"pt":["Requer integração com Vite e Three.js","Sigue um padrão de singleton baseado em classes específico","Limitado a casos de uso de modelagem de componentes 3D"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Vite и Three.js","Следует определенному классическому шаблону singleton","Ограничен случаями использования трехмерной модели компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع Vite و Three.js","يتبع نمطًا محددًا من 单一 الحالة المبني على الفئات","محدود لحالات استخدام نمذجة المكونات 3D"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
