hould be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\nrules/_sections.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:28:38.026Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React and Next.js performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React 和 Next.js 性能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js のパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 및 Next.js 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin d''un rendimiento optimisé de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein optimiertes React- und Next.js-Performance benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется оптимизированное выполнение React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى أداء محسّن ل React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 45 条规则和 8 个类别来自动化 React 和 Next.js 应用的重构和代码生成的能力，按照影响力优先，并利用 Vercel 的综合性能优化指南。","ja":"エージェントに、React と Next.js アプリケーションのリファクタリングとコード生成を自動化する能力を付与します。45 のルールと 8 つのカテゴリを使用し、影響力に基づいて優先し、Vercel の包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션의 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 자동화하는 능력을 부여합니다. 45개의 규칙과 8개의 카테고리를 사용하여 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 지정하며 Vercel의 포괄적인 성능 최적화 가이드를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 45 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto, y aprovechando la guía de optimización de rendimiento integral de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide d''optimisation des performances complet de Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwendet werden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert und die umfassende Leistungsoptimierungsanleitung von Vercel nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js usando 45 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e aproveitando o guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho da Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 45 правил в 8 категориях, отсортированных по воздействию, и опираясь на всесторонний гид по оптимизации производительности Vercel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تسهيل إعادة هيكلة الترميز وتوليد الشفرة البرمجية لتطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب الأثر، وتستفيد من دليل تحسين الأداء الشامل من Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance","Implementing data fetching optimizations for client and server-side rendering","Reviewing code for performance issues and generating automated fixes"],"zh":["为更好的性能重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码","为客户端和服务器端渲染实现数据获取优化","查看代码中的性能问题并生成自动修复"],"ja":["パフォーマンスを向上させるために既存の React と Next.js コードをリファクタリングする","クライアント側とサーバー側のレンダリングのためのデータ取得最適化を実装する","コードのパフォーマンスの問題を確認し、自動修復を生成する"],"ko":["より 나은 성능을 위해 기존 React 및 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하는 것","클라이언트 측 및 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 데이터 가져오기 최적화를 구현하는 것","코드의 성능 문제를 검토하고 자동 수정을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar optimizaciones de recuperación de datos para la representación del cliente y del servidor","Revisar el código en busca de problemas de rendimiento y generar soluciones automatizadas"],"fr":["Refactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des optimisations de récupération de données pour le rendu client et serveur","Examiner le code pour les problèmes de performances et générer des correctifs automatisés"],"de":["Bestehenden React- und Next.js-Code für bessere Leistung neu strukturieren","Datenabruf-Optimierungen für Client- und Server-Seitige Rendering implementieren","Code auf Leistungsprobleme überprüfen und automatisierte Lösungen generieren"],"pt":["Reorganização do código React e Next.js existente para melhor desempenho","Implementação de otimizações de recuperação de dados para renderização do lado do cliente e do servidor","Revisão do código para problemas de desempenho e geração de soluções automatizadas"],"ru":["Рефакторинг существующего кода React и Next.js для лучшей производительности","Реализация оптимизаций извлечения данных для рендеринга на стороне клиента и сервера","Проверка кода на наличие проблем с производительностью и генерация автоматических исправлений"],"ar":["إعادة تنظيم رمز React و Next.js الحالي لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ تحسينات لاسترجاع البيانات لعرض العميل والخادم","مراجعة الشفرة للعثور على مشاكل الأداء وتوليد الإصلاحات التلقائية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js application","Limited to Vercel''s predefined 45 rules and 8 categories"],"zh":["需要 React 或 Next.js 应用","仅限 Vercel 的预定义 45 条规则和 8 个类别"],"ja":["React または Next.js アプリケーションが必要","Vercel の事前定義された 45 のルールと 8 つのカテゴリに限定される"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 애플리케이션이 필요함","Vercel의 사전 정의된 45개의 규칙 및 8개의 카테고리만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una aplicación de React o Next.js","Limitado a las 45 reglas y 8 categorías predefinidas de Vercel"],"fr":["Nécessite une application React ou Next.js","Limité aux 45 règles et 8 catégories prédéfinies de Vercel"],"de":["Benötigt eine React- oder Next.js-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf die 45 vordefinierten Regeln und 8 Kategorien von Vercel"],"pt":["Exige aplicação React ou Next.js","Limitado às 45 regras predefinidas e 8 categorias da Vercel"],"ru":["Требует применения React или Next.js","Ограничен 45 предопределенными правилами и 8 категориями Vercel"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيق React أو Next.js","محدود بالقواعد والفئات الثماني المحددة مسبقًا من Vercel"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nilecui/SkillsBase/prompt-factory', 'community', 'nilecui', 'SkillsBase', 'nilecui/SkillsBase', 'prompt-factory', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z', '2026-02-18T13:28:45.606Z', NULL, '{"id":"nilecui/SkillsBase/prompt-factory","name":"prompt-factory","description":{"zh":"Prompt Factory是一种综合系统，用于生成世界级、生产就绪的提示，消除了迭代的需要。它通过提出5-7个问题来理解要求，并生成一个全面的提示文档","ja":"Prompt Factoryは、ワールドクラスで生产就绪なプロンプトを生成するための総合システムです。イテレーションは不要です。5〜7つの質問を通じて要件を理解し、包括的なプロンプト文書を生成します","ko":"Prompt Factory는 세계 최고의 생산 준비가 된 프롬프트를 생성하는 통합 시스템입니다. 이터레이션이 필요 없습니다. 5~7개의 질문을 통해 요구 사항을 이해하고 포괄적인 프롬프트 문서를 생성합니다","es":"La fábrica de prompts es un sistema que genera prompts de clase mundial en un solo paso, eliminando la necesidad de iteraciones","fr":"L''usine de prompts est un système qui génère des prompts de classe mondiale en un seul étape, éliminant le besoin d''itérations","de":"Die Prompt-Fabrik ist ein System, das weltklasse-Prompts in einem Schritt generiert und das Bedürfnis nach Iterationen eliminiert","pt":"A Fábrica de Prompt é um sistema para gerar prompts de produção de mundo-classe sem necessidade de iteração.","ru":"Фабрика Промптов - это система для генерации промптов мирового класса без необходимости итерации.","ar":"مصنع الاستدعاء هو نظام لإنشاء استدعاءات من الدرجة العالمية بدون حاجة إلى التكرار.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Prompt Factory - 自动生成世界级提示","ja":"Prompt Factory - ワールドクラスのプロンプトを生成","ko":"Prompt Factory - 세계 최고의 프롬프트 생성","es":"Fábrica de Prompts: Generación de Prompts de Clase Mundial","fr":"Usine de Prompts: Génération de Prompts de Classe Mondiale","de":"Prompt-Fabrik: Erstellung von Weltklasse-Prompts","pt":"Fábrica de Prompt: Gere Prompts de Mundo-Classe","ru":"Фабрика Промптов: Генерируйте Промпты Мирового Класса","ar":"مصنع الاستدعاء: قم بإنشاء استدعاءات من الدرجة العالمية","en":"prompt-factory"},"descripti