delage de données","Commandes essentielles pour les migrations et les mises à jour"],"de":["Type-sichere Datenbankanwendungen","Unterstützung für PostgreSQL 18","Drizzle ORM für Datenmodellierung","Essentielle Befehle für Migrationen und Updates"],"pt":["Geração de migração a partir de alterações de esquema","Aplicação de migrações pendentes","Envio direto do esquema (somente para desenvolvimento)","Abertura do navegador de banco de dados","Suporte a relacionamentos de um-para-muitos","Tipagem segura de dados"],"ru":["Генерация миграции из изменений схемы","Применение_PENDING миграций","Прямая отправка схемы (только для разработки)","Открытие браузера базы данных","Поддержка отношений один-ко-многим","Безопасная типизация данных"],"ar":["إنشاء هجرة من تغييرات مخطط","تطبيق هجرات معلقة","إرسال مخطط مباشر (فقط للتنمية)","فتح متصفح قاعدة البيانات","دعم علاقات واحد-للكثير","تصنيف بيانات آمن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Postgres Drizzle","类型安全数据库","PostgreSQL 18","Drizzle ORM","数据库应用","自动迁移","数据库浏览器"],"ja":["Postgres Drizzle","タイプセーフなデータベース","PostgreSQL 18","Drizzle ORM","データベースアプリケーション","自動マイグレーション","データベースブラウザ"],"ko":["Postgres Drizzle","유형 안전한 데이터베이스","PostgreSQL 18","Drizzle ORM","데이터베이스 애플리케이션","자동 마이그레이션","데이터베이스 브라우저"],"es":["Postgres Drizzle","ORM","PostgreSQL 18","Type-safe database applications","Drizzle ORM","Base de datos","Diseño de base de datos","Modelado de datos"],"fr":["Postgres Drizzle","ORM","PostgreSQL 18","Applications de base de données sécurisées","Drizzle ORM","Base de données","Conception de base de données","Modélisation de données"],"de":["Postgres Drizzle","ORM","PostgreSQL 18","Type-sichere Datenbankanwendungen","Drizzle ORM","Datenbank","Datenbankdesign","Datenmodellierung"],"pt":["Postgres","Drizzle ORM","banco de dados","tipagem segura","migração","esquema","relacionamentos","desenvolvimento de aplicações","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"ru":["Postgres","Drizzle ORM","база данных","безопасная типизация","миграция","схема","отношения","разработка приложений","TypeScript","JavaScript"],"ar":["Postgres","Drizzle ORM","قاعدة البيانات","تصنيف آمن","هجرة","مخطط","علاقات","تنمية التطبيقات","TypeScript","JavaScript"]}},"owner":"multideskio","repo":"vinha_admin_center","repoPath":"multideskio/vinha_admin_center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"postgres-drizzle","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM\n\nType-safe database applications with PostgreSQL 18 and Drizzle ORM.\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n```bash\nnpx drizzle-kit generate   # Generate migration from schema changes\nnpx drizzle-kit migrate    # Apply pending migrations\nnpx drizzle-kit push       # Push schema directly (dev only!)\nnpx drizzle-kit studio     # Open database browser\n```\n\n## Quick Decision Trees\n\n### \"How do I model this relationship?\"\n\n```\nRelationship type?\n├─ One-to-many (user has posts)     → FK on","body":"# PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM\n\nType-safe database applications with PostgreSQL 18 and Drizzle ORM.\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n```bash\nnpx drizzle-kit generate   # Generate migration from schema changes\nnpx drizzle-kit migrate    # Apply pending migrations\nnpx drizzle-kit push       # Push schema directly (dev only!)\nnpx drizzle-kit studio     # Open database browser\n```\n\n## Quick Decision Trees\n\n### \"How do I model this relationship?\"\n\n```\nRelationship type?\n├─ One-to-many (user has posts)     → FK on \"many\" side + relations()\n├─ Many-to-many (posts have tags)   → Junction table + relations()\n├─ One-to-one (user has profile)    → FK with unique constraint\n└─ Self-referential (comments)      → FK to same table\n```\n\n### \"Why is my query slow?\"\n\n```\nSlow query?\n├─ Missing index on WHERE/JOIN columns  → Add index\n├─ N+1 queries in loop                  → Use relational queries API\n├─ Full table scan                      → EXPLAIN ANALYZE, add index\n├─ Large result set                     → Add pagination (limit/offset)\n└─ Connection overhead                  → Enable connection pooling\n```\n\n### \"Which drizzle-kit command?\"\n\n```\nWhat do I need?\n├─ Schema changed, need SQL migration   → drizzle-kit generate\n├─ Apply migrations to database         → drizzle-kit migrate\n├─ Quick dev iteration (no migration)   → drizzle-kit push\n└─ Browse/edit data visually            → drizzle-kit studio\n```\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nsrc/db/\n├── schema/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Re-export all tables\n│   ├── users.ts          # Table + relations\n│   └── posts.ts          # Table + relations\n├── db.ts                 # Connection with pooling\n└── migrate.ts            # Migration runner\ndrizzle/\n└── migrations/           # Generated SQL files\ndrizzle.config.ts         # drizzle-kit config\n```\n\n## Schema Patterns\n\n### Basic Table with Timestamps\n\n```typescript\nexport const users = pgTable(''users'', {\n  id: uuid(''id'').primaryKey().defaultRandom(),\n  email: varchar(''email'', { length: 255 }).notNull().unique(),\n  createdAt: timestamp(''created_at'').defaultNow().notNull(),\n  updatedAt: timestamp(''updated_at'').defaultNow().notNull(),\n})\n```\n\n### Foreign Key with Index\n\n```typescript\nexport const posts = pgTable(\n  ''posts'',\n  {\n    id: uuid(''id'').primaryKey().defaultRandom(),\n    userId: uuid(''user_id'')\n      .notNull()\n      .references(() => users.id),\n    title: varchar(''title'', { length: 255 }).notNull(),\n  },\n  (table) => [\n    index(''posts_user_id_idx'').on(table.userId), // ALWAYS index FKs\n  ],\n)\n```\n\n### Relations\n\n```typescript\nexport const usersRelations = relations(users, ({ many }) => ({\n  posts: many(posts),\n}))\n\nexport const postsRelations = relations(posts, ({ one }) => ({\n  author: one(users, { fields: [posts.userId], references: [users.id] }),\n}))\n```\n\n## Query Patterns\n\n### Relational Query (Avoid N+1)\n\n```typescript\n// ✓ Single query with nested data\nconst usersWithPosts = await db.query.users.findMany({\n  with: { posts: true },\n})\n```\n\n### Filtered Query\n\n```typescript\nconst activeUsers = await db.select().from(users).where(eq(users.status, ''active''))\n```\n\n### Transaction\n\n```typescript\nawait db.transaction(async (tx) => {\n  const [user] = await tx.insert(users).values({ email }).returning()\n  await tx.insert(profiles).values({ userId: user.id })\n})\n```\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\n| Priority | Check                                  | Impact                             |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| CRITICAL | Index all foreign keys                 | Prevents full table scans on JOINs |\n| CRITICAL | Use relational queries for nested data | Avoids N+1                         |\n| HIGH     | Connection pooling in production       | Reduces connection overhead        |\n| HIGH     | `EXPLAIN ANALYZE` slow queries         | Identifies missing indexes         |\n| MEDIUM   | Partial indexes for filtered subsets   | Smaller, faster indexes            |\n| MEDIUM   | UUIDv7 for PKs (PG18+)                 | Better index locality              |\n\n## Anti-Patterns (CRITICAL)\n\n| Anti-Pattern             | Problem                    | Fix                                       |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **No FK index**          | Slow JOINs, full scans     | Add index on every FK column              |\n| **N+1 in loops**         | Query per row              | Use `with:` relational queries            |\n| **No pooling**           | Connection per request     | Use `@neondatabase/serverless` or similar |\n| **`push` in prod**       | Data loss risk             | Always use `generate` + `migrate`         |\n| **Storing JSON as text** | No validation, bad queries | Use `jsonb()` column type                 |\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n| File                                                   | Purpose                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| [references/SCHEMA.md](references/SCHEMA.md)           | Column types, constraints        |\n| [references/QUERIES.md](references/QUERIES.md)         | Operators, joins, aggregations   |\n| [references/RELATIONS.md](references/RELATIONS.md)     | One-to-many, many-to-many        |\n| [references/MIGRATIONS.md](references/MIGRATIONS.md)   | drizzle-kit workflows            |\n| [references/POSTGRES.md](references/POSTGRES.md)       | PG18 features, RLS, partitioning |\n| [references/PERFORMANCE.md](references/PERFORMANCE.md) | Indexing, optimization           |\n| [references/CHEATSHEET.md](references/CHEATSHEET.md)   | Quick reference                  |\n\n## Resources\n\n### Drizzle ORM\n\n- **Official Documentation**: https://orm.drizzle.team\n- **GitHub Repository**: https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm\n- **Drizzle Kit (Migrations)**: https://orm.drizzle.team/kit-docs/overview\n\n### PostgreSQL\n\n- **Official Documentation**: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/\n- **SQL Commands Reference**: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-commands.html\n- **Performance Tips**: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/performance-tips.html\n- **Index Types**: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/indexes-types.html\n- **JSON Functions**: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-json.html\n- **Row Level Security**: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-rowsecurity.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:29:20.526Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Data Analysis Agents requiring type-safe PostgreSQL interactions with Drizzle ORM","zh":"适用于需要与 Drizzle ORM 交互的类型安全 PostgreSQL 的数据分析代理","ja":"Drizzle ORM を使用した型安全の PostgreSQL インタラクションを必要とするデータ分析エージェントに適しています","ko":"Drizzle ORM을 사용하는 타입 안전한 PostgreSQL 상호작용을 필요로 하는 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de datos que requieren interacciones con PostgreSQL de tipo seguro con Drizzle ORM","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant des interactions PostgreSQL de type sécurisé avec Drizzle ORM","de":"Ideal für Data-Analytics-Agents, die typsichere PostgreSQL-Interaktionen mit Drizzle ORM erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Dados que exigem interações tipo-seguras com PostgreSQL utilizando Drizzle ORM","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа данных, требующих безопасных типов взаимодействий с PostgreSQL с помощью Drizzle ORM","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات التي تتطلب التفاعلات آمنة نوع مع PostgreSQL باستخدام Drizzle ORM"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate migrations from schema changes, apply pending migrations, and push schema directly to PostgreSQL 18 databases using Drizzle ORM, ensuring type-safe database applications with npx drizzle-kit commands","zh":"赋予代理从模式更改生成迁移、应用待处理迁移以及使用 Drizzle ORM 将模式直接推送到 PostgreSQL 18 数据库的能力，确保使用 npx drizzle-kit 命令的类型安全数据库应用","ja":"スキーマの変更からマイグレーションを生成し、保留中のマイグレーションを適用し、Drizzle ORM を使用して直接 PostgreSQL 18 データベースにスキーマをプッシュする機能をエージェントに与え、npx drizzle-kit コマンドを使用して型安全なデータベースアプリケーションを保証する","ko":"스키마 변경으로부터 마이그레이션을 생성하고, 대기 중인 마이그레이션을 적용하고, Drizzle ORM을 사용하여 직접 PostgreSQL 18 데이터베이스에 스키마를 푸시하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여 npx drizzle-kit 명령을 사용하는 타입 안전한 데이터베이스 애플리케이션을 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar migraciones a partir de cambios en el esquema, aplicar migraciones pendientes y enviar el esquema directamente a bases de datos PostgreSQL 18 mediante comandos de npx drizzle-kit, asegurando aplicaciones de base de datos de tipo seguro con comandos de npx drizzle-kit","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des migrations à partir de modifications de schéma, d''appliquer des migrations en attente et de pousser le schéma directement vers les bases de données PostgreSQL 18 à l''aide de commandes npx drizzle-kit, garantissant des applications de base de données de type sécurisé avec des commandes npx drizzle-kit","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Migrationen aus Schemäänderungen zu generieren, ausstehende Migrationen anzuwenden und das Schema direkt an PostgreSQL-18-Datenbanken mit npx-drizzle-kit-Befehlen zu übertragen, wodurch typsichere Datenbankanwendungen mit npx-drizzle-kit-Befehlen gewährleistet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar migrações a partir de alterações de esquema, aplicar migrações pendentes e enviar esquema diretamente para bancos de dados PostgreSQL 18 usando Drizzle ORM, garantindo aplicações de banco de dados seguras com comandos npx drizzle-kit","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать миграции из изменений схемы, применять ожидаемые миграции и отправлять схему напрямую в базы данных PostgreSQL 18 с помощью Drizzle ORM, обеспечивая безопасные приложения базы данных с командами npx drizzle-kit","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد هجرات من تغييرات المخطط، وتطبيق الهجرات المعلقة، وضغط المخطط مباشرة إلى قواعد بيانات PostgreSQL 18 باستخدام Drizzle ORM، مما يضمن تطبيقات قواعد البيانات آمنة مع أوامر npx drizzle-kit"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating migration scripts from schema updates","Applying pending migrations to PostgreSQL databases","Pushing schema changes directly for development environments","Opening database browsers for schema inspection"],"zh":["从模式更新生成迁移脚本","将待处理迁移应用于 PostgreSQL 数据库","直接将模式更改推送到开发环境","打开数据库浏览器以检查模式"],"ja":["スキーマの更新からマイグレーションスクリプトを生成する","PostgreSQL データベースに保留中のマイグレーションを適用する","開発環境に直接スキーマの変更をプッシュする","スキーマを確認するためにデータベースブラウザーを開く"],"ko":["스키마 업데이트로부터 마이그레이션 스크립트를 생성한다","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스에 대기 중인 마이그레이션을 적용한다","개발 환경에 직접 스키마 변경을 푸시한다","스키마를 확인하기 위해 데이터베이스 브라우저를 연다"],"es":["Generar scripts de migración a partir de actualizaciones de esquema","Aplicar migraciones pendientes a bases de datos de PostgreSQL","Enviar cambios de esquema directamente para entornos de desarrollo","Abrir navegadores de base de datos para inspeccionar el esquema"],"fr":["Générer des scripts de migration à partir de mises à jour de schéma","Appliquer des migrations en attente aux