adas","Utiliza decisiones en árbol para encontrar el marco y los componentes adecuados","Carga referencias detalladas"],"fr":["Utilisez create-tui pour de nouveaux projets","Suivez les règles critiques pour le succès","Créez des interfaces utilisateur de terminal personnalisées","Utilisez des décisions en arbre pour trouver le cadre et les composants appropriés","Chargez des références détaillées"],"de":["Verwenden Sie create-tui für neue Projekte","Folgen Sie den kritischen Regeln für den Erfolg","Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Terminal-Benutzeroberflächen","Verwenden Sie Entscheidungsbäume, um den richtigen Rahmen und die richtigen Komponenten zu finden","Laden Sie detaillierte Referenzen"],"pt":["Crie novos projetos com create-tui","Use opções create-tui antes dos argumentos","Siga as regras críticas para um desenvolvimento eficaz","Acesse referências detalhadas para frameworks e componentes","Use decisões em árvore para encontrar o framework e os componentes certos"],"ru":["Создавайте новые проекты с помощью create-tui","Используйте опции create-tui до аргументов","Следуйте критическим правилам для эффективного развития","Доступ к подробным справочникам для фреймворков и компонентов","Используйте дерево решений, чтобы найти правильный фреймворк и компоненты"],"ar":["أنشئ مشاريع جديدة مع create-tui","استخدم خيارات create-tui قبل المعاملات","اتبع القواعد الحرجة من أجل تطوير فعال","أクセس إلى المراجع المفصلة لFrameworks والمكونات","استخدم شجرة القرارات لإيجاد الإطار والمكونات الصحيحين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenTUI","终端用户界面","开发平台","create-tui","终端应用程序","框架","组件"],"ja":["OpenTUI","ターミナルユーザーインターフェース","開発プラットフォーム","create-tui","ターミナルアプリケーション","フレームワーク","コンポーネント"],"ko":["OpenTUI","터미널 사용자 인터페이스","개발 플랫폼","create-tui","터미널 애플리케이션","프레임워크","컴포넌트"],"es":["OpenTUI","interfaces de usuario de terminal","create-tui","reglas críticas","desarrollo de software","plataformas de código abierto","terminal","usuario","interfaz"],"fr":["OpenTUI","interfaces utilisateur de terminal","create-tui","règles critiques","développement de logiciels","plate-formes open source","terminal","utilisateur","interface"],"de":["OpenTUI","Terminal-Benutzeroberflächen","create-tui","kritische Regeln","Software-Entwicklung","Open-Source-Plattformen","Terminal","Benutzer","Oberfläche"],"pt":["OpenTUI","interfaces de usuário de terminal","create-tui","desenvolvimento de software","plataforma de código aberto","terminal user interface","tui","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["OpenTUI","терминальные интерфейсы пользователя","create-tui","разработка программного обеспечения","открытая платформа","terminal user interface","tui","разработчики"],"ar":["OpenTUI","واجهات المستخدم النهائية","create-tui","تطوير البرمجيات","منصة مفتوحة المصدر","terminal user interface","tui","مطوّرون"]}},"owner":"ryolambert","repo":"kiro-wiz","repoPath":"ryolambert/kiro-wiz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opentui","description":"Comprehensive OpenTUI skill for building terminal user interfaces. Covers the core imperative API, React reconciler, and Solid reconciler. Use for any TUI development task including components, layout, keyboard handling, animations, and testing.","bodyPreview":"# OpenTUI Platform Skill\n\nConsolidated skill for building terminal user interfaces with OpenTUI. Use decision trees below to find the right framework and components, then load detailed references.\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n**Follow these rules in all OpenTUI code:**\n\n1. **Use `create-tui` for new projects.** See framework `REFERENCE.md` quick starts.\n2. **`create-tui` options must come before arguments.** `bunx create-tui -t react my-app` works, `bunx create-tui my-app -t react` does NOT.\n3. **Never c","body":"# OpenTUI Platform Skill\n\nConsolidated skill for building terminal user interfaces with OpenTUI. Use decision trees below to find the right framework and components, then load detailed references.\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n**Follow these rules in all OpenTUI code:**\n\n1. **Use `create-tui` for new projects.** See framework `REFERENCE.md` quick starts.\n2. **`create-tui` options must come before arguments.** `bunx create-tui -t react my-app` works, `bunx create-tui my-app -t react` does NOT.\n3. **Never call `process.exit()` directly.** Use `renderer.destroy()` (see `core/gotchas.md`).\n4. **Text styling requires nested tags in React/Solid.** Use modifier elements, not props (see `components/text-display.md`).\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n### Reference File Structure\n\nFramework references follow a 5-file pattern. Cross-cutting concepts are single-file guides.\n\nEach framework in `./references/<framework>/` contains:\n\n| File | Purpose | When to Read |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| `REFERENCE.md` | Overview, when to use, quick start | **Always read first** |\n| `api.md` | Runtime API, components, hooks | Writing code |\n| `configuration.md` | Setup, tsconfig, bundling | Configuring a project |\n| `patterns.md` | Common patterns, best practices | Implementation guidance |\n| `gotchas.md` | Pitfalls, limitations, debugging | Troubleshooting |\n\nCross-cutting concepts in `./references/<concept>/` have `REFERENCE.md` as the entry point.\n\n### Reading Order\n\n1. Start with `REFERENCE.md` for your chosen framework\n2. Then read additional files relevant to your task:\n   - Building components -> `api.md` + `components/<category>.md`\n   - Setting up project -> `configuration.md`\n   - Layout/positioning -> `layout/REFERENCE.md`\n   - Troubleshooting -> `gotchas.md` + `testing/REFERENCE.md`\n\n### Example Paths\n\n```\n./references/react/REFERENCE.md           # Start here for React\n./references/react/api.md              # React components and hooks\n./references/solid/configuration.md    # Solid project setup\n./references/components/inputs.md      # Input, Textarea, Select docs\n./references/core/gotchas.md           # Core debugging tips\n```\n\n### Runtime Notes\n\nOpenTUI runs on Bun and uses Zig for native builds. Read `./references/core/gotchas.md` for runtime requirements and build guidance.\n\n## Quick Decision Trees\n\n### \"Which framework should I use?\"\n\n```\nWhich framework?\n├─ I want full control, maximum performance, no framework overhead\n│  └─ core/ (imperative API)\n├─ I know React, want familiar component patterns\n│  └─ react/ (React reconciler)\n├─ I want fine-grained reactivity, optimal re-renders\n│  └─ solid/ (Solid reconciler)\n└─ I''m building a library/framework on top of OpenTUI\n   └─ core/ (imperative API)\n```\n\n### \"I need to display content\"\n\n```\nDisplay content?\n├─ Plain or styled text -> components/text-display.md\n├─ Container with borders/background -> components/containers.md\n├─ Scrollable content area -> components/containers.md (scrollbox)\n├─ ASCII art banner/title -> components/text-display.md (ascii-font)\n├─ Code with syntax highlighting -> components/code-diff.md\n├─ Diff viewer (unified/split) -> components/code-diff.md\n└─ Line numbers with diagnostics -> components/code-diff.md\n```\n\n### \"I need user input\"\n\n```\nUser input?\n├─ Single-line text field -> components/inputs.md (input)\n├─ Multi-line text editor -> components/inputs.md (textarea)\n├─ Select from a list (vertical) -> components/inputs.md (select)\n├─ Tab-based selection (horizontal) -> components/inputs.md (tab-select)\n└─ Custom keyboard shortcuts -> keyboard/REFERENCE.md\n```\n\n### \"I need layout/positioning\"\n\n```\nLayout?\n├─ Flexbox-style layouts (row, column, wrap) -> layout/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Absolute positioning -> layout/patterns.md\n├─ Responsive to terminal size -> layout/patterns.md\n├─ Centering content -> layout/patterns.md\n└─ Complex nested layouts -> layout/patterns.md\n```\n\n### \"I need animations\"\n\n```\nAnimations?\n├─ Timeline-based animations -> animation/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Easing functions -> animation/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Property transitions -> animation/REFERENCE.md\n└─ Looping animations -> animation/REFERENCE.md\n```\n\n### \"I need to handle input\"\n\n```\nInput handling?\n├─ Keyboard events (keypress, release) -> keyboard/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Focus management -> keyboard/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Paste events -> keyboard/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Mouse events -> components/containers.md\n└─ Text selection -> components/text-display.md\n```\n\n### \"I need to test my TUI\"\n\n```\nTesting?\n├─ Snapshot testing -> testing/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Interaction testing -> testing/REFERENCE.md\n├─ Test renderer setup -> testing/REFERENCE.md\n└─ Debugging tests -> testing/REFERENCE.md\n```\n\n### \"I need to debug/troubleshoot\"\n\n```\nTroubleshooting?\n├─ Runtime errors, crashes -> <framework>/gotchas.md\n├─ Layout issues -> layout/REFERENCE.md + layout/patterns.md\n├─ Input/focus issues -> keyboard/REFERENCE.md\n└─ Repro + regression tests -> testing/REFERENCE.md\n```\n\n### Troubleshooting Index\n\n- Terminal cleanup, crashes -> `core/gotchas.md`\n- Text styling not applying -> `components/text-display.md`\n- Input focus/shortcuts -> `keyboard/REFERENCE.md`\n- Layout misalignment -> `layout/REFERENCE.md`\n- Flaky snapshots -> `testing/REFERENCE.md`\n\nFor component naming differences and text modifiers, see `components/REFERENCE.md`.\n\n## Product Index\n\n### Frameworks\n| Framework | Entry File | Description |\n|-----------|------------|-------------|\n| Core | `./references/core/REFERENCE.md` | Imperative API, all primitives |\n| React | `./references/react/REFERENCE.md` | React reconciler for declarative TUI |\n| Solid | `./references/solid/REFERENCE.md` | SolidJS reconciler for declarative TUI |\n\n### Cross-Cutting Concepts\n| Concept | Entry File | Description |\n|---------|------------|-------------|\n| Layout | `./references/layout/REFERENCE.md` | Yoga/Flexbox layout system |\n| Components | `./references/components/REFERENCE.md` | Component reference by category |\n| Keyboard | `./references/keyboard/REFERENCE.md` | Keyboard input handling |\n| Animation | `./references/animation/REFERENCE.md` | Timeline-based animations |\n| Testing | `./references/testing/REFERENCE.md` | Test renderer and snapshots |\n\n### Component Categories\n| Category | Entry File | Components |\n|----------|------------|------------|\n| Text & Display | `./references/components/text-display.md` | text, ascii-font, styled text |\n| Containers | `./references/components/containers.md` | box, scrollbox, borders |\n| Inputs | `./references/components/inputs.md` | input, textarea, select, tab-select |\n| Code & Diff | `./references/components/code-diff.md` | code, line-number, diff |\n\n## Resources\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/anomalyco/opentui\n**Core Docs**: https://github.com/anomalyco/opentui/tree/main/packages/core/docs\n**Examples**: https://github.com/anomalyco/opentui/tree/main/packages/core/src/examples\n**Awesome List**: https://github.com/msmps/awesome-opentui\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:29:48.958Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Terminal User Interface Agents needing advanced decision tree navigation and component management with OpenTUI.","zh":"非常适合需要使用OpenTUI进行高级决策树导航和组件管理的终端用户界面代理","ja":"OpenTUIを使用した高度な決定ツリーのナビゲーションとコンポーネント管理が必要なターミナルユーザーインターフェースエージェントに最適","ko":"OpenTUI를 사용하여 고급 결정 트리 탐색 및 컴포넌트 관리가 필요한 터미널 사용자 인터페이스 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Interfaz de Usuario de Terminal que necesitan una navegación avanzada de árbol de decisión y gestión de componentes con OpenTUI.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Interface Utilisateur de Terminal nécessitant une navigation avancée d''arbre de décision et une gestion de composants avec OpenTUI.","de":"Perfekt für Terminal-Benutzeroberflächen-Agents, die eine erweiterte Entscheidungsbaum-Navigation und Komponentenverwaltung mit OpenTUI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Interface de Usuário de Terminal que necessitam de navegação avançada de árvore de decisões e gerenciamento de componentes com OpenTUI.","ru":"Идеально для Терминальных Интерфейсов Пользователя, которым требуются продвинутые навигации по дереву решений и управление компонентами с помощью OpenTUI.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات واجهة المستخدم الطرفية التي تحتاج إلى التنقل المتقدم في شجرة القرار وإدارة المكونات مع OpenTUI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build terminal user interfaces using decision trees and load detailed references with `create-tui`, while ensuring proper option ordering and framework usage, such as `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`.","zh":"赋予代理构建使用决策树和加载详细参考的终端用户界面使用`create-tui`的能力，同时确保正确的选项排序和框架使用，例如`bunx create-tui -t react my-app`","ja":"`create-tui`を使用して決定ツリーと詳細なリファレンスをロードしてターミナルユーザーインターフェースを構築するエージェントを可能にし、適切なオプションの順序とフレームワークの使用を確保する、たとえば`bunx create-tui -t react my-app`","ko":"`create-tui`를 사용하여 결정 트리 및 자세한 참조를 로드하여 터미널 사용자 인터페이스를 구축하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 적절한 옵션 순서와 프레임워크 사용을 보장한다. 예를 들어 `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir interfaces de usuario de terminal utilizando árboles de decisión y cargar referencias detalladas con `create-tui`, al mismo tiempo que garantiza el orden correcto de las opciones y el uso del marco, como `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des interfaces utilisateur de terminal en utilisant des arbres de décision et de charger des références détaillées avec `create-tui`, tout en garantissant l''ordre correct des options et l''utilisation du cadre, comme `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Terminal-Benutzeroberflächen mit Entscheidungsbäumen und detaillierten Referenzen mit `create-tui` zu erstellen, während gleichzeitig die richtige Reihenfolge der Optionen und die Verwendung des Frameworks sichergestellt wird, wie z.B. `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces de usuário de terminal usando árvores de decisões e carregar referências detalhadas com `create-tui`, garantindo a ordem correta de opções e uso de estrutura, como `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать терминальные интерфейсы пользователя с помощью деревьев решений и загружать подробные ссылки с помощью `create-tui`, обеспечивая правильный порядок опций и использование фреймворка, например, `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء واجهات المستخدم الطرفية باستخدام أشجار القرار وتحميل المراجع المفصلة مع `create-tui` ، مع ضمان الترتيب الصحيح للخيارات واستخدام الإطار ، مثل `bunx create-tui -t react my-app`."},"useCases":{"en":["Building terminal user interfaces with OpenTUI","Managing decision trees for UI component selection","Loading detailed references for framework-specific implementations"],"zh":["使用OpenTUI构建终端用户界面","管理决策树用于UI组件选择","加载详细参考用于框架特定实现"],"ja":["OpenTUIを使用してターミナルユーザーインターフェースを構築する","決定ツリーを管理してUIコンポーネントを選択する","詳細なリファレンスをロードしてフレームワーク固有の実装を行う"],"ko":["OpenTUI를 사용하여 터미널 사용자 인터페이스를 구축하는 것","결정 트리를 관리하여 UI 컴포넌트를 선택하는 것","자세한 참조를 로드하여 프레임워크 특정 구현을 하는 것"],"es":["Construir interfaces de usuario de terminal con OpenTUI","Gestionar árboles de decisión para la selección de componentes de la interfaz de usuario","Cargar referencias detalladas para implementaciones específicas del marco"],"fr":["Construire des interfaces utilisateur de terminal avec OpenTUI","Gérer des arbres de décision pour la sélection de composants d''interface utilisateur","Charger des références détaillées pour des implémentations spécifiques au cadre"],"de":["Terminal-Benutzeroberflächen mit OpenTUI erstellen","Entscheidungsbäume für die Auswahl von Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten verwalten","Detaillierte Referenzen für framework-spezifische Implementierungen laden"],"pt":["Construir interfaces de usuário de terminal com OpenTUI","Gerenciar árvores de decisões para seleção de componentes de UI","Carregar referências detalhadas para implementações específicas de estrutura"],"ru":["Создание терминальных интерфейсов пользователя с помощью OpenTUI","Управление деревьями решений для выбора компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Загрузка подробных ссылок для реализаций, специфичных для фреймворка"],"ar":["بناء واجهات المستخدم الطرفية مع OpenTUI","إدارة أشجار القرار لتحديد مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تحميل المراجع المفصلة للتنفيذات الخاصة بالإطار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proper `create-tui` option ordering","Must follow critical rules for OpenTUI code"],"zh":["需要正确的`create-tui`选项排序","必须遵循OpenTUI代码的关键规则"],"ja":["適切な`create-tui`オプションの順序が必要","OpenTUIコードの重要なルールに従う必要がある"],"ko":["적절한 `create-tui` 옵션 순서가 필요","OpenTUI 코드의 중요한 규칙을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere el orden correcto de opciones de `create-tui`","Debe seguir reglas críticas para el código OpenTUI"],"fr":["Nécessite l''ordre correct des options de `create-tui`","Doit suivre des règles critiques pour le code OpenTUI"],"de":["Erfordert die richtige Reihenfolge der `create-tui`-Optionen","Muss kritische Regeln für den OpenTUI-Code befolgen"],"pt":["Exige ordem correta de opções `create-tui`","Deve seguir regras críticas para código OpenTUI"],"ru":["Требует правильного порядка опций `create-tui`","Должно следовать критическим правилам для кода OpenTUI"],"ar":["يتطلب ترتيبًا صحيحًا لخيارات `create-tui`","يجب اتباع قواعد حرجة لкод OpenTUI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
