I 플랫폼의 아키텍처와 기능에 대한 전문가 수준의 정보를 제공합니다","es":"La guía de Backend.AI proporciona información experta sobre la plataforma, incluyendo su arquitectura y funcionalidades.","fr":"Le guide de Backend.AI fournit des informations d''expert sur la plateforme, notamment son architecture et ses fonctionnalités.","de":"Die Anleitung für Backend.AI bietet Experteninformationen über die Plattform, einschließlich ihrer Architektur und Funktionen.","pt":"A guia de Backend.AI fornece informações especializadas sobre a plataforma, incluindo arquitetura e recursos.","ru":"Руководство по Backend.AI предоставляет экспертную информацию о платформе, включая архитектуру и функции.","ar":"دليل Backend.AI يوفر معلومات متخصصة حول المنصة، بما في ذلك الهندسة المعمارية والخصائص.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["提供 Backend.AI 平台的官方文档","递归探索主要组件文档链接","提供关于 Backend.AI 架构和特性的准确答案","支持技术细节的获取","提供专家级信息"],"ja":["Backend.AI プラットフォームの公式ドキュメントを提供","主要コンポーネントのドキュメントリンクを再帰的に探索","Backend.AI のアーキテクチャと機能に関する正確な回答を提供","技術的な詳細を取得することをサポート","専門家レベルの情報を提供"],"ko":["Backend.AI 플랫폼의 공식 문서 제공","주요 구성 요소 문서 링크를 재귀적으로 탐색","Backend.AI 아키텍처와 기능에 대한 정확한 답변 제공","기술적인 세부 정보를 얻는 것을 지원","전문가 수준의 정보 제공"],"es":["Información experta sobre la arquitectura de Backend.AI","Recursos y funcionalidades de la plataforma","Enlaces a documentación oficial y técnicas","Respuestas precisas y respaldadas por fuentes","Exploración recursiva de componentes principales"],"fr":["Informations d''expert sur l''architecture de Backend.AI","Ressources et fonctionnalités de la plateforme","Liens vers la documentation officielle et technique","Réponses précises et étayées par des sources","Exploration récursive des composants principaux"],"de":["Experteninformationen über die Architektur von Backend.AI","Ressourcen und Funktionen der Plattform","Links zur offiziellen und technischen Dokumentation","Genaue und quellengestützte Antworten","Rekursive Exploration von Hauptkomponenten"],"pt":["Documentação oficial do repositório GitHub do Backend.AI","Exploração recursiva de links de documentação de componentes principais","Seguimento de links relevantes para obter detalhes técnicos abrangentes","Respostas precisas e baseadas em fontes sobre a arquitetura e os recursos do Backend.AI","Suporte ao desenvolvimento de plataformas personalizadas"],"ru":["Официальная документация из репозитория GitHub Backend.AI","Рекурсивное исследование ссылок на документацию основных компонентов","Следование релевантным ссылкам для сбора всесторонней технической информации","Точные и основанные на источниках ответы об архитектуре и функциях Backend.AI","Поддержка разработки индивидуальных платформ"],"ar":["التعليمات الرسمية من مستودع GitHub لمنصة Backend.AI","استكشاف متكرر لروابط وثائق المكونات الرئيسية","متابعة الروابط ذات الصلة للحصول على تفاصيل فنية شاملة","إجابات دقيقة ومستندة إلى مصادر حول هندسة Backend.AI والخصائص","دعم تطوير المنصات المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Backend.AI","AI 解决方案","技术指南","官方文档","架构","特性","技术细节"],"ja":["Backend.AI","AI ソリューション","技術ガイド","公式ドキュメント","アーキテクチャ","機能","技術的な詳細"],"ko":["Backend.AI","AI 솔루션","기술 가이드","공식 문서","아키텍처","기능","기술적인 세부 정보"],"es":["Backend.AI","desarrollo de backend","plataformas de desarrollo","recursos para desarrolladores","arquitectura de software","funcionalidades de Backend.AI"],"fr":["Backend.AI","développement de backend","plateformes de développement","ressources pour les développeurs","architecture de logiciel","fonctionnalités de Backend.AI"],"de":["Backend.AI","Entwicklung von Backend","Entwicklungsplattformen","Ressourcen für Entwickler","Software-Architektur","Funktionen von Backend.AI"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de plataformas","Backend.AI","arquitetura de software","recursos de desenvolvimento","documentação técnica","desenvolvimento de software personalizado"],"ru":["разработка платформ","Backend.AI","архитектура программного обеспечения","функции разработки","техническая документация","индивидуальная разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير المنصات","Backend.AI","هندسة البرمجيات","ميزات التطوير","توثيق فني","تطوير برمجيات مخصص"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-ai-guide","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Backend.AI Guide Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides expert-level information about the Backend.AI platform by:\n\n- Fetching official documentation from the Backend.AI GitHub repository\n- Recursively exploring Major Components documentation links\n- Following relevant links to gather comprehensive technical details\n- Providing accurate, source-backed answers about Backend.AI architecture and features\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when the user asks about:\n\n- Backend.AI platform overvie","body":"# Backend.AI Guide Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides expert-level information about the Backend.AI platform by:\n\n- Fetching official documentation from the Backend.AI GitHub repository\n- Recursively exploring Major Components documentation links\n- Following relevant links to gather comprehensive technical details\n- Providing accurate, source-backed answers about Backend.AI architecture and features\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when the user asks about:\n\n- Backend.AI platform overview or architecture\n- Backend.AI components (Manager, Agent, Storage Proxy, Webserver, App Proxy)\n- Backend.AI setup, requirements, or infrastructure\n- Backend.AI APIs (REST, GraphQL)\n- Backend.AI features (session scheduling, resource allocation, multi-tenancy)\n- Backend.AI kernels, containers, or runtime elements\n- How the WebUI connects to or interacts with Backend.AI backend\n- Differences between Backend.AI components\n\n## Primary Documentation Sources\n\n1. **Main README**: https://github.com/lablup/backend.ai/blob/main/README.md\n\n   - Overview and architecture\n   - Major Components section with component links\n   - Requirements and setup information\n\n2. **Major Component READMEs**: Follow links from the Major Components section\n\n   - Manager component details\n   - Agent component details\n   - Storage Proxy details\n   - Webserver details\n   - App Proxy details\n   - And other components\n\n3. **Recursive Link Following**: When a component README references additional documentation, follow those links to gather comprehensive information\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Identify the Question Scope\n\n- Determine what aspect of Backend.AI the user is asking about\n- Identify which components or features are relevant\n\n### Step 2: Fetch the Main README\n\n- Always start by fetching: https://github.com/lablup/backend.ai/blob/main/README.md\n- Extract key information relevant to the question\n- Identify links to Major Components that need to be explored\n\n### Step 3: Recursively Fetch Component Documentation\n\n- For questions about specific components, fetch their individual READMEs\n- Component README links are found in the \"Major Components\" section\n- Example component paths (adjust based on actual links):\n  - Manager: `src/ai/backend/manager/README.md`\n  - Agent: `src/ai/backend/agent/README.md`\n  - Storage Proxy: `src/ai/backend/storage/README.md`\n  - Webserver: `src/ai/backend/web/README.md`\n  - App Proxy: `src/ai/backend/appproxy/README.md`\n\n### Step 4: Follow Additional Links\n\n- If component READMEs reference additional documentation, follow those links\n- Common additional documentation types:\n  - Architecture diagrams\n  - API documentation\n  - Configuration guides\n  - Development guides\n- **Important**: Only follow links that are relevant to answering the user''s question\n\n### Step 5: Synthesize and Present Information\n\n- Combine information from all fetched sources\n- Structure the answer logically:\n  1. Direct answer to the user''s question\n  2. Supporting details from official documentation\n  3. Related component interactions (if applicable)\n  4. Links to source documentation for further reading\n- Use clear headings and formatting\n- Include code examples or configuration snippets when relevant\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always Cite Sources**\n\n   - Reference the specific documentation URLs you fetched\n   - Help users find more detailed information\n\n2. **Stay Current**\n\n   - Fetch documentation fresh each time (don''t rely on cached knowledge)\n   - Note version requirements (Python, Docker, PostgreSQL, etc.)\n\n3. **Explain Component Interactions**\n\n   - Backend.AI is a distributed system - explain how components work together\n   - Clarify the relationship between WebUI (this project) and Backend.AI backend\n\n4. **Be Precise with Technical Details**\n\n   - Include version numbers, requirements, and configuration details\n   - Distinguish between different API types (REST vs GraphQL)\n\n5. **Limit Recursion Depth**\n   - Fetch main README + relevant component READMEs\n   - Only follow 1-2 additional link levels unless user needs deep details\n   - Balance thoroughness with response time\n\n## Example Question Types\n\n**Architecture Questions**\n\n- \"How does Backend.AI work?\"\n- \"What is the architecture of Backend.AI?\"\n- \"What are the main components of Backend.AI?\"\n\n**Component Questions**\n\n- \"What does the Backend.AI Manager do?\"\n- \"How does the Agent component work?\"\n- \"What is the Storage Proxy?\"\n\n**Integration Questions**\n\n- \"How does this WebUI connect to Backend.AI?\"\n- \"What APIs does Backend.AI expose?\"\n- \"How do I authenticate with Backend.AI?\"\n\n**Setup Questions**\n\n- \"What are the requirements for Backend.AI?\"\n- \"How do I set up Backend.AI?\"\n- \"What infrastructure does Backend.AI need?\"\n\n## Response Format\n\nStructure answers as follows:\n\n```markdown\n## [Direct Answer to Question]\n\n[Concise, direct answer based on official documentation]\n\n## Details\n\n[Supporting information from fetched documentation]\n\n### Component Interactions (if applicable)\n\n[How different components work together]\n\n## Technical Specifications (if applicable)\n\n- Requirements: [versions, dependencies]\n- Configuration: [relevant settings]\n- APIs: [REST/GraphQL endpoints]\n\n## Source Documentation\n\n- Main: [URL to main README]\n- Component: [URLs to component READMEs]\n- Additional: [URLs to other relevant docs]\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Backend.AI is the **backend platform** that this WebUI project connects to\n- This WebUI (backend.ai-webui) is a **client application** that uses Backend.AI''s APIs\n- When users ask about \"the backend\" in this project context, they likely mean Backend.AI\n- Distinguish between WebUI code (this project) and Backend.AI platform code (separate repo)\n\n## Limitations\n\n- This skill only fetches publicly available GitHub documentation\n- For questions requiring internal documentation or specific deployment details, direct users to Backend.AI team\n- Cannot access private repositories or non-public documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:29:45.904Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical AI Agents needing in-depth knowledge of the Backend.AI platform architecture and features","zh":"非常适合需要深入了解 Backend.AI 平台架构和功能的技术 AI 代理","ja":"Backend.AI プラットフォームのアーキテクチャと機能に関する詳細な知識を必要とするテクニカル AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Backend.AI 플랫폼 아키텍처 및 기능에 대한 심층적인 지식이 필요한 기술 AI 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Técnicos que necesitan conocimientos en profundidad de la arquitectura y las características de la plataforma Backend.AI","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Techniques ayant besoin de connaissances approfondies de l''architecture et des fonctionnalités de la plateforme Backend.AI","de":"Perfekt für technische KI-Agents, die umfassendes Wissen über die Architektur und Funktionen der Backend.AI-Plattform benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Técnicos que necessitam de conhecimento aprofundado da arquitetura e recursos da plataforma Backend.AI","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов ИИ, которым требуется глубокое знание архитектуры и функций платформы Backend.AI","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الفني الذي يحتاج إلى معرفة متعمقة بهيئة وسمات منصة Backend.AI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide accurate and source-backed answers about Backend.AI by fetching official documentation from the Backend.AI GitHub repository and recursively exploring Major Components documentation links, utilizing protocols like GitHub API and handling file formats like Markdown","zh":"使代理能够通过从 Backend.AI GitHub 存储库中获取官方文档并递归探索主要组件文档链接，利用 GitHub API 等协议和处理 Markdown 等文件格式，提供有关 Backend.AI 的准确和可靠的答案","ja":"Backend.AI の公式ドキュメントを Backend.AI GitHub リポジトリから取得し、メジャー コンポーネントのドキュメント リンクを再帰的に探索することで、GitHub API などのプロトコルを利用し、Markdown などのファイル形式を処理して、Backend.AI に関する正確で信頼できる回答を提供できるようにエージェントをエンパワーする","ko":"Backend.AI GitHub 저장소에서 공식 문서를 가져오고 주요 컴포넌트 문서 링크를 재귀적으로 탐색하여 GitHub API와 같은 프로토콜을 활용하고 Markdown와 같은 파일 형식을 처리함으로써 Backend.AI에 관한 정확하고 신뢰할 수 있는 답변을 제공할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a proporcionar respuestas precisas y respaldadas por fuentes sobre Backend.AI al recuperar la documentación oficial desde el repositorio de GitHub de Backend.AI y explorar recursivamente los enlaces de documentación de los Componentes Principales, utilizando protocolos como la API de GitHub y manejando formatos de archivo como Markdown","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des réponses précises et étayées par des sources sur Backend.AI en récupérant la documentation officielle à partir du référentiel GitHub de Backend.AI et en explorant de manière récursive les liens de documentation des Composants Majeurs, en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''API GitHub et en gérant des formats de fichiers tels que Markdown","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, genaue und durch Quellen gestützte Antworten über Backend.AI zu liefern, indem sie die offizielle Dokumentation aus dem Backend.AI-GitHub-Repository abrufen und rekursiv die Dokumentationslinks der Hauptkomponenten erkunden, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie der GitHub-API und der Verarbeitung von Dateiformaten wie Markdown","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer respostas precisas e comprovadas sobre Backend.AI, buscando documentação oficial do repositório GitHub do Backend.AI e explorando recursivamente links de documentação de Componentes Principais, utilizando protocolos como GitHub API e lidando com formatos de arquivo como Markdown","ru":"Позволяет агентам предоставлять точные и подтвержденные ответы о Backend.AI, извлекая официальную документацию из репозитория GitHub Backend.AI и рекурсивно исследуя ссылки на документацию основных компонентов, используя протоколы как GitHub API и обрабатывая форматы файлов как Markdown","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية تقديم إجابات دقيقة ومستندة عن Backend.AI من خلال استرجاع الوثائق الرسمية من مستودع Backend.AI على GitHub والتنقل بشكل متكرر في وصلات وثائق المكونات الرئيسية، واستخدام πρωتوكولات مثل GitHub API ومعالجة تنسيقات الملفات مثل Markdown"},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching official Backend.AI documentation","Exploring Major Components documentation links","Providing technical details about Backend.AI architecture"],"zh":["获取官方 Backend.AI 文档","探索主要组件文档链接","提供有关 Backend.AI 架构的技术详细信息"],"ja":["公式 Backend.AI ドキュメントの取得","メジャー コンポーネントのドキュメント リンクの探索","Backend.AI アーキテクチャに関する技術的な詳細情報の提供"],"ko":["공식 Backend.AI 문서 가져오기","주요 컴포넌트 문서 링크 탐색","Backend.AI 아키텍처에 관한 기술적인 상세 정보 제공"],"es":["Recuperar la documentación oficial de Backend.AI","Explorar los enlaces de documentación de los Componentes Principales","Proporcionar detalles técnicos sobre la arquitectura de Backend.AI"],"fr":["Récupérer la documentation officielle de Backend.AI","Explorer les liens de documentation des Composants Majeurs","Fournir des détails techniques sur l''architecture de Backend.AI"],"de":["Abrufen der offiziellen Backend.AI-Dokumentation","Erkunden der Dokumentationslinks der Hauptkomponenten","Bereitstellen von technischen Details zur Architektur von Backend.AI"],"pt":["Buscar documentação oficial do Backend.AI","Explorar links de documentação de Componentes Principais","Fornecer detalhes técnicos sobre a arquitetura do Backend.AI"],"ru":["Извлечение официальной документации Backend.AI","Изучение ссылок на документацию основных компонентов","Предоставление технических подробностей об архитектуре Backend.AI"],"ar":["استرجاع الوثائق الرسمية لمنصة Backend.AI","استكشاف وصلات وثائق المكونات الرئيسية","توفير تفاصيل فنية حول هيئة منصة Backend.AI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Backend.AI GitHub repository","Limited to Backend.AI platform information"],"zh":["需要访问 Backend.AI GitHub 存储库","仅限 Backend.AI 平台信息"],"ja":["Backend.AI GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","Backend.AI プラットフォーム情報のみ"],"ko":["Backend.AI GitHub 저장소에 접근해야 함","Backend.AI 플랫폼 정보만"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub de Backend.AI","Limitado a la información de la plataforma Backend.AI"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub de Backend.AI","Limité aux informations de la plateforme Backend.AI"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Backend.AI-GitHub-Repository","Begrenzt auf Informationen der Backend.AI-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório GitHub do Backend.AI","Limitado às informações da plataforma Backend.AI"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub Backend.AI","Ограничен информацией о платформе Backend.AI"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Backend.AI على GitHub","محدود بمعلومات منصة Backend.AI"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
