tificar errores comunes en el código Python. Ayuda a detectar problemas temprano.","fr":"La liste de contrôle des anti-patrons Python est une référence pour identifier les erreurs courantes dans le code Python. Elle aide à détecter les problèmes ...","de":"Die Checkliste für Python-Anti-Muster ist eine Referenz zur Identifizierung häufiger Fehler im Python-Code. Sie hilft, Probleme frühzeitig zu erkennen.","pt":"O skill python-anti-patterns fornece uma lista de verificação de padrões antagonistas comuns em Python, ajudando a detectar erros precocemente.","ru":"Навык python-anti-patterns предоставляет список проверки распространенных анти-шаблонов в Python, giúpая обнаруживать ошибки на ранней стадии.","ar":"المهارة python-anti-patterns توفر قائمة التحقق من الأنماط المضادة الشائعة في بايثون، مما يساعد في الكشف عن الأخطاء في وقت مبكر.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Python "," "," ","Python "," "],"ja":["Python","","","Python",""],"ko":["Python ","","","Python ",""],"es":["Lista de verificación de patrones anti-Python","Identificación de errores comunes en el código","Mejora de la calidad y la eficiencia del código","Ayuda para la depuración de errores","Establecimiento de estándares de codificación para equipos"],"fr":["Liste de contrôle des anti-patrons Python","Identification des erreurs courantes dans le code","Amélioration de la qualité et de l''efficacité du code","Aide à la débogage des erreurs","Établissement de normes de codage pour les équipes"],"de":["Checkliste für Python-Anti-Muster","Identifizierung häufiger Fehler im Code","Verbesserung der Qualität und Effizienz des Codes","Hilfe bei der Fehlersuche","Festlegung von Codierungsstandards für Teams"],"pt":["Lista de verificação de padrões antagonistas comuns","Ajuda a detectar erros precocemente","Melhora a qualidade do código","Otimiza a manutenção do código","Fornece orientação para boas práticas de codificação"],"ru":["Список проверки распространенных анти-шаблонов","Помогает обнаруживать ошибки на ранней стадии","Улучшает качество кода","Оптимизирует поддержку кода","Предоставляет руководство по хорошим практикам кодирования"],"ar":["قائمة التحقق من الأنماط المضادة الشائعة","تساعد في الكشف عن الأخطاء في وقت مبكر","تحسن جودة الكود","ت tốiميز صيانة الكود","توفر إرشادات لprakтиك برمجية جيدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python ","Python "," ","Python "," "," "],"ja":["Python","Python","","Python","",""],"ko":["Python ","Python ","","Python ","",""],"es":["patrones anti-Python","mejora de código","depuración de errores","estándares de codificación","calidad del código","eficiencia del código"],"fr":["anti-patrons Python","amélioration de code","débogage des erreurs","normes de codage","qualité du code","efficacité du code"],"de":["Python-Anti-Muster","Code-Optimierung","Fehlersuche","Codierungsstandards","Code-Qualität","Code-Effizienz"],"pt":["padrões antagonistas python","anti-padrões python","boas práticas de codificação python","qualidade de código python","manutenção de código python","desenvolvimento de software python"],"ru":["анти-шаблоны python","плохие практики кодирования python","хорошие практики кодирования python","качество кода python","поддержка кода python","разработка программного обеспечения python"],"ar":["أنماط مضادة بايثون","ممارسات برمجية سيئة بايثون","praktiك برمجية جيدة بايثون","جودة كود بايثون","صيانة كود بايثون","تطوير برمجيات بايثون"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-anti-patterns","description":"Common Python anti-patterns to avoid. Use as a checklist when reviewing code, before finalizing implementations, or when debugging issues that might stem from known bad practices.","bodyPreview":"# Python Anti-Patterns Checklist\n\nA reference checklist of common mistakes and anti-patterns in Python code. Review this before finalizing implementations to catch issues early.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Reviewing code before merge\n- Debugging mysterious issues\n- Teaching or learning Python best practices\n- Establishing team coding standards\n- Refactoring legacy code\n\n**Note:** This skill focuses on what to avoid. For guidance on positive patterns and architecture, see the `python-design-pat","body":"# Python Anti-Patterns Checklist\n\nA reference checklist of common mistakes and anti-patterns in Python code. Review this before finalizing implementations to catch issues early.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Reviewing code before merge\n- Debugging mysterious issues\n- Teaching or learning Python best practices\n- Establishing team coding standards\n- Refactoring legacy code\n\n**Note:** This skill focuses on what to avoid. For guidance on positive patterns and architecture, see the `python-design-patterns` skill.\n\n## Infrastructure Anti-Patterns\n\n### Scattered Timeout/Retry Logic\n\n```python\n# BAD: Timeout logic duplicated everywhere\ndef fetch_user(user_id):\n    try:\n        return requests.get(url, timeout=30)\n    except Timeout:\n        logger.warning(\"Timeout fetching user\")\n        return None\n\ndef fetch_orders(user_id):\n    try:\n        return requests.get(url, timeout=30)\n    except Timeout:\n        logger.warning(\"Timeout fetching orders\")\n        return None\n```\n\n**Fix:** Centralize in decorators or client wrappers.\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Centralized retry logic\n@retry(stop=stop_after_attempt(3), wait=wait_exponential())\ndef http_get(url: str) -> Response:\n    return requests.get(url, timeout=30)\n```\n\n### Double Retry\n\n```python\n# BAD: Retrying at multiple layers\n@retry(max_attempts=3)  # Application retry\ndef call_service():\n    return client.request()  # Client also has retry configured!\n```\n\n**Fix:** Retry at one layer only. Know your infrastructure''s retry behavior.\n\n### Hard-Coded Configuration\n\n```python\n# BAD: Secrets and config in code\nDB_HOST = \"prod-db.example.com\"\nAPI_KEY = \"sk-12345\"\n\ndef connect():\n    return psycopg.connect(f\"host={DB_HOST}...\")\n```\n\n**Fix:** Use environment variables with typed settings.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\nfrom pydantic_settings import BaseSettings\n\nclass Settings(BaseSettings):\n    db_host: str = Field(alias=\"DB_HOST\")\n    api_key: str = Field(alias=\"API_KEY\")\n\nsettings = Settings()\n```\n\n## Architecture Anti-Patterns\n\n### Exposed Internal Types\n\n```python\n# BAD: Leaking ORM model to API\n@app.get(\"/users/{id}\")\ndef get_user(id: str) -> UserModel:  # SQLAlchemy model\n    return db.query(UserModel).get(id)\n```\n\n**Fix:** Use DTOs/response models.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\n@app.get(\"/users/{id}\")\ndef get_user(id: str) -> UserResponse:\n    user = db.query(UserModel).get(id)\n    return UserResponse.from_orm(user)\n```\n\n### Mixed I/O and Business Logic\n\n```python\n# BAD: SQL embedded in business logic\ndef calculate_discount(user_id: str) -> float:\n    user = db.query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\", user_id)\n    orders = db.query(\"SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = ?\", user_id)\n    # Business logic mixed with data access\n    if len(orders) > 10:\n        return 0.15\n    return 0.0\n```\n\n**Fix:** Repository pattern. Keep business logic pure.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef calculate_discount(user: User, orders: list[Order]) -> float:\n    # Pure business logic, easily testable\n    if len(orders) > 10:\n        return 0.15\n    return 0.0\n```\n\n## Error Handling Anti-Patterns\n\n### Bare Exception Handling\n\n```python\n# BAD: Swallowing all exceptions\ntry:\n    process()\nexcept Exception:\n    pass  # Silent failure - bugs hidden forever\n```\n\n**Fix:** Catch specific exceptions. Log or handle appropriately.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ntry:\n    process()\nexcept ConnectionError as e:\n    logger.warning(\"Connection failed, will retry\", error=str(e))\n    raise\nexcept ValueError as e:\n    logger.error(\"Invalid input\", error=str(e))\n    raise BadRequestError(str(e))\n```\n\n### Ignored Partial Failures\n\n```python\n# BAD: Stops on first error\ndef process_batch(items):\n    results = []\n    for item in items:\n        result = process(item)  # Raises on error - batch aborted\n        results.append(result)\n    return results\n```\n\n**Fix:** Capture both successes and failures.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef process_batch(items) -> BatchResult:\n    succeeded = {}\n    failed = {}\n    for idx, item in enumerate(items):\n        try:\n            succeeded[idx] = process(item)\n        except Exception as e:\n            failed[idx] = e\n    return BatchResult(succeeded, failed)\n```\n\n### Missing Input Validation\n\n```python\n# BAD: No validation\ndef create_user(data: dict):\n    return User(**data)  # Crashes deep in code on bad input\n```\n\n**Fix:** Validate early at API boundaries.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef create_user(data: dict) -> User:\n    validated = CreateUserInput.model_validate(data)\n    return User.from_input(validated)\n```\n\n## Resource Anti-Patterns\n\n### Unclosed Resources\n\n```python\n# BAD: File never closed\ndef read_file(path):\n    f = open(path)\n    return f.read()  # What if this raises?\n```\n\n**Fix:** Use context managers.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef read_file(path):\n    with open(path) as f:\n        return f.read()\n```\n\n### Blocking in Async\n\n```python\n# BAD: Blocks the entire event loop\nasync def fetch_data():\n    time.sleep(1)  # Blocks everything!\n    response = requests.get(url)  # Also blocks!\n```\n\n**Fix:** Use async-native libraries.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\nasync def fetch_data():\n    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:\n        response = await client.get(url)\n```\n\n## Type Safety Anti-Patterns\n\n### Missing Type Hints\n\n```python\n# BAD: No types\ndef process(data):\n    return data[\"value\"] * 2\n```\n\n**Fix:** Annotate all public functions.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef process(data: dict[str, int]) -> int:\n    return data[\"value\"] * 2\n```\n\n### Untyped Collections\n\n```python\n# BAD: Generic list without type parameter\ndef get_users() -> list:\n    ...\n```\n\n**Fix:** Use type parameters.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef get_users() -> list[User]:\n    ...\n```\n\n## Testing Anti-Patterns\n\n### Only Testing Happy Paths\n\n```python\n# BAD: Only tests success case\ndef test_create_user():\n    user = service.create_user(valid_data)\n    assert user.id is not None\n```\n\n**Fix:** Test error conditions and edge cases.\n\n```python\n# GOOD\ndef test_create_user_success():\n    user = service.create_user(valid_data)\n    assert user.id is not None\n\ndef test_create_user_invalid_email():\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError, match=\"Invalid email\"):\n        service.create_user(invalid_email_data)\n\ndef test_create_user_duplicate_email():\n    service.create_user(valid_data)\n    with pytest.raises(ConflictError):\n        service.create_user(valid_data)\n```\n\n### Over-Mocking\n\n```python\n# BAD: Mocking everything\ndef test_user_service():\n    mock_repo = Mock()\n    mock_cache = Mock()\n    mock_logger = Mock()\n    mock_metrics = Mock()\n    # Test doesn''t verify real behavior\n```\n\n**Fix:** Use integration tests for critical paths. Mock only external services.\n\n## Quick Review Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing code, verify:\n\n- [ ] No scattered timeout/retry logic (centralized)\n- [ ] No double retry (app + infrastructure)\n- [ ] No hard-coded configuration or secrets\n- [ ] No exposed internal types (ORM models, protobufs)\n- [ ] No mixed I/O and business logic\n- [ ] No bare `except Exception: pass`\n- [ ] No ignored partial failures in batches\n- [ ] No missing input validation\n- [ ] No unclosed resources (using context managers)\n- [ ] No blocking calls in async code\n- [ ] All public functions have type hints\n- [ ] Collections have type parameters\n- [ ] Error paths are tested\n- [ ] Edge cases are covered\n\n## Common Fixes Summary\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Fix |\n|-------------|-----|\n| Scattered retry logic | Centralized decorators |\n| Hard-coded config | Environment variables + pydantic-settings |\n| Exposed ORM models | DTO/response schemas |\n| Mixed I/O + logic | Repository pattern |\n| Bare except | Catch specific exceptions |\n| Batch stops on error | Return BatchResult with successes/failures |\n| No validation | Validate at boundaries with Pydantic |\n| Unclosed resources | Context managers |\n| Blocking in async | Async-native libraries |\n| Missing types | Type annotations on all public APIs |\n| Only happy path tests | Test errors and edge cases |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:29:55.344Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced Python code analysis and debugging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Python代码分析和调试能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"Pythonコードの高度な分析とデバッグ機能を必要とするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"고급 Python 코드 분석 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades de análisis y depuración de código Python avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et de débogage de code Python avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die erweiterte Python-Code-Analyse- und Debugging-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise avançada de código Python e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа кода Python и отладки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم للكود بايثون وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect and prevent common Python anti-patterns, ensuring adherence to best practices and promoting high-quality code through checklist reviews and debugging mysterious issues using Python''s built-in libraries and syntax.","zh":"使代理能够检测和防止常见的Python反模式，确保遵循最佳实践，并通过清单审查和使用Python的内置库和语法调试神秘问题来促进高质量的代码。","ja":"エージェントが一般的なPythonアンチパターンを検出して防止することを可能にし、ベストプラクティスへの準拠を確保し、チェックリストのレビューとPythonの組み込みライブラリと構文を使用してミステリアスな問題をデバッグすることで、高品質のコードを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 일반적인 Python 반패턴을检测하고 방지할 수 있도록 하여 최고의 관행을 준수하고, 체크리스트 리뷰 및 Python의 내장 라이브러리 및 구문을 사용하여 신비한 문제를 디버깅함으로써, 고품질의 코드를 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar y prevenir anti-patrones comunes de Python, garantizando el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas y promoviendo un código de alta calidad a través de revisiones de lista de verificación y depuración de problemas misteriosos utilizando las bibliotecas y la sintaxis integradas de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter et de prévenir les anti-modèles courants de Python, en garantissant le respect des meilleures pratiques et en promouvant un code de haute qualité grâce à des revues de checklist et au débogage de problèmes mystérieux en utilisant les bibliothèques et la syntaxe intégrées de Python.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, häufige Python-Anti-Muster zu erkennen und zu verhindern, um die Einhaltung der Best Practices sicherzustellen und hochwertigen Code durch Checklisten-Überprüfungen und Debuggen mysteriöser Probleme unter Verwendung der integrierten Bibliotheken und Syntax von Python zu fördern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar e prevenir anti-padrões comuns em Python, garantindo a adesão às melhores práticas e promovendo um código de alta qualidade por meio de revisões de lista de verificação e depuração de problemas misteriosos usando bibliotecas e sintaxe internas do Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и предотвращать распространенные анти-шаблоны Python, обеспечивая соблюдение лучших практик и продвигая высококачественный код посредством проверок по контрольному списку и отладки загадочных проблем с использованием встроенных библиотек и синтаксиса Python.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية الكشف عن منع أنماط مضادة شائعة في بايثون، مما يضمن الالتزام بأفضل الممارسات وتعزيز رمز عالي الجودة من خلال استعراضات قائمة المراجعة وتصحيح مشاكل غامضة باستخدام المكتبات والتركيب المدمج في بايثون."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging mysterious issues in Python code","Reviewing code before merge to catch anti-patterns","Establishing team coding standards with Python best practices"],"zh":["调试Python代码中的神秘问题","在合并前审查代码以捕获反模式","使用Python最佳实践建立团队编码标准"],"ja":["Pythonコードのミステリアスな問題のデバッグ","マージ前のコードレビューでアンチパターンを検出","Pythonのベストプラクティスを使用してチームのコーディング基準を確立"],"ko":["Python 코드의 신비한 문제를 디버깅하기","병합 전 코드를 리뷰하여 반패턴을 捕获하기","Python의 최고의 관행을 사용하여 팀의 코딩 표준을 설정하기"],"es":["Depuración de problemas misteriosos en el código Python","Revisión de código antes de la fusión para detectar anti-patrones","Establecimiento de estándares de codificación de equipo con las mejores prácticas de Python"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes mystérieux dans le code Python","Revue de code avant la fusion pour détecter les anti-modèles","Établissement de normes de codage d''équipe avec les meilleures pratiques de Python"],"de":["Debuggen mysteriöser Probleme im Python-Code","Überprüfung von Code vor dem Merge, um Anti-Muster zu erkennen","Festlegung von Team-Codierungsstandards mit den Best Practices von Python"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas misteriosos no código Python","Revisão de código antes da mesclagem para capturar anti-padrões","Estabelecimento de padrões de codificação da equipe com as melhores práticas em Python"],"ru":["Отладка загадочных проблем в коде Python","Проверка кода перед слиянием, чтобы обнаружить анти-шаблоны","Установление стандартов кодирования команды с лучшими практиками Python"],"ar":["تصحيح مشاكل غامضة في كود بايثون","مراجعة الكود قبل الدمج لالتقاط أنماط مضادة","إنشاء معايير ترميز الفريق بأفضل الممارسات في بايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Focuses on what to avoid, not positive patterns or architecture","Requires Python programming knowledge","Limited to Python-specific anti-patterns"],"zh":["关注于避免什么，而不是积极的模式或架构","需要Python编程知识","仅限于Python特有的反模式"],"ja":["何を避けるべきかではなく、積極的なパターンやアーキテクチャに焦点を当てている","Pythonプログラミングの知識が必要","Python固有のアンチパターンに限定"],"ko":["어떻게 tránh해야 하는지에 초점을 두고,積極的な 模式이나 아키텍처가 아님","Python 프로그래밍 지식이 필요","Python만의 반패턴에 한정"],"es":["Se centra en lo que hay que evitar, no en patrones positivos o arquitectura","Requiere conocimientos de programación en Python","Limitado a anti-patrones específicos de Python"],"fr":["Se concentre sur ce qu''il faut éviter, et non sur les modèles positifs ou l''architecture","Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Python","Limité aux anti-modèles spécifiques à Python"],"de":["Konzentriert sich auf das, was zu vermeiden ist, nicht auf positive Muster oder Architektur","Benötigt Python-Programmierkenntnisse","Begrenzt auf Python-spezifische Anti-Muster"],"pt":["Concentra-se no que evitar, não em padrões positivos ou arquitetura","Requer conhecimento de programação em Python","Limitado a anti-padrões específicos do Python"],"ru":["Сосредоточен на том, чего следует избегать, а не на положительных шаблонах или архитектуре","Требует знаний программирования на Python","Ограничен анти-шаблонами, специфичными для Python"],"ar":["يركز على ما يجب تجنبه، وليس على الأنماط الإيجابية أو الهندسة المعمارية","يتطلب معرفة بالبرمجة بايثون","محدود لأنماط مضادة محددة لبايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
