escription":"Use when facing 2+ independent tasks that can be worked on without shared state or sequential dependencies","bodyPreview":"# Dispatching Parallel Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you have multiple unrelated failures (different test files, different subsystems, different bugs), investigating them sequentially wastes time. Each investigation is independent and can happen in parallel.\n\n**Core principle:** Dispatch one agent per independent problem domain. Let them work concurrently.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Multiple failures?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Are they independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Single","body":"# Dispatching Parallel Agents\n\n## Overview\n\nWhen you have multiple unrelated failures (different test files, different subsystems, different bugs), investigating them sequentially wastes time. Each investigation is independent and can happen in parallel.\n\n**Core principle:** Dispatch one agent per independent problem domain. Let them work concurrently.\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Multiple failures?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Are they independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Single agent investigates all\" [shape=box];\n    \"One agent per problem domain\" [shape=box];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Sequential agents\" [shape=box];\n    \"Parallel dispatch\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Multiple failures?\" -> \"Are they independent?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Are they independent?\" -> \"Single agent investigates all\" [label=\"no - related\"];\n    \"Are they independent?\" -> \"Can they work in parallel?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" -> \"Parallel dispatch\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Can they work in parallel?\" -> \"Sequential agents\" [label=\"no - shared state\"];\n}\n```\n\n**Use when:**\n- 3+ test files failing with different root causes\n- Multiple subsystems broken independently\n- Each problem can be understood without context from others\n- No shared state between investigations\n\n**Don''t use when:**\n- Failures are related (fix one might fix others)\n- Need to understand full system state\n- Agents would interfere with each other\n\n## The Pattern\n\n### 1. Identify Independent Domains\n\nGroup failures by what''s broken:\n- File A tests: Tool approval flow\n- File B tests: Batch completion behavior\n- File C tests: Abort functionality\n\nEach domain is independent - fixing tool approval doesn''t affect abort tests.\n\n### 2. Create Focused Agent Tasks\n\nEach agent gets:\n- **Specific scope:** One test file or subsystem\n- **Clear goal:** Make these tests pass\n- **Constraints:** Don''t change other code\n- **Expected output:** Summary of what you found and fixed\n\n### 3. Dispatch in Parallel\n\n```typescript\n// In Claude Code / AI environment\nTask(\"Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts failures\")\nTask(\"Fix batch-completion-behavior.test.ts failures\")\nTask(\"Fix tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts failures\")\n// All three run concurrently\n```\n\n### 4. Review and Integrate\n\nWhen agents return:\n- Read each summary\n- Verify fixes don''t conflict\n- Run full test suite\n- Integrate all changes\n\n## Agent Prompt Structure\n\nGood agent prompts are:\n1. **Focused** - One clear problem domain\n2. **Self-contained** - All context needed to understand the problem\n3. **Specific about output** - What should the agent return?\n\n```markdown\nFix the 3 failing tests in src/agents/agent-tool-abort.test.ts:\n\n1. \"should abort tool with partial output capture\" - expects ''interrupted at'' in message\n2. \"should handle mixed completed and aborted tools\" - fast tool aborted instead of completed\n3. \"should properly track pendingToolCount\" - expects 3 results but gets 0\n\nThese are timing/race condition issues. Your task:\n\n1. Read the test file and understand what each test verifies\n2. Identify root cause - timing issues or actual bugs?\n3. Fix by:\n   - Replacing arbitrary timeouts with event-based waiting\n   - Fixing bugs in abort implementation if found\n   - Adjusting test expectations if testing changed behavior\n\nDo NOT just increase timeouts - find the real issue.\n\nReturn: Summary of what you found and what you fixed.\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n**❌ Too broad:** \"Fix all the tests\" - agent gets lost\n**✅ Specific:** \"Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts\" - focused scope\n\n**❌ No context:** \"Fix the race condition\" - agent doesn''t know where\n**✅ Context:** Paste the error messages and test names\n\n**❌ No constraints:** Agent might refactor everything\n**✅ Constraints:** \"Do NOT change production code\" or \"Fix tests only\"\n\n**❌ Vague output:** \"Fix it\" - you don''t know what changed\n**✅ Specific:** \"Return summary of root cause and changes\"\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n**Related failures:** Fixing one might fix others - investigate together first\n**Need full context:** Understanding requires seeing entire system\n**Exploratory debugging:** You don''t know what''s broken yet\n**Shared state:** Agents would interfere (editing same files, using same resources)\n\n## Real Example from Session\n\n**Scenario:** 6 test failures across 3 files after major refactoring\n\n**Failures:**\n- agent-tool-abort.test.ts: 3 failures (timing issues)\n- batch-completion-behavior.test.ts: 2 failures (tools not executing)\n- tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts: 1 failure (execution count = 0)\n\n**Decision:** Independent domains - abort logic separate from batch completion separate from race conditions\n\n**Dispatch:**\n```\nAgent 1 → Fix agent-tool-abort.test.ts\nAgent 2 → Fix batch-completion-behavior.test.ts\nAgent 3 → Fix tool-approval-race-conditions.test.ts\n```\n\n**Results:**\n- Agent 1: Replaced timeouts with event-based waiting\n- Agent 2: Fixed event structure bug (threadId in wrong place)\n- Agent 3: Added wait for async tool execution to complete\n\n**Integration:** All fixes independent, no conflicts, full suite green\n\n**Time saved:** 3 problems solved in parallel vs sequentially\n\n## Key Benefits\n\n1. **Parallelization** - Multiple investigations happen simultaneously\n2. **Focus** - Each agent has narrow scope, less context to track\n3. **Independence** - Agents don''t interfere with each other\n4. **Speed** - 3 problems solved in time of 1\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter agents return:\n1. **Review each summary** - Understand what changed\n2. **Check for conflicts** - Did agents edit same code?\n3. **Run full suite** - Verify all fixes work together\n4. **Spot check** - Agents can make systematic errors\n\n## Real-World Impact\n\nFrom debugging session (2025-10-03):\n- 6 failures across 3 files\n- 3 agents dispatched in parallel\n- All investigations completed concurrently\n- All fixes integrated successfully\n- Zero conflicts between agent changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:31:03.797Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Debugging and Testing Agents handling multiple concurrent failures across different subsystems.","zh":"对于调试和测试处理跨不同子系统的多个并发故障的代理至关重要。","ja":"異なるサブシステムにわたる複数の同時発生障害を扱うエージェントのデバッグとテストに不可欠です。","ko":"다른 하위 시스템에서 발생하는 여러 동시 장애를 처리하는 에이전트의 디버깅 및 테스트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para depurar y probar agentes que manejan múltiples fallos concurrentes en diferentes subsistemas.","fr":"Essentiel pour le débogage et les tests d''agents gérant de multiples défaillances simultanées dans différents sous-systèmes.","de":"Unverzichtbar für das Debugging und Testen von Agenten, die mehrere gleichzeitige Fehler in verschiedenen Subsystemen behandeln.","pt":"Essencial para depurar e testar agentes que lidam com múltiplas falhas simultâneas em diferentes subsistemas.","ru":"Необходимо для отладки и тестирования агентов, обрабатывающих множественные одновременные сбои в различных подсистемах.","ar":"ضروري لتصحيح الأخطاء واختبار الوكلاء الذين يتعاملون مع أعطال متعددة متزامنة عبر أنظمة فرعية مختلفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables parallel investigation of independent failures by dispatching dedicated agents per problem domain, drastically reducing debugging time for unrelated issues in different test files or subsystems.","zh":"通过为每个问题领域分派专用代理，支持对独立故障进行并行调查，从而极大缩短了在不同测试文件或子系统中调试不相关问题的时间。","ja":"問題領域ごとに専用エージェントを派遣することで、独立した障害の並列調査を可能にし、異なるテストファイルやサブシステムにおける無関係な問題のデバッグ時間を大幅に短縮します。","ko":"문제 영역별로 전담 에이전트를 파견하여 독립적인 장애에 대한 병렬 조사를 가능하게 하며, 서로 다른 테스트 파일이나 하위 시스템에서 관련 없는 문제를 디버깅하는 시간을 극적으로 줄입니다.","es":"Permite la investigación paralela de fallos independientes mediante el despliegue de agentes dedicados por dominio de problema, reduciendo drásticamente el tiempo de depuración para problemas no relacionados en diferentes archivos de prueba o subsistemas.","fr":"Permet l''investigation parallèle de défaillances indépendantes en déployant des agents dédiés par domaine de problème, réduisant considérablement le temps de débogage pour des problèmes non liés dans différents fichiers de test ou sous-systèmes.","de":"Ermöglicht die parallele Untersuchung unabhängiger Fehler durch den Einsatz dedizierter Agenten pro Problemdomäne, was die Debug-Zeit für nicht zusammenhängende Probleme in verschiedenen Testdateien oder Subsystemen drastisch reduziert.","pt":"Permite a investigação paralela de falhas independentes ao despachar agentes dedicados por domínio de problema, reduzindo drasticamente o tempo de depuração para problemas não relacionados em diferentes arquivos de teste ou subsistemas.","ru":"Позволяет проводить параллельное расследование независимых сбоев путем назначения выделенных агентов для каждой проблемной области, что значительно сокращает время отладки несвязанных проблем в различных тестовых файлах или подсистемах.","ar":"يتيح التحقيق المتوازي في الأعطال المستقلة من خلال إرسال وكلاء مخصصين لكل مجال مشكلة، مما يقلل بشكل كبير من وقت تصحيح الأخطاء للمشكلات غير المرتبطة في ملفات الاختبار أو الأنظمة الفرعية المختلفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating multiple test failures concurrently","Debugging unrelated subsystem issues simultaneously","Triaging independent bugs in parallel"],"zh":["并发调查多个测试失败","同时调试不相关的子系统问题","并行分类独立的缺陷"],"ja":["複数のテスト失敗の同時調査","無関係なサブシステム問題の同時デバッグ","独立したバグの並列トリアージ"],"ko":["여러 테스트 실패 동시 조사","관련 없는 하위 시스템 문제 동시 디버깅","독립적인 버그 병렬 분류"],"es":["Investigar múltiples fallos de prueba de forma concurrente","Depurar problemas de subsistemas no relacionados simultáneamente","Clasificar errores independientes en paralelo"],"fr":["Investigation de multiples échecs de test simultanément","Débogage de problèmes de sous-systèmes non liés simultanément","Tri de bogues indépendants en parallèle"],"de":["Gleichzeitige Untersuchung mehrerer Testfehler","Gleichzeitiges Debuggen nicht zusammenhängender Subsystemprobleme","Parallele Priorisierung unabhängiger Fehler"],"pt":["Investigação de múltiplas falhas de teste simultaneamente","Depuração de problemas de subsistema não relacionados ao mesmo tempo","Triagem de bugs independentes em paralelo"],"ru":["Исследование множественных сбоев тестирования одновременно","Одновременная отладка несвязанных проблем подсистем","Параллельная сортировка независимых ошибок"],"ar":["التحقيق في أعطال اختبار متعددة في وقت واحد","تصحيح الأخطاء في الأنظمة الفرعية غير المرتبطة في وقت واحد","فرز الأخطاء المستقلة بالتوازي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires independent problem domains","Ineffective for sequential/interdependent failures"],"zh":["需要独立的问题领域","对顺序/相互依赖的故障无效"],"ja":["独立した問題領域が必要","順次的/相互依存的な障害には効果がない"],"ko":["독립적인 문제 영역 필요","순차적/상호 의존적 장애에는 효과적이지 않음"],"es":["Requiere dominios de problemas independientes","Ineficaz para fallos secuenciales/interdependientes"],"fr":["Nécessite des domaines de problèmes indépendants","Inefficace pour les défaillances séquentielles/interdépendantes"],"de":["Erfordert unabhängige Problemdomänen","Unwirksam bei sequentiellen/voneinander abhängigen Fehlern"],"pt":["Requer domínios de problema independentes","Ineficaz para falhas sequenciais/interdependentes"],"ru":["Требует независимых проблемных областей","Неэффективно для последовательных/взаимозависимых сбоев"],"ar":["يتطلب مجالات مشكلة مستقلة","غير فعال للأعطال المتسلسلة/المترابطة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit/using-git-worktrees', 'community', 'dwalleck', 'kiro-starter-kit', 'dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit', 'using-git-worktrees', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z', '2026-02-18T13:30:44.863Z', NULL, '{"id":"dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit/using-git-worktrees","name":"using-git-worktrees","description":{"zh":"Git Worktrees 允许在同一个仓库中创建多个隔离的工作空间，实现同时开发多个分支","ja":"Git Worktrees は、同じリポジトリ内で複数の隔離されたワークスペースを作成し、同時に複数のブランチを開発できる","ko":"Git Worktrees는 동일한 저장소 내에서 여러 개의 격리된 작업 공간을 생성하여 동시에 여러 가지 브랜치를 개발할 수 있음","es":"Git Worktrees permite crear espacios de trabajo aislados que comparten el mismo repositorio, permitiendo trabajar en varias ramas simultáneamente","fr":"Les Git Worktrees permettent de créer des espaces de travail isolés qui partagent le même référentiel, permettant de travailler sur plusieurs branches simultanément","de":"Git Worktrees ermöglichen die Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen, die das gleiche Repository teilen, und ermöglichen die Arbeit an mehreren Branches gleichzeitig","pt":"Git Worktrees permitem criar espaços de trabalho isolados que compartilham o mesmo repositório, permitindo trabalhar em várias branches simultaneamente","ru":"Git Worktrees позволяет создавать изолированные рабочие пространства, которые compartir одно и то же хранилище, что позволяет работать над несколькими ветками одновременно","ar":"تمكن Git Worktrees من إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة تشارك نفس المستودع، مما يسمح بالعمل على عدة فروع في نفس الوقت","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Git Worktrees 使用指南","ja":"Git Worktrees の使い方","ko":"Git Worktrees 사용법","es":"Trabajar con Git Worktrees","fr":"Utiliser les Git Worktrees","de":"Git Worktrees verwenden","pt":"Trabalhando com Git Worktrees","ru":"Использование Git Worktrees","ar":"استخدام Git Worktrees","en":"using-git-worktrees"},"description":{"zh":"Git Worktrees 允许在同一个仓库中创建多个隔离的工作空间，实现同时开发多个分支","ja":"Git Worktrees は、同じリポジトリ内で複数の隔離されたワークスペースを作成し、同時に複数のブランチを開発できる","ko":"Git Worktrees는 동일한 저장소 내에서 여러 개의 격리된 작업 공간을 생성하여 동시에 여러 가지 브랜치를 개발할 수 있음","es":"Git Worktrees permite crear espacios de trabajo aislados que comparten el mismo repositorio, permitiendo trabajar en varias ramas simultáneamente","fr":"Les Git Worktrees permettent de créer des espaces de travail isolés qui partagent le même référentiel, permettant de travailler sur plusieurs branches simult...","de":"Git Worktrees ermöglichen die Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen, die das gleiche Repository teilen, und ermöglichen die Arbeit an mehreren Branches ...","pt":"Git Worktrees permitem criar espaços de trabalho isolados que compartilham o mesmo repositório, permitindo trabalhar em várias branches simultaneamente","ru":"Git Worktrees позволяет создавать изолированные рабочие пространства, которые compartir одно и то же хранилище, что позволяет работать над несколькими веткам...","ar":"تمكن Git Worktrees من إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة تشارك نفس المستودع، مما يسمح بالعمل على عدة فروع في نفس الوقت","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建隔离的工作空间","同时开发多个分支","系统化的目录选择过程","安全性验证机制"],"ja":["隔離されたワークスペースの作成","複数のブランチを同時に開発","システム化されたディレクトリ選択プロセス","安全性の検証メカニズム"],"ko":["격리된 작업 공간 생성","동시에 여러 가지 브랜치 개발","시스템화된 디렉토리 선택 과정","안전성 검증 메커니즘"],"es":["Crear espacios de trabajo aislados","Trabajar en varias ramas simultáneamente","Compartir el mismo repositorio","Priorización de directorios","Verificación de seguridad"],"fr":["Créer des espaces de travail isolés","Travailler sur plusieurs branches simultanément","Partager le même référentiel","Priorisation des répertoires","Vérification de sécurité"],"de":["Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen","Arbeiten an mehreren Branches gleichzeitig","Teilen des gleichen Repository","Priorisierung von Verzeichnissen","Sicherheitsüberprüfung"],"pt":["Criação de espaços de trabalho isolados","Compartilhamento do mesmo repositório","Trabalho em várias branches simultaneamente","Segurança e isolamento de diretórios","Prioridade de seleção de diretórios"],"ru":["Создание изолированных рабочих пространств","Общий доступ к одному и тому же хранилищу","Работа над несколькими ветками одновременно","Безопасность и изоляция директорий","Приоритет выбора директорий"],"ar":["إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة","مشاركة نفس المستودع","العمل على عدة فروع في نفس الوقت","أمان و عزل الدلائل","أولوية اختيار الدلائل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git Worktrees","多分支开发","隔离工作空间","Git 工具","版本控制","代码管理"],"ja":["Git Worktrees","マルチブランチ開発","隔離されたワークスペース","Git ツール","バージョン管理","コード管理"],"ko":["Git Worktrees","멀티 브랜치 개발","격리된 작업 공간","Git 도구","버전 관리","코드 관리"],"es":["Git Worktrees","espacios de trabajo aislados","ramas simultáneas","repositorio compartido","priorización de directorios","verificación de seguridad","desarrollo de software","control de versiones"],"fr":["Git Worktrees","espaces de travail isolés","branches simultanées","référentiel partagé","priorisation des répertoires","vérification de sécurité","développement de logiciels","contrôle de version"],"de":["Git Worktrees","isolierte Arbeitsbereiche","Branches gleichzeitig","Repository teilen","Priorisierung von Verzeichnissen","Sicherheitsüberprüfung","Softwareentwicklung","Versionierung"],"pt":["Git Worktrees","desenvolvimento de software","espaços de trabalho isolados","compartilhamento de repositório","trabalho em branches","segurança de diretórios"],"ru":["Git Worktrees","разработка программного обеспечения","изолированные рабочие пространства","общий доступ к хранилищу","работа над ветками","безопасность директорий"],"ar":["Git Worktrees","تطوير البرمجيات","مساحات عمل معزولة","مشاركة المستودع","العمل على الفروع","أمان الدلائل"]}},"owner":"dwalleck","repo":"kiro-starter-kit","repoPath":"dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"using-git-worktrees","description":"Use when starting feature work that needs isolation from current workspace or before executing implementation plans - creates isolated git worktrees with smart directory selection and safety verification","bodyPreview":"# Using Git Worktrees\n\n## Overview\n\nGit worktrees create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing work on multiple branches simultaneously without switching.\n\n**Core principle:** Systematic directory selection + safety verification = reliable isolation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n\n## Directory Selection Process\n\nFollow this priority order:\n\n### 1. Check Existing Directories\n\n```bash\n# Check in priority order","body":"# Using Git Worktrees\n\n## Overview\n\nGit worktrees create isolated workspaces sharing the same repository, allowing work on multiple branches simultaneously without switching.\n\n**Core principle:** Systematic directory selection + safety verification = reliable isolation.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\"\n\n## Directory Selection Process\n\nFollow this priority order:\n\n### 1. Check Existing Directories\n\n```bash\n# Check in priority order\nls -d .worktrees 2>/dev/null     # Preferred (hidden)\nls -d worktrees 2>/dev/null      # Alternative\n```\n\n**If found:** Use that directory. If both exist, `.worktrees` wins.\n\n### 2. Check AGENTS.md\n\n```bash\ngrep -i \"worktree.*director\" AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**If preference specified:** Use it without asking.\n\n### 3. Ask User\n\nIf no directory exists and no AGENTS.md preference:\n\n```\nNo worktree directory found. Where should I create worktrees?\n\n1. .worktrees/ (project-local, hidden)\n2. ~/.config/superpowers/worktrees/<project-name>/ (global location)\n\nWhich would you prefer?\n```\n\n## Safety Verification\n\n### For Project-Local Directories (.worktrees or worktrees)\n\n**MUST verify directory is ignored before creating worktree:**\n\n```bash\n# Check if directory is ignored (respects local, global, and system gitignore)\ngit check-ignore -q .worktrees 2>/dev/null || git check-ignore -q worktrees 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**If NOT ignored:**\n\nPer Jesse''s rule \"Fix broken things immediately\":\n1. Add appropriate line to .gitignore\n2. Commit the change\n3. Proceed with worktree creation\n\n**Why critical:** Prevents accidentally committing worktree contents to repository.\n\n### For Global Directory (~/.config/superpowers/worktrees)\n\nNo .gitignore verification needed - outside project entirely.\n\n## Creation Steps\n\n### 1. Detect Project Name\n\n```bash\nproject=$(basename \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\")\n```\n\n### 2. Create Worktree\n\n```bash\n# Determine full path\ncase $LOCATION in\n  .worktrees|worktrees)\n    path=\"$LOCATION/$BRANCH_NAME\"\n    ;;\n  ~/.config/superpowers/worktrees/*)\n    path=\"~/.config/superpowers/worktrees/$project/$BRANCH_NAME\"\n    ;;\nesac\n\n# Create worktree with new branch\ngit worktree add \"$path\" -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\ncd \"$path\"\n```\n\n### 3. Run Project Setup\n\nAuto-detect and run appropriate setup:\n\n```bash\n# Node.js\nif [ -f package.json ]; then npm install; fi\n\n# Rust\nif [ -f Cargo.toml ]; then cargo build; fi\n\n# Python\nif [ -f requirements.txt ]; then pip install -r requirements.txt; fi\nif [ -f pyproject.toml ]; then poetry install; fi\n\n# Go\nif [ -f go.mod ]; then go mod download; fi\n```\n\n### 4. Verify Clean Baseline\n\nRun tests to ensure worktree starts clean:\n\n```bash\n# Examples - use project-appropriate command\nnpm test\ncargo test\npytest\ngo test ./...\n```\n\n**If tests fail:** Report failures, ask whether to proceed or investigate.\n\n**If tests pass:** Report ready.\n\n### 5. Report Location\n\n```\nWorktree ready at <full-path>\nTests passing (<N> tests, 0 failures)\nReady to implement <feature-name>\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| `.worktrees/` exists | Use it (verify ignored) |\n| `worktrees/` exists | Use it (verify ignored) |\n| Both exist | Use `.worktrees/` |\n| Neither exists | Check AGENTS.md → Ask user |\n| Directory not ignored | Add to .gitignore + commit |\n| Tests fail during baseline | Report failures + ask |\n| No package.json/Cargo.toml | Skip dependency install |\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### Skipping ignore verification\n\n- **Problem:** Worktree contents get tracked, pollute git status\n- **Fix:** Always use `git check-ignore` before creating project-local worktree\n\n### Assuming directory location\n\n- **Problem:** Creates inconsistency, violates project conventions\n- **Fix:** Follow priority: existing > AGENTS.md > ask\n\n### Proceeding with failing tests\n\n- **Problem:** Can''t distinguish new bugs from pre-existing issues\n- **Fix:** Report failures, get explicit permission to proceed\n\n### Hardcoding setup commands\n\n- **Problem:** Breaks on projects using different tools\n- **Fix:** Auto-detect from project files (package.json, etc.)\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using the using-git-worktrees skill to set up an isolated workspace.\n\n[Check .worktrees/ - exists]\n[Verify ignored - git check-ignore confirms .worktrees/ is ignored]\n[Create worktree: git worktree add .worktrees/auth -b feature/auth]\n[Run npm install]\n[Run npm test - 47 passing]\n\nWorktree ready at /Users/jesse/myproject/.worktrees/auth\nTests passing (47 tests, 0 failures)\nReady to implement auth feature\n```\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Create worktree without verifying it''s ignored (project-local)\n- Skip baseline test verification\n- Proceed with failing tests without asking\n- Assume directory location when ambiguous\n- Skip AGENTS.md check\n\n**Always:**\n- Follow directory priority: existing > AGENTS.md > ask\n- Verify directory is ignored for project-local\n- Auto-detect and run project setup\n- Verify clean test baseline\n\n## Integration\n\n**Called by:**\n- **brainstorming** (Phase 4) - REQUIRED when design is approved and implementation follows\n- **subagent-driven-development** - REQUIRED before executing any tasks\n- **executing-plans** - REQUIRED before executing any tasks\n- Any skill needing isolated workspace\n\n**Pairs with:**\n- **finishing-a-development-branch** - REQUIRED for cleanup after work complete\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:30:44.863Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing simultaneous branch management and isolated workspace creation.","zh":"非常适合需要同时管理多个分支和创建隔离工作空间的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが同時に複数のブランチを管理し、隔離されたワークスペースを作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 동시에 여러 가지 분기 관리와 격리된 작업 공간 생성이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gestión de ramas simultánea y creación de espacios de trabajo aislados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de gestion de branches simultanée et de création d''espaces de travail isolés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine simultane Verwaltung von Zweigen und die Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de branch simultâneo e criação de espaço de trabalho isolado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется одновременное управление ветками и создание изолированного рабочего пространства.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة الفرع المتزامن وخلق مساحة عمل معزولة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple Git branches simultaneously using worktrees, ensuring reliable isolation through systematic directory selection and safety verification, and supporting Git protocols.","zh":"通过工作树启用代理同时管理多个Git分支，确保通过系统目录选择和安全性验证实现可靠的隔离，并支持Git协议。","ja":"ワークツリーを使用してエージェントが複数のGitブランチを同時に管理できるようにし、システムディレクトリの選択とセーフティ検証を介した信頼性の高い隔離を保証し、Gitプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"작업 트리를 사용하여 에이전트가 여러 개의 Git 분기를 동시에 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 시스템 디렉토리 선택 및 안전성 검사를 통해 신뢰할 수 있는 격리를 보장하고 Git 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples ramas de Git simultáneamente utilizando worktrees, asegurando una aislación confiable a través de la selección sistemática de directorios y verificación de seguridad, y soportando protocolos de Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs branches Git simultanément en utilisant des worktrees, assurant une isolation fiable grâce à la sélection systématique de répertoires et à la vérification de sécurité, et prenant en charge les protocoles Git.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere Git-Zweige simultan mithilfe von Worktrees zu verwalten, wodurch eine zuverlässige Isolation durch systematische Verzeichnisauswahl und Sicherheitsprüfung gewährleistet wird und Git-Protokolle unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar várias branches do Git simultaneamente usando worktrees, garantindo isolamento confiável por meio da seleção sistemática de diretórios e verificação de segurança, e suportando protocolos Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими ветками Git одновременно с помощью worktrees, обеспечивая надежную изоляцию посредством систематического выбора каталогов и проверки безопасности, а также поддержку протоколов Git.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة عدة فروع من جيت في نفس الوقت باستخدام worktrees، مما يضمن العزل الموثوق به من خلال انتخاب الدلائل النظامي والتحقق من الأمان، ودعم بروتوكولات جيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating isolated workspaces for feature development","Managing multiple release branches concurrently","Testing pull requests in separate worktrees"],"zh":["为功能开发创建隔离的工作空间","同时管理多个发布分支","在单独的工作树中测试拉取请求"],"ja":["機能開発のための隔離されたワークスペースの作成","複数のリリースブランチを同時に管理する","個別のワークツリーでプルリクエストをテストする"],"ko":["기능 개발을 위한 격리된 작업 공간의 생성","여러 릴리스 분기를 동시에 관리","개별 작업 트리에서 풀 요청 테스트"],"es":["Creación de espacios de trabajo aislados para el desarrollo de características","Gestión de varias ramas de lanzamiento de forma simultánea","Pruebas de solicitudes de extracción en worktrees separados"],"fr":["Création d''espaces de travail isolés pour le développement de fonctionnalités","Gestion de plusieurs branches de lancement simultanément","Tests de demandes d''extraction dans des worktrees séparés"],"de":["Erstellung von isolierten Arbeitsbereichen für die Entwicklung von Funktionen","Verwaltung mehrerer Release-Zweige gleichzeitig","Testen von Pull-Anfragen in getrennten Worktrees"],"pt":["Criar espaços de trabalho isolados para desenvolvimento de recursos","Gerenciar várias branches de lançamento simultaneamente","Testar solicitações de pull em worktrees separados"],"ru":["Создание изолированных рабочих пространств для разработки функций","Управление несколькими выпусковыми ветками одновременно","Тестирование запросов на включение в отдельных worktrees"],"ar":["إنشاء مساحات عمل معزولة لتطوير الميزات","إدارة عدة فروع إصدار في نفس الوقت","اختبار طلبات السحب في worktrees منفصلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要Git安装","仅限于Git版本控制系统"],"ja":["Gitのインストールが必要","Gitバージョン管理システムのみに限定"],"ko":["Git 설치가 필요함","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Git","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Git","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation","Begrenzt auf das Git-Versionierungssystem"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Git","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требуется установка Git","Ограничен системой контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت جيت","محدود بنظام التحكم في الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
