:{"zh":"FlutterDart","ja":"FlutterDart","ko":"Flutter Dart","es":"Flutter es un framework para desarrollar aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento con Dart. Aprende a crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas y a implemen...","fr":"Flutter est un framework pour développer des applications mobiles haute performance avec Dart. Apprenez à créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées et ...","de":"Flutter ist ein Framework für die Entwicklung hochleistungsstarker mobiler Anwendungen mit Dart. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen...","pt":"Flutter é um framework para desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis que permite criar aplicações de alta performance e interfaces visuais atraentes.","ru":"Flutter — это фреймворк для разработки мобильных приложений, который позволяет создавать приложения с высокой производительностью и визуально привлекательным...","ar":"Flutter هو إطار عمل لتطوير تطبيقات الجوال يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات عالية الأداء وواجهات مرئية جذابة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Dart","Widget","API","Hot Reload","iOSAndroid"],"ja":["Dart","Widget","API","Hot Reload","iOSAndroid"],"ko":["Dart","Widget","API","Hot Reload","iOSAndroid"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles con rendimiento nativo","Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas con widgets","Implementación de complejas animaciones y efectos visuales","Desarrollo rápido de aplicaciones con recarga en caliente","Creación de experiencias de usuario coherentes en varias plataformas"],"fr":["Développement d''applications mobiles avec des performances natives","Création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées avec des widgets","Implémentation d''animations complexes et d''effets visuels","Développement rapide d''applications avec rechargement à chaud","Création d''expériences utilisateur cohérentes sur plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Entwicklung mobiler Anwendungen mit nativer Leistung","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächen mit Widgets","Implementierung komplexer Animationen und visueller Effekte","Schnelle Anwendungsentwicklung mit Hot-Reload","Erstellung konsistenter Benutzererfahrungen auf mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Criação de aplicativos móveis de alta performance","Desenvolvimento de UIs personalizadas com o sistema de widgets","Implementação de animações complexas e efeitos visuais","Desenvolvimento rápido de aplicativos com recurso de hot reload","Criação de experiências de usuário consistentes em várias plataformas"],"ru":["Создание мобильных приложений с высокой производительностью","Разработка пользовательских интерфейсов с помощью системы виджетов","Реализация сложных анимаций и визуальных эффектов","Быстрая разработка приложений с функцией hot reload","Создание последовательных пользовательских опытов на нескольких платформах"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات الجوال عالية الأداء","تصميم واجهات مستخدم مخصصة باستخدام نظام الويجتس","تنفيذ حركات مرئية معقدة وتأثيرات بصرية","تطوير سريع للتطبيقات باستخدام ميزة إعادة التحميل السريع","إنشاء تجارب مستخدم متسقة عبر منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter","Dart","Widget","API","Hot Reload","iOS","Android","Mobile App"],"ja":["Flutter","Dart","Widget","API","Hot Reload","iOS","Android","Mobile App"],"ko":["Flutter","Dart","Widget","API","Hot Reload","iOS","Android","Mobile App"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Flutter","Dart","aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","animaciones complejas"],"fr":["développement d''applications mobiles","Flutter","Dart","applications mobiles haute performance","interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","animations complexes"],"de":["Mobile-Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Flutter","Dart","hochleistungsstarke Mobile-Anwendungen","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","komplexe Animationen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","Flutter","Dart","aplicativos de alta performance","UIs personalizadas","animações complexas","hot reload","experiências de usuário consistentes"],"ru":["разработка мобильных приложений","Flutter","Dart","приложения с высокой производительностью","пользовательские интерфейсы","сложные анимации","hot reload","последовательные пользовательские опыты"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الجوال","Flutter","Dart","تطبيقات عالية الأداء","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","حركات مرئية معقدة","إعادة التحميل السريع","تجارب مستخدم متسقة"]}},"owner":"yashvinthan","repo":"DuskSpendr","repoPath":"yashvinthan/DuskSpendr","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.520Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-development","description":"Build beautiful cross-platform mobile apps with Flutter and Dart. Covers widgets, state management with Provider/BLoC, navigation, API integration, and material design.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Development\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter with Dart language. Master widget composition, state management patterns, navigation, and API integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building iOS and Android apps with native performance\n- Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system\n- Implementing complex animations and visual effects\n- Rapid app development with hot reload\n- Creating consistent UX across platforms\n\n## Instructions\n\n##","body":"# Flutter Development\n\n## Overview\n\nCreate high-performance, visually stunning mobile applications using Flutter with Dart language. Master widget composition, state management patterns, navigation, and API integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Building iOS and Android apps with native performance\n- Designing custom UIs with Flutter''s widget system\n- Implementing complex animations and visual effects\n- Rapid app development with hot reload\n- Creating consistent UX across platforms\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **Project Structure & Navigation**\n\n```dart\n// pubspec.yaml\nname: my_flutter_app\nversion: 1.0.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  provider: ^6.0.0\n  http: ^1.1.0\n  go_router: ^12.0.0\n\n// main.dart with GoRouter navigation\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:go_router/go_router.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  runApp(const MyApp());\n}\n\nclass MyApp extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyApp({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return MaterialApp.router(\n      title: ''Flutter App'',\n      theme: ThemeData(primarySwatch: Colors.blue, useMaterial3: true),\n      routerConfig: _router,\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nfinal GoRouter _router = GoRouter(\n  routes: <RouteBase>[\n    GoRoute(\n      path: ''/'',\n      builder: (context, state) => const HomeScreen(),\n      routes: [\n        GoRoute(\n          path: ''details/:id'',\n          builder: (context, state) => DetailsScreen(\n            itemId: state.pathParameters[''id'']!\n          ),\n        ),\n      ],\n    ),\n    GoRoute(\n      path: ''/profile'',\n      builder: (context, state) => const ProfileScreen(),\n    ),\n  ],\n);\n```\n\n### 2. **State Management with Provider**\n\n```dart\nimport ''package:flutter/material.dart'';\nimport ''package:http/http.dart'' as http;\nimport ''dart:convert'';\n\nclass User {\n  final String id;\n  final String name;\n  final String email;\n\n  User({required this.id, required this.name, required this.email});\n\n  factory User.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {\n    return User(\n      id: json[''id''],\n      name: json[''name''],\n      email: json[''email''],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass UserProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  User? _user;\n  bool _isLoading = false;\n  String? _error;\n\n  User? get user => _user;\n  bool get isLoading => _isLoading;\n  String? get error => _error;\n\n  Future<void> fetchUser(String userId) async {\n    _isLoading = true;\n    _error = null;\n    notifyListeners();\n\n    try {\n      final response = await http.get(\n        Uri.parse(''https://api.example.com/users/$userId''),\n        headers: {''Content-Type'': ''application/json''},\n      );\n\n      if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n        _user = User.fromJson(jsonDecode(response.body));\n      } else {\n        _error = ''Failed to fetch user'';\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      _error = ''Error: ${e.toString()}'';\n    } finally {\n      _isLoading = false;\n      notifyListeners();\n    }\n  }\n\n  void logout() {\n    _user = null;\n    notifyListeners();\n  }\n}\n\nclass ItemsProvider extends ChangeNotifier {\n  List<Map<String, dynamic>> _items = [];\n\n  List<Map<String, dynamic>> get items => _items;\n\n  Future<void> fetchItems() async {\n    try {\n      final response = await http.get(\n        Uri.parse(''https://api.example.com/items''),\n      );\n\n      if (response.statusCode == 200) {\n        _items = List<Map<String, dynamic>>.from(\n          jsonDecode(response.body) as List\n        );\n        notifyListeners();\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      print(''Error fetching items: $e'');\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **Screens with Provider Integration**\n\n```dart\nclass HomeScreen extends StatefulWidget {\n  const HomeScreen({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  State<HomeScreen> createState() => _HomeScreenState();\n}\n\nclass _HomeScreenState extends State<HomeScreen> {\n  @override\n  void initState() {\n    super.initState();\n    Future.microtask(() {\n      Provider.of<ItemsProvider>(context, listen: false).fetchItems();\n    });\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Home Feed'')),\n      body: Consumer<ItemsProvider>(\n        builder: (context, itemsProvider, child) {\n          if (itemsProvider.items.isEmpty) {\n            return const Center(child: Text(''No items found''));\n          }\n          return ListView.builder(\n            itemCount: itemsProvider.items.length,\n            itemBuilder: (context, index) {\n              final item = itemsProvider.items[index];\n              return ItemCard(item: item);\n            },\n          );\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass ItemCard extends StatelessWidget {\n  final Map<String, dynamic> item;\n\n  const ItemCard({required this.item, Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Card(\n      margin: const EdgeInsets.all(8),\n      child: ListTile(\n        title: Text(item[''title''] ?? ''Untitled''),\n        subtitle: Text(item[''description''] ?? ''''),\n        trailing: const Icon(Icons.arrow_forward),\n        onTap: () => context.go(''/details/${item[''id'']}''),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass DetailsScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  final String itemId;\n\n  const DetailsScreen({required this.itemId, Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Details'')),\n      body: Center(\n        child: Column(\n          mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,\n          children: [\n            Text(''Item ID: $itemId'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18)),\n            const SizedBox(height: 16),\n            ElevatedButton(\n              onPressed: () => context.pop(),\n              child: const Text(''Go Back''),\n            ),\n          ],\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nclass ProfileScreen extends StatelessWidget {\n  const ProfileScreen({Key? key}) : super(key: key);\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Scaffold(\n      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text(''Profile'')),\n      body: Consumer<UserProvider>(\n        builder: (context, userProvider, child) {\n          if (userProvider.isLoading) {\n            return const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator());\n          }\n          if (userProvider.error != null) {\n            return Center(child: Text(''Error: ${userProvider.error}''));\n          }\n          final user = userProvider.user;\n          if (user == null) {\n            return const Center(child: Text(''No user data''));\n          }\n          return Padding(\n            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(16),\n            child: Column(\n              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n              children: [\n                Text(''Name: ${user.name}'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18)),\n                Text(''Email: ${user.email}'', style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 16)),\n                const SizedBox(height: 16),\n                ElevatedButton(\n                  onPressed: () => userProvider.logout(),\n                  child: const Text(''Logout''),\n                ),\n              ],\n            ),\n          );\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Use widgets for every UI element\n- Implement proper state management\n- Use const constructors where possible\n- Dispose resources in state lifecycle\n- Test on multiple device sizes\n- Use meaningful widget names\n- Implement error handling\n- Use responsive design patterns\n- Test on both iOS and Android\n- Document custom widgets\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Build entire screens in build() method\n- Use setState for complex state logic\n- Make network calls in build()\n- Ignore platform differences\n- Create overly nested widget trees\n- Hardcode strings\n- Ignore performance warnings\n- Skip testing\n- Forget to handle edge cases\n- Deploy without thorough testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:31:43.128Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents requiring cross-platform UI generation and native performance optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要跨平台UI生成和原生性能优化的移动开发智能体。","ja":"クロスプラットフォームUI生成とネイティブ性能最適化を必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"크로스 플랫폼 UI 생성 및 네이티브 성능 최적화가 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo móvil que requieren generación de interfaces de usuario multiplataforma y optimización del rendimiento nativo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement mobile nécessitant la génération d''interfaces utilisateur multiplateformes et l''optimisation des performances natives.","de":"Ideal für Mobile-Development-Agents, die plattformübergreifende UI-Generierung und Optimierung der nativen Leistung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Mobile que necessitam de geração de interface de usuário multiplataforma e otimização de desempenho nativo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной разработки, требующих кроссплатформенной генерации пользовательского интерфейса и оптимизации нативной производительности.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الجوال التي تتطلب إنشاء واجهة مستخدم متعددة المنصات وتحسين الأداء الأصلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to architect complete Flutter applications using Dart language, implement complex widget compositions with state management patterns like BLoC or Provider, and integrate RESTful APIs with optimized navigation stacks.","zh":"使智能体能够使用Dart语言架构完整的Flutter应用程序，使用BLoC或Provider等状态管理模式实现复杂的小部件组合，并通过优化的导航栈集成RESTful API。","ja":"Dart言語を使用して完全なFlutterアプリケーションを設計し、BLoCやProviderなどの状態管理パターンで複雑なウィジェット構成を実装し、最適化されたナビゲーションスタックでRESTful APIを統合する機能をエージェントに提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Dart 언어를 사용하여 완전한 Flutter 애플리케이션을 설계하고, BLoC 또는 Provider와 같은 상태 관리 패턴으로 복잡한 위젯 구성을 구현하며, 최적화된 네비게이션 스택으로 RESTful API를 통합할 수 있게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar aplicaciones completas de Flutter utilizando el lenguaje Dart, implementar composiciones de widgets complejas con patrones de gestión de estado como BLoC o Provider, e integrar APIs RESTful con pilas de navegación optimizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des applications Flutter complètes en utilisant le langage Dart, de mettre en œuvre des compositions de widgets complexes avec des modèles de gestion d''état comme BLoC ou Provider, et d''intégrer des API RESTful avec des piles de navigation optimisées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, vollständige Flutter-Anwendungen mit der Programmiersprache Dart zu entwerfen, komplexe Widget-Kompositionen mit Zustandsverwaltungsmustern wie BLoC oder Provider zu implementieren und RESTful-APIs mit optimierten Navigationsstacks zu integrieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes arquitetuem aplicativos Flutter completos usando a linguagem Dart, implementem composições complexas de widgets com padrões de gerenciamento de estado como BLoC ou Provider e integrem APIs RESTful com pilhas de navegação otimizadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать полноценные приложения Flutter на языке Dart, реализовывать сложные композиции виджетов с паттернами управления состоянием, такими как BLoC или Provider, и интегрировать RESTful API с оптимизированными стеками навигации.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من هندسة تطبيقات Flutter كاملة باستخدام لغة Dart، وتنفيذ تركيبات عناصر واجهة مستخدم معقدة بأنماط إدارة الحالة مثل BLoC أو Provider، ودمج واجهات برمجة التطبيقات RESTful مع أكوام التنقل المحسنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating responsive widget trees with Material/Cupertino components","Implementing state management solutions for complex app logic","Creating platform-specific adaptive layouts from single codebase","Integrating REST APIs with Dart HTTP client and JSON serialization"],"zh":["使用Material/Cupertino组件生成响应式小部件树","为复杂的应用程序逻辑实现状态管理解决方案","从单一代码库创建特定于平台的自适应布局","使用Dart HTTP客户端和JSON序列化集成REST API"],"ja":["Material/Cupertinoコンポーネントを使用したレスポンシブなウィジェットツリーの生成","複雑なアプリロジックのための状態管理ソリューションの実装","単一コードベースからのプラットフォーム固有の適応レイアウトの作成","Dart HTTPクライアントとJSONシリアル化によるREST APIの統合"],"ko":["Material/Cupertino 컴포넌트로 반응형 위젯 트리 생성","복잡한 앱 로직을 위한 상태 관리 솔루션 구현","단일 코드베이스에서 플랫폼별 적응형 레이아웃 생성","Dart HTTP 클라이언트 및 JSON 직렬화를 통한 REST API 통합"],"es":["Generación de árboles de widgets responsivos con componentes Material/Cupertino","Implementación de soluciones de gestión de estado para lógica de aplicaciones complejas","Creación de diseños adaptativos específicos de plataforma a partir de una base de código única","Integración de APIs REST con el cliente HTTP de Dart y serialización JSON"],"fr":["Génération d''arbres de widgets réactifs avec les composants Material/Cupertino","Mise en œuvre de solutions de gestion d''état pour une logique applicative complexe","Création de mises en page adaptatives spécifiques à la plateforme à partir d''une base de code unique","Intégration d''API REST avec le client HTTP Dart et la sérialisation JSON"],"de":["Generierung responsiver Widget-Bäume mit Material-/Cupertino-Komponenten","Implementierung von Zustandsverwaltungslösungen für komplexe App-Logik","Erstellung plattformspezifischer adaptiver Layouts aus einer einzigen Codebasis","Integration von REST-APIs mit dem Dart-HTTP-Client und JSON-Serialisierung"],"pt":["Geração de árvores de widgets responsivas com componentes Material/Cupertino","Implementação de soluções de gerenciamento de estado para lógica de aplicativo complexa","Criação de layouts adaptativos específicos de plataforma a partir de uma base de código única","Integração de APIs REST com cliente HTTP Dart e serialização JSON"],"ru":["Генерация отзывчивых деревьев виджетов с компонентами Material/Cupertino","Реализация решений по управлению состоянием для сложной логики приложения","Создание адаптивных макетов для конкретных платформ из единой кодовой базы","Интеграция REST API с HTTP-клиентом Dart и JSON-сериализацией"],"ar":["إنشاء أشجار عناصر واجهة مستخدم متجاوبة مع مكونات Material/Cupertino","تنفيذ حلول إدارة الحالة للمنطق التطبيقي المعقد","إنشاء تخطيطات تكيفية خاصة بكل منصة من قاعدة كود واحدة","دمج واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST مع عميل Dart HTTP وتسييل JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dart language proficiency","Limited to Flutter framework ecosystem","Mobile-focused (iOS/Android) deployment targets"],"zh":["需要精通Dart语言","仅限于Flutter框架生态系统","专注于移动端(iOS/Android)部署目标"],"ja":["Dart言語の習熟度が必要","Flutterフレームワークエコシステムに限定","モバイル焦点（iOS/Android）の展開ターゲット"],"ko":["Dart 언어 숙련도 필요","Flutter 프레임워크 생태계로 제한됨","모바일 중심(iOS/Android) 배포 대상"],"es":["Requiere dominio del lenguaje Dart","Limitado al ecosistema del framework Flutter","Enfocado en objetivos de despliegue móvil (iOS/Android)"],"fr":["Nécessite une maîtrise du langage Dart","Limité à l''écosystème du framework Flutter","Ciblage de déploiement axé sur le mobile (iOS/Android)"],"de":["Erfordert Dart-Sprachkenntnisse","Beschränkt auf das Flutter-Framework-Ökosystem","Mobilfokus (iOS/Android) als Einsatzziele"],"pt":["Requer proficiência na linguagem Dart","Limitado ao ecossistema do framework Flutter","Foco em destinos de implantação para dispositivos móveis (iOS/Android)"],"ru":["Требует знания языка Dart","Ограничено экосистемой фреймворка Flutter","Ориентирован на цели развертывания для мобильных устройств (iOS/Android)"],"ar":["يتطلب إتقان لغة Dart","مقتصر على إطار عمل Flutter","مركز على أهداف النشر للجوال (iOS/Android)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
