التصميم، والمظهر - دليل 2025","en":"mui"},"description":{"zh":"MUI v7 提供了新的组件使用模式、样式和主题集成方法，以及响应式设计","ja":"MUI v7 は、新しいコンポーネント使用パターン、スタイル、テーマ統合方法、およびレスポンシブデザインを提供します","ko":"MUI v7는 새로운 컴포넌트 사용 패턴, 스타일 및 테마 통합 방법 및 반응형 디자인을 제공합니다","es":"MUI v7 ofrece patrones para el uso de componentes, estilos con la prop sx, integración de temas y diseño responsivo","fr":"MUI v7 propose des modèles pour l''utilisation de composants, la personnalisation avec la prop sx, l''intégration de thèmes et la conception réactive","de":"MUI v7 bietet Muster für die Verwendung von Komponenten, Styling mit der sx-Eigenschaft, Theme-Integration und responsives Design","pt":"Este skill oferece padrões oficiais para o uso de componentes, estilização com a prop sx, integração de temas e design responsivo no Material-UI v7. Inclui u...","ru":"Этот навык предоставляет официальные шаблоны для использования компонентов, стилизации с помощью свойства sx, интеграции тем и адаптивного дизайна в Material...","ar":"تقدم هذه المهارة أنماطًا رسمية لاستخدام المكونات، التصميم باستخاصية sx، دمج السمات، والتصميم المتجاوب في Material-UI الإصدار 7. يتضمن دليلًا أساسيًا للتغييرا...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["深度导入更改","Backdrop 点击事件更改","标准化插槽和插槽属性","CSS 层支持"],"ja":["ディープインポートの変更","バックドロップクリックイベントの変更","標準化されたスロットとスロットプロパティ","CSS レイヤーサポート"],"ko":["깊은 가져오기 변경","백드롭 클릭 이벤트 변경","표준화된 슬롯 및 슬롯 속성","CSS 레이어 지원"],"es":["Patrones de componentes personalizados","Estilos con la prop sx","Integración de temas","Diseño responsivo","Compatibilidad con Tailwind v4"],"fr":["Modèles de composants personnalisés","Personnalisation avec la prop sx","Intégration de thèmes","Conception réactive","Compatibilité avec Tailwind v4"],"de":["Muster für benutzerdefinierte Komponenten","Styling mit der sx-Eigenschaft","Theme-Integration","Responsives Design","Unterstützung für Tailwind v4"],"pt":["Padrões oficiais de uso de componentes MUI v7","Estilização avançada utilizando a propriedade `sx`","Integração e customização de temas (theming)","Técnicas para design responsivo","Guia de migração com breaking changes da v6","Suporte a CSS layers (compatível com Tailwind v4)"],"ru":["Официальные шаблоны использования компонентов MUI v7","Продвинутая стилизация с использованием свойства `sx`","Интеграция и кастомизация тем (theming)","Методы адаптивного дизайна","Руководство по миграции с учетом критических изменений с v6","Поддержка CSS layers (совместимо с Tailwind v4)"],"ar":["أنماط استخدام رسمية لمكونات MUI v7","تصميم متقدم باستخدام خاصية `sx`","دمج وتخصيص السمات (theming)","تقنيات التصميم المتجاوب","دليل الترقية مع التغييرات الجوهرية من الإصدار 6","دعم طبقات CSS (متوافق مع Tailwind v4)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MUI v7","Material-UI","组件使用模式","样式和主题集成","响应式设计","深度导入","Backdrop 点击事件"],"ja":["MUI v7","Material-UI","コンポーネント使用パターン","スタイルとテーマ統合","レスポンシブデザイン","ディープインポート","バックドロップクリックイベント"],"ko":["MUI v7","Material-UI","컴포넌트 사용 패턴","스타일 및 테마 통합","반응형 디자인","깊은 가져오기","백드롭 클릭 이벤트"],"es":["MUI v7","patrones de componentes","estilos sx","integración de temas","diseño responsivo","Tailwind v4","desarrollo web","bibliotecas de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["MUI v7","modèles de composants","personnalisation sx","intégration de thèmes","conception réactive","Tailwind v4","développement web","bibliothèques d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["MUI v7","Muster für Komponenten","Styling mit sx","Theme-Integration","responsives Design","Tailwind v4","Webentwicklung","Benutzeroberflächenbibliotheken"],"pt":["mui v7 padrões","material ui v7","propriedade sx mui","mui theming","design responsivo mui","migração mui v6 para v7","mui slots e slotProps","css layers mui tailwind"],"ru":["mui v7 шаблоны","material ui v7","свойство sx mui","mui темы","адаптивный дизайн mui","миграция mui v6 на v7","mui slots и slotProps","css layers mui tailwind"],"ar":["أنماط mui الإصدار 7","material ui الإصدار 7","خاصية sx mui","سمات mui","تصميم متجاوب mui","ترقية mui من الإصدار 6 إلى 7","mui slots و slotProps","طبقات css mui tailwind"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mui","description":"Material-UI v7 component library patterns including sx prop styling, theme integration, responsive design, and MUI-specific hooks. Use when working with MUI components, styling with sx prop, theme customization, or MUI utilities.","bodyPreview":"# MUI v7 Patterns\n\n## Purpose\n\nMaterial-UI v7 (released March 2025) patterns for component usage, styling with sx prop, theme integration, and responsive design.\n\n**Note**: MUI v7 breaking changes from v6:\n- Deep imports no longer work - use package exports field\n- `onBackdropClick` removed from Modal - use `onClose` instead\n- All components now use standardized `slots` and `slotProps` pattern\n- CSS layers support via `enableCssLayer` config (works with Tailwind v4)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n-","body":"# MUI v7 Patterns\n\n## Purpose\n\nMaterial-UI v7 (released March 2025) patterns for component usage, styling with sx prop, theme integration, and responsive design.\n\n**Note**: MUI v7 breaking changes from v6:\n- Deep imports no longer work - use package exports field\n- `onBackdropClick` removed from Modal - use `onClose` instead\n- All components now use standardized `slots` and `slotProps` pattern\n- CSS layers support via `enableCssLayer` config (works with Tailwind v4)\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Styling components with MUI sx prop\n- Using MUI components (Box, Grid, Paper, Typography, etc.)\n- Theme customization and usage\n- Responsive design with MUI breakpoints\n- MUI-specific utilities and hooks\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Basic MUI Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { Box, Typography, Button, Paper } from ''@mui/material'';\nimport type { SxProps, Theme } from ''@mui/material'';\n\nconst styles: Record<string, SxProps<Theme>> = {\n  container: {\n    p: 2,\n    display: ''flex'',\n    flexDirection: ''column'',\n    gap: 2,\n  },\n  header: {\n    mb: 3,\n    fontSize: ''1.5rem'',\n    fontWeight: 600,\n  },\n};\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  return (\n    <Paper sx={styles.container}>\n      <Typography sx={styles.header}>\n        Title\n      </Typography>\n      <Button variant=\"contained\">\n        Action\n      </Button>\n    </Paper>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Styling Patterns\n\n### Inline Styles (< 100 lines)\n\nFor components with simple styling, define styles at the top:\n\n```typescript\nimport type { SxProps, Theme } from ''@mui/material'';\n\nconst componentStyles: Record<string, SxProps<Theme>> = {\n  container: {\n    p: 2,\n    display: ''flex'',\n    flexDirection: ''column'',\n  },\n  header: {\n    mb: 2,\n    color: ''primary.main'',\n  },\n  button: {\n    mt: ''auto'',\n    alignSelf: ''flex-end'',\n  },\n};\n\nfunction Component() {\n  return (\n    <Box sx={componentStyles.container}>\n      <Typography sx={componentStyles.header}>Header</Typography>\n      <Button sx={componentStyles.button}>Action</Button>\n    </Box>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Separate Styles File (>= 100 lines)\n\nFor complex components, create separate style file:\n\n```typescript\n// UserProfile.styles.ts\nimport type { SxProps, Theme } from ''@mui/material'';\n\nexport const userProfileStyles: Record<string, SxProps<Theme>> = {\n  container: {\n    p: 3,\n    maxWidth: 800,\n    mx: ''auto'',\n  },\n  header: {\n    display: ''flex'',\n    justifyContent: ''space-between'',\n    alignItems: ''center'',\n    mb: 3,\n  },\n  // ... many more styles\n};\n\n// UserProfile.tsx\nimport { userProfileStyles as styles } from ''./UserProfile.styles'';\n\nfunction UserProfile() {\n  return <Box sx={styles.container}>...</Box>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Components\n\n### Layout Components\n\n```typescript\n// Box - Generic container\n<Box sx={{ p: 2, bgcolor: ''background.paper'' }}>\n  Content\n</Box>\n\n// Paper - Elevated surface\n<Paper elevation={2} sx={{ p: 3 }}>\n  Content\n</Paper>\n\n// Container - Centered content with max-width\n<Container maxWidth=\"lg\">\n  Content\n</Container>\n\n// Stack - Flex container with spacing\n<Stack spacing={2} direction=\"row\">\n  <Item />\n  <Item />\n</Stack>\n```\n\n### Grid System\n\n```typescript\nimport { Grid } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n// 12-column grid\n<Grid container spacing={2}>\n  <Grid item xs={12} md={6}>\n    Left half\n  </Grid>\n  <Grid item xs={12} md={6}>\n    Right half\n  </Grid>\n</Grid>\n\n// Responsive grid\n<Grid container spacing={3}>\n  <Grid item xs={12} sm={6} md={4} lg={3}>\n    Card\n  </Grid>\n  {/* Repeat for more cards */}\n</Grid>\n```\n\n### Typography\n\n```typescript\n<Typography variant=\"h1\">Heading 1</Typography>\n<Typography variant=\"h2\">Heading 2</Typography>\n<Typography variant=\"body1\">Body text</Typography>\n<Typography variant=\"caption\">Small text</Typography>\n\n// With custom styling\n<Typography\n  variant=\"h4\"\n  sx={{\n    color: ''primary.main'',\n    fontWeight: 600,\n    mb: 2,\n  }}\n>\n  Custom Heading\n</Typography>\n```\n\n### Buttons\n\n```typescript\n// Variants\n<Button variant=\"contained\">Contained</Button>\n<Button variant=\"outlined\">Outlined</Button>\n<Button variant=\"text\">Text</Button>\n\n// Colors\n<Button variant=\"contained\" color=\"primary\">Primary</Button>\n<Button variant=\"contained\" color=\"secondary\">Secondary</Button>\n<Button variant=\"contained\" color=\"error\">Error</Button>\n\n// With icons\nimport { Add as AddIcon } from ''@mui/icons-material'';\n\n<Button startIcon={<AddIcon />}>Add Item</Button>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Theme Integration\n\n### Using Theme Values\n\n```typescript\nimport { useTheme } from ''@mui/material'';\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const theme = useTheme();\n\n  return (\n    <Box\n      sx={{\n        p: 2,\n        bgcolor: theme.palette.primary.main,\n        color: theme.palette.primary.contrastText,\n        borderRadius: theme.shape.borderRadius,\n      }}\n    >\n      Themed box\n    </Box>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Theme in sx Prop\n\n```typescript\n<Box\n  sx={{\n    // Access theme in sx\n    color: ''primary.main'',          // theme.palette.primary.main\n    bgcolor: ''background.paper'',     // theme.palette.background.paper\n    p: 2,                            // theme.spacing(2)\n    borderRadius: 1,                 // theme.shape.borderRadius\n  }}\n>\n  Content\n</Box>\n\n// Callback for advanced usage\n<Box\n  sx={(theme) => ({\n    color: theme.palette.primary.main,\n    ''&:hover'': {\n      color: theme.palette.primary.dark,\n    },\n  })}\n>\n  Hover me\n</Box>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Responsive Design\n\n### Breakpoints\n\n```typescript\n// Mobile-first responsive values\n<Box\n  sx={{\n    width: {\n      xs: ''100%'',    // 0-600px\n      sm: ''80%'',     // 600-900px\n      md: ''60%'',     // 900-1200px\n      lg: ''40%'',     // 1200-1536px\n      xl: ''30%'',     // 1536px+\n    },\n  }}\n>\n  Responsive width\n</Box>\n\n// Responsive display\n<Box\n  sx={{\n    display: {\n      xs: ''none'',    // Hidden on mobile\n      md: ''block'',   // Visible on desktop\n    },\n  }}\n>\n  Desktop only\n</Box>\n```\n\n### Responsive Typography\n\n```typescript\n<Typography\n  sx={{\n    fontSize: {\n      xs: ''1rem'',\n      md: ''1.5rem'',\n      lg: ''2rem'',\n    },\n    lineHeight: {\n      xs: 1.5,\n      md: 1.75,\n    },\n  }}\n>\n  Responsive text\n</Typography>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Forms\n\n```typescript\nimport { TextField, Stack, Button } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n<Box component=\"form\" onSubmit={handleSubmit}>\n  <Stack spacing={2}>\n    <TextField\n      label=\"Email\"\n      type=\"email\"\n      value={email}\n      onChange={(e) => setEmail(e.target.value)}\n      fullWidth\n      required\n      error={!!errors.email}\n      helperText={errors.email}\n    />\n    <Button type=\"submit\" variant=\"contained\">Submit</Button>\n  </Stack>\n</Box>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Card Component\n\n```typescript\nimport { Card, CardContent, CardActions, Typography, Button } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n<Card>\n  <CardContent>\n    <Typography variant=\"h5\" component=\"div\">\n      Title\n    </Typography>\n    <Typography variant=\"body2\" color=\"text.secondary\">\n      Description\n    </Typography>\n  </CardContent>\n  <CardActions>\n    <Button size=\"small\">Learn More</Button>\n  </CardActions>\n</Card>\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal\n\n```typescript\nimport { Dialog, DialogTitle, DialogContent, DialogActions, Button } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n<Dialog open={open} onClose={handleClose}>\n  <DialogTitle>Confirm Action</DialogTitle>\n  <DialogContent>\n    Are you sure you want to proceed?\n  </DialogContent>\n  <DialogActions>\n    <Button onClick={handleClose}>Cancel</Button>\n    <Button onClick={handleConfirm} variant=\"contained\">\n      Confirm\n    </Button>\n  </DialogActions>\n</Dialog>\n```\n\n### Loading States\n\n```typescript\nimport { CircularProgress, Skeleton } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n// Spinner\n<Box sx={{ display: ''flex'', justifyContent: ''center'', p: 3 }}>\n  <CircularProgress />\n</Box>\n\n// Skeleton\n<Stack spacing={1}>\n  <Skeleton variant=\"text\" width=\"60%\" />\n  <Skeleton variant=\"rectangular\" height={200} />\n  <Skeleton variant=\"text\" width=\"40%\" />\n</Stack>\n```\n\n---\n\n## MUI-Specific Hooks\n\n### useMuiSnackbar\n\n```typescript\nimport { useMuiSnackbar } from ''@/hooks/useMuiSnackbar'';\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const { showSuccess, showError, showInfo } = useMuiSnackbar();\n\n  const handleSave = async () => {\n    try {\n      await saveData();\n      showSuccess(''Saved successfully'');\n    } catch (error) {\n      showError(''Failed to save'');\n    }\n  };\n\n  return <Button onClick={handleSave}>Save</Button>;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Icons\n\n```typescript\nimport { Add as AddIcon, Delete as DeleteIcon } from ''@mui/icons-material'';\nimport { Button, IconButton } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n<Button startIcon={<AddIcon />}>Add</Button>\n<IconButton onClick={handleDelete}><DeleteIcon /></IconButton>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Type Your sx Props\n\n```typescript\nimport type { SxProps, Theme } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n// ✅ Good\nconst styles: Record<string, SxProps<Theme>> = {\n  container: { p: 2 },\n};\n\n// ❌ Avoid\nconst styles = {\n  container: { p: 2 }, // No type safety\n};\n```\n\n### 2. Use Theme Tokens\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good: Use theme tokens\n<Box sx={{ color: ''primary.main'', p: 2 }} />\n\n// ❌ Avoid: Hardcoded values\n<Box sx={{ color: ''#1976d2'', padding: ''16px'' }} />\n```\n\n### 3. Consistent Spacing\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good: Use spacing scale\n<Box sx={{ p: 2, mb: 3, mt: 1 }} />\n\n// ❌ Avoid: Random pixel values\n<Box sx={{ padding: ''17px'', marginBottom: ''25px'' }} />\n```\n\n---\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor more detailed patterns, see:\n- [styling-guide.md](resources/styling-guide.md) - Advanced styling patterns\n- [component-library.md](resources/component-library.md) - Component examples\n- [theme-customization.md](resources/theme-customization.md) - Theme setup\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:32:16.011Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Development Agents building modern React applications with Material Design components.","zh":"适用于构建使用 Material Design 组件的现代 React 应用程序的前端开发代理。","ja":"Material Design コンポーネントを使用したモダンな React アプリケーションを構築するフロントエンド開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Material Design 구성 요소를 사용하는 최신 React 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de frontend que crean aplicaciones modernas de React con componentes de Material Design.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de frontend qui créent des applications modernes de React avec des composants de conception de Material.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die moderne React-Anwendungen mit Material-Design-Komponenten erstellen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento de frontend que constroem aplicações React modernas com componentes do Material Design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки фронтенда, создающих современные приложения React с компонентами Material Design.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الواجهة الأمامية التي تبني تطبيقات React الحديثة مع مكونات التصميم المادي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables seamless integration with MUI v7''s component ecosystem using standardized slots and slotProps patterns. Provides responsive design capabilities through sx prop styling and theme integration while maintaining CSS layer compatibility with Tailwind v4.","zh":"通过标准化的插槽和插槽属性模式，实现与 MUI v7 的组件生态系统的无缝集成。通过 sx 属性样式和主题集成提供响应式设计能力，同时保持与 Tailwind v4 的 CSS 层兼容性。","ja":"標準化されたスロットとスロットプロパティのパターンを使用して、MUI v7 のコンポーネントエコシステムとのシームレスな統合を実現します。sx プロパティのスタイリングとテーマの統合を通じて、レスポンシブデザインの機能を提供しながら、Tailwind v4 の CSS レイヤとの互換性を維持します。","ko":"표준화된 슬롯과 슬롯 속성 패턴을 사용하여 MUI v7의 구성 요소 생태계와의无缝 통합을 가능하게 합니다. sx 속성 스타일링 및 테마 통합을 통해 반응형 디자인 기능을 제공하면서 Tailwind v4의 CSS 계층과 호환성을 유지합니다.","es":"Permite una integración sin problemas con el ecosistema de componentes de MUI v7 utilizando patrones de ranuras y slotProps estandarizados. Proporciona capacidades de diseño responsivo a través de la configuración de estilo de prop sx y la integración de temas, manteniendo la compatibilidad con la capa CSS de Tailwind v4.","fr":"Permet une intégration transparente avec l''écosystème de composants MUI v7 en utilisant des modèles de slots et de slotProps standardisés. Fournit des capacités de conception réactive via le style de prop sx et l''intégration de thème, tout en maintenant la compatibilité de la couche CSS avec Tailwind v4.","de":"Ermöglicht eine nahtlose Integration mit dem MUI-v7-Komponenten-Ökosystem unter Verwendung standardisierter Slot- und SlotProps-Muster. Bietet responsive Designfähigkeiten durch sx-Prop-Styling und Theme-Integration, während die Kompatibilität mit der CSS-Schicht von Tailwind v4 aufrechterhalten wird.","pt":"Permite integração sem problemas com o ecossistema de componentes do MUI v7 usando padrões de slots e slotProps padrão. Fornece capacidades de design responsivo por meio da estilização da propriedade sx e integração de tema, mantendo a compatibilidade com a camada CSS do Tailwind v4.","ru":"Позволяет обеспечить бесшовную интеграцию с экосистемой компонентов MUI v7, используя стандартизированные шаблоны слотов и слотПропс. Предоставляет возможности адаптивного дизайна через стилизацию свойства sx и интеграцию темы, сохраняя совместимость со слоем CSS Tailwind v4.","ar":"يمكّن من التكامل السلس مع نظام مكونات MUI v7 باستخدام أنماط.slots و slotProps المعيارية. يوفر قدرات التصميم الاستجابي من خلال تنسيق الخواص sx وتكامل الموضوع مع الحفاظ على توافق طبقة CSS مع Tailwind v4."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing responsive UI layouts using sx prop","Migrating v6 components to v7 slot patterns","Configuring theme-aware components with CSS layer support","Building accessible modal components with standardized onClose handling"],"zh":["使用 sx 属性实现响应式 UI 布局","将 v6 组件迁移到 v7 插槽模式","配置支持 CSS 层的主题感知组件","构建具有标准化 onClose 处理的可访问模态组件"],"ja":["sx プロパティを使用したレスポンシブ UI レイアウトの実装","v6 コンポーネントを v7 スロットパターンに移行","CSS レイヤーをサポートするテーマ認識コンポーネントの構成","標準化された onClose ハンドリングを備えたアクセス可能なモーダルコンポーネントの構築"],"ko":["sx 속성을 사용하여 반응형 UI 레이아웃 구현","v6 구성 요소를 v7 슬롯 패턴으로 마이그레이션","CSS 계층을 지원하는 테마 인식 구성 요소를 구성","표준화된 onClose 처리를 갖춘 접근 가능한 모달 구성 요소를 구축"],"es":["Implementar diseños de interfaz de usuario responsivos utilizando la prop sx","Migrar componentes de v6 a patrones de ranuras de v7","Configurar componentes con conciencia de tema con soporte de capa CSS","Crear componentes de modal accesibles con control de cierre estandarizado"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des dispositions d''interface utilisateur réactives en utilisant la prop sx","Migrer des composants de v6 vers des modèles de slots de v7","Configurer des composants avec une prise en compte de thème et un support de couche CSS","Créer des composants modaux accessibles avec une gestion de fermeture standardisée"],"de":["Reaktive Benutzeroberflächen-Layouts mithilfe der sx-Eigenschaft implementieren","Komponenten von v6 auf v7-Schachtmuster migrieren","Themenbewusste Komponenten mit CSS-Schicht-Unterstützung konfigurieren","Zugängliche Modal-Komponenten mit standardisierter Schließe-Steuerung erstellen"],"pt":["Implementação de layouts de UI responsivos usando a propriedade sx","Migração de componentes v6 para padrões de slots v7","Configuração de componentes conscientes do tema com suporte à camada CSS","Criação de componentes modais acessíveis com tratamento de fechamento padrão"],"ru":["Реализация адаптивных макетов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью свойства sx","Миграция компонентов v6 на шаблоны слотов v7","Настройка компонентов, осведомленных о теме, с поддержкой слоя CSS","Создание доступных компонентов модального окна с стандартизированной обработкой закрытия"],"ar":["تنفيذ تصميمات واجهة المستخدم المستجيبة باستخدام خاصية sx","هجرة مكونات v6 إلى أنماط.slots v7","تكوين مكونات مدروسة للموضوع مع دعم لطبقة CSS","بناء مكونات حوارية قابلة للوصول مع معالجة إغلاق معيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React environment","Breaking changes from v6 (deep imports, onBackdropClick removal)","Dependent on MUI v7 package structure"],"zh":["需要 React 环境","v6 から breaking changes (深層インポート、onBackdropClick 削除)","依赖于 MUI v7 包结构"],"ja":["React 環境が必要","v6 から breaking changes (ディープインポート、onBackdropClick 削除)","MUI v7 パッケージ構造に依存"],"ko":["React 환경이 필요","v6에서 breaking changes(깊은 가져오기, onBackdropClick 제거)","MUI v7 패키지 구조에 종속"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React","Cambios importantes desde la v6 (importaciones profundas, eliminación de onBackdropClick)","Dependiente de la estructura del paquete MUI v7"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React","Changements importants depuis la v6 (importations profondes, suppression de onBackdropClick)","Dépend de la structure du package MUI v7"],"de":["Benötigt React-Umgebung","Wesentliche Änderungen seit v6 (tiefere Importe, Entfernung von onBackdropClick)","Abhängig von der Paketstruktur von MUI v7"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React","Alterações disruptivas do v6 (importações profundas, remoção do onBackdropClick)","Dependente da estrutura do pacote MUI v7"],"ru":["Требуется среда React","Нарушающие изменения v6 (глубокие импорты, удаление onBackdropClick)","Зависит от структуры пакета MUI v7"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React","التغييرات التي تسبب انقطاع في v6 (الاستيراد العميق، إزالة onBackdropClick)","يعتمد على هيكل حزمة MUI v7"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
