 GraphQ...","pt":"NestJS: Framework para Desenvolvimento de APIs","ru":"NestJS: Фреймворк для разработки API","ar":"نست جيه إس: إطار عمل لتطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","en":"nestjs"},"description":{"zh":"NestJS是一个用于构建高效、可扩展的服务器端应用程序的框架，支持RESTful API、GraphQL和微服务","ja":"NestJSは、効率的でスケーラブルなサーバーサイドアプリケーションを構築するためのフレームワークで、RESTful API、GraphQL、ミクロサービスをサポート","ko":"NestJS는 효율적이고 확장 가능한 서버 사이드 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 프레임워크로 RESTful API, GraphQL 및 마이크로 서비스를 지원","es":"NestJS es un framework para desarrollar aplicaciones servidoras eficientes y escalables. Permite crear APIs REST y servidores GraphQL con autenticación y aut...","fr":"NestJS est un framework pour développer des applications serveur efficaces et évolutives. Il permet de créer des API REST et des serveurs GraphQL avec authen...","de":"NestJS ist ein Framework für die Entwicklung effizienter und skalierbarer Serveranwendungen. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung von REST-APIs und GraphQL-Servern m...","pt":"NestJS é um framework Node.js para desenvolver APIs REST e GraphQL escaláveis e seguras. Ele fornece uma arquitetura modular e flexível para construir aplica...","ru":"NestJS - это фреймворк Node.js для разработки масштабируемых и безопасных API REST и GraphQL. Он предоставляет модульную и гибкую архитектуру для построения ...","ar":"نست جيه إس هو إطار عمل نود جيه إس لتطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات_REST و_GraphQL قابلة للتوسيع والأمن. يقدم هيكلاً متجزأً ومروناً لإنشاء تطبيقات الويب.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持RESTful API和GraphQL","内置认证和授权功能","支持多种数据库，包括TypeORM和Drizzle ORM","微服务架构支持","内置测试和文档功能"],"ja":["RESTful APIとGraphQLをサポート","認証と認可機能を内蔵","TypeORMやDrizzle ORMを含む複数のデータベースをサポート","ミクロサービスアーキテクチャをサポート","テストとドキュメント機能を内蔵"],"ko":["RESTful API 및 GraphQL 지원","인증 및 인가 기능 내장","TypeORM 및 Drizzle ORM을 포함한 여러 데이터베이스 지원","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 지원","테스트 및 문서 기능 내장"],"es":["Construcción de APIs REST y servidores GraphQL","Autenticación y autorización","Implementación de middleware, guards y interceptores","Trabajo con bases de datos como TypeORM y Drizzle ORM","Creación de arquitecturas de microservicios","Escritura de pruebas unitarias e integración"],"fr":["Construction d''API REST et de serveurs GraphQL","Authentification et autorisation","Mise en œuvre de middleware, guards et intercepteurs","Travail avec des bases de données comme TypeORM et Drizzle ORM","Création d''architectures de microservices","Écriture de tests unitaires et d''intégration"],"de":["Erstellung von REST-APIs und GraphQL-Servern","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Implementierung von Middleware, Guards und Interzeptoren","Arbeit mit Datenbanken wie TypeORM und Drizzle ORM","Erstellung von Microservices-Architekturen","Schreiben von Einheitstests und Integrations-tests"],"pt":["Arquitetura modular","Suporte a APIs REST e GraphQL","Autenticação e autorização","Middleware, guards e interceptores","Suporte a bancos de dados","Testes unitários e de integração"],"ru":["Модульная архитектура","Поддержка API REST и GraphQL","Аутентификация и авторизация","Мидлваре, гарды и интерсепторы","Поддержка баз данных","Юнит-тесты и интеграционные тесты"],"ar":["هيكل متجزأ","دعم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات_REST و_GraphQL","التحقق والسماح","برامج الوسائط، الحراس والمتدخلون","دعم قواعد البيانات","اختبارات الوحدة واختبارات التكامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NestJS","Node.js","RESTful API","GraphQL","微服务","TypeORM","Drizzle ORM","服务器端应用程序"],"ja":["NestJS","Node.js","RESTful API","GraphQL","ミクロサービス","TypeORM","Drizzle ORM","サーバーサイドアプリケーション"],"ko":["NestJS","Node.js","RESTful API","GraphQL","마이크로 서비스","TypeORM","Drizzle ORM","서버 사이드 애플리케이션"],"es":["NestJS","API REST","GraphQL","autenticación","autorización","middleware","guards","interceptores","TypeORM","Drizzle ORM"],"fr":["NestJS","API REST","GraphQL","authentification","autorisation","middleware","guards","intercepteurs","TypeORM","Drizzle ORM"],"de":["NestJS","REST-API","GraphQL","Authentifizierung","Autorisierung","Middleware","Guards","Interzeptoren","TypeORM","Drizzle ORM"],"pt":["NestJS","Node.js","API REST","API GraphQL","Desenvolvimento de APIs","Arquitetura de software","Autenticação","Autorização","Testes unitários"],"ru":["NestJS","Node.js","API REST","API GraphQL","Разработка API","Архитектура программного обеспечения","Аутентификация","Авторизация","Юнит-тесты"],"ar":["نست جيه إس","نود جيه إس","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات_REST","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات_GraphQL","تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","هيكلة البرمجيات","التحقق","السماح","اختبارات الوحدة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nestjs","description":"Comprehensive NestJS framework guide with Drizzle ORM integration. Use when building NestJS applications, setting up APIs, implementing authentication, working with databases, or integrating Drizzle ORM. Covers controllers, providers, modules, middleware, guards, interceptors, testing, microservices, GraphQL, and database patterns.","bodyPreview":"# NestJS Framework with Drizzle ORM\n\n## When to Use\n- Building REST APIs or GraphQL servers with NestJS\n- Setting up authentication and authorization\n- Implementing middleware, guards, or interceptors\n- Working with databases (TypeORM, Drizzle ORM)\n- Creating microservices architecture\n- Writing unit and integration tests\n- Setting up OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n## Core Architecture\n\n### Module Structure\n```typescript\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\n@Module({\n  imports: [/* other mo","body":"# NestJS Framework with Drizzle ORM\n\n## When to Use\n- Building REST APIs or GraphQL servers with NestJS\n- Setting up authentication and authorization\n- Implementing middleware, guards, or interceptors\n- Working with databases (TypeORM, Drizzle ORM)\n- Creating microservices architecture\n- Writing unit and integration tests\n- Setting up OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n## Core Architecture\n\n### Module Structure\n```typescript\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\n@Module({\n  imports: [/* other modules */],\n  controllers: [/* controllers */],\n  providers: [/* providers */],\n  exports: [/* exported providers */],\n})\nexport class FeatureModule {}\n```\n\n### Controller Pattern\n```typescript\nimport { Controller, Get, Post, Body, Param, Query } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\n@Controller(''users'')\nexport class UsersController {\n  @Get()\n  findAll(@Query() query: any) {\n    return ''This returns all users'';\n  }\n\n  @Get('':id'')\n  findOne(@Param(''id'') id: string) {\n    return `This returns user #${id}`;\n  }\n\n  @Post()\n  create(@Body() createUserDto: any) {\n    return ''This creates a user'';\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Service with Dependency Injection\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class UsersService {\n  constructor(/* inject dependencies */) {}\n\n  findAll() {\n    return ''Users service logic'';\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Database Integration with Drizzle\n\n### Setup with Drizzle ORM\n\n#### Installation\n```bash\n# Using npm\nnpm install drizzle-orm pg\nnpm install -D drizzle-kit tsx @types/pg\n\n# Using yarn\nyarn add drizzle-orm pg\nyarn add -D drizzle-kit tsx @types/pg\n```\n\n#### Configuration\n```typescript\n// drizzle.config.ts\nimport ''dotenv/config'';\nimport { defineConfig } from ''drizzle-kit'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  out: ''./drizzle'',\n  schema: ''./src/db/schema.ts'',\n  dialect: ''postgresql'',\n  dbCredentials: {\n    url: process.env.DATABASE_URL!,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### Database Schema\n```typescript\n// src/db/schema.ts\nimport { pgTable, serial, text, timestamp } from ''drizzle-orm/pg-core'';\n\nexport const users = pgTable(''users'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n  email: text(''email'').notNull().unique(),\n  createdAt: timestamp(''created_at'').defaultNow(),\n});\n```\n\n#### Database Service\n```typescript\n// src/db/database.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { drizzle } from ''drizzle-orm/node-postgres'';\nimport { Pool } from ''pg'';\nimport * as schema from ''./schema'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class DatabaseService {\n  private db: ReturnType<typeof drizzle>;\n\n  constructor() {\n    const pool = new Pool({\n      connectionString: process.env.DATABASE_URL,\n    });\n    this.db = drizzle(pool, { schema });\n  }\n\n  get database() {\n    return this.db;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### User Repository with Drizzle\n```typescript\n// src/users/user.repository.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { DatabaseService } from ''../db/database.service'';\nimport { users } from ''../db/schema'';\nimport { eq } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class UserRepository {\n  constructor(private db: DatabaseService) {}\n\n  async findAll() {\n    return this.db.database.select().from(users);\n  }\n\n  async findOne(id: number) {\n    const result = await this.db.database\n      .select()\n      .from(users)\n      .where(eq(users.id, id))\n      .limit(1);\n    return result[0];\n  }\n\n  async create(data: typeof users.$inferInsert) {\n    const result = await this.db.database\n      .insert(users)\n      .values(data)\n      .returning();\n    return result[0];\n  }\n\n  async update(id: number, data: Partial<typeof users.$inferInsert>) {\n    const result = await this.db.database\n      .update(users)\n      .set(data)\n      .where(eq(users.id, id))\n      .returning();\n    return result[0];\n  }\n\n  async remove(id: number) {\n    const result = await this.db.database\n      .delete(users)\n      .where(eq(users.id, id))\n      .returning();\n    return result[0];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Complete User Module\n```typescript\n// src/users/users.module.ts\nimport { Module } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { UsersController } from ''./users.controller'';\nimport { UsersService } from ''./users.service'';\nimport { UserRepository } from ''./user.repository'';\nimport { DatabaseService } from ''../db/database.service'';\n\n@Module({\n  controllers: [UsersController],\n  providers: [UsersService, UserRepository, DatabaseService],\n  exports: [UsersService],\n})\nexport class UsersModule {}\n```\n\n#### User Service Implementation\n```typescript\n// src/users/users.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { UserRepository } from ''./user.repository'';\nimport { User } from ''./interfaces/user.interface'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class UsersService {\n  constructor(private userRepository: UserRepository) {}\n\n  async findAll(): Promise<User[]> {\n    return this.userRepository.findAll();\n  }\n\n  async findOne(id: number): Promise<User> {\n    const user = await this.userRepository.findOne(id);\n    if (!user) {\n      throw new Error(''User not found'');\n    }\n    return user;\n  }\n\n  async create(userData: Partial<User>): Promise<User> {\n    return this.userRepository.create(userData);\n  }\n\n  async update(id: number, userData: Partial<User>): Promise<User> {\n    await this.findOne(id); // Verify user exists\n    return this.userRepository.update(id, userData);\n  }\n\n  async remove(id: number): Promise<User> {\n    await this.findOne(id); // Verify user exists\n    return this.userRepository.remove(id);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Authentication & Authorization\n\n### JWT Authentication Guard\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, CanActivate, ExecutionContext } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { JwtService } from ''@nestjs/jwt'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class JwtAuthGuard implements CanActivate {\n  constructor(private jwtService: JwtService) {}\n\n  canActivate(context: ExecutionContext) {\n    const request = context.switchToHttp().getRequest();\n    const token = request.headers.authorization?.split('' '')[1];\n\n    if (!token) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const decoded = this.jwtService.verify(token);\n      request.user = decoded;\n      return true;\n    } catch {\n      return false;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Roles-Based Guard\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, CanActivate, ExecutionContext } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { Reflector } from ''@nestjs/core'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class RolesGuard implements CanActivate {\n  constructor(private reflector: Reflector) {}\n\n  canActivate(context: ExecutionContext): boolean {\n    const requiredRoles = this.reflector.get<string[]>(''roles'', context.getHandler());\n    if (!requiredRoles) {\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    const { user } = context.switchToHttp().getRequest();\n    return requiredRoles.some((role) => user.roles?.includes(role));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Validation with Pipes\n\n### Validation Pipe\n```typescript\nimport { PipeTransform, Injectable, ArgumentMetadata, BadRequestException } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { validate } from ''class-validator'';\nimport { plainToClass } from ''class-transformer'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class ValidationPipe implements PipeTransform {\n  async transform(value: any, { metatype }: ArgumentMetadata) {\n    if (!metatype || !this.toValidate(metatype)) {\n      return value;\n    }\n\n    const object = plainToClass(metatype, value);\n    const errors = await validate(object);\n\n    if (errors.length > 0) {\n      throw new BadRequestException(errors);\n    }\n\n    return value;\n  }\n\n  private toValidate(metatype: Function): boolean {\n    const types: Function[] = [String, Boolean, Number, Array, Object];\n    return !types.includes(metatype);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Exception Handling\n\n### Global Exception Filter\n```typescript\nimport { ExceptionFilter, Catch, ArgumentsHost, HttpException } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { Request, Response } from ''express'';\n\n@Catch(HttpException)\nexport class HttpExceptionFilter implements ExceptionFilter {\n  catch(exception: HttpException, host: ArgumentsHost) {\n    const ctx = host.switchToHttp();\n    const response = ctx.getResponse<Response>();\n    const request = ctx.getRequest<Request>();\n    const status = exception.getStatus();\n\n    response.status(status).json({\n      statusCode: status,\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n      path: request.url,\n      message: exception.message,\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Patterns\n\n### Unit Testing Services\n```typescript\nimport { Test, TestingModule } from ''@nestjs/testing'';\nimport { UsersService } from ''./users.service'';\nimport { UserRepository } from ''./user.repository'';\n\ndescribe(''UsersService'', () => {\n  let service: UsersService;\n  let repository: jest.Mocked<UserRepository>;\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    const mockRepository = {\n      findAll: jest.fn(),\n      findOne: jest.fn(),\n      create: jest.fn(),\n      update: jest.fn(),\n      remove: jest.fn(),\n    } as any;\n\n    const module: TestingModule = await Test.createTestingModule({\n      providers: [\n        UsersService,\n        {\n          provide: UserRepository,\n          useValue: mockRepository,\n        },\n      ],\n    }).compile();\n\n    service = module.get<UsersService>(UsersService);\n    repository = module.get(UserRepository);\n  });\n\n  it(''should return all users'', async () => {\n    const expectedUsers = [{ id: 1, name: ''John'', email: ''john@example.com'' }];\n    repository.findAll.mockResolvedValue(expectedUsers);\n\n    const result = await service.findAll();\n    expect(result).toEqual(expectedUsers);\n    expect(repository.findAll).toHaveBeenCalled();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### E2E Testing with Drizzle\n```typescript\nimport { Test, TestingModule } from ''@nestjs/testing'';\nimport { INestApplication } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport * as request from ''supertest'';\nimport { AppModule } from ''./../src/app.module'';\nimport { DatabaseService } from ''../src/db/database.service'';\nimport { drizzle } from ''drizzle-orm/node-postgres'';\nimport { migrate } from ''drizzle-node-postgres/migrator'';\nimport { migrate as drizzleMigrate } from ''drizzle-orm/node-postgres/migrator'';\n\ndescribe(''UsersController (e2e)'', () => {\n  let app: INestApplication;\n  let db: DatabaseService;\n\n  beforeAll(async () => {\n    const moduleFixture: TestingModule = await Test.createTestingModule({\n      imports: [AppModule],\n    }).compile();\n\n    app = moduleFixture.createNestApplication();\n    db = moduleFixture.get<DatabaseService>(DatabaseService);\n\n    // Run migrations\n    await drizzleMigrate(db.database, { migrationsFolder: ''./drizzle'' });\n\n    await app.init();\n  });\n\n  afterAll(async () => {\n    await app.close();\n  });\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    // Clean database\n    await db.database.delete(users).execute();\n  });\n\n  it(''/users (POST)'', () => {\n    const createUserDto = {\n      name: ''Test User'',\n      email: ''test@example.com'',\n    };\n\n    return request(app.getHttpServer())\n      .post(''/users'')\n      .send(createUserDto)\n      .expect(201)\n      .expect((res) => {\n        expect(res.body).toMatchObject(createUserDto);\n        expect(res.body).toHaveProperty(''id'');\n      });\n  });\n\n  it(''/users (GET)'', async () => {\n    // First create a user\n    await db.database.insert(users).values({\n      name: ''Test User'',\n      email: ''test@example.com'',\n    });\n\n    return request(app.getHttpServer())\n      .get(''/users'')\n      .expect(200)\n      .expect((res) => {\n        expect(Array.isArray(res.body)).toBe(true);\n        expect(res.body).toHaveLength(1);\n      });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Migrations with Drizzle\n\n### Generating Migrations\n```bash\nnpx drizzle-kit generate\n```\n\n### Running Migrations\n```typescript\n// src/migrations/migration.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { migrate } from ''drizzle-orm/node-postgres/migrator'';\nimport { DatabaseService } from ''../db/database.service'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class MigrationService {\n  constructor(private db: DatabaseService) {}\n\n  async runMigrations() {\n    try {\n      await migrate(this.db.database, { migrationsFolder: ''./drizzle'' });\n      console.log(''Migrations completed successfully'');\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''Migration failed:'', error);\n      throw error;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration Management\n\n### Environment Configuration\n```typescript\n// src/config/configuration.ts\nexport default () => ({\n  database: {\n    url: process.env.DATABASE_URL,\n  },\n  jwt: {\n    secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET || ''default-secret'',\n    expiresIn: process.env.JWT_EXPIRES_IN || ''24h'',\n  },\n  app: {\n    port: parseInt(process.env.PORT, 10) || 3000,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Custom Decorators\n```typescript\nimport { createParamDecorator, ExecutionContext } from ''@nestjs/common'';\n\nexport const User = createParamDecorator(\n  (data: string, ctx: ExecutionContext) => {\n    const request = ctx.switchToHttp().getRequest();\n    const user = request.user;\n\n    return data ? user?.[data] : user;\n  },\n);\n```\n\n### Interceptors for Logging\n```typescript\nimport { Injectable, NestInterceptor, ExecutionContext, CallHandler } from ''@nestjs/common'';\nimport { Observable } from ''rxjs'';\nimport { tap } from ''rxjs/operators'';\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class LoggingInterceptor implements NestInterceptor {\n  intercept(context: ExecutionContext, next: CallHandler): Observable<any> {\n    const request = context.switchToHttp().getRequest();\n    const { method, url } = request;\n    const now = Date.now();\n\n    console.log(`[${method}] ${url} - Start`);\n\n    return next\n      .handle()\n      .pipe(\n        tap(() => console.log(`[${method}] ${url} - End ${Date.now() - now}ms`)),\n      );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Microservices\n\n### TCP Microservice\n```typescript\n// main.ts\nimport { NestFactory } from ''@nestjs/core'';\nimport { Transport, MicroserviceOptions } from ''@nestjs/microservices'';\nimport { AppModule } from ''./app.module'';\n\nasync function bootstrap() {\n  const app = await NestFactory.createMicroservice<MicroserviceOptions>(\n    AppModule,\n    {\n      transport: Transport.TCP,\n      options: {\n        host: ''localhost'',\n        port: 8877,\n      },\n    },\n  );\n  await app.listen();\n}\nbootstrap();\n```\n\n## GraphQL Integration\n\n### GraphQL Resolver with Drizzle\n```typescript\nimport { Resolver, Query, Mutation, Args } from ''@nestjs/graphql'';\nimport { UserRepository } from ''./user.repository'';\n\n@Resolver(() => User)\nexport class UsersResolver {\n  constructor(private userRepository: UserRepository) {}\n\n  @Query(() => [User])\n  async users() {\n    return this.userRepository.findAll();\n  }\n\n  @Mutation(() => User)\n  async createUser(@Args(''input'') input: CreateUserInput) {\n    return this.userRepository.create(input);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use constructor injection** - Never use property injection\n2. **Use DTOs for data transfer** - Define interfaces for request/response\n3. **Implement proper error handling** - Use exception filters\n4. **Validate all inputs** - Use validation pipes\n5. **Keep modules focused** - Single responsibility principle\n6. **Use environment variables** - Never hardcode credentials\n7. **Write comprehensive tests** - Unit and integration tests\n8. **Use transactions for complex operations** - Maintain data consistency\n9. **Implement proper logging** - Use interceptors for cross-cutting concerns\n10. **Use type safety** - Leverage TypeScript features\n\n## Common Patterns with Drizzle\n\n### Transactions\n```typescript\nasync transferFunds(fromId: number, toId: number, amount: number) {\n  return this.db.database.transaction(async (tx) => {\n    // Debit from account\n    await tx\n      .update(accounts)\n      .set({ balance: sql`${accounts.balance} - ${amount}` })\n      .where(eq(accounts.id, fromId));\n\n    // Credit to account\n    await tx\n      .update(accounts)\n      .set({ balance: sql`${accounts.balance} + ${amount}` })\n      .where(eq(accounts.id, toId));\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Soft Deletes\n```typescript\nexport const users = pgTable(''users'', {\n  id: serial(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n  email: text(''email'').notNull().unique(),\n  deletedAt: timestamp(''deleted_at''),\n});\n\nasync softDelete(id: number) {\n  return this.db.database\n    .update(users)\n    .set({ deletedAt: new Date() })\n    .where(eq(users.id, id));\n}\n```\n\n### Complex Queries with Relations\n```typescript\nasync getUsersWithPosts() {\n  return this.db.database\n    .select()\n    .from(users)\n    .leftJoin(posts, eq(posts.userId, users.id));\n}\n```"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:33:18.913Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents requiring robust backend framework capabilities with NestJS","zh":"适用于需要强大的后端框架能力的全栈代理，使用NestJS","ja":"NestJSを使用して、強力なバックエンドフレームワーク機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"NestJS를 사용하여 강력한 백엔드 프레임워크 기능을 필요로 하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes Full-Stack que requieren capacidades de framework de backend robustas con NestJS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant des capacités de framework de backend robustes avec NestJS","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die robuste Backend-Framework-Fähigkeiten mit NestJS benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que requerem capacidades robustas de framework de backend com NestJS","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, требующих мощных возможностей фреймворка бэкенда с NestJS","ar":"مثالي لعميل الخدمة الكاملة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إطار الخلفية القوية مع NestJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable REST APIs and GraphQL servers with NestJS, leveraging TypeORM and Drizzle ORM for database interactions, and implementing authentication and authorization using middleware, guards, or interceptors","zh":"赋予代理人使用NestJS建立可扩展的REST API和GraphQL服务器的能力，利用TypeORM和Drizzle ORM进行数据库交互，并使用中间件、守卫或拦截器实现身份验证和授权","ja":"エージェントがNestJSを使用してスケーラブルなREST APIとGraphQLサーバーを構築し、TypeORMとDrizzle ORMを使用してデータベースとやり取りし、ミドルウェア、ガード、またはインターセプターを使用して認証と認可を実装することを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 NestJS를 사용하여 확장 가능한 REST API와 GraphQL 서버를 구축하고, TypeORM과 Drizzle ORM을 사용하여 데이터베이스와 상호 작용하며, 미들웨어, 가드 또는 인터셉터를 사용하여 인증 및 인가를 구현할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir REST APIs escalables y servidores GraphQL con NestJS, aprovechando TypeORM y Drizzle ORM para las interacciones con la base de datos, e implementando la autenticación y autorización mediante middleware, guards o interceptores","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des API REST évolutives et des serveurs GraphQL avec NestJS, en exploitant TypeORM et Drizzle ORM pour les interactions avec la base de données, et en mettant en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation à l''aide de middleware, de guards ou d''intercepteurs","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare REST-APIs und GraphQL-Server mit NestJS zu erstellen, indem TypeORM und Drizzle ORM für Datenbankinteraktionen genutzt und Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mithilfe von Middleware, Guards oder Interzeptoren implementiert werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem APIs REST escaláveis e servidores GraphQL com NestJS, aproveitando TypeORM e Drizzle ORM para interações com bancos de dados e implementando autenticação e autorização usando middleware, guards ou interceptores","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые REST API и серверы GraphQL с NestJS, используя TypeORM и Drizzle ORM для взаимодействия с базами данных, и реализуя аутентификацию и авторизацию с помощью middleware, guards или interceptors","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء بناء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات REST قابلة للتوسيع وخادمات GraphQL مع NestJS، واستخدام TypeORM و Drizzle ORM لتفاعلات قاعدة البيانات وتنفيذ المصادقة والسماح باستخدام البرامج الوسيطة أو الحارس أو المحاصر"},"useCases":{"en":["Building microservices architecture with NestJS","Implementing authentication and authorization using guards and middleware","Generating OpenAPI/Swagger documentation for APIs"],"zh":["使用NestJS构建微服务架构","使用守卫和中间件实现身份验证和授权","为API生成OpenAPI/Swagger文档"],"ja":["NestJSを使用したマイクロサービスアーキテクチャの構築","ガードとミドルウェアを使用した認証と認可の実装","APIのOpenAPI/Swaggerドキュメントの生成"],"ko":["NestJS를 사용한 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 구축","가드 및 미들웨어를 사용한 인증 및 인가 구현","API에 대한 OpenAPI/Swagger 문서 생성"],"es":["Construir arquitectura de microservicios con NestJS","Implementar autenticación y autorización utilizando guards y middleware","Generar documentación OpenAPI/Swagger para APIs"],"fr":["Construire une architecture de microservices avec NestJS","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation à l''aide de guards et de middleware","Générer la documentation OpenAPI/Swagger pour les API"],"de":["Microservices-Architektur mit NestJS aufbauen","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mithilfe von Guards und Middleware implementieren","OpenAPI/Swagger-Dokumentation für APIs generieren"],"pt":["Construir arquitetura de microsserviços com NestJS","Implementar autenticação e autorização usando guards e middleware","Gerar documentação OpenAPI/Swagger para APIs"],"ru":["Построение архитектуры микросервисов с NestJS","Реализация аутентификации и авторизации с помощью guards и middleware","Генерация документации OpenAPI/Swagger для API"],"ar":["بناء هندسة المايكروسيرفس مع NestJS","تنفيذ المصادقة والسماح باستخدام الحارس أو البرامج الوسيطة","генерация وثائق OpenAPI/Swagger ل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript knowledge","NestJS framework dependency","Database setup required for TypeORM or Drizzle ORM"],"zh":["需要TypeScript的知识","依赖于NestJS框架","需要为TypeORM或Drizzle ORM设置数据库"],"ja":["TypeScriptの知識が必要","NestJSフレームワークに依存","TypeORMまたはDrizzle ORMのデータベース設定が必要"],"ko":["TypeScript 지식이 필요","NestJS 프레임워크 의존","TypeORM 또는 Drizzle ORM을 위한 데이터베이스 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de TypeScript","Dependencia del framework NestJS","Configuración de la base de datos requerida para TypeORM o Drizzle ORM"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript","Dépendance du framework NestJS","Configuration de la base de données requise pour TypeORM ou Drizzle ORM"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript-Kenntnisse","Abhängigkeit vom NestJS-Framework","Datenbankkonfiguration erforderlich für TypeORM oder Drizzle ORM"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de TypeScript","Dependência do framework NestJS","Configuração do banco de dados necessária para TypeORM ou Drizzle ORM"],"ru":["Требуется знание TypeScript","Зависимость от фреймворка NestJS","Требуется настройка базы данных для TypeORM или Drizzle ORM"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة TypeScript","اعتماد إطار العمل NestJS","إعداد قاعدة البيانات مطلوب ل TypeORM أو Drizzle ORM"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
