e correcte","Automatisation de tâches avec des scripts","Intégration avec le marketplace","Documentation de référence pour les développeurs","Flux de travail personnalisés","Publication de plugins sur le marketplace"],"de":["Erstellung von Plugins mit korrekter Struktur","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit Skripten","Integration mit dem Marketplace","Referenzdokumentation für Entwickler","Anpassbare Workflows","Veröffentlichung von Plugins im Marketplace"],"pt":["Criação de novos plugins","Adição e modificação de componentes de plugin","Atualização de versões de plugin","Integração com marketplaces","Testes locais de plugin","Publicação de plugins"],"ru":["Создание новых плагинов","Добавление и модификация компонентов плагина","Обновление версий плагина","Интеграция с маркетплейсами","Местное тестирование плагина","Публикация плагинов"],"ar":["إنشاء إضافات جديدة","إضافة وتعديل مكونات الإضافة","تحديث إصدارات الإضافة","التكامل مع الأسواق","اختبار الإضافة محليًا","نشر الإضافات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["插件开发","Claude Code","插件管理","工作流","自动化脚本","参考文档","市场集成","插件结构","插件清单"],"ja":["プラグイン開発","Claude Code","プラグイン管理","ワークフロー","自動化スクリプト","リファレンス ドキュメント","市場統合","プラグイン構造","プラグインマニフェスト"],"ko":["플러그인 개발","Claude Code","플러그인 관리","워크플로","자동화 스크립트","참조 문서","시장 통합","플러그인 구조","플러그인 매니페스트"],"es":["desarrollo de plugins","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de tareas","integración de marketplace","documentación de referencia","flujos de trabajo personalizados","publicación de plugins","Plugin Forge"],"fr":["développement de plugins","outils de développement","automatisation de tâches","intégration de marketplace","documentation de référence","flux de travail personnalisés","publication de plugins","Plugin Forge"],"de":["Plugin-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Marketplace-Integration","Referenzdokumentation","anpassbare Workflows","Veröffentlichung von Plugins","Plugin Forge"],"pt":["plugin forge","desenvolvimento de plugins","gerenciamento de plugins","criação de plugins","integração com marketplaces","testes de plugin","publicação de plugins","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["plugin forge","разработка плагинов","управление плагинами","создание плагинов","интеграция с маркетплейсами","тестирование плагина","публикация плагинов","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["plugin forge","تطوير الإضافات","إدارة الإضافات","إنشاء الإضافات","التكامل مع الأسواق","اختبار الإضافة","نشر الإضافات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plugin-forge","description":"Create and manage Claude Code plugins with proper structure, manifests, and marketplace integration. Use when creating plugins for a marketplace, adding plugin components (commands, agents, hooks), bumping plugin versions, or working with plugin.json/marketplace.json manifests.","bodyPreview":"# CC Plugin Forge\n\n## Purpose\n\nBuild and manage Claude Code plugins with correct structure, manifests, and marketplace integration. Includes workflows, automation scripts, and reference docs.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new plugins for a marketplace\n- Adding/modifying plugin components (commands, skills, agents, hooks)\n- Updating plugin versions\n- Working with plugin or marketplace manifests\n- Setting up local plugin testing\n- Publishing plugins\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Create New Plugin\n\nUse `c","body":"# CC Plugin Forge\n\n## Purpose\n\nBuild and manage Claude Code plugins with correct structure, manifests, and marketplace integration. Includes workflows, automation scripts, and reference docs.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new plugins for a marketplace\n- Adding/modifying plugin components (commands, skills, agents, hooks)\n- Updating plugin versions\n- Working with plugin or marketplace manifests\n- Setting up local plugin testing\n- Publishing plugins\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Create New Plugin\n\nUse `create_plugin.py` to generate plugin structure:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/create_plugin.py plugin-name \\\n  --marketplace-root /path/to/marketplace \\\n  --author-name \"Your Name\" \\\n  --author-email \"your.email@example.com\" \\\n  --description \"Plugin description\" \\\n  --keywords \"keyword1,keyword2\" \\\n  --category \"productivity\"\n```\n\nThis automatically:\n\n- Creates plugin directory structure\n- Generates `plugin.json` manifest\n- Creates README template\n- Updates `marketplace.json`\n\n### Bump Version\n\nUse `bump_version.py` to update versions in both manifests:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/bump_version.py plugin-name major|minor|patch \\\n  --marketplace-root /path/to/marketplace\n```\n\nSemantic versioning:\n\n- **major**: Breaking changes (1.0.0 → 2.0.0)\n- **minor**: New features, refactoring (1.0.0 → 1.1.0)\n- **patch**: Bug fixes, docs (1.0.0 → 1.0.1)\n\n## Development Workflow\n\n### 1. Create Structure\n\nManual approach (if not using script):\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p plugins/plugin-name/.claude-plugin\nmkdir -p plugins/plugin-name/commands\nmkdir -p plugins/plugin-name/skills\n```\n\n### 2. Plugin Manifest\n\nFile: `plugins/plugin-name/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"plugin-name\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"Plugin description\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"name\": \"Your Name\",\n    \"email\": \"your.email@example.com\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\"keyword1\", \"keyword2\"]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Register in Marketplace\n\nUpdate `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"plugin-name\",\n  \"source\": \"./plugins/plugin-name\",\n  \"description\": \"Plugin description\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"keyword1\", \"keyword2\"],\n  \"category\": \"productivity\"\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Add Components\n\nCreate in respective directories:\n\n| Component | Location | Format |\n|-----------|----------|--------|\n| Commands | `commands/` | Markdown with frontmatter |\n| Skills | `skills/<name>/` | Directory with `SKILL.md` |\n| Agents | `agents/` | Markdown definitions |\n| Hooks | `hooks/hooks.json` | Event handlers |\n| MCP Servers | `.mcp.json` | External integrations |\n\n### 5. Local Testing\n\n```bash\n# Add marketplace\n/plugin marketplace add /path/to/marketplace-root\n\n# Install plugin\n/plugin install plugin-name@marketplace-name\n\n# After changes: reinstall\n/plugin uninstall plugin-name@marketplace-name\n/plugin install plugin-name@marketplace-name\n```\n\n## Plugin Patterns\n\n### Framework Plugin\n\nFor framework-specific guidance (React, Vue, etc.):\n\n```\nplugins/framework-name/\n├── .claude-plugin/plugin.json\n├── skills/\n│   └── framework-name/\n│       ├── SKILL.md\n│       └── references/\n├── commands/\n│   └── prime/\n│       ├── components.md\n│       └── framework.md\n└── README.md\n```\n\n### Utility Plugin\n\nFor tools and commands:\n\n```\nplugins/utility-name/\n├── .claude-plugin/plugin.json\n├── commands/\n│   ├── action1.md\n│   └── action2.md\n└── README.md\n```\n\n### Domain Plugin\n\nFor domain-specific knowledge:\n\n```\nplugins/domain-name/\n├── .claude-plugin/plugin.json\n├── skills/\n│   └── domain-name/\n│       ├── SKILL.md\n│       ├── references/\n│       └── scripts/\n└── README.md\n```\n\n## Command Naming\n\nSubdirectory-based namespacing with `:` separator:\n\n- `commands/namespace/command.md` → `/namespace:command`\n- `commands/simple.md` → `/simple`\n\nExamples:\n\n- `commands/prime/vue.md` → `/prime:vue`\n- `commands/docs/generate.md` → `/docs:generate`\n\n## Version Management\n\n**Important:** Update version in BOTH locations:\n\n1. `plugins/<name>/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`\n2. `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`\n\nUse `bump_version.py` to automate.\n\n## Git Commits\n\nUse conventional commits:\n\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"feat: add new plugin\"\ngit commit -m \"fix: correct plugin manifest\"\ngit commit -m \"docs: update plugin README\"\ngit commit -m \"feat!: breaking change\"\n```\n\n## Reference Docs\n\nDetailed documentation included:\n\n| Reference | Content |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `references/plugin-structure.md` | Directory structure, manifest schema, components |\n| `references/marketplace-schema.md` | Marketplace format, plugin entries, distribution |\n| `references/workflows.md` | Step-by-step workflows, patterns, publishing |\n\n### Scripts\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/create_plugin.py` | Scaffold new plugin |\n| `scripts/bump_version.py` | Update versions |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:34:20.686Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing streamlined plugin creation and management for Claude Code marketplaces.","zh":"非常适合需要为 Claude Code 市场简化插件创建和管理的开发者代理。","ja":"Claude Code マーケットプレースのプラグイン作成と管理をストリームライン化する必要があるデベロッパー エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드 시장에 대한 플러그인 생성 및 관리를 간소화해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una creación y gestión de plugins simplificadas para los mercados de Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une création et d''une gestion de plugins simplifiées pour les marchés de code Claude.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die eine vereinfachte Erstellung und Verwaltung von Plugins für Claude Code-Märkte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de criação e gerenciamento de plugins simplificados para marketplaces do Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходим упрощенный процесс создания и управления плагинами для магазинов Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء وإدارة الملحقات بسهولة л для سوق كلود كود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build and manage plugins with correct structure, manifests, and marketplace integration, utilizing workflows, automation scripts, and reference docs for efficient plugin development and publishing, including plugin version updates and local testing.","zh":"赋予代理构建和管理插件的能力，具有正确的结构、清单和市场集成，利用工作流、自动化脚本和参考文档实现高效的插件开发和发布，包括插件版本更新和本地测试。","ja":"エージェントに、正しい構造、マニフェスト、市場統合を持つプラグインを構築および管理する能力を付与し、ワークフロー、自動化スクリプト、リファレンスドキュメントを利用して、プラグインのバージョン更新やローカルテストを含む効率的なプラグイン開発および公開を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 올바른 구조, 매니페스트 및 시장 통합을 갖춘 플러그인을 구축 및 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 워크플ロー, 자동화 스크립트 및 참조 문서를 활용하여 플러그인 버전 업데이트 및 로컬 테스트를 포함한 효율적인 플러그인 개발 및 공개를 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir y gestionar plugins con estructura correcta, manifestaciones y integración del mercado, utilizando flujos de trabajo, scripts de automatización y documentación de referencia para un desarrollo y publicación de plugins eficientes, incluyendo actualizaciones de versiones de plugins y pruebas locales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire et de gérer des plugins avec une structure correcte, des manifestes et une intégration du marché, en utilisant des flux de travail, des scripts d''automatisation et des documents de référence pour un développement et une publication de plugins efficaces, y compris les mises à jour de version de plugins et les tests locaux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Plugins mit korrekter Struktur, Manifesten und Marktplatzintegration zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Workflows, Automatisierungsskripte und Referenzdokumente für eine effiziente Plugin-Entwicklung und -Veröffentlichung verwendet werden, einschließlich Plugin-Versionen-Updates und lokaler Tests.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e gerenciar plugins com estrutura correta, manifestos e integração de marketplace, utilizando fluxos de trabalho, scripts de automação e documentos de referência para desenvolvimento e publicação eficientes de plugins, incluindo atualizações de versão de plugins e testes locais.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать и управлять плагинами с правильной структурой, манифестами и интеграцией с магазином, используя рабочие процессы, скрипты автоматизации и справочные документы для эффективного разработки и публикации плагинов, включая обновления версий плагинов и локальное тестирование.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية بناء وإدارة الملحقات ببنية صحيحة ووثائق ودمج السوق، باستخدام سير عمل وبرامج أتمتة وتوثيق إشارة لإنشاء ونشر ملحقات فعال، بما في ذلك تحديث إصدار الملحقات واختبار محلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new plugins for Claude Code marketplaces","Automating plugin component modifications, such as commands, skills, and hooks","Publishing and updating plugins on the marketplace"],"zh":["为 Claude Code 市场创建新的插件","自动化插件组件的修改，例如命令、技能和钩子","在市场上发布和更新插件"],"ja":["Claude Code マーケットプレース用の新しいプラグインを作成する","プラグインコンポーネントの変更を自動化する、たとえばコマンド、スキル、フック","マーケットプレースでプラグインを公開および更新する"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 시장용 새로운 플러그인을 생성하는 것","플러그인 구성 요소의 수정을 자동화하는 것, 예를 들어 명령, 스킬 및 훅","시장에서 플러그인을公開 및 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Crear nuevos plugins para los mercados de Claude Code","Automatizar las modificaciones de componentes de plugins, como comandos, habilidades y ganchos","Publicar y actualizar plugins en el mercado"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux plugins pour les marchés de code Claude","Automatiser les modifications de composants de plugins, tels que les commandes, les compétences et les crochets","Publier et mettre à jour des plugins sur le marché"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Plugins für Claude Code-Märkte","Automatisierung von Änderungen an Plugin-Komponenten, wie Befehlen, Fähigkeiten und Haken","Veröffentlichen und Aktualisieren von Plugins auf dem Marktplatz"],"pt":["Criar novos plugins para marketplaces do Claude Code","Automatizar modificações de componentes de plugins, como comandos, habilidades e ganchos","Publicar e atualizar plugins no marketplace"],"ru":["Создание новых плагинов для магазинов Claude Code","Автоматизация изменений компонентов плагинов, таких как команды, навыки и крючки","Публикация и обновление плагинов в магазине"],"ar":["إنشاء ملحقات جديدة لسوق كلود كود","أتمتة تعديلات مكونات الملحقات، مثل الأوامر والمهارات والسنارات","نشر وتحديث الملحقات في السوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code environment","Limited to plugin development for Claude Code marketplaces"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 环境","仅限为 Claude Code 市场开发的插件"],"ja":["Claude Code 環境が必要","Claude Code マーケットプレース用のプラグイン開発に限定される"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 환경이 필요함","클라우드 코드 시장용 플러그인 개발에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Claude Code","Limitado al desarrollo de plugins para los mercados de Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de code Claude","Limité au développement de plugins pour les marchés de code Claude"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Plugin-Entwicklung für Claude Code-Märkte"],"pt":["Requer ambiente do Claude Code","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de plugins para marketplaces do Claude Code"],"ru":["Требуется среда Claude Code","Ограничен разработкой плагинов для магазинов Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة كلود كود","محدود بتطوير الملحقات لسوق كلود كود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/api-patterns', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'agent-bridge-kit', 'HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit', 'api-patterns', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z', '2026-02-18T13:34:32.997Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/api-patterns","name":"api-patterns","description":{"zh":"API 设计模式与开发指南，提供 REST、GraphQL 和 tRPC 的设计原则和决策方法","ja":"API 設計のパターンと開発のガイド、REST、GraphQL、tRPC の設計原則と決定方法を提供","ko":"API 패턴 및 디자인 가이드, REST, GraphQL, tRPC 설계 원칙 및 결정 방법 제공","es":"Herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Agent, Skill y Workflows de Antigravity IDE a un formato compatible con IDEs y CLIs","fr":"Outil pour convertir les configurations d''Agent, Skill et Workflows d''Antigravity IDE dans un format compatible avec les IDE et les CLIs","de":"Werkzeug zum Konvertieren von Agent-, Skill- und Workflow-Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in ein kompatibles Format für IDEs und CLIs","pt":"O skill de padrões de API fornece orientação sobre como projetar APIs eficazes, incluindo a escolha do tipo de API e a melhoria da experiência do desenvolvedor.","ru":"Навык шаблонов API предоставляет рекомендации по проектированию эффективных API, включая выбор типа API и улучшение опыта разработчика.","ar":"مهارة أنماط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات توفر إرشادات حول كيفية تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات فعالة، بما في ذلك اختيار النوع الصحيح من واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتحسين تجربة المطور.","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"API 设计模式与开发指南","ja":"API パターンと設計のベストプラクティス","ko":"API 패턴 및 디자인 가이드","es":"Patrones de API para desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles d''API pour développeurs","de":"API-Muster für Entwickler","pt":"Padrões de API para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Шаблоны API для Раз