sor","Compatibilidad con CLIs como Kiro y OpenCode","Diseño de APIs REST y GraphQL","Uso de principios de diseño de API para 2025"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec les IDE comme GitHub Copilot et Cursor","Compatibilité avec les CLIs comme Kiro et OpenCode","Conception d''API REST et GraphQL","Utilisation des principes de conception d''API pour 2025"],"de":["Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE","Kompatibilität mit IDEs wie GitHub Copilot und Cursor","Kompatibilität mit CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Entwurf von APIs REST und GraphQL","Verwendung von Entwurfsprinzipien für APIs für 2025"],"pt":["Escolha do tipo de API","Projetar APIs REST","Projetar APIs GraphQL","Melhoria da experiência do desenvolvedor","Otimização da performance da API"],"ru":["Выбор типа API","Проектирование API REST","Проектирование API GraphQL","Улучшение опыта разработчика","Оптимизация производительности API"],"ar":["اختيار نوع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات REST","تصميم واجهات برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL","تحسين تجربة المطور","تحسين أداء واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 设计模式","REST 设计原则","GraphQL 设计指南","tRPC 设计最佳实践","API 类型选择","资源命名","HTTP 方法","状态码","错误处理"],"ja":["API パターン","REST 設計の原則","GraphQL 設計ガイド","tRPC 設計のベストプラクティス","API 種類の選択","リソース命名","HTTP メソッド","ステータスコード","エラーハンドリング"],"ko":["API 패턴","REST 설계 원칙","GraphQL 설계 가이드","tRPC 설계 베스트 프랙티스","API 종류 선택","리소스 명명","HTTP 메소드","상태 코드","에러 처리"],"es":["patrones de API","diseño de API","API REST","API GraphQL","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode"],"fr":["modèles d''API","conception d''API","API REST","API GraphQL","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode"],"de":["API-Muster","Entwurf von APIs","API REST","API GraphQL","Antigravity IDE","GitHub Copilot","Cursor","Kiro","OpenCode"],"pt":["padrões de API","projetar APIs","API REST","API GraphQL","experiência do desenvolvedor","otimização de performance"],"ru":["шаблоны API","проектирование API","API REST","API GraphQL","опыт разработчика","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["نماذج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات GraphQL","تجربة المطور","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-patterns","description":"API design principles and decision-making. REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC selection, response formats, versioning, pagination.","bodyPreview":"# API Patterns\n\n> API design principles and decision-making for 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not copy fixed patterns.**\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `api-style.md` | REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC decision tree | Choosing API type |\n| `rest.md` | Resource naming, HTTP methods, status codes | Designing REST API |\n| `","body":"# API Patterns\n\n> API design principles and decision-making for 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not copy fixed patterns.**\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `api-style.md` | REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC decision tree | Choosing API type |\n| `rest.md` | Resource naming, HTTP methods, status codes | Designing REST API |\n| `response.md` | Envelope pattern, error format, pagination | Response structure |\n| `graphql.md` | Schema design, when to use, security | Considering GraphQL |\n| `trpc.md` | TypeScript monorepo, type safety | TS fullstack projects |\n| `versioning.md` | URI/Header/Query versioning | API evolution planning |\n| `auth.md` | JWT, OAuth, Passkey, API Keys | Auth pattern selection |\n| `rate-limiting.md` | Token bucket, sliding window | API protection |\n| `documentation.md` | OpenAPI/Swagger best practices | Documentation |\n| `security-testing.md` | OWASP API Top 10, auth/authz testing | Security audits |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Skills\n\n| Need | Skill |\n|------|-------|\n| API implementation | `@[skills/backend-development]` |\n| Data structure | `@[skills/database-design]` |\n| Security details | `@[skills/security-hardening]` |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Decision Checklist\n\nBefore designing an API:\n\n- [ ] **Asked user about API consumers?**\n- [ ] **Chosen API style for THIS context?** (REST/GraphQL/tRPC)\n- [ ] **Defined consistent response format?**\n- [ ] **Planned versioning strategy?**\n- [ ] **Considered authentication needs?**\n- [ ] **Planned rate limiting?**\n- [ ] **Documentation approach defined?**\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Anti-Patterns\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Default to REST for everything\n- Use verbs in REST endpoints (/getUsers)\n- Return inconsistent response formats\n- Expose internal errors to clients\n- Skip rate limiting\n\n**DO:**\n- Choose API style based on context\n- Ask about client requirements\n- Document thoroughly\n- Use appropriate status codes\n\n---\n\n## Script\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/api_validator.py` | API endpoint validation | `python scripts/api_validator.py <project_path>` |\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:34:32.997Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API-focused Agents needing to convert configurations between Antigravity IDE and other IDEs like GitHub Copilot or CLIs such as Kiro.","zh":"非常适合需要在反重力IDE和其他IDE（如GitHub Copilot）或CLI（如Kiro）之间转换配置的API专注代理。","ja":"Antigravity IDEと他のIDE（例：GitHub Copilot）やCLI（例：Kiro）間で構成を変換する必要があるAPI中心のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Anti-gravity IDE와 다른 IDE(GitHub Copilot 등) 또는 CLI(Kiro 등) 사이에서 구성 변환을 필요로 하는 API 중심 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en API que necesitan convertir configuraciones entre Antigravity IDE y otros IDE como GitHub Copilot o CLI como Kiro.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''API nécessitant de convertir des configurations entre Antigravity IDE et d''autres IDE comme GitHub Copilot ou des CLI comme Kiro.","de":"Perfekt für API-fokussierte Agenten, die Konfigurationen zwischen Antigravity IDE und anderen IDEs wie GitHub Copilot oder CLIs wie Kiro konvertieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em API que precisam converter configurações entre o Antigravity IDE e outros IDEs, como o GitHub Copilot ou CLIs, como o Kiro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на API, которым необходимо преобразовывать конфигурации между Antigravity IDE и другими IDE, такими как GitHub Copilot или CLI, такими как Kiro.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء التي تركز على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات و التي تحتاج إلى تحويل الإعدادات بين Antigravity IDE وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأخرى مثل GitHub Copilot أو سطر الأوامر مثل Kiro."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly integrate with various development environments by converting Agent, Skill, and Workflows configurations, leveraging REST, GraphQL, and tRPC protocols for optimal API design.","zh":"通过将代理、技能和工作流配置转换为REST、GraphQL和tRPC协议，实现与各个开发环境的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェント、スキル、ワークフロー構成をREST、GraphQL、tRPCプロトコルに変換することで、さまざまな開発環境とのシームレスな統合を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트, 스킬, 워크플로우 구성을 REST, GraphQL, tRPC 프로토콜로 변환하여 다양한 개발 환경과 無縫な 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrarse de forma transparente con diversos entornos de desarrollo al convertir configuraciones de Agentes, Habilidades y Flujos de trabajo, aprovechando los protocolos REST, GraphQL y tRPC para un diseño de API óptimo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''intégrer en toute transparence avec différents environnements de développement en convertissant les configurations d''agents, de compétences et de flux de travail, en exploitant les protocoles REST, GraphQL et tRPC pour une conception d''API optimale.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sich nahtlos in verschiedene Entwicklungsumgebungen zu integrieren, indem sie Konfigurationen von Agenten, Fähigkeiten und Workflows konvertieren, wobei sie die Protokolle REST, GraphQL und tRPC für ein optimales API-Design nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se integrarem perfeitamente a vários ambientes de desenvolvimento, convertendo configurações de Agente, Habilidade e Fluxos de Trabalho, utilizando os protocolos REST, GraphQL e tRPC para um design de API ótimo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью бесшовной интеграции с различными средами разработки, преобразуя конфигурации Агента, Навыка и Рабочих процессов, используя протоколы REST, GraphQL и tRPC для оптимального дизайна API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التكامل السلس مع بيئات تطوير متعددة من خلال تحويل إعدادات الوكيل والخاصية والعمليات، واستخدام بروتوكولات REST وGraphQL وtRPC لتصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الأمثل."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Antigravity IDE configurations to GitHub Copilot compatible formats","Migrating workflows to Kiro CLI","Designing REST APIs with appropriate resource naming and HTTP methods"],"zh":["将反重力IDE配置转换为GitHub Copilot兼容格式","将工作流迁移到Kiro CLI","使用适当的资源命名和HTTP方法设计REST API"],"ja":["Antigravity IDE構成をGitHub Copilotと互換性のある形式に変換する","ワークフローをKiro CLIに移行する","適切なリソース命名とHTTPメソッドを使用してREST APIを設計する"],"ko":["Anti-gravity IDE 구성 파일을 GitHub Copilot과 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 것","워크플로우를 Kiro CLI로 마이그레이션","적절한 리소스 명명 및 HTTP 메서드를 사용하여 REST API 설계"],"es":["Convertir configuraciones de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con GitHub Copilot","Migrar flujos de trabajo a Kiro CLI","Diseñar API de REST con denominaciones de recursos y métodos HTTP adecuados"],"fr":["Convertir des configurations d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec GitHub Copilot","Migrer des flux de travail vers Kiro CLI","Concevoir des API REST avec des noms de ressources et des méthodes HTTP appropriés"],"de":["Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in GitHub-Copilot-kompatible Formate konvertieren","Workflows zu Kiro-CLI migrieren","REST-APIs mit geeigneten Ressourcennamen und HTTP-Methoden entwerfen"],"pt":["Converte configurações do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com o GitHub Copilot","Migra fluxos de trabalho para o Kiro CLI","Projetar APIs REST com nomeação de recursos apropriada e métodos HTTP"],"ru":["Преобразует конфигурации Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с GitHub Copilot","Мигрирует рабочие процессы в Kiro CLI","Проектирование REST API с соответствующим именованием ресурсов и методами HTTP"],"ar":["تحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot","نقل العمليات إلى سطر الأوامر Kiro","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST مع تسمية الموارد المناسبة وأساليب HTTP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with target IDE or CLI","Limited to converting configurations from Antigravity IDE"],"zh":["需要与目标IDE或CLI兼容","仅限将反重力IDE配置转换"],"ja":["対象のIDEまたはCLIと互換性が必要","Antigravity IDE構成の変換のみ"],"ko":["대상 IDE 또는 CLI와의 호환성이 필요","Anti-gravity IDE 구성 파일 변환에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el IDE o CLI de destino","Limitado a la conversión de configuraciones desde Antigravity IDE"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec l''IDE ou la CLI cible","Limité à la conversion de configurations depuis Antigravity IDE"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Ziel-IDE oder -CLI","Begrenzt auf die Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o IDE ou CLI de destino","Limitado à conversão de configurações do Antigravity IDE"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с целевым IDE или CLI","Ограничен преобразованием конфигураций Antigravity IDE"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات أو سطر الأوامر المستهدف","محدود بتحويل إعدادات Antigravity IDE"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit/dotnet-inspect', 'community', 'dwalleck', 'kiro-starter-kit', 'dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit', 'dotnet-inspect', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z', '2026-02-18T13:34:18.099Z', NULL, '{"id":"dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit/dotnet-inspect","name":"dotnet-inspect","description":{"zh":"dotnet-inspect 是一个用于检查 .NET 库和 NuGet 包的 CLI 工具，支持 .NET 10+ SDK。","ja":"dotnet-inspect は、.NET ライブラリと NuGet パッケージを検査するための CLI ツールです。.NET 10+ SDK をサポートしています。","ko":"dotnet-inspect는 .NET 라이브러리 및 NuGet 패키지를 검사하는 CLI 도구입니다. .NET 10+ SDK를 지원합니다.","es":"dotnet-inspect es una herramienta de línea de comandos para inspeccionar bibliotecas y paquetes NuGet de .NET","fr":"dotnet-inspect est un outil de ligne de commande pour inspecter les bibliothèques et les packages NuGet .NET","de":"dotnet-inspect ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zum Untersuchen von .NET-Bibliotheken und NuGet-Paketen","pt":"O dotnet-inspect é uma ferramenta CLI para inspecionar bibliotecas .NET e pacotes NuGet. Ele opera em bibliotecas de plataforma, pacotes NuGet e arquivos locais.","ru":"dotnet-inspect — это инструмент командной строки для инспекции библиотек .NET и пакетов NuGet. Он работает с библиотеками платформы, пакетами NuGet и локальными файлами.","ar":"أداة dotnet-inspect هي أداة سطر الأوامر لاستكشاف مكتبات .NET و حزم NuGet. تعمل على مكتبات المنصة و حزم NuGet و الملفات المحلية.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"dotnet-inspect：.NET 库和 NuGet 包检查工具","ja":"dotnet-inspect：.NET ライブラリと NuGet パッケージの検査ツール","ko":"dotnet-inspect: .NET 라이브러리 및 NuGet 패키지 검사 도구","es":"Herramienta dotnet-inspect para .NET","fr":"Outil dotnet-inspect pour .NET","de":"dotnet-inspect-Tool für .NET","pt":"dotnet-inspect: Ferramenta CLI para Inspeção de Bibliotec...","ru":"dotnet-inspect: Инструмент командной строки для инспекции...","ar":"dotnet-inspect: أداة سطر الأوامر لاستكشاف مكتبات .NET","en":"dotnet-inspect"},"description":{"zh":"dotnet-inspect 是一个用于检查 .NET 库和 NuGet 包的 CLI 工具，支持 .NET 10+ SDK。","ja":"dotnet-inspect は、.NET ライブラリと NuGet パッケージを検査するための CLI ツールです。.NET 10+ SDK をサポートしています。","ko":"dotnet-inspect는 .NET 라이브러리 및 NuGet 패키지를 검사하는 CLI 도구입니다. .NET 10+ SDK를 지원합니다.","es":"dotnet-inspect es una herramienta de línea de comandos para inspeccionar bibliotecas y paquetes NuGet de .NET","fr":"dotnet-inspect est un outil de ligne de commande pour inspecter les bibliothèques et les packages NuGet .NET","de":"dotnet-inspect ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zum Untersuchen von .NET-Bibliotheken und NuGet-Paketen","pt":"O dotnet-inspect é uma ferramenta CLI para inspecionar bibliotecas .NET e pacotes NuGet. Ele opera em bibliotecas de plataforma, pacotes NuGet e arquivos loc...","ru":"dotnet-inspect — это инструмент командной строки для инспекции библиотек .NET и пакетов NuGet. Он работает с библиотеками платформы, пакетами NuGet и локальн...","ar":"أداة dotnet-inspect هي أداة سطر الأوامر لاستكشاف مكتبات .NET و حزم NuGet. تعمل على مكتبات المنصة و حزم NuGet و الملفات المحلية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持检查 .NET 库和 NuGet 包","支持本地文件和平台库","支持 .NET 10+ SDK","使用 dnx 运行，无需全局安装","可以跳过交互式确认提示"],"ja":[".NET ライブラリと NuGet パッケージの検査をサポート","ローカル ファイルとプラットフォーム ライブラリをサポート",".NET 10+ SDK をサポート","dnx を使用して実行し、グローバルインストールは不要","交互的な確認プロンプトをスキップ可能"],"ko":[".NET 라이브러리 및 NuGet 패키지 검사를 지원","로컬 파일 및 플랫폼 라이브러리를 지원",".NET 10+ SDK를 지원","dnx를 사용하여 실행하며, 글로벌 설치는 필요하지 않음","대화형 확인 프롬프트를 건너뛸 수 있음"],"es":["Inspección de bibliotecas de plataforma","Inspección de paquetes NuGet","Soporte para archivos locales","Requiere .NET 10+ SDK","Instalación mediante dnx","Compatibilidad con línea de comandos"],"fr":["Inspection des bibliothèques de plate-forme","Inspection des packages NuGet","Prise en charge des fichiers locaux","Nécessite .NET 10+ SDK","Installation via dnx","Compatibilité avec la ligne de commande"],"de":["Untersuchung von Plattformbibliotheken","Untersuchung von NuGet-Paketen","Unterstützung für lokale Dateien","Benötigt .NET 10+ SDK","Installation über dnx","Kompatibilität mit der Kommandozeile"],"pt":["Inspeciona bibliotecas de plataforma","Inspeciona pacotes NuGet","Inspeciona arquivos locais","Requer .NET 10+ SDK","Instalação via dnx"],"ru":["Осматривает библиотеки платформы","Осматривает пакеты NuGet","Осматривает локальные файлы","Требует .NET 10+ SDK","Установка через dnx"],"ar":["تفتيش مكتبات المنصة","تفتيش حزم NuGet","تفتيش الملفات المحلية","يتطلب .NET 10+ SDK","التثبيت عبر dnx"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dotnet-inspect",".NET 库","NuGet 包","CLI 工具",".NET 10+ SDK","dnx","交互式确认提示"],"ja":["dotnet-inspect",".NET ライブラリ","NuGet パッケージ","CLI ツール",".NET 10+ SDK","dnx","交互的な確認プロンプト"],"ko":["dotnet-inspect",".NET 라이브러리","NuGet 패키지","CLI 도구",".NET 10+ SDK","dnx","대화형 확인 프롬프트"],"es":["dotnet-inspect","herramienta de línea de comandos","inspección de bibliotecas .NET","paquetes NuGet",".NET 10+ SDK","dnx","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["dotnet-inspect","outil de ligne de commande","inspection des bibliothèques .NET","packages NuGet",".NET 10+ SDK","dnx","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["dotnet-inspect","Kommandozeilen-Tool","Untersuchung von .NET-Bibliotheken","NuGet-Pakete",".NET 10+ SDK","dnx","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["dotnet-inspect","ferramenta CLI","inspeção de bibliotecas","pacotes NuGet","desenvolvimento de software","bibliotecas .NET"],"ru":["dotnet-inspect","инструмент командной строки","инспекция библиотек","пакеты NuGet","разработка программного обеспечения","библиотеки .NET"],"ar":["dotnet-inspect","أداة سطر الأوامر","استكشاف المكتبات","حزم NuGet","تطوير البرمجيات","مكتبات .NET"]}},"owner":"dwalleck","repo":"kiro-starter-kit","repoPath":"dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-inspect","description":"Inspect .NET libraries and NuGet packages. Use when you need to understand package contents, view public API surfaces, compare APIs between versions, or audit libraries for SourceLink/determinism. Essential for .NET development tasks involving package exploration or API discovery.","bodyPreview":"# dotnet-inspect\n\nA CLI tool for inspecting .NET libraries and NuGet packages. It operates on platform libraries (e.g., `System.Collections`), NuGet packages (e.g., `Microsoft.Extensions.AI`), and local files.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- .NET 10+ SDK\n\n## Installation\n\nUse `dnx` to run without global installation (like `npx` for Node):\n\n```bash\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- <command>\n```\n\n**Important**:\n\n- Always use `-y` to skip the interactive confirmation prompt (which breaks LLM tool use). New package ver","body":"# dotnet-inspect\n\nA CLI tool for inspecting .NET libraries and NuGet packages. It operates on platform libraries (e.g., `System.Collections`), NuGet packages (e.g., `Microsoft.Extensions.AI`), and local files.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- .NET 10+ SDK\n\n## Installation\n\nUse `dnx` to run without global installation (like `npx` for Node):\n\n```bash\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- <command>\n```\n\n**Important**:\n\n- Always use `-y` to skip the interactive confirmation prompt (which breaks LLM tool use). New package versions also trigger this prompt.\n- Always use `--` to separate dnx options from tool arguments. Without it, `--help` shows dnx help, not dotnet-inspect help.\n\n## Quick Patterns\n\nStart with these common workflows:\n\n```bash\n# Understand a type''s API shape (start here - most useful for learning APIs)\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- api ''HashSet<T>'' --platform System.Collections --shape\n\n# Bare names — routes automatically (platform for System.*/Microsoft.*, NuGet for others)\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- Microsoft.Extensions.AI\n\n# Compare API changes between versions (essential for migrations)\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- diff System.CommandLine@2.0.0-beta4.22272.1..2.0.3\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- diff \"*Json*\" --package System.Text.Json@9.0.0..10.0.0\n\n# Search for types by pattern (single or batch with comma-separated patterns)\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- find \"*Handler*\" --package System.CommandLine\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- find \"Chat*,Diction*\" --dotnet --terse\n\n# Find extension methods for a type (detects C# 14 extension properties too)\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- extensions HttpClient --framework runtime --reachable\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- extensions DbContext --dotnet\n\n# Find types implementing an interface or extending a class\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- implements Stream --dotnet\n\n# Package metadata and versions\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- package System.Text.Json -v:d\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- package System.Text.Json --versions\n\n# Library metadata, SourceLink audit, dependency tree\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- library --package System.Text.Json --source-link-audit\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- library Microsoft.Extensions.AI.OpenAI --dependencies\n\n# Code samples\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- samples Markout MarkoutWriter --list\n\n# Get XML documentation for a type\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- api Option --package System.CommandLine --docs\n\n# Drill into a specific method — get source, decompiled C#, and IL\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- api --package Microsoft.Extensions.Options OptionsFactory --select  # See Select column\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- api --package Microsoft.Extensions.Options OptionsFactory -m Create --index 1  # Member doc\n```\n\n## Key Flags\n\n| Flag | Purpose | Commands |\n| ---- | ------- | -------- |\n| `-v:d` | Detailed output (full signatures, all sections) | all |\n| `--shape` | Type shape diagram (hierarchy + members) | `api` |\n| `--docs` | Include XML documentation | `api` |\n| `-m Name` | Filter to specific member(s), supports globs | `api` |\n| `--select` | Show Select column for member addressing | `api` |\n| `--index N` | Target Nth overload for decompiled member doc | `api` |\n| `-n 10` | Limit results | `find`, `extensions`, `package --versions` |\n| `--dotnet` | runtime + aspnetcore + curated Microsoft packages | `find`, `extensions`, `implements` |\n| `--terse` | Compact output (alias for --oneline --grouped) | `find` |\n| `--reachable` | Include extensions on reachable types | `extensions` |\n| `--dependencies` | Dependency tree (visual) | `library`, `package` |\n| `--source-link-audit` | SourceLink/determinism audit | `library` |\n| `--stat` | Statistics only (no member details) | `diff` |\n| `--breaking` | Breaking changes only | `diff` |\n| `--prerelease` | Include prerelease versions | `package --versions` |\n| `--json` | JSON output | all |\n| `-s Name` | Include section (glob-capable) | all |\n\n**Signatures include `params` and default values** — you can determine calling conventions directly from output.\n\n**Generic types:** Use quotes: `''Option<T>''`, `''IEnumerable<T>''`\n\n## Syntax Rules\n\n**`api` uses positional arguments** — not flags — for library, type, and member:\n\n```bash\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- api System.Text.Json JsonSerializer Serialize   # library type member\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- api Newtonsoft.Json JsonConvert -m SerializeObject  # -m for member filter\n```\n\n**Do NOT use `-t` for type selection** — type is always a positional argument.\n\n**`--platform` vs `--package`**: `--platform` is only for SDK libraries (System.\\*, Microsoft.AspNetCore.\\*). Use `--package` for NuGet packages. Use `--dotnet` when unsure.\n\n**`diff` uses `..` range**: `diff System.Text.Json@8.0.0..9.0.0` (not two separate args).\n\n## Command Reference\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n| ------- | ------- |\n| `api <type>` | **Start here.** Public API surface (table format, or `--shape` for hierarchy) |\n| `diff` | Compare API surfaces between package versions |\n| `find <pattern>` | Search for types across packages, libraries, or frameworks |\n| `extensions <type>` | Find extension methods/properties for a type |\n| `implements <type>` | Find types implementing an interface or extending a class |\n| `package <name>` | Package metadata, files, versions, dependencies |\n| `library <name>` | Library info, symbols, dependencies, SourceLink audit |\n| `samples <pkg> <type>` | Fetch and display code samples |\n| `platform` | List installed frameworks |\n| `cli` | CLI args explorer |\n| `llmstxt` | Complete usage examples for all commands |\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor comprehensive examples and edge cases:\n\n```bash\ndnx dotnet-inspect -y -- llmstxt\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Exploring what types/APIs a NuGet package provides\n- Understanding method signatures, overloads, and type shape\n- Searching for types by pattern across packages or frameworks\n- Finding types that implement an interface or extend a base class\n- Comparing API changes between package versions\n- Viewing library dependency trees\n- Auditing libraries for SourceLink and determinism\n- Getting documentation from source (`--docs`)\n- Viewing decompiled source, IL, and annotated IL for methods\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:34:18.099Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for .NET Analysis Agents needing advanced library inspection capabilities for NuGet packages and platform libraries.","zh":"适用于需要为 NuGet 包和平台库提供高级库检查功能的 .NET 分析代理的理想选择。","ja":".NET 分析エージェントが NuGet パッケージとプラットフォーム ライブラリの高度なライブラリ検査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"NuGet 패키지 및 플랫폼 라이브러리의 고급 라이브러리 검사 기능이 필요한 .NET 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de .NET que necesitan capacidades de inspección de bibliotecas avanzadas para paquetes NuGet y bibliotecas de plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse .NET nécessitant des capacités d''inspection de bibliothèques avancées pour les packages NuGet et les bibliothèques de plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für .NET-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Bibliotheks-Inspektionen für NuGet-Pakete und Plattformbibliotheken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise .NET que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de inspeção de bibliotecas para pacotes NuGet e bibliotecas de plataforma.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа .NET, которым требуются расширенные возможности инспекции библиотек для пакетов NuGet и платформенных библиотек.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل .NET الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتفحص المكتبات لـ NuGet والمكتبات المنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inspect .NET libraries and NuGet packages, operating on platform libraries like System.Collections and local files, utilizing the .NET 10+ SDK for seamless integration with dnx for command-line operations.","zh":"赋予代理检测 .NET 库和 NuGet 包的能力，操作平台库如 System.Collections 和本地文件，利用 .NET 10+ SDK 实现与 dnx 的无缝集成，以进行命令行操作。","ja":"エージェントが .NET ライブラリと NuGet パッケージを検査できるようにし、System.Collections やローカル ファイルなどのプラットフォーム ライブラリを操作し、.NET 10+ SDK を使用して dnx とシームレスに統合し、コマンドライン操作を実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 .NET 라이브러리와 NuGet 패키지를 검사할 수 있도록 하며, System.Collections 및 로컬 파일과 같은 플랫폼 라이브러리를 운영하며, .NET 10+ SDK를 사용하여 dnx와의 무봉제 통합을 구현하여 명령줄 작업을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inspeccionar bibliotecas .NET y paquetes NuGet, operando en bibliotecas de plataforma como System.Collections y archivos locales, utilizando el SDK .NET 10+ para una integración sin problemas con dnx para operaciones de línea de comandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''inspecter les bibliothèques .NET et les packages NuGet, opérant sur les bibliothèques de plateforme comme System.Collections et les fichiers locaux, en utilisant le SDK .NET 10+ pour une intégration transparente avec dnx pour les opérations en ligne de commande.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, .NET-Bibliotheken und NuGet-Pakete zu inspizieren, die auf Plattformbibliotheken wie System.Collections und lokale Dateien operieren, unter Verwendung des .NET 10+ SDK für eine reibungslose Integration mit dnx für Befehlszeilenoperationen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inspecionar bibliotecas .NET e pacotes NuGet, operando em bibliotecas de plataforma como System.Collections e arquivos locais, utilizando o SDK .NET 10+ para integração transparente com dnx para operações de linha de comando.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инспектировать библиотеки .NET и пакеты NuGet, работающие с платформенными библиотеками, такими как System.Collections, и локальными файлами, используя SDK .NET 10+ для бесшовной интеграции с dnx для операций командной строки.","ar":"يُمنح الوكيل القدرة على فحص مكتبات .NET وحزم NuGet، مع تشغيل مكتبات المنصة مثل System.Collections والملفات المحلية، باستخدام SDK .NET 10+ من أجل التكامل السلس مع dnx لعمليات سطر الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Inspecting NuGet packages like Microsoft.Extensions.AI for dependency analysis","Debugging local .NET files for issues related to System.Collections","Analyzing platform libraries for compatibility and versioning issues"],"zh":["检查 NuGet 包（如 Microsoft.Extensions.AI）以进行依赖分析","调试本地 .NET 文件以解决与 System.Collections 相关的问题","分析平台库以检查兼容性和版本问题"],"ja":["依存関係分析のために Microsoft.Extensions.AI などの NuGet パッケージを検査する","System.Collections 関連の問題を解決するためにローカル .NET ファイルをデバッグする","互換性とバージョンに関する問題を確認するためにプラットフォーム ライブラリを分析する"],"ko":["의존성 분석을 위해 Microsoft.Extensions.AI와 같은 NuGet 패키지를 검사합니다.","System.Collections 관련 문제를 해결하기 위해 로컬 .NET 파일을 디버깅합니다.","호환성 및 버전 문제를 확인하기 위해 플랫폼 라이브러리를 분석합니다."],"es":["Inspeccionar paquetes NuGet como Microsoft.Extensions.AI para análisis de dependencias","Depurar archivos .NET locales para problemas relacionados con System.Collections","Analizar bibliotecas de plataforma para problemas de compatibilidad y versiones"],"fr":["Inspecter des packages NuGet comme Microsoft.Extensions.AI pour l''analyse des dépendances","Déboguer des fichiers .NET locaux pour les problèmes liés à System.Collections","Analyser les bibliothèques de plateforme pour les problèmes de compatibilité et de version"],"de":["NuGet-Pakete wie Microsoft.Extensions.AI für Abhängigkeitsanalysen inspizieren","Lokale .NET-Dateien für Probleme im Zusammenhang mit System.Collections debuggen","Plattformbibliotheken auf Kompatibilitäts- und Versionsprobleme analysieren"],"pt":["Inspecionar pacotes NuGet como Microsoft.Extensions.AI para análise de dependências","Depurar arquivos .NET locais para problemas relacionados a System.Collections","Analizar bibliotecas de plataforma para problemas de compatibilidade e versionamento"],"ru":["Осматривать пакеты NuGet, такие как Microsoft.Extensions.AI, для анализа зависимостей","Отлаживать локальные файлы .NET для проблем, связанных с System.Collections","Анализировать платформенные библиотеки для проблем совместимости и версионности"],"ar":["فحص حزم NuGet مثل Microsoft.Extensions.AI من أجل تحليل التبعيات","تصحيح أخطاء الملفات .NET المحلية المتعلقة بـ System.Collections","تحليل مكتبات المنصة لمشاكل التوافق والإصدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 10+ SDK","Uses dnx for command-line operations, skipping interactive prompts with -y flag"],"zh":["需要 .NET 10+ SDK","使用 dnx 进行命令行操作，使用 -y 标志跳过交互式提示"],"ja":["。NET 10+ SDK が必要","dnx を使用してコマンドライン操作を実行し、-y フラグを使用して対話式のプロンプトをスキップする"],"ko":[".NET 10+ SDK가 필요합니다.","dnx를 사용하여 명령줄 작업을 수행하고 -y 플래그를 사용하여 대화형 프롬프트를 건너뜁니다."],"es":["Requiere SDK .NET 10+","Utiliza dnx para operaciones de línea de comandos, saltando las invitaciones interactivas con la bandera -y"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK .NET 10+","Utilise dnx pour les opérations en ligne de commande, en sautant les invites interactives avec le drapeau -y"],"de":["Benötigt .NET 10+ SDK","Verwendet dnx für Befehlszeilenoperationen, überspringt interaktive Aufforderungen mit -y-Flag"],"pt":["Requer SDK .NET 10+","Utiliza dnx para operações de linha de comando, pulando prompts interativos com a flag -y"],"ru":["Требует SDK .NET 10+","Использует dnx для операций командной строки, пропуская интерактивные приглашения с флагом -y"],"ar":["يتطلب SDK .NET 10+","يستخدم dnx لعمليات سطر الأوامر، متجاوزًا التحفيزات التفاعلية مع علم -y"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
