تصميم الشرائح","إنشاء شرائح مع التركيز على النقاط المحددة","تحسين الشرائح لمواد الدرس أو الندوة","تخصيص الشرائح مع خيارات التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Marp幻灯片","Marp幻灯片创建工具","Marp幻灯片设计","Marp幻灯片模板","Marp幻灯片主题","Marp开发工具"],"ja":["Marpスライド","Marpスライド作成ツール","Marpスライドデザイン","Marpスライドテンプレート","Marpスライドテーマ","Marp開発ツール"],"ko":["Marp 슬라이드","Marp 슬라이드 생성 도구","Marp 슬라이드 디자인","Marp 슬라이드 템플릿","Marp 슬라이드 테마","Marp 개발 도구"],"es":["Marp","diapositivas","presentaciones","temas pre diseñados","mejores prácticas","diseño de diapositivas","materiales de conferencia","puntos de lista"],"fr":["Marp","diapositives","présentations","thèmes prédéfinis","meilleures pratiques","conception de diapositives","matériel de conférence","points de liste"],"de":["Marp","Folien","Präsentationen","vorgefertigte Designs","Best Practices","Folien-Design","Vortragsmaterial","Aufzählungspunkte"],"pt":["slides Marp","criar slides","design de slides","apresentações profissionais","materiais de aula","seminário","Marp Slide Creator"],"ru":["слайды Marp","создать слайды","дизайн слайдов","профессиональные презентации","учебные материалы","семинар","Marp Slide Creator"],"ar":["شرائح مارب","إنشاء شرائح","تصميم الشرائح","عروض احترافية","مواد الدرس","الندوة","مبدع شرائح مارب"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marp-slide","description":"Create professional Marp presentation slides with 7 beautiful themes (default, minimal, colorful, dark, gradient, tech, business). Use when users request slide creation, presentations, or Marp documents. Supports custom themes, image layouts, and make it look good requests with automatic quality improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Marp Slide Creator\n\nCreate professional, visually appealing Marp presentation slides with 7 pre-designed themes and built-in best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Requests to create presentation slides or Marp documents\n- Asks to \"make slides look good\" or \"improve slide design\"\n- Provides vague instructions like \"良い感じにして\" (make it nice) or \"かっこよく\" (make it cool)\n- Wants to create lecture or seminar materials\n- Needs bullet-point focused slides with occasi","body":"# Marp Slide Creator\n\nCreate professional, visually appealing Marp presentation slides with 7 pre-designed themes and built-in best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when the user:\n- Requests to create presentation slides or Marp documents\n- Asks to \"make slides look good\" or \"improve slide design\"\n- Provides vague instructions like \"良い感じにして\" (make it nice) or \"かっこよく\" (make it cool)\n- Wants to create lecture or seminar materials\n- Needs bullet-point focused slides with occasional images\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Select Theme\n\nFirst, determine the appropriate theme based on the user''s request and content.\n\n**Quick theme selection:**\n- **Technical/Developer content** → tech theme\n- **Business/Corporate** → business theme\n- **Creative/Event** → colorful or gradient theme\n- **Academic/Simple** → minimal theme\n- **General/Unsure** → default theme\n- **Dark background preferred** → dark or tech theme\n\nFor detailed theme selection guidance, read `references/theme-selection.md`.\n\n### Step 2: Create Slides\n\n1. **Read relevant references first**:\n   - Always start by reading `references/marp-syntax.md` for basic syntax\n   - For images: `references/image-patterns.md` (official Marpit image syntax)\n   - For advanced features (math, emoji): `references/advanced-features.md`\n   - For custom themes: `references/theme-css-guide.md`\n\n2. Copy content from the appropriate template file:\n   - `assets/template-basic.md` - Default theme (most common)\n   - `assets/template-minimal.md` - Minimal theme\n   - `assets/template-colorful.md` - Colorful theme\n   - `assets/template-dark.md` - Dark mode theme\n   - `assets/template-gradient.md` - Gradient theme\n   - `assets/template-tech.md` - Tech/code theme\n   - `assets/template-business.md` - Business theme\n\n3. Read `references/best-practices.md` for quality guidelines\n\n4. Structure content following best practices:\n   - Title slide with `<!-- _class: lead -->`\n   - Concise h2 titles (5-7 characters in Japanese)\n   - 3-5 bullet points per slide\n   - Adequate whitespace\n\n5. Add images if needed using patterns from `references/image-patterns.md`\n\n6. Save to `/mnt/user-data/outputs/` with `.md` extension\n\n## Available Themes\n\n### 1. Default Theme\n**Colors**: Beige background, navy text, blue headings\n**Style**: Clean, sophisticated with decorative lines\n**Use for**: General seminars, lectures, presentations\n**Template**: `template-basic.md`\n\n### 2. Minimal Theme\n**Colors**: White background, gray text, black headings\n**Style**: Minimal decoration, wide margins, light fonts\n**Use for**: Content-focused presentations, academic talks\n**Template**: `template-minimal.md`\n\n### 3. Colorful & Pop Theme\n**Colors**: Pink gradient background, multi-color accents\n**Style**: Vibrant gradients, bold fonts, rainbow accents\n**Use for**: Youth-oriented events, creative projects\n**Template**: `template-colorful.md`\n\n### 4. Dark Mode Theme\n**Colors**: Black background, cyan/purple accents\n**Style**: Dark theme with glow effects, eye-friendly\n**Use for**: Tech presentations, evening talks, modern look\n**Template**: `template-dark.md`\n\n### 5. Gradient Background Theme\n**Colors**: Purple/pink/blue/green gradients (varies per slide)\n**Style**: Different gradient per slide, white text, shadows\n**Use for**: Visual-focused, creative presentations\n**Template**: `template-gradient.md`\n\n### 6. Tech/Code Theme\n**Colors**: GitHub-style dark background, blue/green accents\n**Style**: Code fonts, Markdown-style headers with # symbols\n**Use for**: Programming tutorials, tech meetups, developer content\n**Template**: `template-tech.md`\n\n### 7. Business Theme\n**Colors**: White background, navy headings, blue accents\n**Style**: Corporate presentation style, top border, table support\n**Use for**: Business presentations, proposals, reports\n**Template**: `template-business.md`\n\n## Creating Slides Process\n\n### Basic Workflow\n\n1. **Understand requirements**\n   - Identify content: title, topics, key points\n   - Determine target audience\n   - Assess formality level\n\n2. **Select theme**\n   - Use quick selection rules above\n   - If uncertain, consult `references/theme-selection.md`\n   - Default to default theme if still unsure\n\n3. **Apply template**\n   - Load appropriate template from `assets/`\n   - CSS is already embedded - no external files needed\n   - Maintain template structure\n\n4. **Structure content**\n   - Title slide: `<!-- _class: lead -->` + h1\n   - Content slides: h2 title + bullet points\n   - Keep titles to 5-7 characters (Japanese)\n   - Use 3-5 bullet points per slide\n\n5. **Refine quality**\n   - Read `references/best-practices.md`\n   - Ensure adequate whitespace\n   - Maintain consistency\n   - Keep text concise (15-25 chars per line)\n\n6. **Add images**\n   - If needed, consult `references/image-patterns.md`\n   - Common: `![bg right:40%](image.png)` for side images\n   - Use proper Marp image syntax\n\n7. **Output file**\n   - Save to `/mnt/user-data/outputs/`\n   - Use descriptive filename like `presentation.md`\n\n## Handling \"Make It Look Good\" Requests\n\nWhen users give vague instructions like \"良い感じにして\", \"かっこよく\", or \"make it cool\":\n\n1. **Infer theme from content**:\n   - Business content → business theme\n   - Technical content → tech or dark theme\n   - Creative content → gradient or colorful theme\n   - General → default theme\n\n2. **Apply best practices automatically**:\n   - Shorten titles to 5-7 characters\n   - Limit bullet points to 3-5 items\n   - Add adequate whitespace\n   - Use consistent structure\n\n3. **Enhance visual hierarchy**:\n   - Use h3 for sub-sections when appropriate\n   - Break up dense text into multiple slides\n   - Ensure logical flow (intro → body → conclusion)\n\n4. **Maintain professional tone**:\n   - Match formality to content\n   - Use parallel structure in lists\n   - Keep technical terms consistent\n\n## Image Integration\n\nFor slides with images, consult `references/image-patterns.md` for detailed syntax.\n\nCommon patterns:\n- **Side image**: `![bg right:40%](image.png)` - Image on right, text on left\n- **Centered**: `![w:600px](image.png)` - Centered with specific width\n- **Full background**: `![bg](image.png)` - Full-screen background\n- **Multiple images**: Multiple `![bg]` declarations\n\nExample lecture pattern:\n```markdown\n## Slide Title\n\n![bg right:40%](diagram.png)\n\n- Explanation point 1\n- Explanation point 2\n- Explanation point 3\n```\n\n## File Output\n\nAlways save the final Marp file to `/mnt/user-data/outputs/` with `.md` extension:\n- `presentation.md`\n- `seminar-slides.md`\n- `lecture-materials.md`\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\nBefore delivering slides, verify:\n- [ ] Theme selected appropriately for content\n- [ ] CSS theme is embedded in the file\n- [ ] Title slide uses `<!-- _class: lead -->`\n- [ ] All h2 titles are concise (5-7 chars)\n- [ ] Bullet points are 3-5 items per slide\n- [ ] Images use proper Marp syntax\n- [ ] File saved to outputs directory\n- [ ] Content follows best practices\n\n## References\n\n### Core Documentation\n- **Marp syntax**: `references/marp-syntax.md` - Basic Marp/Marpit syntax (directives, frontmatter, pagination, etc.)\n- **Image patterns**: `references/image-patterns.md` - Official image syntax (bg, filters, split backgrounds)\n- **Theme CSS guide**: `references/theme-css-guide.md` - How to create custom themes based on Marpit specification\n- **Advanced features**: `references/advanced-features.md` - Math, emoji, fragmented lists, Marp CLI, VS Code\n- **Official themes**: `references/official-themes.md` - default, gaia, uncover themes documentation\n\n### Quality & Selection Guides\n- **Theme selection**: `references/theme-selection.md` - How to choose the right theme for content\n- **Best practices**: `references/best-practices.md` - Quality guidelines for \"cool\" slides\n\n### Templates & Assets\n- **Templates**: `assets/template-*.md` - Starting points with embedded CSS for each theme (7 themes)\n- **Standalone CSS**: `assets/theme-*.css` - CSS files for reference (already embedded in templates)\n\n### Official External Links\n- **Marp Official Site**: https://marp.app/\n- **Marpit Directives**: https://marpit.marp.app/directives\n- **Marpit Image Syntax**: https://marpit.marp.app/image-syntax\n- **Marpit Theme CSS**: https://marpit.marp.app/theme-css\n- **Marp Core GitHub**: https://github.com/marp-team/marp-core\n- **Marp CLI GitHub**: https://github.com/marp-team/marp-cli\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:36:17.932Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Presentation Agents needing professional, visually appealing Marp slide creation capabilities with pre-designed themes.","zh":"非常适合需要专业、视觉效果出众的Marp幻灯片创建能力的演示代理，具有预设计的主题。","ja":"プレゼンテーションエージェントがプロフェッショナルで視覚的に魅力的であるMarpスライドの作成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。予め設計されたテーマがあります。","ko":"전문적이고 시각적으로 매력적인 Marp 슬라이드 생성 기능과 사전設計된 테마가 필요한 프레젠테이션 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de presentación que necesitan capacidades de creación de diapositivas Marp profesionales y visualmente atractivas con temas pre-diseñados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de présentation ayant besoin de capacités de création de diapositives Marp professionnelles et visuellement attrayantes avec des thèmes pré-conçus.","de":"Perfekt für Präsentationsagenten, die professionelle, visuell ansprechende Marp-Foliencreation-Fähigkeiten mit vorgefertigten Designs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Apresentação que precisam de capacidades de criação de slides Marp profissionais e visualmente atraentes com temas pré-projetados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Презентационных Агентов, требующих профессиональных, визуально привлекательных возможностей создания слайдов Marp с предварительно разработанными темами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل العرض الذي يحتاج إلى возможности إنشاء شرائح Marp احترافية ومرئية جذابة مع تصاميم مواضيع مسبقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate engaging Marp presentation slides with 7 pre-designed themes, utilizing built-in best practices for bullet-point focused slides and lecture materials, all while supporting Marp document creation.","zh":"赋予代理生成引人入胜的Marp演示幻灯片的能力，具有7个预设计的主题，利用内置的最佳实践进行项目符号重点幻灯片和讲座材料的创建，同时支持Marp文档的创建。","ja":"7つの予め設計されたテーマを利用し、エージェントが魅力的であるMarpプレゼンテーションスライドを生成できるようにします。内蔵のベストプラクティスを使用して、項目記号を重点としたスライドや講義資料を作成し、同时にMarpドキュメントの作成をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 7개의 사전設計된 테마를 사용하여 매력적인 Marp 프레젠테이션 슬라이드를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 내장된 최선의 관행을 사용하여 불릿 포인트 집중 슬라이드와 강의 자료를 생성하며同時に Marp 문서 생성을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar diapositivas de presentación Marp atractivas con 7 temas pre-diseñados, utilizando las mejores prácticas integradas para diapositivas centradas en puntos y materiales de conferencia, todo mientras admite la creación de documentos Marp.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diapositives de présentation Marp engageantes avec 7 thèmes pré-conçus, en utilisant les meilleures pratiques intégrées pour des diapositives axées sur les points et les matériaux de conférence, le tout en soutenant la création de documents Marp.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ansprechende Marp-Präsentationsfolien mit 7 vorgefertigten Designs zu erstellen, indem es integrierte Best Practices für punktfokussierte Folien und Vortragsmaterialien nutzt und dabei die Erstellung von Marp-Dokumenten unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar slides de apresentação Marp atraentes com 7 temas pré-projetados, utilizando as melhores práticas incorporadas para slides focados em pontos de bala e materiais de aula, tudo isso enquanto suporta a criação de documentos Marp.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать привлекательные слайды презентации Marp с 7 предварительно разработанными темами, используя встроенные лучшие практики для слайдов, ориентированных на пункты, и лекционных материалов, все это при поддержке создания документов Marp.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من إنشاء شرائح عرض Marp جذابة مع 7 تصاميم مواضيع مسبقة، باستخدام أفضل الممارسات المدمجة للشرائح التي تركز على نقاط البند ومواد المحاضرة، مع دعم إنشاء مستندات Marp."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating professional Marp presentation slides for lectures and seminars","Creating visually appealing slides with pre-designed themes for enhanced user engagement","Improving slide design for better communication of ideas and information"],"zh":["为讲座和研讨会生成专业的Marp演示幻灯片","使用预设计的主题创建视觉效果出众的幻灯片以提高用户参与度","改进幻灯片设计以更好地传达思想和信息"],"ja":["講義やセミナー用のプロフェッショナルなMarpプレゼンテーションスライドを生成する","予め設計されたテーマを使用して視覚的に魅力的であるスライドを作成し、ユーザー参与度を高める","スライドのデザインを改善してアイデアや情報の伝達をよりよくする"],"ko":["강의와 세미나를 위한 전문적인 Marp 프레젠테이션 슬라이드를 생성한다","사전設計된 테마를 사용하여 시각적으로 매력적인 슬라이드를 생성하여 사용자 참여도를 향상한다","슬라이드 디자인을 개선하여 아이디어와 정보의 전달을 더 잘한다"],"es":["Generación de diapositivas de presentación Marp profesionales para conferencias y seminarios","Creación de diapositivas visualmente atractivas con temas pre-diseñados para una mayor participación del usuario","Mejora del diseño de diapositivas para una mejor comunicación de ideas y información"],"fr":["Génération de diapositives de présentation Marp professionnelles pour conférences et séminaires","Création de diapositives visuellement attrayantes avec des thèmes pré-conçus pour une participation utilisateur améliorée","Amélioration de la conception de diapositives pour une meilleure communication d''idées et d''informations"],"de":["Erstellung professioneller Marp-Präsentationsfolien für Vorträge und Seminare","Erstellung visuell ansprechender Folien mit vorgefertigten Designs für eine verbesserte Benutzerbeteiligung","Verbesserung des Folien-Designs für eine bessere Kommunikation von Ideen und Informationen"],"pt":["Gerar slides de apresentação Marp profissionais para palestras e seminários","Criar slides visualmente atraentes com temas pré-projetados para engajamento do usuário melhorado","Melhorar o design do slide para uma melhor comunicação de ideias e informações"],"ru":["Генерировать профессиональные слайды презентации Marp для лекций и семинаров","Создавать визуально привлекательные слайды с предварительно разработанными темами для улучшения вовлеченности пользователей","Улучшать дизайн слайда для лучшей передачи идей и информации"],"ar":["إنشاء شرائح عرض Marp احترافية لمحاضرات وندوات","إنشاء شرائح مرئية جذابة مع تصاميم مواضيع مسبقة لتحسين المشاركة المستخدم","تحسين تصميم الشريحة لنقل أفضل للأفكار والمعلومات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Marp presentation slide creation","Requires user input for slide content and design preferences"],"zh":["仅限于Marp演示幻灯片的创建","需要用户输入幻灯片内容和设计偏好"],"ja":["Marpプレゼンテーションスライドの作成のみに限定される","スライドの内容やデザインの偏好についてユーザー入力を必要とする"],"ko":["Marp 프레젠테이션 슬라이드 생성에만 제한된다","슬라이드 내용과 디자인偏好的 경우 사용자 입력이 필요하다"],"es":["Limitado a la creación de diapositivas de presentación Marp","Requiere la entrada del usuario para el contenido y las preferencias de diseño de la diapositiva"],"fr":["Limité à la création de diapositives de présentation Marp","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour le contenu et les préférences de conception de la diapositive"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Marp-Präsentationsfolien","Benötigt Benutzereingaben für den Inhalt und die Designpräferenzen der Folie"],"pt":["Limitado à criação de slides de apresentação Marp","Requer entrada do usuário para conteúdo e preferências de design do slide"],"ru":["Ограничен созданием слайдов презентации Marp","Требует ввода пользователя для содержания и предпочтений дизайна слайда"],"ar":["محدود بإنشاء شرائح عرض Marp","يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لمحتوى وتصميم تفضيلات الشريحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/templates', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'agent-bridge-kit', 'HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit', 'templates', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z', '2026-02-18T13:36:19.554Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/templates","name":"templates","description":{"zh":"模板转换工具帮助开发者快速适配多IDE，支持Next.js、Prisma、Stripe、Framer等技术栈","ja":"テンプレート変換ツールは、開発者が多IDEに対応できるようにサポートします。Next.js、Prisma、Stripe、Framerなどのテクノロジーをサポートしています","ko":"템플릿 변환 도구는 개발자가 다양한 IDE에 맞게 구성할 수 있도록 도와줍니다. Next.js, Prisma, Stripe, Framer 등 다양한 기술 스택을 지원합니다","es":"Herramienta para convertir configuraciones de Agent, Skill y Workflows de Antigravity IDE a formatos compatibles con IDEs y CLIs","fr":"Outil pour convertir les configurations d''Agent, Skill et Workflows d''Antigravity IDE en formats compatibles avec les IDE et les CLIs","de":"Werkzeug zum Konvertieren von Agent-, Skill- und Workflow-Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE in kompatible Formate für IDEs und CLIs","pt":"Ferramenta para converter configurações de Agent, Skill e Workflows do Antigravity IDE para formatos compatíveis com IDEs e CLIs","ru":"Инструмент для конвертации конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workflows из Antigravity IDE в форматы, совместимые с IDE и CLI","ar":"أداة لتحويل تكوينات الوكيل والمهارة والتدفقات العمل من Antigravity IDE إلى تنسيقات متوافقة مع IDE و CLI","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"模板转换工具 - 轻松适配多IDE","ja":"テンプレート変換ツール - 多IDE対応","ko":"템플릿 변환 도구 - 다양한 IDE 지원","es":"Plantillas de proyectos para desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles de projets pour les développeurs","de":"Projektvorlagen für Entwickler","pt":"Modelos de Projeto para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Шаблоны Проектов для Разработчиков"