 contratos que permite estructurar proyectos de manera eficiente. Descubre cómo funciona","fr":"oRPC Contract-First est une approche de développement de contrats qui permet de structurer les projets de manière efficace. Découvrez comment cela fonctionne","de":"oRPC Contract-First ist ein Ansatz für die Vertragsentwicklung, der es ermöglicht, Projekte effizient zu strukturieren. Erfahren Sie, wie es funktioniert","pt":"O desenvolvimento de contrato oRPC é uma abordagem para criar contratos robustos e escaláveis para aplicações web","ru":"Разработка контракта oRPC - это подход к созданию надежных и масштабируемых контрактов для веб-приложений","ar":"تطوير عقد oRPC هو نهج لإنشاء عقود قوية ومرنة لطبقات الويب","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["定义合约规范 API 接口","提高开发效率","支持多域控制台合约","提供 Router 组合和类型导出","支持 Marketplace 合约"],"ja":["コントラクトを定義して API インターフェースを規定","開発効率を向上させる","複数ドメインコンソールコントラクトをサポート","Router の組み合わせとタイプのエクスポートを提供","Marketplace コントラクトをサポート"],"ko":["계약을 정의하여 API 인터페이스를 규정","개발 효율성을 향상시키는","다중 도메인 콘솔 계약을 지원","Router의 조합과 유형 내보내기 제공","Marketplace 계약을 지원"],"es":["Estructura de proyecto flexible","Creación de contratos personalizados","Mejora del flujo de trabajo","Integración con oRPC","Soporte para varios dominios"],"fr":["Structure de projet flexible","Création de contrats personnalisés","Amélioration du flux de travail","Intégration avec oRPC","Prise en charge de plusieurs domaines"],"de":["Flexibles Projektstruktur","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Verträgen","Verbesserung des Arbeitsablaufs","Integration mit oRPC","Unterstützung für mehrere Domänen"],"pt":["Criação de contratos robustos","Estrutura de projeto modular","Tipos de exportação de composição de roteador","Suporte a múltiplos domínios","Integração com o console de contrato","Definição de rotas personalizadas"],"ru":["Создание надежных контрактов","Модульная структура проекта","Типы экспорта композиции роутера","Поддержка нескольких доменов","Интеграция с консолью контракта","Определение пользовательских маршрутов"],"ar":["إنشاء عقود قوية","هيكل مشروع معماري","أنواع تصدير تركيبة الموجه","دعم مجالات متعددة","التكامل مع لوحة تحكم العقد","تحديد مسارات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["oRPC","合约优先开发","API 接口","开发效率","多域控制台合约","Router 组合"],"ja":["oRPC","コントラクトファースト開発","API インターフェース","開発効率","複数ドメインコンソールコントラクト","Router の組み合わせ"],"ko":["oRPC","계약 우선 개발","API 인터페이스","개발 효율성","다중 도메인 콘솔 계약","Router의 조합"],"es":["oRPC Contract-First","desarrollo de contratos","estructura de proyecto","flujo de trabajo","integración con oRPC","contratos personalizados","dominios múltiples"],"fr":["oRPC Contract-First","développement de contrats","structure de projet","flux de travail","intégration avec oRPC","contrats personnalisés","domaines multiples"],"de":["oRPC Contract-First","Vertragsentwicklung","Projektstruktur","Arbeitsablauf","Integration mit oRPC","benutzerdefinierte Verträge","mehrere Domänen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de contrato oRPC","contrato oRPC","oRPC","desenvolvimento web","contratos robustos","escalabilidade","modularidade"],"ru":["разработка контракта oRPC","контракт oRPC","oRPC","веб-разработка","надежные контракты","масштабируемость","модульность"],"ar":["تطوير عقد oRPC","عقد oRPC","oRPC","تطوير ويب","عقود قوية","المرونة","الهيكلة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"orpc-contract-first","description":"Guide for implementing oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend. Triggers when creating new API contracts, adding service endpoints, integrating TanStack Query with typed contracts, or migrating legacy service calls to oRPC. Use for all API layer work in web/contract and web/service directories.","bodyPreview":"# oRPC Contract-First Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/contract/\n├── base.ts           # Base contract (inputStructure: ''detailed'')\n├── router.ts         # Router composition & type exports\n├── marketplace.ts    # Marketplace contracts\n└── console/          # Console contracts by domain\n    ├── system.ts\n    └── billing.ts\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Create contract** in `web/contract/console/{domain}.ts`\n   - Import `base` from `../base` and `type` from `@orpc/contract`\n   - Define route w","body":"# oRPC Contract-First Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/contract/\n├── base.ts           # Base contract (inputStructure: ''detailed'')\n├── router.ts         # Router composition & type exports\n├── marketplace.ts    # Marketplace contracts\n└── console/          # Console contracts by domain\n    ├── system.ts\n    └── billing.ts\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Create contract** in `web/contract/console/{domain}.ts`\n   - Import `base` from `../base` and `type` from `@orpc/contract`\n   - Define route with `path`, `method`, `input`, `output`\n\n2. **Register in router** at `web/contract/router.ts`\n   - Import directly from domain file (no barrel files)\n   - Nest by API prefix: `billing: { invoices, bindPartnerStack }`\n\n3. **Create hooks** in `web/service/use-{domain}.ts`\n   - Use `consoleQuery.{group}.{contract}.queryKey()` for query keys\n   - Use `consoleClient.{group}.{contract}()` for API calls\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- **Input structure**: Always use `{ params, query?, body? }` format\n- **Path params**: Use `{paramName}` in path, match in `params` object\n- **Router nesting**: Group by API prefix (e.g., `/billing/*` → `billing: {}`)\n- **No barrel files**: Import directly from specific files\n- **Types**: Import from `@/types/`, use `type<T>()` helper\n\n## Type Export\n\n```typescript\nexport type ConsoleInputs = InferContractRouterInputs<typeof consoleRouterContract>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:36:44.618Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript","zh":"非常适合需要使用oRPC和TypeScript进行契约优先开发的API开发代理","ja":"oRPCとTypeScriptを使用した契約先開発が必要なAPI開発エージェントに最適","ko":"oRPC와 TypeScript를 사용한 계약 우선 개발이 필요한 API 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript","fr":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript","de":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript","pt":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript","ru":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript","ar":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing contract-first development with oRPC and TypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract","zh":"赋予代理定义和管理oRPC契约的能力，使用TypeScript提供结构化的API开发方法，具有基础契约定义、路由器组合和类型导出等功能，利用@orpc/contract等库","ja":"エージェントがoRPC契約を定義して管理できるようにし、TypeScriptを使用して構造化されたAPI開発アプローチを提供することで、ベース契約定義、ルーターコンポジション、タイプエクスポートなどの機能を提供し、@orpc/contractなどのライブラリを活用する","ko":"에이전트가 oRPC 계약을 정의하고 관리할 수 있도록 하여 TypeScript를 사용하여 구조화된 API 개발 접근 방식을 제공하며, 기본 계약 정의, 라우터 조합 및 유형 내보내기와 같은 기능을 제공하고, @orpc/contract와 같은 라이브러리를 활용","es":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract","fr":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract","de":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract","pt":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract","ru":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract","ar":"Empowers agents to define and manage oRPC contracts using TypeScript, providing a structured approach to API development with features like base contract definition, router composition, and type exports, leveraging libraries like @orpc/contract"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"],"zh":["为市场API定义oRPC契约","为控制台契约生成路由器组合","使用基础契约继承创建特定领域的契约"],"ja":["マーケットAPI用のoRPC契約を定義する","コンソール契約用のルーターコンポジションを生成する","ベース契約継承を使用してドメイン固有の契約を作成する"],"ko":["마켓 API를 위한 oRPC 계약 정의","콘솔 계약을 위한 라우터 조합 생성","기본 계약 상속을 사용하여 도메인 특정 계약 생성"],"es":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"],"fr":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"],"de":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"],"pt":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"],"ru":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"],"ar":["Defining oRPC contracts for marketplace APIs","Generating router compositions for console contracts","Creating domain-specific contracts with base contract inheritance"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","oRPC特定实现","项目结构必须遵循web/contract目录组织"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","oRPC固有の実装","プロジェクト構造はweb/contractディレクトリの組織に従う必要がある"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요","oRPC 특정 구현","프로젝트 구조는 web/contract 디レクト리 조직을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"],"fr":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"],"de":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"],"pt":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"],"ru":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"],"ar":["Requires TypeScript environment","oRPC specific implementation","Project structure adherence to web/contract directory organization"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
