,"keywords":{"zh":["竞争格局分析","市场竞争动态","差异化机会","竞争策略","Porter的五力分析","蓝海战略"],"ja":["競合環境分析","市場の競争動向","差別化の機会","競争戦略","ポーターの五力分析","ブルーオーシャン戦略"],"ko":["경쟁 환경 분석","시장 경쟁 동향","차별화 기회","경쟁 전략","포터의 5가지 힘 분석","블루 오션 전략"],"es":["análisis de competencia","estrategia de mercado","posicionamiento de marca","ventajas competitivas","diferenciación","análisis de porter"],"fr":["analyse de la concurrence","stratégie de marché","positionnement de marque","avantages concurrentiels","différenciation","analyse de porter"],"de":["Wettbewerbsanalyse","Marktstrategie","Markenpositionierung","Wettbewerbsvorteile","Differenzierung","Porter-Analyse"],"pt":["análise de paisagem competitiva","estratégia de mercado","posicionamento de mercado","vantagens competitivas","forças de porter","ocean azul"],"ru":["анализ конкурентной среды","стратегия рынка","позиционирование на рынке","конкурентные преимущества","силы Портера","Синий Океан"],"ar":["تحليل المناظير التنافسية","استراتيجية السوق","موقف السوق","المزايا التنافسية","قوى بورتر","المحيط الأزرق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"competitive-landscape","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to analyze competitors, assess competitive landscape, identify differentiation, evaluate market positioning, apply Porters Five Forces, or requests competitive strategy analysis.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Competitive Landscape Analysis\n\nComprehensive frameworks for analyzing competition, identifying differentiation opportunities, and developing winning market positioning strategies.\n\n## Overview\n\nUnderstand competitive dynamics using proven frameworks (Porter''s Five Forces, Blue Ocean Strategy, positioning maps) to identify opportunities and craft defensible competitive advantages.\n\n## Porter''s Five Forces\n\nAnalyze industry attractiveness and competitive intensity.\n\n### Force 1: Threat of New E","body":"# Competitive Landscape Analysis\n\nComprehensive frameworks for analyzing competition, identifying differentiation opportunities, and developing winning market positioning strategies.\n\n## Overview\n\nUnderstand competitive dynamics using proven frameworks (Porter''s Five Forces, Blue Ocean Strategy, positioning maps) to identify opportunities and craft defensible competitive advantages.\n\n## Porter''s Five Forces\n\nAnalyze industry attractiveness and competitive intensity.\n\n### Force 1: Threat of New Entrants\n\n**Barriers to Entry:**\n\n- Capital requirements\n- Economies of scale\n- Switching costs\n- Brand loyalty\n- Regulatory barriers\n- Access to distribution\n- Network effects\n\n**High Threat:** Low barriers, easy to enter (e.g., simple SaaS tools)\n**Low Threat:** High barriers (e.g., regulated industries, hardware)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- How easy is it for new competitors to enter?\n- What would it cost to launch a competing product?\n- Are there network effects or switching costs protecting incumbents?\n\n### Force 2: Bargaining Power of Suppliers\n\n**Supplier Power Factors:**\n\n- Supplier concentration\n- Availability of substitutes\n- Importance to supplier\n- Switching costs\n- Forward integration threat\n\n**High Power:** Few suppliers, critical inputs (e.g., cloud infrastructure providers)\n**Low Power:** Many alternatives, commoditized (e.g., generic services)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- Who are our critical suppliers?\n- Could they raise prices or reduce quality?\n- Can we switch suppliers easily?\n\n### Force 3: Bargaining Power of Buyers\n\n**Buyer Power Factors:**\n\n- Buyer concentration\n- Volume purchased\n- Product differentiation\n- Price sensitivity\n- Backward integration threat\n\n**High Power:** Few large customers, standardized products (e.g., enterprise deals)\n**Low Power:** Many small customers, differentiated product (e.g., consumer subscriptions)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- Can customers easily switch to competitors?\n- Do few customers generate most revenue?\n- How price-sensitive are buyers?\n\n### Force 4: Threat of Substitutes\n\n**Substitute Considerations:**\n\n- Alternative solutions\n- Price-performance tradeoff\n- Switching costs\n- Buyer propensity to substitute\n\n**High Threat:** Many alternatives, low switching cost (e.g., productivity software)\n**Low Threat:** Unique solution, high switching cost (e.g., ERP systems)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- What alternative ways can customers solve this problem?\n- How do substitutes compare on price and performance?\n- What''s the cost to switch to a substitute?\n\n### Force 5: Competitive Rivalry\n\n**Rivalry Intensity Factors:**\n\n- Number of competitors\n- Industry growth rate\n- Product differentiation\n- Exit barriers\n- Strategic stakes\n\n**High Rivalry:** Many competitors, slow growth, commoditized (e.g., email marketing)\n**Low Rivalry:** Few competitors, fast growth, differentiated (e.g., emerging AI tools)\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n\n- How many direct competitors exist?\n- Is the market growing or stagnant?\n- How differentiated are offerings?\n- Are competitors competing on price or value?\n\n### Forces Analysis Summary\n\nCreate a scorecard:\n\n| Force          | Intensity (1-5) | Impact | Key Factors                       |\n| -------------- | --------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| New Entrants   | 3               | Medium | Low barriers but network effects  |\n| Supplier Power | 2               | Low    | Many cloud providers              |\n| Buyer Power    | 4               | High   | Enterprise customers concentrated |\n| Substitutes    | 3               | Medium | Manual processes alternative      |\n| Rivalry        | 4               | High   | 10+ direct competitors            |\n\n**Overall Assessment:** Moderate industry attractiveness with high rivalry and buyer power\n\n## Blue Ocean Strategy\n\nIdentify uncontested market space through value innovation.\n\n### Four Actions Framework\n\n**Eliminate:**\nWhat factors can be eliminated that the industry takes for granted?\n\n**Reduce:**\nWhat factors can be reduced well below industry standard?\n\n**Raise:**\nWhat factors can be raised well above industry standard?\n\n**Create:**\nWhat factors can be created that the industry never offered?\n\n### Strategy Canvas\n\nMap your offering vs. competitors on key factors.\n\n**Example: Budget Hotels**\n\n```\nHigh |                    ★ Traditional Hotels\n     |          ★ Budget Hotels (new)\n     |\nLow  |___________________________________\n     Price  Luxury  Convenience  Cleanliness\n\nBudget Hotel Strategy:\n- Eliminate: Luxury amenities, room service\n- Reduce: Lobby size, staff\n- Raise: Cleanliness, online booking\n- Create: Self-service kiosks, mobile app\n```\n\n### Value Innovation\n\nFind the sweet spot: Lower cost + higher value\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. Map industry competing factors\n2. Identify factors to eliminate/reduce (cost savings)\n3. Identify factors to raise/create (differentiation)\n4. Validate that combination creates new market space\n\n## Competitive Positioning\n\n### Positioning Map\n\nPlot competitors on 2-3 key dimensions.\n\n**Example Dimensions:**\n\n- Price vs. Features\n- Complexity vs. Ease of Use\n- Enterprise vs. SMB Focus\n- Self-Service vs. High-Touch\n- Generalist vs. Specialist\n\n**How to Create:**\n\n1. Choose 2 dimensions most important to customers\n2. Plot all competitors\n3. Identify gaps (white space)\n4. Validate gap represents real customer need\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nHigh Price\n    |\n    |  ★ Enterprise A      ★ Enterprise B\n    |\n    |          ● Our Position (gap)\n    |\n    |  ★ Competitor C      ★ Competitor D\n    |\nLow Price |____________________________________________\n        Simple                           Complex\n```\n\n### Differentiation Strategy\n\n**How to Differentiate:**\n\n1. **Product Differentiation**\n   - Unique features\n   - Superior performance\n   - Better design/UX\n   - Integration ecosystem\n\n2. **Service Differentiation**\n   - Customer support quality\n   - Onboarding experience\n   - Response time\n   - Success programs\n\n3. **Brand Differentiation**\n   - Trust and reputation\n   - Thought leadership\n   - Community\n   - Values alignment\n\n4. **Price Differentiation**\n   - Premium positioning\n   - Value positioning\n   - Transparent pricing\n   - Flexible packaging\n\n### Positioning Statement Framework\n\n```\nFor [target customer]\nWho [statement of need or opportunity]\nOur product is [product category]\nThat [statement of key benefit]\nUnlike [primary competitive alternative]\nOur product [statement of primary differentiation]\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```\nFor e-commerce companies\nWho struggle with email marketing automation\nOur product is an AI-powered email platform\nThat increases conversion rates by 40%\nUnlike Klaviyo and Mailchimp\nOur product uses AI to personalize at scale\n```\n\n## Competitive Intelligence\n\n### Information Gathering\n\n**Public Sources:**\n\n- Company websites and blogs\n- Press releases and news\n- Job postings (hint at strategy)\n- Customer reviews (G2, Capterra)\n- Social media and forums\n- Glassdoor (employee insights)\n- SEC filings (public companies)\n- Patent filings\n\n**Direct Research:**\n\n- Customer interviews\n- Win/loss analysis\n- Sales team feedback\n- Product demos and trials\n- Conference attendance\n\n### Competitor Profile Template\n\nFor each key competitor, document:\n\n**Company Overview:**\n\n- Founded, HQ, funding, size\n- Leadership team\n- Company stage and trajectory\n\n**Product:**\n\n- Core features\n- Target customers\n- Pricing and packaging\n- Technology stack\n- Recent launches\n\n**Go-to-Market:**\n\n- Sales model (self-serve, sales-led)\n- Marketing strategy\n- Distribution channels\n- Partnerships\n\n**Strengths:**\n\n- What they do better than anyone\n- Key competitive advantages\n- Market position\n\n**Weaknesses:**\n\n- Gaps in product\n- Customer complaints\n- Operational challenges\n\n**Strategy:**\n\n- Stated direction\n- Inferred priorities\n- Likely next moves\n\n## Competitive Pricing Analysis\n\n### Price Positioning\n\n**Premium (Top 25%):**\n\n- Superior product/service\n- Strong brand\n- High-touch sales\n- Enterprise focus\n\n**Mid-Market (Middle 50%):**\n\n- Balanced value\n- Standard features\n- Mixed sales model\n- Broad market\n\n**Value (Bottom 25%):**\n\n- Basic functionality\n- Self-service\n- Cost leadership\n- High volume, low margin\n\n### Pricing Comparison Matrix\n\n| Competitor   | Entry Price | Mid Tier | Enterprise | Model        |\n| ------------ | ----------- | -------- | ---------- | ------------ |\n| Competitor A | $29/mo      | $99/mo   | Custom     | Subscription |\n| Competitor B | $49/mo      | $199/mo  | $499/mo    | Subscription |\n| Us           | $39/mo      | $129/mo  | Custom     | Subscription |\n\n**Analysis:**\n\n- Are we priced competitively?\n- What does our pricing signal?\n- Are there gaps in our packaging?\n\n## Go-to-Market Strategy\n\n### Market Entry Strategies\n\n**Direct Competition:**\n\n- Head-to-head against established players\n- Requires differentiation and resources\n- Example: Better features at lower price\n\n**Niche Focus:**\n\n- Target underserved segment\n- Become specialist vs. generalist\n- Example: \"Salesforce for real estate\"\n\n**Disruptive Innovation:**\n\n- Target non-consumers or low end\n- Improve over time to move upmarket\n- Example: Freemium model disrupting enterprise\n\n**Platform Play:**\n\n- Build ecosystem and network effects\n- Aggregate complementary services\n- Example: Marketplace or API platform\n\n### Beachhead Market\n\n**Characteristics of Good Beachhead:**\n\n- Specific, reachable segment\n- Acute pain you solve well\n- Limited competition\n- Willing to pay\n- Can lead to expansion\n\n**Example:**\nInstead of \"project management software\", target \"project management for construction teams\"\n\n## Competitive Advantage\n\n### Sustainable Advantages\n\n**Network Effects:**\n\n- Value increases with users\n- Example: Slack, marketplaces\n\n**Switching Costs:**\n\n- High cost to change\n- Example: CRM systems with data\n\n**Economies of Scale:**\n\n- Unit costs decrease with volume\n- Example: Cloud infrastructure\n\n**Brand:**\n\n- Trust and reputation\n- Example: Security software\n\n**Proprietary Technology:**\n\n- Patents or trade secrets\n- Example: Algorithms, data\n\n**Regulatory:**\n\n- Licenses or approvals\n- Example: Fintech, healthcare\n\n### Testing Your Advantage\n\nAsk:\n\n- Can competitors copy this in < 2 years?\n- Does this matter to customers?\n- Do we execute this better than anyone?\n- Is this advantage durable?\n\nIf \"no\" to any, it''s not a sustainable advantage.\n\n## Competitive Monitoring\n\n### What to Track\n\n**Product Changes:**\n\n- New features\n- Pricing changes\n- Packaging adjustments\n\n**Market Signals:**\n\n- Funding announcements\n- Key hires (especially leadership)\n- Customer wins/losses\n- Partnerships\n\n**Performance Metrics:**\n\n- Revenue (if public or disclosed)\n- Customer count\n- Growth rate\n- Market share estimates\n\n### Monitoring Cadence\n\n**Weekly:**\n\n- Product release notes\n- News mentions\n\n**Monthly:**\n\n- Win/loss analysis review\n- Positioning map updates\n\n**Quarterly:**\n\n- Deep competitive review\n- Strategy adjustment\n\n**Annually:**\n\n- Major strategy reassessment\n- Market trends analysis\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\n- **`references/frameworks-deep-dive.md`** - Detailed application of each framework with worksheets\n- **`references/intel-sources.md`** - Comprehensive list of competitive intelligence sources\n\n### Example Files\n\n- **`examples/competitor-analysis.md`** - Complete competitive analysis for a SaaS startup\n- **`examples/positioning-workshop.md`** - Step-by-step positioning development process\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo analyze competitive landscape:\n\n1. **Identify competitors** - Direct, indirect, and future threats\n2. **Apply Porter''s Five Forces** - Assess industry attractiveness\n3. **Create positioning map** - Visualize competitive space\n4. **Profile top 3-5 competitors** - Deep dive on key rivals\n5. **Identify differentiation** - What makes you unique\n6. **Analyze pricing** - Where do you fit?\n7. **Assess advantages** - What''s defensible?\n8. **Develop strategy** - How to win\n\nFor detailed frameworks and examples, see `references/` and `examples/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:37:07.523Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Strategic Analysis Agents needing to conduct comprehensive market intelligence and competitive positioning.","zh":"非常适合需要开展全面市场情报和竞争定位分析的战略分析智能体。","ja":"包括的な市場インテリジェンスと競争ポジショニングを実施する必要がある戦略分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 시장 정보 및 경쟁 포지셔닝 분석을 수행해야 하는 전략 분석 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Estratégico que necesitan realizar inteligencia de mercado y posicionamiento competitivo comprehensivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse stratégique ayant besoin de réaliser une intelligence de marché et un positionnement compétitif complets.","de":"Perfekt für Strategieanalyseagenten, die umfassende Marktinformations- und Wettbewerbspositionierungsanalysen durchführen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Estratégica que precisam realizar inteligência de mercado abrangente e posicionamento competitivo.","ru":"Идеально для Стратегических Аналитических Агентов, которым необходимо проводить всесторонний рыночный анализ и конкурентное позиционирование.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل استراتيجي يتطلبون إجراء استخبارات سوق شاملة وتحديد المواقع التنافسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to systematically analyze industry dynamics using Porter''s Five Forces framework, identify Blue Ocean Strategy opportunities, and create competitive positioning maps for strategic advantage.","zh":"使智能体能够使用波特五力模型系统分析行业动态，识别蓝海战略机会，并为获取战略优势创建竞争定位图。","ja":"ポーターのファイブフォースフレームワークを使用して業界のダイナミクスを体系的に分析し、ブルーオーシャン戦略の機会を特定し、戦略的優位性のための競争ポジショニングマップを作成することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 포터의 다섯 가지 힘 프레임워크를 사용하여 산업 역학을 체계적으로 분석하고, 블루오션 전략 기회를 식별하며, 전략적 이점을 위한 경쟁 포지셔닝 맵을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar sistemáticamente la dinámica de la industria utilizando el marco de las Cinco Fuerzas de Porter, identificar oportunidades de Estrategia del Océano Azul y crear mapas de posicionamiento competitivo para obtener una ventaja estratégica.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser systématiquement la dynamique de l''industrie en utilisant le cadre des Cinq Forces de Porter, d''identifier des opportunités de Stratégie de l''Océan Bleu et de créer des cartes de positionnement compétitif pour obtenir un avantage stratégique.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Industriedynamik systematisch mit dem Rahmenwerk der Fünf Kräfte von Porter zu analysieren, Chancen der Blauen Ozean Strategie zu identifizieren und Wettbewerbspositionierungs-Karten für einen strategischen Vorteil zu erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem sistematicamente a dinâmica da indústria usando a estrutura das Cinco Forças de Porter, identifiquem oportunidades de Estratégia do Oceano Azul e criem mapas de posicionamento competitivo para vantagem estratégica.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически анализировать динамику отрасли с использованием структуры Пяти сил Портера, выявлять возможности Синего океана и создавать карты конкурентного позиционирования для стратегического преимущества.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله تحليل ديناميكية الصناعة بشكل منهجي باستخدام إطار عمل خمسة قوى بورتر، وتحديد فرص استراتيجية المحيط الأزرق، وإنشاء خرائط لتحديد المواقع التنافسية من أجل الحصول على ميزة استراتيجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Conducting industry attractiveness analysis","Identifying market differentiation opportunities","Developing defensible competitive positioning strategies","Mapping competitor positioning across key market dimensions"],"zh":["执行行业吸引力分析","识别市场差异化机会","制定可靠的竞争定位策略","绘制关键市场维度上的竞争对手定位图"],"ja":["業界の魅力分析の実施","市場差別化の機会の特定","防御可能な競争ポジショニング戦略の策定","主要な市場次元における競合他社のポジショニングのマッピング"],"ko":["산업 매력도 분석 수행","시장 차별화 기회 식별","방어 가능한 경쟁 포지셔닝 전략 개발","주요 시장 차원에서 경쟁사 포지셔닝 매핑"],"es":["Realizar análisis de atractividad de la industria","Identificar oportunidades de diferenciación del mercado","Desarrollar estrategias de posicionamiento competitivo defensibles","Mapear el posicionamiento de los competidores en dimensiones clave del mercado"],"fr":["Réaliser une analyse de l''attractivité de l''industrie","Identifier des opportunités de différenciation du marché","Développer des stratégies de positionnement compétitif défensables","Cartographier le positionnement des concurrents sur les dimensions clés du marché"],"de":["Durchführung einer Branchenattraktivitätsanalyse","Identifizierung von Marktdifferenzierungschancen","Entwicklung von verteidigungsfähigen Wettbewerbspositionierungsstrategien","Abbilden der Wettbewerberpositionierung über wichtige Markt dimensionen"],"pt":["Realizar análise de atratividade da indústria","Identificar oportunidades de diferenciação de mercado","Desenvolver estratégias de posicionamento competitivo defensáveis","Mapear o posicionamento dos concorrentes nas principais dimensões do mercado"],"ru":["Проведение анализа привлекательности отрасли","Определение возможностей рыночной дифференциации","Разработка оборонительных конкурентных стратегий позиционирования","Картирование позиционирования конкурентов по ключевым рыночным измерениям"],"ar":["إجراء تحليل جاذبية الصناعة","تحديد فرص التمايز في السوق","وضع استراتيجيات لتحديد المواقع التنافسية القابلة للدفاع"," رسم خريطة لمواقع المنافسين على أبعاد السوق الرئيسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires structured market data input","Depends on accurate competitor intelligence","Framework-based analysis may require human interpretation"],"zh":["需要结构化的市场数据输入","依赖于准确的竞争对手情报","基于框架的分析可能需要人为解释"],"ja":["構造化された市場データの入力が必要","正確な競合他社のインテリジェンスに依存","フレームワークベースの分析には人間の解釈が必要な場合がある"],"ko":["구조화된 시장 데이터 입력 필요","정확한 경쟁사 정보에 의존","프레임워크 기반 분석은 인간의 해석이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de datos de mercado estructurada","Depende de una inteligencia de competidores precisa","El análisis basado en marcos puede requerir interpretación humana"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de données de marché structurée","Dépend d''une intelligence de concurrents précise","L''analyse basée sur des cadres peut nécessiter une interprétation humaine"],"de":["Benötigt eine strukturierte Marktdaten-Eingabe","Hängt von genauer Wettbewerber-Intelligence ab","Rahmenwerk-basierte Analyse kann menschliche Interpretation erfordern"],"pt":["Requer entrada de dados de mercado estruturados","Depende de inteligência de concorrentes precisa","Análise baseada em estrutura pode requerer interpretação humana"],"ru":["Требует структурированного входного рыночного данных","Зависит от точной конкурентной разведки","Анализ на основе структуры может требовать человеческой интерпретации"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال بيانات السوق المنظمة","يعتمد على استخبارات دقيقة للمنافسين","التحليل القائم على الإطار قد يتطلب تفسيرًا بشريًا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/memory-forensics', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'memory-forensics', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z', '2026-02-18T13:36:38.732Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/memory-forensics","name":"memory-forensics","description":{"zh":"内存取证是一种用于获取、分析和提取内存덤프中的工件以进行事件响应和恶意软件分析的综合技术","ja":"メモリフォレンジックスは、インシデント対応とマルウェア分析のためにメモリダンプからアーティファクトを取得、分析、抽出するための総合的なテクニックです","ko":"메모리 포렌식은 사고 대응과 악성 코드 분석을 위해 메모리 덤프에서 아티팩트를 수집, 분석, 추출하는 종합적인 기술입니다","es":"Técnicas de forensia de memoria para la adquisición, análisis y extracción de artefactos de volcados de memoria","fr":"Techniques de forensique mémoire pour l''acquisition, l''analyse et l''extraction d''artefacts de dumps de mémoire","de":"Memory-Forensik-Techniken für die Erfassung, Analyse und Extraktion von Artefakten aus Speicherdumps","pt":"Análise de memória forense é uma técnica para adquirir, analisar e extrair artefatos de dumps de memória para resposta a incidentes e análise de malware.","ru":"Форензика памяти - это техника для получения, анализа и извлечения артефактов из дампов памяти для реагирования на инциденты и анализа вредоносного ПО.","ar":"علم تحليل الذاكرة الجنائي هو تقنية لاكتساب وتحليل واستخراج الملفات من مسودات الذاكرة لاستجابة الحوادث وتحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"内存取证技术","ja":"メモリフォレンジックス","ko":"메모리 포렌식","es":"Técnicas de Forensia de Memoria","fr":"Techniques de Forensique Mémoire","de":"Memory-Forensik-Techniken","pt":"Análise de Memória Forense: Técnicas Avançadas","ru":"Форензика Памяти: Комплексные Техники","ar":"علم تحليل الذاكرة الجنائي: تقنيات شاملة","en":"memory-forensics"},"description":{"zh":"内存取证是一种用于获取、分析和提取内存덤프中的工件以进行事件响应和恶意软件分析的综合技术","ja":"メモリフォレンジックスは、インシデント対応とマルウェア分析のためにメモリダンプからアーティファクトを取得、分析、抽出するための総合的なテクニックです","ko":"메모리 포렌식은 사고 대응과 악성 코드 분석을 위해 메모리 덤프에서 아티팩트를 수집, 분석, 추출하는 종합적인 기술입니다","es":"Técnicas de forensia de memoria para la adquisición, análisis y extracción de artefactos de volcados de memoria","fr":"Techniques de forensique mémoire pour l''acquisition, l''analyse et l''extraction d''artefacts de dumps de mémoire","de":"Memory-Forensik-Techniken für die Erfassung, Analyse und Extraktion von Artefakten aus Speicherdumps","pt":"Análise de memória forense é uma técnica para adquirir, analisar e extrair artefatos de dumps de memória para resposta a incidentes e análise de malware.","ru":"Форензика памяти - это техника для получения, анализа и извлечения артефактов из дампов памяти для реагирования на инциденты и анализа вредоносного ПО.","ar":"علم تحليل الذاكرة الجنائي هو تقنية لاكتساب وتحليل واستخراج الملفات من مسودات الذاكرة لاستجابة الحوادث وتحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["内存获取技术","内存分析工具","事件响应","恶意软件分析","内存덤프提取"],"ja":["メモリ取得技術","メモリ分析ツール","インシデント対応","マルウェア分析","メモリダンプ抽出"],"ko":["메모리 수집 기술","메모리 분석 도구","사고 대응","악성 코드 분석","메모리 덤프 추출"],"es":["Técnicas de adquisición de memoria en vivo","Herramientas de adquisición de memoria para Windows y Linux","Análisis de artefactos de volcados de memoria","Extracción de información de volcados de memoria","Uso de herramientas como WinPmem y LiME"],"fr":["Techniques d''acquisition de mémoire en direct","Outils d''acquisition de mémoire pour Windows et Linux","Analyse d''artefacts de dumps de mémoire","Extraction d''informations de dumps de mémoire","Utilisation d''outils tels que WinPmem et LiME"],"de":["Techniken zur Erfassung von Speicher in Echtzeit","Werkzeuge zur Erfassung von Speicher für Windows und Linux","Analyse von Artefakten aus Speicherdumps","Extraktion von Informationen aus Speicherdumps","Verwendung von Tools wie WinPmem und LiME"],"pt":["Técnicas de aquisição de memória","Análise de dumps de memória","Extração de artefatos","Ferramentas de análise de memória","Métodos de resposta a incidentes"],"ru":["Техники получения памяти","Анализ дампов памяти","Извлечение артефактов","Инструменты анализа памяти","Методы реагирования на инциденты"],"ar":["تقنيات اكتساب الذاكرة","تحليل مسودات الذاكرة","استخراج الملفات","أدوات تحليل الذاكرة","أساليب استجابة الحوادث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["内存取证","事件响应","恶意软件分析","内存获取","内存分析","内存덤프"],"ja":["メモリフォレンジックス","インシデント対応","マルウェア分析","メモリ取得","メモリ分析","メモリダンプ"],"ko":["메모리 포렌식","사고 대응","악성 코드 분석","메모리 수집","메모리 분석","메모리 덤프"],"es":["forensia de memoria","análisis de malware","respuesta a incidentes","adquisición de memoria","herramientas de forensia","WinPmem","LiME"],"fr":["forensique mémoire","analyse de malware","réponse aux incidents","acquisition de mémoire","outils de forensique","WinPmem","LiME"],"de":["Memory-Forensik","Malware-Analyse","Reaktion auf Vorfälle","Erfassung von Speicher","Forensik-Tools","WinPmem","LiME"],"pt":["análise de memória forense","resposta a incidentes","análise de malware","ferramentas de análise de memória","técnicas de aquisição de memória","extração de artefatos"],"ru":["форензика памяти","реагирование на инциденты","анализ вредоносного ПО","инструменты анализа памяти","техники получения памяти","извлечение артефактов"],"ar":["علم تحليل الذاكرة الجنائي","استجابة الحوادث","تحليل البرمجيات الخبيثة","أدوات تحليل الذاكرة","تقنيات اكتساب الذاكرة","استخراج الملفات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"memory-forensics","description":"Master memory forensics techniques including memory acquisition, process analysis, and artifact extraction using Volatility and related tools. Use when analyzing memory dumps, investigating incidents, or performing malware analysis from RAM captures.","bodyPreview":"# Memory Forensics\n\nComprehensive techniques for acquiring, analyzing, and extracting artifacts from memory dumps for incident response and malware analysis.\n\n## Memory Acquisition\n\n### Live Acquisition Tools\n\n#### Windows\n\n```powershell\n# WinPmem (Recommended)\nwinpmem_mini_x64.exe memory.raw\n\n# DumpIt\nDumpIt.exe\n\n# Belkasoft RAM Capturer\n# GUI-based, outputs raw format\n\n# Magnet RAM Capture\n# GUI-based, outputs raw format\n```\n\n#### Linux\n\n```bash\n# LiME (Linux Memory Extractor)\nsudo insmod lime","body":"# Memory Forensics\n\nComprehensive techniques for acquiring, analyzing, and extracting artifacts from memory dumps for incident response and malware analysis.\n\n## Memory Acquisition\n\n### Live Acquisition Tools\n\n#### Windows\n\n```powershell\n# WinPmem (Recommended)\nwinpmem_mini_x64.exe memory.raw\n\n# DumpIt\nDumpIt.exe\n\n# Belkasoft RAM Capturer\n# GUI-based, outputs raw format\n\n# Magnet RAM Capture\n# GUI-based, outputs raw format\n```\n\n#### Linux\n\n```bash\n# LiME (Linux Memory Extractor)\nsudo insmod lime.ko \"path=/tmp/memory.lime format=lime\"\n\n# /dev/mem (limited, requires permissions)\nsudo dd if=/dev/mem of=memory.raw bs=1M\n\n# /proc/kcore (ELF format)\nsudo cp /proc/kcore memory.elf\n```\n\n#### macOS\n\n```bash\n# osxpmem\nsudo ./osxpmem -o memory.raw\n\n# MacQuisition (commercial)\n```\n\n### Virtual Machine Memory\n\n```bash\n# VMware: .vmem file is raw memory\ncp vm.vmem memory.raw\n\n# VirtualBox: Use debug console\nvboxmanage debugvm \"VMName\" dumpvmcore --filename memory.elf\n\n# QEMU\nvirsh dump <domain> memory.raw --memory-only\n\n# Hyper-V\n# Checkpoint contains memory state\n```\n\n## Volatility 3 Framework\n\n### Installation and Setup\n\n```bash\n# Install Volatility 3\npip install volatility3\n\n# Install symbol tables (Windows)\n# Download from https://downloads.volatilityfoundation.org/volatility3/symbols/\n\n# Basic usage\nvol -f memory.raw <plugin>\n\n# With symbol path\nvol -f memory.raw -s /path/to/symbols windows.pslist\n```\n\n### Essential Plugins\n\n#### Process Analysis\n\n```bash\n# List processes\nvol -f memory.raw windows.pslist\n\n# Process tree (parent-child relationships)\nvol -f memory.raw windows.pstree\n\n# Hidden process detection\nvol -f memory.raw windows.psscan\n\n# Process memory dumps\nvol -f memory.raw windows.memmap --pid <PID> --dump\n\n# Process environment variables\nvol -f memory.raw windows.envars --pid <PID>\n\n# Command line arguments\nvol -f memory.raw windows.cmdline\n```\n\n#### Network Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Network connections\nvol -f memory.raw windows.netscan\n\n# Network connection state\nvol -f memory.raw windows.netstat\n```\n\n#### DLL and Module Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Loaded DLLs per process\nvol -f memory.raw windows.dlllist --pid <PID>\n\n# Find hidden/injected DLLs\nvol -f memory.raw windows.ldrmodules\n\n# Kernel modules\nvol -f memory.raw windows.modules\n\n# Module dumps\nvol -f memory.raw windows.moddump --pid <PID>\n```\n\n#### Memory Injection Detection\n\n```bash\n# Detect code injection\nvol -f memory.raw windows.malfind\n\n# VAD (Virtual Address Descriptor) analysis\nvol -f memory.raw windows.vadinfo --pid <PID>\n\n# Dump suspicious memory regions\nvol -f memory.raw windows.vadyarascan --yara-rules rules.yar\n```\n\n#### Registry Analysis\n\n```bash\n# List registry hives\nvol -f memory.raw windows.registry.hivelist\n\n# Print registry key\nvol -f memory.raw windows.registry.printkey --key \"Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\"\n\n# Dump registry hive\nvol -f memory.raw windows.registry.hivescan --dump\n```\n\n#### File System Artifacts\n\n```bash\n# Scan for file objects\nvol -f memory.raw windows.filescan\n\n# Dump files from memory\nvol -f memory.raw windows.dumpfiles --pid <PID>\n\n# MFT analysis\nvol -f memory.raw windows.mftscan\n```\n\n### Linux Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Process listing\nvol -f memory.raw linux.pslist\n\n# Process tree\nvol -f memory.raw linux.pstree\n\n# Bash history\nvol -f memory.raw linux.bash\n\n# Network connections\nvol -f memory.raw linux.sockstat\n\n# Loaded kernel modules\nvol -f memory.raw linux.lsmod\n\n# Mount points\nvol -f memory.raw linux.mount\n\n# Environment variables\nvol -f memory.raw linux.envars\n```\n\n### macOS Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Process listing\nvol -f memory.raw mac.pslist\n\n# Process tree\nvol -f memory.raw mac.pstree\n\n# Network connections\nvol -f memory.raw mac.netstat\n\n# Kernel extensions\nvol -f memory.raw mac.lsmod\n```\n\n## Analysis Workflows\n\n### Malware Analysis Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Initial process survey\nvol -f memory.raw windows.pstree > processes.txt\nvol -f memory.raw windows.pslist > pslist.txt\n\n# 2. Network connections\nvol -f memory.raw windows.netscan > network.txt\n\n# 3. Detect injection\nvol -f memory.raw windows.malfind > malfind.txt\n\n# 4. Analyze suspicious processes\nvol -f memory.raw windows.dlllist --pid <PID>\nvol -f memory.raw windows.handles --pid <PID>\n\n# 5. Dump suspicious executables\nvol -f memory.raw windows.pslist --pid <PID> --dump\n\n# 6. Extract strings from dumps\nstrings -a pid.<PID>.exe > strings.txt\n\n# 7. YARA scanning\nvol -f memory.raw windows.yarascan --yara-rules malware.yar\n```\n\n### Incident Response Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Timeline of events\nvol -f memory.raw windows.timeliner > timeline.csv\n\n# 2. User activity\nvol -f memory.raw windows.cmdline\nvol -f memory.raw windows.consoles\n\n# 3. Persistence mechanisms\nvol -f memory.raw windows.registry.printkey \\\n    --key \"Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\"\n\n# 4. Services\nvol -f memory.raw windows.svcscan\n\n# 5. Scheduled tasks\nvol -f memory.raw windows.scheduled_tasks\n\n# 6. Recent files\nvol -f memory.raw windows.filescan | grep -i \"recent\"\n```\n\n## Data Structures\n\n### Windows Process Structures\n\n```c\n// EPROCESS (Executive Process)\ntypedef struct _EPROCESS {\n    KPROCESS Pcb;                    // Kernel process block\n    EX_PUSH_LOCK ProcessLock;\n    LARGE_INTEGER CreateTime;\n    LARGE_INTEGER ExitTime;\n    // ...\n    LIST_ENTRY ActiveProcessLinks;   // Doubly-linked list\n    ULONG_PTR UniqueProcessId;       // PID\n    // ...\n    PEB* Peb;                        // Process Environment Block\n    // ...\n} EPROCESS;\n\n// PEB (Process Environment Block)\ntypedef struct _PEB {\n    BOOLEAN InheritedAddressSpace;\n    BOOLEAN ReadImageFileExecOptions;\n    BOOLEAN BeingDebugged;           // Anti-debug check\n    // ...\n    PVOID ImageBaseAddress;          // Base address of executable\n    PPEB_LDR_DATA Ldr;              // Loader data (DLL list)\n    PRTL_USER_PROCESS_PARAMETERS ProcessParameters;\n    // ...\n} PEB;\n```\n\n### VAD (Virtual Address Descriptor)\n\n```c\ntypedef struct _MMVAD {\n    MMVAD_SHORT Core;\n    union {\n        ULONG LongFlags;\n        MMVAD_FLAGS VadFlags;\n    } u;\n    // ...\n    PVOID FirstPrototypePte;\n    PVOID LastContiguousPte;\n    // ...\n    PFILE_OBJECT FileObject;\n} MMVAD;\n\n// Memory protection flags\n#define PAGE_EXECUTE           0x10\n#define PAGE_EXECUTE_READ      0x20\n#define PAGE_EXECUTE_READWRITE 0x40\n#define PAGE_EXECUTE_WRITECOPY 0x80\n```\n\n## Detection Patterns\n\n### Process Injection Indicators\n\n```python\n# Malfind indicators\n# - PAGE_EXECUTE_READWRITE protection (suspicious)\n# - MZ header in non-image VAD region\n# - Shellcode patterns at allocation start\n\n# Common injection techniques\n# 1. Classic DLL Injection\n#    - VirtualAllocEx + WriteProcessMemory + CreateRemoteThread\n\n# 2. Process Hollowing\n#    - CreateProcess (SUSPENDED) + NtUnmapViewOfSection + WriteProcessMemory\n\n# 3. APC Injection\n#    - QueueUserAPC targeting alertable threads\n\n# 4. Thread Execution Hijacking\n#    - SuspendThread + SetThreadContext + ResumeThread\n```\n\n### Rootkit Detection\n\n```bash\n# Compare process lists\nvol -f memory.raw windows.pslist > pslist.txt\nvol -f memory.raw windows.psscan > psscan.txt\ndiff pslist.txt psscan.txt  # Hidden processes\n\n# Check for DKOM (Direct Kernel Object Manipulation)\nvol -f memory.raw windows.callbacks\n\n# Detect hooked functions\nvol -f memory.raw windows.ssdt  # System Service Descriptor Table\n\n# Driver analysis\nvol -f memory.raw windows.driverscan\nvol -f memory.raw windows.driverirp\n```\n\n### Credential Extraction\n\n```bash\n# Dump hashes (requires hivelist first)\nvol -f memory.raw windows.hashdump\n\n# LSA secrets\nvol -f memory.raw windows.lsadump\n\n# Cached domain credentials\nvol -f memory.raw windows.cachedump\n\n# Mimikatz-style extraction\n# Requires specific plugins/tools\n```\n\n## YARA Integration\n\n### Writing Memory YARA Rules\n\n```yara\nrule Suspicious_Injection\n{\n    meta:\n        description = \"Detects common injection shellcode\"\n\n    strings:\n        // Common shellcode patterns\n        $mz = { 4D 5A }\n        $shellcode1 = { 55 8B EC 83 EC }  // Function prologue\n        $api_hash = { 68 ?? ?? ?? ?? 68 ?? ?? ?? ?? E8 }  // Push hash, call\n\n    condition:\n        $mz at 0 or any of ($shellcode*)\n}\n\nrule Cobalt_Strike_Beacon\n{\n    meta:\n        description = \"Detects Cobalt Strike beacon in memory\"\n\n    strings:\n        $config = { 00 01 00 01 00 02 }\n        $sleep = \"sleeptime\"\n        $beacon = \"%s (admin)\" wide\n\n    condition:\n        2 of them\n}\n```\n\n### Scanning Memory\n\n```bash\n# Scan all process memory\nvol -f memory.raw windows.yarascan --yara-rules rules.yar\n\n# Scan specific process\nvol -f memory.raw windows.yarascan --yara-rules rules.yar --pid 1234\n\n# Scan kernel memory\nvol -f memory.raw windows.yarascan --yara-rules rules.yar --kernel\n```\n\n## String Analysis\n\n### Extracting Strings\n\n```bash\n# Basic string extraction\nstrings -a memory.raw > all_strings.txt\n\n# Unicode strings\nstrings -el memory.raw >> all_strings.txt\n\n# Targeted extraction from process dump\nvol -f memory.raw windows.memmap --pid 1234 --dump\nstrings -a pid.1234.dmp > process_strings.txt\n\n# Pattern matching\ngrep -E \"(https?://|[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3})\" all_strings.txt\n```\n\n### FLOSS for Obfuscated Strings\n\n```bash\n# FLOSS extracts obfuscated strings\nfloss malware.exe > floss_output.txt\n\n# From memory dump\nfloss pid.1234.dmp\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Acquisition Best Practices\n\n1. **Minimize footprint**: Use lightweight acquisition tools\n2. **Document everything**: Record time, tool, and hash of capture\n3. **Verify integrity**: Hash memory dump immediately after capture\n4. **Chain of custody**: Maintain proper forensic handling\n\n### Analysis Best Practices\n\n1. **Start broad**: Get overview before deep diving\n2. **Cross-reference**: Use multiple plugins for same data\n3. **Timeline correlation**: Correlate memory findings with disk/network\n4. **Document findings**: Keep detailed notes and screenshots\n5. **Validate results**: Verify findings through multiple methods\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Stale data**: Memory is volatile, analyze promptly\n- **Incomplete dumps**: Verify dump size matches expected RAM\n- **Symbol issues**: Ensure correct symbol files for OS version\n- **Smear**: Memory may change during acquisition\n- **Encryption**: Some data may be encrypted in memory\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:36:38.732Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced memory analysis capabilities for incident response and malware analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要高级内存分析功能的网络安全代理，尤其是在事件响应和恶意软件分析方面。","ja":"サイバーセキュリティエージェントがインシデントレスポンスとマルウェア分析のための高度なメモリ分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"사이버 보안 에이전트가 사건 대응과 악성 코드 분석을 위한 고급 메모리 분석 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ciberseguridad que necesitan capacidades de análisis de memoria avanzadas para respuesta a incidentes y análisis de malware.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de cybersécurité ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse de mémoire avancées pour la réponse aux incidents et l''analyse de logiciels malveillants.","de":"Perfekt für Cybersicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Speicheranalysefunktionen für Reaktionen auf Vorfälle und Malware-Analysen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Cibersegurança que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de memória para resposta a incidentes e análise de malware.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кибербезопасности, которым требуются расширенные возможности анализа памяти для реагирования на инциденты и анализа вредоносного ПО.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمن السيبراني الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل الذاكرة للاستجابة للحوادث وتحليل البرامج الضارة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to acquire and analyze memory dumps using tools like WinPmem, LiME, and DumpIt, extracting artifacts in raw format for further investigation, and supporting protocols like live acquisition and memory extraction.","zh":"赋予代理获取和分析内存转储的能力，使用诸如 WinPmem、LiME 和 DumpIt 等工具，从原始格式中提取工件，以便进一步调查，并支持实时获取和内存提取等协议。","ja":"WinPmem、LiME、DumpIt などのツールを使用してメモリダンプを取得して分析する機能をエージェントに与え、生の形式でアーティファクトを抽出し、さらに調査するために、ライブ取得やメモリ抽出などのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 WinPmem, LiME, DumpIt 등의 도구를 사용하여 메모리 덤프를 획득하고 분석할 수 있도록 하며, 원시 형식에서 아티팩트를 추출하여 추가 조사하고, 라이브 수집 및 메모리 추출 등의 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes adquirir y analizar volcados de memoria utilizando herramientas como WinPmem, LiME y DumpIt, extrayendo artefactos en formato bruto para una mayor investigación y soportando protocolos como adquisición en vivo y extracción de memoria.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''acquérir et d''analyser les dumps de mémoire à l''aide d''outils tels que WinPmem, LiME et DumpIt, en extrayant des artefacts au format brut pour une investigation plus approfondie, et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que l''acquisition en direct et l''extraction de mémoire.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Speicherauszüge mit Tools wie WinPmem, LiME und DumpIt zu erfassen und zu analysieren, Artefakte im Rohformat für weitere Untersuchungen zu extrahieren und Protokolle wie Live-Erfassung und Speicherextraktion zu unterstützen.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a adquirir e analisar despejos de memória usando ferramentas como WinPmem, LiME e DumpIt, extraindo artefatos em formato bruto para investigação adicional, e suportando protocolos como aquisição ao vivo e extração de memória.","ru":"Позволяет агентам получать и анализировать дампы памяти с помощью таких инструментов, как WinPmem, LiME и DumpIt, извлекать артефакты в сыром формате для дальнейшего расследования и поддерживает такие протоколы, как живое приобретение и извлечение памяти.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الحصول على صور الذاكرة وتحليلها باستخدام أدوات مثل WinPmem وLiME وDumpIt، واستخراج القطع الأثرية بتنسيق خام لمزيد من التحقيق، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل الاقتناء المباشر واستخراج الذاكرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Acquiring memory dumps for malware analysis","Analyzing memory artifacts for incident response","Extracting sensitive data from memory dumps"],"zh":["为恶意软件分析获取内存转储","为事件响应分析内存工件","从内存转储中提取敏感数据"],"ja":["マルウェア分析のためのメモリダンプの取得","インシデントレスポンスのためのメモリアーティファクトの分析","メモリダンプからの機密データの抽出"],"ko":["악성 코드 분석을 위한 메모리 덤프 획득","사건 대응을 위한 메모리 아티팩트 분석","메모리 덤프에서 민감한 데이터 추출"],"es":["Adquisición de volcados de memoria para análisis de malware","Análisis de artefactos de memoria para respuesta a incidentes","Extracción de datos sensibles de los volcados de memoria"],"fr":["Acquisition de dumps de mémoire pour analyse de logiciels malveillants","Analyse d''artefacts de mémoire pour réponse aux incidents","Extraction de données sensibles à partir des dumps de mémoire"],"de":["Erfassung von Speicherauszügen für Malware-Analysen","Analyse von Speicherartefakten für Reaktionen auf Vorfälle","Extraktion von sensiblen Daten aus Speicherauszügen"],"pt":["Aquisição de despejos de memória para análise de malware","Análise de artefatos de memória para resposta a incidentes","Extrair dados sensíveis de despejos de memória"],"ru":["Получение дампов памяти для анализа вредоносного ПО","Анализ артефактов памяти для реагирования на инциденты","Извлечение конфиденциальных данных из дампов памяти"],"ar":["الحصول على صور الذاكرة لتحليل البرامج الضارة","تحليل القطع الأثرية في الذاكرة للاستجابة للحوادث","استخراج البيانات الحساسة من صور الذاكرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires administrative privileges for memory acquisition","Limited to Windows and Linux operating systems","Dependent on specific tools like WinPmem and LiME"],"zh":["需要管理权限来获取内存","仅限于 Windows 和 Linux 操作系统","依赖特定的工具如 WinPmem 和 LiME"],"ja":["メモリ取得のために管理者権限が必要","Windows と Linux のみのオペレーティングシステム","WinPmem や LiME などの特定のツールに依存"],"ko":["메모리 수집을 위해 관리자 권한이 필요함","윈도우와 리눅스 운영 체제만 지원","WinPmem, LiME 등의 특정 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere privilegios administrativos para la adquisición de memoria","Limitado a sistemas operativos Windows y Linux","Dependiente de herramientas específicas como WinPmem y LiME"],"fr":["Nécessite des privilèges administratifs pour l''acquisition de mémoire","Limité aux systèmes d''exploitation Windows et Linux","Dépendant d''outils spécifiques tels que WinPmem et LiME"],"de":["Benötigt administrative Rechte für die Speichererfassung","Begrenzt auf Windows- und Linux-Betriebssysteme","Abhängig von spezifischen Tools wie WinPmem und LiME"],"pt":["Requer privilégios administrativos para aquisição de memória","Limitado aos sistemas operacionais Windows e Linux","Dependente de ferramentas específicas como WinPmem e LiME"],"ru":["Требует административных привилегий для получения памяти","Ограничено операционными системами Windows и Linux","Зависит от конкретных инструментов, таких как WinPmem и LiME"],"ar":["يتطلب امتيازات إدارية للحصول على الذاكرة","يقتصر على أنظمة التشغيل Windows وLinux","يعتمد على أدوات محددة مثل WinPmem وLiME"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/kpi-dashboard-design', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'kpi-dashboard-design', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z', '2026-02-18T13:36:53.967Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/kpi-dashboard-design","name":"kpi-dashboard-design","description":{"zh":"KPI仪表盘设计是创建有效的数据可视化以支持业务决策的过程。它涉及选择有意义的KPI、设计实时监控显示和建立指标治理","ja":"KPIダッシュボード設計は、ビジネス上の意思決定を支援するための効果的なデータ可視化を作成するプロセスです。意味のあるKPIを選択し、リアルタイムモニタリング表示を設計し、メトリクスガバナンスを確立することが含まれます","ko":"KPI 대시보드 디자인은 비즈니스 의사결정을 지원하기 위한 효과적인 데이터 시각화를 만드는 과정입니다. 의미 있는 KPI를 선택하고, 실시간 모니터링 표시를 설계하며, 메트릭스 거버넌스를 확립하는 것이 포함됩니다","es":"El diseño de tableros de KPI es fundamental para tomar decisiones empresariales informadas. Aprende a crear tableros efectivos","fr":"La conception de tableaux de bord KPI est essentielle pour prendre des décisions commerciales éclairées. Apprenez à créer des tableaux efficaces","de":"Das Design von KPI-Dashboards ist entscheidend für fundierte Geschäftsentscheidungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Dashboards erstellen","pt":"O desenho de painel de KPI é fundamental para impulsionar decisões de negócios. Aprenda a criar painéis eficazes com nossos padrões abrangentes.","ru":"Дизайн панели KPI имеет важное значение для стимулирования бизнес-решений. Узнайте, как создать эффективные панели с помощью наших комплексных дизайн-шаблонов.","ar":"تصميم لوحة KPI ضروري لتحفيز اتخاذ القرارات التجارية. تعرف على كيفية إنشاء لوحات فعالة باستخدام أنماط التصميم الشاملة لدينا.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"KPI仪表盘设计 - 提升业务决策的数据可视化","ja":"KPIダッシュボード設計 - ビジネス上の意思決定を支援するデータ可視化","ko":"KPI 대시보드 디자인 - 비즈니스 의사결정을 지원하는 데이터 시각화","es":"Diseño de tableros de KPI","fr":"Conception de tableaux de bord KPI","de":"KPI-Dashboard-Design","pt":"Desenho de Painel de KPI","ru":"Дизайн панели KPI","ar":"تصميم لوحة仪表 KPI","en":"kpi-dashboard-design"},"description":{"zh":"KPI仪表盘设计是创建有效的数据可视化以支持业务决策的过程。它涉及选择有意义的KPI、设计实时监控显示和建立指标治理","ja":"KPIダッシュボード設計は、ビジネス上の意思決定を支援するための効果的なデータ可視化を作成するプロセスです。意味のあるKPIを選択し、リアルタイムモニタリング表示を設計し、メトリクスガバナンスを確立することが含まれます","ko":"KPI 대시보드 디자인은 비즈니스 의사결정을 지원하기 위한 효과적인 데이터 시각화를 만드는 과정입니다. 의미 있는 KPI를 선택하고, 실시간 모니터링 표시를 설계하며, 메트릭스 거버넌스를 확립하는 것이 포함됩니다","es":"El diseño de tableros de KPI es fundamental para tomar decisiones empresariales informadas. Aprende a crear tableros efectivos","fr":"La conception de tableaux de bord KPI est essentielle pour prendre des décisions commerciales éclairées. Apprenez à créer des tableaux efficaces","de":"Das Design von KPI-Dashboards ist entscheidend für fundierte Geschäftsentscheidungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie effektive Dashboards erstellen","pt":"O desenho de painel de KPI é fundamental para impulsionar decisões de negócios. Aprenda a criar painéis eficazes com nossos padrões abrangentes.","ru":"Дизайн панели KPI имеет важное значение для стимулирования бизнес-решений. Узнайте, как создать эффективные панели с помощью наших комплексных дизайн-шаблонов.","ar":"تصميم لوحة KPI ضروري لتحفيز اتخاذ القرارات التجارية. تعرف على كيفية إنشاء لوحات فعالة باستخدام أنماط التصميم الشاملة لدينا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["选择有意义的KPI","设计实时监控显示","创建部门特定的指标视图","改进现有的仪表盘布局","建立指标治理"],"ja":["意味のあるKPIを選択する","リアルタイムモニタリング表示を設計する","部門特有のメトリクスビューを作成する","既存のダッシュボードレイアウトを改善する","メトリクスガバナンスを確立する"],"ko":["의미 있는 KPI를 선택","실시간 모니터링 표시를 설계","부서 특有的 메트릭스 뷰를 생성","기존의 대시보드 레이아웃을 개선","메트릭스 거버넌스를 확립"],"es":["Diseño de tableros ejecutivos","Selección de KPI significativos","Creación de vistas de métricas en tiempo real","Mejora de diseños de tableros existentes","Establecimiento de gobernanza de métricas"],"fr":["Conception de tableaux de bord pour les dirigeants","Sélection de KPI pertinents","Création de vues de métriques en temps réel","Amélioration de la conception de tableaux de bord existants","Établissement d''une gouvernance des métriques"],"de":["Entwurf von Executive-Dashboards","Auswahl bedeutender KPI","Erstellung von Echtzeit-Metrikenansichten","Verbesserung bestehender Dashboard-Layouts","Einrichtung einer Metrik-Governance"],"pt":["Padrões de design de painel de KPI","Seleção de KPIs significativas","Criação de exibições de monitoramento em tempo real","Desenvolvimento de vistas de métricas personalizadas","Otimização de layouts de painel existentes","Estabelecimento de governança de métricas"],"ru":["Дизайн-шаблоны панели KPI","Выбор значимых KPI","Создание дисплеев мониторинга в режиме реального времени","Разработка настраиваемых представлений метрик","Оптимизация существующих макетов панелей","Установление метрической управляемости"],"ar":["أنماط تصميم لوحة KPI","اختيار KPIs ذات معنى","إنشاء عروض مراقبة في الوقت الفعلي","تطوير مناظير مترية مخصصة","تحسين تخطيطات لوحة موجودة","إنشاء حوكمة مترية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["KPI仪表盘设计","数据可视化","业务决策","关键绩效指标","实时监控","指标治理"],"ja":["KPIダッシュボード設計","データ可視化","ビジネス上の意思決定","重要なパフォーマンス指標","リアルタイムモニタリング","メトリクスガバナンス"],"ko":["KPI 대시보드 디자인","데이터 시각화","비즈니스 의사결정","주요 성과 지표","실시간 모니터링","메트릭스 거버넌스"],"es":["diseño de tableros de KPI","indicadores de rendimiento clave","tableros ejecutivos","métricas en tiempo real","gobernanza de métricas","análisis de datos"],"fr":["conception de tableaux de bord KPI","indicateurs de performance clés","tableaux de bord pour les dirigeants","métriques en temps réel","gouvernance des métriques","analyse de données"],"de":["KPI-Dashboard-Design","Schlüssel-Leistungsindikatoren","Executive-Dashboards","Echtzeit-Metriken","Metrik-Governance","Datenanalyse"],"pt":["desenho de painel de KPI","KPI","indicadores de desempenho","painel de controle","design de dashboard","métricas de negócios","tomada de decisões","análise de dados"],"ru":["дизайн панели KPI","KPI","показатели эффективности","панель управления","дизайн dashboard","бизнес-метрики","принятие решений","анализ данных"],"ar":["تصميم لوحة KPI","KPI","مؤشرات الأداء","لوحة التحكم","تصميم لوحة","متريات الأعمال","اتخاذ القرارات","تحليل البيانات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kpi-dashboard-design","description":"Design effective KPI dashboards with metrics selection, visualization best practices, and real-time monitoring patterns. Use when building business dashboards, selecting metrics, or designing data visualization layouts.","bodyPreview":"# KPI Dashboard Design\n\nComprehensive patterns for designing effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards that drive business decisions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing executive dashboards\n- Selecting meaningful KPIs\n- Building real-time monitoring displays\n- Creating department-specific metrics views\n- Improving existing dashboard layouts\n- Establishing metric governance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. KPI Framework\n\n| Level           | Focus            | Update Frequency  | Audience","body":"# KPI Dashboard Design\n\nComprehensive patterns for designing effective Key Performance Indicator (KPI) dashboards that drive business decisions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing executive dashboards\n- Selecting meaningful KPIs\n- Building real-time monitoring displays\n- Creating department-specific metrics views\n- Improving existing dashboard layouts\n- Establishing metric governance\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. KPI Framework\n\n| Level           | Focus            | Update Frequency  | Audience   |\n| --------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| **Strategic**   | Long-term goals  | Monthly/Quarterly | Executives |\n| **Tactical**    | Department goals | Weekly/Monthly    | Managers   |\n| **Operational** | Day-to-day       | Real-time/Daily   | Teams      |\n\n### 2. SMART KPIs\n\n```\nSpecific: Clear definition\nMeasurable: Quantifiable\nAchievable: Realistic targets\nRelevant: Aligned to goals\nTime-bound: Defined period\n```\n\n### 3. Dashboard Hierarchy\n\n```\n├── Executive Summary (1 page)\n│   ├── 4-6 headline KPIs\n│   ├── Trend indicators\n│   └── Key alerts\n├── Department Views\n│   ├── Sales Dashboard\n│   ├── Marketing Dashboard\n│   ├── Operations Dashboard\n│   └── Finance Dashboard\n└── Detailed Drilldowns\n    ├── Individual metrics\n    └── Root cause analysis\n```\n\n## Common KPIs by Department\n\n### Sales KPIs\n\n```yaml\nRevenue Metrics:\n  - Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)\n  - Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR)\n  - Average Revenue Per User (ARPU)\n  - Revenue Growth Rate\n\nPipeline Metrics:\n  - Sales Pipeline Value\n  - Win Rate\n  - Average Deal Size\n  - Sales Cycle Length\n\nActivity Metrics:\n  - Calls/Emails per Rep\n  - Demos Scheduled\n  - Proposals Sent\n  - Close Rate\n```\n\n### Marketing KPIs\n\n```yaml\nAcquisition:\n  - Cost Per Acquisition (CPA)\n  - Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)\n  - Lead Volume\n  - Marketing Qualified Leads (MQL)\n\nEngagement:\n  - Website Traffic\n  - Conversion Rate\n  - Email Open/Click Rate\n  - Social Engagement\n\nROI:\n  - Marketing ROI\n  - Campaign Performance\n  - Channel Attribution\n  - CAC Payback Period\n```\n\n### Product KPIs\n\n```yaml\nUsage:\n  - Daily/Monthly Active Users (DAU/MAU)\n  - Session Duration\n  - Feature Adoption Rate\n  - Stickiness (DAU/MAU)\n\nQuality:\n  - Net Promoter Score (NPS)\n  - Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)\n  - Bug/Issue Count\n  - Time to Resolution\n\nGrowth:\n  - User Growth Rate\n  - Activation Rate\n  - Retention Rate\n  - Churn Rate\n```\n\n### Finance KPIs\n\n```yaml\nProfitability:\n  - Gross Margin\n  - Net Profit Margin\n  - EBITDA\n  - Operating Margin\n\nLiquidity:\n  - Current Ratio\n  - Quick Ratio\n  - Cash Flow\n  - Working Capital\n\nEfficiency:\n  - Revenue per Employee\n  - Operating Expense Ratio\n  - Days Sales Outstanding\n  - Inventory Turnover\n```\n\n## Dashboard Layout Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Executive Summary\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  EXECUTIVE DASHBOARD                        [Date Range ▼]  │\n├─────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────────┤\n│   REVENUE   │   PROFIT    │  CUSTOMERS  │    NPS SCORE    │\n│   $2.4M     │    $450K    │    12,450   │       72        │\n│   ▲ 12%     │    ▲ 8%     │    ▲ 15%    │     ▲ 5pts     │\n├─────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────────┤\n│                                                             │\n│  Revenue Trend                    │  Revenue by Product     │\n│  ┌───────────────────────┐       │  ┌──────────────────┐   │\n│  │    /\\    /\\          │       │  │ ████████ 45%     │   │\n│  │   /  \\  /  \\    /\\   │       │  │ ██████   32%     │   │\n│  │  /    \\/    \\  /  \\  │       │  │ ████     18%     │   │\n│  │ /            \\/    \\ │       │  │ ██        5%     │   │\n│  └───────────────────────┘       │  └──────────────────┘   │\n│                                                             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  🔴 Alert: Churn rate exceeded threshold (>5%)              │\n│  🟡 Warning: Support ticket volume 20% above average        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: SaaS Metrics Dashboard\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  SAAS METRICS                     Jan 2024  [Monthly ▼]     │\n├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  ┌────────────────┐  │  MRR GROWTH                          │\n│  │      MRR       │  │  ┌────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │    $125,000    │  │  │                          /──   │  │\n│  │     ▲ 8%       │  │  │                    /────/      │  │\n│  └────────────────┘  │  │              /────/            │  │\n│  ┌────────────────┐  │  │        /────/                  │  │\n│  │      ARR       │  │  │   /────/                       │  │\n│  │   $1,500,000   │  │  └────────────────────────────────┘  │\n│  │     ▲ 15%      │  │  J  F  M  A  M  J  J  A  S  O  N  D  │\n│  └────────────────┘  │                                      │\n├──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  UNIT ECONOMICS      │  COHORT RETENTION                    │\n│                      │                                      │\n│  CAC:     $450       │  Month 1: ████████████████████ 100%  │\n│  LTV:     $2,700     │  Month 3: █████████████████    85%   │\n│  LTV/CAC: 6.0x       │  Month 6: ████████████████     80%   │\n│                      │  Month 12: ██████████████      72%   │\n│  Payback: 4 months   │                                      │\n├──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  CHURN ANALYSIS                                             │\n│  ┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────────────────┐ │\n│  │ Gross    │ Net      │ Logo     │ Expansion            │ │\n│  │ 4.2%     │ 1.8%     │ 3.1%     │ 2.4%                 │ │\n│  └──────────┴──────────┴──────────┴──────────────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Real-time Operations\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  OPERATIONS CENTER                    Live ● Last: 10:42:15 │\n├────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┤\n│  SYSTEM HEALTH             │  SERVICE STATUS                │\n│  ┌──────────────────────┐  │                                │\n│  │   CPU    MEM    DISK │  │  ● API Gateway      Healthy    │\n│  │   45%    72%    58%  │  │  ● User Service     Healthy    │\n│  │   ███    ████   ███  │  │  ● Payment Service  Degraded   │\n│  │   ███    ████   ███  │  │  ● Database         Healthy    │\n│  │   ███    ████   ███  │  │  ● Cache            Healthy    │\n│  └──────────────────────┘  │                                │\n├────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤\n│  REQUEST THROUGHPUT        │  ERROR RATE                    │\n│  ┌──────────────────────┐  │  ┌──────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │ ▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█▇▆▅▄▃▂▁▂▃▄▅ │  │  │ ▁▁▁▁▁▂▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁▁  │  │\n│  └──────────────────────┘  │  └──────────────────────────┘  │\n│  Current: 12,450 req/s     │  Current: 0.02%                │\n│  Peak: 18,200 req/s        │  Threshold: 1.0%               │\n├────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────┤\n│  RECENT ALERTS                                              │\n│  10:40  🟡 High latency on payment-service (p99 > 500ms)    │\n│  10:35  🟢 Resolved: Database connection pool recovered     │\n│  10:22  🔴 Payment service circuit breaker tripped          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Implementation Patterns\n\n### SQL for KPI Calculations\n\n```sql\n-- Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR)\nWITH mrr_calculation AS (\n    SELECT\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', billing_date) AS month,\n        SUM(\n            CASE subscription_interval\n                WHEN ''monthly'' THEN amount\n                WHEN ''yearly'' THEN amount / 12\n                WHEN ''quarterly'' THEN amount / 3\n            END\n        ) AS mrr\n    FROM subscriptions\n    WHERE status = ''active''\n    GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(''month'', billing_date)\n)\nSELECT\n    month,\n    mrr,\n    LAG(mrr) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS prev_mrr,\n    (mrr - LAG(mrr) OVER (ORDER BY month)) / LAG(mrr) OVER (ORDER BY month) * 100 AS growth_pct\nFROM mrr_calculation;\n\n-- Cohort Retention\nWITH cohorts AS (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', created_at) AS cohort_month\n    FROM users\n),\nactivity AS (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', event_date) AS activity_month\n    FROM user_events\n    WHERE event_type = ''active_session''\n)\nSELECT\n    c.cohort_month,\n    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM age(a.activity_month, c.cohort_month)) AS months_since_signup,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT a.user_id) AS active_users,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT a.user_id)::FLOAT / COUNT(DISTINCT c.user_id) * 100 AS retention_rate\nFROM cohorts c\nLEFT JOIN activity a ON c.user_id = a.user_id\n    AND a.activity_month >= c.cohort_month\nGROUP BY c.cohort_month, EXTRACT(MONTH FROM age(a.activity_month, c.cohort_month))\nORDER BY c.cohort_month, months_since_signup;\n\n-- Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC)\nSELECT\n    DATE_TRUNC(''month'', acquired_date) AS month,\n    SUM(marketing_spend) / NULLIF(COUNT(new_customers), 0) AS cac,\n    SUM(marketing_spend) AS total_spend,\n    COUNT(new_customers) AS customers_acquired\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        DATE_TRUNC(''month'', u.created_at) AS acquired_date,\n        u.id AS new_customers,\n        m.spend AS marketing_spend\n    FROM users u\n    JOIN marketing_spend m ON DATE_TRUNC(''month'', u.created_at) = m.month\n    WHERE u.source = ''marketing''\n) acquisition\nGROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(''month'', acquired_date);\n```\n\n### Python Dashboard Code (Streamlit)\n\n```python\nimport streamlit as st\nimport pandas as pd\nimport plotly.express as px\nimport plotly.graph_objects as go\n\nst.set_page_config(page_title=\"KPI Dashboard\", layout=\"wide\")\n\n# Header with date filter\ncol1, col2 = st.columns([3, 1])\nwith col1:\n    st.title(\"Executive Dashboard\")\nwith col2:\n    date_range = st.selectbox(\n        \"Period\",\n        [\"Last 7 Days\", \"Last 30 Days\", \"Last Quarter\", \"YTD\"]\n    )\n\n# KPI Cards\ndef metric_card(label, value, delta, prefix=\"\", suffix=\"\"):\n    delta_color = \"green\" if delta >= 0 else \"red\"\n    delta_arrow = \"▲\" if delta >= 0 else \"▼\"\n    st.metric(\n        label=label,\n        value=f\"{prefix}{value:,.0f}{suffix}\",\n        delta=f\"{delta_arrow} {abs(delta):.1f}%\"\n    )\n\ncol1, col2, col3, col4 = st.columns(4)\nwith col1:\n    metric_card(\"Revenue\", 2400000, 12.5, prefix=\"$\")\nwith col2:\n    metric_card(\"Customers\", 12450, 15.2)\nwith col3:\n    metric_card(\"NPS Score\", 72, 5.0)\nwith col4:\n    metric_card(\"Churn Rate\", 4.2, -0.8, suffix=\"%\")\n\n# Charts\ncol1, col2 = st.columns(2)\n\nwith col1:\n    st.subheader(\"Revenue Trend\")\n    revenue_data = pd.DataFrame({\n        ''Month'': pd.date_range(''2024-01-01'', periods=12, freq=''M''),\n        ''Revenue'': [180000, 195000, 210000, 225000, 240000, 255000,\n                    270000, 285000, 300000, 315000, 330000, 345000]\n    })\n    fig = px.line(revenue_data, x=''Month'', y=''Revenue'',\n                  line_shape=''spline'', markers=True)\n    fig.update_layout(height=300)\n    st.plotly_chart(fig, use_container_width=True)\n\nwith col2:\n    st.subheader(\"Revenue by Product\")\n    product_data = pd.DataFrame({\n        ''Product'': [''Enterprise'', ''Professional'', ''Starter'', ''Other''],\n        ''Revenue'': [45, 32, 18, 5]\n    })\n    fig = px.pie(product_data, values=''Revenue'', names=''Product'',\n                 hole=0.4)\n    fig.update_layout(height=300)\n    st.plotly_chart(fig, use_container_width=True)\n\n# Cohort Heatmap\nst.subheader(\"Cohort Retention\")\ncohort_data = pd.DataFrame({\n    ''Cohort'': [''Jan'', ''Feb'', ''Mar'', ''Apr'', ''May''],\n    ''M0'': [100, 100, 100, 100, 100],\n    ''M1'': [85, 87, 84, 86, 88],\n    ''M2'': [78, 80, 76, 79, None],\n    ''M3'': [72, 74, 70, None, None],\n    ''M4'': [68, 70, None, None, None],\n})\nfig = go.Figure(data=go.Heatmap(\n    z=cohort_data.iloc[:, 1:].values,\n    x=[''M0'', ''M1'', ''M2'', ''M3'', ''M4''],\n    y=cohort_data[''Cohort''],\n    colorscale=''Blues'',\n    text=cohort_data.iloc[:, 1:].values,\n    texttemplate=''%{text}%'',\n    textfont={\"size\": 12},\n))\nfig.update_layout(height=250)\nst.plotly_chart(fig, use_container_width=True)\n\n# Alerts Section\nst.subheader(\"Alerts\")\nalerts = [\n    {\"level\": \"error\", \"message\": \"Churn rate exceeded threshold (>5%)\"},\n    {\"level\": \"warning\", \"message\": \"Support ticket volume 20% above average\"},\n]\nfor alert in alerts:\n    if alert[\"level\"] == \"error\":\n        st.error(f\"🔴 {alert[''message'']}\")\n    elif alert[\"level\"] == \"warning\":\n        st.warning(f\"🟡 {alert[''message'']}\")\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Limit to 5-7 KPIs** - Focus on what matters\n- **Show context** - Comparisons, trends, targets\n- **Use consistent colors** - Red=bad, green=good\n- **Enable drilldown** - From summary to detail\n- **Update appropriately** - Match metric frequency\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t show vanity metrics** - Focus on actionable data\n- **Don''t overcrowd** - White space aids comprehension\n- **Don''t use 3D charts** - They distort perception\n- **Don''t hide methodology** - Document calculations\n- **Don''t ignore mobile** - Ensure responsive design\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Stephen Few''s Dashboard Design](https://www.perceptualedge.com/articles/visual_business_intelligence/rules_for_using_color.pdf)\n- [Edward Tufte''s Principles](https://www.edwardtufte.com/tufte/)\n- [Google Data Studio Gallery](https://datastudio.google.com/gallery)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:36:53.967Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Data Visualization Agents needing to transform raw metrics into executive-level dashboard insights.","zh":"非常适合需要将原始指标转化为高管级仪表板洞察力的数据可视化智能体。","ja":"生のメトリクスを経営陣レベルのダッシュボードの洞察に変換する必要があるデータ可視化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"원시 메트릭을 경영진 수준의 대시보드 인사이트로 변환해야 하는 데이터 시각화 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de visualización de datos que necesitan transformar métricas raw en perspectivas de panel de nivel ejecutivo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de visualisation de données ayant besoin de transformer des métriques brutes en informations de tableau de bord de niveau exécutif.","de":"Ideal für Data-Visualisierungsagenten, die rohe Metriken in Erkenntnisse auf Unternehmensleitebene umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Visualização de Dados que precisam transformar métricas brutas em insights de painel de execução de nível executivo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов визуализации данных, которым необходимо преобразовывать сырые метрики в информацию для панелей высшего уровня.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل المقاييس الخام إلى رؤى لوحة تنفيذية من المستوى التنفيذي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to design comprehensive KPI frameworks with appropriate metric selection, audience targeting, and update frequency optimization for real-time monitoring displays. Provides structured patterns for department-specific metrics views and establishes governance protocols for dashboard consistency.","zh":"使智能体能够设计全面的KPI框架，包括适当的指标选择、受众定位和实时监控显示的更新频率优化。为特定部门的指标视图提供结构化模式，并建立仪表板一致性的治理协议。","ja":"適切なメトリクス選択、対象者のターゲティング、リアルタイム監視表示のための更新頻度の最適化を備えた包括的なKPIフレームワークの設計をエージェントに可能にします。部門固有のメトリクスビューに対する構造化されたパターンを提供し、ダッシュボードの一貫性のためのガバナンスプロトコルを確立します。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 메트릭 선택, 대상 타겟팅 및 실시간 모니터링 디스플레이를 위한 업데이트 빈도 최적화를 통해 포괄적인 KPI 프레임워크를 설계할 수 있도록 합니다. 부서별 메트릭 보기를 위한 구조화된 패턴을 제공하고 대시보드 일관성을 위한 거버넌스 프로토콜을 수립합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar marcos de indicadores clave de rendimiento (KPI) integrales con una selección de métricas adecuada, orientación a la audiencia y optimización de la frecuencia de actualización para pantallas de monitoreo en tiempo real. Proporciona patrones estructurados para vistas de métricas específicas de departamento y establece protocolos de gobernanza para la coherencia de los paneles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des cadres d''indicateurs clés de performance (KPI) complets avec une sélection de métriques appropriée, une ciblage du public et une optimisation de la fréquence de mise à jour pour les écrans de surveillance en temps réel. Fournit des modèles structurés pour des vues de métriques spécifiques au département et établit des protocoles de gouvernance pour la cohérence des tableaux de bord.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende KPI-Rahmen mit geeigneter Metrikauswahl, Zielgruppenansprache und Optimierung der Aktualisierungshäufigkeit für Echtzeit-Überwachungsanzeige zu entwerfen. Bietet strukturierte Muster für abteilungsspezifische Metrikenansichten und etabliert Governance-Protokolle für die Konsistenz der Dashboards.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem estruturas de indicadores de desempenho abrangentes com seleção apropriada de métricas, direcionamento de público e otimização da frequência de atualização para displays de monitoramento em tempo real. Fornece padrões estruturados para visualizações de métricas específicas de departamento e estabelece protocolos de governança para consistência de painéis.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать всесторонние рамки показателей эффективности с соответствующим выбором метрик, целевой аудиторией и оптимизацией частоты обновления для дисплеев мониторинга в режиме реального времени. Предоставляет структурированные шаблоны для отраслевых представлений метрик и устанавливает протоколы управления для последовательности панелей.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم إطارات شاملة لمؤشرات الأداء مع اختيار مناسب للمقاييس وتصميم الجمهور وتحسين تردد التحديث لشاشات مراقبة في الوقت الفعلي. يوفر أنماطًا منظمة لمقاييس محددة للقسم وتضع بروتوكولات الحوكمة لاتساق اللوحات."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing executive dashboards for C-suite reporting","Building real-time monitoring displays for operational metrics","Creating department-specific metrics views for sales, marketing, or operations","Establishing metric governance frameworks for organizational consistency"],"zh":["为最高管理层报告设计高管仪表板","为运营指标构建实时监控显示","为销售、市场或运营部门创建特定部门的指标视图","为组织一致性建立指标治理框架"],"ja":["最高経営陣（C-suite）への報告のための経営ダッシュボードの設計","運用メトリクスのためのリアルタイム監視表示の構築","販売、マーケティング、または運用のための部門固有のメトリクスビューの作成","組織的一貫性のためのメトリクスガバナンスフレームワークの確立"],"ko":["최고 경영진 보고를 위한 경영진 대시보드 설계","운영 메트릭을 위한 실시간 모니터링 디스플레이 구축","영업, 마케팅 또는 운영을 위한 부서별 메트릭 보기 생성","조직적 일관성을 위한 메트릭 거버넌스 프레임워크 수립"],"es":["Diseñar paneles ejecutivos para informes de la suite ejecutiva","Crear pantallas de monitoreo en tiempo real para métricas operativas","Crear vistas de métricas específicas de departamento para ventas, marketing o operaciones","Establecer marcos de gobernanza de métricas para la coherencia organizativa"],"fr":["Concevoir des tableaux de bord exécutifs pour les rapports de la direction","Créer des écrans de surveillance en temps réel pour les métriques opérationnelles","Créer des vues de métriques spécifiques au département pour les ventes, le marketing ou les opérations","Établir des cadres de gouvernance des métriques pour la cohérence organisationnelle"],"de":["Entwerfen von Exekutiv-Dashboards für C-Level-Berichterstattung","Erstellen von Echtzeit-Überwachungsanzeige für operative Metriken","Erstellen von abteilungsspezifischen Metrikenansichten für Vertrieb, Marketing oder Betrieb","Etablierung von Metrik-Governance-Rahmen für organisationale Konsistenz"],"pt":["Projetar painéis executivos para relatórios da C-suite","Construir displays de monitoramento em tempo real para métricas operacionais","Criar visualizações de métricas específicas de departamento para vendas, marketing ou operações","Estabelecer estruturas de governança de métricas para consistência organizacional"],"ru":["Разрабатывать панели управления для отчетности высшего уровня","Создавать дисплеи мониторинга в режиме реального времени для операционных метрик","Создавать отраслевые представления метрик для продаж, маркетинга или операций","Устанавливать рамки управления метриками для организационной последовательности"],"ar":["تصميم لوحات تنفيذية لتقرير مجموعة الإدارة العليا","بناء شاشات مراقبة في الوقت الفعلي لمقاييس تشغيلية","إنشاء مناظير مقاييس محددة للقسم للمبيعات والتسويق أو العمليات","إنشاء إطارات حوكمة لمقاييس لاتساق المنظمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to business metric definitions and data sources","Needs understanding of specific departmental reporting requirements","Depends on available visualization tools and platforms"],"zh":["需要访问业务指标定义和数据源","需要了解特定部门的报告要求","依赖于可用的可视化工具和平台"],"ja":["ビジネスメトリクスの定義とデータソースへのアクセスが必要","特定部門の報告要件の理解が必要","利用可能な可視化ツールとプラットフォームに依存する"],"ko":["비즈니스 메트릭 정의 및 데이터 소스에 대한 액세스 필요","특정 부서별 보고 요구사항에 대한 이해 필요","사용 가능한 시각화 도구 및 플랫폼에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a definiciones de métricas comerciales y fuentes de datos","Necesita comprensión de los requisitos de informes específicos de departamento","Depende de las herramientas y plataformas de visualización disponibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux définitions de métriques commerciales et aux sources de données","A besoin d''une compréhension des exigences de rapport spécifiques au département","Dépend des outils et plateformes de visualisation disponibles"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Geschäftsmetrik-Definitionen und Datenquellen","Benötigt Verständnis für spezifische Abteilungsberichtsanforderungen","Hängt von verfügbaren Visualisierungstools und -plattformen ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a definições de métricas de negócios e fontes de dados","Necessita de compreensão dos requisitos de relatórios específicos de departamento","Depende de ferramentas e plataformas de visualização disponíveis"],"ru":["Требует доступа к определениям бизнес-метрик и источникам данных","Требует понимания конкретных требований отчетности департамента","Зависит от доступных инструментов и платформ визуализации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تعريفات مقاييس الأعمال ومصادر البيانات","يحتاج إلى فهم متطلبات التقرير الخاصة بالقسم","يعتمد على أدوات ومنصات التصور المتاحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
