álisis de tamaño de mercado proporciona la base para la estrategia, la recaudación de fondos y la planificación empresarial de las startups","fr":"L''analyse de taille de marché fournit la base pour la stratégie, la collecte de fonds et la planification d''entreprise des startups","de":"Die Marktgrößenanalyse bildet die Grundlage für die Strategie, das Fundraising und die Geschäftsplanung von Startups","pt":"A análise de tamanho de mercado fornece a base para a estratégia de startup, captação de recursos e planejamento de negócios.","ru":"Анализ размера рынка обеспечивает основу для стратегии стартапа, привлечения средств и бизнес-планирования.","ar":"تحليل حجم السوق يوفر الأساس لاستراتيجية الشركة الناشئة وتحليل المخاطر والتخطيط التجاري.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["总可寻址市场（TAM）计算","服务可用市场（SAM）计算","可服务获得市场（SOM）计算","顶层法（行业报告）","底层法（客户细分计算）","价值理论（意愿支付）"],"ja":["総アドレス可能市場（TAM）計算","サービス可能市場（SAM）計算","サービス可能取得市場（SOM）計算","トップダウン法（業界レポート）","ボトムアップ法（顧客セグメント計算）","価値理論（意欲支払い）"],"ko":["총 주소 가능한 시장（TAM） 계산","서비스 가능한 시장（SAM） 계산","서비스 가능한 획득 시장（SOM） 계산","상층법（산업 보고서）","하층법（고객 세분 계산）","가치 이론（의지 지불）"],"es":["Metodologías de tamaño de mercado","Cálculo de Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Cálculo de Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Cálculo de Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Análisis de oportunidad de mercado","Planificación empresarial"],"fr":["Méthodologies de taille de marché","Calcul de Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Calcul de Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Calcul de Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Analyse d''opportunité de marché","Planification d''entreprise"],"de":["Marktgrößenmethoden","Berechnung von Total Addressable Market (TAM)","Berechnung von Serviceable Available Market (SAM)","Berechnung von Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM)","Marktopportunitätsanalyse","Geschäftsplanung"],"pt":["Cálculo do TAM (Mercado Total Endereçável)","Cálculo do SAM (Mercado Disponível Serviço)","Cálculo do SOM (Mercado Obtenível Serviço)","Metodologias top-down, bottom-up e value theory","Análise de segmentos de clientes","Planejamento de negócios e captação de recursos"],"ru":["Расчет TAM (Общий адресуемый рынок)","Расчет SAM (Доступный обслуживаемый рынок)","Расчет SOM (Обслуживаемый рынок)","Методологии top-down, bottom-up и value theory","Анализ сегментов клиентов","Бизнес-планирование и привлечение средств"],"ar":["حساب TAM (السوق الكلي الموجه)","حساب SAM (السوق المتاح للخدمة)","حساب SOM (السوق الحاصل للخدمة)","منهجيات顶向下، 底向上 و نظرية القيمة","تحليل قطاعات العملاء","تخطيط الأعمال وجذب الأموال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["市场规模分析","总可寻址市场","服务可用市场","可服务获得市场","顶层法","底层法","价值理论","创业策略","筹资","商业规划"],"ja":["マーケットサイズ分析","総アドレス可能市場","サービス可能市場","サービス可能取得市場","トップダウン法","ボトムアップ法","価値理論","スタートアップ戦略","資金調達","ビジネス計画"],"ko":["시장 규모 분석","총 주소 가능한 시장","서비스 가능한 시장","서비스 가능한 획득 시장","상층법","하층법","가치 이론","스타트업 전략","자금 조달","비즈니스 계획"],"es":["análisis de tamaño de mercado","tamaño de mercado","Total Addressable Market","Serviceable Available Market","Serviceable Obtainable Market","oportunidad de mercado","planificación empresarial","startups"],"fr":["analyse de taille de marché","taille de marché","Total Addressable Market","Serviceable Available Market","Serviceable Obtainable Market","opportunité de marché","planification d''entreprise","startups"],"de":["Marktgrößenanalyse","Marktgröße","Total Addressable Market","Serviceable Available Market","Serviceable Obtainable Market","Marktopportunität","Geschäftsplanung","Startups"],"pt":["análise de tamanho de mercado","TAM","SAM","SOM","metodologias de análise de mercado","planejamento de negócios","captação de recursos","startups"],"ru":["анализ размера рынка","TAM","SAM","SOM","методологии анализа рынка","бизнес-планирование","привлечение средств","стартапы"],"ar":["تحليل حجم السوق","TAM","SAM","SOM","منهجيات تحليل السوق","تخطيط الأعمال","جذب الأموال","الشركات الناشئة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"market-sizing-analysis","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to calculate TAM, determine SAM, estimate SOM, size the market, calculate market opportunity, whats the total addressable market, or requests market sizing analysis for a startup or business opportunity.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Market Sizing Analysis\n\nComprehensive market sizing methodologies for calculating Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) for startup opportunities.\n\n## Overview\n\nMarket sizing provides the foundation for startup strategy, fundraising, and business planning. Calculate market opportunity using three complementary methodologies: top-down (industry reports), bottom-up (customer segment calculations), and value theory (willingness","body":"# Market Sizing Analysis\n\nComprehensive market sizing methodologies for calculating Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) for startup opportunities.\n\n## Overview\n\nMarket sizing provides the foundation for startup strategy, fundraising, and business planning. Calculate market opportunity using three complementary methodologies: top-down (industry reports), bottom-up (customer segment calculations), and value theory (willingness to pay).\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### The Three-Tier Market Framework\n\n**TAM (Total Addressable Market)**\n\n- Total revenue opportunity if achieving 100% market share\n- Defines the universe of potential customers\n- Used for long-term vision and market validation\n- Example: All email marketing software revenue globally\n\n**SAM (Serviceable Available Market)**\n\n- Portion of TAM targetable with current product/service\n- Accounts for geographic, segment, or capability constraints\n- Represents realistic addressable opportunity\n- Example: AI-powered email marketing for e-commerce in North America\n\n**SOM (Serviceable Obtainable Market)**\n\n- Realistic market share achievable in 3-5 years\n- Accounts for competition, resources, and market dynamics\n- Used for financial projections and fundraising\n- Example: 2-5% of SAM based on competitive landscape\n\n### When to Use Each Methodology\n\n**Top-Down Analysis**\n\n- Use when established market research exists\n- Best for mature, well-defined markets\n- Validates market existence and growth\n- Starts with industry reports and narrows down\n\n**Bottom-Up Analysis**\n\n- Use when targeting specific customer segments\n- Best for new or niche markets\n- Most credible for investors\n- Builds from customer data and pricing\n\n**Value Theory**\n\n- Use when creating new market categories\n- Best for disruptive innovations\n- Estimates based on value creation\n- Calculates willingness to pay for problem solution\n\n## Three-Methodology Framework\n\n### Methodology 1: Top-Down Analysis\n\nStart with total market size and narrow to addressable segments.\n\n**Process:**\n\n1. Identify total market category from research reports\n2. Apply geographic filters (target regions)\n3. Apply segment filters (target industries/customers)\n4. Calculate competitive positioning adjustments\n\n**Formula:**\n\n```\nTAM = Total Market Category Size\nSAM = TAM × Geographic % × Segment %\nSOM = SAM × Realistic Capture Rate (2-5%)\n```\n\n**When to use:** Established markets with available research (e.g., SaaS, fintech, e-commerce)\n\n**Strengths:** Quick, uses credible data, validates market existence\n\n**Limitations:** May overestimate for new categories, less granular\n\n### Methodology 2: Bottom-Up Analysis\n\nBuild market size from customer segment calculations.\n\n**Process:**\n\n1. Define target customer segments\n2. Estimate number of potential customers per segment\n3. Determine average revenue per customer\n4. Calculate realistic penetration rates\n\n**Formula:**\n\n```\nTAM = Σ (Segment Size × Annual Revenue per Customer)\nSAM = TAM × (Segments You Can Serve / Total Segments)\nSOM = SAM × Realistic Penetration Rate (Year 3-5)\n```\n\n**When to use:** B2B, niche markets, specific customer segments\n\n**Strengths:** Most credible for investors, granular, defensible\n\n**Limitations:** Requires detailed customer research, time-intensive\n\n### Methodology 3: Value Theory\n\nCalculate based on value created and willingness to pay.\n\n**Process:**\n\n1. Identify problem being solved\n2. Quantify current cost of problem (time, money, inefficiency)\n3. Calculate value of solution (savings, gains, efficiency)\n4. Estimate willingness to pay (typically 10-30% of value)\n5. Multiply by addressable customer base\n\n**Formula:**\n\n```\nValue per Customer = Problem Cost × % Solved by Solution\nPrice per Customer = Value × Willingness to Pay % (10-30%)\nTAM = Total Potential Customers × Price per Customer\nSAM = TAM × % Meeting Buy Criteria\nSOM = SAM × Realistic Adoption Rate\n```\n\n**When to use:** New categories, disruptive innovations, unclear existing markets\n\n**Strengths:** Shows value creation, works for new markets\n\n**Limitations:** Requires assumptions, harder to validate\n\n## Step-by-Step Process\n\n### Step 1: Define the Market\n\nClearly specify what market is being measured.\n\n**Questions to answer:**\n\n- What problem is being solved?\n- Who are the target customers?\n- What''s the product/service category?\n- What''s the geographic scope?\n- What''s the time horizon?\n\n**Example:**\n\n- Problem: E-commerce companies struggle with email marketing automation\n- Customers: E-commerce stores with >$1M annual revenue\n- Category: AI-powered email marketing software\n- Geography: North America initially, global expansion\n- Horizon: 3-5 year opportunity\n\n### Step 2: Gather Data Sources\n\nIdentify credible data for calculations.\n\n**Top-Down Sources:**\n\n- Industry research reports (Gartner, Forrester, IDC)\n- Government statistics (Census, BLS, trade associations)\n- Public company filings and earnings\n- Market research firms (Statista, CB Insights, PitchBook)\n\n**Bottom-Up Sources:**\n\n- Customer interviews and surveys\n- Sales data and CRM records\n- Industry databases (LinkedIn, ZoomInfo, Crunchbase)\n- Competitive intelligence\n- Academic research\n\n**Value Theory Sources:**\n\n- Customer problem quantification\n- Time/cost studies\n- ROI case studies\n- Pricing research and willingness-to-pay surveys\n\n### Step 3: Calculate TAM\n\nApply chosen methodology to determine total market.\n\n**For Top-Down:**\n\n1. Find total category size from research\n2. Document data source and year\n3. Apply growth rate if needed\n4. Validate with multiple sources\n\n**For Bottom-Up:**\n\n1. Count total potential customers\n2. Calculate average annual revenue per customer\n3. Multiply to get TAM\n4. Break down by segment\n\n**For Value Theory:**\n\n1. Quantify total addressable customer base\n2. Calculate value per customer\n3. Estimate pricing based on value\n4. Multiply for TAM\n\n### Step 4: Calculate SAM\n\nNarrow TAM to serviceable addressable market.\n\n**Apply Filters:**\n\n- Geographic constraints (regions you can serve)\n- Product limitations (features you currently have)\n- Customer requirements (size, industry, use case)\n- Distribution channel access\n- Regulatory or compliance restrictions\n\n**Formula:**\n\n```\nSAM = TAM × (% matching all filters)\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n- TAM: $10B global email marketing\n- Geographic filter: 40% (North America)\n- Product filter: 30% (e-commerce focus)\n- Feature filter: 60% (need AI capabilities)\n- SAM = $10B × 0.40 × 0.30 × 0.60 = $720M\n\n### Step 5: Calculate SOM\n\nDetermine realistic obtainable market share.\n\n**Consider:**\n\n- Current market share of competitors\n- Typical market share for new entrants (2-5%)\n- Resources available (funding, team, time)\n- Go-to-market effectiveness\n- Competitive advantages\n- Time to achieve (3-5 years typically)\n\n**Conservative Approach:**\n\n```\nSOM (Year 3) = SAM × 2%\nSOM (Year 5) = SAM × 5%\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n- SAM: $720M\n- Year 3 SOM: $720M × 2% = $14.4M\n- Year 5 SOM: $720M × 5% = $36M\n\n### Step 6: Validate and Triangulate\n\nCross-check using multiple methods.\n\n**Validation Techniques:**\n\n1. Compare top-down and bottom-up results (should be within 30%)\n2. Check against public company revenues in space\n3. Validate customer count assumptions\n4. Sense-check pricing assumptions\n5. Review with industry experts\n6. Compare to similar market categories\n\n**Red Flags:**\n\n- TAM that''s too small (< $1B for VC-backed startups)\n- TAM that''s too large (unsupported by data)\n- SOM that''s too aggressive (> 10% in 5 years for new entrant)\n- Inconsistency between methodologies (> 50% difference)\n\n## Industry-Specific Considerations\n\n### SaaS Markets\n\n**Key Metrics:**\n\n- Number of potential businesses in target segment\n- Average contract value (ACV)\n- Typical market penetration rates\n- Expansion revenue potential\n\n**TAM Calculation:**\n\n```\nTAM = Total Target Companies × Average ACV × (1 + Expansion Rate)\n```\n\n### Marketplace Markets\n\n**Key Metrics:**\n\n- Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) of category\n- Take rate (% of GMV you capture)\n- Total transactions or users\n\n**TAM Calculation:**\n\n```\nTAM = Total Category GMV × Expected Take Rate\n```\n\n### Consumer Markets\n\n**Key Metrics:**\n\n- Total addressable users/households\n- Average revenue per user (ARPU)\n- Engagement frequency\n\n**TAM Calculation:**\n\n```\nTAM = Total Users × ARPU × Purchase Frequency per Year\n```\n\n### B2B Services\n\n**Key Metrics:**\n\n- Number of target companies by size/industry\n- Average project value or retainer\n- Typical buying frequency\n\n**TAM Calculation:**\n\n```\nTAM = Total Target Companies × Average Deal Size × Deals per Year\n```\n\n## Presenting Market Sizing\n\n### For Investors\n\n**Structure:**\n\n1. Market definition and problem scope\n2. TAM/SAM/SOM with methodology\n3. Data sources and assumptions\n4. Growth projections and drivers\n5. Competitive landscape context\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Lead with bottom-up calculation (most credible)\n- Show triangulation with top-down\n- Explain conservative assumptions\n- Link to revenue projections\n- Highlight market growth rate\n\n### For Strategy\n\n**Structure:**\n\n1. Addressable customer segments\n2. Prioritization by opportunity size\n3. Entry strategy by segment\n4. Expected penetration timeline\n5. Resource requirements\n\n**Key Points:**\n\n- Focus on SAM and SOM\n- Show segment-level detail\n- Connect to go-to-market plan\n- Identify expansion opportunities\n- Discuss competitive positioning\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n**Mistake 1: Confusing TAM with SAM**\n\n- Don''t claim entire market as addressable\n- Apply realistic product/geographic constraints\n- Be honest about serviceable market\n\n**Mistake 2: Overly Aggressive SOM**\n\n- New entrants rarely capture > 5% in 5 years\n- Account for competition and resources\n- Show realistic ramp timeline\n\n**Mistake 3: Using Only Top-Down**\n\n- Investors prefer bottom-up validation\n- Top-down alone lacks credibility\n- Always triangulate with multiple methods\n\n**Mistake 4: Cherry-Picking Data**\n\n- Use consistent, recent data sources\n- Don''t mix methodologies inappropriately\n- Document all assumptions clearly\n\n**Mistake 5: Ignoring Market Dynamics**\n\n- Account for market growth/decline\n- Consider competitive intensity\n- Factor in switching costs and barriers\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\nFor detailed methodologies and frameworks:\n\n- **`references/methodology-deep-dive.md`** - Comprehensive guide to each methodology with step-by-step worksheets\n- **`references/data-sources.md`** - Curated list of market research sources, databases, and tools\n- **`references/industry-templates.md`** - Specific templates for SaaS, marketplace, consumer, B2B, and fintech markets\n\n### Example Files\n\nWorking examples with complete calculations:\n\n- **`examples/saas-market-sizing.md`** - Complete TAM/SAM/SOM for a B2B SaaS product\n- **`examples/marketplace-sizing.md`** - Marketplace platform market opportunity calculation\n- **`examples/value-theory-example.md`** - Value-based market sizing for disruptive innovation\n\nUse these examples as templates for your own market sizing analysis. Each includes real numbers, data sources, and assumptions documented clearly.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo perform market sizing analysis:\n\n1. **Define the market** - Problem, customers, category, geography\n2. **Choose methodology** - Bottom-up (preferred) or top-down + triangulation\n3. **Gather data** - Industry reports, customer data, competitive intelligence\n4. **Calculate TAM** - Apply methodology formula\n5. **Narrow to SAM** - Apply product, geographic, segment filters\n6. **Estimate SOM** - 2-5% realistic capture rate\n7. **Validate** - Cross-check with alternative methods\n8. **Document** - Show methodology, sources, assumptions\n9. **Present** - Structure for audience (investors, strategy, operations)\n\nFor detailed step-by-step guidance on each methodology, reference the files in `references/` directory. For complete worked examples, see `examples/` directory.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:37:15.183Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Strategy Agents requiring advanced market analysis capabilities for calculating Total Addressable Market (TAM), Serviceable Available Market (SAM), and Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM).","zh":"适用于需要高级市场分析能力的商业策略代理，用于计算总可寻址市场（TAM）、可服务可用市场（SAM）和可服务可获得市场（SOM）。","ja":"高度な市場分析機能を必要とするビジネス戦略エージェントに適しており、Total Addressable Market（TAM）、Serviceable Available Market（SAM）、Serviceable Obtainable Market（SOM）を計算できます。","ko":"전체 주소 가능 시장(TAM), 서비스 가능한 사용 가능한 시장(SAM), 서비스 가능한 얻을 수 있는 시장(SOM)을 계산하는 고급 시장 분석 기능을 필요로 하는 비즈니스 전략 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de estrategia empresarial que requieren capacidades de análisis de mercado avanzadas para calcular el Mercado Direccionable Total (TAM), el Mercado Disponible Servible (SAM) y el Mercado Obtensible Servible (SOM).","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de stratégie d''entreprise nécessitant des capacités d''analyse de marché avancées pour calculer le Marché Abordable Total (TAM), le Marché Disponible Serviceable (SAM) et le Marché Serviceable Obtensible (SOM).","de":"Ideal für Geschäftsstrategieagenten, die erweiterte Marktanalysefähigkeiten für die Berechnung des gesamten adressierbaren Marktes (TAM), des verfügbaren servicebaren Marktes (SAM) und des servicebaren erreichbaren Marktes (SOM) benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Estratégia de Negócios que requerem capacidades avançadas de análise de mercado para calcular o Mercado Total Endereçável (TAM), Mercado Disponível Serviço (SAM) e Mercado Obtenível Serviço (SOM).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-стратегии, требующих продвинутых возможностей анализа рынка для расчета общего адресуемого рынка (TAM), обслуживаемого доступного рынка (SAM) и обслуживаемого достижимого рынка (SOM).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء استراتيجية الأعمال الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من التحليل السوقي لحساب السوق الكلي القابل للعناوين (TAM) ، والسوق المتاحة الخدمية (SAM) ، والسوق القابل للخدمة (SOM)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct comprehensive market sizing using top-down, bottom-up, and value theory methodologies, providing actionable insights for startup opportunities and business planning through industry reports and customer segment calculations.","zh":"赋予代理商使用自上而下、自下而上和价值理论方法进行全面市场规模分析的能力，通过行业报告和客户细分计算提供可行的见解，用于启动机会和业务规划。","ja":"エージェントがトップダウン、ボトムアップ、価値理論の方法論を使用して包括的な市場サイズ分析を実行できるようにし、業界レポートと顧客セグメントの計算を通じてスタートアップの機会とビジネス計画のための実行可能な洞察を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 상향식, 하향식 및 가치 이론 방법론을 사용하여 포괄적인 시장 규모 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 산업 보고서 및 고객 세분화 계산을 통해 스타트업 기회 및 비즈니스 계획을 위한 실행 가능한 통찰력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un tamaño de mercado integral utilizando metodologías de arriba hacia abajo, de abajo hacia arriba y de teoría del valor, proporcionando conocimientos aprovechables para oportunidades de inicio y planificación empresarial a través de informes de la industria y cálculos de segmentos de clientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser une taille de marché complète en utilisant des méthodologies de haut en bas, de bas en haut et de théorie de la valeur, fournissant des connaissances exploitables pour les opportunités de démarrage et la planification commerciale via des rapports d''industrie et des calculs de segments de clients.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine umfassende Marktbewertung durchzuführen, indem sie Methoden von oben nach unten, von unten nach oben und die Werttheorie verwenden, um handhabbare Erkenntnisse für Startchancen und Geschäftsplanung durch Branchenberichte und Kundensegmentberechnungen bereitzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar um dimensionamento de mercado abrangente utilizando metodologias de cima para baixo, de baixo para cima e teoria de valor, fornecendo insights ações para oportunidades de startup e planejamento de negócios por meio de relatórios de indústria e cálculos de segmentos de clientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всестороннее определение размера рынка с использованием методологий сверху вниз, снизу вверх и теории стоимости, предоставляя действия, дающие представление для возможностей стартапов и бизнес-планирования посредством отчетов отрасли и расчетов сегментов клиентов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إجراء تحديد حجم سوق شامل باستخدام منهجيات من العلوي إلى السفلي ومن السفلي إلى العلوي ونظرية القيمة ، وتقديم رؤى قابلة للتنفيذ لفرص بدء التشغيل والتخطيط التجاري من خلال تقارير الصناعة وحسابات قطاعات العملاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Calculating Total Addressable Market (TAM) for startup fundraising","Analyzing Serviceable Available Market (SAM) for business strategy development","Estimating Serviceable Obtainable Market (SOM) for market expansion planning"],"zh":["用于启动资金筹集的总可寻址市场（TAM）计算","用于商业策略开发的可服务可用市场（SAM）分析","用于市场扩张规划的可服务可获得市场（SOM）估算"],"ja":["スタートアップの資金調達のためのTotal Addressable Market（TAM）の計算","ビジネス戦略開発のためのServiceable Available Market（SAM）の分析","市場拡大計画のためのServiceable Obtainable Market（SOM）の推定"],"ko":["시작アップ 자금 조달을 위한 전체 주소 가능 시장(TAM) 계산","비즈니스 전략 개발을 위한 서비스 가능한 사용 가능한 시장(SAM) 분석","시장 확장 계획을 위한 서비스 가능한 얻을 수 있는 시장(SOM) 추정"],"es":["Calcular el Mercado Direccionable Total (TAM) para la recaudación de fondos de inicio","Analizar el Mercado Disponible Servible (SAM) para el desarrollo de la estrategia empresarial","Estimar el Mercado Obtensible Servible (SOM) para la planificación de la expansión del mercado"],"fr":["Calculer le Marché Abordable Total (TAM) pour le financement des startups","Analyser le Marché Disponible Serviceable (SAM) pour le développement de la stratégie d''entreprise","Estimer le Marché Serviceable Obtensible (SOM) pour la planification de l''expansion du marché"],"de":["Berechnen des gesamten adressierbaren Marktes (TAM) für die Startup-Finanzierung","Analyse des verfügbaren servicebaren Marktes (SAM) für die Entwicklung der Geschäftsstrategie","Schätzen des servicebaren erreichbaren Marktes (SOM) für die Markterweiterungsplanung"],"pt":["Calculando o Mercado Total Endereçável (TAM) para captação de recursos para startups","Analisando o Mercado Disponível Serviço (SAM) para desenvolvimento de estratégia de negócios","Estimando o Mercado Obtenível Serviço (SOM) para planejamento de expansão de mercado"],"ru":["Расчет общего адресуемого рынка (TAM) для привлечения средств для стартапов","Анализ обслуживаемого доступного рынка (SAM) для разработки бизнес-стратегии","Оценка обслуживаемого достижимого рынка (SOM) для планирования расширения рынка"],"ar":["حساب السوق الكلي القابل للعناوين (TAM) لجمع التمويل لبدء التشغيل","تحليل السوق المتاحة الخدمية (SAM) لتطوير استراتيجية الأعمال","تقدير السوق القابل للخدمة (SOM) لتخطيط توسيع السوق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to industry reports and market data","Assumes knowledge of market analysis principles and terminology"],"zh":["需要访问行业报告和市场数据","假设了解市场分析原则和术语"],"ja":["業界レポートと市場データへのアクセスが必要","市場分析の原則と用語の知識が必要"],"ko":["산업 보고서 및 시장 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","시장 분석 원칙 및 용어에 대한 지식이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a informes de la industria y datos de mercado","Supone conocimiento de los principios y la terminología del análisis de mercado"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des rapports d''industrie et à des données de marché","Suppose une connaissance des principes et de la terminologie de l''analyse de marché"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugang zu Branchenberichten und Marktdaten","Geht von der Kenntnis der Grundsätze und Terminologie der Marktanalyse aus"],"pt":["Requer acesso a relatórios de indústria e dados de mercado","Pressupõe conhecimento dos princípios e terminologia de análise de mercado"],"ru":["Требует доступа к отчетам отрасли и рыночным данным","Предполагает знание принципов и терминологии рыночной аналитики"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تقارير الصناعة والبيانات السوقية","يفترض kiến​​ العارف بمبادئ وترميز التحليل السوقي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/documentation-templates', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'agent-bridge-kit', 'HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit', 'documentation-templates', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z', '2026-02-18T13:37:28.490Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit/documentation-templates","name":"documentation-templates","description":{"zh":"文档模板工具用于转换Antigravity IDE配置，支持GitHub Copilot、Cursor等IDE和Kiro、OpenCode等CLI","ja":"ドキュメントテンプレートツールは、Antigravity IDE設定をGitHub Copilot、CursorなどIDEとKiro、OpenCodeなどCLIと互換性のある形式に変換するために使用されます","ko":"문서 템플릿 도구는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등 IDE 및 Kiro, OpenCode 등 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Las plantillas de documentación ofrecen estructuras y guías para la documentación de proyectos de software","fr":"Les modèles de documentation offrent des structures et des guides pour la documentation de projets de logiciel","de":"Die Dokumentationsvorlagen bieten Strukturen und Richtlinien für die Dokumentation von Softwareprojekten","pt":"O recurso de modelos de documentação fornece diretrizes de estrutura para tipos comuns de documentação, incluindo README e API Reference","ru":"Функция шаблонов документации предоставляет рекомендации по структуре для общих типов документации, включая README и API Reference","ar":"ميزة قوالب التوثيق توفر إرشادات هيكل للتوثيق الشائع، بما في ذلك README و API Reference","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"文档模板工具 - 转换Antigravity IDE配置","ja":"ドキュメントテンプレートツール - Antigravity IDE設定の変換","ko":"문서 템플릿 도구 - Antigravity IDE 설정 변환","es":"Plantillas de Documentación para Desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles de Documentation pour Développeurs","de":"Dokumentationsvorlagen für Entwickler","pt":"Modelos de Documentação para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Шаблоны документации для разработчиков","ar":"قوالب توثيق للمطورين","en":"documentation-templates"},"description":{"zh":"文档模板工具用于转换Antigravity IDE配置，支持GitHub Copilot、Cursor等IDE和Kiro、OpenCode等CLI","ja":"ドキュメントテンプレートツールは、Antigravity IDE設定をGitHub Copilot、CursorなどIDEとKiro、OpenCodeなどCLIと互換性のある形式に変換するために使用されます","ko":"문서 템플릿 도구는 Antigravity IDE 설정을 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등 IDE 및 Kiro, OpenCode 등 CLI와 호환되는 형식으로 변환하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Las plantillas de documentación ofrecen estructuras y guías para la documentación de proyectos de software","fr":"Les modèles de documentation offrent des structures et des guides pour la documentation de projets de logiciel","de":"Die Dokumentationsvorlagen bieten Strukturen und Richtlinien für die Dokumentation von Softwareprojekten","pt":"O recurso de modelos de documentação fornece diretrizes de estrutura para tipos comuns de documentação, incluindo README e API Reference","ru":"Функция шаблонов документации предоставляет рекомендации по структуре для общих типов документации, включая README и API Reference","ar":"ميزة قوالب التوثيق توفر إرشادات هيكل للتوثيق الشائع، بما في ذلك README و API Reference","en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro..."},"definition":{"en":"Tool for converting Agent, Skill and Workfows configurations from Antigravity IDE to a format compatible with IDEs (GitHub Copilot, Cursor,..) and CLIs (Kiro, OpenCode,..)."},"features":{"zh":["支持GitHub Copilot、Cursor等IDE","支持Kiro、OpenCode等CLI","提供README结构和模板","支持快速开始和配置","提供API参考和贡献指南"],"ja":["GitHub Copilot、CursorなどIDEをサポート","Kiro、OpenCodeなどCLIをサポート","README構造とテンプレートを提供","クイックスタートと設定をサポート","APIリファレンスと貢献ガイドを提供"],"ko":["GitHub Copilot, Cursor 등 IDE 지원","Kiro, OpenCode 등 CLI 지원","README 구조 및 템플릿 제공","快速 시작 및 설정 지원","API 참조 및 기여 가이드 제공"],"es":["Estructura de archivo README estandarizada","Secciones esenciales p