자는 효율적이고 확장 가능한 저장소를 구축하여 코드 공유와 일관된 툴링을 달성할 수 있습니다","es":"La gestión de monorepo permite a los desarrolladores crear proyectos escalables y eficientes con un enfoque en la colaboración y la reducción de la complejidad","fr":"La gestion de monorepo permet aux développeurs de créer des projets évolutifs et efficaces avec un focus sur la collaboration et la réduction de la complexité","de":"Die Monorepo-Verwaltung ermöglicht es Entwicklern, skalierbare und effiziente Projekte mit einem Fokus auf Zusammenarbeit und Komplexitätsreduzierung zu erst...","pt":"O gerenciamento de monorepo permite a criação de repositórios escaláveis e eficientes, com compartilhamento de código e ferramentas consistentes.","ru":"Управление монорепозиторием позволяет создавать масштабируемые и эффективные репозитории, с разделением кода и последовательными инструментами.","ar":"إدارة مونوربو تمكن من إنشاء مستودعات قابلة للتوسعة والفعالة، مع مشاركة الكود وأدوات متسقة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["代码共享和重用","一致的工具和工作流","原子性的变更和版本控制","CI/CD集成和自动化","依赖管理和优化","调试和故障排除"],"ja":["コードの共有と再利用","一貫したツールとワークフロー","原子的な変更とバージョン管理","CI/CDの統合と自動化","依存関係の管理と最適化","デバッグとトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["코드 공유와 재사용","일관된 툴링과 워크플로","원자적인 변경과 버전 관리","CI/CD 통합과 자동화","의존성 관리와 최적화","디버깅과 문제 해결"],"es":["Configuración de nuevos proyectos de monorepo","Migración de multi-repo a monorepo","Optimización del rendimiento de compilación y pruebas","Gestión de dependencias compartidas","Implementación de estrategias de compartición de código","Configuración de CI/CD para monorepos"],"fr":["Configuration de nouveaux projets de monorepo","Migration de multi-repo à monorepo","Optimisation des performances de compilation et de tests","Gestion des dépendances partagées","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de partage de code","Configuration de CI/CD pour les monorepos"],"de":["Konfiguration neuer Monorepo-Projekte","Migration von Multi-Repo zu Monorepo","Optimierung der Build- und Testleistung","Verwaltung von gemeinsamen Abhängigkeiten","Implementierung von Code-Teilungsstrategien","Konfiguration von CI/CD für Monorepos"],"pt":["Compartilhamento de código","Ferramentas consistentes","Melhoria da produtividade","Otimização do desempenho","Gerenciamento de dependências","Implementação de estratégias de compartilhamento de código"],"ru":["Разделение кода","Последовательные инструменты","Улучшение производительности","Оптимизация производительности","Управление зависимостями","Реализация стратегий разделения кода"],"ar":["مشاركة الكود","أدوات متسقة","تحسين الإنتاجية","تحسين الأداء","إدارة التبعيات","تنفيذ استراتيجيات مشاركة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mono仓库","代码共享","一致的工具","原子性的变更","CI/CD","依赖管理","调试","版本控制","代码重用"],"ja":["モノレポ","コードの共有","一貫したツール","原子的な変更","CI/CD","依存関係の管理","デバッグ","バージョン管理","コードの再利用"],"ko":["모노레포","코드 공유","일관된 툴링","원자적인 변경","CI/CD","의존성 관리","디버깅","버전 관리","코드 재사용"],"es":["monorepo","gestión de monorepo","desarrollo de software","colaboración en equipo","reducción de complejidad","escalabilidad","eficiencia","CI/CD","compartición de código"],"fr":["monorepo","gestion de monorepo","développement de logiciels","collaboration d''équipe","réduction de complexité","évolutivité","efficacité","CI/CD","partage de code"],"de":["monorepo","monorepo-verwaltung","software-entwicklung","teamzusammenarbeit","komplexitätsreduzierung","skalierbarkeit","effizienz","CI/CD","code-teilung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de monorepo","compartilhamento de código","ferramentas consistentes","produtividade","otimização de desempenho","desenvolvimento de software","repositórios escaláveis"],"ru":["управление монорепозиторием","разделение кода","последовательные инструменты","производительность","оптимизация производительности","разработка программного обеспечения","масштабируемые репозитории"],"ar":["إدارة مونوربو","مشاركة الكود","أدوات متسقة","الإنتاجية","تحسين الأداء","تطوير البرمجيات","مستودعات قابلة للتوسعة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monorepo-management","description":"Master monorepo management with Turborepo, Nx, and pnpm workspaces to build efficient, scalable multi-package repositories with optimized builds and dependency management. Use when setting up monorepos, optimizing builds, or managing shared dependencies.","bodyPreview":"# Monorepo Management\n\nBuild efficient, scalable monorepos that enable code sharing, consistent tooling, and atomic changes across multiple packages and applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new monorepo projects\n- Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo\n- Optimizing build and test performance\n- Managing shared dependencies\n- Implementing code sharing strategies\n- Setting up CI/CD for monorepos\n- Versioning and publishing packages\n- Debugging monorepo-specific issues\n\n## Core Conc","body":"# Monorepo Management\n\nBuild efficient, scalable monorepos that enable code sharing, consistent tooling, and atomic changes across multiple packages and applications.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up new monorepo projects\n- Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo\n- Optimizing build and test performance\n- Managing shared dependencies\n- Implementing code sharing strategies\n- Setting up CI/CD for monorepos\n- Versioning and publishing packages\n- Debugging monorepo-specific issues\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Why Monorepos?\n\n**Advantages:**\n\n- Shared code and dependencies\n- Atomic commits across projects\n- Consistent tooling and standards\n- Easier refactoring\n- Simplified dependency management\n- Better code visibility\n\n**Challenges:**\n\n- Build performance at scale\n- CI/CD complexity\n- Access control\n- Large Git repository\n\n### 2. Monorepo Tools\n\n**Package Managers:**\n\n- pnpm workspaces (recommended)\n- npm workspaces\n- Yarn workspaces\n\n**Build Systems:**\n\n- Turborepo (recommended for most)\n- Nx (feature-rich, complex)\n- Lerna (older, maintenance mode)\n\n## Turborepo Setup\n\n### Initial Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create new monorepo\nnpx create-turbo@latest my-monorepo\ncd my-monorepo\n\n# Structure:\n# apps/\n#   web/          - Next.js app\n#   docs/         - Documentation site\n# packages/\n#   ui/           - Shared UI components\n#   config/       - Shared configurations\n#   tsconfig/     - Shared TypeScript configs\n# turbo.json      - Turborepo configuration\n# package.json    - Root package.json\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```json\n// turbo.json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://turbo.build/schema.json\",\n  \"globalDependencies\": [\"**/.env.*local\"],\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\", \"!.next/cache/**\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"coverage/**\"]\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"outputs\": []\n    },\n    \"dev\": {\n      \"cache\": false,\n      \"persistent\": true\n    },\n    \"type-check\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": []\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n```json\n// package.json (root)\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-monorepo\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"workspaces\": [\"apps/*\", \"packages/*\"],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"turbo run build\",\n    \"dev\": \"turbo run dev\",\n    \"test\": \"turbo run test\",\n    \"lint\": \"turbo run lint\",\n    \"format\": \"prettier --write \\\"**/*.{ts,tsx,md}\\\"\",\n    \"clean\": \"turbo run clean && rm -rf node_modules\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"turbo\": \"^1.10.0\",\n    \"prettier\": \"^3.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@8.0.0\"\n}\n```\n\n### Package Structure\n\n```json\n// packages/ui/package.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"@repo/ui\",\n  \"version\": \"0.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"main\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"import\": \"./dist/index.js\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/index.d.ts\"\n    },\n    \"./button\": {\n      \"import\": \"./dist/button.js\",\n      \"types\": \"./dist/button.d.ts\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsup src/index.ts --format esm,cjs --dts\",\n    \"dev\": \"tsup src/index.ts --format esm,cjs --dts --watch\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint src/\",\n    \"type-check\": \"tsc --noEmit\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@repo/tsconfig\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"tsup\": \"^7.0.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"^18.2.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## pnpm Workspaces\n\n### Setup\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - \"apps/*\"\n  - \"packages/*\"\n  - \"tools/*\"\n```\n\n```json\n// .npmrc\n# Hoist shared dependencies\nshamefully-hoist=true\n\n# Strict peer dependencies\nauto-install-peers=true\nstrict-peer-dependencies=true\n\n# Performance\nstore-dir=~/.pnpm-store\n```\n\n### Dependency Management\n\n```bash\n# Install dependency in specific package\npnpm add react --filter @repo/ui\npnpm add -D typescript --filter @repo/ui\n\n# Install workspace dependency\npnpm add @repo/ui --filter web\n\n# Install in all packages\npnpm add -D eslint -w\n\n# Update all dependencies\npnpm update -r\n\n# Remove dependency\npnpm remove react --filter @repo/ui\n```\n\n### Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Run script in specific package\npnpm --filter web dev\npnpm --filter @repo/ui build\n\n# Run in all packages\npnpm -r build\npnpm -r test\n\n# Run in parallel\npnpm -r --parallel dev\n\n# Filter by pattern\npnpm --filter \"@repo/*\" build\npnpm --filter \"...web\" build  # Build web and dependencies\n```\n\n## Nx Monorepo\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\n# Create Nx monorepo\nnpx create-nx-workspace@latest my-org\n\n# Generate applications\nnx generate @nx/react:app my-app\nnx generate @nx/next:app my-next-app\n\n# Generate libraries\nnx generate @nx/react:lib ui-components\nnx generate @nx/js:lib utils\n```\n\n### Configuration\n\n```json\n// nx.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"nx/presets/npm.json\",\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/nx/schemas/nx-schema.json\",\n  \"targetDefaults\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"inputs\": [\"production\", \"^production\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"^production\", \"{workspaceRoot}/jest.preset.js\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    },\n    \"lint\": {\n      \"inputs\": [\"default\", \"{workspaceRoot}/.eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"cache\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"namedInputs\": {\n    \"default\": [\"{projectRoot}/**/*\", \"sharedGlobals\"],\n    \"production\": [\n      \"default\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/**/?(*.)+(spec|test).[jt]s?(x)?(.snap)\",\n      \"!{projectRoot}/tsconfig.spec.json\"\n    ],\n    \"sharedGlobals\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Running Tasks\n\n```bash\n# Run task for specific project\nnx build my-app\nnx test ui-components\nnx lint utils\n\n# Run for affected projects\nnx affected:build\nnx affected:test --base=main\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnx graph\n\n# Run in parallel\nnx run-many --target=build --all --parallel=3\n```\n\n## Shared Configurations\n\n### TypeScript Configuration\n\n```json\n// packages/tsconfig/base.json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"incremental\": true,\n    \"declaration\": true\n  },\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\"]\n}\n\n// packages/tsconfig/react.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"./base.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"]\n  }\n}\n\n// apps/web/tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"@repo/tsconfig/react.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n### ESLint Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// packages/config/eslint-preset.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [\n    \"eslint:recommended\",\n    \"plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended\",\n    \"plugin:react/recommended\",\n    \"plugin:react-hooks/recommended\",\n    \"prettier\",\n  ],\n  plugins: [\"@typescript-eslint\", \"react\", \"react-hooks\"],\n  parser: \"@typescript-eslint/parser\",\n  parserOptions: {\n    ecmaVersion: 2022,\n    sourceType: \"module\",\n    ecmaFeatures: {\n      jsx: true,\n    },\n  },\n  settings: {\n    react: {\n      version: \"detect\",\n    },\n  },\n  rules: {\n    \"@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars\": \"error\",\n    \"react/react-in-jsx-scope\": \"off\",\n  },\n};\n\n// apps/web/.eslintrc.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  extends: [\"@repo/config/eslint-preset\"],\n  rules: {\n    // App-specific rules\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Code Sharing Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Shared UI Components\n\n```typescript\n// packages/ui/src/button.tsx\nimport * as React from ''react'';\n\nexport interface ButtonProps {\n  variant?: ''primary'' | ''secondary'';\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n  onClick?: () => void;\n}\n\nexport function Button({ variant = ''primary'', children, onClick }: ButtonProps) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className={`btn btn-${variant}`}\n      onClick={onClick}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n\n// packages/ui/src/index.ts\nexport { Button, type ButtonProps } from ''./button'';\nexport { Input, type InputProps } from ''./input'';\n\n// apps/web/src/app.tsx\nimport { Button } from ''@repo/ui'';\n\nexport function App() {\n  return <Button variant=\"primary\">Click me</Button>;\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Shared Utilities\n\n```typescript\n// packages/utils/src/string.ts\nexport function capitalize(str: string): string {\n  return str.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + str.slice(1);\n}\n\nexport function truncate(str: string, length: number): string {\n  return str.length > length ? str.slice(0, length) + \"...\" : str;\n}\n\n// packages/utils/src/index.ts\nexport * from \"./string\";\nexport * from \"./array\";\nexport * from \"./date\";\n\n// Usage in apps\nimport { capitalize, truncate } from \"@repo/utils\";\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Shared Types\n\n```typescript\n// packages/types/src/user.ts\nexport interface User {\n  id: string;\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n  role: \"admin\" | \"user\";\n}\n\nexport interface CreateUserInput {\n  email: string;\n  name: string;\n  password: string;\n}\n\n// Used in both frontend and backend\nimport type { User, CreateUserInput } from \"@repo/types\";\n```\n\n## Build Optimization\n\n### Turborepo Caching\n\n```json\n// turbo.json\n{\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      // Build depends on dependencies being built first\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n\n      // Cache these outputs\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\"],\n\n      // Cache based on these inputs (default: all files)\n      \"inputs\": [\"src/**/*.tsx\", \"src/**/*.ts\", \"package.json\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      // Run tests in parallel, don''t depend on build\n      \"cache\": true,\n      \"outputs\": [\"coverage/**\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Remote Caching\n\n```bash\n# Turborepo Remote Cache (Vercel)\nnpx turbo login\nnpx turbo link\n\n# Custom remote cache\n# turbo.json\n{\n  \"remoteCache\": {\n    \"signature\": true,\n    \"enabled\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## CI/CD for Monorepos\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/ci.yml\nname: CI\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0 # For Nx affected commands\n\n      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2\n        with:\n          version: 8\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3\n        with:\n          node-version: 18\n          cache: \"pnpm\"\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n\n      - name: Build\n        run: pnpm turbo run build\n\n      - name: Test\n        run: pnpm turbo run test\n\n      - name: Lint\n        run: pnpm turbo run lint\n\n      - name: Type check\n        run: pnpm turbo run type-check\n```\n\n### Deploy Affected Only\n\n```yaml\n# Deploy only changed apps\n- name: Deploy affected apps\n  run: |\n    if pnpm nx affected:apps --base=origin/main --head=HEAD | grep -q \"web\"; then\n      echo \"Deploying web app\"\n      pnpm --filter web deploy\n    fi\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Consistent Versioning**: Lock dependency versions across workspace\n2. **Shared Configs**: Centralize ESLint, TypeScript, Prettier configs\n3. **Dependency Graph**: Keep it acyclic, avoid circular dependencies\n4. **Cache Effectively**: Configure inputs/outputs correctly\n5. **Type Safety**: Share types between frontend/backend\n6. **Testing Strategy**: Unit tests in packages, E2E in apps\n7. **Documentation**: README in each package\n8. **Release Strategy**: Use changesets for versioning\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Circular Dependencies**: A depends on B, B depends on A\n- **Phantom Dependencies**: Using deps not in package.json\n- **Incorrect Cache Inputs**: Missing files in Turborepo inputs\n- **Over-Sharing**: Sharing code that should be separate\n- **Under-Sharing**: Duplicating code across packages\n- **Large Monorepos**: Without proper tooling, builds slow down\n\n## Publishing Packages\n\n```bash\n# Using Changesets\npnpm add -Dw @changesets/cli\npnpm changeset init\n\n# Create changeset\npnpm changeset\n\n# Version packages\npnpm changeset version\n\n# Publish\npnpm changeset publish\n```\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/release.yml\n- name: Create Release Pull Request or Publish\n  uses: changesets/action@v1\n  with:\n    publish: pnpm release\n  env:\n    GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n    NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/turborepo-guide.md**: Comprehensive Turborepo documentation\n- **references/nx-guide.md**: Nx monorepo patterns\n- **references/pnpm-workspaces.md**: pnpm workspace features\n- **assets/monorepo-checklist.md**: Setup checklist\n- **assets/migration-guide.md**: Multi-repo to monorepo migration\n- **scripts/dependency-graph.ts**: Visualize package dependencies\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:38:22.256Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for DevOps and Infrastructure Agents orchestrating complex codebases with shared dependencies.","zh":"适用于DevOps和基础设施代理，负责编排具有共享依赖关系的复杂代码库。","ja":"DevOpsとインフラストラクチャエージェントが複雑なコードベースをオーケストレーションし、共有依存関係を持つ場合に不可欠です。","ko":"공유 종속성을 갖는 복잡한 코드베이스를 오케스트레이션하는 데브옵스 및 인프라 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de DevOps e Infraestructura que orquestan códigos complejos con dependencias compartidas.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents DevOps et Infrastructure orchestrant des bases de code complexes avec des dépendances partagées.","de":"Wesentlich für DevOps- und Infrastrukturagenten, die komplexe Codebasen mit gemeinsamen Abhängigkeiten orchestrieren.","pt":"Essencial para DevOps e Agents de Infraestrutura que orquestram codebases complexos com dependências compartilhadas.","ru":"Необходим для DevOps и агентов инфраструктуры, управляющих сложными кодовыми базами с общими зависимостями.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات DevOps ووكلاء البنية التحتية الذين يديرون قواعد رمزية معقدة مع تبعيات مشتركة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables atomic changes across multiple packages, optimizes build and test performance through advanced caching, and implements consistent tooling configurations. Provides critical capabilities for managing shared dependencies and implementing code sharing strategies in scalable monorepos.","zh":"实现多个软件包的原子性更改，通过高级缓存优化构建和测试性能，并实施一致的工具配置。为可扩展的单体仓库中管理共享依赖关系和实施代码共享策略提供了关键能力。","ja":"複数のパッケージをまたぐ原子的な変更を可能にし、高度なキャッシュを通じてビルドとテストのパフォーマンスを最適化し、一貫したツール設定を実施する。拡張可能なモノリポで共有依存関係を管理し、コード共有戦略を実装するための重要な機能を提供する。","ko":"여러 패키지에 걸친 원자적 변경을 가능하게 하며, 고급 캐시를 통해 빌드 및 테스트 성능을 최적화하고, 일관된 툴링 구성을 구현한다. 확장 가능한 모노리포에서 공유 종속성을 관리하고 코드 공유 전략을 구현하기 위한 중요한 기능을 제공한다.","es":"Habilita cambios atómicos en varios paquetes, optimiza el rendimiento de la compilación y las pruebas a través de una caché avanzada e implementa configuraciones de herramientas coherentes. Proporciona capacidades críticas para gestionar dependencias compartidas e implementar estrategias de intercambio de código en monorepos escalables.","fr":"Permet des modifications atomiques à travers plusieurs packages, optimise les performances de construction et de test via un cache avancé et met en œuvre des configurations d''outils cohérentes. Fournit des capacités critiques pour gérer les dépendances partagées et mettre en œuvre des stratégies de partage de code dans des monorepos escalables.","de":"Ermöglicht atomare Änderungen über mehrere Pakete, optimiert die Build- und Testleistung durch erweiterte Caching und implementiert konsistente Werkzeugkonfigurationen. Bietet kritische Fähigkeiten für die Verwaltung gemeinsamer Abhängigkeiten und die Implementierung von Code-Freigabestrategien in skalierbaren Monorepos.","pt":"Permite alterações atômicas em vários pacotes, otimiza o desempenho da compilação e do teste por meio de cache avançado e implementa configurações de ferramentas consistentes. Fornece capacidades críticas para gerenciar dependências compartilhadas e implementar estratégias de compartilhamento de código em monorepos escaláveis.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять атомарные изменения в нескольких пакетах, оптимизирует производительность сборки и тестирования за счет продвинутого кэширования и реализует последовательные конфигурации инструментов. Предоставляет критически важные возможности для управления общими зависимостями и реализации стратегий обмена кодом в масштабируемых монорепозиториях.","ar":"تمكن من التعديلات الذرية عبر حزم متعددة، ويتحسين أداء بناء الاختبار من خلال التخزين المؤقت المتقدم، وينفذ تكوينات أدوات متسقة. يوفر القدرات الحرجة لإدارة التبعيات المشتركة وتنفيذ استراتيجيات مشاركة الرمز في مستودعات مونو قابلة للتوسيع."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating from multi-repo to monorepo architecture","Setting up CI/CD pipelines for interdependent packages","Debugging monorepo-specific dependency resolution issues","Versioning and publishing coordinated package releases"],"zh":["从多仓库到单体仓库的迁移","为相互依赖的软件包设置CI/CD流水线","调试单体仓库特定的依赖关系解析问题","版本控制和发布协调的软件包版本"],"ja":["マルチリポジトリからモノリポジトリへの移行","相互依存するパッケージのCI/CDパイプラインの設定","モノリポジトリ固有の依存関係解決問題のデバッグ","調整されたパッケージリリースのバージョニングと公開"],"ko":["다중 저장소에서 단일 저장소로의 마이그레이션","상호 의존하는 패키지에 대한 CI/CD 파이프라인 설정","단일 저장소 특有的 종속성 해결 문제 디버깅","조정된 패키지 릴리스의 버저닝 및 발행"],"es":["Migrar de una arquitectura de multi-repo a monorepo","Configurar pipelines de CI/CD para paquetes interdependientes","Depurar problemas de resolución de dependencias específicos de monorepo","Versionar y publicar versiones de paquetes coordinadas"],"fr":["Migrer d''une architecture multi-repo à monorepo","Configurer des pipelines CI/CD pour des packages interdépendants","Déboguer les problèmes de résolution de dépendances spécifiques au monorepo","Versionner et publier des versions de packages coordonnées"],"de":["Von einer Multi-Repo- zu einer Monorepo-Architektur migrieren","CI/CD-Pipelines für interdependenten Pakete einrichten","Monorepo-spezifische Abhängigkeitsauflösungsprobleme debuggen","Koordinierte Paketversionen versionieren und veröffentlichen"],"pt":["Migrando de arquitetura multi-repo para monorepo","Configurando pipelines de CI/CD para pacotes interdependentes","Depurando problemas de resolução de dependência específicos do monorepo","Versão e publicação de lançamentos de pacotes coordenados"],"ru":["Миграция с архитектуры multi-repo на monorepo","Настройка конвейеров CI/CD для взаимозависимых пакетов","Отладка проблем с разрешением зависимостей, специфичных для монорепозитория","Версия и публикация скоординированных выпусков пакетов"],"ar":["الانتقال من هيكل متعدد المستودعات إلى هيكل مستودع واحد","تكوين خطوط أنابيب CI/CD للحزم التابعة","تصحيح أخطاء في حل التبعية الخاصة بمستودع مونو","إصدار ونشر إصدارات الحزم المنسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing project structure analysis","Performance optimization dependent on specific build tools","Dependency management complexity increases with scale"],"zh":["需要现有的项目结构分析","性能优化依赖于特定的构建工具","依赖管理复杂性会随着规模的增加而增加"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクト構造分析が必要","パフォーマンス最適化は特定のビルドツールに依存する","依存関係管理の複雑さは規模の増加とともに増加する"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트 구조 분석이 필요함","성능 최적화는 특정 빌드 도구에 의존함","의존성 관리 복잡도는 규모가 증가함에 따라 증가함"],"es":["Requiere un análisis existente de la estructura del proyecto","La optimización del rendimiento depende de herramientas de compilación específicas","La complejidad de la gestión de dependencias aumenta con la escala"],"fr":["Nécessite une analyse existante de la structure du projet","L''optimisation des performances dépend de outils de construction spécifiques","La complexité de la gestion des dépendances augmente avec la taille"],"de":["Benötigt eine vorhandene Analyse der Projektstruktur","Die Leistungsoptimierung hängt von spezifischen Build-Tools ab","Die Komplexität des Abhängigkeitsmanagements erhöht sich mit der Größe"],"pt":["Exige análise da estrutura do projeto existente","Otimização do desempenho dependente de ferramentas de compilação específicas","A complexidade do gerenciamento de dependências aumenta com a escala"],"ru":["Требует анализа существующей структуры проекта","Оптимизация производительности зависит от конкретных инструментов сборки","Сложность управления зависимостями увеличивается с масштабом"],"ar":["يتطلب تحليل هيكل المشروع الحالي","تحسين الأداء يعتمد على أدوات البناء المحددة","تزداد تعقيد إدارة التبعيات مع التوسع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
