,"다양한 개발 작업 지원"],"es":["Orquestación de tareas complejas","Compatibilidad con Antigravity IDE y otros entornos de desarrollo","Mejora de la eficiencia y la productividad","Soporte para múltiples expertos y dominios","Análisis de código desde diferentes perspectivas"],"fr":["Orchestration de tâches complexes","Compatibilité avec Antigravity IDE et d''autres environnements de développement","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la productivité","Support pour plusieurs experts et domaines","Analyse de code depuis différentes perspectives"],"de":["Orchestrierung von komplexen Aufgaben","Kompatibilität mit Antigravity IDE und anderen Entwicklungsumgebungen","Verbesserung der Effizienz und der Produktivität","Unterstützung für mehrere Experten und Domänen","Code-Analyse aus verschiedenen Perspektiven"],"pt":["Orquestração de tarefas complexas","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Controle total dentro do Antigravity","Análise de código de segurança, desempenho e qualidade","Revisões abrangentes de arquitetura"],"ru":["Оркестровка сложных задач","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Полный контроль внутри Antigravity","Анализ кода безопасности, производительности и качества","Комплексные обзоры архитектуры"],"ar":["تنسيق المهام المعقدة","التوافق مع IDE و CLI","التحكم الكامل داخل Antigravity","تحليل رمز الأمان والكفاءة والجودة","مراجعات شاملة للعمارة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["并行代理工具","Antigravity IDE","配置转换","开发工具","IDE","CLI","开发效率"],"ja":["パラレルエージェントツール","Antigravity IDE","設定変換","開発ツール","IDE","CLI","開発効率"],"ko":["병렬 에이전트 도구","Antigravity IDE","설정 변환","개발 도구","IDE","CLI","개발 효율성"],"es":["agentes paralelos","orquestación de tareas","Antigravity IDE","desarrollo de software","eficiencia y productividad","análisis de código"],"fr":["agents parallèles","orchestration de tâches","Antigravity IDE","développement de logiciels","efficacité et productivité","analyse de code"],"de":["parallele Agenten","Orchestrierung von Aufgaben","Antigravity IDE","Software-Entwicklung","Effizienz und Produktivität","Code-Analyse"],"pt":["agentes paralelos","orquestração de tarefas","Antigravity","IDE","CLI","análise de código","segurança","desempenho","qualidade"],"ru":["параллельные агенты","оркестровка задач","Antigravity","IDE","CLI","анализ кода","безопасность","производительность","качество"],"ar":["وكلاء متوازيون","تنسيق المهام","Antigravity","IDE","CLI","تحليل رمز","أمان","كفاءة","جودة"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"parallel-agents","description":"Multi-agent orchestration patterns. Use when multiple independent tasks can run with different domain expertise or when comprehensive analysis requires multiple perspectives.","bodyPreview":"# Native Parallel Agents\n\n> Orchestration through Antigravity''s built-in Agent Tool\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill enables coordinating multiple specialized agents through Antigravity''s native agent system. Unlike external scripts, this approach keeps all orchestration within Antigravity''s control.\n\n## When to Use Orchestration\n\n✅ **Good for:**\n- Complex tasks requiring multiple expertise domains\n- Code analysis from security, performance, and quality perspectives\n- Comprehensive reviews (architecture","body":"# Native Parallel Agents\n\n> Orchestration through Antigravity''s built-in Agent Tool\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill enables coordinating multiple specialized agents through Antigravity''s native agent system. Unlike external scripts, this approach keeps all orchestration within Antigravity''s control.\n\n## When to Use Orchestration\n\n✅ **Good for:**\n- Complex tasks requiring multiple expertise domains\n- Code analysis from security, performance, and quality perspectives\n- Comprehensive reviews (architecture + security + testing)\n- Feature implementation needing backend + frontend + database work\n\n❌ **Not for:**\n- Simple, single-domain tasks\n- Quick fixes or small changes\n- Tasks where one agent suffices\n\n---\n\n## Native Agent Invocation\n\n### Single Agent\n```\nUse the security-auditor agent to review authentication\n```\n\n### Sequential Chain\n```\nFirst, use the explorer-agent to discover project structure.\nThen, use the backend-specialist to review API endpoints.\nFinally, use the test-engineer to identify test gaps.\n```\n\n### With Context Passing\n```\nUse the frontend-specialist to analyze React components.\nBased on those findings, have the test-engineer generate component tests.\n```\n\n### Resume Previous Work\n```\nResume agent [agentId] and continue with additional requirements.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Orchestration Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Comprehensive Analysis\n```\nAgents: explorer-agent → [domain-agents] → synthesis\n\n1. explorer-agent: Map codebase structure\n2. security-auditor: Security posture\n3. backend-specialist: API quality\n4. frontend-specialist: UI/UX patterns\n5. test-engineer: Test coverage\n6. Synthesize all findings\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Feature Review\n```\nAgents: affected-domain-agents → test-engineer\n\n1. Identify affected domains (backend? frontend? both?)\n2. Invoke relevant domain agents\n3. test-engineer verifies changes\n4. Synthesize recommendations\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Security Audit\n```\nAgents: security-auditor → penetration-tester → synthesis\n\n1. security-auditor: Configuration and code review\n2. penetration-tester: Active vulnerability testing\n3. Synthesize with prioritized remediation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Available Agents\n\n| Agent | Expertise | Trigger Phrases |\n|-------|-----------|-----------------|\n| `orchestrator` | Coordination | \"comprehensive\", \"multi-perspective\" |\n| `security-auditor` | Security | \"security\", \"auth\", \"vulnerabilities\" |\n| `penetration-tester` | Security Testing | \"pentest\", \"red team\", \"exploit\" |\n| `backend-specialist` | Backend | \"API\", \"server\", \"Node.js\", \"Express\" |\n| `frontend-specialist` | Frontend | \"React\", \"UI\", \"components\", \"Next.js\" |\n| `test-engineer` | Testing | \"tests\", \"coverage\", \"TDD\" |\n| `devops-engineer` | DevOps | \"deploy\", \"CI/CD\", \"infrastructure\" |\n| `database-architect` | Database | \"schema\", \"Prisma\", \"migrations\" |\n| `mobile-developer` | Mobile | \"React Native\", \"Flutter\", \"mobile\" |\n| `api-designer` | API Design | \"REST\", \"GraphQL\", \"OpenAPI\" |\n| `debugger` | Debugging | \"bug\", \"error\", \"not working\" |\n| `explorer-agent` | Discovery | \"explore\", \"map\", \"structure\" |\n| `documentation-writer` | Documentation | \"write docs\", \"create README\", \"generate API docs\" |\n| `performance-optimizer` | Performance | \"slow\", \"optimize\", \"profiling\" |\n| `project-planner` | Planning | \"plan\", \"roadmap\", \"milestones\" |\n| `seo-specialist` | SEO | \"SEO\", \"meta tags\", \"search ranking\" |\n| `game-developer` | Game Development | \"game\", \"Unity\", \"Godot\", \"Phaser\" |\n\n---\n\n## Antigravity Built-in Agents\n\nThese work alongside custom agents:\n\n| Agent | Model | Purpose |\n|-------|-------|---------|\n| **Explore** | Haiku | Fast read-only codebase search |\n| **Plan** | Sonnet | Research during plan mode |\n| **General-purpose** | Sonnet | Complex multi-step modifications |\n\nUse **Explore** for quick searches, **custom agents** for domain expertise.\n\n---\n\n## Synthesis Protocol\n\nAfter all agents complete, synthesize:\n\n```markdown\n## Orchestration Synthesis\n\n### Task Summary\n[What was accomplished]\n\n### Agent Contributions\n| Agent | Finding |\n|-------|---------|\n| security-auditor | Found X |\n| backend-specialist | Identified Y |\n\n### Consolidated Recommendations\n1. **Critical**: [Issue from Agent A]\n2. **Important**: [Issue from Agent B]\n3. **Nice-to-have**: [Enhancement from Agent C]\n\n### Action Items\n- [ ] Fix critical security issue\n- [ ] Refactor API endpoint\n- [ ] Add missing tests\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Available agents** - 17 specialized agents can be orchestrated\n2. **Logical order** - Discovery → Analysis → Implementation → Testing\n3. **Share context** - Pass relevant findings to subsequent agents\n4. **Single synthesis** - One unified report, not separate outputs\n5. **Verify changes** - Always include test-engineer for code modifications\n\n---\n\n## Key Benefits\n\n- ✅ **Single session** - All agents share context\n- ✅ **AI-controlled** - Claude orchestrates autonomously\n- ✅ **Native integration** - Works with built-in Explore, Plan agents\n- ✅ **Resume support** - Can continue previous agent work\n- ✅ **Context passing** - Findings flow between agents\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:38:55.464Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Agent Systems needing native parallel agent orchestration and compatibility with various IDEs and CLIs.","zh":"适用于需要原生并行代理编排和兼容各种IDE和CLI的多代理系统。","ja":"マルチエージェントシステムに最適で、ネイティブの並列エージェントオーケストレーションと、さまざまなIDEおよびCLIとの互換性が必要です。","ko":"원生 병렬 에이전트 오케스트레이션 및 다양한 IDE 및 CLI와의 호환성이 필요한 멀티 에이전트 시스템에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para sistemas de multiagentes que necesitan orquestación de agentes paralelos nativos y compatibilidad con varios IDE y CLIs.","fr":"Idéal pour les systèmes multi-agents nécessitant une orchestration d''agents parallèles natives et une compatibilité avec divers IDE et CLIs.","de":"Ideal für Multi-Agenten-Systeme, die eine native parallele Agenten-Orchestrierung und Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen IDEs und CLIs benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Sistemas de Múltiplos Agentes que necessitam de orquestração de agentes paralelos nativos e compatibilidade com várias IDEs e CLIs.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Многоагентных Систем, требующих родной параллельной оркестровки агентов и совместимости с различными IDE и CLI.","ar":"مثالي لنظم المتعددة الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى أوركسترا وكلاء موازية أصلية ومتوافقة مع مختلف بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate multiple specialized agents through Antigravity''s built-in agent system, enabling complex task automation and comprehensive reviews using native workflows and configurations compatible with GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and other platforms.","zh":"通过Antigravity的内置代理系统，赋予代理协调多个专业代理的能力，实现复杂任务的自动化，并使用与GitHub Copilot、Cursor和其他平台兼容的工作流和配置进行全面审查。","ja":"Antigravityの組み込みエージェントシステムを通じて、複数の専門エージェントを調整するエージェントの能力を提供し、複雑なタスクの自動化と、GitHub Copilot、Cursor、およびその他のプラットフォームと互換性のあるワークフローと構成を使用した包括的なレビューを可能にします。","ko":"Antigravity의 내장 에이전트 시스템을 통해 여러 전문 에이전트를 조정하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 복잡한 작업의 자동화와 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 및 기타 플랫폼과 호환되는 워크플로 및 구성으로 전체 리뷰를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a coordinar múltiples agentes especializados a través del sistema de agentes integrado de Antigravity, lo que permite la automatización de tareas complejas y revisiones exhaustivas utilizando flujos de trabajo y configuraciones nativos compatibles con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y otras plataformas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner plusieurs agents spécialisés via le système d''agents intégré d''Antigravity, permettant ainsi l''automatisation de tâches complexes et des examens complets en utilisant des flux de travail et des configurations natifs compatibles avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et d''autres plateformes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere spezialisierte Agenten über das in Antigravity integrierte Agentensystem zu koordinieren, wodurch komplexe Aufgaben automatisiert und umfassende Überprüfungen mithilfe nativer Workflows und Konfigurationen ermöglicht werden, die mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und anderen Plattformen kompatibel sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar vários agentes especializados por meio do sistema de agente integrado da Antigravity, permitindo a automação de tarefas complexas e revisões abrangentes usando fluxos de trabalho e configurações nativas compatíveis com GitHub Copilot, Cursor e outras plataformas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью координировать несколько специализированных агентов посредством встроенной системы агентов Antigravity, что позволяет автоматизировать сложные задачи и проводить комплексные обзоры, используя родные рабочие процессы и конфигурации, совместимые с GitHub Copilot, Cursor и другими платформами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق عدة وكلاء متخصصين من خلال نظام الوكيل المدمج في Antigravity، مما يُمكن من توفير أتمتة مهام معقدة ومراجعات شاملة باستخدام سير عمل وتكوينات أصلية متوافقة مع GitHub Copilot و Cursor ومنصات أخرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating complex tasks requiring multiple expertise domains","Coordinating code analysis from security, performance, and quality perspectives","Orchestrating comprehensive reviews of architecture and design"],"zh":["自动化需要多个专业领域的复杂任务","从安全、性能和质量的角度协调代码分析","编排对架构和设计的全面审查"],"ja":["複数の専門分野を必要とする複雑なタスクの自動化","セキュリティ、パフォーマンス、品質の観点からコード分析の調整","アーキテクチャと設計の包括的なレビューのオーケストレーション"],"ko":["여러 전문 분야가 필요한 복잡한 작업의 자동화","보안, 성능, 품질의 관점에서 코드 분석의 조정","아키텍처 및 설계의 전체 리뷰 오케스트레이션"],"es":["Automatización de tareas complejas que requieren múltiples dominios de especialización","Coordinación del análisis de código desde perspectivas de seguridad, rendimiento y calidad","Orquestación de revisiones exhaustivas de arquitectura y diseño"],"fr":["Automatisation de tâches complexes nécessitant plusieurs domaines d''expertise","Coordination de l''analyse de code desde des perspectives de sécurité, de performance et de qualité","Orchestration d''examen complets d''architecture et de conception"],"de":["Automatisierung komplexer Aufgaben, die mehrere Fachbereiche erfordern","Koordinierung der Code-Analyse aus Sicherheits-, Leistungs- und Qualitätsperspektive","Orchestrierung umfassender Überprüfungen von Architektur und Design"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas complexas que exigem múltiplos domínios de especialização","Coordenar análise de código do ponto de vista de segurança, desempenho e qualidade","Orquestrar revisões abrangentes de arquitetura e design"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сложные задачи, требующие нескольких областей экспертизы","Координировать анализ кода с точки зрения безопасности, производительности и качества","Оркестрировать комплексные обзоры архитектуры и дизайна"],"ar":["أتمتة المهام المعقدة التي تتطلب مجالات خبرة متعددة","تنسيق تحليل الشفرة من وجهة نظر الأمان والأداء والجودة","أوركسترا مراجعات شاملة للهندسة المعمارية والتصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Antigravity IDE for native agent system","Compatibility limited to supported IDEs and CLIs"],"zh":["需要Antigravity IDE进行原生代理系统","兼容性仅限于支持的IDE和CLI"],"ja":["ネイティブエージェントシステムのためにAntigravity IDEが必要","互換性はサポートされているIDEおよびCLIに限定される"],"ko":["원生 에이전트 시스템을 위해 Antigravity IDE가 필요합니다","호환성은 지원되는 IDE 및 CLI로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Antigravity IDE para el sistema de agentes nativo","La compatibilidad está limitada a los IDE y CLIs admitidos"],"fr":["Nécessite Antigravity IDE pour le système d''agents natif","La compatibilité est limitée aux IDE et CLIs pris en charge"],"de":["Benötigt Antigravity IDE für das native Agentensystem","Die Kompatibilität ist auf unterstützte IDEs und CLIs beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige o IDE da Antigravity para o sistema de agente nativo","Compatibilidade limitada às IDEs e CLIs suportadas"],"ru":["Требует IDE Antigravity для родной системы агентов","Совместимость ограничена поддерживаемыми IDE и CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة التطوير المتكاملة من Antigravity لنظام الوكيل الأصلي","التوافق محدود بالبيئات المتطورة المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر المدعومة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
