nden Sie diese Regeln an, wenn Sie Next.js-Code schreiben oder überprüfen, um die Qualität und Leistung Ihrer Anwendung zu verbessern","pt":"As práticas recomendadas para Next.js ajudam a melhorar a qualidade e a manutenção do código","ru":"Лучшие практики для Next.js помогают улучшить качество и поддержку кода","ar":"تساعد أفضل الممارسات ل Next.js على تحسين جودة وصيانة الكود","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["文件约定","RSC 边界检测","路由段检测","中间件重命名","并行路由检测","拦截路由检测"],"ja":["ファイル命名規則","RSC境界検出","ルートセグメント検出","ミドルウェアの名前変更","並列ルート検出","インターセプトルート検出"],"ko":["파일 규칙","RSC 경계검출","라우트 세그먼트 검출","미들웨어 이름 변경","병렬 라우트 검출","인터셉트 라우트 검출"],"es":["Convenciones de archivos y estructura de proyectos","Detección de patrones de componentes de servidor de React inválidos","Soporte para rutas paralelas e interceptadoras","Renombramiento de middleware en la versión 16","Detección de componentes de cliente asíncronos inválidos"],"fr":["Conventions de fichiers et structure de projets","Détection de modèles de composants de serveur React invalides","Prise en charge des routes parallèles et d''interception","Renommage de middleware dans la version 16","Détection de composants de client asynchrones invalides"],"de":["Dateikonventionen und Projektstruktur","Erkennung von ungültigen React-Server-Komponentenmustern","Unterstützung für parallele und abfangende Routen","Umbenennung von Middleware in Version 16","Erkennung von ungültigen asynchronen Client-Komponenten"],"pt":["Convenções de arquivo","Limites de componentes do servidor React","Detecção de componentes de cliente assíncronos","Nomeação de middleware em v16","Estrutura de projeto e arquivos especiais"],"ru":["Конвенции файлов","Границы серверных компонентов React","Обнаружение асинхронных компонентов клиента","Переименование middleware в v16","Структура проекта и специальные файлы"],"ar":["اتفاقيات الملفات","حدود مكونات الخادم التفاعلية","كشف مكونات العميل غير المتزامنة","إعادة تسمية middleware في v16","هيكل المشروع والملفات الخاصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","最佳实践","文件约定","RSC 边界检测","路由段检测","中间件重命名","并行路由检测","拦截路由检测","React Server Component"],"ja":["Next.js","ベストプラクティス","ファイル命名規則","RSC境界検出","ルートセグメント検出","ミドルウェアの名前変更","並列ルート検出","インターセプトルート検出","React Server Component"],"ko":["Next.js","최상의 실践","파일 규칙","RSC 경계검출","라우트 세그먼트 검출","미들웨어 이름 변경","병렬 라우트 검출","인터셉트 라우트 검출","React Server Component"],"es":["next.js","mejores prácticas","convenciones de archivos","rsc","react server components","desarrollo web","optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["next.js","meilleures pratiques","conventions de fichiers","rsc","composants de serveur react","développement web","optimisation des performances"],"de":["next.js","best practices","dateikonventionen","rsc","react-server-komponenten","webentwicklung","leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Next.js","práticas recomendadas","desenvolvimento web","React","componentes do servidor","middleware","convenções de arquivo"],"ru":["Next.js","лучшие практики","веб-разработка","React","серверные компоненты","middleware","конвенции файлов"],"ar":["Next.js","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير الويب","React","مكونات الخادم","middleware","اتفاقيات الملفات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"next-best-practices","description":"Next.js best practices - file conventions, RSC boundaries, data patterns, async APIs, metadata, error handling, route handlers, image/font optimization, bundling","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\nApply these rules when writing or reviewing Next.js code.\n\n## File Conventions\n\nSee [file-conventions.md](./file-conventions.md) for:\n- Project structure and special files\n- Route segments (dynamic, catch-all, groups)\n- Parallel and intercepting routes\n- Middleware rename in v16 (middleware → proxy)\n\n## RSC Boundaries\n\nDetect invalid React Server Component patterns.\n\nSee [rsc-boundaries.md](./rsc-boundaries.md) for:\n- Async client component detection (invalid)\n- Non-ser","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\nApply these rules when writing or reviewing Next.js code.\n\n## File Conventions\n\nSee [file-conventions.md](./file-conventions.md) for:\n- Project structure and special files\n- Route segments (dynamic, catch-all, groups)\n- Parallel and intercepting routes\n- Middleware rename in v16 (middleware → proxy)\n\n## RSC Boundaries\n\nDetect invalid React Server Component patterns.\n\nSee [rsc-boundaries.md](./rsc-boundaries.md) for:\n- Async client component detection (invalid)\n- Non-serializable props detection\n- Server Action exceptions\n\n## Async Patterns\n\nNext.js 15+ async API changes.\n\nSee [async-patterns.md](./async-patterns.md) for:\n- Async `params` and `searchParams`\n- Async `cookies()` and `headers()`\n- Migration codemod\n\n## Runtime Selection\n\nSee [runtime-selection.md](./runtime-selection.md) for:\n- Default to Node.js runtime\n- When Edge runtime is appropriate\n\n## Directives\n\nSee [directives.md](./directives.md) for:\n- `''use client''`, `''use server''` (React)\n- `''use cache''` (Next.js)\n\n## Functions\n\nSee [functions.md](./functions.md) for:\n- Navigation hooks: `useRouter`, `usePathname`, `useSearchParams`, `useParams`\n- Server functions: `cookies`, `headers`, `draftMode`, `after`\n- Generate functions: `generateStaticParams`, `generateMetadata`\n\n## Error Handling\n\nSee [error-handling.md](./error-handling.md) for:\n- `error.tsx`, `global-error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx`\n- `redirect`, `permanentRedirect`, `notFound`\n- `forbidden`, `unauthorized` (auth errors)\n- `unstable_rethrow` for catch blocks\n\n## Data Patterns\n\nSee [data-patterns.md](./data-patterns.md) for:\n- Server Components vs Server Actions vs Route Handlers\n- Avoiding data waterfalls (`Promise.all`, Suspense, preload)\n- Client component data fetching\n\n## Route Handlers\n\nSee [route-handlers.md](./route-handlers.md) for:\n- `route.ts` basics\n- GET handler conflicts with `page.tsx`\n- Environment behavior (no React DOM)\n- When to use vs Server Actions\n\n## Metadata & OG Images\n\nSee [metadata.md](./metadata.md) for:\n- Static and dynamic metadata\n- `generateMetadata` function\n- OG image generation with `next/og`\n- File-based metadata conventions\n\n## Image Optimization\n\nSee [image.md](./image.md) for:\n- Always use `next/image` over `<img>`\n- Remote images configuration\n- Responsive `sizes` attribute\n- Blur placeholders\n- Priority loading for LCP\n\n## Font Optimization\n\nSee [font.md](./font.md) for:\n- `next/font` setup\n- Google Fonts, local fonts\n- Tailwind CSS integration\n- Preloading subsets\n\n## Bundling\n\nSee [bundling.md](./bundling.md) for:\n- Server-incompatible packages\n- CSS imports (not link tags)\n- Polyfills (already included)\n- ESM/CommonJS issues\n- Bundle analysis\n\n## Scripts\n\nSee [scripts.md](./scripts.md) for:\n- `next/script` vs native script tags\n- Inline scripts need `id`\n- Loading strategies\n- Google Analytics with `@next/third-parties`\n\n## Hydration Errors\n\nSee [hydration-error.md](./hydration-error.md) for:\n- Common causes (browser APIs, dates, invalid HTML)\n- Debugging with error overlay\n- Fixes for each cause\n\n## Suspense Boundaries\n\nSee [suspense-boundaries.md](./suspense-boundaries.md) for:\n- CSR bailout with `useSearchParams` and `usePathname`\n- Which hooks require Suspense boundaries\n\n## Parallel & Intercepting Routes\n\nSee [parallel-routes.md](./parallel-routes.md) for:\n- Modal patterns with `@slot` and `(.)` interceptors\n- `default.tsx` for fallbacks\n- Closing modals correctly with `router.back()`\n\n## Self-Hosting\n\nSee [self-hosting.md](./self-hosting.md) for:\n- `output: ''standalone''` for Docker\n- Cache handlers for multi-instance ISR\n- What works vs needs extra setup\n\n## Debug Tricks\n\nSee [debug-tricks.md](./debug-tricks.md) for:\n- MCP endpoint for AI-assisted debugging\n- Rebuild specific routes with `--debug-build-paths`\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:39:06.254Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing Next.js code optimization and best practices implementation.","zh":"非常适合需要Next.js代码优化和最佳实践实施的前端代理。","ja":"Next.jsのコード最適化とベストプラクティスの実装が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js 코드 최적화 및 모범 사례 구현이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que necesitan optimización de código Next.js e implementación de mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''optimisation de code Next.js et de mise en œuvre des meilleures pratiques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Next.js-Codeoptimierung und die Implementierung von Best Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de otimização de código Next.js e implementação de melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима оптимизация кода Next.js и внедрение лучших практик.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين код Next.js وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce file conventions, detect invalid React Server Component patterns, and optimize route segments using middleware and proxy configurations in Next.js projects, ensuring adherence to best practices for project structure, RSC boundaries, and route management.","zh":"赋予代理人强制执行文件约定、检测无效的React Server Component模式，并使用中间件和代理配置在Next.js项目中优化路由段，从而确保项目结构、RSC边界和路由管理的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントにファイル規約の強制、有効でないReact Server Componentパターンの検出、およびNext.jsプロジェクトでのルートセグメントの最適化を中間WAREとプロキシ構成を使用して実行する力を与え、プロジェクト構造、RSCの境界、ルート管理のベストプラクティスに従うことを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 파일 규약을 강제로 적용하고, 유효하지 않은 React Server Component 패턴을 감지하며, Next.js 프로젝트에서 미들웨어 및 프록시 구성으로 라우트 세그먼트를 최적화할 수 있도록 하여 프로젝트 구조, RSC 경계, 라우트 관리의 모범 사례를 준수하도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir las convenciones de archivos, detectar patrones inválidos de componentes del servidor React y optimizar segmentos de ruta utilizando middleware y configuraciones de proxy en proyectos Next.js, garantizando el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas para la estructura del proyecto, los límites de RSC y la gestión de rutas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter les conventions de fichiers, de détecter les modèles de composants serveur React non valides et d''optimiser les segments de route en utilisant des middlewares et des configurations de proxy dans les projets Next.js, assurant le respect des meilleures pratiques pour la structure du projet, les limites RSC et la gestion des routes.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Dateikonventionen durchzusetzen, ungültige React Server Component-Muster zu erkennen und Routensegmente durch Middleware- und Proxy-Konfigurationen in Next.js-Projekten zu optimieren, wodurch die Einhaltung von Best Practices für Projektstruktur, RSC-Grenzen und Routenverwaltung sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor convenções de arquivos, detectar padrões de componentes de servidor React inválidos e otimizar segmentos de rota usando configurações de middleware e proxy em projetos Next.js, garantindo a adesão às melhores práticas para estrutura de projeto, limites de RSC e gerenciamento de rotas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение конвенций файлов, обнаруживать недопустимые шаблоны компонентов сервера React и оптимизировать сегменты маршрутов с помощью конфигураций middleware и прокси в проектах Next.js, обеспечивая соблюдение лучших практик для структуры проекта, границ RSC и управления маршрутами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض اتفاقيات الملفات، وكشف أنماط مكونات الخادم التفاعلية غير الصالحة، وتحسين مقاطع المسار باستخدامconfigurations الوسيط والوكالة في مشاريع Next.js، مما يضمن الالتزام بأفضل الممارسات لهيكلة المشروع، وحدود RSC، وإدارة المسارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing project structure and file conventions in Next.js projects","Detecting invalid React Server Component patterns and async client components","Optimizing route segments and middleware configurations for better performance"],"zh":["在Next.js项目中强制执行项目结构和文件约定","检测无效的React Server Component模式和异步客户端组件","优化路由段和中间件配置以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["Next.jsプロジェクトでのプロジェクト構造とファイル規約の強制","有効でないReact Server Componentパターンと非同期クライアントコンポーネントの検出","ルートセグメントと中間WARE構成の最適化によるパフォーマンスの向上"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트에서 프로젝트 구조 및 파일 규약을 강제 적용","유효하지 않은 React Server Component 패턴 및 비동기 클라이언트 컴포넌트 감지","라우트 세그먼트 및 미들웨어 구성 최적화를 통한 성능 개선"],"es":["Aplicación de la estructura del proyecto y convenciones de archivos en proyectos Next.js","Detección de patrones inválidos de componentes del servidor React y componentes de cliente asíncronos","Optimización de segmentos de ruta y configuraciones de middleware para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Application de la structure de projet et des conventions de fichiers dans les projets Next.js","Détection des modèles de composants serveur React non valides et des composants clients asynchrones","Optimisation des segments de route et des configurations middleware pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Durchsetzung der Projektstruktur und Dateikonventionen in Next.js-Projekten","Erkennung ungültiger React Server Component-Muster und asynchroner Client-Komponenten","Optimierung von Routensegmenten und Middleware-Konfigurationen für eine bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Impor estrutura de projeto e convenções de arquivos em projetos Next.js","Detectar padrões de componentes de servidor React inválidos e componentes de cliente assíncronos","Otimizar segmentos de rota e configurações de middleware para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Обеспечение структуры проекта и конвенций файлов в проектах Next.js","Обнаружение недопустимых шаблонов компонентов сервера React и асинхронных компонентов клиента","Оптимизация сегментов маршрутов и конфигураций middleware для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["فرض هيكلة المشروع واتفاقيات الملفات في مشاريع Next.js","كشف أنماط مكونات الخادم التفاعلية غير الصالحة ومكونات العميل غير المتزامنة","تحسين مقاطع المسار وتكوين الوسيط من أجل أداء أفضل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js project setup","Limited to React Server Component pattern detection and optimization","Next.js version 16 or later recommended for middleware and proxy configurations"],"zh":["需要Next.js项目设置","仅限于React Server Component模式检测和优化","建议使用Next.js版本16或更高版本以进行中间件和代理配置"],"ja":["Next.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","React Server Componentパターンの検出と最適化に限定","中間WAREとプロキシ構成のためにNext.jsバージョン16またはそれ以降を推奨"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","React Server Component 패턴 감지 및 최적화로 제한","미들웨어 및 프록시 구성에 Next.js 버전 16 이상을 권장"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de un proyecto Next.js","Limitado a la detección y optimización de patrones de componentes del servidor React","Se recomienda Next.js versión 16 o posterior para configuraciones de middleware y proxy"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''un projet Next.js","Limité à la détection et à l''optimisation des modèles de composants serveur React","Next.js version 16 ou ultérieure recommandée pour les configurations middleware et proxy"],"de":["Erfordert Next.js-Projekteinrichtung","Beschränkt auf die Erkennung und Optimierung von React Server Component-Mustern","Next.js Version 16 oder höher für Middleware- und Proxy-Konfigurationen empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer configuração de projeto Next.js","Limitado à detecção e otimização de padrões de componentes de servidor React","Versão 16 ou posterior do Next.js recomendada para configurações de middleware e proxy"],"ru":["Требуется настройка проекта Next.js","Ограничен обнаружением и оптимизацией шаблонов компонентов сервера React","Рекомендуется версия 16 или позднее Next.js для конфигураций middleware и прокси"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Next.js","محدود بكشف وضبط أنماط مكونات الخادم التفاعلية","يوصى بإصدار 16 أو أحدث من Next.js لتكوين الوسيط والوكالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
