ти","Ступенчатые стратегии обновления","Тестирование совместимости","Автоматизация обновлений","Решение конфликтов зависимостей","Планирование обновлений безопасности"],"ar":["تحليل التوافق","خطط لترقية متدرجة","اختبارات التوافق","تأتميم التحديثات","حل نزاعات الإعتماديات","تخطيط تحديثات الأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["依赖升级","版本升级","兼容性分析","自动化更新","软件开发","依赖管理"],"ja":["依存関係アップグレード","バージョンアップ","互換性分析","自動化更新","ソフトウェア開発","依存関係管理"],"ko":["의존성 업그레이드","버전 업그레이드","호환성 분석","자동화 업데이트","소프트웨어 개발","의존성 관리"],"es":["actualización de dependencias","análisis de compatibilidad","estrategias de actualización","pruebas comprehensivas","automatización de actualizaciones","resolución de conflictos de dependencias","seguridad de dependencias","mejora de la compatibilidad"],"fr":["mise à niveau des dépendances","analyse de compatibilité","stratégies de mise à niveau","tests comprehensifs","automation des mises à jour","résolution de conflits de dépendances","sécurité des dépendances","amélioration de la compatibilité"],"de":["Abhängigkeitsaktualisierung","Kompatibilitätsanalyse","Update-Strategien","umfassende Tests","Automatisierung von Abhängigkeits-Updates","Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten","Sicherheit von Abhängigkeiten","Verbesserung der Kompatibilität"],"pt":["atualização de dependências","análise de compatibilidade","estratégias de atualização","testes de compatibilidade","automatização de atualizações","resolução de conflitos de dependências","planejamento de atualizações de segurança","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["обновление зависимостей","анализ совместимости","ступенчатые стратегии обновления","тестирование совместимости","автоматизация обновлений","решение конфликтов зависимостей","планирование обновлений безопасности","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ترقية الإعتماديات","تحليل التوافق","خطط لترقية متدرجة","اختبارات التوافق","تأتميم التحديثات","حل نزاعات الإعتماديات","تخطيط تحديثات الأمان","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.521Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dependency-upgrade","description":"Manage major dependency version upgrades with compatibility analysis, staged rollout, and comprehensive testing. Use when upgrading framework versions, updating major dependencies, or managing breaking changes in libraries.","bodyPreview":"# Dependency Upgrade\n\nMaster major dependency version upgrades, compatibility analysis, staged upgrade strategies, and comprehensive testing approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Upgrading major framework versions\n- Updating security-vulnerable dependencies\n- Modernizing legacy dependencies\n- Resolving dependency conflicts\n- Planning incremental upgrade paths\n- Testing compatibility matrices\n- Automating dependency updates\n\n## Semantic Versioning Review\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH (e.g., 2.3.1)","body":"# Dependency Upgrade\n\nMaster major dependency version upgrades, compatibility analysis, staged upgrade strategies, and comprehensive testing approaches.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Upgrading major framework versions\n- Updating security-vulnerable dependencies\n- Modernizing legacy dependencies\n- Resolving dependency conflicts\n- Planning incremental upgrade paths\n- Testing compatibility matrices\n- Automating dependency updates\n\n## Semantic Versioning Review\n\n```\nMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH (e.g., 2.3.1)\n\nMAJOR: Breaking changes\nMINOR: New features, backward compatible\nPATCH: Bug fixes, backward compatible\n\n^2.3.1 = >=2.3.1 <3.0.0 (minor updates)\n~2.3.1 = >=2.3.1 <2.4.0 (patch updates)\n2.3.1 = exact version\n```\n\n## Dependency Analysis\n\n### Audit Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# npm\nnpm outdated\nnpm audit\nnpm audit fix\n\n# yarn\nyarn outdated\nyarn audit\n\n# Check for major updates\nnpx npm-check-updates\nnpx npm-check-updates -u  # Update package.json\n```\n\n### Analyze Dependency Tree\n\n```bash\n# See why a package is installed\nnpm ls package-name\nyarn why package-name\n\n# Find duplicate packages\nnpm dedupe\nyarn dedupe\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnpx madge --image graph.png src/\n```\n\n## Compatibility Matrix\n\n```javascript\n// compatibility-matrix.js\nconst compatibilityMatrix = {\n  react: {\n    \"16.x\": {\n      \"react-dom\": \"^16.0.0\",\n      \"react-router-dom\": \"^5.0.0\",\n      \"@testing-library/react\": \"^11.0.0\",\n    },\n    \"17.x\": {\n      \"react-dom\": \"^17.0.0\",\n      \"react-router-dom\": \"^5.0.0 || ^6.0.0\",\n      \"@testing-library/react\": \"^12.0.0\",\n    },\n    \"18.x\": {\n      \"react-dom\": \"^18.0.0\",\n      \"react-router-dom\": \"^6.0.0\",\n      \"@testing-library/react\": \"^13.0.0\",\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nfunction checkCompatibility(packages) {\n  // Validate package versions against matrix\n}\n```\n\n## Staged Upgrade Strategy\n\n### Phase 1: Planning\n\n```bash\n# 1. Identify current versions\nnpm list --depth=0\n\n# 2. Check for breaking changes\n# Read CHANGELOG.md and MIGRATION.md\n\n# 3. Create upgrade plan\necho \"Upgrade order:\n1. TypeScript\n2. React\n3. React Router\n4. Testing libraries\n5. Build tools\" > UPGRADE_PLAN.md\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Incremental Updates\n\n```bash\n# Don''t upgrade everything at once!\n\n# Step 1: Update TypeScript\nnpm install typescript@latest\n\n# Test\nnpm run test\nnpm run build\n\n# Step 2: Update React (one major version at a time)\nnpm install react@17 react-dom@17\n\n# Test again\nnpm run test\n\n# Step 3: Continue with other packages\nnpm install react-router-dom@6\n\n# And so on...\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Validation\n\n```javascript\n// tests/compatibility.test.js\ndescribe(\"Dependency Compatibility\", () => {\n  it(\"should have compatible React versions\", () => {\n    const reactVersion = require(\"react/package.json\").version;\n    const reactDomVersion = require(\"react-dom/package.json\").version;\n\n    expect(reactVersion).toBe(reactDomVersion);\n  });\n\n  it(\"should not have peer dependency warnings\", () => {\n    // Run npm ls and check for warnings\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Breaking Change Handling\n\n### Identifying Breaking Changes\n\n```bash\n# Use changelog parsers\nnpx changelog-parser react 16.0.0 17.0.0\n\n# Or manually check\ncurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/facebook/react/main/CHANGELOG.md\n```\n\n### Codemod for Automated Fixes\n\n```bash\n# React upgrade codemods\nnpx react-codeshift <transform> <path>\n\n# Example: Update lifecycle methods\nnpx react-codeshift \\\n  --parser tsx \\\n  --transform react-codeshift/transforms/rename-unsafe-lifecycles.js \\\n  src/\n```\n\n### Custom Migration Script\n\n```javascript\n// migration-script.js\nconst fs = require(\"fs\");\nconst glob = require(\"glob\");\n\nglob(\"src/**/*.tsx\", (err, files) => {\n  files.forEach((file) => {\n    let content = fs.readFileSync(file, \"utf8\");\n\n    // Replace old API with new API\n    content = content.replace(\n      /componentWillMount/g,\n      \"UNSAFE_componentWillMount\",\n    );\n\n    // Update imports\n    content = content.replace(\n      /import { Component } from ''react''/g,\n      \"import React, { Component } from ''react''\",\n    );\n\n    fs.writeFileSync(file, content);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n### Unit Tests\n\n```javascript\n// Ensure tests pass before and after upgrade\nnpm run test\n\n// Update test utilities if needed\nnpm install @testing-library/react@latest\n```\n\n### Integration Tests\n\n```javascript\n// tests/integration/app.test.js\ndescribe(\"App Integration\", () => {\n  it(\"should render without crashing\", () => {\n    render(<App />);\n  });\n\n  it(\"should handle navigation\", () => {\n    const { getByText } = render(<App />);\n    fireEvent.click(getByText(\"Navigate\"));\n    expect(screen.getByText(\"New Page\")).toBeInTheDocument();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Visual Regression Tests\n\n```javascript\n// visual-regression.test.js\ndescribe(\"Visual Regression\", () => {\n  it(\"should match snapshot\", () => {\n    const { container } = render(<App />);\n    expect(container.firstChild).toMatchSnapshot();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### E2E Tests\n\n```javascript\n// cypress/e2e/app.cy.js\ndescribe(\"E2E Tests\", () => {\n  it(\"should complete user flow\", () => {\n    cy.visit(\"/\");\n    cy.get(''[data-testid=\"login\"]'').click();\n    cy.get(''input[name=\"email\"]'').type(\"user@example.com\");\n    cy.get(''button[type=\"submit\"]'').click();\n    cy.url().should(\"include\", \"/dashboard\");\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Automated Dependency Updates\n\n### Renovate Configuration\n\n```json\n// renovate.json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"config:base\"],\n  \"packageRules\": [\n    {\n      \"matchUpdateTypes\": [\"minor\", \"patch\"],\n      \"automerge\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"matchUpdateTypes\": [\"major\"],\n      \"automerge\": false,\n      \"labels\": [\"major-update\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"schedule\": [\"before 3am on Monday\"],\n  \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\"\n}\n```\n\n### Dependabot Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# .github/dependabot.yml\nversion: 2\nupdates:\n  - package-ecosystem: \"npm\"\n    directory: \"/\"\n    schedule:\n      interval: \"weekly\"\n    open-pull-requests-limit: 5\n    reviewers:\n      - \"team-leads\"\n    commit-message:\n      prefix: \"chore\"\n      include: \"scope\"\n```\n\n## Rollback Plan\n\n```javascript\n// rollback.sh\n#!/bin/bash\n\n# Save current state\ngit stash\ngit checkout -b upgrade-branch\n\n# Attempt upgrade\nnpm install package@latest\n\n# Run tests\nif npm run test; then\n  echo \"Upgrade successful\"\n  git add package.json package-lock.json\n  git commit -m \"chore: upgrade package\"\nelse\n  echo \"Upgrade failed, rolling back\"\n  git checkout main\n  git branch -D upgrade-branch\n  npm install  # Restore from package-lock.json\nfi\n```\n\n## Common Upgrade Patterns\n\n### Lock File Management\n\n```bash\n# npm\nnpm install --package-lock-only  # Update lock file only\nnpm ci  # Clean install from lock file\n\n# yarn\nyarn install --frozen-lockfile  # CI mode\nyarn upgrade-interactive  # Interactive upgrades\n```\n\n### Peer Dependency Resolution\n\n```bash\n# npm 7+: strict peer dependencies\nnpm install --legacy-peer-deps  # Ignore peer deps\n\n# npm 8+: override peer dependencies\nnpm install --force\n```\n\n### Workspace Upgrades\n\n```bash\n# Update all workspace packages\nnpm install --workspaces\n\n# Update specific workspace\nnpm install package@latest --workspace=packages/app\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/semver.md**: Semantic versioning guide\n- **references/compatibility-matrix.md**: Common compatibility issues\n- **references/staged-upgrades.md**: Incremental upgrade strategies\n- **references/testing-strategy.md**: Comprehensive testing approaches\n- **assets/upgrade-checklist.md**: Step-by-step checklist\n- **assets/compatibility-matrix.csv**: Version compatibility table\n- **scripts/audit-dependencies.sh**: Dependency audit script\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Read Changelogs**: Understand what changed\n2. **Upgrade Incrementally**: One major version at a time\n3. **Test Thoroughly**: Unit, integration, E2E tests\n4. **Check Peer Dependencies**: Resolve conflicts early\n5. **Use Lock Files**: Ensure reproducible installs\n6. **Automate Updates**: Use Renovate or Dependabot\n7. **Monitor**: Watch for runtime errors post-upgrade\n8. **Document**: Keep upgrade notes\n\n## Upgrade Checklist\n\n```markdown\nPre-Upgrade:\n\n- [ ] Review current dependency versions\n- [ ] Read changelogs for breaking changes\n- [ ] Create feature branch\n- [ ] Backup current state (git tag)\n- [ ] Run full test suite (baseline)\n\nDuring Upgrade:\n\n- [ ] Upgrade one dependency at a time\n- [ ] Update peer dependencies\n- [ ] Fix TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Update tests if needed\n- [ ] Run test suite after each upgrade\n- [ ] Check bundle size impact\n\nPost-Upgrade:\n\n- [ ] Full regression testing\n- [ ] Performance testing\n- [ ] Update documentation\n- [ ] Deploy to staging\n- [ ] Monitor for errors\n- [ ] Deploy to production\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Upgrading all dependencies at once\n- Not testing after each upgrade\n- Ignoring peer dependency warnings\n- Forgetting to update lock file\n- Not reading breaking change notes\n- Skipping major versions\n- Not having rollback plan\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:39:15.042Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing streamlined dependency management and version upgrades.","zh":"适合需要简化依赖管理和版本升级的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントが依存関係の管理とバージョンアップグレードを簡素化する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"依赖 관리와 버전 업그레이드를 간소화해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión de dependencias optimizada y actualizaciones de versión.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion de dépendances simplifiée et de mises à jour de version.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine optimierte Abhängigkeitsverwaltung und Versionsupdates benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes DevOps que necessitam de gerenciamento de dependência simplificado e atualizações de versão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется упрощенное управление зависимостями и обновления версий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة التبعيات المبسطة وتحديث الإصدارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master major dependency version upgrades, analyze compatibility, and automate testing approaches using semantic versioning and staged upgrade strategies, ensuring secure and efficient dependency updates with MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH version control.","zh":"赋予代理掌握主要依赖版本升级、分析兼容性和使用语义版本和分阶段升级策略自动化测试方法，确保安全高效的依赖更新，使用主要.次要.补丁版本控制。","ja":"メジャーな依存関係バージョンのアップグレードをマスターし、互換性を分析し、セマンティックバージョニングとステージドアップグレード戦略を使用してテストアプローチを自動化することで、エージェントに力を与え、メジャー.マイナー.パッチバージョンコントロールを使用して安全で効率的な依存関係の更新を保証する。","ko":"메이저 의존성 버전 업그레이드, 호환성 분석 및 의미 체계 버전 및 단계적 업그레이드 전략을 사용한 테스트 접근 방식 자동화에 대한 지식을 습득하고, 메이저.마이너.패치 버전 제어를 사용하여 보안 및 효율적인 의존성 업데이트를 보장하여 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar las actualizaciones principales de versiones de dependencias, analizar la compatibilidad y automatizar enfoques de prueba utilizando versiones semánticas y estrategias de actualización por etapas, garantizando actualizaciones de dependencias seguras y eficientes con control de versión MAYOR.MENOR.PARCHES.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les mises à jour majeures des versions de dépendances, d''analyser la compatibilité et d''automatiser les approches de test en utilisant la version sémantique et les stratégies de mise à jour par étapes, garantissant des mises à jour de dépendances sécurisées et efficaces avec un contrôle de version Majeure.MineureCorrectif.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die wichtigsten Abhängigkeitsversionen zu meistern, die Kompatibilität zu analysieren und Testansätze mithilfe semantischer Versionen und schrittweiser Upgrade-Strategien zu automatisieren, um sichere und effiziente Abhängigkeitsupdates mit Versionskontrolle MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar as atualizações principais de versões de dependência, analisar a compatibilidade e automatizar abordagens de teste usando versionamento semântico e estratégias de atualização por estágios, garantindo atualizações de dependência seguras e eficientes com controle de versão MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью овладевать основными обновлениями версий зависимостей, анализировать совместимость и автоматизировать подходы к тестированию, используя семантическое версионирование и этапные стратегии обновления, обеспечивая безопасные и эффективные обновления зависимостей с контролем версий MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التسلط على تحديثات الإصدارات الرئيسية للتبعيات، وتحليل التوافق، وتحقيق آلي لنهج الاختبار باستخدام الإصدار الدلالي والстратегيات المتدرجة للتحديث، مما يضمن تحديثات التبعيات الآمنة والفعالة مع التحكم في الإصدار MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH."},"useCases":{"en":["Upgrading major framework versions with compatibility analysis","Automating security-vulnerable dependency updates with incremental upgrade paths","Resolving dependency conflicts and testing compatibility matrices"],"zh":["使用兼容性分析升级主要框架版本","使用增量升级路径自动化安全漏洞依赖更新","解决依赖冲突并测试兼容性矩阵"],"ja":["互換性分析を使用してメジャーフレームワークバージョンをアップグレードする","インクリメンタルアップグレードパスを使用してセキュリティ脆弱性のある依存関係の更新を自動化する","依存関係のコンフリクトを解決し、互換性マトリックスをテストする"],"ko":["호환성 분석을 사용하여 주요 프레임워크 버전을 업그레이드하는 것","증분 업그레이드 경로를 사용하여 보안 취약성 의존성 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","의존성 충돌을 해결하고 호환성 매트릭스를 테스트하는 것"],"es":["Actualización de versiones principales de frameworks con análisis de compatibilidad","Automatización de actualizaciones de dependencias vulnerables a la seguridad con rutas de actualización incrementales","Resolución de conflictos de dependencias y pruebas de matrices de compatibilidad"],"fr":["Mise à jour des versions principales de frameworks avec analyse de compatibilité","Automatisation des mises à jour de dépendances vulnérables à la sécurité avec des chemins de mise à jour incrémentiels","Résolution de conflits de dépendances et tests de matrices de compatibilité"],"de":["Aktualisierung von Hauptframework-Versionen mit Kompatibilitätsanalyse","Automatisierung von Sicherheits-Updates für Abhängigkeiten mit inkrementellen Update-Pfaden","Auflösung von Abhängigkeitskonflikten und Testen von Kompatibilitätsmatrizen"],"pt":["Atualizar versões principais de estruturas com análise de compatibilidade","Automatizar atualizações de dependências vulneráveis à segurança com caminhos de atualização incrementais","Resolver conflitos de dependência e testar matrizes de compatibilidade"],"ru":["Обновление основных версий фреймворков с анализом совместимости","Автоматизация обновлений уязвимых для безопасности зависимостей с инкрементными путями обновления","Решение конфликтов зависимостей и тестирование матриц совместимости"],"ar":["تحديث الإصدارات الرئيسية للإطارات مع تحليل التوافق","تحقيق آلي لتحديثات التبعيات المتأثرة بأمان مع مسارات تحديث متدرجة","حل النزاعات بين التبعيات واختبار مصفوفات التوافق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project dependency configurations","Limited to dependencies with semantic versioning support (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"zh":["需要访问项目依赖配置","仅限于支持语义版本的依赖（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）"],"ja":["プロジェクトの依存関係構成にアクセスする必要がある","セマンティックバージョニングをサポートする依存関係（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）に限定される"],"ko":["프로젝트 의존성 구성에 액세스해야 함","의미 체계 버전을 지원하는 의존성(메이저.마이너.패치)으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a las configuraciones de dependencias del proyecto","Limitado a dependencias con soporte de versiones semánticas (MAYOR.MENOR.PARCHES)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux configurations de dépendances du projet","Limité aux dépendances avec prise en charge de la version sémantique (Majeure.MineureCorrectif)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Abhängigkeitskonfigurationen des Projekts","Begrenzt auf Abhängigkeiten mit Unterstützung für semantische Versionen (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"pt":["Requer acesso às configurações de dependência do projeto","Limitado às dependências com suporte a versionamento semântico (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к конфигурациям зависимостей проекта","Ограничен зависимостями с поддержкой семантического версионирования (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تكوينات التبعية للمشروع","محدود بالتبعيات التي تدعم الإصدار الدلالي (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
