e/workers-types"],"pt":["Banco de dados de vetores globalmente distribuído","Busca semântica e RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation)","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Suporte a embeddings com cloudflare-workers-ai","Implementação pronta para produção"],"ru":["Глобально распространенная векторная база данных","Семантический поиск и RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation)","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка эмбеддингов с cloudflare-workers-ai","Реализация, готова для производства"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات متجهات موزعة على مستوى العالم","بحث دلالي و RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation)","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","دعم المضمنات مع cloudflare-workers-ai","تنفيذ جاهز للانتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Vectorize","Cloudflare Workers","RAG","AI","","Vector Database","Semantic Search","Cloudflare"],"ja":["Cloudflare Vectorize","Cloudflare Workers","RAG","AI","","Vector Database","Semantic Search","Cloudflare"],"ko":["Cloudflare Vectorize","Cloudflare Workers","RAG","AI","","Vector Database","Semantic Search","Cloudflare"],"es":["Cloudflare Vectorize","base de datos de vectores","búsqueda semántica","aplicaciones de AI","Cloudflare Workers","wrangler","@cloudflare/workers-types"],"fr":["Cloudflare Vectorize","base de données de vecteurs","recherche sémantique","applications d''IA","Cloudflare Workers","wrangler","@cloudflare/workers-types"],"de":["Cloudflare Vectorize","Vektordatenbank","semantische Suche","KI-Anwendungen","Cloudflare Workers","wrangler","@cloudflare/workers-types"],"pt":["Cloudflare Vectorize","busca semântica","RAG","IA","banco de dados de vetores","Cloudflare Workers","embeddings","desenvolvimento de aplicações","tecnologia de IA"],"ru":["Cloudflare Vectorize","семантический поиск","RAG","ИИ","векторная база данных","Cloudflare Workers","эмбеддинги","разработка приложений","технология ИИ"],"ar":["Cloudflare Vectorize","بحث دلالي","RAG","ذكاء اصطناعي","قاعدة بيانات متجهات","Cloudflare Workers","مضمنات","تطوير التطبيقات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare-vectorize","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Vectorize\n\nComplete implementation guide for Cloudflare Vectorize - a globally distributed vector database for building semantic search, RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation), and AI-powered applications with Cloudflare Workers.\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: cloudflare-worker-base (for Worker setup), cloudflare-workers-ai (for embeddings)\n**Latest Versions**: wrangler@4.59.3, @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0\n**Token Savings**: ~7","body":"# Cloudflare Vectorize\n\nComplete implementation guide for Cloudflare Vectorize - a globally distributed vector database for building semantic search, RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation), and AI-powered applications with Cloudflare Workers.\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: cloudflare-worker-base (for Worker setup), cloudflare-workers-ai (for embeddings)\n**Latest Versions**: wrangler@4.59.3, @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0\n**Token Savings**: ~70%\n**Errors Prevented**: 14\n**Dev Time Saved**: ~4 hours\n\n## What This Skill Provides\n\n### Core Capabilities\n- ✅ **Index Management**: Create, configure, and manage vector indexes\n- ✅ **Vector Operations**: Insert, upsert, query, delete, and list vectors (list-vectors added August 2025)\n- ✅ **Metadata Filtering**: Advanced filtering with 10 metadata indexes per index\n- ✅ **Semantic Search**: Find similar vectors using cosine, euclidean, or dot-product metrics\n- ✅ **RAG Patterns**: Complete retrieval-augmented generation workflows\n- ✅ **Siliconflow Integration**: Native embedding generation with @cf/baai/bge-base-en-v1.5\n- ✅ **OpenAI Integration**: Support for text-embedding-3-small/large models\n- ✅ **Document Processing**: Text chunking and batch ingestion pipelines\n- ✅ **Testing Setup**: Vitest configuration with Vectorize bindings\n\n### Templates Included\n1. **basic-search.ts** - Simple vector search with Siliconflow\n2. **rag-chat.ts** - Full RAG chatbot with context retrieval\n3. **document-ingestion.ts** - Document chunking and embedding pipeline\n4. **metadata-filtering.ts** - Advanced filtering patterns\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Vectorize V2 Breaking Changes (September 2024)\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Vectorize V2 became GA in September 2024 with significant breaking changes.\n\n### What Changed in V2\n\n**Performance Improvements**:\n- **Index capacity**: 200,000 → **5 million vectors** per index\n- **Query latency**: 549ms → **31ms** median (18× faster)\n- **TopK limit**: 20 → **100** results per query\n- **Scale limits**: 100 → **50,000 indexes** per account\n- **Namespace limits**: 100 → **50,000 namespaces** per index\n\n**Breaking API Changes**:\n1. **Async Mutations** - All mutations now asynchronous:\n   ```typescript\n   // V2: Returns mutationId\n   const result = await env.VECTORIZE_INDEX.insert(vectors);\n   console.log(result.mutationId); // \"xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n\n   // Vector inserts/deletes may take a few seconds to be reflected\n   ```\n\n2. **returnMetadata Parameter** - Boolean → String enum:\n   ```typescript\n   // ❌ V1 (deprecated)\n   { returnMetadata: true }\n\n   // ✅ V2 (required)\n   { returnMetadata: ''all'' | ''indexed'' | ''none'' }\n   ```\n\n3. **Metadata Indexes Required Before Insert**:\n   - V2 requires metadata indexes created BEFORE vectors inserted\n   - Vectors added before metadata index won''t be indexed\n   - Must re-upsert vectors after creating metadata index\n\n**V1 Deprecation Timeline**:\n- **December 2024**: Can no longer create V1 indexes\n- **Existing V1 indexes**: Continue to work (other operations unaffected)\n- **Migration**: Use `wrangler vectorize --deprecated-v1` flag for V1 operations\n\n**Wrangler Version Required**:\n- **Minimum**: wrangler@3.71.0 for V2 commands\n- **Recommended**: wrangler@4.54.0+ (latest)\n\n### Check Mutation Status\n\n```typescript\n// Get index info to check last mutation processed\nconst info = await env.VECTORIZE_INDEX.describe();\nconsole.log(info.mutationId); // Last mutation ID\nconsole.log(info.processedUpToMutation); // Last processed timestamp\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Setup Rules\n\n### ⚠️ MUST DO BEFORE INSERTING VECTORS\n```bash\n# 1. Create the index with FIXED dimensions and metric\nnpx wrangler vectorize create my-index \\\n  --dimensions=768 \\\n  --metric=cosine\n\n# 2. Create metadata indexes IMMEDIATELY (before inserting vectors!)\nnpx wrangler vectorize create-metadata-index my-index \\\n  --property-name=category \\\n  --type=string\n\nnpx wrangler vectorize create-metadata-index my-index \\\n  --property-name=timestamp \\\n  --type=number\n```\n\n**Why**: Metadata indexes MUST exist before vectors are inserted. Vectors added before a metadata index was created won''t be filterable on that property.\n\n### Index Configuration (Cannot Be Changed Later)\n\n```bash\n# Dimensions MUST match your embedding model output:\n# - Siliconflow @cf/baai/bge-base-en-v1.5: 768 dimensions\n# - OpenAI text-embedding-3-small: 1536 dimensions\n# - OpenAI text-embedding-3-large: 3072 dimensions\n\n# Metrics determine similarity calculation:\n# - cosine: Best for normalized embeddings (most common)\n# - euclidean: Absolute distance between vectors\n# - dot-product: For non-normalized vectors\n```\n\n## Wrangler Configuration\n\n**wrangler.jsonc**:\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-vectorize-worker\",\n  \"main\": \"src/index.ts\",\n  \"compatibility_date\": \"2025-10-21\",\n  \"vectorize\": [\n    {\n      \"binding\": \"VECTORIZE_INDEX\",\n      \"index_name\": \"my-index\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"ai\": {\n    \"binding\": \"AI\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## TypeScript Types\n\n```typescript\nexport interface Env {\n  VECTORIZE_INDEX: VectorizeIndex;\n  AI: Ai;\n}\n\ninterface VectorizeVector {\n  id: string;\n  values: number[] | Float32Array | Float64Array;\n  namespace?: string;\n  metadata?: Record<string, string | number | boolean | string[]>;\n}\n\ninterface VectorizeMatches {\n  matches: Array<{\n    id: string;\n    score: number;\n    values?: number[];\n    metadata?: Record<string, any>;\n    namespace?: string;\n  }>;\n  count: number;\n}\n```\n\n## Metadata Filter Operators (V2)\n\nVectorize V2 supports advanced metadata filtering with range queries:\n\n```typescript\n// Equality (implicit $eq)\n{ category: \"docs\" }\n\n// Not equals\n{ status: { $ne: \"archived\" } }\n\n// In/Not in arrays\n{ category: { $in: [\"docs\", \"tutorials\"] } }\n{ category: { $nin: [\"deprecated\", \"draft\"] } }\n\n// Range queries (numbers) - NEW in V2\n{ timestamp: { $gte: 1704067200, $lt: 1735689600 } }\n\n// Range queries (strings) - prefix searching\n{ url: { $gte: \"/docs/workers\", $lt: \"/docs/workersz\" } }\n\n// Nested metadata with dot notation\n{ \"author.id\": \"user123\" }\n\n// Multiple conditions (implicit AND)\n{ category: \"docs\", language: \"en\", \"metadata.published\": true }\n```\n\n## Metadata Best Practices\n\n### 1. Cardinality Considerations\n\n**Low Cardinality (Good for $eq filters)**:\n```typescript\n// Few unique values - efficient filtering\nmetadata: {\n  category: \"docs\",        // ~10 categories\n  language: \"en\",          // ~5 languages\n  published: true          // 2 values (boolean)\n}\n```\n\n**High Cardinality (Avoid in range queries)**:\n```typescript\n// Many unique values - avoid large range scans\nmetadata: {\n  user_id: \"uuid-v4...\",         // Millions of unique values\n  timestamp_ms: 1704067200123    // Use seconds instead\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Metadata Limits\n\n- **Max 10 metadata indexes** per Vectorize index\n- **Max 10 KiB metadata** per vector\n- **String indexes**: First 64 bytes (UTF-8)\n- **Number indexes**: Float64 precision\n- **Filter size**: Max 2048 bytes (compact JSON)\n\n### 3. Vector Dimension Limit\n\n**Current Limit**: 1536 dimensions per vector\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #8729](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/8729)\n\n**Supported Embedding Models**:\n- Siliconflow `@cf/baai/bge-base-en-v1.5`: 768 dimensions ✅\n- OpenAI `text-embedding-3-small`: 1536 dimensions ✅\n- OpenAI `text-embedding-3-large`: 3072 dimensions ❌ (requires dimension reduction)\n\n**Unsupported Models** (>1536 dimensions):\n- `nomic-embed-code`: 3584 dimensions\n- `Qodo-Embed-1-7B`: >1536 dimensions\n\n**Workaround**:\nUse dimensionality reduction (e.g., PCA) to compress embeddings to 1536 or fewer dimensions, though this may reduce semantic quality.\n\n**Feature Request**: Higher dimension support is under consideration. Use [Limit Increase Request Form](https://forms.gle/nyamy2SM9zwWTXKE6) if this blocks your use case.\n\n### 4. Key Restrictions\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ INVALID metadata keys\nmetadata: {\n  \"\": \"value\",              // Empty key\n  \"user.name\": \"John\",      // Contains dot (reserved for nesting)\n  \"$admin\": true,           // Starts with $\n  \"key\\\"with\\\"quotes\": 1    // Contains quotes\n}\n\n// ✅ VALID metadata keys\nmetadata: {\n  \"user_name\": \"John\",\n  \"isAdmin\": true,\n  \"nested\": { \"allowed\": true }  // Access as \"nested.allowed\" in filters\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Batch Insert Performance\n\n**Critical**: Use batch size of 5000 vectors for optimal performance.\n\n**Performance Data**:\n- **Individual inserts**: 2.5M vectors in 36+ hours (incomplete)\n- **Batch inserts (5000)**: 4M vectors in ~12 hours\n- **18× faster with proper batching**\n\n**Why 5000?**\n- Vectorize''s internal Write-Ahead Log (WAL) optimized for this size\n- Avoids Cloudflare API rate limits\n- Balances throughput and memory usage\n\n**Optimal Pattern**:\n```typescript\nconst BATCH_SIZE = 5000;\n\nasync function insertVectors(vectors: VectorizeVector[]) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < vectors.length; i += BATCH_SIZE) {\n    const batch = vectors.slice(i, i + BATCH_SIZE);\n    const result = await env.VECTORIZE.insert(batch);\n    console.log(`Inserted batch ${i / BATCH_SIZE + 1}, mutationId: ${result.mutationId}`);\n\n    // Optional: Rate limiting delay\n    if (i + BATCH_SIZE < vectors.length) {\n      await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 100));\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Sources**:\n- [Community Report](https://community.cloudflare.com/t/performance-issues-with-large-scale-inserts-in-vectorize/788917)\n- [Official Best Practices](https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/best-practices/insert-vectors/)\n\n---\n\n### Query Accuracy Modes\n\nVectorize uses approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) search by default with ~80% accuracy compared to exact search.\n\n**Default Mode**: Approximate scoring (~80% accuracy)\n- Faster latency\n- Good for RAG, search, recommendations\n- topK up to 100\n\n**High-Precision Mode**: Near 100% accuracy\n- Enabled via `returnValues: true`\n- Higher latency\n- Limited to topK=20\n\n**Trade-off Example**:\n```typescript\n// Fast, ~80% accuracy, topK up to 100\nconst results = await env.VECTORIZE.query(embedding, {\n  topK: 50,\n  returnValues: false  // Default\n});\n\n// Slower, ~100% accuracy, topK max 20\nconst preciseResults = await env.VECTORIZE.query(embedding, {\n  topK: 10,\n  returnValues: true   // High-precision scoring\n});\n```\n\n**When to Use High-Precision**:\n- Critical applications (fraud detection, legal compliance)\n- Small result sets (topK < 20)\n- Accuracy is higher priority than latency\n\n**Source**: [Cloudflare Blog - Building Vectorize](https://blog.cloudflare.com/building-vectorize-a-distributed-vector-database-on-cloudflare-developer-platform/)\n\n---\n\n## Common Errors & Solutions\n\n### Error 1: Metadata Index Created After Vectors Inserted\n```\nProblem: Filtering doesn''t work on existing vectors\nSolution: Delete and re-insert vectors OR create metadata indexes BEFORE inserting\n```\n\n### Error 2: Dimension Mismatch\n```\nProblem: \"Vector dimensions do not match index configuration\"\nSolution: Ensure embedding model output matches index dimensions:\n  - Siliconflow bge-base: 768\n  - OpenAI small: 1536\n  - OpenAI large: 3072\n```\n\n### Error 3: Invalid Metadata Keys\n```\nProblem: \"Invalid metadata key\"\nSolution: Keys cannot:\n  - Be empty\n  - Contain . (dot)\n  - Contain \" (quote)\n  - Start with $ (dollar sign)\n```\n\n### Error 4: Filter Too Large\n```\nProblem: \"Filter exceeds 2048 bytes\"\nSolution: Simplify filter or split into multiple queries\n```\n\n### Error 5: Range Query on High Cardinality\n```\nProblem: Slow queries or reduced accuracy\nSolution: Use lower cardinality fields for range queries, or use seconds instead of milliseconds for timestamps\n```\n\n### Error 6: Insert vs Upsert Confusion\n```\nProblem: Updates not reflecting in index\nSolution: Use upsert() to overwrite existing vectors, not insert()\n```\n\n### Error 7: Missing Bindings\n```\nProblem: \"VECTORIZE_INDEX is not defined\"\nSolution: Add [[vectorize]] binding to wrangler.jsonc\n```\n\n### Error 8: Namespace vs Metadata Confusion\n```\nProblem: Unclear when to use namespace vs metadata filtering\nSolution:\n  - Namespace: Partition key, applied BEFORE metadata filters\n  - Metadata: Flexible key-value filtering within namespace\n```\n\n### Error 9: V2 Async Mutation Timing (NEW in V2)\n```\nProblem: Inserted vectors not immediately queryable\nSolution: V2 mutations are asynchronous - vectors may take a few seconds to be reflected\n  - Use mutationId to track mutation status\n  - Check env.VECTORIZE_INDEX.describe() for processedUpToMutation timestamp\n```\n\n### Error 10: V1 returnMetadata Boolean (BREAKING in V2)\n```\nProblem: \"returnMetadata must be ''all'', ''indexed'', or ''none''\"\nSolution: V2 changed returnMetadata from boolean to string enum:\n  - ❌ V1: { returnMetadata: true }\n  - ✅ V2: { returnMetadata: ''all'' }\n```\n\n### Error 11: Wrangler --json Output Contains Log Prefix\n\n**Error**: `wrangler vectorize list --json` output starts with log message, breaking JSON parsing\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #11011](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/11011)\n\n**Affected Commands**:\n- `wrangler vectorize list --json`\n- `wrangler vectorize list-metadata-index --json`\n\n**Problem**:\n```bash\n$ wrangler vectorize list --json\n📋 Listing Vectorize indexes...\n[\n  { \"created_on\": \"2025-10-18T13:28:30.259277Z\", ... }\n]\n```\n\nThe log message makes output invalid JSON, breaking piping to `jq` or other tools.\n\n**Solution**: Strip first line before parsing:\n```bash\n# Using tail\nwrangler vectorize list --json | tail -n +2 | jq ''.''\n\n# Using sed\nwrangler vectorize list --json | sed ''1d'' | jq ''.''\n```\n\n---\n\n### Error 12: TypeScript Types Missing Filter Operators\n\n**Error**: `wrangler types` generates incomplete `VectorizeVectorMetadataFilterOp` type\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #10092](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/10092)\n**Status**: OPEN (tracked internally as VS-461)\n\n**Problem**:\nGenerated type only includes `$eq` and `$ne`, missing V2 operators: `$in`, `$nin`, `$lt`, `$lte`, `$gt`, `$gte`\n\n**Impact**:\nTypeScript shows false errors when using valid V2 metadata filter operators:\n```typescript\nconst vectorizeRes = env.VECTORIZE.queryById(imgId, {\n  filter: { gender: { $in: genderFilters } }, // ❌ TS error but works!\n  topK,\n  returnMetadata: ''indexed'',\n});\n```\n\n**Workaround**: Manual type override until wrangler types is fixed:\n```typescript\n// Add to your types file\ntype VectorizeMetadataFilter = Record<string,\n  | string\n  | number\n  | boolean\n  | {\n      $eq?: string | number | boolean;\n      $ne?: string | number | boolean;\n      $in?: (string | number | boolean)[];\n      $nin?: (string | number | boolean)[];\n      $lt?: number | string;\n      $lte?: number | string;\n      $gt?: number | string;\n      $gte?: number | string;\n    }\n>;\n```\n\n---\n\n### Error 13: Windows Dev Registry Failure (FIXED)\n\n**Error**: `ENOENT: no such file or directory` when running `wrangler dev` on Windows\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #10383](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/10383)\n**Status**: FIXED in wrangler@4.32.0\n\n**Problem**:\nWrangler attempted to create external worker files with colons in the name (invalid on Windows):\n```\nError: ENOENT: ... ''__WRANGLER_EXTERNAL_VECTORIZE_WORKER:<project>:<binding>''\n```\n\n**Solution**:\nUpdate to wrangler@4.32.0 or later:\n```bash\nnpm install -g wrangler@latest\n```\n\n---\n\n### Error 14: topK Limit Depends on returnValues/returnMetadata\n\n**Error**: `topK exceeds maximum allowed value`\n**Source**: [Vectorize Limits](https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/platform/limits/)\n\n**Problem**: Maximum topK value changes based on query options:\n\n| Configuration | Max topK |\n|---------------|----------|\n| `returnValues: false`, `returnMetadata: ''none''` | 100 |\n| `returnValues: true` OR `returnMetadata: ''all''` | 20 |\n| `returnMetadata: ''indexed''` | 100 |\n\n**Common Error**:\n```typescript\n// ❌ ERROR - topK too high with returnValues\nquery(embedding, {\n  topK: 100,            // Exceeds limit!\n  returnValues: true    // Max topK=20 when true\n});\n```\n\n**Solution**:\n```typescript\n// ✅ OK - respects conditional limit\nquery(embedding, {\n  topK: 20,\n  returnValues: true\n});\n\n// ✅ OK - higher topK without values\nquery(embedding, {\n  topK: 100,\n  returnValues: false,\n  returnMetadata: ''indexed''\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## V2 Migration Checklist\n\n**If migrating from V1 to V2**:\n\n1. ✅ Update wrangler to 3.71.0+ (`npm install -g wrangler@latest`)\n2. ✅ Create new V2 index (can''t upgrade V1 → V2)\n3. ✅ Create metadata indexes BEFORE inserting vectors\n4. ✅ Update `returnMetadata` boolean → string enum (''all'', ''indexed'', ''none'')\n5. ✅ Handle async mutations (expect `mutationId` in responses)\n6. ✅ Test with V2 limits (topK up to 100, 5M vectors per index)\n7. ✅ Update error handling for async behavior\n\n**V1 Deprecation**:\n- After December 2024: Cannot create new V1 indexes\n- Existing V1 indexes: Continue to work\n- Use `wrangler vectorize --deprecated-v1` for V1 operations\n\n---\n\n## Testing Considerations\n\n### Vitest with Vectorize Bindings\n\n**Issue**: Using `@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers` with Vectorize or Siliconflow bindings causes runtime failure.\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #7434](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/7434)\n\n**Error**: `wrapped binding module can''t be resolved`\n\n**Workaround**:\n1. Create `wrangler-test.jsonc` without Vectorize/AI bindings\n2. Point vitest config to test-specific wrangler file\n3. Mock bindings in your tests\n\n**Example**:\n```typescript\n// wrangler-test.jsonc (no Vectorize binding)\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-worker-test\",\n  \"main\": \"src/index.ts\",\n  \"compatibility_date\": \"2025-10-21\"\n  // No vectorize binding\n}\n\n// vitest.config.ts\nimport { defineWorkersProject } from ''@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers/config'';\n\nexport default defineWorkersProject({\n  test: {\n    poolOptions: {\n      workers: {\n        wrangler: {\n          configPath: \"./wrangler-test.jsonc\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n});\n\n// Mock in tests\nimport { vi } from ''vitest'';\n\nconst mockVectorize = {\n  query: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue({\n    matches: [\n      { id: ''test-1'', score: 0.95, metadata: { category: ''docs'' } }\n    ],\n    count: 1\n  }),\n  insert: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue({ mutationId: \"test-mutation-id\" }),\n  upsert: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue({ mutationId: \"test-mutation-id\" })\n};\n\n// Use mock in tests\ntest(''vector search'', async () => {\n  const env = { VECTORIZE_INDEX: mockVectorize };\n  // ... test logic\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Community Tips\n\n**Note**: These tips come from community discussions and official blog posts. Verify against your Vectorize version.\n\n### Tip 1: Range Queries at Scale May Have Reduced Accuracy (Community-sourced)\n\n**Source**: [Query Best Practices](https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/best-practices/query-vectors/)\n**Confidence**: MEDIUM\n**Applies to**: Datasets with ~10M+ vectors\n\nRange queries (`$lt`, `$lte`, `$gt`, `$gte`) on large datasets may experience reduced accuracy.\n\n**Optimization Strategy**:\n```typescript\n// ❌ High-cardinality range at scale\nmetadata: {\n  timestamp_ms: 1704067200123\n}\nfilter: { timestamp_ms: { $gte: 1704067200000 } }\n\n// ✅ Bucketed into discrete values\nmetadata: {\n  timestamp_bucket: \"2025-01-01-00:00\",  // 1-hour buckets\n  timestamp_ms: 1704067200123  // Original (non-indexed)\n}\nfilter: {\n  timestamp_bucket: {\n    $in: [\"2025-01-01-00:00\", \"2025-01-01-01:00\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**When This Matters**:\n- Time-based filtering over months/years\n- User IDs, transaction IDs (UUID ranges)\n- Any high-cardinality continuous data\n\n**Alternative**: Use equality filters (`$eq`, `$in`) with bucketed values.\n\n---\n\n### Tip 2: List Vectors Operation (Added August 2025)\n\n**Source**: [Vectorize Changelog](https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/platform/changelog/)\n\nVectorize V2 added support for the `list-vectors` operation for paginated iteration through vector IDs.\n\n**Use Cases**:\n- Auditing vector collections\n- Bulk vector operations\n- Debugging index contents\n\n**API**:\n```typescript\nconst result = await env.VECTORIZE_INDEX.list({\n  limit: 1000,  // Max 1000 per page\n  cursor?: string\n});\n\n// result.vectors: Array<{ id: string }>\n// result.cursor: string | undefined\n// result.count: number\n\n// Pagination example\nlet cursor: string | undefined;\nconst allVectorIds: string[] = [];\n\ndo {\n  const result = await env.VECTORIZE_INDEX.list({\n    limit: 1000,\n    cursor\n  });\n  allVectorIds.push(...result.vectors.map(v => v.id));\n  cursor = result.cursor;\n} while (cursor);\n```\n\n**Limitations**:\n- Returns IDs only (not values or metadata)\n- Max 1000 vectors per page\n- Use cursor for pagination\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Vectorize V2 Docs**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/\n- **V2 Changelog**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/platform/changelog/\n- **V1 to V2 Migration**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/reference/transition-vectorize-legacy/\n- **Metadata Filtering**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/vectorize/reference/metadata-filtering/\n- **Siliconflow Models**: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/\n\n---\n\n**Status**: Production Ready ✅ (Vectorize V2 GA - September 2024)\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Token Savings**: ~70%\n**Errors Prevented**: 14 (includes V2 breaking changes, testing setup, TypeScript types)\n**Changes**: Added 4 new errors (wrangler --json, TypeScript types, Windows dev, topK limits), batch performance best practices, query accuracy modes, testing setup, community tips on range queries and list-vectors operation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:40:20.075Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to build semantic search and RAG applications with Cloudflare Workers","zh":"非常适合需要使用Cloudflare Workers构建语义搜索和RAG应用程序的AI代理","ja":"Cloudflare Workersを使用してセマンティック検索およびRAGアプリケーションを構築する必要があるAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 의미적 검색 및 RAG 애플리케이션을 구축해야 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan crear aplicaciones de búsqueda semántica y RAG con Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de créer des applications de recherche sémantique et RAG avec Cloudflare Workers","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die semantische Such- und RAG-Anwendungen mit Cloudflare Workers erstellen müssen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que precisam construir aplicações de busca semântica e RAG com Cloudflare Workers","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым необходимо создавать приложения семантического поиска и RAG с помощью Cloudflare Workers","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء تطبيقات البحث الدلالي وتطبيقات RAG باستخدام Cloudflare Workers"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Cloudflare Vectorize, a globally distributed vector database, for advanced AI-powered applications, utilizing cloudflare-worker-base for Worker setup and cloudflare-workers-ai for embeddings, and supporting protocols like wrangler@4.59.3 and @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0","zh":"赋予代理使用Cloudflare Vectorize，这是一个全球分布的向量数据库，用于高级AI驱动的应用程序，利用cloudflare-worker-base进行Worker设置，cloudflare-workers-ai进行嵌入，并支持wrangler@4.59.3和@cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0等协议","ja":"エージェントにCloudflare Vectorizeを使用する権限を与え、グローバルに分散したベクトルデータベースを利用し、高度なAI駆動型アプリケーションを実現する。cloudflare-worker-baseを使用してWorkerを設定し、cloudflare-workers-aiを使用して埋め込みを行い、wrangler@4.59.3や@cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0などのプロトコルをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Vectorize를 사용하도록하여 고급 AI 구동 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, cloudflare-worker-base를 사용하여 작업자 설정을 수행하고, cloudflare-workers-ai를 사용하여 임베딩을 지원하며, wrangler@4.59.3 및 @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0などの 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar Cloudflare Vectorize, una base de datos de vectores distribuida a nivel global, para aplicaciones avanzadas impulsadas por IA, utilizando cloudflare-worker-base para la configuración del trabajador y cloudflare-workers-ai para incrustaciones, y admitiendo protocolos como wrangler@4.59.3 y @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter Cloudflare Vectorize, une base de données de vecteurs distribuée à l''échelle mondiale, pour des applications avancées alimentées par l''IA, en utilisant cloudflare-worker-base pour la configuration du travailleur et cloudflare-workers-ai pour les embeddings, et en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que wrangler@4.59.3 et @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Cloudflare Vectorize, eine global verteilte Vektordatenbank, für fortschrittliche KI-gesteuerte Anwendungen zu nutzen, indem sie cloudflare-worker-base für die Worker-Konfiguration und cloudflare-workers-ai für Einbettungen verwenden und Protokolle wie wrangler@4.59.3 und @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0 unterstützen","pt":"Permite que os agentes aproveitem o Cloudflare Vectorize, um banco de dados vetorial distribuído globalmente, para aplicações avançadas com IA, utilizando cloudflare-worker-base para configuração do Worker e cloudflare-workers-ai para embeddings, e suportando protocolos como wrangler@4.59.3 e @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать Cloudflare Vectorize, глобально распределенную векторную базу данных, для продвинутых приложений на базе ИИ, используя cloudflare-worker-base для настройки Worker и cloudflare-workers-ai для эмбеддингов, а также поддерживая протоколы, такие как wrangler@4.59.3 и @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من Cloudflare Vectorize، قاعدة بيانات المتجهات الموزعة عالميًا، للتطبيقات المتقدمة المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، باستخدام cloudflare-worker-base لإعداد Worker و cloudflare-workers-ai للتضمين، مع دعم بروتوكولات مثل wrangler@4.59.3 و @cloudflare/workers-types@4.20260109.0"},"useCases":{"en":["Building semantic search applications with Cloudflare Vectorize","Implementing Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) with Cloudflare Workers","Developing AI-powered applications with globally distributed vector databases"],"zh":["使用Cloudflare Vectorize构建语义搜索应用程序","使用Cloudflare Workers实现检索增强生成（RAG）","使用全球分布的向量数据库开发AI驱动的应用程序"],"ja":["Cloudflare Vectorizeを使用してセマンティック検索アプリケーションを構築する","Cloudflare Workersを使用してリトリーバル増強生成（RAG）を実装する","グローバルに分散したベクトルデータベースを使用してAI駆動型アプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["Cloudflare Vectorize를 사용하여 의미적 검색 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여检索增强生成（RAG）을 구현하는 것","全球적으로 분산된 벡터 데이터베이스를 사용하여 AI 구동 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Crear aplicaciones de búsqueda semántica con Cloudflare Vectorize","Implementar la generación aumentada de recuperación (RAG) con Cloudflare Workers","Desarrollar aplicaciones impulsadas por IA con bases de datos de vectores distribuidas a nivel global"],"fr":["Créer des applications de recherche sémantique avec Cloudflare Vectorize","Mettre en œuvre la génération augmentée de récupération (RAG) avec Cloudflare Workers","Développer des applications alimentées par l''IA avec des bases de données de vecteurs distribuées à l''échelle mondiale"],"de":["Erstellen von semantischen Suchanwendungen mit Cloudflare Vectorize","Implementierung der Retrieval-erweiterten Generierung (RAG) mit Cloudflare Workers","Entwicklung von KI-gesteuerten Anwendungen mit global verteilten Vektordatenbanken"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações de busca semântica com Cloudflare Vectorize","Implementação de Geração Aumentada por Recuperação (RAG) com Cloudflare Workers","Desenvolvimento de aplicações com IA usando bancos de dados vetoriais distribuídos globalmente"],"ru":["Создание приложений семантического поиска с помощью Cloudflare Vectorize","Реализация Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) с помощью Cloudflare Workers","Разработка приложений на базе ИИ с использованием глобально распределенных векторных баз данных"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات البحث الدلالي باستخدام Cloudflare Vectorize","تنفيذ التوليد المعزز بالاسترجاع (RAG) باستخدام Cloudflare Workers","تطوير تطبيقات مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام قواعد بيانات المتجهات الموزعة عالميًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires cloudflare-worker-base for Worker setup","Dependent on cloudflare-workers-ai for embeddings","Specific versions of wrangler and @cloudflare/workers-types required"],"zh":["需要cloudflare-worker-base进行Worker设置","依赖cloudflare-workers-ai进行嵌入","需要wrangler和@cloudflare/workers-types的特定版本"],"ja":["cloudflare-worker-baseを使用してWorkerを設定する必要がある","cloudflare-workers-aiに依存して埋め込みを行う","wranglerと@cloudflare/workers-typesの特定のバージョンが必要"],"ko":["cloudflare-worker-base를 사용하여 작업자 설정이 필요","cloudflare-workers-ai에 의존하여 임베딩을 수행","wrangler 및 @cloudflare/workers-types의 특정 버전이 필요"],"es":["Requiere cloudflare-worker-base para la configuración del trabajador","Dependiente de cloudflare-workers-ai para incrustaciones","Se requieren versiones específicas de wrangler y @cloudflare/workers-types"],"fr":["Nécessite cloudflare-worker-base pour la configuration du travailleur","Dépend de cloudflare-workers-ai pour les embeddings","Des versions spécifiques de wrangler et @cloudflare/workers-types sont requises"],"de":["Benötigt cloudflare-worker-base für die Worker-Konfiguration","Abhängig von cloudflare-workers-ai für Einbettungen","Spezifische Versionen von wrangler und @cloudflare/workers-types werden benötigt"],"pt":["Requer cloudflare-worker-base para configuração do Worker","Dependente do cloudflare-workers-ai para embeddings","Versões específicas do wrangler e @cloudflare/workers-types necessárias"],"ru":["Требуется cloudflare-worker-base для настройки Worker","Зависит от cloudflare-workers-ai для эмбеддингов","Требуются определенные версии wrangler и @cloudflare/workers-types"],"ar":["يتطلب cloudflare-worker-base لإعداد Worker","يعتمد على cloudflare-workers-ai للتضمين","إصدارات محددة من wrangler و @cloudflare/workers-types مطلوبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/brand-guidelines', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'brand-guidelines', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z', '2026-02-18T13:40:29.423Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/brand-guidelines","name":"brand-guidelines","description":{"zh":"Anthropic ","ja":"Anthropic","ko":"Anthropic ","es":"La guía de marca Anthropic proporciona acceso a recursos de identidad y estilo de marca para desarrolladores","fr":"La directive de marque Anthropic fournit un accès aux ressources d''identité et de style de marque pour les développeurs","de":"Die Markenrichtlinien von Anthropic bieten Entwicklern Zugang zu Ressourcen für Markenidentität und -stil","pt":"As diretrizes de marca Anthropic fornecem recursos de identidade e estilo para desenvolvedores","ru":"Руководство по бренду Anthropic предоставляет ресурсы идентичности и стиля для разработчиков","ar":"إرشادات العلامة التجارية لأنثروبك توفر موارد الهوية والتصميم للمطورين","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Anthropic ","ja":"Anthropic","ko":"Anthropic ","es":"Pautas de marca Anthropic","fr":"Directives de marque Anthropic","de":"Anthropic Markenrichtlinien","pt":"Diretrizes de Marca Anthropic","ru":"Руководство по бренду Anthropic","ar":"إرشادات العلامة التجارية لأنثروبك","en":"brand-guidelines"},"description":{"zh":"Anthropic ","ja":"Anthropic","ko":"Anthropic ","es":"La guía de marca Anthropic proporciona acceso a recursos de identidad y estilo de marca para desarrolladores","fr":"La directive de marque Anthropic fournit un accès aux ressources d''identité et de style de marque pour les développeurs","de":"Die Markenrichtlinien von Anthropic bieten Entwicklern Zugang zu Ressourcen für Markenidentität und -stil","pt":"As diretrizes de marca Anthropic fornecem recursos de identidade e estilo para desenvolvedores","ru":"Руководство по бренду Anthropic предоставляет ресурсы идентичности и стиля для разработчиков","ar":"إرشادات العلامة التجارية لأنثروبك توفر موارد الهوية والتصميم للمطورين","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Anthropic","","","Mid Gray"],"ja":["Anthropic","","","Mid Gray"],"ko":["Anthropic","","","Mid Gray"],"es":["Colores principales: oscuro, claro y gris medio","Tipografía y diseño visual","Recursos de estilo y marca","Guía para desarrolladores","Identidad de marca oficial","Diseño de formato visual"],"fr":["Couleurs principales : sombre, clair et gris moyen","Typographie et design visuel","Ressources de style et de marque","Guide pour les développeurs","Identité de marque officielle","Conception de format visuel"],"de":["Hauptfarben: dunkel, hell und mittelgrau","Typografie und visuelles Design","Stil- und Markenressourcen","Entwicklerhandbuch","Offizielle Markenidentität","Visuelles Formatdesign"],"pt":["Cores principais: Dark, Light e Mid Gray","Recursos de identidade visual","Estilo de marca Anthropic","Diretrizes de formatação visual","Recursos de design","Cores e tipografia"],"ru":["Основные цвета: Dark, Light и Mid Gray","Ресурсы визуальной идентичности","Стиль бренда Anthropic","Руководства по визуальной форматировке","Ресурсы дизайна","Цвета и типография"],"ar":["الألوان الرئيسية: الداكن والفاتح والرمادي المتوسط","موارد الهوية البصرية","أسلوب العلامة التجارية لأنثروبك","إرشادات التنسيق البصري","موارد التصميم","الألوان والخطوط"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Anthropic","","","","",""],"ja":["Anthropic","","","","",""],"ko":["Anthropic","","","","",""],"es":["pautas de marca","identidad de marca","estilo de marca","desarrollo de marca","colores de marca","tipografía de marca","diseño visual","formato visual","marca Anthropic"],"fr":["directives de marque","identité de marque","style de marque","développement de marque","couleurs de marque","typographie de marque","conception visuelle","format visuel","marque Anthropic"],"de":["Markenrichtlinien","Markenidentität","Markenstil","Markenentwicklung","Markenfarben","Markentypografie","visuelles Design","visuelles Format","Anthropic-Marke"],"pt":["diretrizes de marca","identidade visual","estilo de marca","recursos de design","cores principais","tipografia","formatação visual","desenvolvedores","marca Anthropic"],"ru":["руководство по бренду","визуальная идентичность","стиль бренда","ресурсы дизайна","основные цвета","типография","визуальная форматировка","разработчики","бренд Anthropic"],"ar":["إرشادات العلامة التجارية","الهوية البصرية","أسلوب العلامة التجارية","موارد التصميم","الألوان الرئيسية","الخطوط","التنسيق البصري","المطورون","العلامة التجارية لأنثروبك"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brand-guidelines","description":"Applies Anthropics official brand colors and typography to any sort of artifact that may benefit from having Anthropics look-and-feel. Use it when brand colors or style guidelines, visual formatting, or company design standards apply.","bodyPreview":"# Anthropic Brand Styling\n\n## Overview\n\nTo access Anthropic''s official brand identity and style resources, use this skill.\n\n**Keywords**: branding, corporate identity, visual identity, post-processing, styling, brand colors, typography, Anthropic brand, visual formatting, visual design\n\n## Brand Guidelines\n\n### Colors\n\n**Main Colors:**\n\n- Dark: `#141413` - Primary text and dark backgrounds\n- Light: `#faf9f5` - Light backgrounds and text on dark\n- Mid Gray: `#b0aea5` - Secondary elements\n- Light","body":"# Anthropic Brand Styling\n\n## Overview\n\nTo access Anthropic''s official brand identity and style resources, use this skill.\n\n**Keywords**: branding, corporate identity, visual identity, post-processing, styling, brand colors, typography, Anthropic brand, visual formatting, visual design\n\n## Brand Guidelines\n\n### Colors\n\n**Main Colors:**\n\n- Dark: `#141413` - Primary text and dark backgrounds\n- Light: `#faf9f5` - Light backgrounds and text on dark\n- Mid Gray: `#b0aea5` - Secondary elements\n- Light Gray: `#e8e6dc` - Subtle backgrounds\n\n**Accent Colors:**\n\n- Orange: `#d97757` - Primary accent\n- Blue: `#6a9bcc` - Secondary accent\n- Green: `#788c5d` - Tertiary accent\n\n### Typography\n\n- **Headings**: Poppins (with Arial fallback)\n- **Body Text**: Lora (with Georgia fallback)\n- **Note**: Fonts should be pre-installed in your environment for best results\n\n## Features\n\n### Smart Font Application\n\n- Applies Poppins font to headings (24pt and larger)\n- Applies Lora font to body text\n- Automatically falls back to Arial/Georgia if custom fonts unavailable\n- Preserves readability across all systems\n\n### Text Styling\n\n- Headings (24pt+): Poppins font\n- Body text: Lora font\n- Smart color selection based on background\n- Preserves text hierarchy and formatting\n\n### Shape and Accent Colors\n\n- Non-text shapes use accent colors\n- Cycles through orange, blue, and green accents\n- Maintains visual interest while staying on-brand\n\n## Technical Details\n\n### Font Management\n\n- Uses system-installed Poppins and Lora fonts when available\n- Provides automatic fallback to Arial (headings) and Georgia (body)\n- No font installation required - works with existing system fonts\n- For best results, pre-install Poppins and Lora fonts in your environment\n\n### Color Application\n\n- Uses RGB color values for precise brand matching\n- Applied via python-pptx''s RGBColor class\n- Maintains color fidelity across different systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:40:29.423Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Design Agents needing strict adherence to Anthropic''s brand styling and identity guidelines.","zh":"非常适合需要严格遵守Anthropic品牌样式和身份指南的视觉设计代理。","ja":"Anthropicのブランドスタイリングおよびアイデンティティガイドラインに厳格に従う必要があるビジュアルデザインエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Anthropic의 브랜드 스타일링 및 아이덴티티 가이드라인을 엄격하게遵守해야 하는 비주얼 디자인 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Diseño Visual que necesitan una estricta adherencia a las pautas y directrices de estilo y marca de Anthropic.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception visuelle ayant besoin d''une adhésion stricte aux directives de style et d''identité de marque d''Anthropic.","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Design-Agenten, die eine strikte Einhaltung der Markenstyling- und Identitätsrichtlinien von Anthropic benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design Visual que necessitam de adesão rigorosa às diretrizes de marca e identidade da Anthropic.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуального дизайна, которым требуется строгое соблюдение руководящих принципов по бренду и идентичности Anthropic.","ar":"مثالي لوسائط التصميم المرئي التي تحتاج إلى امتثال صارم لمبادئ نمط العلامة التجارية والهوية لهيئة آنثروبيك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply consistent visual formatting using Anthropic''s brand colors, typography, and styling, ensuring seamless integration of visual design elements through post-processing and visual design protocols.","zh":"赋予代理应用一致的视觉格式，使用Anthropic的品牌颜色、字体和样式，确保通过后处理和视觉设计协议实现视觉设计元素的无缝集成。","ja":"Anthropicのブランドカラー、タイポグラフィ、スタイリングを使用して一貫した視覚的なフォーマットを適用できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、ポストプロセスと視覚的なデザインプロトコルを介して視覚的なデザイン要素のシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"Anthropic의 브랜드 색상, 타이포그래피 및 스타일을 사용하여 일관된 시각적 형식을 적용할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하여 후처리 및 시각적 디자인 프로토콜을 통해 시각적 디자인 요소의 無縫な統合을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar un formato visual coherente utilizando los colores, la tipografía y el estilo de la marca de Anthropic, garantizando una integración sin problemas de los elementos de diseño visual a través de protocolos de postprocesamiento y diseño visual.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un formatage visuel cohérent en utilisant les couleurs, la typographie et le style de la marque d''Anthropic, assurant une intégration sans heurts des éléments de conception visuelle via des protocoles de post-traitement et de conception visuelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, konsistentes visuelles Formatting unter Verwendung von Anthropics Markenfarben, Typografie und Stil anzuwenden, um eine nahtlose Integration von visuellen Designelementen durch Postprocessing- und visuelle Designprotokolle sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar uma formatação visual consistente usando as cores da marca da Anthropic, a tipografia e o estilo, garantindo uma integração perfeita dos elementos de design visual por meio de protocolos de pós-processamento e design visual.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять последовательную визуальную форматировку с использованием цветов бренда Anthropic, типографики и стиля, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию визуальных элементов дизайна через постобработку и протоколы визуального дизайна.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق تنسيق مرئي متسق باستخدام ألوان العلامة التجارية لهيئة آنثروبيك والطباعة والنمط، مما يضمن تكاملًا без مشاكل لعناصر التصميم المرئي من خلال بروتوكولات المعالجة اللاحقة والتصميم المرئي."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying Anthropic''s brand colors to digital assets","Generating visually consistent typography across documents","Ensuring corporate identity consistency in marketing materials"],"zh":["将Anthropic的品牌颜色应用于数字资产","在文档中生成视觉一致的字体","确保营销材料中的企业身份一致性"],"ja":["デジタルアセットにAnthropicのブランドカラーを適用する","文書全体で視覚的一貫性のあるタイポグラフィを生成する","マーケティング資料におけるコーポレートアイデンティティの一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["디지털 자산에 Anthropic의 브랜드 색상을 적용한다","문서 전체에서 시각적으로 일관된 타이포그래피를 생성한다","마케팅 자료의 기업 아이덴티티 일관성을 보장한다"],"es":["Aplicar los colores de la marca de Anthropic a activos digitales","Generar una tipografía visualmente coherente en todo el documento","Garantizar la coherencia de la identidad corporativa en materiales de marketing"],"fr":["Appliquer les couleurs de la marque d''Anthropic aux actifs numériques","Générer une typographie visuellement cohérente à travers les documents","Assurer la cohérence de l''identité d''entreprise dans les matériaux de marketing"],"de":["Anwenden von Anthropics Markenfarben auf digitale Vermögenswerte","Erzeugen einer visuell konsistenten Typografie über Dokumente hinweg","Sicherstellen der Konformität der Unternehmensidentität in Marketingmaterialien"],"pt":["Aplicar as cores da marca da Anthropic aos ativos digitais","Gerar tipografia consistentemente visual em todos os documentos","Garantir a consistência da identidade corporativa em materiais de marketing"],"ru":["Применение цветов бренда Anthropic к цифровым активам","Генерация визуально последовательной типографики во всех документах","Обеспечение последовательности корпоративной идентичности в маркетинговых материалах"],"ar":["تطبيق ألوان العلامة التجارية لهيئة آنثروبيك على الأصول الرقمية","توليد طباعة متسقة بصريًا في جميع المستندات","ضمان الاتساق في الهوية المؤسسية في مواد التسويق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Anthropic''s official brand resources","Limited to Anthropic''s specific brand guidelines and style resources"],"zh":["需要访问Anthropic的官方品牌资源","仅限于Anthropic的特定品牌指南和样式资源"],"ja":["Anthropicの公式ブランドリソースへのアクセスが必要","Anthropicの特定のブランドガイドラインとスタイルリソースに限定される"],"ko":["Anthropic의 공식 브랜드 리소스에 접근할 필요가 있다","Anthropic의 특정 브랜드 가이드라인 및 스타일 리소스에만 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los recursos oficiales de la marca de Anthropic","Limitado a las directrices y recursos de estilo específicos de la marca de Anthropic"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux ressources officielles de la marque d''Anthropic","Limité aux directives et ressources de style spécifiques de la marque d''Anthropic"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die offiziellen Markenressourcen von Anthropic","Begrenzt auf die spezifischen Markenrichtlinien und Stilressourcen von Anthropic"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos recursos oficiais de marca da Anthropic","Limitado às diretrizes e recursos de estilo específicos da marca da Anthropic"],"ru":["Требует доступа к официальным ресурсам бренда Anthropic","Ограничен конкретными руководящими принципами и ресурсами стиля бренда Anthropic"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى موارد العلامة التجارية الرسمية لهيئة آنثروبيك","محدود بمبادئ نمط العلامة التجارية ومواردها النوعية لهيئة آنثروبيك"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
