 eliminar waterfalls primeiro, otimizar bundles em segundo lugar","Regras de leitura seletiva para revisões de desempenho","Mapa de conteúdo para navegação fácil","Otimização de desempenho para Next.js e React"],"ru":["57 правил оптимизации, отсортированных по влиянию","Философия оптимизации: сначала устранить waterfalls, затем оптимизировать bundles","Правила выбора для обзоров производительности","Карта контента для легкой навигации","Оптимизация производительности для Next.js и React"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء مصنفة حسب التأثير","فلسفة تحسين الأداء: القضاء على waterfalls أولاً ، ثم تحسين الحزم","قواعد القراءة الانتقائية لاستعراض الأداء","خريطة المحتوى للتنقل السهل","تحسين الأداء ل Next.js و React"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React 优化","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","代码优化","性能优化","开发效率"],"ja":["React 最適化","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","コード最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","開発効率"],"ko":["리액트 최적화","리액트 최적화 도구","Next.js 최적화","코드 최적화","성능 최적화","개발 효율성"],"es":["React","optimización","rendimiento","desarrollo web","mejores prácticas","Next.js","Vercel"],"fr":["React","optimisation","performances","développement web","meilleures pratiques","Next.js","Vercel"],"de":["React","Optimierung","Leistung","Webentwicklung","Best Practices","Next.js","Vercel"],"pt":["melhores práticas react","otimização de desempenho react","next.js","react performance","desenvolvimento web","otimização de bundles","waterfalls","regras de otimização"],"ru":["лучшие практики react","оптимизация производительности react","next.js","react производительность","веб-разработка","оптимизация bundles","waterfalls","правила оптимизации"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لري액ت","تحسين الأداء لري액ت","next.js","أداء ري액ت","تطوير الويب","تحسين الحزم","waterfalls","قواعد تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization from Vercel Engineering. Use when building React components, optimizing performance, eliminating waterfalls, reducing bundle size, reviewing code for performance issues, or implementing server/client-side optimizations.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js & React Performance Expert\n\n> **From Vercel Engineering** - 57 optimization rules prioritized by impact\n> **Philosophy:** Eliminate waterfalls first, optimize bundles second, then micro-optimize.\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule (MANDATORY)\n\n**Read ONLY sections relevant to your task!** Check the content map below and load what you need.\n\n> 🔴 **For performance reviews: Start with CRITICAL sections (1-2), then move to HIGH/MEDIUM.**\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File","body":"# Next.js & React Performance Expert\n\n> **From Vercel Engineering** - 57 optimization rules prioritized by impact\n> **Philosophy:** Eliminate waterfalls first, optimize bundles second, then micro-optimize.\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule (MANDATORY)\n\n**Read ONLY sections relevant to your task!** Check the content map below and load what you need.\n\n> 🔴 **For performance reviews: Start with CRITICAL sections (1-2), then move to HIGH/MEDIUM.**\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File                                    | Impact             | Rules    | When to Read                                                    |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------ | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `1-async-eliminating-waterfalls.md`     | 🔴 **CRITICAL**    | 5 rules  | Slow page loads, sequential API calls, data fetching waterfalls |\n| `2-bundle-bundle-size-optimization.md`  | 🔴 **CRITICAL**    | 5 rules  | Large bundle size, slow Time to Interactive, First Load issues  |\n| `3-server-server-side-performance.md`   | 🟠 **HIGH**        | 7 rules  | Slow SSR, API route optimization, server-side waterfalls        |\n| `4-client-client-side-data-fetching.md` | 🟡 **MEDIUM-HIGH** | 4 rules  | Client data management, SWR patterns, deduplication             |\n| `5-rerender-re-render-optimization.md`  | 🟡 **MEDIUM**      | 12 rules | Excessive re-renders, React performance, memoization            |\n| `6-rendering-rendering-performance.md`  | 🟡 **MEDIUM**      | 9 rules  | Rendering bottlenecks, virtualization, image optimization       |\n| `7-js-javascript-performance.md`        | ⚪ **LOW-MEDIUM**  | 12 rules | Micro-optimizations, caching, loop performance                  |\n| `8-advanced-advanced-patterns.md`       | 🔵 **VARIABLE**    | 3 rules  | Advanced React patterns, useLatest, init-once                   |\n\n**Total: 57 rules across 8 categories**\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Quick Decision Tree\n\n**What''s your performance issue?**\n\n```\n🐌 Slow page loads / Long Time to Interactive\n  → Read Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls\n  → Read Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n\n📦 Large bundle size (> 200KB)\n  → Read Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n  → Check: Dynamic imports, barrel imports, tree-shaking\n\n🖥️ Slow Server-Side Rendering\n  → Read Section 3: Server-Side Performance\n  → Check: Parallel data fetching, streaming\n\n🔄 Too many re-renders / UI lag\n  → Read Section 5: Re-render Optimization\n  → Check: React.memo, useMemo, useCallback\n\n🎨 Rendering performance issues\n  → Read Section 6: Rendering Performance\n  → Check: Virtualization, layout thrashing\n\n🌐 Client-side data fetching problems\n  → Read Section 4: Client-Side Data Fetching\n  → Check: SWR deduplication, localStorage\n\n✨ Need advanced patterns\n  → Read Section 8: Advanced Patterns\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 Impact Priority Guide\n\n**Use this order when doing comprehensive optimization:**\n\n```\n1️⃣ CRITICAL (Biggest Gains - Do First):\n   ├─ Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls\n   │  └─ Each waterfall adds full network latency (100-500ms+)\n   └─ Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n      └─ Affects Time to Interactive and Largest Contentful Paint\n\n2️⃣ HIGH (Significant Impact - Do Second):\n   └─ Section 3: Server-Side Performance\n      └─ Eliminates server-side waterfalls, faster response times\n\n3️⃣ MEDIUM (Moderate Gains - Do Third):\n   ├─ Section 4: Client-Side Data Fetching\n   ├─ Section 5: Re-render Optimization\n   └─ Section 6: Rendering Performance\n\n4️⃣ LOW (Polish - Do Last):\n   ├─ Section 7: JavaScript Performance\n   └─ Section 8: Advanced Patterns\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Skills\n\n| Need                    | Skill                             |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| API design patterns     | `@[skills/api-patterns]`          |\n| Database optimization   | `@[skills/database-design]`       |\n| Testing strategies      | `@[skills/testing-patterns]`      |\n| UI/UX design principles | `@[skills/frontend-design]`       |\n| TypeScript patterns     | `@[skills/typescript-expert]`     |\n| Deployment & DevOps     | `@[skills/deployment-procedures]` |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Performance Review Checklist\n\nBefore shipping to production:\n\n**Critical (Must Fix):**\n\n- [ ] No sequential data fetching (waterfalls eliminated)\n- [ ] Bundle size < 200KB for main bundle\n- [ ] No barrel imports in app code\n- [ ] Dynamic imports used for large components\n- [ ] Parallel data fetching where possible\n\n**High Priority:**\n\n- [ ] Server components used where appropriate\n- [ ] API routes optimized (no N+1 queries)\n- [ ] Suspense boundaries for data fetching\n- [ ] Static generation used where possible\n\n**Medium Priority:**\n\n- [ ] Expensive computations memoized\n- [ ] List rendering virtualized (if > 100 items)\n- [ ] Images optimized with next/image\n- [ ] No unnecessary re-renders\n\n**Low Priority (Polish):**\n\n- [ ] Hot path loops optimized\n- [ ] RegExp patterns hoisted\n- [ ] Property access cached in loops\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Anti-Patterns (Common Mistakes)\n\n**DON''T:**\n\n- ❌ Use sequential `await` for independent operations\n- ❌ Import entire libraries when you need one function\n- ❌ Use barrel exports (`index.ts` re-exports) in app code\n- ❌ Skip dynamic imports for large components/libraries\n- ❌ Fetch data in useEffect without deduplication\n- ❌ Forget to memoize expensive computations\n- ❌ Use client components when server components work\n\n**DO:**\n\n- ✅ Fetch data in parallel with `Promise.all()`\n- ✅ Use dynamic imports: `const Comp = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''))`\n- ✅ Import directly: `import { specific } from ''library/specific''`\n- ✅ Use Suspense boundaries for better UX\n- ✅ Leverage React Server Components\n- ✅ Measure performance before optimizing\n- ✅ Use Next.js built-in optimizations (next/image, next/font)\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 How to Use This Skill\n\n### For New Features:\n\n1. Check **Section 1 & 2** while building (prevent waterfalls, keep bundle small)\n2. Use server components by default (Section 3)\n3. Apply memoization for expensive operations (Section 5)\n\n### For Performance Reviews:\n\n1. Start with **Section 1** (waterfalls = biggest impact)\n2. Then **Section 2** (bundle size)\n3. Then **Section 3** (server-side)\n4. Finally other sections as needed\n\n### For Debugging Slow Performance:\n\n1. Identify the symptom (slow load, lag, etc.)\n2. Use Quick Decision Tree above\n3. Read relevant section\n4. Apply fixes in priority order\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Learning Path\n\n**Beginner (Focus on Critical):**\n→ Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls\n→ Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n\n**Intermediate (Add High Priority):**\n→ Section 3: Server-Side Performance\n→ Section 5: Re-render Optimization\n\n**Advanced (Full Optimization):**\n→ All sections + Section 8: Advanced Patterns\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 Validation Script\n\n| Script                                 | Purpose                     | Command                                                      |\n| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `scripts/react_performance_checker.py` | Automated performance audit | `python scripts/react_performance_checker.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 📖 Section Details\n\n### Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Each waterfall adds 100-500ms+ latency\n**Key Concepts:** Parallel fetching, Promise.all(), Suspense boundaries, preloading\n\n### Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Directly affects Time to Interactive, Largest Contentful Paint\n**Key Concepts:** Dynamic imports, tree-shaking, barrel import avoidance\n\n### Section 3: Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** Faster server responses, better SEO\n**Key Concepts:** Parallel server fetching, streaming, API route optimization\n\n### Section 4: Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** Reduces redundant requests, better UX\n**Key Concepts:** SWR deduplication, localStorage caching, event listeners\n\n### Section 5: Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n**Impact:** Smoother UI, less wasted computation\n**Key Concepts:** React.memo, useMemo, useCallback, component structure\n\n### Section 6: Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n**Impact:** Better rendering efficiency\n**Key Concepts:** Virtualization, image optimization, layout thrashing\n\n### Section 7: JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n**Impact:** Incremental improvements in hot paths\n**Key Concepts:** Loop optimization, caching, RegExp hoisting\n\n### Section 8: Advanced Patterns (VARIABLE)\n\n**Impact:** Specific use cases\n**Key Concepts:** useLatest hook, init-once patterns, event handler refs\n\n---\n\n## 🎓 Best Practices Summary\n\n**Golden Rules:**\n\n1. **Measure first** - Use React DevTools Profiler, Chrome DevTools\n2. **Biggest impact first** - Waterfalls → Bundle → Server → Micro\n3. **Don''t over-optimize** - Focus on real bottlenecks\n4. **Use platform features** - Next.js has optimizations built-in\n5. **Think about users** - Real-world conditions matter\n\n**Performance Mindset:**\n\n- Every `await` in sequence = potential waterfall\n- Every `import` = potential bundle bloat\n- Every re-render = wasted computation (if unnecessary)\n- Server components = less JavaScript to ship\n- Measure, don''t guess\n\n---\n\n**Source:** Vercel Engineering\n**Date:** January 2026\n**Version:** 1.0.0\n**Total Rules:** 57 across 8 categories\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:40:03.074Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in React and Next.js development, seeking to optimize performance and follow best practices.","zh":"非常适合专注于 React 和 Next.js 开发的前端代理，旨在优化性能和遵循最佳实践。","ja":"React と Next.js 開発を専門とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適で、パフォーマンスを最適化し、ベスト プラクティスに従うことを目指しています。","ko":"React와 Next.js 개발에 전문적인 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 성능을 최적화하고 최선의 관행을 따르려는 목표를 가지고 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que se especializan en desarrollo de React y Next.js, y que buscan optimizar el rendimiento y seguir las mejores prácticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend spécialisés dans le développement React et Next.js, cherchant à optimiser les performances et à suivre les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung von React und Next.js spezialisieren und die Leistung optimieren und die besten Praktiken befolgen möchten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend especializados em desenvolvimento React e Next.js, buscando otimizar o desempenho e seguir as melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке React и Next.js, стремящихся оптимизировать производительность и следовать лучшим практикам.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصصة في تطوير React و Next.js ، الذين يبحثون عن تحسين الأداء اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to eliminate waterfalls, optimize bundles, and micro-optimize using 57 prioritized optimization rules, ensuring high-performance React applications with Next.js, leveraging expertise from Vercel Engineering.","zh":"赋予代理人消除瀑布、优化包和使用 57 个优先的优化规则进行微优化的能力，确保使用 Next.js 的高性能 React 应用程序，并利用 Vercel Engineering 的专业知识。","ja":"エージェントがウォーターフォールを排除し、バンドルを最適化し、57 の優先順位付けされた最適化ルールを使用してマイクロ最適化を行うことを可能にし、Vercel Engineering の専門知識を活用して Next.js を使用した高パフォーマンスの React アプリケーションを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 폭포를 제거하고, 번들을 최적화하고, 57개의 우선순위가 지정된 최적화 규칙을 사용하여 마이크로 최적화를 수행할 수 있도록 해줌으로써, Vercel Engineering의 전문 지식을 활용하여 Next.js를 사용하는 고성능 React 애플리케이션을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a eliminar cascadas, optimizar paquetes y microoptimizar utilizando 57 reglas de optimización priorizadas, garantizando aplicaciones React de alto rendimiento con Next.js, aprovechando la experiencia de Vercel Engineering.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''éliminer les cascades, d''optimiser les bundles et de micro-optimiser en utilisant 57 règles d''optimisation priorisées, garantissant des applications React haute performance avec Next.js, en exploitant l''expertise de Vercel Engineering.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Wasserfälle zu eliminieren, Bundles zu optimieren und zu mikrooptimieren, indem sie 57 priorisierte Optimierungsregeln verwenden, um Hochleistungs-React-Anwendungen mit Next.js sicherzustellen, die Expertise von Vercel Engineering nutzend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a eliminar cascata, otimizar pacotes e micro-otimizar usando 57 regras de otimização priorizadas, garantindo aplicativos React de alto desempenho com Next.js, aproveitando a expertise da Vercel Engineering.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устранить каскад, оптимизировать пакеты и микрооптимизировать с помощью 57 приоритизированных правил оптимизации, обеспечивая высокопроизводительные приложения React с Next.js, используя опыт Vercel Engineering.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على القضاء على المياه الشلال ، وتحسين الحزمة ، والتحسين الدقيق باستخدام 57 قاعدة تحسين ذات أولوية ، مما يضمن تطبيقات React عالية الأداء مع Next.js ، مستفيدًا من خبرة Vercel Engineering."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance reviews for React applications","Generating optimized bundles for Next.js projects","Micro-optimizing critical components for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["为 React 应用程序自动执行性能审查","为 Next.js 项目生成优化的包","为增强的用户体验而对关键组件进行微优化"],"ja":["React アプリケーションのパフォーマンス レビューを自動化する","Next.js プロジェクトの最適化されたバンドルを生成する","強化されたユーザー エクスペリエンスのために重要なコンポーネントをマイクロ最適化する"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션의 성능 검토를 자동화하는 것","Next.js 프로젝트를 위한 최적화된 번들을 생성하는 것","강화된 사용자 경험을 위해 중요한 구성 요소를 마이크로 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de rendimiento para aplicaciones React","Generar paquetes optimizados para proyectos Next.js","Microoptimizar componentes críticos para una experiencia de usuario mejorada"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de performances pour les applications React","Générer des bundles optimisés pour les projets Next.js","Micro-optimiser les composants critiques pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée"],"de":["Automatisieren von Leistungsüberprüfungen für React-Anwendungen","Erzeugen von optimierten Bundles für Next.js-Projekte","Mikrooptimieren von kritischen Komponenten für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de desempenho para aplicações React","Gerar pacotes otimizados para projetos Next.js","Micro-otimizar componentes críticos para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обзоры производительности для приложений React","Генерировать оптимизированные пакеты для проектов Next.js","Микрооптимизировать критические компоненты для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["أتمتة مراجعة الأداء لتطبيقات React","إنشاء حزمة محسنة لمشاريع Next.js","التحسين الدقيق للمكونات الحرجة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js","Limited to optimization of React and Next.js applications"],"zh":["需要 React 和 Next.js 的知识","仅限于 React 和 Next.js 应用程序的优化"],"ja":["React と Next.js の知識が必要","React と Next.js のアプリケーションの最適化のみに限定される"],"ko":["React와 Next.js에 대한 지식이 필요","React와 Next.js 애플리케이션의 최적화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React y Next.js","Limitado a la optimización de aplicaciones React y Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React et Next.js","Limité à l''optimisation des applications React et Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React und Next.js","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React e Next.js","Limitado à otimização de aplicações React e Next.js"],"ru":["Требует знания React и Next.js","Ограничен оптимизацией приложений React и Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و Next.js","محدود بتحسين تطبيقات React و Next.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
