hon 지원","보안 취약점 체크"],"es":["Conversión de configuraciones de Antigravity IDE","Compatibilidad con IDEs como GitHub Copilot y Cursor","Compatibilidad con CLIs como Kiro y OpenCode","Validación de código con herramientas como ESLint y Ruff","Análisis de seguridad con herramientas como npm audit y Bandit"],"fr":["Conversion des configurations d''Antigravity IDE","Compatibilité avec les IDEs comme GitHub Copilot et Cursor","Compatibilité avec les CLIs comme Kiro et OpenCode","Validation de code avec des outils comme ESLint et Ruff","Analyse de sécurité avec des outils comme npm audit et Bandit"],"de":["Konvertierung von Konfigurationen von Antigravity IDE","Kompatibilität mit IDEs wie GitHub Copilot und Cursor","Kompatibilität mit CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode","Code-Validierung mit Tools wie ESLint und Ruff","Sicherheitsanalyse mit Tools wie npm audit und Bandit"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações de Agent, Skill e Workflows","Compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs","Validação e linting do código","Suporte a Node.js e TypeScript","Suporte a Python"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций Agent, Skill и Workflows","Совместимость с IDE и CLI","Проверка и исправление кода","Поддержка Node.js и TypeScript","Поддержка Python"],"ar":["تحويل تكوينات Agent و Skill و Workflows","التوافق مع IDE و CLIs","التحقق والتصحيح الشامل للコード","دعم Node.js و TypeScript","دعم Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码lint","代码验证","代码质量","代码安全","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","IDE","CLI"],"ja":["コードLint","コード検証","コード品質","コードセキュリティ","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","IDE","CLI"],"ko":["코드 린트","코드 검증","코드 품질","코드 보안","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","IDE","CLI"],"es":["lint-and-validate","validación de código","conversión de configuraciones","compatibilidad con IDEs","compatibilidad con CLIs","análisis de seguridad","desarrollo de software","calidad del código"],"fr":["lint-and-validate","validation de code","conversion de configurations","compatibilité avec les IDEs","compatibilité avec les CLIs","analyse de sécurité","développement de logiciels","qualité du code"],"de":["lint-and-validate","code-validierung","konvertierung von konfigurationen","kompatibilität mit ide","kompatibilität mit cli","sicherheitsanalyse","software-entwicklung","code-qualität"],"pt":["lint e validate","conversão de configurações","Agent","Skill","Workflows","Antigravity IDE","IDEs","CLIs","Node.js","TypeScript","Python"],"ru":["lint и validate","конвертация конфигураций","Agent","Skill","Workflows","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","Node.js","TypeScript","Python"],"ar":["lint و validate","تحويل التكوينات","Agent","Skill","Workflows","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLIs","Node.js","TypeScript","Python"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lint-and-validate","description":"Automatic quality control, linting, and static analysis procedures. Use after every code modification to ensure syntax correctness and project standards. Triggers onKeywords: lint, format, check, validate, types, static analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Lint and Validate Skill\n\n> **MANDATORY:** Run appropriate validation tools after EVERY code change. Do not finish a task until the code is error-free.\n\n### Procedures by Ecosystem\n\n#### Node.js / TypeScript\n1. **Lint/Fix:** `npm run lint` or `npx eslint \"path\" --fix`\n2. **Types:** `npx tsc --noEmit`\n3. **Security:** `npm audit --audit-level=high`\n\n#### Python\n1. **Linter (Ruff):** `ruff check \"path\" --fix` (Fast & Modern)\n2. **Security (Bandit):** `bandit -r \"path\" -ll`\n3. **Types (MyPy):** `m","body":"# Lint and Validate Skill\n\n> **MANDATORY:** Run appropriate validation tools after EVERY code change. Do not finish a task until the code is error-free.\n\n### Procedures by Ecosystem\n\n#### Node.js / TypeScript\n1. **Lint/Fix:** `npm run lint` or `npx eslint \"path\" --fix`\n2. **Types:** `npx tsc --noEmit`\n3. **Security:** `npm audit --audit-level=high`\n\n#### Python\n1. **Linter (Ruff):** `ruff check \"path\" --fix` (Fast & Modern)\n2. **Security (Bandit):** `bandit -r \"path\" -ll`\n3. **Types (MyPy):** `mypy \"path\"`\n\n## The Quality Loop\n1. **Write/Edit Code**\n2. **Run Audit:** `npm run lint && npx tsc --noEmit`\n3. **Analyze Report:** Check the \"FINAL AUDIT REPORT\" section.\n4. **Fix & Repeat:** Submitting code with \"FINAL AUDIT\" failures is NOT allowed.\n\n## Error Handling\n- If `lint` fails: Fix the style or syntax issues immediately.\n- If `tsc` fails: Correct type mismatches before proceeding.\n- If no tool is configured: Check the project root for `.eslintrc`, `tsconfig.json`, `pyproject.toml` and suggest creating one.\n\n---\n**Strict Rule:** No code should be committed or reported as \"done\" without passing these checks.\n\n---\n\n## Scripts\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/lint_runner.py` | Unified lint check | `python scripts/lint_runner.py <project_path>` |\n| `scripts/type_coverage.py` | Type coverage analysis | `python scripts/type_coverage.py <project_path>` |\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:40:02.717Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced linting and validation capabilities for Node.js and Python projects.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 linting 和验证功能的 Node.js 和 Python 项目的代码审查代理。","ja":"Node.js と Python プロジェクトで高度な linting と検証機能を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Node.js와 Python 프로젝트에서 고급 linting 및 유효성 검사 기능을 필요로 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced linting and validation capabilities for Node.js and Python projects.","fr":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced linting and validation capabilities for Node.js and Python projects.","de":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced linting and validation capabilities for Node.js and Python projects.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de linting e validação para projetos Node.js e Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, требующих продвинутых возможностей линтинга и проверки для проектов Node.js и Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل استعراض الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتنسيق الشفرة والتحقق من صحتها لمشاريع Node.js و Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards and security best practices using tools like ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff, and Bandit, ensuring error-free code with features like automatic fixing and high-level audit reporting.","zh":"使代理能够使用 ESLint、TypeScript、Ruff 和 Bandit 等工具强制执行编码标准和安全最佳实践，从而确保代码无错误，具有自动修复和高级审计报告等功能。","ja":"ESLint、TypeScript、Ruff、Bandit などのツールを使用して、コード標準とセキュリティのベストプラクティスを強制的に実施し、自動修復や高度な監査レポートなどの機能により、エラーのないコードを保証します。","ko":"ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff, Bandit 등의 도구를 사용하여 코드 표준 및 보안 모범 사례를 강제로 시행하여 자동 수정 및 고급 감사 보고서 등의 기능으로 오류가 없는 코드를 보장합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards and security best practices using tools like ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff, and Bandit, ensuring error-free code with features like automatic fixing and high-level audit reporting.","fr":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards and security best practices using tools like ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff, and Bandit, ensuring error-free code with features like automatic fixing and high-level audit reporting.","de":"Empowers agents to enforce coding standards and security best practices using tools like ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff, and Bandit, ensuring error-free code with features like automatic fixing and high-level audit reporting.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de codificação e práticas de segurança recomendadas usando ferramentas como ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff e Bandit, garantindo código sem erros com recursos como correção automática e relatórios de auditoria de alto nível.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования и лучших практик безопасности с помощью инструментов như ESLint, TypeScript, Ruff и Bandit, гарантируя отсутствие ошибок в коде с функциями автоматического исправления и отчетов аудита высокого уровня.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض معايير التشفير وأفضل الممارسات الأمنية باستخدام أدوات مثل ESLint و TypeScript و Ruff و Bandit، مما يضمن شفرة خالية من الأخطاء مع ميزات مثل الإصلاح التلقائي وتقارير التدقيق على مستوى عال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code linting and fixing for Node.js projects using npm and ESLint","Validating Python code security using Bandit and ensuring compliance with high audit levels","Enforcing type checking for TypeScript projects using the tsc compiler"],"zh":["使用 npm 和 ESLint 自动化 Node.js 项目的代码 linting 和修复","使用 Bandit 验证 Python 代码的安全性并确保遵守高级审计标准","使用 tsc 编译器强制执行 TypeScript 项目的类型检查"],"ja":["npm と ESLint を使用して Node.js プロジェクトのコード linting と修复を自動化する","Bandit を使用して Python コードのセキュリティを検証し、高い監査レベルに準拠するようにする","tsc コンパイラを使用して TypeScript プロジェクトの型チェックを強制実施する"],"ko":["npm과 ESLint를 사용하여 Node.js 프로젝트의 코드 linting 및 수정을 자동화하는 것","Bandit를 사용하여 Python 코드의 보안을 검증하고 높은 감사 수준을 준수하도록 하는 것","tsc 컴파일러를 사용하여 TypeScript 프로젝트의 유형 검사를 강제로 적용하는 것"],"es":["Automating code linting and fixing for Node.js projects using npm and ESLint","Validating Python code security using Bandit and ensuring compliance with high audit levels","Enforcing type checking for TypeScript projects using the tsc compiler"],"fr":["Automating code linting and fixing for Node.js projects using npm and ESLint","Validating Python code security using Bandit and ensuring compliance with high audit levels","Enforcing type checking for TypeScript projects using the tsc compiler"],"de":["Automating code linting and fixing for Node.js projects using npm and ESLint","Validating Python code security using Bandit and ensuring compliance with high audit levels","Enforcing type checking for TypeScript projects using the tsc compiler"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação e correção de código para projetos Node.js usando npm e ESLint","Validar a segurança do código Python usando Bandit e garantir a conformidade com níveis de auditoria elevados","Impor a verificação de tipo para projetos TypeScript usando o compilador tsc"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку и исправление кода для проектов Node.js с помощью npm и ESLint","Проверять безопасность кода Python с помощью Bandit и обеспечивать соответствие высоким уровням аудита","Обеспечивать проверку типов для проектов TypeScript с помощью компилятора tsc"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي للتحقق والإصلاح الشفرة لمشاريع Node.js باستخدام npm و ESLint","التحقق من أمان شفرة Python باستخدام Bandit وضمان المطابقة لمستويات التدقيق العالية","فرض التحقق من النوع لمشاريع TypeScript باستخدام مترجم tsc"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js and npm for JavaScript linting and validation","Requires Python and specific libraries (Ruff, Bandit, MyPy) for Python linting and validation","Limited to specific security audit levels (high) for npm projects"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 和 npm 来进行 JavaScript 代码的 linting 和验证","需要 Python 和特定的库（Ruff、Bandit、MyPy）来进行 Python 代码的 linting 和验证","仅限于 npm 项目的特定安全审计级别（高）"],"ja":["JavaScript コードの linting と検証を行うには Node.js と npm が必要","Python コードの linting と検証を行うには Python と特定のライブラリ（Ruff、Bandit、MyPy）が必要","npm プロジェクトの特定のセキュリティ監査レベル（高）に限定される"],"ko":["JavaScript 코드의 linting 및 유효성 검사를 수행하려면 Node.js와 npm가 필요합니다.","Python 코드의 linting 및 유효성 검사를 수행하려면 Python 및 특정 라이브러리(Ruff, Bandit, MyPy)가 필요합니다.","npm 프로젝트의 특정 보안 감사 수준(높음)으로 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requires Node.js and npm for JavaScript linting and validation","Requires Python and specific libraries (Ruff, Bandit, MyPy) for Python linting and validation","Limited to specific security audit levels (high) for npm projects"],"fr":["Requires Node.js and npm for JavaScript linting and validation","Requires Python and specific libraries (Ruff, Bandit, MyPy) for Python linting and validation","Limited to specific security audit levels (high) for npm projects"],"de":["Requires Node.js and npm for JavaScript linting and validation","Requires Python and specific libraries (Ruff, Bandit, MyPy) for Python linting and validation","Limited to specific security audit levels (high) for npm projects"],"pt":["Exige Node.js e npm para linting e validação JavaScript","Exige Python e bibliotecas específicas (Ruff, Bandit, MyPy) para linting e validação Python","Limitado a níveis de auditoria de segurança específicos (alto) para projetos npm"],"ru":["Требует Node.js и npm для линтинга и проверки JavaScript","Требует Python и специальных библиотек (Ruff, Bandit, MyPy) для линтинга и проверки Python","Ограничен конкретными уровнями аудита безопасности (высокий) для проектов npm"],"ar":["يتطلب Node.js و npm للتنسيق والتحقق من صحة JavaScript","يتطلب Python ومكتبات محددة (Ruff و Bandit و MyPy) للتنسيق والتحقق من صحة Python","محدود بمستويات التدقيق الأمني المحددة (المرتفع) لمشاريع npm"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
