ion von SAST-Tools wie Semgrep, SonarQube und CodeQL","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Sicherheitsregeln für Ihren Code","Integration von Sicherheitstests in CI/CD-Pipelines","Konfiguration von Qualitäts- und Compliance-Toren","Analyse von Schwachstellen in mehreren Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Configuração de ferramentas SAST","Criação de regras de segurança personalizadas","Integração com pipelines de CI/CD","Análise de código em múltiplos idiomas","Configuração de portas de qualidade e conformidade"],"ru":["Настройка инструментов SAST","Создание пользовательских правил безопасности","Интеграция с конвейерами CI/CD","Анализ кода на нескольких языках","Настройка контрольных точек качества и соответствия"],"ar":["تكوين أدوات SAST","إنشاء قواعد أمان مخصصة","التكامل مع أنابيب CI/CD","تحليل الرمز في لغات متعددة","تكوين بوابات الجودة والامتثال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SAST配置","静态应用程序安全测试","Semgrep","SonarQube","CodeQL","CI/CD管道","代码安全扫描"],"ja":["SAST設定","静的アプリケーションセキュリティテスト","Semgrep","SonarQube","CodeQL","CI/CDパイプライン","コードセキュリティスキャン"],"ko":["SAST 구성","정적 애플리케이션 보안 테스트","Semgrep","SonarQube","CodeQL","CI/CD 파이프라인","코드 보안 스캔"],"es":["SAST","pruebas de seguridad","seguridad de aplicaciones","herramientas SAST","configuración de SAST","reglas de seguridad personalizadas","integración de pruebas de seguridad","análisis de vulnerabilidades"],"fr":["SAST","tests de sécurité","sécurité des applications","outils SAST","configuration SAST","règles de sécurité personnalisées","intégration de tests de sécurité","analyse de vulnérabilités"],"de":["SAST","Sicherheitstests","Sicherheit von Anwendungen","SAST-Tools","SAST-Konfiguration","benutzerdefinierte Sicherheitsregeln","Integration von Sicherheitstests","Schwachstellenanalyse"],"pt":["SAST","segurança de aplicativos","ferramentas de teste","configuração de SAST","regras de segurança personalizadas","análise de código"],"ru":["SAST","безопасность приложений","инструменты тестирования","настройка SAST","пользовательские правила безопасности","анализ кода"],"ar":["SAST","أمان التطبيقات","أدوات الاختبار","تكوين SAST","قواعد أمان مخصصة","تحليل الرمز"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sast-configuration","description":"Configure Static Application Security Testing (SAST) tools for automated vulnerability detection in application code. Use when setting up security scanning, implementing DevSecOps practices, or automating code vulnerability detection.","bodyPreview":"# SAST Configuration\n\nStatic Application Security Testing (SAST) tool setup, configuration, and custom rule creation for comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for setting up and configuring SAST tools including Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL. Use this skill when you need to:\n\n- Set up SAST scanning in CI/CD pipelines\n- Create custom security rules for your codebase\n- Configure quality gates and compliance p","body":"# SAST Configuration\n\nStatic Application Security Testing (SAST) tool setup, configuration, and custom rule creation for comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for setting up and configuring SAST tools including Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL. Use this skill when you need to:\n\n- Set up SAST scanning in CI/CD pipelines\n- Create custom security rules for your codebase\n- Configure quality gates and compliance policies\n- Optimize scan performance and reduce false positives\n- Integrate multiple SAST tools for defense-in-depth\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Semgrep Configuration\n\n- Custom rule creation with pattern matching\n- Language-specific security rules (Python, JavaScript, Go, Java, etc.)\n- CI/CD integration (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins)\n- False positive tuning and rule optimization\n- Organizational policy enforcement\n\n### 2. SonarQube Setup\n\n- Quality gate configuration\n- Security hotspot analysis\n- Code coverage and technical debt tracking\n- Custom quality profiles for languages\n- Enterprise integration with LDAP/SAML\n\n### 3. CodeQL Analysis\n\n- GitHub Advanced Security integration\n- Custom query development\n- Vulnerability variant analysis\n- Security research workflows\n- SARIF result processing\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Initial Assessment\n\n1. Identify primary programming languages in your codebase\n2. Determine compliance requirements (PCI-DSS, SOC 2, etc.)\n3. Choose SAST tool based on language support and integration needs\n4. Review baseline scan to understand current security posture\n\n### Basic Setup\n\n```bash\n# Semgrep quick start\npip install semgrep\nsemgrep --config=auto --error\n\n# SonarQube with Docker\ndocker run -d --name sonarqube -p 9000:9000 sonarqube:latest\n\n# CodeQL CLI setup\ngh extension install github/gh-codeql\ncodeql database create mydb --language=python\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [Semgrep Rule Creation](references/semgrep-rules.md) - Pattern-based security rule development\n- [SonarQube Configuration](references/sonarqube-config.md) - Quality gates and profiles\n- [CodeQL Setup Guide](references/codeql-setup.md) - Query development and workflows\n\n## Templates & Assets\n\n- [semgrep-config.yml](assets/semgrep-config.yml) - Production-ready Semgrep configuration\n- [sonarqube-settings.xml](assets/sonarqube-settings.xml) - SonarQube quality profile template\n- [run-sast.sh](scripts/run-sast.sh) - Automated SAST execution script\n\n## Integration Patterns\n\n### CI/CD Pipeline Integration\n\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions example\n- name: Run Semgrep\n  uses: returntocorp/semgrep-action@v1\n  with:\n    config: >-\n      p/security-audit\n      p/owasp-top-ten\n```\n\n### Pre-commit Hook\n\n```bash\n# .pre-commit-config.yaml\n- repo: https://github.com/returntocorp/semgrep\n  rev: v1.45.0\n  hooks:\n    - id: semgrep\n      args: [''--config=auto'', ''--error'']\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Start with Baseline**\n   - Run initial scan to establish security baseline\n   - Prioritize critical and high severity findings\n   - Create remediation roadmap\n\n2. **Incremental Adoption**\n   - Begin with security-focused rules\n   - Gradually add code quality rules\n   - Implement blocking only for critical issues\n\n3. **False Positive Management**\n   - Document legitimate suppressions\n   - Create allow lists for known safe patterns\n   - Regularly review suppressed findings\n\n4. **Performance Optimization**\n   - Exclude test files and generated code\n   - Use incremental scanning for large codebases\n   - Cache scan results in CI/CD\n\n5. **Team Enablement**\n   - Provide security training for developers\n   - Create internal documentation for common patterns\n   - Establish security champions program\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### New Project Setup\n\n```bash\n./scripts/run-sast.sh --setup --language python --tools semgrep,sonarqube\n```\n\n### Custom Rule Development\n\n```yaml\n# See references/semgrep-rules.md for detailed examples\nrules:\n  - id: hardcoded-jwt-secret\n    pattern: jwt.encode($DATA, \"...\", ...)\n    message: JWT secret should not be hardcoded\n    severity: ERROR\n```\n\n### Compliance Scanning\n\n```bash\n# PCI-DSS focused scan\nsemgrep --config p/pci-dss --json -o pci-scan-results.json\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### High False Positive Rate\n\n- Review and tune rule sensitivity\n- Add path filters to exclude test files\n- Use nostmt metadata for noisy patterns\n- Create organization-specific rule exceptions\n\n### Performance Issues\n\n- Enable incremental scanning\n- Parallelize scans across modules\n- Optimize rule patterns for efficiency\n- Cache dependencies and scan results\n\n### Integration Failures\n\n- Verify API tokens and credentials\n- Check network connectivity and proxy settings\n- Review SARIF output format compatibility\n- Validate CI/CD runner permissions\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [OWASP Top 10 Checklist](../owasp-top10-checklist/SKILL.md)\n- [Container Security](../container-security/SKILL.md)\n- [Dependency Scanning](../dependency-scanning/SKILL.md)\n\n## Tool Comparison\n\n| Tool      | Best For                 | Language Support | Cost            | Integration   |\n| --------- | ------------------------ | ---------------- | --------------- | ------------- |\n| Semgrep   | Custom rules, fast scans | 30+ languages    | Free/Enterprise | Excellent     |\n| SonarQube | Code quality + security  | 25+ languages    | Free/Commercial | Good          |\n| CodeQL    | Deep analysis, research  | 10+ languages    | Free (OSS)      | GitHub native |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Complete initial SAST tool setup\n2. Run baseline security scan\n3. Create custom rules for organization-specific patterns\n4. Integrate into CI/CD pipeline\n5. Establish security gate policies\n6. Train development team on findings and remediation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:40:57.378Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing configuration and custom rule creation for comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages.","zh":"非常适合需要高级静态应用程序安全测试配置和自定义规则创建的安全代理，以便在多种编程语言中进行全面安全扫描。","ja":"高度な静的アプリケーションセキュリティテストの構成とカスタムルールの作成が必要なセキュリティエージェントに最適です。複数のプログラミング言語で包括的なセキュリティスキャンを行うことができます。","ko":"고급 정적 애플리케이션 보안 테스트 구성 및 사용자 정의 규칙 생성이 필요한 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 여러 프로그래밍 언어에서 종합적인 보안 스캔을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de seguridad que necesitan configuración avanzada de pruebas de seguridad de aplicaciones estáticas y creación de reglas personalizadas para escaneo de seguridad integral en varios lenguajes de programación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de sécurité ayant besoin d''une configuration avancée de tests de sécurité d''applications statiques et de création de règles personnalisées pour un balayage de sécurité complet sur plusieurs langages de programmation.","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsagenten, die eine erweiterte Konfiguration von statischen Anwendungssicherheitstests und eine benutzerdefinierte Regelerstellung für umfassendes Sicherheitsscanning in mehreren Programmiersprachen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança que necessitam de configuração avançada de Teste de Segurança de Aplicativos Estáticos e criação de regras personalizadas para varredura de segurança abrangente em várias linguagens de programação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности, которым необходима расширенная настройка статического тестирования безопасности приложений и создание пользовательских правил для комплексного сканирования безопасности на нескольких языках программирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين متقدم لاختبار الأمان التطبيقي الثابت وإنشاء قواعد مخصصة لفحص أمان شامل عبر عدة لغات برمجة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning, custom security rule creation, and quality gate configuration through CI/CD pipelines using protocols like quality gates and compliance protocols.","zh":"赋予代理配置和自定义SAST工具（如Semgrep、SonarQube和CodeQL）的能力，从而实现全面安全扫描、自定义安全规则创建和通过CI/CD管道使用质量门和合规协议的质量门配置。","ja":"Semgrep、SonarQube、CodeQLなどのSASTツールを構成およびカスタマイズするエージェントの能力を提供し、包括的なセキュリティスキャン、カスタムセキュリティルールの作成、CI/CDパイプラインを使用した品質ゲートとコンプライアンスプロトコルの構成を可能にします。","ko":"Semgrep, SonarQube, CodeQL 등의 SAST 도구를 구성 및 사용자 정의할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여, 종합적인 보안 스캔, 사용자 정의 보안 규칙 생성 및 CI/CD 파이프라인을 통해 품질 게이트 및 컴플라이언스 프로토콜의 구성이 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar y personalizar herramientas de SAST como Semgrep, SonarQube y CodeQL, lo que permite un escaneo de seguridad integral, la creación de reglas de seguridad personalizadas y la configuración de puertas de calidad a través de pipelines de CI/CD utilizando protocolos como puertas de calidad y protocolos de cumplimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et de personnaliser des outils SAST tels que Semgrep, SonarQube et CodeQL, ce qui permet un balayage de sécurité complet, la création de règles de sécurité personnalisées et la configuration de portes de qualité via des pipelines CI/CD en utilisant des protocoles tels que des portes de qualité et des protocoles de conformité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, SAST-Tools wie Semgrep, SonarQube und CodeQL zu konfigurieren und anzupassen, wodurch umfassendes Sicherheitsscanning, benutzerdefinierte Sicherheitsregelerstellung und QualitätsTor-Konfiguration über CI/CD-Pipelines mithilfe von Protokollen wie Qualitäts-Toren und Compliance-Protokollen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e personalizar ferramentas de SAST como Semgrep, SonarQube e CodeQL, permitindo varredura de segurança abrangente, criação de regras de segurança personalizadas e configuração de portas de qualidade por meio de pipelines de CI/CD usando protocolos como portas de qualidade e protocolos de conformidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать и tùy chỉnh инструменты SAST, такие как Semgrep, SonarQube и CodeQL, что позволяет выполнять комплексное сканирование безопасности, создавать пользовательские правила безопасности и настраивать ворота качества через конвейеры CI/CD с использованием протоколов, таких как ворота качества и протоколы соответствия.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تكوين أدوات SAST مثل Semgrep و SonarQube و CodeQL، وتمكين فحص أمان شامل وإنشاء قواعد أمان مخصصة وتكوين بوابات الجودة من خلال خطوط أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل بوابات الجودة وبروتوكولات الامتثال."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring SAST scanning in CI/CD pipelines","Creating custom security rules for codebases","Setting up quality gates and compliance protocols"],"zh":["在CI/CD管道中配置SAST扫描","为代码库创建自定义安全规则","设置质量门和合规协议"],"ja":["CI/CDパイプラインでSASTスキャンを構成する","コードベースにカスタムセキュリティルールを作成する","品質ゲートとコンプライアンスプロトコルを設定する"],"ko":["CI/CD 파이프라인에서 SAST 스캔을 구성하는 것","코드베이스에 사용자 정의 보안 규칙을 생성하는 것","품질 게이트 및 컴플라이언스 프로토콜을 설정하는 것"],"es":["Configuración del escaneo SAST en pipelines de CI/CD","Creación de reglas de seguridad personalizadas para código","Configuración de puertas de calidad y protocolos de cumplimiento"],"fr":["Configuration du balayage SAST dans les pipelines CI/CD","Création de règles de sécurité personnalisées pour le code","Configuration des portes de qualité et des protocoles de conformité"],"de":["Konfiguration des SAST-Scannings in CI/CD-Pipelines","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Sicherheitsregeln für Code","Konfiguration von Qualitäts-Toren und Compliance-Protokollen"],"pt":["Configuração de varredura SAST em pipelines de CI/CD","Criação de regras de segurança personalizadas para bases de código","Configuração de portas de qualidade e protocolos de conformidade"],"ru":["Настройка сканирования SAST в конвейерах CI/CD","Создание пользовательских правил безопасности для кодовых баз","Настройка ворот качества и протоколов соответствия"],"ar":["تكوين فحص SAST في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD","إنشاء قواعد أمان مخصصة لقواعد البيان","تكوين بوابات الجودة وبروتوكولات الامتثال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of programming languages and SAST tools","Limited to Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL"],"zh":["需要了解编程语言和SAST工具","仅限于Semgrep、SonarQube和CodeQL"],"ja":["プログラミング言語とSASTツールの知識が必要","Semgrep、SonarQube、CodeQLのみに限定される"],"ko":["프로그래밍 언어 및 SAST 도구에 대한 지식이 필요","Semgrep, SonarQube, CodeQL만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de lenguajes de programación y herramientas SAST","Limitado a Semgrep, SonarQube y CodeQL"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langages de programmation et en outils SAST","Limité à Semgrep, SonarQube et CodeQL"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in Programmiersprachen und SAST-Tools","Eingeschränkt auf Semgrep, SonarQube und CodeQL"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de linguagens de programação e ferramentas SAST","Limitado a Semgrep, SonarQube e CodeQL"],"ru":["Требует знания языков программирования и инструментов SAST","Ограничен Semgrep, SonarQube и CodeQL"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغات البرمجة وأدوات SAST","محدود بالسمغريب و SonarQube و CodeQL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
