n"},"description":{"zh":"mTLS配置是实现零信任服务网格通信的综合指南，涵盖证书管理、TLS握手调试等","ja":"mTLS設定はゼロトラストサービスメッシュ通信を実現するための包括的なガイドです","ko":"mTLS 설정은零신뢰 서비스 메쉬 통신을 위한 포괄적인 가이드입니다","es":"La configuración de mTLS es crucial para una comunicación de malla de servicios segura. Aprende a implementarla para una comunicación de confianza cero.","fr":"La configuration mTLS est essentielle pour une communication de mesh de services sécurisée. Découvrez comment la mettre en œuvre pour une communication de co...","de":"Die mTLS-Konfiguration ist entscheidend für eine sichere Kommunikation von Service-Mesh. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie für eine Zero-Trust-Kommunikation implemen...","pt":"A configuração mTLS é um guia abrangente para implementar a autenticação mTLS para comunicação de malha de serviço de confiança zero. Aprenda a proteger a co...","ru":"Конфигурация mTLS - это всесторонний гид по реализации взаимной аутентификации TLS для сетей с нулевым доверием. Узнайте, как защитить обмен данными между се...","ar":"تكوين مTLS هو دليل شامل لتنفيذ التلزق المتبادل لشبكة الخدمات الموثوق بها. تعلم كيفية حماية الاتصالات بين الخدمات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["零信任网络实现","服务间通信保护","证书管理","TLS握手调试","合规性要求满足"],"ja":["ゼロトラストネットワークの実現","サービス間通信の保護","証明書の管理","TLSハンドシェイクの問題解決","コンプライアンス要件の満足"],"ko":["零신뢰 네트워크 구현","서비스 간 통신 보호","인증서 관리","TLS 핸드셰이크 문제 해결","준수 요구사항 충족"],"es":["Implementación de mTLS para comunicación de confianza cero","Autenticación mutua entre servicios","Rotación y administración de certificados","Depuración de problemas de handshake de TLS","Cumplimiento de requisitos de cumplimiento (PCI-DSS, HIPAA)","Comunicación segura entre clústeres múltiples"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de mTLS pour une communication de confiance zéro","Authentification mutuelle entre les services","Rotation et gestion des certificats","Débogage des problèmes de handshake de TLS","Conformité aux exigences de conformité (PCI-DSS, HIPAA)","Communication sécurisée entre les clusters multiples"],"de":["Implementierung von mTLS für Zero-Trust-Kommunikation","Gegenseitige Authentifizierung zwischen Diensten","Zertifikatsrotation und -verwaltung","Fehlersuche bei TLS-Handshake-Problemen","Einhaltung von Compliance-Anforderungen (PCI-DSS, HIPAA)","Sichere Kommunikation zwischen mehreren Clustern"],"pt":["Implementação de rede de confiança zero","Proteção da comunicação entre serviços","Gestão de certificados e rotação","Depuração de problemas de handshake TLS","Atendimento aos requisitos de conformidade"],"ru":["Реализация сетей с нулевым доверием","Защита обмена данными между сервисами","Управление сертификатами и ротация","Дебаггинг проблем handshake TLS","Соответствие требованиям соблюдения нормативов"],"ar":["تنفيذ شبكة موثوق بها","حماية الاتصالات بين الخدمات","إدارة الشهادات وتدويرها","تصحيح أخطاء handshake TLS","تنفيذ متطلبات التوافق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["mTLS配置","零信任网络","服务间通信","证书管理","TLS握手","合规性要求"],"ja":["mTLS設定","ゼロトラストネットワーク","サービス間通信","証明書の管理","TLSハンドシェイク","コンプライアンス要件"],"ko":["mTLS 설정","零신뢰 네트워크","서비스 간 통신","인증서 관리","TLS 핸드셰이크","준수 요구사항"],"es":["mTLS","configuración de mTLS","comunicación de confianza cero","seguridad de servicio","autenticación mutua","rotación de certificados","depuración de TLS","cumplimiento de PCI-DSS","cumplimiento de HIPAA"],"fr":["mTLS","configuration mTLS","communication de confiance zéro","sécurité de service","authentification mutuelle","rotation des certificats","débogage de TLS","conformité à PCI-DSS","conformité à HIPAA"],"de":["mTLS","mTLS-Konfiguration","Zero-Trust-Kommunikation","Dienstsicherheit","gegenseitige Authentifizierung","Zertifikatsrotation","TLS-Fehlersuche","Einhaltung von PCI-DSS","Einhaltung von HIPAA"],"pt":["mTLS","configuração mTLS","autenticação mTLS","comunicação de malha de serviço","confiança zero","segurança de rede"],"ru":["mTLS","конфигурация mTLS","взаимная аутентификация TLS","сеть сервисов","сеть с нулевым доверием","безопасность сети"],"ar":["مTLS","تكوين مTLS","التحقق المتبادل مTLS","شبكة الخدمات","شبكة موثوق بها","أمن الشبكة"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mtls-configuration","description":"Configure mutual TLS (mTLS) for zero-trust service-to-service communication. Use when implementing zero-trust networking, certificate management, or securing internal service communication.","bodyPreview":"# mTLS Configuration\n\nComprehensive guide to implementing mutual TLS for zero-trust service mesh communication.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing zero-trust networking\n- Securing service-to-service communication\n- Certificate rotation and management\n- Debugging TLS handshake issues\n- Compliance requirements (PCI-DSS, HIPAA)\n- Multi-cluster secure communication\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. mTLS Flow\n\n```\n┌─────────┐                              ┌─────────┐\n│ Service │","body":"# mTLS Configuration\n\nComprehensive guide to implementing mutual TLS for zero-trust service mesh communication.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Implementing zero-trust networking\n- Securing service-to-service communication\n- Certificate rotation and management\n- Debugging TLS handshake issues\n- Compliance requirements (PCI-DSS, HIPAA)\n- Multi-cluster secure communication\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. mTLS Flow\n\n```\n┌─────────┐                              ┌─────────┐\n│ Service │                              │ Service │\n│    A    │                              │    B    │\n└────┬────┘                              └────┬────┘\n     │                                        │\n┌────┴────┐      TLS Handshake          ┌────┴────┐\n│  Proxy  │◄───────────────────────────►│  Proxy  │\n│(Sidecar)│  1. ClientHello             │(Sidecar)│\n│         │  2. ServerHello + Cert      │         │\n│         │  3. Client Cert             │         │\n│         │  4. Verify Both Certs       │         │\n│         │  5. Encrypted Channel       │         │\n└─────────┘                              └─────────┘\n```\n\n### 2. Certificate Hierarchy\n\n```\nRoot CA (Self-signed, long-lived)\n    │\n    ├── Intermediate CA (Cluster-level)\n    │       │\n    │       ├── Workload Cert (Service A)\n    │       └── Workload Cert (Service B)\n    │\n    └── Intermediate CA (Multi-cluster)\n            │\n            └── Cross-cluster certs\n```\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: Istio mTLS (Strict Mode)\n\n```yaml\n# Enable strict mTLS mesh-wide\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: PeerAuthentication\nmetadata:\n  name: default\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  mtls:\n    mode: STRICT\n---\n# Namespace-level override (permissive for migration)\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: PeerAuthentication\nmetadata:\n  name: default\n  namespace: legacy-namespace\nspec:\n  mtls:\n    mode: PERMISSIVE\n---\n# Workload-specific policy\napiVersion: security.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: PeerAuthentication\nmetadata:\n  name: payment-service\n  namespace: production\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: payment-service\n  mtls:\n    mode: STRICT\n  portLevelMtls:\n    8080:\n      mode: STRICT\n    9090:\n      mode: DISABLE # Metrics port, no mTLS\n```\n\n### Template 2: Istio Destination Rule for mTLS\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: DestinationRule\nmetadata:\n  name: default\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  host: \"*.local\"\n  trafficPolicy:\n    tls:\n      mode: ISTIO_MUTUAL\n---\n# TLS to external service\napiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: DestinationRule\nmetadata:\n  name: external-api\nspec:\n  host: api.external.com\n  trafficPolicy:\n    tls:\n      mode: SIMPLE\n      caCertificates: /etc/certs/external-ca.pem\n---\n# Mutual TLS to external service\napiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1\nkind: DestinationRule\nmetadata:\n  name: partner-api\nspec:\n  host: api.partner.com\n  trafficPolicy:\n    tls:\n      mode: MUTUAL\n      clientCertificate: /etc/certs/client.pem\n      privateKey: /etc/certs/client-key.pem\n      caCertificates: /etc/certs/partner-ca.pem\n```\n\n### Template 3: Cert-Manager with Istio\n\n```yaml\n# Install cert-manager issuer for Istio\napiVersion: cert-manager.io/v1\nkind: ClusterIssuer\nmetadata:\n  name: istio-ca\nspec:\n  ca:\n    secretName: istio-ca-secret\n---\n# Create Istio CA secret\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Secret\nmetadata:\n  name: istio-ca-secret\n  namespace: cert-manager\ntype: kubernetes.io/tls\ndata:\n  tls.crt: <base64-encoded-ca-cert>\n  tls.key: <base64-encoded-ca-key>\n---\n# Certificate for workload\napiVersion: cert-manager.io/v1\nkind: Certificate\nmetadata:\n  name: my-service-cert\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  secretName: my-service-tls\n  duration: 24h\n  renewBefore: 8h\n  issuerRef:\n    name: istio-ca\n    kind: ClusterIssuer\n  commonName: my-service.my-namespace.svc.cluster.local\n  dnsNames:\n    - my-service\n    - my-service.my-namespace\n    - my-service.my-namespace.svc\n    - my-service.my-namespace.svc.cluster.local\n  usages:\n    - server auth\n    - client auth\n```\n\n### Template 4: SPIFFE/SPIRE Integration\n\n```yaml\n# SPIRE Server configuration\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: spire-server\n  namespace: spire\ndata:\n  server.conf: |\n    server {\n      bind_address = \"0.0.0.0\"\n      bind_port = \"8081\"\n      trust_domain = \"example.org\"\n      data_dir = \"/run/spire/data\"\n      log_level = \"INFO\"\n      ca_ttl = \"168h\"\n      default_x509_svid_ttl = \"1h\"\n    }\n\n    plugins {\n      DataStore \"sql\" {\n        plugin_data {\n          database_type = \"sqlite3\"\n          connection_string = \"/run/spire/data/datastore.sqlite3\"\n        }\n      }\n\n      NodeAttestor \"k8s_psat\" {\n        plugin_data {\n          clusters = {\n            \"demo-cluster\" = {\n              service_account_allow_list = [\"spire:spire-agent\"]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      KeyManager \"memory\" {\n        plugin_data {}\n      }\n\n      UpstreamAuthority \"disk\" {\n        plugin_data {\n          key_file_path = \"/run/spire/secrets/bootstrap.key\"\n          cert_file_path = \"/run/spire/secrets/bootstrap.crt\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n---\n# SPIRE Agent DaemonSet (abbreviated)\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: DaemonSet\nmetadata:\n  name: spire-agent\n  namespace: spire\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: spire-agent\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: spire-agent\n          image: ghcr.io/spiffe/spire-agent:1.8.0\n          volumeMounts:\n            - name: spire-agent-socket\n              mountPath: /run/spire/sockets\n      volumes:\n        - name: spire-agent-socket\n          hostPath:\n            path: /run/spire/sockets\n            type: DirectoryOrCreate\n```\n\n### Template 5: Linkerd mTLS (Automatic)\n\n```yaml\n# Linkerd enables mTLS automatically\n# Verify with:\n# linkerd viz edges deployment -n my-namespace\n\n# For external services without mTLS\napiVersion: policy.linkerd.io/v1beta1\nkind: Server\nmetadata:\n  name: external-api\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  podSelector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: my-app\n  port: external-api\n  proxyProtocol: HTTP/1 # or TLS for passthrough\n---\n# Skip TLS for specific port\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: my-service\n  annotations:\n    config.linkerd.io/skip-outbound-ports: \"3306\" # MySQL\n```\n\n## Certificate Rotation\n\n```bash\n# Istio - Check certificate expiry\nistioctl proxy-config secret deploy/my-app -o json | \\\n  jq ''.dynamicActiveSecrets[0].secret.tlsCertificate.certificateChain.inlineBytes'' | \\\n  tr -d ''\"'' | base64 -d | openssl x509 -text -noout\n\n# Force certificate rotation\nkubectl rollout restart deployment/my-app\n\n# Check Linkerd identity\nlinkerd identity -n my-namespace\n```\n\n## Debugging mTLS Issues\n\n```bash\n# Istio - Check if mTLS is enabled\nistioctl authn tls-check my-service.my-namespace.svc.cluster.local\n\n# Verify peer authentication\nkubectl get peerauthentication --all-namespaces\n\n# Check destination rules\nkubectl get destinationrule --all-namespaces\n\n# Debug TLS handshake\nistioctl proxy-config log deploy/my-app --level debug\nkubectl logs deploy/my-app -c istio-proxy | grep -i tls\n\n# Linkerd - Check mTLS status\nlinkerd viz edges deployment -n my-namespace\nlinkerd viz tap deploy/my-app --to deploy/my-backend\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Start with PERMISSIVE** - Migrate gradually to STRICT\n- **Monitor certificate expiry** - Set up alerts\n- **Use short-lived certs** - 24h or less for workloads\n- **Rotate CA periodically** - Plan for CA rotation\n- **Log TLS errors** - For debugging and audit\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t disable mTLS** - For convenience in production\n- **Don''t ignore cert expiry** - Automate rotation\n- **Don''t use self-signed certs** - Use proper CA hierarchy\n- **Don''t skip verification** - Verify the full chain\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Istio Security](https://istio.io/latest/docs/concepts/security/)\n- [SPIFFE/SPIRE](https://spiffe.io/)\n- [cert-manager](https://cert-manager.io/)\n- [Zero Trust Architecture (NIST)](https://www.nist.gov/publications/zero-trust-architecture)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:41:31.267Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents requiring advanced mutual TLS configuration for zero-trust service mesh communication.","zh":"非常适合需要高级互认证TLS配置的零信任服务网格通信的安全代理。","ja":"ゼロトラストサービスメッシュ通信のための高度な相互認証TLS構成を必要とするセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"零 신뢰 서비스 메시 통신을 위한 고급 상호 인증 TLS 구성이 필요한 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad que requieren una configuración de TLS mutua avanzada para la comunicación de malla de servicio de confianza cero.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité nécessitant une configuration de TLS mutuelle avancée pour la communication de maille de service de confiance zéro.","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsagenten, die eine erweiterte gegenseitige TLS-Konfiguration für die Kommunikation in einem Zero-Trust-Service-Mesh benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança que exigem configuração de TLS mútuo avançada para comunicação de malha de serviço de confiança zero.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности, требующих расширенной настройки взаимного TLS для общения сервисной сетки с нулевым доверием.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الأمن التي تتطلب تكوين TLS المتبادل المتقدم لاتصالات شبكة الخدمة بدون ثقة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure service-to-service communication using mutual TLS, facilitating certificate rotation and management, and ensuring compliance with protocols like PCI-DSS and HIPAA.","zh":"使代理能够使用相互认证TLS实现服务之间的安全通信，促进证书轮换和管理，并确保遵守PCI-DSS和HIPAA等协议。","ja":"エージェントが相互認証TLSを使用してサービス間の安全な通信を実現し、証明書のローテーションと管理を促進し、PCI-DSSやHIPAAなどのプロトコルに準拠することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 상호 인증 TLS를 사용하여 서비스 간의 보안 통신을 구현하고, 인증서 회전 및 관리를 촉진하며, PCI-DSS 및 HIPAA와 같은 프로토콜을 준수할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una comunicación segura de servicio a servicio utilizando TLS mutuo, facilitando la rotación y administración de certificados, y garantizando el cumplimiento de protocolos como PCI-DSS y HIPAA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une communication de service à service sécurisée en utilisant le TLS mutuel, facilitant la rotation et la gestion des certificats, et assurant la conformité avec des protocoles tels que PCI-DSS et HIPAA.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine sichere Service-to-Service-Kommunikation mithilfe von gegenseitigem TLS zu implementieren, erleichtert die Zertifikatsrotation und -verwaltung und stellt die Einhaltung von Protokollen wie PCI-DSS und HIPAA sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar comunicação de serviço para serviço segura usando TLS mútuo, facilitando a rotação e gerenciamento de certificados e garantindo conformidade com protocolos como PCI-DSS e HIPAA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать безопасное общение сервиса к сервису с использованием взаимного TLS, облегчая вращение и управление сертификатами, а также обеспечение соответствия протоколам, таким как PCI-DSS и HIPAA.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ اتصال خدمة آمنة باستخدام بروتوكول TLS المتبادل، و تسهيل دوران الشهادات و إدارتها، و ضمان الامتثال لبروتوكولات مثل PCI-DSS و HIPAA."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing zero-trust networking with mTLS","Debugging TLS handshake issues in multi-cluster environments","Automating certificate rotation and management for secure communication"],"zh":["使用mTLS实现零信任网络","在多集群环境中调试TLS握手问题","自动化证书轮换和管理以实现安全通信"],"ja":["mTLSを使用したゼロトラストネットワークの実現","マルチクラスタ環境でのTLSハンドシェイクの問題のデバッグ","証明書のローテーションと管理の自動化による安全な通信の実現"],"ko":["mTLS를 사용한零 신뢰 네트워킹 구현","다중 클러스터 환경에서 TLS 핸드셰이크 문제 디버깅","인증서 회전 및 관리 자동화에 의한 보안 통신 구현"],"es":["Implementar redes de confianza cero con mTLS","Depurar problemas de apretón de manos TLS en entornos de multi-cluster","Automatizar la rotación y administración de certificados para una comunicación segura"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des réseaux de confiance zéro avec mTLS","Déboguer les problèmes de poignée de main TLS dans des environnements multi-cluster","Automatiser la rotation et la gestion des certificats pour une communication sécurisée"],"de":["Implementierung von Zero-Trust-Netzwerken mit mTLS","Debuggen von TLS-Handshake-Problemen in Multi-Cluster-Umgebungen","Automatisierung der Zertifikatsrotation und -verwaltung für eine sichere Kommunikation"],"pt":["Implementação de rede de confiança zero com mTLS","Depuração de problemas de aperto de mão TLS em ambientes de vários clusters","Automação da rotação e gerenciamento de certificados para comunicação segura"],"ru":["Реализация сетей с нулевым доверием с использованием mTLS","Отладка проблем рукопожатия TLS в многокластерных средах","Автоматизация вращения и управления сертификатами для безопасного общения"],"ar":["تنفيذ شبكة بدون ثقة باستخدام بروتوكول TLS المتبادل","تصحيح أخطاء握手 بروتوكول TLS في بيئات متعددة","أتمتة دوران الشهادات وإدارتها للاتصال الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TLS protocol and certificate management","Specific to mutual TLS configuration, not applicable to other security protocols"],"zh":["需要TLS协议和证书管理的知识","仅适用于相互认证TLS配置，不适用于其他安全协议"],"ja":["TLSプロトコルと証明書管理の知識が必要","相互認証TLS構成にのみ適用され、他のセキュリティプロトコルには適用されない"],"ko":["TLS 프로토콜 및 인증서 관리 지식이 필요","상호 인증 TLS 구성에만 적용되며, 다른 보안 프로토콜에는 적용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del protocolo TLS y administración de certificados","Específico para la configuración de TLS mutua, no aplicable a otros protocolos de seguridad"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur le protocole TLS et la gestion des certificats","Spécifique à la configuration de TLS mutuelle, non applicable à d''autres protocoles de sécurité"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse des TLS-Protokolls und der Zertifikatsverwaltung","Spezifisch für die Konfiguration von gegenseitigem TLS, nicht anwendbar auf andere Sicherheitsprotokolle"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do protocolo TLS e gerenciamento de certificados","Específico para configuração de TLS mútuo, não aplicável a outros protocolos de segurança"],"ru":["Требует знания протокола TLS и управления сертификатами","Относится конкретно к настройке взаимного TLS, не применима к другим протоколам безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بروتوكول TLS وإدارة الشهادات","محدد لتكوين بروتوكول TLS المتبادل، لا ينطبق على بروتوكولات أمنية أخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
