o conocimientos cero sobre la base de código y dominio del problema","fr":"Écrire des plans d''implémentation complets pour les développeurs, en supposant des connaissances nulles sur la base de code et le domaine du problème","de":"Erstellen Sie detaillierte Implementierungspläne für Entwickler, unter der Annahme von null Kenntnissen über die Codebasis und Problemdomäne","pt":"Escreva planos de implementação completos, documentando tudo o que o engenheiro precisa saber, desde arquivos até testes e documentação","ru":"Напишите полные планы реализации, документируя все, что инженер должен знать, от файлов до тестов и документации","ar":"اكتب خطط تنفيذ شاملة، وثق كل ما يحتاجه المهندس معرفته، من الملفات إلى الاختبارات والتوثيق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["任务分解","代码实现","测试和验证","文档记录","频繁提交"],"ja":["タスク分解","コード実装","テストと検証","ドキュメント作成","頻繁なコミット"],"ko":["태스크 분해","코드 구현","테스트 및 검증","문서 기록","頻繁한 커밋"],"es":["Tareas en tamaño bite","Documentación completa","Pruebas y validación","Commit frecuentes","Seguimiento de principios DRY y YAGNI"],"fr":["Tâches de taille réduite","Documentation complète","Tests et validation","Commit fréquents","Suivi des principes DRY et YAGNI"],"de":["Aufgaben in kleinen Schritten","Vollständige Dokumentation","Tests und Validierung","Häufige Commits","Einhalten der Prinzipien DRY und YAGNI"],"pt":["Documentação abrangente","Tarefas divididas em partes menores","Testes e validação","Commits frequentes","Princípios DRY e YAGNI"],"ru":["Комплексная документация","Задачи, разделенные на меньшие части","Тесты и валидация","Частые коммиты","Принципы DRY и YAGNI"],"ar":["توثيق شامل","مهام منقسمة إلى أجزاء أصغر","اختبارات وتحقق","التزامات متكررة","مبادئ DRY و YAGNI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["开发实施计划","编写代码","测试和文档","频繁提交","任务分解","代码实现"],"ja":["開発実装計画","コード作成","テストとドキュメント","頻繁なコミット","タスク分解","コード実装"],"ko":["개발 구현 계획","코드 작성","테스트 및 문서","頻繁한 커밋","태스크 분해","코드 구현"],"es":["planificación de implementación","desarrollo de software","pruebas y validación","documentación técnica","commit frecuentes","principios DRY y YAGNI","desarrollo ágil","metodologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["planification d''implémentation","développement de logiciels","tests et validation","documentation technique","commit fréquents","principes DRY et YAGNI","développement agile","méthodologies de développement"],"de":["Implementierungsplanung","Softwareentwicklung","Tests und Validierung","technische Dokumentation","häufige Commits","Prinzipien DRY und YAGNI","agiles Entwicklung","Entwicklungsmethoden"],"pt":["planos de implementação","documentação técnica","testes de software","desenvolvimento de software","princípios de desenvolvimento","engenharia de software"],"ru":["планы реализации","техническая документация","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","принципы разработки","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["خطط التنفيذ","توثيق تقني","اختبارات البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","مبادئ التطوير","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-plans","description":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code","bodyPreview":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test","body":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test design very well.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the writing-plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n\n**Context:** This should be run in a dedicated worktree (created by brainstorming skill).\n\n**Save plans to:** `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`\n\n## Bite-Sized Task Granularity\n\n**Each step is one action (2-5 minutes):**\n- \"Write the failing test\" - step\n- \"Run it to make sure it fails\" - step\n- \"Implement the minimal code to make the test pass\" - step\n- \"Run the tests and make sure they pass\" - step\n- \"Commit\" - step\n\n## Plan Document Header\n\n**Every plan MUST start with this header:**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.\n\n**Goal:** [One sentence describing what this builds]\n\n**Architecture:** [2-3 sentences about approach]\n\n**Tech Stack:** [Key technologies/libraries]\n\n---\n```\n\n## Task Structure\n\n```markdown\n### Task N: [Component Name]\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `exact/path/to/file.py`\n- Modify: `exact/path/to/existing.py:123-145`\n- Test: `tests/exact/path/to/test.py`\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test**\n\n```python\ndef test_specific_behavior():\n    result = function(input)\n    assert result == expected\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: FAIL with \"function not defined\"\n\n**Step 3: Write minimal implementation**\n\n```python\ndef function(input):\n    return expected\n```\n\n**Step 4: Run test to verify it passes**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: PASS\n\n**Step 5: Commit**\n\n```bash\ngit add tests/path/test.py src/path/file.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add specific feature\"\n```\n```\n\n## Remember\n- Exact file paths always\n- Complete code in plan (not \"add validation\")\n- Exact commands with expected output\n- Reference relevant skills with @ syntax\n- DRY, YAGNI, TDD, frequent commits\n\n## Execution Handoff\n\nAfter saving the plan, offer execution choice:\n\n**\"Plan complete and saved to `docs/plans/<filename>.md`. Two execution options:**\n\n**1. Subagent-Driven (this session)** - I dispatch fresh subagent per task, review between tasks, fast iteration\n\n**2. Parallel Session (separate)** - Open new session with executing-plans, batch execution with checkpoints\n\n**Which approach?\"**\n\n**If Subagent-Driven chosen:**\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development\n- Stay in this session\n- Fresh subagent per task + code review\n\n**If Parallel Session chosen:**\n- Guide them to open new session in worktree\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** New session uses superpowers:executing-plans\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:41:30.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing structured implementation planning with DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化实施规划的开发者代理，包括DRY、YAGNI和TDD原则。","ja":"構造化された実装計画が必要な開発者エージェントに最適で、DRY、YAGNI、TDDの原則を備えています。","ko":"구조화된 구현 계획이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 적합하며 DRY, YAGNI 및 TDD 원칙을 따릅니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una planificación de implementación estructurada con principios DRY, YAGNI y TDD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée avec les principes DRY, YAGNI et TDD.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung mit DRY-, YAGNI- und TDD-Prinzipien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores que necessitam de planejamento de implementação estruturado com os princípios DRY, YAGNI e TDD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуется структурированный план реализации с принципами DRY, YAGNI и TDD.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط تنفيذ منظم مع مبادئ DRY و YAGNI و TDD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive implementation plans with bite-sized tasks, frequent commits, and adherence to testing and documentation best practices, utilizing code, testing, and docs checks.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面实施计划的能力，具有小规模任务、频繁提交和遵守测试和文档最佳实践的特点，利用代码、测试和文档检查。","ja":"エージェントが包括的な実装計画を生成できるようにし、小規模なタスク、頻繁なコミット、テストおよびドキュメントのベストプラクティスに従うことを可能にし、コード、テスト、ドキュメントのチェックを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 구현 계획을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 작은 규모의 작업, 빈번한 커밋, 테스트 및 문서의 최선의 관행을 준수하는 기능을 제공하고 코드, 테스트, 문서 점검을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar planes de implementación completos con tareas de tamaño reducido, confirmaciones frecuentes y adherencia a las mejores prácticas de prueba y documentación, utilizando comprobaciones de código, pruebas y documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des plans d''implémentation complets avec des tâches de petite taille, des validations fréquentes et une adhésion aux meilleures pratiques de test et de documentation, en utilisant des vérifications de code, de test et de documentation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Implementierungspläne mit kleinen Aufgaben, häufigen Commits und Einhaltung der besten Praktiken für Tests und Dokumentation zu generieren, indem Code-, Test- und Dokumentationsprüfungen verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem planos de implementação abrangentes com tarefas de tamanho reduzido, commits frequentes e adesão às melhores práticas de teste e documentação, utilizando verificações de código, teste e documentação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать комплексные планы реализации с задачами небольшого размера, частыми коммитами и соблюдением лучших практик тестирования и документации, используя проверки кода, тестирования и документации.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء خطط تنفيذ شاملة مع مهام بحجم مناسب، وتواصل متكرر، والالتزام بالمعايير المثلى للاختبار والتوثيق، باستخدام فحص الشفرة واختبارات والوثائق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task planning for new features","Generating step-by-step guides for codebase navigation","Debugging complex implementation issues with detailed testing plans"],"zh":["自动化新功能的任务规划","生成代码库导航的分步指南","使用详细测试计划调试复杂的实施问题"],"ja":["新しい機能のタスク計画の自動化","コードベースのナビゲーション用のステップバイステップガイドの生成","詳細なテスト計画を使用した複雑な実装問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["새로운 기능의 작업 계획 자동화","코드베이스 내비게이션을 위한 단계별 가이드 생성","상세한 테스트 계획을 사용한 복잡한 구현 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de tareas para nuevas características","Generación de guías paso a paso para la navegación de la base de código","Depuración de problemas de implementación complejos con planes de pruebas detallados"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification des tâches pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Génération de guides étape par étape pour la navigation du codebase","Débogage de problèmes d''implémentation complexes avec des plans de test détaillés"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenplanung für neue Funktionen","Generierung von Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitungen für die Navigation der Codebasis","Fehlerbehebung komplexer Implementierungsprobleme mit detaillierten Testplänen"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de tarefas para novos recursos","Gerar guias passo a passo para navegação no código","Depurar problemas de implementação complexos com planos de teste detalhados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование задач для новых функций","Генерировать пошаговые руководства для навигации по кодовой базе","Отлаживать сложные проблемы реализации с помощью детальных планов тестирования"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتخطيط المهام للسمات الجديدة","توليد دليل خطوة بخطوة للملاحة في قاعدة الشفرة","تصحيح مشاكل التنفيذ المعقدة مع خطط اختبار مفصلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Assumes skilled developer with minimal context","Requires knowledge of toolset and problem domain for optimal use"],"zh":["假设开发者具有最小的上下文知识","需要工具集和问题域的知识以实现最佳使用"],"ja":["最小のコンテキスト知識を持つ開発者を前提としています","最適な使用にはツールセットと問題ドメインの知識が必要です"],"ko":["최소한의 문맥 지식을 가진 개발자를 가정","최적의 사용을 위해서는 도구 세트와 문제 도메인에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Supone un desarrollador capacitado con un contexto mínimo","Requiere conocimiento del conjunto de herramientas y del dominio del problema para un uso óptimo"],"fr":["Suppose un développeur qualifié avec un contexte minimal","Requiert une connaissance de l''ensemble d''outils et du domaine du problème pour une utilisation optimale"],"de":["Geht von einem qualifizierten Entwickler mit minimalem Kontext aus","Benötigt Kenntnisse des Werkzeugsets und des Problembereichs für eine optimale Nutzung"],"pt":["Pressupõe um desenvolvedor qualificado com contexto mínimo","Exige conhecimento do conjunto de ferramentas e domínio do problema para uso ótimo"],"ru":["Предполагает наличие опытного разработчика с минимальным контекстом","Требует знания набора инструментов и области проблемы для оптимального использования"],"ar":["يفترض وجود مطور ماهر مع سياق أدنى","يتطلب معرفة مجموعة الأدوات ومجال المشكلة للاستخدام الأمثل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
