,"producción de software","plataformas de despliegue","desarrollo de software","devops","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["déploiement d''applications","procédures de déploiement","déploiement sécurisé","production de logiciels","plateformes de déploiement","développement de logiciels","devops","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Anwendungs-Deploy","Deploy-Prozeduren","sicheres Deployen","Software-Produktion","Deploy-Plattformen","Software-Entwicklung","devops","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["procedimentos de implantação","conversão de configurações","Antigravity IDE","IDEs","CLIs","implantação segura","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["процедуры развертывания","конвертация конфигураций","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","безопасное развертывание","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إجراءات النشر","تحويل الإعدادات","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","نشر آمن","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deployment-procedures","description":"Production deployment principles and decision-making. Safe deployment workflows, rollback strategies, and verification. Teaches thinking, not scripts.","bodyPreview":"# Deployment Procedures\n\n> Deployment principles and decision-making for safe production releases.\n> **Learn to THINK, not memorize scripts.**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill teaches **deployment principles**, not bash scripts to copy.\n\n- Every deployment is unique\n- Understand the WHY behind each step\n- Adapt procedures to your platform\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you deploying?\n│\n├── Static site / JAMstack\n│   └── Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pa","body":"# Deployment Procedures\n\n> Deployment principles and decision-making for safe production releases.\n> **Learn to THINK, not memorize scripts.**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill teaches **deployment principles**, not bash scripts to copy.\n\n- Every deployment is unique\n- Understand the WHY behind each step\n- Adapt procedures to your platform\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you deploying?\n│\n├── Static site / JAMstack\n│   └── Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages\n│\n├── Simple web app\n│   ├── Managed → Railway, Render, Fly.io\n│   └── Control → VPS + PM2/Docker\n│\n├── Microservices\n│   └── Container orchestration\n│\n└── Serverless\n    └── Edge functions, Lambda\n```\n\n### Each Platform Has Different Procedures\n\n| Platform | Deployment Method |\n|----------|------------------|\n| **Vercel/Netlify** | Git push, auto-deploy |\n| **Railway/Render** | Git push or CLI |\n| **VPS + PM2** | SSH + manual steps |\n| **Docker** | Image push + orchestration |\n| **Kubernetes** | kubectl apply |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Pre-Deployment Principles\n\n### The 4 Verification Categories\n\n| Category | What to Check |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **Code Quality** | Tests passing, linting clean, reviewed |\n| **Build** | Production build works, no warnings |\n| **Environment** | Env vars set, secrets current |\n| **Safety** | Backup done, rollback plan ready |\n\n### Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n- [ ] All tests passing\n- [ ] Code reviewed and approved\n- [ ] Production build successful\n- [ ] Environment variables verified\n- [ ] Database migrations ready (if any)\n- [ ] Rollback plan documented\n- [ ] Team notified\n- [ ] Monitoring ready\n\n---\n\n## 3. Deployment Workflow Principles\n\n### The 5-Phase Process\n\n```\n1. PREPARE\n   └── Verify code, build, env vars\n\n2. BACKUP\n   └── Save current state before changing\n\n3. DEPLOY\n   └── Execute with monitoring open\n\n4. VERIFY\n   └── Health check, logs, key flows\n\n5. CONFIRM or ROLLBACK\n   └── All good? Confirm. Issues? Rollback.\n```\n\n### Phase Principles\n\n| Phase | Principle |\n|-------|-----------|\n| **Prepare** | Never deploy untested code |\n| **Backup** | Can''t rollback without backup |\n| **Deploy** | Watch it happen, don''t walk away |\n| **Verify** | Trust but verify |\n| **Confirm** | Have rollback trigger ready |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Post-Deployment Verification\n\n### What to Verify\n\n| Check | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| **Health endpoint** | Service is running |\n| **Error logs** | No new errors |\n| **Key user flows** | Critical features work |\n| **Performance** | Response times acceptable |\n\n### Verification Window\n\n- **First 5 minutes**: Active monitoring\n- **15 minutes**: Confirm stable\n- **1 hour**: Final verification\n- **Next day**: Review metrics\n\n---\n\n## 5. Rollback Principles\n\n### When to Rollback\n\n| Symptom | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Service down | Rollback immediately |\n| Critical errors | Rollback |\n| Performance >50% degraded | Consider rollback |\n| Minor issues | Fix forward if quick |\n\n### Rollback Strategy by Platform\n\n| Platform | Rollback Method |\n|----------|----------------|\n| **Vercel/Netlify** | Redeploy previous commit |\n| **Railway/Render** | Rollback in dashboard |\n| **VPS + PM2** | Restore backup, restart |\n| **Docker** | Previous image tag |\n| **K8s** | kubectl rollout undo |\n\n### Rollback Principles\n\n1. **Speed over perfection**: Rollback first, debug later\n2. **Don''t compound errors**: One rollback, not multiple changes\n3. **Communicate**: Tell team what happened\n4. **Post-mortem**: Understand why after stable\n\n---\n\n## 6. Zero-Downtime Deployment\n\n### Strategies\n\n| Strategy | How It Works |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **Rolling** | Replace instances one by one |\n| **Blue-Green** | Switch traffic between environments |\n| **Canary** | Gradual traffic shift |\n\n### Selection Principles\n\n| Scenario | Strategy |\n|----------|----------|\n| Standard release | Rolling |\n| High-risk change | Blue-green (easy rollback) |\n| Need validation | Canary (test with real traffic) |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Emergency Procedures\n\n### Service Down Priority\n\n1. **Assess**: What''s the symptom?\n2. **Quick fix**: Restart if unclear\n3. **Rollback**: If restart doesn''t help\n4. **Investigate**: After stable\n\n### Investigation Order\n\n| Check | Common Issues |\n|-------|--------------|\n| **Logs** | Errors, exceptions |\n| **Resources** | Disk full, memory |\n| **Network** | DNS, firewall |\n| **Dependencies** | Database, APIs |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Deploy on Friday | Deploy early in week |\n| Rush deployment | Follow the process |\n| Skip staging | Always test first |\n| Deploy without backup | Backup before deploy |\n| Walk away after deploy | Monitor for 15+ min |\n| Multiple changes at once | One change at a time |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Decision Checklist\n\nBefore deploying:\n\n- [ ] **Platform-appropriate procedure?**\n- [ ] **Backup strategy ready?**\n- [ ] **Rollback plan documented?**\n- [ ] **Monitoring configured?**\n- [ ] **Team notified?**\n- [ ] **Time to monitor after?**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Best Practices\n\n1. **Small, frequent deploys** over big releases\n2. **Feature flags** for risky changes\n3. **Automate** repetitive steps\n4. **Document** every deployment\n5. **Review** what went wrong after issues\n6. **Test rollback** before you need it\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Every deployment is a risk. Minimize risk through preparation, not speed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:41:56.638Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing standardized release procedures across IDEs and CLIs.","zh":"非常适合需要在IDE和CLI中标准化发布程序的云部署代理。","ja":"IDEやCLIで標準化されたリリース手順を必要とするクラウドデプロイメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"IDE 및 CLI에서 표준화된 릴리스 프로세스가 필요한 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan procedimientos de lanzamiento estandarizados en IDE y CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant des procédures de publication standardisées sur les IDE et les CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die standardisierte Release-Verfahren über IDEs und CLIs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Implantação em Nuvem que necessitam de procedimentos de lançamento padronizados em IDEs e CLIs.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания в облаке, которым требуются стандартизированные процедуры выпуска в IDE и CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النشر السحابي الذين يحتاجون إلى إجراءات إصدار معيارية عبر بيئات التطوير المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to adapt deployment procedures to unique platforms, leveraging decision trees for safe production releases and compatibility with GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and other IDEs and CLIs like Kiro and OpenCode.","zh":"赋予代理人根据独特的平台来调整部署流程的能力，利用决策树来确保安全的生产发布，并与GitHub Copilot、Cursor以及其他IDE和CLI如Kiro和OpenCode兼容。","ja":"エージェントが独自のプラットフォームに応じたデプロイ手順を適応させる能力を提供し、決定木を使用して安全な生产リリースを保証し、GitHub Copilot、Cursor、およびその他のIDEやCLI such as KiroおよびOpenCodeと互換性がある。","ko":"에이전트가 고유한 플랫폼에 따라 배포 절차를 조정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 결정 트리를 사용하여 안전한 프로덕션 릴리스를 보장하고 GitHub Copilot, Cursor 및 기타 IDE 및 CLI와의 호환성을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes adaptar los procedimientos de implementación a plataformas únicas, aprovechando árboles de decisión para lanzamientos de producción seguros y compatibilidad con GitHub Copilot, Cursor y otros IDE y CLI como Kiro y OpenCode.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''adapter les procédures de déploiement à des plates-formes uniques, en exploitant les arbres de décision pour des publications de production sécurisées et une compatibilité avec GitHub Copilot, Cursor et d''autres IDE et CLI comme Kiro et OpenCode.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Bereitstellungsverfahren an einzigartige Plattformen anzupassen, indem Entscheidungsbäume für sichere Produktionsfreigaben und Kompatibilität mit GitHub Copilot, Cursor und anderen IDEs und CLIs wie Kiro und OpenCode genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes adaptem os procedimentos de implantação a plataformas únicas, aproveitando árvores de decisão para lançamentos de produção seguros e compatibilidade com GitHub Copilot, Cursor e outras IDEs e CLIs como Kiro e OpenCode.","ru":"Позволяет агентам адаптировать процедуры развертывания к уникальным платформам, используя деревья решений для безопасных производственных релизов и совместимости с GitHub Copilot, Cursor и другими IDE и CLI, такими как Kiro и OpenCode.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعديل إجراءات النشر لتتناسب مع منصات فريدة، مستفيداً من أشجار القرار لتحقيق إصدارات الإنتاج الآمنة والمتوافقة مع GitHub Copilot و Cursor وأدوات التطوير المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر الأخرى مثل Kiro و OpenCode."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating platform selection using decision trees","Generating deployment scripts for static sites and JAMstack","Debugging production releases with adaptable procedures"],"zh":["使用决策树自动选择平台","为静态站点和JAMstack生成部署脚本","使用可适应的流程调试生产发布"],"ja":["決定木を使用してプラットフォームを自動的に選択する","静的サイトやJAMstackのデプロイスクリプトを生成する","適応可能な手順を使用して生産リリースをデバッグする"],"ko":["결정 트리를 사용하여 플랫폼을 자동으로 선택하는 것","정적 사이트 및 JAMstack에 대한 배포 스크립트 생성","적응 가능한 절차를 사용하여 프로덕션 릴리스를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la selección de plataforma utilizando árboles de decisión","Generación de scripts de implementación para sitios estáticos y JAMstack","Depuración de lanzamientos de producción con procedimientos adaptables"],"fr":["Automatisation de la sélection de plate-forme à l''aide d''arbres de décision","Génération de scripts de déploiement pour les sites statiques et JAMstack","Débogage des publications de production avec des procédures adaptables"],"de":["Automatisierung der Plattformauswahl unter Verwendung von Entscheidungsbäumen","Generierung von Bereitstellungsskripten für statische Seiten und JAMstack","Fehlerbehebung bei Produktionsfreigaben mit anpassbaren Verfahren"],"pt":["Automatizar a seleção de plataforma usando árvores de decisão","Gerar scripts de implantação para sites estáticos e JAMstack","Depurar lançamentos de produção com procedimentos adaptáveis"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выбор платформы с помощью деревьев решений","Генерировать скрипты развертывания для статических сайтов и JAMstack","Отлаживать производственные релизы с адаптируемыми процедурами"],"ar":["تحسين اختيار المنصة باستخدام أشجار القرار","توليد نصوص برمجية لنشر المواقع الثابتة و JAMstack","تصحيح أخطاء إصدارات الإنتاج مع إجراءات قابلة للتكيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of deployment principles","Limited to compatibility with specified IDEs and CLIs"],"zh":["需要了解部署原则","仅限与指定的IDE和CLI兼容"],"ja":["デプロイの原則を理解することが必要","指定されたIDEとCLIとの互換性のみ"],"ko":["배포 원리를 이해해야 함","지정된 IDE 및 CLI와의 호환성만 제공"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de implementación","Limitado a la compatibilidad con los IDE y CLI especificados"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de déploiement","Limité à la compatibilité avec les IDE et les CLI spécifiés"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis der Bereitstellungsprinzipien","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität mit den angegebenen IDEs und CLIs"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de implantação","Limitado à compatibilidade com IDEs e CLIs especificados"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов развертывания","Ограничен совместимостью с указанными IDE и CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ النشر","محدود بالتوافق مع أدوات التطوير المتكاملة وواجهات سطر الأوامر المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
