равнения","Анализ конкурентов и выявление возможностей","Разработка контента, который приносит ценность пользователям","Оптимизация для поисковых систем","Интеграция с маркетинговыми стратегиями"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات مقارنة مخصصة","تحليل المنافسين وتحديد الفرص","تطوير المحتوى الذي يُقرّ بالقيمة للمستخدمين","تحسين محركات البحث","الدمج مع استراتيجيات التسويق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["竞争对手比较","替代方案","搜索引擎优化","产品营销","评估者价值","产品差异化","竞争对手分析","市场营销策略"],"ja":["競合比較","代替案","検索エンジン最適化","製品マーケティング","評価者への価値","製品の差異化","競合分析","市場マーケティング戦略"],"ko":["경쟁사 비교","대체方案","검색 엔진 최적화","제품 마케팅","평가자 가치","제품 차별화","경쟁사 분석","시장 마케팅 전략"],"es":["alternativas de competidores","comparación de productos","análisis de competidores","optimización para motores de búsqueda","contenido de valor","posicionamiento de productos","evaluadores","motores de búsqueda","SEO"],"fr":["alternatives de concurrents","comparaison de produits","analyse des concurrents","optimisation pour les moteurs de recherche","contenu de valeur","positionnement de produits","évaluateurs","moteurs de recherche","SEO"],"de":["Wettbewerbsalternativen","Vergleich von Produkten","Wettbewerbsanalyse","Optimierung für Suchmaschinen","Wertvoller Inhalt","Positionieren von Produkten","Evaluator","Suchmaschinen","SEO"],"pt":["páginas de alternativas","comparação de concorrentes","posicionamento de produto","otimização para mecanismos de busca","desenvolvimento de conteúdo","estratégias de marketing"],"ru":["страницы альтернатив","сравнение конкурентов","позиционирование продукта","оптимизация для поисковых систем","разработка контента","маркетинговые стратегии"],"ar":["صفحات البدائل","المقارنة بالمنافسين","موقع المنتج","تحسين محركات البحث","تطوير المحتوى","استراتيجيات التسويق"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"competitor-alternatives","description":"When the user wants to create competitor comparison or alternative pages for SEO and sales enablement. Also use when the user mentions alternative page, vs page, competitor comparison, comparison page, [Product] vs [Product], [Product] alternative, or competitive landing pages. Covers four formats: singular alternative, plural alternatives, you vs competitor, and competitor vs competitor. Emphasizes deep research, modular content architecture, and varied section types beyond feature tables.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Competitor & Alternative Pages\n\nYou are an expert in creating competitor comparison and alternative pages. Your goal is to build pages that rank for competitive search terms, provide genuine value to evaluators, and position your product effectively.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.","body":"# Competitor & Alternative Pages\n\nYou are an expert in creating competitor comparison and alternative pages. Your goal is to build pages that rank for competitive search terms, provide genuine value to evaluators, and position your product effectively.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore creating competitor pages, understand:\n\n1. **Your Product**\n   - Core value proposition\n   - Key differentiators\n   - Ideal customer profile\n   - Pricing model\n   - Strengths and honest weaknesses\n\n2. **Competitive Landscape**\n   - Direct competitors\n   - Indirect/adjacent competitors\n   - Market positioning of each\n   - Search volume for competitor terms\n\n3. **Goals**\n   - SEO traffic capture\n   - Sales enablement\n   - Conversion from competitor users\n   - Brand positioning\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Honesty Builds Trust\n- Acknowledge competitor strengths\n- Be accurate about your limitations\n- Don''t misrepresent competitor features\n- Readers are comparing—they''ll verify claims\n\n### 2. Depth Over Surface\n- Go beyond feature checklists\n- Explain *why* differences matter\n- Include use cases and scenarios\n- Show, don''t just tell\n\n### 3. Help Them Decide\n- Different tools fit different needs\n- Be clear about who you''re best for\n- Be clear about who competitor is best for\n- Reduce evaluation friction\n\n### 4. Modular Content Architecture\n- Competitor data should be centralized\n- Updates propagate to all pages\n- Single source of truth per competitor\n\n---\n\n## Page Formats\n\n### Format 1: [Competitor] Alternative (Singular)\n\n**Search intent**: User is actively looking to switch from a specific competitor\n\n**URL pattern**: `/alternatives/[competitor]` or `/[competitor]-alternative`\n\n**Target keywords**: \"[Competitor] alternative\", \"alternative to [Competitor]\", \"switch from [Competitor]\"\n\n**Page structure**:\n1. Why people look for alternatives (validate their pain)\n2. Summary: You as the alternative (quick positioning)\n3. Detailed comparison (features, service, pricing)\n4. Who should switch (and who shouldn''t)\n5. Migration path\n6. Social proof from switchers\n7. CTA\n\n---\n\n### Format 2: [Competitor] Alternatives (Plural)\n\n**Search intent**: User is researching options, earlier in journey\n\n**URL pattern**: `/alternatives/[competitor]-alternatives`\n\n**Target keywords**: \"[Competitor] alternatives\", \"best [Competitor] alternatives\", \"tools like [Competitor]\"\n\n**Page structure**:\n1. Why people look for alternatives (common pain points)\n2. What to look for in an alternative (criteria framework)\n3. List of alternatives (you first, but include real options)\n4. Comparison table (summary)\n5. Detailed breakdown of each alternative\n6. Recommendation by use case\n7. CTA\n\n**Important**: Include 4-7 real alternatives. Being genuinely helpful builds trust and ranks better.\n\n---\n\n### Format 3: You vs [Competitor]\n\n**Search intent**: User is directly comparing you to a specific competitor\n\n**URL pattern**: `/vs/[competitor]` or `/compare/[you]-vs-[competitor]`\n\n**Target keywords**: \"[You] vs [Competitor]\", \"[Competitor] vs [You]\"\n\n**Page structure**:\n1. TL;DR summary (key differences in 2-3 sentences)\n2. At-a-glance comparison table\n3. Detailed comparison by category (Features, Pricing, Support, Ease of use, Integrations)\n4. Who [You] is best for\n5. Who [Competitor] is best for (be honest)\n6. What customers say (testimonials from switchers)\n7. Migration support\n8. CTA\n\n---\n\n### Format 4: [Competitor A] vs [Competitor B]\n\n**Search intent**: User comparing two competitors (not you directly)\n\n**URL pattern**: `/compare/[competitor-a]-vs-[competitor-b]`\n\n**Page structure**:\n1. Overview of both products\n2. Comparison by category\n3. Who each is best for\n4. The third option (introduce yourself)\n5. Comparison table (all three)\n6. CTA\n\n**Why this works**: Captures search traffic for competitor terms, positions you as knowledgeable.\n\n---\n\n## Essential Sections\n\n### TL;DR Summary\nStart every page with a quick summary for scanners—key differences in 2-3 sentences.\n\n### Paragraph Comparisons\nGo beyond tables. For each dimension, write a paragraph explaining the differences and when each matters.\n\n### Feature Comparison\nFor each category: describe how each handles it, list strengths and limitations, give bottom line recommendation.\n\n### Pricing Comparison\nInclude tier-by-tier comparison, what''s included, hidden costs, and total cost calculation for sample team size.\n\n### Who It''s For\nBe explicit about ideal customer for each option. Honest recommendations build trust.\n\n### Migration Section\nCover what transfers, what needs reconfiguration, support offered, and quotes from customers who switched.\n\n**For detailed templates**: See [references/templates.md](references/templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Content Architecture\n\n### Centralized Competitor Data\nCreate a single source of truth for each competitor with:\n- Positioning and target audience\n- Pricing (all tiers)\n- Feature ratings\n- Strengths and weaknesses\n- Best for / not ideal for\n- Common complaints (from reviews)\n- Migration notes\n\n**For data structure and examples**: See [references/content-architecture.md](references/content-architecture.md)\n\n---\n\n## Research Process\n\n### Deep Competitor Research\n\nFor each competitor, gather:\n\n1. **Product research**: Sign up, use it, document features/UX/limitations\n2. **Pricing research**: Current pricing, what''s included, hidden costs\n3. **Review mining**: G2, Capterra, TrustRadius for common praise/complaint themes\n4. **Customer feedback**: Talk to customers who switched (both directions)\n5. **Content research**: Their positioning, their comparison pages, their changelog\n\n### Ongoing Updates\n\n- **Quarterly**: Verify pricing, check for major feature changes\n- **When notified**: Customer mentions competitor change\n- **Annually**: Full refresh of all competitor data\n\n---\n\n## SEO Considerations\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n| Format | Primary Keywords |\n|--------|-----------------|\n| Alternative (singular) | [Competitor] alternative, alternative to [Competitor] |\n| Alternatives (plural) | [Competitor] alternatives, best [Competitor] alternatives |\n| You vs Competitor | [You] vs [Competitor], [Competitor] vs [You] |\n| Competitor vs Competitor | [A] vs [B], [B] vs [A] |\n\n### Internal Linking\n- Link between related competitor pages\n- Link from feature pages to relevant comparisons\n- Create hub page linking to all competitor content\n\n### Schema Markup\nConsider FAQ schema for common questions like \"What is the best alternative to [Competitor]?\"\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Competitor Data File\nComplete competitor profile in YAML format for use across all comparison pages.\n\n### Page Content\nFor each page: URL, meta tags, full page copy organized by section, comparison tables, CTAs.\n\n### Page Set Plan\nRecommended pages to create with priority order based on search volume.\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What are common reasons people switch to you?\n2. Do you have customer quotes about switching?\n3. What''s your pricing vs. competitors?\n4. Do you offer migration support?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building competitor pages at scale\n- **copywriting**: For writing compelling comparison copy\n- **seo-audit**: For optimizing competitor pages\n- **schema-markup**: For FAQ and comparison schema\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:42:30.067Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing competitor comparison and alternative analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要竞争对手比较和替代分析功能的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが競合他社の比較と代替分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"경쟁사 비교 및 대체 분석 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidad de comparación de competidores y análisis de alternativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de capacités de comparaison des concurrents et d''analyse des alternatives.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine Vergleichsmöglichkeit mit Konkurrenten und eine Alternative-Analyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de comparação de concorrentes e capacidades de análise de alternativas.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы возможности сравнения конкурентов и анализа альтернатив.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل إدارة التسويق التي تحتاج إلى مقارنة المنافسين وقدرات تحليل البديل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create ranking pages for competitive search terms, utilizing product marketing context and positioning products effectively, leveraging markdown files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理创建排名页面的能力，用于竞争性搜索词，利用产品营销背景和有效地定位产品，利用类似 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的 markdown 文件进行明智的决策。","ja":"エージェントが競合する検索用語のランキングページを作成する能力を与え、製品マーケティングのコンテキストと製品の効果的なポジショニングを利用し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のようなマークダウンファイルを使用して情報に基づいた決定を下します。","ko":"에이전트가 경쟁적인 검색 용어에 대한 랭킹 페이지를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 제품 마케팅 문脈과 제품의 효과적인 포지셔닝을 利用하여, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 정보에 기반한 의사 결정을 내립니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear páginas de clasificación para términos de búsqueda competitivos, utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y posicionando los productos de manera efectiva, aprovechando archivos markdown como .claude/product-marketing-context.md para la toma de decisiones informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages de classement pour des termes de recherche compétitifs, en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits et en positionnant les produits de manière efficace, en exploitant des fichiers markdown comme .claude/product-marketing-context.md pour une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Ranking-Seiten für wettbewerbsrelevante Suchbegriffe zu erstellen, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext nutzen und Produkte effektiv positionieren, unter Ausnutzung von Markdown-Dateien wie .claude/product-marketing-context.md für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem páginas de classificação para termos de pesquisa competitivos, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produtos e posicionando produtos de forma eficaz, utilizando arquivos markdown como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать страницы ранжирования для конкурентных поисковых запросов, используя контекст маркетинга продукта и эффективно позиционируя продукты, используя файлы markdown, такие как `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`, для принятия обоснованных решений.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء صفحات تصنيف للبحث عن المصطلحات التنافسية، باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج ووضع المنتجات بشكل فعال، باستخدام ملفات markdown مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating competitor comparison pages for product evaluation","Creating alternative pages to rank for competitive search terms","Positioning products effectively against competitors using data-driven insights"],"zh":["为产品评估生成竞争对手比较页面","创建替代页面以排名竞争性搜索词","使用数据驱动的洞察力有效地将产品定位在竞争对手之上"],"ja":["製品評価のための競合他社比較ページを生成する","競合する検索用語のランキングに使用するための代替ページを作成する","データドリブンの洞察力を使用して、製品を競合他社よりも効果的にポジショニングする"],"ko":["제품 평가를 위한 경쟁사 비교 페이지 생성","경쟁적인 검색 용어에 대한 랭킹에 사용되는 대체 페이지 생성","데이터에 의한 통찰력을 사용하여 제품을 경쟁사보다 효과적으로 포지셔닝하는 것"],"es":["Generación de páginas de comparación de competidores para la evaluación de productos","Creación de páginas alternativas para clasificar términos de búsqueda competitivos","Posicionamiento efectivo de productos contra competidores utilizando conocimientos basados en datos"],"fr":["Génération de pages de comparaison des concurrents pour l''évaluation des produits","Création de pages alternatives pour classer des termes de recherche compétitifs","Positionnement efficace des produits par rapport aux concurrents en utilisant des connaissances basées sur les données"],"de":["Erstellung von Vergleichsseiten für Wettbewerber zur Produktbewertung","Erstellung von Alternativseiten, um wettbewerbsrelevante Suchbegriffe zu bewerten","Effektives Positionieren von Produkten gegenüber Wettbewerbern unter Nutzung von datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen"],"pt":["Geração de páginas de comparação de concorrentes para avaliação de produtos","Criação de páginas de alternativas para classificar termos de pesquisa competitivos","Posicionamento eficaz de produtos contra concorrentes usando insights baseados em dados"],"ru":["Генерация страниц сравнения конкурентов для оценки продуктов","Создание страниц альтернатив для ранжирования конкурентных поисковых запросов","Эффективное позиционирование продуктов против конкурентов с помощью данных, основанных на инсайтах"],"ar":["توليد صفحات لمقارنة المنافسين لتقييم المنتجات","إنشاء صفحات بديلة للتصنيف بالمصطلحات البحثية التنافسية","وضع المنتجات بشكل فعال ضد المنافسين باستخدام رؤى قائمة على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) for optimal performance","Limited to text-based content generation, no visual or multimedia capabilities"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景文件（.claude/product-marketing-context.md）以实现最佳性能","仅限于基于文本的内容生成，无视觉或多媒体功能"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために、製品マーケティングのコンテキストファイル（.claude/product-marketing-context.md）が必要","テキストベースのコンテンツ生成のみ、視覚的またはマルチメディア機能はありません"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 제품 마케팅 문脈 파일(.claude/product-marketing-context.md)이 필요","텍스트 기반의 컨텐츠 생성만 가능하며, 시각적 또는 멀티미디어 기능은 없음"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de contexto de marketing de productos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a la generación de contenido basado en texto, sin capacidades visuales o multimedia"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte de marketing de produits (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) pour des performances optimales","Limité à la génération de contenu basé sur le texte, sans capacités visuelles ou multimédia"],"de":["Benötigt eine Produktmarketing-Kontextdatei (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) für optimale Leistung","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von textbasiertem Inhalt, ohne visuelle oder multimedialen Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer arquivo de contexto de marketing de produtos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) para desempenho ótimo","Limitado à geração de conteúdo baseado em texto, sem capacidades visuais ou multimídia"],"ru":["Требует файла контекста маркетинга продукта (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен генерацией текстового контента, без визуальных или мультимедийных возможностей"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف контекست تسويق المنتج (.claude/product-marketing-con