..","de":"Der ''marketing-ideas''-Skill bietet 139 bewährte Marketingideen, um den Benutzern zu helfen, die richtigen Strategien für ihr SaaS-Unternehmen zu finden.","pt":"Aprenda a utilizar 139 ideias de marketing comprovadas para impulsionar o seu negócio de SaaS.","ru":"Узнайте, как использовать 139 проверенных маркетинговых идей для развития вашего бизнеса SaaS.","ar":"تعلم كيفية استخدام 139 فكرة تسويقية مثبتة لتعزيز أعمالك في برامج السحابية.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["139","SaaS"," "," ","API"],"ja":["139","SaaS",""," ","API"],"ko":["139","SaaS"," "," ","API"],"es":["139 ideas de marketing probadas","Estrategias personalizadas para cada situación y recurso","Ayuda para encontrar las estrategias adecuadas para tu negocio de SaaS","Acceso a una biblioteca de ideas de marketing","Posibilidad de preguntar por información específica"],"fr":["139 idées de marketing éprouvées","Stratégies personnalisées pour chaque situation et ressource","Aide pour trouver les stratégies adaptées à votre entreprise de logiciel en tant que service","Accès à une bibliothèque d''idées de marketing","Possibilité de poser des questions spécifiques"],"de":["139 bewährte Marketingideen","Maßgeschneiderte Strategien für jede Situation und Ressourcen","Hilfe bei der Suche nach den richtigen Strategien für Ihr SaaS-Unternehmen","Zugang zu einer Bibliothek von Marketingideen","Möglichkeit, spezifische Fragen zu stellen"],"pt":["139 ideias de marketing comprovadas","Estratégias personalizadas para cada negócio","Otimização para diferentes estágios e recursos","Contexto de marketing de produto integrado","Suporte para múltiplas linguagens e regiões"],"ru":["139 проверенных маркетинговых идей","Персонализированные стратегии для каждого бизнеса","Оптимизация для разных стадий и ресурсов","Интегрированный контекст маркетинга продукта","Поддержка нескольких языков и регионов"],"ar":["139 فكرة تسويقية مثبتة","استراتيجيات مُخصصة لكل عمل","تحسين لأوضاع و موارد مختلفة","سياق تسويق المنتج المتكامل","دعم للعديد من اللغات والمناطق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS"," ","139"," ","API"," "," "," "],"ja":["SaaS","","139","","API","","",""],"ko":["SaaS"," ","139"," ","API"," "," "," "],"es":["ideas de marketing para SaaS","estrategias de marketing para empresas de software","marketing para empresas de tecnología","ideas de marketing innovadoras","estrategias de marketing efectivas","marketing para SaaS"],"fr":["idées de marketing pour les logiciels en tant que service","stratégies de marketing pour les entreprises de logiciel","marketing pour les entreprises de technologie","idées de marketing innovantes","stratégies de marketing efficaces","marketing pour les logiciels en tant que service"],"de":["Marketingideen für SaaS-Unternehmen","Marketingstrategien für Software-Unternehmen","Marketing für Technologie-Unternehmen","innovative Marketingideen","effektive Marketingstrategien","Marketing für SaaS-Unternehmen"],"pt":["ideias de marketing para SaaS","estratégias de marketing para software","marketing de produto para SaaS","otimização de marketing para negócios","soluções de marketing para empresas","desenvolvimento de marketing para SaaS"],"ru":["маркетинговые идеи для SaaS","стратегии маркетинга для программного обеспечения","маркетинг продукта для SaaS","оптимизация маркетинга для бизнеса","решения маркетинга для компаний","разработка маркетинга для SaaS"],"ar":["أفكار التسويق لبرامج السحابية","استراتيجيات التسويق لبرامج الكمبيوتر","تسويق المنتج لبرامج السحابية","تحسين التسويق للأعمال","حلول التسويق للشركات","تطوير التسويق لبرامج السحابية"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marketing-ideas","description":"When the user needs marketing ideas, inspiration, or strategies for their SaaS or software product. Also use when the user asks for marketing ideas, growth ideas, how to market, marketing strategies, marketing tactics, ways to promote, or ideas to grow. This skill provides 139 proven marketing approaches organized by category.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas","body":"# Marketing Ideas for SaaS\n\nYou are a marketing strategist with a library of 139 proven marketing ideas. Your goal is to help users find the right marketing strategies for their specific situation, stage, and resources.\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nWhen asked for marketing ideas:\n1. Ask about their product, audience, and current stage if not clear\n2. Suggest 3-5 most relevant ideas based on their context\n3. Provide details on implementation for chosen ideas\n4. Consider their resources (time, budget, team size)\n\n---\n\n## Ideas by Category (Quick Reference)\n\n| Category | Ideas | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Content & SEO | 1-10 | Programmatic SEO, Glossary marketing, Content repurposing |\n| Competitor | 11-13 | Comparison pages, Marketing jiu-jitsu |\n| Free Tools | 14-22 | Calculators, Generators, Chrome extensions |\n| Paid Ads | 23-34 | LinkedIn, Google, Retargeting, Podcast ads |\n| Social & Community | 35-44 | LinkedIn audience, Reddit marketing, Short-form video |\n| Email | 45-53 | Founder emails, Onboarding sequences, Win-back |\n| Partnerships | 54-64 | Affiliate programs, Integration marketing, Newsletter swaps |\n| Events | 65-72 | Webinars, Conference speaking, Virtual summits |\n| PR & Media | 73-76 | Press coverage, Documentaries |\n| Launches | 77-86 | Product Hunt, Lifetime deals, Giveaways |\n| Product-Led | 87-96 | Viral loops, Powered-by marketing, Free migrations |\n| Content Formats | 97-109 | Podcasts, Courses, Annual reports, Year wraps |\n| Unconventional | 110-122 | Awards, Challenges, Guerrilla marketing |\n| Platforms | 123-130 | App marketplaces, Review sites, YouTube |\n| International | 131-132 | Expansion, Price localization |\n| Developer | 133-136 | DevRel, Certifications |\n| Audience-Specific | 137-139 | Referrals, Podcast tours, Customer language |\n\n**For the complete list with descriptions**: See [references/ideas-by-category.md](references/ideas-by-category.md)\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Tips\n\n### By Stage\n\n**Pre-launch:**\n- Waitlist referrals (#79)\n- Early access pricing (#81)\n- Product Hunt prep (#78)\n\n**Early stage:**\n- Content & SEO (#1-10)\n- Community (#35)\n- Founder-led sales (#47)\n\n**Growth stage:**\n- Paid acquisition (#23-34)\n- Partnerships (#54-64)\n- Events (#65-72)\n\n**Scale:**\n- Brand campaigns\n- International (#131-132)\n- Media acquisitions (#73)\n\n### By Budget\n\n**Free:**\n- Content & SEO\n- Community building\n- Social media\n- Comment marketing\n\n**Low budget:**\n- Targeted ads\n- Sponsorships\n- Free tools\n\n**Medium budget:**\n- Events\n- Partnerships\n- PR\n\n**High budget:**\n- Acquisitions\n- Conferences\n- Brand campaigns\n\n### By Timeline\n\n**Quick wins:**\n- Ads, email, social posts\n\n**Medium-term:**\n- Content, SEO, community\n\n**Long-term:**\n- Brand, thought leadership, platform effects\n\n---\n\n## Top Ideas by Use Case\n\n### Need Leads Fast\n- Google Ads (#31) - High-intent search\n- LinkedIn Ads (#28) - B2B targeting\n- Engineering as Marketing (#15) - Free tool lead gen\n\n### Building Authority\n- Conference Speaking (#70)\n- Book Marketing (#104)\n- Podcasts (#107)\n\n### Low Budget Growth\n- Easy Keyword Ranking (#1)\n- Reddit Marketing (#38)\n- Comment Marketing (#44)\n\n### Product-Led Growth\n- Viral Loops (#93)\n- Powered By Marketing (#87)\n- In-App Upsells (#91)\n\n### Enterprise Sales\n- Investor Marketing (#133)\n- Expert Networks (#57)\n- Conference Sponsorship (#72)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen recommending ideas, provide for each:\n\n- **Idea name**: One-line description\n- **Why it fits**: Connection to their situation\n- **How to start**: First 2-3 implementation steps\n- **Expected outcome**: What success looks like\n- **Resources needed**: Time, budget, skills required\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current stage and main growth goal?\n2. What''s your marketing budget and team size?\n3. What have you already tried that worked or didn''t?\n4. What competitor tactics do you admire?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For scaling SEO content (#4)\n- **competitor-alternatives**: For comparison pages (#11)\n- **email-sequence**: For email marketing tactics\n- **free-tool-strategy**: For engineering as marketing (#15)\n- **referral-program**: For viral growth (#93)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:42:22.074Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude or AutoGPT seeking to enhance their strategic marketing capabilities with proven SaaS marketing ideas.","zh":"适用于Claude或AutoGPT等AI代理，旨在通过验证的SaaS营销理念增强其战略营销能力。","ja":"ClaudeやAutoGPTなどのAIエージェントが戦略的マーケティング能力を強化するために、実証済みのSaaSマーケティングアイデアを使用するのに適しています。","ko":"클라우드 또는 오토GPT와 같은 AI 에이전트가 검증된 SaaS 마케팅 아이디어로 전략적 마케팅 능력을 향상시키는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude o AutoGPT que buscan mejorar sus capacidades de marketing estratégico con ideas de marketing de SaaS probadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude ou AutoGPT qui cherchent à améliorer leurs capacités de marketing stratégique avec des idées de marketing SaaS éprouvées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Claude oder AutoGPT, die ihre strategischen Marketingfähigkeiten mit bewährten SaaS-Marketingideen verbessern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude ou AutoGPT que buscam aprimorar suas capacidades de marketing estratégico com ideias de marketing de SaaS comprovadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude или AutoGPT, стремящихся повысить свои стратегические возможности маркетинга с помощью проверенных идей маркетинга SaaS.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude أو AutoGPT الذين يแสعون لتحسين قدراتهم التسويقية الاستراتيجية بأفكار تسويقية سaaS مثبتة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to strategize with 139 proven marketing ideas, leveraging product marketing context from files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and tailoring approaches based on specific situations, stages, and resources, utilizing markdown files for context and customization.","zh":"赋予代理人使用139个验证的营销理念来制定策略的能力，利用来自文件（如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`）的产品营销背景，并根据具体情况、阶段和资源量身定制方法，利用Markdown文件实现背景和定制。","ja":"エージェントが139の検証済みマーケティングアイデアを使用して戦略を立てることができるようにし、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`などのファイルからの製品マーケティングコンテキストを利用し、特定の状況、段階、リソースに基づいてアプローチを調整し、Markdownファイルを使用してコンテキストとカスタマイズを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 139개의 검증된 마케팅 아이디어를 사용하여 전략을 수립할 수 있도록 하며 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일에서 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 활용하고 특정 상황, 단계 및 리소스에 따라 접근 방식을 조정하며 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 컨텍스트 및 사용자 지정 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a estrategizar con 139 ideas de marketing probadas, aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos de archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y adaptando enfoques según situaciones, etapas y recursos específicos, utilizando archivos de markdown para contexto y personalización.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stratégiser avec 139 idées de marketing éprouvées, en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits de fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en adaptant les approches en fonction de situations, de phases et de ressources spécifiques, en utilisant des fichiers markdown pour le contexte et la personnalisation.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, mit 139 bewährten Marketingideen zu strategisieren, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext aus Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` nutzen und ihre Ansätze basierend auf spezifischen Situationen, Phasen und Ressourcen anpassen, wobei sie Markdown-Dateien für Kontext und Anpassung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estrategizar com 139 ideias de marketing comprovadas, aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos a partir de arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e adaptando as abordagens com base em situações, estágios e recursos específicos, utilizando arquivos markdown para contexto e personalização.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью стратегизировать с помощью 139 проверенных маркетинговых идей, используя контекст маркетинга продукции из файлов типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и адаптируя подходы на основе конкретных ситуаций, стадий и ресурсов, используя файлы markdown для контекста и настройки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استراتيجية مع 139 فكرة تسويقية مثبتة، مستفيدة من سياق تسويق المنتجات من ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وتكييف المناهج根据 حالات ومراحل وموارد محددة، باستخدام ملفات markdown للسياق والتخصيص."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating tailored marketing strategies for SaaS products","Analyzing product marketing context for informed decisions","Providing stage-specific marketing advice for businesses"],"zh":["为SaaS产品生成定制的营销策略","分析产品营销背景以做出明智的决定","为企业提供阶段特定的营销建议"],"ja":["SaaS製品のためのカスタマイズされたマーケティング戦略を生成する","製品マーケティングコンテキストを分析して情報に基づいた決定を下す","企業のための段階特定的マーケティングアドバイスを提供する"],"ko":["SaaS 제품을 위한 맞춤형 마케팅 전략 생성","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트 분석을 통한 정보에 기반한 의사 결정","기업을 위한 단계별 마케팅 조언 제공"],"es":["Generar estrategias de marketing personalizadas para productos SaaS","Analizar el contexto de marketing de productos para tomar decisiones informadas","Proporcio