"Unterstützung für Conventional Commits","Anpassbare Regeln für Commits","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Commits","Verbesserung der Sicherheit und Überprüfung von Commits"],"pt":["Commits lógicos e descritivos","Mensagens de commit claras e concisas","Commits seguros para enviar","Prática de desenvolvimento melhorada","Revisão fácil e eficiente","Integração com Conventional Commits"],"ru":["Логические и описательные коммиты","Ясные и краткие сообщения коммитов","Безопасные коммиты для отправки","Улучшенная практика разработки","Легкая и эффективная проверка","Интеграция с Conventional Commits"],"ar":["التزامات منطقية ووصفية","رسائل التزام واضحة وموجزة","التزامات آمنة للنشر","ممارسة تطوير محسنة","مراجعة سهلة وفعالة","التكامل مع التزامات التقليدية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Commit Work","代码提交","代码审查","Conventional Commits","提交消息","代码安全"],"ja":["コミットワーク","コード提出","コードレビュー","Conventional Commits","コミットメッセージ","コードセキュリティ"],"ko":["커밋 작업","코드 제출","코드 검토","Conventional Commits","커밋 메시지","코드 보안"],"es":["commit work","commits de alta calidad","estructura de commits","seguridad de commits","revisión de commits","desarrollo de software","prácticas de codificación","commits convencionales","reglas de commits"],"fr":["commit work","commits de haute qualité","structure de commits","sécurité de commits","revue de commits","développement de logiciels","pratiques de codage","commits convencionales","règles de commits"],"de":["commit work","commits von hoher qualität","struktur von commits","sicherheit von commits","überprüfung von commits","software-entwicklung","codierpraktiken","conventionelle commits","regeln für commits"],"pt":["commit work","desenvolvimento de software","commits lógicos","mensagens de commit","Conventional Commits","revisão de código","segurança de commits","práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["коммит-работа","разработка программного обеспечения","логические коммиты","сообщения коммитов","Conventional Commits","проверка кода","безопасность коммитов","практики разработки"],"ar":["التزام العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","التزامات منطقية","رسائل التزام","التزامات التقليدية","مراجعة الكود","أمان الإلتزامات","ممارسات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-work","description":"Create high-quality git commits: review/stage intended changes, split into logical commits, and write clear commit messages (including Conventional Commits). Use when the user asks to commit, craft a commit message, stage changes, or split work into multiple commits.","bodyPreview":"# Commit work\n\n## Goal\nMake commits that are easy to review and safe to ship:\n- only intended changes are included\n- commits are logically scoped (split when needed)\n- commit messages describe what changed and why\n\n## Inputs to ask for (if missing)\n- Single commit or multiple commits? (If unsure: default to multiple small commits when there are unrelated changes.)\n- Commit style: Conventional Commits are required.\n- Any rules: max subject length, required scopes.\n\n## Workflow (checklist)\n1) Insp","body":"# Commit work\n\n## Goal\nMake commits that are easy to review and safe to ship:\n- only intended changes are included\n- commits are logically scoped (split when needed)\n- commit messages describe what changed and why\n\n## Inputs to ask for (if missing)\n- Single commit or multiple commits? (If unsure: default to multiple small commits when there are unrelated changes.)\n- Commit style: Conventional Commits are required.\n- Any rules: max subject length, required scopes.\n\n## Workflow (checklist)\n1) Inspect the working tree before staging\n   - `git status`\n   - `git diff` (unstaged)\n   - If many changes: `git diff --stat`\n2) Decide commit boundaries (split if needed)\n   - Split by: feature vs refactor, backend vs frontend, formatting vs logic, tests vs prod code, dependency bumps vs behavior changes.\n   - If changes are mixed in one file, plan to use patch staging.\n3) Stage only what belongs in the next commit\n   - Prefer patch staging for mixed changes: `git add -p`\n   - To unstage a hunk/file: `git restore --staged -p` or `git restore --staged <path>`\n4) Review what will actually be committed\n   - `git diff --cached`\n   - Sanity checks:\n     - no secrets or tokens\n     - no accidental debug logging\n     - no unrelated formatting churn\n5) Describe the staged change in 1-2 sentences (before writing the message)\n   - \"What changed?\" + \"Why?\"\n   - If you cannot describe it cleanly, the commit is probably too big or mixed; go back to step 2.\n6) Write the commit message\n   - Use Conventional Commits (required):\n     - `type(scope): short summary`\n     - blank line\n     - body (what/why, not implementation diary)\n     - footer (BREAKING CHANGE) if needed\n   - Prefer an editor for multi-line messages: `git commit -v`\n   - Use `references/commit-message-template.md` if helpful.\n7) Run the smallest relevant verification\n   - Run the repo''s fastest meaningful check (unit tests, lint, or build) before moving on.\n8) Repeat for the next commit until the working tree is clean\n\n## Deliverable\nProvide:\n- the final commit message(s)\n- a short summary per commit (what/why)\n- the commands used to stage/review (at minimum: `git diff --cached`, plus any tests run)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:42:25.081Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit formatting and review safety","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交格式和审查安全的代码管理代理","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミット形式とレビューセーフティを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"표준화된 커밋 형식과 리뷰 안전성이 필요한 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan un formato de confirmación estandarizado y seguridad de revisión","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un format de commit standardisé et une sécurité de révision","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Format und eine Überprüfungssicherheit benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de formatação de commit padronizada e segurança de revisão","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, которым необходима стандартизированная форматировка коммитов и безопасность проверки","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى تنسيق إيداع معياري وأمان للمراجعة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create logically scoped commits with descriptive messages using Conventional Commits, ensuring only intended changes are included and commits are safe to ship, following specific rules such as max subject length and required scopes","zh":"赋予代理创建逻辑作用域的提交和描述性消息，使用约定提交，确保只包含预期的更改，并且提交是安全的，可以遵循特定的规则，例如最大主题长度和所需的作用域","ja":"エージェントに論理的にスコープされたコミットと記述的なメッセージを作成する権限を与え、Conventional Commitsを使用して、意図した変更のみが含まれることを保証し、コミットは出荷するための安全性を確保し、最大の主題の長さや必要なスコープなどの特定のルールに従う","ko":"에이전트가 논리적으로 범위가 지정된 커밋과 설명 메시지를 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 약관 커밋을 사용하여 의도한 변경 사항만 포함되도록 하고, 커밋이 안전하게 출하될 수 있도록하며, 최대 주제 길이 및 필요한 범위などの 특정 규칙을 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear commits con alcance lógico y mensajes descriptivos utilizando Commits Convencionales, asegurando que solo se incluyan los cambios pretendidos y que los commits sean seguros para su envío, siguiendo reglas específicas como la longitud máxima del asunto y los alcances requeridos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des commits à portée logique avec des messages descriptifs en utilisant les Commits Conventionnels, en garantissant que seuls les changements intentionnels soient inclus et que les commits soient sécurisés pour leur expédition, en suivant des règles spécifiques telles que la longueur maximale du sujet et les portées requises","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, logisch umfangreiche Commits mit beschreibenden Nachrichten unter Verwendung von Conventional Commits zu erstellen, um sicherzustellen, dass nur die beabsichtigten Änderungen enthalten sind und Commits sicher zum Versand freigegeben werden, unter Einhaltung spezifischer Regeln wie der maximalen Betrefflänge und der erforderlichen Umfänge","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar commits com escopos lógicos e mensagens descritivas usando Conventional Commits, garantindo que apenas as alterações pretendidas sejam incluídas e os commits sejam seguros para envio, seguindo regras específicas como comprimento máximo do assunto e escopos obrigatórios","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать логически выделенные коммиты с описательными сообщениями, используя Conventional Commits, гарантируя, что включаются только преднамеренные изменения и коммиты безопасны для отправки, следующих конкретным правилам, таким как максимальная длина темы и обязательные области","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء إيداعات ذات نطاقات منطقية ورسائل وصفية باستخدام الإيداعات التقليدية، مما يضمن включ التحديثات المقصودة فقط وإيداعات آمنة للشحن، اتباعًا لقواعد محددة مثل أقصى طول للموضوع والنطاقات المطلوبة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit message generation","Validating commit scopes and sizes","Standardizing commit history for easier review"],"zh":["自动化提交消息生成","验证提交范围和大小","标准化提交历史以便于审查"],"ja":["コミットメッセージの自動生成","コミットのスコープとサイズの検証","コミット履歴の標準化によるレビューの容易化"],"ko":["커밋 메시지 자동 생성","커밋 범위 및 크기 유효성 검사","리뷰를 쉽게하기 위한 커밋 기록 표준화"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de mensajes de confirmación","Validación de los alcances y tamaños de los commits","Estandarización del historial de commits para una revisión más fácil"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de messages de commit","Validation des portées et des tailles des commits","Standardisation de l''historique des commits pour une révision plus facile"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Commit-Nachrichten","Validierung der Umfänge und Größen von Commits","Standardisierung der Commit-Historie für eine einfachere Überprüfung"],"pt":["Automação da geração de mensagens de commit","Validação de escopos e tamanhos de commit","Padronização do histórico de commit para revisão mais fácil"],"ru":["Автоматизация генерации сообщений коммитов","Проверка областей и размеров коммитов","Стандартизация истории коммитов для более легкой проверки"],"ar":["أتمتة توليد رسائل الإيداع","تحقق من نطاقات وأحجام الإيداع","تقييس سجل الإيداع من أجل مراجعة أسهل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits style","May require additional configuration for max subject length and scopes"],"zh":["需要遵守约定提交样式","可能需要额外的配置以满足最大主题长度和作用域"],"ja":["Conventional Commitsスタイルへの従業員が必要","最大の主題の長さやスコープに対応するために追加の構成が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["약관 커밋 스타일을 따르는 것이 필요","최대 주제 길이 및 범위에 대한 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al estilo de Commits Convencionales","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para la longitud máxima del asunto y los alcances"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au style des Commits Conventionnels","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour la longueur maximale du sujet et les portées"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Stils","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für die maximale Betrefflänge und die Umfänge erfordern"],"pt":["Exige adesão ao estilo Conventional Commits","Pode exigir configuração adicional para comprimento máximo do assunto e escopos"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения стиля Conventional Commits","Может потребовать дополнительной конфигурации для максимальной длины темы и областей"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع نمط الإيداعات التقليدية","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا لأقصى طول للموضوع والنطاقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
