s avec Jetpack Compose","Implémentation de modèles de navigation avec Navigation Compose","Conception de layouts adaptables pour les appareils Android","Utilisation de Material 3 theming avec des couleurs dynamiques","Création d''applications modernes et adaptables pour les appareils Android"],"de":["Entwurf von Benutzeroberflächen mit Material Design 3","Erstellung von Layouts mit Jetpack Compose","Implementierung von Navigationmustern mit Navigation Compose","Entwurf von anpassbaren Layouts für Android-Geräte","Verwendung von Material 3-Theming mit dynamischen Farben","Erstellung von modernen und anpassbaren Anwendungen für Android-Geräte"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário modernas e adaptáveis","Integração com o ecossistema Android","Uso de Material Design 3 e Jetpack Compose","Implementação de padrões de navegação Android","Criação de layouts adaptáveis para telefones, tablets e dispositivos dobráveis"],"ru":["Создание современных и адаптивных интерфейсов пользователей","Интеграция с экосистемой Android","Использование Material Design 3 и Jetpack Compose","Реализация паттернов навигации Android","Создание адаптивных макетов для телефонов, планшетов и складных устройств"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم حديثة ومرنة","التكامل مع نظام أندرويد","استخدام ماديال ديزاين 3 وجيتباك كومبوز","تنفيذ أنماط التوجه في أندرويد","إنشاء تخطيطات مرنة للهواتف والنوتبوك والأجهزة القابلة للطي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Android ","Material Design 3","Jetpack Compose","Android ","Android ","Material You","Navigation Compose","Dynamic Colors"],"ja":["Android","Material Design 3","Jetpack Compose","Android ","Android ","Material You","Navigation Compose","Dynamic Colors"],"ko":["Android ","Material Design 3","Jetpack Compose","Android ","Android ","Material You","Navigation Compose","Dynamic Colors"],"es":["diseño móvil android","material design 3","jetpack compose","navegación android","layouts adaptables","material 3 theming","aplicaciones android modernas","desarrollo de aplicaciones android"],"fr":["conception mobile android","material design 3","jetpack compose","navigation android","layouts adaptables","material 3 theming","applications android modernes","développement d''applications android"],"de":["android mobile design","material design 3","jetpack compose","android navigation","anpassbare layouts","material 3 theming","moderne android anwendungen","entwicklung von android anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de apps Android","Material Design 3","Jetpack Compose","Interfaces de usuário modernas","Adaptação de layouts","Navegação Android","Ecossistema Android"],"ru":["Разработка приложений Android","Material Design 3","Jetpack Compose","Современные интерфейсы пользователей","Адаптивные макеты","Навигация Android","Экосистема Android"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات أندرويد","ماديال ديزاين 3","جيتباك كومبوز","واجهات مستخدم حديثة","تخطيطات مرنة","التوجه في أندرويد","نظام أندرويد"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-android-design","description":"Master Material Design 3 and Jetpack Compose patterns for building native Android apps. Use when designing Android interfaces, implementing Compose UI, or following Googles Material Design guidelines.","bodyPreview":"# Android Mobile Design\n\nMaster Material Design 3 (Material You) and Jetpack Compose to build modern, adaptive Android applications that integrate seamlessly with the Android ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing Android app interfaces following Material Design 3\n- Building Jetpack Compose UI and layouts\n- Implementing Android navigation patterns (Navigation Compose)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for phones, tablets, and foldables\n- Using Material 3 theming with dynamic colors\n- Build","body":"# Android Mobile Design\n\nMaster Material Design 3 (Material You) and Jetpack Compose to build modern, adaptive Android applications that integrate seamlessly with the Android ecosystem.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Designing Android app interfaces following Material Design 3\n- Building Jetpack Compose UI and layouts\n- Implementing Android navigation patterns (Navigation Compose)\n- Creating adaptive layouts for phones, tablets, and foldables\n- Using Material 3 theming with dynamic colors\n- Building accessible Android interfaces\n- Implementing Android-specific gestures and interactions\n- Designing for different screen configurations\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Material Design 3 Principles\n\n**Personalization**: Dynamic color adapts UI to user''s wallpaper\n**Accessibility**: Tonal palettes ensure sufficient color contrast\n**Large Screens**: Responsive layouts for tablets and foldables\n\n**Material Components:**\n\n- Cards, Buttons, FABs, Chips\n- Navigation (rail, drawer, bottom nav)\n- Text fields, Dialogs, Sheets\n- Lists, Menus, Progress indicators\n\n### 2. Jetpack Compose Layout System\n\n**Column and Row:**\n\n```kotlin\n// Vertical arrangement with alignment\nColumn(\n    modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),\n    verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp),\n    horizontalAlignment = Alignment.Start\n) {\n    Text(\n        text = \"Title\",\n        style = MaterialTheme.typography.headlineSmall\n    )\n    Text(\n        text = \"Subtitle\",\n        style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium,\n        color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant\n    )\n}\n\n// Horizontal arrangement with weight\nRow(\n    modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n    horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\n    verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically\n) {\n    Icon(Icons.Default.Star, contentDescription = null)\n    Text(\"Featured\")\n    Spacer(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))\n    TextButton(onClick = {}) {\n        Text(\"View All\")\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Lazy Lists and Grids:**\n\n```kotlin\n// Lazy column with sticky headers\nLazyColumn {\n    items.groupBy { it.category }.forEach { (category, categoryItems) ->\n        stickyHeader {\n            Text(\n                text = category,\n                modifier = Modifier\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\n                    .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surface)\n                    .padding(16.dp),\n                style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium\n            )\n        }\n        items(categoryItems) { item ->\n            ItemRow(item = item)\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Adaptive grid\nLazyVerticalGrid(\n    columns = GridCells.Adaptive(minSize = 150.dp),\n    contentPadding = PaddingValues(16.dp),\n    horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp),\n    verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp)\n) {\n    items(items) { item ->\n        ItemCard(item = item)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Navigation Patterns\n\n**Bottom Navigation:**\n\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun MainScreen() {\n    val navController = rememberNavController()\n\n    Scaffold(\n        bottomBar = {\n            NavigationBar {\n                val navBackStackEntry by navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()\n                val currentDestination = navBackStackEntry?.destination\n\n                NavigationDestination.entries.forEach { destination ->\n                    NavigationBarItem(\n                        icon = { Icon(destination.icon, contentDescription = null) },\n                        label = { Text(destination.label) },\n                        selected = currentDestination?.hierarchy?.any {\n                            it.route == destination.route\n                        } == true,\n                        onClick = {\n                            navController.navigate(destination.route) {\n                                popUpTo(navController.graph.findStartDestination().id) {\n                                    saveState = true\n                                }\n                                launchSingleTop = true\n                                restoreState = true\n                            }\n                        }\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    ) { innerPadding ->\n        NavHost(\n            navController = navController,\n            startDestination = NavigationDestination.Home.route,\n            modifier = Modifier.padding(innerPadding)\n        ) {\n            composable(NavigationDestination.Home.route) { HomeScreen() }\n            composable(NavigationDestination.Search.route) { SearchScreen() }\n            composable(NavigationDestination.Profile.route) { ProfileScreen() }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Navigation Drawer:**\n\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun DrawerNavigation() {\n    val drawerState = rememberDrawerState(DrawerValue.Closed)\n    val scope = rememberCoroutineScope()\n\n    ModalNavigationDrawer(\n        drawerState = drawerState,\n        drawerContent = {\n            ModalDrawerSheet {\n                Spacer(Modifier.height(12.dp))\n                Text(\n                    \"App Name\",\n                    modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleLarge\n                )\n                HorizontalDivider()\n\n                NavigationDrawerItem(\n                    icon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Home, null) },\n                    label = { Text(\"Home\") },\n                    selected = true,\n                    onClick = { scope.launch { drawerState.close() } }\n                )\n                NavigationDrawerItem(\n                    icon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Settings, null) },\n                    label = { Text(\"Settings\") },\n                    selected = false,\n                    onClick = { }\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    ) {\n        Scaffold(\n            topBar = {\n                TopAppBar(\n                    title = { Text(\"Home\") },\n                    navigationIcon = {\n                        IconButton(onClick = { scope.launch { drawerState.open() } }) {\n                            Icon(Icons.Default.Menu, contentDescription = \"Menu\")\n                        }\n                    }\n                )\n            }\n        ) { innerPadding ->\n            Content(modifier = Modifier.padding(innerPadding))\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Material 3 Theming\n\n**Color Scheme:**\n\n```kotlin\n// Dynamic color (Android 12+)\nval dynamicColorScheme = if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.S) {\n    val context = LocalContext.current\n    if (darkTheme) dynamicDarkColorScheme(context)\n    else dynamicLightColorScheme(context)\n} else {\n    if (darkTheme) DarkColorScheme else LightColorScheme\n}\n\n// Custom color scheme\nprivate val LightColorScheme = lightColorScheme(\n    primary = Color(0xFF6750A4),\n    onPrimary = Color.White,\n    primaryContainer = Color(0xFFEADDFF),\n    onPrimaryContainer = Color(0xFF21005D),\n    secondary = Color(0xFF625B71),\n    onSecondary = Color.White,\n    tertiary = Color(0xFF7D5260),\n    onTertiary = Color.White,\n    surface = Color(0xFFFFFBFE),\n    onSurface = Color(0xFF1C1B1F),\n)\n```\n\n**Typography:**\n\n```kotlin\nval AppTypography = Typography(\n    displayLarge = TextStyle(\n        fontFamily = FontFamily.Default,\n        fontWeight = FontWeight.Normal,\n        fontSize = 57.sp,\n        lineHeight = 64.sp\n    ),\n    headlineMedium = TextStyle(\n        fontFamily = FontFamily.Default,\n        fontWeight = FontWeight.Normal,\n        fontSize = 28.sp,\n        lineHeight = 36.sp\n    ),\n    titleLarge = TextStyle(\n        fontFamily = FontFamily.Default,\n        fontWeight = FontWeight.Normal,\n        fontSize = 22.sp,\n        lineHeight = 28.sp\n    ),\n    bodyLarge = TextStyle(\n        fontFamily = FontFamily.Default,\n        fontWeight = FontWeight.Normal,\n        fontSize = 16.sp,\n        lineHeight = 24.sp\n    ),\n    labelMedium = TextStyle(\n        fontFamily = FontFamily.Default,\n        fontWeight = FontWeight.Medium,\n        fontSize = 12.sp,\n        lineHeight = 16.sp\n    )\n)\n```\n\n### 5. Component Examples\n\n**Cards:**\n\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun FeatureCard(\n    title: String,\n    description: String,\n    imageUrl: String,\n    onClick: () -> Unit\n) {\n    Card(\n        onClick = onClick,\n        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n        shape = RoundedCornerShape(16.dp),\n        colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(\n            containerColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surfaceVariant\n        )\n    ) {\n        Column {\n            AsyncImage(\n                model = imageUrl,\n                contentDescription = null,\n                modifier = Modifier\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\n                    .height(180.dp),\n                contentScale = ContentScale.Crop\n            )\n            Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {\n                Text(\n                    text = title,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium\n                )\n                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))\n                Text(\n                    text = description,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium,\n                    color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Buttons:**\n\n```kotlin\n// Filled button (primary action)\nButton(onClick = { }) {\n    Text(\"Continue\")\n}\n\n// Filled tonal button (secondary action)\nFilledTonalButton(onClick = { }) {\n    Icon(Icons.Default.Add, null)\n    Spacer(Modifier.width(8.dp))\n    Text(\"Add Item\")\n}\n\n// Outlined button\nOutlinedButton(onClick = { }) {\n    Text(\"Cancel\")\n}\n\n// Text button\nTextButton(onClick = { }) {\n    Text(\"Learn More\")\n}\n\n// FAB\nFloatingActionButton(\n    onClick = { },\n    containerColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer,\n    contentColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onPrimaryContainer\n) {\n    Icon(Icons.Default.Add, contentDescription = \"Add\")\n}\n```\n\n## Quick Start Component\n\n```kotlin\n@Composable\nfun ItemListCard(\n    item: Item,\n    onItemClick: () -> Unit,\n    modifier: Modifier = Modifier\n) {\n    Card(\n        onClick = onItemClick,\n        modifier = modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n        shape = RoundedCornerShape(12.dp)\n    ) {\n        Row(\n            modifier = Modifier\n                .padding(16.dp)\n                .fillMaxWidth(),\n            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically\n        ) {\n            Box(\n                modifier = Modifier\n                    .size(48.dp)\n                    .clip(CircleShape)\n                    .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer),\n                contentAlignment = Alignment.Center\n            ) {\n                Icon(\n                    imageVector = Icons.Default.Star,\n                    contentDescription = null,\n                    tint = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onPrimaryContainer\n                )\n            }\n\n            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(16.dp))\n\n            Column(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f)) {\n                Text(\n                    text = item.title,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium\n                )\n                Text(\n                    text = item.subtitle,\n                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium,\n                    color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant\n                )\n            }\n\n            Icon(\n                imageVector = Icons.Default.ChevronRight,\n                contentDescription = null,\n                tint = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Material Theme**: Access colors via `MaterialTheme.colorScheme` for automatic dark mode support\n2. **Support Dynamic Color**: Enable dynamic color on Android 12+ for personalization\n3. **Adaptive Layouts**: Use `WindowSizeClass` for responsive designs\n4. **Content Descriptions**: Add `contentDescription` to all interactive elements\n5. **Touch Targets**: Minimum 48dp touch targets for accessibility\n6. **State Hoisting**: Hoist state to make components reusable and testable\n7. **Remember Properly**: Use `remember` and `rememberSaveable` appropriately\n8. **Preview Annotations**: Add `@Preview` with different configurations\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Recomposition Issues**: Avoid passing unstable lambdas; use `remember`\n- **State Loss**: Use `rememberSaveable` for configuration changes\n- **Performance**: Use `LazyColumn` instead of `Column` for long lists\n- **Theme Leaks**: Ensure `MaterialTheme` wraps all composables\n- **Navigation Crashes**: Handle back press and deep links properly\n- **Memory Leaks**: Cancel coroutines in `DisposableEffect`\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Material Design 3](https://m3.material.io/)\n- [Jetpack Compose Documentation](https://developer.android.com/jetpack/compose)\n- [Compose Samples](https://github.com/android/compose-samples)\n- [Material 3 Compose](https://developer.android.com/jetpack/compose/designsystems/material3)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:42:52.308Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Android Development Agents needing to create modern, adaptive user interfaces with Material Design 3 and Jetpack Compose.","zh":"非常适合需要利用 Material Design 3 和 Jetpack Compose 创建现代自适应用户界面的 Android 开发智能体。","ja":"Material Design 3 と Jetpack Compose を使用してモダンで適応性のあるユーザーインターフェースを作成する必要がある Android 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Material Design 3와 Jetpack Compose를 사용하여 현대적이고 적응형 사용자 인터페이스를 만들어야 하는 Android 개발 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Android que necesitan crear interfaces de usuario modernas y adaptables con Material Design 3 y Jetpack Compose.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Android ayant besoin de créer des interfaces utilisateur modernes et adaptatives avec Material Design 3 et Jetpack Compose.","de":"Ideal für Android-Entwicklungsagenten, die moderne, adaptive Benutzeroberflächen mit Material Design 3 und Jetpack Compose erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento Android que precisam criar interfaces de usuário modernas e adaptáveis com Material Design 3 e Jetpack Compose.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Android, которым необходимо создавать современные, адаптивные пользовательские интерфейсы с помощью Material Design 3 и Jetpack Compose.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير Android الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء واجهات مستخدم حديثة ومتكيفة مع Material Design 3 و Jetpack Compose."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and build seamless Android app interfaces using Material You, implement Navigation Compose patterns, and create adaptive layouts with dynamic colors and Material 3 theming.","zh":"使智能体能够使用 Material You 设计和构建无缝的 Android 应用界面，实现 Navigation Compose 模式，并使用动态颜色和 Material 3 主题创建自适应布局。","ja":"Material You を使用してシームレスな Android アプリインターフェースを設計および構築し、Navigation Compose パターンを実装し、動的カラーと Material 3 テーマを使用して適応レイアウトを作成する機能をエージェントに提供します。","ko":"Material You를 사용하여 원활한 Android 앱 인터페이스를 설계 및 구축하고, Navigation Compose 패턴을 구현하며, 동적 색상과 Material 3 테마를 사용하여 적응형 레이아웃을 생성하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y construir interfaces de aplicaciones Android perfectas utilizando Material You, implementar patrones de navegación Compose y crear diseños adaptables con colores dinámicos y temas de Material 3.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de construire des interfaces d''applications Android parfaites en utilisant Material You, de mettre en œuvre des modèles de navigation Compose et de créer des dispositions adaptatives avec des couleurs dynamiques et un thème Material 3.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, nahtlose Android-App-Oberflächen mit Material You zu entwerfen und zu erstellen, Navigation-Compose-Muster zu implementieren und adaptive Layouts mit dynamischen Farben und Material-3-Themen zu erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projatem e construam interfaces de aplicativos Android sem interrupções, usando Material You, implementem padrões de navegação Compose e criem layouts adaptáveis com cores dinâmicas e tema Material 3.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и создавать бесшовные интерфейсы приложений Android с помощью Material You, реализовывать шаблоны навигации Compose и создавать адаптивные макеты с динамическими цветами и темой Material 3.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وبناء واجهات تطبيقات Android بدون انقطاع باستخدام Material You، وتنفيذ أنماط الملاحة Compose، وإنشاء تخطيطات متكيفة مع ألوان ديناميكية وتحسين الموضوعات Material 3."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing Android app interfaces following Material Design 3 principles","Building and customizing Jetpack Compose UI and layouts for various Android devices","Implementing Android navigation patterns with Navigation Compose","Creating adaptive and responsive layouts for phones, tablets, and foldables"],"zh":["遵循 Material Design 3 原则设计 Android 应用界面","为各种 Android 设备构建和定制 Jetpack Compose UI 及布局","使用 Navigation Compose 实现 Android 导航模式","为手机、平板电脑和可折叠设备创建自适应和响应式布局"],"ja":["Material Design 3 の原則に従った Android アプリインターフェースの設計","さまざまな Android デバイス向けの Jetpack Compose UI とレイアウトの構築とカスタマイズ","Navigation Compose を使用した Android ナビゲーションパターンの実装","スマートフォン、タブレット、折りたたみ式端末向けの適応性および応答性レイアウトの作成"],"ko":["Material Design 3 원칙에 따른 Android 앱 인터페이스 설계","다양한 Android 기기를 위한 Jetpack Compose UI 및 레이아웃 구축 및 사용자 정의","Navigation Compose를 사용한 Android 탐색 패턴 구현","휴대폰, 태블릿, 폴더블을 위한 적응형 및 반응형 레이아웃 생성"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces de aplicaciones Android siguiendo los principios de Material Design 3","Crear y personalizar la interfaz de usuario y los diseños de Jetpack Compose para varios dispositivos Android","Implementar patrones de navegación de Android con Navigation Compose","Crear diseños adaptables y responsivos para teléfonos, tabletas y dispositivos plegables"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces d''applications Android suivant les principes de Material Design 3","Construire et personnaliser l''interface utilisateur et les dispositions de Jetpack Compose pour divers appareils Android","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de navigation Android avec Navigation Compose","Créer des dispositions adaptatives et réactives pour les téléphones, les tablettes et les appareils pliables"],"de":["Entwerfen von Android-App-Oberflächen unter Einhaltung der Material-Design-3-Prinzipien","Erstellen und Anpassen der Benutzeroberfläche und der Layouts von Jetpack Compose für verschiedene Android-Geräte","Implementieren von Android-Navigationsmustern mit Navigation Compose","Erstellen von adaptiven und responsiven Layouts für Telefone, Tablets und faltbare Geräte"],"pt":["Projetar interfaces de aplicativos Android seguindo os princípios do Material Design 3","Construir e personalizar a interface do usuário e layouts Jetpack Compose para vários dispositivos Android","Implementar padrões de navegação Android com Navigation Compose","Criar layouts adaptáveis e responsivos para telefones, tablets e dispositivos dobráveis"],"ru":["Проектировать интерфейсы приложений Android в соответствии с принципами Material Design 3","Создавать и настраивать пользовательский интерфейс и макеты Jetpack Compose для различных устройств Android","Реализовывать шаблоны навигации Android с помощью Navigation Compose","Создавать адаптивные и отзывчивые макеты для телефонов, планшетов и складных устройств"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات تطبيقات Android اتباعًا لمبادئ Material Design 3","بناء وتخصيص واجهة المستخدم وتخطيطات Jetpack Compose لمختلف أجهزة Android","تنفيذ أنماط الملاحة Android مع Navigation Compose","إنشاء تخطيطات متكيفة واستجابة للهواتف والألواح والاجهزة القابلة للطي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Android development and Kotlin programming language","Limited to Android platform","Dependent on Jetpack Compose and Material Design 3 libraries"],"zh":["需要具备 Android 开发和 Kotlin 编程语言的知识","仅限于 Android 平台","依赖于 Jetpack Compose 和 Material Design 3 库"],"ja":["Android 開発および Kotlin プログラミング言語の知識が必要","Android プラットフォームに限定される","Jetpack Compose および Material Design 3 ライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Android 개발 및 Kotlin 프로그래밍 언어에 대한 지식 필요","Android 플랫폼으로 제한됨","Jetpack Compose 및 Material Design 3 라이브러리에 종속됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de desarrollo de Android y del lenguaje de programación Kotlin","Limitado a la plataforma Android","Dependiente de las bibliotecas Jetpack Compose y Material Design 3"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en développement Android et en langage de programmation Kotlin","Limité à la plate-forme Android","Dépendant des bibliothèques Jetpack Compose et Material Design 3"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in Android-Entwicklung und der Programmiersprache Kotlin","Begrenzt auf die Android-Plattform","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken Jetpack Compose und Material Design 3"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de desenvolvimento Android e linguagem de programação Kotlin","Limitado à plataforma Android","Dependente das bibliotecas Jetpack Compose e Material Design 3"],"ru":["Требует знания разработки Android и языка программирования Kotlin","Ограничен платформой Android","Зависит от библиотек Jetpack Compose и Material Design 3"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتطوير Android ولغة البرمجة Kotlin","محدود منصة Android","يعتمد على مكتبات Jetpack Compose و Material Design 3"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/paywall-upgrade-cro', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'paywall-upgrade-cro', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z', '2026-02-18T13:42:47.420Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/paywall-upgrade-cro","name":"paywall-upgrade-cro","description":{"zh":"付费墙和升级流程是应用内转化的关键环节，优化它们可以提高转化率和用户留存率","ja":"有料化ウォールとアップグレードフローはアプリ内コンバージョンの重要な要素で、それらを最適化することでコンバージョン率とユーザー留存率を向上させることができます","ko":"페이월 및 업그레이드 흐름은 애플리케이션 내 전환의 중요한 요소이며,它们을 최적화하면 전환률과 사용자 유지율을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"El paywall y la pantalla de actualización son fundamentales para convertir usuarios gratuitos en de pago. Aprende a optimizarlos para aumentar tus ingresos.","fr":"Le paywall et l''écran de mise à niveau sont essentiels pour convertir les utilisateurs gratuits en utilisateurs payants. Découvrez comment les optimiser pour augmenter vos revenus.","de":"Der Paywall und der Upgrade-Screen sind entscheidend, um kostenlose Nutzer in zahlende Nutzer umzuwandeln. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie optimieren, um Ihre Einnahmen zu steigern.","pt":"Otimização de paywall e upgrade para converter usuários gratuitos em pagantes","ru":"Оптимизация платной стены и обновления для конвертации бесплатных пользователей в платных","ar":"تحسين جدار الدفع وتحديث الشاشة لتحويل المستخدمين المجانيين إلى مدفوعين","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"提升付费墙和升级流程的转化率","ja":"有料化ウォールとアップグレードフローの改善","ko":"페이월 및 업그레이드 흐름 최적화","es":"Optimización de Paywall y Pantalla de Actualización","fr":"Optimisation du Paywall et de l''Écran de Mise à Niveau","de":"Paywall- und Upgrade-Screen-Optimierung","pt":"Otimização de Paywall e Upgrade para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Оптимизация платной стены и обновления для разработчиков","ar":"تحسين جدار الدفع وتحديث الشاشة لِمُطوِّرين","en":"paywall-upgrade-cro"},"description":{"zh":"付费墙和升级流程是应用内转化的关键环节，优化它们可以提高转化率和用户留存率","ja":"有料化ウォールとアップグレードフローはアプリ内コンバージョンの重要な要素で、それらを最適化することでコンバージョン率とユーザー留存率を向上させることができます","ko":"페이월 및 업그레이드 흐름은 애플리케이션 내 전환의 중요한 요소이며,它们을 최적화하면 전환률과 사용자 유지율을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"El paywall y la pantalla de actualización son fundamentales para convertir usuarios gratuitos en de pago. Aprende a optimizarlos para aumentar tus ingresos.","fr":"Le paywall et l''écran de mise à niveau sont essentiels pour convertir les utilisateurs gratuits en utilisateurs payants. Découvrez comment les optimiser pour...","de":"Der Paywall und der Upgrade-Screen sind entscheidend, um kostenlose Nutzer in zahlende Nutzer umzuwandeln. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie optimieren, um Ihre Einn...","pt":"Otimização de paywall e upgrade para converter usuários gratuitos em pagantes","ru":"Оптимизация платной стены и обновления для конвертации бесплатных пользователей в платных","ar":"تحسين جدار الدفع وتحديث الشاشة لتحويل المستخدمين المجانيين إلى مدفوعين","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["优化付费墙和升级流程","提高转化率和用户留存率","个性化推荐和用户体验","数据驱动的决策和优化","跨平台的兼容性和集成"],"ja":["有料化ウォールとアップグレードフローの最適化","コンバージョン率とユーザー留存率の向上","パーソナライズされたレコメンドとユーザーエクスペリエンス","データドリブンの意思決定と最適化","クロスプラットフォームの互換性と統合"],"ko":["페이월 및 업그레이드 흐름 최적화","전환률과 사용자 유지율 향상","개인화된 추천 및 사용자 경험","데이터 기반의 의사결정 및 최적화","크로스 플랫폼의 호환성 및 통합"],"es":["Optimización de paywalls y pantallas de actualización","Técnicas de conversión de usuarios gratuitos en de pago","Análisis de comportamiento de usuarios","Personalización de pantallas de actualización","Pruebas A/B y análisis de resultados"],"fr":["Optimisation des paywalls et des écrans de mise à niveau","Techniques de conversion des utilisateurs gratuits en utilisateurs payants","Analyse du comportement des utilisateurs","Personnalisation des écrans de mise à niveau","Tests A/B et analyse des résultats"],"de":["Optimierung von Paywalls und Upgrade-Screens","Techniken zur Umwandlung von kostenlosen Nutzern in zahlende Nutzer","Analyse des Nutzerverhaltens","Personalisierung von Upgrade-Screens","A/B-Tests und Ergebnisanalyse"],"pt":["Otimização de paywall para conversão de usuários","Técnicas de CRO para fluxos de upgrade","Análise de dados para melhorar a conversão","Personalização de experiência de usuário","Integração com plataformas de pagamento","Monitoramento de desempenho de paywall e upgrade"],"ru":["Оптимизация платной стены для конвертации пользователей","Техники CRO для потоков обновления","Анализ данных для улучшения конвертации","Персонализация опыта пользователя","Интеграция с платформами оплаты","Мониторинг производительности платной стены и обновления"],"ar":["تحسين جدار الدفع لتحويل المستخدمين","تقنيات CRO لتدفقات التحديث","تحليل البيانات لتحسين التحويل","تخصيص تجربة المستخدم","التكامل مع منصات الدفع","مراقبة أداء جدار الدفع وتحديث الشاشة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["付费墙优化","升级流程优化","应用内转化","用户留存率","个性化推荐","数据驱动的决策","跨平台兼容性","移动应用开发"],"ja":["有料化ウォール最適化","アップグレードフロー最適化","アプリ内コンバージョン","ユーザー留存率","パーソナライズされたレコメンド","データドリブンの意思決定","クロスプラットフォームの互換性","モバイルアプリ開発"],"ko":["페이월 최적화","업그레이드 흐름 최적화","애플리케이션 내 전환","사용자 유지율","개인화된 추천","데이터 기반의 의사결정","크로스 플랫폼 호환성","모바일 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["paywall","pantalla de actualización","optimización de conversión","usuarios gratuitos","usuarios de pago","análisis de comportamiento","personalización","pruebas A/B"],"fr":["paywall","écran de mise à niveau","optimisation de conversion","utilisateurs gratuits","utilisateurs payants","analyse de comportement","personnalisation","tests A/B"],"de":["Paywall","Upgrade-Screen","Optimierung der Konversion","kostenlose Nutzer","zahlende Nutzer","Analyse des Nutzerverhaltens","Personalisierung","A/B-Tests"],"pt":["paywall","upgrade","CRO","otimização de paywall","conversão de usuários","técnica de CRO","fluxos de upgrade","análise de dados","personalização de experiência de usuário"],"ru":["платная стена","обновление","CRO","оптимизация платной стены","конвертация пользователей","техника CRO","потоки обновления","анализ данных","персонализация опыта пользователя"],"ar":["جدار الدفع","تحديث","CRO","تحسين جدار الدفع","تحويل المستخدمين","تقنية CRO","تدفقات التحديث","تحليل البيانات","تخصيص تجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paywall-upgrade-cro","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize in-app paywalls, upgrade screens, upsell modals, or feature gates. Also use when the user mentions paywall, upgrade screen, upgrade modal, upsell, feature gate, convert free to paid, freemium conversion, trial expiration screen, limit reached screen, plan upgrade prompt, or in-app pricing. Distinct from public pricing pages (see page-cro) — this skill focuses on in-product upgrade moments where the user has already experienced value.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Paywall and Upgrade Screen CRO\n\nYou are an expert in in-app paywalls and upgrade flows. Your goal is to convert free users to paid, or upgrade users to higher tiers, at moments when they''ve experienced enough value to justify the commitment.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore pr","body":"# Paywall and Upgrade Screen CRO\n\nYou are an expert in in-app paywalls and upgrade flows. Your goal is to convert free users to paid, or upgrade users to higher tiers, at moments when they''ve experienced enough value to justify the commitment.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore providing recommendations, understand:\n\n1. **Upgrade Context** - Freemium → Paid? Trial → Paid? Tier upgrade? Feature upsell? Usage limit?\n\n2. **Product Model** - What''s free? What''s behind paywall? What triggers prompts? Current conversion rate?\n\n3. **User Journey** - When does this appear? What have they experienced? What are they trying to do?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Value Before Ask\n- User should have experienced real value first\n- Upgrade should feel like natural next step\n- Timing: After \"aha moment,\" not before\n\n### 2. Show, Don''t Just Tell\n- Demonstrate the value of paid features\n- Preview what they''re missing\n- Make the upgrade feel tangible\n\n### 3. Friction-Free Path\n- Easy to upgrade when ready\n- Don''t make them hunt for pricing\n\n### 4. Respect the No\n- Don''t trap or pressure\n- Make it easy to continue free\n- Maintain trust for future conversion\n\n---\n\n## Paywall Trigger Points\n\n### Feature Gates\nWhen user clicks a paid-only feature:\n- Clear explanation of why it''s paid\n- Show what the feature does\n- Quick path to unlock\n- Option to continue without\n\n### Usage Limits\nWhen user hits a limit:\n- Clear indication of limit reached\n- Show what upgrading provides\n- Don''t block abruptly\n\n### Trial Expiration\nWhen trial is ending:\n- Early warnings (7, 3, 1 day)\n- Clear \"what happens\" on expiration\n- Summarize value received\n\n### Time-Based Prompts\nAfter X days of free use:\n- Gentle upgrade reminder\n- Highlight unused paid features\n- Easy to dismiss\n\n---\n\n## Paywall Screen Components\n\n1. **Headline** - Focus on what they get: \"Unlock [Feature] to [Benefit]\"\n\n2. **Value Demonstration** - Preview, before/after, \"With Pro you could...\"\n\n3. **Feature Comparison** - Highlight key differences, current plan marked\n\n4. **Pricing** - Clear, simple, annual vs. monthly options\n\n5. **Social Proof** - Customer quotes, \"X teams use this\"\n\n6. **CTA** - Specific and value-oriented: \"Start Getting [Benefit]\"\n\n7. **Escape Hatch** - Clear \"Not now\" or \"Continue with Free\"\n\n---\n\n## Specific Paywall Types\n\n### Feature Lock Paywall\n```\n[Lock Icon]\nThis feature is available on Pro\n\n[Feature preview/screenshot]\n\n[Feature name] helps you [benefit]:\n• [Capability]\n• [Capability]\n\n[Upgrade to Pro - $X/mo]\n[Maybe Later]\n```\n\n### Usage Limit Paywall\n```\nYou''ve reached your free limit\n\n[Progress bar at 100%]\n\nFree: 3 projects | Pro: Unlimited\n\n[Upgrade to Pro]  [Delete a project]\n```\n\n### Trial Expiration Paywall\n```\nYour trial ends in 3 days\n\nWhat you''ll lose:\n• [Feature used]\n• [Data created]\n\nWhat you''ve accomplished:\n• Created X projects\n\n[Continue with Pro]\n[Remind me later]  [Downgrade]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Timing and Frequency\n\n### When to Show\n- After value moment, before frustration\n- After activation/aha moment\n- When hitting genuine limits\n\n### When NOT to Show\n- During onboarding (too early)\n- When they''re in a flow\n- Repeatedly after dismissal\n\n### Frequency Rules\n- Limit per session\n- Cool-down after dismiss (days, not hours)\n- Track annoyance signals\n\n---\n\n## Upgrade Flow Optimization\n\n### From Paywall to Payment\n- Minimize steps\n- Keep in-context if possible\n- Pre-fill known information\n\n### Post-Upgrade\n- Immediate access to features\n- Confirmation and receipt\n- Guide to new features\n\n---\n\n## A/B Testing\n\n### What to Test\n- Trigger timing\n- Headline/copy variations\n- Price presentation\n- Trial length\n- Feature emphasis\n- Design/layout\n\n### Metrics to Track\n- Paywall impression rate\n- Click-through to upgrade\n- Completion rate\n- Revenue per user\n- Churn rate post-upgrade\n\n**For comprehensive experiment ideas**: See [references/experiments.md](references/experiments.md)\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### Dark Patterns\n- Hiding the close button\n- Confusing plan selection\n- Guilt-trip copy\n\n### Conversion Killers\n- Asking before value delivered\n- Too frequent prompts\n- Blocking critical flows\n- Complicated upgrade process\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What''s your current free → paid conversion rate?\n2. What triggers upgrade prompts today?\n3. What features are behind the paywall?\n4. What''s your \"aha moment\" for users?\n5. What pricing model? (per seat, usage, flat)\n6. Mobile app, web app, or both?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **page-cro**: For public pricing page optimization\n- **onboarding-cro**: For driving to aha moment before upgrade\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing paywall variations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:42:47.420Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversion Rate Optimization Agents specializing in in-app paywalls and upgrade flows","zh":"适合专门从事应用内支付墙和升级流程的转化率优化代理","ja":"アプリ内の支払いウォールとアップグレードフローを専門とするコンバージョンレート最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"애플리케이션 내 결제 벽 및 업그레이드 흐름을専門으로 하는 전환률 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de optimización de la tasa de conversión que se especializan en pantallas de pago dentro de la aplicación y flujos de actualización","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''optimisation du taux de conversion spécialisés dans les écrans de paiement dans l''application et les flux de mise à niveau","de":"Ideal für Agenten zur Optimierung der Konvertierungsrate, die sich auf In-App-Bezahlwände und Upgrade-Flüsse spezialisieren","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Taxa de Conversão especializados em paywalls e fluxos de upgrade dentro do aplicativo","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации коэффициента конверсии, специализирующихся на внутриприложных платежных стенках и потоках обновления","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين معدل التحويل التخصصي في جدران الدفع داخل التطبيق وfluxes الترقية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize paywall and upgrade screen conversions by leveraging product marketing context, analyzing user value justification, and identifying moments to prompt tier upgrades, utilizing files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for informed decision-making","zh":"通过利用产品营销背景、分析用户价值理由并确定提示等级升级的时刻，来赋予代理优化支付墙和升级屏幕转化的能力，利用诸如 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的文件来进行明智的决策","ja":"製品マーケティングコンテキストを利用し、ユーザーの価値理由を分析し、階級アップグレードを促すタイミングを特定することで、エージェントが支払いウォールとアップグレードスクリーンのコンバージョンを最適化できるようにし、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のようなファイルを使用して情報に基づいた意思決定を行う","ko":"제품 마케팅.context를 활용하고 사용자의 가치 정당성을 분석하며 계층 업그레이드를 유도할 시기를 결정함으로써 에이전트가 결제 벽 및 업그레이드 화면의 전환을 최적화 할 수 있도록 하며, `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 정보에基づいた 의사결정을 함","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar las conversiones de la pantalla de pago y la pantalla de actualización aprovechando el contexto de marketing de productos, analizando la justificación del valor del usuario e identificando los momentos para solicitar actualizaciones de nivel, utilizando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para la toma de decisiones informadas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les conversions d''écran de paiement et d''écran de mise à niveau en exploitant le contexte de marketing de produits, en analysant la justification de la valeur de l''utilisateur et en identifiant les moments pour solliciter des mises à niveau de niveau, en utilisant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour une prise de décision éclairée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Konvertierungen von Bezahlwänden und Upgrade-Bildschirmen zu optimieren, indem sie den Produktmarketing-Kontext nutzen, die Nutzerwertberechtigung analysieren und Momente zur Aufforderung von Tier-Upgrades identifizieren, unter Nutzung von Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für eine informierte Entscheidungsfindung","pt":"Habilita agentes a otimizar conversões de paywall e tela de upgrade aproveitando o contexto de marketing de produtos, analisando a justificativa do valor do usuário e identificando momentos para solicitar upgrades de nível, utilizando arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para tomada de decisão informada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать конверсии платежных стенок и экранов обновления, используя контекст маркетинга продукта, анализируя обоснование ценности пользователя и определяя моменты для запроса апгрейда уровня, используя файлы типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для принятия обоснованных решений","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تحسين تحويلات جدار الدفع وشاشة الترقية من خلال الاستفادة من سياق تسويق المنتج وتحليل مبرر قيمة المستخدم وتحديد اللحظات لطلب ترقية المستوى، باستخدام ملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` لاتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing user behavior to justify paywall prompts","Optimizing upgrade flows based on product marketing context","Identifying high-value moments for tier upgrades"],"zh":["分析用户行为以证明支付墙提示","基于产品营销背景优化升级流程","确定高价值时刻以进行等级升级"],"ja":["ユーザーの行動を分析して支払いウォールの提示を正当化する","製品マーケティングコンテキストに基づいてアップグレードフローを最適化する","高価値の瞬間を特定して階級アップグレードを実行する"],"ko":["사용자 행동을 분석하여 결제 벽提示를 정당화함","제품 마케팅.context에基づいて 업그레이드 흐름을 최적화함","고가치의 순간을 결정하여 계층 업그레이드를 수행함"],"es":["Análisis del comportamiento del usuario para justificar las solicitudes de pantalla de pago","Optimización de los flujos de actualización en función del contexto de marketing de productos","Identificación de momentos de alto valor para actualizaciones de nivel"],"fr":["Analyse du comportement de l''utilisateur pour justifier les invites d''écran de paiement","Optimisation des flux de mise à niveau en fonction du contexte de marketing de produits","Identification des moments à forte valeur pour les mises à niveau de niveau"],"de":["Analyse des Benutzerverhaltens, um die Anforderungen von Bezahlwänden zu begründen","Optimierung der Upgrade-Flüsse auf der Grundlage des Produktmarketing-Kontexts","Identifizierung von hochwertigen Momenten für Tier-Upgrades"],"pt":["Analisar comportamento do usuário para justificar prompts de paywall","Otimizar fluxos de upgrade com base no contexto de marketing de produtos","Identificar momentos de alto valor para upgrades de nível"],"ru":["Анализ поведения пользователя для обоснования запросов на платежную стенку","Оптимизация потоков обновления на основе контекста маркетинга продукта","Определение моментов высокого значения для апгрейда уровня"],"ar":["تحليل سلوك المستخدم لمبرر مطالب جدار الدفع","تحسين تدفقات الترقية بالاعتماد على سياق تسويق المنتج","تحديد اللحظات القيمة العالية لترقية المستوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product marketing context files","Limited to in-app paywall and upgrade flow optimization"],"zh":["需要访问产品营销背景文件","仅限于应用内支付墙和升级流程优化"],"ja":["製品マーケティングコンテキストファイルへのアクセスが必要","アプリ内支払いウォールとアップグレードフロー最適化のみに限定"],"ko":["제품 마케팅.context 파일에 액세스 해야함","애플리케이션 내 결제 벽 및 업그레이드 흐름 최적화에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de marketing de productos","Limitado a la optimización de pantallas de pago y flujos de actualización dentro de la aplicación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers de contexte de marketing de produits","Limité à l''optimisation des écrans de paiement et des flux de mise à niveau dans l''application"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Produktmarketing-Kontext-Dateien","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von In-App-Bezahlwänden und Upgrade-Flüssen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de contexto de marketing de produtos","Limitado à otimização de paywall e fluxo de upgrade dentro do aplicativo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста маркетинга продукта","Ограничен оптимизацией внутриприложных платежных стенок и потоков обновления"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق تسويق المنتج","محدود بتحسين جدار الدفع وfluxes الترقية داخل التطبيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
