té avec d''autres IDEs et CLIs","Approche structurée pour le débogage","Processus de débogage en 4 phases","Reproduction des erreurs de manière fiable"],"de":["Konvertierung von Antigravity-IDE-Konfigurationen","Kompatibilität mit anderen IDEs und CLIs","Strukturierter Ansatz für die Fehlersuche","Fehlersuchprozess in 4 Phasen","Reproduktion von Fehlern in zuverlässiger Weise"],"pt":["Conversão de configurações de IDEs e CLIs","Abordagem estruturada para depuração","Prevenção de suposições aleatórias","Garantia de compreensão dos problemas antes da resolução"],"ru":["Конвертация конфигураций IDE и CLI","Структурированный подход к отладке","Предотвращение случайных предположений","Гарантия понимания проблем перед решением"],"ar":["تحويل التكوينات من IDE و CLI","نهج منظم للتصحيح","منع افتراضات عشوائية","ضمان فهم المشاكل قبل الحل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["系统调试","结构化调试","Antigravity IDE","IDE兼容","CLI兼容","调试工具","问题解决"],"ja":["体系的なデバッグ","構造化されたデバッグ","Antigravity IDE","IDE互換","CLI互換","デバッグツール","問題解決"],"ko":["시스템 디버깅","구조화된 디버깅","Antigravity IDE","IDE 호환","CLI 호환","디버깅 도구","문제 해결"],"es":["depuración sistemática","conversión de configuraciones","Antigravity IDE","desarrollo de software","depuración de errores","proceso de depuración"],"fr":["débogage systématique","conversion de configurations","Antigravity IDE","développement de logiciels","débogage d''erreurs","processus de débogage"],"de":["systematische Fehlersuche","Konvertierung von Konfigurationen","Antigravity IDE","Softwareentwicklung","Fehlersuche","Fehlersuchprozess"],"pt":["depuração sistemática","conversão de configurações","IDE","CLI","desenvolvimento de software","depuração de código"],"ru":["системная отладка","конвертация конфигураций","IDE","CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","отладка кода"],"ar":["التصحيح المنهجي","تحويل التكوينات","IDE","CLI","تطوير البرمجيات","تصحيح الشفرة"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"systematic-debugging","description":"4-phase systematic debugging methodology with root cause analysis and evidence-based verification. Use when debugging complex issues.","bodyPreview":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a structured approach to debugging that prevents random guessing and ensures problems are properly understood before solving.\n\n## 4-Phase Debugging Process\n\n### Phase 1: Reproduce\nBefore fixing, reliably reproduce the issue.\n\n```markdown\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. [Exact step to reproduce]\n2. [Next step]\n3. [Expected vs actual result]\n\n## Reproduction Rate\n- [ ] Always (100%)\n- [ ] Often (50-90%)\n- [ ] Sometimes (1","body":"# Systematic Debugging\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a structured approach to debugging that prevents random guessing and ensures problems are properly understood before solving.\n\n## 4-Phase Debugging Process\n\n### Phase 1: Reproduce\nBefore fixing, reliably reproduce the issue.\n\n```markdown\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. [Exact step to reproduce]\n2. [Next step]\n3. [Expected vs actual result]\n\n## Reproduction Rate\n- [ ] Always (100%)\n- [ ] Often (50-90%)\n- [ ] Sometimes (10-50%)\n- [ ] Rare (<10%)\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Isolate\nNarrow down the source.\n\n```markdown\n## Isolation Questions\n- When did this start happening?\n- What changed recently?\n- Does it happen in all environments?\n- Can we reproduce with minimal code?\n- What''s the smallest change that triggers it?\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Understand\nFind the root cause, not just symptoms.\n\n```markdown\n## Root Cause Analysis\n### The 5 Whys\n1. Why: [First observation]\n2. Why: [Deeper reason]\n3. Why: [Still deeper]\n4. Why: [Getting closer]\n5. Why: [Root cause]\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Fix & Verify\nFix and verify it''s truly fixed.\n\n```markdown\n## Fix Verification\n- [ ] Bug no longer reproduces\n- [ ] Related functionality still works\n- [ ] No new issues introduced\n- [ ] Test added to prevent regression\n```\n\n## Debugging Checklist\n\n```markdown\n## Before Starting\n- [ ] Can reproduce consistently\n- [ ] Have minimal reproduction case\n- [ ] Understand expected behavior\n\n## During Investigation\n- [ ] Check recent changes (git log)\n- [ ] Check logs for errors\n- [ ] Add logging if needed\n- [ ] Use debugger/breakpoints\n\n## After Fix\n- [ ] Root cause documented\n- [ ] Fix verified\n- [ ] Regression test added\n- [ ] Similar code checked\n```\n\n## Common Debugging Commands\n\n```bash\n# Recent changes\ngit log --oneline -20\ngit diff HEAD~5\n\n# Search for pattern\ngrep -r \"errorPattern\" --include=\"*.ts\"\n\n# Check logs\npm2 logs app-name --err --lines 100\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Random changes** - \"Maybe if I change this...\"\n❌ **Ignoring evidence** - \"That can''t be the cause\"\n❌ **Assuming** - \"It must be X\" without proof\n❌ **Not reproducing first** - Fixing blindly\n❌ **Stopping at symptoms** - Not finding root cause\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:43:32.050Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Debugging Agents requiring a structured approach to issue resolution, such as those integrated with GitHub Copilot or Cursor","zh":"适用于需要结构化方法来解决问题的调试代理，例如与 GitHub Copilot 或 Cursor 集成的代理","ja":"デバッグエージェントが問題を解決するために構造化されたアプローチを必要とする場合に最適です。例えば、GitHub Copilot または Cursor と統合されたエージェントなど","ko":"문제를 해결하기 위해 구조화된 접근 방식을 필요로 하는 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어 GitHub Copilot 또는 Cursor와 통합된 에이전트","es":"Ideal para agentes de depuración que requieren un enfoque estructurado para la resolución de problemas, como aquellos integrados con GitHub Copilot o Cursor","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage nécessitant une approche structurée pour la résolution des problèmes, tels que ceux intégrés à GitHub Copilot ou Cursor","de":"Ideal für Debugging-Agents, die einen strukturierten Ansatz für die Problemlösung erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die in GitHub Copilot oder Cursor integriert sind","pt":"Ideal para agentes de depuração que exigem uma abordagem estruturada para a resolução de problemas, como aqueles integrados ao GitHub Copilot ou Cursor","ru":"Идеально подходит для отладочных агентов, требующих структурированного подхода к решению проблем, таких как те, которые интегрированы с GitHub Copilot или Cursor","ar":"مثالي لعمليات فحص الأعطال التي تتطلب نهجًا منظمًا لحل المشكلات، مثل تلك المتكاملة مع GitHub Copilot أو Cursor"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically debug issues using a 4-phase process, including reliable reproduction, and ensures problems are properly understood before solving, leveraging Markdown for step-by-step documentation","zh":"使代理能够系统地使用 4 个阶段的过程来调试问题，包括可靠的再现，并确保在解决问题之前正确理解问题，并利用 Markdown 进行分步文档记录","ja":"エージェントが問題を体系的に調査する 4 つの段階のプロセスを使用してデバッグを行うことができ、信頼性の高い再現を可能にし、問題を解決する前に問題が適切に理解されることを保証し、また Markdown を使用してステップバイステップのドキュメント化を行う","ko":"에이전트가 문제를 체계적으로 디버깅하기 위해 4단계의 프로세스를 사용할 수 있도록 하며, 신뢰할 수 있는 재현을 가능하게 하고, 문제를 해결하기 전에 문제가 올바르게 이해되는 것을 보장하며, 마크다운을 사용하여 단계별 문서화를 수행","es":"Permite a los agentes depurar sistemáticamente los problemas utilizando un proceso de 4 fases, incluyendo la reproducción confiable, y asegura que los problemas se entiendan adecuadamente antes de resolverlos, utilizando Markdown para la documentación paso a paso","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer systématiquement les problèmes en utilisant un processus de 4 phases, incluant la reproduction fiable, et s''assure que les problèmes sont correctement compris avant d''être résolus, en utilisant Markdown pour la documentation étape par étape","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Probleme systematisch zu debuggen, indem sie einen 4-Phasen-Prozess verwenden, einschließlich zuverlässiger Reproduktion, und stellt sicher, dass die Probleme vor der Lösung ordnungsgemäß verstanden werden, unter Verwendung von Markdown für die schrittweise Dokumentation","pt":"Habilita os agentes a depurar problemas sistematicamente usando um processo de 4 fases, incluindo reprodução confiável, e garante que os problemas sejam adequadamente compreendidos antes de serem resolvidos, utilizando Markdown para documentação passo a passo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически отлаживать проблемы, используя 4-фазовый процесс, включая надежную репродукцию, и гарантирует, что проблемы правильно поняты до их решения, используя Markdown для шаг за шагом документации","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من فحص الأعطال بشكل منهجي باستخدام عملية من 4 مراحل، بما في ذلك إعادة إنتاج موثوقة، ويضمن فهم المشكلات بشكل صحيح قبل حلها، باستخدام Markdown للتوثيق خطوة بخطوة"},"useCases":{"en":["Reproducing issues consistently","Documenting reproduction steps in Markdown","Analyzing reproduction rates for efficient debugging"],"zh":["一致地再现问题","使用 Markdown 记录再现步骤","分析再现率以进行高效的调试"],"ja":["問題を一貫して再現する","Markdown を使用して再現手順を文書化する","再現率を分析して効率的なデバッグを行う"],"ko":["일관되게 문제를 재현","마크다운을 사용하여 재현 단계를 문서화","재현율을 분석하여 효율적인 디버깅"],"es":["Reproducir problemas de manera consistente","Documentar los pasos de reproducción en Markdown","Analizar las tasas de reproducción para un depuración eficiente"],"fr":["Reproduire les problèmes de manière cohérente","Documenter les étapes de reproduction en Markdown","Analyser les taux de reproduction pour un débogage efficace"],"de":["Probleme konsistent reproduzieren","Die Reproduktionsschritte in Markdown dokumentieren","Die Reproduktionsraten für eine effiziente Fehlersuche analysieren"],"pt":["Reproduzir problemas consistentemente","Documentar etapas de reprodução em Markdown","Analizar taxas de reprodução para depuração eficiente"],"ru":["Последовательно воспроизводить проблемы","Документировать шаги воспроизведения в Markdown","Анализировать скорость воспроизведения для эффективной отладки"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج المشكلات بشكل متسق","توثيق خطوات الإعادة في Markdown","تحليل معدلات الإعادة لإجراء فحص الأعطال بكفاءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires exact reproduction steps","Limited to issues that can be reliably reproduced"],"zh":["需要精确的再现步骤","仅限于可以可靠地再现的问题"],"ja":["正確な再現手順が必要","信頼性の高い再現が可能な問題にのみ限られる"],"ko":["정확한 재현 단계가 필요","신뢰할 수 있는 재현이 가능한 문제에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere pasos de reproducción exactos","Limitado a problemas que pueden ser reproducidos de manera confiable"],"fr":["Nécessite des étapes de reproduction exactes","Limité aux problèmes qui peuvent être reproduits de manière fiable"],"de":["Erfordert exakte Reproduktionsschritte","Begrenzt auf Probleme, die zuverlässig reproduziert werden können"],"pt":["Exige etapas de reprodução exatas","Limitado a problemas que podem ser reproduzidos de forma confiável"],"ru":["Требует точных шагов воспроизведения","Ограничен проблемами, которые могут быть надежно воспроизведены"],"ar":["يتطلب خطوات إعادة دقيقة","محدود بالمشكلات التي يمكن إعادة إنتاجها بثقة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
