rramientas y diseño de instrucciones","fr":"Le développement d''agents pour Claude Code implique la création d''agents personnalisés avec une délégation appropriée, un accès aux outils et une conception ...","de":"Die Agenten-Entwicklung für Claude Code beinhaltet die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Agenten mit angemessener Delegation, Tool-Zugriff und Prompt-Design","pt":"O desenvolvimento de agentes para Claude Code permite criar soluções personalizadas com delegação adequada, acesso a ferramentas e design de prompts","ru":"Разработка агентов для Claude Code позволяет создавать индивидуальные решения с правильной делегацией, доступом к инструментам и проектированием подсказок","ar":"تطوير وكلاء ل Claude Code يسمح بإنشاء حلول مخصصة مع تفويض مناسب ووصول إلى الأدوات وتصميم التحفيزات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Claude Code","API","SDK","CLI","Webhook","Bash"],"ja":["Claude Code","API","SDK","CLI","Webhook","Bash"],"ko":["Claude Code","API","SDK","CLI","Webhook","Bash"],"es":["Delegación automática de tareas","Acceso a herramientas y tecnologías","Diseño de instrucciones personalizadas","Integración con Claude Code","Automatización de tareas repetitivas","Mejora de la eficiencia y productividad"],"fr":["Délégation automatique de tâches","Accès aux outils et technologies","Conception d''instructions personnalisées","Intégration avec Claude Code","Automatisation de tâches répétitives","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la productivité"],"de":["Automatische Delegation von Aufgaben","Zugriff auf Tools und Technologien","Benutzerdefiniertes Prompt-Design","Integration mit Claude Code","Automatisierung von wiederkehrenden Aufgaben","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Produktivität"],"pt":["Criação de agentes personalizados","Delegação adequada de tarefas","Acesso a ferramentas e recursos","Design de prompts eficazes","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных агентов","Правильная делегация задач","Доступ к инструментам и ресурсам","Проектирование эффективных подсказок","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["إنشاء وكلاء مخصصين","تفويض مناسب للمهام","وصول إلى الأدوات والموارد","تصميم تحفيزات فعالة","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude Code","AI","Agent","API","SDK","CLI","Webhook","Bash","Automation","Development"],"ja":["Claude Code","AI","Agent","API","SDK","CLI","Webhook","Bash","Automation","Development"],"ko":["Claude Code","AI","Agent","API","SDK","CLI","Webhook","Bash","Automation","Development"],"es":["desarrollo de agentes","Claude Code","automatización de tareas","delegación de tareas","acceso a herramientas","diseño de instrucciones","agentes personalizados","integración con Claude Code","eficiencia y productividad"],"fr":["développement d''agents","Claude Code","automatisation de tâches","délégation de tâches","accès aux outils","conception d''instructions","agents personnalisés","intégration avec Claude Code","efficacité et productivité"],"de":["Agenten-Entwicklung","Claude Code","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Delegation von Aufgaben","Zugriff auf Tools","Prompt-Design","benutzerdefinierte Agenten","Integration mit Claude Code","Effizienz und Produktivität"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de agentes","Claude Code","agentes personalizados","delegação de tarefas","acesso a ferramentas","design de prompts","integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["разработка агентов","Claude Code","индивидуальные агенты","делегация задач","доступ к инструментам","проектирование подсказок","интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["تطوير وكلاء","Claude Code","وكلاء مخصصين","تفويض المهام","وصول إلى الأدوات","تصميم التحفيزات","التكامل مع Claude Code"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-development","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Agent Development for Claude Code\n\nBuild effective custom agents for Claude Code with proper delegation, tool access, and prompt design.\n\n## Agent Description Pattern\n\nThe description field determines whether Claude will automatically delegate tasks.\n\n### Strong Trigger Pattern\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: agent-name\ndescription: |\n  [Role] specialist. MUST BE USED when [specific triggers].\n  Use PROACTIVELY for [task category].\n  Keywords: [trigger words]\ntools: Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash\nmode","body":"# Agent Development for Claude Code\n\nBuild effective custom agents for Claude Code with proper delegation, tool access, and prompt design.\n\n## Agent Description Pattern\n\nThe description field determines whether Claude will automatically delegate tasks.\n\n### Strong Trigger Pattern\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: agent-name\ndescription: |\n  [Role] specialist. MUST BE USED when [specific triggers].\n  Use PROACTIVELY for [task category].\n  Keywords: [trigger words]\ntools: Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash\nmodel: sonnet\n---\n```\n\n### Weak vs Strong Descriptions\n\n| Weak (won''t auto-delegate) | Strong (auto-delegates) |\n|---------------------------|-------------------------|\n| \"Analyzes screenshots for issues\" | \"Visual QA specialist. MUST BE USED when analyzing screenshots. Use PROACTIVELY for visual QA.\" |\n| \"Runs Playwright scripts\" | \"Playwright specialist. MUST BE USED when running Playwright scripts. Use PROACTIVELY for browser automation.\" |\n\n**Key phrases**:\n- \"MUST BE USED when...\"\n- \"Use PROACTIVELY for...\"\n- Include trigger keywords\n\n### Delegation Mechanisms\n\n1. **Explicit**: `Task tool subagent_type: \"agent-name\"` - always works\n2. **Automatic**: Claude matches task to agent description - requires strong phrasing\n\n**Session restart required** after creating/modifying agents.\n\n## Tool Access Principle\n\n**If an agent doesn''t need Bash, don''t give it Bash.**\n\n| Agent needs to... | Give tools | Don''t give |\n|-------------------|------------|------------|\n| Create files only | Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep | Bash |\n| Run scripts/CLIs | Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash | — |\n| Read/audit only | Read, Glob, Grep | Write, Edit, Bash |\n\n**Why?** Models default to `cat > file << ''EOF''` heredocs instead of Write tool. Each bash command requires approval, causing dozens of prompts per agent run.\n\n### Allowlist Pattern\n\nInstead of restricting Bash, allowlist safe commands in `.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"Write\", \"Edit\", \"WebFetch(domain:*)\",\n      \"Bash(cd *)\", \"Bash(cp *)\", \"Bash(mkdir *)\", \"Bash(ls *)\",\n      \"Bash(cat *)\", \"Bash(head *)\", \"Bash(tail *)\", \"Bash(grep *)\",\n      \"Bash(diff *)\", \"Bash(mv *)\", \"Bash(touch *)\", \"Bash(file *)\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Model Selection (Quality First)\n\nDon''t downgrade quality to work around issues - fix root causes instead.\n\n| Model | Use For |\n|-------|---------|\n| **Opus** | Creative work (page building, design, content) - quality matters |\n| **Sonnet** | Most agents - content, code, research (default) |\n| **Haiku** | Only script runners where quality doesn''t matter |\n\n## Memory Limits\n\n### Root Cause Fix (REQUIRED)\n\nAdd to `~/.bashrc` or `~/.zshrc`:\n```bash\nexport NODE_OPTIONS=\"--max-old-space-size=16384\"\n```\n\nIncreases Node.js heap from 4GB to 16GB.\n\n### Parallel Limits (Even With Fix)\n\n| Agent Type | Max Parallel | Notes |\n|------------|--------------|-------|\n| Any agents | 2-3 | Context accumulates; batch then pause |\n| Heavy creative (Opus) | 1-2 | Uses more memory |\n\n### Recovery\n\n1. `source ~/.bashrc` or restart terminal\n2. `NODE_OPTIONS=\"--max-old-space-size=16384\" claude`\n3. Check what files exist, continue from there\n\n## Sub-Agent vs Remote API\n\n**Always prefer Task sub-agents over remote API calls.**\n\n| Aspect | Remote API Call | Task Sub-Agent |\n|--------|-----------------|----------------|\n| Tool access | None | Full (Read, Grep, Write, Bash) |\n| File reading | Must pass all content in prompt | Can read files iteratively |\n| Cross-referencing | Single context window | Can reason across documents |\n| Decision quality | Generic suggestions | Specific decisions with rationale |\n| Output quality | ~100 lines typical | 600+ lines with specifics |\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG - Remote API call\nconst response = await fetch(''https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages'', {...})\n\n// ✅ CORRECT - Use Task tool\n// Invoke Task with subagent_type: \"general-purpose\"\n```\n\n## Declarative Over Imperative\n\nDescribe **what** to accomplish, not **how** to use tools.\n\n### Wrong (Imperative)\n\n```markdown\n### Check for placeholders\n```bash\ngrep -r \"PLACEHOLDER:\" build/*.html\n```\n```\n\n### Right (Declarative)\n\n```markdown\n### Check for placeholders\nSearch all HTML files in build/ for:\n- PLACEHOLDER: comments\n- TODO or TBD markers\n- Template brackets like [Client Name]\n\nAny match = incomplete content.\n```\n\n### What to Include\n\n| Include | Skip |\n|---------|------|\n| Task goal and context | Explicit bash/tool commands |\n| Input file paths | \"Use X tool to...\" |\n| Output file paths and format | Step-by-step tool invocations |\n| Success/failure criteria | Shell pipeline syntax |\n| Blocking checks (prerequisites) | Micromanaged workflows |\n| Quality checklists | |\n\n## Self-Documentation Principle\n\n> \"Agents that won''t have your context must be able to reproduce the behaviour independently.\"\n\nEvery improvement must be encoded into the agent''s prompt, not left as implicit knowledge.\n\n### What to Encode\n\n| Discovery | Where to Capture |\n|-----------|------------------|\n| Bug fix pattern | Agent''s \"Corrections\" or \"Common Issues\" section |\n| Quality requirement | Agent''s \"Quality Checklist\" section |\n| File path convention | Agent''s \"Output\" section |\n| Tool usage pattern | Agent''s \"Process\" section |\n| Blocking prerequisite | Agent''s \"Blocking Check\" section |\n\n### Test: Would a Fresh Agent Succeed?\n\nBefore completing any agent improvement:\n1. Read the agent prompt as if you have no context\n2. Ask: Could a new session follow this and produce the same quality?\n3. If no: Add missing instructions, patterns, or references\n\n### Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why It Fails |\n|--------------|--------------|\n| \"As we discussed earlier...\" | No prior context exists |\n| Relying on files read during dev | Agent may not read same files |\n| Assuming knowledge from errors | Agent won''t see your debugging |\n| \"Just like the home page\" | Agent hasn''t built home page |\n\n## Agent Prompt Structure\n\nEffective agent prompts include:\n\n```markdown\n## Your Role\n[What the agent does]\n\n## Blocking Check\n[Prerequisites that must exist]\n\n## Input\n[What files to read]\n\n## Process\n[Step-by-step with encoded learnings]\n\n## Output\n[Exact file paths and formats]\n\n## Quality Checklist\n[Verification steps including learned gotchas]\n\n## Common Issues\n[Patterns discovered during development]\n```\n\n## Pipeline Agents\n\nWhen inserting a new agent into a numbered pipeline (e.g., `HTML-01` → `HTML-05` → `HTML-11`):\n\n| Must Update | What |\n|-------------|------|\n| New agent | \"Workflow Position\" diagram + \"Next\" field |\n| **Predecessor agent** | Its \"Next\" field to point to new agent |\n\n**Common bug**: New agent is \"orphaned\" because predecessor still points to old next agent.\n\n**Verification**:\n```bash\ngrep -n \"Next:.*→\\|Then.*runs next\" .claude/agents/*.md\n```\n\n## The Sweet Spot\n\n**Best use case**: Tasks that are **repetitive but require judgment**.\n\nExample: Auditing 70 skills manually = tedious. But each audit needs intelligence (check docs, compare versions, decide what to fix). Perfect for parallel agents with clear instructions.\n\n**Not good for**:\n- Simple tasks (just do them)\n- Highly creative tasks (need human direction)\n- Tasks requiring cross-file coordination (agents work independently)\n\n## Effective Prompt Template\n\n```\nFor each [item]:\n1. Read [source file]\n2. Verify with [external check - npm view, API call, etc.]\n3. Check [authoritative source]\n4. Score/evaluate\n5. FIX issues found ← Critical instruction\n```\n\n**Key elements**:\n- **\"FIX issues found\"** - Without this, agents only report. With it, they take action.\n- **Exact file paths** - Prevents ambiguity\n- **Output format template** - Ensures consistent, parseable reports\n- **Batch size ~5 items** - Enough work to be efficient, not so much that failures cascade\n\n## Workflow Pattern\n\n```\n1. ME: Launch 2-3 parallel agents with identical prompt, different item lists\n2. AGENTS: Work in parallel (read → verify → check → edit → report)\n3. AGENTS: Return structured reports (score, status, fixes applied, files modified)\n4. ME: Review changes (git status, spot-check diffs)\n5. ME: Commit in batches with meaningful changelog\n6. ME: Push and update progress tracking\n```\n\n**Why agents don''t commit**: Allows human review, batching, and clean commit history.\n\n## Signs a Task Fits This Pattern\n\n**Good fit**:\n- Same steps repeated for many items\n- Each item requires judgment (not just transformation)\n- Items are independent (no cross-item dependencies)\n- Clear success criteria (score, pass/fail, etc.)\n- Authoritative source exists to verify against\n\n**Bad fit**:\n- Items depend on each other''s results\n- Requires creative/subjective decisions\n- Single complex task (use regular agent instead)\n- Needs human input mid-process\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Agent Frontmatter Template\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: my-agent\ndescription: |\n  [Role] specialist. MUST BE USED when [triggers].\n  Use PROACTIVELY for [task category].\n  Keywords: [trigger words]\ntools: Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash\nmodel: sonnet\n---\n```\n\n### Fix Bash Approval Spam\n\n1. Remove Bash from tools if not needed\n2. Put critical instructions FIRST (right after frontmatter)\n3. Use allowlists in `.claude/settings.json`\n\n### Memory Crash Recovery\n\n```bash\nexport NODE_OPTIONS=\"--max-old-space-size=16384\"\nsource ~/.bashrc && claude\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:43:31.280Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing customized task delegation and prompt design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自定义任务委托和提示设计能力的AI代理，如Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Codeのような、カスタマイズされたタスクの委任とプロンプト設計機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 사용자 지정 작업 위임 및 프롬프트 디자인 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code que necesitan una delegación de tareas personalizada y capacidades de diseño de instrucciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code ayant besoin d''une délégation de tâches personnalisée et de capacités de conception de invites.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine benutzerdefinierte Aufgabenverteilung und eine Gestaltung von Prompts benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code que necessitam de delegação de tarefas personalizadas e capacidades de design de prompts.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих индивидуальной делегации задач и возможностей проектирования запросов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى تفويض مهام مخصص وسمات تصميم الاستجابة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage proper delegation, tool access, and prompt design using keywords and specific triggers, enhancing their task automation capabilities with tools like Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, and Bash.","zh":"能够让代理利用适当的委托、工具访问和提示设计，使用关键字和特定触发器，增强他们使用Read、Write、Edit、Glob、Grep和Bash等工具的任务自动化能力。","ja":"キーワードや特定のトリガーを使った適切な委任、ツールアクセス、プロンプト設計をエージェントが利用できるようにし、Read、Write、Edit、Glob、Grep、Bashなどのツールを使用したタスクの自動化能力を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 위임, 도구 액세스 및 프롬프트 디자인을 사용하여 키워드와 특정 트리거를 사용하여 Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep 및 Bash와 같은 도구를 사용한 작업 자동화 기능을 강화할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una delegación adecuada, acceso a herramientas y diseño de instrucciones utilizando palabras clave y desencadenadores específicos, mejorando sus capacidades de automatización de tareas con herramientas como Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep y Bash.","fr":"Permet aux agents de profiter d''une délégation appropriée, d''un accès aux outils et d''une conception d''invites en utilisant des mots clés et des déclencheurs spécifiques, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités d''automatisation de tâches avec des outils comme Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep et Bash.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine ordnungsgemäße Delegation, Werkzeugzugriff und Promptgestaltung unter Verwendung von Schlüsselwörtern und spezifischen Auslösern zu nutzen, wodurch ihre Fähigkeiten zur Aufgabenautomatisierung mit Tools wie Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep und Bash verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar a delegação adequada, o acesso às ferramentas e o design de prompts usando palavras-chave e gatilhos específicos, melhorando suas capacidades de automação de tarefas com ferramentas como Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep e Bash.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать правильную делегацию, доступ к инструментам и проектирование запросов с помощью ключевых слов и определенных триггеров, повышая их возможности автоматизации задач с помощью инструментов, таких как Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep и Bash.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استغلال التفويض المناسب ووصول الأدوات وتصميم الاستجابة باستخدام الكلمات الرئيسية والزوار الخاصة، مما يعزز قدراتهم على 자동ة المهام بأدوات مثل Read و Write و Edit و Glob و Grep و Bash."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task delegation based on specific triggers and keywords","Designing effective prompts for proactive task execution","Configuring agents with appropriate tool access for efficient task completion"],"zh":["基于特定触发器和关键字的任务委托自动化","为主动任务执行设计有效的提示","配置代理以获得适当的工具访问权限以实现高效的任务完成"],"ja":["特定トリガーとキーワードに基づくタスクの委任の自動化","能動的なタスク実行のための効果的なプロンプトの設計","エージェントを適切なツールアクセスで構成し、効率的なタスク完了を実現する"],"ko":["특정 트리거 및 키워드를 기반으로 하는 작업 위임 자동화","능동적인 작업 실행을 위한 효과적인 프롬프트 디자인","에이전트를 적절한 도구 액세스와 함께 구성하여 효율적인 작업 완성을 달성하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la delegación de tareas en función de desencadenadores y palabras clave específicas","Diseño de instrucciones efectivas para la ejecución proactiva de tareas","Configuración de agentes con acceso a herramientas adecuadas para una finalización de tareas eficiente"],"fr":["Automatisation de la délégation de tâches en fonction de déclencheurs et de mots clés spécifiques","Conception d''invites efficaces pour l''exécution proactive de tâches","Configuration d''agents avec un accès aux outils appropriés pour une réalisation de tâches efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenverteilung basierend auf spezifischen Auslösern und Schlüsselwörtern","Gestaltung effektiver Prompts für die proaktive Ausführung von Aufgaben","Konfiguration von Agenten mit geeigneten Werkzeugzugriffen für eine effiziente Aufgabenabwicklung"],"pt":["Automatizar a delegação de tarefas com base em gatilhos e palavras-chave específicos","Projetar prompts eficazes para a execução proativa de tarefas","Configurar agentes com acesso a ferramentas apropriadas para conclusão eficiente de tarefas"],"ru":["Автоматизация делегации задач на основе определенных триггеров и ключевых слов","Проектирование эффективных запросов для проактивной реализации задач","Настройка агентов с доступом к соответствующим инструментам для эффективного выполнения задач"],"ar":["تأتمت تفويض المهام على أساس الزوار والكلمات الرئيسية الخاصة","تصميم استجابات فعالة لتنفيذ المهام بالشكل التفاعلي","تكوين الوكلاء بالوصول إلى الأدوات المناسبة لإنجاز المهام بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Claude Code''s delegation patterns","Limited to tools specified in the agent''s configuration, such as Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash"],"zh":["需要了解Claude Code的委托模式","仅限于代理配置中指定的工具，例如Read、Write、Edit、Glob、Grep、Bash"],"ja":["Claude Codeの委任パターンを理解する必要がある","エージェントの構成で指定されたツール、たとえばRead、Write、Edit、Glob、Grep、B