ياق صفري"]},"keywords":{"zh":["编写计划","开发人员","实施计划","代码","测试","文档","DRY","YAGNI","TDD","频繁提交"],"ja":["実装計画の作成","開発者","詳細な計画","コード","テスト","ドキュメント","DRY","YAGNI","TDD","頻繁なコミット"],"ko":["구현 계획 작성","개발자","종합적인 계획","코드","테스트","문서","DRY","YAGNI","TDD","頻繁 커밋"],"es":["planificación de implementación","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","documentación técnica","desarrollo ágil","principios DRY","principios YAGNI","TDD","commits frecuentes"],"fr":["planification de mise en œuvre","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","documentation technique","développement agile","principes DRY","principes YAGNI","TDD","commits fréquents"],"de":["Implementierungsplanung","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","technische Dokumentation","agiles Entwicklung","DRY-Prinzipien","YAGNI-Prinzipien","TDD","häufige Commits"],"pt":["planejamento de implementação","engenheiro de software","desenvolvimento de software","documentação técnica","testes unitários","commits frequentes"],"ru":["план реализации","инженер-программист","разработка программного обеспечения","техническая документация","юнит-тесты","частые коммиты"],"ar":["خطط التنفيذ","مهندس برمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","توثيق فني","اختبارات الوحدة","الالتزامات المتكررة"]}},"owner":"dwalleck","repo":"kiro-starter-kit","repoPath":"dwalleck/kiro-starter-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-plans","description":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code","bodyPreview":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test","body":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test design very well.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the writing-plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n\n**Context:** This should be run in a dedicated worktree (created by brainstorming skill).\n\n**Save plans to:** `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`\n\n## Bite-Sized Task Granularity\n\n**Each step is one action (2-5 minutes):**\n- \"Write the failing test\" - step\n- \"Run it to make sure it fails\" - step\n- \"Implement the minimal code to make the test pass\" - step\n- \"Run the tests and make sure they pass\" - step\n- \"Commit\" - step\n\n## Plan Document Header\n\n**Every plan MUST start with this header:**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.\n\n**Goal:** [One sentence describing what this builds]\n\n**Architecture:** [2-3 sentences about approach]\n\n**Tech Stack:** [Key technologies/libraries]\n\n---\n```\n\n## Task Structure\n\n```markdown\n### Task N: [Component Name]\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `exact/path/to/file.py`\n- Modify: `exact/path/to/existing.py:123-145`\n- Test: `tests/exact/path/to/test.py`\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test**\n\n```python\ndef test_specific_behavior():\n    result = function(input)\n    assert result == expected\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: FAIL with \"function not defined\"\n\n**Step 3: Write minimal implementation**\n\n```python\ndef function(input):\n    return expected\n```\n\n**Step 4: Run test to verify it passes**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: PASS\n\n**Step 5: Commit**\n\n```bash\ngit add tests/path/test.py src/path/file.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add specific feature\"\n```\n```\n\n## Remember\n- Exact file paths always\n- Complete code in plan (not \"add validation\")\n- Exact commands with expected output\n- Reference relevant skills with @ syntax\n- DRY, YAGNI, TDD, frequent commits\n\n## Execution Handoff\n\nAfter saving the plan, offer execution choice:\n\n**\"Plan complete and saved to `docs/plans/<filename>.md`. Two execution options:**\n\n**1. Subagent-Driven (this session)** - I dispatch fresh subagent per task, review between tasks, fast iteration\n\n**2. Parallel Session (separate)** - Open new session with executing-plans, batch execution with checkpoints\n\n**Which approach?\"**\n\n**If Subagent-Driven chosen:**\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development\n- Stay in this session\n- Fresh subagent per task + code review\n\n**If Parallel Session chosen:**\n- Guide them to open new session in worktree\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** New session uses superpowers:executing-plans\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:44:04.952Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents needing to create comprehensive implementation plans with zero context for a codebase.","zh":"适合需要为代码库创建全面实施计划且无需任何上下文的技术写作代理。","ja":"コンテキストがまったくないコードベースに詳細な実装計画を作成する必要があるテクニカルライティングエージェントに適しています。","ko":"코드베이스에 대한 아무런 문맥이 필요없는 기술 문서 에이전트가 구체적인 구현 계획을 생성해야 할 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan crear planes de implementación comprehensivos con cero contexto para un código base.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de rédaction technique ayant besoin de créer des plans de mise en œuvre complets avec zéro contexte pour une base de code.","de":"Ideal für technische Schreibagenten, die umfassende Implementierungspläne mit null Kontext für einen Codebase erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents needing to create comprehensive implementation plans with zero context for a codebase.","ru":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents needing to create comprehensive implementation plans with zero context for a codebase.","ar":"Ideal for Technical Writing Agents needing to create comprehensive implementation plans with zero context for a codebase."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate detailed, bite-sized tasks following DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles, including which files to touch, code, testing, and documentation checks, utilizing frequent commits for version control.","zh":"使代理能够根据DRY、YAGNI和TDD原则生成详细、bite-sized任务，包括需要修改哪些文件、代码、测试和文档检查，并利用频繁提交进行版本控制。","ja":"DRY、YAGNI、TDDの原則に従って詳細でサイズの小さいタスクを生成することが代理に可能になり、変更するファイル、コード、テスト、ドキュメントのチェックを含み、頻繁なコミットを使用してバージョン管理を行う。","ko":"DRY, YAGNI, TDD 원칙을 따르는 자세한 작업을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하며, 수정할 파일, 코드, 테스트 및 문서 확인을 포함하고 버전 관리를 위해 자주 커밋합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar tareas detalladas y en porciones pequeñas siguiendo los principios de DRY, YAGNI y TDD, incluyendo qué archivos tocar, código, pruebas y comprobaciones de documentación, utilizando commits frecuentes para el control de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des tâches détaillées et en petites quantités suivant les principes DRY, YAGNI et TDD, incluant quels fichiers toucher, code, tests et vérifications de documentation, en utilisant des commits fréquents pour le contrôle de version.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, detaillierte, portionierte Aufgaben unter Berücksichtigung der Prinzipien DRY, YAGNI und TDD zu erstellen, einschließlich welcher Dateien zu bearbeiten sind, Code, Tests und Dokumentationsprüfungen, unter Nutzung häufiger Commits für die Versionskontrolle.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate detailed, bite-sized tasks following DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles, including which files to touch, code, testing, and documentation checks, utilizing frequent commits for version control.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate detailed, bite-sized tasks following DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles, including which files to touch, code, testing, and documentation checks, utilizing frequent commits for version control.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate detailed, bite-sized tasks following DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles, including which files to touch, code, testing, and documentation checks, utilizing frequent commits for version control."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating step-by-step implementation guides","Creating testing plans with minimal context","Documenting codebases for new developers"],"zh":["生成分步实施指南","创建最小上下文的测试计划","为新开发人员记录代码库"],"ja":["ステップバイステップの実装ガイドを生成する","最小限のコンテキストを持つテストプランを作成する","新しい開発者のためのコードベースの文書化"],"ko":["단계별 구현 가이드 생성","최소한의 문맥을 가진 테스트 계획 생성","새로운 개발자를 위한 코드베이스 문서화"],"es":["Generar guías de implementación paso a paso","Crear planes de pruebas con mínimo contexto","Documentar códigos base para nuevos desarrolladores"],"fr":["Générer des guides d''implémentation étape par étape","Créer des plans de tests avec un minimum de contexte","Documenter les bases de code pour les nouveaux développeurs"],"de":["Schritt-für-Schritt-Implementierungsleitfäden erstellen","Testpläne mit minimalem Kontext erstellen","Codebases für neue Entwickler dokumentieren"],"pt":["Generating step-by-step implementation guides","Creating testing plans with minimal context","Documenting codebases for new developers"],"ru":["Generating step-by-step implementation guides","Creating testing plans with minimal context","Documenting codebases for new developers"],"ar":["Generating step-by-step implementation guides","Creating testing plans with minimal context","Documenting codebases for new developers"]},"limitations":{"en":["Assumes skilled developer with limited domain knowledge","Requires frequent commits for effective version control"],"zh":["假设开发者具有有限的领域知识","需要频繁提交以有效进行版本控制"],"ja":["開発者が限定されたドメイン知識を持っていることが前提","有効なバージョン管理を行うために頻繁なコミットが必要"],"ko":["개발자가 제한된 도메인 지식을 갖고 있다고 가정","유효한 버전 관리를 위해 자주 커밋해야 함"],"es":["Supone un desarrollador capacitado con conocimientos limitados de dominio","Requiere commits frecuentes para un control de versiones eficaz"],"fr":["Suppose un développeur qualifié avec des connaissances limitées de domaine","Requiert des commits fréquents pour un contrôle de version efficace"],"de":["Geht von einem erfahrenen Entwickler mit begrenztem Domänenwissen aus","Erfordert häufige Commits für eine effektive Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Assumes skilled developer with limited domain knowledge","Requires frequent commits for effective version control"],"ru":["Assumes skilled developer with limited domain knowledge","Requires frequent commits for effective version control"],"ar":["Assumes skilled developer with limited domain knowledge","Requires frequent commits for effective version control"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
