dad y la eficiencia de las pruebas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo y testing"],"fr":["Pyramide de tests pour une stratégie de testing efficace","Modèle AAA pour des tests structurés et faciles à maintenir","Principes pour créer des suites de tests fiables et évolutives","Techniques pour améliorer la qualité et l''efficacité des tests","Intégration avec des outils de développement et de testing"],"de":["Testpyramide für eine effektive Teststrategie","AAA-Muster für strukturierte und wartbare Tests","Prinzipien für die Erstellung von zuverlässigen und skalierbaren Test-Suites","Techniken zur Verbesserung der Qualität und Effizienz von Tests","Integration mit Entwicklungstools und Testing-Tools"],"pt":["Pirâmide de teste","Padrão AAA","Testes de unidade","Testes de integração","Testes de fluxo crítico"],"ru":["Пирамида тестирования","Шаблон AAA","Юнит-тесты","Интеграционные тесты","Тесты критических потоков"],"ar":["هرم الاختبار","نمط AAA","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل","اختبارات تدفق حرج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["测试模式工具","可靠测试套件","测试金字塔","AAA模式","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","开发者工具"],"ja":["テスティングパターン工具","信頼性の高いテストスイート","テスティングパターン","AAAパターン","Antigravity IDE","IDE","CLI","開発者ツール"],"ko":["테스팅 패턴 도구","안정적인 테스트 세트","테스팅 패턴","AAA 패턴","안티그래비티 IDE","IDE","CLI","개발자 도구"],"es":["patrones de pruebas de software","pirámide de pruebas","patrón AAA","testing de software","desarrollo de software","pruebas de integración","pruebas unitarias","pruebas de funcionalidad"],"fr":["modèles de tests logiciels","pyramide de tests","modèle AAA","testing de logiciel","développement de logiciel","tests d''intégration","tests unitaires","tests de fonctionnalité"],"de":["Software-Testmuster","Testpyramide","AAA-Muster","Software-Testing","Software-Entwicklung","Integrationstests","Unit-Tests","Funktionalitätstests"],"pt":["padrões de teste","testes de software","desenvolvimento de software","pirâmide de teste","padrão AAA","testes de unidade","testes de integração"],"ru":["шаблоны тестирования","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","пирамида тестирования","шаблон AAA","юнит-тесты","интеграционные тесты"],"ar":["نماذج الاختبار","اختبارات البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","هرم الاختبار","نمط AAA","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-patterns","description":"Testing patterns and principles. Unit, integration, mocking strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Patterns\n\n> Principles for reliable test suites.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Testing Pyramid\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, DB queries\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Unit (Many)\n                    Functions, classes\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. AAA Pattern\n\n| Step | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **Arrange** | Set up test data |\n| **Act** | Execute code under test |\n| **Assert** | Verify outcom","body":"# Testing Patterns\n\n> Principles for reliable test suites.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Testing Pyramid\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, DB queries\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Unit (Many)\n                    Functions, classes\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. AAA Pattern\n\n| Step | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **Arrange** | Set up test data |\n| **Act** | Execute code under test |\n| **Assert** | Verify outcome |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Test Type Selection\n\n### When to Use Each\n\n| Type | Best For | Speed |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| **Unit** | Pure functions, logic | Fast (<50ms) |\n| **Integration** | API, DB, services | Medium |\n| **E2E** | Critical user flows | Slow |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Unit Test Principles\n\n### Good Unit Tests\n\n| Principle | Meaning |\n|-----------|---------|\n| Fast | < 100ms each |\n| Isolated | No external deps |\n| Repeatable | Same result always |\n| Self-checking | No manual verification |\n| Timely | Written with code |\n\n### What to Unit Test\n\n| Test | Don''t Test |\n|------|------------|\n| Business logic | Framework code |\n| Edge cases | Third-party libs |\n| Error handling | Simple getters |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Integration Test Principles\n\n### What to Test\n\n| Area | Focus |\n|------|-------|\n| API endpoints | Request/response |\n| Database | Queries, transactions |\n| External services | Contracts |\n\n### Setup/Teardown\n\n| Phase | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| Before All | Connect resources |\n| Before Each | Reset state |\n| After Each | Clean up |\n| After All | Disconnect |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Mocking Principles\n\n### When to Mock\n\n| Mock | Don''t Mock |\n|------|------------|\n| External APIs | The code under test |\n| Database (unit) | Simple dependencies |\n| Time/random | Pure functions |\n| Network | In-memory stores |\n\n### Mock Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Stub | Return fixed values |\n| Spy | Track calls |\n| Mock | Set expectations |\n| Fake | Simplified implementation |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Test Organization\n\n### Naming\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Should behavior | \"should return error when...\" |\n| When condition | \"when user not found...\" |\n| Given-when-then | \"given X, when Y, then Z\" |\n\n### Grouping\n\n| Level | Use |\n|-------|-----|\n| describe | Group related tests |\n| it/test | Individual case |\n| beforeEach | Common setup |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Test Data\n\n### Strategies\n\n| Approach | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Factories | Generate test data |\n| Fixtures | Predefined datasets |\n| Builders | Fluent object creation |\n\n### Principles\n\n- Use realistic data\n- Randomize non-essential values (faker)\n- Share common fixtures\n- Keep data minimal\n\n---\n\n## 9. Best Practices\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| One assert per test | Clear failure reason |\n| Independent tests | No order dependency |\n| Fast tests | Run frequently |\n| Descriptive names | Self-documenting |\n| Clean up | Avoid side effects |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Test implementation | Test behavior |\n| Duplicate test code | Use factories |\n| Complex test setup | Simplify or split |\n| Ignore flaky tests | Fix root cause |\n| Skip cleanup | Reset state |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Tests are documentation. If someone can''t understand what the code does from the tests, rewrite them.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:44:37.727Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT requiring structured testing methodologies for reliable test suites.","zh":"适用于像 Cursor 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要结构化的测试方法来获得可靠的测试套件。","ja":"Cursor や AutoGPT などの AI エージェントに適しています。構造化されたテスト方法論が必要であり、信頼性の高いテスト スイートを実現します。","ko":"Cursor 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 구조화된 테스트 방법론이 필요한 곳에서 신뢰할 수 있는 테스트 스위트를 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y AutoGPT que requieren metodologías de prueba estructuradas para suites de prueba confiables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant des méthodologies de test structurées pour des suites de tests fiables.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die strukturierte Testmethoden für zuverlässige Test-Suiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor e AutoGPT que requerem metodologias de teste estruturadas para conjuntos de testes confiáveis.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, требующих структурированных методологий тестирования для надёжных наборов тестов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسيط الذكية مثل Cursor و AutoGPT التي تتطلب منهجيات اختبار متوازنة لاستدعاءات الاختبار الموثوقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply the Testing Pyramid and AAA Pattern, ensuring comprehensive test coverage through unit, integration, and E2E testing, utilizing critical flows and API queries for validation.","zh":"使代理能够应用测试金字塔和 AAA 模式，通过单元测试、集成测试和 E2E 测试确保全面测试覆盖，并利用关键流程和 API 查询进行验证。","ja":"エージェントがテスト ピラミッドと AAA パターンを適用できるようにし、ユニット テスト、統合テスト、E2E テストを通じて、包括的なテスト カバレッジを保証し、重要なフローと API クエリを使用して検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 테스트 피라미드와 AAA 패턴을 적용할 수 있도록 하여 단위 테스트, 통합 테스트 및 E2E 테스트를 통해 종합적인 테스트 커버리지를 보장하고 중요한 흐름과 API 쿼리를 사용하여 검증합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar la Pirámide de Pruebas y el Patrón AAA, garantizando una cobertura de pruebas exhaustiva a través de pruebas unitarias, de integración y de extremo a extremo, utilizando flujos críticos y consultas de API para la validación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer la Pyramide de Tests et le Modèle AAA, garantissant une couverture de tests exhaustive à travers des tests unitaires, d''intégration et de bout en bout, en utilisant des flux critiques et des requêtes API pour la validation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Testpyramide und das AAA-Muster anzuwenden, um eine umfassende Testabdeckung durch Einheitstests, Integrationstests und End-to-End-Tests sicherzustellen, wobei kritische Flüsse und API-Abfragen für die Validierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes apliquem a Pirâmide de Testes e o Padrão AAA, garantindo uma cobertura de teste abrangente por meio de testes unitários, integração e de ponta a ponta, utilizando fluxos críticos e consultas de API para validação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять Пирамиду Тестирования и Шаблон AAA, обеспечивая комплексное тестирование через модульное, интеграционное и конечное тестирование, используя критические потоки и запросы API для проверки.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطبيق هرم الاختبار ونمط AAA، مما يضمن تغطية اختبار شاملة من خلال اختبارات الوحدة والتكامل واختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية، باستخدام تدفقات حرجة واستفسارات واجهة البرمجة للتأكيد."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing the Testing Pyramid for balanced test suites","Applying the AAA Pattern for consistent test structure","Debugging critical flows and API queries"],"zh":["为平衡的测试套件实现测试金字塔","应用 AAA 模式以获得一致的测试结构","调试关键流程和 API 查询"],"ja":["バランスのとれたテスト スイートのためのテスト ピラミッドの実装","一貫したテスト構造のための AAA パターンの適用","重要なフローと API クエリのデバッグ"],"ko":["균형 잡힌 테스트 스위트를 위한 테스트 피라미드 구현","일관된 테스트 구조를 위한 AAA 패턴 적용","중요한 흐름 및 API 쿼리 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar la Pirámide de Pruebas para suites de prueba equilibradas","Aplicar el Patrón AAA para una estructura de prueba coherente","Depurar flujos críticos y consultas de API"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre la Pyramide de Tests pour des suites de tests équilibrées","Appliquer le Modèle AAA pour une structure de test cohérente","Déboguer les flux critiques et les requêtes API"],"de":["Die Testpyramide für ausgewogene Test-Suiten implementieren","Das AAA-Muster für eine konsistente Teststruktur anwenden","Kritische Flüsse und API-Abfragen debuggen"],"pt":["Implementar a Pirâmide de Testes para conjuntos de testes equilibrados","Aplicar o Padrão AAA para estrutura de teste consistente","Depurar fluxos críticos e consultas de API"],"ru":["Реализация Пирамиды Тестирования для сбалансированных наборов тестов","Применение Шаблона AAA для последовательной структуры теста","Отладка критических потоков и запросов API"],"ar":["تنفيذ هرم الاختبار لاستدعاءات الاختبار المتوازنة","تطبيق نمط AAA لهيكلة الاختبار الثابتة","تصحيح تدفقات حرجة واستفسارات واجهة البرمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of testing principles","Limited to software development contexts"],"zh":["需要了解测试原则","仅限于软件开发环境"],"ja":["テストの原則を理解する必要がある","ソフトウェア開発の文脈のみに限定される"],"ko":["테스트 원리를 이해해야 함","소프트웨어 개발 맥락에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de prueba","Limitado a contextos de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de test","Limité aux contextes de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Benötigt das Verständnis von Testprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Software-Entwicklungskontexte"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de teste","Limitado a contextos de desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов тестирования","Ограничен контекстами разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ الاختبار","محدود سياقات تطوير البرمجيات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
