. Apprenez à déboguer les problèmes de latence et d''erreurs","de":"Komplette Anleitung zu Observability-Mustern für Service-Mesh. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Latenz- und Fehlerprobleme debuggen","pt":"Guia completo para padrões de observabilidade em malhas de serviços","ru":"Полное руководство по шаблонам наблюдаемости для сеток служб","ar":"دليل شامل لأنماط المراقبة في شبكات الخدمات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["分布式追踪","服务网格指标和仪表盘","延迟和错误问题调试","服务通信的SLO定义","服务依赖关系可视化","网格连接性故障排除"],"ja":["分散トレーシング","サービスメッシュのメトリクスとダッシュボード","遅延とエラーの問題のデバッグ","サービス間のSLOの定義","サービス依存関係の可視化","メッシュ接続性のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["분산 추적","서비스 메시 메트릭 및 대시보드","지연 및 오류 문제 디버깅","서비스 간의 SLO 정의","서비스 종속성 시각화","메시 연결성 문제 해결"],"es":["Seguimiento distribuido de servicios","Implementación de métricas y paneles de servicio","Depuración de problemas de latencia y errores","Definición de SLO para la comunicación de servicios","Visualización de dependencias de servicios","Solución de problemas de conectividad de malla"],"fr":["Traçage distribué des services","Mise en œuvre de métriques et de tableaux de bord de service","Débogage des problèmes de latence et d''erreurs","Définition de SLO pour la communication de services","Visualisation des dépendances de services","Résolution des problèmes de connectivité de la maille"],"de":["Verteilte Nachverfolgung von Diensten","Implementierung von Dienstmetriken und -Dashboards","Fehlerbehebung bei Latenz- und Fehlerproblemen","Definition von SLO für Dienstkommunikation","Visualisierung von Dienstabhängigkeiten","Fehlerbehebung bei der Mesh-Konnektivität"],"pt":["Rastreamento distribuído","Métricas e painéis de malha de serviços","Depuração de problemas de latência e erro","Definição de SLOs para comunicação de serviços","Visualização de dependências de serviços","Solução de problemas de conectividade de malha"],"ru":["Распределенная трассировка","Метрики и панели сетки служб","Отладка проблем с задержкой и ошибками","Определение SLO для служебной коммуникации","Визуализация зависимостей служб","Решение проблем с подключением сетки"],"ar":["التحديد التوزعي","مؤشرات أداء ولوحات تحكم شبكة الخدمات","تصحيح أخطاء مشاكل التأخير والأخطاء","تحديد معايير الأداء الخدمي","تجسيد зависимости الخدمات","معالجة مشاكل الاتصال الشبكي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["服务网格可观察性","分布式追踪","服务网格指标","Istio","Linkerd","服务通信","SLO","可视化"],"ja":["サービスメッシュの可観測性","分散トレーシング","サービスメッシュのメトリクス","Istio","Linkerd","サービス間の通信","SLO","可視化"],"ko":["서비스 메시 관측 가능성","분산 추적","서비스 메시 메트릭","Istio","Linkerd","서비스 간의 통신","SLO","시각화"],"es":["service mesh","observabilidad","istio","linkerd","despliegue de service mesh","depuración de servicios","métricas de servicio","paneles de servicio"],"fr":["service mesh","observabilité","istio","linkerd","déploiement de service mesh","débogage de services","métriques de service","tableaux de bord de service"],"de":["service mesh","beobachtbarkeit","istio","linkerd","service-mesh-deployment","fehlerbehebung von diensten","dienstmetriken","dienstdashboards"],"pt":["malha de serviços","observabilidade","Istio","Linkerd","rastreamento distribuído","métricas de serviços","depuração de latência","SLOs para serviços"],"ru":["сетка служб","наблюдаемость","Istio","Linkerd","распределенная трассировка","метрики служб","отладка задержки","SLO для служб"],"ar":["شبكة الخدمات","مراقبة","Istio","Linkerd","التحديد التوزعي","مؤشرات أداء الخدمات","تصحيح أخطاء التأخير","معايير الأداء الخدمي"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"service-mesh-observability","description":"Implement comprehensive observability for service meshes including distributed tracing, metrics, and visualization. Use when setting up mesh monitoring, debugging latency issues, or implementing SLOs for service communication.","bodyPreview":"# Service Mesh Observability\n\nComplete guide to observability patterns for Istio, Linkerd, and service mesh deployments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up distributed tracing across services\n- Implementing service mesh metrics and dashboards\n- Debugging latency and error issues\n- Defining SLOs for service communication\n- Visualizing service dependencies\n- Troubleshooting mesh connectivity\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Three Pillars of Observability\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────","body":"# Service Mesh Observability\n\nComplete guide to observability patterns for Istio, Linkerd, and service mesh deployments.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up distributed tracing across services\n- Implementing service mesh metrics and dashboards\n- Debugging latency and error issues\n- Defining SLOs for service communication\n- Visualizing service dependencies\n- Troubleshooting mesh connectivity\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Three Pillars of Observability\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                  Observability                       │\n├─────────────────┬─────────────────┬─────────────────┤\n│     Metrics     │     Traces      │      Logs       │\n│                 │                 │                 │\n│ • Request rate  │ • Span context  │ • Access logs   │\n│ • Error rate    │ • Latency       │ • Error details │\n│ • Latency P50   │ • Dependencies  │ • Debug info    │\n│ • Saturation    │ • Bottlenecks   │ • Audit trail   │\n└─────────────────┴─────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 2. Golden Signals for Mesh\n\n| Signal         | Description               | Alert Threshold   |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **Latency**    | Request duration P50, P99 | P99 > 500ms       |\n| **Traffic**    | Requests per second       | Anomaly detection |\n| **Errors**     | 5xx error rate            | > 1%              |\n| **Saturation** | Resource utilization      | > 80%             |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: Istio with Prometheus & Grafana\n\n```yaml\n# Install Prometheus\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: prometheus\n  namespace: istio-system\ndata:\n  prometheus.yml: |\n    global:\n      scrape_interval: 15s\n    scrape_configs:\n      - job_name: ''istio-mesh''\n        kubernetes_sd_configs:\n          - role: endpoints\n            namespaces:\n              names:\n                - istio-system\n        relabel_configs:\n          - source_labels: [__meta_kubernetes_service_name]\n            action: keep\n            regex: istio-telemetry\n---\n# ServiceMonitor for Prometheus Operator\napiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1\nkind: ServiceMonitor\nmetadata:\n  name: istio-mesh\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: istiod\n  endpoints:\n    - port: http-monitoring\n      interval: 15s\n```\n\n### Template 2: Key Istio Metrics Queries\n\n```promql\n# Request rate by service\nsum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m])) by (destination_service_name)\n\n# Error rate (5xx)\nsum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\", response_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))\n  / sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m])) * 100\n\n# P99 latency\nhistogram_quantile(0.99,\n  sum(rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m]))\n  by (le, destination_service_name))\n\n# TCP connections\nsum(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{reporter=\"destination\"}) by (destination_service_name)\n\n# Request size\nhistogram_quantile(0.99,\n  sum(rate(istio_request_bytes_bucket{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m]))\n  by (le, destination_service_name))\n```\n\n### Template 3: Jaeger Distributed Tracing\n\n```yaml\n# Jaeger installation for Istio\napiVersion: install.istio.io/v1alpha1\nkind: IstioOperator\nspec:\n  meshConfig:\n    enableTracing: true\n    defaultConfig:\n      tracing:\n        sampling: 100.0 # 100% in dev, lower in prod\n        zipkin:\n          address: jaeger-collector.istio-system:9411\n---\n# Jaeger deployment\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: jaeger\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: jaeger\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: jaeger\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: jaeger\n          image: jaegertracing/all-in-one:1.50\n          ports:\n            - containerPort: 5775 # UDP\n            - containerPort: 6831 # Thrift\n            - containerPort: 6832 # Thrift\n            - containerPort: 5778 # Config\n            - containerPort: 16686 # UI\n            - containerPort: 14268 # HTTP\n            - containerPort: 14250 # gRPC\n            - containerPort: 9411 # Zipkin\n          env:\n            - name: COLLECTOR_ZIPKIN_HOST_PORT\n              value: \":9411\"\n```\n\n### Template 4: Linkerd Viz Dashboard\n\n```bash\n# Install Linkerd viz extension\nlinkerd viz install | kubectl apply -f -\n\n# Access dashboard\nlinkerd viz dashboard\n\n# CLI commands for observability\n# Top requests\nlinkerd viz top deploy/my-app\n\n# Per-route metrics\nlinkerd viz routes deploy/my-app --to deploy/backend\n\n# Live traffic inspection\nlinkerd viz tap deploy/my-app --to deploy/backend\n\n# Service edges (dependencies)\nlinkerd viz edges deployment -n my-namespace\n```\n\n### Template 5: Grafana Dashboard JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dashboard\": {\n    \"title\": \"Service Mesh Overview\",\n    \"panels\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Request Rate\",\n        \"type\": \"graph\",\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\\\"destination\\\"}[5m])) by (destination_service_name)\",\n            \"legendFormat\": \"{{destination_service_name}}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Error Rate\",\n        \"type\": \"gauge\",\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"sum(rate(istio_requests_total{response_code=~\\\"5..\\\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(istio_requests_total[5m])) * 100\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"fieldConfig\": {\n          \"defaults\": {\n            \"thresholds\": {\n              \"steps\": [\n                { \"value\": 0, \"color\": \"green\" },\n                { \"value\": 1, \"color\": \"yellow\" },\n                { \"value\": 5, \"color\": \"red\" }\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"P99 Latency\",\n        \"type\": \"graph\",\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{reporter=\\\"destination\\\"}[5m])) by (le, destination_service_name))\",\n            \"legendFormat\": \"{{destination_service_name}}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Service Topology\",\n        \"type\": \"nodeGraph\",\n        \"targets\": [\n          {\n            \"expr\": \"sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\\\"destination\\\"}[5m])) by (source_workload, destination_service_name)\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Template 6: Kiali Service Mesh Visualization\n\n```yaml\n# Kiali installation\napiVersion: kiali.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Kiali\nmetadata:\n  name: kiali\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  auth:\n    strategy: anonymous # or openid, token\n  deployment:\n    accessible_namespaces:\n      - \"**\"\n  external_services:\n    prometheus:\n      url: http://prometheus.istio-system:9090\n    tracing:\n      url: http://jaeger-query.istio-system:16686\n    grafana:\n      url: http://grafana.istio-system:3000\n```\n\n### Template 7: OpenTelemetry Integration\n\n```yaml\n# OpenTelemetry Collector for mesh\napiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: otel-collector-config\ndata:\n  config.yaml: |\n    receivers:\n      otlp:\n        protocols:\n          grpc:\n            endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317\n          http:\n            endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318\n      zipkin:\n        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:9411\n\n    processors:\n      batch:\n        timeout: 10s\n\n    exporters:\n      jaeger:\n        endpoint: jaeger-collector:14250\n        tls:\n          insecure: true\n      prometheus:\n        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:8889\n\n    service:\n      pipelines:\n        traces:\n          receivers: [otlp, zipkin]\n          processors: [batch]\n          exporters: [jaeger]\n        metrics:\n          receivers: [otlp]\n          processors: [batch]\n          exporters: [prometheus]\n---\n# Istio Telemetry v2 with OTel\napiVersion: telemetry.istio.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Telemetry\nmetadata:\n  name: mesh-default\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  tracing:\n    - providers:\n        - name: otel\n      randomSamplingPercentage: 10\n```\n\n## Alerting Rules\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1\nkind: PrometheusRule\nmetadata:\n  name: mesh-alerts\n  namespace: istio-system\nspec:\n  groups:\n    - name: mesh.rules\n      rules:\n        - alert: HighErrorRate\n          expr: |\n            sum(rate(istio_requests_total{response_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) by (destination_service_name)\n            / sum(rate(istio_requests_total[5m])) by (destination_service_name) > 0.05\n          for: 5m\n          labels:\n            severity: critical\n          annotations:\n            summary: \"High error rate for {{ $labels.destination_service_name }}\"\n\n        - alert: HighLatency\n          expr: |\n            histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m]))\n            by (le, destination_service_name)) > 1000\n          for: 5m\n          labels:\n            severity: warning\n          annotations:\n            summary: \"High P99 latency for {{ $labels.destination_service_name }}\"\n\n        - alert: MeshCertExpiring\n          expr: |\n            (certmanager_certificate_expiration_timestamp_seconds - time()) / 86400 < 7\n          labels:\n            severity: warning\n          annotations:\n            summary: \"Mesh certificate expiring in less than 7 days\"\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Sample appropriately** - 100% in dev, 1-10% in prod\n- **Use trace context** - Propagate headers consistently\n- **Set up alerts** - For golden signals\n- **Correlate metrics/traces** - Use exemplars\n- **Retain strategically** - Hot/cold storage tiers\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t over-sample** - Storage costs add up\n- **Don''t ignore cardinality** - Limit label values\n- **Don''t skip dashboards** - Visualize dependencies\n- **Don''t forget costs** - Monitor observability costs\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Istio Observability](https://istio.io/latest/docs/tasks/observability/)\n- [Linkerd Observability](https://linkerd.io/2.14/features/dashboard/)\n- [OpenTelemetry](https://opentelemetry.io/)\n- [Kiali](https://kiali.io/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:45:46.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Native Agents needing advanced service mesh monitoring and troubleshooting capabilities for Istio and Linkerd","zh":"非常适合需要高级服务网格监控和故障诊断能力的云原生代理，特别是对于Istio和Linkerd","ja":"IstioおよびLinkerdの高度なサービスメッシュ監視およびトラブルシューティング機能を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適","ko":"Istio 및 Linkerd의 고급 서비스 메시監视 및 문제 해결 기능이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Nativos en la Nube que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de monitoreo y solución de problemas de malla de servicio para Istio y Linkerd","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud Native nécessitant des capacités avancées de surveillance et de dépannage de la mesh de service pour Istio et Linkerd","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die erweiterte Service-Mesh-Überwachungs- und Fehlerbehebungsfunktionen für Istio und Linkerd benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de monitoramento e solução de problemas de malha de serviço para Istio e Linkerd","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности мониторинга и устранения неполадок в сетке сервисов для Istio и Linkerd","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمراقبة شبكة الخدمة وإصلاحها لمشاكل Istio و Linkerd"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement distributed tracing, metrics, and dashboards for service mesh deployments, enabling real-time debugging of latency and error issues, and defining SLOs for service communication using protocols like HTTP and gRPC","zh":"赋予代理实现分布式跟踪、指标和仪表盘的能力，用于服务网格部署，实现对延迟和错误问题的实时调试，并使用HTTP和gRPC等协议定义服务通信的SLO","ja":"エージェントがサービスメッシュの分散トレーシング、メトリクス、ダッシュボードを実装できるようにし、サービスメッシュのデプロイに対してリアルタイムで待ち時間やエラーの問題をデバッグでき、HTTPやgRPCなどのプロトコルを使用してサービス間の通信のSLOを定義できる","ko":"에이전트가 분산 추적, 메트릭 및 대시보드를 구현할 수 있도록 해주어 서비스 메시 배포에 대한 지연 및 오류 문제를 실시간으로 디버깅할 수 있고, HTTP 및 gRPC 등 프로토콜을 사용하여 서비스 간 통신의 SLO를 정의할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar seguimiento distribuido, métricas y paneles de control para implementaciones de malla de servicio, lo que permite la depuración en tiempo real de problemas de latencia y errores, y la definición de SLO para la comunicación de servicios que utilizan protocolos como HTTP y gRPC","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre un traçage distribué, des métriques et des tableaux de bord pour les déploiements de mesh de service, ce qui permet un débogage en temps réel des problèmes de latence et d''erreur, et la définition de SLO pour la communication de services à l''aide de protocoles tels que HTTP et gRPC","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, verteilte Nachverfolgung, Metriken und Dashboards für Service-Mesh-Implementierungen umzusetzen, wodurch Echtzeit-Debugging von Latenz- und Fehlerproblemen ermöglicht wird und SLO für die Servicekommunikation mithilfe von Protokollen wie HTTP und gRPC definiert werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem rastreamento distribuído, métricas e painéis para implantações de malha de serviço, permitindo depuração em tempo real de problemas de latência e erros, e definindo SLOs para comunicação de serviço usando protocolos como HTTP e gRPC","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать распределенное трассирование, метрики и панели для развертываний сетки сервисов, что позволяет выполнять отладку в реальном времени проблем задержки и ошибок, а также определять SLO для коммуникации сервисов с использованием протоколов như HTTP и gRPC","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تنفيذ التتبع الموزع والأدلة واللوحات لمشاريع شبكة الخدمة، مما يتيح فحصًا في الوقت الفعلي لمشاكل التأخير والأخطاء، وتحديد معايير الخدمة لاتصالات الخدمة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و gRPC"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging mesh connectivity issues","Visualizing service dependencies and communication patterns","Implementing service mesh metrics and dashboards for performance monitoring"],"zh":["调试网格连接问题","可视化服务依赖关系和通信模式","实现服务网格指标和仪表盘用于性能监控"],"ja":["メッシュ接続の問題をデバッグする","サービス依存関係と通信パターンを視覚化する","サービスメッシュのメトリクスとダッシュボードを実装してパフォーマンスを監視する"],"ko":["메쉬 연결 문제 디버깅","서비스 종속성 및 통신 패턴 시각화","서비스 메쉬 메트릭 및 대시보드를 구현하여 성능 모니터링"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de conectividad de la malla","Visualización de dependencias y patrones de comunicación de servicios","Implementación de métricas y paneles de control de malla de servicio para la supervisión del rendimiento"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de connectivité de la mesh","Visualisation des dépendances et des modèles de communication de services","Mise en œuvre de métriques et de tableaux de bord de mesh de service pour la surveillance des performances"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Mesh-Connectivity-Problemen","Visualisierung von Service-Abhängigkeiten und Kommunikationsmustern","Implementierung von Service-Mesh-Metriken und Dashboards für Leistungsüberwachung"],"pt":["Depurar problemas de conectividade de malha","Visualizar dependências de serviço e padrões de comunicação","Implementar métricas e painéis de malha de serviço para monitoramento de desempenho"],"ru":["Отладка проблем подключения сетки","Визуализация зависимостей сервиса и шаблонов коммуникации","Реализация метрик и панелей сетки сервиса для мониторинга производительности"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء مشاكل الاتصال بالشبكة","تجسيد التبعيات الخدمية وأنماط الاتصال","تنفيذ معايير وألواح شبكة الخدمة لمراقبة الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires service mesh deployment like Istio or Linkerd","Limited to observability patterns for microservices architectures"],"zh":["需要类似Istio或Linkerd的服务网格部署","仅限于微服务架构的可观察性模式"],"ja":["IstioまたはLinkerdのようなサービスメッシュのデプロイが必要","マイクロサービスのアーキテクチャの可観測性パターンに限定"],"ko":["Istio 또는 Linkerd와 같은 서비스 메쉬 배포가 필요","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처의 관측 가능 패턴으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere una implementación de malla de servicio como Istio o Linkerd","Limitado a patrones de observabilidad para arquitecturas de microservicios"],"fr":["Nécessite un déploiement de mesh de service comme Istio ou Linkerd","Limité aux modèles d''observabilité pour les architectures de microservices"],"de":["Benötigt eine Service-Mesh-Implementierung wie Istio oder Linkerd","Begrenzt auf Observability-Muster für Mikroservices-Architekturen"],"pt":["Exige implantação de malha de serviço como Istio ou Linkerd","Limitado a padrões de observabilidade para arquiteturas de microsserviços"],"ru":["Требует развертывания сетки сервисов, такой как Istio или Linkerd","Ограничен шаблонами наблюдаемости для архитектур микросервисов"],"ar":["يتطلب نشر شبكة الخدمة مثل Istio أو Linkerd","محدود لأنماط المراقبة للهياكل المعمارية لميكروسيرفيس"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
