 수행하는 방법을 제공하며 여러 기술 스택을 지원","es":"Plantillas de GitHub Actions para testing, construcción y despliegue de aplicaciones de manera eficiente y segura","fr":"Modèles d''Actions GitHub pour tester, construire et déployer des applications de manière efficace et sécurisée","de":"Vorlagen für GitHub Actions zur effizienten und sicheren Erstellung und Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","pt":"Os modelos de ações do GitHub fornecem padrões de fluxo de trabalho para testar, compilar e implantar aplicações de forma eficiente e segura.","ru":"Шаблоны GitHub Actions предоставляют готовые шаблоны рабочих процессов для тестирования, сборки и развертывания приложений.","ar":"توفر قوالب إجراءات جيثب أنماطاً لسير العمل لاختبار وتجميع وتحديث التطبيقات بطريقة فعالة وأمنة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多种技术栈","高效的持续集成和部署","安全的工作流模式","自动化测试和部署","Docker 镜像构建和推送","Kubernetes 集群部署"],"ja":["複数のテクノロジー スタックのサポート","効率的な継続的インテグレーションとデプロイ","安全なワークフローのパターン","自動化されたテストとデプロイ","Docker イメージのビルドとプッシュ","Kubernetes クラスターのデプロイ"],"ko":["여러 기술 스택 지원","효율적인 지속적 통합 및 배포","안전한 워크플로 패턴","자동화된 테스트 및 배포","Docker 이미지 빌드 및 푸시","Kubernetes 클러스터 배포"],"es":["Automatización de testing y despliegue","Creación de imágenes Docker y envío a registros","Despliegue en clusters de Kubernetes","Ejecución de análisis de seguridad","Implementación de construcciones de matriz para múltiples entornos"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests et déploiements","Création d''images Docker et envoi à des registres","Déploiement sur des clusters Kubernetes","Exécution d''analyses de sécurité","Mise en œuvre de constructions de matrice pour plusieurs environnements"],"de":["Automatisierung von Tests und Bereitstellungen","Erstellung von Docker-Images und Versand an Registrierungen","Bereitstellung in Kubernetes-Clustern","Ausführung von Sicherheitsanalysen","Implementierung von Matrix-Builds für mehrere Umgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes e implantação","Compilar imagens Docker e enviar para registradores","Implantar para clusters Kubernetes","Executar verificações de segurança","Implementar compilações matriciais para vários ambientes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование и развертывание","Собирать образы Docker и отправлять в реестры","Развертывать в кластерах Kubernetes","Выполнять сканирование безопасности","Реализовывать матричные сборки для нескольких сред"],"ar":["تحسين اختبارات وتحديث","تجميع صور دッカー وإرسالها إلى السجلات","تثبيت في مجموعات كوبيرنيتس","تشغيل فحوصات أمنية","تنفيذ تجميعات مصفوفة لعدة بيئات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Actions","持续集成","持续部署","自动化测试","Docker","Kubernetes","技术栈","工作流模式","安全性"],"ja":["GitHub Actions","継続的インテグレーション","継続的デプロイ","自動化されたテスト","Docker","Kubernetes","テクノロジー スタック","ワークフローのパターン","セキュリティ"],"ko":["GitHub Actions","지속적 통합","지속적 배포","자동화된 테스트","Docker","Kubernetes","기술 스택","워크플로 패턴","보안"],"es":["github actions","plantillas de github actions","integración continua","despliegue continuo","testing automático","construcción de docker","kubernetes","seguridad"],"fr":["github actions","modèles d''actions github","intégration continue","déploiement continu","testing automatique","construction de docker","kubernetes","sécurité"],"de":["github actions","github actions-vorlagen","kontinuierliche integration","kontinuierliche bereitstellung","automatisiertes testing","docker-erstellung","kubernetes","sicherheit"],"pt":["github actions","modelos de ações","fluxo de trabalho","integração contínua","implantação contínua","desenvolvimento de software","automatização de testes","segurança de software"],"ru":["github actions","шаблоны действий","рабочий процесс","непрерывная интеграция","непрерывное развертывание","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация тестирования","безопасность программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إجراءات جيثب","قوالب إجراءات","سير العمل","الدمج المستمر","النشر المستمر","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين الاختبارات","أمان البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-actions-templates","description":"Create production-ready GitHub Actions workflows for automated testing, building, and deploying applications. Use when setting up CI/CD with GitHub Actions, automating development workflows, or creating reusable workflow templates.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Actions Templates\n\nProduction-ready GitHub Actions workflow patterns for testing, building, and deploying applications.\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate efficient, secure GitHub Actions workflows for continuous integration and deployment across various tech stacks.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Automate testing and deployment\n- Build Docker images and push to registries\n- Deploy to Kubernetes clusters\n- Run security scans\n- Implement matrix builds for multiple environments\n\n## Common Workflow Patterns\n\n### Pat","body":"# GitHub Actions Templates\n\nProduction-ready GitHub Actions workflow patterns for testing, building, and deploying applications.\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate efficient, secure GitHub Actions workflows for continuous integration and deployment across various tech stacks.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Automate testing and deployment\n- Build Docker images and push to registries\n- Deploy to Kubernetes clusters\n- Run security scans\n- Implement matrix builds for multiple environments\n\n## Common Workflow Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Test Workflow\n\n```yaml\nname: Test\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main, develop]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        node-version: [18.x, 20.x]\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Use Node.js ${{ matrix.node-version }}\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}\n          cache: \"npm\"\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: npm ci\n\n      - name: Run linter\n        run: npm run lint\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        run: npm test\n\n      - name: Upload coverage\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n        with:\n          files: ./coverage/lcov.info\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/test-workflow.yml`\n\n### Pattern 2: Build and Push Docker Image\n\n```yaml\nname: Build and Push\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n    tags: [\"v*\"]\n\nenv:\n  REGISTRY: ghcr.io\n  IMAGE_NAME: ${{ github.repository }}\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    permissions:\n      contents: read\n      packages: write\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Log in to Container Registry\n        uses: docker/login-action@v3\n        with:\n          registry: ${{ env.REGISTRY }}\n          username: ${{ github.actor }}\n          password: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n      - name: Extract metadata\n        id: meta\n        uses: docker/metadata-action@v5\n        with:\n          images: ${{ env.REGISTRY }}/${{ env.IMAGE_NAME }}\n          tags: |\n            type=ref,event=branch\n            type=ref,event=pr\n            type=semver,pattern={{version}}\n            type=semver,pattern={{major}}.{{minor}}\n\n      - name: Build and push\n        uses: docker/build-push-action@v5\n        with:\n          context: .\n          push: true\n          tags: ${{ steps.meta.outputs.tags }}\n          labels: ${{ steps.meta.outputs.labels }}\n          cache-from: type=gha\n          cache-to: type=gha,mode=max\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/deploy-workflow.yml`\n\n### Pattern 3: Deploy to Kubernetes\n\n```yaml\nname: Deploy to Kubernetes\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}\n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}\n          aws-region: us-west-2\n\n      - name: Update kubeconfig\n        run: |\n          aws eks update-kubeconfig --name production-cluster --region us-west-2\n\n      - name: Deploy to Kubernetes\n        run: |\n          kubectl apply -f k8s/\n          kubectl rollout status deployment/my-app -n production\n          kubectl get services -n production\n\n      - name: Verify deployment\n        run: |\n          kubectl get pods -n production\n          kubectl describe deployment my-app -n production\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Matrix Build\n\n```yaml\nname: Matrix Build\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n        python-version: [\"3.9\", \"3.10\", \"3.11\", \"3.12\"]\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Set up Python\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n        with:\n          python-version: ${{ matrix.python-version }}\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: |\n          python -m pip install --upgrade pip\n          pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        run: pytest\n```\n\n**Reference:** See `assets/matrix-build.yml`\n\n## Workflow Best Practices\n\n1. **Use specific action versions** (@v4, not @latest)\n2. **Cache dependencies** to speed up builds\n3. **Use secrets** for sensitive data\n4. **Implement status checks** on PRs\n5. **Use matrix builds** for multi-version testing\n6. **Set appropriate permissions**\n7. **Use reusable workflows** for common patterns\n8. **Implement approval gates** for production\n9. **Add notification steps** for failures\n10. **Use self-hosted runners** for sensitive workloads\n\n## Reusable Workflows\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/reusable-test.yml\nname: Reusable Test Workflow\n\non:\n  workflow_call:\n    inputs:\n      node-version:\n        required: true\n        type: string\n    secrets:\n      NPM_TOKEN:\n        required: true\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ${{ inputs.node-version }}\n      - run: npm ci\n      - run: npm test\n```\n\n**Use reusable workflow:**\n\n```yaml\njobs:\n  call-test:\n    uses: ./.github/workflows/reusable-test.yml\n    with:\n      node-version: \"20.x\"\n    secrets:\n      NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n## Security Scanning\n\n```yaml\nname: Security Scan\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  security:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Run Trivy vulnerability scanner\n        uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master\n        with:\n          scan-type: \"fs\"\n          scan-ref: \".\"\n          format: \"sarif\"\n          output: \"trivy-results.sarif\"\n\n      - name: Upload Trivy results to GitHub Security\n        uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v2\n        with:\n          sarif_file: \"trivy-results.sarif\"\n\n      - name: Run Snyk Security Scan\n        uses: snyk/actions/node@master\n        env:\n          SNYK_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.SNYK_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n## Deployment with Approvals\n\n```yaml\nname: Deploy to Production\n\non:\n  push:\n    tags: [\"v*\"]\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    environment:\n      name: production\n      url: https://app.example.com\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Deploy application\n        run: |\n          echo \"Deploying to production...\"\n          # Deployment commands here\n\n      - name: Notify Slack\n        if: success()\n        uses: slackapi/slack-github-action@v1\n        with:\n          webhook-url: ${{ secrets.SLACK_WEBHOOK }}\n          payload: |\n            {\n              \"text\": \"Deployment to production completed successfully!\"\n            }\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `assets/test-workflow.yml` - Testing workflow template\n- `assets/deploy-workflow.yml` - Deployment workflow template\n- `assets/matrix-build.yml` - Matrix build template\n- `references/common-workflows.md` - Common workflow patterns\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `gitlab-ci-patterns` - For GitLab CI workflows\n- `deployment-pipeline-design` - For pipeline architecture\n- `secrets-management` - For secrets handling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:45:44.482Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring streamlined continuous integration and deployment workflows with GitHub Actions","zh":"适用于需要使用 GitHub Actions 进行流畅的持续集成和部署工作流的 DevOps Agent","ja":"GitHub Actions を使用したスムーズな継続的インテグレーションとデプロイメントのワークフローを必要とする DevOps エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub Actions를 사용하여 원활한 연속 통합 및 배포 워크플ロー가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren flujos de trabajo de integración y despliegue continuo simplificados con GitHub Actions","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant des flux de travail d''intégration et de déploiement continu simplifiés avec GitHub Actions","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die stromlinienförmige Continuous-Integration- und -Deployment-Workflows mit GitHub Actions erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem fluxos de trabalho de integração e implantação contínua otimizados com GitHub Actions","ru":"Идеально для агентов DevOps, требующих оптимизированных потоков непрерывной интеграции и развертывания с GitHub Actions","ar":"مثالي لعمليات DevOps التي تتطلب تيارات عمل متسلسلة لدمج وتنفيذ مستمر مع GitHub Actions"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate testing, building, and deploying applications across various tech stacks using GitHub Actions workflow patterns, supporting Docker image builds, Kubernetes deployments, and security scans with matrix builds for multiple environments","zh":"赋予代理自动化测试、构建和部署应用程序的能力，支持使用 GitHub Actions 工作流模式、Docker 镜像构建、Kubernetes 部署和安全扫描，以及针对多个环境的矩阵构建","ja":"エージェントに、GitHub Actions ワークフロー パターン、Docker イメージ ビルド、Kubernetes デプロイ、セキュリティ スキャン、および複数の環境のマトリックス ビルドを使用して、テスト、ビルド、アプリケーションのデプロイを自動化する機能を提供","ko":"에이전트에 GitHub Actions 워크플로 패턴, Docker 이미지 빌드, Kubernetes 배포 및 보안 스캔을 사용하여 테스트, 빌드 및 애플리케이션 배포를 자동화하는 기능을 제공하며, 여러 환경에 대한 행렬 빌드를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas, la creación y la implementación de aplicaciones en varios stacks tecnológicos utilizando patrones de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions, que admiten la creación de imágenes de Docker, la implementación de Kubernetes y las exploraciones de seguridad con compilaciones de matriz para múltiples entornos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests, la construction et le déploiement d''applications sur différents stacks technologiques en utilisant des modèles de flux de travail GitHub Actions, prenant en charge la construction d''images Docker, le déploiement de Kubernetes et les analyses de sécurité avec des builds de matrice pour plusieurs environnements","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Tests, Erstellung und Bereitstellung von Anwendungen in verschiedenen Technologiestacks mithilfe von GitHub-Actions-Workflussmustern zu automatisieren, die Docker-Image-Erstellung, Kubernetes-Bereitstellung und Sicherheitsprüfungen mit Matrixbuilds für mehrere Umgebungen unterstützen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes, compilação e implantação de aplicações em várias pilhas de tecnologia usando padrões de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions, com suporte a compilação de imagens do Docker, implantações do Kubernetes e digitalizações de segurança com compilações de matriz para vários ambientes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование, сборку и развертывание приложений в различных технологических стеках с помощью шаблонов рабочих процессов GitHub Actions, поддерживающих сборку образов Docker, развертывание Kubernetes и сканирование безопасности с матричными сборками для нескольких сред","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من تلقين اختبارات وتجمي