\n1. Identify research type (market, competitive, domain, technical)\n2. Load appropriate workflow from `_bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/`\n3. Follow research methodology in the selected workflow\n4. Gather and analyze relevant information\n5. Document research findings and insights\n6. Save research outputs to project documentation","body":"# Research Workflow\n\nExecute research workflow based on research type:\n\n1. Identify research type (market, competitive, domain, technical)\n2. Load appropriate workflow from `_bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/`\n3. Follow research methodology in the selected workflow\n4. Gather and analyze relevant information\n5. Document research findings and insights\n6. Save research outputs to project documentation"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:46:24.818Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for autonomous research agents executing structured analysis pipelines across market, competitive, domain, and technical research types.","zh":"对于执行跨市场、竞争、领域和技术研究类型的结构化分析流程的自主研究代理而言至关重要。","ja":"市場、競合、分野、技術といった研究タイプにわたる構造化された分析パイプラインを実行する自律的な研究エージェントにとって不可欠です。","ko":"시장, 경쟁, 도메인 및 기술 연구 유형에 걸친 구조화된 분석 파이프라인을 실행하는 자율 연구 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de investigación autónomos que ejecutan análisis estructurados de pipelines a través de tipos de investigación de mercado, competitiva, dominio y técnica.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de recherche autonomes exécutant des analyses de pipelines structurées à travers les types de recherche de marché, concurrentielle, de domaine et technique.","de":"Wesentlich für autonome Forschungsagenten, die strukturierte Analyse-Pipelines über Marktforschung, Wettbewerbsforschung, Domänenforschung und technische Forschungstypen ausführen.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de pesquisa autônoma que executam pipelines de análise estruturada em diferentes tipos de pesquisa, incluindo mercado, competitiva, domínio e técnica.","ru":"Необходим для автономных исследовательских агентов, выполняющих структурированные аналитические конвейеры для различных типов исследований на рынке, конкурентной среде, области и технических исследованиях.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء الباحثين الأوتوماتيكيين الذين ينفذون خطوط أنابيب تحليلية منظمة عبر أنواع البحث السوقية والتنافسية والمنطقة والفنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables autonomous execution of BMAD Method research workflows with specialized methodologies for each research type, including information gathering, analysis, and documentation capabilities. Integrates directly with Kiro CLI''s epic execution pipeline for systematic research output generation.","zh":"能够自主执行BMAD方法研究流程，为每种研究类型提供专门的方法论，包括信息收集、分析和文档化功能。直接与Kiro CLI的史诗级执行管道集成，以系统化地生成研究成果。","ja":"情報収集、分析、文書化機能を含む、各研究タイプに特化した方法論でBMADメソッドの研究ワークフローを自律的に実行できます。体系的な研究成果生成のために、Kiro CLIのエピック実行パイプラインと直接連携します。","ko":"정보 수집, 분석 및 문서화 기능을 포함하여 각 연구 유형별로 특화된 방법론으로 BMAD Method 연구 워크플로우를 자율적으로 실행할 수 있도록 합니다. 체계적인 연구 결과 생성을 위해 Kiro CLI의 epic 실행 파이프라인과 직접 통합됩니다.","es":"Permite la ejecución autónoma de flujos de trabajo de investigación del método BMAD con metodologías especializadas para cada tipo de investigación, incluyendo capacidades de recopilación de información, análisis y documentación. Se integra directamente con la infraestructura de Kiro CLI para la generación sistemática de resultados de investigación.","fr":"Permet l''exécution autonome des flux de travail de recherche de la méthode BMAD avec des méthodologies spécialisées pour chaque type de recherche, y compris des capacités de collecte d''informations, d''analyse et de documentation. S''intègre directement avec l''infrastructure Kiro CLI pour la génération systématique de résultats de recherche.","de":"Ermöglicht die autonome Ausführung von Forschungs-Workflows der BMAD-Methode mit spezialisierten Methoden für jeden Forschungstyp, einschließlich Fähigkeiten zur Informationsbeschaffung, -analyse und -dokumentation. Integriert sich direkt in die Kiro-CLI-Infrastruktur für die systematische Erzeugung von Forschungsergebnissen.","pt":"Permite a execução autônoma de fluxos de trabalho de pesquisa do método BMAD com metodologias especializadas para cada tipo de pesquisa, incluindo capacidades de coleta de informações, análise e documentação. Integra-se diretamente com o pipeline de execução épica do Kiro CLI para geração sistemática de saídas de pesquisa.","ru":"Позволяет автономно выполнять рабочие потоки исследования метода BMAD с специализированными методологиями для каждого типа исследования, включая возможности сбора информации, анализа и документации. Интегрируется напрямую с конвейером эпической выполнения Kiro CLI для систематической генерации результатов исследования.","ar":"تمكن من تنفيذ تلقائي لتدفقات عمل البحث بأسلوب BMAD مع منهجيات متخصصة لكل نوع من أنواع البحث، بما في ذلك إمكانيات جمع المعلومات والتحليل والتوثيق. يدمج مباشرة مع خط أنابيب التنفيذ الملحمي لبرنامج 命令 Kiro لإنشاء مخرجات بحثية منتظمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing competitive analysis workflows against industry rivals","Conducting technical research on emerging frameworks and libraries","Performing market research for product positioning strategies","Documenting domain research findings for project knowledge bases"],"zh":["针对行业竞争对手执行竞争分析工作流程","对新出现的框架和库进行技术研究","为产品定位策略执行市场研究","为项目知识库记录领域研究成果"],"ja":["業界の競合他社に対する競合分析ワークフローの実行","新興のフレームワークやライブラリに関する技術研究の実施","製品ポジショニング戦略のための市場調査の実施","プロジェクトナレッジベースのための分野研究結果の文書化"],"ko":["산업 경쟁사에 대한 경쟁 분석 워크플로우 실행","신흥 프레임워크 및 라이브러리에 대한 기술 연구 수행","제품 포지셔닝 전략을 위한 시장 조사 수행","프로젝트 지식 베이스를 위한 도메인 연구 결과 문서화"],"es":["Ejecutar flujos de trabajo de análisis competitiva contra rivales de la industria","Realizar investigaciones técnicas sobre frameworks y bibliotecas emergentes","Realizar investigaciones de mercado para estrategias de posicionamiento de productos","Documentar los hallazgos de la investigación de dominio para bases de conocimiento de proyectos"],"fr":["Exécuter des flux de travail d''analyse concurrentielle contre les rivaux de l''industrie","Effectuer des recherches techniques sur les frameworks et les bibliothèques émergentes","Effectuer des recherches de marché pour les stratégies de positionnement de produits","Documenter les résultats de la recherche de domaine pour les bases de connaissances de projet"],"de":["Ausführen von Wettbewerbsanalysen-Workflows gegen Branchenkonkurrenten","Durchführen von technischen Forschungen zu aufkommenden Frameworks und Bibliotheken","Durchführen von Marktforschung für Produktpositionierungsstrategien","Dokumentieren von Domänenforschungsergebnissen für Projektwissensbasen"],"pt":["Executando fluxos de trabalho de análise competitiva contra rivais da indústria","Realizando pesquisas técnicas sobre estruturas e bibliotecas emergentes","Realizando pesquisas de mercado para estratégias de posicionamento de produtos","Documentando descobertas de pesquisa de domínio para bases de conhecimento de projetos"],"ru":["Выполняя рабочие потоки конкурентного анализа против отраслевых конкурентов","Проведение технических исследований по возникающим фреймворкам и библиотекам","Проведение рыночных исследований для стратегий позиционирования продуктов","Документирование результатов исследования области для баз знаний проектов"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات عمل تحليل تنافسي ضد منافسين في الصناعة","إجراء بحوث فنية حول الإطارات وال المكتبات الناشئة","إجراء بحوث سوقية لاستراتيجيات وضع المنتجات","توثيق النتائج البحثية لمنطقة الدراسة لمخازن المعرفة للمشاريع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires BMAD Method workflow files in _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","Dependent on Kiro CLI infrastructure","Limited to four predefined research types (market, competitive, domain, technical)"],"zh":["需要在_bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/目录中存在BMAD方法工作流程文件","依赖于Kiro CLI基础设施","仅限于四种预定义的研究类型（市场、竞争、领域、技术）"],"ja":["_bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/ にBMADメソッドのワークフローファイルが必要","Kiro CLIインフラストラクチャに依存","4つの事前定義された研究タイプ（市場、競合、分野、技術）に限定"],"ko":["_bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/ 디렉토리에 BMAD Method 워크플로우 파일 필요","Kiro CLI 인프라에 의존","4가지 사전 정의된 연구 유형(시장, 경쟁, 도메인, 기술)으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere archivos de flujo de trabajo del método BMAD en _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","Dependiente de la infraestructura de Kiro CLI","Limitado a cuatro tipos de investigación predefinidos (mercado, competitiva, dominio, técnica)"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de workflow de la méthode BMAD dans _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","Dépendant de l''infrastructure Kiro CLI","Limité à quatre types de recherche prédéfinis (marché, concurrentielle, de domaine, technique)"],"de":["Benötigt BMAD-Methoden-Workflow-Dateien in _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","Abhängig von der Kiro-CLI-Infrastruktur","Begrenzt auf vier vorgegebene Forschungstypen (Markt, Wettbewerb, Domäne, Technik)"],"pt":["Requer arquivos de fluxo de trabalho do método BMAD em _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","Depende da infraestrutura do Kiro CLI","Limitado a quatro tipos de pesquisa predefinidos (mercado, competitiva, domínio, técnica)"],"ru":["Требует файлов рабочих потоков метода BMAD в _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","Зависит от инфраструктуры Kiro CLI","Ограничен четырьмя предопределенными типами исследований (рынок, конкурентная среда, область, технические исследования)"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات تدفق عمل أسلوب BMAD في _bmad/bmm/workflows/1-analysis/research/","يعتمد على بنية تحتية لبرنامج 命令 Kiro","محدود بأربعة أنواع بحث محددة مسبقا (سوق، تنافس، منطقة، تقني)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ma1orek/replay/OpenAI Apps MCP', 'community', 'ma1orek', 'replay', 'ma1orek/replay', 'OpenAI Apps MCP', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z', '2026-02-18T13:47:04.679Z', NULL, '{"id":"ma1orek/replay/OpenAI Apps MCP","name":"OpenAI Apps MCP","description":{"es":"Construye aplicaciones de ChatGPT personalizadas con servidores MCP en Cloudflare Workers. Amplía ChatGPT con herramientas personalizadas y widgets interactivos","fr":"Construisez des applications ChatGPT personnalisées avec des serveurs MCP sur Cloudflare Workers. Étendez ChatGPT avec des outils personnalisés et des widgets interactifs","de":"Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte ChatGPT-Anwendungen mit MCP-Servern auf Cloudflare Workers. Erweitern Sie ChatGPT mit benutzerdefinierten Tools und interaktiven Widgets","pt":"Construa aplicativos OpenAI com servidores MCP stateless na Cloudflare Workers, estendendo o ChatGPT com ferramentas personalizadas","ru":"Постройте приложения OpenAI с использованием серверов MCP без состояния на Cloudflare Workers, расширяя ChatGPT кастомными инструментами","ar":"ابني تطبيقات OpenAI باستخدام خوادم MCP بدون حالة على Cloudflare Workers، وتوسيع ChatGPT بالأدوات المخصصة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones de ChatGPT con servidores MCP","fr":"Créez des applications ChatGPT avec des serveurs MCP","de":"Erstellen Sie ChatGPT-Anwendungen mit MCP-Servern","pt":"Desenvolva Aplicativos OpenAI com MCP","ru":"Разработка приложений OpenAI с MCP","ar":"بناء تطبيقات OpenAI مع MCP","en":"OpenAI Apps MCP"},"description":{"es":"Construye aplicaciones de ChatGPT personalizadas con servidores MCP en Cloudflare Workers. Amplía ChatGPT con herramientas personalizadas y widgets interactivos","fr":"Construisez des applications ChatGPT personnalisées avec des serveurs MCP sur Cloudflare Workers. Étendez ChatGPT avec des outils personnalisés et des widget...","de":"Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte ChatGPT-Anwendungen mit MCP-Servern auf Cloudflare Workers. Erweitern Sie ChatGPT mit benutzerdefinierten Tools und interakt...","pt":"Construa aplicativos OpenAI com servidores MCP stateless na Cloudflare Workers, estendendo o ChatGPT com ferramentas personalizadas","ru":"Постройте приложения OpenAI с использованием серверов MCP без состояния на Cloudflare Workers, расширяя ChatGPT кастомными инструментами","ar":"ابني تطبيقات OpenAI باستخدام خوادم MCP بدون حالة على Cloudflare Workers، وتوسيع ChatGPT بالأدوات المخصصة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de ChatGPT personalizadas","Uso de servidores MCP en Cloudflare Workers","Ampliación de ChatGPT con herramientas personalizadas","Integración de widgets interactivos","Compatibilidad con tecnologías como Hono y Zod"],"fr":["Création d''applications ChatGPT personnalisées","Utilisation de serveurs MCP sur Cloudflare Workers","Étension de ChatGPT avec des outils personnalisés","Intégration de widgets interactifs","Compatibilité avec des technologies comme Hono et Zod"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter ChatGPT-Anwendungen","Verwendung von MCP-Servern auf Cloudflare Workers","Erweiterung von ChatGPT mit benutzerdefinierten Tools","Integration interaktiver Widgets","Kompatibilität mit Technologien wie Hono und Zod"],"pt":["Crie aplicativos ChatGPT personalizados","Use servidores MCP stateless na Cloudflare Workers","Estenda o ChatGPT com ferramentas e widgets interativos","Renderize UI em iframe com HTML e JS","Utilize dependências como cloudflare-worker-base e hono-routing"],"ru":["Создайте кастомные приложения ChatGPT","Используйте серверы MCP без состояния на Cloudflare Workers","Расширьте ChatGPT кастомными инструментами и интерактивными виджетами","Рендерите UI в iframe с использованием HTML и JS","Используйте зависимости như cloudflare-worker-base и hono-routing"],"ar":["ابني تطبيقات ChatGPT المخصصة","استخدم خوادم MCP بدون حالة على Cloudflare Workers","وسّع ChatGPT بالأدوات والWidgets التفاعلية","عرّض واجهة المستخدم في iframe باستخدام HTML و JS","استخدم الإعتماديات مثل cloudflare-worker-base و hono-routing"]},"keywords":{"es":["ChatGPT","MCP","Cloudflare Workers","aplicaciones personalizadas","herramientas personalizadas","widgets interactivos","Hono","Zod","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["ChatGPT","MCP","Cloudflare Workers","applications personnalisées","outils personnalisés","widgets interactifs","Hono","Zod","développement d''applications"],"de":["ChatGPT","MCP","Cloudflare Workers","benutzerdefinierte Anwendungen","benutzerdefinierte Tools","interaktive Widgets","Hono","Zod","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["OpenAI","MCP","ChatGPT","Cloudflare Workers","servidores stateless","aplicativos personalizados","ferramentas interativas","HTML","JS","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["OpenAI","MCP","ChatGPT","Cloudflare Workers","серверы без состояния","кастомные приложения","интерактивные инструменты","HTML","JS","разработка приложений"],"ar":["OpenAI","MCP","ChatGPT","Cloudflare Workers","خوادم بدون حالة","تطبيقات مخصصة","أدوات تفاعلية","HTML","JS","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.522Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"OpenAI Apps MCP","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Building OpenAI Apps with Stateless MCP Servers\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: `cloudflare-worker-base`, `hono-routing` (optional)\n**Latest Versions**: @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.25.3, hono@4.11.3, zod@4.3.5, wrangler@4.58.0\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild **ChatGPT Apps** using **MCP (Model Context Protocol)** servers on Cloudflare Workers. Extends ChatGPT with custom tools and interactive widgets (HTML/JS UI rendered in iframe).\n\n**Architecture**: Chat","body":"# Building OpenAI Apps with Stateless MCP Servers\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: `cloudflare-worker-base`, `hono-routing` (optional)\n**Latest Versions**: @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.25.3, hono@4.11.3, zod@4.3.5, wrangler@4.58.0\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild **ChatGPT Apps** using **MCP (Model Context Protocol)** servers on Cloudflare Workers. Extends ChatGPT with custom tools and interactive widgets (HTML/JS UI rendered in iframe).\n\n**Architecture**: ChatGPT → MCP endpoint (JSON-RPC 2.0) → Tool handlers → Widget resources (HTML)\n\n**Status**: Apps available to Business/Enterprise/Edu (GA Nov 13, 2025). MCP Apps Extension (SEP-1865) formalized Nov 21, 2025.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Scaffold & Install\n\n```bash\nnpm create cloudflare@latest my-openai-app -- --type hello-world --ts --git --deploy false\ncd my-openai-app\nnpm install @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.25.3 hono@4.11.3 zod@4.3.5\nnpm install -D @cloudflare/vite-plugin@1.17.1 vite@7.2.4\n```\n\n### 2. Configure wrangler.jsonc\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-openai-app\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"compatibility_flags\": [\"nodejs_compat\"],  // Required for MCP SDK\n  \"assets\": {\n    \"directory\": \"dist/client\",\n    \"binding\": \"ASSETS\"  // Must match TypeScript\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Create MCP Server (`src/index.ts`)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Hono } from ''hono'';\nimport { cors } from ''hono/cors'';\nimport { Server } from ''@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/index.js'';\nimport { ListToolsRequestSchema, CallToolRequestSchema } from ''@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/types.js'';\n\nconst app = new Hono<{ Bindings: { ASSETS: Fetcher } }>();\n\n// CRITICAL: Must allow chatgpt.com\napp.use(''/mcp/*'', cors({ origin: ''https://chatgpt.com'' }));\n\nconst mcpServer = new Server(\n  { name: ''my-app'', version: ''1.0.0'' },\n  { capabilities: { tools: {}, resources: {} } }\n);\n\n// Tool registration\nmcpServer.setRequestHandler(ListToolsRequestSchema, async () => ({\n  tools: [{\n    name: ''hello'',\n    description: ''Use this when user wants to see a greeting'',\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: ''object'',\n      properties: { name: { type: ''string'' } },\n      required: [''name'']\n    },\n    annotations: {\n      openai: { outputTemplate: ''ui://widget/hello.html'' }  // Widget URI\n    }\n  }]\n}));\n\n// Tool execution\nmcpServer.setRequestHandler(CallToolRequestSchema, async (request) => {\n  if (request.params.name === ''hello'') {\n    const { name } = request.params.arguments as { name: string };\n    return {\n      content: [{ type: ''text'', text: `Hello, ${name}!` }],\n      _meta: { initialData: { name } }  // Passed to widget\n    };\n  }\n  throw new Error(`Unknown tool: ${request.params.name}`);\n});\n\napp.post(''/mcp'', async (c) => {\n  const body = await c.req.json();\n  const response = await mcpServer.handleRequest(body);\n  return c.json(response);\n});\n\napp.get(''/widgets/*'', async (c) => c.env.ASSETS.fetch(c.req.raw));\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### 4. Create Widget (`src/widgets/hello.html`)\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: system-ui; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"greeting\">Loading...</div>\n  <script>\n    if (window.openai && window.openai.getInitialData) {\n      const data = window.openai.getInitialData();\n      document.getElementById(''greeting'').textContent = `Hello, ${data.name}! 👋`;\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n### 5. Deploy\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\nnpx wrangler deploy\nnpx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector https://my-app.workers.dev/mcp\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Requirements\n\n**CORS**: Must allow `https://chatgpt.com` on `/mcp/*` routes\n**Widget URI**: Must use `ui://widget/` prefix (e.g., `ui://widget/map.html`)\n**MIME Type**: Must be `text/html+skybridge` for HTML resources\n**Widget Data**: Pass via `_meta.initialData` (accessed via `window.openai.getInitialData()`)\n**Tool Descriptions**: Action-oriented (\"Use this when user wants to...\")\n**ASSETS Binding**: Serve widgets from ASSETS, not bundled in worker code\n**SSE**: Send heartbeat every 30s (100s timeout on Workers)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **14** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: CORS Policy Blocks MCP Endpoint\n**Error**: `Access to fetch blocked by CORS policy`\n**Fix**: `app.use(''/mcp/*'', cors({ origin: ''https://chatgpt.com'' }))`\n\n### Issue #2: Widget Returns 404 Not Found\n**Error**: `404 (Not Found)` for widget URL\n**Fix**: Use `ui://widget/` prefix (not `resource://` or `/widgets/`)\n```typescript\nannotations: { openai: { outputTemplate: ''ui://widget/map.html'' } }\n```\n\n### Issue #3: Widget Displays as Plain Text\n**Error**: HTML source code visible instead of rendered widget\n**Fix**: MIME type must be `text/html+skybridge` (not `text/html`)\n```typescript\nserver.setRequestHandler(ListResourcesRequestSchema, async () => ({\n  resources: [{ uri: ''ui://widget/map.html'', mimeType: ''text/html+skybridge'' }]\n}));\n```\n\n### Issue #4: ASSETS Binding Undefined\n**Error**: `TypeError: Cannot read property ''fetch'' of undefined`\n**Fix**: Binding name in wrangler.jsonc must match TypeScript\n```jsonc\n{ \"assets\": { \"binding\": \"ASSETS\" } }  // wrangler.jsonc\n```\n```typescript\ntype Bindings = { ASSETS: Fetcher };  // index.ts\n```\n\n### Issue #5: SSE Connection Drops After 100 Seconds\n**Error**: SSE stream closes unexpectedly\n**Fix**: Send heartbeat every 30s (Workers timeout at 100s inactivity)\n```typescript\nconst heartbeat = setInterval(async () => {\n  await stream.writeSSE({ data: JSON.stringify({ type: ''heartbeat'' }), event: ''ping'' });\n}, 30000);\n```\n\n### Issue #6: ChatGPT Doesn''t Suggest Tool\n**Error**: Tool registered but never appears in suggestions\n**Fix**: Use action-oriented descriptions\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good: ''Use this when user wants to see a location on a map''\n// ❌ Bad: ''Shows a map''\n```\n\n### Issue #7: Widget Can''t Access Initial Data\n**Error**: `window.openai.getInitialData()` returns `undefined`\n**Fix**: Pass data via `_meta.initialData`\n```typescript\nreturn {\n  content: [{ type: ''text'', text: ''Here is your map'' }],\n  _meta: { initialData: { location: ''SF'', zoom: 12 } }\n};\n```\n\n### Issue #8: Widget Scripts Blocked by CSP\n**Error**: `Refused to load script (CSP directive)`\n**Fix**: Use inline scripts or same-origin scripts. Third-party CDNs blocked.\n```html\n<!-- ✅ Works --> <script>console.log(''ok'');</script>\n<!-- ❌ Blocked --> <script src=\"https://cdn.example.com/lib.js\"></script>\n```\n\n### Issue #9: Hono Global Response Override Breaks Next.js (v1.25.0-1.25.2)\n**Error**: `No response is returned from route handler` (Next.js App Router)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #1369](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/1369)\n**Affected Versions**: v1.25.0 to v1.25.2\n**Fixed In**: v1.25.3\n**Why It Happens**: Hono (MCP SDK dependency) overwrites `global.Response`, breaking frameworks that extend it (Next.js, Remix, SvelteKit). NextResponse instanceof check fails.\n**Prevention**:\n- **Upgrade to v1.25.3+** (recommended)\n- **Before fix**: Use `webStandardStreamableHTTPServerTransport` instead\n- **Or**: Run MCP server on separate port from Next.js/Remix/SvelteKit app\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ v1.25.3+ - Fixed\nconst transport = new StreamableHTTPServerTransport({\n  sessionIdGenerator: undefined,\n});\n\n// ✅ v1.25.0-1.25.2 - Workaround\nimport { webStandardStreamableHTTPServerTransport } from ''@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/index.js'';\nconst transport = webStandardStreamableHTTPServerTransport({\n  sessionIdGenerator: undefined,\n});\n```\n\n### Issue #10: Elicitation (User Input) Fails on Cloudflare Workers\n**Error**: `EvalError: Code generation from strings disallowed`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #689](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/689)\n**Why It Happens**: Internal AJV v6 validator uses prohibited APIs on edge platforms\n**Prevention**: Avoid `elicitInput()` on edge platforms (Cloudflare Workers, Vercel Edge, Deno Deploy)\n\n**Workaround**:\n```typescript\n// ❌ Don''t use on Cloudflare Workers\nconst userInput = await server.elicitInput({\n  prompt: \"What is your name?\",\n  schema: { type: \"string\" }\n});\n\n// ✅ Use tool parameters instead\nserver.setRequestHandler(CallToolRequestSchema, async (request) => {\n  const { name } = request.params.arguments as { name: string };\n  // User provides via tool call, not elicitation\n});\n```\n\n**Status**: Requires MCP SDK v2 to fix properly. Track [PR #844](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/pull/844).\n\n### Issue #11: SSE Transport Statefulness Breaks Serverless Deployments\n**Error**: `400: No transport found for sessionId`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #273](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/273)\n**Why It Happens**: `SSEServerTransport` relies on in-memory session storage. In serverless environments (AWS Lambda, Cloudflare Workers), the initial `GET /sse` request may be handled by Instance A, but subsequent `POST /messages` requests land on Instance B, which lacks the in-memory state.\n**Prevention**: Use **Streamable HTTP transport** (added in v1.24.0) instead of SSE for serverless deployments\n**Solution**: For stateful SSE, deploy to non-serverless environments (VPS, long-running containers)\n\n**Official Status**: Fixed by introducing Streamable HTTP (v1.24+) - now the **recommended standard** for serverless.\n\n### Issue #12: OAuth Configuration Requires TWO Separate Apps\n**Source**: [Cloudflare Remote MCP Server Docs](https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/guides/remote-mcp-server/)\n**Why It Happens**: OAuth providers validate redirect URLs strictly. Localhost and production have different URLs, so they need separate OAuth client registrations.\n**Prevention**:\n```bash\n# Development OAuth App\nCallback URL: http://localhost:8788/callback\n\n# Production OAuth App\nCallback URL: https://my-mcp-server.workers.dev/callback\n```\n\n**Additional Requirements**:\n- KV namespace for auth state storage (create manually)\n- `COOKIE_ENCRYPTION_KEY` env var: `openssl rand -hex 32`\n- Client restart required after config changes\n\n### Issue #13: Widget State Over 4k Tokens Causes Performance Issues (Community-sourced)\n**Source**: [OpenAI Apps SDK - ChatGPT UI](https://developers.openai.com/apps-sdk/build/chatgpt-ui/)\n**Why It Happens**: Widget state persists only to a single widget instance tied to one conversation message. State is reset when users submit via the main chat composer instead of widget controls.\n**Prevention**: Keep state payloads under **4k tokens** for optimal performance\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Lightweight state\nwindow.openai.setWidgetState({ selectedId: \"item-123\", view: \"grid\" });\n\n// ❌ Bad - Will cause performance issues\nwindow.openai.setWidgetState({\n  items: largeArray,           // Don''t store full datasets\n  history: conversationLog,    // Don''t store conversation history\n  cache: expensiveComputation  // Don''t cache large results\n});\n```\n\n**Best Practice**:\n- Store only UI state (selected items, view mode, filters)\n- Fetch data from MCP server on widget mount\n- Use tool calls to persist important data\n\n### Issue #14: Widget-Initiated Tool Calls Fail Without Permission Flag (Community-sourced)\n**Source**: [OpenAI Apps SDK - ChatGPT UI](https://developers.openai.com/apps-sdk/build/chatgpt-ui/)\n**Why It Happens**: Components initiating tool calls via `window.openai.callTool()` require the tool marked as \"able to be initiated by the component\" on the MCP server. Without this flag, calls fail silently.\n**Prevention**: Mark tools as `widgetCallable: true` in annotations\n\n```typescript\n// MCP Server - Mark tool as widget-callable\nserver.setRequestHandler(ListToolsRequestSchema, async () => ({\n  tools: [{\n    name: ''update_item'',\n    description: ''Update an item'',\n    inputSchema: { /* ... */ },\n    annotations: {\n      openai: {\n        outputTemplate: ''ui://widget/item.html'',\n        // ✅ Required for widget-initiated calls\n        widgetCallable: true\n      }\n    }\n  }]\n}));\n\n// Widget - Now allowed to call tool\nwindow.openai.callTool({\n  name: ''update_item'',\n  arguments: { id: itemId, status: ''completed'' }\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Widget Development Best Practices\n\n### File Upload Limitations (Community-sourced)\n**Source**: [OpenAI Apps SDK - ChatGPT UI](https://developers.openai.com/apps-sdk/build/chatgpt-ui/)\n\n`window.openai.uploadFile()` only supports 3 image formats: `image/png`, `image/jpeg`, and `image/webp`. Other formats fail silently.\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Supported\nwindow.openai.uploadFile({ accept: ''image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp'' });\n\n// ❌ Not supported (fails silently)\nwindow.openai.uploadFile({ accept: ''application/pdf'' });\nwindow.openai.uploadFile({ accept: ''text/csv'' });\n```\n\n**Alternative for Other File Types**:\n1. Use base64 encoding in tool arguments\n2. Request user paste text content\n3. Use external upload service (S3, R2) and pass URL\n\n### Tool Performance Targets (Community-sourced)\n**Source**: [OpenAI Apps SDK - Troubleshooting](https://developers.openai.com/apps-sdk/deploy/troubleshooting)\n\nTool calls exceeding \"a few hundred milliseconds\" cause UI sluggishness in ChatGPT. Official docs recommend profiling backends and implementing caching for slow operations.\n\n**Performance Targets**:\n- **< 200ms**: Ideal response time\n- **200-500ms**: Acceptable but noticeable\n- **> 500ms**: Sluggish, needs optimization\n\n**Optimization Strategies**:\n```typescript\n// 1. Cache expensive computations\nconst cache = new Map();\nif (cache.has(key)) return cache.get(key);\nconst result = await expensiveOperation();\ncache.set(key, result);\n\n// 2. Use KV/D1 for pre-computed data\nconst cached = await env.KV.get(`result:${id}`);\nif (cached) return JSON.parse(cached);\n\n// 3. Paginate large datasets\nreturn {\n  content: [{ type: ''text'', text: ''First 20 results...'' }],\n  _meta: { hasMore: true, nextPage: 2 }\n};\n\n// 4. Move slow work to async tasks\n// Return immediately, update via follow-up\n```\n\n---\n\n## MCP SDK 1.25.x Updates (December 2025)\n\n**Breaking Changes** from @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.24.x → 1.25.x:\n- Removed loose type exports (Prompts, Resources, Roots, Sampling, Tools) - use specific schemas\n- ES2020 target required (previous: ES2018)\n- `setRequestHandler` is now typesafe - incorrect schemas throw type errors\n\n**New Features**:\n- **Tasks** (v1.24.0+): Long-running operations with progress tracking\n- **Sampling with Tools** (v1.24.0+): Tools can request model sampling\n- **OAuth Client Credentials** (M2M): Machine-to-machine authentication\n\n**Migration**: If using loose type imports, update to specific schema imports:\n```typescript\n// ❌ Old (removed in 1.25.0)\nimport { Tools } from ''@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/types.js'';\n\n// ✅ New (1.25.1+)\nimport { ListToolsRequestSchema, CallToolRequestSchema } from ''@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/types.js'';\n```\n\n---\n\n## Zod 4.0 Migration Notes (MAJOR UPDATE - July 2025)\n\n**Breaking Changes** from zod@3.x → 4.x:\n- `.default()` now expects input type (not output type). Use `.prefault()` for old behavior.\n- ZodError: `error.issues` (not `error.errors`)\n- `.merge()` and `.superRefine()` deprecated\n- Optional properties with defaults now always apply\n\n**Performance**: 14x faster string parsing, 7x faster arrays, 6.5x faster objects\n\n**Migration**: Update validation code:\n```typescript\n// Zod 4.x\ntry {\n  const validated = schema.parse(data);\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n    return { content: [{ type: ''text'', text: error.issues.map(e => e.message).join('', '') }] };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk\": \"^1.25.3\",\n    \"hono\": \"^4.11.3\",\n    \"zod\": \"^4.3.5\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@cloudflare/vite-plugin\": \"^1.17.1\",\n    \"@cloudflare/workers-types\": \"^4.20260103.0\",\n    \"vite\": \"^7.2.4\",\n    \"wrangler\": \"^4.54.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **MCP Specification**: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/ (Latest: 2025-11-25)\n- **MCP SDK**: https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk\n- **OpenAI Apps SDK**: https://developers.openai.com/apps-sdk\n- **MCP Apps Extension (SEP-1865)**: http://blog.modelcontextprotocol.io/posts/2025-11-21-mcp-apps/\n- **Context7 Library ID**: /modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk\n\n## Production Reference\n\n**Open Source Example**: https://github.com/jezweb/chatgpt-app-sdk (portfolio carousel widget)\n- **Live in Production**: Rendering in ChatGPT Business\n- **MCP Server**: Full JSON-RPC 2.0 implementation with tools + resources (~310 lines)\n- **Widget Integration**: WordPress API → `window.openai.toolOutput` → React carousel\n- **Database**: D1 (SQLite) for contact form submissions\n- **Stack**: Hono 4 + React 19 + Tailwind v4 + Drizzle ORM\n- **Key Files**:\n  - `/src/lib/mcp/server.ts` - Complete MCP handler\n  - `/src/server/tools/portfolio.ts` - Tool with widget annotations\n  - `/src/widgets/PortfolioWidget.tsx` - Data access pattern\n- **Verified**: All 14 known issues prevented, zero errors in production\n\n---\n\n## Community Resources\n\n### Deployment Tools\n\n**Cloudflare One-Click Deploy**: Deploy MCP servers to Cloudflare Workers with pre-built templates and auto-configured CI/CD. Includes OAuth wrapper and Python support.\n- Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/guides/remote-mcp-server/\n- Blog: https://blog.cloudflare.com/model-context-protocol/\n\n### Frameworks\n\n**Skybridge** (Community): React-focused framework with HMR support for widgets and enhanced MCP server helpers. Unofficial but actively maintained.\n- GitHub: https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge\n- Docs: https://www.skybridge.tech/\n\n> **Note**: Community frameworks are not officially supported. Use at your own discretion\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:47:04.679Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Chat Agent Ecosystems needing to extend ChatGPT with custom tools and interactive widgets.","zh":"非常适合需要使用自定义工具和交互式小部件扩展ChatGPT的聊天代理生态系统。","ja":"ChatGPTをカスタムツールやインタラクティブウィジェットで拡張する必要があるチャットエージェントエコシステムに最適です。","ko":"ChatGPT를 사용자 지정 도구 및 상호 작용 위젯으로 확장해야 하는 채팅 에이전트 생태계에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para ecosistemas de agentes de chat que necesitan extender ChatGPT con herramientas personalizadas y widgets interactivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les écosystèmes d''agents de chat ayant besoin d''étendre ChatGPT avec des outils personnalisés et des widgets interactifs.","de":"Perfekt für Chat-Agent-Ökosysteme, die ChatGPT mit benutzerdefinierten Tools und interaktiven Widgets erweitern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para ecossistemas de Agentes de Chat que precisam estender o ChatGPT com ferramentas personalizadas e widgets interativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для экосистем чат-агентов, которым необходимо расширить ChatGPT с помощью пользовательских инструментов и интерактивных виджетов.","ar":"مثالي لنظام البيئات الوكيل المحادثة التي تحتاج إلى توسيع ChatGPT مع أدوات مخصصة وأدوات تفاعلية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables deployment of stateless MCP servers on Cloudflare Workers, extending ChatGPT capabilities with custom tools and HTML/JS widgets rendered in iframes. Leverages Model Context Protocol SDK 1.25.3 for seamless integration with OpenAI''s ecosystem.","zh":"实现了在Cloudflare Workers上部署无状态MCP服务器，使用自定义工具和在iframe中渲染的HTML/JS小部件来扩展ChatGPT的功能。利用Model Context Protocol SDK 1.25.3实现与OpenAI生态系统的无缝集成。","ja":"Cloudflare Workers上でステートレスMCPサーバーをデプロイし、カスタムツールとiframe内でレンダリングされるHTML/JSウィジェットを使用してChatGPTの機能を拡張することを可能にします。Model Context Protocol SDK 1.25.3を使用して、OpenAIのエコシステムとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"Cloudflare Workers에서 상태 비存 MCP 서버를 배포하여 사용자 지정 도구 및 iframe 내에서 렌더링되는 HTML/JS 위젯을 사용하여 ChatGPT의 기능을 확장할 수 있습니다. Model Context Protocol SDK 1.25.3를 사용하여 OpenAI의 생태계와의 무缝한 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite la implementación de servidores MCP sin estado en Cloudflare Workers, extendiendo las capacidades de ChatGPT con herramientas personalizadas y widgets HTML/JS renderizados en iframes. Aprovecha el SDK del Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo 1.25.3 para una integración sin problemas con el ecosistema de OpenAI.","fr":"Permet le déploiement de serveurs MCP sans état sur Cloudflare Workers, en étendant les capacités de ChatGPT avec des outils personnalisés et des widgets HTML/JS rendus dans des iframes. Exploite le SDK du Protocole de Contexte de Modèle 1.25.3 pour une intégration transparente avec l''écosystème d''OpenAI.","de":"Ermöglicht die Bereitstellung von staatlosen MCP-Servern auf Cloudflare Workers, wodurch die Funktionen von ChatGPT mit benutzerdefinierten Tools und HTML/JS-Widgets erweitert werden, die in Iframes gerendert werden. Nutzt das SDK des Modellkontextprotokolls 1.25.3 für eine nahtlose Integration in das OpenAI-Ökosystem.","pt":"Permite a implantação de servidores MCP sem estado no Cloudflare Workers, estendendo as capacidades do ChatGPT com ferramentas personalizadas e widgets HTML/JS renderizados em iframes. Utiliza o SDK do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo 1.25.3 para integração perfeita com o ecossistema da OpenAI.","ru":"Позволяет развертывать бесстатные серверы MCP на Cloudflare Workers, расширяя возможности ChatGPT с помощью пользовательских инструментов и HTML/JS-виджетов, отображаемых в iframe. Использует SDK Протокола контекста модели 1.25.3 для бесшовной интеграции с экосистемой OpenAI.","ar":"يسمح بنشر خادم MCP بدون حالة على Cloudflare Workers، مما يوسع قدرات ChatGPT مع أدوات مخصصة وأدوات HTML/JS الم 渲رزة في الإطارات. يستفيد من SDK بروتوكول سياق النموذج 1.25.3 لتكامل مثالي مع نظام البيئات OpenAI."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom ChatGPT Apps with specialized tools","Developing interactive widgets with HTML/JS iframe rendering","Extending ChatGPT functionality through Cloudflare Workers","Creating MCP-compatible tools for OpenAI''s ecosystem"],"zh":["构建具有专用工具的自定义ChatGPT应用程序","使用HTML/JS iframe渲染开发交互式小部件","通过Cloudflare Workers扩展ChatGPT功能","为OpenAI的生态系统创建MCP兼容工具"],"ja":["専用ツールを備えたカスタムChatGPTアプリケーションを構築する","HTML/JS iframeレンダリングを使用してインタラクティブウィジェットを開発する","Cloudflare Workersを使用してChatGPTの機能を拡張する","OpenAIのエコシステム用のMCP互換ツールを作成する"],"ko":["전용 도구가 있는 사용자 지정 ChatGPT 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","HTML/JS iframe 렌더링을 사용하여 상호 작용 위젯을 개발하는 것","Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 ChatGPT 기능을 확장하는 것","OpenAI의 생태계를 위한 MCP 호환 도구를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones ChatGPT personalizadas con herramientas especializadas","Desarrollo de widgets interactivos con renderizado de iframe HTML/JS","Extensión de la funcionalidad de ChatGPT a través de Cloudflare Workers","Creación de herramientas compatibles con MCP para el ecosistema de OpenAI"],"fr":["Création d''applications ChatGPT personnalisées avec des outils spécialisés","Développement de widgets interactifs avec un rendu de iframe HTML/JS","Extension des fonctionnalités de ChatGPT via Cloudflare Workers","Création d''outils compatibles MCP pour l''écosystème d''OpenAI"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter ChatGPT-Apps mit spezialisierten Tools","Entwicklung interaktiver Widgets mit HTML/JS-Ifrae-Rendering","Erweiterung der ChatGPT-Funktionalität über Cloudflare Workers","Erstellung von MCP-kompatiblen Tools für das OpenAI-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Construir Aplicativos ChatGPT personalizados com ferramentas especializadas","Desenvolver widgets interativos com renderização de iframe HTML/JS","Estender a funcionalidade do ChatGPT por meio do Cloudflare Workers","Criar ferramentas compatíveis com MCP para o ecossistema da OpenAI"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских приложений ChatGPT с специализированными инструментами","Разработка интерактивных виджетов с помощью отображения iframe HTML/JS","Расширение функциональности ChatGPT с помощью Cloudflare Workers","Создание инструментов, совместимых с MCP, для экосистемы OpenAI"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات ChatGPT المخصصة مع أدوات متخصصة","تطوير أدوات تفاعلية مع عرض iframe HTML/JS","توسيع وظائف ChatGPT من خلال Cloudflare Workers","إنشاء أدوات متوافقة مع MCP لنظام البيئات OpenAI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare Workers deployment","Dependent on Model Context Protocol SDK","Needs hono-routing for optimal implementation"],"zh":["需要在Cloudflare Workers上部署","依赖于Model Context Protocol SDK","需要hono-routing才能实现最佳实现"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workersへのデプロイが必要","Model Context Protocol SDKに依存する","最適な実装にはhono-routingが必要"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers에 배포해야 함","Model Context Protocol SDK에 의존","최적의 구현을 위해서는 hono-routing가 필요"],"es":["Requiere implementación de Cloudflare Workers","Dependiente del SDK del Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","Necesita enrutamiento de hono para una implementación óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite un déploiement de Cloudflare Workers","Dépendant du SDK du Protocole de Contexte de Modèle","Nécessite un routage hono pour une mise en œuvre optimale"],"de":["Erfordert die Bereitstellung von Cloudflare Workers","Abhängig vom SDK des Modellkontextprotokolls","Benötigt Hono-Weiterleitung für eine optimale Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer implantação do Cloudflare Workers","Dependente do SDK do Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo","Necessita de roteamento hono para implementação otimizada"],"ru":["Требует развертывания Cloudflare Workers","Зависит от SDK Протокола контекста модели","Требует маршрутизации hono для оптимальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب نشر Cloudflare Workers","يعتمد على SDK بروتوكول سياق النموذج","يحتاج إلى التوجيه hono لتنفيذ مثالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
