zh":"项目会话管理是一种跟踪工作进度的方法，使用SESSION.md和git检查点来记录进度","ja":"プロジェクトセッション管理は、SESSION.mdとgitチェックポイントを使用して進捗を追跡する方法です","ko":"프로젝트 세션 관리는 SESSION.md와 git 체크포인트를 사용하여 진행 상황을 추적하는 방법입니다","es":"La gestión de sesiones de proyecto permite realizar un seguimiento del progreso a través de sesiones de trabajo, utilizando SESSION.md con puntos de control ...","fr":"La gestion de sessions de projet permet de suivre la progression à travers des sessions de travail, en utilisant SESSION.md avec des points de contrôle git e...","de":"Die Projekt-Sitzungs-Verwaltung ermöglicht die Verfolgung des Fortschritts über Arbeitsitzungen hinweg, indem sie SESSION.md mit Git-Checkpoints und konkrete...","pt":"O Gerenciamento de Sessão de Projeto é uma habilidade que permite rastrear o progresso em sessões de trabalho usando SESSION.md com checkpoints de git","ru":"Управление сессиями проекта - это навык, позволяющий отслеживать прогресс в рабочих сессиях с помощью файла SESSION.md и контрольных точек git","ar":"إدارة جلسة المشروع هي مهارة تمكنك من تتبع التقدم في جلسات العمل باستخدام ملف SESSION.md و نقاط التحقق من git","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用SESSION.md记录进度","使用git检查点跟踪进度","支持多阶段管理","支持中断和恢复工作","支持实现验证和调试循环"],"ja":["SESSION.mdを使用して進捗を記録","gitチェックポイントを使用して進捗を追跡","複数の段階を管理する機能","作業の中断と再開のサポート","実装、検証、デバッグのサイクルを実現"],"ko":["SESSION.md를 사용하여 진행 상황을 기록","git 체크포인트를 사용하여 진행 상황을 추적","다중 단계 관리 기능","작업 중단과 재개 지원","구현, 검증, 디버깅 사이클을 구현"],"es":["Seguimiento del progreso a través de sesiones de trabajo","Uso de SESSION.md con puntos de control de git","Acciones concretas para cada sesión de trabajo","Integración con la planificación de proyectos","Soporte para checkpoints de fase y transiciones de fase"],"fr":["Suivi de la progression à travers des sessions de travail","Utilisation de SESSION.md avec des points de contrôle git","Actions concrètes pour chaque session de travail","Intégration avec la planification de projets","Support pour les checkpoints de phase et les transitions de phase"],"de":["Verfolgung des Fortschritts über Arbeitsitzungen hinweg","Verwendung von SESSION.md mit Git-Checkpoints","Konkrete Aktionen für jede Arbeitsitzung","Integration mit der Projektplanung","Unterstützung für Phasen-Checkpoints und Phasenübergänge"],"pt":["Rastreamento de progresso em sessões de trabalho","Uso de arquivo SESSION.md para acompanhamento","Checkpoints de git para controle de versão","Definição de ações concretas para próxima etapa","Integração com planejamento de projeto"],"ru":["Отслеживание прогресса в рабочих сессиях","Использование файла SESSION.md для сопровождения","Контрольные точки git для контроля версий","Определение конкретных действий для следующего этапа","Интеграция с планированием проекта"],"ar":["تتبع التقدم في جلسات العمل","استخدام ملف SESSION.md لتتبع","نقاط التحقق من git للتحكم في الإصدار","تحديد إجراءات ملموسة للخطوة التالية","التكامل مع تخطيط المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目会话管理","SESSION.md","git检查点","工作进度跟踪","项目管理","工作流程优化"],"ja":["プロジェクトセッション管理","SESSION.md","gitチェックポイント","進捗追跡","プロジェクト管理","ワークフロー最適化"],"ko":["프로젝트 세션 관리","SESSION.md","git 체크포인트","진행 상황 추적","프로젝트 관리","워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["gestión de sesiones de proyecto","seguimiento del progreso","SESSION.md","git checkpoints","acciones concretas","planificación de proyectos","checkpoints de fase","transiciones de fase"],"fr":["gestion de sessions de projet","suivi de la progression","SESSION.md","points de contrôle git","actions concrètes","planification de projets","checkpoints de phase","transitions de phase"],"de":["Projekt-Sitzungs-Verwaltung","Verfolgung des Fortschritts","SESSION.md","Git-Checkpoints","konkrete Aktionen","Projektplanung","Phasen-Checkpoints","Phasenübergänge"],"pt":["gerenciamento de sessão de projeto","rastreamento de progresso","SESSION.md","checkpoints de git","planejamento de projeto","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["управление сессиями проекта","отслеживание прогресса","SESSION.md","контрольные точки git","планирование проекта","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["إدارة جلسة المشروع","تتبع التقدم","SESSION.md","نقاط التحقق من git","تخطيط المشروع","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-session-management","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Session Management Skill\n\nTrack progress across work sessions using SESSION.md with git checkpoints and concrete next actions.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting projects after `project-planning` generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n- Resuming work after context clears\n- Mid-phase checkpoints when context is full\n- Phase transitions\n- Tracking Implementation → Verification → Debugging cycle\n\n---\n\n## Phases vs Sessions\n\n**Phases** (IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md): Units of WORK (e.g., \"Database S","body":"# Project Session Management Skill\n\nTrack progress across work sessions using SESSION.md with git checkpoints and concrete next actions.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting projects after `project-planning` generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n- Resuming work after context clears\n- Mid-phase checkpoints when context is full\n- Phase transitions\n- Tracking Implementation → Verification → Debugging cycle\n\n---\n\n## Phases vs Sessions\n\n**Phases** (IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md): Units of WORK (e.g., \"Database Schema\", \"Auth API\"). Have verification/exit criteria. May span multiple sessions.\n\n**Sessions** (SESSION.md): Units of CONTEXT. Complete before clearing/compacting context. Can complete a phase, part of a phase, or multiple small phases.\n\n**Example**: Phase 3 (Tasks API) → Session 1 (GET/POST) → Session 2 (PATCH/DELETE) → Session 3 (verify) ✅\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n**Starting New Project**:\n1. After `project-planning` creates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, offer: \"Create SESSION.md to track progress?\"\n2. Generate SESSION.md from phases, set Phase 1 as 🔄 (in progress), set concrete \"Next Action\"\n\n**Ending Session**:\n- **Automated**: `/wrap-session` (updates SESSION.md, creates checkpoint commit, outputs summary)\n- **Manual**: Update SESSION.md → git checkpoint → set concrete \"Next Action\"\n\n**Resuming**:\n- **Automated**: `/continue-session` (loads context, shows summary, continues from \"Next Action\")\n- **Manual**: Read SESSION.md → check \"Next Action\" → continue\n\n---\n\n## Automation Commands\n\n**`/wrap-session`**: Analyzes state → updates SESSION.md → updates related docs → creates checkpoint commit → outputs summary → optionally pushes\n\n**`/continue-session`**: Loads SESSION.md + planning docs → shows git history + summary → displays verification criteria (if in Verification stage) → opens \"Next Action\" file → asks permission to continue\n\n---\n\n## SESSION.md Structure\n\n**Purpose**: Navigation hub referencing planning docs, tracking current progress\n**Target**: <200 lines in project root\n**Update**: After significant progress (not every change)\n\n### Template\n\n```markdown\n# Session State\n\n**Current Phase**: Phase 3\n**Current Stage**: Implementation (or Verification/Debugging)\n**Last Checkpoint**: abc1234 (2025-10-23)\n**Planning Docs**: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Setup ✅\n**Completed**: 2025-10-15 | **Checkpoint**: abc1234\n**Summary**: Vite + React + Tailwind v4 + D1 binding\n\n## Phase 2: Database ✅\n**Completed**: 2025-10-18 | **Checkpoint**: def5678\n**Summary**: D1 schema + migrations + seed data\n\n## Phase 3: Tasks API 🔄\n**Type**: API | **Started**: 2025-10-23\n**Spec**: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md#phase-3`\n\n**Progress**:\n- [x] GET /api/tasks endpoint (commit: ghi9012)\n- [x] POST /api/tasks endpoint (commit: jkl3456)\n- [ ] PATCH /api/tasks/:id ← **CURRENT**\n- [ ] DELETE /api/tasks/:id\n- [ ] Verify all endpoints (see IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md for criteria)\n\n**Next Action**: Implement PATCH /api/tasks/:id in src/routes/tasks.ts:47, handle validation and ownership check\n\n**Key Files**:\n- `src/routes/tasks.ts`\n- `src/lib/schemas.ts`\n\n**Known Issues**: None\n\n## Phase 4: Task UI ⏸️\n**Spec**: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md#phase-4`\n```\n\n---\n\n## Status Icons\n\nUse these emoji status icons consistently:\n\n- **⏸️** = Not started (pending)\n- **🔄** = In progress\n- **✅** = Complete\n- **🚫** = Blocked\n\n---\n\n## Stages Within a Phase\n\n1. **Implementation** → Writing code\n2. **Verification** → Testing against criteria\n3. **Debugging** → Fixing issues\n\nUpdate SESSION.md with current stage and progress. Example:\n\n```markdown\n**Current Stage**: Verification\n\n**Verification Progress**:\n- [x] GET /api/tasks returns 200 ✅\n- [x] POST /api/tasks creates task ✅\n- [ ] POST with invalid data returns 400 ❌ (returns 500)\n\n**Current Issue**: Invalid data returning 500. Check src/middleware/validate.ts\n```\n\n---\n\n## SESSION.md Guidelines\n\n✅ Collapse completed phases (2-3 lines), concrete \"Next Action\" (file+line+task), reference planning docs, checkpoint at phase end or when context full\n\n❌ No code copying, no duplicating IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, no vague actions, keep <200 lines\n\n---\n\n## Git Checkpoint Format\n\n```\ncheckpoint: Phase [N] [Status] - [Brief Description]\n\nPhase: [N] - [Name]\nStatus: [Complete/In Progress/Paused]\nSession: [What was accomplished this session]\n\nFiles Changed:\n- path/to/file.ts (what changed)\n\nNext: [Concrete next action]\n```\n\n**Example** (Phase Complete):\n```\ncheckpoint: Phase 3 Complete - Tasks API\n\nPhase: 3 - Tasks API\nStatus: Complete\nSession: Completed all CRUD endpoints and verified functionality\n\nFiles Changed:\n- src/routes/tasks.ts (all CRUD operations)\n- src/lib/schemas.ts (task validation)\n\nNext: Phase 4 - Start building Task List UI component\n```\n\n---\n\n## Expected Uncommitted Files (CRITICAL)\n\n**Checkpoint Cycle**: `/wrap-session` creates commit → gets hash → updates SESSION.md with hash. Therefore **SESSION.md is always uncommitted when resuming** (BY DESIGN).\n\n**Expected uncommitted files** (no warning):\n- **SESSION.md** - Checkpoint hash updated post-commit, always uncommitted between sessions (NORMAL)\n- **CLAUDE.md** - Often updated during dev, may be uncommitted (NORMAL)\n- **.roomodes** - Editor/IDE state, not relevant to session handoff (SAFE TO IGNORE)\n\n**Warning triggers** (unexpected):\n- Source files (.ts, .tsx, .js)\n- Config files (vite.config.ts, wrangler.jsonc)\n- Planning docs (IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- New untracked files\n\n**`/continue-session` behavior**:\n- ℹ️ Info message when only SESSION.md/CLAUDE.md/.roomodes uncommitted\n- ⚠️ Warning when code/doc changes uncommitted (shows filtered list excluding expected files)\n\n---\n\n## Context Management\n\n**Context full mid-phase**: Update SESSION.md → checkpoint → clear context → read SESSION.md + planning docs → continue from \"Next Action\"\n\n**Phase complete**: Check verification criteria → mark 🔄→✅ → checkpoint → move next phase ⏸️→🔄\n\n**Troubleshooting**: Update to \"Debugging\" stage → document \"Current Issue\" → when fixed, return to \"Verification\" or \"Implementation\"\n\n---\n\n## Integration with project-planning\n\n`project-planning` generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md (the plan) → `project-session-management` creates SESSION.md (the tracker) → work through phases → git checkpoints → resume from SESSION.md\n\nPlanning docs (/docs): Reference material, rarely change\nSESSION.md (root): Living document, updates constantly\n\n---\n\n## Creating SESSION.md for New Project\n\nAfter `project-planning` runs:\n\n1. Read IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n2. Create SESSION.md in root: Phase 1 as 🔄, others as ⏸️\n3. Expand Phase 1 with task checklist\n4. Set concrete \"Next Action\"\n5. Output for review\n\nOffer: \"Would you like me to create SESSION.md to track progress through these phases? (clear current phase, progress tracking, easy resume, git checkpoint format)\"\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n**Templates**: SESSION.md.template, checkpoint-commit-format.md, CLAUDE-session-snippet.md\n\n**Scripts**: resume.sh (show current state)\n\n**References**: session-handoff-protocol.md, best-practices.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:46:45.318Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Task Management Agents requiring structured project tracking and git integration.","zh":"适用于需要结构化项目跟踪和git集成的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが構造化されたプロジェクト追跡とGit統合を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 추적 및 Git 통합을 필요로 하는 태스크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de tareas que requieren un seguimiento estructurado de proyectos e integración con git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de tâches nécessitant un suivi structuré de projet et une intégration git.","de":"Ideal für Task-Management-Agents, die strukturierte Projektverfolgung und Git-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestão de Tarefas que necessitam de acompanhamento estruturado de projetos e integração com git.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих структурированного отслеживания проектов и интеграции с git.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة المهام الذين يتطلبون تتبعًا منظمًا للمشاريع والتكامل مع git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track progress across work sessions using SESSION.md files, create concrete next actions, and leverage git checkpoints for version control, streamlining the Implementation → Verification → Debugging cycle with protocols like git.","zh":"使代理能够使用SESSION.md文件跨工作会话跟踪进度，创建具体的下一步行动，并利用Git检查点进行版本控制，从而简化实现 → 验证 → 调试周期，使用类似Git的协议。","ja":"SESSION.mdファイルを使用して作業セッションを跨いで進捗状況を追跡し、具体的な次のアクションを作成し、Gitのチェックポイントを使用してバージョン管理を行うことで、実装 → 検証 → デバッグサイクルを簡素化し、Gitなどのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"SESSION.md 파일을 사용하여 작업 세션을跨어 진행 상황을 추적하고, 구체적인 다음 행동을 생성하며, Git 체크포인트를 사용하여 버전 관리를 수행함으로써, 구현 → 검증 → 디버깅 사이클을 간소화하고, Git과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un seguimiento del progreso entre sesiones de trabajo utilizando archivos SESSION.md, crear acciones concretas siguientes y aprovegar los puntos de control de git para el control de versiones, optimizando el ciclo Implementación → Verificación → Depuración con protocolos como git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les progrès entre les sessions de travail en utilisant des fichiers SESSION.md, de créer des prochaines actions concrètes et de tirer parti des points de contrôle git pour la gestion de version, rationalisant le cycle Implémentation → Vérification → Débogage avec des protocoles comme git.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, den Fortschritt über Arbeitssitzungen hinweg mit SESSION.md-Dateien zu verfolgen, konkrete nächste Aktionen zu erstellen und Git-Checkpoints für die Versionskontrolle zu nutzen, wodurch der Zyklus Implementierung → Verifikation → Debugging mit Protokollen wie git optimiert wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a acompanharem o progresso entre sessões de trabalho usando ficheiros SESSION.md, criar ações concretas seguintes e aproveitar pontos de verificação do git para controlo de versões, simplificando o ciclo de Implementação → Verificação → Depuração com protocolos como o git.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отслеживать прогресс между рабочими сессиями с использованием файлов SESSION.md, создавать конкретные следующие действия и использовать контрольные точки git для управления версиями, упрощая цикл Реализация → Проверка → Отладка с помощью таких протоколов, как git.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تقدم التقدم عبر جلسات العمل باستخدام ملفات SESSION.md، وإنشاء إجراءات تالية ملموسة، والاستفادة من نقاط التحقق في git للتحكم في الإصدارات، مما يبسط دورة التنفيذ → التحقق → التصحيح باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل git."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project session tracking with SESSION.md","Generating concrete next actions for project phases","Checkpointing progress with git for transparent version control"],"zh":["使用SESSION.md自动化项目会话跟踪","为项目阶段生成具体的下一步行动","使用Git进行进度检查点以实现透明的版本控制"],"ja":["SESSION.mdを使用してプロジェクトセッションの追跡を自動化する","プロジェクト段階の具体的な次のアクションを生成する","Gitを使用して進捗状況のチェックポイントをとり、バージョン管理を透明化する"],"ko":["SESSION.md를 사용하여 프로젝트 세션 추적을 자동화한다","프로젝트 단계의 구체적인 다음 행동을 생성한다","Git를 사용하여 진행 상황 체크포인트를 설정하여 버전 관리를 투명하게 한다"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de sesiones de proyecto con SESSION.md","Generación de acciones concretas siguientes para las fases del proyecto","Puntos de control del progreso con git para un control de versiones transparente"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des sessions de projet avec SESSION.md","Génération de prochaines actions concrètes pour les phases du projet","Point de contrôle des progrès avec git pour un contrôle de version transparent"],"de":["Automatisierung der Projekt-Sitzungsverfolgung mit SESSION.md","Generierung konkreter nächster Aktionen für Projektphasen","Fortschritts-Checkpointing mit Git für transparente Versionskontrolle"],"pt":["Automatização do acompanhamento de sessões de projeto com SESSION.md","Geração de ações concretas seguintes para fases do projeto","Criação de pontos de verificação de progresso com git para controlo de versões transparente"],"ru":["Автоматизация отслеживания сессий проекта с помощью SESSION.md","Генерация конкретных следующих действий для этапов проекта","Создание контрольных точек прогресса с помощью git для прозрачного контроля версий"],"ar":["أتمتة تتبع جلسات المشروع باستخدام SESSION.md","توليد إجراءات تالية ملموسة لمراحل المشروع","نقاط تحقق التقدم باستخدام git للتحكم الشفاف في الإصدارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git setup and configuration","SESSION.md file format must be adhered to","Implementation phases must be predefined in IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md"],"zh":["需要Git设置和配置","SESSION.md文件格式必须遵守","实现阶段必须在IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md中预定义"],"ja":["Gitの設定と構成が必要","SESSION.mdファイルのフォーマットを遵守する必要がある","実装段階はIMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.mdに事前に定義する必要がある"],"ko":["Git 설정 및 구성이 필요하다","SESSION.md 파일 형식은 준수해야 한다","구현 단계는 IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md에 미리 정의되어야 한다"],"es":["Requiere la configuración y puesta a punto de git","Se debe adherir al formato de archivo SESSION.md","Las fases de implementación deben estar predefinidas en IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de git","Le format de fichier SESSION.md doit être respecté","Les phases de mise en œuvre doivent être prédéfinies dans IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md"],"de":["Erfordert Git-Setup und -Konfiguration","Das SESSION.md-Dateiformat muss eingehalten werden","Implementierungsphasen müssen in IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md vordefiniert sein"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do git","O formato do ficheiro SESSION.md deve ser seguido","As fases de implementação devem ser predefinidas em IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации git","Необходимо соблюдать формат файла SESSION.md","Этапы реализации должны быть предопределены в файле IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين git","يجب الالتزام بتنسيق ملف SESSION.md","يجب تحديد مراحل التنفيذ مسبقًا في ملف IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
