en E-E-A-T","Kennzahlen Core Web Vitals","Optimierung der Leistung","Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["SEO para desenvolvedores","Otimização de motores de busca","Desenvolvimento web","E-E-A-T Framework","Core Web Vitals","Antigravity IDE","IDEs e CLIs"],"ru":["SEO для разработчиков","Оптимизация поисковых систем","Веб-разработка","E-E-A-T Framework","Core Web Vitals","Antigravity IDE","IDE и CLI"],"ar":["تحسين محركات البحث للمطورين","تحسين محركات البحث","تطوير الويب","إطار E-E-A-T","المؤشرات الأساسية للويب","Antigravity IDE","IDE و CLI"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"agent-bridge-kit","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/agent-bridge-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-fundamentals","description":"SEO fundamentals, E-E-A-T, Core Web Vitals, and Google algorithm principles.","bodyPreview":"# SEO Fundamentals\n\n> Principles for search engine visibility.\n\n---\n\n## 1. E-E-A-T Framework\n\n| Principle | Signals |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **Experience** | First-hand knowledge, real examples |\n| **Expertise** | Credentials, depth of knowledge |\n| **Authoritativeness** | Backlinks, mentions, industry recognition |\n| **Trustworthiness** | HTTPS, transparency, accurate info |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Core Web Vitals\n\n| Metric | Target | Measures |\n|--------|--------|----------|\n| **LCP** | < 2.5s | Loadin","body":"# SEO Fundamentals\n\n> Principles for search engine visibility.\n\n---\n\n## 1. E-E-A-T Framework\n\n| Principle | Signals |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **Experience** | First-hand knowledge, real examples |\n| **Expertise** | Credentials, depth of knowledge |\n| **Authoritativeness** | Backlinks, mentions, industry recognition |\n| **Trustworthiness** | HTTPS, transparency, accurate info |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Core Web Vitals\n\n| Metric | Target | Measures |\n|--------|--------|----------|\n| **LCP** | < 2.5s | Loading performance |\n| **INP** | < 200ms | Interactivity |\n| **CLS** | < 0.1 | Visual stability |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Technical SEO Principles\n\n### Site Structure\n\n| Element | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| XML sitemap | Help crawling |\n| robots.txt | Control access |\n| Canonical tags | Prevent duplicates |\n| HTTPS | Security signal |\n\n### Performance\n\n| Factor | Impact |\n|--------|--------|\n| Page speed | Core Web Vital |\n| Mobile-friendly | Ranking factor |\n| Clean URLs | Crawlability |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Content SEO Principles\n\n### Page Elements\n\n| Element | Best Practice |\n|---------|---------------|\n| Title tag | 50-60 chars, keyword front |\n| Meta description | 150-160 chars, compelling |\n| H1 | One per page, main keyword |\n| H2-H6 | Logical hierarchy |\n| Alt text | Descriptive, not stuffed |\n\n### Content Quality\n\n| Factor | Importance |\n|--------|------------|\n| Depth | Comprehensive coverage |\n| Freshness | Regular updates |\n| Uniqueness | Original value |\n| Readability | Clear writing |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Schema Markup Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Article | Blog posts, news |\n| Organization | Company info |\n| Person | Author profiles |\n| FAQPage | Q&A content |\n| Product | E-commerce |\n| Review | Ratings |\n| BreadcrumbList | Navigation |\n\n---\n\n## 6. AI Content Guidelines\n\n### What Google Looks For\n\n| ✅ Do | ❌ Don''t |\n|-------|----------|\n| AI draft + human edit | Publish raw AI content |\n| Add original insights | Copy without value |\n| Expert review | Skip fact-checking |\n| Follow E-E-A-T | Keyword stuffing |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Ranking Factors (Prioritized)\n\n| Priority | Factor |\n|----------|--------|\n| 1 | Quality, relevant content |\n| 2 | Backlinks from authority sites |\n| 3 | Page experience (Core Web Vitals) |\n| 4 | Mobile optimization |\n| 5 | Technical SEO fundamentals |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Measurement\n\n| Metric | Tool |\n|--------|------|\n| Rankings | Search Console, Ahrefs |\n| Traffic | Analytics |\n| Core Web Vitals | PageSpeed Insights |\n| Indexing | Search Console |\n| Backlinks | Ahrefs, Semrush |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** SEO is a long-term game. Quality content + technical excellence + patience = results.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:47:02.232Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Content Strategy Agents optimizing web content for search engine visibility and user experience.","zh":"对于优化搜索引擎可见性和用户体验的内容策略智能体而言至关重要。","ja":"検索エンジンの可視性とユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化するコンテンツ戦略エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"검색 엔진 가시성과 사용자 경험을 최적화하는 콘텐츠 전략 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Estrategia de Contenidos que optimizan el contenido web para la visibilidad en motores de búsqueda y la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Stratégie de Contenu optimisant le contenu web pour la visibilité sur les moteurs de recherche et l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Essenziell für Content-Strategie-Agents, die Webinhalte für die Sichtbarkeit in Suchmaschinen und die Benutzererfahrung optimieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Estratégia de Conteúdo que otimizam o conteúdo da web para visibilidade de mecanismos de busca e experiência do usuário.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов по стратегии контента, оптимизирующих веб-контент для видимости в поисковых системах и пользовательского опыта.","ar":"ضروري لوسائل الإعلام ووكلاء الاستراتيجية المحتوى الذين يضمنون تحسين المحتوى على الويب للوضوح في محركات البحث وتجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides immediate access to E-E-A-T framework implementation and Core Web Vitals optimization, enabling agents to evaluate HTTPS security, backlink profiles, and page loading performance metrics like LCP (<2.5s target).","zh":"提供对E-E-A-T框架实施和核心网页指标优化的即时访问，使智能体能够评估HTTPS安全性、反向链接配置文件以及LCP（目标<2.5秒）等页面加载性能指标。","ja":"E-E-A-Tフレームワークの実装とCore Web Vitalsの最適化への即時アクセスを提供し、エージェントがHTTPSセキュリティ、バックリンクプロファイル、LCP（目標<2.5秒）などのページ読み込みパフォーマンス指標を評価できるようにします。","ko":"E-E-A-T 프레임워크 구현과 Core Web Vitals 최적화에 대한 즉각적인 접근을 제공하여, 에이전트가 HTTPS 보안, 백링크 프로필, LCP(목표 <2.5초)와 같은 페이지 로딩 성능 지표를 평가할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Proporciona acceso inmediato a la implementación del marco E-E-A-T y a la optimización de Core Web Vitals, permitiendo a los agentes evaluar la seguridad HTTPS, los perfiles de backlinks y las métricas de rendimiento de carga de página como LCP (objetivo <2.5s).","fr":"Fournit un accès immédiat à la mise en œuvre du cadre E-E-A-T et à l''optimisation des Core Web Vitals, permettant aux agents d''évaluer la sécurité HTTPS, les profils de backlinks et les métriques de performance de chargement de page comme le LCP (objectif <2.5s).","de":"Bietet sofortigen Zugriff auf die Implementierung des E-E-A-T-Frameworks und die Optimierung der Core Web Vitals, ermöglicht es Agents, die HTTPS-Sicherheit, Backlink-Profile und Seitenladeleistungsmetriken wie LCP (Zielwert <2,5s) zu bewerten.","pt":"Fornece acesso imediato à implementação do quadro E-E-A-T e à otimização dos Principais Vitais da Web, permitindo que os agentes avaliem a segurança HTTPS, perfis de backlink e métricas de desempenho de carregamento de página, como LCP (meta de <2,5 s).","ru":"Предоставляет немедленный доступ к реализации框架 E-E-A-T и оптимизации Core Web Vitals, позволяя агентам оценить безопасность HTTPS, профили обратных ссылок и метрики производительности загрузки страниц, такие как LCP (цель <2,5 с).","ar":"يوفر الوصول الفوري إلى تنفيذ إطار E-E-A-T وتحسين جوهر الحياة على شبكة الإنترنت، مما يسمح للوكلاء بتقييم أمان HTTPS وملفات تعريف الارتباط الخلفية وأداء指标 تحميل الصفحة مثل LCP (الهدف من <2.5 ثانية)."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing content against E-E-A-T principles","Optimizing Core Web Vitals performance","Generating SEO compliance reports","Implementing HTTPS and transparency protocols"],"zh":["根据E-E-A-T原则审核内容","优化核心网页指标性能","生成SEO合规性报告","实施HTTPS和透明度协议"],"ja":["E-E-A-T原則に基づくコンテンツ監査","Core Web Vitalsのパフォーマンス最適化","SEOコンプライアンスレポートの生成","HTTPSおよび透明性プロトコルの実装"],"ko":["E-E-A-T 원칙에 따른 콘텐츠 감사","Core Web Vitals 성능 최적화","SEO 준수 보고서 생성","HTTPS 및 투명성 프로토콜 구현"],"es":["Auditoría de contenido según los principios E-E-A-T","Optimización del rendimiento de Core Web Vitals","Generación de informes de cumplimiento SEO","Implementación de protocolos HTTPS y de transparencia"],"fr":["Audit de contenu selon les principes E-E-A-T","Optimisation des performances Core Web Vitals","Génération de rapports de conformité SEO","Mise en œuvre des protocoles HTTPS et de transparence"],"de":["Auditierung von Inhalten nach E-E-A-T-Prinzipien","Optimierung der Core Web Vitals-Leistung","Erstellung von SEO-Compliance-Berichten","Implementierung von HTTPS- und Transparenzprotokollen"],"pt":["Auditoria de conteúdo contra os princípios E-E-A-T","Otimização do desempenho dos Principais Vitais da Web","Geração de relatórios de conformidade de SEO","Implementação de protocolos HTTPS e transparência"],"ru":["Аудит контента по принципам E-E-A-T","Оптимизация производительности Core Web Vitals","Генерация отчетов о соответствии SEO","Реализация протоколов HTTPS и прозрачности"],"ar":["مراجعة المحتوى مقابل مبادئ E-E-A-T","تحسين أداء جوهر الحياة على شبكة الإنترنت","توليد تقارير مطابقة لتحسين محركات البحث","تنفيذ بروتوكولات HTTPS والشفافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to website performance metrics","Needs backlink analysis capabilities","Dependent on real-time page loading data"],"zh":["需要访问网站性能指标","需要反向链接分析能力","依赖实时页面加载数据"],"ja":["ウェブサイトパフォーマンス指標へのアクセスが必要","バックリンク分析機能が必要","リアルタイムのページ読み込みデータに依存"],"ko":["웹사이트 성능 지표에 대한 접근 필요","백링크 분석 기능 필요","실시간 페이지 로딩 데이터에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a métricas de rendimiento del sitio web","Necesita capacidades de análisis de backlinks","Depende de datos de carga de página en tiempo real"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux métriques de performance du site web","Requiert des capacités d''analyse de backlinks","Dépend de données de chargement de page en temps réel"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Website-Leistungsmetriken","Benötigt Backlink-Analysefunktionen","Ist von Echtzeit-Seitenladedaten abhängig"],"pt":["Exige acesso às métricas de desempenho do site","Necessita de capacidades de análise de backlink","Dependente de dados de carregamento de página em tempo real"],"ru":["Требует доступа к метрикам производительности сайта","Требует возможностей анализа обратных ссылок","Зависит от данных о загрузке страницы в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى معايير أداء الموقع","يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تحليل الارتباط الخلفي","يعتمد على بيانات تحميل الصفحة في الوقت الفعلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
