Решений и Шаблоны","ar":"هندسة متعددة السحابي: إطار تصمیم و أنماط","en":"multi-cloud-architecture"},"description":{"zh":"多云架构提供了设计云无关架构和选择云服务的决策框架","ja":"マルチクラウドアーキテクチャは、クラウドプロバイダーに依存しないアーキテクチャの設計とサービス選択のための決定フレームワークを提供","ko":"다중 클라우드 아키텍처는 클라우드 공급자에 의존하지 않는 아키텍처의 설계와 서비스 선택을 위한 결정 프레임워크를 제공","es":"La arquitectura multi-nube permite diseñar aplicaciones escalables y seguras en múltiples proveedores de nube. Aprende a tomar decisiones informadas sobre la...","fr":"L''architecture multi-cloud permet de concevoir des applications évolutives et sécurisées sur plusieurs fournisseurs de cloud. Découvrez comment prendre des d...","de":"Die Multi-Cloud-Architektur ermöglicht die Konzeption von skalierbaren und sicheren Anwendungen bei mehreren Cloud-Anbietern. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie fundierte...","pt":"A arquitetura multi-cloud é uma abordagem que permite projetar aplicações em diferentes provedores de nuvem, como AWS, Azure e GCP.","ru":"Мультиоблачная архитектура - это подход, позволяющий проектировать приложения в разных провайдерах облачных услуг, таких как AWS, Azure и GCP.","ar":"هندسة متعددة السحابي هي نهج يسمح بتصميم التطبيقات على مزودي سحابة مختلفين، مثل AWS و Azure و GCP.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["设计云无关架构","选择云服务","优化成本","跨云提供商设计","实现云无关应用"],"ja":["クラウドプロバイダーに依存しないアーキテクチャの設計","サービス選択","コストの最適化","クラウドプロバイダー間の設計","クラウドプロバイダーに依存しないアプリケーションの実装"],"ko":["클라우드 공급자에 의존하지 않는 아키텍처의 설계","서비스 선택","비용 최적화","클라우드 공급자 간의 설계","클라우드 공급자에 의존하지 않는 애플리케이션의 구현"],"es":["Diseño de arquitecturas en la nube agnósticas","Selección de servicios en AWS, Azure y GCP","Migración entre proveedores de nube","Implementación de arquitecturas multi-nube","Optimización de costos en múltiples proveedores"],"fr":["Conception d''architectures cloud agnostiques","Sélection de services sur AWS, Azure et GCP","Migration entre les fournisseurs de cloud","Mise en œuvre d''architectures multi-cloud","Optimisation des coûts sur plusieurs fournisseurs"],"de":["Entwurf von cloud-agnostischen Architekturen","Auswahl von Diensten bei AWS, Azure und GCP","Migration zwischen Cloud-Anbietern","Implementierung von Multi-Cloud-Architekturen","Kostenoptimierung bei mehreren Anbietern"],"pt":["Projetar arquiteturas de nuvem agnósticas","Tomar decisões informadas sobre seleção de serviços","Migrar entre provedores de nuvem","Implementar arquiteturas de nuvem flexíveis","Otimizar custos em diferentes provedores"],"ru":["Проектировать архитектуру облачного приложения, не зависящую от конкретного провайдера","Принимать обоснованные решения о выборе сервисов","Перемещаться между провайдерами облачных услуг","Реализовывать гибкую архитектуру облачного приложения","Оптимизировать расходы в разных провайдерах"],"ar":["تصميم هندسة سحابية محايدة","تحديد خدمات السحابة المناسبة","الانتقال بين مزودي السحابة","تنفيذ هندسة سحابية مرنة","تحسين التكاليف على مزودي السحابة المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["多云架构","云计算","架构设计","云服务选择","成本优化","跨云提供商"],"ja":["マルチクラウドアーキテクチャ","クラウドコンピューティング","アーキテクチャ設計","サービス選択","コスト最適化","クラウドプロバイダー間"],"ko":["다중 클라우드 아키텍처","클라우드 컴퓨팅","아키텍처 설계","서비스 선택","비용 최적화","클라우드 공급자 간"],"es":["arquitectura multi-nube","diseño de aplicaciones en la nube","AWS","Azure","GCP","migración de nube","optimización de costos","seguridad en la nube"],"fr":["architecture multi-cloud","conception d''applications cloud","AWS","Azure","GCP","migration de cloud","optimisation des coûts","sécurité cloud"],"de":["Multi-Cloud-Architektur","Anwendungsdesign in der Cloud","AWS","Azure","GCP","Cloud-Migration","Kostenoptimierung","Cloud-Sicherheit"],"pt":["arquitetura multi-cloud","nuvem agnóstica","seleção de serviços","migração de nuvem","otimização de custos","aws","azure","gcp"],"ru":["мультиоблачная архитектура","облачное приложение","рамки принятия решений","выбор сервисов","перемещение между провайдерами","оптимизация расходов","aws","azure","gcp"],"ar":["هندسة متعددة السحابي","سحابة محايدة","تحديد خدمات السحابة","الانتقال بين مزودي السحابة","تحسين التكاليف","aws","azure","gcp"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"multi-cloud-architecture","description":"Design multi-cloud architectures using a decision framework to select and integrate services across AWS, Azure, and GCP. Use when building multi-cloud systems, avoiding vendor lock-in, or leveraging best-of-breed services from multiple providers.","bodyPreview":"# Multi-Cloud Architecture\n\nDecision framework and patterns for architecting applications across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Purpose\n\nDesign cloud-agnostic architectures and make informed decisions about service selection across cloud providers.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Design multi-cloud strategies\n- Migrate between cloud providers\n- Select cloud services for specific workloads\n- Implement cloud-agnostic architectures\n- Optimize costs across providers\n\n## Cloud Service Comparison\n\n### Compute Services","body":"# Multi-Cloud Architecture\n\nDecision framework and patterns for architecting applications across AWS, Azure, and GCP.\n\n## Purpose\n\nDesign cloud-agnostic architectures and make informed decisions about service selection across cloud providers.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Design multi-cloud strategies\n- Migrate between cloud providers\n- Select cloud services for specific workloads\n- Implement cloud-agnostic architectures\n- Optimize costs across providers\n\n## Cloud Service Comparison\n\n### Compute Services\n\n| AWS     | Azure               | GCP             | Use Case           |\n| ------- | ------------------- | --------------- | ------------------ |\n| EC2     | Virtual Machines    | Compute Engine  | IaaS VMs           |\n| ECS     | Container Instances | Cloud Run       | Containers         |\n| EKS     | AKS                 | GKE             | Kubernetes         |\n| Lambda  | Functions           | Cloud Functions | Serverless         |\n| Fargate | Container Apps      | Cloud Run       | Managed containers |\n\n### Storage Services\n\n| AWS     | Azure           | GCP             | Use Case       |\n| ------- | --------------- | --------------- | -------------- |\n| S3      | Blob Storage    | Cloud Storage   | Object storage |\n| EBS     | Managed Disks   | Persistent Disk | Block storage  |\n| EFS     | Azure Files     | Filestore       | File storage   |\n| Glacier | Archive Storage | Archive Storage | Cold storage   |\n\n### Database Services\n\n| AWS         | Azure            | GCP           | Use Case        |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ------------- | --------------- |\n| RDS         | SQL Database     | Cloud SQL     | Managed SQL     |\n| DynamoDB    | Cosmos DB        | Firestore     | NoSQL           |\n| Aurora      | PostgreSQL/MySQL | Cloud Spanner | Distributed SQL |\n| ElastiCache | Cache for Redis  | Memorystore   | Caching         |\n\n**Reference:** See `references/service-comparison.md` for complete comparison\n\n## Multi-Cloud Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Single Provider with DR\n\n- Primary workload in one cloud\n- Disaster recovery in another\n- Database replication across clouds\n- Automated failover\n\n### Pattern 2: Best-of-Breed\n\n- Use best service from each provider\n- AI/ML on GCP\n- Enterprise apps on Azure\n- General compute on AWS\n\n### Pattern 3: Geographic Distribution\n\n- Serve users from nearest cloud region\n- Data sovereignty compliance\n- Global load balancing\n- Regional failover\n\n### Pattern 4: Cloud-Agnostic Abstraction\n\n- Kubernetes for compute\n- PostgreSQL for database\n- S3-compatible storage (MinIO)\n- Open source tools\n\n## Cloud-Agnostic Architecture\n\n### Use Cloud-Native Alternatives\n\n- **Compute:** Kubernetes (EKS/AKS/GKE)\n- **Database:** PostgreSQL/MySQL (RDS/SQL Database/Cloud SQL)\n- **Message Queue:** Apache Kafka (MSK/Event Hubs/Confluent)\n- **Cache:** Redis (ElastiCache/Azure Cache/Memorystore)\n- **Object Storage:** S3-compatible API\n- **Monitoring:** Prometheus/Grafana\n- **Service Mesh:** Istio/Linkerd\n\n### Abstraction Layers\n\n```\nApplication Layer\n    ↓\nInfrastructure Abstraction (Terraform)\n    ↓\nCloud Provider APIs\n    ↓\nAWS / Azure / GCP\n```\n\n## Cost Comparison\n\n### Compute Pricing Factors\n\n- **AWS:** On-demand, Reserved, Spot, Savings Plans\n- **Azure:** Pay-as-you-go, Reserved, Spot\n- **GCP:** On-demand, Committed use, Preemptible\n\n### Cost Optimization Strategies\n\n1. Use reserved/committed capacity (30-70% savings)\n2. Leverage spot/preemptible instances\n3. Right-size resources\n4. Use serverless for variable workloads\n5. Optimize data transfer costs\n6. Implement lifecycle policies\n7. Use cost allocation tags\n8. Monitor with cloud cost tools\n\n**Reference:** See `references/multi-cloud-patterns.md`\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n### Phase 1: Assessment\n\n- Inventory current infrastructure\n- Identify dependencies\n- Assess cloud compatibility\n- Estimate costs\n\n### Phase 2: Pilot\n\n- Select pilot workload\n- Implement in target cloud\n- Test thoroughly\n- Document learnings\n\n### Phase 3: Migration\n\n- Migrate workloads incrementally\n- Maintain dual-run period\n- Monitor performance\n- Validate functionality\n\n### Phase 4: Optimization\n\n- Right-size resources\n- Implement cloud-native services\n- Optimize costs\n- Enhance security\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use infrastructure as code** (Terraform/OpenTofu)\n2. **Implement CI/CD pipelines** for deployments\n3. **Design for failure** across clouds\n4. **Use managed services** when possible\n5. **Implement comprehensive monitoring**\n6. **Automate cost optimization**\n7. **Follow security best practices**\n8. **Document cloud-specific configurations**\n9. **Test disaster recovery** procedures\n10. **Train teams** on multiple clouds\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/service-comparison.md` - Complete service comparison\n- `references/multi-cloud-patterns.md` - Architecture patterns\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `terraform-module-library` - For IaC implementation\n- `cost-optimization` - For cost management\n- `hybrid-cloud-networking` - For connectivity\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:48:13.158Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Architecture Agents designing cross-platform solutions across AWS, Azure, and GCP.","zh":"适用于云架构代理设计跨平台解决方案，支持AWS、Azure和GCP。","ja":"クロスプラットフォームソリューションをAWS、Azure、GCPで設計するクラウドアーキテクチャエージェントに最適。","ko":"AWS, Azure, GCP에서 크로스 플랫폼 솔루션을 설계하는 클라우드 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de arquitectura en la nube que diseñan soluciones multiplataforma en AWS, Azure y GCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''architecture cloud conçuant des solutions multiplateformes sur AWS, Azure et GCP.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Architektur-Agenten, die cross-plattform Lösungen über AWS, Azure und GCP entwerfen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura de Nuvem que projetam soluções multiplataforma em AWS, Azure e GCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной архитектуры, разрабатывающих кроссплатформенные решения в AWS, Azure и GCP.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل هندسة السحابة التي تصمم حلولا متعددة المنصات عبر AWS و Azure و GCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables intelligent cloud service comparison and decision-making across compute, storage, and networking services from multiple providers. Provides framework for implementing cloud-agnostic architectures and optimizing multi-cloud cost structures.","zh":"实现智能云服务比较和决策，支持多个提供商的计算、存储和网络服务。提供框架用于实现云无关架构和优化多云成本结构。","ja":"複数のプロバイダーからのコンピュート、ストレージ、ネットワーキングサービス全体で、インテリジェントなクラウドサービス比較および意思決定を可能にする。クラウド非依存アーキテクチャの実装とマルチクラウドコスト構造の最適化のためのフレームワークを提供する。","ko":"여러 제공업체의 컴퓨팅, 스토리지, 네트워킹 서비스 전반에 걸쳐 智能한 클라우드 서비스 비교 및 의사 결정을 가능하게 합니다. 클라우드 비의존적 아키텍처 구현 및 다중 클라우드 비용 구조 최적화를 위한 프레임워크를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la comparación inteligente de servicios en la nube y la toma de decisiones en servicios de proceso, almacenamiento y redes de múltiples proveedores. Proporciona un marco para implementar arquitecturas agnósticas a la nube y optimizar estructuras de costos multi-nube.","fr":"Permet la comparaison intelligente des services cloud et la prise de décision sur les services de calcul, de stockage et de réseau de plusieurs fournisseurs. Fournit un cadre pour mettre en œuvre des architectures cloud agnostiques et optimiser les structures de coûts multi-cloud.","de":"Ermöglicht den intelligenten Vergleich von Cloud-Diensten und Entscheidungsfindung bei Rechen-, Speicher- und Netzwerkdiensten von mehreren Anbietern. Bietet einen Rahmen für die Implementierung cloud-agnostischer Architekturen und die Optimierung von Multi-Cloud-Kostenstrukturen.","pt":"Permite a comparação inteligente de serviços de nuvem e a tomada de decisões em serviços de computação, armazenamento e rede de vários fornecedores. Fornece uma estrutura para implementar arquiteturas agnósticas de nuvem e otimizar estruturas de custo multi-nuvem.","ru":"Позволяет интеллектуально сравнивать облачные сервисы и принимать решения по сервисам вычислений, хранилищу и сетям от нескольких поставщиков. Предоставляет框架 для реализации облачно-независимых архитектур и оптимизации структур затрат в нескольких облаках.","ar":"يمكن المقارنة الذكية لخدمات السحابة واتخاذ القرارات عبر خدمات الحوسبة والتخزين والشبكة من عدة موردين. توفر إطارًا لتنفيذ هياكل تطبيقات متعددة السحابة وتحسين هياكل التكلفة عبر موفري السحابة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing multi-cloud migration strategies","Selecting optimal cloud services for specific workloads","Implementing cloud-agnostic application architectures","Optimizing cost structures across cloud providers","Comparing compute services across AWS, Azure, and GCP"],"zh":["设计多云迁移策略","为特定工作负载选择最优云服务","实现云无关应用架构","优化跨云提供商的成本结构","比较AWS、Azure和GCP的计算服务"],"ja":["マルチクラウド移行戦略の設計","特定のワークロードに最適なクラウドサービスを選択","クラウド非依存アプリケーションアーキテクチャの実装","クラウドプロバイダー全体のコスト構造の最適化","AWS、Azure、GCPのコンピュートサービスを比較"],"ko":["다중 클라우드 마이그레이션 전략 설계","특정 워크로드에 최적의 클라우드 서비스 선택","클라우드 비의존적 애플리케이션 아키텍처 구현","클라우드 제공업체 전체의 비용 구조 최적화","AWS, Azure, GCP의 컴퓨팅 서비스 비교"],"es":["Diseñar estrategias de migración multi-nube","Seleccionar servicios en la nube óptimos para cargas de trabajo específicas","Implementar arquitecturas de aplicaciones agnósticas a la nube","Optimizar estructuras de costos en proveedores en la nube","Comparar servicios de proceso en AWS, Azure y GCP"],"fr":["Concevoir des stratégies de migration multi-cloud","Sélectionner les services cloud optimaux pour des charges de travail spécifiques","Mettre en œuvre des architectures d''applications cloud agnostiques","Optimiser les structures de coûts sur les fournisseurs de cloud","Comparer les services de calcul sur AWS, Azure et GCP"],"de":["Entwerfen von Multi-Cloud-Migrationsstrategien","Auswählen optimaler Cloud-Dienste für spezifische Workloads","Implementieren cloud-agnostischer Anwendungsarchitekturen","Optimieren von Kostenstrukturen über Cloud-Anbieter hinweg","Vergleichen von Rechendiensten über AWS, Azure und GCP"],"pt":["Projetar estratégias de migração multi-nuvem","Selecionar serviços de nuvem ótimos para cargas de trabalho específicas","Implementar arquiteturas de aplicativos agnósticos de nuvem","Otimizar estruturas de custo em vários fornecedores de nuvem","Comparar serviços de computação em AWS, Azure e GCP"],"ru":["Проектирование стратегий миграции в несколько облаков","Выбор оптимальных облачных сервисов для конкретных рабочих нагрузок","Реализация архитектур приложений, независимых от облака","Оптимизация структур затрат у нескольких поставщиков облачных услуг","Сравнение сервисов вычислений в AWS, Azure и GCP"],"ar":["تصميم استراتيجيات النقل المتعددة للسحابة","اختيار خدمات السحابة المثالية لأحمال العمل المحددة","تنفيذ هياكل تطبيقات متعددة السحابة","تحسين هياكل التكلفة عبر عدة موفري السحابة","مقارنة خدمات الحوسبة عبر AWS و Azure و GCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of multiple cloud platforms","Needs access to cloud provider documentation and pricing data","Decision framework requires continuous updates for new service releases"],"zh":["需要多个云平台的知识","需要访问云提供商的文档和定价数据","决策框架需要持续更新以适应新服务发布"],"ja":["複数のクラウドプラットフォームの知識が必要","クラウドプロバイダーのドキュメントおよび価格データへのアクセスが必要","意思決定フレームワークは、新しいサービスリリースに合わせて継続的に更新する必要がある"],"ko":["다중 클라우드 플랫폼에 대한 지식 필요","클라우드 제공업체의 문서 및 가격 데이터에 대한 액세스 필요","의사 결정 프레임워크는 새로운 서비스 릴리스에 따라 지속적으로 업데이트해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de múltiples plataformas en la nube","Necesita acceso a la documentación y los datos de precios de los proveedores en la nube","El marco de decisión requiere actualizaciones continuas para nuevos lanzamientos de servicios"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de plusieurs plateformes cloud","Nécessite un accès à la documentation et aux données de tarification des fournisseurs de cloud","Le cadre de décision nécessite des mises à jour continues pour les nouveaux lancements de services"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von mehreren Cloud-Plattformen","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentation und Preisdaten der Cloud-Anbieter","Das Entscheidungsframework benötigt kontinuierliche Updates für neue Service-Veröffentlichungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de várias plataformas de nuvem","Necessita acesso à documentação e dados de preços dos fornecedores de nuvem","O framework de tomada de decisões requer atualizações contínuas para novos lançamentos de serviços"],"ru":["Требует знаний нескольких облачных платформ","Требует доступа к документации и данным о ценах облачных провайдеров","Фреймворк принятия решений требует постоянных обновлений для новых релизов сервисов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بعهدة منصات السحابة","يتطلب الوصول إلى दसات وبيانات أسعار موفري السحابة","إطار اتخاذ القرارات يتطلب تحديثات مستمرة للنسخ الجديدة من خدمات السحابة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
