sonnalisées","Automatisation de campagnes de marketing par e-mail","Analyse des résultats et suivi des conversions","Intégration avec des outils de marketing et CRM","Création de contenu d''e-mail attrayant et pertinent"],"de":["Erstellung von personalisierten E-Mail-Sequenzen","Automatisierung von E-Mail-Marketing-Kampagnen","Analyse von Ergebnissen und Verfolgung von Konversionen","Integration mit Marketing- und CRM-Tools","Erstellung von ansprechendem und relevantem E-Mail-Inhalt"],"pt":["Criação de sequências de email personalizadas","Otimização de campanhas de marketing","Aumento de conversões","Melhoria da experiência do cliente","Análise de desempenho de campanhas"],"ru":["Создание персонализированных почтовых последовательностей","Оптимизация маркетинговых кампаний","Увеличение конверсий","Улучшение опыта клиентов","Анализ эффективности кампаний"],"ar":["إنشاء تسلسلات بريد إلكتروني مخصصة","تحسين حملات التسويق","تعزيز التحويلات","تحسين تجربة العملاء","تحليل أداء الحملات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["邮件序列设计AI","自动化营销开发","邮件工作流集成","产品营销上下文","用户关系培养","转化驱动策略","营销自动化API","智能邮件模板","开发者营销工具","邮件序列优化"],"ja":["メールシーケンス設計AI","自動化マーケティング開発","メールワークフロー統合","製品マーケティングコンテキスト","ユーザー関係構築","コンバージョン駆動戦略","マーケティング自動化API","インテリジェントメールテンプレート","開発者向けマーケティングツール","メールシーケンス最適化"],"ko":["이메일 시퀀스 설계 AI","자동화 마케팅 개발","이메일 워크플로우 통합","제품 마케팅 컨텍스트","사용자 관계 형성","전환율驱动 전략","마케팅 자동화 API","지능형 이메일 템플릿","개발자용 마케팅 도구","이메일 시퀀스 최적화"],"es":["secuencias de correo electrónico","marketing por correo electrónico","automatización de marketing","campañas de correo electrónico","conversiones","relaciones con clientes","contenido de correo electrónico","herramientas de marketing","CRM"],"fr":["séquences d''e-mail","marketing par e-mail","automatisation de marketing","campagnes d''e-mail","conversions","relations avec les clients","contenu d''e-mail","outils de marketing","CRM"],"de":["E-Mail-Sequenzen","E-Mail-Marketing","Marketing-Automatisierung","E-Mail-Kampagnen","Konversionen","Kundenbeziehungen","E-Mail-Inhalt","Marketing-Tools","CRM"],"pt":["sequência de email","marketing por email","otimização de campanhas","conversões","experiência do cliente","análise de desempenho"],"ru":["почтовая последовательность","маркетинг по электронной почте","оптимизация кампаний","конверсии","опыт клиентов","анализ эффективности"],"ar":["تسلسل البريد الإلكتروني","تسويق البريد الإلكتروني","تحسين الحملات","التحويلات","تجربة العملاء","تحليل الأداء"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"email-sequence","description":"When the user wants to create or optimize an email sequence, drip campaign, automated email flow, or lifecycle email program. Also use when the user mentions email sequence, drip campaign, nurture sequence, onboarding emails, welcome sequence, re-engagement emails, email automation, or lifecycle emails. For in-app onboarding, see onboarding-cro.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Email Sequence Design\n\nYou are an expert in email marketing and automation. Your goal is to create email sequences that nurture relationships, drive action, and move people toward conversion.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore creating a sequence, understand:\n\n1. **Sequence Type","body":"# Email Sequence Design\n\nYou are an expert in email marketing and automation. Your goal is to create email sequences that nurture relationships, drive action, and move people toward conversion.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore creating a sequence, understand:\n\n1. **Sequence Type**\n   - Welcome/onboarding sequence\n   - Lead nurture sequence\n   - Re-engagement sequence\n   - Post-purchase sequence\n   - Event-based sequence\n   - Educational sequence\n   - Sales sequence\n\n2. **Audience Context**\n   - Who are they?\n   - What triggered them into this sequence?\n   - What do they already know/believe?\n   - What''s their current relationship with you?\n\n3. **Goals**\n   - Primary conversion goal\n   - Relationship-building goals\n   - Segmentation goals\n   - What defines success?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. One Email, One Job\n- Each email has one primary purpose\n- One main CTA per email\n- Don''t try to do everything\n\n### 2. Value Before Ask\n- Lead with usefulness\n- Build trust through content\n- Earn the right to sell\n\n### 3. Relevance Over Volume\n- Fewer, better emails win\n- Segment for relevance\n- Quality > frequency\n\n### 4. Clear Path Forward\n- Every email moves them somewhere\n- Links should do something useful\n- Make next steps obvious\n\n---\n\n## Email Sequence Strategy\n\n### Sequence Length\n- Welcome: 3-7 emails\n- Lead nurture: 5-10 emails\n- Onboarding: 5-10 emails\n- Re-engagement: 3-5 emails\n\nDepends on:\n- Sales cycle length\n- Product complexity\n- Relationship stage\n\n### Timing/Delays\n- Welcome email: Immediately\n- Early sequence: 1-2 days apart\n- Nurture: 2-4 days apart\n- Long-term: Weekly or bi-weekly\n\nConsider:\n- B2B: Avoid weekends\n- B2C: Test weekends\n- Time zones: Send at local time\n\n### Subject Line Strategy\n- Clear > Clever\n- Specific > Vague\n- Benefit or curiosity-driven\n- 40-60 characters ideal\n- Test emoji (they''re polarizing)\n\n**Patterns that work:**\n- Question: \"Still struggling with X?\"\n- How-to: \"How to [achieve outcome] in [timeframe]\"\n- Number: \"3 ways to [benefit]\"\n- Direct: \"[First name], your [thing] is ready\"\n- Story tease: \"The mistake I made with [topic]\"\n\n### Preview Text\n- Extends the subject line\n- ~90-140 characters\n- Don''t repeat subject line\n- Complete the thought or add intrigue\n\n---\n\n## Sequence Types Overview\n\n### Welcome Sequence (Post-Signup)\n**Length**: 5-7 emails over 12-14 days\n**Goal**: Activate, build trust, convert\n\nKey emails:\n1. Welcome + deliver promised value (immediate)\n2. Quick win (day 1-2)\n3. Story/Why (day 3-4)\n4. Social proof (day 5-6)\n5. Overcome objection (day 7-8)\n6. Core feature highlight (day 9-11)\n7. Conversion (day 12-14)\n\n### Lead Nurture Sequence (Pre-Sale)\n**Length**: 6-8 emails over 2-3 weeks\n**Goal**: Build trust, demonstrate expertise, convert\n\nKey emails:\n1. Deliver lead magnet + intro (immediate)\n2. Expand on topic (day 2-3)\n3. Problem deep-dive (day 4-5)\n4. Solution framework (day 6-8)\n5. Case study (day 9-11)\n6. Differentiation (day 12-14)\n7. Objection handler (day 15-18)\n8. Direct offer (day 19-21)\n\n### Re-Engagement Sequence\n**Length**: 3-4 emails over 2 weeks\n**Trigger**: 30-60 days of inactivity\n**Goal**: Win back or clean list\n\nKey emails:\n1. Check-in (genuine concern)\n2. Value reminder (what''s new)\n3. Incentive (special offer)\n4. Last chance (stay or unsubscribe)\n\n### Onboarding Sequence (Product Users)\n**Length**: 5-7 emails over 14 days\n**Goal**: Activate, drive to aha moment, upgrade\n**Note**: Coordinate with in-app onboarding—email supports, doesn''t duplicate\n\nKey emails:\n1. Welcome + first step (immediate)\n2. Getting started help (day 1)\n3. Feature highlight (day 2-3)\n4. Success story (day 4-5)\n5. Check-in (day 7)\n6. Advanced tip (day 10-12)\n7. Upgrade/expand (day 14+)\n\n**For detailed templates**: See [references/sequence-templates.md](references/sequence-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Email Types by Category\n\n### Onboarding Emails\n- New users series\n- New customers series\n- Key onboarding step reminders\n- New user invites\n\n### Retention Emails\n- Upgrade to paid\n- Upgrade to higher plan\n- Ask for review\n- Proactive support offers\n- Product usage reports\n- NPS survey\n- Referral program\n\n### Billing Emails\n- Switch to annual\n- Failed payment recovery\n- Cancellation survey\n- Upcoming renewal reminders\n\n### Usage Emails\n- Daily/weekly/monthly summaries\n- Key event notifications\n- Milestone celebrations\n\n### Win-Back Emails\n- Expired trials\n- Cancelled customers\n\n### Campaign Emails\n- Monthly roundup / newsletter\n- Seasonal promotions\n- Product updates\n- Industry news roundup\n- Pricing updates\n\n**For detailed email type reference**: See [references/email-types.md](references/email-types.md)\n\n---\n\n## Email Copy Guidelines\n\n### Structure\n1. **Hook**: First line grabs attention\n2. **Context**: Why this matters to them\n3. **Value**: The useful content\n4. **CTA**: What to do next\n5. **Sign-off**: Human, warm close\n\n### Formatting\n- Short paragraphs (1-3 sentences)\n- White space between sections\n- Bullet points for scanability\n- Bold for emphasis (sparingly)\n- Mobile-first (most read on phone)\n\n### Tone\n- Conversational, not formal\n- First-person (I/we) and second-person (you)\n- Active voice\n- Read it out loud—does it sound human?\n\n### Length\n- 50-125 words for transactional\n- 150-300 words for educational\n- 300-500 words for story-driven\n\n### CTA Guidelines\n- Buttons for primary actions\n- Links for secondary actions\n- One clear primary CTA per email\n- Button text: Action + outcome\n\n**For detailed copy, personalization, and testing guidelines**: See [references/copy-guidelines.md](references/copy-guidelines.md)\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Sequence Overview\n```\nSequence Name: [Name]\nTrigger: [What starts the sequence]\nGoal: [Primary conversion goal]\nLength: [Number of emails]\nTiming: [Delay between emails]\nExit Conditions: [When they leave the sequence]\n```\n\n### For Each Email\n```\nEmail [#]: [Name/Purpose]\nSend: [Timing]\nSubject: [Subject line]\nPreview: [Preview text]\nBody: [Full copy]\nCTA: [Button text] → [Link destination]\nSegment/Conditions: [If applicable]\n```\n\n### Metrics Plan\nWhat to measure and benchmarks\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What triggers entry to this sequence?\n2. What''s the primary goal/conversion action?\n3. What do they already know about you?\n4. What other emails are they receiving?\n5. What''s your current email performance?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key email tools:\n\n| Tool | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **Customer.io** | Behavior-based automation | - | [customer-io.md](../../tools/integrations/customer-io.md) |\n| **Mailchimp** | SMB email marketing | ✓ | [mailchimp.md](../../tools/integrations/mailchimp.md) |\n| **Resend** | Developer-friendly transactional | ✓ | [resend.md](../../tools/integrations/resend.md) |\n| **SendGrid** | Transactional email at scale | - | [sendgrid.md](../../tools/integrations/sendgrid.md) |\n| **Kit** | Creator/newsletter focused | - | [kit.md](../../tools/integrations/kit.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **onboarding-cro**: For in-app onboarding (email supports this)\n- **copywriting**: For landing pages emails link to\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing email elements\n- **popup-cro**: For email capture popups\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:49:30.279Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Marketing Automation Agents requiring advanced email sequence design and automation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级电子邮件序列设计和自动化功能的营销自动化代理。","ja":"マーケティングオートメーションエージェントが高度な電子メールシーケンス設計と自動化機能を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"고급 이메일 시퀀스 설계 및 자동화 기능이 필요한 마케팅 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de marketing que requieren un diseño avanzado de secuencias de correo electrónico y capacidades de automatización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation du marketing nécessitant une conception avancée de séquences d''e-mail et des capacités d''automatisation.","de":"Ideal für Marketing-Automatisierungsagenten, die ein fortschrittliches E-Mail-Sequenz-Design und Automatisierungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que necessitam de design avançado de sequências de e-mail e capacidades de automação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов маркетинговой автоматизации, требующих расширенного проектирования последовательности электронной почты и возможностей автоматизации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات التسويق التي تتطلب تصميم متقدم لتسلسل البريد الإلكتروني وقدرات التأهيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft personalized email sequences using product marketing context, understanding sequence types, and driving conversions through targeted automation, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` for context.","zh":"赋予代理人使用产品营销背景、了解序列类型、通过有针对性的自动化驱动转化的能力，利用类似 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` 的文件来获取背景。","ja":"エージェントが製品マーケティングコンテキスト、シーケンスの種類の理解、ターゲット自動化によるコンバージョンの促進を使用してパーソナライズされた電子メールシーケンスを作成できるようにします。`.claude/product-marketing-context.md` のようなファイルを使用してコンテキストを取得します。","ko":"에이전트가 제품 마케팅 상황, 시퀀스 유형 이해, 목표 자동화를 통해 전환을 유도하는 개인화된 이메일 시퀀스를 만들 수 있도록 합니다. `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일을 사용하여 상황을 이해합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear secuencias de correo electrónico personalizadas utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos, entendiendo los tipos de secuencia y conduciendo conversiones a través de la automatización dirigida, aprovechando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para el contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des séquences d''e-mail personnalisées en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits, en comprenant les types de séquences et en conduisant les conversions grâce à l''automatisation ciblée, en exploitant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` pour le contexte.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, personalisierte E-Mail-Sequenzen zu erstellen, die den Produktmarketing-Kontext verwenden, die Sequenztypen verstehen und Konversionen durch gezielte Automatisierung vorantreiben, indem Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` für den Kontext genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar sequências de e-mail personalizadas usando o contexto de marketing de produto, entendendo os tipos de sequência e impulsionando conversões por meio da automação direcionada, utilizando arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` para contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать персонализированные последовательности электронной почты с помощью контекста маркетинга продукта, понимания типов последовательности и стимулирования конверсий посредством нацеливания на автоматизацию, используя файлы вида `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` для контекста.","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من إنشاء تسلسلات بريد إلكتروني مخصصة باستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج، وفهم أنواع التسلسلات، وضغط التحويلات من خلال التأهيل المستهدف، باستخدام الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` للسياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing nurture email sequences","Automating conversion-driven email campaigns","Analyzing sequence performance for optimization"],"zh":["设计培育电子邮件序列","自动化转化驱动的电子邮件活动","分析序列性能以优化"],"ja":["ナースリング電子メールシーケンスの設計","コンバージョンドリブンの電子メールキャンペーンの自動化","最適化のためのシーケンスパフォーマンス分析"],"ko":["양육 이메일 시퀀스 설계","전환驱동 이메일 캠페인 자동화","최적화를 위한 시퀀스 성능 분석"],"es":["Diseñar secuencias de correo electrónico de fomento","Automatizar campañas de correo electrónico orientadas a la conversión","Analizar el rendimiento de la secuencia para la optimización"],"fr":["Concevoir des séquences d''e-mail de mise en valeur","Automatiser des campagnes d''e-mail axées sur la conversion","Analyser les performances de la séquence pour l''optimisation"],"de":["Entwurf von E-Mail-Nachsorge-Sequenzen","Automatisierung von konversionsorientierten E-Mail-Kampagnen","Analyse der Sequenzleistung zur Optimierung"],"pt":["Projetar sequências de e-mail de nutrição","Automatizar campanhas de e-mail impulsionadas por conversão","Analisar o desempenho da sequência para otimização"],"ru":["Проектирование последовательностей электронной почты для питания","Автоматизация кампаний электронной почты, ориентированных на конверсию","Анализ производительности последовательности для оптимизации"],"ar":["تصميم تسلسلات بريد إلكتروني للتغذية","تأهيل حملات بريد إلكتروني مدفوعة بالتحويل","تحليل أداء التسلسل لتحسينه"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context file (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) for optimal performance","Sequence type understanding necessary for effective use"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景文件 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) 以获得最佳性能","序列类型理解对于有效使用是必要的"],"ja":["最適なパフォーマンスを得るために、製品マーケティングコンテキストファイル (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) が必要","シーケンスの種類の理解は有効な使用のために必要"],"ko":["최적의 성능을 얻기 위해 제품 마케팅 상황 파일 (.claude/product-marketing-context.md)가 필요","시퀀스 유형 이해는有效한 사용을 위해 필요"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de contexto de marketing de productos (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) para un rendimiento óptimo","La comprensión del tipo de secuencia es necesaria para un uso efectivo"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de contexte de marketing de produits (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) pour des performances optimales","La compréhension du type de séquence est nécessaire pour une utilisation efficace"],"de":["Benötigt eine Produktmarketing-Kontextdatei (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) für optimale Leistung","Das Verständnis des Sequenztyps ist für eine effektive Verwendung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige arquivo de contexto de marketing de produto (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) para desempenho ótimo","Entendimento do tipo de sequência necessário para uso eficaz"],"ru":["Требует файла контекста маркетинга продукта (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) для оптимальной производительности","Понимание типа последовательности необходимо для эффективного использования"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف سياق تسويق المنتج (.claude/product-marketing-context.md) لأداء مثالي","فهم نوع التسلسل ضروري للاستخدام الفعال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
