eanimated","Шаблоны UI","Оптимизация платформы","Настройка родных модулей","Структуризация проектов monorepo"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","الرسوم المتحركة مع Reanimated","أنماط الواجهة","تحسين منصة","تكوين الوحدات الأصلية","هيكلة مشاريع مونوريبوا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React Native","React Native 优化","Expo 应用最佳实践","性能优化","动画实现","UI 模式","平台特定优化"],"ja":["Vercel React Native","React Native 最適化","Expo アプリのベストプラクティス","パフォーマンス最適化","アニメーションの実装","UI パターン","プラットフォーム固有の最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React Native","React Native 최적화","Expo 애플리케이션 최적화 방법","성능 최적화","애니메이션 구현","UI 패턴","플랫폼 특정 최적화"],"es":["React Native","Expo","mejores prácticas","rendimiento","animaciones","optimización de plataforma","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","React Native performance","Expo optimization"],"fr":["React Native","Expo","meilleures pratiques","performances","animations","optimisation de plateforme","développement d''applications mobiles","React Native performance","Expo optimisation"],"de":["React Native","Expo","Best Practices","Leistung","Animationen","Plattformoptimierung","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","React Native Leistung","Expo Optimierung"],"pt":["React Native","Vercel","Expo","Desempenho","Animações","UI","Otimização","Módulos nativos","Monorepo"],"ru":["React Native","Vercel","Expo","Производительность","Анимации","UI","Оптимизация","Родные модули","Monorepo"],"ar":["رياكت ناتيف","فيرسل","إكسبو","الأداء","الرسوم المتحركة","واجهة المستخدم","تحسين","الوحدات الأصلية","مونوريبوا"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.523Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-native-skills","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with na","body":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with native dependencies\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category         | Impact   | Prefix               |\n| -------- | ---------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 1        | List Performance | CRITICAL | `list-performance-`  |\n| 2        | Animation        | HIGH     | `animation-`         |\n| 3        | Navigation       | HIGH     | `navigation-`        |\n| 4        | UI Patterns      | HIGH     | `ui-`                |\n| 5        | State Management | MEDIUM   | `react-state-`       |\n| 6        | Rendering        | MEDIUM   | `rendering-`         |\n| 7        | Monorepo         | MEDIUM   | `monorepo-`          |\n| 8        | Configuration    | LOW      | `fonts-`, `imports-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. List Performance (CRITICAL)\n\n- `list-performance-virtualize` - Use FlashList for large lists\n- `list-performance-item-memo` - Memoize list item components\n- `list-performance-callbacks` - Stabilize callback references\n- `list-performance-inline-objects` - Avoid inline style objects\n- `list-performance-function-references` - Extract functions outside render\n- `list-performance-images` - Optimize images in lists\n- `list-performance-item-expensive` - Move expensive work outside items\n- `list-performance-item-types` - Use item types for heterogeneous lists\n\n### 2. Animation (HIGH)\n\n- `animation-gpu-properties` - Animate only transform and opacity\n- `animation-derived-value` - Use useDerivedValue for computed animations\n- `animation-gesture-detector-press` - Use Gesture.Tap instead of Pressable\n\n### 3. Navigation (HIGH)\n\n- `navigation-native-navigators` - Use native stack and native tabs over JS navigators\n\n### 4. UI Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `ui-expo-image` - Use expo-image for all images\n- `ui-image-gallery` - Use Galeria for image lightboxes\n- `ui-pressable` - Use Pressable over TouchableOpacity\n- `ui-safe-area-scroll` - Handle safe areas in ScrollViews\n- `ui-scrollview-content-inset` - Use contentInset for headers\n- `ui-menus` - Use native context menus\n- `ui-native-modals` - Use native modals when possible\n- `ui-measure-views` - Use onLayout, not measure()\n- `ui-styling` - Use StyleSheet.create or Nativewind\n\n### 5. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `react-state-minimize` - Minimize state subscriptions\n- `react-state-dispatcher` - Use dispatcher pattern for callbacks\n- `react-state-fallback` - Show fallback on first render\n- `react-compiler-destructure-functions` - Destructure for React Compiler\n- `react-compiler-reanimated-shared-values` - Handle shared values with compiler\n\n### 6. Rendering (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-text-in-text-component` - Wrap text in Text components\n- `rendering-no-falsy-and` - Avoid falsy && for conditional rendering\n\n### 7. Monorepo (MEDIUM)\n\n- `monorepo-native-deps-in-app` - Keep native dependencies in app package\n- `monorepo-single-dependency-versions` - Use single versions across packages\n\n### 8. Configuration (LOW)\n\n- `fonts-config-plugin` - Use config plugins for custom fonts\n- `imports-design-system-folder` - Organize design system imports\n- `js-hoist-intl` - Hoist Intl object creation\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/list-performance-virtualize.md\nrules/animation-gpu-properties.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T13:50:38.757Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing comprehensive React Native and Expo application optimization skills","zh":"非常适合需要全面掌握 React Native 和 Expo 应用优化技能的移动应用代理","ja":"React Native と Expo アプリケーションの最適化スキルを包括的に必要とするモバイル アプリ エージェントに最適","ko":"React Native와 Expo 애플리케이션 최적화 기술을 종합적으로 필요로 하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan habilidades de optimización de aplicaciones React Native y Expo integral","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de compétences en optimisation d''applications React Native et Expo complètes","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die umfassende Fähigkeiten zur Optimierung von React Native- und Expo-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de habilidades abrangentes de otimização de aplicativos React Native e Expo","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильных приложений, которым необходимы всесторонние навыки оптимизации приложений React Native и Expo","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى مهارات شاملة لتحسين تطبيقات React Native و Expo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize list and scroll performance, implement animations with Reanimated, and configure native modules or fonts, while following best practices for UI patterns and platform-specific optimizations in React Native and Expo applications","zh":"赋予代理优化列表和滚动性能、使用 Reanimated 实现动画，并配置原生模块或字体的能力，同时遵循 React Native 和 Expo 应用中的 UI 模式和平台特定优化的最佳实践","ja":"エージェントにリストとスクロールのパフォーマンスを最適化し、Reanimated を使用してアニメーションを実装し、ネイティブ モジュールまたはフォントを構成する能力を与え、同時に React Native と Expo アプリケーションの UI パターンとプラットフォーム固有の最適化のベスト プラクティスに従う","ko":"에이전트가 목록 및 스크롤 성능을 최적화하고 Reanimated를 사용하여 애니메이션을 구현하며 네이티브 모듈 또는 글꼴을 구성할 수 있도록 하며同時に React Native 및 Expo 애플리케이션의 UI 패턴 및 플랫폼별 최적화에 대한 모범 사례를 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el rendimiento de listas y desplazamiento, implementar animaciones con Reanimated y configurar módulos o fuentes nativas, siguiendo las mejores prácticas para patrones de interfaz de usuario y optimizaciones específicas de plataforma en aplicaciones React Native y Expo","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances des listes et du défilement, de mettre en œuvre des animations avec Reanimated et de configurer des modules ou des polices natives, tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour les modèles d''interface utilisateur et les optimisations spécifiques à la plateforme dans les applications React Native et Expo","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Leistung von Listen und Scrollen zu optimieren, Animationen mit Reanimated umzusetzen und native Module oder Schriftarten zu konfigurieren, während sie die besten Praktiken für Benutzeroberflächenmuster und plattformspezifische Optimierungen in React Native- und Expo-Anwendungen befolgen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho de listas e rolagem, implementar animações com Reanimated e configurar módulos nativos ou fontes, seguindo as melhores práticas para padrões de UI e otimizações específicas de plataforma em aplicativos React Native e Expo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность списков и прокрутки, реализовывать анимации с помощью Reanimated и настраивать родные модули или шрифты, следуя лучшим практикам для шаблонов UI и платформо-специфических оптимизаций в приложениях React Native и Expo","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين أداء القوائم والتمرير وتنفيذ Animations مع Reanimated وتكوين الوحدات الأصلية أو الخطوط ، متبعين أفضل الممارسات لطرازات واجهة المستخدم والتحسينات الخاصة بالمنصة في تطبيقات React Native و Expo"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing list and scroll performance in React Native apps","Implementing animations with Reanimated for seamless user experiences","Configuring native modules or fonts for customized app appearances"],"zh":["在 React Native 应用中优化列表和滚动性能","使用 Reanimated 为用户体验实现动画","为自定义应用外观配置原生模块或字体"],"ja":["React Native アプリケーションでのリストとスクロールのパフォーマンスを最適化","Reanimated を使用してユーザー体験にアニメーションを実装","カスタマイズされたアプリの外観のためにネイティブ モジュールまたはフォントを構成"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션에서 목록 및 스크롤 성능 최적화","Reanimated를 사용하여 사용자 경험에 애니메이션을 구현","사용자 지정 애플리케이션外観을 위한 네이티브 모듈 또는 글꼴 구성"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de listas y desplazamiento en aplicaciones React Native","Implementar animaciones con Reanimated para experiencias de usuario sin interrupciones","Configurar módulos o fuentes nativas para apariencias de aplicaciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des listes et du défilement dans les applications React Native","Mettre en œuvre des animations avec Reanimated pour des expériences utilisateur sans interruption","Configurer des modules ou des polices natives pour des apparences d''application personnalisées"],"de":["Optimieren der Leistung von Listen und Scrollen in React Native-Anwendungen","Umsetzen von Animationen mit Reanimated für unterbrechungsfreie Benutzererfahrungen","Konfigurieren von nativen Modulen oder Schriftarten für benutzerdefinierte App-Aussehen"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho de listas e rolagem em aplicativos React Native","Implementar animações com Reanimated para experiências de usuário sem interrupção","Configurar módulos nativos ou fontes para aparências de aplicativos personalizadas"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность списков и прокрутки в приложениях React Native","Реализовывать анимации с помощью Reanimated для бесшовных пользовательских опытов","Настраивать родные модули или шрифты для настраиваемых внешних видов приложений"],"ar":["تحسين أداء القوائم والتمرير في تطبيقات React Native","تنفيذ Animations مع Reanimated لتحقيق تجارب مستخدم لامسكة","تكوين الوحدات الأصلية أو الخطوط لمظهر تطبيقات مخصص"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native or Expo application development environment","Limited to React Native and Expo platforms"],"zh":["需要 React Native 或 Expo 应用开发环境","仅限 React Native 和 Expo 平台"],"ja":["React Native または Expo アプリケーション開発環境が必要","React Native と Expo プラットフォームのみに限定"],"ko":["React Native 또는 Expo 애플리케이션 개발 환경 필요","React Native 및 Expo 플랫폼으로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de aplicaciones React Native o Expo","Limitado a las plataformas React Native y Expo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement d''applications React Native ou Expo","Limité aux plates-formes React Native et Expo"],"de":["Benötigt eine Entwicklungsumgebung für React Native- oder Expo-Anwendungen","Begrenzt auf die Plattformen React Native und Expo"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento de aplicativos React Native ou Expo","Limitado às plataformas React Native e Expo"],"ru":["Требует среды разработки приложений React Native или Expo","Ограничен платформами React Native и Expo"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير تطبيقات React Native أو Expo","محدود بالمنصات React Native و Expo"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
